const ARTISTS = [{"id":"puuung","name":"Puuung","cat":"illustrators","en":"Puuung","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/puuung.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/puuung","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","scenes","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-ochre","dark-brown","ochre","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Puuung is a South Korean illustrator known for capturing the beauty of everyday life and intimate moments between people. Her work often explores themes of love, connection, and the small joys found in daily interactions, resonating with audiences worldwide.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses finely drawn outlines, flat yet subtly varied color areas, and dense domestic detail to create lived-in interior scenes. Warm earthy greens, oranges, and browns, strong dark contours, and expressive character poses give the illustrations a nostalgic, intimate graphic quality."},{"id":"marjolein-bastin","name":"Marjolein Bastin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marjolein Bastin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marjolein-bastin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marjolein-bastin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","pastel-colors"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-olive","silver","muted-magenta","dark-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Marjolein Bastin is a Dutch artist known for her detailed and charming nature illustrations. Her work often features wildlife, particularly birds and small animals, set in lush, floral environments. Bastin's art is celebrated for its delicate detail and ability to capture the beauty of the natural world.","observation":"The style combines softly visible paintwork with finely rendered feathers, petals, leaves, and branching stems, creating richly layered botanical compositions. Pastel pinks, lilacs, creams, and muted greens unify the detailed bird-and-flower arrangements, which resemble decorative natural-history studies while retaining expressive brush texture."},{"id":"marta-abad-blay","name":"Marta Abad Blay","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marta Abad Blay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marta-abad-blay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marta-abad-blay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","olive","bone-white","vivid-red","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Marta Abad Blay is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and whimsical illustrations that often feature floral and nature elements. Her work is characterized by a playful and imaginative style that captures the essence of youth and fantasy, making her a notable figure in modern illustration.","observation":"The style combines vividly colored illustrative figures and animals with visible painterly brushwork, fine drawn contours, and selectively flat color. Dense tropical foliage, flowers, houseplants, geometric furnishings, and patterned surfaces create richly packed decorative compositions across both portrait and interior scenes."},{"id":"cristina-mcallister","name":"Cristina McAllister","cat":"illustrators","en":"Cristina McAllister","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cristina-mcallister.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cristina-mcallister","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-red","beige","red","dark-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Cristina McAllister is an artist known for her intricate and fantastical illustrations that often blend elements of nature and mythology. Her work is characterized by detailed linework and vibrant color palettes, drawing inspiration from various cultural and mythological sources.","observation":"The style combines richly layered, jewel-toned portraiture with dense botanical ornament, flowing hair, insects, feathers, and elaborate headdresses. Fine contouring and decorative linework define the faces and motifs, while painterly shading, strong contrast, and abundant surface detail create a lush fantasy illustration with surreal, emblematic compositions."},{"id":"zhang-jingna","name":"Zhang Jingna","cat":"photographers","en":"Zhang Jingna","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zhang-jingna.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zhang-jingna","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","deep-red","beige"],"intro":"Zhang Jingna is a renowned photographer known for her ethereal and romantic portraiture. Born in Beijing and raised in Singapore, she has made significant contributions to contemporary photography with her unique blend of fashion and fine art. Her work often explores themes of beauty, culture, and identity, capturing the delicate interplay between subject and environment.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed close-up portrait photography with dark, muted jewel tones and dramatic cinematic lighting. Elaborate dark garments, gold embroidery, fur, and windblown hair create a brooding, romantic atmosphere, while shallow focus keeps attention on the faces."},{"id":"miles-aldridge","name":"Miles Aldridge","cat":"photographers","en":"Miles Aldridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/miles-aldridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/miles-aldridge","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["deep-red","black","beige","red","muted-cyan","green"],"intro":"Miles Aldridge is a renowned British fashion photographer known for his vivid and surreal imagery. His work often features glamorous and stylized portraits that draw inspiration from pop art and cinematic aesthetics. Aldridge's photography is characterized by its bold use of color, dramatic lighting, and intricate compositions, creating a unique blend of fashion and fine art.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic portrait photography with saturated primary colors, especially red and blue, and strong contrast. Glamorous retro fashion, theatrical makeup, glossy surfaces, carefully staged interiors, and selective focus create a polished mid-century luxury atmosphere."},{"id":"frank-miller","name":"Frank Miller","cat":"illustrators","en":"Frank Miller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-miller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-miller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","white","vivid-red","muted-cyan","beige"],"intro":"Frank Miller is a renowned American comic book writer, artist, and film director, celebrated for his influential work in the comic book industry. He is best known for his dark, gritty storytelling and distinctive visual style, which have been pivotal in shaping modern comics. His notable works include \"The Dark Knight Returns,\" \"Sin City,\" and \"300,\" each characterized by their unique blend of narrative depth and striking visual aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines graphic illustration with forceful ink drawing, thick contour lines, dense hatching, splatters, and stark black shadows. It alternates stark monochrome with intense red-and-blue color blocking, presenting expressive, surreal characters in tightly cropped or poster-like compositions."},{"id":"hayao-miyazaki","name":"Hayao Miyazaki","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hayao Miyazaki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hayao-miyazaki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hayao-miyazaki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","motion","painterly","vivid-colors","cute","dreamy","epic","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-teal","muted-cyan","bone-white","olive","rust"],"intro":"Hayao Miyazaki is a renowned Japanese animator, director, and co-founder of Studio Ghibli. He is celebrated for his imaginative storytelling and beautifully crafted animated films such as \"My Neighbor Totoro ,\" \" Spirited Away ,\" and \"Princess Mononoke.\" His works often explore themes of nature, childhood, and the supernatural, blending fantasy with reality in a unique and captivating way.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible brushwork with saturated natural color, dense environmental detail, and expressive, storybook-like figures. Vast mountainous landscapes, whimsical creatures, and monumental architecture are arranged as dreamy fantasy scenes with energetic movement and dramatic clouds, mist, and light."},{"id":"eve-ventrue","name":"Eve Ventrue","cat":"illustrators","en":"Eve Ventrue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eve-ventrue.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eve-ventrue","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Eve Ventrue is a contemporary artist known for her digital paintings that often explore fantasy and gothic themes. Her work is characterized by a detailed and painterly style, capturing the essence of mythical and dark narratives through rich textures and intricate details.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly portrait rendering with fine brushwork, restrained dark earth tones, and softly illuminated pale faces. Elaborate black clothing, jewelry, feathers, and loose hair create a refined, somber, old-world fashion atmosphere against sparse neutral backgrounds."},{"id":"vincent-laforet","name":"Vincent Laforet","cat":"photographers","en":"Vincent Laforet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vincent-laforet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vincent-laforet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","glow","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","sci-fi"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","brown","dark-red","grey","red"],"intro":"Vincent Laforet is a renowned photographer and filmmaker known for his innovative aerial photography and dynamic visual storytelling. His work often captures the essence of urban landscapes and the interplay of light and shadow, bringing a unique perspective to cityscapes and modern life.","observation":"The style presents expansive nighttime cityscapes with a highly realistic, cinematic aerial viewpoint and dense architectural detail. Deep blue-black shadows are punctuated by vivid cyan and orange-red illumination, glowing windows, signage, and flowing traffic networks, producing a futuristic and energetic metropolitan atmosphere."},{"id":"richard-caldicott","name":"Richard Caldicott","cat":"various-artists","en":"Richard Caldicott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-caldicott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-caldicott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","pale-orange","grey","blue","vivid-red","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Richard Caldicott is a contemporary British artist known for his innovative use of photography and abstract compositions. His work often explores the boundaries between photography and painting, creating visually striking pieces that challenge traditional perceptions of both mediums.","observation":"The style combines stark geometric forms, expansive negative space, and sharply separated blocks of saturated teal, coral, blue, red, and black. Flat graphic planes are presented with dramatic shadow and silhouette, while a subtle grainy, paper-like texture softens the otherwise precise edges across architectural, coastal, and abstract scenes."},{"id":"mamoru-hosoda","name":"Mamoru Hosoda","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mamoru Hosoda","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mamoru-hosoda.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mamoru-hosoda","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","muted-cyan","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Mamoru Hosoda is a renowned Japanese film director and animator, celebrated for his work in the anime industry. He is known for directing acclaimed films such as \"The Girl Who Leapt Through Time,\" \" Summer Wars,\" and \"Wolf Children.\" Hosoda's storytelling often explores themes of family, time, and the intersection of technology and nature, earning him a distinctive place in contemporary animation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive illustrated characters with crisp, fine dark linework, strong graphic shapes, and vivid red, teal, cream, and black contrasts. It combines energetic poses and windswept hair with detailed urban environments, atmospheric skies, and tightly cropped portrait framing."},{"id":"matt-wagner","name":"Matt Wagner","cat":"illustrators","en":"Matt Wagner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-wagner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-wagner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","pale-orange","beige","blue","dark-brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Matt Wagner is an American comic book writer and artist known for his work on series like \"Grendel\" and \"Mage.\" His storytelling often blends elements of fantasy and noir, creating rich, layered narratives that have captivated audiences for decades.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible, energetic brushwork with dense illustrative detail and sharp ink-like contours. It favors dramatic fantasy characters and creatures in high-contrast compositions, shifting between moody forest scenes, stark paper-toned studies, and vivid action-filled tableaux."},{"id":"alan-fearnley","name":"Alan Fearnley","cat":"painters","en":"Alan Fearnley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-fearnley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-fearnley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","grey"],"intro":"Alan Fearnley is a renowned British artist known for his evocative paintings, often depicting classic cars, trains, and historical scenes. His work is celebrated for its attention to detail and ability to capture the essence of a bygone era, blending realism with a romanticized view of history.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly visible brushwork and layered paint create a detailed, atmospheric picture-book realism, with softened edges, textured surfaces, and expressive strokes. Muted blue-green and ochre palettes are punctuated by warm lamps and reflections, while rain, haze, historic architecture, and vintage cars give the scenes a cinematic retro character."},{"id":"tracy-miller","name":"Tracy Miller","cat":"painters","en":"Tracy Miller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tracy-miller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tracy-miller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","animals","floral","portraits","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["light-cyan","pale-pink","pink","vivid-red","dark-blue","olive","deep-blue"],"intro":"Tracy Miller is a contemporary American artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings. Her work often features bold colors and dynamic compositions, drawing inspiration from nature and everyday life. Miller's art is celebrated for its playful and whimsical qualities, combining elements of fantasy and realism.","observation":"Across all four renders, animals are presented as close-up, stylized portraits surrounded by exuberant floral and feather-like color. Thick, clearly visible paint strokes build the forms, with highly saturated pinks, oranges, blues, greens, and turquoise grounds creating a bold illustrative effect."},{"id":"william-tillyer","name":"William Tillyer","cat":"painters","en":"William Tillyer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-tillyer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-tillyer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","glow","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-orange","vivid-red","muted-brown","brown","dark-blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"William Tillyer is a British artist known for his abstract and innovative approach to painting. His work often explores the interplay between natural forms and artistic expression, using a variety of materials and techniques to create dynamic compositions. Tillyer's art is celebrated for its vibrant color palettes and textured surfaces, reflecting a deep engagement with the physicality of painting.","observation":"Across the four works, vivid abstract forms combine geometric fragments with sweeping, gestural paint and translucent washes. The style shifts between crisp overlapping shapes and blurred luminous fields, retaining an expressive, tactile paper-and-paint surface with strong color contrasts."},{"id":"prue-stent-and-honey-long","name":"Prue Stent & Honey Long","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Prue Stent & Honey Long","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/prue-stent-and-honey-long.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/prue-stent-and-honey-long","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","landscapes","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["red","pink","muted-blue","brown","blue"],"intro":"Prue Stent & Honey Long are contemporary conceptual photographers known for their dreamlike and ethereal imagery. Their work often explores themes of femininity, identity, and the surreal, utilizing soft pastel colors and natural landscapes to create visually captivating scenes. Their photography blends elements of surrealism and fine art, resulting in a unique and contemplative visual style.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic photography with vivid pink environments and elaborate flowing garments placed in expansive natural landscapes. Repeated human figures, soft daylight, unusual color transformation, and monumental fabric textures create a dreamy surreal fashion tableau."},{"id":"trisha-romance","name":"Trisha Romance","cat":"painters","en":"Trisha Romance","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/trisha-romance.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/trisha-romance","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","beige","bone-white","muted-ochre","dark-olive","rust"],"intro":"Trisha Romance is a Canadian artist known for her romantic and nostalgic depictions of family life and home interiors. Her works often capture serene and intimate moments, drawing inspiration from Victorian and European influences. Romance's paintings are characterized by their warm tones, delicate detailing, and a sense of tranquility.","observation":"The style uses finely visible brushwork and softly textured, realistic rendering to depict densely detailed townhouse gardens and stoops. Restrained, natural colors, abundant floral growth, architectural ornament, and gentle seasonal light create an elegant classical atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"jiro-kuwata","name":"Jiro Kuwata","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jiro Kuwata","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jiro-kuwata.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jiro-kuwata","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["black","bone-white","vivid-red","grey","charcoal","red","olive"],"intro":"Jiro Kuwata is a renowned Japanese manga artist, best known for his work in the 1960s and 1970s. He gained fame for creating the manga series \"8 Man\" and his contributions to the genre of superhero comics in Japan. Kuwata's style is characterized by its dynamic action sequences and bold line work, which have influenced many artists in the manga and comic book industries.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic comic-book composition with heavy black contouring, dense hatching, and strongly separated blocks of color. It shifts between vivid red-blue scenes and stark monochrome imagery while retaining expressive figures, dramatic landscapes, and surreal narrative situations."},{"id":"clarence-john-laughlin","name":"Clarence John Laughlin","cat":"photographers","en":"Clarence John Laughlin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clarence-john-laughlin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clarence-john-laughlin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver"],"intro":"","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome photography with pronounced grain, deep shadows, and stark highlights to create an eerie, dreamlike atmosphere. Realistic women in flowing white garments are placed within richly textured interiors, water, and wooded landscapes, with cinematic framing, selective focus, and recurring suggestions of haunting or apparition."},{"id":"georges-dambier","name":"Georges Dambier","cat":"photographers","en":"Georges Dambier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-dambier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-dambier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["grey","white","black","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Georges Dambier was a renowned French photographer known for his work in fashion photography during the mid-20th century. He captured the elegance and style of post-war Paris, often working with leading fashion magazines and designers. His photography is celebrated for its sophisticated composition and ability to convey the essence of the era's fashion and lifestyle.","observation":"The style uses high-contrast black-and-white photographic imagery with carefully staged fashion portraits and urban situations. Vintage clothing, automobiles, hats, wet streets, architectural settings, selective focus, and cinematic framing create a polished mid-century atmosphere across the four renders."},{"id":"richard-tuschman","name":"Richard Tuschman","cat":"photographers","en":"Richard Tuschman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-tuschman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-tuschman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","grey","ochre"],"intro":"Richard Tuschman is a contemporary American photographer known for his evocative and narrative-driven work. His real-life counterpart often explores themes of solitude and introspection, blending elements of painting and photography to create atmospheric and surreal compositions. Tuschman's work is recognized for its meticulous attention to detail and its ability to convey deep emotional resonance through carefully constructed scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, cinematic staging with solitary characters set within decayed interiors, deserted streets, and bleak coastal landscapes. Muted green, brown, charcoal, and rust tones combine with strong chiaroscuro, shafts of light, and occasional warm practical glow to create a somber, atmospheric narrative."},{"id":"niki-boon","name":"Niki Boon","cat":"photographers","en":"Niki Boon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/niki-boon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/niki-boon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","black","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Niki Boon is a photographer known for her evocative and intimate black and white imagery, often capturing the raw and unfiltered aspects of life. Her work frequently explores themes of childhood, nature, and the human experience, characterized by a deep connection to the natural world and a sense of timelessness.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome and filmic, using strong tonal separation, backlight, shallow focus, and atmospheric coastal landscapes. Human figures are integrated into windswept grass and moving fabric, creating a dreamy yet somber sense of motion and solitude."},{"id":"gerry-anderson","name":"Gerry Anderson","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Gerry Anderson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerry-anderson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerry-anderson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","retro"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-ochre","grey","silver","dark-red","red","light-green"],"intro":"Gerry Anderson was a British television and film producer, director, and writer, best known for his innovative use of puppetry and special effects in series like \"Thunderbirds\" and \"Captain Scarlet.\" His work in the 1960s and 1970s was groundbreaking in the realm of science fiction, blending live-action and model work to create captivating futuristic worlds.","observation":"The style combines richly textured painted surfaces with crisp illustrative forms, saturated red-and-teal color, and strong cinematic contrast. It presents retro-futurist space crews, vehicles, and exploratory situations against expansive mountains, canyons, and coastlines, with detailed machinery and dramatic widescreen compositions."},{"id":"julius-leblanc-stewart","name":"Julius Leblanc Stewart","cat":"painters","en":"Julius Leblanc Stewart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julius-leblanc-stewart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julius-leblanc-stewart","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","brown","bone-white","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Julius Leblanc Stewart was an American artist known for his luxurious and detailed paintings of Parisian society during the Belle Époque. His works often depicted the opulence and elegance of the upper class, capturing intimate social gatherings and fashionable individuals with a keen eye for detail and texture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured oil-paint handling, visible directional strokes, and softly blended yet highly descriptive faces, fabrics, and furnishings. Dark, warm interiors contrast with cream, pink, and red garments, while posed women, elaborate clothing, and intimate social groupings create a refined historical portrait-and-scene atmosphere."},{"id":"ary-scheffer","name":"Ary Scheffer","cat":"painters","en":"Ary Scheffer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ary-scheffer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ary-scheffer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","bone-white","brown","deep-rust"],"intro":"Ary Scheffer was a 19th-century Dutch-French painter known for his romantic and historical subjects. He was a prominent figure in the Romantic movement, often depicting scenes from literature and history with a focus on emotion and drama. His works are characterized by their detailed execution, use of chiaroscuro, and emotional depth, making him a key figure in the art world of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, tightly cropped portraiture with visible oil-paint brushwork and finely modelled faces. Deep shadows, warm earthy reds, pale highlights, and dramatic directional lighting create a solemn, emotionally intense atmosphere with a classical devotional feel."},{"id":"john-burningham","name":"John Burningham","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Burningham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-burningham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-burningham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","muted-cyan","silver","light-orange","red"],"intro":"John Burningham is a renowned British illustrator and author, celebrated for his distinctive and imaginative children's books. His work is characterized by a unique blend of whimsy and depth, often exploring themes of childhood wonder and adventure. Burningham's illustrations have captivated audiences with their charming and evocative storytelling, earning him numerous awards and a lasting legacy in the world of children's literature.","observation":"Across all four images, loose watercolor-like washes and visibly textured surfaces are combined with delicate, scratchy ink contours. Muted blue, gray, cream, and earth tones are punctuated by strong red clothing, while small figures, buildings, trees, and waterside settings create atmospheric storybook scenes with expressive, slightly rough detail."},{"id":"robert-reid","name":"Robert Reid","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Reid","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-reid.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-reid","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","dark-brown","charcoal","ochre","muted-blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Robert Reid is an American painter known for his contributions to the American Impressionist movement. He was born in 1862 and became renowned for his depictions of women in serene and intimate settings, often surrounded by lush gardens and floral arrangements. Reid's work is characterized by its soft color palette and delicate brushwork, capturing the gentle interplay of light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents women in richly painted, framed portrait scenes, with expressive poses, elaborate garments, and densely worked surroundings. Visible brushwork shifts from delicate facial and fabric modeling to broader, more energetic strokes in clothing and backgrounds, while muted neutrals are punctuated by saturated floral and jewel-toned accents."},{"id":"arne-svenson","name":"Arne Svenson","cat":"photographers","en":"Arne Svenson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arne-svenson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arne-svenson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","grey","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Arne Svenson is an American photographer known for his unique approach to capturing everyday life through windows and reflections. His work often explores themes of privacy and voyeurism, creating a sense of intimacy and introspection in his subjects.","observation":"The style depicts quiet, intimate interior scenes rendered with visible painterly brushwork and highly realistic, carefully observed detail. Dark architectural framing, window reflections, blinds, and strong bands of warm and cool light create a cinematic, subdued atmosphere with geometric compositions and restrained human activity."},{"id":"david-drebin","name":"David Drebin","cat":"photographers","en":"David Drebin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-drebin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-drebin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","urban","backlighting","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","ochre","silver","blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"David Drebin is a contemporary photographer known for his cinematic and evocative imagery that often explores themes of urban life and romantic allure. His work is characterized by a blend of storytelling and visual drama, capturing moments that are both intimate and grand in scale. Drebin's photographs have been featured in numerous exhibitions and publications, earning him a reputation for his unique artistic vision.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is photographic and filmic, pairing glamorous female figures with expansive nighttime city views. Moody blue-and-amber lighting, strong backlighting, glowing windows, reflective wet surfaces, and selective focus create a dramatic urban fashion-editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"jen-bartel","name":"Jen Bartel","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jen Bartel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jen-bartel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jen-bartel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","pink","muted-blue","dark-green","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Jen Bartel is a contemporary illustrator known for her vibrant and detailed artwork, often featuring strong female characters and fantastical elements. Her work is celebrated for its bold use of color and intricate linework, blending elements of pop culture and fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly painted, highly detailed close-up character portraits with visible directional brushwork and fine drawn accents. Saturated pinks, blues, oranges, and deep blacks create strong contrast, while fantastical elements such as unusual hair colors, butterflies, a black cat, oversized flowers, and a luminous moon give the imagery a surreal, expressive character."},{"id":"bev-doolittle","name":"Bev Doolittle","cat":"painters","en":"Bev Doolittle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bev-doolittle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bev-doolittle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-ochre","muted-ochre","black","ochre","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"","observation":"Across the sheet, richly textured paint and fine, directional brushwork render dense wilderness scenes filled with animals, riders, trees, and rocky terrain. Earthy autumn colors, dramatic movement, and highly descriptive natural detail give the images an expressive, mythic fantasy character."},{"id":"mark-schultz","name":"Mark Schultz","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mark Schultz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-schultz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-schultz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","fantasy","drawing","ink","epic"],"colours":["white","grey","black","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Mark Schultz is an American illustrator and comic book artist known for his work on series like \"Xenozoic Tales.\" His style is characterized by detailed linework and a strong influence from classic adventure and fantasy art. Schultz's illustrations often feature dynamic compositions and heroic figures, drawing inspiration from the pulp magazines and comic books of the mid-20th century.","observation":"The style combines monochrome, high-contrast fantasy illustration with visible ink lines, energetic brushwork, and dense textural detail in fur, clothing, rocks, and snow. Heroic human figures are paired with oversized or monstrous animals in dramatic wilderness scenes, giving the images an epic, rugged storybook quality."},{"id":"irene-sheri-vishnevskaya","name":"Irene Sheri Vishnevskaya","cat":"painters","en":"Irene Sheri Vishnevskaya","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/irene-sheri-vishnevskaya.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/irene-sheri-vishnevskaya","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["vivid-red","ochre","bone-white","deep-red","brown","black"],"intro":"Irene Sheri Vishnevskaya is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and expressive portraiture, often blending elements of fantasy and realism. Her work is characterized by a romantic and whimsical style, capturing the emotional depth and allure of her subjects through bold colors and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, elegant fashion portraits are built from richly layered, visibly brushed paint, with fine directional marks shaping faces, clothing, flowers, and accessories. Saturated reds dominate alongside cream, blue, green, and black, while elaborate hats, patterned garments, and floral details create a dense decorative surface."},{"id":"frank-frazetta","name":"Frank Frazetta","cat":"illustrators","en":"Frank Frazetta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-frazetta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-frazetta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","bone-white","dark-brown","grey","orange","rust"],"intro":"Frank Frazetta was an American fantasy and science fiction artist, renowned for his powerful and dynamic illustrations. His work is celebrated for its vivid depictions of muscular heroes, mythical creatures, and dramatic landscapes, often featured in comic books, album covers, and movie posters. Frazetta's distinctive style has influenced countless artists and continues to be a cornerstone in the fantasy art genre.","observation":"The style uses vigorous, visible brushwork and strongly modeled forms to depict monumental horned beasts, warriors, and rugged landscapes. Dark earthy tones, blazing orange highlights, turbulent atmosphere, and forceful diagonals create an intense epic-fantasy mood across all four images."},{"id":"karin-kuhlmann","name":"Karin Kuhlmann","cat":"various-artists","en":"Karin Kuhlmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karin-kuhlmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karin-kuhlmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","grey","black","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Karin Kuhlmann is a digital artist known for her intricate and surreal compositions that often explore themes of fantasy and nature. Her work is characterized by a dreamy and ethereal quality, blending detailed textures with imaginative subjects.","observation":"The style combines highly rendered female close-ups with visible brushwork, layered tactile surfaces, and dense botanical and fabric ornament. Muted blue-gray, cream, and rust-red colors, fine linear marks, and surreal juxtapositions of faces, birds, berries, and abstract patchwork create an intimate, dreamlike portrait language."},{"id":"esad-ribic","name":"Esad Ribic","cat":"illustrators","en":"Esad Ribic","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/esad-ribic.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/esad-ribic","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","red","silver","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Esad Ribic is a renowned comic book artist and illustrator known for his work in the fantasy and superhero genres. He has contributed significantly to major comic book publishers, bringing to life epic tales with his distinctive style that combines realism with fantastical elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from visibly broad, energetic brushwork, dense character groupings, and strongly modeled faces and costumes. Dark teal shadows, saturated red and orange accents, and pale blue highlights create a moody, high-contrast fantasy atmosphere, while theatrical poses and strange masked or monstrous figures give the scenes an expressive surreal quality."},{"id":"evgeni-dinev","name":"Evgeni Dinev","cat":"photographers","en":"Evgeni Dinev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/evgeni-dinev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/evgeni-dinev","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","landscapes","backlighting","glow","mist","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-red","black","grey","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Evgeni Dinev is a renowned photographer known for his captivating landscape photography that often captures the ethereal beauty of nature. His work is celebrated for its vivid colors, dynamic compositions, and the ability to evoke a sense of tranquility and wonder.","observation":"The style is photorealistic and richly detailed, built around expansive autumn landscapes with saturated copper, amber, and deep blue tones. Strong low-angle sunlight, glowing haze, mist, and layered atmospheric depth create a cinematic, dreamy sense of scale across the scenes."},{"id":"tammam-azzam","name":"Tammam Azzam","cat":"painters","en":"Tammam Azzam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tammam-azzam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tammam-azzam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","bone-white","silver","vivid-red"],"intro":"Tammam Azzam is a Syrian artist known for his powerful and evocative works that often address themes of conflict, identity, and human resilience. His art frequently incorporates elements of digital manipulation and collage, creating a unique blend of traditional and contemporary techniques. Azzam's work has been exhibited internationally, drawing attention to the socio-political issues in the Middle East.","observation":"Across the renders, ruined urban architecture is built from dense, visible painterly strokes and heavily textured fragments, with broad scraped marks, broken edges, and layered debris. A restrained beige, gray, and black palette is punctuated by vivid red accents and stark shadows, while small figures and occasional surreal compositional distortions create a bleak, expressive atmosphere."},{"id":"leigh-bowery","name":"Leigh Bowery","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Leigh Bowery","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leigh-bowery.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leigh-bowery","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["light-yellow","dark-red","grey","dark-brown","silver","black"],"intro":"Leigh Bowery was an Australian performance artist, club promoter, and fashion designer known for his flamboyant and avant-garde style. He became a prominent figure in the London club scene during the 1980s and 1990s, renowned for his bold and often shocking costumes that challenged conventional notions of fashion and identity. Bowery's work was characterized by its theatricality, surrealism, and a playful yet provocative approach to self-expression.","observation":"The style presents tightly framed studio portraits of theatrical characters in intensely saturated colors, with exaggerated makeup, sculptural headpieces, and heavily embellished costumes. Dense tactile surfaces⁠—beads, sequins, fringe, metallic jewelry, animal print, and polka dots⁠—combine realistic photographic rendering with surreal, flamboyant fashion imagery."},{"id":"henri-rousseau","name":"Henri Rousseau","cat":"painters","en":"Henri Rousseau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-rousseau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-rousseau","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","dark-green","muted-olive","bone-white","grey","red"],"intro":"Henri Rousseau was a French post-impressionist painter known for his vivid jungle scenes and dreamlike compositions. Despite having never left France, Rousseau's works are characterized by exotic landscapes filled with lush foliage and fantastical creatures. His style is often described as naïve or primitive, with a flat perspective and a focus on detailed, imaginative environments.","observation":"Across the renders, richly layered tropical gardens and waterways are depicted with finely controlled, illustrative forms and visible painted texture. Dense foliage, ornamental trees, flowers, animals, and elegantly posed figures create a dreamy, slightly surreal garden-world in restrained greens, blues, and warm floral accents."},{"id":"claude-joseph-vernet","name":"Claude-Joseph Vernet","cat":"painters","en":"Claude-Joseph Vernet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claude-joseph-vernet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claude-joseph-vernet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","motion","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","muted-blue","beige","pale-orange"],"intro":"Claude-Joseph Vernet was a renowned French painter of the 18th century, celebrated for his masterful landscapes and maritime scenes. His works often depicted dramatic and romanticized views of nature, capturing the sublime beauty of the natural world. Vernet's paintings are characterized by their detailed rendering, use of light and shadow, and balanced compositions, reflecting the artistic movements of Romanticism and Neoclassicism.","observation":"The style combines richly visible painterly texture with highly detailed, illustrative fantasy landscapes. Monumental cliffs, ruined fortresses, ships, and turbulent surf are staged in dramatic vertical compositions, using cool subdued tones, warm breaks of sunlight, and strong dark-to-light contrast. The recurring scale contrast between tiny figures and enormous coastal architecture gives the scenes an epic, slightly surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"christoph-niemann","name":"Christoph Niemann","cat":"designers","en":"Christoph Niemann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christoph-niemann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christoph-niemann","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","scenes","urban","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark","geometric","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["green","black","cream","vivid-red","dark-green"],"intro":"Christoph Niemann is a renowned German illustrator, graphic designer, and author known for his playful and thought-provoking work. His illustrations have appeared in numerous publications, including The New Yorker, and he is celebrated for his ability to blend humor with insightful commentary on contemporary life.","observation":"The style uses stark graphic shapes, heavy black silhouettes, angular architectural forms, and large areas of deliberate negative space. A restricted but saturated palette of seafoam, vermilion, cream, and black combines with high contrast, fine textural grain, and dynamic diagonals to create dramatic narrative scenes."},{"id":"jan-van-haasteren","name":"Jan van Haasteren","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jan van Haasteren","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-van-haasteren.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-van-haasteren","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","fine-lines","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","ochre","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Jan van Haasteren is a renowned Dutch cartoonist and illustrator, celebrated for his intricate and humorous illustrations. His work is characterized by crowded, chaotic scenes filled with quirky characters and hidden jokes, often set in urban environments. Van Haasteren's illustrations are popular in puzzle form, where the challenge is to spot various humorous details and recurring characters.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely packed urban streets are depicted with colorful row houses, crowds, vehicles, shopfronts, and layered architectural details. The style is highly illustrative, using extensive fine black linework with occasional heavier contours, crisp graphic shapes, and saturated red, blue, green, and ochre accents."},{"id":"teagan-white","name":"Teagan White","cat":"illustrators","en":"Teagan White","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/teagan-white.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/teagan-white","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","subdued-colors","drawing","ink"],"colours":["cream","bone-white","black","brown","orange","rust"],"intro":"Teagan White is an illustrator known for their intricate and nature-inspired artwork. Their work often features detailed depictions of flora and fauna, blending elements of fantasy and realism to create whimsical and ethereal compositions. White's illustrations are characterized by a delicate use of line and color, often incorporating themes of nature and the human connection to the environment.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed animal studies with abundant botanical ornament, using delicate ink-like linework, carefully layered hatching, and selectively muted cream, black, teal, and rust tones. Across the renders, forms remain illustrative and finely drawn, with expressive feathers and fur arranged in decorative, flowing compositions on a paper-like ground."},{"id":"bob-staake","name":"Bob Staake","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bob Staake","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-staake.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-staake","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","pale-orange","rust","dark-green","blue"],"intro":"Bob Staake is an American illustrator and author known for his distinctive and playful style, often seen in children's books and editorial illustrations. His work is characterized by bold colors, geometric shapes, and a whimsical approach that appeals to both children and adults.","observation":"The style uses graphic, poster-like illustration with clean angular shapes, bold dark contours, and strongly blocked saturated colors. Glamorous fashion portraits and lively party scenes are cropped tightly, combining dramatic red, black, blue, and skin-tone fields with subtle grain and occasional textured shading."},{"id":"peter-adderley","name":"Peter Adderley","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Adderley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-adderley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-adderley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-olive","charcoal","silver","muted-blue","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Peter Adderley is a contemporary British artist known for his charming and whimsical paintings that often depict rural and coastal scenes. His work is characterized by a playful and lighthearted approach, capturing the essence of village life with a unique and stylized perspective. Adderley's art is celebrated for its vibrant color palette and engaging narrative quality, making it appealing to a wide audience.","observation":"These scenes use visibly textured, hand-painted surfaces with fine drawn contours, simplified angular anatomy, elongated features, and strongly patterned clothing. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and ochres support whimsical narrative tableaux populated by recurring stylized people and animals, with dense but clearly organized details."},{"id":"rainer-werner-fassbinder","name":"Rainer Werner Fassbinder","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Rainer Werner Fassbinder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rainer-werner-fassbinder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rainer-werner-fassbinder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","dark-brown","rust","red"],"intro":"Rainer Werner Fassbinder was a prolific German filmmaker, actor, and playwright, known for his significant impact on the New German Cinema movement. His works often explored themes of social alienation, love, and power dynamics, characterized by their bold storytelling and complex characters.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic portrait photography with intimate close framing, shallow focus, visible film grain, and strong contrast. Its subdued dark interiors, warm practical lamps, occasional cool window light, cigarette smoke, and retro clothing create a moody nightlife atmosphere."},{"id":"moebius","name":"Moebius","cat":"illustrators","en":"Moebius","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/moebius.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/moebius","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["blue","charcoal","dark-blue","pale-orange","silver","red"],"intro":"Moebius is a pseudonym for Jean Giraud, a renowned French artist known for his influential work in the comic book industry. He gained fame for his unique and imaginative style, contributing significantly to both European and American comics. His work is characterized by intricate line work, surreal landscapes, and a blend of science fiction and fantasy themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely populated alien environments with crisp, fine contour lines and highly descriptive graphic rendering. Cool blue grounds are repeatedly contrasted with coral, orange, and pink accents, while monumental rock forms, strange machinery, robed figures, and oversized celestial bodies create a surreal science-fiction fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"bada-shanren","name":"Bada Shanren","cat":"painters","en":"Bada Shanren","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bada-shanren.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bada-shanren","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","religious","ink","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["pale-orange","bone-white","brown","muted-ochre","beige","rust"],"intro":"Bada Shanren was a Chinese painter and calligrapher of the late Ming and early Qing dynasties, known for his expressive and often surreal ink paintings. His work is characterized by bold brushstrokes and a unique blend of abstraction and realism, often reflecting themes of nature and solitude.","observation":"The style uses expressive ink-and-wash painting with visible brushwork, fine linear accents, and translucent layered washes on a warm paper ground. Sparse compositions place monumental mountains, ancient trees, and small robed figures within large areas of misty negative space, creating a contemplative, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"masaaki-yuasa","name":"Masaaki Yuasa","cat":"illustrators","en":"Masaaki Yuasa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/masaaki-yuasa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/masaaki-yuasa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["muted-cyan","muted-green","red","vivid-red","dark-green","light-orange","violet"],"intro":"Masaaki Yuasa is a renowned Japanese animator and director known for his unique and imaginative style. He has worked on a variety of projects, including films and television series, that often explore surreal and fantastical themes. Yuasa's work is characterized by its fluid animation, bold visual choices, and a distinctive blend of humor and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vivid flat color, strong dark contouring, and densely packed illustrative detail. It combines dynamic anime-like characters and vehicles with surreal, fantastical environments, exaggerated perspective, and crowded dreamlike landscapes."},{"id":"paul-guy-gantner","name":"Paul Guy Gantner","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Guy Gantner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-guy-gantner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-guy-gantner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","landscapes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","grey","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Paul Guy Gantner is a contemporary artist known for his romantic and idyllic depictions of European landscapes, particularly those inspired by the Mediterranean region. His work often features lush, floral environments and rustic architecture, capturing the serene beauty of rural settings with a painterly touch.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly brushwork with highly detailed rustic architecture and abundant flowering gardens. Warm sunlight, saturated reds and greens, layered foliage, and softly luminous air create an inviting, dreamlike courtyard atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"anne-gifford","name":"Anne Gifford","cat":"painters","en":"Anne Gifford","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-gifford.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-gifford","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","grey","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"Anne Gifford is an American artist known for her vibrant watercolor paintings that capture the beauty of natural landscapes and rural life. Her work often features detailed depictions of gardens, countryside scenes, and coastal villages, reflecting a deep appreciation for the serene and idyllic aspects of nature.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly layered interiors and garden spaces are rendered with visible, delicate brushwork, dense botanical detail, and saturated jewel-like color. The style combines illustrative clarity with a warm, imaginative atmosphere, filling domestic scenes with plants, textiles, books, patterned surfaces, and sunlight."},{"id":"alexandre-calame","name":"Alexandre Calame","cat":"painters","en":"Alexandre Calame","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexandre-calame.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexandre-calame","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","silver","grey","charcoal","ochre","olive"],"intro":"Alexandre Calame was a Swiss painter known for his dramatic and detailed landscapes, particularly those depicting the Swiss Alps. Born in 1810, Calame became a prominent figure in the Romantic movement, capturing the grandeur and beauty of nature with precision and emotion. His works are celebrated for their meticulous attention to detail and ability to convey the sublime power of the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents expansive alpine landscapes with towering crags, glaciers, lakes, trees, and dramatic cloud formations. Richly textured, painterly surfaces combine vivid natural color with strong sunlight and shadow, producing a cinematic, dreamy sense of scale and epic atmosphere."},{"id":"anita-jeram","name":"Anita Jeram","cat":"illustrators","en":"Anita Jeram","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anita-jeram.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anita-jeram","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["white","dark-olive","olive","pale-yellow","ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Anita Jeram is a British illustrator best known for her charming and whimsical illustrations in children's books, particularly the beloved \"Guess How Much I Love You.\" Her work is characterized by its gentle and expressive depiction of animals and nature, often using watercolor and ink to create soft, inviting scenes.","observation":"The style uses delicate watercolor washes with visible fine linework, textured brush marks, and softly blended earthy colors. It presents expressive, storybook-like animal scenes with richly observed fur, clothing, vegetation, and small environmental details against generous white space."},{"id":"jack-vettriano","name":"Jack Vettriano","cat":"painters","en":"Jack Vettriano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-vettriano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-vettriano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["grey","bone-white","brown","light-orange","rust","dark-red"],"intro":"Jack Vettriano is a Scottish painter known for his distinctive style that often depicts romantic and nostalgic scenes. His works frequently feature elegantly dressed figures in intimate or solitary settings, capturing moments of reflection and emotion. Vettriano's paintings are characterized by their cinematic quality, often evoking a sense of narrative and drama.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and clothing are built with visible, broad, painterly strokes, simplified contours, and strong light-dark modeling. The restrained seaside palette, vivid red garments, low viewpoints, and vintage dress create nostalgic, cinematic scenes of couples on a bright boardwalk or beach."},{"id":"edwin-lutyens","name":"Edwin Lutyens","cat":"architects","en":"Edwin Lutyens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edwin-lutyens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edwin-lutyens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","olive"],"intro":"Edwin Lutyens was a renowned British architect known for his imaginative and innovative designs, particularly in the early 20th century. He played a significant role in shaping the architectural landscape of Britain and beyond, with notable works including the design of New Delhi and various country houses and gardens. Lutyens's style is characterized by a blend of traditional and modern elements, often incorporating classical motifs with a unique twist.","observation":"The style presents richly detailed architectural and garden scenes with realistic textures, carefully composed views, and strong natural light. Subdued greens, stone, brick, and warm wood are balanced by deep shadows, while arches, columns, domes, and axial paths create a formal geometric order."},{"id":"betty-woodman","name":"Betty Woodman","cat":"various-artists","en":"Betty Woodman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/betty-woodman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/betty-woodman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","floral","patterns","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","muted-orange","dark-olive","red","ochre","muted-blue"],"intro":"Betty Woodman is an influential American artist known for her innovative work in ceramics and her exploration of form, color, and space. Her career spanned several decades, during which she became renowned for her vibrant and playful ceramic pieces that often blurred the lines between sculpture and painting. Woodman's work is celebrated for its bold use of color and its ability to transform everyday objects into art.","observation":"Across all four renders, everyday vessels and floral or animal forms are treated as brightly painted ceramic sculptures, with visible brush marks, raised texture, and irregular handmade modelling. Saturated reds, yellows, blues, greens, and oranges combine with bold graphic patterns and crisp studio presentation against pale backgrounds."},{"id":"philippe-halsman","name":"Philippe Halsman","cat":"photographers","en":"Philippe Halsman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philippe-halsman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philippe-halsman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","funny","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Philippe Halsman was a renowned Latvian-born American photographer known for his innovative and surreal portraiture. He gained fame for his collaborations with Salvador Dalí and his distinctive 'jumpology' series, capturing celebrities in mid-air. Halsman's work is celebrated for its creativity, technical skill, and ability to capture the essence of his subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, sharply lit monochrome figures are isolated against spacious studio backgrounds, with deep shadows and visible photographic grain. Exaggerated poses, suspended bodies, and comic facial expressions create a theatrical, kinetic style that feels like staged film stills."},{"id":"patrick-nagel","name":"Patrick Nagel","cat":"illustrators","en":"Patrick Nagel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patrick-nagel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patrick-nagel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","bold-lines","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","bone-white","cream","muted-blue","dark-blue","deep-red"],"intro":"Patrick Nagel was an American artist known for his distinctive style that became iconic in the 1980s. His work is characterized by its bold lines, flat colors, and stylized depictions of women, often drawing inspiration from art deco and pop art. Nagel's illustrations were widely recognized in commercial art and fashion, contributing to the visual culture of the era.","observation":"A graphic fashion-portrait style built from clean flat color fields, sharp angular shading, and emphatic black contour lines. The four close-up faces share dramatic makeup, saturated red lips, dark hair, high contrast, and tightly cropped editorial compositions."},{"id":"james-bidgood","name":"James Bidgood","cat":"filmmakers","en":"James Bidgood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-bidgood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-bidgood","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-magenta","dark-blue","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"James Bidgood is an influential American filmmaker and photographer known for his pioneering work in queer cinema and art. His most famous work, the film \"Pink Narcissus,\" is celebrated for its lush, dreamlike visuals and exploration of homoerotic themes. Bidgood's style is characterized by elaborate set designs, vibrant colors, and a unique blend of fantasy and reality.","observation":"The style is cinematic and highly theatrical, combining lavish costume, dense floral environments, and posed human figures with saturated reds, blues, and pinks. Strong directional light, candle glow, selective focus, and richly layered set dressing create a dreamy, extravagant fashion-editorial atmosphere across the four images."},{"id":"anna-griffin","name":"Anna Griffin","cat":"designers","en":"Anna Griffin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anna-griffin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anna-griffin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","light-lime","olive","dark-olive","red","brown"],"intro":"Anna Griffin is a designer known for her elegant and sophisticated paper crafting products, often featuring intricate floral patterns and vintage-inspired designs. Her work is characterized by a blend of traditional and contemporary elements, appealing to those who appreciate detailed and ornate aesthetics.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed botanical and decorative imagery with crisp illustrative contours, fine linework, and selectively flat, poster-like color areas. Dense floral arrangements, patterned textiles, porcelain, birds, and gift boxes create an ornate classical still-life and wallpaper effect, using saturated greens, pinks, corals, creams, and blue accents."},{"id":"alex-webb","name":"Alex Webb","cat":"photographers","en":"Alex Webb","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-webb.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-webb","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","urban","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-brown","dark-cyan","muted-orange","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Alex Webb is a renowned American photographer known for his vibrant and complex color photographs, often capturing the essence of street life and cultural intersections. His work is characterized by its rich color palettes, intricate compositions, and a deep sense of place and atmosphere, often exploring themes of migration, borders, and the human condition.","observation":"The style is strongly photographic and cinematic, using saturated warm-and-cool colors, harsh sunlight, deep shadows, and visible film grain. Candid portraits and street scenes are framed through doorways, vehicle windows, and tight crops, with selective focus and a vivid sense of movement and place."},{"id":"javiera-estrada","name":"Javiera Estrada","cat":"photographers","en":"Javiera Estrada","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/javiera-estrada.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/javiera-estrada","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-ochre","vivid-orange","dark-rust","muted-teal","dark-blue"],"intro":"Javiera Estrada is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and surreal portraiture that often incorporates elements of nature and fantasy. Her work is characterized by a dreamy and imaginative style, blending reality with a touch of whimsy to create captivating visual narratives.","observation":"A highly realistic, detailed portrait style uses tight crops, direct gazes, and faces partially concealed by oversized flowers, foliage, hair, or clothing. Saturated color blocking, carefully rendered skin and hair detail, and fashion-editorial styling give the images a vivid, graphic presence, with selective focus adding photographic depth."},{"id":"beatrix-potter","name":"Beatrix Potter","cat":"illustrators","en":"Beatrix Potter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/beatrix-potter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/beatrix-potter","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-olive","yellow","dark-olive","ochre","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"Beatrix Potter was a renowned English author and illustrator, best known for her children's books featuring animal characters such as Peter Rabbit. Her work is celebrated for its detailed and charming illustrations, as well as its gentle storytelling that captures the essence of rural English life.","observation":"The style combines delicate watercolor washes with fine brown drawn outlines and visible paper texture, creating softly modeled but highly readable storybook figures. It uses subdued woodland greens and earthy browns, with dense botanical detail surrounding expressive anthropomorphic rabbits in small narrative scenes."},{"id":"kelly-hoppen","name":"Kelly Hoppen","cat":"designers","en":"Kelly Hoppen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kelly-hoppen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kelly-hoppen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","still-life","glow","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","silver"],"intro":"Kelly Hoppen is a renowned British interior designer known for her signature style that blends East and West influences with a neutral color palette. She has been influential in the world of interior design, creating luxurious yet comfortable spaces that emphasize simplicity and elegance.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, carefully staged luxury interiors with restrained neutral colors, dark accents, crisp architectural geometry, and balanced compositions. Warm candlelight, fireplaces, and layered architectural lighting create selective glow and contrast, while flowers, furniture, marble, and artwork provide dense but controlled visual detail."},{"id":"dwight-william-tryon","name":"Dwight William Tryon","cat":"painters","en":"Dwight William Tryon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dwight-william-tryon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dwight-william-tryon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-brown","yellow","white"],"intro":"Dwight William Tryon was an American painter known for his contributions to the Tonalist movement during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work often depicted serene landscapes and atmospheric scenes, characterized by a subtle use of color and light to evoke mood and emotion. Tryon's paintings are celebrated for their harmonious compositions and the delicate interplay of light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four renders, the landscapes are treated as richly textured oil paintings, with visible broad strokes, layered clouds, dark vegetation, and luminous sunset or dawn light. Restrained earthy colors, strong light-dark separation, ornate dimensional frames, and reflective water create a somber, traditional gallery-like atmosphere."},{"id":"miki-asai","name":"Miki Asai","cat":"photographers","en":"Miki Asai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/miki-asai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/miki-asai","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","floral","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["blue","dark-blue","deep-blue","charcoal"],"intro":"Miki Asai is a photographer known for her intricate and delicate macro photography, often focusing on the small wonders of nature. Her work captures the beauty of tiny details, such as dew drops on petals and the subtle play of light and shadow, creating a sense of wonder and tranquility.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic macro photography with richly saturated blue-dominant color grading, delicate highlights, and abundant water droplets. Extremely shallow focus isolates flowers and small insects against soft circular bokeh, creating a luminous, moody garden atmosphere."},{"id":"hiroshi-nagai","name":"Hiroshi Nagai","cat":"painters","en":"Hiroshi Nagai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hiroshi-nagai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hiroshi-nagai","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","urban","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","blue","beige","red","ochre"],"intro":"Hiroshi Nagai is a Japanese illustrator and artist known for his distinctive style that captures the essence of urban and natural landscapes with a nostalgic and serene quality. His work often features vibrant colors and clean lines, reflecting the influence of 1980s Japanese pop culture and city pop music.","observation":"The style combines crisp geometric architecture and strongly simplified, clean-edged forms with vivid sunset, blue-hour, and neon-lit palettes. Dense city skylines, palms, cars, mountains, and water are rendered as polished retro-futurist illustrations with graphic flat color, deep shadows, and high contrast."},{"id":"jarek-puczel","name":"Jarek Puczel","cat":"painters","en":"Jarek Puczel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jarek-puczel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jarek-puczel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","portraits","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["black","pale-cyan","muted-cyan","bone-white","white","charcoal","orange"],"intro":"Jarek Puczel is a contemporary Polish painter known for his minimalist and introspective portraiture. His work often explores themes of identity and emotion through a refined and subtle approach, utilizing soft colors and smooth gradients to create a serene atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four portraits, simplified side-facing figures are rendered as near-black silhouettes with selectively modeled faces, hair, and clothing. Restrained blue, cream, and charcoal tones, strong light-dark separation, clean graphic edges, and generous plain backgrounds create a stark, moody illustrative style."},{"id":"george-yepes","name":"George Yepes","cat":"painters","en":"George Yepes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-yepes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-yepes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","ochre","dark-brown","red","pale-orange","beige"],"intro":"George Yepes is a renowned Mexican-American artist known for his vibrant and expressive works that often explore themes of cultural identity and spirituality. His art is deeply rooted in the Chicano movement, blending traditional Mexican iconography with contemporary elements to create powerful visual narratives.","observation":"The style uses intensely detailed, close-up portraiture with visible layered brushwork, tactile impasto, and dense ornamental surfaces. Saturated reds, blues, and deep shadows are punctuated by reflective gold accents, while flowers, fabrics, veils, and jewelry merge with the faces into richly embellished, dreamlike compositions."},{"id":"david-bellemere","name":"David Bellemere","cat":"photographers","en":"David Bellemere","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-bellemere.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-bellemere","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","backlighting","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","charcoal","grey","brown","muted-orange"],"intro":"David Bellemere is a renowned French photographer known for his work in fashion and fine art photography. His distinctive style often features intimate and ethereal portraits, capturing the essence of natural beauty and sensuality. Bellemere's work has been featured in numerous high-profile fashion magazines and campaigns, making him a prominent figure in the world of contemporary photography.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic portrait photography with intimate close-up framing, shallow focus, and softly subdued natural colors. Warm backlight, windswept hair, textured clothing, and atmospheric outdoor settings create a dreamy, editorial bohemian mood across the portraits."},{"id":"laura-iverson","name":"Laura Iverson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Laura Iverson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laura-iverson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laura-iverson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-red","muted-green","dark-magenta","silver"],"intro":"Laura Iverson is an artist known for her enchanting and mystical landscape paintings, often featuring ethereal and dreamlike qualities. Her work typically incorporates elements of fantasy and nature, creating a unique blend of realism and imagination.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured brushwork shapes dark, gnarled trees and dense woodland into dramatic frames around moons and small human figures. The palette shifts between teal, green, crimson, violet, and coral while retaining strong light-dark contrast, dreamlike fantasy imagery, and an ominous, atmospheric mood."},{"id":"hans-feurer","name":"Hans Feurer","cat":"photographers","en":"Hans Feurer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-feurer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-feurer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","backlighting","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","dark-brown","brown","beige","muted-ochre","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Hans Feurer is a renowned Swiss fashion photographer known for his vibrant and dynamic imagery. His work often features bold colors and striking compositions, capturing the essence of fashion and beauty in a unique and expressive manner. Feurer's photography has been influential in the fashion industry, with a career spanning several decades.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped beauty portraits with meticulous skin, makeup, fabric, and textile detail. Strong directional sunlight creates deep shadows, patterned projections, luminous highlights, and vivid accents against restrained backgrounds, giving the images a polished editorial-fashion character."},{"id":"rachel-bingaman","name":"Rachel Bingaman","cat":"painters","en":"Rachel Bingaman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rachel-bingaman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rachel-bingaman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["light-blue","blue","red","deep-red","brown","muted-pink"],"intro":"Rachel Bingaman is an American artist known for her vibrant and imaginative landscape paintings. Her work often features surreal and dreamlike elements, blending fantasy with a painterly approach to create detailed and ethereal scenes. Bingaman's art is characterized by a central focus on natural elements, particularly trees, which are depicted with vivid colors and smooth textures.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses saturated red foliage and contrasting blue or snowy grounds in simplified, dreamlike landscape compositions. Visible brush texture and delicate clustered strokes give the trees and terrain a painterly, expressive surface, while solitary trees and small surreal details create a whimsical atmosphere."},{"id":"david-roberts","name":"David Roberts","cat":"painters","en":"David Roberts","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-roberts.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-roberts","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","orange","brown","muted-blue"],"intro":"David Roberts was a Scottish painter known for his detailed and romanticized depictions of architectural and historical scenes, particularly in the Middle East and Europe. His works often captured the grandeur and exoticism of the 19th-century world, with a focus on intricate architectural details and expansive landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured, painterly environments with immense cliffside architecture, waterways, and tiny figures that emphasize overwhelming scale. Warm atmospheric haze, cool cavern shadows, luminous openings, and strong tonal contrast give the scenes a cinematic, dreamlike fantasy character."},{"id":"leonor-fini","name":"Leonor Fini","cat":"painters","en":"Leonor Fini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leonor-fini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leonor-fini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-orange","muted-ochre","black","dark-ochre","deep-rust","rust"],"intro":"Leonor Fini was an Argentine-Italian surrealist painter known for her enigmatic and fantastical works that often explored themes of femininity and mythology. Born in 1907, she became a prominent figure in the surrealist movement, celebrated for her unique style that blended dreamlike imagery with intricate details.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, finely rendered paint to combine elegant portraiture with elaborate costumes, fur, and ornamental patterned surfaces. Muted earthy colors, dark backgrounds, and uncanny juxtapositions of people and animals give the images a dreamlike, surreal atmosphere with an antique decorative character."},{"id":"max-fleischer","name":"Max Fleischer","cat":"illustrators","en":"Max Fleischer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/max-fleischer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/max-fleischer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","bw-monochrome","comics","retro","drawing","funny"],"colours":["white","muted-orange","charcoal","brown","black","grey"],"intro":"Max Fleischer was an American animator, inventor, and film director known for creating iconic animated characters such as Betty Boop and Popeye. He was a pioneer in the animation industry, developing techniques like the rotoscope, which allowed for more realistic movement in animation. His work in the early to mid-20th century helped shape the Golden Age of Animation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines monochrome archival animation imagery with clean, graphic cartoon drawings. Heavy black outlines, simplified flat shapes, exaggerated poses, and elastic character anatomy create a playful vintage animation aesthetic, while the photographic production scenes reinforce the old studio context."},{"id":"doug-tennapel","name":"Doug TenNapel","cat":"illustrators","en":"Doug TenNapel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/doug-tennapel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/doug-tennapel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","orange","red","muted-olive","silver"],"intro":"Doug TenNapel is an American artist, writer, and animator known for his work in video games, comic books, and television. He is the creator of the popular video game character Earthworm Jim and has worked on various animated series and graphic novels. TenNapel's style is characterized by its bold, expressive lines and imaginative storytelling, often blending elements of fantasy and humor.","observation":"The style is a densely detailed, expressive comic illustration built from heavy black contours, ink-like hatching, and scratchy hand-drawn textures. Saturated reds, greens, purples, and ochres heighten the grotesque fantasy characters, while exaggerated anatomy, crooked environments, and dramatic close-ups give the scenes a lively, macabre humor."},{"id":"alex-horley","name":"Alex Horley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alex Horley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-horley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-horley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-cyan","blue","rust","light-orange"],"intro":"Alex Horley is an Italian illustrator known for his work in fantasy and science fiction art. His illustrations often feature dynamic compositions and vivid depictions of mythical creatures, warriors, and epic battles, contributing to various comic books, trading cards, and video games.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible broad strokes, layered texture, and densely modeled organic surfaces. Saturated blue, teal, and ember-orange lighting creates strong contrast around grotesque fantasy characters, ominous figures, and supernatural scenes, giving the images a dark, dramatic, surreal intensity."},{"id":"brandon-woelfel","name":"Brandon Woelfel","cat":"photographers","en":"Brandon Woelfel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brandon-woelfel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brandon-woelfel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-red","pale-cyan","grey","red","pale-red","blue"],"intro":"Brandon Woelfel is a contemporary photographer known for his vibrant and dreamy portraits that often feature whimsical lighting and a distinctive use of color. His work is characterized by a unique blend of fantasy and reality, capturing youthful subjects in urban settings with a focus on modern aesthetics and digital techniques.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, tightly cropped portrait photography with faces and glasses surrounded by colorful out-of-focus lights. Saturated teal, coral, pink, and cyan illumination creates a moody nighttime atmosphere, while shallow focus and luminous reflections in the lenses give the images a cinematic glow."},{"id":"ashraful-arefin","name":"Ashraful Arefin","cat":"photographers","en":"Ashraful Arefin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ashraful-arefin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ashraful-arefin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","floral","still-life","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","muted-blue","brown","orange","pale-orange"],"intro":"Ashraful Arefin is a contemporary photographer known for his enchanting and whimsical imagery. His work often features small creatures and playful scenarios, capturing a sense of wonder and fantasy. Arefin's photography is characterized by its vivid colors and detailed compositions, often incorporating elements of nature and everyday life.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed photographic scenes with shallow focus, soft bokeh, and a recurring teal-and-warm-orange twilight palette. Small natural subjects and still-life objects are isolated against misty, dark backgrounds, while internal light sources create luminous reflections and cinematic contrast."},{"id":"lita-cabellut","name":"Lita Cabellut","cat":"painters","en":"Lita Cabellut","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lita-cabellut.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lita-cabellut","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-orange","brown","bone-white","dark-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Lita Cabellut is a contemporary Spanish artist known for her large-scale, expressive portraits. Her work often explores themes of identity, emotion, and the human condition, utilizing a distinctive style that combines classical techniques with modern sensibilities. Cabellut's paintings are characterized by their textured surfaces and dramatic use of color, reflecting her deep interest in capturing the essence of her subjects.","observation":"These are tightly cropped painted portraits with clearly visible directional brushwork, built-up texture, and fine drawn marks across the skin and clothing. Dark grounds and garments contrast with pale faces and restrained red accents, creating an intense, emotionally charged appearance."},{"id":"olha-darchuk","name":"Olha Darchuk","cat":"painters","en":"Olha Darchuk","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olha-darchuk.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olha-darchuk","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","blue","ochre","dark-olive","red","vivid-red","pink"],"intro":"Olha Darchuk is a contemporary Ukrainian artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings, often depicting natural landscapes and floral themes. Her work is characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions, capturing the beauty and energy of the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly visible, built-up paint with energetic directional strokes and strongly saturated color. Floral and human subjects remain recognizable but dissolve into lively, impressionistic marks, with recurring umbrellas, gardens, flowers, and reflective outdoor settings creating a dreamy sense of motion."},{"id":"francoise-gilot","name":"Francoise Gilot","cat":"painters","en":"Francoise Gilot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francoise-gilot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francoise-gilot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["white","blue","light-orange","vivid-rust","black","beige"],"intro":"","observation":"Across all four images, recognizable figures, faces, interiors, flowers, and landscapes are reduced to angular blocks and strongly outlined shapes. Saturated orange, blue, red, green, black, and cream dominate, with flat graphic passages mixed with visible, energetic paint texture and repeated stripes or geometric motifs."},{"id":"kristina-makeeva","name":"Kristina Makeeva","cat":"photographers","en":"Kristina Makeeva","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kristina-makeeva.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kristina-makeeva","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","landscapes","scenes","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-cyan","red","grey","dark-red","dark-cyan","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Kristina Makeeva is a contemporary photographer known for her enchanting and surreal imagery. Her work often features vibrant colors and imaginative compositions that transport viewers to fantastical worlds.","observation":"The style combines highly saturated coral, pink, and turquoise color with elaborate, dreamlike tableaux that merge fashion imagery, oceanic landscapes, and impossible scale. Figures in flowing gowns are placed within dense cotton-like formations, balloons, parasols, whales, and reflective water, producing a polished yet boldly surreal visual world."},{"id":"louise-balaam","name":"Louise Balaam","cat":"painters","en":"Louise Balaam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louise-balaam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louise-balaam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","floral","landscapes","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","beige","silver","grey","black"],"intro":"Louise Balaam is a contemporary British artist known for her evocative landscape paintings. Her work often captures the essence of the natural world, focusing on the interplay of light, weather, and terrain. Balaam's paintings are celebrated for their emotional depth and expressive brushwork, drawing inspiration from the landscapes of the United Kingdom.","observation":"Across the four images, recognizable flowers, bottles, and shorelines are built from thick, visibly directional paint with energetic, irregular strokes. The restrained gray, cream, brown, and blue-gray palette is punctuated by strong dark-light contrasts, while details remain suggestive rather than finely delineated."},{"id":"dima-dmitriev","name":"Dima Dmitriev","cat":"painters","en":"Dima Dmitriev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dima-dmitriev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dima-dmitriev","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","dark-cyan","dark-blue","black","pale-blue","deep-red"],"intro":"Dima Dmitriev is a contemporary artist known for his unique approach to landscape painting, blending elements of fantasy and surrealism with a painterly style. His work often features vibrant colors and imaginative compositions, drawing inspiration from both classical and modern art movements.","observation":"The style uses visible, textured brushwork and fine surface marks to build richly detailed rainy and wintry landscapes. Restrained blue-gray palettes, isolated red accents, mist-softened distance, reflective water, and solitary figures create a dark, dreamy atmosphere across all four scenes."},{"id":"chris-samnee","name":"Chris Samnee","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris Samnee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-samnee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-samnee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","bold-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","ink"],"colours":["black","white","grey","vivid-red","dark-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Chris Samnee is an American comic book artist known for his work on titles such as \"Daredevil\" and \"Black Widow.\" His style is characterized by bold lines, dynamic compositions, and a strong sense of storytelling. Samnee's work often features a noir aesthetic, blending traditional comic art techniques with modern sensibilities.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white graphic illustration with heavy ink fills, bold contouring, and dense directional hatching. Noir-like figures and urban streets are framed with dramatic perspectives, deep silhouettes, and expressive atmospheric detail; one red panel reinforces the same high-contrast visual language rather than changing it."},{"id":"annie-leibovitz","name":"Annie Leibovitz","cat":"photographers","en":"Annie Leibovitz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/annie-leibovitz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/annie-leibovitz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-ochre","silver","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Annie Leibovitz is an acclaimed American portrait photographer known for her engaging and dramatic celebrity portraits. Her work often features bold compositions and a keen attention to detail, capturing the essence of her subjects in a distinctive style that has made her one of the most influential photographers of her time.","observation":"The style combines posed, cinematic portraiture with richly textured, painterly surfaces and carefully arranged figures, garments, flowers, and interiors. A restrained, dark palette of blacks, deep greens, muted earth tones, and selective crimson creates a somber theatrical mood, while elaborate clothing and botanical settings provide dense visual detail."},{"id":"matt-sesow","name":"Matt Sesow","cat":"painters","en":"Matt Sesow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-sesow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-sesow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","ink","geometric"],"colours":["black","blue","vivid-red","yellow","red","silver","dark-blue","teal"],"intro":"Matt Sesow is an American painter known for his raw, emotive, and often chaotic works that explore themes of personal trauma and resilience. His art is characterized by bold colors, distorted figures, and a frenetic energy that challenges traditional notions of beauty and form.","observation":"The style combines vivid, high-contrast color blocks with visibly layered, rough paint and energetic black linework. It is densely packed with expressive cartoon-like faces, monster characters, eyes, teeth, symbols, and handwritten marks, creating a surreal, graffiti-like visual field."},{"id":"katsuya-terada","name":"Katsuya Terada","cat":"illustrators","en":"Katsuya Terada","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/katsuya-terada.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/katsuya-terada","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","fine-lines","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","grey","charcoal","muted-ochre","orange","violet"],"intro":"Katsuya Terada is a renowned Japanese illustrator and character designer known for his intricate and detailed artworks. His work often blends elements of fantasy and science fiction, creating immersive and imaginative worlds. Terada has contributed to various media, including manga, video games, and film, and is celebrated for his unique style and visionary approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, finely drawn linework and ink-like hatching define highly intricate character portraits and biomechanical costume details. Sparse white backgrounds emphasize the expressive faces and dense mechanical forms, while selective pastel-bright color accents⁠—especially blue, orange, pink, and rust⁠—animate the illustrative science-fiction fantasy designs."},{"id":"paul-corfield","name":"Paul Corfield","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Corfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-corfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-corfield","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","flat-color","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","olive","light-blue","bone-white","blue","red"],"intro":"Paul Corfield is a contemporary British artist known for his vibrant and idyllic landscape paintings. His work often features rolling hills, structured foliage, and a whimsical portrayal of the countryside, capturing a sense of tranquility and fantasy.","observation":"These landscapes use bright, saturated colors, clean graphic shapes, and softly modeled but highly regular forms. Rounded topiary-like trees, sculpted hills, winding paths, cottages, and oversized clouds create a carefully arranged, storybook pastoral world with a dreamy fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"elena-kotliarker","name":"Elena Kotliarker","cat":"painters","en":"Elena Kotliarker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elena-kotliarker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elena-kotliarker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["ochre","dark-brown","red","grey","light-yellow","charcoal"],"intro":"Elena Kotliarker is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and intricate paintings that often incorporate elements of fantasy and nature. Her work is characterized by a rich use of color and detailed compositions, drawing inspiration from cultural folklore and mythological themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, highly saturated portraits and figures merge with birds, flowers, feathers, and swirling organic motifs in dense, interwoven compositions. Visible directional brushwork and richly built surfaces give the imagery a tactile painted quality, while delicate facial modelling contrasts with ornate, expressive decorative detail."},{"id":"mike-mignola","name":"Mike Mignola","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mike Mignola","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-mignola.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-mignola","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","fantasy","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","charcoal","deep-red","grey","light-yellow","light-orange"],"intro":"Mike Mignola is an American comic book artist and writer, best known for creating the comic series 'Hellboy.' His distinctive style is characterized by its use of heavy shadows, minimalistic lines, and a gothic aesthetic, often drawing on themes of horror and folklore.","observation":"The style uses heavily inked, graphic-novel imagery with thick contour lines, flattened color blocks, and dense scratch-like texturing. Across the renders, saturated red-orange grounds contrast sharply with black and blue-gray forms, creating dramatic scenes of cloaked characters, monsters, weapons, and ruined fantastical landscapes."},{"id":"fred-benes","name":"Fred Benes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Fred Benes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fred-benes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fred-benes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-red","charcoal","orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Fred Benes is a fictional representation inspired by the work of real-life illustrators known for their contributions to comic book art and fantasy illustrations. The style often reflects a blend of bold, dynamic visuals with a focus on character-driven narratives, drawing from a rich tradition of graphic storytelling.","observation":"The style uses highly rendered comic-book character art with forceful ink outlines, dense crosshatched shading, and energetic directional marks. Saturated reds, oranges, and deep blues are pushed against heavy blacks, creating expressive, dramatic portraits and action-oriented fantasy imagery."},{"id":"wes-anderson","name":"Wes Anderson","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Wes Anderson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wes-anderson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wes-anderson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","vivid-colors","cinematic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-brown","red","light-cyan","deep-red","muted-red"],"intro":"Wes Anderson is a renowned American filmmaker known for his distinctive visual and narrative style. His films often feature meticulously crafted sets, symmetrical compositions, and a unique color palette that creates a whimsical and nostalgic atmosphere. Anderson's storytelling is characterized by its quirky characters and intricate plots, often exploring themes of family, adventure, and identity.","observation":"A cinematic, realistic style built around meticulously centered compositions, rigid architectural symmetry, and carefully staged characters. Saturated pink, red, green, and blue palettes, tailored costumes, period furnishings, and theatrical interiors create a polished, storybook-like visual world."},{"id":"isao-takahata","name":"Isao Takahata","cat":"illustrators","en":"Isao Takahata","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isao-takahata.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isao-takahata","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","dark-olive","muted-orange","olive"],"intro":"Isao Takahata was a renowned Japanese film director, producer, and co-founder of Studio Ghibli , known for his work on animated films such as \" Grave of the Fireflies \" and \"The Tale of the Princess Kaguya.\" His films are celebrated for their emotional depth, attention to detail, and exploration of themes like family, nature, and the human condition.","observation":"Across the renders, softly textured brushwork combines with fine drawn contours, naturalistic landscapes, and expressive child characters. Muted blue-green and earthy colors, atmospheric skies, broad scenic framing, and recurring walking or looking figures create a quiet, dreamy visual narrative."},{"id":"rainer-fetting","name":"Rainer Fetting","cat":"painters","en":"Rainer Fetting","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rainer-fetting.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rainer-fetting","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","red","dark-blue","deep-blue","green"],"intro":"Rainer Fetting is a German painter and sculptor, known for his association with the Neue Wilde movement, a group of neo-expressionist artists in the late 20th century. His work often explores themes of identity, urban life, and human emotion, characterized by bold colors and expressive brushwork.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and portraits are built from broad, visible brushstrokes, rough edges, and emphatic dark linework. Saturated red, blue, and green fields contrast sharply with near-black shadows, producing an expressive, dramatic painted style with cropped, fashion-oriented poses."},{"id":"humberto-ramos","name":"Humberto Ramos","cat":"illustrators","en":"Humberto Ramos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/humberto-ramos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/humberto-ramos","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","beige","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Humberto Ramos is a renowned comic book artist known for his dynamic and expressive style, particularly in the superhero genre. He has worked with major publishers like Marvel and DC Comics, contributing to popular series such as Spider-Man and X-Men. Ramos's work is characterized by its energetic line work and vivid color palettes, making his illustrations instantly recognizable.","observation":"The style combines expressive, heavily worked portraiture with fine ink contours, loose sketch marks, and visible painterly brushwork. Muted earth and grey tones are punctuated by strong reds and deep shadows, while dense costume, hair, and surface details give the figures a dramatic graphic-novel and fantasy character."},{"id":"pierre-adolphe-valette","name":"Pierre Adolphe Valette","cat":"painters","en":"Pierre Adolphe Valette","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-adolphe-valette.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-adolphe-valette","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","pale-orange","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Pierre Adolphe Valette is a French painter known for his impressionistic landscapes and urban scenes. He was active in the early 20th century and is celebrated for his atmospheric depictions of Manchester, England, where he spent much of his career. Valette's work is characterized by its delicate handling of light and color, often capturing the misty and industrial ambiance of the city.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines visible painted texture and fine drawn contours with richly layered scenes of urban and garden life. Restrained ochres, creams, greens, reds, and deep blacks create a period-fashioned atmosphere, while strong architectural framing, dramatic shadows, and carefully posed figures give the pictures a cinematic, illustrative character."},{"id":"jean-michel-basquiat","name":"Jean-Michel Basquiat","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Michel Basquiat","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-michel-basquiat.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-michel-basquiat","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","cyan","black","muted-rust","vivid-red","orange"],"intro":"Jean-Michel Basquiat was an influential American artist known for his raw, expressive style that combined elements of street art and neo-expressionism. Emerging from the New York City art scene in the late 1970s and 1980s, Basquiat's work often explored themes of identity, race, and social commentary, incorporating text and symbols into his vibrant compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, rough painted surfaces, forceful black outlines, scribbled marks, and layered blocks of red, blue, orange, black, and cream create an energetic mixed-media look. Crowned, mask-like faces recur as expressive figures, combining flat graphic shapes with visible brushwork, drips, scratches, and dense improvised linework."},{"id":"claude-monet","name":"Claude Monet","cat":"painters","en":"Claude Monet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claude-monet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claude-monet","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","blue","dark-green","grey","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Claude Monet was a French painter and a founder of the Impressionist movement, known for his innovative use of light and color. His works often depicted landscapes and scenes of nature, capturing fleeting moments with a focus on the effects of light and atmosphere. Monet's paintings are characterized by loose brushwork and a vibrant color palette, which convey a sense of immediacy and movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, natural landscapes and reflective ponds are built from visible, directional brushwork, layered marks, and softly blended light. The scenes feel calm and dreamlike, with subdued blue-green and lavender tones, water-lily detail, atmospheric reflections, and occasional ornate framing."},{"id":"tony-diterlizzi","name":"Tony DiTerlizzi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tony DiTerlizzi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tony-diterlizzi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tony-diterlizzi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","dark-ochre","charcoal","muted-ochre","brown","red"],"intro":"Tony DiTerlizzi is an American illustrator and writer, renowned for his work in children's literature and fantasy art. He is best known for co-authoring and illustrating \"The Spiderwick Chronicles,\" a series that has captivated readers with its enchanting and imaginative storytelling. DiTerlizzi's artistic style is characterized by its intricate detail, whimsical characters, and a strong narrative quality, making his work both visually captivating and richly engaging.","observation":"The style combines finely drawn ink contours with translucent, visibly textured watercolor-like paint, giving every creature and costume a tactile, hand-rendered presence. It is densely populated with expressive anthropomorphic animal characters, eccentric garments, props, and narrative interactions, using an earthy storybook palette with occasional saturated reds, blues, and greens."},{"id":"roe-ethridge","name":"Roe Ethridge","cat":"photographers","en":"Roe Ethridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roe-ethridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roe-ethridge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-olive","deep-red","grey","black","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Roe Ethridge is a contemporary American photographer known for his eclectic and conceptual approach to photography. He often blends commercial and fine art styles, creating images that are both familiar and unsettling. His work is characterized by a mix of staged and found imagery, exploring themes of identity, consumerism, and the everyday.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, editorial fashion photography with carefully staged tableaux, strong geometric compositions, and dramatic directional sunlight. Rich floral surfaces, vintage furnishings, saturated red and green accents, and period-inspired clothing create a polished retro atmosphere, while the subjects remain sharply detailed and theatrically posed."},{"id":"lim-heng-swee","name":"Lim Heng Swee","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lim Heng Swee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lim-heng-swee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lim-heng-swee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["muted-cyan","muted-teal","black","bone-white","vivid-red"],"intro":"Lim Heng Swee is a contemporary illustrator known for his whimsical and minimalist style. His work often features playful and imaginative scenes, blending simplicity with a touch of humor and charm. Swee's illustrations are characterized by clean lines, soft color palettes, and a focus on nature and everyday life, capturing a sense of tranquility and joy.","observation":"The style combines graphic, clean-edged illustration with surreal juxtapositions, tiny silhouetted figures, oversized balloons, animals, and impossible landscapes. A restrained teal ground is punctuated by vivid red and pale cream accents, while grainy texture, strong dark-light contrast, and large areas of empty space give the scenes a dreamlike poster-like character."},{"id":"alastair-magnaldo","name":"Alastair Magnaldo","cat":"photographers","en":"Alastair Magnaldo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alastair-magnaldo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alastair-magnaldo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","motion","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","black","muted-blue","brown","silver","dark-blue"],"intro":"Alastair Magnaldo is a contemporary photographer known for his surreal and imaginative compositions. His work often blends reality with fantasy, creating dreamlike scenes that challenge perceptions and evoke a sense of wonder. Magnaldo's photography is characterized by meticulous attention to detail and a unique ability to transform ordinary landscapes into extraordinary visions.","observation":"Across the sheet, realistic photographic rendering is combined with dreamlike, impossible juxtapositions: monumental clouds, floating spheres, vast curtains, circular apertures, boats, birds, and tiny isolated people. Muted blue-gray and sepia tones, dramatic natural light, expansive negative space, and carefully staged compositions give the scenes a cinematic, epic atmosphere."},{"id":"terry-richardson","name":"Terry Richardson","cat":"photographers","en":"Terry Richardson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/terry-richardson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/terry-richardson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors"],"colours":["white","brown","black","bone-white","grey","muted-red"],"intro":"Terry Richardson is a contemporary American fashion and portrait photographer known for his provocative and candid style. His work often features celebrities and models in bold, sometimes controversial poses, capturing a raw and unfiltered aesthetic. Richardson's photography has been featured in numerous high-profile fashion magazines and advertising campaigns, making him a prominent figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style is grounded in realistic, tightly cropped portrait photography with direct flash, shallow focus, and a lightly grainy snapshot texture. Muted cool backgrounds contrast with pale skin, dark clothing, messy hair, tattoos, and expressive styling, while spontaneous gestures and close physical proximity give the images an intimate party-documentary feel."},{"id":"rick-remender","name":"Rick Remender","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rick Remender","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rick-remender.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rick-remender","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["charcoal","black","bone-white","muted-cyan","muted-ochre","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Rick Remender is a renowned comic book writer and artist known for his work on titles such as \"Fear Agent,\" \"Deadly Class,\" and \"Black Science.\" His storytelling often blends elements of science fiction, fantasy, and adventure, characterized by complex characters and intricate plots.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, expressive character illustration with sharply drawn contours, layered costumes, and heavily textured surfaces. Cool blue-green shadows are repeatedly punctuated by vivid orange, with strong light-dark separation and a hybrid fantasy science-fiction atmosphere."},{"id":"michael-lang","name":"Michael Lang","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Lang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-lang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-lang","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-green","ochre","muted-yellow","dark-red"],"intro":"Michael Lang is a contemporary artist known for his surreal and expressive paintings. His work often explores themes of fantasy and abstraction, creating a unique visual language that captivates viewers.","observation":"Across all four portraits, recognizable faces are broken into angular, geometric planes and reunited with strong dark contour lines. Saturated teal, rust, red, orange, and green dominate, while visible directional brushwork and layered paint give the otherwise graphic compositions a tactile, expressive surface."},{"id":"elisabeth-sonrel","name":"Elisabeth Sonrel","cat":"painters","en":"Elisabeth Sonrel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elisabeth-sonrel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elisabeth-sonrel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","black","deep-rust","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Elisabeth Sonrel was a French painter and illustrator known for her Art Nouveau style, which often featured mythological and allegorical themes. Born in 1874, she gained recognition for her detailed and romantic portrayals of feminine beauty, often incorporating floral motifs and natural elements. Her work is characterized by its delicate detailing and harmonious compositions, reflecting the aesthetics of the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"Highly detailed painted portraits are tightly interwoven with abundant flowers, leaves, flowing hair, patterned clothing, and jewelry. Fine brushwork, layered botanical decoration, saturated orange, green, cream, and red hues, and intimate close cropping create a lush, dreamy, classically decorative appearance."},{"id":"james-avati","name":"James Avati","cat":"illustrators","en":"James Avati","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-avati.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-avati","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-brown","ochre","beige","vivid-red"],"intro":"James Avati is known as an American illustrator celebrated for his work in paperback book covers during the mid-20th century. His illustrations often depicted realistic and emotionally charged scenes, capturing the essence of the narratives they accompanied. Avati's work is characterized by its attention to detail and ability to convey complex emotions through visual storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, controlled brushwork to model glamorous figures with rich surfaces, strong facial features, and expressive poses. Deep shadows, warm reds, greens, and amber highlights create a dramatic vintage atmosphere, while crowded interiors, costumes, and props give the portraits a polished retro illustration quality."},{"id":"sally-cruikshank","name":"Sally Cruikshank","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sally Cruikshank","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sally-cruikshank.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sally-cruikshank","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","bone-white","ochre","red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Sally Cruikshank is an American animator and cartoonist known for her distinctive and whimsical style. She gained recognition for her work in animation, particularly in the 1970s and 1980s, with films like \"Quasi at the Quackadero.\" Her animations are celebrated for their surreal and playful qualities, often featuring eccentric characters and vibrant colors.","observation":"A densely layered illustrative collage combines fine drawn lines, crisp decorative forms, and an abundance of separately readable botanical, animal, and costume details. Saturated reds, greens, blues, and creams create a vivid, high-contrast fantasy world where natural history imagery blends with surreal mythical creatures and ornate patterning."},{"id":"henri-matisse","name":"Henri Matisse","cat":"painters","en":"Henri Matisse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-matisse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-matisse","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","still-life","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["vivid-red","dark-olive","ochre","light-orange","dark-blue","grey"],"intro":"Henri Matisse was a French artist known for his use of color and his fluid and original draughtsmanship. He was a leading figure in modern art and a prominent member of the Fauvist movement, which emphasized painterly qualities and strong color over representational or realistic values.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines visible, directional brushwork with flattened yet richly described interiors, figures, flowers, foliage, ceramics, and textiles. Saturated orange, cobalt blue, deep green, and coral dominate, reinforced by dark contouring, strong contrast, decorative pattern, and densely layered domestic arrangements."},{"id":"etel-adnan","name":"Etel Adnan","cat":"painters","en":"Etel Adnan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/etel-adnan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/etel-adnan","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["pale-red","light-orange","vivid-red","dark-olive","dark-blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"Etel Adnan is a Lebanese-American poet, essayist, and visual artist known for her vibrant abstract landscapes. Her work often explores themes of nature, identity, and the interplay between color and form, drawing inspiration from her diverse cultural background and the landscapes of the Mediterranean.","observation":"Across all four works, landscapes are reduced to broad, angular landforms and horizon bands in highly saturated pinks, oranges, blues, greens, and yellows. Clean-edged color fields are combined with visible painted texture and simplified, graphic silhouettes, giving the series a bold illustrative character while retaining the physical feel of applied paint."},{"id":"rembrandt-harmenszoon-van-rijn","name":"Rembrandt","cat":"painters","en":"Rembrandt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rembrandt-harmenszoon-van-rijn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rembrandt-harmenszoon-van-rijn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","brown"],"intro":"Rembrandt Harmenszoon van Rijn was a Dutch painter and etcher known for his realistic depiction of light and shadow through the use of chiaroscuro in his Baroque paintings, drawings, and prints.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses visible, finely controlled brushwork to model aged faces and textured hair against expanses of near-black ground. Strong light-to-dark separation, restrained umber or monochrome palettes, cropped bust compositions, and solemn expressions create a classical, grave presence."},{"id":"phyllis-galembo","name":"Phyllis Galembo","cat":"photographers","en":"Phyllis Galembo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/phyllis-galembo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/phyllis-galembo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["muted-teal","muted-red","brown","bone-white","red","ochre"],"intro":"Phyllis Galembo is an American photographer known for her work documenting cultural and religious traditions, particularly in Africa and the Caribbean. Her photography often explores themes of identity, ritual, and costume, capturing vibrant and intricate details of traditional attire and ceremonies.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly costumed Black figures are presented in vivid, highly detailed portrait scenes, with enormous floral and feathered headdresses, layered textiles, embellishments, and expressive styling. The realistic photographic treatment is heightened by surreal theatrical costumes and weathered turquoise walls, creating a tactile, ornate, fashion-focused visual language."},{"id":"constance-spry","name":"Constance Spry","cat":"illustrators","en":"Constance Spry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/constance-spry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/constance-spry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","patterns","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","brown","dark-brown","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Constance Spry was a renowned British floral designer and educator, known for her innovative and naturalistic approach to flower arranging. She revolutionized floral design in the early to mid-20th century, emphasizing the use of unconventional materials and wildflowers, and authored several influential books on the subject.","observation":"The style presents abundant floral still lifes with layered, irregular bouquets, trailing stems, fallen petals, and richly textured vessels. Visible brushwork and softly modelled petals give the images a hand-painted surface, while dark backgrounds, warm subdued hues, and selective highlights create a dramatic, intimate atmosphere."},{"id":"egon-schiele","name":"Egon Schiele","cat":"painters","en":"Egon Schiele","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/egon-schiele.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/egon-schiele","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["bone-white","black","muted-orange","muted-ochre","brown","rust"],"intro":"Egon Schiele was an Austrian painter known for his intense and raw expressionist works. Born in 1890, Schiele became a prominent figure in the early 20th-century art scene, particularly associated with the Vienna Secession movement. His work is characterized by its bold, expressive lines, and often erotic and psychological themes, exploring the human form and emotions in a distinctive and provocative manner.","observation":"The style combines finely drawn, ink-like contour lines with translucent, visibly textured paint washes, producing highly detailed close-up portraits. Muted beige, brown, black, and ochre tones, rough hair rendering, and weary or distressed expressions give the images an intimate, somber intensity."},{"id":"anne-rothenstein","name":"Anne Rothenstein","cat":"painters","en":"Anne Rothenstein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-rothenstein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-rothenstein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","red","dark-olive","muted-ochre","dark-brown","light-yellow"],"intro":"Anne Rothenstein is a contemporary British artist known for her distinctive figurative paintings. Her work often features elongated figures and stylized faces, drawing inspiration from modernist influences and Western art traditions. Rothenstein's art is characterized by its introspective and contemplative mood, often exploring themes of human emotion and intimate settings.","observation":"These portraits use visible, controlled brushwork with fine linear accents, simplified geometric interiors, and carefully modelled but slightly elongated figures. Repeated blocks of red, green, black, cream, and brown create a subdued, psychologically introspective atmosphere, while the seated poses and cropped framing give the scenes a formal, still tension."},{"id":"riitta-ikonen","name":"Riitta Ikonen","cat":"various-artists","en":"Riitta Ikonen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/riitta-ikonen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/riitta-ikonen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","fantasy","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","white","brown","olive","dark-green","grey"],"intro":"Riitta Ikonen is a Finnish artist known for her innovative use of natural materials and costume design to explore themes of identity and the human connection to nature. Her work often involves collaboration with communities and draws on folk traditions and environmental themes, creating a unique blend of art and nature.","observation":"The style is grounded in realistic, cinematic photography with subdued, cool greens and greys, dense natural texture, and soft overcast light. Human figures are integrated into mossy woodland environments as uncanny, dreamlike camouflage forms, balancing documentary-looking landscapes with a quiet fantasy mood."},{"id":"alexander-jansson","name":"Alexander Jansson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alexander Jansson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexander-jansson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexander-jansson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-green","light-teal","muted-teal","muted-green","brown","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Alexander Jansson is a Swedish illustrator known for his whimsical and surreal artwork, often featuring fantastical creatures and dreamlike landscapes. His work is characterized by a blend of digital techniques and traditional illustration methods, creating a unique style that is both detailed and imaginative.","observation":"The style presents richly layered fantasy landscapes with crooked, storybook architecture, dense vegetation, reflective water, and small narrative figures. Painterly textures, deep teal-green atmosphere, warm interior lights, mist, and selective luminous accents create a cinematic, dreamlike mood across the varied scenes."},{"id":"chris-cunningham","name":"Chris Cunningham","cat":"various-artists","en":"Chris Cunningham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-cunningham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-cunningham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","collage","dark","geometric"],"colours":["black","beige","red","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Chris Cunningham is a renowned British director and artist known for his innovative work in music videos and film. He gained fame for his collaborations with artists like Aphex Twin and Björk, creating visually striking and often unsettling imagery that blends the boundaries between the human and the mechanical.","observation":"The style combines stark close-up portraiture with distressed collage construction, hard flash, deep black backgrounds, and selective red or monochrome treatment. Grain, scanline-like interference, rough paper textures, geometric blocks, and disrupted facial features create a tense, surreal editorial image language."},{"id":"kim-keever","name":"Kim Keever","cat":"photographers","en":"Kim Keever","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kim-keever.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kim-keever","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","grey","beige","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Kim Keever is an American artist known for his innovative approach to photography, often involving large-scale water tanks to create ethereal and surreal landscapes. His work blends elements of painting and photography, resulting in dreamlike images that challenge the boundaries between reality and imagination.","observation":"These images combine lush, highly detailed landscape compositions with enormous sculptural clouds that resemble painted or cotton-like masses, creating a surreal fantasy environment. Saturated coral, pink, blue, teal, and orange hues, reflective water, luminous haze, and abundant flowering vegetation give the style a dreamy yet grand, otherworldly character."},{"id":"john-singleton-copley","name":"John Singleton Copley","cat":"painters","en":"John Singleton Copley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-singleton-copley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-singleton-copley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-blue","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"John Singleton Copley was an American painter, born in 1738, renowned for his portraits of prominent figures in colonial New England. His works are celebrated for their detail, realism, and ability to capture the character and status of his subjects. Copley's style is characterized by its precision, use of light, and incorporation of European influences, which he later expanded upon during his time in England.","observation":"The style uses richly visible, broad painterly strokes to model expressive figures, elaborate clothing, and turbulent skies, with strong dark-light contrasts and deep, moody tones. Across the scenes, theatrical gestures, crowded arrangements, and emotionally charged faces create a grand classical drama."},{"id":"nicoletta-ceccoli","name":"Nicoletta Ceccoli","cat":"illustrators","en":"Nicoletta Ceccoli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicoletta-ceccoli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicoletta-ceccoli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","beige","bone-white","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Nicoletta Ceccoli is an Italian illustrator known for her enchanting and surreal artworks. Her illustrations often feature whimsical and eerie themes, blending elements of fantasy and childhood innocence. Ceccoli's work is recognized for its delicate detailing and dreamlike quality, capturing the imagination with its unique blend of the cute and the dark.","observation":"The style combines softly rendered, finely textured painting with doll-like figures, porcelain complexions, exaggerated hair, and richly patterned clothing. Muted gray-green grounds, gentle rosy accents, and unusual animal companions create a melancholic, dreamlike fairytale atmosphere across the portraits and vignettes."},{"id":"edwin-henry-landseer","name":"Edwin Henry Landseer","cat":"painters","en":"Edwin Henry Landseer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edwin-henry-landseer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edwin-henry-landseer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Edwin Henry Landseer was a prominent British painter and sculptor, renowned for his animal paintings and sculptures during the 19th century. His works often depicted animals with human-like expressions and emotions, capturing the Victorian fascination with nature and wildlife. Landseer was a favorite of Queen Victoria and was knighted for his contributions to art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork building fur, foliage, and shadowed backgrounds. Dogs are arranged in expressive, dramatic group scenes using an earthy, subdued palette, deep surrounding darkness, and strong light-and-shadow modelling."},{"id":"kansuke-yamamoto","name":"Kansuke Yamamoto","cat":"photographers","en":"Kansuke Yamamoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kansuke-yamamoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kansuke-yamamoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","collage","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","bone-white","grey","black","white"],"intro":"Kansuke Yamamoto is a Japanese photographer and poet known for his surreal and avant-garde works. He was a prominent figure in the Japanese avant-garde art scene during the 20th century, blending elements of surrealism and dadaism in his photography. Yamamoto's work often explores themes of identity, nature, and transformation, utilizing photomontage and collage techniques to create dreamlike and enigmatic images.","observation":"A monochrome portrait style built around intimate, tightly cropped faces, deep shadows, and strong tonal separation. Disheveled hair, obscured features, torn-paper overlays, and grain create an expressive, unsettling editorial mood, with sparse backgrounds emphasizing the figures."},{"id":"fitz-henry-lane","name":"Fitz Henry Lane","cat":"painters","en":"Fitz Henry Lane","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fitz-henry-lane.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fitz-henry-lane","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","beige","brown","orange","grey","silver"],"intro":"Fitz Henry Lane was a prominent American painter known for his luminist landscapes and maritime scenes during the 19th century. Born in 1804, Lane became renowned for his detailed and atmospheric depictions of the New England coast, capturing the interplay of light and water with a serene and romantic touch. His works are celebrated for their tranquil beauty and precise rendering of natural elements, contributing significantly to the American landscape painting tradition.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly seascapes with carefully rendered rigging, sails, waves, clouds, and reflective water. Dramatic low sunlight, moonlight, mist, and subdued blue-gray and amber tones create a cinematic, atmospheric sense of maritime grandeur across both tranquil harbors and rough open water."},{"id":"genndy-tartakovsky","name":"Genndy Tartakovsky","cat":"illustrators","en":"Genndy Tartakovsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/genndy-tartakovsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/genndy-tartakovsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-red","muted-teal","blue","dark-blue"],"intro":"Genndy Tartakovsky is a renowned animator and director known for creating popular animated series such as \" Samurai Jack \" and \"Dexter's Laboratory.\" His work is characterized by a distinctive style that blends action and storytelling with unique visual elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic comic-like silhouettes, thick angular outlines, sharply simplified shapes, and intense flat color contrasts. Rough, visibly textured painted backgrounds add expressive energy to fantastical scenes of forests, cliffs, castles, monsters, and heroic figures."},{"id":"jim-lee","name":"Jim Lee","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jim Lee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-lee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-lee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","beige","red","vivid-red","olive"],"intro":"Jim Lee is a renowned comic book artist and writer, known for his influential work in the American comic book industry. He has contributed significantly to the development of iconic characters and series, particularly with DC Comics and Marvel. Lee's style is characterized by its dynamic composition, detailed line work, and vivid portrayal of superhero figures.","observation":"The style is graphic and comic-book driven, combining forceful ink contours, dense crosshatching, scratchy textural marks, and strongly modeled anatomy. Across the sheet, expressive character portraits and full figures use dramatic cropping, high contrast, and selective saturated reds, blues, and greens against monochrome or paper-toned grounds."},{"id":"raina-telgemeier","name":"Raina Telgemeier","cat":"illustrators","en":"Raina Telgemeier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raina-telgemeier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raina-telgemeier","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","muted-cyan","olive","bone-white","light-yellow","orange"],"intro":"Raina Telgemeier is a celebrated American cartoonist and graphic novelist known for her work in children's and young adult literature. Her graphic novels often explore themes of adolescence, friendship, and personal growth, resonating with readers of all ages. Telgemeier's storytelling is characterized by its relatable narratives and engaging visual style, making her a prominent figure in contemporary comics.","observation":"The style is a colorful comic illustration with thick black contour lines, clean flat color areas, and lively hand-drawn texture. Exaggerated facial expressions, oversized eyes and glasses, playful gestures, and recurring animal companions give the scenes a warm, humorous storybook character."},{"id":"ithell-colquhoun","name":"Ithell Colquhoun","cat":"painters","en":"Ithell Colquhoun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ithell-colquhoun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ithell-colquhoun","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["pale-yellow","charcoal","red","muted-blue","vivid-red","muted-olive"],"intro":"Ithell Colquhoun was a British artist and writer known for her contributions to surrealism and her exploration of esoteric themes. Born in 1906, she was a prominent figure in the 20th-century art scene, blending mystical and symbolic elements in her work. Her art often delved into the realms of the subconscious and the spiritual, creating a unique fusion of visual and thematic depth.","observation":"The style combines densely layered natural imagery with visible painted texture, fine directional marks, and crisp illustrative contours. Saturated coral, turquoise, green, blue, and red hues unify floral, animal, and mountainous forms, while surreal juxtapositions and flowing contours make the compositions feel like elaborate botanical-geological collages."},{"id":"simon-kenny","name":"Simon Kenny","cat":"painters","en":"Simon Kenny","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/simon-kenny.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/simon-kenny","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-red","dark-red","red","black","dark-cyan","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Simon Kenny is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant abstract paintings that explore themes of emotion and spirituality. His work often features dynamic compositions and a vivid color palette, creating a sense of movement and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is abstract and painterly, built from broad, visibly worked strokes that form swirling, cloud-like masses rather than identifiable subjects. Saturated teal, coral, red, orange, and violet collide with deep shadow, while luminous internal color and turbulent flow create an expressive, dreamy atmosphere."},{"id":"elise-palmigiani","name":"Elise Palmigiani","cat":"painters","en":"Elise Palmigiani","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elise-palmigiani.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elise-palmigiani","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["blue","vivid-red","dark-blue","red","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Elise Palmigiani is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings that often explore themes of emotion and nature. Her work is characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions, capturing the essence of her subjects with a unique blend of abstraction and realism.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable people, horses, and a coastal town are built from vigorous, visible palette-knife strokes and rough, layered paint. The style relies on saturated cobalt blues and hot reds or oranges, strong dark-light contrasts, angular contours, and expressive distortion while retaining clear representational subjects."},{"id":"roger-hargreaves","name":"Roger Hargreaves","cat":"illustrators","en":"Roger Hargreaves","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-hargreaves.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-hargreaves","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","cute","funny","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","blue","white","brown","vivid-orange","pink"],"intro":"Roger Hargreaves is best known as the creator of the beloved \"Mr. Men\" and \"Little Miss\" series, which have captivated children and adults alike with their charming simplicity and humor. Born in England, Hargreaves's work is characterized by its bold use of color, playful characters, and engaging narratives, making him a significant figure in children's literature.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses brightly colored, hand-painted blocks filled with friendly, simplified monster-like characters. Thick black outlines, flat graphic shapes, visible brush texture, exaggerated eyes and uncomplicated expressions create a playful, childlike illustrative language."},{"id":"nick-park","name":"Nick Park","cat":"illustrators","en":"Nick Park","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nick-park.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nick-park","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","drawing"],"colours":["brown","white","beige","black","rust","deep-red"],"intro":"Nick Park is a renowned British animator and filmmaker best known for creating the beloved claymation characters Wallace and Gromit. His work is characterized by a unique blend of humor, charm, and meticulous craftsmanship, earning him multiple Academy Awards and a place in animation history.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic portrait photography with expressive handmade sheep puppets, presenting the maker and characters in richly populated workshop settings. It shifts between polished shallow-focus photographs and a loose fine-line illustrated treatment, while maintaining subdued, tactile textures and carefully observed facial expressions."},{"id":"vincent-van-gogh","name":"Vincent van Gogh","cat":"painters","en":"Vincent van Gogh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vincent-van-gogh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vincent-van-gogh","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","portraits","glow","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["blue","dark-blue","ochre","brown","dark-brown","silver"],"intro":"Vincent van Gogh is a renowned Dutch painter known for his post-impressionist works that have had a profound influence on 20th-century art. Born in 1853, van Gogh's career was marked by a unique style characterized by bold colors and dramatic, expressive brushwork. Despite his struggles with mental health, he produced over 2,000 artworks, including famous pieces like \"Starry Night \" and \"Sunflowers,\" which continue to captivate audiences worldwide.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, visible directional brushwork to make skies, clouds, fields, buildings, and faces feel turbulent and alive. Strong blue-and-gold color contrasts, luminous accents, and swirling contours create an expressive, richly textured painted look while retaining clearly readable landscapes, scenes, and portrait forms."},{"id":"dran","name":"Dran","cat":"street-artists","en":"Dran","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dran.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dran","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","orange","bone-white","silver","red","blue"],"intro":"Dran is a French street artist known for his satirical and humorous approach to social commentary. Often referred to as the 'French Banksy ,' Dran uses his art to critique societal norms and issues, blending dark humor with poignant messages. His work often features children and everyday scenes, rendered with a distinctive illustrative style that combines elements of graffiti and fine art.","observation":"Across the sheet, vividly colored character scenes combine visible brushwork, rough layered surfaces, and strong drawn contours. The imagery is highly detailed and expressive, pairing whimsical human-animal and mechanical figures with graffiti-like backgrounds, distressed textures, and surreal narrative situations."},{"id":"jock","name":"Jock","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jock","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jock.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jock","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","black","silver","brown","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jock is a renowned British comic book artist and illustrator, celebrated for his work in graphic novels and film concept art. Known for his dynamic and bold style, Jock has contributed to major titles and franchises, bringing a unique visual flair that combines expressive line work with a cinematic approach.","observation":"Across the four images, recognizable portraits, figures, birds, and architecture are fragmented into forceful geometric blocks and layered, visibly brushed paint. A stark black, white, and red scheme dominates, with cyan and pink accents, deep contrast, scraped textures, drips, and large areas of pale negative space creating an expressive urban atmosphere."},{"id":"baz-luhrmann","name":"Baz Luhrmann","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Baz Luhrmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/baz-luhrmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/baz-luhrmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["red","deep-red","black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Baz Luhrmann is an Australian filmmaker known for his visually extravagant and stylistically bold films. His works often blend elements of theater, music, and dance, creating a unique cinematic experience. Luhrmann's films are characterized by their vibrant color palettes, dynamic storytelling, and a flair for the dramatic, often reimagining classic tales with a modern twist.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, energetic brushwork to build expressive figures, clothing, interiors, and crowds with a richly layered painted surface. Strong warm reds, oranges, and greens are shaped by theatrical lighting, glowing fixtures, deep shadows, and cinematic social moments."},{"id":"andrew-wyeth","name":"Andrew Wyeth","cat":"painters","en":"Andrew Wyeth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrew-wyeth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrew-wyeth","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["beige","cream","brown","black","dark-brown"],"intro":"Andrew Wyeth is one of the most celebrated American painters of the 20th century, known for his detailed and realistic depictions of rural life. His work often focuses on the landscapes and people of Pennsylvania and Maine, capturing the quiet and introspective nature of these settings. Wyeth's paintings are characterized by their use of tempera and watercolor, creating a distinctive texture and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses muted brown, grey, and winter-white tones with visible, softly textured paint handling and fine linear detail in branches, buildings, and clothing. Solitary figures and sparse rural landscapes are arranged as quiet, bleak narrative scenes, with an old-fashioned illustrative atmosphere and subdued dramatic mood."},{"id":"ruth-asawa","name":"Ruth Asawa","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Ruth Asawa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ruth-asawa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ruth-asawa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","floral","patterns","still-life","glow","fine-lines","subdued-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white","white"],"intro":"Ruth Asawa is a renowned American sculptor known for her intricate wire sculptures and contributions to modern art. Born in 1926, she became a significant figure in the 20th-century art scene, celebrated for her innovative techniques and dedication to arts education. Asawa's work is characterized by its organic forms and delicate structures, often inspired by nature and geometry.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, fine-lined wire structures with sculptural organic forms, repeatedly echoing seed pods, flowers, and branching trees. Restrained neutral tones, warm internal illumination, strong radial symmetry, and projected shadows give the objects an ornate yet minimalist-interior presentation."},{"id":"pierre-auguste-cot","name":"Pierre-Auguste Cot","cat":"painters","en":"Pierre-Auguste Cot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-auguste-cot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-auguste-cot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Pierre-Auguste Cot was a French painter known for his works in the academic style, particularly during the 19th century. He is celebrated for his romantic and idealized depictions of pastoral and mythological scenes, often characterized by soft lighting and detailed brushwork. Cot's paintings frequently explore themes of youthful innocence and romantic encounters, capturing the essence of the romanticism movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, soft modeling, and fine textural detail to portray expressive female portrait studies. Dark grounds, warm flesh tones, restrained floral colors, and strong light-dark separation create a romantic, somber atmosphere, while roses and flowing garments provide recurring decorative accents."},{"id":"naoki-urasawa","name":"Naoki Urasawa","cat":"illustrators","en":"Naoki Urasawa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/naoki-urasawa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/naoki-urasawa","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing"],"colours":["silver","black","charcoal","grey","white"],"intro":"Naoki Urasawa is a renowned Japanese manga artist and writer, celebrated for his intricate storytelling and detailed artwork. Known for works like \"Monster,\" \"20th Century Boys,\" and \"Pluto,\" Urasawa has made significant contributions to the manga industry, blending suspense, drama, and psychological depth in his narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed black-and-white comic illustration with precise fine lines, dense hatching, and strong light-dark contrast. It combines expressive close-up character portraits with urban settings and dynamic, cinematic-feeling panel compositions."},{"id":"otto-schmidt","name":"Otto Schmidt","cat":"various-artists","en":"Otto Schmidt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/otto-schmidt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/otto-schmidt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","grey","pale-orange","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Otto Schmidt is an artist known for his distinctive style in comic book illustration and character design, often blending elements of fantasy and realism. His work is characterized by bold lines, vibrant colors, and a unique approach to character portrayal, making him a notable figure in the contemporary art scene.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive, fashion-oriented character portraits with visible brushwork, fine drawn accents, and strongly modeled faces and hair. Saturated orange, ochre, teal, cream, and black create a high-contrast editorial look, while close crops, graphic silhouettes, and assertive poses give the portraits a bold presence."},{"id":"claire-wendling","name":"Claire Wendling","cat":"illustrators","en":"Claire Wendling","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claire-wendling.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claire-wendling","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","bone-white","beige","brown","black","red"],"intro":"Claire Wendling is a renowned French illustrator and comic book artist known for her intricate and expressive fantasy illustrations. Her work often features mythical creatures and imaginative worlds, blending fine lines with detailed compositions. Wendling's unique style has garnered a dedicated following, and she is celebrated for her contributions to both comics and fantasy art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive ink drawing with fine, restless contour lines, cross-stroked shading, and lightly washed earth tones on an off-white paper ground. Elongated human figures interact with animals in whimsical, dreamlike situations, while loose anatomy, flowing hair, and energetic gestures give the illustrations a fantastical, sketchbook character."},{"id":"sam-chivers","name":"Sam Chivers","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sam Chivers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sam-chivers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sam-chivers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","grey","dark-brown","rust","orange"],"intro":"Sam Chivers is a contemporary illustrator known for his vibrant and surreal artworks. His work often explores themes of nature, technology, and the cosmos, blending them into intricate and colorful compositions. Chivers's style is characterized by a unique combination of digital techniques and traditional influences, creating a distinct visual language that is both modern and timeless.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured paint-like surfaces build dense natural forms, from cloud banks and foliage to patterned walls and cactus shapes. The style combines highly saturated teal, coral, orange, and green colors with strong tonal contrasts, mixing recognizable scenes and animals with dreamlike, exaggerated environments."},{"id":"edward-gorey","name":"Edward Gorey","cat":"illustrators","en":"Edward Gorey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-gorey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-gorey","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","comics","drawing","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","white","black","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Edward Gorey was an American writer and artist known for his distinctive pen-and-ink illustrations and macabre, whimsical narratives. His work often features Victorian and Edwardian settings, with a unique blend of dark humor and gothic elements. Gorey's illustrations are characterized by their detailed line work, intricate patterns, and a monochromatic palette, creating an eerie yet captivating atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses dense black-and-white pen drawing with delicate contour lines, crosshatching, and stippled textures. It combines stark, simplified silhouettes with highly specific costumes, birdlike faces, umbrellas, architecture, and barren settings, producing an eerie but whimsical illustrated tableau."},{"id":"matt-furie","name":"Matt Furie","cat":"illustrators","en":"Matt Furie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-furie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-furie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","olive","dark-olive","muted-cyan","red","vivid-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Matt Furie is an American artist and illustrator known for his unique and whimsical style. He gained widespread recognition for creating the character Pepe the Frog, which became an internet meme. Furie's work often features surreal and humorous elements, blending pop culture with fantasy.","observation":"Across all four paintings, fantastical monster characters are rendered with saturated colors, heavy contour lines, and clearly visible, energetic paint strokes on textured canvas. The expressive faces, exaggerated eyes and mouths, dense imaginative settings, and layered small marks create a playful yet grotesque surreal character-painting style."},{"id":"johnathan-harris","name":"Johnathan Harris","cat":"painters","en":"Johnathan Harris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johnathan-harris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johnathan-harris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","landscapes","glow","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-blue","dark-red","rust","muted-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Johnathan Harris is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and imaginative works that often blend elements of fantasy and surrealism. His art is characterized by bold colors, intricate details, and a whimsical approach that invites viewers into dreamlike worlds.","observation":"Across the four images, saturated orange, violet, blue, and turquoise paint is built from clearly visible directional strokes, giving foliage, fur, architecture, mountains, and clouds a tactile, energetic surface. The compositions remain representational but heighten each subject with dramatic light, strong contrast, luminous skies, and swirling movement."},{"id":"kim-jung-gi","name":"Kim Jung Gi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kim Jung Gi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kim-jung-gi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kim-jung-gi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","white","brown","beige","red"],"intro":"Kim Jung Gi is a renowned South Korean artist known for his exceptional ability to create highly detailed and intricate illustrations without the aid of visual references. His work is celebrated for its dynamic compositions and imaginative storytelling, often blending elements of fantasy, realism, and surrealism. Kim's unique approach to drawing has earned him a significant following and recognition in the world of illustration and comics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly intricate black-and-white ink drawing with fine contour lines, crosshatching, and selective wash-like shading. It combines surreal, heavily layered humanoid characters with armor, clothing, machinery, and weapons, often isolating the dense figures against generous off-white negative space."},{"id":"phil-hester","name":"Phil Hester","cat":"illustrators","en":"Phil Hester","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/phil-hester.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/phil-hester","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","ink"],"colours":["black","grey","deep-red","vivid-red","silver","dark-blue"],"intro":"Phil Hester is an American comic book artist and writer known for his work on titles such as \"Green Arrow\" and \"Swamp Thing.\" With a career spanning several decades, Hester has become a notable figure in the comic book industry, recognized for his distinctive style and storytelling abilities.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic-novel illustration with heavy black outlines, dense ink shading, crosshatching, and selectively flat, saturated red, orange, blue, and gray areas. Dramatic close-up characters and monstrous figures dominate, with exaggerated expressions, stark contrast, distressed textures, and dark fantastical settings."},{"id":"louise-lawler","name":"Louise Lawler","cat":"photographers","en":"Louise Lawler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louise-lawler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louise-lawler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","orange","dark-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Louise Lawler is an American artist known for her conceptual photography that often explores the presentation and context of artworks. Her work frequently examines the relationship between art, its environment, and its audience, challenging traditional notions of art ownership and display.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed interior scenes with crisp illustrative drawing, fine contour lines, and selectively flat, saturated color fields. Strong architectural framing, decorative furnishings, botanical motifs, patterned fabrics, and dramatic sunlight recur across the four renders, creating polished, editorial room compositions."},{"id":"shinichi-maruyama","name":"Shinichi Maruyama","cat":"various-artists","en":"Shinichi Maruyama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shinichi-maruyama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shinichi-maruyama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","black","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Shinichi Maruyama is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his innovative approach to capturing motion and fluidity in art. His work often explores the intersection of photography and painting, creating dynamic compositions that challenge traditional perceptions of movement and form.","observation":"Across all four renders, dark humanlike figures dissolve into sweeping, fluid masses of fabric, water, and brushwork. Broad visible strokes, splashes, sharp tonal separation, and generous pale negative space create an expressive, kinetic, surreal appearance."},{"id":"junji-ito","name":"Junji Ito","cat":"illustrators","en":"Junji Ito","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/junji-ito.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/junji-ito","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","silver","beige","light-orange"],"intro":"Junji Ito is a renowned Japanese horror manga artist known for his intricate and unsettling illustrations. His works often explore themes of horror, the supernatural, and the grotesque, captivating audiences with their unique blend of psychological terror and visual artistry.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses dense black-and-white pen work with delicate contour lines, crosshatching, and stark tonal contrast. Repeated female faces and monstrous eye forms are tightly packed into surreal, unsettling compositions, combining illustrative clarity with elaborate hand-drawn texture."},{"id":"keiji-inafune","name":"Keiji Inafune","cat":"illustrators","en":"Keiji Inafune","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/keiji-inafune.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/keiji-inafune","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["white","blue","charcoal","brown","orange","red"],"intro":"Keiji Inafune is a renowned Japanese video game producer and illustrator, best known for his work on the Mega Man series and other influential titles. His contributions to the gaming industry have left a significant impact, blending innovative design with engaging storytelling.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, densely populated science-fiction environments with colorful, expressive robot characters and strong comic-like outlines. Saturated flat color, selective painterly texture, and elaborate mechanical ornament create a vivid illustrated look that ranges from action scenes to character-centered assemblages."},{"id":"johnny-morant","name":"Johnny Morant","cat":"painters","en":"Johnny Morant","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johnny-morant.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johnny-morant","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","beige","silver","rust"],"intro":"Johnny Morant is a contemporary artist known for his expressive and painterly approach to portraiture. His work often explores themes of identity and human emotion, capturing intimate moments with a focus on light and shadow. Morant's paintings are characterized by their textured surfaces and dynamic compositions, blending realism with a touch of abstraction.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable people and interiors are built from visible, layered brushwork that breaks forms into angular, shifting planes. The subdued gray, cream, ochre, rust, and teal palette supports an expressive, slightly surreal atmosphere, with detailed but partially dissolved faces, clothing, furniture, and architectural reflections."},{"id":"carel-fabritius","name":"Carel Fabritius","cat":"painters","en":"Carel Fabritius","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carel-fabritius.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carel-fabritius","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Carel Fabritius was a Dutch painter known for his contributions to the Baroque period, particularly during the Dutch Golden Age. He was a student of Rembrandt and is recognized for his innovative use of perspective and light. His most famous work, \"The Goldfinch,\" showcases his skill in capturing intricate details and lifelike representations.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic bird portraits with carefully modelled anatomy, layered feather detail, and visible fine brushwork. Dark backgrounds, warm subdued browns, and selective highlights create a dramatic, museum-like atmosphere with strong subject isolation."},{"id":"dan-slott","name":"Dan Slott","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dan Slott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-slott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-slott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","orange","dark-teal","rust","muted-green"],"intro":"Dan Slott is a renowned American comic book writer known for his work on titles such as \"The Amazing Spider-Man\" and \"She-Hulk.\" He has been a prominent figure in the comic book industry, contributing to various superhero narratives and shaping the modern landscape of comic storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable heroic figures are painted with highly visible, broad directional brushstrokes, rugged texture, and strong dark-to-light contrast. Saturated oranges, reds, greens, and blues heighten the expressive comic-book imagery, while crowded character groupings, dramatic cropping, and monumental poses give the montage a mythic, surreal energy."},{"id":"tim-bradstreet","name":"Tim Bradstreet","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tim Bradstreet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-bradstreet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-bradstreet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","vivid-red","grey","white","dark-red"],"intro":"Tim Bradstreet is an American artist known for his distinctive work in comic book illustration and cover art. His style is characterized by a strong emphasis on realism combined with a gritty, noir aesthetic. Bradstreet has contributed to various popular comic series, showcasing his talent for creating atmospheric and detailed illustrations that capture the essence of the characters and stories.","observation":"The style uses heavily textured, visibly brushed rendering with rough marks, distressed surfaces, and emphatic dark-versus-light modeling. It presents ominous, theatrical character scenes through oversized figures, obscured faces, stark poses, and occasional saturated red against near-black surroundings."},{"id":"gregory-crewdson","name":"Gregory Crewdson","cat":"photographers","en":"Gregory Crewdson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gregory-crewdson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gregory-crewdson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","muted-cyan","rust","orange"],"intro":"Gregory Crewdson is an American photographer known for his elaborately staged scenes of American homes and neighborhoods. His work often explores themes of suburban life, isolation, and the uncanny, using cinematic techniques to create detailed, atmospheric images that blur the line between reality and fiction.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, built around moody blue-green darkness, warm practical lights, wet reflective streets, and atmospheric rain or haze. Broad environmental compositions combine rural houses, forested mountains, roads, and small human figures with strong narrative tension and selective focus."},{"id":"vittorio-matteo-corcos","name":"Vittorio Matteo Corcos","cat":"painters","en":"Vittorio Matteo Corcos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vittorio-matteo-corcos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vittorio-matteo-corcos","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","brown","beige","black"],"intro":"Vittorio Matteo Corcos is an Italian painter known for his elegant and detailed portraits, often depicting women in fashionable attire. Born in 1859, Corcos became renowned for his ability to capture the grace and beauty of his subjects, blending realism with a romantic touch. His works are characterized by meticulous attention to detail and a refined use of color, reflecting the cultural and social nuances of the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"The style uses refined, realistic portrait painting with visible delicate brushwork and carefully rendered fabric, lace, feathers, fur, and skin. Restrained blue, green, cream, and rose tones create an elegant atmosphere, while tightly cropped compositions emphasize fashionable hats, garments, and poised female figures."},{"id":"johanna-basford","name":"Johanna Basford","cat":"illustrators","en":"Johanna Basford","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johanna-basford.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johanna-basford","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","muted-olive","muted-cyan","green","olive","red"],"intro":"Johanna Basford is a Scottish illustrator known for her intricate and hand-drawn illustrations, often featuring natural and whimsical themes. She gained international fame for her adult coloring books, which have become a popular tool for relaxation and creativity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines fine ink-like contouring with transparent watercolor washes, saturated botanical color, and abundant small decorative details. Plants, flowers, patterned feathers, and animals are arranged as ornamental illustrated compositions on light paper, with a whimsical storybook and natural-history feel."},{"id":"humphry-repton","name":"Humphry Repton","cat":"designers","en":"Humphry Repton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/humphry-repton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/humphry-repton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["dark-olive","silver","bone-white","ochre","beige"],"intro":"Humphry Repton was a prominent English landscape designer and architect of the late 18th and early 19th centuries. Known for his work in the Picturesque movement, Repton was celebrated for his innovative approach to landscape gardening, often creating detailed 'Red Books' for his clients that illustrated his vision for transforming their estates. His designs emphasized harmony with nature, blending formal and informal elements to create idyllic and scenic landscapes.","observation":"These landscapes use richly layered, visibly brushed foliage and carefully articulated botanical detail to create expansive pastoral vistas. Subdued greens and warm atmospheric light, distant haze, reflective water, and monumental trees give the scenes a dreamy, grand, classically composed character."},{"id":"h-r-giger","name":"H. R. Giger","cat":"painters","en":"H. R. Giger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/h-r-giger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/h-r-giger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","glow","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","sci-fi","dark","epic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","dark-olive"],"intro":"H. R. Giger is a Swiss artist known for his distinctive style that combines surrealism and sci-fi elements, most famously contributing to the design of the 'Alien' creature in the film franchise. His work often explores themes of the biomechanical, merging organic and mechanical forms to create haunting, otherworldly images.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly detailed biomechanical structures with sculptural, convincingly solid surfaces and intricate fine linear relief. Dark metallic green, black, and silver tones create strong contrast, while repeated arches, ribs, conduits, and axial layouts give the imagery a monumental sci-fi cathedral character."},{"id":"leon-golub","name":"Leon Golub","cat":"painters","en":"Leon Golub","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leon-golub.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leon-golub","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","collage"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","dark-red","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Leon Golub is an American painter known for his large-scale, politically charged works that often depict scenes of violence and power dynamics. His art is characterized by a raw, expressive style that reflects his interest in the human condition and societal issues.","observation":"Across all four panels, recognizable figures and faces are built from vigorous, visible paint strokes, scraped textures, and rough linear marks rather than smooth realism. The style combines muted earth tones with forceful reds, dark accents, layered collage-like framing, and emotionally charged, tightly cropped human groupings."},{"id":"jo-grundy","name":"Jo Grundy","cat":"painters","en":"Jo Grundy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jo-grundy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jo-grundy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","pastel-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","silver","muted-blue","ochre","rust"],"intro":"Jo Grundy is a contemporary artist known for her charming and whimsical depictions of the English countryside. Her work often features idyllic landscapes, quaint villages, and seasonal changes, capturing the serene beauty of rural life with a distinctive folk art style.","observation":"These landscapes combine finely rendered illustrative structure with visible, delicate brushwork and richly textured surfaces. Repeated cottages, stone walls, winding paths, bare trees, flower-filled fields, and softly varied seasonal palettes create detailed, contemplative rural scenes with a dreamy atmosphere."},{"id":"tony-allain","name":"Tony Allain","cat":"painters","en":"Tony Allain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tony-allain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tony-allain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","blue","dark-blue","muted-blue","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Tony Allain is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and expressive use of color, often focusing on landscapes and urban scenes. His work is characterized by bold brushstrokes and a dynamic sense of movement, capturing the essence of a moment with a painterly approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, urban streets and buildings are reduced to expressive blocks of saturated blue-violet, black, coral, and orange. Broad, visible brushwork, scraped textures, reflected light, and simplified pedestrian silhouettes create a dramatic rainy-city atmosphere with strong contrast and energetic movement."},{"id":"florian-nicolle","name":"Florian Nicolle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Florian Nicolle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/florian-nicolle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/florian-nicolle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","collage","ink"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","cream","brown","pale-orange","muted-brown","red"],"intro":"Florian Nicolle is a contemporary French illustrator known for his unique approach to portraiture, blending traditional and digital techniques to create expressive and dynamic artworks. His work often explores themes of identity and emotion, characterized by a distinctive style that combines fine lines with bold, textural elements.","observation":"A series of tightly cropped portraits combines visible brushwork, delicate drawn lines, ink-like marks, and rough paper textures with layered collage fragments. Muted earth tones are punctuated by deep blacks, pale highlights, and occasional red bars, producing an expressive, fragmented, slightly uncanny presentation."},{"id":"walter-launt-palmer","name":"Walter Launt Palmer","cat":"painters","en":"Walter Launt Palmer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walter-launt-palmer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walter-launt-palmer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","silver","muted-blue","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Walter Launt Palmer is an American artist known for his exquisite landscape paintings, particularly those depicting winter scenes. Born in 1854, Palmer was a prominent figure in the American Impressionism movement and was celebrated for his ability to capture the ethereal beauty of snow-covered landscapes. His works often feature serene and tranquil settings, characterized by a masterful use of light and color.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents realistic winter woodland landscapes with dense tree structure, winding streams, and snow-covered ground. Visible directional brushwork and finely modulated color give the scenes a richly painterly surface, while subdued cool tones are warmed by low sunlight and reflective water."},{"id":"david-fincher","name":"David Fincher","cat":"filmmakers","en":"David Fincher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-fincher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-fincher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","mist","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-green","dark-teal","muted-teal","dark-brown","dark-ochre"],"intro":"David Fincher is an acclaimed American filmmaker known for his meticulous and visually striking films. His work often explores themes of obsession, identity, and the darker aspects of human nature. Fincher's distinctive style is characterized by its precise camera work, atmospheric lighting, and a focus on complex narratives.","observation":"A consistently cinematic, realistic visual language uses dark teal shadows against isolated amber and red practical lights, with heavy contrast and a brooding atmosphere. Rain, mist, wet reflective surfaces, grain, selective focus, and carefully framed solitary figures turn urban transit spaces and streets into tense narrative scenes."},{"id":"ed-roth","name":"Ed Roth","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ed Roth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-roth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-roth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","motion","bold-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","epic","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","beige","light-yellow","muted-blue","dark-red","red","orange"],"intro":"Ed Roth was an influential American artist and custom car designer, best known for his work in the Kustom Kulture movement. He gained fame in the 1950s and 60s for creating iconic hot rod art and characters like Rat Fink, which became symbols of the counterculture and custom car scene. Roth's work combined elements of surrealism, humor, and fantasy, leaving a lasting impact on both automotive and art communities.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured brushwork and heavy graphic contours turn fantastical hot rods, monsters, and landscapes into dense, energetic tableaux. Saturated colors, exaggerated mechanical forms, swirling organic shapes, and dramatic motion give the style an exuberant, heroic fantasy quality."},{"id":"alberta-ferretti","name":"Alberta Ferretti","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Alberta Ferretti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alberta-ferretti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alberta-ferretti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["beige","black","bone-white","brown","dark-red","charcoal"],"intro":"Alberta Ferretti is an Italian fashion designer known for her elegant and romantic designs. Her work is characterized by flowing silhouettes, delicate fabrics, and intricate detailing, often drawing inspiration from classical and fantasy themes. Ferretti's designs are celebrated for their sophisticated and ethereal qualities, making them a staple on red carpets and fashion runways.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic editorial fashion imagery with carefully posed models, elongated silhouettes, and elaborate floor-length garments. Rich textile texture, pleating, brocade, floral patterning, and restrained earthy colors create an ornate, moody luxury aesthetic across both runway and studio settings."},{"id":"don-rosa","name":"Don Rosa","cat":"illustrators","en":"Don Rosa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/don-rosa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/don-rosa","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","light-orange","grey","dark-brown","ochre","silver","vivid-red"],"intro":"Don Rosa is an American comic book writer and illustrator, renowned for his work on Disney's Scrooge McDuck and Donald Duck stories. His detailed and humorous storytelling has earned him a dedicated fanbase and numerous awards. Rosa's style is characterized by intricate line work and a deep respect for the legacy of Carl Barks , another legendary Disney artist.","observation":"The style combines richly crowded adventure illustrations with clean cartoon character design, using heavy ink contours, vivid color, and strong light-dark separation. Elaborate maps, machinery, nautical settings, and city environments are packed with small readable details, giving every scene an exploratory fantasy-comic atmosphere."},{"id":"abbey-lossing","name":"Abbey Lossing","cat":"illustrators","en":"Abbey Lossing","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abbey-lossing.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abbey-lossing","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","grey","red","dark-brown","vivid-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Abbey Lossing is a contemporary illustrator known for her vibrant and playful digital artworks. Her work often features whimsical characters and scenes, characterized by a distinctive use of color and pattern. Lossing's illustrations have been featured in various publications and projects, showcasing her unique ability to blend modern aesthetics with a touch of nostalgia.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable people and environments are built from visibly textured, directional paint with broad, expressive strokes and simplified graphic shapes. Saturated reds, pinks, greens, and dusk blues combine with deep shadows, while carefully arranged figures, architecture, foliage, and atmospheric skies create narrative, dreamlike scenes."},{"id":"yoji-shinkawa","name":"Yoji Shinkawa","cat":"illustrators","en":"Yoji Shinkawa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yoji-shinkawa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yoji-shinkawa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","bone-white","beige","charcoal"],"intro":"Yoji Shinkawa is a renowned Japanese illustrator and concept artist, best known for his work on the \"Metal Gear\" series. His distinctive style combines traditional Japanese aesthetics with modern, dynamic imagery, often featuring intricate designs and a strong sense of motion.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses vigorous visible brushwork, ink-like black marks, gray washes, and occasional muted earthy accents against expansive white grounds. Faces remain recognizable but are fragmented by gestural strokes, splatters, and partially abstracted edges, creating a highly expressive, textural portrait treatment."},{"id":"ezra-petronio","name":"Ezra Petronio","cat":"photographers","en":"Ezra Petronio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ezra-petronio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ezra-petronio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","white","silver","orange","brown","beige","vivid-red"],"intro":"Ezra Petronio is a renowned photographer and creative director known for his influential work in the fashion industry. He is the co-founder and creative director of the magazine \"Self Service,\" which has become a significant platform for contemporary fashion and culture. Petronio's work is characterized by its bold and innovative approach to fashion photography, often blending elements of art and design.","observation":"The style is realistic, highly detailed portrait photography with tight, cropped compositions and direct-flash contrast. Saturated skin, hair, clothing, and accessory tones combine with expressive poses and fashion-editorial styling, often against dark or plain indoor backgrounds."},{"id":"rob-ryan","name":"Rob Ryan","cat":"various-artists","en":"Rob Ryan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rob-ryan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rob-ryan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","floral","landscapes","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["deep-blue","bone-white","charcoal","muted-blue","red","muted-red"],"intro":"Rob Ryan is a British visual artist known for his intricate papercut artwork, often featuring whimsical and romantic themes. His work is characterized by detailed silhouettes and storytelling elements, capturing scenes of nature, love, and human connection.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, graphic botanical illustrations built from dense fine lines, crisp silhouettes, and flat blocks of restricted color. Repeated trees, foliage, flowers, wildlife, and small cottages fill layered woodland scenes with a decorative, pattern-like rhythm across all four variations."},{"id":"hope-gangloff","name":"Hope Gangloff","cat":"painters","en":"Hope Gangloff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hope-gangloff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hope-gangloff","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["light-orange","beige","black","red","vivid-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Hope Gangloff is an American contemporary artist known for her vibrant and expressive portraits. Her work often features friends and acquaintances in intimate settings, capturing the nuances of modern life through bold colors and intricate patterns. Gangloff's style is characterized by its detailed line work and the use of vivid, contrasting colors, creating a dynamic and engaging visual experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines close-up female portraiture with richly patterned clothing and tightly cropped, intimate poses. Saturated red, blue, coral, and green areas are shaped by fine dark contour lines, visible painted texture, and dense decorative textile motifs, producing an expressive, highly detailed illustrative-painterly surface."},{"id":"mort-walker","name":"Mort Walker","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mort Walker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mort-walker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mort-walker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing"],"colours":["white","bone-white","blue","muted-ochre","black","red"],"intro":"Mort Walker is a renowned American cartoonist best known for creating the comic strip 'Beetle Bailey.' His work has been a staple in American newspapers, showcasing his talent for humor and character-driven storytelling. Walker's style is characterized by its simplicity and wit, often focusing on military life and everyday situations.","observation":"The style uses expressive comic-strip drawing with thick, irregular black contours, simplified rounded figures, and clean flat areas of strong color. Across the sheet, lively character poses, exaggerated facial features, and familiar domestic or suburban settings create a playful retro cartoon appearance."},{"id":"jorge-maia","name":"Jorge Maia","cat":"photographers","en":"Jorge Maia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jorge-maia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jorge-maia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","mist","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Jorge Maia is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative and atmospheric landscape photography. His work often explores themes of solitude and the sublime, capturing the interplay of light and shadow in natural settings. Maia's photographs are characterized by their meticulous composition and a profound sense of mood, often achieved through the use of long exposure techniques and a keen eye for detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic coastal photography with highly detailed rocks, structures, and cloud formations arranged in cinematic, strongly leading compositions. Long-exposure water creates silky motion and visible atmospheric softness, while the palette ranges from stark monochrome to restrained blue-grey and sunset tones with deep shadows and dramatic skies."},{"id":"masamune-shirow","name":"Masamune Shirow","cat":"illustrators","en":"Masamune Shirow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/masamune-shirow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/masamune-shirow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["charcoal","beige","pale-orange","rust","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Masamune Shirow is a renowned Japanese manga artist and writer, best known for his influential works in the cyberpunk genre, including 'Ghost in the Shell' and 'Appleseed.' His art is characterized by its intricate detail, futuristic themes, and a blend of technology with human elements, often exploring philosophical and existential themes.","observation":"The style uses densely packed, highly detailed character scenes rendered as expressive graphic illustrations, with fine ink-like outlines, crisp descriptive edges, and selectively modeled color. Saturated oranges, reds, blues, and skin tones stand out against dark mechanical clutter, creating a vivid, high-contrast science-fiction tableau with surreal combinations of humans, machines, and debris."},{"id":"ivan-brunetti","name":"Ivan Brunetti","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ivan Brunetti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ivan-brunetti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ivan-brunetti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink","funny"],"colours":["white","bone-white","black","brown","beige"],"intro":"Ivan Brunetti is an American cartoonist and illustrator known for his work in comics and graphic novels. His style is characterized by its simplicity, humor, and expressive characters, often exploring themes of urban life and media culture.","observation":"The style uses stark black ink on warm, lightly grainy paper, with thick contour lines, sparse hatching, and flat uncolored interiors. Simplified human and animal characters have rounded forms, minimal facial features, and deadpan comic expressions, appearing in lightly detailed everyday urban and domestic scenes."},{"id":"mary-bradish-titcomb","name":"Mary Bradish Titcomb","cat":"painters","en":"Mary Bradish Titcomb","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-bradish-titcomb.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-bradish-titcomb","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","grey","red"],"intro":"Mary Bradish Titcomb was an American painter known for her impressionistic style, often focusing on portraits and landscapes. Born in 1858, she was part of the Boston School and contributed significantly to American art during the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"The style is built from visible, directional oil-paint strokes, with layered impasto and expressive, loosely resolved forms. Garden scenes and elegantly dressed figures emerge from dark foliage and abundant flowers through subdued earthy colors, warm highlights, and richly textured brushwork."},{"id":"gary-benfield","name":"Gary Benfield","cat":"painters","en":"Gary Benfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gary-benfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gary-benfield","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","bone-white","black","ochre","muted-orange"],"intro":"Gary Benfield is a contemporary British artist known for his delicate and ethereal paintings that often explore themes of romance and fantasy. His work is characterized by fine brushwork and a soft, dreamy quality, capturing intimate moments and figures with a sense of fluidity and grace.","observation":"Across all four panels, horses are rendered as expressive close-up portraits with visible, directional paint strokes and richly textured surfaces. The restrained umber, ochre, cream, and charcoal palette supports energetic manes, softly blended backgrounds, and selective facial detail."},{"id":"nona-faustine","name":"Nona Faustine","cat":"photographers","en":"Nona Faustine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nona-faustine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nona-faustine","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","brown","red","beige","white","deep-red"],"intro":"Nona Faustine is an American photographer known for her evocative and thought-provoking work that often explores themes of race, history, and identity. Her photographs frequently engage with historical narratives and challenge viewers to confront uncomfortable truths about the past.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, editorial-like photography with carefully staged figures, dramatic architecture, and strong fashion or art-installation elements. Saturated red and pink accents stand against darker neutrals, while cinematic framing, directional light, and richly rendered textures give the scenes a polished, theatrical presence."},{"id":"louis-janmot","name":"Louis Janmot","cat":"painters","en":"Louis Janmot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-janmot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-janmot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","floral","landscapes","portraits","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","orange","bone-white","dark-brown","light-yellow"],"intro":"Louis Janmot is a 19th-century French painter known for his association with the Symbolist movement. His works often explore themes of spirituality and mysticism, characterized by a romantic and dreamlike quality. Janmot's paintings frequently depict ethereal landscapes and figures engaged in contemplative poses, reflecting his interest in the metaphysical and the divine.","observation":"These images use richly layered, realistic oil-paint rendering with visible brush texture, carefully modeled faces, elaborate foliage, and abundant fabric detail. Warm, restrained earth tones and sunset light create a romantic, dreamlike atmosphere, while formal portraits and groups are set against expansive mountainous landscapes and classical architectural elements."},{"id":"norman-rockwell","name":"Norman Rockwell","cat":"painters","en":"Norman Rockwell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norman-rockwell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norman-rockwell","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","muted-ochre","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"Norman Rockwell was an American painter and illustrator known for his depictions of everyday life in the United States. His work often appeared on the cover of the Saturday Evening Post, capturing the essence of American culture with warmth and humor. Rockwell's art is characterized by its attention to detail, narrative quality, and ability to evoke a sense of nostalgia.","observation":"The style combines realistic, highly detailed figure painting with visible brushwork and carefully observed textures in clothing, wood, paper, and skin. Each image presents a quietly narrative everyday scene, using subdued earthy colors, expressive gestures, and dense period interiors to create a classical illustrative finish."},{"id":"matthias-heiderich","name":"Matthias Heiderich","cat":"photographers","en":"Matthias Heiderich","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matthias-heiderich.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matthias-heiderich","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["muted-teal","light-yellow","dark-ochre","light-green","black","dark-red"],"intro":"Matthias Heiderich is a contemporary German photographer known for his striking architectural and urban photography. His work often features vibrant colors, geometric compositions, and a minimalist aesthetic, capturing the beauty and simplicity of urban environments.","observation":"These architectural street scenes use realistic, highly detailed photography with strong geometric forms, repeated structures, and sculptural concrete surfaces. Saturated turquoise, coral, cream, and red colors are sharpened by bright directional sunlight and deep shadows, giving the images a bold retro-modern character."},{"id":"wlop","name":"WLOP","cat":"various-artists","en":"WLOP","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wlop.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wlop","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","cream","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"WLOP is a digital artist known for creating ethereal and fantastical artworks, often featuring detailed and atmospheric scenes. Their work is characterized by a blend of fantasy and realism, capturing the imagination with vivid storytelling and intricate designs.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses intimate close-up portraiture with softly modelled faces, loose hair, and richly visible painterly strokes. The subdued, warm-dark palette, selective highlights, and tactile fabrics create an expressive, dreamy, slightly melancholy atmosphere."},{"id":"iwan-baan","name":"Iwan Baan","cat":"photographers","en":"Iwan Baan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/iwan-baan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/iwan-baan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","brown","muted-blue","beige","silver"],"intro":"Iwan Baan is a renowned Dutch photographer known for his unique approach to architectural photography. His work often captures the interaction between people and architecture, highlighting the human element within urban environments. Baan's photography is celebrated for its narrative quality, often telling stories about the spaces people inhabit and how they shape and are shaped by them.","observation":"The style presents futuristic civic architecture with highly realistic, cinematic visualization: sweeping curves, layered terraces, glass walls, and monumental concrete surfaces dominate carefully composed urban scenes. Cool blue ambient light contrasts with warm illuminated interiors, while small human figures and distant city views provide scale; atmospheric haze and restrained color keep the images polished and contemplative."},{"id":"ebru-sidar","name":"Ebru Sidar","cat":"photographers","en":"Ebru Sidar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ebru-sidar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ebru-sidar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","white","silver","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Ebru Sidar is a contemporary photographer known for her evocative and atmospheric landscape photography. Her work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, capturing the interplay between human presence and nature.","observation":"Across all four images, stark monochrome landscapes combine immense rolling terrain, dark tree forms, and tiny solitary figures. Heavy tonal contrast, atmospheric fog, and partially obscured backgrounds create a bleak, cinematic sense of isolation, with silhouettes and winding paths guiding the compositions."},{"id":"chien-chung-wei","name":"Chien Chung-Wei","cat":"painters","en":"Chien Chung-Wei","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chien-chung-wei.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chien-chung-wei","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ethnic-poc","landscapes","scenes","urban","mist","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","pale-orange","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Chien Chung-Wei is a contemporary watercolor artist from Taiwan, renowned for his mastery in capturing urban landscapes with a blend of traditional and modern techniques. His work often reflects a deep connection to East Asian culture, showcasing scenes that evoke nostalgia and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four views, dense historic urban scenes are rendered with visible painterly strokes, fine linear detail, and weathered architectural textures. Muted earth tones, soft atmospheric haze, and layered depth unify the streets, rooftops, traditional structures, and rainy passages into an expressive, richly observed cityscape style."},{"id":"csaba-markus","name":"Csaba Markus","cat":"painters","en":"Csaba Markus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/csaba-markus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/csaba-markus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["dark-ochre","muted-ochre","black","dark-brown","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Csaba Markus is a Hungarian-American artist known for his intricate and romantic paintings, often featuring ethereal female figures. His work blends classical techniques with contemporary themes, creating a unique fusion that is both timeless and modern.","observation":"The style combines highly rendered female portraiture with dense, visibly built-up paint texture and richly decorated garments and headwear. Restrained earth reds, olive greens, bronze, and tarnished gold create an antique devotional atmosphere, while ornamental circular motifs and elaborate textile surfaces unify the portraits."},{"id":"keiichi-tanaami","name":"Keiichi Tanaami","cat":"illustrators","en":"Keiichi Tanaami","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/keiichi-tanaami.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/keiichi-tanaami","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","animals","patterns","motion","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","madness"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","brown","red","vivid-red","yellow","dark-blue","green"],"intro":"Keiichi Tanaami is a renowned Japanese artist and designer known for his vibrant and surreal works that blend pop art with psychedelic influences. Emerging in the 1960s, Tanaami's art often reflects themes of fantasy, dreams, and the subconscious, drawing inspiration from both Western pop culture and traditional Japanese motifs. His work spans various mediums, including illustration, graphic design, and animation, making him a versatile and influential figure in contemporary art.","observation":"The style is an intensely crowded, psychedelic visual collage built from vivid flat-color shapes, heavy outlines, intricate patterns, animals, faces, architecture, and botanical forms. Explosive radial gestures, warped contours, and extreme contrast create a kinetic, chaotic surface in which recognizable imagery continually interlocks with abstract decoration."},{"id":"klaus-frahm","name":"Klaus Frahm","cat":"photographers","en":"Klaus Frahm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/klaus-frahm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/klaus-frahm","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","epic","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","grey","silver","rust","light-orange"],"intro":"Klaus Frahm is a renowned German photographer known for his architectural and interior photography. His work often explores the interplay between light, space, and structure, capturing the essence of modernist architecture with a distinct minimalist approach. Frahm's photographs are celebrated for their precision, clarity, and ability to convey the monumental scale of architectural spaces.","observation":"The style treats vast architectural interiors as cinematic, realistic environments, using strong perspective, monumental geometry, and dense structural detail. Dark teal, charcoal, and rust tones are punctuated by glowing chandeliers, lamps, and theatrical spotlights, with haze and deep shadow creating an ominous, epic atmosphere."},{"id":"dana-trippe","name":"Dana Trippe","cat":"photographers","en":"Dana Trippe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dana-trippe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dana-trippe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-teal","dark-green","deep-rust","silver","vivid-red"],"intro":"Dana Trippe is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and surreal imagery. Her work often explores themes of fantasy and dreamlike states, using vibrant colors and layered compositions to create visually striking pieces. Trippe's photography has been featured in various publications and exhibitions, highlighting her unique approach to blending reality with imagination.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is cinematic and photographic, pairing saturated red-orange highlights with deep teal shadows and strong contrast. Portrait subjects are framed in atmospheric environments with shallow focus, visible film grain, neon reflections, and a retro editorial mood."},{"id":"kate-leth","name":"Kate Leth","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kate Leth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kate-leth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kate-leth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing"],"colours":["black","muted-olive","orange","vivid-red","dark-red","pink"],"intro":"Kate Leth is a Canadian comic book artist and writer known for her work on various graphic novels and comic series. She has contributed to titles such as \" Adventure Time \" and \"Patsy Walker, A.K.A. Hellcat!\", showcasing her unique style and storytelling abilities.","observation":"This style uses dense comic-book illustration with thick, emphatic black contours, crisp flat color areas, and strongly saturated orange, pink, green, purple, and turquoise hues. Expressive faces and poses dominate the compositions, while botanical and occult-like details, patterned clothing, and crowded backgrounds create a richly layered, high-contrast visual surface."},{"id":"michelangelo","name":"Michelangelo","cat":"various-artists","en":"Michelangelo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michelangelo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michelangelo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Michelangelo was an Italian Renaissance sculptor, painter, architect, and poet, renowned for his masterpieces such as the Sistine Chapel ceiling and the statue of David. His work is celebrated for its anatomical precision, dynamic compositions, and profound emotional depth, influencing countless artists and shaping the course of Western art.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic portrait studies with the tactile volume and anatomy of carved marble busts. Fine drawn lines, dense shading, restrained stone-like tones, and strong light-dark separation recur across the seated figure and close-up portraits, with classical drapery and monumental cropping reinforcing the antique subject matter."},{"id":"yoshitaka-amano","name":"Yoshitaka Amano","cat":"illustrators","en":"Yoshitaka Amano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yoshitaka-amano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yoshitaka-amano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","brown","vivid-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Yoshitaka Amano is a renowned Japanese artist and illustrator, celebrated for his work in the fields of anime, video games, and graphic novels. His distinctive style combines traditional Japanese art techniques with modern fantasy elements, making him a pivotal figure in contemporary visual storytelling. Amano is best known for his contributions to the Final Fantasy series and his collaborations with authors like Neil Gaiman.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, expressive portraiture with flowing hair, ornate costume, fantastical figures, and densely layered miniature motifs. Fine drawn contours sit within richly worked painterly surfaces, while vivid reds, whites, blacks, and metallic-looking accents create dramatic contrast and a surreal, theatrical intensity."},{"id":"bertha-lum","name":"Bertha Lum","cat":"printmakers","en":"Bertha Lum","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bertha-lum.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bertha-lum","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["light-orange","muted-teal","black","muted-rust","charcoal","rust"],"intro":"Bertha Lum was an American artist known for her significant contributions to the Japonisme movement and her mastery of woodblock printing. Born in 1869, she was instrumental in bringing Asian art styles to Western audiences, particularly through her delicate and detailed prints that often depicted serene and mystical themes inspired by East Asian culture.","observation":"Across all four panels, elegant female figures are rendered with delicate contour lines, softly textured paint, and richly patterned flowing garments. Muted teal, rust, cream, black, and ochre palettes unify the ornate botanical settings, elongated profiles, and decorative surface detail."},{"id":"callie-fink","name":"Callie Fink","cat":"painters","en":"Callie Fink","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/callie-fink.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/callie-fink","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-red","muted-orange","red","muted-green","blue"],"intro":"Callie Fink is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and surreal digital artworks that often explore themes of fantasy and transformation. Her work is characterized by intricate detailing and a vivid color palette, drawing inspiration from both natural and cosmic elements.","observation":"The style uses intensely saturated, multicolored paint applied in dense, visible directional strokes, combining recognizable close-up faces with swirling semi-abstract surroundings. Fine marks model skin, hair, eyes, and facial hair while exaggerated color and flowing distortions make the portraits expressive and surreal."},{"id":"andrei-tarkovsky","name":"Andrei Tarkovsky","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Andrei Tarkovsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrei-tarkovsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrei-tarkovsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Andrei Tarkovsky was a renowned Russian filmmaker known for his profound and visually striking films. His works are celebrated for their philosophical depth, poetic imagery, and exploration of spiritual and existential themes. Tarkovsky's films often feature long takes, dreamlike sequences, and a meticulous attention to detail, making him a pivotal figure in world cinema.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, filmic landscape imagery with subdued green-grey tones, dense atmospheric mist, and a brooding, solitary mood. Grain, soft focus, silhouetted vegetation, reflective water, and isolated human figures create an uncanny, dreamlike sense of quiet."},{"id":"patricia-voulgaris","name":"Patricia Voulgaris","cat":"photographers","en":"Patricia Voulgaris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patricia-voulgaris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patricia-voulgaris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","flat-color","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["white","black","grey","silver","charcoal","vivid-red"],"intro":"Patricia Voulgaris is a contemporary photographer known for her innovative and conceptual approach to portraiture. Her work often explores themes of identity and perception, utilizing bold and abstract elements to challenge traditional representations of the human form. Voulgaris's photography is characterized by its modernist influences and avant-garde style, making her a notable figure in the contemporary art scene.","observation":"This style combines highly rendered portrait forms with stark geometric overlays that conceal, divide, and reshape the faces. It relies on a predominantly black-and-white palette, hard tonal separation, clean graphic shapes, and occasional red accents, creating an editorial and surreal visual language."},{"id":"camille-walala","name":"Camille Walala","cat":"street-artists","en":"Camille Walala","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/camille-walala.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/camille-walala","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","patterns","scenes","urban","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","red","orange","silver","dark-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Camille Walala is a contemporary artist known for her bold, geometric designs and colorful patterns. Her work often transforms urban spaces with vibrant murals and installations, drawing inspiration from the Memphis design movement and pop art. Walala's style is characterized by its playful and energetic use of color, creating immersive environments that engage and delight viewers.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly saturated, graphic interiors packed with repeating stripes, dots, zigzags, grids, and angular color blocks. Clean-edged flat shapes, heavy outlines, and sculptural architectural forms create a bold, surreal installation-like environment with a playful retro visual language."},{"id":"andrea-torres-balaguer","name":"Andrea Torres Balaguer","cat":"photographers","en":"Andrea Torres Balaguer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrea-torres-balaguer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrea-torres-balaguer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","silver","dark-brown","charcoal","grey","ochre"],"intro":"Andrea Torres Balaguer is a contemporary Spanish photographer known for her surreal and conceptual imagery. Her work often explores themes of identity, nature, and the subconscious, using a blend of photography and digital manipulation to create dreamlike scenes.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic portrait photography with subdued, moody color grading, soft natural light, and shallow focus. Obscured faces, formal dark clothing, symbolic props, and carefully staged outdoor or interior settings create a dreamy, dark, psychologically charged atmosphere."},{"id":"hajime-sorayama","name":"Hajime Sorayama","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hajime Sorayama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hajime-sorayama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hajime-sorayama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","metallic","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","silver","beige","black","muted-ochre","white"],"intro":"Hajime Sorayama is a renowned Japanese illustrator known for his hyper-realistic portrayals of feminine robots and futuristic themes. His work often explores the intersection of technology and sensuality, creating a unique blend of fantasy and realism that has influenced various media, including film and fashion.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic portrait photography with elaborate, sculptural chrome forms that wrap around the figures like reflective armor or liquid metal. Strong specular highlights, deep shadows, warm skin tones, tight editorial framing, and selective background focus give the images a polished cinematic-fashion quality."},{"id":"claude-cahun","name":"Claude Cahun","cat":"photographers","en":"Claude Cahun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claude-cahun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claude-cahun","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal"],"colours":["grey","beige","brown","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Claude Cahun was a French surrealist photographer and writer known for their self-portraits and exploration of gender identity and fluidity. Born in 1894, Cahun's work often challenged traditional gender roles and societal norms, making them a significant figure in both the surrealist movement and LGBTQ+ history.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces are presented in stark black-and-white with pronounced grain and strong tonal contrast. Hand-drawn eye imagery, graphic makeup, glitter, and expressive gestures create a surreal editorial portrait style that combines photographic detail with fine drawn marks."},{"id":"john-carpenter","name":"John Carpenter","cat":"filmmakers","en":"John Carpenter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-carpenter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-carpenter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-blue","red","muted-cyan","muted-orange"],"intro":"John Carpenter is a renowned American filmmaker known for his work in the horror and science fiction genres. He gained fame for directing iconic films such as \"Halloween,\" \"The Thing,\" and \"Escape from New York,\" which have become classics in cinematic history. Carpenter's distinctive style often combines suspenseful storytelling with innovative visual effects, establishing him as a master of genre filmmaking.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, visibly painted surfaces with broad expressive strokes, intense blue-orange color, and deep shadow. Dramatic character closeups and narrative scenes are rendered with luminous fire or spectral light, creating a dark, surreal fantasy atmosphere full of crowded imagery and ominous apparitions."},{"id":"wong-kar-wai","name":"Wong Kar-wai","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Wong Kar-wai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wong-kar-wai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wong-kar-wai","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-olive","deep-brown","vivid-red","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Wong Kar-wai is a renowned Hong Kong filmmaker known for his visually unique and emotionally resonant films. His work often explores themes of love, time, and memory, characterized by a distinctive style that combines vivid colors, atmospheric settings, and a deep sense of nostalgia. Wong's films have garnered international acclaim and have significantly influenced contemporary cinema.","observation":"A cinematic, realistic night-world style built from intimate portraits and fleeting urban encounters, with shallow focus and dense out-of-focus lights. Saturated red and green illumination, deep shadows, rain, condensation, and reflective streets create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere throughout."},{"id":"myles-birket-foster","name":"Myles Birket Foster","cat":"illustrators","en":"Myles Birket Foster","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/myles-birket-foster.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/myles-birket-foster","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","silver","grey","red"],"intro":"Myles Birket Foster was a renowned English watercolor artist and illustrator, celebrated for his picturesque depictions of the English countryside. Born in 1825, Foster's work is characterized by its detailed and delicate portrayal of rural life, often featuring idyllic scenes of cottages, gardens, and pastoral landscapes. His art is noted for its fine brushwork and soft, harmonious color palettes, capturing the essence of 19th-century rural England.","observation":"The style uses finely observed, softly textured brushwork to depict idyllic rural villages, gardens, fields, and lanes with abundant architectural and botanical detail. Warm natural light, gentle atmospheric distance, and restrained yet luminous colors give the scenes a nostalgic, pastoral character."},{"id":"don-bluth","name":"Don Bluth","cat":"illustrators","en":"Don Bluth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/don-bluth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/don-bluth","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","crosshatching","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["pale-orange","light-orange","muted-ochre","dark-brown","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Don Bluth is an American animator and film director known for his work on animated films such as \"The Secret of NIMH,\" \"An American Tail,\" and \"The Land Before Time.\" He gained prominence in the 1980s for his distinctive animation style and storytelling, which often featured darker themes and complex characters compared to contemporary animated films.","observation":"The style combines loose, expressive character drawing with visible ink lines, crosshatched shading, and rough, painterly marks on warm sketchbook paper. Anthropomorphic animals are rendered with exaggerated faces, flowing gestures, and occasional restrained color accents, giving the sheet a theatrical storybook-fantasy character."},{"id":"oliver-jeffers","name":"Oliver Jeffers","cat":"illustrators","en":"Oliver Jeffers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oliver-jeffers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oliver-jeffers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-cyan","muted-teal","muted-green","bone-white","charcoal","dark-red"],"intro":"Oliver Jeffers is a renowned illustrator and author known for his distinctive style in children's literature. Born in Australia and raised in Northern Ireland, Jeffers has gained international acclaim for his picture books, which often blend whimsical storytelling with unique artistic techniques. His works are celebrated for their ability to engage both children and adults, using simple yet profound narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive turquoise skies and pale horizons surround tiny figures and improbable airborne structures, creating a dreamy, fantastical sense of scale. Visible brushwork gives the clouds, sky, and ground a tactile painted surface, while saturated coral-red accents and delicate atmospheric detail heighten the expressive, surreal scenes."},{"id":"hans-holbein-the-elder","name":"Hans Holbein the Elder","cat":"painters","en":"Hans Holbein the Elder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-holbein-the-elder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-holbein-the-elder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-orange","dark-red","dark-brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Hans Holbein the Elder was a German painter and draftsman known for his contributions to the Northern Renaissance. Born in Augsburg around 1465, he was a prominent figure in the development of German art during the late 15th and early 16th centuries. Holbein's work is characterized by its detailed realism and expressive portraits, often depicting religious themes and figures with a meticulous attention to detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly rendered oil-paint textures, delicate brushwork, subdued dark colors, and carefully modeled faces and fabrics. Formal bust-length portraits, period clothing, fur, velvet, jewelry, and document props are set against deep, restrained backgrounds with a solemn classical presence."},{"id":"miroslav-sasek","name":"Miroslav Sasek","cat":"illustrators","en":"Miroslav Sasek","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/miroslav-sasek.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/miroslav-sasek","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","scenes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","light-yellow","vivid-red","deep-red","orange","green"],"intro":"Miroslav Sasek is a renowned Czech illustrator best known for his series of children's books titled \"This Is...\", which introduced young readers to cities around the world. His work is characterized by a distinctive style that combines vibrant colors with playful and informative illustrations, capturing the essence of each location with charm and wit.","observation":"The style combines vivid, poster-like color blocking and clean illustrative contours with visible dry-brush and paper texture. It presents fashionable figures, urban scenes, landmarks, and travel settings in richly arranged midcentury compositions, balancing simplified geometry with abundant architectural and clothing details."},{"id":"james-jean","name":"James Jean","cat":"various-artists","en":"James Jean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-jean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-jean","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","black","dark-brown","dark-blue","orange","red"],"intro":"James Jean is a Taiwanese-American visual artist known for his intricate and imaginative works that blend elements of fantasy, surrealism, and contemporary art. His art often features detailed line work and a rich use of color, exploring themes of nature, mythology, and the human condition.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, illustrative linework with visible painted texture and expressive, flowing brush marks. Saturated coral, cream, and blue tones create strong contrast, while dense floral ornament and curling organic forms surround stylized human figures."},{"id":"jim-lambie","name":"Jim Lambie","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jim Lambie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-lambie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-lambie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","patterns","scenes","motion","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["muted-rust","bone-white","red","brown","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Jim Lambie is a contemporary Scottish artist known for his vibrant and immersive installations. He often utilizes everyday materials to create dynamic and colorful environments that challenge perceptions and engage viewers in a playful manner. Lambie's work is characterized by its bold use of color and pattern, often transforming spaces into optical experiences.","observation":"The style depicts immersive gallery installations where dense, vividly colored stripes flow across floors, walls, and sculptural forms. Clean graphic edges, repeated linear patterns, and strong perspective make the imagery feel illustrative, geometric, and kinetic, while the impossible continuity of the bands gives it a surreal quality."},{"id":"boris-vallejo","name":"Boris Vallejo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Boris Vallejo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/boris-vallejo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/boris-vallejo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-cyan","dark-red","red","orange"],"intro":"Boris Vallejo is a Peruvian-American artist known for his hyper-realistic fantasy illustrations. His work often features muscular heroes, mythical creatures, and dramatic, action-packed scenes. Vallejo's art has been influential in the fantasy genre, contributing to book covers, posters, and calendars.","observation":"The style uses richly visible, broad painterly strokes to build dense textures in scales, hair, feathers, armor, and rocky terrain. Saturated teal, orange, red, and violet hues combine with strong light-dark contrast, presenting dramatic fantasy characters and creatures in cinematic close-ups and monumental volcanic landscapes."},{"id":"milt-kahl","name":"Milt Kahl","cat":"illustrators","en":"Milt Kahl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/milt-kahl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/milt-kahl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["cream","pale-yellow","white","muted-ochre","brown","silver"],"intro":"Milt Kahl was a renowned American animator and one of Disney's Nine Old Men, known for his significant contributions to the animation industry during the mid-20th century. He played a crucial role in creating some of Disney's most iconic characters and was celebrated for his mastery of character design and animation techniques.","observation":"The style uses loose, energetic graphite and ink linework with fine contours, hatching, and selective dark shading on mostly white or sepia paper. It combines expressive character acting and exaggerated facial features with animated animal and human designs, presenting both close-up portraits and small narrative interactions."},{"id":"alessandro-gottardo","name":"Alessandro Gottardo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alessandro Gottardo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alessandro-gottardo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alessandro-gottardo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","scenes","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["pale-green","muted-teal","grey","black","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Alessandro Gottardo is an Italian illustrator known for his minimalist and surreal visual style. His work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, using simplified forms and a restrained color palette to convey deep emotions and narratives. Gottardo's illustrations have been featured in numerous publications and exhibitions, earning him recognition in the contemporary art world.","observation":"The style combines graphic, poster-like landscape forms with subdued teal, cream, charcoal, and occasional red accents. Vast negative space, tiny isolated figures, stark silhouettes, and impossible composite landscapes create a quiet, cinematic dreaminess, while a coarse grain overlays the clean illustrative shapes."},{"id":"mary-engelbreit","name":"Mary Engelbreit","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mary Engelbreit","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-engelbreit.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-engelbreit","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","floral","still-life","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["muted-olive","red","ochre","black","bone-white","muted-blue"],"intro":"Mary Engelbreit is an American illustrator known for her distinctive and charming artwork, often featured in children's books, greeting cards, and home decor. Her work is characterized by a whimsical and nostalgic style, drawing inspiration from folk art and storybook illustrations, and is widely recognized for its intricate details and vivid color palettes.","observation":"The style combines visible hand-painted texture with crisp illustrative outlines, densely layering vivid colors, floral motifs, ceramics, textiles, furniture, and patterned surfaces. Storybook characters and animals appear within highly decorative domestic and garden settings, with ornate details and strong geometric accents such as checkerboards and framed panels."},{"id":"josan-gonzalez","name":"Josan Gonzalez","cat":"illustrators","en":"Josan Gonzalez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josan-gonzalez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josan-gonzalez","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-red","charcoal","grey","red","orange","light-cyan"],"intro":"Josan Gonzalez is a contemporary illustrator known for his intricate and imaginative sci-fi themed artworks. His work often explores futuristic and surreal landscapes, populated by detailed characters and mechanical elements. Gonzalez's style is characterized by bold lines and vivid colors, drawing inspiration from both classic and modern science fiction.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense graphic illustration with heavy black contouring, clean color blocks, and highly saturated teal, coral, red, and orange accents. It combines elaborate cybernetic characters and machinery with ruined architecture, crowded urban environments, and dramatic science-fiction imagery, producing an energetic, high-contrast comic-book look."},{"id":"elsa-beskow","name":"Elsa Beskow","cat":"illustrators","en":"Elsa Beskow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elsa-beskow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elsa-beskow","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","drawing"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-olive","light-yellow","rust","grey"],"intro":"Elsa Beskow was a Swedish author and illustrator known for her charming children's books that often featured elements of nature and folklore. Her work is celebrated for its delicate and detailed illustrations, which bring to life enchanting stories filled with whimsy and innocence.","observation":"The style combines finely drawn outlines with softly layered, visibly painted color, creating a richly detailed storybook illustration. Repeated scenes of children tending gardens are packed with flowers, vegetables, birds, and animals, using earthy greens and warm red-orange accents in an expressive classical composition."},{"id":"lisbeth-zwerger","name":"Lisbeth Zwerger","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lisbeth Zwerger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lisbeth-zwerger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lisbeth-zwerger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","retro","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","silver","dark-olive","grey","red"],"intro":"Lisbeth Zwerger is an acclaimed Austrian illustrator known for her enchanting and whimsical illustrations, often inspired by classic fairy tales and literature. Her work is characterized by delicate watercolor techniques and a unique ability to capture the essence of the stories she illustrates, making her a beloved figure in the world of children's literature.","observation":"The style uses softly textured, visibly painted surfaces with delicate linework, subdued earthy colors, and occasional saturated red garments as focal points. It presents quiet, dreamlike storybook scenes populated by elongated children, animals, books, bare branches, and candlelit or pastoral settings, with a gently aged illustrative finish."},{"id":"gustave-dore","name":"Gustave Dore","cat":"printmakers","en":"Gustave Dore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-dore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-dore","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Gustave Dore was a French artist, printmaker, illustrator, and sculptor known for his detailed and imaginative engravings. Born in 1832, Dore gained fame for his illustrations of literary classics such as Dante's \"Divine Comedy\" and Cervantes' \"Don Quixote.\" His work is characterized by its dramatic use of light and shadow, intricate detailing, and grand, often fantastical themes.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed black-and-white illustration with fine etched lines, dense textures, and stark contrasts between illuminated figures and vast shadowed spaces. Across the scenes, monumental caverns, cliffs, storms, and processions create an epic, dark-fantasy atmosphere with expressive cinematic-scale lighting."},{"id":"annie-ovenden","name":"Annie Ovenden","cat":"various-artists","en":"Annie Ovenden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/annie-ovenden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/annie-ovenden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","muted-blue","brown","beige","red"],"intro":"Annie Ovenden is a British artist known for her detailed landscape paintings that often depict the English countryside. She is associated with the Brotherhood of Ruralists, a group of artists dedicated to capturing the beauty of rural life. Ovenden's work is characterized by its romantic and pastoral themes, often featuring idyllic scenes of nature.","observation":"The style uses realistic rural landscapes with dense, sharply legible networks of bare branches and layered hills, rendered in subdued blue-grey and dusky rose tones. Moonlight, sunset glow, and visible mist create a dark, dreamy atmosphere, with occasional animals and distant figures providing scale."},{"id":"adrienne-segur","name":"Adrienne Segur","cat":"illustrators","en":"Adrienne Segur","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adrienne-segur.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adrienne-segur","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","bone-white","ochre","dark-red","orange"],"intro":"Adrienne Segur is a renowned French illustrator known for her enchanting fairy tale illustrations, particularly in children's books. Her work is characterized by intricate detailing and a delicate, whimsical style that captures the imagination.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, visible brushwork with densely packed figures, animals, flowers, costumes, and ornamental surfaces. Restrained jewel-like colors, pale faces, elaborate textiles, and dark foliage create a theatrical fairy-tale atmosphere with surreal visual pairings."},{"id":"gustav-klimt","name":"Gustav Klimt","cat":"painters","en":"Gustav Klimt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustav-klimt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustav-klimt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","ochre","beige","brown","dark-rust","red"],"intro":"Gustav Klimt was an Austrian symbolist painter known for his distinctive style that combined symbolism with Art Nouveau elements. He was a prominent member of the Vienna Secession movement and is best known for his paintings, murals, and sketches that often featured elaborate patterns and gold leaf. Klimt's work is characterized by its sensuality, intricate detailing, and use of symbolic imagery, often exploring themes of love, beauty, and eroticism.","observation":"The style combines intimate female portraiture with richly layered decorative surfaces, using visible brushwork, intricate patterning, metallic-looking gold areas, and dense floral or textile motifs. Saturated reds, oranges, creams, and blacks create a dramatic, opulent mood while the carefully modeled faces remain soft and expressive."},{"id":"kaethe-butcher","name":"Kaethe Butcher","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kaethe Butcher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kaethe-butcher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kaethe-butcher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","floral","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","white","muted-orange","beige","brown","red"],"intro":"Kaethe Butcher is a contemporary illustrator known for her bold and expressive depictions of feminine themes. Her work often explores the emotional and sensual aspects of womanhood, using a distinctive monochrome palette and fine line work to create striking and intimate portraits.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses finely drawn, ink-like contours and dense line detail to depict intimate female close-ups, with large areas of solid black hair and clothing against warm cream grounds. The restrained palette is dominated by black, ivory, and beige, punctuated by occasional red floral or lipstick accents, creating a bold, darkly romantic illustrative effect."},{"id":"milo-manara","name":"Milo Manara","cat":"illustrators","en":"Milo Manara","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/milo-manara.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/milo-manara","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","drawing"],"colours":["orange","charcoal","bone-white","beige","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Milo Manara is an Italian comic book artist and illustrator known for his erotic and sensual style. His work often features detailed and expressive depictions of the human form, particularly focusing on feminine beauty. Manara's illustrations are characterized by their intricate line work, soft color palettes, and a blend of classical and contemporary themes.","observation":"The style combines finely drawn ink contours with delicate, visible brushwork and softly blended, earthy watercolor-like color. It focuses on expressive female portraits and fashion details, using dense hair, fabric, jewelry, and facial marks to create richly ornamented compositions."},{"id":"helen-dardik","name":"Helen Dardik","cat":"illustrators","en":"Helen Dardik","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helen-dardik.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helen-dardik","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","patterns","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","cute","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","green","light-yellow","red","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Helen Dardik is a contemporary illustrator known for her vibrant and whimsical designs. Her work often features playful characters and intricate patterns, drawing inspiration from folk art and nature. Dardik's illustrations have been used in various products, including stationery, textiles, and children's books.","observation":"The style combines dense, fantastical botanical scenes with expressive faces and charming animal characters, rendered in saturated jewel-like colors. Visible directional brushwork, layered textures, simplified forms, and decorative markings create a richly packed yet playful illustrated world."},{"id":"ludwig-deutsch","name":"Ludwig Deutsch","cat":"painters","en":"Ludwig Deutsch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ludwig-deutsch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ludwig-deutsch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","ethnic-poc","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","deep-rust","orange","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Ludwig Deutsch is an Austrian painter known for his Orientalist works, capturing the allure and mystique of Middle Eastern culture during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His paintings are celebrated for their meticulous detail, vivid color palettes, and the romanticized depiction of Eastern life, often focusing on architectural elements and everyday scenes.","observation":"These images use richly textured, realistic painting with visible fine brushwork, dense architectural and textile detail, and strong sunlight against deep shadow. Repeated courtyards, carved doors, arches, robed figures, rugs, and vessels create an ornate North African marketplace atmosphere in subdued earth tones punctuated by blue and red garments."},{"id":"joe-madureira","name":"Joe Madureira","cat":"illustrators","en":"Joe Madureira","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joe-madureira.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joe-madureira","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","motion","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","cream","dark-red","charcoal","beige","rust","light-yellow"],"intro":"Joe Madureira is a renowned comic book artist and writer, known for his work on popular series such as \"Uncanny X-Men\" and \"Battle Chasers.\" His distinctive style blends Western comic art with Japanese manga influences, characterized by dynamic poses and detailed line work.","observation":"The style combines densely rendered fantasy character art with forceful black contours, energetic gestures, and dramatic close-up compositions. Richly modeled armor, monstrous anatomy, torn fabric, and debris are pushed by high contrast and saturated firelit orange against cooler shadowed tones, while the lower renders retain a sketch-like ink and brush quality."},{"id":"oliviero-toscani","name":"Oliviero Toscani","cat":"photographers","en":"Oliviero Toscani","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oliviero-toscani.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oliviero-toscani","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","black","beige","muted-brown","dark-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Oliviero Toscani is an Italian photographer known for his provocative and socially conscious advertising campaigns, particularly for Benetton. His work often challenges societal norms and explores themes of identity, diversity, and human rights, making him a significant figure in contemporary photography.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely textured portrait photography with intimate close crops and unusual human⁠–animal pairings. Restrained backgrounds and earthy tones keep attention on tactile fur, skin, hair, garments, and direct expressions, while the editorial styling and bold juxtapositions give the images a striking, cinematic presence."},{"id":"artgerm","name":"Artgerm","cat":"illustrators","en":"Artgerm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/artgerm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/artgerm","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","bone-white","charcoal","grey","orange","muted-rust"],"intro":"Artgerm is a renowned illustrator known for his vibrant and dynamic character designs, often blending elements of realism with a stylized approach. His work is celebrated for its attention to detail, expressive characters, and captivating use of color, making him a prominent figure in the digital art community.","observation":"Across the sheet, the style combines polished, painterly portrait rendering with visible fine sketch lines and delicate brushwork. It focuses on tightly cropped female characters with expressive gazes, flowing hair, ornamental accessories, and a mix of richly colored and graphite-like treatments."},{"id":"brian-stelfreeze","name":"Brian Stelfreeze","cat":"illustrators","en":"Brian Stelfreeze","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-stelfreeze.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-stelfreeze","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing"],"colours":["black","blue","red","vivid-orange","dark-brown","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Brian Stelfreeze is a renowned American comic book artist and illustrator known for his dynamic and expressive style. He has worked on numerous projects for major comic book publishers, contributing to both mainstream superhero comics and independent graphic novels. Stelfreeze's work is characterized by his bold use of color, intricate line work, and ability to convey emotion and movement through his illustrations.","observation":"Across all four portraits, saturated color blocks and deep shadows are shaped with vigorous visible brushwork and heavy dark contour lines. The tightly cropped faces, expressive poses, textured marks, and graphic backgrounds give the style an energetic painted-illustration quality."},{"id":"bruce-timm","name":"Bruce Timm","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bruce Timm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruce-timm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruce-timm","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing"],"colours":["white","black","vivid-red","deep-blue","grey","orange"],"intro":"Bruce Timm is an American artist, animator, and producer known for his influential work in the animation industry, particularly in the creation of the DC Animated Universe. His distinctive style blends classic comic book aesthetics with modern animation techniques, contributing significantly to the visual identity of characters like Batman and Superman.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic comic-book illustration with heavy black contouring, sharply angular anatomy, and clean flat color blocks. Saturated reds, blacks, whites, and blues create forceful contrast, while expressive poses, masked characters, and fashion-forward superhero costumes give the images a retro pulp energy."},{"id":"andrea-galvani","name":"Andrea Galvani","cat":"photographers","en":"Andrea Galvani","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrea-galvani.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrea-galvani","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-blue","silver","charcoal","dark-blue","brown"],"intro":"Andrea Galvani is an Italian contemporary artist known for his conceptual approach to photography and installation art. His work often explores themes of memory, time, and the intersection of science and art, using a mix of photography, drawing, and sculpture to create thought-provoking pieces.","observation":"The style uses photorealistic, cinematic wide compositions that place tiny solitary figures against immense landscapes and monumental cloud formations. Strong scale contrast, expansive negative space, soft natural light, and surreal juxtapositions make the scenes feel epic and otherworldly."},{"id":"mo-willems","name":"Mo Willems","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mo Willems","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mo-willems.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mo-willems","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["muted-green","orange","light-cyan","rust","dark-olive","bone-white"],"intro":"Mo Willems is an American author, illustrator, and animator known for his work in children's literature. He has created beloved characters such as the Pigeon, Elephant and Piggie, and Knuffle Bunny. Willems's books are celebrated for their humor, simplicity, and ability to engage young readers, earning him multiple awards, including several Caldecott Honors.","observation":"The style uses flat, saturated color fields with rough paper texture and prominent hand-drawn black outlines. It combines eccentric anthropomorphic animal characters, oversized eyes, awkward proportions, and expressive facial gestures in whimsical comic-like scenes."},{"id":"xenia-hausner","name":"Xenia Hausner","cat":"painters","en":"Xenia Hausner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/xenia-hausner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/xenia-hausner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-orange","charcoal","dark-brown","deep-red","vivid-red","muted-cyan","olive"],"intro":"Xenia Hausner is an Austrian contemporary artist known for her vivid and expressive portraiture. Her work often explores themes of identity and emotion, capturing the complexity of human experiences through bold colors and dynamic compositions. Hausner's paintings are celebrated for their intense emotional depth and intricate detailing, making her a prominent figure in modern European art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses tightly cropped female portraits with vivid coral, red, green, and blue color contrasts and expressive gazes or gestures. Visible directional brushwork builds hair, skin, fabric, and facial features, combining highly descriptive portrait detail with a vivid illustrative clarity."},{"id":"ryo-takemasa","name":"Ryo Takemasa","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ryo Takemasa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryo-takemasa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryo-takemasa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","grain","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","muted-blue","silver","red"],"intro":"Ryo Takemasa is a contemporary illustrator known for his clean and minimalist style, often depicting serene landscapes and nature scenes. His work is characterized by the use of subdued colors and geometric forms, creating a sense of tranquility and reflection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines simplified, graphic forms with atmospheric landscape scenes, using deep blue tones, restrained red accents, and strong silhouette-like shapes. A pervasive granular print texture softens the clean geometry, while tiny solitary figures and dreamlike scale relationships create a quiet, surreal mood."},{"id":"jessica-stockholder","name":"Jessica Stockholder","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jessica Stockholder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jessica-stockholder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jessica-stockholder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","sculptural","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["silver","beige","red","brown","ochre","blue","olive"],"intro":"Jessica Stockholder is an American artist known for her pioneering work in installation art, often incorporating everyday objects into vibrant, large-scale compositions. Her work blurs the boundaries between painting, sculpture, and architecture, creating immersive environments that challenge traditional notions of space and form.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents exuberant mixed-media assemblages in a bright gallery setting, combining geometric painted panels, found furniture, textiles, ropes, and scattered construction debris. Saturated colors, hard-edged shapes, visible painted surfaces, and dense layered arrangements create a playful yet deliberately chaotic sculptural effect."},{"id":"simon-stalenhag","name":"Simon Stalenhag","cat":"illustrators","en":"Simon Stalenhag","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/simon-stalenhag.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/simon-stalenhag","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","dark-cyan","blue","cream","brown","red"],"intro":"Simon Stalenhag is a Swedish artist and author known for his unique blend of science fiction and realism. His work often explores themes of technology and nature, set against the backdrop of a nostalgic, yet eerie, Scandinavian landscape. Stalenhag's illustrations have gained international acclaim for their detailed and immersive storytelling.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic environmental compositions with cool blue-gray grading, restrained warm red-orange lights, and extensive mist that softens the distant landscape. Detailed industrial and roadside elements are framed as atmospheric scenes, with monumental alien machinery and small human figures creating an ominous, epic scale."},{"id":"shintaro-kago","name":"Shintaro Kago","cat":"illustrators","en":"Shintaro Kago","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shintaro-kago.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shintaro-kago","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","red","dark-blue","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Shintaro Kago is a Japanese manga artist known for his unique style that blends elements of horror, science fiction, and surrealism. His work often explores themes of body horror and the grotesque, characterized by intricate linework and a distinctive blend of humor and unsettling imagery. Kago's art is recognized for its bold and detailed illustrations that challenge conventional narratives and visual aesthetics.","observation":"The style combines densely packed urban imagery and close-up character portraits with vivid red and blue color blocking, crisp fine outlines, and highly legible small details. Flat illustrative shapes are energized by expressive faces, unusual juxtapositions, and surreal visual overload across the compositions."},{"id":"david-lachapelle","name":"David LaChapelle","cat":"photographers","en":"David LaChapelle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-lachapelle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-lachapelle","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","red","beige","dark-blue","light-orange","pink"],"intro":"David LaChapelle is an American photographer and director known for his distinctive and often surreal style. His work is characterized by its vibrant colors, elaborate staging, and a blend of pop culture and fine art. LaChapelle's photography often explores themes of consumerism, celebrity culture, and the human condition, making him a prominent figure in contemporary art and fashion photography.","observation":"The style builds lavish, densely packed theatrical tableaux with extravagant costumes, ornamental settings, flowers, flames, and fantastical props. Saturated jewel tones and warm firelight create strong cinematic contrast, while glowing sources and elaborate surfaces give the scenes a dreamlike, surreal spectacle."},{"id":"salvador-dali","name":"Salvador Dali","cat":"painters","en":"Salvador Dali","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/salvador-dali.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/salvador-dali","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","motion","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["grey","brown","orange","ochre","muted-blue"],"intro":"Salvador Dali was a prominent Spanish surrealist artist known for his striking and bizarre images. Born in 1904, Dali's works are characterized by dreamlike scenes and meticulous detail, often exploring themes of subconscious and imagination. His most famous works include \"The Persistence of Memory,\" which features melting clocks in a desert landscape.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive desert and shoreline settings combine realistic atmospheric light with impossible monumental figures, distorted faces, oversized eyes, and uncanny flying forms. The painterly surfaces, warm ochre-and-blue palette, dramatic clouds, and tiny isolated people create a cinematic, dreamlike sense of scale and estrangement."},{"id":"massimo-vitali","name":"Massimo Vitali","cat":"photographers","en":"Massimo Vitali","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/massimo-vitali.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/massimo-vitali","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","motion","vivid-colors"],"colours":["light-cyan","grey","silver","muted-blue","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Massimo Vitali is an Italian photographer known for his large-scale images of beaches and public spaces, capturing the essence of leisure and social interaction. His work often explores themes of mass tourism and the human presence within natural landscapes, using a distinctive high vantage point to create expansive, detailed scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is photographic and highly realistic, with expansive coastal compositions, crisp natural textures, and saturated turquoise water against pale rock and blue sky. Crowds of bathers and rolling surf provide recurring human scale and motion, while atmospheric sea haze and broad cinematic framing soften the distant horizon."},{"id":"clifford-possum-tjapaltjarri","name":"Clifford Possum Tjapaltjarri","cat":"painters","en":"Clifford Possum Tjapaltjarri","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clifford-possum-tjapaltjarri.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clifford-possum-tjapaltjarri","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","ornate","ethnic-poc","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["deep-red","dark-brown","rust","muted-orange","muted-brown","brown"],"intro":"Clifford Possum Tjapaltjarri was a renowned Indigenous Australian artist known for his significant contributions to the contemporary Aboriginal art movement. Born in 1932, he was a pioneer in the Western Desert art movement, using traditional symbols and stories to create vibrant and intricate paintings that reflect the cultural heritage and spiritual beliefs of his people.","observation":"The style is a dense abstract pattern language built from concentric circles, spirals, and nested square forms, arranged in repeating fields rather than depicting objects or scenes. Earthy reds, browns, ochres, cream, and black dominate, with visible hand-painted texture, broad uneven strokes, bold outlining, and dotted accents giving the geometric designs an artisanal surface."},{"id":"mike-zeck","name":"Mike Zeck","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mike Zeck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-zeck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-zeck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-blue","muted-ochre","red","ochre"],"intro":"Mike Zeck is a renowned American comic book artist known for his work on popular superhero titles. His contributions to the comic book industry include iconic runs on series such as 'The Punisher,' 'Captain America,' and 'Secret Wars.' Zeck's distinctive style is characterized by dynamic compositions, detailed line work, and a strong sense of action and drama.","observation":"The style is intensely graphic comic-book illustration, built from heavy black contours, angular anatomy, expressive faces, flat saturated color, and dense crosshatched shadow. Crowded character groupings, dramatic close-ups, distressed ink texture, and explosive backgrounds create a dark, energetic visual density across the sheet."},{"id":"max-ernst","name":"Max Ernst","cat":"painters","en":"Max Ernst","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/max-ernst.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/max-ernst","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-ochre","muted-blue","orange","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Max Ernst was a German painter, sculptor, and pioneer of the Dada and Surrealist movements. Born in 1891, he became known for his innovative techniques and dreamlike imagery, often exploring themes of the subconscious and fantasy. His work is characterized by a blend of reality and imagination, utilizing methods such as collage, frottage, and grattage to create textured and layered compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures, animals, planets and landscapes are fused with angular geometric shapes and dreamlike scale shifts. Thick, visibly worked paint, scraped textures, layered fragments and energetic marks create a tactile collage-like surface, with saturated oranges and blues set against deep dark areas."},{"id":"tim-hildebrandt","name":"Tim Hildebrandt","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tim Hildebrandt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-hildebrandt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-hildebrandt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Tim Hildebrandt was an American illustrator known for his work in the fantasy genre, often collaborating with his twin brother Greg Hildebrandt. The Hildebrandt brothers gained fame for their contributions to the world of fantasy art, including iconic illustrations for \" The Lord of the Rings \" and \"Star Wars\". Their work is characterized by vivid colors, intricate details, and a strong narrative quality that captures the imagination.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, energetic brushwork and richly layered detail to depict dramatic fantasy scenes, characters, and monumental landscapes. Saturated orange and blue lighting, deep shadows, firelight, and atmospheric skies create an epic, theatrical mood with luminous internal light sources."},{"id":"chris-sanders","name":"Chris Sanders","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris Sanders","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-sanders.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-sanders","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","funny"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","light-orange","brown","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Chris Sanders is an American animator, director, and illustrator known for his work in the animation industry, particularly with Disney and DreamWorks.","observation":"This style combines loose, finely drawn pencil contours with selective watercolor-like washes, visible paper texture, and earthy, restrained color. It consistently presents whimsical animal characters with exaggerated anatomy, oversized eyes, scruffy textures, and humorous, highly expressive groupings."},{"id":"alexander-calder","name":"Alexander Calder","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Alexander Calder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexander-calder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexander-calder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","minimalist","sculptural","motion","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","bone-white","beige","dark-red","black"],"intro":"Alexander Calder is a renowned American sculptor known for his innovative mobiles and kinetic sculptures. His work is characterized by its playful use of color and movement, often incorporating elements of balance and motion to create dynamic compositions. Calder's contributions to modern art have made him a pivotal figure in the development of kinetic art.","observation":"The style presents sparse abstract mobiles as sculptural arrangements of smooth, flat geometric and organic forms, strongly dominated by red, black, white, and occasional primary-color accents. Thin wires, suspended counterweights, open spacing, and carefully balanced asymmetry create a kinetic, airy composition against clean gallery-like backgrounds."},{"id":"kourtney-roy","name":"Kourtney Roy","cat":"photographers","en":"Kourtney Roy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kourtney-roy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kourtney-roy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-cyan","muted-orange","red","dark-green","light-teal","deep-rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"Kourtney Roy is a contemporary photographer known for her vibrant and cinematic style that often explores themes of identity and fantasy. Her work is characterized by a playful and surreal approach, blending elements of fashion and narrative storytelling.","observation":"These images use crisp, realistic photography with saturated coral, turquoise, mint, and red hues, sharply controlled sunlight, and deep graphic shadows. Carefully arranged geometric architecture, vintage automobiles and furnishings, and posed fashion figures create a polished retro editorial look with strong symmetry and bold color blocking."},{"id":"bill-willingham","name":"Bill Willingham","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bill Willingham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-willingham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-willingham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","pale-orange","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Bill Willingham is an American writer and artist, best known for his work on the comic book series \"Fables.\" He has contributed significantly to the comic book industry, creating engaging narratives and visually captivating illustrations that blend fantasy and reality.","observation":"The style uses densely detailed illustrative drawing with fine, ink-like contour lines, crosshatching, and layered black shading over a warm cream ground. Expressive fantasy characters and beasts dominate tightly cropped compositions, with flowing hair, textured clothing, and occasional muted red or blue accents reinforcing the dark, dramatic mood."},{"id":"axel-scheffler","name":"Axel Scheffler","cat":"illustrators","en":"Axel Scheffler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/axel-scheffler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/axel-scheffler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","grey","rust","ochre","light-yellow"],"intro":"Axel Scheffler is a renowned illustrator known for his work in children's literature, particularly for his collaborations with author Julia Donaldson. His distinctive style is characterized by playful and expressive characters, often set in whimsical and imaginative worlds. Scheffler's illustrations are beloved for their ability to capture the attention and imagination of young readers, combining humor and warmth with detailed and engaging visuals.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, hand-rendered brushwork with strong dark outlines and densely drawn fur, foliage, and facial features. Vivid rust, blue, green, and gray tones give the expressive animal characters a whimsical storybook presence, ranging from crowded group scenes to dramatic close-ups and scale contrasts."},{"id":"maynard-dixon","name":"Maynard Dixon","cat":"painters","en":"Maynard Dixon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maynard-dixon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maynard-dixon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","epic"],"colours":["muted-blue","muted-ochre","grey","charcoal","pale-orange","orange"],"intro":"Maynard Dixon was an American artist known for his depictions of the American West. Born in 1875, Dixon's work is celebrated for its portrayal of Western landscapes, Native American culture, and the spirit of the frontier. His paintings often feature vast, open spaces and a deep connection to the land, capturing the essence of the American West with a unique blend of realism and romanticism.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive desert landscapes are painted with visible, layered brushwork, strong warm-cool color contrasts, and carefully modelled mountains and cloud masses. The compositions feel like dramatic landscape tableaux, pairing monumental skies and peaks with sparse roads, scrub, and occasional rural structures."},{"id":"tom-eckersley","name":"Tom Eckersley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tom Eckersley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-eckersley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-eckersley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","still-life","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","bone-white","vivid-red","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Tom Eckersley was a pioneering British graphic designer and poster artist known for his influential work in the mid-20th century. He was a key figure in the development of modern graphic design, particularly in the United Kingdom, and his work is celebrated for its bold use of color and geometric forms. Eckersley's designs often featured simplified shapes and strong visual impact, making them highly effective for advertising and public information campaigns.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses flat, hard-edged geometric shapes, strong black silhouettes, and a restricted orange, cream, and charcoal palette. Large areas of negative space and subtle grain give the graphic compositions a retro poster or screenprint quality, while angular forms and bold contrast make the figures and objects immediately legible."},{"id":"dan-spiegle","name":"Dan Spiegle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dan Spiegle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-spiegle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-spiegle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","ink"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-brown","orange","muted-cyan","light-orange"],"intro":"Dan Spiegle is an American comic book artist known for his work on various titles across different publishers, including DC Comics and Gold Key Comics. His career spanned several decades, during which he contributed to both mainstream superhero comics and adaptations of popular television series.","observation":"The style uses densely detailed comic-book illustration with thick black ink contours, crosshatching, flat color blocks, and strongly saturated primary hues. Dramatic character poses, monstrous figures, explosive backgrounds, and panel-like framing create a bold, high-contrast vintage superhero aesthetic."},{"id":"chad-dutson","name":"Chad Dutson","cat":"photographers","en":"Chad Dutson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chad-dutson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chad-dutson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","brown","red","pink"],"intro":"Chad Dutson is a contemporary photographer known for his stunning landscape photography, capturing the natural beauty of the American wilderness. His work often features dramatic lighting and vivid colors, bringing the grandeur of nature to life.","observation":"The style combines saturated coral, magenta, teal, and indigo with dramatic contrast, producing luminous twilight landscapes and highly graphic tattoo imagery. Clean illustrative contours and bold dark linework coexist with dense natural detail, swirling decorative forms, and dreamlike celestial atmosphere."},{"id":"katsuhiro-otomo","name":"Katsuhiro Otomo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Katsuhiro Otomo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/katsuhiro-otomo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/katsuhiro-otomo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["grey","white","black","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Katsuhiro Otomo is a renowned Japanese manga artist, screenwriter, and film director, best known for his work on the groundbreaking manga and anime \"Akira.\" His contributions to the world of manga and anime have left a lasting impact, influencing countless artists and creators globally. Otomo's work is celebrated for its intricate detail, dynamic storytelling, and exploration of futuristic and dystopian themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense black-and-white comic illustration with highly detailed environments, expressive figures, and dramatic low or tilted perspectives. Fine contour lines, crosshatching, ink-like shading, and stark black areas define the ruined urban and orbital settings."},{"id":"makoto-shinkai","name":"Makoto Shinkai","cat":"illustrators","en":"Makoto Shinkai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/makoto-shinkai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/makoto-shinkai","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","brown","silver","pale-orange","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Makoto Shinkai is a renowned Japanese animator and filmmaker known for his visually stunning and emotionally resonant films. His works often explore themes of love, distance, and the passage of time, with a strong focus on the beauty of nature and urban environments. Shinkai's films, such as \"Your Name\" and \"Weathering with You,\" have gained international acclaim for their intricate animation and compelling storytelling.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly environments with cinematic wide compositions and fine graphic linework in wires, rails, and architecture. Saturated blue-and-gold light, dramatic cloud formations, and glowing sunsets give both urban and rural scenes a dreamy, expansive atmosphere."},{"id":"dora-carrington","name":"Dora Carrington","cat":"painters","en":"Dora Carrington","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dora-carrington.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dora-carrington","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","ochre","dark-blue"],"intro":"Dora Carrington was an English painter and decorative artist, associated with the Bloomsbury Group. Known for her unique style that combined elements of post-impressionism and romanticism, Carrington's work often depicted intimate domestic scenes and landscapes, capturing the essence of early 20th-century British art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines representational figures and interiors with visibly worked, tactile paint surfaces and finely controlled brushwork. It favors dense portrait-centered compositions, earthy greens and ochres, strong light-dark separation, patterned surroundings, and layered decorative details."},{"id":"aries-moross","name":"Aries Moross","cat":"designers","en":"Aries Moross","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aries-moross.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aries-moross","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","patterns","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","psychedelic-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["pink","muted-cyan","vivid-red","blue","charcoal","orange","green"],"intro":"Aries Moross is a contemporary graphic designer and illustrator known for their vibrant and dynamic artwork. They have gained recognition for their unique approach to design, incorporating bold colors and intricate patterns that often explore themes of identity and culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly saturated psychedelic color with visible painted texture, thick contouring, and densely layered surreal imagery. Giant eyes, faces, plants, organic forms, patterned surfaces, and architectural fragments interlock in complex, graphic compositions."},{"id":"loretta-lux","name":"Loretta Lux","cat":"photographers","en":"Loretta Lux","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/loretta-lux.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/loretta-lux","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","dark","symmetry"],"colours":["light-yellow","muted-ochre","muted-green","silver","olive","brown"],"intro":"Loretta Lux is a German fine art photographer known for her surreal and meticulously crafted portraits of children. Her work often combines photography with digital manipulation to create ethereal and timeless images that evoke a sense of nostalgia and fantasy.","observation":"The style uses carefully staged, front-facing portraits and tableaux of children in vintage clothing, with repeated symmetry, formal poses, and restrained pastel tones. Soft naturalistic lighting, richly patterned interiors, floral settings, and unusually serious expressions create a nostalgic yet quietly unsettling cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"franck-bohbot","name":"Franck Bohbot","cat":"photographers","en":"Franck Bohbot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/franck-bohbot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/franck-bohbot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","urban","glow","mist","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","retro"],"colours":["dark-teal","black","brown","muted-teal","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Franck Bohbot is a contemporary photographer known for his vibrant and meticulously composed images that often explore urban environments and architectural spaces. His work frequently captures the interplay of light and shadow, creating a sense of mood and atmosphere that is both nostalgic and modern.","observation":"Across the four views, realistic urban streets are rendered with a cinematic night-photography mood: deep teal shadows contrast with saturated coral, amber, and cyan practical lights. Neon signage, grain, atmospheric moisture, snow, and reflective pavement give the scenes a nostalgic retro character while preserving detailed architectural and street-level textures."},{"id":"rene-magritte","name":"Rene Magritte","cat":"painters","en":"Rene Magritte","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rene-magritte.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rene-magritte","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","scenes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-cyan","muted-blue","black","charcoal","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Rene Magritte was a Belgian surrealist artist known for his thought-provoking and witty images that challenge observers' perceptions of reality. His work often features ordinary objects in unusual contexts, creating a sense of mystery and intrigue. Magritte's art is characterized by a meticulous technique and a keen sense of humor, making him one of the most influential figures in the Surrealist movement.","observation":"The style combines softly textured, visibly painted surfaces with restrained blue, cream, black, and rust tones, presenting sharply dressed figures against expansive cloud-filled skies. Repeated concealed faces, unexpected bird placement, and altered viewpoints create a dreamy surrealism while the formal portrait framing and strong silhouettes give the images a cinematic, graphic presence."},{"id":"vs-gaitonde","name":"VS Gaitonde","cat":"painters","en":"VS Gaitonde","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vs-gaitonde.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vs-gaitonde","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","brown","dark-ochre","ochre","vivid-red","vivid-orange"],"intro":"VS Gaitonde was an influential Indian abstract painter known for his non-representational art that emphasized color, form, and texture. His work is characterized by a deep spiritual quality, often reflecting themes of silence and introspection. Gaitonde's paintings are celebrated for their meditative and contemplative nature, making him a pivotal figure in Indian modernism.","observation":"The style uses heavily textured, visibly brushed surfaces with broad, rough marks and layered, weathered pigment. Sparse geometric silhouettes and architectural fragments sit in large atmospheric fields of subdued teal, ochre, gray, and brown, punctuated by sharp rust-red or amber accents and strong dark-light contrasts."},{"id":"andy-rementer","name":"Andy Rementer","cat":"illustrators","en":"Andy Rementer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andy-rementer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andy-rementer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","animals","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","muted-teal","pink","charcoal","blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"Andy Rementer is an American illustrator and artist known for his vibrant and playful style. His work often features bold colors, geometric shapes, and whimsical characters, drawing inspiration from pop culture and everyday life. Rementer's illustrations have been featured in various publications and exhibitions worldwide, showcasing his unique approach to contemporary art.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines vivid, high-contrast color blocking with thick dark outlines, visibly painted surfaces, and dense layers of playful geometric and organic forms. Repeated eyes, faces, teeth, animal-like creatures, and architectural motifs create a surreal mural language that feels energetic, decorative, and heavily hand-rendered."},{"id":"john-lovett","name":"John Lovett","cat":"painters","en":"John Lovett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-lovett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-lovett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","mist","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","silver","grey","muted-rust","charcoal","red"],"intro":"John Lovett is an accomplished artist known for his expertise in watercolor painting, often focusing on landscapes and architectural subjects. His work is characterized by a unique blend of realism and impressionism, capturing the essence of his subjects with a vibrant and expressive style.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable urban architecture is dissolved into atmospheric painted passages, with visible brush texture, fine construction lines, and selectively sharpened masonry and towers. Cool blue-gray surroundings, warm coral accents, reflective surfaces, and hazy distance create a dreamy, expressive cityscape style."},{"id":"henri-jules-jean-geoffroy","name":"Henri-Jules-Jean Geoffroy","cat":"painters","en":"Henri-Jules-Jean Geoffroy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-jules-jean-geoffroy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-jules-jean-geoffroy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Henri-Jules-Jean Geoffroy is a French painter known for his depictions of children and everyday life in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work often captures the innocence and simplicity of childhood, set against the backdrop of rural and domestic French settings. Geoffroy's paintings are characterized by their detailed realism and warm, earthy color palette, reflecting the charm and intimacy of his subjects.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is richly painterly and representational, with visible directional brushwork, layered textures, and carefully observed faces, clothing, animals, and masonry. Warm earth tones, strong light-dark modeling, and expressive everyday interactions create detailed urban genre scenes with a classical, humane atmosphere."},{"id":"joaquin-sorolla","name":"Joaquin Sorolla","cat":"painters","en":"Joaquin Sorolla","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joaquin-sorolla.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joaquin-sorolla","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["grey","brown","black","muted-orange","green","dark-rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"Joaquin Sorolla was a Spanish painter known for his luminous and vibrant depictions of landscapes and social scenes. Born in 1863, Sorolla became renowned for his mastery of light and color, capturing the essence of Mediterranean life with a distinct impressionistic style. His works often featured beach scenes, portraits, and everyday activities, characterized by dynamic compositions and a vivid color palette.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable people and coastal settings are built from visible, directional paint strokes rather than smooth digital shapes. The style combines lively, saturated blues, greens, creams, and warm reds with realistic figures, animated water, windblown clothing, and energetic compositions."},{"id":"joan-cornella","name":"Joan Cornella","cat":"illustrators","en":"Joan Cornella","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joan-cornella.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joan-cornella","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","drawing","cute"],"colours":["red","blue","vivid-red","green","black","light-orange"],"intro":"Joan Cornella is a Spanish illustrator and cartoonist known for his darkly humorous and satirical comics. His work often features simplistic, cartoonish characters in absurd and surreal situations, exploring themes of modern life and social commentary.","observation":"The style uses flat, highly saturated color fields, thick dark contour lines, and simplified cartoon-like figures with minimal facial features. Characters are presented in expressive gestures and close portrait or vignette compositions, with occasional patterned clothing and a subtly textured paper-like surface."},{"id":"jose-guadalupe-posada","name":"Jose Guadalupe Posada","cat":"printmakers","en":"Jose Guadalupe Posada","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jose-guadalupe-posada.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jose-guadalupe-posada","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","retro","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","pale-orange","muted-yellow","beige"],"intro":"Jose Guadalupe Posada was a Mexican printmaker and engraver known for his satirical and politically charged illustrations. His work, often featuring calaveras (skeletons), became iconic in Mexican culture, especially associated with the Day of the Dead. Posada's art is recognized for its social commentary and influence on Mexican visual culture.","observation":"The style uses monochrome, high-contrast ink drawing with thick contour lines and dense crosshatching, giving the skeleton characters a strongly graphic, print-like appearance. Repeated skull figures in elaborate clothing and hats are arranged in theatrical social scenes, with a distressed cream-paper ground and an unmistakably vintage printed texture."},{"id":"kazuo-oga","name":"Kazuo Oga","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kazuo Oga","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kazuo-oga.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kazuo-oga","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","muted-olive","dark-rust","bone-white","muted-blue"],"intro":"Kazuo Oga is a renowned Japanese art director and background artist, best known for his work with Studio Ghibli.","observation":"Across the sheet, richly textured brushwork and fine strokes render faces, hair, flowers, fabric, and foliage with dense, tactile detail. The compositions pair intimate, emotionally charged portraits with a misty rain-darkened landscape, using deep shadows, selective highlights, saturated botanical reds and greens, and a dreamlike cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"albert-dubout","name":"Albert Dubout","cat":"illustrators","en":"Albert Dubout","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-dubout.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-dubout","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["charcoal","black","beige","grey","silver","rust"],"intro":"Albert Dubout is a renowned French illustrator and cartoonist known for his humorous and satirical works. Born in 1905, Dubout gained fame for his exaggerated and whimsical illustrations that often depicted chaotic scenes filled with lively characters. His style is characterized by intricate details and a playful approach to everyday life, making him a beloved figure in the world of illustration.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed illustrative city scenes built from stark black silhouettes, crisp graphic contours, and selectively flat areas of pale grey, white, and warm window light. Strong tonal contrast, stippled grain, snowy atmospheres, and repeated silhouetted figures and trees create a nostalgic, dreamlike urban winter mood."},{"id":"rebecca-sugar","name":"Rebecca Sugar","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rebecca Sugar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rebecca-sugar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rebecca-sugar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","red","pale-red","muted-blue","vivid-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Rebecca Sugar is an American animator, director, screenwriter, producer, and songwriter known for her work on the animated series \"Steven Universe.\" She is celebrated for her unique storytelling, character development, and the incorporation of themes such as love, family, and identity. Sugar's work is recognized for its emotional depth and the use of music as a narrative tool.","observation":"The style uses colorful, graphic character portraits with thick black contour lines, simplified flat color, and selectively textured, grainy surfaces. Saturated coral, pink, orange, teal, and blue palettes combine with exaggerated eyes, hair, expressions, and tightly cropped framing for a playful comic-like energy."},{"id":"alphonse-mucha","name":"Alphonse Mucha","cat":"painters","en":"Alphonse Mucha","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alphonse-mucha.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alphonse-mucha","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["pale-yellow","muted-ochre","ochre","brown","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Alphonse Mucha was a Czech painter and decorative artist known for his distinctive Art Nouveau style. His work, characterized by elegant compositions and intricate details, became iconic in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. Mucha's art often featured beautiful women surrounded by elaborate floral patterns and ornate designs, capturing the essence of the Belle Époque era.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines finely rendered female portraits with abundant flowers, flowing hair, circular medallion framing, and dense decorative borders. Muted earthy colors, delicate linework, and softly modeled painted surfaces create an elegant, highly ornamental botanical composition."},{"id":"adrian-tomine","name":"Adrian Tomine","cat":"illustrators","en":"Adrian Tomine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adrian-tomine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adrian-tomine","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","comics","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","charcoal","dark-ochre","grey","pale-yellow","red"],"intro":"Adrian Tomine is an American cartoonist and illustrator known for his work in graphic novels and comics. His style is characterized by its clean lines, minimalist approach, and focus on urban life and personal narratives. Tomine's work often explores themes of modern relationships, identity, and the nuances of everyday interactions.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses graphic, comic-like figures with heavy black contour lines, simplified flat color areas, and tightly controlled blocks of muted teal, olive, beige, and ochre. Dense urban crowds and street details are rendered with strong silhouettes, crisp architectural geometry, and high contrast, creating a retro illustrated reportage feel."},{"id":"malika-favre","name":"Malika Favre","cat":"illustrators","en":"Malika Favre","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/malika-favre.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/malika-favre","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-blue","dark-red","pale-orange","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Malika Favre is a French illustrator known for her bold, minimalist style that combines elements of pop art and graphic design. Her work often features clean lines, vibrant colors, and striking compositions, making her one of the most recognizable artists in contemporary illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic, poster-like figures with clean angular shapes, thick dark contours, and broad areas of unmodulated color. Saturated scarlet, orange, navy, and black create a consistently high-contrast retro fashion-editorial mood, with dramatic crops, geometric shadows, and cinematic posing."},{"id":"slim-aarons","name":"Slim Aarons","cat":"photographers","en":"Slim Aarons","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/slim-aarons.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/slim-aarons","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","landscapes","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-rust","grey","silver","bone-white"],"intro":"Slim Aarons was a renowned American photographer known for his iconic images of the rich and famous, capturing the essence of high society during the mid-20th century. His work often depicted luxurious lifestyles, glamorous settings, and the leisure activities of the elite, making him a celebrated figure in lifestyle photography.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, using sun-drenched tropical settings, strong architectural geometry, and carefully staged leisure scenes. Saturated turquoise, coral, pink, and white are balanced by deep shadows and crisp midday light, with period-styled clothing and resort details creating a polished vacation tableau."},{"id":"lisa-frank","name":"Lisa Frank","cat":"various-artists","en":"Lisa Frank","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lisa-frank.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lisa-frank","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["pink","blue","silver","red","dark-green","light-lime","green"],"intro":"Lisa Frank is an American artist and businesswoman known for her colorful and whimsical designs, primarily featured on school supplies and accessories. Her work became iconic in the 1980s and 1990s, characterized by vibrant colors, playful themes, and a focus on animals and fantasy elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable animal portraits are built from exuberant rainbow hues, swirling organic shapes, and clearly visible broad paint strokes. The imagery combines dense decorative detail, floral and star accents, and fantastical rainbow motifs with bold, expressive faces and simplified graphic color areas."},{"id":"drew-struzan","name":"Drew Struzan","cat":"illustrators","en":"Drew Struzan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/drew-struzan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/drew-struzan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["brown","orange","black","grey"],"intro":"Drew Struzan is an American artist renowned for his iconic movie posters, particularly for blockbuster films like Star Wars and Indiana Jones. His work is characterized by a distinctive illustrative style that combines realism with fantasy elements, making his posters instantly recognizable and beloved by fans worldwide.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with finely rendered faces, layered figures, and expansive adventure tableaux. Strong orange-and-blue color contrasts, dramatic illumination, and densely arranged cinematic compositions give the images the feel of lavish painted film posters."},{"id":"gennady-spirin","name":"Gennady Spirin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gennady Spirin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gennady-spirin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gennady-spirin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","brown","black","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Gennady Spirin is a renowned Russian illustrator known for his exquisite and detailed illustrations, often inspired by classical literature and fairy tales. His work is characterized by a blend of traditional techniques and a unique, whimsical style that brings stories to life with rich textures and intricate details.","observation":"Across all four renders, highly detailed close-up portraits are rendered with visible fine brushwork, tactile fabrics, elaborate costumes, and densely ornamented surroundings. Muted antique hues, strong light-dark separation, and formal framing give the figures a classical, richly material appearance."},{"id":"dr-seuss","name":"Dr. Seuss","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dr. Seuss","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dr-seuss.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dr-seuss","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["muted-ochre","dark-olive","bone-white","muted-cyan","yellow","red"],"intro":"Dr. Seuss was a renowned American author and illustrator known for his whimsical and imaginative children's books. His real name was Theodor Seuss Geisel, and he created beloved characters and fantastical worlds that have captivated generations of readers. His work is characterized by playful rhymes, unique creatures, and moral lessons, making him a staple in children's literature.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a richly detailed, hand-drawn storybook illustration with expressive furry creatures, fine black contouring, and abundant environmental texture. Strongly saturated reds, yellows, blues, and greens contrast with dark ink marks, while fantastical woodland scenes and exaggerated character designs give the images a whimsical, animated quality."},{"id":"jimmy-palmiotti","name":"Jimmy Palmiotti","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jimmy Palmiotti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jimmy-palmiotti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jimmy-palmiotti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","orange","dark-red","vivid-red","olive"],"intro":"Jimmy Palmiotti is a renowned American comic book writer and artist known for his work in the superhero genre. He has contributed to numerous popular titles and is celebrated for his dynamic storytelling and distinctive artistic style. Palmiotti's collaborations with various artists have left a significant mark on the comic book industry, making him a respected figure among fans and peers alike.","observation":"The style is a dense comic-book illustration built from heavy ink contours, intricate cross-detail, and strongly expressive faces and creatures. Saturated reds, teals, ochres, and blacks create a high-contrast, ominous visual field, while tightly packed character groupings and ruined urban fragments make every panel feel crowded and dramatic."},{"id":"jeremy-scott","name":"Jeremy Scott","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Jeremy Scott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeremy-scott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeremy-scott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","patterns","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-blue","white","charcoal","red","dark-red","ochre","light-yellow"],"intro":"Jeremy Scott is an American fashion designer known for his bold and eclectic designs. He has been the creative director of Moschino and is recognized for his playful and avant-garde approach to fashion, often incorporating pop culture elements and vibrant colors into his work.","observation":"The style presents highly imaginative fashion as elaborate wearable sculpture, combining bold silhouettes, dense surface embellishment, tactile materials, and fantastical motifs. Saturated colours, strong patterning, and realistic photographic rendering make the costumes and accessories feel like striking runway or editorial objects."},{"id":"akira-toriyama","name":"Akira Toriyama","cat":"illustrators","en":"Akira Toriyama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/akira-toriyama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/akira-toriyama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","sci-fi","fantasy","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","ochre","bone-white","muted-cyan","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Akira Toriyama is a renowned Japanese manga artist and character designer, best known for creating the iconic series \"Dragon Ball.\" His work has had a significant impact on the manga and anime industries, influencing countless artists and spawning a vast media franchise that includes anime adaptations, films, and video games.","observation":"The style combines vivid, high-contrast comic illustration with heavy black ink contours, energetic hatching, and distressed paper-like surface texture. It consistently presents expressive characters within densely detailed fantasy and futuristic environments, balancing flat graphic color with occasional painterly atmospheric scenery."},{"id":"edward-hopper","name":"Edward Hopper","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Hopper","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-hopper.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-hopper","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","light-yellow","rust","muted-blue"],"intro":"Edward Hopper is a renowned American realist painter known for his depictions of urban and rural scenes, often characterized by a sense of isolation and introspection. His work captures the essence of American life in the early to mid-20th century, with a focus on architecture, light, and solitary figures. Hopper's paintings are celebrated for their narrative quality and ability to evoke emotion through composition and color.","observation":"The style uses visible, broad oil-paint strokes to build richly textured urban architecture, interiors, and figures, with simplified but carefully observed forms. Strong light-dark contrasts, warm reds and ochres against deep blue-green shadows, and cinematic framing create a moody sense of narrative across both street scenes and interiors."},{"id":"paul-thomas-anderson","name":"Paul Thomas Anderson","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Paul Thomas Anderson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-thomas-anderson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-thomas-anderson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","muted-olive","muted-cyan","rust","bone-white"],"intro":"Paul Thomas Anderson is a renowned American filmmaker known for his distinctive storytelling and visual style. His films often explore complex characters and intricate narratives, earning him critical acclaim and a dedicated following.","observation":"Across the sheet, the images use a moody, cinematic portrait language with dramatic lighting, deep shadows, and carefully staged mid-century interiors. Visible brushwork and fine textural strokes give the figures, clothing, and furnishings a painterly yet highly controlled finish, while hats, suits, red interiors, and noir-like framing unify the atmosphere."},{"id":"patrick-seymour","name":"Patrick Seymour","cat":"illustrators","en":"Patrick Seymour","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patrick-seymour.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patrick-seymour","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Patrick Seymour is a contemporary illustrator known for his intricate and bold line work. His style often incorporates geometric patterns and abstract forms, creating visually striking and detailed illustrations. Seymour's work is characterized by a modern approach to design, blending elements of op art and contemporary illustration.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped portrait busts whose faces, hair, and clothing are transformed by high-contrast stripes, dots, and warped geometric patterns. It is graphic and illustrative, relying on flat black-and-white or red-black color fields, bold linear contours, deep shadows, and surreal optical distortion."},{"id":"jean-louis-forain","name":"Jean-Louis Forain","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Louis Forain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-louis-forain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-louis-forain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","brown","bone-white","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Jean-Louis Forain is a renowned French painter and printmaker known for his works depicting Parisian life during the Belle Époque. His art often captures the vibrancy and elegance of social gatherings, theaters, and cafes, characterized by a loose, impressionistic style that emphasizes mood and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from energetic, visibly layered brushwork with sketch-like linear accents and strongly simplified but recognizable figures. Restrained earth, cream, black, and red tones create dramatic contrast, while fashionable groups and intimate social scenes emerge through broad strokes, cropped compositions, and atmospheric painterly texture."},{"id":"jordi-bernet","name":"Jordi Bernet","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jordi Bernet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jordi-bernet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jordi-bernet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bold-lines","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","white","bone-white","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Jordi Bernet is a renowned Spanish comic artist, best known for his work on the series \"Torpedo.\" His style is characterized by a strong influence from American noir comics, with a focus on expressive characters and dramatic storytelling. Bernet's work often features gritty urban settings and complex narratives, making him a significant figure in the world of graphic novels.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white comic illustration with heavy ink contours, fine hatching, and sharply controlled areas of shadow. It combines close-up character portraits with noir city scenes, vintage clothing, automobiles, and dramatic cinematic framing on a lightly aged paper-toned ground."},{"id":"edvard-munch","name":"Edvard Munch","cat":"painters","en":"Edvard Munch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edvard-munch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edvard-munch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-blue","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Edvard Munch was a Norwegian painter and printmaker, renowned for his evocative treatment of psychological themes. His work is often associated with Symbolism and Expressionism , and he is best known for his iconic painting \"The Scream.\" Munch's art is characterized by its emotional depth and exploration of human anxiety and existential dread, often using vivid colors and dramatic compositions to convey intense feelings.","observation":"Across all four renders, heavily visible brushwork and broad, directional strokes create turbulent skies, water, and clothing, with vivid reds, oranges, and deep blues. Repeated isolated figures and emotionally charged faces appear in dark, high-contrast landscapes, while warped perspective and flowing contours give the scenes a restless, expressive motion."},{"id":"matthew-pillsbury","name":"Matthew Pillsbury","cat":"photographers","en":"Matthew Pillsbury","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matthew-pillsbury.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matthew-pillsbury","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","mist","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Matthew Pillsbury is an acclaimed photographer known for his evocative black and white images that explore themes of time and motion. His work often captures the essence of urban life, using long exposure techniques to create ghostly, dreamlike scenes that convey a sense of movement and transience.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white realism with dramatic architectural interiors, deep shadows, bright shafts of light, and highly detailed surfaces. Long-exposure motion blur turns crowds into translucent, ghostlike forms, creating cinematic, dark, atmospheric scenes with reflective floors and monumental spaces."},{"id":"monica-blatton","name":"Monica Blatton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Monica Blatton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/monica-blatton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/monica-blatton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["orange","muted-olive","dark-brown","bone-white","black","red"],"intro":"Monica Blatton is an illustrator known for her whimsical and surreal artistic style. Her work often features dreamy and fantastical elements, blending cute and floral motifs with detailed and illustrative techniques. Her style is characterized by a playful and ethereal mood, often drawing inspiration from European folklore and nature symbolism.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, visible oil-like brushwork with fine drawn accents and softly idealized, expressive faces. Cropped character portraits use vivid reds, pale skin, floral and animal motifs, elaborate clothing, and whimsical fantasy embellishments throughout."},{"id":"theodore-robinson","name":"Theodore Robinson","cat":"painters","en":"Theodore Robinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theodore-robinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theodore-robinson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","grey","muted-olive","silver","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Theodore Robinson was an American painter known for his Impressionist landscapes and depictions of rural life. Born in 1852, he was a key figure in the American Impressionism movement, often painting en plein air to capture the natural light and atmosphere of his surroundings. His works are characterized by their soft brushwork, delicate color palettes, and intimate portrayals of everyday scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, broken color, and softly blended yet highly articulated natural forms. Sunlit gardens, lakes, trees, flowers, boats, and figures are rendered in a restrained natural palette with luminous highlights and an elegant, scene-based composition."},{"id":"mvrdv","name":"MVRDV","cat":"architects","en":"MVRDV","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mvrdv.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mvrdv","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","glow","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal"],"colours":["black","blue","dark-red","dark-blue","pale-blue","red"],"intro":"MVRDV is a renowned Dutch architecture and urban design practice known for its innovative and experimental approach to architecture. Founded in 1993 by Winy Maas, Jacob van Rijs, and Nathalie de Vries, the firm has become synonymous with bold and imaginative designs that challenge conventional architectural norms. MVRDV's work often explores themes of sustainability, urban density, and social interaction, making them a significant influence in contemporary architecture.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic architectural scenes with bold futuristic buildings, vivid coral, pink, teal, and blue color contrasts, and warm interior illumination at blue hour. Modular stacked forms, rounded glass volumes, rooftop greenery, and active pedestrian streets create a surreal yet believable sci-fi urban atmosphere."},{"id":"eric-lacombe","name":"Eric Lacombe","cat":"various-artists","en":"Eric Lacombe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-lacombe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-lacombe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","cream","brown","silver","muted-orange","dark-rust"],"intro":"Eric Lacombe is a contemporary artist known for his haunting and surreal artworks that explore themes of identity, decay, and the human psyche. His work often features distorted figures and a dark, moody atmosphere, drawing inspiration from gothic and surrealist traditions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines heavily worked, tactile paint with fine, nervous drawn lines and scratched marks, producing distressed close-up portraits and animal-human hybrids. Earthy beige, gray, black, and muted rust tones, deep shadows, and sparse backgrounds create a bleak, expressive atmosphere while preserving strong facial and anatomical detail."},{"id":"john-singer-sargent","name":"John Singer Sargent","cat":"painters","en":"John Singer Sargent","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-singer-sargent.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-singer-sargent","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","bone-white","deep-red","red"],"intro":"John Singer Sargent was an American expatriate artist, considered the \"leading portrait painter of his generation\" for his evocations of Edwardian-era luxury. Born in 1856, Sargent was known for his remarkable ability to capture the individuality and personality of his subjects, often depicting them in elegant and sophisticated settings. His works are characterized by a mastery of light and texture, combining elements of Impressionism and Realism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, directional brushwork to model faces, clothing, and voluminous fabric, with layered tonal transitions rather than clean graphic edges. Restrained whites, creams, reds, and deep browns create an elegant, somber atmosphere around recurring seated female portraits in elaborate formal dress."},{"id":"roeselien-raimond","name":"Roeselien Raimond","cat":"photographers","en":"Roeselien Raimond","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roeselien-raimond.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roeselien-raimond","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-rust","orange","brown","muted-blue","light-orange","grey"],"intro":"Roeselien Raimond is a renowned wildlife photographer known for her captivating and intimate portraits of animals in their natural habitats. Her work often focuses on the serene and whimsical aspects of wildlife, capturing moments of tranquility and beauty.","observation":"The style is realistic wildlife photography with finely resolved fur, natural animal anatomy, and richly textured meadow environments. Warm and cool light alternate across the images, with luminous backlighting, atmospheric haze, and shallow focus creating intimate, cinematic-looking portraits of animals in the wild."},{"id":"victo-ngai","name":"Victo Ngai","cat":"illustrators","en":"Victo Ngai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/victo-ngai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/victo-ngai","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-green","black","muted-olive","light-orange","rust","dark-brown"],"intro":"Victo Ngai is a renowned illustrator known for her intricate and imaginative artwork, often blending elements of fantasy and surrealism. Her work is celebrated for its detailed and narrative-driven style, drawing inspiration from cultural and mythological themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense painted strokes and fine contour lines turn water, smoke, fire, foliage, and clouds into dramatic swirling forms. Saturated teal, cream, orange, and red create high-contrast scenes combining human figures, coastal drama, and East Asian-inspired landscapes with an imaginative, fantastical atmosphere."},{"id":"ann-telnaes","name":"Ann Telnaes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ann Telnaes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ann-telnaes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ann-telnaes","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","fashion","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","bone-white","muted-orange","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"Ann Telnaes is a renowned American editorial cartoonist known for her sharp wit and distinctive style. She has received numerous accolades for her work, including the Pulitzer Prize for Editorial Cartooning. Her illustrations often feature bold lines and a satirical edge, focusing on political and social themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses loose, visible brushwork and ink-like outlines to depict glamorous fashion portraits with simplified facial features and dramatic poses. Strong black clothing and accessories are set against generous white space, punctuated by vivid red accents and occasional pale washes."},{"id":"will-burrard-lucas","name":"Will Burrard-Lucas","cat":"photographers","en":"Will Burrard-Lucas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/will-burrard-lucas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/will-burrard-lucas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","white","charcoal","orange","grey"],"intro":"Will Burrard-Lucas is a renowned wildlife photographer known for his innovative techniques and captivating images of African wildlife. He has gained recognition for using technology like camera traps and remote-controlled devices to capture unique perspectives of animals in their natural habitats, contributing significantly to wildlife conservation and awareness.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, richly detailed wildlife photography with dramatic cinematic framing and strong natural textures. Vivid earth tones, high contrast, expressive close-ups, and action-filled compositions emphasize the scale, motion, and immediacy of animals in African landscapes."},{"id":"david-hockney","name":"David Hockney","cat":"painters","en":"David Hockney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-hockney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-hockney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","scenes","urban","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-blue","red","muted-teal","muted-brown","light-orange"],"intro":"David Hockney is a renowned British artist known for his contributions to the pop art movement and his vibrant depictions of California landscapes and lifestyle. Born in 1937, Hockney's work spans painting, drawing, printmaking, photography, and digital art. He is celebrated for his innovative use of color and perspective, often exploring themes of modern life and personal identity.","observation":"Across all four renders, brightly colored interiors are built from large geometric color fields, crisp graphic edges, and visible painted strokes. Dense tropical foliage, furnishings, and seated figures create richly populated domestic scenes, while the saturated blue, coral, pink, and green palette gives the compositions a bold illustrative character."},{"id":"bella-kotak","name":"Bella Kotak","cat":"photographers","en":"Bella Kotak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bella-kotak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bella-kotak","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","deep-red","dark-red","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Bella Kotak is a renowned photographer known for her enchanting and dreamlike imagery. Her work often explores themes of fantasy and nature, creating visually captivating narratives that transport viewers to otherworldly realms. She is celebrated for her ability to blend reality with imagination, crafting scenes that are both ethereal and richly detailed.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, richly detailed portrait photography set inside dense, dark gardens overflowing with red flowers. Elaborate floral headpieces and textured red garments create an ornate, fashion-editorial look, while shallow focus, subdued ambient light, and selective red saturation give the portraits a dreamy, romantic darkness."},{"id":"jamie-hewlett","name":"Jamie Hewlett","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jamie Hewlett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jamie-hewlett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jamie-hewlett","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","pale-orange","muted-ochre","muted-cyan","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jamie Hewlett is a British artist and designer known for co-creating the virtual band Gorillaz and the comic series Tank Girl. His work is characterized by a distinctive style that blends elements of punk, pop culture, and vibrant illustration, making him a prominent figure in contemporary art and design.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense comic-like character imagery with exaggerated faces, heavy black contouring, and expressive poses. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and yellows are set against strong dark-light contrast, while ink-like hatching and a coarse printed texture give the clean illustrative forms a rough, tactile finish."},{"id":"guweiz","name":"Guweiz","cat":"illustrators","en":"Guweiz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guweiz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guweiz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","glow","fine-lines","painterly","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","brown","rust","red","muted-blue","bone-white"],"intro":"Guweiz is a contemporary digital artist known for his captivating character illustrations that often blend elements of fantasy and realism. His work is recognized for its intricate details, emotional depth, and a unique style that resonates with modern audiences.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines visible painterly brushwork with finely rendered facial features, loose hair strands, glossy lips, and reflective accessories. Dramatic red-orange illumination against deep blue-green shadows, luminous practical lights, and blurred bokeh create an intimate, nocturnal cinematic mood in tightly cropped compositions."},{"id":"katsushika-hokusai","name":"Katsushika Hokusai","cat":"printmakers","en":"Katsushika Hokusai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/katsushika-hokusai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/katsushika-hokusai","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","patterns","motion","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["dark-blue","beige","pale-orange","muted-blue","orange"],"intro":"Katsushika Hokusai was a renowned Japanese artist and printmaker, best known for his woodblock print series \"Thirty-Six Views of Mount Fuji,\" which includes the iconic \"The Great Wave off Kanagawa.\" His work played a significant role in popularizing the ukiyo-e genre during the Edo period, and his influence extends beyond Japan, impacting Western art movements such as Impressionism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses crisp, outlined shapes and flat, selectively layered color, with dense fine-line detailing in the waves, clouds, mountains, and boats. Repeated sweeping wave forms create strong geometric diagonals and kinetic motion, while the restrained blue, cream, and peach palette and high contrast give the landscapes a decorative printed character."},{"id":"randall-munroe","name":"Randall Munroe","cat":"illustrators","en":"Randall Munroe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/randall-munroe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/randall-munroe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["black","white","blue","silver","dark-blue"],"intro":"Randall Munroe is an American cartoonist, author, and former NASA roboticist known for creating the webcomic xkcd. His work often explores themes of science, technology, and mathematics, presented with humor and insight. Munroe's distinctive style combines simple line drawings with complex ideas, making his comics both accessible and intellectually engaging.","observation":"The style uses spare comic-like line drawing with very fine black contours, crosshatched terrain, and stark black-and-white or limited blue-and-white fields. Simple solitary figures are placed in expansive astronomical landscapes, with large areas of negative space and a quiet, surreal sense of isolation."},{"id":"scarlett-hooft-graafland","name":"Scarlett Hooft Graafland","cat":"photographers","en":"Scarlett Hooft Graafland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/scarlett-hooft-graafland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/scarlett-hooft-graafland","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","landscapes","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","muted-blue","dark-blue","grey","light-red","dark-red"],"intro":"Scarlett Hooft Graafland is a contemporary Dutch artist known for her unique approach to photography, often blending performance and landscape. Her work frequently explores themes of cultural identity and the relationship between humans and their environment, using remote and striking landscapes as her canvas.","observation":"These images use a cinematic, realistic photographic look with expansive salt-flat landscapes, low horizons, dramatic skies, and large areas of open space. Saturated flowing garments and isolated figures create a dreamy surreal contrast against the stark terrain, with fabric movement and carefully staged fashion-like poses adding visual drama."},{"id":"takeshi-obata","name":"Takeshi Obata","cat":"illustrators","en":"Takeshi Obata","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/takeshi-obata.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/takeshi-obata","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","comics","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","light-orange","silver","red"],"intro":"Takeshi Obata is a renowned Japanese manga artist known for his work on popular series such as \" Death Note \" and \"Bakuman.\" His distinctive style combines intricate linework with a deep understanding of character design and storytelling, making him a significant figure in the manga industry.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses densely rendered character portraits with expressive faces, dramatic shadowing, and strongly directional hair and clothing. Fine ink contours, crosshatched tonal marks, and selective muted rust, blue, and skin-color accents give the illustrative images a tactile graphic-novel quality."},{"id":"steve-cutts","name":"Steve Cutts","cat":"illustrators","en":"Steve Cutts","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-cutts.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-cutts","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-red","red","muted-ochre","muted-blue","magenta"],"intro":"Steve Cutts is a contemporary illustrator known for his satirical and thought-provoking works that critique modern society, consumerism, and technology. His illustrations often feature exaggerated characters and surreal scenarios, blending humor with dark themes to convey his messages.","observation":"The style is a highly detailed, graphic illustration built from thick ink-like outlines, dense interior hatching, and expressive distorted forms. Saturated pinks, blues, oranges, and greens create strong contrast across surreal scenes populated by grotesque monsters, ruined environments, and recurring human figures."},{"id":"james-lee-byars","name":"James Lee Byars","cat":"various-artists","en":"James Lee Byars","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-lee-byars.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-lee-byars","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","still-life","glow","metallic","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","beige","deep-red","orange"],"intro":"James Lee Byars was an American conceptual artist known for his performance art, sculpture, and installations. His work often explored themes of perfection, beauty, and the ephemeral nature of life, using materials like gold leaf, marble, and paper.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, detailed architectural interiors with ornate classical decoration and carefully staged geometric golden objects. Warm subdued tones, reflective metallic surfaces, polished floors, and localized glowing light create a luxurious yet subtly surreal installation-like atmosphere across all four renders."},{"id":"gray-malin","name":"Gray Malin","cat":"photographers","en":"Gray Malin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gray-malin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gray-malin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","cyan","teal","dark-teal","muted-teal","red"],"intro":"Gray Malin is a contemporary photographer known for his vibrant and whimsical aerial beach photography. His work often captures leisure and vacation scenes, characterized by a playful and joyful atmosphere. Malin's photographs are celebrated for their unique perspective and colorful compositions, often featuring symmetrical arrangements and dynamic angles.","observation":"The style uses crisp, realistic aerial views with highly saturated turquoise water, pale sand, and sharply defined colorful umbrellas. Repeated geometric arrangements, strong sunlight, and deep shadows turn the beach activity into graphic compositions while retaining abundant environmental detail."},{"id":"harry-anderson","name":"Harry Anderson","cat":"painters","en":"Harry Anderson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harry-anderson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harry-anderson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["muted-brown","brown","ochre","black","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Harry Anderson was an American illustrator and painter known for his work in the mid-20th century. He gained recognition for his illustrations in magazines such as The Saturday Evening Post and for his religious artwork. Anderson's style is characterized by its realistic portrayal of everyday life, with a focus on narrative and emotion. His work often reflects the cultural and social dynamics of mid-century America.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, broad paint strokes to model expressive faces, clothing, and lively social interactions. Warm saturated reds, creams, greens, and browns combine with strong light-dark contrasts, while tightly cropped groups and period clothing create a polished vintage fashion-and-social scene aesthetic."},{"id":"jan-matson","name":"Jan Matson","cat":"painters","en":"Jan Matson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-matson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-matson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","pastel-colors","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["blue","pale-cyan","pale-blue","white","pale-magenta"],"intro":"Jan Matson is an Australian artist known for her vibrant and textured paintings, often depicting serene coastal scenes and landscapes. Her work is characterized by a dreamy and whimsical quality, capturing the essence of beach life and nature with a romantic touch.","observation":"Across all four renders, the beach scenes are built from visible, textured brushwork with loose fine strokes describing surf, reflections, and shorelines. Turquoise water and pastel pink sand create a luminous, dreamy atmosphere, while tiny beachgoers and umbrellas add motion and scale to the expansive coastal compositions."},{"id":"herb-trimpe","name":"Herb Trimpe","cat":"illustrators","en":"Herb Trimpe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herb-trimpe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herb-trimpe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["dark-green","vivid-red","olive","dark-brown","dark-blue","light-orange","pink"],"intro":"Herb Trimpe was an American comic book artist and writer, best known for his work with Marvel Comics during the 1970s and 1980s. He is particularly recognized for his long run on 'The Incredible Hulk' and for being the first artist to draw Wolverine for publication. Trimpe's style is characterized by its dynamic action scenes and bold, expressive line work.","observation":"The style is a densely packed comic-book collage built from bold ink contours, flat saturated colour blocks, halftone texture, and strong light-dark contrast. Numerous exaggerated heroes, monsters, masks, and action poses overlap in busy panel-like arrangements, giving the imagery a vivid retro-fantasy energy."},{"id":"kathrin-honesta","name":"Kathrin Honesta","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kathrin Honesta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kathrin-honesta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kathrin-honesta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","light-orange","dark-green","brown","vivid-red","red"],"intro":"Kathrin Honesta is an illustrator known for her enchanting and whimsical style. Her work often features delicate characters set in dreamlike environments, blending elements of fantasy and nature. Honesta's illustrations are recognized for their fine lines, soft shading, and vibrant color palettes, creating a sense of ethereal beauty and serenity.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, textured painting with crisp illustrative contours, densely layering faces, garments, animals, and foliage. Restrained deep greens, blacks, creams, and greys are punctuated by vivid red-orange accents, while tightly cropped portraits and decorative botanical framing create an expressive editorial mood."},{"id":"garance-dore","name":"Garance Dore","cat":"illustrators","en":"Garance Dore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/garance-dore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/garance-dore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","black","beige","vivid-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Garance Dore is a French illustrator, photographer, and author known for her work in the fashion industry. She gained prominence through her blog, where she combined her illustrations with photography and writing, offering a unique perspective on fashion and lifestyle. Her work is characterized by its elegance, simplicity, and a distinctly Parisian flair.","observation":"Across all four images, fashion portraits are rendered with loose ink contours, translucent watercolor washes, and visible dry-brush texture. The mostly white backgrounds create generous negative space, while saturated orange and red clothing, black sunglasses, and lipstick provide vivid graphic accents and strong contrast."},{"id":"andre-courreges","name":"Andre Courreges","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Andre Courreges","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andre-courreges.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andre-courreges","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","vivid-colors","sci-fi","retro","geometric"],"colours":["muted-cyan","silver","beige","rust","muted-teal","dark-brown"],"intro":"Andre Courreges was a French fashion designer known for his innovative and futuristic designs during the 1960s. He played a pivotal role in the space age fashion movement, introducing bold geometric shapes, monochrome palettes, and a minimalist aesthetic. Courreges's work was characterized by its forward-thinking approach and a departure from traditional fashion norms, often incorporating unconventional materials and styles.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, polished fashion photography with graphic, geometric silhouettes and deliberately futuristic retro styling. Saturated teal, white, orange, and red create bold blocks of color, while sculptural hats, glossy garments, sunglasses, and sparse architectural backdrops give the portraits a controlled editorial look."},{"id":"louise-dahl-wolfe","name":"Louise Dahl-Wolfe","cat":"photographers","en":"Louise Dahl-Wolfe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louise-dahl-wolfe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louise-dahl-wolfe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["muted-ochre","silver","brown","bone-white","muted-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Louise Dahl-Wolfe was an influential American photographer known for her work in fashion photography, particularly during the mid-20th century. She contributed significantly to Harper's Bazaar, where her innovative use of color and natural light set new standards in the industry. Her work is characterized by elegant compositions and a keen eye for capturing the essence of her subjects, often featuring models in natural settings.","observation":"The style uses sun-drenched, editorial photography with vivid Mediterranean blues, whites, reds, and warm skin tones, often set against whitewashed architecture and expansive sky. Posed fashion figures, strong geometric framing, hard sunlight, deep shadows, and a lightly grainy vintage finish give the images a polished yet nostalgic travel-magazine character."},{"id":"wu-guanzhong","name":"Wu Guanzhong","cat":"painters","en":"Wu Guanzhong","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wu-guanzhong.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wu-guanzhong","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","religious","drawing","ink","geometric"],"colours":["cream","beige","silver","charcoal","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Wu Guanzhong was a renowned Chinese painter known for his innovative fusion of traditional Chinese ink painting with Western modernist techniques. Born in 1919, he played a pivotal role in modernizing Chinese art, blending abstract and expressive styles with cultural themes. His works often feature landscapes and urban scenes, characterized by bold compositions and vibrant colors.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines delicate ink lines with visible, fluid brushwork and pale blue-grey washes, punctuated by restrained red and orange accents. Whitewashed traditional villages, tiled roofs, waterways, bare trees, distant hills, calligraphic marks, and seal-like stamps are arranged in airy, vertically layered landscapes with a dreamlike, slightly surreal compression of space."},{"id":"robert-crumb","name":"Robert Crumb","cat":"illustrators","en":"Robert Crumb","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-crumb.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-crumb","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Robert Crumb is an American cartoonist and illustrator known for his distinctive style and significant influence on the underground comix movement. Born in 1943, Crumb gained fame in the 1960s and 1970s for his satirical and often controversial works that critiqued American culture, politics, and society. His characters, such as Fritz the Cat and Mr. Natural, became iconic symbols of the counterculture era.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed black-and-white ink drawing, with fine contour lines, dense crosshatching, and stark tonal contrast. Exaggerated close-up character portraits dominate, combining grotesque facial proportions and intense expressions with busy urban or interior backgrounds in a comic-like composition."},{"id":"herge","name":"Herge","cat":"illustrators","en":"Herge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["brown","blue","ochre","bone-white","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Herge is a renowned Belgian cartoonist, best known for creating the comic series 'The Adventures of Tintin.' His work is characterized by the 'ligne claire' style, which emphasizes clear, strong lines and vibrant colors. Herge's storytelling is celebrated for its intricate plots and rich, detailed illustrations, capturing the imagination of readers worldwide.","observation":"The style uses clean, heavy black contours, flat yet strongly saturated color blocks, and dense crosshatched or stippled detail to create a classic graphic-adventure look. Each panel depicts an active travel or exploration scene, with expressive characters and animals set against crisply structured mountains, forests, roads, and coastal vistas."},{"id":"bettina-rheims","name":"Bettina Rheims","cat":"photographers","en":"Bettina Rheims","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bettina-rheims.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bettina-rheims","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-orange","charcoal","black","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Bettina Rheims is a renowned French photographer known for her provocative and intimate portraits that often explore themes of femininity and gender. Her work is characterized by a bold and cinematic style, capturing the essence of her subjects with a distinct blend of elegance and sensuality.","observation":"The style combines intimate fashion portraiture with tightly cropped, editorial compositions and occasional full-figure staging. Muted, earthy color, visible film grain, shallow focus, tactile fabrics, floral patterns, and carefully styled retro clothing give the images a softly nostalgic yet highly detailed photographic character."},{"id":"ray-caesar","name":"Ray Caesar","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ray Caesar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ray-caesar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ray-caesar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-green","dark-olive","muted-olive","beige","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Ray Caesar is a contemporary digital artist known for his surreal and fantastical imagery, often featuring delicate, doll-like figures in dreamlike settings. His work blends elements of the Victorian era with modern digital techniques, creating a unique and recognizable style that has garnered a significant following in the art world.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, softly painterly portraiture with elaborate historical clothing, powdered wigs, lace, flowers, and animal companions. Muted sage, ivory, blush, and red tones, ornate interiors, delicate brushwork, and dreamlike theatrical compositions create a refined old-world fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"shirley-hughes","name":"Shirley Hughes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Shirley Hughes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shirley-hughes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shirley-hughes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["orange","dark-brown","bone-white","red","brown","beige"],"intro":"Shirley Hughes is a renowned British author and illustrator, celebrated for her contributions to children's literature. She is best known for her beautifully illustrated books that capture the essence of childhood with warmth and authenticity. Her works often depict everyday life and family interactions, resonating with both children and adults alike.","observation":"The style combines richly visible watercolor-and-gouache brushwork with delicate drawn contours, layered textures, and warm, lively color. It focuses on expressive children in intimate everyday scenes, using close crops, animated faces, clothing detail, and softly suggested backgrounds to create a nostalgic illustrated-storybook feel."},{"id":"arnold-lobel","name":"Arnold Lobel","cat":"illustrators","en":"Arnold Lobel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arnold-lobel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arnold-lobel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["ochre","dark-olive","brown","light-yellow","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Arnold Lobel is a renowned American author and illustrator, best known for his children's books, particularly the \"Frog and Toad\" series. His work is celebrated for its gentle humor, warmth, and the ability to capture the imagination of young readers. Lobel's illustrations often feature anthropomorphic animals and charming, whimsical scenes that have become iconic in children's literature.","observation":"These images use richly textured, hand-painted illustration with fine ink-like contours, layered foliage, and abundant small natural details. A subdued earthy palette, expressive anthropomorphic frogs, and storybook woodland situations create a whimsical fantasy atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"jean-jullien","name":"Jean Jullien","cat":"designers","en":"Jean Jullien","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-jullien.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-jullien","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","comics"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","pale-red","dark-brown","dark-blue","teal","light-yellow"],"intro":"Jean Jullien is a French graphic designer and illustrator known for his bold, humorous, and often satirical work. He has gained international recognition for his ability to capture the essence of contemporary life through simple yet impactful visual language. His work spans various mediums, including illustration, photography, video, costumes, installations, books, posters, and clothing.","observation":"Across all four renders, simplified human and animal figures are built from vivid flat color fields enclosed by thick, slightly rough black outlines. The recurring grainy surface, sparse facial marks, exaggerated proportions, and deadpan or expressive poses give the illustrations a bold graphic-comic character."},{"id":"bob-kane","name":"Bob Kane","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bob Kane","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-kane.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-kane","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","orange","vivid-red","brown","muted-green"],"intro":"Bob Kane was an American comic book artist and writer, best known for co-creating the iconic superhero Batman. Born in 1915, Kane's work in the comic book industry began in the late 1930s, and he played a significant role in shaping the superhero genre. His contributions to the Batman series have left a lasting impact on popular culture, influencing countless adaptations in various media.","observation":"The style uses bold ink contours, flat blocks of saturated red, yellow, blue, green, and black, and strongly graphic shadows to create a vintage comic-book appearance. It combines expressive masked characters and tightly cropped portraits with dense panel-like compositions, occasional rough paint texture, and emphatic pop-art contrast."},{"id":"david-lynch","name":"David Lynch","cat":"filmmakers","en":"David Lynch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-lynch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-lynch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","collage","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","charcoal","beige"],"intro":"David Lynch is an American filmmaker, painter, musician, and writer, renowned for his unique and surreal cinematic style. His works often explore themes of dreams, reality, and the subconscious, blending elements of horror, mystery, and the avant-garde. Lynch's films, such as \"Eraserhead,\" \"Blue Velvet,\" and \"Mulholland Drive,\" are characterized by their dreamlike narratives, unsettling atmospheres, and distinctive visual aesthetics.","observation":"The style centers on stern, tightly framed male portraits rendered with stark monochrome tonal range, deep shadows, visible grain, and dramatic directional light. Smoke, windblown hair, and distressed painterly or printed overlays introduce expressive motion and occasional collage-like disruption while retaining a photographic, confrontational presence."},{"id":"val-byrne","name":"Val Byrne","cat":"various-artists","en":"Val Byrne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/val-byrne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/val-byrne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","charcoal","beige","brown","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Val Byrne is an artist known for his evocative landscapes and coastal scenes, often capturing the essence of rural Ireland. His work is characterized by a unique blend of realism and impressionism, with a focus on texture and atmosphere.","observation":"These scenes use a rough, tactile painted surface with visible directional strokes, scraped textures, and assertive ink-like outlines. Weathered urban and coastal buildings are reduced to blocky architectural shapes, with muted gray, cream, and black tones punctuated by saturated red and orange accents and strong dark-light contrast."},{"id":"earle-bergey","name":"Earle Bergey","cat":"illustrators","en":"Earle Bergey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/earle-bergey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/earle-bergey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["brown","black","orange","red","bone-white"],"intro":"Earle Bergey was an American illustrator known for his work on pulp magazines and paperback covers during the mid-20th century. His art often featured bold, dramatic compositions with a focus on science fiction and fantasy themes, characterized by vivid colors and dynamic figures. Bergey's work is recognized for its influence on the visual style of pulp and pin-up art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines polished character illustration with visible, directional oil-paint brushwork and richly modeled faces, hair, clothing, and fabric. Saturated reds, creams, ochres, and deep blacks create strong contrast, while glamorous portraits and romantic social scenes are framed with a nostalgic mid-century advertising feel."},{"id":"ron-clements","name":"Ron Clements","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ron Clements","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ron-clements.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ron-clements","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","dark-teal","orange","beige"],"intro":"Ron Clements is a renowned American animator, director, and screenwriter, best known for his work with Disney on classic animated films such as 'The Little Mermaid,' 'Aladdin,' and 'Moana.' His storytelling and animation have significantly influenced the world of animated cinema, bringing to life beloved characters and fantastical worlds.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, energetic brushwork with richly layered surfaces, expressive figures, and sweeping fantasy environments. Saturated oranges and teals create strong light-dark contrasts, while dramatic scale, atmospheric depth, and action-oriented compositions give the scenes an adventurous, epic storybook quality."},{"id":"robert-kirkman","name":"Robert Kirkman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Robert Kirkman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-kirkman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-kirkman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","vivid-red","dark-red","light-orange","light-red"],"intro":"Robert Kirkman is an American comic book writer best known for creating \"The Walking Dead\" series. His work has significantly influenced the zombie genre in comics and television, combining horror with deep character development and storytelling.","observation":"The style uses graphic-novel illustration with heavy black linework, dense ink texture, and sharply separated blocks of saturated red-orange, yellow, blue, and charcoal. Expressive faces, imposing silhouettes, ruined urban settings, and dramatic sunlit backdrops create a dark, high-contrast post-apocalyptic atmosphere across the images."},{"id":"rick-baker","name":"Rick Baker","cat":"various-artists","en":"Rick Baker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rick-baker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rick-baker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","brown","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Rick Baker is a renowned American special makeup effects artist known for his work in the film industry. He has won numerous awards, including multiple Academy Awards, for his innovative and realistic creature designs and makeup effects. Baker's work is celebrated for its creativity and technical excellence, contributing significantly to the visual effects field.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic portrait photography with dramatic contrast, dark workshop settings, and subdued earthy colors. It emphasizes dense tactile detail in aged faces, fur, hair, prosthetic makeup, and sculpted creature busts, often framing the maker alongside the fantastical character or practical effect."},{"id":"cristina-coral","name":"Cristina Coral","cat":"photographers","en":"Cristina Coral","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cristina-coral.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cristina-coral","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["ornate","realistic","characters","scenes","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","retro","dark","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-green","deep-red","brown","grey","black"],"intro":"Cristina Coral is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and introspective style. Her work often explores themes of identity, memory, and the passage of time, using soft colors and dreamlike compositions to create a sense of tranquility and reflection. Coral's photography is characterized by its delicate use of light and shadow, often incorporating elements of nature and vintage aesthetics.","observation":"The style uses carefully staged, cinematic interior scenes with centered or strongly geometric compositions, vintage furnishings, patterned surfaces, and restrained teal, green, coral, and red hues. Realistic figures are placed in uncanny, dreamlike situations, while symmetrical framing, ornate decor, and low, moody illumination create a quietly surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"jim-aparo","name":"Jim Aparo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jim Aparo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-aparo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-aparo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","white","muted-blue","light-orange","dark-olive","red","magenta"],"intro":"Jim Aparo was an American comic book artist known for his work with DC Comics, particularly on titles like Batman and The Brave and the Bold. His style is characterized by its realistic portrayal of superheroes, dynamic compositions, and expressive line work, making significant contributions to the superhero genre during the 1970s to 1990s.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses strongly inked comic-book figures, heavy contour lines, flat color blocks, and dense hatching for shadow and volume. Saturated blue, green, purple, orange, and pink accents contrast sharply with large black areas, while dynamic poses and panel-like compositions create an emphatic superhero narrative."},{"id":"robert-cottingham","name":"Robert Cottingham","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Cottingham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-cottingham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-cottingham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","letters","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-cyan","muted-green","pale-orange","vivid-red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Robert Cottingham is an American painter known for his photorealistic depictions of urban landscapes and commercial signage. His work often focuses on the visual language of American consumer culture, capturing the essence of mid-20th century architecture and typography. Cottingham's art is celebrated for its meticulous attention to detail and vibrant use of color, reflecting the bustling energy of city life.","observation":"The style uses graphic, poster-like architectural illustrations with crisp bold outlines, flat color blocks, and dense decorative detail. Saturated red, teal, cream, and deep blue create strong contrast, while low-angle urban compositions emphasize marquee lettering, ornate theater facades, and geometric building forms."},{"id":"nirav-patel","name":"Nirav Patel","cat":"photographers","en":"Nirav Patel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nirav-patel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nirav-patel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","brown"],"intro":"Nirav Patel is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative and atmospheric imagery. His work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, capturing moments that are both intimate and expansive. Patel's photography is characterized by its use of natural light and a soft, muted color palette that evokes a sense of nostalgia and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four images, solitary robed figures are placed within vast, rugged landscapes, creating a cinematic sense of scale and isolation. The realistic photographic rendering uses subdued earthy colors, deep shadows, atmospheric haze, selective softness, and occasional reflective water to produce a dark, contemplative mood."},{"id":"frank-quitely","name":"Frank Quitely","cat":"illustrators","en":"Frank Quitely","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-quitely.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-quitely","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["muted-cyan","brown","dark-teal","bone-white","light-yellow","red"],"intro":"Frank Quitely is a renowned Scottish comic book artist known for his distinctive style and contributions to major comic book series such as 'All-Star Superman' and 'New X-Men.' His work is characterized by detailed linework, expressive characters, and dynamic compositions that have earned him a significant place in the comic book industry.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed comic-book drawing with assertive ink contours, dense crosshatched textures, and selectively flat, saturated color fields. Dramatic character-focused compositions combine teal grounds with coral, blue, and ochre accents, producing an expressive, slightly surreal graphic-novel atmosphere."},{"id":"tom-of-finland","name":"Tom of Finland","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tom of Finland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-of-finland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-of-finland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","silver","bone-white","beige","black","brown"],"intro":"Tom of Finland was a Finnish artist known for his influential work in homoerotic art. His real name was Touko Laaksonen, and he gained fame for his stylized and exaggerated depictions of muscular men, often in leather and uniform, which became iconic within gay culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed black-and-white ink drawing with fine contour lines, dense crosshatching, and strongly contrasted light and shadow. It presents expressive, tightly cropped character portraits with carefully rendered faces, hair, clothing, accessories, and period-styled masculine fashion."},{"id":"saner","name":"Saner","cat":"street-artists","en":"Saner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/saner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/saner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","urban","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["red","muted-cyan","charcoal","deep-red","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Saner is a renowned Mexican street artist known for his vibrant and surreal works that often explore themes of identity and cultural heritage. His real-life counterpart is celebrated for blending traditional Mexican motifs with contemporary urban art, creating pieces that resonate with both local and global audiences.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses intensely saturated mural colors, graphic outlines, and flattened yet richly layered shapes on urban walls. Anthropomorphic animals and whimsical characters appear in imaginative scenes, combining bold patterning, theatrical costumes, and surreal juxtapositions with dense illustrative detail."},{"id":"keith-haring","name":"Keith Haring","cat":"painters","en":"Keith Haring","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/keith-haring.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/keith-haring","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","patterns","scenes","urban","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","red","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Keith Haring was an American artist and social activist known for his graffiti-inspired artwork that emerged from the New York City street culture of the 1980s. His work is characterized by bold lines, vivid colors, and energetic figures, often conveying social messages related to life, death, sexuality, and war. Haring's art is recognized for its accessibility and its ability to engage with a wide audience through public murals and installations.","observation":"The style combines realistic photographic figures and urban architecture with dense, geometric mural patterns rendered in strong black, white, and red. Heavy graphic linework, high contrast, and saturated accents give the scenes a bold illustrative character while preserving detailed environments and posed human subjects."},{"id":"e-h-shepard","name":"E. H. Shepard","cat":"illustrators","en":"E. H. Shepard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/e-h-shepard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/e-h-shepard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","bone-white","beige","brown","ochre","yellow"],"intro":"E. H. Shepard was a renowned English illustrator best known for his work on A.A. Milne's \" Winnie-the-Pooh \" and Kenneth Grahame's \"The Wind in the Willows.\" His illustrations are celebrated for their detailed line work and ability to capture the whimsical and gentle nature of the stories they accompany, contributing significantly to the charm and enduring popularity of these classic children's books.","observation":"The style combines delicate ink drawing, fine crosshatched lines, and restrained watercolor washes, with visible paper texture and carefully described fur, grasses, leaves, and branches. It presents gentle woodland narratives through expressive animal characters, mostly in rear or profile views, balancing densely worked natural detail with airy pale backgrounds."},{"id":"don-hertzfeldt","name":"Don Hertzfeldt","cat":"illustrators","en":"Don Hertzfeldt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/don-hertzfeldt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/don-hertzfeldt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","glow","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-cyan","dark-red","red","magenta"],"intro":"Don Hertzfeldt is an American animator and filmmaker known for his distinctive style and independent approach to animation. He has received critical acclaim for his short films, which often explore existential themes and absurdist humor. Hertzfeldt's work is characterized by its hand-drawn animation, dark humor, and unique storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, starkly isolated, round-headed figures inhabit sparse nocturnal landscapes, with scratchy ink-like linework and heavily textured ground. Dark atmospheric palettes, strong light-dark separation, and small luminous orbs create an eerie surreal mood while leaving extensive empty sky around the figures."},{"id":"j-scott-campbell","name":"J. Scott Campbell","cat":"illustrators","en":"J. Scott Campbell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/j-scott-campbell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/j-scott-campbell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","vivid-colors","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","muted-orange","silver","brown","grey","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"J. Scott Campbell is a renowned American comic book artist known for his work on series like \"Gen¹³\" and \"Danger Girl.\" He gained fame for his distinctive style characterized by dynamic poses, detailed line work, and a flair for depicting female characters with exaggerated features.","observation":"Across the sheet, the style combines highly detailed illustrative character art with expressive faces, dynamic poses, flowing hair, and carefully rendered clothing. Fine ink-like lines and crosshatched marks coexist with loose watercolor-like color washes, shifting between monochrome linework and saturated red, blue, and flesh tones."},{"id":"kevin-wada","name":"Kevin Wada","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kevin Wada","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kevin-wada.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kevin-wada","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","white","black","deep-red","ochre"],"intro":"Kevin Wada is an American illustrator known for his vibrant and stylish fashion illustrations. He gained recognition for his unique approach to character design, often blending elements of high fashion with popular culture. Wada's work is celebrated for its bold use of color and expressive portrayal of diverse characters, making him a prominent figure in contemporary illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents tightly cropped fashion portraits with expressive faces, elaborate hair, makeup, and clothing details. Saturated reds, pinks, oranges, and deep blacks are rendered with visible watercolor-like brush texture, fine drawn contours, and energetic painterly marks on a paper-textured ground."},{"id":"richard-scarry","name":"Richard Scarry","cat":"illustrators","en":"Richard Scarry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-scarry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-scarry","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","retro","drawing"],"colours":["brown","dark-olive","dark-blue","light-orange","vivid-red","orange"],"intro":"Richard Scarry is a beloved American children's author and illustrator, renowned for his richly detailed and whimsical books that have entertained generations. His works often feature anthropomorphic animals engaging in everyday activities, set in bustling and colorful worlds. Scarry's illustrations are characterized by their intricate details and playful narratives, making them a staple in children's literature.","observation":"The style is richly painted and storybook-like, combining fine drawn outlines with visible textured brushwork, layered details, and warmly saturated colors. Anthropomorphic animals act out lively domestic and seasonal narratives in carefully populated interiors, streets, gardens, and landscapes, with a nostalgic illustrated-book feeling."},{"id":"hiroshi-yoshida","name":"Hiroshi Yoshida","cat":"painters","en":"Hiroshi Yoshida","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hiroshi-yoshida.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hiroshi-yoshida","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-ochre","brown","pale-orange","silver"],"intro":"Hiroshi Yoshida is a renowned Japanese artist known for his contributions to the shin-hanga movement, which revitalized traditional Japanese woodblock printing in the early 20th century. His work is celebrated for its exquisite landscapes and detailed depictions of both Japanese and international scenes, often capturing the serene beauty of nature and architecture with a harmonious blend of colors and compositions.","observation":"The style combines finely outlined, highly detailed illustrative scenes with visible painterly texture and a subdued palette punctuated by warm sunset oranges and blossom pinks. Across the views, layered temple architecture, gardens, water, cliffs, and trees are arranged as atmospheric landscape vignettes with strong dark-to-light contrasts and delicate linework."},{"id":"greg-land","name":"Greg Land","cat":"illustrators","en":"Greg Land","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-land.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-land","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","motion","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","cream","beige","rust","muted-blue"],"intro":"Greg Land is a contemporary American comic book artist known for his work on various superhero titles for major comic publishers. He gained recognition for his detailed and realistic style, often incorporating photographic references into his illustrations. Land's work is characterized by its dynamic composition and vivid color palettes, making him a prominent figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"The style combines dense comic-book linework and heavy ink contours with visible, energetic paint strokes, creating highly detailed heroic figures and turbulent environments. Strong contrast, saturated reds and blues, dramatic foreshortening, and diagonal action poses give every panel an emphatic, kinetic quality."},{"id":"tatsuro-kiuchi","name":"Tatsuro Kiuchi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tatsuro Kiuchi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tatsuro-kiuchi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tatsuro-kiuchi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","scenes","urban","fine-lines","grain","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","blue","dark-blue","muted-cyan","dark-red","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Tatsuro Kiuchi is a renowned Japanese illustrator known for his distinctive style that blends traditional and contemporary elements. His work often features serene and introspective themes, capturing moments of everyday life with a unique artistic flair. Kiuchi's illustrations have been widely recognized and celebrated in both Japan and internationally, contributing significantly to the field of modern illustration.","observation":"The style combines painterly surface texture and fine drawn marks with cinematic, highly composed urban and waterfront views. Restrained blue-green palettes are repeatedly cut by intense orange light, deep shadows, grain, and atmospheric haze, giving the scenes a moody, expressive graphic quality."},{"id":"leonardo-da-vinci","name":"Leonardo Da Vinci","cat":"painters","en":"Leonardo Da Vinci","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leonardo-da-vinci.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leonardo-da-vinci","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","bone-white","ochre","beige"],"intro":"Leonardo Da Vinci was a renowned Italian polymath of the Renaissance period, known for his contributions to art, science, and engineering. His most famous works include the 'Mona Lisa' and 'The Last Supper,' which exemplify his mastery of painting techniques such as sfumato and chiaroscuro. Da Vinci's work is celebrated for its intricate detail, realistic portrayal of human anatomy, and profound exploration of light and shadow.","observation":"The style combines intensely close portraiture with painterly, weathered surfaces, visible fine linework, scratches, and cracked textures. Restrained earth tones, deep shadows, and selective highlights create a dark, expressive mood, while surreal mechanical additions and distorted facial layering give the portraits an uncanny character."},{"id":"mark-fiore","name":"Mark Fiore","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mark Fiore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-fiore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-fiore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","funny"],"colours":["brown","dark-green","dark-brown","orange","muted-blue","muted-yellow"],"intro":"Mark Fiore is a renowned American political cartoonist known for his animated political cartoons. His work often features satirical and humorous takes on current events and social issues, earning him a Pulitzer Prize in 2010 for Editorial Cartooning.","observation":"The style uses clean, graphic cartoon rendering with thick black contour lines, flat yet strongly varied color areas, and dense cross-scene detail. Exaggerated faces and expressive poses create a humorous, satirical ensemble of suited human caricatures and anthropomorphic animals in crowded jungle and courtroom-like settings."},{"id":"andrew-atroshenko","name":"Andrew Atroshenko","cat":"painters","en":"Andrew Atroshenko","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrew-atroshenko.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrew-atroshenko","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","deep-red","muted-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Andrew Atroshenko is a contemporary Russian artist known for his vibrant and expressive paintings, often focusing on the beauty and grace of the human form. His work is characterized by a romantic and passionate style, capturing the elegance and sensuality of his subjects with a keen eye for detail and emotion.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses visibly built-up oil-paint strokes, loose directional marks, and layered texture to render fashionable female figures and expressive faces. Deep browns, blacks, creams, and saturated reds create a warm, high-contrast atmosphere, while cropped portrait and tableau compositions emphasize faces, garments, flowers, and dramatic fabric movement."},{"id":"gianni-versace","name":"Gianni Versace","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Gianni Versace","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gianni-versace.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gianni-versace","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","metallic","vivid-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["brown","orange","ochre","deep-blue","muted-ochre","muted-blue","green"],"intro":"Gianni Versace was an influential Italian fashion designer known for his bold and glamorous designs. He founded the fashion house Versace, which became renowned for its luxurious clothing, accessories, and fragrances. Versace's work was characterized by vivid colors, bold prints, and an opulent style that often drew inspiration from classical art and mythology. His designs have left a lasting impact on the fashion industry, symbolizing high fashion and luxury.","observation":"This style combines richly patterned fashion imagery with dense floral and classical ornament, rendered in saturated blue, gold, orange, and jewel tones. Crisp graphic outlines, decorative borders, metallic-looking embellishments, and highly detailed textiles create a lavish editorial presentation across both full-figure and close-up views."},{"id":"ben-garrison","name":"Ben Garrison","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ben Garrison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ben-garrison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ben-garrison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["pale-orange","brown","muted-ochre","red","charcoal","muted-blue"],"intro":"Ben Garrison is an American political cartoonist known for his controversial and bold illustrations that often reflect his libertarian views. His work is characterized by exaggerated caricatures and a distinctive, detailed style that aims to provoke thought and discussion on political matters.","observation":"The style is a densely packed, highly detailed comic illustration built from bold ink-like contours, vivid colors, and strong contrast. Exaggerated human faces, grotesque creature hybrids, political caricature, and fantastical scenes are layered into busy narrative compositions with expressive poses and dramatic close-ups."},{"id":"christian-tagliavini","name":"Christian Tagliavini","cat":"photographers","en":"Christian Tagliavini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-tagliavini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-tagliavini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["dark-olive","beige","bone-white","dark-ochre","black","deep-red"],"intro":"Christian Tagliavini is a contemporary photographer known for his unique blend of fine art and conceptual portraiture. His work often explores historical and cultural themes, drawing inspiration from Renaissance and Baroque art. Tagliavini's photographs are characterized by their meticulous attention to detail, elaborate costumes, and a surreal, dreamlike quality that challenges the boundaries between reality and imagination.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, tightly cropped fashion portraits with exceptionally elaborate historical-looking garments, ruffs, lace, pearls, and sculptural headpieces. Muted cream, olive, and red tones, soft directional light, and finely resolved textile detail create a formal, antique editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"ron-tandberg","name":"Ron Tandberg","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ron Tandberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ron-tandberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ron-tandberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","black","muted-blue","brown","deep-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Ron Tandberg was an Australian political cartoonist known for his sharp wit and distinctive style. His work often appeared in newspapers, where he used humor and satire to comment on political and social issues. Tandberg's cartoons were recognized for their simplicity, yet they conveyed powerful messages that resonated with the public.","observation":"The style uses graphic cartoon drawing with heavy, emphatic outlines, simplified anatomy, and flat blocks of mostly primary color against open paper or solid backgrounds. Across the portraits and full figures, exaggerated noses, eyes, hair, and gestures create an expressive, humorous character-design language."},{"id":"conor-harrington","name":"Conor Harrington","cat":"street-artists","en":"Conor Harrington","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/conor-harrington.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/conor-harrington","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-yellow","black","grey","brown","red"],"intro":"Conor Harrington is an Irish street artist known for his dynamic and expressive works that blend classical and contemporary elements. His art often explores themes of identity, power, and conflict, using a combination of traditional painting techniques and street art influences.","observation":"Across all four renders, human figures and fashion-like garments dissolve into vigorous, visible paintwork, with broad and fine strokes, scraped textures, drips, and fragmented contours. The restrained neutral grounds make saturated reds, purples, oranges, and turquoise accents stand out, while energetic poses and partially obscured faces create a restless, surreal sense of movement."},{"id":"gil-elvgren","name":"Gil Elvgren","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gil Elvgren","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gil-elvgren.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gil-elvgren","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["muted-blue","orange","silver","rust","bone-white","dark-brown"],"intro":"Gil Elvgren was a prominent American painter and illustrator, best known for his pin-up art during the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by its vibrant and playful depictions of women, often capturing the essence of 1950s Americana. Elvgren's illustrations were widely used in advertising and calendars, making him a significant figure in popular culture of that era.","observation":"The style uses richly visible brushwork and carefully rendered faces, hair, fabric, and skin in a polished mid-century advertising-illustration manner. Saturated reds against clear sky blues, dramatic poses, flirtatious expressions, and tightly cropped compositions give the portraits a lively, glamorous pin-up energy."},{"id":"a-r-penck","name":"A. R. Penck","cat":"painters","en":"A. R. Penck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/a-r-penck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/a-r-penck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","letters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","light-orange","bone-white","dark-blue","deep-red"],"intro":"A. R. Penck is a German painter and sculptor known for his neo-expressionist style, characterized by bold, abstract forms and symbolic imagery. His work often incorporates primitive and geometric elements, reflecting influences from both contemporary and urban art movements.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines aggressive hand-painted marks, oversized black lettering-like glyphs, and simplified faces or figures with visible brush texture. Saturated red, blue, black, and cream create strong contrast, while repeated eyes, masks, and fragmented characters make the imagery expressive, graphic, and surreal."},{"id":"christian-schloe","name":"Christian Schloe","cat":"illustrators","en":"Christian Schloe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-schloe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-schloe","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-green","grey","black","dark-olive","light-yellow","ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Christian Schloe is an Austrian artist known for his digital artworks that blend elements of surrealism and fantasy. His work often features dreamlike scenes with a focus on ethereal beauty and symbolic imagery.","observation":"These portraits combine finely rendered faces and garments with visible brush texture, softly weathered surfaces, and restrained blue-green, cream, black, and ochre hues. Each image uses surreal symbolic pairings⁠—fish, birds, butterflies, and oversized flowers⁠—within decorative, dreamlike compositions that feel both antique and fantastical."},{"id":"tex-avery","name":"Tex Avery","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tex Avery","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tex-avery.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tex-avery","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","dark-blue","dark-brown","ochre","black","beige"],"intro":"Tex Avery was a pioneering American animator and director known for his work during the Golden Age of Animation. He created iconic characters and was influential in developing the style of animated cartoons with exaggerated, surreal humor. Avery's work is characterized by its bold, innovative approach to animation, often pushing the boundaries of the medium.","observation":"The style uses expressive cartoon drawing with bold black contours, simplified flat color, and exaggerated, elongated character anatomy. Strong color blocks and sparse backgrounds create high contrast, while theatrical poses and anthropomorphic animals give the scenes a playful vintage-animation feel."},{"id":"ito-jakuchu","name":"Ito Jakuchu","cat":"painters","en":"Ito Jakuchu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ito-jakuchu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ito-jakuchu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","ethnic-poc","floral","landscapes","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","charcoal","grey","muted-brown","orange","red"],"intro":"Ito Jakuchu was a Japanese painter of the Edo period, known for his unique and imaginative works that often depicted birds, animals, and plants. His art is characterized by intricate details, vibrant colors, and a blend of realism and fantasy, reflecting both traditional Japanese styles and his own innovative approaches.","observation":"The style combines densely layered botanical and animal imagery with delicate, controlled outlines and visible painted texture. Muted blue, cream, coral, and red tones, ornamental repetition, and flattened spatial layering create a richly decorative East Asian-inspired picture surface."},{"id":"dan-hipp","name":"Dan Hipp","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dan Hipp","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-hipp.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-hipp","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["vivid-red","pink","muted-cyan","black","light-yellow","dark-red"],"intro":"Dan Hipp is a contemporary illustrator known for his vibrant and bold comic book art. His work often features dynamic compositions and a playful yet eerie atmosphere, drawing inspiration from pop culture and sci-fi themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses densely packed cartoon characters and creatures with exaggerated faces, heavy black contouring, and flat, sharply separated areas of saturated color. Irregular ink textures, expressive gestures, grotesque details, and fantasy props create a lively, chaotic comic-book look."},{"id":"karol-bak","name":"Karol Bak","cat":"painters","en":"Karol Bak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karol-bak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karol-bak","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","deep-rust","muted-cyan","vivid-red"],"intro":"Karol Bak is a contemporary Polish artist known for his intricate and surreal paintings that often explore themes of fantasy and mythology. His work is characterized by a unique blend of classical techniques and modern aesthetics, creating a distinctive style that captivates viewers with its depth and detail.","observation":"Highly detailed, painterly close-up portraits combine visible fine brushwork with dense ornamental costume, jewelry, feathers, embroidery, and reflective metalwork. Saturated jewel tones and copper-gold surfaces contrast against dark fabrics, creating an opulent fantastical fashion aesthetic."},{"id":"pablo-picasso","name":"Pablo Picasso","cat":"painters","en":"Pablo Picasso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pablo-picasso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pablo-picasso","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage","ink"],"colours":["blue","bone-white","black","muted-brown","muted-cyan","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Pablo Picasso is one of the most influential artists of the 20th century, known for pioneering the Cubist movement and transforming modern art. Born in Spain in 1881, Picasso's work spans a variety of styles and mediums, including painting, sculpture, and ceramics. His innovative approach to form and perspective challenged traditional artistic conventions and left a lasting impact on the art world.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces combine recognizable anatomy with energetic distortion, heavy contour marks, and visibly worked paint. Blue grounds and orange accents recur throughout, with collage-like blocks, scraped textures, and strong light-dark contrasts producing an expressive mixed-media portrait style."},{"id":"alex-howitt","name":"Alex Howitt","cat":"photographers","en":"Alex Howitt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-howitt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-howitt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy","silhouette"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Alex Howitt is a fictional representation, possibly inspired by real-life photographers known for their work in black and white photography, focusing on urban landscapes and solitary figures. This style is reminiscent of mid-20th century street photography, capturing the essence of urban solitude and introspection.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photography with heavy grain, deep silhouettes, and intense separation between dark foreground forms and luminous fog. Repeated solitary figures, bare trees, wet paths, and distant architecture create a cinematic, dreamlike atmosphere, often softened by shallow focus and atmospheric haze."},{"id":"ben-eine","name":"Ben Eine","cat":"street-artists","en":"Ben Eine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ben-eine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ben-eine","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","patterns","urban","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","light-cyan","red","pink","blue","orange"],"intro":"Ben Eine is a British street artist known for his distinctive typographic style. He gained recognition for his colorful and bold lettering on shop shutters and walls, primarily in urban environments. Eine's work often explores the interplay between text and public spaces, making him a significant figure in the street art scene.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses vivid, highly saturated color blocks and oversized geometric letterforms to transform urban brick facades into graphic murals. Clean-edged shapes, strong outlines, overlapping patterns, and the retained architectural details create a bold illustrative treatment of city buildings."},{"id":"mert-alas","name":"Mert Alas","cat":"photographers","en":"Mert Alas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mert-alas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mert-alas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","fashion","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-red","deep-red","beige","dark-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Mert Alas is a renowned photographer, known for his work in fashion photography, often in collaboration with Marcus Piggott. His style is characterized by a focus on high fashion, celebrity culture, and bold, glamorous imagery.","observation":"The style is cinematic editorial portraiture built around tight facial close-ups, dramatic posing, and highly controlled studio-like lighting. It alternates saturated red-and-blue color treatments with stark monochrome, using deep shadows, strong contrast, sculpted makeup, and luxurious textured clothing to create a dark, high-fashion mood."},{"id":"aerin-lauder","name":"Aerin Lauder","cat":"designers","en":"Aerin Lauder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aerin-lauder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aerin-lauder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","floral","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["white","beige","brown","black","muted-blue","orange","green"],"intro":"Aerin Lauder is a prominent American businesswoman and style icon, known for her work in the beauty and lifestyle industries. She is the granddaughter of Estée Lauder and has played a significant role in expanding the family's brand. Aerin Lauder's influence extends to home decor, where her aesthetic is characterized by a blend of classic elegance and modern sensibilities.","observation":"The style combines richly textured floral painting with refined, elegant interior presentation. Across the renders, layered brushwork, dense botanical detail, and softened pastel-leaning colors create decorative still lifes that sit naturally within formal rooms and paneled walls."},{"id":"sakimichan","name":"Sakimichan","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sakimichan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sakimichan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sakimichan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","red","dark-blue","bone-white","muted-blue","charcoal"],"intro":"Sakimichan is a renowned digital artist known for her vibrant and detailed character illustrations, often drawing inspiration from anime and fantasy genres. Her work is celebrated for its expressive style and intricate detailing, capturing the imagination of a wide audience.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped fantasy portraits with luminous skin, jewel-like eyes, elaborate hair, and richly embellished costume details. Visible fine brushwork gives the faces and hair a softly painterly finish, while saturated pink, blue, silver, and warm highlights create a dreamy, glowing atmosphere."},{"id":"jimmy-marble","name":"Jimmy Marble","cat":"photographers","en":"Jimmy Marble","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jimmy-marble.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jimmy-marble","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","backlighting","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["cyan","blue","rust","muted-green","dark-green","dark-cyan","light-yellow","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jimmy Marble is a contemporary photographer and director known for his vibrant and whimsical style. His work often features bold colors and playful compositions, capturing a sense of nostalgia and fantasy. Marble's photography is characterized by its vivid hues, surreal elements, and a retro aesthetic that draws inspiration from mid-20th century Americana.","observation":"This style uses highly realistic fashion photography with saturated primary-color clothing and architectural surfaces arranged in bold geometric blocks. Hard directional sunlight creates deep, graphic shadows and strong backlighting, while generous negative space and unusual cropped compositions give the images a cinematic editorial feel."},{"id":"jama-jurabaev","name":"Jama Jurabaev","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jama Jurabaev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jama-jurabaev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jama-jurabaev","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","white","brown","grey","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"Jama Jurabaev is a renowned concept artist and illustrator known for his work in the entertainment industry, particularly in film and video games. His expertise lies in creating immersive and fantastical worlds that captivate audiences with their depth and detail.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic environments with monumental scale, strong atmospheric perspective, and carefully staged solitary figures or crowds. Desaturated winter tones, deep shadows, warm practical lights, mist, smoke, and reflective surfaces create a dark, epic mood across both wilderness and urban scenes."},{"id":"kelly-beeman","name":"Kelly Beeman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kelly Beeman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kelly-beeman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kelly-beeman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","black","muted-ochre","brown","vivid-red","red"],"intro":"Kelly Beeman is a contemporary artist known for her distinctive figurative illustrations. Her work often explores themes of identity, fashion, and introspection, characterized by a delicate and refined aesthetic.","observation":"The style combines refined fashion-illustration figures with visible fine linework, softly modeled paint, and subtly textured paper-like surfaces. Repeated dark hair, pale faces, graphic clothing patterns, strong black accents, and coral or cream color fields create a cohesive, high-contrast editorial look across portraits, group compositions, and animal pairings."},{"id":"poul-kjaerholm","name":"Poul Kjaerholm","cat":"designers","en":"Poul Kjaerholm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/poul-kjaerholm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/poul-kjaerholm","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["white","silver","beige","brown","dark-rust","dark-brown"],"intro":"Poul Kjaerholm is a renowned Danish designer known for his minimalist and functionalist furniture designs. He was a prominent figure in the mid-20th century, celebrated for his innovative use of materials such as steel and leather, and his ability to blend form and function seamlessly.","observation":"The style presents furniture as highly realistic studio product imagery, with carefully rendered leather, woven surfaces, reflective metal, and structural curves. Restrained brown, grey, and white tones are shaped by directional lighting and strong cast shadows against sparse architectural backdrops."},{"id":"walter-lantz","name":"Walter Lantz","cat":"illustrators","en":"Walter Lantz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walter-lantz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walter-lantz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing","ink","funny"],"colours":["light-orange","bone-white","black","ochre","dark-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Walter Lantz is best known as an American cartoonist and animator, famous for creating the iconic character Woody Woodpecker. His work in the animation industry during the mid-20th century contributed significantly to the Golden Age of Animation , influencing the style and humor of cartoons of that era.","observation":"The style combines energetic cartoon drawing with thick black ink contours, simplified graphic forms, and highly exaggerated facial expressions and poses. Most panels use cream paper and near-monochrome ink, while selected scenes add vivid red, orange, green, and ochre accents with rough painterly background texture."},{"id":"adrianna-papell","name":"Adrianna Papell","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Adrianna Papell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adrianna-papell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adrianna-papell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","beige","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Adrianna Papell is a renowned fashion designer known for creating elegant and sophisticated evening wear and bridal gowns. Her designs often feature intricate detailing, luxurious fabrics, and a timeless aesthetic that appeals to a wide range of women seeking classic yet contemporary styles.","observation":"A refined fashion-editorial style presents women and garments with realistic skin, delicate facial features, and carefully rendered textile construction. Muted blush, cream, taupe, and blue-grey tones, soft directional light, ornate floral embroidery, and composed portrait framing create an elegant classical mood."},{"id":"jim-starlin","name":"Jim Starlin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jim Starlin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-starlin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-starlin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","red","orange","dark-blue","dark-indigo"],"intro":"Jim Starlin is an American comic book writer and artist, renowned for his work in the science fiction and superhero genres. He is best known for creating iconic characters and storylines for major comic book publishers, particularly in the Marvel Universe, where he introduced characters like Thanos and Drax the Destroyer.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a densely packed comic-book collage with thick black contouring, clean graphic shapes, and intensely saturated reds, blues, greens, and oranges. Dramatic character poses, explosive cosmic settings, layered panels, and surreal monsters create a highly energetic, maximalist visual narrative."},{"id":"allie-brosh","name":"Allie Brosh","cat":"illustrators","en":"Allie Brosh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/allie-brosh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/allie-brosh","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","funny"],"colours":["pale-pink","orange","brown","muted-blue","pink","light-yellow"],"intro":"Allie Brosh is an American author and artist, best known for her webcomic \"Hyperbole and a Half.\" Her work is characterized by its humorous and candid storytelling, often depicting personal anecdotes and struggles with mental health. Brosh's unique style combines simple, childlike drawings with sharp, witty narratives, making her a beloved figure in the world of webcomics.","observation":"The style uses vividly colored, flat illustrative shapes enclosed by thick, irregular black outlines. Crowded groups of bizarre, elongated characters have oversized eyes, toothy mouths, awkward anatomy, and expressive comic expressions, with occasional scribbled interior texture and surreal tropical backgrounds."},{"id":"petra-collins","name":"Petra Collins","cat":"photographers","en":"Petra Collins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/petra-collins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/petra-collins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["muted-ochre","black","bone-white","dark-ochre","muted-cyan","dark-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Petra Collins is a Canadian artist and photographer known for her work that explores themes of femininity, youth, and self-expression. Her photography often features a soft, dreamlike quality and has been influential in shaping contemporary visual culture, particularly in the realms of fashion and social media.","observation":"The style uses realistic, intimate fashion portraiture with close, sometimes dramatically cropped faces and direct-flash illumination. Saturated colors, strong highlights, deep shadows, visible film grain, and selective focus give the images a candid nightlife-editorial character across both indoor and outdoor settings."},{"id":"nick-alm","name":"Nick Alm","cat":"painters","en":"Nick Alm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nick-alm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nick-alm","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","fashion","portraits","glow","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","pale-yellow","deep-red","orange"],"intro":"Nick Alm is a contemporary Swedish painter known for his realistic and emotive figurative works. His art often explores themes of human emotion and interaction, capturing intimate moments with a focus on light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly visible brushwork, softened edges, and expressive portrait rendering rather than crisp graphic outlines. Dark clothing and warm brown-black interiors dominate, punctuated by amber lamps and reflective highlights, creating an intimate, somber atmosphere around elegantly posed women."},{"id":"john-kenn-mortensen","name":"John Kenn Mortensen","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Kenn Mortensen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-kenn-mortensen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-kenn-mortensen","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","light-orange","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"John Kenn Mortensen is a Danish illustrator known for his distinctive style that blends elements of horror and whimsy. His work often features eerie and surreal scenes, populated by strange creatures and haunting landscapes. Mortensen's illustrations are characterized by their intricate line work and dark, moody atmospheres, drawing inspiration from Nordic folklore and gothic art.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses dense black linework, fine hatching, and ink-like crosshatching on a warm, paper-toned ground. Small human figures and stark, dark creatures are set against bleak forests, rooftops, and open terrain, creating a highly detailed, ominous illustrated-storybook atmosphere with strong scale contrasts."},{"id":"caravaggio","name":"Caravaggio","cat":"painters","en":"Caravaggio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/caravaggio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/caravaggio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-brown","ochre","pale-orange","red"],"intro":"Caravaggio was an Italian Baroque painter known for his dramatic use of lighting and realistic depiction of human figures. His work often featured intense emotional expressions and religious themes, making him one of the most influential artists of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modeled, painterly figures against near-black grounds, with warm umbers, creams, and restrained red accents. Strong directional light creates dramatic chiaroscuro, while expressive poses, intertwined bodies, drapery, and cropped framing give the scenes an intense theatrical quality."},{"id":"eric-cahan","name":"Eric Cahan","cat":"photographers","en":"Eric Cahan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-cahan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-cahan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","minimalist","landscapes","glow","flat-color","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-cyan","dark-cyan","light-teal","pale-lime","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Eric Cahan is an American photographer known for his captivating sky and landscape photography. His work often explores the interplay of light and color, capturing the ethereal beauty of natural environments. Cahan's photography is celebrated for its ability to evoke a sense of tranquility and wonder, often focusing on the serene and meditative aspects of nature.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style reduces the image to expansive, nearly empty sky-like color fields with a soft horizontal horizon and luminous sunset gradients. Saturated cyan, teal, coral, orange, and pink transitions create an abstract, minimalist landscape impression without figures, objects, or visible brushwork."},{"id":"margarita-kareva","name":"Margarita Kareva","cat":"photographers","en":"Margarita Kareva","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/margarita-kareva.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/margarita-kareva","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","deep-red","muted-cyan","dark-red","brown"],"intro":"Margarita Kareva is a renowned Russian photographer known for her enchanting and fantastical portraits. Her work often blurs the line between reality and fantasy, creating dreamlike images that captivate viewers with their intricate details and imaginative themes. Kareva's photography is celebrated for its ability to transport audiences into otherworldly realms, often featuring elaborate costumes and settings that evoke a sense of magic and wonder.","observation":"A cinematic, realistic portrait style built around elaborate floral costumes and fashion-like posing in misty woodland settings. Strong teal-and-red color grading, deep shadows, selective focus, and dense botanical details create a dramatic, dreamlike atmosphere across the images."},{"id":"peter-wileman","name":"Peter Wileman","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Wileman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-wileman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-wileman","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["blue","dark-blue","muted-pink","muted-cyan","red"],"intro":"Peter Wileman is a contemporary British artist known for his vibrant and atmospheric landscape paintings. His work often captures the interplay of light and color, creating a sense of movement and emotion. Wileman's paintings are characterized by their bold use of color and expressive brushwork, often depicting coastal scenes and dramatic skies.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad, visibly built-up brushwork turns coastal horizons and water into loosely abstracted landscapes. Cool blue fields are energized by saturated coral, pink, and orange light, with glowing reflections, hazy transitions, and expressive gestural marks creating a dreamy atmosphere."},{"id":"krenz-cushart","name":"Krenz Cushart","cat":"illustrators","en":"Krenz Cushart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/krenz-cushart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/krenz-cushart","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","beige","dark-brown","white","red"],"intro":"Krenz Cushart is an illustrator known for their distinctive style that blends elements of fantasy and surrealism. Their work often features detailed and expressive characters set in vibrant, imaginative worlds. With a focus on digital painting, Cushart's art is characterized by its rich color palette, intricate details, and dynamic compositions that capture the viewer's attention.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly layered, directional paint strokes to build expressive female portraits with tactile hair, skin, fabric, and clothing. Saturated reds, blue-greens, and warm highlights create a vivid, cinematic atmosphere, while close framing and luminous back- or side-lighting emphasize emotional faces and gestural movement."},{"id":"antony-cairns","name":"Antony Cairns","cat":"various-artists","en":"Antony Cairns","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antony-cairns.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antony-cairns","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","bone-white","brown","beige"],"intro":"Antony Cairns is a contemporary artist known for his innovative approach to photography and digital art. His work often explores urban environments and the interplay between technology and human experience, utilizing experimental techniques to create unique visual narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white imagery, deep shadows, blown highlights, and heavy optical blur to turn urban figures and architecture into ghostly silhouettes. Grain, scratches, reflections, and motion-softened forms create a dreamlike, cinematic sense of isolation and transient movement."},{"id":"paul-rand","name":"Paul Rand","cat":"designers","en":"Paul Rand","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-rand.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-rand","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","vivid-red","dark-blue","dark-brown","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Paul Rand was an influential American graphic designer, best known for his corporate logo designs, including those for IBM, UPS, and ABC. His work played a significant role in defining the visual language of American corporate identity in the mid-20th century, blending modernist aesthetics with practical design solutions.","observation":"The style uses flat, sharply bounded geometric shapes, heavy black outlines, and a restricted but highly saturated red, blue, pink, black, and cream palette. Graphic female portraits sit alongside spare abstract symbols and repeated dots or stripes, all unified by a tactile vintage print grain and poster-like composition."},{"id":"paul-gauguin","name":"Paul Gauguin","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Gauguin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-gauguin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-gauguin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","floral","landscapes","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-brown","black","orange","silver","rust"],"intro":"Paul Gauguin was a French post-impressionist artist known for his experimental use of color and synthetist style that were distinctly different from Impressionism. He is celebrated for his bold colors, exaggerated body proportions, and stark contrasts in his depictions of Polynesian life and landscapes, which he explored extensively after moving to Tahiti.","observation":"Across the four renders, vivid tropical portraits and landscapes are unified by visible, layered brushwork, rich surface texture, and densely constructed vegetation, fabrics, and flowers. Figures, gardens, mountains, and village houses are rendered with expressive contours and saturated warm-cool color contrasts, often surrounded by decorative botanical details."},{"id":"mark-spain","name":"Mark Spain","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Spain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-spain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-spain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","deep-red","ochre","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Mark Spain is a contemporary artist known for his evocative and romantic figurative paintings. His work often features elegant and expressive portrayals of women, capturing moments of introspection and allure. Spain's art is characterized by a blend of classical and modern techniques, creating a unique style that resonates with a wide audience.","observation":"Across all four panels, the images use visible, broad, energetic paint strokes to model expressive figures, clothing, hair, and architectural interiors. Saturated reds stand out against deep brown-green surroundings and warm lamps, with dramatic cropping, lively poses, and densely populated dance scenes giving the style a theatrical, fashion-portrait character."},{"id":"martin-parr","name":"Martin Parr","cat":"photographers","en":"Martin Parr","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-parr.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-parr","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","urban","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["muted-cyan","brown","beige","black","silver","dark-rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"Martin Parr is a renowned British photographer known for his satirical and humorous approach to documentary photography. His work often explores themes of consumerism, leisure, and social norms, capturing the quirks and idiosyncrasies of everyday life. Parr's photographs are characterized by their vibrant colors, candid compositions, and a keen eye for detail, making ordinary scenes appear extraordinary.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic street photography with carefully composed, characterful figures in urban and seaside settings. Restrained vintage color, period clothing, oversized sunglasses, classic vehicles, and crisp environmental detail create a playful retro fashion-documentary atmosphere."},{"id":"joe-quesada","name":"Joe Quesada","cat":"illustrators","en":"Joe Quesada","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joe-quesada.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joe-quesada","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","red","charcoal","light-orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"Joe Quesada is a renowned American comic book artist, writer, and editor, known for his influential work in the comic book industry. He has been a pivotal figure at Marvel Comics, serving as editor-in-chief and later as Chief Creative Officer. Quesada's artistic style is characterized by dynamic compositions, bold lines, and a strong sense of storytelling, contributing significantly to modern superhero narratives.","observation":"The style uses densely detailed comic-book drawing with heavy black contour lines, crosshatched shadows, and sharply articulated anatomy. Saturated reds, oranges, and blues are pushed against deep blacks, while tilted cityscapes, flames, debris, and forceful poses create an intense, kinetic superhero atmosphere."},{"id":"john-lasseter","name":"John Lasseter","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Lasseter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-lasseter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-lasseter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-blue","light-orange","grey","red"],"intro":"John Lasseter is a renowned American animator, director, and producer, best known for his work with Pixar Animation Studios and Walt Disney Animation Studios. He played a pivotal role in the development of computer-animated films, contributing to iconic movies such as 'Toy Story,' 'A Bug's Life,' and 'Cars.' Lasseter's influence on modern animation is profound, blending storytelling with cutting-edge technology to create beloved family films.","observation":"Across the illustrated panels, saturated coral, teal, blue, orange, and green forms are built from clearly visible directional brushstrokes and thick, textured paint. Crowded ensembles of wide-eyed creatures, human figures, vehicles, and fantastical objects combine playful character design with expressive, slightly surreal imagery."},{"id":"guy-delisle","name":"Guy Delisle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Guy Delisle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-delisle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-delisle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","ink","dark"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","orange","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Guy Delisle is a Canadian cartoonist and animator known for his travelogues and graphic novels. His works often explore themes of cultural observation and personal experience, drawing from his time spent in various countries. Delisle's storytelling is marked by a blend of humor and insight, offering readers a unique perspective on the places he visits.","observation":"The style is a dark, graphic narrative illustration built from heavy black contour lines, ink-like hatching, and muted blue-gray, brown, and red colors. Dense crowds, damaged urban architecture, staged viewpoints, and sharply contrasting lamps, flames, and spotlights create cinematic scenes with a somber, socially charged atmosphere."},{"id":"gary-varvel","name":"Gary Varvel","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gary Varvel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gary-varvel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gary-varvel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","muted-blue","dark-blue","brown","muted-orange","vivid-red","olive"],"intro":"Gary Varvel is a renowned American cartoonist known for his work as an editorial cartoonist. His illustrations often focus on political and social commentary, capturing the essence of current events with humor and insight. Varvel's work is characterized by its bold lines, expressive characters, and satirical edge, making him a prominent figure in the world of political cartoons.","observation":"This style uses highly expressive editorial cartooning with exaggerated anatomy, oversized facial features, thick black contour lines, and selective ink hatching. Saturated blue, red, black, and skin tones are laid in mostly flat areas with sharp highlights, while dynamic props and environmental chaos create forceful narrative scenes."},{"id":"pete-mckee","name":"Pete McKee","cat":"illustrators","en":"Pete McKee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pete-mckee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pete-mckee","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","subdued-colors","comics","retro","geometric"],"colours":["muted-olive","black","bone-white","muted-cyan","rust","dark-brown"],"intro":"Pete McKee is a contemporary British artist known for his distinctive style that captures the essence of working-class life in post-war Britain. His work often reflects themes of nostalgia, community, and everyday life, drawing inspiration from his own experiences and surroundings.","observation":"The style uses flat, muted color fields enclosed by heavy black contour lines, with deliberately simplified but distinctive human and animal figures. Dense interiors and street scenes are packed with small graphic details, while a coarse grain gives the illustrations a printed, tactile surface and a restrained retro-comic character."},{"id":"matt-groening","name":"Matt Groening","cat":"illustrators","en":"Matt Groening","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-groening.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-groening","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["red","charcoal","muted-orange","blue","light-yellow","green"],"intro":"Matt Groening is an American cartoonist, writer, and producer, best known for creating the iconic television series \" The Simpsons \" and \"Futurama.\" His work is characterized by its satirical humor, distinctive character designs, and cultural commentary. Groening's influence on animation and pop culture is profound, with \" The Simpsons \" becoming one of the longest-running TV shows in history.","observation":"The style combines flat, intensely saturated cartoon color with thick black contours and visible rough brush texture. It consistently exaggerates eyes, mouths, teeth, and anatomy into expressive grotesque characters, while dense crowded compositions alternate with brightly colored storybook environments."},{"id":"thomas-schaller","name":"Thomas Schaller","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Schaller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-schaller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-schaller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","white","muted-blue","silver","muted-red","red"],"intro":"Thomas Schaller is an acclaimed American watercolor artist known for his architectural and landscape paintings. His work often captures the interplay of light and shadow, creating atmospheric and evocative scenes that reflect both natural and built environments.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses loose, visible watercolor-like brushwork to build atmospheric historic city scenes with dense architectural detail. Cool blue-gray shadows, warm orange lamps and windows, reflective wet surfaces, and softened distance create a moody, dreamlike urban atmosphere."},{"id":"phil-noto","name":"Phil Noto","cat":"painters","en":"Phil Noto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/phil-noto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/phil-noto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","drawing"],"colours":["black","ochre","pale-orange","dark-brown","beige","red"],"intro":"Phil Noto is a contemporary American artist known for his work in comic books and illustration. He has contributed to various notable comic series and is recognized for his distinctive style that blends realism with a painterly touch, often featuring strong, expressive characters.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive close-up portraiture with visible brushwork, fine contour lines, and richly layered hair and facial detail. Warm terracotta, cream, charcoal, and muted skin tones create a restrained palette with strong dark-light separation, while tightly cropped framing and fashion-oriented clothing give the images an editorial feel."},{"id":"chris-ware","name":"Chris Ware","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris Ware","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-ware.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-ware","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","fine-lines","flat-color"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","beige","bone-white","red","orange"],"intro":"Chris Ware is a renowned American cartoonist and graphic novelist known for his intricate and innovative storytelling techniques. His work often explores themes of loneliness, isolation, and the passage of time, using a unique visual style that combines detailed line work with a muted color palette. Ware's most famous work, \"Jimmy Corrigan, the Smartest Kid on Earth,\" has received critical acclaim for its emotional depth and complex narrative structure.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed architectural cutaways packed with rooms, furnishings, staircases, rooftops, and small figures, arranged as expansive urban scenes. Clean fine outlines, flat blocks of blue, coral, yellow, and green, and graphic illustrative shading give the dense environments a precise, diagrammatic quality."},{"id":"gemma-correll","name":"Gemma Correll","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gemma Correll","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gemma-correll.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gemma-correll","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","funny"],"colours":["white","vivid-red","black","grey","silver"],"intro":"Gemma Correll is a British illustrator and cartoonist known for her humorous and relatable drawings, often featuring pugs and cats. Her work is characterized by a playful and witty style that resonates with a wide audience, capturing everyday life with a touch of sarcasm and charm.","observation":"The style uses spare, graphic cartoon drawings built from thick black ink contours, flat white and intensely red areas, and a deliberately limited palette. Exaggerated eyes, angular simplified bodies, deadpan expressions, and crowded cat-and-human interactions create a dry, humorous comic sensibility across both vignette scenes and close-ups."},{"id":"dan-brereton","name":"Dan Brereton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dan Brereton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-brereton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-brereton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","red","muted-blue","beige","dark-blue"],"intro":"Dan Brereton is an American artist known for his vibrant and dynamic comic book illustrations. His work often features bold colors and dramatic compositions, bringing to life a variety of fantastical and supernatural themes. Brereton's unique style has garnered a dedicated following, and he has contributed to numerous comic book series and graphic novels.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible brushwork, layered textures, and expressive, high-detail character painting. Deep shadows and saturated crimson, blue, and amber tones create a dark fantasy mood, with fire and candlelight providing localized luminous accents around dramatic female figures and ominous creatures."},{"id":"megan-hess","name":"Megan Hess","cat":"illustrators","en":"Megan Hess","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/megan-hess.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/megan-hess","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","pastel-colors","drawing"],"colours":["white","pale-red","silver","grey","black","red"],"intro":"Megan Hess is an acclaimed illustrator known for her elegant and sophisticated fashion illustrations. Her work is characterized by a distinctive style that combines intricate line work with a modern sensibility, often featuring glamorous and fashionable subjects. Hess has collaborated with numerous high-profile brands and publications, establishing herself as a prominent figure in the world of fashion illustration.","observation":"This style uses polished fashion-illustration drawing with bold black contour lines, clean flat color areas, and selective fine interior marks. Pastel pinks and blues are set against crisp black-and-white accents, while densely decorated salons, floral arrangements, glamorous clothing, and tea-table details create an ornate, editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"neil-leifer","name":"Neil Leifer","cat":"photographers","en":"Neil Leifer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/neil-leifer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/neil-leifer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","charcoal","silver","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Neil Leifer is an acclaimed American photographer known for his iconic sports photography, particularly his work capturing the dynamic and dramatic moments in boxing. His career spans several decades, during which he has documented some of the most memorable events in sports history, including numerous Olympic Games and Super Bowls. Leifer's work is characterized by its vivid detail, dynamic composition, and the ability to convey the intensity and emotion of the sporting world.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, presenting forceful football action through tight, telephoto-like framing, frozen impacts, and strong bodily movement. Saturated team colors, deep shadows, shallow focus, and visible grain create a gritty retro sports-photography character across all four renders."},{"id":"viktor-vasnetsov","name":"Viktor Vasnetsov","cat":"painters","en":"Viktor Vasnetsov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/viktor-vasnetsov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/viktor-vasnetsov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","grey","rust"],"intro":"Viktor Vasnetsov was a Russian painter and architect, known for his role in the revival of Russian folklore and mythology in art. He was a key figure in the Russian Revivalist movement, creating works that combined realism with romantic and symbolic elements. Vasnetsov's paintings often depicted scenes from Russian fairy tales, epic poems, and historical events, characterized by their detailed and narrative-rich compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, broad painterly strokes to build densely detailed historical-fantasy scenes. Dark earthy greens and browns are punctuated by pale garments, snowy light, and red banners, with dramatic compositions populated by armored riders, horses, fortifications, and crowds."},{"id":"dan-povenmire","name":"Dan Povenmire","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dan Povenmire","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-povenmire.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-povenmire","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","bone-white","dark-green","muted-green","red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Dan Povenmire is an American animator, writer, director, and producer known for his work on popular animated television series. He is best recognized for co-creating the hit show \"Phineas and Ferb,\" which has gained a significant following for its humor and creativity.","observation":"The style combines expressive cartoon character design with vivid, high-contrast color and strongly exaggerated faces, especially oversized eyes, beaks, and open mouths. Across the painted and cleaner drawn examples, bold contours, energetic poses, dense foliage, and visible surface texture create a lively fantasy-comedy world."},{"id":"howard-david-johnson","name":"Howard David Johnson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Howard David Johnson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howard-david-johnson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howard-david-johnson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","grey","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Howard David Johnson is a contemporary American artist known for his realistic and imaginative illustrations that often blend traditional and digital techniques. His work frequently explores themes of mythology, fantasy, and history, creating vivid and detailed visual narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, layered textures, and expressive treatment of faces, fabric, foliage, smoke, and clouds. It combines subdued, shadow-heavy atmospheres with intense red accents, glowing fire or light, elaborate mythic costumes, and dreamlike fantasy scenes."},{"id":"david-keochkerian","name":"David Keochkerian","cat":"photographers","en":"David Keochkerian","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-keochkerian.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-keochkerian","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-red","dark-blue","muted-blue","red","light-blue"],"intro":"David Keochkerian is a contemporary photographer known for his striking landscape imagery, often utilizing infrared techniques to create surreal and dreamlike scenes. His work captures the beauty of natural environments, transforming them into vivid and otherworldly landscapes that challenge the viewer's perception of reality.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive natural landscapes are depicted with highly realistic detail, dramatic cloud formations, and strong cyan-and-pink color separation. The saturated foliage, deep blue skies, and crisp high contrast create a vivid, dreamlike atmospheric style while maintaining photographic spatial depth."},{"id":"roy-lichtenstein","name":"Roy Lichtenstein","cat":"painters","en":"Roy Lichtenstein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roy-lichtenstein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roy-lichtenstein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","retro","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","orange","deep-blue","vivid-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Roy Lichtenstein was an American pop artist known for his comic strip-inspired works and contributions to the pop art movement of the 1960s. His art often featured bold colors, thick outlines, and Ben-Day dots, mimicking the printing techniques used in comic books and advertisements. Lichtenstein's work challenged traditional notions of fine art by incorporating elements of popular culture and mass media.","observation":"The style uses bold black outlines, hard-edged geometric fragments, flat primary colors, and repeated dot or hatch textures to create a strongly graphic comic-book appearance. Across both portraits and abstract compositions, layered patterns and angular forms produce a dense, retro visual language with saturated red, blue, yellow, black, and off-white."},{"id":"syd-mead","name":"Syd Mead","cat":"designers","en":"Syd Mead","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/syd-mead.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/syd-mead","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","retro"],"colours":["dark-blue","charcoal","bone-white","red","dark-red","brown"],"intro":"Syd Mead is a renowned American industrial designer and concept artist, celebrated for his visionary work in futuristic design. His career spanned several decades, during which he contributed to iconic films such as \" Blade Runner ,\" \"Tron,\" and \"Aliens,\" influencing the visual language of science fiction with his innovative and detailed designs.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines vividly saturated orange, red, blue, and cream with stark dark-light separation and visible painterly texture. Streamlined futuristic vehicles, monumental architecture, tiny figures, and dramatic low or tilted perspectives create dense retro-futurist scenes with an expressive, graphic quality."},{"id":"jacques-majorelle","name":"Jacques Majorelle","cat":"painters","en":"Jacques Majorelle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacques-majorelle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacques-majorelle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","brown","muted-blue","orange","rust"],"intro":"Jacques Majorelle was a French painter known for his Orientalist works and his creation of the Majorelle Garden in Marrakech, Morocco. His art is characterized by vibrant colors and exotic themes, reflecting his fascination with North African culture and landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly layered paint strokes with clean, graphic shapes, producing richly textured figures, foliage, textiles, and architecture. Saturated cobalt blues, warm terracotta, ochre, and red are set against strong light and shadow, while ornate courtyard details and carefully dressed figures create a decorative, luxurious atmosphere."},{"id":"guido-argentini","name":"Guido Argentini","cat":"photographers","en":"Guido Argentini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guido-argentini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guido-argentini","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","realistic","fashion","portraits","glow","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","metallic","dark"],"colours":["grey","brown","black","silver","muted-brown"],"intro":"Guido Argentini is an Italian photographer known for his work in fine art and fashion photography. His real-life counterpart is celebrated for capturing the human form with a unique blend of elegance and sensuality, often exploring themes of beauty and intimacy.","observation":"A hyper-detailed photographic beauty-editorial style built around extreme close-up portraits, expressive hand gestures, glossy skin, and sculptural metallic makeup and accessories. Monochrome treatment, occasional bronze-gold toning, hard directional lighting, deep shadows, and reflective surfaces create a bold, dark, high-contrast glamour aesthetic."},{"id":"zhang-huan","name":"Zhang Huan","cat":"various-artists","en":"Zhang Huan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zhang-huan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zhang-huan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-blue","black","rust","dark-brown","muted-ochre","brown"],"intro":"Zhang Huan is a renowned Chinese artist known for his work in performance art, sculpture, and painting. His art often explores themes of identity, spirituality, and the human condition, with a focus on the intersection of personal and cultural history. Zhang Huan's work is characterized by its bold and often provocative nature, challenging viewers to confront complex social and philosophical issues.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped portrait photography with exceptionally clear skin, pigment, tattoo, and body-paint texture. Restrained earthy colors, direct gazes, and simple blue-grey or tree-textured backgrounds keep attention on the faces and their dense surface markings."},{"id":"emiliano-ponzi","name":"Emiliano Ponzi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Emiliano Ponzi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emiliano-ponzi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emiliano-ponzi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","urban","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","muted-teal","charcoal","muted-yellow","red","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Emiliano Ponzi is an Italian illustrator known for his distinctive style characterized by bold colors, clean lines, and a strong narrative sense. His work often explores themes of modern life, solitude, and introspection, capturing the essence of contemporary urban environments with a minimalist yet impactful approach.","observation":"The style uses graphic, illustrative architecture with crisp geometric masses, strong silhouettes, and carefully controlled negative space. Across the scenes, subdued teal-and-rust palettes, orange sunset light, deep shadows, and textured grain create a moody cinematic atmosphere, while small human figures provide scale and quiet narrative tension."},{"id":"arthur-adams","name":"Arthur Adams","cat":"illustrators","en":"Arthur Adams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-adams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-adams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","pale-orange","dark-red","orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"Arthur Adams is a renowned American comic book artist known for his detailed and dynamic style. He gained prominence in the 1980s with his work on titles such as \"Longshot\" and has since contributed to numerous major comic book series. Adams is celebrated for his intricate linework, expressive characters, and ability to bring fantastical worlds to life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is densely packed and highly illustrative, with fine dark contour lines defining elaborate creatures, figures, vegetation, and environments. Saturated color, strong light-dark separation, ornamental surface detail, and fantastical scenes create an intense mythic-world effect."},{"id":"alan-lee","name":"Alan Lee","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alan Lee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-lee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-lee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["beige","charcoal","black","white","grey"],"intro":"Alan Lee is a renowned British illustrator and conceptual artist, best known for his work on J.R.R. Tolkien's Middle-earth books and Peter Jackson 's film adaptations of \"The Lord of the Rings.\" His illustrations are celebrated for their intricate detail, atmospheric depth, and ability to bring fantastical worlds to life with a sense of authenticity and wonder.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and highly detailed, with visible fine brushwork describing weathered faces, hair, fabric, stone, feathers, and tangled branches. Restrained earthy colors, deep shadows, and concentrated shafts of light create a solemn, dark-fantasy atmosphere across recurring scenes of hooded figures, animals, ruins, and wilderness."},{"id":"hieronymus-bosch","name":"Hieronymus Bosch","cat":"painters","en":"Hieronymus Bosch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hieronymus-bosch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hieronymus-bosch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","dark-ochre","black","grey","bone-white","ochre","red"],"intro":"Hieronymus Bosch was a Dutch painter from the late Middle Ages, known for his fantastical and often surreal depictions of religious and moral narratives. His works are characterized by intricate details, imaginative creatures, and complex compositions that explore themes of human folly and divine judgment.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured paint builds densely populated rural tableaux filled with human figures, animals, architecture, and bizarre hybrid forms. The subdued earthy palette, fine surface crackle, uncanny scale shifts, and imaginative creature designs create an eerie, dreamlike fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"konstantin-razumov","name":"Konstantin Razumov","cat":"painters","en":"Konstantin Razumov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/konstantin-razumov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/konstantin-razumov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","pastel-colors"],"colours":["beige","brown","grey","dark-olive","dark-brown","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Konstantin Razumov is a contemporary Russian painter known for his romantic and impressionistic style, often depicting elegant and intimate scenes of feminine beauty. His work is characterized by delicate brushwork and a keen attention to detail, capturing the grace and elegance of his subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional paint strokes to build elegant women, elaborate dresses, roses, and sunlit domestic or garden settings. The palette is luminous and pastel, with richly layered floral detail and softly romantic portrait compositions."},{"id":"frederic-william-burton","name":"Frederic William Burton","cat":"painters","en":"Frederic William Burton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederic-william-burton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederic-william-burton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","deep-red","dark-blue","muted-orange"],"intro":"Frederic William Burton was an Irish painter associated with the Pre-Raphaelite movement, known for his detailed and romantic depictions of historical and mythical subjects. His most famous work, \"The Meeting on the Turret Stairs,\" exemplifies his skill in capturing emotion and narrative through intricate detail and rich color.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, finely worked oil-paint surfaces with softly modeled faces, visible brushwork, and dense ornamental detail. Close-up figures are framed by luxuriant hair, patterned textiles, botanical elements, and jewel-toned reds and blues, creating a romantic, historical, dreamlike mood."},{"id":"vincent-castiglia","name":"Vincent Castiglia","cat":"painters","en":"Vincent Castiglia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vincent-castiglia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vincent-castiglia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","drawing"],"colours":["dark-brown","ochre","light-orange","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Vincent Castiglia is an American artist known for his unique technique of painting with human blood. His work often explores themes of life, death, and the human condition, blending elements of surrealism and symbolism to create haunting and introspective pieces.","observation":"The style uses highly rendered, close-up portraiture in a restrained sepia-brown palette, combining dense fine lines with delicate painterly strokes and strong tonal modelling. Facial expressions, hair, skin, and fabric are described through layered hatching and richly textured marks, giving the images an old-master-like, tactile illustrative quality."},{"id":"dick-sprang","name":"Dick Sprang","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dick Sprang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dick-sprang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dick-sprang","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","pale-yellow","dark-brown","dark-cyan","vivid-red","ochre"],"intro":"Dick Sprang was an American comic book artist renowned for his work on Batman during the Golden Age of Comic Books. He began his career with DC Comics in the early 1940s and quickly became one of the primary artists for Batman and Detective Comics. Sprang's distinctive, clean line work and dynamic compositions contributed significantly to the visual style of Batman, particularly in the depiction of Gotham City and its rogues' gallery. His tenure on the series included the introduction of iconic characters and the development of classic storylines. Sprang's work is characterized by its clarity, attention to detail, and a sense of adventure, which helped define the aesthetic of superhero comics in the mid-20th century.","observation":"The style uses bold comic-book drawing with thick black contour lines, flat saturated primary colors, and dense ink hatching to model anatomy, clothing, rocks, and shadows. Across the scenes, exaggerated muscular characters and dynamic flying or confrontational poses create strong motion and high contrast, with a distressed vintage-print surface and panel-like framing."},{"id":"garth-ennis","name":"Garth Ennis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Garth Ennis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/garth-ennis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/garth-ennis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","comics","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","dark-brown","vivid-red","red"],"intro":"Garth Ennis is a renowned comic book writer from Northern Ireland, best known for his work on series such as \"Preacher\" and \"The Boys.\" His storytelling often explores themes of violence, dark humor, and complex characters, making him a significant figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"The style combines heavily textured, visible brushwork with ink-like linework, distressed surfaces, and forceful dark-versus-red contrast. It presents grim, cinematic character scenes as graphic-novel panels, emphasizing rugged faces, military clothing, dramatic poses, and abrasive battlefield imagery."},{"id":"franz-von-stuck","name":"Franz von Stuck","cat":"painters","en":"Franz von Stuck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/franz-von-stuck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/franz-von-stuck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","ochre","light-orange","deep-rust"],"intro":"Franz von Stuck was a German painter, sculptor, and architect, known for his role in the Symbolist movement during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work often featured mythological themes, with a focus on the human form and dramatic, moody compositions. Stuck's art is characterized by its rich color palette, intricate details, and a blend of realism with fantastical elements.","observation":"These images use richly textured, visibly brushed paint with fine strokes, dense surface detail, and deep near-black shadows against restrained red, blue, ochre, and flesh tones. Close-up faces, animal companions, horns, and hooded forms create an expressive, dark-fantasy portrait style with intense gazes and strongly modeled features."},{"id":"warren-ellis","name":"Warren Ellis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Warren Ellis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/warren-ellis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/warren-ellis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","white","charcoal","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"Warren Ellis is a renowned comic book writer and novelist known for his work on titles such as \"Transmetropolitan\" and \"Planetary.\" His storytelling often explores themes of science fiction, technology, and the human condition, blending dark humor with intricate plots.","observation":"The style combines heavily worked painterly surfaces with forceful ink-like contours, distressed texture, and dense directional marks. Across the portraits, animals, and bleak outdoor settings, a restrained near-monochrome palette is punctuated by stark red, producing an expressive, ominous, surreal graphic quality."},{"id":"mabel-lucie-attwell","name":"Mabel Lucie Attwell","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mabel Lucie Attwell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mabel-lucie-attwell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mabel-lucie-attwell","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","retro","drawing","cute"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","light-orange","beige","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Mabel Lucie Attwell is a renowned British illustrator known for her charming and whimsical illustrations of children and fairy tales. Her work, primarily from the early 20th century, captures the innocence and imagination of childhood with a distinctive style that has become beloved in children's literature.","observation":"The style uses delicate fine-line drawing with softly brushed, lightly textured watercolor-like fills and gentle, subdued colors. It consistently depicts sweetly posed children in intimate everyday vignettes, with rosy faces, period clothing, floral details, and a tender nostalgic charm."},{"id":"william-steig","name":"William Steig","cat":"illustrators","en":"William Steig","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-steig.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-steig","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","urban","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","dark-olive","pale-cyan","orange","light-orange"],"intro":"William Steig was an American cartoonist, illustrator, and writer, known for his work in children's literature and his long association with The New Yorker. He created a number of beloved children's books, including \" Shrek !\" which inspired the popular film series. Steig's work is characterized by its humor, whimsy, and the ability to capture the imagination of both children and adults.","observation":"The style uses finely drawn ink outlines, dense crosshatched textures, and softly filled illustrative color to create expressive storybook scenes. Ordinary streets and sparse landscapes are transformed by oversized, improbable animals and childlike encounters, giving the images a whimsical surreal quality."},{"id":"walt-handelsman","name":"Walt Handelsman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Walt Handelsman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walt-handelsman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walt-handelsman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","funny"],"colours":["pale-blue","vivid-red","muted-ochre","black","pale-orange","blue","dark-blue"],"intro":"Walt Handelsman is a Pulitzer Prize-winning American editorial cartoonist known for his insightful and humorous takes on current events and politics. His work often features bold lines, vivid colors, and a distinctive style that captures the essence of the subjects he portrays. Handelsman's cartoons are widely recognized for their wit and ability to engage audiences in critical reflection on societal issues.","observation":"The style uses brightly colored, flat graphic shapes enclosed by heavy, energetic black linework, with exaggerated anatomy and highly expressive faces. It presents humorous character-driven vignettes and animal encounters with dense compositions, visual gags, and occasional hand-drawn lettering."},{"id":"giuseppe-cristiano","name":"Giuseppe Cristiano","cat":"various-artists","en":"Giuseppe Cristiano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giuseppe-cristiano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giuseppe-cristiano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","grey","red","white","dark-red"],"intro":"Giuseppe Cristiano is a contemporary artist known for his work in illustration and graphic design, often incorporating elements of pop culture and modern urban life into his art. His style is characterized by bold lines, vivid colors, and a cinematic approach to composition, drawing inspiration from both traditional and digital mediums.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped expressive portraits rendered as high-contrast graphic illustrations, with heavy black contours, ink-like hatching, and selectively textured surfaces. Saturated red, cyan, white, and black areas create a stark split-tone palette, while dramatic shadows and exaggerated facial features give the images an intense comic-book presence."},{"id":"karla-gerard","name":"Karla Gerard","cat":"painters","en":"Karla Gerard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karla-gerard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karla-gerard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","landscapes","patterns","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["muted-brown","vivid-red","brown","bone-white","muted-blue","orange"],"intro":"Karla Gerard is a contemporary American folk artist known for her vibrant and whimsical paintings. Her work often features playful landscapes and village scenes, characterized by bold colors and decorative patterns. Gerard's art is celebrated for its cheerful and uplifting style, drawing inspiration from folk traditions and modern decorative art.","observation":"These pictures use visibly textured, hand-painted surfaces with strong black outlines, vivid color, and densely repeated floral and circular motifs. Stylized village landscapes, houses, trees, flowers, and figures are arranged in expressive, pattern-rich scenes with flattened geometric forms and abundant small decorative details."},{"id":"rachel-maclean","name":"Rachel Maclean","cat":"photographers","en":"Rachel Maclean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rachel-maclean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rachel-maclean","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["ochre","dark-red","brown","muted-blue","beige","violet"],"intro":"Rachel Maclean is a contemporary Scottish artist known for her multimedia works that often explore themes of identity, society, and culture through a fantastical lens. Her work is characterized by its vibrant use of color, surreal imagery, and a blend of digital and traditional techniques to create immersive visual narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly realistic, tightly framed theatrical portraits with elaborate costumes, sculpted wigs, floral adornments, pearls, jewels, and painted faces. Saturated pastel colors, dense surface decoration, selective background blur, and surreal fashion styling create a flamboyant fantasy effect."},{"id":"karim-rashid","name":"Karim Rashid","cat":"designers","en":"Karim Rashid","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karim-rashid.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karim-rashid","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","glow","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal"],"colours":["pink","red","muted-magenta","pale-magenta","deep-red","brown"],"intro":"Karim Rashid is a renowned industrial designer known for his innovative and colorful approach to product and interior design. He has created a wide range of products, from furniture to fashion, characterized by their bold colors and futuristic forms. Rashid's work often blurs the line between art and design, emphasizing functionality while maintaining a distinct aesthetic appeal.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style depicts highly designed futuristic interiors built from rounded, biomorphic forms, glossy surfaces, and sculptural furniture. Saturated pink, coral, lavender, and orange hues dominate, with integrated luminous fixtures and flowing architectural curves creating a surreal, polished sci-fi atmosphere."},{"id":"alex-ross","name":"Alex Ross","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alex Ross","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-ross.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-ross","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","red","silver","orange","olive"],"intro":"Alex Ross is a renowned American comic book artist known for his realistic and detailed illustrations of superheroes. His work often features iconic characters from major comic book publishers, and he is celebrated for bringing a fine art sensibility to the comic book medium.","observation":"The style combines dense superhero imagery with vigorous, visibly broad paint strokes, sharp highlights, deep shadows, and saturated reds, blues, greens, and golds. Crowded heroic figures, forceful poses, expressive faces, capes, costumes, and explosive light create an epic, high-energy illustrated tableau."},{"id":"kate-baylay","name":"Kate Baylay","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kate Baylay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kate-baylay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kate-baylay","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","fashion","floral","patterns","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","brown","black","dark-red"],"intro":"Kate Baylay is an illustrator known for her intricate and decorative style, often drawing inspiration from mythological and fantasy themes. Her work is characterized by a blend of art nouveau influences and contemporary illustration techniques, creating a unique and recognizable aesthetic.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, illustrative portrait figures with dense floral, textile, and animal ornament, all organized through delicate contour lines and repeated patterns. A restrained cream, black, red, and muted green palette, elaborate garments, and decorative accessories create a refined, richly embellished appearance across the sheet."},{"id":"vincent-munier","name":"Vincent Munier","cat":"photographers","en":"Vincent Munier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vincent-munier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vincent-munier","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","light-blue","white","muted-blue"],"intro":"Vincent Munier is a renowned French wildlife photographer known for his ethereal and minimalist approach to capturing nature. His work often focuses on the serene and mystical aspects of wildlife, particularly in snowy and remote landscapes. Munier's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey the tranquility and beauty of the natural world, often highlighting rare and elusive animals in their natural habitats.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and finely detailed, portraying white-furred animals against expansive snowy landscapes in a restrained icy-blue palette. Wide compositions use abundant negative space, soft atmospheric light, and selective focus to create a quiet, cinematic, dreamlike sense of isolation."},{"id":"susan-rios","name":"Susan Rios","cat":"painters","en":"Susan Rios","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/susan-rios.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/susan-rios","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-ochre","dark-green","muted-ochre","rust","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Susan Rios is an American painter known for her romantic and idyllic depictions of domestic and pastoral scenes. Her work often features serene landscapes, charming interiors, and gentle portrayals of women and children, capturing a sense of warmth and nostalgia.","observation":"The style combines highly visible, finely layered brushwork with vivid color and densely packed floral, domestic, animal, and human motifs. It feels like richly staged garden tableaux, using decorative textiles, foliage, flowers, and patterned objects to create an ornate, immersive atmosphere while retaining clear illustrative forms."},{"id":"andre-kertesz","name":"Andre Kertesz","cat":"photographers","en":"Andre Kertesz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andre-kertesz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andre-kertesz","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["grey","black","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Andre Kertesz was a Hungarian-born photographer known for his groundbreaking contributions to photographic composition and the photo essay. His work is celebrated for its innovative use of angles and perspectives, capturing the essence of everyday life with a unique, often surreal vision. Kertesz's influence extends across generations, impacting the fields of photojournalism and art photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with hard sunlight, deep shadows, and strongly silhouetted figures. Elevated viewpoints, elongated cast shadows, and carefully staged urban situations create a dramatic, filmic documentary mood."},{"id":"agostino-arrivabene","name":"Agostino Arrivabene","cat":"painters","en":"Agostino Arrivabene","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/agostino-arrivabene.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/agostino-arrivabene","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","charcoal","beige"],"intro":"Agostino Arrivabene is an Italian contemporary artist known for his intricate and surreal paintings that often explore themes of mythology, transcendence, and the human psyche. His works are characterized by a meticulous attention to detail and a unique blending of classical techniques with modern surrealist elements.","observation":"Across all four portraits, visible directional brushwork and layered surface texture create a painterly, expressive treatment rather than clean illustration. Dark teal and charcoal grounds contrast with amber and blue highlights, while luminous particles, radiant forms, and translucent spheres give the obscured figures a dreamlike, surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"francis-bacon","name":"Francis Bacon","cat":"painters","en":"Francis Bacon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francis-bacon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francis-bacon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","charcoal","grey","red"],"intro":"Francis Bacon was a 20th-century British painter known for his raw, unsettling imagery and emotional intensity. His work often explored themes of existentialism, isolation, and the human condition, using distorted figures and dramatic compositions to convey psychological depth. Bacon's style is characterized by bold, expressive brushwork and a dark, moody color palette, making him a pivotal figure in modern art.","observation":"Across all four portraits, visible directional brushwork and rough, built-up paint give the images an expressive, painterly surface. Dark grounds and strong red, cyan, and magenta accents create a high-contrast, moody presentation, while close cropping and partial facial dissolution make the portraits feel intense and psychologically charged."},{"id":"claudia-rogge","name":"Claudia Rogge","cat":"various-artists","en":"Claudia Rogge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claudia-rogge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claudia-rogge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Claudia Rogge is a contemporary German artist known for her exploration of human forms and collective identity through photography and digital manipulation. Her work often delves into themes of repetition and pattern, creating intricate compositions that challenge perceptions of individuality and mass behavior.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, cinematic overhead compositions packed with repeated human figures, drapery, and physically convincing textures. Subdued earthy or monochromatic palettes, strong light-dark separation, and immense crowd formations create a dark, surreal, and epic visual impact."},{"id":"christopher-balaskas","name":"Christopher Balaskas","cat":"illustrators","en":"Christopher Balaskas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christopher-balaskas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christopher-balaskas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi","epic"],"colours":["muted-cyan","black","dark-cyan","dark-brown","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Christopher Balaskas is an artist known for his imaginative and visually striking works that often explore themes of science fiction and fantasy. His art is characterized by a blend of surreal and epic elements, creating immersive and otherworldly experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic, realistic landscape imagery built around colossal monolithic rock formations and tiny human figures for scale. Deep teal-blue shadows, warm orange fissures, and occasional cyan light create a moody, high-contrast science-fiction atmosphere, while mist, storm clouds, and ocean spray add depth and epic scale."},{"id":"ragnar-axelsson","name":"Ragnar Axelsson","cat":"photographers","en":"Ragnar Axelsson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ragnar-axelsson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ragnar-axelsson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["white","black","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Ragnar Axelsson is a renowned Icelandic photographer known for his striking black and white images that capture the stark beauty and harsh realities of life in the Arctic. His work often focuses on the people, landscapes, and wildlife of Iceland and Greenland, highlighting the challenges and changes faced by these communities due to environmental shifts.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photographic imagery with deep shadows, blown highlights, visible grain, and dramatic atmospheric light. Vast landscapes, isolated buildings, animals, and solitary figures are arranged as uncanny cinematic vignettes, producing a bleak, surreal sense of scale and quiet tension."},{"id":"gray-morrow","name":"Gray Morrow","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gray Morrow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gray-morrow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gray-morrow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-green","dark-blue","ochre","red"],"intro":"Gray Morrow is an American illustrator and comic book artist known for his work in science fiction and fantasy genres. He contributed to various comic series and magazines, creating vivid and imaginative illustrations that captured the essence of speculative fiction.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible broad paint strokes, rough built-up texture, and strongly expressive modeling of faces, clothing, creatures, and foliage. Saturated reds, greens, and blues are set against deep shadows and bright highlights, with theatrical compositions centered on heroic or threatening figures in energetic fantasy situations."},{"id":"jack-kirby","name":"Jack Kirby","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jack Kirby","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-kirby.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-kirby","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","dark-red","vivid-red","muted-olive","orange"],"intro":"Jack Kirby was a pioneering American comic book artist, writer, and editor, widely regarded as one of the most influential creators in the comic book industry. Known for co-creating many iconic characters and series, including the Fantastic Four, X-Men, and Captain America, Kirby's work is characterized by dynamic compositions, bold lines, and imaginative storytelling.","observation":"The style is a dense, highly detailed comic-book collage built from bold black contour lines, flat color blocks, and extensive interior hatching. Saturated reds, blues, pinks, greens, and oranges create high contrast across surreal mechanical characters, cosmic motifs, and tightly packed geometric patterns."},{"id":"sardax","name":"Sardax","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sardax","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sardax.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sardax","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Sardax is an illustrator known for his intricate and fantastical artwork, often exploring themes of fantasy and surrealism. His work is characterized by detailed line work, rich textures, and a dark, enigmatic atmosphere. Sardax's illustrations frequently feature mythical creatures, gothic elements, and elaborate costume designs, creating a unique blend of fantasy and reality.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense black-and-white illustration with finely controlled linework, crosshatching, and ink-like shading. Elaborate Victorian clothing, theatrical poses, ravens, clocks, and antique interiors create a dark, highly detailed gothic atmosphere with strong tonal contrast."},{"id":"roger-de-la-fresnaye","name":"Roger de La Fresnaye","cat":"painters","en":"Roger de La Fresnaye","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-de-la-fresnaye.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-de-la-fresnaye","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","still-life","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","dark-brown","red","black","dark-blue"],"intro":"Roger de La Fresnaye was a French painter known for his contributions to the Cubist movement in the early 20th century. His work often featured geometric abstraction and a vivid use of color, reflecting the avant-garde spirit of his time. De La Fresnaye's paintings are characterized by their fragmented forms and innovative compositions, which capture the dynamism and complexity of modern life.","observation":"The style combines visible, tactile paint texture with flattened geometric planes, strong contour lines, and vivid blocks of red, blue, green, cream, and ochre. Across portraits, still lifes, and architectural scenes, recognizable forms are fractured into overlapping angular shapes while retaining a carefully composed, decorative quality."},{"id":"julie-paschkis","name":"Julie Paschkis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Julie Paschkis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julie-paschkis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julie-paschkis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["rust","dark-brown","dark-blue","vivid-red","charcoal","muted-orange"],"intro":"Julie Paschkis is an American artist and illustrator known for her vibrant and whimsical illustrations often inspired by folk art traditions. Her work spans children's books, textiles, and fine art, characterized by intricate patterns and a playful use of color.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible painted texture with extremely dense ornamental detail, saturated jewel-like color, and repeated geometric and botanical motifs. Stylized women and animals are integrated into richly patterned textiles and floral environments, balancing recognizable forms with decorative, fantastical imagery."},{"id":"larry-elmore","name":"Larry Elmore","cat":"illustrators","en":"Larry Elmore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-elmore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-elmore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","yellow","dark-brown","muted-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Larry Elmore is a renowned American fantasy artist, best known for his work on the Dungeons & Dragons franchise and other fantasy role-playing games. His illustrations have defined the visual style of fantasy art for decades, featuring detailed and imaginative depictions of mythical worlds and characters.","observation":"The style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork building faces, foliage, fabric, leather, and bark into a highly detailed surface. Saturated greens, blues, and warm earth tones are shaped by strong sunlight and shadow, while crowded character groupings, active poses, and forest settings create an epic fantasy-adventure feeling."},{"id":"kay-nielsen","name":"Kay Nielsen","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kay Nielsen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kay-nielsen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kay-nielsen","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","pale-orange","muted-blue","grey","orange"],"intro":"Kay Nielsen was a Danish illustrator known for his distinctive style that combined elements of Art Nouveau and fairy tale illustration. Born in 1886, Nielsen gained fame for his work on fairy tale collections and his contributions to Disney's \"Fantasia.\" His illustrations are characterized by their intricate detail, ethereal quality, and use of muted colors.","observation":"The style combines densely ornamental, fine-lined illustration with visible painterly texture, layering elaborate costumes, architecture, creatures, and patterned surfaces into theatrical tableaux. A restrained blue-black palette is punctuated by ivory, red, and metallic-looking gold, with strong dark⁠–light contrasts and recurring celestial and fantastical imagery."},{"id":"atey-ghailan","name":"Atey Ghailan","cat":"illustrators","en":"Atey Ghailan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/atey-ghailan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/atey-ghailan","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","backlighting","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","grey","brown","orange","rust"],"intro":"Atey Ghailan is a contemporary illustrator known for his captivating digital artworks that often explore themes of urban life and fantasy. His work is characterized by a unique blend of realism and imaginative elements, creating immersive visual narratives that resonate with audiences worldwide. Ghailan's illustrations often feature dynamic compositions and vivid color palettes, reflecting his background in concept art and storytelling.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses painterly, atmospheric scenes with expressive brushwork, cinematic framing, and strongly opposed warm orange light against cool blue shadows. Backlit figures, glowing suns or windows, reflective surfaces, and expansive landscapes create a moody, contemplative sense of place."},{"id":"magali-villeneuve","name":"Magali Villeneuve","cat":"painters","en":"Magali Villeneuve","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/magali-villeneuve.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/magali-villeneuve","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Magali Villeneuve is a renowned French artist and illustrator, known for her work in the fantasy genre. Her art has graced the covers of numerous books and games, bringing to life vivid and imaginative worlds. Villeneuve's style is characterized by its intricate detail and rich storytelling, often drawing inspiration from mythological and medieval themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to depict dramatic fantasy characters in close-up, with carefully rendered faces, hair, fabrics, jewelry, and animal features. Deep earthy shadows contrast with warm firelit highlights and glowing embers, creating an intense, atmospheric portrait style."},{"id":"alessio-albi","name":"Alessio Albi","cat":"photographers","en":"Alessio Albi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alessio-albi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alessio-albi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","mist","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","silver","dark-olive"],"intro":"Alessio Albi is a contemporary photographer known for his ethereal and introspective portraiture. His work often explores the connection between humans and nature, using natural light and organic elements to create a sense of mystery and intimacy.","observation":"The style is cinematic and photorealistic, combining intimate, textural close-ups with atmospheric forest scenes and a recurring figure in motion. Muted earthy colors, cool shadows, soft mist, selective focus, and foliage or windblown hair partially obscuring the subjects create a moody, immersive sense of mystery."},{"id":"bill-owens","name":"Bill Owens","cat":"photographers","en":"Bill Owens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-owens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-owens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro"],"colours":["silver","brown","black","grey"],"intro":"Bill Owens is an American photographer known for his work documenting suburban life in the United States during the 1970s. His photographs capture the essence of middle-class American culture, often focusing on the mundane and everyday aspects of life in suburban neighborhoods. Owens's work is celebrated for its candid and insightful portrayal of American society, offering a unique perspective on the cultural and social dynamics of the time.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photographic realism with crisp detail, strong tonal contrast, and carefully observed domestic settings. Its candid, cinematic compositions depict family members and pets in lived-in mid-century interiors, balancing portrait-like faces with documentary scenes and nostalgic atmosphere."},{"id":"sophie-delaporte","name":"Sophie Delaporte","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sophie Delaporte","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sophie-delaporte.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sophie-delaporte","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","fashion","floral","portraits","glow","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["dark-teal","muted-blue","muted-cyan","dark-red","muted-red","red"],"intro":"Sophie Delaporte is a contemporary French photographer known for her imaginative and whimsical fashion photography. Her work often explores themes of fantasy and surrealism, utilizing vibrant colors and intricate compositions to create dreamlike images.","observation":"The style is polished, editorial portrait photography built around surreal sculptural costumes, transparent plastic, inflated forms, and elaborate floral interventions. Saturated red, pink, and blue palettes, carefully arranged studio compositions, tactile materials, and controlled highlights give the images a theatrical, cinematic fashion-magazine presence."},{"id":"james-wan","name":"James Wan","cat":"filmmakers","en":"James Wan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-wan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-wan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","backlighting","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-teal","grey","black","light-cyan"],"intro":"James Wan is a renowned filmmaker known for his work in the horror genre, having directed and produced several successful films. He is recognized for his ability to create suspenseful and atmospheric narratives that captivate audiences worldwide.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistically rendered, using highly detailed environments, dramatic scale, and solitary figures framed against vast forests, cliffs, waterfalls, and cavernous spaces. A restrained blue-green palette, deep shadows, bright atmospheric openings, mist, and occasional rim light create a dark, epic, foreboding mood."},{"id":"roger-deakins","name":"Roger Deakins","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Roger Deakins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-deakins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-deakins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-cyan","deep-rust","dark-brown","pale-orange"],"intro":"Roger Deakins is a renowned British cinematographer known for his work on films such as \" Blade Runner 2049,\" \"Skyfall,\" and \"The Shawshank Redemption.\" His distinctive style is characterized by meticulous attention to lighting, composition, and color, often creating visually striking and emotionally resonant imagery. Deakins has received numerous accolades for his contributions to the art of filmmaking, including multiple Academy Awards.","observation":"Across the renders, the style is cinematic and realistic, built from atmospheric landscapes, solitary figures, and strongly staged moments. Deep teal, brown, and ember-orange grading, dense mist, backlighting, and isolated practical light create a dark, high-contrast mood with dramatic silhouettes and expansive wooded settings."},{"id":"adam-kubert","name":"Adam Kubert","cat":"illustrators","en":"Adam Kubert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adam-kubert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adam-kubert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","vivid-red","rust","dark-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Adam Kubert is a renowned American comic book artist known for his dynamic and detailed illustrations, particularly in the superhero genre. He has worked with major comic book publishers like Marvel and DC Comics, contributing to iconic series and characters. Kubert's work is characterized by its bold lines, intricate details, and a strong sense of motion, making his art instantly recognizable in the world of comics.","observation":"Across the sheet, dramatic figures and action scenes are rendered with dense comic-book linework, forceful silhouettes, and strongly outlined anatomy. Saturated orange, red, yellow, black, and deep green create a high-contrast, energetic look, while explosive backgrounds, flames, creatures, and dynamic poses heighten the expressive intensity."},{"id":"goro-fujita","name":"Goro Fujita","cat":"illustrators","en":"Goro Fujita","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/goro-fujita.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/goro-fujita","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","grey","dark-brown","pale-orange","orange"],"intro":"Goro Fujita is a contemporary illustrator and animator known for his enchanting and whimsical digital art. He has worked in various creative fields, including animation and virtual reality, contributing to projects that emphasize storytelling and visual wonder. Fujita's work often features vibrant colors, imaginative worlds, and a sense of playful fantasy, making him a notable figure in the realm of modern illustration.","observation":"The style uses richly painted, visible fine brushwork with cinematic framing, dramatic silhouettes, and strong warm-versus-cool lighting. Saturated blue skies, orange highlights, luminous sunlit edges, and imaginative character encounters give the scenes a wistful fantasy-storybook quality."},{"id":"lisi-martin","name":"Lisi Martin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lisi Martin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lisi-martin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lisi-martin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","light-orange","brown","rust","grey"],"intro":"Lisi Martin is a Spanish illustrator known for her enchanting and whimsical depictions of children and nature. Her work often features delicate details and a soft, pastel color palette, capturing the innocence and wonder of childhood. Martin's illustrations have been widely recognized for their ability to evoke a sense of nostalgia and fantasy, making her a beloved figure in the world of children's art.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with delicate brushwork, layered detail, and softly blended yet saturated color. It presents tender, storybook-like children and animals in intimate domestic or fantastical encounters, combining expressive faces, abundant natural motifs, and a dreamy illustrative atmosphere."},{"id":"harrison-fisher","name":"Harrison Fisher","cat":"illustrators","en":"Harrison Fisher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harrison-fisher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harrison-fisher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","retro","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","bone-white","black","muted-ochre","brown","rust"],"intro":"Harrison Fisher was an American illustrator known for his depictions of beautiful women, often referred to as the 'Fisher Girls.' His work was prominent in the early 20th century, gracing the covers of magazines like Cosmopolitan and Saturday Evening Post. Fisher's illustrations captured the elegance and fashion of the Edwardian era, contributing significantly to the visual culture of his time.","observation":"These portraits combine visible painterly brushwork with delicate, gestural strokes, softly modeled faces, and loosely sketched clothing and hair. Restrained cream, black, brown, and muted red tones, expansive pale backgrounds, and oversized hats create an elegant vintage fashion-illustration feel across the sheet."},{"id":"julian-glander","name":"Julian Glander","cat":"illustrators","en":"Julian Glander","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julian-glander.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julian-glander","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","glow","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["muted-cyan","red","light-pink","grey","orange"],"intro":"Julian Glander is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and whimsical digital illustrations. His work often explores playful and surreal themes, characterized by a unique blend of humor and imagination. Glander's style is recognized for its bold use of color and geometric forms, creating a distinctive visual language that resonates with modern digital culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds dense fantastical environments from rounded geometric forms, candy-colored architecture, glossy spheres, organic textures, and unusual oversized objects. Saturated pastel hues, luminous surfaces, reflective materials, and softly modeled dimensional forms create a playful surreal world with strong sculptural presence."},{"id":"elizabeth-nourse","name":"Elizabeth Nourse","cat":"painters","en":"Elizabeth Nourse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elizabeth-nourse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elizabeth-nourse","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Elizabeth Nourse was an American painter known for her realist and naturalist works, often depicting women and children in domestic settings. Born in 1859 in Cincinnati, Ohio, she studied at the Académie Julian in Paris and spent much of her career in France. Nourse's work is characterized by its intimate portrayal of everyday life, with a focus on the emotional depth and dignity of her subjects.","observation":"The style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, layered strokes, and textured surfaces to model faces, hair, fur, and fabric with convincing volume. Restrained earth tones, deep backgrounds, and selective highlights create an intimate, serious mood across both close portraits and the familial group scene."},{"id":"dave-perillo","name":"Dave Perillo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dave Perillo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dave-perillo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dave-perillo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","cute"],"colours":["black","pale-yellow","vivid-red","muted-teal","rust","dark-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Dave Perillo is a contemporary illustrator known for his vibrant and playful artworks that often draw inspiration from mid-century modern design and pop culture. His work is characterized by bold colors, geometric shapes, and a whimsical approach to storytelling, making it instantly recognizable and widely appreciated in the world of graphic design.","observation":"The style uses bold, clean graphic outlines, flat color blocks, and a vivid red, navy, black, and cream palette, with stippled textures adding tactile print-like variation. It combines densely arranged decorative motifs with whimsical animals, plants, mushrooms, castles, and storybook scenes, giving the whole sheet a playful fantasy character."},{"id":"james-turrell","name":"James Turrell","cat":"various-artists","en":"James Turrell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-turrell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-turrell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","minimalist","characters","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-red","deep-blue","dark-blue","red","blue"],"intro":"James Turrell is an American artist known for his work within the Light and Space movement. He is renowned for his innovative use of light and space to create immersive environments that challenge perceptions of reality and explore the nature of human vision. Turrell's work often involves large-scale installations that manipulate natural and artificial light to transform architectural spaces.","observation":"The style combines stark geometric architecture with vast negative space, isolated figures, and monumental circular forms. Saturated blue, red, and orange lighting creates a high-contrast, cinematic atmosphere, while glowing orbs and carefully centered compositions give the scenes a surreal, contemplative scale."},{"id":"abbas-kiarostami","name":"Abbas Kiarostami","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Abbas Kiarostami","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abbas-kiarostami.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abbas-kiarostami","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","grey","black","white","silver"],"intro":"Abbas Kiarostami is a renowned Iranian filmmaker, photographer, and poet, celebrated for his innovative contributions to cinema. His work is characterized by its poetic simplicity, profound humanism, and a unique blend of documentary and fiction. Kiarostami's films often explore themes of life, death, and existentialism, set against the backdrop of Iran's landscapes and culture.","observation":"The style uses stark, grainy photographic imagery with strong monochrome contrast, occasional restrained sepia, and large expanses of atmospheric landscape. Solitary dark figures, vintage cars, oversized facial details, and unusual scale relationships create a cinematic, melancholic surrealism with ample negative space."},{"id":"jim-hansel","name":"Jim Hansel","cat":"painters","en":"Jim Hansel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-hansel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-hansel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","muted-rust","muted-blue","orange"],"intro":"Jim Hansel is an American artist known for his captivating landscape paintings that often feature serene and idyllic scenes. His work is celebrated for its attention to detail and the ability to evoke a sense of tranquility and nostalgia. Hansel's paintings frequently depict rural and natural settings, capturing the beauty of the American countryside.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and highly detailed, with visible textured brushwork, dramatic lighting, and strong warm-versus-cool color contrasts. It treats wilderness, figures, animals, and narrative settings with cinematic scale, atmospheric mist, glowing practical lights, and a dark fantastical mood."},{"id":"ruslan-lobanov","name":"Ruslan Lobanov","cat":"photographers","en":"Ruslan Lobanov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ruslan-lobanov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ruslan-lobanov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","urban","backlighting","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Ruslan Lobanov is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative and stylish imagery, often capturing the elegance and allure of his subjects in a timeless manner. His work is characterized by a sophisticated blend of classic and modern aesthetics, often drawing inspiration from mid-20th century fashion and culture.","observation":"A cinematic photographic style built around elegant fashion portraits in urban settings, with strong black-and-white tonality and occasional muted sepia warmth. High contrast, selective focus, backlit haze, deep shadows, and vintage wardrobe details create a moody retro atmosphere."},{"id":"hiro-mashima","name":"Hiro Mashima","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hiro Mashima","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hiro-mashima.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hiro-mashima","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","charcoal","muted-blue","red","dark-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Hiro Mashima is a renowned Japanese manga artist best known for his work on popular series such as \"Fairy Tail\" and \"Rave Master.\" His storytelling and artistic style have captivated audiences worldwide, making him a significant figure in the manga industry. Mashima's work is characterized by its dynamic action sequences, imaginative worlds, and engaging characters, often blending elements of fantasy and adventure.","observation":"The style combines densely detailed character illustration with expressive poses, saturated color accents, and forceful dark outlines. Ink-like contouring, crosshatched shading, and energetic painted splash marks give the fantasy combat imagery a tactile, kinetic intensity."},{"id":"euan-uglow","name":"Euan Uglow","cat":"painters","en":"Euan Uglow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/euan-uglow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/euan-uglow","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["pale-orange","muted-blue","muted-brown","black","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Euan Uglow was a British painter known for his meticulous approach to figurative art. Born in 1932, Uglow's work is characterized by its precision and attention to detail, often focusing on the human form and still life. He was a prominent figure in the post-war British art scene, celebrated for his unique style that combined elements of modernism with classical techniques.","observation":"The style combines visibly textured, layered paint with simplified geometric planes, restrained earthy colors, and crisp drawn contours. It repeatedly presents cropped, fashion-conscious character portraits against blocky abstract backdrops, balancing illustrative graphic structure with expressive facial modeling and surface detail."},{"id":"nina-ricci","name":"Nina Ricci","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Nina Ricci","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nina-ricci.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nina-ricci","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","red","muted-red","muted-cyan","dark-green","black"],"intro":"Nina Ricci is a renowned French fashion house founded in 1932 by Maria \"Nina\" Ricci and her son Robert. Known for its elegant and sophisticated designs, the brand has become synonymous with timeless femininity and luxury. Nina Ricci's creations often feature delicate fabrics, intricate details, and a romantic aesthetic, making it a staple in haute couture and ready-to-wear fashion.","observation":"The style combines editorial fashion portraiture with highly elaborate, sculptural garments, especially layers of translucent ruffles, tulle, and sweeping fabric. It shifts between polished photographic realism and visibly gestural painted treatment, using saturated pinks and greens, restrained studio backgrounds, and expressive, carefully composed model poses."},{"id":"ivan-bilibin","name":"Ivan Bilibin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ivan Bilibin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ivan-bilibin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ivan-bilibin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","religious","geometric"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","pale-orange","beige","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Ivan Bilibin was a Russian illustrator and stage designer, known for his distinctive style that drew heavily on Russian folklore and traditional art. He was a prominent figure in the early 20th century, contributing significantly to the world of illustration with his detailed and decorative works. Bilibin's art is characterized by its intricate line work, vibrant colors, and incorporation of folk motifs, which have left a lasting impact on Russian art and illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly detailed landscapes and architectural scenes are built from crisp fine outlines, flat-to-gently shaded color areas, and dense decorative patterning. Saturated jewel tones, ornamental domes and towers, birch forests, foliage, and elaborately dressed figures create a fantastical storybook atmosphere with strong Russian-inspired architectural motifs."},{"id":"joseph-cornell","name":"Joseph Cornell","cat":"various-artists","en":"Joseph Cornell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joseph-cornell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joseph-cornell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","still-life","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","retro"],"colours":["grey","brown","black","muted-yellow","rust","white"],"intro":"Joseph Cornell was an American artist and sculptor, known for his innovative and distinctive assemblage art. He was a pioneer of assemblage, creating intricate shadow boxes filled with found objects, photographs, and ephemera that evoke a sense of nostalgia and surrealism. His work is often associated with the Surrealist movement, although he remained largely independent from any specific artistic group.","observation":"The style presents densely arranged shadow-box assemblages in weathered, ornate frames, combining faded objects, botanical specimens, maritime imagery, clouds, and celestial motifs. Painterly surfaces, aged patina, subdued teal-and-brown colors, and dramatic localized light give the scenes a nostalgic, handcrafted cabinet-of-curiosities character with surreal juxtapositions."},{"id":"bill-amend","name":"Bill Amend","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bill Amend","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-amend.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-amend","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","funny","geometric"],"colours":["pale-blue","muted-green","pale-orange","charcoal","muted-blue","dark-red","magenta"],"intro":"Bill Amend is an American cartoonist, best known for creating the comic strip \"FoxTrot,\" which humorously depicts the life of the Fox family. His work is characterized by its witty humor and relatable family dynamics, appealing to a wide audience.","observation":"The style uses clean, heavy contour drawing with flat, lightly varied color and exaggerated cartoon anatomy, especially oversized eyes, noses, and expressive poses. It consistently presents humorous character-driven situations in busy comic-panel compositions, with energetic action, speech bubbles, and vivid winter and suburban settings."},{"id":"jon-klassen","name":"Jon Klassen","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jon Klassen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jon-klassen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jon-klassen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","beige"],"intro":"Jon Klassen is a Canadian author and illustrator known for his distinctive style in children's books. He has received numerous awards for his work, including the Caldecott Medal. Klassen's illustrations often feature animals and natural settings, characterized by a subtle humor and a minimalist approach.","observation":"The style combines broad, visibly textured brushwork with ink-like silhouettes, sparse pale grounds, and strongly enlarged animal forms. Muted beige, brown, and black tones, stark value contrasts, reflective watery settings, and tiny isolated figures create a quiet, uncanny storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"eyvind-earle","name":"Eyvind Earle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Eyvind Earle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eyvind-earle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eyvind-earle","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","glow","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","dark-blue","dark-green","light-green","dark-red"],"intro":"Eyvind Earle was an American artist and illustrator known for his distinctive style in animation and painting, especially his work with Disney on films like 'Sleeping Beauty.' His art is characterized by bold colors, intricate details, and a unique blend of realism and fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents richly layered fantastical landscapes with enormous twisted trees, dense rounded foliage, distant spires and luminous valleys. Clean graphic contours and strongly silhouetted dark forms contrast with saturated blue-green twilight, warm horizon light and occasional red accents, creating a dreamy, otherworldly woodland atmosphere."},{"id":"yossi-kotler","name":"Yossi Kotler","cat":"painters","en":"Yossi Kotler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yossi-kotler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yossi-kotler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["grey","orange","bone-white","brown","red","blue"],"intro":"Yossi Kotler is an artist known for his vibrant and expressive works that often explore themes of identity and emotion through abstract portraiture. His style is characterized by a bold use of color and dynamic compositions that capture the viewer's attention.","observation":"Across all four panels, tightly cropped faces emerge from dense layers of visible brushwork, scraped paint, fine dark marks, and overlapping fragments. Saturated reds, turquoise, orange, black, and pale flesh tones create a high-contrast, emotionally charged surface in which realistic facial features are continually disrupted by abstract painterly gestures."},{"id":"beatrice-alemagna","name":"Beatrice Alemagna","cat":"illustrators","en":"Beatrice Alemagna","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/beatrice-alemagna.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/beatrice-alemagna","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","floral","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["dark-olive","ochre","black","grey","pale-yellow","red"],"intro":"Beatrice Alemagna is an Italian illustrator and author known for her enchanting children's books. Her work often features whimsical and dreamlike illustrations that capture the imagination of both children and adults. Alemagna's unique style combines a sense of nostalgia with contemporary artistic techniques, making her a beloved figure in the world of children's literature.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, hand-painted surfaces with fine drawn marks, layered foliage, and carefully patterned details. Muted greens, blues, browns, and creams are punctuated by strong red accents, while stylized animals and wide-eyed human figures inhabit dense, surreal woodland compositions."},{"id":"sion-sono","name":"Sion Sono","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Sion Sono","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sion-sono.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sion-sono","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","dark"],"colours":["black","red","brown","orange","muted-cyan","dark-red"],"intro":"Sion Sono is a renowned Japanese filmmaker known for his provocative and unconventional storytelling. His work often explores themes of identity, society, and human nature, blending elements of horror, drama, and surrealism. Sono's films are characterized by their bold visual style, emotional depth, and intricate narratives, making him a distinctive voice in contemporary cinema.","observation":"The style combines tightly framed, highly detailed portraits with crowded group compositions, vivid red-and-teal color, deep shadows, and pronounced grain. Collage-like poster construction, graphic typography, theatrical makeup, patterned clothing, and surreal visual juxtapositions give the images an intense, unsettling editorial character."},{"id":"ilya-kuvshinov","name":"Ilya Kuvshinov","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ilya Kuvshinov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ilya-kuvshinov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ilya-kuvshinov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","erotic"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","red","dark-red","muted-pink","dark-blue"],"intro":"Ilya Kuvshinov is a contemporary illustrator known for his captivating digital portraits that blend anime aesthetics with a modern illustrative style. His work often features youthful characters with large, expressive eyes and delicate features, drawing inspiration from Japanese pop culture and manga.","observation":"The style uses graphic, illustrative portraiture with crisp dark outlines, selectively visible drawing marks, and simplified yet carefully modelled facial and hair details. Saturated coral-red grounds, deep blue-black hair, sharp shadow bands, and bright highlights create a bold, high-contrast fashion-editorial mood across all four portraits."},{"id":"shohei-otomo","name":"Shohei Otomo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Shohei Otomo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shohei-otomo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shohei-otomo","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","portraits","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Shohei Otomo is a Japanese illustrator known for his intricate and bold black-and-white artworks that often explore themes of contemporary Japanese culture, blending traditional elements with modern influences. His works are characterized by their detailed line work, cultural references, and striking compositions.","observation":"The style combines stark black-and-white portraiture with extremely dense, finely rendered assemblages of faces, costumes, machinery, animals, and fragments. Fine ink-like linework and collage-like layering create surreal mechanical transformations, set against broad areas of white negative space and intensified by hard tonal contrast."},{"id":"sandra-boynton","name":"Sandra Boynton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sandra Boynton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sandra-boynton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sandra-boynton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","cute"],"colours":["bone-white","white","grey","brown","yellow","rust"],"intro":"Sandra Boynton is a renowned American author, illustrator, and humorist known for her whimsical and charming children's books. Her work often features playful animal characters and humorous narratives, appealing to both children and adults. Boynton's style is characterized by its simplicity, warmth, and a touch of silliness, making her a beloved figure in children's literature.","observation":"The style combines loose, fine black outlines with softly textured watercolor-like fills and visible colored-pencil marks. It uses vivid but slightly softened colors, exaggerated eyes, expressive faces, and quirky anthropomorphic animals arranged in playful storybook scenes."},{"id":"jose-royo","name":"Jose Royo","cat":"painters","en":"Jose Royo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jose-royo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jose-royo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["light-orange","muted-ochre","dark-brown","beige","black","red"],"intro":"Jose Royo is a contemporary Spanish painter known for his romantic and impressionistic style. Born in Valencia, Spain, he has gained recognition for his ability to capture light and emotion in his portraits and landscapes. Royo's work often features soft, pastel colors and delicate brushwork, creating a dreamy and serene atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines softly modeled, romantic female portraits with clearly visible layered brushwork and fine strokes in hair, fabric, and skin. Muted warm tones, dark grounds, elaborate garments, and dramatic highlights create an expressive, richly textured painted-illustration effect."},{"id":"bill-watterson","name":"Bill Watterson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bill Watterson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-watterson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-watterson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["pale-orange","ochre","brown","cream","beige","vivid-ochre"],"intro":"Bill Watterson is an American cartoonist best known for creating the comic strip 'Calvin and Hobbes,' which ran from 1985 to 1995. His work is celebrated for its humor, philosophical undertones, and exploration of childhood imagination. Watterson's style is characterized by expressive line work and a blend of simplicity and detail, often depicting the adventures of a young boy and his stuffed tiger.","observation":"The style combines loose watercolor washes and visibly textured paint with strong black ink contours, energetic hatching, and expressive cartoon figures. Warm orange, olive, cream, and blue-green colors create a playful storybook atmosphere across woodland scenes featuring recurring animal characters and fantastical seasonal details."},{"id":"luis-royo","name":"Luis Royo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Luis Royo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luis-royo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luis-royo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-rust","muted-orange","silver","grey"],"intro":"Luis Royo is a renowned Spanish artist known for his distinctive fantasy illustrations, often characterized by dark, sensual themes and detailed depictions of mythical and futuristic worlds. His work has been influential in the realms of fantasy art and has been featured in various publications, book covers, and exhibitions worldwide.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses tightly cropped, highly realistic portraiture with visible fine brushwork and abundant tactile detail in hair, skin, jewelry, and garments. Earthy, desaturated colors, deep shadows, and intense expressions create a dark, forceful fashion-editorial mood, while ornate accessories and rough layered textures heighten the dramatic character."},{"id":"glen-keane","name":"Glen Keane","cat":"illustrators","en":"Glen Keane","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/glen-keane.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/glen-keane","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","comics","drawing"],"colours":["silver","white","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Glen Keane is a renowned American animator, author, and illustrator known for his work with Walt Disney Animation Studios. He played a pivotal role in creating some of the most beloved animated characters, contributing to films such as \"The Little Mermaid,\" \"Beauty and the Beast,\" and \"Aladdin.\" Keane's distinctive style and storytelling have left a lasting impact on the animation industry.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses monochrome graphite-like drawing with abundant fine contour lines, loose exploratory marks, and crosshatched shading. Large expressive eyes, stylized facial proportions, and dramatic hair shapes give the character portraits a comic-like illustrative quality while retaining a visibly hand-sketched surface."},{"id":"jan-berenstain","name":"Jan Berenstain","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jan Berenstain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-berenstain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-berenstain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["dark-olive","olive","orange","light-orange","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Jan Berenstain was an American author and illustrator, best known for co-creating the beloved children's book series, \"The Berenstain Bears,\" alongside her husband, Stan Berenstain. The series, which began in 1962, has become a staple in children's literature, celebrated for its engaging stories and relatable family themes.","observation":"The style is richly detailed and brightly colored, with expressive bear characters and bustling woodland scenes filled with flowers, fruit, trees, and cozy buildings. Clean, heavy ink outlines define the forms, while flat-to-lightly textured illustrative color gives the images a classic storybook clarity and lively movement."},{"id":"dick-bruna","name":"Dick Bruna","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dick Bruna","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dick-bruna.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dick-bruna","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","drawing","cute"],"colours":["vivid-red","dark-green","cream","black","light-orange"],"intro":"Dick Bruna is a renowned Dutch author, artist, and graphic designer, best known for creating the beloved children's character Miffy , a small rabbit. His work is characterized by its simplicity, bold lines, and use of primary colors, making it instantly recognizable and widely influential in the realm of children's literature and illustration.","observation":"The style uses simple, graphic character drawings with thick irregular black outlines, flat areas of saturated colour, and minimal facial features. Repeated rabbit figures are presented in charming everyday vignettes against bold red or green grounds, with a lightly grainy, tactile surface that softens the otherwise clean illustration."},{"id":"terence-donovan","name":"Terence Donovan","cat":"photographers","en":"Terence Donovan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/terence-donovan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/terence-donovan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","fashion","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["black","white","silver"],"intro":"Terence Donovan was a renowned British photographer and filmmaker, celebrated for his influential work in fashion photography during the 1960s. He was a key figure in the 'Swinging London' era, alongside contemporaries like David Bailey and Brian Duffy. Donovan's work is characterized by its bold use of contrast, innovative compositions, and a focus on the glamorous and fashionable.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white studio portraiture with very high contrast, clean pale backgrounds, and deep shadowed clothing. Fashion-editorial styling is emphasized through oversized brimmed hats, sculptural black garments, fur textures, direct gazes, and tightly composed face-focused framing."},{"id":"hsiao-ron-cheng","name":"Hsiao Ron Cheng","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hsiao Ron Cheng","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hsiao-ron-cheng.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hsiao-ron-cheng","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","pastel-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","cream","beige","red","dark-green"],"intro":"Hsiao Ron Cheng is a contemporary Taiwanese illustrator known for her ethereal and whimsical style. Her work often features delicate, dreamlike portraits that blend elements of fantasy and surrealism, drawing inspiration from both traditional and modern Asian aesthetics.","observation":"The style combines highly rendered, softly painterly portraiture with elaborate floral and botanical framing, emphasizing porcelain skin, flowing pale hair, and delicate facial details. A restrained pastel palette, airy backgrounds, and fine decorative textures create a dreamy, ethereal fashion-editorial mood across all four portraits."},{"id":"john-holcroft","name":"John Holcroft","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Holcroft","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-holcroft.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-holcroft","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","charcoal","red","muted-cyan","muted-brown"],"intro":"John Holcroft is a contemporary British illustrator known for his satirical and thought-provoking works that often comment on modern society and consumerism. His illustrations have been featured in various publications, where he uses a distinctive style to convey complex themes through simple yet impactful imagery.","observation":"The style uses clean, fine outlined drawing with flattened but richly varied color fields, strong geometric cropping, and hard-edged shadows. Dense groups of figures and repeated objects are arranged like editorial vignettes, with a restrained retro palette intensified by grainy printed texture and high contrast."},{"id":"andre-franquin","name":"André Franquin","cat":"illustrators","en":"André Franquin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andre-franquin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andre-franquin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","light-orange","black","brown","muted-cyan","ochre"],"intro":"André Franquin is a renowned Belgian comic artist best known for his work on the Spirou et Fantasio series and the creation of the character Gaston Lagaffe. His style is characterized by its humor, dynamic compositions, and expressive characters, making significant contributions to the Franco-Belgian comic tradition.","observation":"The style combines expressive comic characters and adventurous action scenes with loose, energetic ink drawing, fine contour lines, splashes, and dense hatching. Most images use a restrained cream, black, and gray palette, with occasional muted blue and rust-red color, while exaggerated poses and sweeping marks create strong motion."},{"id":"richard-estes","name":"Richard Estes","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Estes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-estes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-estes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","fine-lines","high-contrast"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","bone-white","grey","rust"],"intro":"Richard Estes is an American artist known for his photorealistic paintings, particularly of urban landscapes. Born in 1932, he is a leading figure in the photorealism movement, capturing the intricate details of city life with precision and clarity. His work often features reflective surfaces, such as glass and metal, which add depth and realism to his compositions.","observation":"This style presents densely layered urban streets with highly articulated historic architecture, storefronts, transit, and pedestrians. Fine linear definition, sharp perspective, reflective glass, and strong sun-shadow contrasts give the scenes a richly detailed, almost drawn realism while retaining an expressive, constructed quality."},{"id":"banksy","name":"Banksy","cat":"street-artists","en":"Banksy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/banksy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/banksy","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","charcoal","grey","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Banksy is a pseudonymous England-based street artist known for his satirical and subversive street art. His works often combine dark humor with graffiti executed in a distinctive stenciling technique. Banksy's art has appeared on streets, walls, and bridges across the world, and his identity remains unknown.","observation":"The style combines bold, stencil-like black figures and clean flat color accents with visibly weathered, textured urban walls. Repeated reaching gestures, floating red heart balloons, and sparse wall compositions create expressive movement and a surreal narrative across the four murals."},{"id":"dean-crouser","name":"Dean Crouser","cat":"painters","en":"Dean Crouser","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dean-crouser.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dean-crouser","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["white","grey","dark-red","charcoal","red","orange","blue"],"intro":"Dean Crouser is an American artist known for his vibrant watercolor paintings, often depicting wildlife and nature. His work is characterized by bold colors and expressive brushwork, capturing the essence and energy of his subjects. Crouser's style combines traditional watercolor techniques with a modern, dynamic approach, making his art both visually striking and emotionally resonant.","observation":"Across all four panels, birds and a mammal are rendered with energetic watercolor washes, visible brush marks, pigment blooms, and splattered paint on a largely white ground. Saturated reds, blues, oranges, and purples are combined with fine dark contour marks and expressive, partially dissolved edges, producing vivid animal portraits with a spontaneous handmade feel."},{"id":"jamie-hawkesworth","name":"Jamie Hawkesworth","cat":"photographers","en":"Jamie Hawkesworth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jamie-hawkesworth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jamie-hawkesworth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","white","muted-ochre","bone-white","muted-blue"],"intro":"Jamie Hawkesworth is a British photographer known for his evocative and atmospheric portraiture, often capturing the subtle interplay of light and shadow. His work frequently explores themes of youth and natural beauty, with a focus on intimate and contemplative moments.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed close-up portrait photography with tactile hair, skin, and fabric textures. Muted earthy colors, soft natural light, shallow focus, and intimate asymmetrical framing create a quiet, fashion-editorial mood across the four images."},{"id":"john-currin","name":"John Currin","cat":"painters","en":"John Currin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-currin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-currin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","orange","black","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"John Currin is an American painter known for his provocative and technically skilled works that blend classical techniques with contemporary themes. His art often explores the boundaries of beauty, sexuality, and social norms, drawing inspiration from both historical and modern sources.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses realistic, finely controlled oil-paint handling with visible delicate brushwork, softly modelled faces, and richly textured clothing. Muted romantic colors, decorative fabrics, elaborate collars and sleeves, and formal poses create an ornate classical portrait-and-fashion presentation."},{"id":"molly-brett","name":"Molly Brett","cat":"illustrators","en":"Molly Brett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/molly-brett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/molly-brett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","pale-orange","brown","silver","ochre","red"],"intro":"Molly Brett is a renowned British illustrator known for her enchanting children's book illustrations, often featuring animals and whimsical scenes. Her work is celebrated for its delicate detail and charming portrayal of nature, capturing the imagination of young readers.","observation":"These richly illustrated scenes combine visible fine brushwork and delicate linework with dense botanical detail, decorative surfaces, and saturated floral color. Animals and human figures are woven into fantastical garden and woodland settings, giving the style a storybook quality while maintaining an ornate, hand-painted appearance."},{"id":"akihiko-yoshida","name":"Akihiko Yoshida","cat":"illustrators","en":"Akihiko Yoshida","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/akihiko-yoshida.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/akihiko-yoshida","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","sculptural","characters","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","cream","brown","muted-orange","ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Akihiko Yoshida is a renowned Japanese artist and character designer known for his work in the video game industry, particularly with Square Enix. He has contributed to the visual design of popular games such as \"Final Fantasy Tactics,\" \"Vagrant Story,\" and \"Bravely Default,\" where his distinctive style combines intricate detail with a unique blend of fantasy and realism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines finely drawn, ink-like contours with visible painterly texture, dense ornament, and highly elaborate clothing, hair, armor, and foliage. Restrained cream, charcoal, brown, and red tones create strong light-dark contrast, while elongated fantasy characters and crowded compositions give the images an expressive, storybook quality."},{"id":"ren-hang","name":"Ren Hang","cat":"photographers","en":"Ren Hang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ren-hang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ren-hang","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","floral","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-green","black","green","bone-white","muted-blue"],"intro":"Ren Hang was a Chinese photographer known for his provocative and intimate portraits that often explored themes of sexuality and identity. His work challenged traditional norms and was celebrated for its boldness and unique perspective.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed photographic portraits arranged as intimate overhead tableaux in dense grass and wildflowers. Muted greens and natural skin tones, soft selective focus, and visible film grain create a quiet, dreamy editorial mood, with clothing and vegetation forming rich organic textures around the faces."},{"id":"charles-burns","name":"Charles Burns","cat":"illustrators","en":"Charles Burns","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-burns.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-burns","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink"],"colours":["grey","black","white","charcoal","bone-white"],"intro":"Charles Burns is an American cartoonist and illustrator known for his distinctive black-and-white style and contributions to graphic novels and comics. His work often explores themes of suburban life, psychological tension, and the surreal, with a strong influence from pop culture and pulp fiction. Burns's illustrations are characterized by their meticulous detail, bold lines, and a sense of dark humor, making him a prominent figure in the world of underground comix and graphic storytelling.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses stark black-and-white ink illustration with fine contour lines, dense hatching, stippling, and sharply blocked shadows. It focuses on tightly cropped, expressive portraits, combining graphic clarity with surreal facial distortions and patterned clothing."},{"id":"kazuo-umezu","name":"Kazuo Umezu","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kazuo Umezu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kazuo-umezu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kazuo-umezu","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","ink"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","vivid-red","deep-red","muted-blue","orange"],"intro":"Kazuo Umezu is a renowned Japanese manga artist and writer, celebrated for his influential work in the horror genre. Known for his unique storytelling and distinctive art style, Umezu has left a lasting impact on both manga and horror enthusiasts worldwide.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses densely packed comic-like portrait imagery with fine ink contours, crosshatched shading, and sharply bounded blocks of saturated red, blue, black, and cream. Enlarged eyes, fragmented faces, grotesque figures, and distorted expressions create an intense surreal-horror mood, while the repeated linework and flat graphic color unify the collage-like compositions."},{"id":"sara-riches","name":"Sara Riches","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sara Riches","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sara-riches.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sara-riches","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["light-orange","silver","muted-ochre","bone-white","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Sara Riches is an illustrator known for her intricate and emotive portraiture that blends elements of fantasy and surrealism. Her work often explores themes of nature and mythology, creating a unique and introspective visual narrative.","observation":"The style combines finely drawn ink contours with visible watercolor-like washes, translucent shading, and textured paper, giving the portraits a handmade, painterly character. Repeated close-up figures, animals, loose strands, and partially unfinished outlines create an expressive, dreamlike collage with restrained cream, ochre, gray, and rust-red tones."},{"id":"jim-fitzpatrick","name":"Jim Fitzpatrick","cat":"painters","en":"Jim Fitzpatrick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-fitzpatrick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-fitzpatrick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","muted-orange","deep-red","black","vivid-red","ochre","blue"],"intro":"Jim Fitzpatrick is an Irish artist known for his intricate and vibrant artwork, often inspired by Celtic mythology and folklore. His work is characterized by detailed linework and vivid colors, capturing the essence of mythical and historical themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly saturated colors, assertive dark contour lines, and densely packed ornamental patterning to create elaborate close-up character portraits. Faces, costumes, jewelry, headdresses, and floral or textile motifs merge into a vivid fantasy tableau with strong graphic contrast and expressive poses."},{"id":"mary-delany","name":"Mary Delany","cat":"painters","en":"Mary Delany","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-delany.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-delany","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","dark-red","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Mary Delany was an 18th-century English artist known for her exquisite botanical collages. She is celebrated for creating intricate paper mosaics that depict flowers with remarkable detail and accuracy, blending art with scientific observation.","observation":"Across all four renders, flowers and foliage are rendered with visible fine brushwork, layered texture, and carefully observed botanical detail against a nearly black ground. The restrained dark palette is punctuated by saturated reds, pinks, oranges, and whites, with strong light-dark separation and densely arranged ornamental plant forms."},{"id":"james-thurber","name":"James Thurber","cat":"illustrators","en":"James Thurber","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-thurber.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-thurber","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","comics","drawing","ink","funny"],"colours":["white","silver","grey"],"intro":"James Thurber was an American cartoonist, author, and humorist known for his contributions to \"The New Yorker\" magazine. His work often featured whimsical and satirical illustrations, capturing the absurdities of everyday life with a humorous twist. Thurber's style is characterized by simple yet expressive line drawings that convey a sense of wit and irony.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses crisp black ink on white paper, with confident contour lines, selective crosshatching, and simplified but expressive caricatural figures. Everyday encounters between formally dressed people and birds are staged as humorous visual vignettes, balancing sparse backgrounds with densely worked faces, clothing, and furnishings."},{"id":"paul-jenkins","name":"Paul Jenkins","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Jenkins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-jenkins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-jenkins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["vivid-red","bone-white","dark-blue","black","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Paul Jenkins was an American abstract expressionist painter known for his use of vibrant colors and fluid forms. He was a prominent figure in the 20th-century art scene, often associated with the New York School. Jenkins's work is characterized by his innovative techniques, including the use of poured paint to create dynamic, flowing compositions that explore the interplay of color and light.","observation":"Across all four panels, saturated red, navy, coral, and pale ground are worked into forceful abstract compositions through broad, visibly dragged brushstrokes and built-up paint. Sweeping diagonals, curved gestures, splatters, and sharp dark-light contrasts create a kinetic, expressive surface with fluid, almost otherworldly forms."},{"id":"bertil-nilsson","name":"Bertil Nilsson","cat":"photographers","en":"Bertil Nilsson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bertil-nilsson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bertil-nilsson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","motion","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","white","pale-blue","muted-blue","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Bertil Nilsson is a contemporary photographer known for his exploration of the human form and movement. His work often intersects with dance and performance art, capturing the fluidity and grace of the human body in motion. Nilsson's photography is characterized by a keen attention to detail and a minimalist aesthetic, often utilizing natural landscapes and urban environments as backdrops.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic environmental imagery with solitary faceless figures wrapped in voluminous fabric, posed dramatically against stark cliffs and open water. A subdued blue-gray atmosphere, heavy shadows, misty air, and occasional red or orange fire accents create a dark, theatrical sense of movement and menace."},{"id":"mary-blair","name":"Mary Blair","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mary Blair","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-blair.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-blair","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","red","muted-cyan","bone-white","olive"],"intro":"Mary Blair is a renowned American artist and illustrator known for her work with The Walt Disney Company. She played a significant role in the visual development of classic films such as \"Cinderella,\" \"Alice in Wonderland,\" and \"Peter Pan.\" Blair's distinct style, characterized by vibrant colors and imaginative designs, has left a lasting impact on animation and children's literature.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured brushwork combines with bold outlines, geometric shapes, and strongly saturated colors. Dense floral and animal motifs, theatrical figures, dark grounds, and decorative framing create an ornate, expressive storybook world with a dreamy fairytale atmosphere."},{"id":"annie-soudain","name":"Annie Soudain","cat":"painters","en":"Annie Soudain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/annie-soudain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/annie-soudain","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","landscapes","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-brown","grey","light-orange","silver","rust"],"intro":"Annie Soudain is a contemporary British artist known for her vibrant and intricate linocut prints that often explore themes of nature and the countryside. Her work is celebrated for its detailed patterns and use of color, capturing the essence of rural landscapes and flora.","observation":"The style combines highly visible directional brushwork with crisp illustrative contours, flat color blocks, and dense decorative line patterns. Across the landscapes, saturated orange, blue, cream, and dark green create strong contrast, while repeated trees, grasses, hills, and horses are rendered with expressive, finely articulated marks."},{"id":"eric-carle","name":"Eric Carle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Eric Carle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-carle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-carle","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","cute","geometric"],"colours":["white","green","dark-green","olive","vivid-red","orange"],"intro":"Eric Carle is a renowned American author and illustrator, best known for his children's books featuring colorful and imaginative illustrations. His most famous work, \"The Very Hungry Caterpillar,\" has captivated young readers worldwide with its unique collage technique and vibrant visuals. Carle's style is characterized by its playful and educational themes, often incorporating animals and nature.","observation":"The style combines brightly saturated, hand-painted textures with bold, simplified cutout-like forms and expressive visible brushwork. Repeated caterpillar characters use geometric leaf segments, strong outlines, playful faces, and radiating marks in loosely arranged illustrative scenes."},{"id":"jack-sorenson","name":"Jack Sorenson","cat":"painters","en":"Jack Sorenson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-sorenson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-sorenson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","muted-blue","muted-rust","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Jack Sorenson is an American artist known for his realistic portrayals of the American West. His works often capture the spirit of cowboy culture, frontier life, and the natural beauty of rural landscapes. Sorenson's paintings are celebrated for their attention to detail and ability to evoke a sense of nostalgia and romance associated with the Western genre.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses energetic, visibly layered brushwork to depict riders and horses in sweeping wilderness settings. Saturated blue, copper, orange, and earth tones, dramatic cloud formations, and strong directional light create an epic cinematic sense of motion and scale."},{"id":"howard-behrens","name":"Howard Behrens","cat":"painters","en":"Howard Behrens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howard-behrens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howard-behrens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","silver","brown","dark-blue","rust"],"intro":"Howard Behrens is known for his vibrant and expressive paintings, often depicting idyllic landscapes and coastal scenes. His work is characterized by the use of a palette knife, creating textured surfaces that capture the light and atmosphere of the Mediterranean. Behrens's art is celebrated for its ability to evoke a sense of place and emotion, drawing viewers into the serene and colorful worlds he portrays.","observation":"These scenes use visible, broad painterly strokes to build bright coastal architecture, shimmering water, dense foliage, and abundant flowers. Strong sunlight, saturated blues and warm terracotta tones, layered seaside vistas, and decorative village details create an expressive, dreamlike Mediterranean atmosphere."},{"id":"vicki-boutin","name":"Vicki Boutin","cat":"designers","en":"Vicki Boutin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vicki-boutin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vicki-boutin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["brown","red","bone-white","vivid-red","muted-teal","ochre"],"intro":"Vicki Boutin is a contemporary mixed media artist and designer known for her vibrant and expressive artworks. She often incorporates a variety of materials and techniques to create rich, layered compositions that celebrate color and texture. Her work is widely appreciated in the crafting and art journaling communities.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines intensely saturated floral imagery with layered mixed-media surfaces, visible brushwork, ink-like outlines, stencilled marks, and collage-like overlaps. Dense decorative detail and bold graphic shapes create an exuberant, tactile, hand-painted appearance."},{"id":"katie-scott","name":"Katie Scott","cat":"illustrators","en":"Katie Scott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/katie-scott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/katie-scott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","fine-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","light-orange","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Katie Scott is a contemporary illustrator known for her intricate and nature-inspired artwork. Her work often features detailed botanical elements and whimsical compositions, drawing inspiration from both scientific illustration and modern surrealism.","observation":"The style combines densely layered botanical and animal imagery with fine, dark outlines and carefully modeled illustrative color. Rich foliage, flowers, birds, fruit, and butterflies fill the compositions in an ornate natural-history-tattoo aesthetic, balancing deep greens and blacks with vivid reds, creams, and coral tones."},{"id":"leone-frollo","name":"Leone Frollo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Leone Frollo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leone-frollo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leone-frollo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["orange","dark-red","bone-white","black","dark-brown","dark-blue"],"intro":"Leone Frollo was an Italian comic book artist known for his work in erotic and fantasy genres. Born in 1931, he gained recognition for his distinctive style that combined sensuality with detailed illustration. Frollo's work often featured strong, expressive characters and was characterized by its intricate line work and romantic themes.","observation":"The style uses sharply outlined, graphic illustrations with flat yet richly colored areas, strong black accents, and selectively detailed textures in fabrics, feathers, jewelry, and hair. Repeated glamorous female portraits, dramatic cropping, ornate evening clothing, and saturated reds create a polished vintage fashion-poster effect."},{"id":"frieke-janssens","name":"Frieke Janssens","cat":"photographers","en":"Frieke Janssens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frieke-janssens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frieke-janssens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-olive","brown","black","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Frieke Janssens is a contemporary photographer known for her distinctive style that often blends surreal and whimsical elements with classical influences. Her work frequently explores themes of childhood, fantasy, and nostalgia, creating images that are both imaginative and thought-provoking.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, carefully staged portraits with elaborate floral headpieces, lace garments, feathers, and live or mounted animals. Muted sage, cream, rust, and dark green tones, ornate interiors, selective dramatic cropping, and uncanny pairings create a dreamy, surreal editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"albert-irvin","name":"Albert Irvin","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Irvin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-irvin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-irvin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["vivid-red","pink","deep-blue","ochre","vivid-pink","dark-blue"],"intro":"Albert Irvin is a renowned British abstract painter known for his vibrant and dynamic works. Born in London in 1922, Irvin became a prominent figure in the post-war art scene, celebrated for his bold use of color and energetic compositions. His works often feature large canvases filled with expressive brushstrokes and geometric forms, reflecting a deep engagement with the possibilities of abstract expressionism.","observation":"Across all four panels, vivid saturated paint is layered in energetic abstract blocks, arcs, streaks, and drips. Broad, visibly directional brushwork, rough edges, and overlapping marks create a tactile, expressive sense of motion."},{"id":"clyde-caldwell","name":"Clyde Caldwell","cat":"illustrators","en":"Clyde Caldwell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clyde-caldwell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clyde-caldwell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-orange","rust","dark-blue","pink"],"intro":"Clyde Caldwell is an American artist known for his work in fantasy art, particularly in the realms of role-playing games and book covers. His illustrations often feature strong, heroic characters set in mythical and fantastical landscapes, blending realism with imaginative elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly visible, energetic brushwork with richly layered surfaces, strong dark-to-light contrasts, and saturated orange, blue, purple, and red accents. It presents tightly composed heroic fantasy characters and creatures with ornate armor, weapons, fur, and dramatic firelit or shadowed backgrounds."},{"id":"juergen-teller","name":"Juergen Teller","cat":"photographers","en":"Juergen Teller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/juergen-teller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/juergen-teller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["bone-white","white","ochre","dark-brown","black","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Juergen Teller is a renowned German photographer known for his candid and often provocative style. His work spans fashion, portraiture, and fine art, characterized by its raw and unfiltered aesthetic. Teller's photography often blurs the lines between commercial and personal, capturing moments that are both intimate and revealing. His distinctive approach has made him a significant figure in contemporary photography, influencing both the art world and popular culture.","observation":"The style is photorealistic and editorial, built around intimate portraits with close, sometimes cropped framing and candid interactions with animals. Soft natural light, selective focus, subdued warm colors, visible film grain, and occasional deep shadows give the images a nostalgic cinematic texture."},{"id":"takehiko-inoue","name":"Takehiko Inoue","cat":"illustrators","en":"Takehiko Inoue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/takehiko-inoue.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/takehiko-inoue","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Takehiko Inoue is a renowned Japanese manga artist known for his works such as \"Slam Dunk\" and \"Vagabond.\" His storytelling and artistic skills have earned him a significant place in the manga industry, where he is celebrated for his detailed and expressive illustrations.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed black-and-white ink drawing with fine contour work, dense hatching, rough textural marks, and stark tonal contrast. Large expressive character portraits alternate with dramatic action tableaux, creating a grim, monumental atmosphere centered on weathered figures, blades, smoke, and desolate settings."},{"id":"sophie-gamand","name":"Sophie Gamand","cat":"photographers","en":"Sophie Gamand","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sophie-gamand.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sophie-gamand","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","fashion","portraits","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-cyan","bone-white","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Sophie Gamand is a renowned French photographer known for her captivating and whimsical portraits, often focusing on themes of beauty and nature. Her work frequently explores the relationship between humans and animals, capturing the essence of her subjects with a unique blend of humor and tenderness. Gamand's photography has been widely celebrated for its artistic depth and emotional resonance.","observation":"The style presents dogs as carefully staged formal portraits, rendered with highly realistic fur, facial detail, and tactile costume surfaces. Elaborate feathers, pearls, lace, flowers, and brocade are set against restrained studio backgrounds, with controlled directional lighting and a subdued, theatrical palette."},{"id":"adonna-khare","name":"Adonna Khare","cat":"painters","en":"Adonna Khare","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adonna-khare.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adonna-khare","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","black"],"intro":"Adonna Khare is an American artist known for her intricate pencil drawings that often feature fantastical animals and surreal scenes. Her work is characterized by a high level of detail and a whimsical, imaginative style that draws viewers into her unique world.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, monochrome-to-sepia illustration with delicate ink-like linework, fine hatching, and softly modeled graphite textures. It combines woodland landscapes, animal portraits, and fantastical human-animal tableaux into dense, dreamlike storybook scenes with atmospheric forest depth and richly textured fur, feathers, bark, and foliage."},{"id":"john-twachtman","name":"John Twachtman","cat":"painters","en":"John Twachtman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-twachtman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-twachtman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","silver","black","beige","muted-blue","ochre"],"intro":"John Twachtman was an American Impressionist painter known for his landscapes and use of soft, atmospheric effects. Born in 1853, Twachtman studied in Europe and was influenced by both French Impressionism and the Tonalism movement. His work often features serene natural scenes, capturing the subtle interplay of light and color.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible layered brushwork and soft, broken strokes to build tranquil lakeside and woodland landscapes. Subdued blue-green, brown, and ochre colors, reflective water, atmospheric distance, and loosely articulated details create a dreamy, expressive pastoral mood."},{"id":"linda-ravenscroft","name":"Linda Ravenscroft","cat":"illustrators","en":"Linda Ravenscroft","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/linda-ravenscroft.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/linda-ravenscroft","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-olive","muted-ochre","dark-olive","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Linda Ravenscroft is a renowned British artist known for her detailed and enchanting fantasy illustrations. Her work often draws inspiration from nature, mythology, and folklore, creating a whimsical and ethereal world that captivates viewers with its intricate details and vivid imagery.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, painterly animal imagery with dense floral ornament and richly layered foliage. Symmetrical medallion-like arrangements, fine contour work, saturated reds and greens, and decorative curved forms give the pictures an elaborate botanical-emblematic character."},{"id":"gerd-arntz","name":"Gerd Arntz","cat":"printmakers","en":"Gerd Arntz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerd-arntz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerd-arntz","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","minimalist","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","geometric","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["white","black","grey","silver"],"intro":"Gerd Arntz was a German artist known for his work in the field of graphic design, particularly for his collaboration with Otto Neurath in developing the ISOTYPE visual language. Arntz created over 4,000 pictograms that were used to convey complex information in a simplified and accessible manner. His work is characterized by its clarity, precision, and the use of bold, geometric shapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black silhouettes on an almost entirely white ground, reducing people, animals, buildings, and objects to bold, recognizable shapes. Clean graphic contours, flat fills, geometric simplification, and generous negative space create a minimalist pictographic look while varied gestures and interactions provide simple visual narratives."},{"id":"josh-kirby","name":"Josh Kirby","cat":"illustrators","en":"Josh Kirby","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josh-kirby.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josh-kirby","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","motion","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","epic","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-blue","dark-brown","beige","orange","yellow"],"intro":"Josh Kirby is a renowned British artist known for his vibrant and imaginative illustrations, particularly in the realm of science fiction and fantasy. He gained fame for his work on the covers of Terry Pratchett's Discworld series, where his detailed and whimsical style brought the fantastical elements of the stories to life.","observation":"A richly painterly style builds vast fantasy worlds from visible brush texture, saturated contrasting colour, and dense layers of small creatures, architecture, terrain, and atmospheric forms. Monumental figures and landscapes are arranged in sweeping, energetic compositions that combine cosmic scenery, floating cities, volcanic skies, and surreal architectural detail."},{"id":"saul-bass","name":"Saul Bass","cat":"designers","en":"Saul Bass","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/saul-bass.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/saul-bass","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","silhouette"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","dark-red","pale-orange"],"intro":"Saul Bass is a renowned American graphic designer and filmmaker, celebrated for his iconic work in film title sequences and corporate logos. His innovative approach to design, characterized by simplicity and clarity, revolutionized the way visual storytelling was integrated into cinema and branding. Bass's work includes collaborations with Alfred Hitchcock , Stanley Kubrick , and Martin Scorsese , and his influence extends across various design disciplines.","observation":"The style uses stark black silhouettes and hard-edged red fields, with bold graphic contours, simplified flat shapes, and extreme scale contrasts between monumental body fragments and tiny figures. Grainy distressed texture and surreal visual juxtapositions give the poster-like compositions a raw, ominous intensity."},{"id":"aboudia","name":"Aboudia","cat":"painters","en":"Aboudia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aboudia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aboudia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","charcoal","muted-ochre","muted-blue","rust","vivid-rust","deep-blue"],"intro":"Aboudia is an Ivorian contemporary artist known for his vibrant and expressive paintings that often depict urban life and social issues. His works are characterized by a raw, energetic style that combines elements of street art and traditional African influences, creating a unique visual language that speaks to themes of identity and post-colonial experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, flattened, mask-like characters are built from saturated color blocks, rough brushwork, and emphatic black linework. Scratches, drips, layered marks, and irregular facial features create a dense, energetic painted surface with a recurring surreal, improvised character language."},{"id":"sergei-parajanov","name":"Sergei Parajanov","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Sergei Parajanov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sergei-parajanov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sergei-parajanov","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","ochre","dark-green","dark-rust","beige"],"intro":"Sergei Parajanov was a Soviet film director and artist known for his visually rich and non-linear narrative style. His works often drew upon Armenian and Georgian cultural motifs and folklore, creating a unique cinematic language that defied the conventions of Soviet cinema. Parajanov's films are celebrated for their vivid imagery, intricate set designs, and symbolic storytelling.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic portraiture in a crowded theatrical setting, with performers surrounded by painted masks, brocade costumes, towering hats, and reflective ornaments. Rich but restrained warm colors, deep shadows, strong highlights, and close cinematic framing create a dark, ceremonial atmosphere. Dense textile patterns and elaborate dress make the images feel ornate and historically theatrical."},{"id":"eiichiro-oda","name":"Eiichiro Oda","cat":"illustrators","en":"Eiichiro Oda","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eiichiro-oda.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eiichiro-oda","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","black","pale-orange","rust","grey"],"intro":"Eiichiro Oda is a renowned Japanese manga artist best known for creating the popular series \"One Piece.\" His work is characterized by its imaginative storytelling, unique character designs, and intricate world-building, which have captivated audiences worldwide.","observation":"The style is a densely packed comic illustration built from heavy ink contours, expressive faces, energetic poses, and numerous small costume, creature, and prop details. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and ochres sit against deep shadows, giving the fantastical character scenes a vivid, high-contrast presence."},{"id":"raimonds-staprans","name":"Raimonds Staprans","cat":"painters","en":"Raimonds Staprans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raimonds-staprans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raimonds-staprans","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-blue","dark-teal","dark-blue","vivid-red","pale-orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Raimonds Staprans is a Latvian-American painter known for his abstract and minimalist landscapes and still lifes. His work often features bold colors and geometric forms, capturing the interplay of light and space in a unique and contemplative manner.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad visible brushwork combines with hard-edged geometric planes and strongly saturated red, blue, teal, and ochre color. Spacious compositions use horizontal bands, angular architecture, and simplified landscapes, with small figures and objects set against expansive areas of sky, water, or wall."},{"id":"paul-rader","name":"Paul Rader","cat":"illustrators","en":"Paul Rader","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-rader.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-rader","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["ochre","pale-yellow","black","dark-brown","red","muted-green"],"intro":"Paul Rader is a renowned American illustrator known for his work in the mid-20th century, particularly in the realm of pulp fiction and paperback covers. His art is characterized by its vivid and bold portrayals of characters, often featuring glamorous and sensuous women in dramatic and intriguing scenarios. Rader's illustrations are celebrated for their detailed and painterly style, capturing the essence of the era's pop culture and societal norms.","observation":"Across all four panels, glamorous couples and intimate social moments are rendered with recognizable faces, stylized clothing, and tightly cropped portrait compositions. Visible directional brushwork, warm flesh tones, saturated reds and teals, and strong light-dark modeling create a polished yet expressive painted illustration with a mid-century glamour feel."},{"id":"gustav-adolf-mossa","name":"Gustav-Adolf Mossa","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gustav-Adolf Mossa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustav-adolf-mossa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustav-adolf-mossa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","subdued-colors","classical","retro","geometric"],"colours":["beige","grey","charcoal","bone-white","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Gustav-Adolf Mossa was a French Symbolist painter and illustrator, known for his intricate and detailed works that often explored themes of mythology, fantasy, and the surreal. His art is characterized by a blend of Art Nouveau and Symbolism, with a focus on elaborate compositions and rich, imaginative narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed illustrative drawing with fine dark contours, flattened color areas, and dense ornamental patterning. Restrained blue-gray, cream, brown, and rust tones unify fashion figures, decorated interiors, and urban architecture into a richly layered, vintage-looking composition."},{"id":"richard-diebenkorn","name":"Richard Diebenkorn","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Diebenkorn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-diebenkorn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-diebenkorn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["pale-yellow","muted-blue","muted-cyan","muted-ochre","dark-olive","orange"],"intro":"Richard Diebenkorn is an American painter known for his contributions to the Bay Area Figurative Movement and Abstract Expressionism. His work often combines elements of abstraction with representational imagery, creating a unique fusion that has influenced many contemporary artists.","observation":"The style combines visibly brushed, weathered paint with carefully drawn fine construction lines and broad geometric divisions. Muted coastal blues, greens, creams, and ochres organize simplified rural and seaside landscapes into layered, slightly unreal panel-like compositions."},{"id":"peter-coulson","name":"Peter Coulson","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Coulson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-coulson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-coulson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Peter Coulson is a renowned Australian photographer known for his striking black and white portraiture. His work often focuses on fashion and beauty, capturing the essence of his subjects with a distinctive style that blends glamour with fine art.","observation":"A realistic monochrome portrait style built around tightly framed female faces, with one full-body fashion pose, dramatic shadows, and strong tonal contrast. Windblown hair, textured black garments, selective focus, and expressive gazes create a dark, cinematic editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"emil-melmoth","name":"Emil Melmoth","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Emil Melmoth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emil-melmoth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emil-melmoth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","high-contrast","subdued-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Emil Melmoth is a contemporary artist known for his dark and surreal sculptures that often explore themes of decay, transformation, and identity. His work is characterized by intricate detailing and a haunting atmosphere, drawing inspiration from gothic and fantasy art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents tightly framed humanoid portraits with highly modeled, tactile surfaces and dense insectoid or mechanical adornment. Muted earthy materials, deep near-black backgrounds, controlled highlights, and realistic dimensional rendering create a dark, fantastical science-fiction character-study aesthetic."},{"id":"dimitry-roulland","name":"Dimitry Roulland","cat":"photographers","en":"Dimitry Roulland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dimitry-roulland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dimitry-roulland","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","mist","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","grey","silver","orange"],"intro":"Dimitry Roulland is a contemporary photographer known for his captivating and adventurous imagery that often blends urban and natural landscapes. His work is characterized by a unique ability to capture motion and emotion, creating a sense of narrative and exploration.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic photography with softly muted, moody color grading, selective focus, and glowing practical lights reflected on wet surfaces. Across the scenes, flowing white garments and expressive ballet poses create a sense of motion against richly detailed urban streets and ruined interiors, often softened by rain or atmospheric haze."},{"id":"joey-chou","name":"Joey Chou","cat":"illustrators","en":"Joey Chou","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joey-chou.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joey-chou","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","glow","flat-color","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic","geometric"],"colours":["blue","charcoal","silver","muted-green","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Joey Chou is a contemporary illustrator known for his vibrant and whimsical style, often drawing inspiration from childhood memories and fantasy worlds. His work is characterized by bright colors, playful compositions, and a sense of wonder, making it popular in children's literature and animation.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, storybook illustration with vivid, cleanly blocked colors and fantastical landscapes populated by small narrative figures. Monumental trees, castles, flowers, water, and luminous atmospheric accents create a dreamy, expansive fairytale world across every render."},{"id":"kestutis-kasparavicius","name":"Kestutis Kasparavicius","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kestutis Kasparavicius","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kestutis-kasparavicius.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kestutis-kasparavicius","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","retro","drawing"],"colours":["muted-yellow","ochre","brown","muted-olive","rust","bone-white"],"intro":"Kestutis Kasparavicius is a Lithuanian illustrator and author known for his charming and whimsical children's books. His works often feature anthropomorphic animals and intricate, detailed illustrations that captivate both young and adult audiences.","observation":"These images use richly textured, hand-painted storybook illustration with fine outlines, softly weathered surfaces, and a restrained earthy palette. Dense urban vignettes combine anthropomorphic animals, human figures, market activity, old masonry, tiled roofs, and whimsical period details into lively scenes."},{"id":"chip-zdarsky","name":"Chip Zdarsky","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chip Zdarsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chip-zdarsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chip-zdarsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-orange","dark-brown","ochre","grey","red"],"intro":"Chip Zdarsky is a Canadian comic book artist and writer known for his work on titles like \"Sex Criminals\" and \"Daredevil.\" He has gained recognition for his unique storytelling and artistic style, contributing significantly to the modern comic book landscape.","observation":"The style combines graphic, ink-like contour lines and hatching with visibly textured, broad painted strokes and layered, weathered surfaces. Saturated reds, teals, oranges, and deep shadows create a high-contrast, expressive urban mood across portraits, street scenes, murals, and groups of figures."},{"id":"dick-giordano","name":"Dick Giordano","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dick Giordano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dick-giordano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dick-giordano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","pale-orange","ochre","rust","grey","teal"],"intro":"Dick Giordano was an influential American comic book artist and editor, known for his work with DC Comics. He played a significant role in shaping the superhero genre, contributing to the visual style and storytelling of iconic characters. Giordano's work is celebrated for its dynamic composition and expressive line work, which have left a lasting impact on the world of comics.","observation":"The style combines painterly brush texture with bold, ink-like contouring, dense hatching, and strongly modeled faces and costumes. Saturated red, blue, turquoise, cream, and black create high-contrast retro comic imagery, alternating dramatic portraits with crowded superhero action scenes."},{"id":"maira-kalman","name":"Maira Kalman","cat":"painters","en":"Maira Kalman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maira-kalman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maira-kalman","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","animals","characters","fashion","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["pale-red","red","black","dark-olive","olive","blue"],"intro":"Maira Kalman is an American illustrator, writer, and designer known for her whimsical and narrative style. Her work often features vibrant colors, playful characters, and a unique blend of humor and thoughtfulness. Kalman has illustrated numerous books and contributed to publications like The New Yorker, capturing everyday moments with a distinctive charm.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible broad brushwork and strongly simplified, graphic forms to depict fashionable women alongside dogs in colorful everyday vignettes. Saturated pinks, reds, blues, greens, and oranges are arranged in large flat color fields, while expressive painted marks retain a lively handmade surface."},{"id":"alejandro-gonzalez-inarritu","name":"Alejandro Gonzalez Inarritu","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Alejandro Gonzalez Inarritu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alejandro-gonzalez-inarritu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alejandro-gonzalez-inarritu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","dark-brown","muted-ochre","vivid-orange","red"],"intro":"Alejandro Gonzalez Inarritu is a renowned Mexican filmmaker known for his innovative and immersive storytelling. He has received numerous accolades for his work, including Academy Awards for films like \"Birdman\" and \"The Revenant.\" His films often explore themes of human struggle, interconnectedness, and existential questions, characterized by a distinctive visual style and emotional depth.","observation":"The style centers on intensely expressive male portraits and character moments, rendered with visible painterly texture, fine strokes, and richly weathered skin. Moody teal, rust, amber, and monochrome passages combine with strong contrast, dramatic close cropping, glowing background accents, and cinematic emotional tension."},{"id":"j-c-leyendecker","name":"J. C. Leyendecker","cat":"painters","en":"J. C. Leyendecker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/j-c-leyendecker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/j-c-leyendecker","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","pale-yellow","muted-ochre","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"J. C. Leyendecker was an influential American illustrator, renowned for his work on magazine covers and advertisements during the early 20th century. His distinctive style, characterized by elegant compositions and idealized figures, made him one of the most popular artists of his time. Leyendecker's illustrations often featured themes of American lifestyle and fashion, capturing the essence of the era with a unique blend of realism and stylization.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, broad painterly strokes to model expressive figures, clothing, hair, and flowers, combining descriptive illustration with rich surface texture. Warm creams, browns, blacks, and rust accents create a subdued but strongly contrasted palette, while tight portrait-like cropping and theatrical poses give the scenes an intimate fashion-editorial character."},{"id":"sandro-botticelli","name":"Sandro Botticelli","cat":"painters","en":"Sandro Botticelli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sandro-botticelli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sandro-botticelli","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["black","ochre","dark-brown","muted-orange","dark-olive","grey"],"intro":"Sandro Botticelli was an Italian painter of the Early Renaissance , renowned for his contributions to the Florentine school of painting. His most famous works include \"The Birth of Venus\" and \"Primavera,\" which exemplify his mastery of line, composition, and mythological themes. Botticelli's art is characterized by its graceful figures, flowing lines, and a delicate balance between realism and idealism.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces and figures are rendered with layered oil-paint texture, delicate brushwork, and highly articulated hair, skin, foliage, and fabric. The restrained earthy palette, botanical adornment, decorative surfaces, and mythic presentation give the portraits a classical yet fantastical character."},{"id":"guillem-h-pongiluppi","name":"Guillem H. Pongiluppi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Guillem H. Pongiluppi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guillem-h-pongiluppi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guillem-h-pongiluppi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","muted-cyan","brown","red"],"intro":"Guillem H. Pongiluppi is a contemporary artist known for his detailed and imaginative illustrations, often exploring themes of fantasy and science fiction. His work is characterized by a strong narrative element, bringing to life epic scenes and mythical creatures with a cinematic quality.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic environmental imagery with immense dark landscapes, imposing rock formations, and tiny solitary figures or vessels to create overwhelming scale. A cold teal atmosphere, dense haze, deep shadows, and selective orange-red or amber light produce a bleak yet fantastical sense of danger and discovery."},{"id":"jan-brett","name":"Jan Brett","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jan Brett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-brett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-brett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver","ochre","pale-orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Jan Brett is a renowned American illustrator and children's book author, celebrated for her detailed and whimsical illustrations that often draw inspiration from folklore and nature. Her works are characterized by intricate linework, vivid colors, and a rich storytelling quality that captivates both children and adults alike.","observation":"The style combines richly visible paint texture with fine illustrative linework, densely rendering fur, feathers, foliage, snow, and fabric. Saturated woodland colors and storybook-like animal gatherings create a detailed, gentle fantasy atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"eugenio-recuenco","name":"Eugenio Recuenco","cat":"photographers","en":"Eugenio Recuenco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eugenio-recuenco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eugenio-recuenco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","fashion","scenes","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","muted-olive","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Eugenio Recuenco is a renowned Spanish photographer known for his distinctive narrative style and cinematic approach. His work often blends elements of fantasy and surrealism, creating visually compelling stories that captivate the viewer. Recuenco's photography is characterized by its elaborate sets, intricate costumes, and a strong sense of drama, often drawing comparisons to the works of filmmakers and other visual artists.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds richly staged interior tableaux from period clothing, ornate furniture, birdcages, and birds, with dense environmental detail and a cinematic sense of narrative. Deep green-brown hues, strong pools of window and lamplight, selective focus, and shadow-heavy contrast create a dark, atmospheric, dreamlike theatricality."},{"id":"hendrik-kerstens","name":"Hendrik Kerstens","cat":"photographers","en":"Hendrik Kerstens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hendrik-kerstens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hendrik-kerstens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","dark-blue"],"intro":"Hendrik Kerstens is a contemporary Dutch photographer known for his evocative portraits that often draw inspiration from the Dutch Golden Age. His work is characterized by a unique blend of historical and modern elements, creating a bridge between past and present through his meticulous attention to detail and composition.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, studio-lit portraiture with restrained black, white, and charcoal tones against dark backgrounds. Its visual identity comes from dramatic sculptural garments and headwear⁠—veils, hoods, pleated collars, and fur⁠—rendered with crisp textile detail and strong tonal contrast."},{"id":"m-c-escher","name":"M. C. Escher","cat":"illustrators","en":"M. C. Escher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/m-c-escher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/m-c-escher","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","characters","urban","motion","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","ink","dreamy","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","bone-white","charcoal","beige","grey","white"],"intro":"M. C. Escher was a Dutch graphic artist known for his mathematically inspired woodcuts, lithographs, and mezzotints. His work features explorations of infinity, architecture, and tessellations, often creating mind-bending optical illusions and impossible constructions. Escher's art is celebrated for its meticulous detail and imaginative complexity, blending art with mathematical concepts.","observation":"Across all four images, dense ink linework and crosshatched shading render highly detailed, monochrome scenes with strong tonal contrast. Repeated figures, birds, and buildings are arranged into radial or spherical structures, combining geometric symmetry with impossible perspectives and dreamlike motion."},{"id":"pedro-almodovar","name":"Pedro Almodovar","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Pedro Almodovar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pedro-almodovar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pedro-almodovar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["vivid-red","deep-red","black","dark-brown","orange","beige","dark-blue"],"intro":"Pedro Almodovar is a renowned Spanish filmmaker known for his vibrant and provocative films that often explore themes of identity, sexuality, and family. His work is characterized by its bold colors, complex characters, and intricate narratives, making him a significant figure in contemporary cinema.","observation":"The style combines saturated red-led color blocking with visible, energetic brushwork and strong dark outlines. It presents tightly cropped, expressive fashion portraits with oversized sunglasses, patterned garments, and repeated graphic motifs, balancing illustrative flat shapes against richly textured painted surfaces."},{"id":"tyrus-wong","name":"Tyrus Wong","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tyrus Wong","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tyrus-wong.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tyrus-wong","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","animals","landscapes","mist","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-green","grey","charcoal","muted-olive","orange","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Tyrus Wong was a Chinese-American artist known for his work as a painter, illustrator, and film production designer. He gained significant recognition for his role as the lead artist for Disney's \"Bambi,\" where his distinctive style influenced the film's visual aesthetics. Wong's art often drew inspiration from traditional Chinese painting techniques, blending them with Western art influences to create a unique and evocative style.","observation":"Across all four renders, loosely handled paint builds atmospheric woodland scenes in a restrained teal, green, and ochre palette, with small vividly accented birds as focal points. Broad directional strokes, scraped textures, fine branch lines, and softened distances create a dreamy, misty sense of depth."},{"id":"fred-herzog","name":"Fred Herzog","cat":"photographers","en":"Fred Herzog","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fred-herzog.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fred-herzog","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","silver","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Fred Herzog was a German-Canadian photographer known for his pioneering work in color street photography. Born in 1930, Herzog captured the vibrant urban life of Vancouver during the mid-20th century, focusing on everyday scenes and the nuances of city living. His work is celebrated for its vivid colors and candid portrayal of the human condition, offering a unique glimpse into the social landscape of the time.","observation":"These images use realistic, cinematic photography with subdued, darkly atmospheric color and selective focus. Weathered urban streets, vintage vehicles, fog, warm practical lights, and candid human moments create a nostalgic, lived-in retro mood."},{"id":"andrea-kowch","name":"Andrea Kowch","cat":"painters","en":"Andrea Kowch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrea-kowch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrea-kowch","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","black","grey","dark-brown"],"intro":"Andrea Kowch is a contemporary American painter known for her narrative style that often combines elements of magic realism and American Gothic. Her works frequently explore themes of solitude and introspection, set against the backdrop of rural American landscapes. Kowch's paintings are characterized by their meticulous detail and evocative storytelling, often featuring strong female figures in expansive natural settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines convincingly realistic figures with visible, finely worked paint texture and carefully described clothing, vegetation, and weathered rural settings. Muted earthy colors, overcast light, solemn expressions, and close portrait-like framing create a melancholy, filmic visual atmosphere."},{"id":"tom-tomorrow","name":"Tom Tomorrow","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tom Tomorrow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-tomorrow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-tomorrow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["red","black","green","blue","muted-pink","light-yellow","vivid-red"],"intro":"Tom Tomorrow is a contemporary American cartoonist known for his satirical comic strip \"This Modern World.\" His work often critiques politics, consumer culture, and technology through a humorous and surreal lens, making him a prominent figure in alternative comics.","observation":"The style uses highly saturated, flat graphic color bounded by heavy black comic outlines, with fine interior hatching and stippled texture adding dimensional detail. It repeatedly combines close-up character portraits with grotesque facial exaggeration, surreal monsters, dense visual clutter, and stark high-contrast compositions."},{"id":"gustave-loiseau","name":"Gustave Loiseau","cat":"painters","en":"Gustave Loiseau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-loiseau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-loiseau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","urban","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","beige","red"],"intro":"Gustave Loiseau was a French Post-Impressionist painter known for his landscapes and depictions of rural France. He was part of the Impressionist movement, focusing on capturing the changing effects of light and atmosphere in his works. Loiseau's paintings often feature vibrant colors and dynamic brushstrokes, contributing to the lively and textured surfaces that characterize his style.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses visible, finely broken brushwork to build richly observed village landscapes, with softened edges and atmospheric distance. Subdued winter blues, rosy light, greens, and occasional floral reds create a dreamy, gently expressive mood across streets, waterways, churches, and countryside."},{"id":"qi-baishi","name":"Qi Baishi","cat":"painters","en":"Qi Baishi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/qi-baishi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/qi-baishi","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","cream","brown","beige","red"],"intro":"Qi Baishi was a renowned Chinese painter, known for his mastery in traditional Chinese painting techniques, particularly in the genres of bird-and-flower painting. Born in 1864, Qi Baishi's work is celebrated for its simplicity, expressiveness, and the use of vibrant colors, often depicting natural subjects such as insects, birds, and plants. His style is characterized by the use of ink wash and watercolor, which allows for a delicate yet bold expression of form and color.","observation":"Across all four panels, expressive ink-and-wash brushwork depicts flowers, foliage, insects, and small animals against generous cream-colored paper. Dark diluted ink, selective blue and red accents, calligraphic marks, and seal stamps create a restrained yet richly textured traditional scroll-like appearance."},{"id":"ed-hardy","name":"Ed Hardy","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Ed Hardy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-hardy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-hardy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","motion","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","bone-white","orange","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Ed Hardy is an American tattoo artist known for his iconic designs that blend traditional tattoo art with contemporary influences. His work is characterized by bold lines, vibrant colors, and a fusion of Eastern and Western motifs, making him a significant figure in the tattoo and fashion industries.","observation":"Across all four renders, forceful tiger and dragon imagery is built from dense decorative forms, heavy dark outlines, saturated orange, blue, red, and cream, and visible painted texture. Floral elements, curling waves, flames, and clouds interlock around the animals, creating an ornate, highly detailed composition with strong motion and contrast."},{"id":"robert-gillmor","name":"Robert Gillmor","cat":"illustrators","en":"Robert Gillmor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-gillmor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-gillmor","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","ink","geometric"],"colours":["pale-yellow","charcoal","beige","rust","blue","orange"],"intro":"Robert Gillmor is a renowned British wildlife artist and illustrator, celebrated for his detailed and vibrant depictions of birds and natural scenes. His work is recognized for its contribution to nature conservation and ornithology, capturing the beauty and diversity of British wildlife through a distinctive artistic style.","observation":"The style combines flat, strongly colored illustrative shapes with dense black contouring, fine hatching, and visible print-like texture. It layers animals, people, clothing, water, textiles, and fish into crowded collage-like scenes, with a restrained retro editorial feel and recurring cream, blue, orange, red, and black tones."},{"id":"jenny-frison","name":"Jenny Frison","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jenny Frison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jenny-frison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jenny-frison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing"],"colours":["muted-orange","black","red","bone-white","charcoal","beige"],"intro":"Jenny Frison is a contemporary comic book cover artist known for her work with major publishers like DC Comics and Marvel. Her style often features strong, detailed portraits of female characters, blending elements of fantasy and realism.","observation":"The style combines richly textured painted surfaces with delicate, visibly drawn contour lines and finely rendered hair, skin, and facial features. Close-cropped female portraits use saturated accent colors, metallic decorative details, and expressive poses against textured paper-like grounds."},{"id":"chema-madoz","name":"Chema Madoz","cat":"photographers","en":"Chema Madoz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chema-madoz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chema-madoz","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","white","black","brown"],"intro":"Chema Madoz is a renowned Spanish photographer known for his surreal and minimalist black and white images. His work often features ordinary objects placed in unexpected contexts, creating visual metaphors and thought-provoking compositions. Madoz's photography is celebrated for its conceptual depth and meticulous attention to detail, drawing comparisons to surrealist artists like Man Ray and René Magritte.","observation":"The style presents isolated everyday and natural objects as carefully lit monochrome studio still lifes, with tactile material detail, crisp edges, and pronounced shadows. Generous empty backgrounds and improbable object pairings give the compositions a surreal, conceptual quality while retaining a realistic photographic appearance."},{"id":"alberto-seveso","name":"Alberto Seveso","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alberto Seveso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alberto-seveso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alberto-seveso","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","sculptural","patterns","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","red","grey","dark-teal","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Alberto Seveso is an Italian digital artist known for his innovative work in the realm of digital illustration and photography. He gained recognition for his unique approach to capturing the beauty of ink and water, creating mesmerizing images that blend fluid dynamics with human forms. Seveso's work often explores the intersection of art and technology, pushing the boundaries of traditional artistic techniques.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds abstract vertical masses from richly layered, fluid-looking brushwork, with fine strokes, translucent tendrils, and sculptural folds that resemble suspended pigment or smoke. Saturated coral, teal, blue, and peach forms stand out against generous pale backgrounds, creating a dreamy, kinetic, surreal effect."},{"id":"scott-mccloud","name":"Scott McCloud","cat":"illustrators","en":"Scott McCloud","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/scott-mccloud.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/scott-mccloud","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","retro","drawing"],"colours":["white","silver","black","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Scott McCloud is an influential American cartoonist and theorist, known for his work in the field of comics. He is renowned for his book \"Understanding Comics,\" which explores the theory and practice of the medium. McCloud has contributed significantly to the understanding and appreciation of comics as a legitimate art form, and his works are celebrated for their insightful analysis and innovative storytelling techniques.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white graphic drawing with heavy contour lines, dense crosshatched shading, and large areas of clean white space. It consistently presents deadpan, bespectacled male characters in close-up portrait or panel compositions, with selectively detailed clothing, hair, and crowded backgrounds."},{"id":"charles-schulz","name":"Charles Schulz","cat":"illustrators","en":"Charles Schulz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-schulz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-schulz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","subdued-colors","comics","drawing","ink","cute"],"colours":["cream","white","orange","brown","beige","black","dark-red"],"intro":"Charles Schulz is best known as the creator of the beloved comic strip \"Peanuts,\" which features iconic characters like Charlie Brown and Snoopy. His work has been celebrated for its gentle humor, philosophical insights, and relatable themes of childhood and friendship. Schulz's influence on the world of comics is profound, and his characters have become enduring symbols of American pop culture.","observation":"The style uses loose black-ink cartoon drawing with thick, irregular outlines, simplified rounded figures, sparse facial features, and occasional hatching for dark areas. Mostly white or muted tan grounds are punctuated by small flat color accents, while expressive poses and familiar character groupings create a playful comic-strip feeling."},{"id":"paige-evans","name":"Paige Evans","cat":"various-artists","en":"Paige Evans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paige-evans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paige-evans","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","patterns","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-cyan","pink","charcoal","blue","red","ochre","green"],"intro":"Paige Evans is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and imaginative works that often explore themes of nature and fantasy. Her art is characterized by a whimsical and ethereal quality, drawing inspiration from both the natural world and the realms of imagination. Evans's work often features intricate detailing and a rich color palette, making her pieces both visually striking and deeply engaging.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense botanical compositions combine vivid turquoise, pink, coral, orange, and violet with clearly visible painted strokes and layered textures. The imagery is highly detailed and illustrative yet dreamlike, with oversized flowers, foliage, small creatures, and occasional human presence arranged as exuberant floral tableaux."},{"id":"francis-bernard-dicksee","name":"Francis Bernard Dicksee","cat":"painters","en":"Francis Bernard Dicksee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francis-bernard-dicksee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francis-bernard-dicksee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","dark-red","light-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Francis Bernard Dicksee is a renowned British painter and illustrator associated with the late Victorian era. Known for his romantic and historical subjects, Dicksee's work often features elegant compositions and dramatic scenes, capturing the essence of the Pre-Raphaelite and Romantic movements. His paintings are characterized by their detailed execution, rich color palettes, and a focus on themes of chivalry and courtly love.","observation":"The style uses highly rendered oil-paint surfaces with visible fine brushwork, dense ornament, and carefully modelled faces, hair, fabric, metal, and flowers. Deep brown shadows and saturated reds create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while elaborate costumes, skulls, weapons, and intimate figures give the compositions a classical dramatic character."},{"id":"quentin-blake","name":"Quentin Blake","cat":"illustrators","en":"Quentin Blake","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/quentin-blake.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/quentin-blake","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","beige","muted-olive","brown","orange"],"intro":"Quentin Blake is a renowned British illustrator and children's book author, celebrated for his distinctive, lively illustrations. He is best known for his collaborations with author Roald Dahl, where his whimsical and expressive drawings brought stories to life. Blake's style is characterized by loose, energetic lines and a playful use of color, capturing the imagination of both children and adults alike.","observation":"Across all four images, loose black ink linework combines with translucent watercolor washes, visible paper grain, and irregularly pooled color. The expressive storybook figures and creatures have whimsical fantasy forms, lively gestures, and densely hatched details against airy, lightly washed backgrounds."},{"id":"meghan-howland","name":"Meghan Howland","cat":"painters","en":"Meghan Howland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/meghan-howland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/meghan-howland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","muted-orange","silver","grey","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Meghan Howland is an American contemporary artist known for her ethereal and romantic paintings that often explore themes of nature and human connection. Her work is characterized by a dreamy, surreal quality that invites viewers into introspective and whimsical worlds.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces and figures are intertwined with abundant flowers, foliage, and occasional black birds. The style combines saturated reds, whites, greens, and blue-greens with deep shadows, expressive poses, and clearly visible, finely controlled painterly brushwork."},{"id":"ken-sugimori","name":"Ken Sugimori","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ken Sugimori","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ken-sugimori.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ken-sugimori","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","cute"],"colours":["white","silver","charcoal","muted-cyan","blue","pink","light-yellow"],"intro":"Ken Sugimori is a renowned Japanese illustrator and video game designer, best known for his work on the Pokémon franchise. He played a pivotal role in designing the original 151 Pokémon and has significantly influenced the visual style of the series. Sugimori's work is characterized by its vibrant and imaginative character designs, which have become iconic in the realm of video games and pop culture.","observation":"The style presents whimsical animal-like characters as clean, outlined illustrations on an uncluttered white ground. Saturated yet softly blended colors, visible watercolor-like brush texture, rounded forms, and oversized expressive eyes give the creatures a cute fantasy character-design quality."},{"id":"jon-mcnaught","name":"Jon McNaught","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jon McNaught","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jon-mcnaught.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jon-mcnaught","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","glow","bold-lines","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","brown","red","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jon McNaught is a contemporary illustrator and comic artist known for his detailed and atmospheric works. His art often explores themes of nostalgia and everyday life, capturing quiet moments with a unique blend of simplicity and depth. McNaught's illustrations are characterized by their clean lines, muted color palettes, and a focus on suburban and natural landscapes.","observation":"These images use a graphic, illustrative treatment with dense fine branchwork, heavy dark silhouettes, and strongly limited but saturated blue-and-coral color contrasts. Grainy printed texture and small internal line marks enrich the wooded landscapes, while isolated moons and warmly lit windows provide luminous focal points against the nocturnal scenes."},{"id":"gucci","name":"Gucci","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Gucci","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gucci.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gucci","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","bone-white","muted-cyan","muted-ochre","dark-brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Gucci is a renowned Italian luxury fashion brand founded in 1921 by Guccio Gucci in Florence. Known for its high-quality leather goods, clothing, and accessories, Gucci has become a symbol of elegance and sophistication. Over the years, the brand has evolved, embracing bold and innovative designs under the creative direction of various designers, including the influential Alessandro Michele.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly rendering with highly detailed luxury-fashion portraits and accessory still lifes. Saturated jewel tones, metallic hardware, floral textiles, fur, beads, and ornate embellishments create an opulent retro editorial look, with visible fine brushwork throughout."},{"id":"don-blanding","name":"Don Blanding","cat":"illustrators","en":"Don Blanding","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/don-blanding.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/don-blanding","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","landscapes","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","epic","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Don Blanding is known as an American poet and artist, celebrated for his contributions to the arts in the early to mid-20th century. He was particularly recognized for his poetic works that often reflected themes of nature and travel, as well as his artistic endeavors that included illustrations and designs.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark black-and-white imagery combines dense engraved-looking linework, stippling, hatching, and sweeping contour patterns with huge luminous negative spaces. Solitary figures inhabit surreal coastal and cosmic landscapes, where radiating suns, star fields, portals, and distorted trees create a monumental, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"gerald-brom","name":"Gerald Brom","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gerald Brom","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerald-brom.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerald-brom","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","ochre","dark-brown","dark-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Gerald Brom is a renowned American artist known for his distinctive dark fantasy illustrations. His work often features gothic and surreal elements, blending mythological themes with a modern twist. Brom 's art is characterized by its detailed and painterly style, capturing the imagination with its eerie and dramatic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a richly textured, dark fantasy portrait treatment with visible brushwork, layered costumes, weathered faces, ornate metalwork, and densely rendered small details. Earthy browns, blacks, and deep reds dominate, with strong directional lighting and dramatic, ominous character presentation."},{"id":"david-uhl","name":"David Uhl","cat":"painters","en":"David Uhl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-uhl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-uhl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","brown","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"David Uhl is a contemporary American artist known for his detailed and realistic paintings, often focusing on motorcycle culture and Americana themes. His work captures the essence of freedom and adventure, often depicting scenes of the open road and the iconic Harley-Davidson motorcycles.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible, broad painterly strokes with highly descriptive illustrative composition and dense mechanical, clothing, and architectural detail. Warm saturated reds, ochres, and creams, strong sunlight, and assertive character poses create a nostalgic mid-century travel-adventure atmosphere with cinematic framing."},{"id":"mel-ramos","name":"Mel Ramos","cat":"painters","en":"Mel Ramos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mel-ramos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mel-ramos","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","retro"],"colours":["light-orange","vivid-rust","brown","dark-brown","grey","blue"],"intro":"Mel Ramos is an American artist known for his distinctive pop art style, which often features glamorous depictions of women intertwined with commercial imagery. His work is characterized by its playful and vibrant approach, drawing inspiration from advertising and comic book art, and has been influential in the pop art movement.","observation":"Across all four images, expressive close-up characters are rendered with thick ink-like outlines, simplified flat color areas, and highly saturated red, blue, orange, and flesh tones. Exaggerated eyes, gestures, hair, and facial expressions give the framed portraits a vintage comic-advertising appearance, while visible painted texture softens the otherwise graphic treatment."},{"id":"denis-villeneuve","name":"Denis Villeneuve","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Denis Villeneuve","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/denis-villeneuve.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/denis-villeneuve","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-teal","grey","silver","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"Denis Villeneuve is a renowned Canadian filmmaker known for his work in science fiction and drama. His films often explore complex themes and are characterized by their visual grandeur and meticulous attention to detail. Villeneuve has directed critically acclaimed films such as \"Arrival,\" \" Blade Runner 2049,\" and \"Dune,\" which showcase his ability to blend narrative depth with stunning visual storytelling.","observation":"Cinematic, realistic landscapes are rendered with subdued teal and charcoal tones, punctuated by occasional orange atmospheric light. Vast horizons, monumental terrain, mist, reflective water, and tiny isolated figures create a bleak, epic sense of scale across the scenes."},{"id":"leon-tukker","name":"Leon Tukker","cat":"illustrators","en":"Leon Tukker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leon-tukker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leon-tukker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","grey","ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Leon Tukker is a contemporary digital artist known for his intricate and imaginative sci-fi and fantasy illustrations. His work often explores futuristic and otherworldly themes, blending detailed architectural elements with vast, cosmic landscapes. Tukker's art is characterized by its vivid color palettes and dynamic compositions, capturing the viewer's imagination with scenes of epic scale and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed, realistic environments with cinematic framing, monumental scale, and dramatic natural light. Dark, moody colors contrast with warm sunlight and glowing architecture, presenting fantastical landscapes and immense stone structures with tiny solitary figures for scale."},{"id":"maciej-kuciara","name":"Maciej Kuciara","cat":"illustrators","en":"Maciej Kuciara","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maciej-kuciara.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maciej-kuciara","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","white","muted-orange","dark-red","grey"],"intro":"Maciej Kuciara is a renowned concept artist and illustrator known for his work in the entertainment industry, particularly in film and video games. He has contributed to major projects, creating intricate and imaginative worlds that blend realism with fantastical elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly surfaces to depict solitary robed figures within immense, ruined landscapes. Dark atmospheric palettes, sharp light contrasts, monumental forms, and glowing environmental accents create an expressive, ominous fantasy world with a surreal sense of scale."},{"id":"takato-yamamoto","name":"Takato Yamamoto","cat":"illustrators","en":"Takato Yamamoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/takato-yamamoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/takato-yamamoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","portraits","fine-lines","vivid-colors","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","dark-red","charcoal","bone-white"],"intro":"Takato Yamamoto is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his unique style that blends traditional Japanese aesthetics with modern sensibilities. His work often explores themes of beauty, eroticism, and the macabre, drawing inspiration from ukiyo-e and other classical Japanese art forms.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, flat illustrative portraiture with delicate dark linework, pale faces, flowing black hair, and carefully rendered hands. Saturated red flowers and patterned foliage fill the compositions, creating an ornate decorative surface against deep black clothing and shadowed areas."},{"id":"paul-chabas","name":"Paul Chabas","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Chabas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-chabas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-chabas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-brown","bone-white","ochre","muted-orange","beige","brown"],"intro":"Paul Chabas was a French painter known for his delicate and romantic portrayals of female figures, often set in natural and serene environments. His most famous work, \"September Morn,\" exemplifies his style, characterized by soft brushwork and a focus on light and atmosphere.","observation":"The style uses visible, finely controlled brushwork to model elegant figures, fabric, water, and foliage with luminous, softly blended surfaces. Warm subdued tones, sparkling highlights, floral details, and intimate cropped compositions create a romantic, dreamy atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"josef-frank","name":"Josef Frank","cat":"designers","en":"Josef Frank","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josef-frank.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josef-frank","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["muted-olive","charcoal","red","pale-orange","orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Josef Frank was an Austrian-born architect and designer known for his influential work in modernist architecture and interior design. He became a prominent figure in the Swedish design scene, contributing significantly to the development of Scandinavian modernism. Frank's work is characterized by its vibrant use of color, bold patterns, and a harmonious blend of functionality and aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a dense botanical pattern language built from oversized flowers, foliage, and repeated organic motifs. Saturated navy, coral, red, orange, green, and cream are combined with graphic outlines, flat color areas, visible brush marks, and richly layered decorative detail."},{"id":"eugene-grasset","name":"Eugene Grasset","cat":"painters","en":"Eugene Grasset","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eugene-grasset.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eugene-grasset","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","muted-orange","dark-brown","red","orange"],"intro":"Eugene Grasset was a Swiss decorative artist and pioneer in the Art Nouveau movement, known for his work in graphic design, illustration, and decorative arts during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His style is characterized by intricate line work, floral motifs, and a harmonious blend of colors, which became influential in the development of modern graphic design.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, flat-color illustration with crisp fine outlines, dense ornamental patterns, and richly decorated clothing and foliage. Saturated rust, teal, ochre, red, and black create a strong retro decorative poster quality, with recurring profile figures and animals integrated into dense botanical compositions."},{"id":"gabor-csupo","name":"Gabor Csupo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gabor Csupo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gabor-csupo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gabor-csupo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","collage","drawing","funny","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","red","black","muted-blue","magenta","olive"],"intro":"Gabor Csupo is a Hungarian-American animator, writer, and producer known for co-founding the animation studio Klasky Csupo, which created popular animated series such as \"Rugrats\" and \"Aaahh!!! Real Monsters.\" His work is characterized by a distinctive style that blends quirky, surreal elements with a bold, colorful aesthetic.","observation":"The style combines vividly colored cartoon characters with heavy black contour lines, flat graphic color blocks, and expressive distorted faces. Rough brushwork, drips, scraped textures, geometric fragments, and collage-like overlaps create a densely layered painted surface across all four renders."},{"id":"albert-koetsier","name":"Albert Koetsier","cat":"various-artists","en":"Albert Koetsier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-koetsier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-koetsier","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","floral","patterns","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","subdued-colors"],"colours":["white","silver","black","blue","grey"],"intro":"Albert Koetsier is a contemporary artist known for his innovative use of x-ray photography to create ethereal and detailed images, often focusing on botanical and natural forms. His work is characterized by a unique blend of scientific precision and artistic expression, capturing the delicate intricacies of his subjects in a way that reveals their hidden beauty.","observation":"The style combines delicate fashion-illustration draftsmanship with translucent botanical forms, using fine, flowing lines and softly layered brushwork to describe petals, fabric, hair, and facial planes. Mostly white, grey, black, and restrained blue fields create an airy editorial look, with occasional saturated accents such as red lips."},{"id":"david-pope","name":"David Pope","cat":"illustrators","en":"David Pope","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-pope.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-pope","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","fine-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["muted-blue","bone-white","beige","brown","silver","black","ochre"],"intro":"David Pope is a contemporary illustrator known for his detailed and imaginative works that often explore themes of fantasy and science fiction. His style is characterized by intricate line work and a vivid use of color, creating immersive and whimsical worlds.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, expressive figurative drawing with strong black contour lines, fine internal hatching, and loose sketch-like marks. Muted earth colors are set against recurring pale blue grounds, while dramatic poses, rugged characters, animals, and frontier props create energetic illustrated adventure scenes."},{"id":"ida-rentoul-outhwaite","name":"Ida Rentoul Outhwaite","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ida Rentoul Outhwaite","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ida-rentoul-outhwaite.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ida-rentoul-outhwaite","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","landscapes","glow","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","muted-blue","brown","beige"],"intro":"Ida Rentoul Outhwaite was an Australian illustrator known for her enchanting depictions of fairies and children's stories. Her work, primarily from the early 20th century, is celebrated for its delicate line work and imaginative storytelling, often featuring whimsical and fantastical themes.","observation":"A richly painted, highly detailed nocturnal fantasy style combines deep blue and green forests with luminous moons, stars, fireflies, and reflective water. Fine illustrative linework, layered foliage, elegant pale-clad figures, and softly uncanny compositions create a dreamy, storybook surrealism."},{"id":"wolf-kahn","name":"Wolf Kahn","cat":"painters","en":"Wolf Kahn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wolf-kahn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wolf-kahn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["orange","muted-brown","pink","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Wolf Kahn was a German-born American painter known for his vivid use of color and integration of realism with abstract expressionism. His work often depicted landscapes, blending elements of color field painting with traditional landscape art, creating a unique and recognizable style.","observation":"Across all four renders, natural landscapes are transformed through vigorous, visible brushwork, elongated vertical marks, and strongly expressive color. Saturated oranges, pinks, purples, and teal-greens flatten and reshape the woods and fields into a dreamlike, painterly vision while dark tree trunks provide repeated graphic structure."},{"id":"george-petty","name":"George Petty","cat":"illustrators","en":"George Petty","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-petty.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-petty","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","erotic","retro"],"colours":["white","pale-orange","cream","orange","black","rust"],"intro":"George Petty was an American illustrator known for his pin-up art, particularly during the 1930s and 1940s. His work was characterized by glamorous and sensual depictions of women, often featured in magazines like Esquire. Petty's style became iconic, influencing the portrayal of feminine beauty in commercial art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines polished illustrative figure work with visible fine brushstrokes, softly modelled skin, and carefully rendered hair, makeup, and clothing. The restrained cream, peach, red, black, and muted green palette, glamorous poses, and vintage fashion create a retro pin-up mood with sensual portrait framing."},{"id":"sandy-skoglund","name":"Sandy Skoglund","cat":"photographers","en":"Sandy Skoglund","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sandy-skoglund.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sandy-skoglund","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","retro","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["cyan","dark-red","muted-cyan","deep-red","muted-green","dark-cyan"],"intro":"Sandy Skoglund is an American photographer and installation artist known for her surreal and often whimsical images that blend photography with elaborate set designs. Her work typically involves creating intricate, dreamlike environments that challenge perceptions of reality and explore themes of consumer culture and domestic life.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic staging with carefully controlled architectural symmetry and dense, tactile interior textures. Each tableau is dominated by a bold monochromatic color scheme, ornate period furnishings, formally posed figures and animals, producing a surreal, retro atmosphere."},{"id":"frank-weston-benson","name":"Frank Weston Benson","cat":"painters","en":"Frank Weston Benson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-weston-benson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-weston-benson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-blue","brown","charcoal","bone-white","rust","ochre"],"intro":"Frank Weston Benson is an American artist known for his contributions to the American Impressionism movement. Born in 1862, Benson was a prominent painter and etcher, celebrated for his depictions of outdoor scenes and elegant portraits. His work often features vibrant colors and a masterful use of light, capturing the serene beauty of nature and leisurely moments.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and outdoor settings are built from visible, broad, energetic paint strokes, with heavily worked fabric, foliage, rocks, and water. Bright natural light, saturated blues and greens, and warm floral accents create a lively yet relaxed scene-based style with classical dress and carefully composed figures."},{"id":"lois-greenfield","name":"Lois Greenfield","cat":"photographers","en":"Lois Greenfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lois-greenfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lois-greenfield","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","scenes","motion","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","charcoal","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Lois Greenfield is an acclaimed American photographer renowned for her unique approach to capturing the fluidity and dynamism of dance. Her work is celebrated for its ability to freeze motion in a way that reveals the grace and athleticism of dancers, often highlighting the interplay of light and shadow. Greenfield's images are characterized by their striking composition and the ethereal quality of the subjects, which often appear to be suspended in mid-air.","observation":"Across all four images, human dancers are captured in expansive, suspended poses, with translucent layered garments sweeping into sculptural vortices around their bodies. The restrained gray-and-ivory palette, precise fabric detail, soft studio lighting, and sense of motion create an ethereal, dreamlike photographic style."},{"id":"zdzislaw-beksinski","name":"Zdzislaw Beksinski","cat":"painters","en":"Zdzislaw Beksinski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zdzislaw-beksinski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zdzislaw-beksinski","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","red","bone-white","dark-red","muted-blue","charcoal"],"intro":"Zdzislaw Beksinski was a Polish painter, photographer, and sculptor known for his dystopian surrealism. His work often features dreamlike, nightmarish landscapes and figures, characterized by a haunting and eerie atmosphere.","observation":"These images use a painterly, heavily textured surface with expressive marks, atmospheric haze, and strongly modulated dark blue, rust, and volcanic red tones. Monumental landscapes dwarf solitary cloaked figures, while internal red light and stark silhouettes create an epic, ominous fantasy mood."},{"id":"anne-louis-girodet","name":"Anne-Louis Girodet","cat":"painters","en":"Anne-Louis Girodet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-louis-girodet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-louis-girodet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","pale-yellow","dark-rust"],"intro":"Anne-Louis Girodet is a renowned French painter known for his neoclassical and romantic works during the late 18th and early 19th centuries. His art often features mythological themes, dramatic lighting, and a meticulous attention to detail, reflecting the transition from neoclassicism to romanticism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modelled oil-paint surfaces, fine visible brushwork, dramatic chiaroscuro, and a dark warm palette. Close, emotionally charged figures emerge from near-black grounds, with flowing hair, fabric, and reflective highlights creating theatrical movement and classical intensity."},{"id":"gail-albert-halaban","name":"Gail Albert Halaban","cat":"photographers","en":"Gail Albert Halaban","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gail-albert-halaban.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gail-albert-halaban","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","charcoal","muted-ochre","dark-brown","grey"],"intro":"Gail Albert Halaban is an American photographer known for her evocative urban landscapes and intimate portrayals of city life. Her work often explores themes of community, privacy, and the unseen connections between people in urban environments. Halaban's photography has been exhibited internationally and is celebrated for its unique perspective on modern living.","observation":"The style is cinematic and highly realistic, presenting richly detailed urban interiors and exteriors through large windows and layered architectural frames. Subdued green and brown tones are punctuated by warm practical lights, creating a moody, intimate atmosphere where dense foliage merges with city apartments and rooftops."},{"id":"john-maler-collier","name":"John Maler Collier","cat":"painters","en":"John Maler Collier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-maler-collier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-maler-collier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","deep-red","muted-orange"],"intro":"John Maler Collier was a prominent British painter and writer, known for his portraits and historical scenes. Born in 1850, he was a leading figure in the Pre-Raphaelite movement, which sought to return to the detail, color, and complexity of early Renaissance art. Collier's work often depicted mythological and literary themes, characterized by meticulous attention to detail and vibrant color palettes.","observation":"Across the renders, richly painted female figures occupy intimate, elaborately furnished interiors, with expressive faces, layered clothing, and abundant decorative objects. Dark surrounding tones, selective warm illumination, strong value contrast, and visible directional brushwork create a refined but melancholic atmosphere."},{"id":"marie-laurencin","name":"Marie Laurencin","cat":"painters","en":"Marie Laurencin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marie-laurencin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marie-laurencin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","painterly","pastel-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-orange","brown","black","dark-blue","red","blue"],"intro":"Marie Laurencin was a French painter and printmaker associated with the Cubist movement. She was known for her delicate and feminine style, often depicting women in soft, pastel colors. Laurencin's work was characterized by its ethereal quality and subtle emotional depth, making her a notable figure in early 20th-century art.","observation":"Across all four renders, elegantly stylized women are presented in carefully arranged portrait scenes with distinctive hats, dresses, flowers, and domestic decorative details. The images use softly muted pastel colors, simplified graphic contours, and clearly visible layered brushwork that gives the surfaces a tactile painted texture."},{"id":"richard-neutra","name":"Richard Neutra","cat":"architects","en":"Richard Neutra","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-neutra.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-neutra","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-blue","ochre","grey","silver","rust"],"intro":"Richard Neutra is a renowned architect known for his significant contributions to modernist architecture, particularly in the United States during the mid-20th century. His designs are characterized by their integration with nature, open spaces, and use of modern materials, reflecting the ideals of the International Style and mid-century modernism.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic architectural views with crisp geometric forms, broad horizontal compositions, and carefully framed pools, houses, trees, and mountain backdrops. Warm late-day sunlight, subdued earthy colors, strong light-dark separation, reflective water, and selective background softness give the scenes a polished midcentury residential character."},{"id":"paul-signac","name":"Paul Signac","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Signac","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-signac.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-signac","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["silver","pale-orange","muted-blue","muted-rust","rust","charcoal"],"intro":"Paul Signac was a French Neo-Impressionist painter known for his development of the Pointillist technique alongside Georges Seurat. Born in 1863, Signac's work is characterized by the use of small, distinct dots of color applied in patterns to form an image. His paintings often depict vibrant landscapes and seascapes, capturing the essence of light and atmosphere with meticulous detail and a harmonious color palette.","observation":"Across all four views, coastal harbors and villages are rendered with highly visible, directional paint marks and densely repeated dabs. The bright blue, pink, orange, and ochre palette creates lively reflections and atmospheric water, while simplified architecture, boats, and trees remain clearly readable."},{"id":"gus-van-sant","name":"Gus Van Sant","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Gus Van Sant","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gus-van-sant.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gus-van-sant","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","red","dark-red","vivid-red","pale-orange","brown","deep-blue"],"intro":"Gus Van Sant is an American filmmaker known for his work in independent cinema, often exploring themes of marginalized individuals and subcultures. His films are characterized by their unique visual style and narrative depth, capturing the essence of American life and youth culture.","observation":"Across all four images, faces and figures are rendered with visible, broad, tactile brushwork, simplified planes, and strongly saturated color. Cropped portrait compositions combine expressive gazes and gestures with patterned clothing and selectively detailed interiors, balancing painterly modeling against bold graphic blocks of color."},{"id":"alex-colville","name":"Alex Colville","cat":"painters","en":"Alex Colville","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-colville.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-colville","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","portraits","backlighting","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","charcoal","bone-white","muted-ochre","brown","rust"],"intro":"Alex Colville is a renowned Canadian painter known for his precise and detailed realism. His work often explores themes of everyday life, solitude, and the passage of time, capturing moments with a unique sense of stillness and contemplation. Colville's paintings are celebrated for their meticulous technique and the subtle tension they convey, reflecting a deep understanding of human experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines painterly texture with cinematic, carefully staged compositions and subdued, moody earth tones. Strong backlighting, deep shadows, sparse horizons, and solitary figures create a quiet, contemplative atmosphere, while windows, doorways, paths, and architectural forms provide recurring geometric framing."},{"id":"cecil-aldin","name":"Cecil Aldin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Cecil Aldin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cecil-aldin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cecil-aldin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","fine-lines","subdued-colors","retro","drawing","ink","cute"],"colours":["pale-yellow","pale-orange","muted-ochre","dark-brown","brown","rust"],"intro":"Cecil Aldin is a renowned British illustrator known for his charming depictions of animals and rural life, particularly in children's books. His work is characterized by a gentle, whimsical style that captures the essence of early 20th-century British society. Aldin's illustrations often feature animals in human-like scenarios, blending humor and warmth in a way that has captivated audiences for generations.","observation":"The style uses finely drawn ink contours and delicate hatching to describe affectionate children, dogs, and cats with abundant fur and facial detail. Restrained cream, brown, black, and occasional red coloring on a paper-like ground gives the illustrations a nostalgic printed character, while the cropped, vignette-like arrangements feel playful and intimate."},{"id":"philippe-geluck","name":"Philippe Geluck","cat":"illustrators","en":"Philippe Geluck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philippe-geluck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philippe-geluck","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-blue","brown","beige","black","dark-red"],"intro":"Philippe Geluck is a Belgian cartoonist and illustrator, best known for his comic strip 'Le Chat.' His work is characterized by a unique blend of humor and philosophical insights, often featuring his iconic cat character. Geluck's style is widely recognized for its wit and simplicity, making him a prominent figure in European comics.","observation":"The style combines realistic photographic presentation with brightly colored cartoon-animal characters rendered as both black-outlined murals and smooth, dimensional sculptures. Exaggerated eyes, noses, tongues, and elongated forms create a playful illustrative language, while crisp lighting, strong color contrast, and gallery or street settings give the images a polished cinematic feel."},{"id":"chesley-bonestell","name":"Chesley Bonestell","cat":"painters","en":"Chesley Bonestell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chesley-bonestell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chesley-bonestell","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","surreal","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","dark-brown","orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Chesley Bonestell was an American painter and illustrator, renowned for his pioneering work in astronomical art. His visionary depictions of space and futuristic landscapes have inspired generations of artists and scientists, earning him the title of the \"Father of Modern Space Art.\" Bonestell's work played a significant role in popularizing the concept of space exploration during the mid-20th century.","observation":"The style presents vast alien landscapes with photorealistic, cinematic scale, sharply rendered rock formations, planetary bodies, and futuristic structures. Deep shadows and warm orange highlights create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while glowing moons and distant lights reinforce the epic science-fiction mood."},{"id":"spike-jonze","name":"Spike Jonze","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Spike Jonze","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/spike-jonze.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/spike-jonze","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["deep-rust","dark-olive","black","muted-olive","grey","ochre"],"intro":"Spike Jonze is an American filmmaker, photographer, and actor known for his innovative and often surreal approach to storytelling. He has directed acclaimed films such as 'Being John Malkovich,' 'Adaptation,' and 'Her,' which showcase his unique ability to blend reality with fantasy. Jonze's work often explores themes of identity, consciousness, and the human experience, making him a distinctive voice in contemporary cinema.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, with carefully staged tableaux, strong symmetry, and highly designed interiors or landscapes. Muted teal, ochre, red, and green tones, warm directional light, deep shadows, and precise production-design details create a nostalgic, subtly surreal atmosphere across all four renders."},{"id":"harriet-lee-merrion","name":"Harriet Lee-Merrion","cat":"illustrators","en":"Harriet Lee-Merrion","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harriet-lee-merrion.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harriet-lee-merrion","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","floral","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","subdued-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","charcoal","beige","red","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"Harriet Lee-Merrion is a contemporary illustrator known for her delicate and intricate line work. Her art often explores themes of nature, solitude, and introspection, drawing inspiration from both the natural world and personal reflection. Lee-Merrion's work has been featured in numerous publications and exhibitions, showcasing her unique ability to blend fine lines with serene and whimsical imagery.","observation":"The style uses finely drawn contour lines, restrained flat color fields, and dense but carefully organized detail across figures, architecture, foliage, and flowers. Its muted coral, blue, cream, and deep green palette gives the scenes a decorative, softly atmospheric quality while geometric structures and patterned botanical forms keep the compositions controlled."},{"id":"masaaki-sasamoto","name":"Masaaki Sasamoto","cat":"painters","en":"Masaaki Sasamoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/masaaki-sasamoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/masaaki-sasamoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","muted-orange","brown","bone-white","light-yellow"],"intro":"Masaaki Sasamoto is a contemporary artist known for his intricate and ethereal digital paintings that often blend elements of fantasy and surrealism. His work is characterized by a delicate balance between the fantastical and the realistic, often exploring themes of nature and human connection.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, painterly portraiture with dense botanical ornament, embroidered textiles, and antique-looking surface texture. Muted olive, cream, brown, and black tones are punctuated by gold-like accents and deep shadows, while close cropping and delicate faces create a dreamy, decorative atmosphere."},{"id":"rinko-kawauchi","name":"Rinko Kawauchi","cat":"photographers","en":"Rinko Kawauchi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rinko-kawauchi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rinko-kawauchi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","floral","landscapes","glow","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","blue","silver","grey","red"],"intro":"Rinko Kawauchi is a contemporary Japanese photographer known for her serene and poetic imagery. Her work often captures the beauty of everyday life, focusing on themes of nature, light, and the ephemeral. Kawauchi's photography is characterized by its delicate use of color and light, creating a dreamlike quality that invites viewers to find beauty in the mundane.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, naturalistic photography with vivid blue skies, warm pink highlights, visible grain, and strong atmospheric light effects. Flowers and open landscapes are framed from low viewpoints with selective focus, glowing lens flare, and occasional motion blur, creating a dreamy, nostalgic mood."},{"id":"liam-wong","name":"Liam Wong","cat":"photographers","en":"Liam Wong","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/liam-wong.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/liam-wong","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","dark"],"colours":["dark-teal","black","dark-cyan","dark-red","red","muted-cyan","light-orange"],"intro":"Liam Wong is a renowned photographer and visual artist known for his captivating night photography and cyberpunk aesthetics. His work often explores urban environments, capturing the interplay of light and shadow in cityscapes. Wong's distinctive style is characterized by vivid colors, particularly neon hues, and a cinematic approach that evokes a sense of mystery and futurism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is cinematic and realistic, depicting dense urban night scenes in heavy rain. Saturated teal-and-red neon, deep shadows, glowing signage, wet reflective surfaces, misty air, and layered city architecture create a dark futuristic atmosphere."},{"id":"hilma-af-klint","name":"Hilma af Klint","cat":"painters","en":"Hilma af Klint","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hilma-af-klint.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hilma-af-klint","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","ornate","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["light-orange","black","brown","ochre","red","grey","dark-blue"],"intro":"Hilma af Klint was a Swedish artist and mystic whose abstract works predated the first purely abstract compositions by Kandinsky. She was a pioneer of abstract art, creating paintings rich in symbolism and spiritual meaning, often inspired by her interest in theosophy and spiritualism.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines visibly textured, hand-painted surfaces with precise concentric geometry, radial organization, and repeated planetary orbs. Muted jewel tones, fine circular lines, symbolic diagram-like arrangements, and ornamental botanical details create a mystical, surreal visual language."},{"id":"jennifer-lommers","name":"Jennifer Lommers","cat":"painters","en":"Jennifer Lommers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jennifer-lommers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jennifer-lommers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["light-yellow","red","olive","dark-green","grey","brown"],"intro":"Jennifer Lommers is a contemporary American artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings that often feature nature and wildlife themes. Her work is characterized by a whimsical and joyful style, drawing inspiration from the natural world and her surroundings.","observation":"The style is richly painterly, built from visible directional brushstrokes and layered, tactile marks. Saturated coral, orange, turquoise, green, and pink hues fill densely composed botanical scenes, combining recognizable birds and woodland settings with decorative spirals and dreamlike floral abundance."},{"id":"jacob-jordaens","name":"Jacob Jordaens","cat":"painters","en":"Jacob Jordaens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacob-jordaens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacob-jordaens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["baroque","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-brown","dark-brown","rust","muted-orange"],"intro":"Jacob Jordaens was a prominent Flemish Baroque painter known for his lively and detailed genre scenes, portraits, and historical paintings. Born in 1593 in Antwerp, he became one of the leading artists of his time, alongside contemporaries like Peter Paul Rubens. Jordaens's work is characterized by its vibrant use of color, dynamic compositions, and expressive figures, often depicting scenes of merriment and everyday life.","observation":"These images use richly textured oil paint, broad visible strokes, warm earthy color, and strong light-dark contrast to model expressive faces and clothing. The crowded figures, theatrical gestures, deep shadows, and lavish table details create a dramatic classical atmosphere with heightened, almost grotesque emotion."},{"id":"godmachine","name":"GodMachine","cat":"illustrators","en":"GodMachine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/godmachine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/godmachine","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","grey","light-orange","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"GodMachine is a contemporary illustrator known for his dark and surreal artistic style, often exploring themes of fantasy and horror. His work is characterized by intricate line art and a bold use of color, creating a distinctive visual impact that has garnered a dedicated following.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, finely drawn linework and intricate organic detail to build grotesque, monumental fantasy figures and ominous environments. Dark teal, black, and earthy grounds are punctuated by vivid red and orange, with dramatic compositions and surreal anatomical motifs such as skulls, horns, eyes, roots, and tendrils."},{"id":"butcher-billy","name":"Butcher Billy","cat":"illustrators","en":"Butcher Billy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/butcher-billy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/butcher-billy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","funny"],"colours":["black","pale-yellow","red","muted-cyan","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Butcher Billy is a Brazilian artist known for his distinctive style that merges pop culture with a retro aesthetic. His work often features iconic figures from comics, movies, and music, reimagined with a bold and expressive flair. Butcher Billy's art is characterized by its vibrant colors, strong lines, and a playful yet rebellious tone, making it instantly recognizable and widely appreciated in the realms of graphic design and illustration.","observation":"The style uses bold comic-book linework, dense crosshatched facial detail, flat saturated color blocks, and stark black shadows across tightly cropped character portraits. Distressed paper texture, ink wear, and retro panel-like framing give the images a printed vintage feel, with exaggerated masks, costumes, props, and humorous expressions reinforcing the graphic-pop character."},{"id":"ann-mortimer","name":"Ann Mortimer","cat":"painters","en":"Ann Mortimer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ann-mortimer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ann-mortimer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["dark-green","olive","grey","bone-white","blue","orange"],"intro":"Ann Mortimer is a contemporary watercolor artist known for her exquisite botanical and nature-themed paintings. Her work often features delicate floral compositions and serene landscapes, capturing the beauty of the natural world with precision and grace. Mortimer's art is celebrated for its intricate detail and vibrant use of color, reflecting her deep appreciation for the flora and fauna she portrays.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses luminous watercolor washes with visible paper grain, translucent layering, and energetic but controlled brushwork. It combines richly detailed botanical scenes with expressive, finely observed flowers, foliage, cottage settings, and birdlife, using saturated greens, reds, blues, and violet accents."},{"id":"butch-hartman","name":"Butch Hartman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Butch Hartman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/butch-hartman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/butch-hartman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","retro"],"colours":["brown","black","light-red","orange","dark-red","magenta"],"intro":"Butch Hartman is an American animator, writer, and producer known for creating popular animated television series such as \"The Fairly OddParents,\" \"Danny Phantom,\" and \"T.U.F.F. Puppy.\" His work is characterized by a distinctive cartoon style that combines humor with imaginative storytelling, appealing to both children and adults.","observation":"The style combines bold, clean cartoon linework with flat, saturated color fills and exaggerated facial features, consistently resembling comic and animated-character artwork. Dense character groupings, energetic poses, and retro superhero imagery give the designs a lively, graphic tattoo-and-poster appearance."},{"id":"arthur-rackham","name":"Arthur Rackham","cat":"illustrators","en":"Arthur Rackham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-rackham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-rackham","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Arthur Rackham was a renowned English illustrator known for his distinctive style in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. He gained fame for his work in children's literature, bringing to life classic tales with his intricate and imaginative illustrations. Rackham's art is characterized by its detailed line work, muted color palette, and whimsical yet dark themes, often drawing from folklore and mythology.","observation":"These pictures use densely worked, fine linear detail and visible painterly texture to build tangled forests, rocky ravines, and expressive human and creature figures. Muted earth tones, deep shadows, and small warm openings of light create a dark, fantastical storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"aimee-stewart","name":"Aimee Stewart","cat":"various-artists","en":"Aimee Stewart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aimee-stewart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aimee-stewart","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","glow","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-ochre","muted-teal","orange","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Aimee Stewart is a contemporary digital artist known for her vibrant and detailed fantasy artworks. Her work often features intricate compositions that blend elements of nature, mythology, and surrealism, creating a whimsical and imaginative visual experience.","observation":"The style combines visibly textured, painterly surfaces with densely layered botanical, animal, architectural, and human imagery. Saturated teal, crimson, orange, and gold hues create a dramatic, glowing atmosphere, while floral crowns, jewelry, luminous buildings, and fantastical garden details give the compositions an ornate, dreamy quality."},{"id":"joseph-pennell","name":"Joseph Pennell","cat":"printmakers","en":"Joseph Pennell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joseph-pennell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joseph-pennell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","drawing","ink"],"colours":["beige","pale-orange","black","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Joseph Pennell was an American artist and author known for his work as an illustrator and printmaker. He was born in 1857 and became renowned for his etchings and lithographs, particularly those depicting urban landscapes and architectural scenes. Pennell's work often captured the essence of the industrial age, focusing on the grandeur and complexity of modern cities.","observation":"Across all four images, monumental urban architecture and riverside views are rendered as highly detailed drawings in fine, densely layered ink lines and crosshatching. The restrained sepia-black palette, deep architectural shadows, and pale atmospheric skies create a moody, antique print-like appearance."},{"id":"ralph-steadman","name":"Ralph Steadman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ralph Steadman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ralph-steadman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ralph-steadman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["cream","black","bone-white","rust","grey","red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Ralph Steadman is a British illustrator and artist known for his distinctive and chaotic style, often associated with the works of Hunter S. Thompson. His art is characterized by bold lines, surreal imagery, and a satirical edge, frequently exploring themes of madness and social critique.","observation":"The style combines loosely sketched animal and human-like figures with visible ink lines, broad, rough paint marks, splashes, drips, and layered surface texture. Strong red, blue, black, and cream contrasts, exaggerated anatomy, and oversized eyes create an expressive, surreal character-study quality across the sheet."},{"id":"brian-froud","name":"Brian Froud","cat":"illustrators","en":"Brian Froud","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-froud.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-froud","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","brown","grey","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Brian Froud is a renowned British illustrator and conceptual designer, best known for his work in the fantasy genre. His illustrations often feature mythical creatures and have been influential in films such as \"The Dark Crystal\" and \"Labyrinth.\" Froud's work is characterized by its intricate detail and imaginative portrayal of folklore and fairy tales.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly close-ups of grotesque fantasy beings integrated with roots, leaves, feathers, and other forest materials. Dark teal, brown, and ochre colors, soft atmospheric backgrounds, and expressive faces create a brooding, folkloric surrealism with highly tactile surface detail."},{"id":"januz-miralles","name":"Januz Miralles","cat":"various-artists","en":"Januz Miralles","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/januz-miralles.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/januz-miralles","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","white","black","beige","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Januz Miralles is an artist known for his unique approach to digital and mixed media art, often exploring themes of identity and emotion through abstract and surreal compositions. His work is characterized by a blend of traditional and digital techniques, creating haunting and introspective pieces that challenge conventional portraiture.","observation":"Across all four portraits, realistic facial features dissolve into forceful black brushwork, ink splatters, charcoal-like shading, and loose linear marks. The stark monochrome palette, pale negative space, and repeated facial obscuration create an expressive, fragmented, slightly dark surreal mood."},{"id":"michael-humphries","name":"Michael Humphries","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Humphries","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-humphries.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-humphries","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","charcoal","brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Michael Humphries is an American artist known for his detailed and atmospheric paintings, often depicting serene landscapes and nostalgic scenes. His work is characterized by a romantic and whimsical style, capturing the essence of idyllic settings with a painterly approach.","observation":"The style combines richly textured painterly rendering with fine, controlled brushwork and dense architectural, botanical, and environmental detail. Cool blue-green atmospheres are punctuated by warm lanterns and windows, while towering clouds, waterfalls, and monumental fantasy structures create expressive, immersive scenes with strong light-dark contrast."},{"id":"karen-noles","name":"Karen Noles","cat":"painters","en":"Karen Noles","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karen-noles.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karen-noles","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-ochre","grey","dark-red","light-orange","orange"],"intro":"Karen Noles is an American artist known for her detailed and realistic paintings, often depicting Native American themes and subjects. Her work is characterized by a deep appreciation for cultural heritage and a focus on the beauty of everyday life, capturing moments with a sense of warmth and authenticity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible brushwork with highly detailed, expressive portraits set in lush gardens. Saturated reds, greens, and warm skin tones are shaped by glowing sunlight, while elaborate garments, jewelry, flowers, and small animals create a romantic fantasy tableau."},{"id":"greg-staples","name":"Greg Staples","cat":"illustrators","en":"Greg Staples","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-staples.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-staples","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-red","muted-blue","dark-blue","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Greg Staples is a renowned illustrator known for his work in fantasy and science fiction genres. He has contributed to various comic books and trading card games, creating vivid and imaginative worlds. His art is characterized by detailed and expressive characters, often set in epic and otherworldly scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, broad painterly strokes to build dense fantasy scenes filled with robed characters, magical effects, ruins, and imposing environments. Saturated purples, reds, blues, and teals are pushed against deep shadows, with internal light sources such as fire, magical energy, glowing spheres, and luminous water creating a dramatic epic mood."},{"id":"hideo-kojima","name":"Hideo Kojima","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hideo Kojima","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hideo-kojima.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hideo-kojima","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","dark"],"colours":["black","white","charcoal","grey","silver","orange","red"],"intro":"Hideo Kojima is a renowned Japanese video game designer, director, and producer, best known for creating the Metal Gear series. His work is characterized by complex narratives, cinematic storytelling, and innovative gameplay mechanics. Kojima has been influential in the gaming industry, often blending elements of film and interactive media to create immersive experiences.","observation":"The style combines stark, highly realistic portrait photography with dramatic black-and-white contrast, selective red accents, and dense distressed graphic overlays. Repeated glasses, beards, dark clothing, fragmented cybernetic details, and collage-like ruptures create a bleak, surreal techno-industrial character aesthetic."},{"id":"alberto-burri","name":"Alberto Burri","cat":"painters","en":"Alberto Burri","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alberto-burri.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alberto-burri","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-red","ochre","vivid-red","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"Alberto Burri is an Italian artist known for his innovative use of materials and techniques in abstract art. He was a key figure in the Arte Povera movement, which emerged in Italy in the 1960s. Burri's work often involved unconventional materials such as burlap, plastic, and tar, creating textured and tactile surfaces that challenged traditional notions of painting.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses abstract geometric blocks in a forceful red, black, cream, and beige palette. Thick, visibly built-up paint, scraped and cracked surfaces, rough edges, and broad gestural marks give the compositions an expressive, tactile quality with strong contrast."},{"id":"jamel-shabazz","name":"Jamel Shabazz","cat":"photographers","en":"Jamel Shabazz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jamel-shabazz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jamel-shabazz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","portraits","urban","grain","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","charcoal","dark-red"],"intro":"Jamel Shabazz is a renowned American photographer known for his vivid documentation of urban life and hip-hop culture in New York City during the 1980s and 1990s. His work captures the essence of street style and the vibrant energy of youth, often focusing on themes of identity, community, and cultural expression. Shabazz's photographs are celebrated for their authenticity and ability to convey the spirit of an era.","observation":"The style is a detailed, realistic photographic treatment of boldly styled people posed throughout dense urban streets and stoops. Saturated warm colors, vintage clothing, strong accessories, and visible film grain give the portraits a retro editorial and cinematic character."},{"id":"erik-madigan-heck","name":"Erik Madigan Heck","cat":"photographers","en":"Erik Madigan Heck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erik-madigan-heck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erik-madigan-heck","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-red","deep-red","muted-red"],"intro":"Erik Madigan Heck is a contemporary American photographer known for his vibrant and painterly fashion photography. His work often blurs the line between photography and fine art, creating images that are both visually striking and conceptually rich. Heck's photographs are characterized by their bold use of color, intricate patterns, and a surreal, dreamlike quality that draws inspiration from historical art movements.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, ornate floral textiles with composed fashion portraits, using saturated red, blue, and ivory against strong dark-light contrast. Clean illustrative contours and densely repeated botanical motifs give the images a luxurious editorial, textile-design quality, while sculptural garments and dramatic cropping create bold silhouettes."},{"id":"roberto-ferri","name":"Roberto Ferri","cat":"painters","en":"Roberto Ferri","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roberto-ferri.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roberto-ferri","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Roberto Ferri is an Italian painter known for his contemporary interpretations of classical themes, often drawing inspiration from Baroque and Renaissance art. His work is characterized by a deep understanding of human anatomy and a dramatic use of light and shadow, reminiscent of Caravaggio.","observation":"The style uses richly painted, highly visible brushwork to model flesh, hair, and voluminous fabric with dense tactile detail. Dark grounds and strong light-dark separation create an intense, theatrical mood, while cropped figures, blindfolds, and expressive poses give the portraits a charged sense of vulnerability and movement."},{"id":"balthus","name":"Balthus","cat":"painters","en":"Balthus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/balthus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/balthus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","deep-red","muted-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Balthus is a renowned 20th-century painter known for his enigmatic and evocative works, often depicting young girls in introspective and dreamlike settings. His real-life counterpart, Balthasar Klossowski de Rola, was a Polish-French modern artist whose style combined elements of surrealism and classicism, creating a unique narrative quality in his paintings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly interiors populated by carefully posed figures and everyday domestic activity. Muted earthy colors, selective red accents, deep shadows, and sharply angled window light create a somber, psychologically charged atmosphere, while fine brushwork supports abundant architectural and material detail."},{"id":"petrina-hicks","name":"Petrina Hicks","cat":"photographers","en":"Petrina Hicks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/petrina-hicks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/petrina-hicks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-cyan","silver","muted-green","beige","dark-brown","ochre","red"],"intro":"Petrina Hicks is an Australian photographer known for her contemporary and surreal portraiture. Her work often explores themes of beauty, identity, and the human condition, utilizing a minimalist aesthetic and soft color palettes to create ethereal images.","observation":"This style combines highly realistic, finely rendered portraiture with elaborate fashion details, especially lace, ruffles, sculpted hairstyles, and oversized floral adornment. Soft pastel backgrounds, restrained color, centered cropping, and gentle diffused light give the images a dreamy, refined editorial mood."},{"id":"herzog-and-de-meuron","name":"Herzog & de Meuron","cat":"architects","en":"Herzog & de Meuron","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herzog-and-de-meuron.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herzog-and-de-meuron","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","brown","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Herzog & de Meuron is a Swiss architectural firm known for its innovative and sustainable designs. Founded in 1978, the firm has gained international acclaim for its unique approach to integrating modernist principles with environmental considerations. Their work often features bold geometric forms, extensive use of glass, and incorporation of greenery, reflecting a commitment to both aesthetic and ecological sustainability.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic architectural visualizations with monumental geometric forms, carefully resolved structural details, and integrated greenery in dense urban settings. Warm low-angle sunlight, reflective water, deep shadow, and subdued earthy materials create a cinematic sense of scale and atmosphere across both interior and exterior views."},{"id":"bong-joon-ho","name":"Bong Joon Ho","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Bong Joon Ho","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bong-joon-ho.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bong-joon-ho","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Bong Joon Ho is a renowned South Korean filmmaker known for his work in both Korean and international cinema. He gained global recognition for his unique storytelling and genre-blending films, such as \"Parasite,\" which won the Academy Award for Best Picture. Bong's films often explore themes of class struggle, social inequality, and human nature, presented with a mix of dark humor and suspense.","observation":"The style presents intimate, highly realistic close-up portraits with strong monochrome contrast, dramatic directional light, and selective focus. Repeated glasses, curly hair, stubble, dark clothing, and contemplative poses create a cinematic, psychologically focused portrait aesthetic, while one panel introduces a rough graphic-textured treatment without changing the overall photographic character."},{"id":"stephen-gammell","name":"Stephen Gammell","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stephen Gammell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-gammell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-gammell","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","dreamy","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["white","grey","silver","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Stephen Gammell is an American illustrator known for his distinctive and haunting artwork, particularly in children's books. His illustrations often feature eerie and surreal elements, creating a unique and memorable visual style that has captivated audiences for decades.","observation":"Across all four images, broad, gestural black-and-white marks build hazy landscapes and immense stormlike forms around tiny, isolated figures. High contrast, extensive white space, blurred edges, and expressive brushwork create a dreamlike, ominous sense of scale and motion."},{"id":"anton-corbijn","name":"Anton Corbijn","cat":"photographers","en":"Anton Corbijn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anton-corbijn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anton-corbijn","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","white","charcoal","silver","grey"],"intro":"Anton Corbijn is a renowned Dutch photographer and filmmaker known for his iconic portraits of musicians and artists. His work often captures the raw and intimate essence of his subjects, blending elements of rock and roll culture with a stark, minimalist aesthetic. Corbijn's photography has significantly influenced the visual representation of music and celebrity culture.","observation":"A stark black-and-white photographic style built around severe contrast, deep shadows, and grainy texture. Close-cropped portraits and full-body figures in black clothing are placed in bleak outdoor settings, with cinematic compositions, windblown hair, and animal companions reinforcing the austere mood."},{"id":"ralph-bakshi","name":"Ralph Bakshi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ralph Bakshi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ralph-bakshi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ralph-bakshi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-red","blue","vivid-red","light-orange","light-yellow"],"intro":"Ralph Bakshi is an influential American animator and director known for his work in both animated and live-action films. He gained prominence in the 1970s and 1980s with groundbreaking projects that often pushed the boundaries of traditional animation. Bakshi's work is characterized by its bold storytelling, unique visual style, and willingness to tackle controversial themes. He is best known for films like \"Fritz the Cat,\" \" The Lord of the Rings ,\" and \"American Pop,\" which have left a lasting impact on the animation industry.","observation":"The style combines dense, imaginative fantasy scenes with strongly outlined illustrative drawing, intricate organic textures, and dramatic silhouettes. Saturated blues, oranges, reds, and greens are pushed against deep blacks, while surreal creatures, monumental architecture, and robed figures create an otherworldly narrative atmosphere."},{"id":"clemens-ascher","name":"Clemens Ascher","cat":"photographers","en":"Clemens Ascher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clemens-ascher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clemens-ascher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-cyan","muted-cyan","vivid-red","pale-green","muted-ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Clemens Ascher is an Austrian photographer known for his conceptual and visually striking works that often explore themes of modernity and urban life. His photography is characterized by a unique blend of minimalism and surrealism, creating a distinct visual language that challenges conventional perceptions of space and architecture.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, fashion-editorial photography with saturated teal, red, and cream color blocking, hard sunlight, and pronounced shadows. Human figures are placed small or off-center within vast geometric settings, creating cinematic, surreal-looking scenes with strong negative space and carefully controlled visual balance."},{"id":"rumiko-takahashi","name":"Rumiko Takahashi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rumiko Takahashi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rumiko-takahashi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rumiko-takahashi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","floral","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","light-orange","silver","vivid-red","dark-blue","dark-brown"],"intro":"Rumiko Takahashi is a renowned Japanese manga artist known for her popular series such as ' Inuyasha ' and 'Ranma ½'. Her work is celebrated for its engaging storytelling, memorable characters, and distinctive art style that has influenced the manga and anime industry worldwide.","observation":"The style uses highly expressive illustrated character portraits with thick ink-like outlines, clean cel-shaded color blocks, and saturated red, blue, black, and cream tones. Dense floral and scenic backgrounds, dramatic cropping, large reflective eyes, and a lightly textured printed surface give the images a retro comic-panel appearance."},{"id":"aaron-horkey","name":"Aaron Horkey","cat":"illustrators","en":"Aaron Horkey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aaron-horkey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aaron-horkey","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","muted-orange","black","deep-red","pale-orange"],"intro":"Aaron Horkey is an American artist known for his intricate and highly detailed illustrations, often featuring surreal and fantastical themes. His work is characterized by fine linework and ornate detailing, drawing inspiration from nature and mythology. Horkey's pieces often incorporate elements of fantasy and gothic aesthetics, creating a unique blend of realism and imagination.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, highly detailed linework to build expressive birds and fantastical creatures from layered feathers, curls, and ornamental forms. Dark grounds, cream highlights, and selective red accents create a dramatic high-contrast palette, while the elaborate contours and hybrid imagery give the compositions a surreal fantasy character."},{"id":"alena-aenami","name":"Alena Aenami","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alena Aenami","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alena-aenami.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alena-aenami","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-pink","red","charcoal"],"intro":"Alena Aenami is a contemporary digital artist known for her captivating and atmospheric illustrations. Her work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, set against expansive landscapes and urban environments. Aenami's art is characterized by its vivid color palettes and dreamlike quality, drawing viewers into a world that feels both familiar and otherworldly.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly city and suburban landscapes shaped by dramatic twilight skies, saturated coral-pink light, and deep blue shadow. Dense utility-wire silhouettes, wet reflective surfaces, and isolated human figures create a cinematic, atmospheric sense of solitude and motion."},{"id":"earl-norem","name":"Earl Norem","cat":"illustrators","en":"Earl Norem","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/earl-norem.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/earl-norem","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","charcoal","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Earl Norem is known for his work as an American illustrator, particularly in the realm of fantasy and adventure art. His illustrations have graced the covers of numerous comic books, magazines, and novels, often depicting heroic figures and mythical creatures in dynamic and dramatic settings. Norem's style is characterized by its vivid color palettes, detailed compositions, and a strong sense of narrative.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and densely packed, using broad, visible strokes, strongly modeled figures, and expressive faces across dramatic fantasy tableaux. Saturated reds, ochres, and blues stand against deep shadow, with high contrast and warm firelike illumination reinforcing the theatrical, mythic atmosphere."},{"id":"olly-moss","name":"Olly Moss","cat":"illustrators","en":"Olly Moss","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olly-moss.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olly-moss","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["black","bone-white","vivid-red","charcoal","grey","beige"],"intro":"Olly Moss is a contemporary British graphic designer and illustrator known for his distinctive and minimalist style, often incorporating clever visual twists and pop culture references. His work spans various media, including posters, book covers, and video game art, and he has gained recognition for his ability to distill complex themes into simple yet impactful visuals.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental landscapes and sparse robed figures are reduced to stark silhouettes and broad, expressive painted forms. Deep blacks, intense reds, and smoky blue-green shadows create high contrast, while rough brush texture and generous negative space give the images a graphic, poster-like atmosphere."},{"id":"masao-yamamoto","name":"Masao Yamamoto","cat":"photographers","en":"Masao Yamamoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/masao-yamamoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/masao-yamamoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["animals","landscapes","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","dreamy","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["black","beige","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Masao Yamamoto is a Japanese photographer known for his small-scale, intimate photographs that explore themes of memory, nature, and the passage of time. His work often features a delicate interplay of light and shadow, capturing fleeting moments with a sense of tranquility and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses restrained near-monochrome tones, heavy silhouettes, deep shadows, and broad areas of atmospheric emptiness. Grain, fog, soft horizons, and isolated natural or human forms create a quiet, ominous, dreamlike cinematic mood."},{"id":"stephanie-pui-mun-law","name":"Stephanie Law","cat":"painters","en":"Stephanie Law","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephanie-pui-mun-law.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephanie-pui-mun-law","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["beige","grey","silver","charcoal","dark-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Stephanie Law is an American fantasy artist known for her intricate watercolor paintings that blend elements of mythology, nature, and the fantastical. Her work often features delicate linework, ethereal subjects, and a dreamlike quality, drawing inspiration from folklore and the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly painted birds, feathers, flowers, and foliage fill the frame with delicate linework and visible, layered brush marks. The restrained cream, teal, green, and coral palette, elaborate surface decoration, and flowing organic contours create an ornate, dreamlike natural tableau."},{"id":"adrian-smith","name":"Adrian Smith","cat":"illustrators","en":"Adrian Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adrian-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adrian-smith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["grey","black","brown","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Adrian Smith is a renowned illustrator and concept artist known for his work in the fantasy genre, particularly in the realm of gaming and graphic novels. His art often features intricate details and a strong narrative element, bringing to life fantastical worlds and characters with a distinct style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly and heavily textured, with broad visible strokes shaping elaborate armor, bones, fabric, and ruined environments. Dark teal and brown shadows are punctuated by intense red cloth and occasional warm light, creating a grim, high-contrast fantasy world of monumental undead figures and dramatic atmospheric scenes."},{"id":"erwin-olaf","name":"Erwin Olaf","cat":"photographers","en":"Erwin Olaf","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erwin-olaf.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erwin-olaf","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","brown","grey"],"intro":"Erwin Olaf is a renowned Dutch photographer known for his highly stylized and meticulously crafted images that often explore themes of societal norms and human emotion. His work is characterized by a blend of classical aesthetics with modern techniques, creating a unique visual language that is both provocative and thought-provoking.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic staging with carefully composed figures, animals, costumes, and antique interiors. Muted green, black, cream, and occasional dusty pink tones create a dark, surreal mood, while selective focus, dramatic lighting, and richly rendered fabrics and furnishings give the tableaux a polished editorial quality."},{"id":"emperor-huizong-of-song","name":"Emperor Huizong of Song","cat":"painters","en":"Emperor Huizong of Song","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emperor-huizong-of-song.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emperor-huizong-of-song","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["brown","muted-brown","muted-ochre","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Emperor Huizong of Song was a Chinese emperor known for his patronage of the arts and his own artistic talents. He reigned during the Song Dynasty and was a notable painter and calligrapher, contributing significantly to the cultural and artistic developments of his time.","observation":"These images use highly detailed, painterly brushwork with delicate ink-like lines, layered washes, and a restrained earthy palette accented by red blossoms and seals. Gnarled trees, flowers, birds, deer, mountains, snow, and architectural elements are arranged in expansive scroll-like landscapes with ornamental surface detail and atmospheric depth."},{"id":"jessica-galbreth","name":"Jessica Galbreth","cat":"painters","en":"Jessica Galbreth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jessica-galbreth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jessica-galbreth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","charcoal","dark-pink","dark-red"],"intro":"Jessica Galbreth is an artist known for her enchanting fantasy illustrations, often featuring ethereal and mystical themes. Her work typically includes delicate and detailed portrayals of mythical beings, often surrounded by nature and floral elements.","observation":"The style combines intimate close-up portraiture with richly rendered flowers, foliage, birds, and other natural adornments. Fine drawn lines, visible textured strokes, softly muted jewel tones, and dense surface detail give the images an ornate, hand-illustrated fantasy quality."},{"id":"alex-raymond","name":"Alex Raymond","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alex Raymond","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-raymond.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-raymond","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","light-orange","rust","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Alex Raymond was an influential American comic strip artist, best known for creating the classic adventure series \"Flash Gordon.\" His work is celebrated for its detailed and dynamic illustrations, which have left a lasting impact on the comic art genre.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines graphic, illustrative figure design with visible broad paint strokes, rough surface texture, and forceful dark-versus-light modeling. It favors tightly cropped characters, theatrical expressions, crowded narrative groupings, and a restrained palette punctuated by warm reds, ochres, and deep blue-green."},{"id":"cody-ellingham","name":"Cody Ellingham","cat":"photographers","en":"Cody Ellingham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cody-ellingham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cody-ellingham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","backlighting","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi"],"colours":["charcoal","black","dark-cyan","dark-brown","grey","rust"],"intro":"Cody Ellingham is a contemporary photographer known for capturing the essence of urban environments, often focusing on the interplay between light and architecture. His work frequently explores themes of nostalgia and futurism, drawing inspiration from urban landscapes and the stories they tell.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic realism to frame sparse, atmospheric scenes of monumental architecture, vehicles, and isolated figures. A restrained teal-and-orange palette, deep shadows, glowing practical lights, wet reflections, mist, and occasional backlighting create a moody futuristic-industrial atmosphere."},{"id":"richard-mosse","name":"Richard Mosse","cat":"photographers","en":"Richard Mosse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-mosse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-mosse","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal"],"colours":["pink","deep-red","dark-magenta","muted-blue","white","black"],"intro":"Richard Mosse is an Irish photographer known for his work that captures conflict zones using infrared film, creating surreal and vivid imagery. His work often explores themes of war, human suffering, and the environment, utilizing unique photographic techniques to challenge perceptions and provoke thought.","observation":"The style combines realistic, cinematic landscape imagery with an aggressively magenta color treatment that makes natural terrain feel surreal and otherworldly. Broad panoramic compositions, strong atmospheric depth, and occasional industrial interior settings contrast organic mountains with artificial lighting and projected scenery."},{"id":"aaron-james-draplin","name":"Aaron James Draplin","cat":"designers","en":"Aaron James Draplin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aaron-james-draplin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aaron-james-draplin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","patterns","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["pale-yellow","cream","charcoal","vivid-orange","muted-green","orange","green"],"intro":"Aaron James Draplin is a prominent American graphic designer known for his bold and colorful design work. He is the founder of Draplin Design Co. and has worked with numerous high-profile clients, creating logos, posters, and other visual materials that are both functional and aesthetically striking. Draplin's work often draws inspiration from vintage Americana and industrial design, combining a love for typography and bold graphics.","observation":"The style uses bold geometric silhouettes, clean flat color blocks, and strongly outlined graphic forms, repeatedly treating landscapes and wildlife as emblematic poster or badge designs. Saturated orange, teal, cream, navy, and dark green are unified by a subtle printed grain and retro outdoor-signage sensibility."},{"id":"alex-prager","name":"Alex Prager","cat":"photographers","en":"Alex Prager","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-prager.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-prager","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","backlighting","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["muted-ochre","dark-green","muted-blue","black","charcoal","ochre"],"intro":"Alex Prager is an American photographer and filmmaker known for her staged, cinematic images that often feature meticulously crafted scenes and characters. Her work is recognized for its blend of Hollywood glamour and surreal narratives, drawing inspiration from film, fashion, and popular culture.","observation":"These realistic photographic scenes use dramatic low and overhead viewpoints, forceful diagonals, cropped bodies, and long shadows to create a kinetic, filmic sense of action. Saturated warm tones, hard directional sunlight, vintage clothing and suburban settings give the images a strongly retro visual character, while selective blur and expressive poses heighten the staged narrative mood."},{"id":"alec-monopoly","name":"Alec Monopoly","cat":"street-artists","en":"Alec Monopoly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alec-monopoly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alec-monopoly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","collage"],"colours":["black","pale-orange","vivid-red","beige","muted-cyan","olive"],"intro":"Alec Monopoly is a pseudonymous street artist known for his satirical depictions of popular culture icons, often focusing on themes of wealth and capitalism. His work frequently features the Monopoly Man, a character from the board game, as a symbol of financial excess and societal critique. Alec Monopoly's art has been showcased in galleries and public spaces worldwide, blending graffiti with pop art influences.","observation":"The style combines brightly colored, flat graphic cartoon figures with extremely heavy black contour lines and simplified facial features. These clean comic forms are layered over a densely worked, tactile mixed-media ground of paint splatters, scrawled marks, currency imagery, patterns, and typography, producing a high-contrast collage effect."},{"id":"richard-avedon","name":"Richard Avedon","cat":"photographers","en":"Richard Avedon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-avedon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-avedon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["white","charcoal","black","silver","grey"],"intro":"Richard Avedon is a renowned American fashion and portrait photographer known for his work in the mid-20th century. He revolutionized fashion photography by bringing emotion and movement into his images, often capturing the essence of his subjects in a striking and memorable way. Avedon's portraits are celebrated for their stark simplicity and ability to reveal the personality and inner life of the subject.","observation":"A stark monochrome portrait style uses realistic, highly textured faces, deep blacks, and bright white backgrounds to create intense contrast. Extreme cropping, direct gazes, expressive poses, and occasional movement in hair or clothing give the images a forceful editorial character."},{"id":"marc-johns","name":"Marc Johns","cat":"various-artists","en":"Marc Johns","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-johns.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-johns","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","grain","subdued-colors","comics","surreal","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","white","silver","black","beige","brown"],"intro":"Marc Johns is a contemporary Canadian artist known for his whimsical and minimalist illustrations. His work often features humorous and surreal elements, combining simple line drawings with clever captions. Johns's art has been widely appreciated for its unique blend of simplicity and wit, making it popular in various media and publications.","observation":"The style uses spare, hand-drawn character designs with heavy ink contours, simple facial features, elongated proportions, and occasional scratchy interior marks. Muted color accents sit on a textured paper ground, while large areas of negative space and surreal, quietly odd situations give the images a whimsical yet slightly melancholic storybook quality."},{"id":"corey-arnold","name":"Corey Arnold","cat":"photographers","en":"Corey Arnold","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/corey-arnold.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/corey-arnold","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","scenes","mist","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","light-cyan","charcoal","muted-cyan","silver","dark-brown"],"intro":"Corey Arnold is a contemporary photographer known for capturing the rugged and often isolated beauty of natural and rural environments. His work often explores themes of human interaction with nature, focusing on the stark and sometimes harsh realities of life at sea and in remote landscapes.","observation":"A realistic, cinematic style depicts fishermen working aboard small boats in violent, wet seas, with dense environmental detail and active motion throughout. Cold blue-green shadows, restrained color, orange protective clothing, rain, spray, and heavy cloud create a dark, high-contrast maritime atmosphere."},{"id":"craig-mullins","name":"Craig Mullins","cat":"illustrators","en":"Craig Mullins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/craig-mullins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/craig-mullins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","beige","ochre","pale-orange"],"intro":"Craig Mullins is a renowned digital artist known for his pioneering work in concept art and illustration. His contributions to the fields of video games, films, and books have made him a highly influential figure in the digital art community. Mullins's work is characterized by its dynamic compositions, rich textures, and innovative use of digital techniques, which have set a standard for contemporary digital art.","observation":"The style uses heavily textured, visible brushwork with expressive, finely broken strokes to build imposing figures, ruined architecture, and skeletal forms. A dark burnt-orange and black palette, strong light⁠–shadow separation, and smoky atmospheric depth create a grim, cinematic fantasy mood across both portraits and expansive scenes."},{"id":"vince-low","name":"Vince Low","cat":"painters","en":"Vince Low","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vince-low.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vince-low","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal"],"colours":["white","silver","black","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Vince Low is a Malaysian artist known for his intricate and expressive line drawings, often focusing on portraits that convey deep emotion and complexity. His work is characterized by a unique use of fine lines and dynamic strokes, creating a sense of movement and intensity.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, intensely detailed facial portraiture with monochrome tonal modelling and stark contrast. Fine, tangled drawn lines, crosshatched marks, splatters, and eroded fragments break apart the faces against near-empty white grounds, giving the portraits an expressive and surreal quality."},{"id":"hasui-kawase","name":"Hasui Kawase","cat":"printmakers","en":"Hasui Kawase","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hasui-kawase.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hasui-kawase","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-cyan","dark-blue","muted-blue","black","charcoal","pale-orange"],"intro":"Hasui Kawase was a prominent Japanese printmaker and painter, known for his contributions to the shin-hanga movement in the early 20th century. His works often depict serene landscapes, rural scenes, and traditional Japanese architecture, capturing the beauty and tranquility of Japan's natural and built environments. Kawase's prints are celebrated for their exquisite detail, subtle color gradations, and ability to evoke a sense of nostalgia and peace.","observation":"The style presents richly detailed lakeside landscapes with dark, cool blue-green palettes, warm window light, and strong twilight contrast. Painterly texture, atmospheric mist, reflective water, and carefully rendered trees and traditional wooden buildings create a quiet, dreamlike mood across changing seasons and weather."},{"id":"olivia-locher","name":"Olivia Locher","cat":"photographers","en":"Olivia Locher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olivia-locher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olivia-locher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-cyan","deep-red","light-lime","ochre","dark-olive"],"intro":"Olivia Locher is an American photographer known for her vibrant and whimsical conceptual photography. Her work often challenges societal norms and explores themes of humor and surrealism, making her a distinctive voice in contemporary art.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic editorial portrait photography with surreal, sculptural floral headpieces, theatrical props, and deliberately coordinated costumes. Saturated orange, turquoise, mint, and red accents stand out against spacious teal studio backgrounds, while shallow focus and carefully arranged tableaux create a polished fashion-magazine look."},{"id":"ralph-mcquarrie","name":"Ralph McQuarrie","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ralph McQuarrie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ralph-mcquarrie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ralph-mcquarrie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","dark-blue","brown","orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"Ralph McQuarrie was an American conceptual designer and illustrator, renowned for his work on the original Star Wars trilogy. His visionary designs and illustrations played a crucial role in shaping the visual identity of the Star Wars universe, influencing the look of science fiction in film and media.","observation":"The style presents speculative spacecraft and monumental alien environments with a photorealistic, filmic treatment. Muted twilight palettes, warm atmospheric light, visible haze, and strong scale contrasts create a dreamy yet grounded science-fiction mood across varied landscapes."},{"id":"stephen-hillenburg","name":"Stephen Hillenburg","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stephen Hillenburg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-hillenburg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-hillenburg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","funny"],"colours":["red","blue","dark-cyan","muted-green","deep-red","orange"],"intro":"Stephen Hillenburg is best known as the creator of the iconic animated television series \"SpongeBob SquarePants.\" Born in 1961, Hillenburg was an American animator, writer, producer, and marine science educator. His work has had a significant impact on popular culture, particularly through his unique blend of humor and oceanic themes.","observation":"The style combines recognizable cartoon characters with thick, tactile paint, visible brush marks, rough edges, and broad expressive strokes. Saturated pinks, yellows, blues, and turquoise dominate, while exaggerated faces, playful poses, and lightly absurd scenes give the images a humorous fantasy quality."},{"id":"naoya-hatakeyama","name":"Naoya Hatakeyama","cat":"photographers","en":"Naoya Hatakeyama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/naoya-hatakeyama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/naoya-hatakeyama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-green","brown","beige","red"],"intro":"Naoya Hatakeyama is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his exploration of the relationship between nature and urban environments. His work often captures the intricate details and expansive views of landscapes, both natural and man-made, reflecting on the impact of human activity on the environment.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic landscape imagery with dense natural detail, dramatic scale, and carefully controlled atmospheric depth. Deep blue-green shadows contrast with intense orange illumination, while mist, smoke, cloud masses, and distant terrain create layered, film-like vistas."},{"id":"guy-aroch","name":"Guy Aroch","cat":"photographers","en":"Guy Aroch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-aroch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-aroch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","backlighting","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","dark-brown","orange","pale-green","rust"],"intro":"Guy Aroch is a renowned photographer known for his work in fashion and celebrity portraiture. His style is characterized by a cinematic approach, often capturing intimate and expressive moments with a focus on natural lighting and vivid colors. Aroch's work has been featured in numerous high-profile magazines and advertising campaigns, making him a prominent figure in contemporary photography.","observation":"A cinematic photographic portrait style built from intimate close-ups, warm amber highlights, deep teal shadows, and strong directional light. Window-like bands, reflections, flare, shallow focus, grain, and occasional motion blur create a tactile, nostalgic editorial mood across the portraits."},{"id":"rosalyn-drexler","name":"Rosalyn Drexler","cat":"various-artists","en":"Rosalyn Drexler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rosalyn-drexler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rosalyn-drexler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","fashion","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric","silhouette"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","cyan","red","orange"],"intro":"Rosalyn Drexler is an American artist, novelist, and playwright known for her contributions to the pop art movement. Her work often explores themes of consumer culture and media influence, reflecting the vibrant and bold aesthetics of the 1960s.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses hard-edged graphic shapes, flat blocks of saturated red, blue, yellow, and black, and strongly simplified figures with selectively indicated facial and clothing details. Dramatic cropping, silhouettes, angular compositions, and staged social or leisure activities give the images a stylized retro film-poster atmosphere."},{"id":"ashley-wood","name":"Ashley Wood","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ashley Wood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ashley-wood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ashley-wood","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","sci-fi"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","grey","black","brown"],"intro":"Ashley Wood is an Australian illustrator and artist known for his distinctive style that blends traditional and digital techniques. He has worked on various projects, including comic books, graphic novels, and video game art, and is recognized for his gritty, expressive approach that often features sci-fi and surreal elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, futuristic armored figures are built from forceful, visible brushwork and broken, gestural marks rather than clean digital edges. The restrained beige, gray, black, and off-white palette is repeatedly punctuated by strong dark forms, while mechanical details remain readable within the expressive painterly abstraction."},{"id":"yves-brayer","name":"Yves Brayer","cat":"painters","en":"Yves Brayer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yves-brayer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yves-brayer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","grey","muted-ochre","dark-rust","yellow"],"intro":"Yves Brayer is a renowned French painter known for his vivid landscapes and scenes depicting Mediterranean life. His work often captures the essence of rural and coastal settings, characterized by a rich use of color and dynamic compositions. Brayer's paintings are celebrated for their ability to convey the warmth and vibrancy of the regions he portrayed, making him a significant figure in 20th-century French art.","observation":"Across all four pictures, coastal architecture and sea views are rendered with visible, directional brushwork, simplified geometric forms, and crisp linear accents. Saturated blues, greens, coral pinks, and warm creams create a bright Mediterranean atmosphere, while layered buildings, foliage, furniture, and framed views give the compositions considerable visual detail."},{"id":"mike-mayhew","name":"Mike Mayhew","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mike Mayhew","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-mayhew.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-mayhew","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["charcoal","red","dark-brown","orange","muted-blue","pale-orange"],"intro":"Mike Mayhew is an American comic book artist known for his detailed and realistic style, often working on covers and interiors for major publishers like Marvel and DC Comics. His work is characterized by a strong sense of realism combined with dynamic compositions and vivid colors, bringing iconic characters to life in a way that resonates with fans of the superhero genre.","observation":"The style combines strongly visible, broad paint strokes with graphic illustrative construction, bold contours, saturated primary colors, and sharp light-dark contrasts. It favors tightly cropped, emotionally forceful character portraits and superheroic figures, rendered with retro poster-like drama and energetic, textured surfaces."},{"id":"shepard-fairey","name":"Shepard Fairey","cat":"street-artists","en":"Shepard Fairey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shepard-fairey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shepard-fairey","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","portraits","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","ink"],"colours":["black","red","ochre","pale-orange","dark-brown","brown"],"intro":"Shepard Fairey is an American contemporary street artist, graphic designer, and activist known for his iconic \"Obey Giant\" art campaign and the Barack Obama \"Hope\" poster. His work is characterized by its bold, graphic style and often incorporates political and social themes, making him a prominent figure in the street art movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses tightly cropped female portraits with heavy black contouring, simplified flat color planes, and strongly graphic red, cream, and black contrast. Dense textile patterns and distressed mural-like surfaces add ornamental detail, while the bold ink-like lines and posterized shading keep the images illustrative rather than photographic."},{"id":"alex-grey","name":"Alex Grey","cat":"painters","en":"Alex Grey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-grey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-grey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","religious","symmetry"],"colours":["deep-blue","red","charcoal","dark-red","dark-magenta"],"intro":"Alex Grey is an American artist known for his visionary and spiritual art that explores themes of consciousness and the human experience. His work often features intricate anatomical depictions intertwined with spiritual and psychedelic imagery, creating a unique fusion of art and spirituality.","observation":"Highly saturated red-and-blue frontal faces are built from dense, finely drawn lines, repeating motifs, and radial symmetry. The portraits merge human features with multiple eyes, glowing centers, ornamental textures, and abstract patterned forms, giving the style an intense visionary and icon-like presence."},{"id":"claudio-silvestrin","name":"Claudio Silvestrin","cat":"architects","en":"Claudio Silvestrin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claudio-silvestrin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claudio-silvestrin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Claudio Silvestrin is an Italian architect known for his minimalist and serene architectural designs. His work often features clean lines, open spaces, and a harmonious balance between form and function, emphasizing simplicity and tranquility.","observation":"The style presents monumental, geometric architectural spaces with massive earthen walls, sculptural forms, and carefully controlled compositions. Subdued terracotta and stone colors are shaped by strong directional sunlight, deep shadows, and expansive architectural voids, producing a realistic yet imposing atmosphere."},{"id":"alice-kettle","name":"Alice Kettle","cat":"painters","en":"Alice Kettle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alice-kettle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alice-kettle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","collage"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","charcoal","muted-blue","red","orange"],"intro":"Alice Kettle is a contemporary British textile artist known for her large-scale, expressive works that blend traditional embroidery techniques with modern artistic practices. Her art often explores themes of identity, nature, and human experience, utilizing intricate stitching and vibrant colors to create dynamic and textured pieces.","observation":"The style combines intensely textured, hand-painted portraiture with assembled textile surfaces, frayed threads, woven fabric, and fine loose linework. Vivid reds, blues, greens, and oranges heighten the expressive faces and surreal narrative scenes, while collage-like layering makes the images feel tactile and materially constructed."},{"id":"don-heck","name":"Don Heck","cat":"illustrators","en":"Don Heck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/don-heck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/don-heck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","white","grey","red","orange","dark-green"],"intro":"Don Heck is a renowned comic book artist known for his work during the Silver Age of Comic Books, particularly with Marvel Comics. He co-created iconic characters such as Iron Man and contributed significantly to the visual style of superhero comics in the 1960s.","observation":"Across the sheet, the style uses graphic comic-book drawing with heavy black contours, dense ink shading, crosshatched texture, and strongly separated blocks of saturated color. Expressive faces, masks, monstrous figures, and dramatic fantasy situations are composed with bold silhouettes and high contrast, combining flat-color posterization with intricate line detail."},{"id":"philippe-caza","name":"Philippe Caza","cat":"illustrators","en":"Philippe Caza","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philippe-caza.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philippe-caza","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","glow","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","epic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Philippe Caza is a renowned French illustrator and comic artist known for his work in the science fiction and fantasy genres. His real-life counterpart has contributed significantly to the visual landscape of speculative fiction, often blending surreal and futuristic elements in his art. Caza's illustrations are characterized by their intricate detail and imaginative settings, making him a prominent figure in the world of graphic novels and speculative art.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, surreal cosmic environments with monumental faces, robed figures, stairways, and impossible architecture. Strong symmetry, radial structures, fine etched linework, dense textures, and stark black-and-white contrast dominate most images, while one render introduces saturated red and indigo against the same ominous, otherworldly grandeur."},{"id":"marsel-van-oosten","name":"Marsel van Oosten","cat":"photographers","en":"Marsel van Oosten","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marsel-van-oosten.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marsel-van-oosten","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","dark-brown","muted-orange"],"intro":"Marsel van Oosten is a renowned wildlife photographer known for his striking images of nature and animals. His work often captures the beauty and complexity of the natural world, earning him numerous awards and recognition in the field of photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is cinematic and highly realistic, combining finely resolved animal subjects or distant birds with vast, sculptural landscapes. Subdued blue-gray and brown palettes are shaped by strong golden backlighting, deep shadows, atmospheric haze, selective focus, and expansive, dreamlike compositions."},{"id":"liniers","name":"Liniers","cat":"illustrators","en":"Liniers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/liniers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/liniers","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","orange","rust"],"intro":"Liniers is an Argentine cartoonist and illustrator known for his comic strip \"Macanudo\" and other works that blend humor with a touch of the surreal. His real-life counterpart, Ricardo Siri, has gained international recognition for his unique style and storytelling ability, often featuring whimsical characters and imaginative scenarios.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses densely detailed, hand-drawn linework with fine hatching and textured marks to build expressive creatures, children, trees, and village settings. Muted blue-gray, brown, black, and rust tones create an eerie woodland atmosphere, while exaggerated eyes, unusual proportions, and whimsical encounters give the scenes a surreal storybook character."},{"id":"rie-cramer","name":"Rie Cramer","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rie Cramer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rie-cramer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rie-cramer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","vivid-colors","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["muted-orange","black","brown","muted-green","red","deep-red"],"intro":"Rie Cramer is a renowned Dutch illustrator known for her enchanting children's book illustrations and fairy tale depictions. Her work is characterized by delicate lines, soft colors, and a whimsical, dreamlike quality that captures the imagination of both children and adults alike.","observation":"The style combines highly decorative, illustrative portraiture with fine contour lines, flattened forms, and densely patterned floral surfaces. Saturated coral, red, teal, cream, and black create a vivid retro palette, while recurring women, flowers, garments, and woodland motifs give the four images a cohesive ornamental character."},{"id":"cathy-horvath-buchanan","name":"Cathy Horvath Buchanan","cat":"painters","en":"Cathy Horvath Buchanan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cathy-horvath-buchanan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cathy-horvath-buchanan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["ochre","vivid-red","silver","blue","brown"],"intro":"Cathy Horvath Buchanan is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and whimsical landscape paintings. Her work often features bold colors and playful compositions that evoke a sense of joy and wonder. Drawing inspiration from nature and folk art traditions, Buchanan's paintings are characterized by their expressive style and imaginative themes.","observation":"The style combines vivid, highly saturated autumn colors with clean illustrative forms and visible, directional impasto-like brush marks. Repeated pastoral landscapes use bold dark outlines, simplified architecture, richly patterned foliage, winding roads, and layered hills to create a storybook-like countryside.】【。}"},{"id":"aaron-reed","name":"Aaron Reed","cat":"photographers","en":"Aaron Reed","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aaron-reed.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aaron-reed","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","floral","landscapes","glow","mist","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","muted-blue","deep-red","light-red","red","magenta"],"intro":"Aaron Reed is a contemporary photographer known for his vibrant and detailed landscape photography, often capturing the beauty of nature with a focus on color and composition. His work is celebrated for its ability to convey the grandeur and tranquility of natural settings, often highlighting the interplay of light and color in the environment.","observation":"Highly realistic landscape imagery combines dense natural detail with saturated seasonal color, from deep mossy greens and fiery autumn reds to luminous pink and orange skies. Misty atmospheric depth, glowing backlight, sculptural rocks and trees, and silky flowing water create a vivid, dreamy sense of wilderness across forests, rivers, and mountain valleys."},{"id":"william-patino","name":"William Patino","cat":"photographers","en":"William Patino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-patino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-patino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","orange","silver","dark-olive","olive"],"intro":"William Patino is a renowned landscape photographer known for capturing the breathtaking beauty of natural environments, particularly in New Zealand and Australia. His work often features dramatic lighting and vivid colors, bringing a sense of awe and wonder to his compositions. Patino's photographs are celebrated for their ability to convey the majesty and tranquility of the natural world.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and richly detailed, presenting monumental landscapes with sculptural rock formations, flowing water, and strong cinematic depth. Saturated sunset light, deep shadows, reflective surfaces, mist, spray, and luminous sunbeams create a vivid, high-contrast atmosphere across the varied coastal and mountain scenes."},{"id":"yuko-shimizu","name":"Yuko Shimizu","cat":"illustrators","en":"Yuko Shimizu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yuko-shimizu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yuko-shimizu","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","floral","landscapes","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["grey","black","pale-orange","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Yuko Shimizu is a Japanese illustrator known for her intricate and imaginative artwork that often blends traditional Japanese themes with contemporary elements. Her work spans various mediums and has been featured in numerous publications and exhibitions worldwide. Shimizu's distinctive style is characterized by its detailed line work and vibrant compositions, drawing inspiration from Japanese folklore and cultural motifs.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely packed, illustrative linework with sweeping, repeated curves that make waves, clouds, hair, foliage, and cosmic forms feel constantly in motion. Saturated red, black, cream, and blue-green areas create strong contrast, while figures and landscapes are staged in grand, dreamlike compositions filled with intricate botanical and atmospheric detail."},{"id":"walt-disney","name":"Walt Disney","cat":"illustrators","en":"Walt Disney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walt-disney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walt-disney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","muted-blue","orange","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Walt Disney was a pioneering American animator, film producer, and entrepreneur, best known for creating iconic characters such as Mickey Mouse and founding Disneyland and Walt Disney World. His work in animation set the foundation for modern animated films and established Disney as a major force in the entertainment industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly layered, directional brushwork with richly textured surfaces and softly blended atmospheric distance. Saturated warm and cool colors, glowing skies and windows, castle landscapes, and populated storybook tableaux create an expansive, cinematic fantasy-painting effect."},{"id":"robert-mcginnis","name":"Robert McGinnis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Robert McGinnis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-mcginnis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-mcginnis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","pale-yellow","muted-cyan","red"],"intro":"Robert McGinnis is an American artist known for his iconic illustrations and paintings, particularly in the realm of paperback book covers and movie posters. His work is characterized by its detailed and realistic portrayal of figures, often capturing the essence of mid-20th-century American culture. McGinnis's art has been influential in the fields of commercial and fine art, leaving a lasting impact on visual storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visible brushwork with layered strokes and strongly modelled faces, clothing, and hair. It presents glamorous fashion-oriented figures in tightly cropped, high-contrast compositions, balancing saturated accent colors with deep blacks and warm earth tones."},{"id":"sarah-andersen","name":"Sarah Andersen","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sarah Andersen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sarah-andersen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sarah-andersen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","bw-monochrome","comics","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Sarah Andersen is a contemporary American cartoonist known for her webcomic series \"Sarah's Scribbles,\" which humorously explores the challenges and quirks of adulthood, often through a semi-autobiographical lens. Her work is celebrated for its relatable content, capturing the essence of millennial life with wit and charm.","observation":"The style is a stark black-and-white comic drawing built from bold ink contours, dense black fills, and mostly unmodulated white space. Simplified, wide-eyed human and animal characters act out small everyday situations with exaggerated expressions, sparse settings, and a dry, expressive awkwardness."},{"id":"dav-pilkey","name":"Dav Pilkey","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dav Pilkey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dav-pilkey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dav-pilkey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","cute"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-brown","black","cyan","red","yellow"],"intro":"Dav Pilkey is an American author and illustrator known for his popular children's book series, including \"Captain Underpants\" and \"Dog Man.\" His work is characterized by humor, engaging storytelling, and a distinctive illustrative style that appeals to young readers.","observation":"Across the sheet, playful cartoon characters use thick black outlines, simplified flat color areas, exaggerated expressions, and highly saturated reds, blues, oranges, and pinks. The imagery feels energetic and humorous, while visible brush texture, paint splatters, and rough mural surfaces give the graphic forms a hand-painted quality."},{"id":"loish","name":"Loish","cat":"various-artists","en":"Loish","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/loish.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/loish","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-red","muted-blue","orange","silver"],"intro":"Loish is a digital artist known for her distinctive style that blends whimsical and ethereal elements with a focus on characters and storytelling. Her work often features dreamy, fantasy-like themes with a modern twist, capturing the imagination of a global audience.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses tightly cropped character portraits with realistic facial anatomy, vivid contrasting color schemes, and strongly expressive gazes and poses. Visible directional brushwork models hair, skin, and fabric, while cyan, orange, and violet light creates luminous highlights against dark backgrounds."},{"id":"amedeo-modigliani","name":"Amedeo Modigliani","cat":"painters","en":"Amedeo Modigliani","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amedeo-modigliani.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amedeo-modigliani","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-red","muted-orange","brown","dark-blue"],"intro":"Amedeo Modigliani was an Italian painter and sculptor known for his distinctive style characterized by elongated forms, simplified shapes, and a focus on portraits. Born in 1884, Modigliani became a prominent figure in the early 20th-century Parisian art scene, contributing to the modernist movement with his unique approach to form and color.","observation":"Across all four portraits, simplified elongated faces, almond-shaped eyes, angular noses, and strong contour lines create a stylized, graphic character. Richly textured brushwork remains visible throughout, combining muted earthy backgrounds with concentrated red, blue, black, and flesh tones and carefully posed fashion details."},{"id":"shuji-terayama","name":"Shuji Terayama","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Shuji Terayama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shuji-terayama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shuji-terayama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","letters","portraits","fine-lines","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","halftone"],"colours":["orange","brown","dark-red","red","green","violet"],"intro":"Shuji Terayama was a Japanese avant-garde filmmaker, poet, and playwright known for his experimental and surreal works. Born in 1935, Terayama became a prominent figure in the Japanese New Wave cinema movement, creating films that challenged traditional narratives and explored themes of identity, memory, and societal norms. His work often incorporated elements of fantasy and surrealism, reflecting his interest in the subconscious mind and the boundaries of reality.","observation":"The style combines tightly cropped portrait photography with surreal facial distortions, vivid clashing colors, oversized red lettering, and visibly degraded print texture. Collage-like layouts, halftone grain, hard color separations, and high contrast give the images an experimental retro editorial character."},{"id":"lisa-holloway","name":"Lisa Holloway","cat":"photographers","en":"Lisa Holloway","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lisa-holloway.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lisa-holloway","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","floral","scenes","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-rust","rust","orange","pale-orange"],"intro":"Lisa Holloway is a renowned American photographer known for her emotive and beautifully composed portraits, often capturing the essence of childhood and family life. Her work is celebrated for its use of natural light and the ability to convey deep emotion and connection through her subjects.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed cinematic photography with warm sunset illumination, glowing backlight, and shallow focus that separates the children from flower-filled meadows. Soft haze, subdued earthy color, and intimate spontaneous gestures give the images a dreamy, storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"gene-colan","name":"Gene Colan","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gene Colan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gene-colan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gene-colan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","beige","pale-orange"],"intro":"Gene Colan is a renowned American comic book artist known for his work on titles such as \"Daredevil,\" \"Batman,\" and \"Doctor Strange.\" His career spanned several decades, during which he developed a distinctive style characterized by dynamic compositions and expressive characters. Colan's work is celebrated for its atmospheric quality and innovative use of light and shadow.","observation":"Across the four images, the style uses visibly broad, directional paint strokes and dense, tactile surface texture to build dramatic figures, vehicles, cliffs, and crowded environments. Deep blacks, earthy browns, slate blues, and selective green or cream accents create a moody, high-contrast cinematic atmosphere, with expressive staging and strongly narrative scenes."},{"id":"neil-harbisson","name":"Neil Harbisson","cat":"various-artists","en":"Neil Harbisson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/neil-harbisson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/neil-harbisson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","fashion","patterns","portraits","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["vivid-red","blue","rust","brown","olive","vivid-magenta"],"intro":"Neil Harbisson is a contemporary artist and cyborg activist known for being the first person to have an antenna implanted in his skull, allowing him to perceive colors beyond the human visual spectrum. He is a co-founder of the Cyborg Foundation, an organization that promotes the use of technology to extend human senses and abilities.","observation":"The style combines realistic close-up portrait photography with intensely saturated, high-contrast color and surreal optical patterns. Geometric bowl haircuts, fluorescent hair treatments, patterned clothing, and graphic backgrounds create a bold fashion-editorial look with occasional luminous color effects."},{"id":"michel-gondry","name":"Michel Gondry","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Michel Gondry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michel-gondry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michel-gondry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","animals","characters","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-green","ochre","deep-red","blue"],"intro":"Michel Gondry is a French filmmaker known for his inventive visual style and imaginative storytelling. He gained prominence with films like \"Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind\" and is celebrated for his unique approach to visual effects, often using practical techniques and handcrafted elements to create surreal and whimsical worlds.","observation":"The style presents richly staged interior tableaux filled with eccentric props, theatrical characters, animals, and unexpected spatial transformations. Saturated teal, red, orange, and blue hues combine with strong directional lighting, elaborate set dressing, and surreal oversized or floating elements to create a cinematic, dreamlike world."},{"id":"cliff-chiang","name":"Cliff Chiang","cat":"illustrators","en":"Cliff Chiang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cliff-chiang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cliff-chiang","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","orange","dark-blue","vivid-red","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Cliff Chiang is a renowned American comic book artist known for his work on titles such as 'Wonder Woman' and 'Paper Girls.' His distinctive style combines clean lines and bold colors, often featuring strong, dynamic characters and a modern aesthetic. Chiang's work is celebrated for its clarity, expressiveness, and ability to convey narrative through visual storytelling.","observation":"A bold graphic-comic style built from thick black ink contours, clean flat color blocks, and strongly contrasted saturated reds, oranges, blues, and blacks. The four images emphasize glamorous close-up female characters, fashion styling, dramatic poses, and occasional urban or floral details with a vintage print-like sensibility."},{"id":"elia-locardi","name":"Elia Locardi","cat":"photographers","en":"Elia Locardi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elia-locardi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elia-locardi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-blue","muted-violet","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Elia Locardi is a renowned travel photographer known for his vibrant and dynamic images that capture the essence of locations around the world. His work often features stunning landscapes and cityscapes, showcasing his expertise in using light and color to create breathtaking visuals. Locardi's photography is celebrated for its ability to transport viewers to the places he captures, offering a unique perspective on the beauty of our world.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, detailed aerial vistas with cinematic golden-hour lighting, saturated warm-and-cool color contrasts, and dramatic cloud-filled skies. Monumental landmarks and dense cityscapes are framed from elevated viewpoints, with atmospheric mist, glowing windows, and reflective water reinforcing an epic sense of scale."},{"id":"childe-hassam","name":"Childe Hassam","cat":"painters","en":"Childe Hassam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/childe-hassam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/childe-hassam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","mist","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","grey","muted-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Childe Hassam was an American Impressionist painter, known for his urban and coastal scenes. Born in 1859, he became a prominent figure in the American Impressionism movement, capturing the essence of modern life with a focus on light and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses visibly textured, loose brushwork and broad strokes to build busy urban scenes with atmospheric depth. Muted blue-gray, brown, and cream tones, scattered warm lights, wet reflections, rain or haze, and moving carriages create a lively yet softly nostalgic city mood."},{"id":"jim-cheung","name":"Jim Cheung","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jim Cheung","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-cheung.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-cheung","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-red","orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Jim Cheung is a renowned comic book artist known for his work with major publishers, particularly in the superhero genre. His detailed and dynamic style has made him a favorite among fans of modern comics, and he has contributed to numerous high-profile series.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, visibly brushed paintwork with dramatic character-centered fantasy scenes, ranging from intimate portraits to vast battlefields. Deep blacks, smoky neutrals, and concentrated reds and oranges create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while exaggerated anatomy, monsters, armor, wings, and fiery skies give the imagery a surreal, expressive intensity."},{"id":"beverly-joubert","name":"Beverly Joubert","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Beverly Joubert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/beverly-joubert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/beverly-joubert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","portraits","scenes","still-life","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","charcoal","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Beverly Joubert is a renowned wildlife filmmaker and photographer known for her work in documenting African wildlife and conservation efforts. Her career spans several decades, during which she has produced numerous films and photographic works that highlight the beauty and challenges of wildlife in Africa. Joubert's work often focuses on the intricate relationships between animals and their environments, aiming to raise awareness about conservation issues.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and richly detailed, presenting leopards with sharply resolved fur, eyes, whiskers, bark, fruit, and foliage. Dark backgrounds, subdued earthy colors, strong shadow contrast, and carefully arranged classical compositions give the images a moody, museum-like still-life character."},{"id":"christopher-nolan","name":"Christopher Nolan","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Christopher Nolan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christopher-nolan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christopher-nolan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","muted-teal","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Christopher Nolan is a renowned filmmaker known for his innovative storytelling and visually striking films. His work often explores complex narratives and themes, blending elements of science fiction, thriller, and drama. Nolan's films are characterized by their meticulous attention to detail, intricate plots, and a distinctive visual style that combines realism with a sense of grandeur.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is cinematic and realistic, built from moody teal-and-amber color grading, strong contrast, urban settings, and dramatic human figures. Smoke, haze, glowing practical lights, reflections, and selective focus create a polished, film-still atmosphere with densely layered city detail."},{"id":"henri-cartier-bresson","name":"Henri Cartier-Bresson","cat":"photographers","en":"Henri Cartier-Bresson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-cartier-bresson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-cartier-bresson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["grey","silver","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Henri Cartier-Bresson was a pioneering French photographer known for his candid and spontaneous style, often referred to as the 'father of modern photojournalism.' He co-founded Magnum Photos and is celebrated for his concept of the 'decisive moment,' capturing fleeting scenes that reveal deeper truths about human nature and society. His work is characterized by a keen eye for composition and an ability to capture the essence of a scene with minimal intervention.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses high-contrast black-and-white photographic rendering with visible grain, stark sunlight, and deep architectural shadows. Urban scenes are staged as cinematic, expressive vignettes, emphasizing isolated figures, unusual perspectives, and moments of movement against weathered stone surroundings."},{"id":"thomas-saliot","name":"Thomas Saliot","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Saliot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-saliot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-saliot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","grey","orange","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Thomas Saliot is a contemporary French artist known for his vibrant and sensual paintings, often focusing on the human form and intimate expressions. His work is characterized by a blend of realism and a painterly approach, capturing the subtleties of light and shadow with fine brushwork and rich color palettes.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic close-up portraits are built from visible, energetic brushwork, with expressive faces, loose hair, and strongly cropped framing. Deep shadows, warm red-orange highlights, cool blue-green surroundings, and reflective urban backgrounds create a moody, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"john-larriva","name":"John Larriva","cat":"painters","en":"John Larriva","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-larriva.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-larriva","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-rust","red","dark-red","pale-orange"],"intro":"John Larriva is a contemporary artist known for his expressive and detailed portraiture. His work often explores themes of identity and emotion, capturing the subtleties of human expression with a painterly approach. Larriva's art is characterized by its vivid color palette and realistic depiction of subjects, often focusing on the face and upper body to convey intimacy and depth.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped, expressive portraits rendered with visible, directional oil-paint strokes and richly modelled facial features. Strong warm-versus-dark colour contrasts, luminous skin highlights, deep shadows, and textured hair and clothing give the images an intense editorial character."},{"id":"gustaf-tenggren","name":"Gustaf Tenggren","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gustaf Tenggren","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustaf-tenggren.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustaf-tenggren","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","ochre","muted-orange","grey","rust"],"intro":"Gustaf Tenggren was a Swedish-American illustrator known for his work on children's books and animated films, particularly during the early to mid-20th century. His style is characterized by its detailed and whimsical illustrations, often drawing from European folklore and fairy tales. Tenggren's work has left a lasting impact on the world of illustration, blending traditional techniques with imaginative storytelling.","observation":"The style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, layered textures, and finely articulated foliage, garments, animals, and faces. Dark woodland greens, ochres, muted blues, and selective red accents create a moody fantasy atmosphere across narrative forest tableaux populated by characters and animals."},{"id":"joost-swarte","name":"Joost Swarte","cat":"illustrators","en":"Joost Swarte","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joost-swarte.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joost-swarte","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","muted-olive","muted-blue","rust","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Joost Swarte is a Dutch illustrator and comic artist known for his clear line style and playful, detailed illustrations. He has contributed significantly to the world of comics and graphic design, often incorporating elements of humor and retro aesthetics into his work. Swarte's style is characterized by precise lines, vibrant colors, and a strong sense of composition, making his art both visually striking and narratively engaging.","observation":"The style uses richly detailed, graphic line drawing with heavy black contours, flat blocks of saturated color, and selective crosshatched texture. It consistently presents urban social vignettes and fashion-focused figures in a retro illustrated-panel aesthetic, with strong contrast and carefully arranged architectural backgrounds."},{"id":"ed-mcguinness","name":"Ed McGuinness","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ed McGuinness","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-mcguinness.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-mcguinness","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","ink"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","silver","red","olive"],"intro":"Ed McGuinness is a renowned comic book artist known for his dynamic and bold style, primarily working with major publishers like Marvel and DC Comics. His work is characterized by strong, muscular forms and expressive characters, often depicting iconic superheroes and villains. McGuinness's art is celebrated for its vivid energy and dramatic compositions, making him a prominent figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly expressive comic-book character portraits with heavy black contouring, crisp illustrative shapes, and dense inked interior detail. Saturated reds, oranges, and greens are set against deep shadows and pale skin, creating a bold, high-contrast tattoo aesthetic with dramatic faces and fantasy or superhero-like imagery."},{"id":"marc-muench","name":"Marc Muench","cat":"photographers","en":"Marc Muench","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-muench.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-muench","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","dark-blue","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Marc Muench is a renowned American landscape photographer known for his breathtaking images of natural scenes. He has a strong focus on capturing the beauty and majesty of landscapes, often highlighting the interplay of light and shadow in his compositions. Muench's work is celebrated for its vivid colors and dramatic perspectives, making him a prominent figure in contemporary landscape photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is highly realistic and richly detailed, presenting expansive mountain landscapes with cinematic framing and dramatic natural light. Deep shadows, warm highlights, atmospheric haze, glowing sun or moonlight, and layered terrain create a moody, grand wilderness atmosphere."},{"id":"simen-johan","name":"Simen Johan","cat":"photographers","en":"Simen Johan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/simen-johan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/simen-johan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["white","black","charcoal","grey","brown","beige","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Simen Johan is a contemporary artist known for his unique blend of photography and digital manipulation, creating surreal and fantastical imagery. His work often explores themes of nature, wildlife, and the boundaries between reality and imagination, resulting in visually striking compositions that challenge perceptions.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic animal portraits and group tableaux staged among abundant flowers, moss, and rugged alpine rocks. Subdued, cool-toned color and controlled cinematic lighting create a moody yet dreamlike fantasy atmosphere, with dense botanical detail and richly textured fur throughout."},{"id":"fernando-amorsolo","name":"Fernando Amorsolo","cat":"painters","en":"Fernando Amorsolo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fernando-amorsolo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fernando-amorsolo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","ochre","pale-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Fernando Amorsolo was a renowned Filipino painter known for his luminous landscapes and depictions of rural life in the Philippines. Born in 1892, he became the first National Artist of the Philippines and is celebrated for his mastery of light and color, capturing the essence of Filipino culture and everyday scenes with a distinctive impressionistic style.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, softened edges, and layered strokes that build foliage, fabric, skin, and water. Warm, subdued natural colors and dappled sunlight create expressive outdoor scenes populated by groups of figures, with detailed vegetation and elegant period-like clothing."},{"id":"federico-babina","name":"Federico Babina","cat":"illustrators","en":"Federico Babina","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/federico-babina.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/federico-babina","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","scenes","urban","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","retro","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","pale-orange","vivid-red","black","muted-green","dark-brown"],"intro":"Federico Babina is an Italian architect and illustrator known for his unique blend of architecture and illustration, often creating works that explore the intersection of these fields. His work is characterized by a playful and imaginative approach, often incorporating elements of surrealism and abstraction.","observation":"The style combines graphic architectural illustration with stark geometric masses, flat cream, red, teal, black, and blue shapes, and strong light-dark separation. Dense structural details, tiny human figures, paper grain, and distressed surfaces give the clean modernist compositions a retro printed-poster character, while improbable scale and isolated objects introduce a surreal edge."},{"id":"aida-muluneh","name":"Aida Muluneh","cat":"photographers","en":"Aida Muluneh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aida-muluneh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aida-muluneh","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-blue","vivid-red","black","deep-red","vivid-yellow","dark-brown"],"intro":"Aida Muluneh is an Ethiopian photographer known for her vibrant and culturally rich imagery. Her work often explores themes of identity, culture, and heritage, using bold colors and striking compositions to convey powerful narratives. Muluneh's photography is celebrated for its unique blend of traditional and contemporary elements, reflecting her deep connection to her Ethiopian roots.","observation":"The style combines highly saturated primary colors with crisp geometric patterning, flat graphic backdrops, and carefully arranged editorial portraits. Sculptural clothing and headwraps, strong symmetry, bold silhouettes, and repeated checkerboard or diamond motifs create a theatrical, fashion-focused visual language."},{"id":"michael-shapcott","name":"Michael Shapcott","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Shapcott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-shapcott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-shapcott","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","muted-orange","black","dark-red"],"intro":"Michael Shapcott is an American artist known for his distinctive style that combines elements of realism and fantasy. His work often features detailed portraits with a focus on expressive faces and ethereal themes. Shapcott's art is characterized by its use of mixed media, incorporating both traditional and digital techniques to create layered textures and soft gradients.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped, highly detailed portraits with softly modeled skin, visible fine brushwork, and delicate linear marks in the hair and facial features. Muted teal, coral, beige, and rose tones create an intimate, slightly weathered illustrative-painterly surface across all four images."},{"id":"larry-sultan","name":"Larry Sultan","cat":"photographers","en":"Larry Sultan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-sultan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-sultan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","floral","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-brown","muted-blue"],"intro":"Larry Sultan is an American photographer known for his exploration of domestic life and personal history through staged and documentary-style photography. His work often delves into themes of family dynamics, suburban life, and the complexities of the American Dream, capturing intimate and reflective moments with a cinematic touch.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, detailed photographic tableaux with cinematic wide framing, warm sunlight, and strong contrast. Saturated greens, pinks, corals, and cream tones combine with retro suburban interiors and streetscapes, while posed characters, animals, flowers, and cluttered environments create theatrical visual narratives."},{"id":"oswald-achenbach","name":"Oswald Achenbach","cat":"painters","en":"Oswald Achenbach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oswald-achenbach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oswald-achenbach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","charcoal","bone-white","ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Oswald Achenbach was a German painter known for his landscape paintings, particularly those depicting Italian scenes. He was a prominent figure in the Düsseldorf school of painting and contributed significantly to the development of landscape art in the 19th century. His works are characterized by their dramatic use of light and shadow, as well as their detailed and romantic portrayal of nature.","observation":"These images use richly textured, painterly rendering with dense environmental detail, dramatic skies, and strong contrasts between warm light and deep shadow. Monumental cliffs, castles, ships, and turbulent water create cinematic fantasy landscapes with glowing horizons, misty atmosphere, and an epic, brooding mood."},{"id":"ryan-ottley","name":"Ryan Ottley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ryan Ottley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryan-ottley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryan-ottley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-brown","grey","orange","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Ryan Ottley is a contemporary American comic book artist, best known for his work on the series \"Invincible\" published by Image Comics. His dynamic and detailed style has garnered a significant following, making him a prominent figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses densely packed fantasy imagery with dramatic creatures, figures, and active poses. Thick black contouring, graphic color blocks, intense orange-red and teal hues, and sharply articulated textures create a high-impact illustrated look with expressive motion and monumental monster forms."},{"id":"donald-zolan","name":"Donald Zolan","cat":"painters","en":"Donald Zolan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/donald-zolan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/donald-zolan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","grey","brown","bone-white","dark-brown","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Donald Zolan is known for his heartwarming paintings that capture the innocence and joy of childhood. His works often depict children in idyllic settings, engaging in playful activities, and are celebrated for their realistic yet tender portrayal of youthful moments. Zolan's art has been widely appreciated for its ability to evoke nostalgia and a sense of wonder.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is softly realistic and painterly, with visible directional brushwork shaping faces, clothing, feathers, foliage, and woven straw. Warm natural light, gentle earth-and-sky colors, intimate child-and-animal interactions, and richly layered rural settings create a tender, nostalgic, dreamlike mood."},{"id":"peter-mckinnon","name":"Peter McKinnon","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter McKinnon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-mckinnon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-mckinnon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","glow","mist","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","bone-white","grey","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Peter McKinnon is a Canadian photographer and filmmaker known for his engaging YouTube tutorials and stunning photography, particularly in the realms of travel and lifestyle. He has gained a significant following for his ability to teach complex photography techniques in an accessible way, inspiring many to explore their creative potential.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, photorealistic compositions with solitary human figures set against surreal eruptions of smoke, fire, birds, and atmospheric landscapes. A moody blue-gray palette is punctuated by intense orange light, glowing embers, reflective surfaces, mist, and strong contrast, giving every image a dramatic sense of motion and portent."},{"id":"irving-amen","name":"Irving Amen","cat":"printmakers","en":"Irving Amen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/irving-amen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/irving-amen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","blue","charcoal","dark-brown","orange","red"],"intro":"Irving Amen is an American printmaker and painter known for his vibrant and expressive works that often explore themes of humanity and spirituality. His art is characterized by bold lines, geometric forms, and a vivid color palette, reflecting influences from modern art movements.","observation":"Across all four renders, faces and figures are fragmented into interlocking angular planes, outlined with heavy dark lines and filled with strongly contrasting blocks of saturated color. Visible brush and crackle texture gives the otherwise graphic, flat shapes a hand-painted surface, while overlapping profiles and distorted proportions create an expressive, surreal character."},{"id":"alfonso-cuaron","name":"Alfonso Cuaron","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Alfonso Cuaron","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfonso-cuaron.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfonso-cuaron","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","surreal"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","dark-brown","silver","rust"],"intro":"Alfonso Cuaron is a renowned Mexican filmmaker known for his diverse and impactful contributions to cinema. His works often explore themes of human connection, societal issues, and the fantastical, blending realism with imaginative storytelling. Cuaron's films, such as 'Gravity' and 'Roma,' have received critical acclaim for their innovative techniques and emotional depth.","observation":"The style is cinematic and photorealistic, using carefully staged narrative scenes, dramatic close-ups, and expansive environmental views. Deep shadows, teal-leaning darkness, warm isolated highlights, reflective surfaces, and luminous practical sources create a tense, surreal science-fiction atmosphere across the images."},{"id":"paulo-zerbato","name":"Paulo Zerbato","cat":"painters","en":"Paulo Zerbato","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paulo-zerbato.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paulo-zerbato","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","floral","crosshatching","fine-lines","subdued-colors","collage","drawing","dreamy"],"colours":["pale-orange","light-yellow","ochre","charcoal","dark-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Paulo Zerbato is a contemporary artist known for his surreal and expressive artworks that often explore themes of human emotion and transformation. His work is characterized by a blend of fantasy and reality, creating a unique visual language that resonates with viewers on a psychological level.","observation":"Across all four renders, finely drawn profile figures merge with birds, butterflies, flowers, and other organic forms. Dense crosshatching and loose sketch lines sit over aged paper and translucent watercolor-like washes, creating an expressive, dreamlike illustrative collage style with restrained earth tones and recurring blue and coral accents."},{"id":"bernie-fuchs","name":"Bernie Fuchs","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bernie Fuchs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bernie-fuchs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bernie-fuchs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["red","dark-red","black","light-pink","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Bernie Fuchs was an influential American illustrator known for his innovative approach to commercial art. Born in 1932, Fuchs's work spanned various media, including magazines, advertisements, and books. He was celebrated for his ability to blend realism with a painterly style, capturing the essence of mid-20th century American life. His illustrations often featured dynamic compositions and a keen attention to detail, making him a prominent figure in the world of illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and social moments are built from vigorous, visible paint strokes, scraped textures, and broad blocks of saturated coral, teal, violet, and black. Cropped portraits and fashionably dressed characters dominate the compositions, with strong dark-light contrasts and an expressive, slightly moody atmosphere."},{"id":"katy-smail","name":"Katy Smail","cat":"illustrators","en":"Katy Smail","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/katy-smail.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/katy-smail","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","portraits","bold-lines","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","black","red","beige","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Katy Smail is an illustrator known for her enchanting and whimsical artwork, often featuring delicate floral elements and ethereal figures. Her work is characterized by a dreamy and surreal quality, blending fantasy with a contemporary illustrative style.","observation":"The style combines close-up female portraiture with abundant floral framing, using saturated coral, pink, green, black, and cream. Clean illustrative shapes and dark ink-like contours coexist with visible brush texture, layered paint, and finely drawn facial and botanical details."},{"id":"john-kricfalusi","name":"John Kricfalusi","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Kricfalusi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-kricfalusi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-kricfalusi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink","funny"],"colours":["pale-orange","beige","brown","cream","muted-cyan","red","light-orange","pink"],"intro":"John Kricfalusi is a Canadian animator and illustrator best known for creating the animated television series 'The Ren & Stimpy Show.' His work is characterized by its unique and often controversial style, which combines elements of classic animation with a modern, irreverent twist. Kricfalusi's influence extends beyond television, impacting the broader animation industry and inspiring a generation of animators and artists.","observation":"The style is energetic cartoon illustration built from heavy black ink contours, exaggerated anatomy, expressive faces, and strongly posed characters. Vivid flat color, rough hand-drawn texture, dense hatching, and occasional environmental action give the images a lively comic-panel feel."},{"id":"david-bowers","name":"David Bowers","cat":"painters","en":"David Bowers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-bowers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-bowers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","dark-brown","grey","rust"],"intro":"David Bowers is an American painter known for his detailed and imaginative works that blend elements of realism and fantasy. His art often features intricate compositions with a focus on mythological and historical themes, rendered with a high degree of technical skill and a rich color palette.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly layered figures and interiors are built with visible fine brushwork, elaborate lace, patterned fabrics, reflective vessels, and dense botanical detail. The palette is dark and subdued overall, punctuated by warm candlelight, coral garments, deep blue skies, and expressive portrait faces in ornate historical settings."},{"id":"emmanuel-lubezki","name":"Emmanuel Lubezki","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Emmanuel Lubezki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emmanuel-lubezki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emmanuel-lubezki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","silver","dark-brown","muted-teal","red"],"intro":"Emmanuel Lubezki is a renowned Mexican cinematographer known for his innovative use of natural lighting and long takes. He has won multiple Academy Awards for his work on films such as \"Gravity,\" \"Birdman,\" and \"The Revenant,\" and is celebrated for his ability to create immersive and visually stunning cinematic experiences.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, built from wide, carefully composed environments populated by small, isolated figures. Muted teal, rust, and amber grading, strong shadow-to-light contrast, mist, sunsets, and practical lights create a dark, atmospheric sense of suspense across both wilderness and urban settings."},{"id":"david-martiashvili","name":"David Martiashvili","cat":"painters","en":"David Martiashvili","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-martiashvili.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-martiashvili","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","silver","deep-rust","ochre","vivid-rust"],"intro":"David Martiashvili is a contemporary artist known for his unique blend of surrealism and fantasy, often incorporating elements of Georgian culture and architecture into his work. His paintings are characterized by vivid colors, intricate details, and imaginative compositions that transport viewers into dreamlike worlds.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines vivid, highly saturated colors with dense, hand-painted surface texture and lively, slightly distorted architectural scenes. Fine drawn contours, flattened color regions, and expressive figures create a whimsical storybook world filled with crooked buildings, trees, animals, music, and everyday street life."},{"id":"maud-humphrey","name":"Maud Humphrey","cat":"illustrators","en":"Maud Humphrey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maud-humphrey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maud-humphrey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","painterly","pastel-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","white","muted-orange","ochre","muted-ochre","dark-brown"],"intro":"Maud Humphrey is an American illustrator known for her charming and detailed illustrations, particularly of children and women in Victorian and Edwardian settings. She was active during the late 19th and early 20th centuries and was the mother of actor Humphrey Bogart. Her work often features romantic and nostalgic themes, capturing the innocence and elegance of her subjects.","observation":"This style presents idealized female portraits with softly modeled faces, flowing curled hair, elaborate floral adornments, and delicate period clothing. Warm cream grounds, pastel pinks and greens, visible brushwork, and ornate oval or circular frames create a refined decorative portrait aesthetic."},{"id":"diego-rivera","name":"Diego Rivera","cat":"painters","en":"Diego Rivera","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/diego-rivera.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/diego-rivera","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","ethnic-poc","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","bone-white","grey","muted-ochre","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Diego Rivera was a prominent Mexican painter and muralist, known for his large frescoes that helped establish the Mexican Mural Movement. Born in 1886, Rivera's works are celebrated for their bold colors and depictions of Mexican society, history, and politics. His art often reflects themes of social justice and indigenous culture, making him a significant figure in both art and political activism.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and densely composed, using visible brushwork, fine linear accents, earthy colors, and strong dark⁠–light separation. Monumental crowds, workers, musicians, flowers, machines, and symbolic objects are layered into socially charged narrative scenes with expressive faces and gestures."},{"id":"scott-listfield","name":"Scott Listfield","cat":"illustrators","en":"Scott Listfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/scott-listfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/scott-listfield","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","retro"],"colours":["muted-cyan","black","muted-red","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Scott Listfield is an American artist known for his unique paintings featuring a lone astronaut exploring surreal landscapes filled with pop culture references and futuristic elements. His work often comments on modern society and technology through the lens of science fiction.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, film-like imagery with strong teal-and-pink color grading, deep shadows, and saturated highlights. Astronaut characters are placed in expansive road, mountain, and vehicle settings, combining retro automotive imagery with futuristic sci-fi costumes and dramatic cinematic framing."},{"id":"gene-luen-yang","name":"Gene Luen Yang","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gene Luen Yang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gene-luen-yang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gene-luen-yang","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["dark-cyan","muted-cyan","pale-yellow","black","beige","rust"],"intro":"Gene Luen Yang is an acclaimed American cartoonist and writer known for his work in graphic novels and comics. His storytelling often explores themes of identity, culture, and personal growth, blending elements of fantasy and reality. Yang has received numerous awards for his contributions to the field, including the prestigious MacArthur Fellowship.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly detailed, graphic illustrations with heavy black contours, expressive faces and energetic poses. Saturated teal-blue and peach-orange colors, strong tonal contrast, swirling water and clouds, and enormous mythic creatures create a sweeping dreamlike adventure mood."},{"id":"chantal-joffe","name":"Chantal Joffe","cat":"painters","en":"Chantal Joffe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chantal-joffe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chantal-joffe","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["light-orange","black","bone-white","rust","vivid-red","brown"],"intro":"Chantal Joffe is a contemporary British painter known for her expressive and bold portraits, often focusing on the female form. Her work is characterized by a painterly style that combines vivid colors and broad brushstrokes to convey emotion and personality.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped people are built from clearly visible, directional paint strokes, with softly modeled faces and hair alongside bold blocks of clothing and background color. The portraits feel intimate and expressive, combining vivid accents, layered garments, and dense overlapping figures or a companion dog."},{"id":"henning-larsen","name":"Henning Larsen","cat":"architects","en":"Henning Larsen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henning-larsen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henning-larsen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","silver","beige","black","grey","white"],"intro":"Henning Larsen is a renowned Danish architect known for his innovative and sustainable architectural designs. He founded Henning Larsen Architects, a firm recognized for its modernist approach and commitment to creating functional and aesthetically pleasing spaces. Larsen's work often emphasizes natural light, open spaces, and a harmonious relationship with the environment.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic architectural visualizations with carefully controlled cinematic framing, subdued cool exteriors, and warm interior illumination. Monumental curved forms, layered terraces, timber soffits, glass walls, and broad public spaces are rendered with crisp geometric detail, while dusk, reflections, and selective focus add atmosphere."},{"id":"cathy-hegman","name":"Cathy Hegman","cat":"painters","en":"Cathy Hegman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cathy-hegman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cathy-hegman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["beige","black","pale-yellow","ochre","red","deep-red"],"intro":"Cathy Hegman is an American contemporary artist known for her evocative and introspective figurative paintings. Her work often explores themes of identity, emotion, and the human condition, using a distinct style that blends realism with abstraction. Hegman's paintings are characterized by their textured surfaces, layered compositions, and a muted color palette that conveys a sense of quiet reflection.","observation":"The style combines loose, visibly textured paint with descriptive figurative imagery, presenting elegant women, garments, and occasional birds in arranged vignette-like panels. Muted blue-gray grounds are punctuated by strong coral-red and black clothing, while scraped, layered surfaces and expressive brushwork give the compositions a weathered, tactile character."},{"id":"katya-gridneva","name":"Katya Gridneva","cat":"painters","en":"Katya Gridneva","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/katya-gridneva.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/katya-gridneva","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Katya Gridneva is a contemporary artist known for her exquisite portraiture that captures the subtle nuances of human emotion and beauty. Her work often features delicate and introspective depictions of female figures, rendered with a refined and classical approach that emphasizes elegance and grace.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible paint strokes and layered, textured surfaces to depict psychologically intense close-up portraits. Dark clothing and subdued, moody surroundings dominate, with restrained red, purple, and white accents, while cropped poses and direct or withdrawn gazes create an intimate fashion-editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"giuseppe-arcimboldo","name":"Giuseppe Arcimboldo","cat":"painters","en":"Giuseppe Arcimboldo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giuseppe-arcimboldo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giuseppe-arcimboldo","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-ochre","dark-brown","rust","ochre"],"intro":"Giuseppe Arcimboldo was an Italian painter known for his imaginative portrait heads made entirely of objects such as fruits, vegetables, flowers, fish, and books. His work is often associated with the Mannerist movement and is characterized by its whimsical and surreal qualities, blending natural elements into human forms.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, visibly painted detail to build human faces and busts from dense arrangements of fruits, vegetables, leaves, and flowers. Saturated reds, greens, and ochres stand out against deep backgrounds, with ornate botanical surfaces, strong tonal contrast, and uncanny yet classically composed portrait framing."},{"id":"robert-montgomery","name":"Robert Montgomery","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Robert Montgomery","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-montgomery.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-montgomery","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","letters","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-red","beige","pale-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Robert Montgomery is a contemporary artist known for his text-based installations and light art. His work often involves large-scale public installations that incorporate poetic texts, exploring themes of urban life, communication, and the human condition. Montgomery's art is characterized by its use of light and shadow, creating a powerful visual impact in public spaces.","observation":"The style presents realistic, cinematic views of large typographic light installations in industrial and urban settings. Strong contrast, deep shadows, saturated red or restrained night tones, and visible internal illumination give the scenes a moody, theatrical atmosphere, while geometric architecture and isolated people establish scale."},{"id":"valentine-cameron-prinsep","name":"Valentine Cameron Prinsep","cat":"painters","en":"Valentine Cameron Prinsep","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/valentine-cameron-prinsep.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/valentine-cameron-prinsep","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","muted-brown","deep-red","muted-orange"],"intro":"Valentine Cameron Prinsep was a British painter associated with the Pre-Raphaelite movement, known for his romantic and historical themes. Born in 1838, Prinsep was part of a circle of artists who sought to revive the vivid detail and complex compositions of early Renaissance art. His works often depicted scenes from literature and history, characterized by rich colors and intricate details.","observation":"These richly rendered portraits combine visible brushwork with dense ornamental detail, layered textiles, patterned interiors, and abundant flowers. Deep reds, greens, and browns create a subdued, moody palette, while warm directional light and expressive faces give the scenes a contemplative, classical presence."},{"id":"george-miller","name":"George Miller","cat":"filmmakers","en":"George Miller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-miller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-miller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","beige","pale-orange","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"George Miller is an acclaimed filmmaker known for his work in the action and fantasy genres, particularly the \"Mad Max\" series. His films often explore themes of dystopia and survival, characterized by intense action sequences and imaginative world-building.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, energetic brushwork and richly layered painted surfaces to build dramatic characters, landscapes, and fantastical environments. Strong warm-versus-cool color contrasts, monumental cloud formations, atmospheric depth, and cinematic compositions give the scenes an expansive, mythic feeling."},{"id":"roger-fry","name":"Roger Fry","cat":"painters","en":"Roger Fry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-fry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-fry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","rust","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Roger Fry was an influential English painter and art critic, known for his role in introducing Post- Impressionism to the English-speaking world. He was a member of the Bloomsbury Group and played a crucial part in shaping modern art appreciation in the early 20th century.","observation":"Across all four panels, the images use visible, directional brushwork and richly modelled paint to depict posed people and sunlit rural settings. Earthy, moderately restrained colours are punctuated by strong darks and warm highlights, with expressive faces, textured clothing, and landscape forms built from broad strokes."},{"id":"maggie-holmes","name":"Maggie Holmes","cat":"designers","en":"Maggie Holmes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maggie-holmes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maggie-holmes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","red","black","dark-brown","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Maggie Holmes is a designer known for her whimsical and romantic style, often incorporating floral and nature motifs into her work. Her designs are characterized by a dreamy and ethereal quality, drawing inspiration from fantasy and surrealism.","observation":"The style combines visibly textured, layered paint with highly detailed floral imagery, ornate surfaces, and expressive character tableaux. Saturated coral, teal, pink, orange, and green tones support a dreamy, theatrical fantasy mood, while oversized flowers and elaborate clothing dominate the compositions."},{"id":"joel-sternfeld","name":"Joel Sternfeld","cat":"photographers","en":"Joel Sternfeld","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joel-sternfeld.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joel-sternfeld","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-ochre","grey","white","ochre","brown"],"intro":"Joel Sternfeld is an influential American photographer known for his large-format color photographs documenting suburban and urban landscapes. His work often explores themes of American culture, environmental concerns, and the human presence in natural and built environments.","observation":"These images use a realistic, cinematic photographic treatment with subdued, slightly moody color, strong environmental detail, and a grainy vintage-film texture. Wide compositions place neglected vehicles, damaged buildings, trees, and sparse figures within expansive post-disaster landscapes, while selective focus and warm directional light create a quietly ominous atmosphere."},{"id":"ernst-haas","name":"Ernst Haas","cat":"photographers","en":"Ernst Haas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernst-haas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernst-haas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","rust","red"],"intro":"Ernst Haas was an influential Austrian-American photographer known for his pioneering work in color photography. Born in 1921, Haas became a prominent figure in the field, celebrated for his innovative use of color and composition. He was associated with Magnum Photos and contributed significantly to the development of photojournalism and fine art photography.","observation":"A consistently cinematic, realistic treatment depicts rainy urban streets through deep shadows, saturated red and amber reflections, and cool blue ambient light. Visible grain, lens softness, window or water droplets, glowing practical lights, and silhouetted pedestrians create a moody nocturnal atmosphere across all four images."},{"id":"sylvie-guillot","name":"Sylvie Guillot","cat":"painters","en":"Sylvie Guillot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sylvie-guillot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sylvie-guillot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["muted-orange","orange","bone-white","brown","red","grey"],"intro":"Sylvie Guillot is a contemporary artist known for her expressive and introspective portraiture. Her work often explores themes of human emotion and vulnerability, capturing the essence of personal introspection through detailed and evocative imagery.","observation":"Across all four images, tightly cropped faces are rendered with translucent, layered paint and abundant fine, wandering linework. Restrained flesh tones are punctuated by red, blue, and green marks, while expressive eyes, distorted facial planes, loose hair, and unfinished contours give the portraits an intense, dreamlike quality."},{"id":"daria-petrilli","name":"Daria Petrilli","cat":"illustrators","en":"Daria Petrilli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daria-petrilli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daria-petrilli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-olive","light-teal","black","dark-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Daria Petrilli is an Italian illustrator known for her ethereal and surreal artworks. Her style often combines elements of fantasy and classical beauty, creating dreamlike portraits that evoke a sense of whimsy and introspection. Petrilli's work is characterized by its detailed and delicate approach, often featuring floral and nature motifs.","observation":"Across all four renders, softly modeled female figures are presented in richly patterned garments amid dense botanical elements, birds, and flowers. Fine brushwork, muted teal and olive grounds, restrained autumnal reds, and intricate textile and foliage textures create an ornate, dreamlike portrait style with a classical decorative sensibility."},{"id":"richard-mcguire","name":"Richard McGuire","cat":"illustrators","en":"Richard McGuire","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-mcguire.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-mcguire","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","subdued-colors","surreal","retro","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["muted-olive","silver","muted-blue","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Richard McGuire is an American artist and illustrator known for his work in graphic novels, children's books, and magazine illustrations. He has a distinctive style that combines clean lines and geometric forms, often exploring themes of time and space. His notable works include the graphic novel \"Here,\" which innovatively examines the passage of time within a single room.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses finely drawn architectural lines, clean flat color fields, and carefully organized geometric interiors and exteriors. It combines detailed domestic scenes with muted blue-green and salmon tones, cutaway-like layering, and subtly surreal spatial juxtapositions."},{"id":"neil-krug","name":"Neil Krug","cat":"photographers","en":"Neil Krug","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/neil-krug.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/neil-krug","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","portraits","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["dark-olive","brown","muted-cyan","ochre","muted-teal","yellow"],"intro":"Neil Krug is a contemporary American photographer and director known for his distinctive style that blends elements of psychedelia, surrealism, and retro aesthetics. His work often features vibrant colors, dreamlike compositions, and a nostalgic nod to the 1970s, making him a prominent figure in modern visual arts.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, combining intimate low-angle portraits with expansive desert and roadside scenes. Warm, slightly faded colors, visible film grain, selective focus, windblown hair, and strong sunlight create a nostalgic yet dreamlike editorial mood across the images."},{"id":"rossdraws","name":"Rossdraws","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rossdraws","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rossdraws.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rossdraws","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-blue","muted-red","charcoal","silver","red"],"intro":"Rossdraws is a digital artist known for his vibrant and imaginative illustrations, often blending elements of fantasy and anime. His work is characterized by dynamic compositions, expressive characters, and a distinctive use of color and light.","observation":"These portraits combine visibly layered paint strokes with highly refined facial detail, especially in the hair, eyes, skin, and clothing. Saturated blue and red accents, strong light-dark separation, and energetic directional strokes give the close-up character studies an expressive fantasy illustration quality."},{"id":"gareth-pugh","name":"Gareth Pugh","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Gareth Pugh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gareth-pugh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gareth-pugh","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","symmetry"],"colours":["black","silver","grey","brown","beige"],"intro":"Gareth Pugh is a British fashion designer known for his innovative and avant-garde approach to fashion. His work often features bold, sculptural designs that challenge traditional notions of clothing and fashion. Pugh's designs are characterized by their dramatic silhouettes, use of unconventional materials, and a monochromatic color palette, often exploring themes of identity and transformation.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic runway fashion with monumental, architectural silhouettes, concealed faces, pointed hoods, and sweeping floor-length forms. Dense ribbed, pleated, and ruffled textures make the garments ornate and detailed, while restrained black, white, and charcoal tones, dramatic contrast, and shallow runway focus create a severe, theatrical mood."},{"id":"lisa-graa-jensen","name":"Lisa Graa Jensen","cat":"painters","en":"Lisa Graa Jensen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lisa-graa-jensen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lisa-graa-jensen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","muted-blue","dark-olive","muted-ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Lisa Graa Jensen is a contemporary artist known for her enchanting and whimsical depictions of nature and rural life. Her work often features vibrant colors and detailed landscapes, capturing the essence of idyllic countryside scenes. Jensen's art is characterized by a playful and joyful atmosphere, drawing inspiration from folk art and nature.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses richly textured paint and delicate, highly visible strokes to build densely detailed seasonal landscapes. Strong outlines, abundant flowers, branching trees, saturated color, and storybook-like village scenes create an expressive, fantastical panorama."},{"id":"pascal-campion","name":"Pascal Campion","cat":"illustrators","en":"Pascal Campion","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pascal-campion.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pascal-campion","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","muted-orange","ochre","dark-brown","grey"],"intro":"Pascal Campion is a French-American illustrator known for his vibrant and emotive digital artwork. His work often captures intimate moments and everyday life, blending warmth and charm with a unique narrative style. Campion's illustrations have been widely appreciated for their ability to convey emotion and storytelling through visual art.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad visible paint marks and layered textured surfaces give the scenes an expressive, hand-painted character. Strong warm-versus-cool palettes, luminous windows and sunsets, deep shadows, and recurring solitary figures create moody urban and landscape vignettes with cinematic-scale atmosphere."},{"id":"luis-ricardo-falero","name":"Luis Ricardo Falero","cat":"painters","en":"Luis Ricardo Falero","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luis-ricardo-falero.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luis-ricardo-falero","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","deep-rust","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Luis Ricardo Falero was a Spanish painter known for his works featuring mythological and fantastical themes, often with an erotic undertone. Born in 1851, Falero's art is characterized by its detailed and romantic portrayal of celestial and mythical subjects, blending classical techniques with imaginative compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, layered textures, and fine strokes to model expressive figures in dramatic, theatrical poses. Deep earthy shadows and warm reds are punctuated by strong light, ornate costumes, rocky settings, and fantastical characters arranged with energetic diagonals."},{"id":"hong-oai-don","name":"Hong-Oai Don","cat":"photographers","en":"Hong-Oai Don","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hong-oai-don.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hong-oai-don","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","mist","painterly","surreal","dreamy","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["white","charcoal","grey","silver","beige","dark-ochre"],"intro":"Hong-Oai Don is a photographer known for capturing serene and ethereal landscapes, often blending traditional Chinese aesthetics with modern photographic techniques. His work is characterized by a deep appreciation for nature and a meticulous attention to detail, creating images that evoke a sense of tranquility and timeless beauty.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly imagery with delicate ink-wash passages, blending intimate figures and studio objects with monumental mountains, trees, birds, blossoms, and water. It repeatedly uses spacious compositions, misty atmospheric depth, softly luminous color, and dreamlike transitions between realistic detail and surreal landscape forms."},{"id":"ezra-jack-keats","name":"Ezra Jack Keats","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ezra Jack Keats","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ezra-jack-keats.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ezra-jack-keats","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["muted-olive","black","vivid-red","bone-white","rust","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Ezra Jack Keats was an American author and illustrator, renowned for his children's books, particularly \"The Snowy Day,\" which won the Caldecott Medal in 1963. His work often focused on urban settings and multicultural themes, bringing diverse characters to the forefront of children's literature.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines vivid, high-contrast color blocks with visibly rough, layered paint and broad expressive strokes. Urban architecture, landscapes, trees, and small human figures are arranged as flattened illustrative scenes, often with collage-like overlaps, stark silhouettes, and tactile surface texture."},{"id":"harumi-hironaka","name":"Harumi Hironaka","cat":"illustrators","en":"Harumi Hironaka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harumi-hironaka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harumi-hironaka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-pink","pink","muted-blue","red","olive"],"intro":"Harumi Hironaka is a contemporary artist known for her captivating and surreal illustrations that often explore themes of femininity and fantasy. Her work is characterized by a unique blend of bold colors, intricate details, and expressive compositions that draw the viewer into a dreamlike world.","observation":"The style uses highly saturated pinks, blues, greens, and blacks in tightly cropped, expressive fashion portraits. Visible fine linework and painterly surface marks define hair, skin, makeup, clothing, and flowers, while strong contrast and glossy highlights give the images an intense editorial presence."},{"id":"navid-baraty","name":"Navid Baraty","cat":"photographers","en":"Navid Baraty","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/navid-baraty.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/navid-baraty","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","silver","dark-brown","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Navid Baraty is a contemporary photographer known for his captivating aerial and urban photography. His work often explores the intricate patterns and vibrant life of cityscapes, capturing the essence of urban environments from unique perspectives.","observation":"A cinematic, realistic urban style presents dense city streets from varied elevated and street-level viewpoints, with strong vertical architecture, traffic, and pedestrians creating a sense of movement. Rain, reflective pavement, selective focus, and moody blue-hour lighting contrast with saturated taxi colors and glowing windows."},{"id":"lilia-alvarado","name":"Lilia Alvarado","cat":"photographers","en":"Lilia Alvarado","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lilia-alvarado.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lilia-alvarado","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","ochre","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Lilia Alvarado is a contemporary photographer known for her enchanting and emotive portraiture, often focusing on children and family themes. Her work is characterized by a dreamy and whimsical quality, capturing intimate moments with a soft, painterly touch. Alvarado's photography often features natural settings and a warm, earthy color palette, evoking a sense of nostalgia and innocence.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is photorealistic and cinematic, built around intimate child-centered moments in a wooded setting. Warm backlighting, glowing sunset tones, shallow focus, and soft bokeh create a dreamy, emotionally gentle atmosphere with dark woodland backgrounds and luminous edges."},{"id":"jan-gossaert","name":"Jan Gossaert","cat":"painters","en":"Jan Gossaert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-gossaert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-gossaert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Jan Gossaert is a renowned Flemish painter from the Northern Renaissance , known for his detailed and intricate works that blend Gothic and Renaissance styles. He was active in the early 16th century and is celebrated for his religious and mythological subjects, as well as his portraits of nobility. Gossaert's work is characterized by its meticulous attention to detail, rich color palette, and the use of classical motifs.","observation":"The style uses richly worked oil-paint surfaces with fine brushwork, exceptionally detailed textures, and strongly modelled faces, hands, fabrics, flowers, and metal. Dense ornamental arrangements, deep shadows, red and green coloration, reflective armour, and closely cropped figures create a sumptuous classical portrait effect."},{"id":"cindy-sherman","name":"Cindy Sherman","cat":"photographers","en":"Cindy Sherman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cindy-sherman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cindy-sherman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","black","dark-brown","muted-orange","grey","rust"],"intro":"Cindy Sherman is an influential American photographer and artist known for her conceptual portraits that explore identity, gender, and societal roles. She gained prominence in the late 20th century with her 'Untitled Film Stills' series, where she used herself as a model to portray various female stereotypes from movies and media. Sherman's work is characterized by its use of costumes, makeup, and props to create narrative-rich images that challenge viewers' perceptions of reality and fiction.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses highly realistic, intimate close-up portrait photography with carefully staged vintage fashion, expressive makeup, and richly textured garments. Muted, warm color grading, shallow focus, soft directional light, and occasional dark backgrounds give the portraits a cinematic, retro editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"michael-craig-martin","name":"Michael Craig-Martin","cat":"various-artists","en":"Michael Craig-Martin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-craig-martin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-craig-martin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["red","blue","pink","vivid-red","vivid-green"],"intro":"Michael Craig-Martin is a contemporary artist known for his conceptual art and vibrant use of color. Born in Dublin in 1941, he has been influential in the development of British art, particularly through his teaching at Goldsmiths College, where he mentored several prominent artists. His work often explores the relationship between objects and their representation, using everyday items as subjects.","observation":"The style uses clean, heavy contour lines and large areas of unmodulated, highly saturated color, giving ordinary objects a graphic poster-like presence. Sparse interior settings, simplified geometry, and hard-edged shadows create a deliberately retro, surreal-pop visual language across the four renders."},{"id":"jon-carling","name":"Jon Carling","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jon Carling","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jon-carling.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jon-carling","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","landscapes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","cream","beige"],"intro":"Jon Carling is an illustrator known for his distinctive style that blends elements of surrealism and dark fantasy. His work often features intricate linework and whimsical, yet eerie characters that evoke a sense of mystery and wonder.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed black-ink illustration with fine, scratchy lines, crosshatching, and dense dark animal forms against pale paper-like backgrounds. Surreal encounters between tiny human figures and oversized woodland creatures create a stark, storybook atmosphere, with small red accents appearing against the otherwise monochrome scenes."},{"id":"georgy-kurasov","name":"Georgy Kurasov","cat":"painters","en":"Georgy Kurasov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georgy-kurasov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georgy-kurasov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","muted-green","dark-brown","charcoal","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Georgy Kurasov is a contemporary Russian artist known for his vibrant and geometric compositions. His work often features bold colors and abstract forms, drawing inspiration from cubism and modern art movements. Kurasov's paintings are characterized by their dynamic interplay of shapes and vivid color palettes, creating a sense of movement and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, fashion-oriented female figures and portraits are built from vivid, sharply organized geometric forms, with recognizable city architecture and instruments woven into the compositions. The surfaces retain visible fine painterly strokes while clean illustrative contours, rich color blocking, and dense decorative detail give the images a polished, graphic quality."},{"id":"geoff-mcfetridge","name":"Geoff McFetridge","cat":"various-artists","en":"Geoff McFetridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/geoff-mcfetridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/geoff-mcfetridge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","fashion","patterns","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["white","black","deep-blue","grey","vivid-red","beige"],"intro":"Geoff McFetridge is a contemporary artist and designer known for his distinctive graphic style and contributions to various fields including art, design, and film. His work often features bold, minimalist designs with a focus on everyday themes and human experiences. McFetridge's art is characterized by its simplicity, clarity, and a playful yet thoughtful approach to visual storytelling.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses flat, sharply bounded color fields, heavy graphic outlines, and simplified human forms that often read as silhouettes or angular profiles. A restricted but vivid palette of cobalt blue, black, red-orange, and cream creates bold poster-like compositions, with overlapping shapes and occasional repeated figures or botanical motifs."},{"id":"tim-burton","name":"Tim Burton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tim Burton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-burton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-burton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","drawing","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","white","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Tim Burton is an American filmmaker and artist known for his distinctive gothic and fantastical style. His work often features dark, whimsical themes and unique character designs, drawing inspiration from horror and fantasy genres. Burton's films, such as \"Edward Scissorhands\" and \"The Nightmare Before Christmas,\" showcase his talent for blending the eerie with the enchanting, creating a visual language that is both recognizable and influential.","observation":"The style combines hand-rendered, scratchy linework with softly modelled, tactile surfaces and densely textured clothing, hair, and backgrounds. Gaunt doll-like characters, exaggerated eyes, elongated anatomy, and distressed costumes recur in moody, high-contrast compositions with subdued grayscale and brown tones."},{"id":"kaffe-fassett","name":"Kaffe Fassett","cat":"designers","en":"Kaffe Fassett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kaffe-fassett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kaffe-fassett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","brown","dark-red","muted-blue","magenta","olive"],"intro":"Kaffe Fassett is a renowned American-born artist and designer known for his vibrant and intricate textile designs. His work spans various mediums, including knitting, needlepoint, and quilting, and he is celebrated for his bold use of color and pattern. Fassett's designs often draw inspiration from traditional crafts and folk art, blending them with a contemporary sensibility to create visually striking pieces.","observation":"The style is exuberant and highly decorative, built from densely packed floral motifs, patchwork blocks, concentric rosettes, and strongly saturated contrasting colors. Clean graphic shapes and prominent stitched or quilted surface marks make the textiles read as carefully constructed decorative panels, shown both as hanging outdoor quilts and as a textile backdrop with a standing figure."},{"id":"wes-craven","name":"Wes Craven","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Wes Craven","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wes-craven.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wes-craven","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","dark-red","charcoal","dark-brown","beige"],"intro":"Wes Craven was a renowned American filmmaker and screenwriter, best known for his work in the horror genre. He created iconic films such as \"A Nightmare on Elm Street\" and \"Scream,\" which have left a lasting impact on horror cinema. Craven's work is characterized by its innovative storytelling, suspenseful atmosphere, and memorable characters, making him a pivotal figure in the world of horror films.","observation":"Across the four renders, dark fantasy characters are built from dense ink-like linework and visibly worked, expressive paint, with rough strokes and heavily textured surfaces. Deep blacks, blood reds, and smoky blue-grey shadows create stark, moody lighting, while masked or monstrous figures and vulnerable children give the compositions a consistently ominous storybook tension."},{"id":"aitor-throup","name":"Aitor Throup","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Aitor Throup","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aitor-throup.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aitor-throup","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","grey","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Aitor Throup is a British fashion designer known for his innovative approach to clothing design, often incorporating elements of sculpture and conceptual art. His work is characterized by a focus on form, structure, and the exploration of identity through wearable art.","observation":"The style presents faceless, heavily layered garments as sculptural character forms in stark black-and-white studio compositions. Sparse neutral backgrounds and strong tonal separation emphasize the wrinkled fabric, suspended or exaggerated poses, and surreal mannequin-like presence across the set."},{"id":"nadav-kander","name":"Nadav Kander","cat":"photographers","en":"Nadav Kander","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nadav-kander.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nadav-kander","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","dark-green","muted-green","black","muted-blue","dark-blue"],"intro":"Nadav Kander is a renowned British photographer known for his evocative and contemplative imagery. His work often explores themes of isolation, human presence, and the interaction between nature and urban environments. Kander's photography is characterized by its cinematic quality, meticulous composition, and a distinctive use of muted color palettes.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic environmental compositions with solitary figures placed within vast, bleak landscapes or aging interiors. Desaturated green and blue palettes, diffuse overcast light, mist, and reflective wet surfaces create a quiet, ominous atmosphere, while broad negative space emphasizes isolation."},{"id":"jan-urschel","name":"Jan Urschel","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jan Urschel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-urschel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-urschel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","sci-fi"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","muted-teal","white","orange"],"intro":"Jan Urschel is a contemporary concept artist known for his work in the entertainment industry, particularly in film and video games. He specializes in creating visually compelling and imaginative environments that often explore futuristic and dystopian themes.","observation":"The style presents vast, realistic science-fiction landscapes with monumental, heavily weathered structures dwarfing small human figures. Subdued blue-green tones, deep shadows, isolated orange lights, and pervasive mist create a cinematic, bleak atmosphere, while dense surface detail and atmospheric perspective reinforce the immense scale."},{"id":"todd-mclellan","name":"Todd McLellan","cat":"photographers","en":"Todd McLellan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/todd-mclellan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/todd-mclellan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","flat-color","subdued-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","cream","beige","muted-brown","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Todd McLellan is a Canadian photographer known for his unique approach to capturing the intricate details of everyday objects. His work often involves deconstructing items to reveal their inner workings, presenting them in a meticulous and organized manner. McLellan's photography has been recognized for its ability to transform ordinary objects into extraordinary visual experiences, highlighting the beauty and complexity of design and engineering.","observation":"The style arranges dense collections of mechanical and electronic parts into recognizable object forms, with clocks, cameras, and other devices emerging from carefully organized fragments. It combines highly detailed, dimensional object rendering with restrained cream, white, metallic, and occasional red or blue accents, set against expansive pale negative space."},{"id":"jim-holland","name":"Jim Holland","cat":"painters","en":"Jim Holland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-holland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-holland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","charcoal","muted-orange","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Jim Holland is a contemporary American painter known for his serene and contemplative landscapes that often depict architectural elements and open spaces. His work is characterized by a minimalist approach, focusing on the interplay between light and shadow, and the subtle use of color to evoke mood and atmosphere.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, highly realistic compositions with carefully staged domestic and rural scenes, strong geometry, and dramatic directional light. Saturated warm reds and oranges contrast with deep teal shadows and blue skies, while long cast shadows, glowing lamps, and sunset illumination create a nostalgic retro atmosphere."},{"id":"inessa-garmash","name":"Inessa Garmash","cat":"painters","en":"Inessa Garmash","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/inessa-garmash.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/inessa-garmash","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-ochre","dark-brown","brown","silver","grey","red"],"intro":"Inessa Garmash is a contemporary artist known for her romantic and impressionistic style. Her works often capture intimate and serene moments, focusing on feminine themes and natural settings. Garmash's paintings are characterized by their detailed brushwork and soft lighting, creating a dreamy and contemplative atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses luminous, richly colored oil-like paint with clearly visible, varied brushstrokes and softly modeled figures. Women in airy white clothing are framed in intimate garden, terrace, and interior settings, with flowers, foliage, fabric, and sunlight rendered through layered expressive marks and glowing highlights."},{"id":"asaf-hanuka","name":"Asaf Hanuka","cat":"illustrators","en":"Asaf Hanuka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/asaf-hanuka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/asaf-hanuka","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","brown","black","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Asaf Hanuka is an Israeli illustrator and comic artist known for his work in graphic novels and editorial illustration. His style often combines personal narratives with broader social themes, creating a unique blend of storytelling and visual art. Hanuka's work is characterized by its expressive line work and vivid color palettes, often exploring themes of identity and contemporary life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, surreal tableaux packed with characters, animals, and environmental fragments. Heavy black contour lines, clean graphic color fields, strong contrast, and saturated accents create an expressive illustrated look, while grotesque anatomy and uncanny juxtapositions give the scenes a dark, dreamlike intensity."},{"id":"noma-bar","name":"Noma Bar","cat":"illustrators","en":"Noma Bar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/noma-bar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/noma-bar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","animals","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","blue","cream","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Noma Bar is an acclaimed Israeli graphic designer and illustrator known for his innovative use of negative space and minimalistic style. His work often features clever visual puns and dual imagery, making his illustrations both thought-provoking and visually striking. Bar's designs have been widely recognized in the fields of editorial illustration and advertising, showcasing his ability to communicate complex ideas through simple yet powerful visuals.","observation":"The style uses stark, graphic silhouettes and clean geometric shapes against broad cream, red, or blue fields. Strong black-red contrast, sparse compositions, and occasional tiny surface grain create a bold poster-like language, while human and animal forms are simplified into enigmatic, surreal symbols."},{"id":"angela-barrett","name":"Angela Barrett","cat":"illustrators","en":"Angela Barrett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/angela-barrett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/angela-barrett","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","silver","charcoal","grey","dark-brown","dark-rust"],"intro":"Angela Barrett is a contemporary British illustrator known for her detailed and atmospheric work, often drawing inspiration from classic literature and fairy tales. Her illustrations are characterized by a delicate and intricate style, capturing the essence of the stories she illustrates with a unique blend of realism and fantasy.","observation":"These images use finely rendered, visible brushwork to create richly detailed storybook scenes with softly subdued woodland colors, delicate faces, ornate clothing, and architectural textures. Dreamlike encounters between children and animals unfold in forests, castle grounds, and gothic interiors, combining naturalistic modeling with a quiet fantastical atmosphere."},{"id":"christy-tomlinson","name":"Christy Tomlinson","cat":"various-artists","en":"Christy Tomlinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christy-tomlinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christy-tomlinson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["light-orange","silver","red","beige","brown","rust"],"intro":"Christy Tomlinson is an American mixed media artist known for her whimsical and expressive style. She often incorporates elements of folk art and fantasy into her work, creating pieces that are both playful and imaginative. Her art is characterized by a rich use of textures and layers, often combining various mediums to achieve a unique, textured look.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork and layered, collage-like surfaces with fine black contour drawing, creating expressive female portraits surrounded by dense flowers and occasional animals. Saturated coral, turquoise, ochre, and sage hues, patterned fabrics, and ornamental botanical forms produce a highly decorative yet tactile illustrative finish."},{"id":"joe-fenton","name":"Joe Fenton","cat":"painters","en":"Joe Fenton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joe-fenton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joe-fenton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","landscapes","patterns","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","bone-white","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Joe Fenton is a contemporary artist known for his intricate and surreal illustrations. His work often features fantastical and dark themes, blending elements of fantasy and gothic art. Fenton's art is characterized by its detailed linework and imaginative compositions, drawing inspiration from mythological and surrealist motifs.","observation":"Across the renders, richly layered imagery combines botanical abundance, skulls, gothic architecture, seascapes, and flowing smoke or waves with intricate decorative patterning. Saturated coral, turquoise, blue, and gold repeatedly stand against deep dark grounds, while visible brushwork and fine line detail give the surreal compositions a lavish, handcrafted presence."},{"id":"carole-feuerman","name":"Carole Feuerman","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Carole Feuerman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carole-feuerman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carole-feuerman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-blue","muted-red","blue","silver","dark-red","black"],"intro":"Carole Feuerman is a renowned American sculptor known for her hyper-realistic sculptures of swimmers and bathers. Her work often explores themes of beauty, strength, and serenity, capturing the human form with incredible detail and lifelike accuracy. Feuerman's sculptures are celebrated for their meticulous craftsmanship and the way they convey a sense of calm and introspection.","observation":"The style presents close-up mannequin-like portraits with exaggerated facial proportions, glossy modeled skin, and brightly painted swim caps. Clean studio backdrops, saturated primary and pastel hues, and carefully visible brush-textured surfaces combine graphic illustration with a solid, sculptural presence."},{"id":"robert-venturi","name":"Robert Venturi","cat":"architects","en":"Robert Venturi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-venturi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-venturi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","blue","brown","ochre","grey","orange"],"intro":"Robert Venturi is a renowned American architect, known for his influential role in the development of postmodern architecture. His work challenges the minimalist principles of modernism, embracing complexity and contradiction in architectural design. Venturi's designs often incorporate historical references, playful forms, and a mix of styles, making him a pivotal figure in architectural theory and practice.","observation":"The style combines precise architectural drawing with flat, saturated blocks of red, blue, yellow, white, and black, using fine construction lines and lightly grainy surfaces. Across the renders, realistic buildings are reorganized into graphic, collage-like compositions with strong geometric masses, repeated arches, and a clear editorial architectural-illustration character."},{"id":"david-wiesner","name":"David Wiesner","cat":"illustrators","en":"David Wiesner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-wiesner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-wiesner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-olive","muted-blue","black","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"David Wiesner is a renowned American illustrator and author, celebrated for his imaginative and whimsical picture books. His work often features fantastical elements, detailed illustrations, and a narrative style that captivates both children and adults. Wiesner has won multiple awards, including several Caldecott Medals, for his contributions to children's literature.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, hand-rendered illustration with fine ink-like lines, dense crosshatched surfaces, and carefully modeled architectural and organic details. Muted blue-green twilight is punctuated by warm windows, lamps, mushrooms, and clothing, while oversized frogs and human figures create a whimsical fantasy narrative within atmospheric urban scenes."},{"id":"arthur-tress","name":"Arthur Tress","cat":"photographers","en":"Arthur Tress","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-tress.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-tress","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","bone-white"],"intro":"Arthur Tress is an American photographer known for his surreal and often haunting imagery. His work often explores themes of fantasy, dreams, and the subconscious, capturing the bizarre and the uncanny in everyday life. Tress's photography is characterized by its narrative quality, often involving staged scenes that evoke a sense of mystery and wonder.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white, high-contrast photographic imagery with richly resolved textures, architectural detail, and emphatic portrait framing. Realistic urban and rural settings are transformed by solemn children and uncanny animal companions into bleak, dreamlike scenes with a cinematic, surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"jeff-kinney","name":"Jeff Kinney","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jeff Kinney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeff-kinney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeff-kinney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","bone-white","blue","grey","black"],"intro":"Jeff Kinney is an American author and cartoonist best known for his \"Diary of a Wimpy Kid\" series. His work has gained widespread popularity for its humorous and relatable depiction of middle school life, capturing the challenges and adventures of adolescence through the eyes of the protagonist, Greg Heffley.","observation":"The style is a clean, hand-drawn comic illustration built from thick, emphatic black ink outlines, simplified figures, and selective flat color. Rounded child characters, sparse settings, expressive gestures, and small narrative props recur across the scenes, with occasional loose hatching and sketchy environmental marks."},{"id":"eiko-ojala","name":"Eiko Ojala","cat":"illustrators","en":"Eiko Ojala","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eiko-ojala.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eiko-ojala","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","sculptural","characters","landscapes","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","collage","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-blue","blue","beige","muted-blue","black","dark-teal","dark-rust"],"intro":"Eiko Ojala is an Estonian illustrator and graphic designer known for his unique approach to paper cut and digital illustration. His work often explores themes of nature, human form, and identity, blending traditional techniques with modern digital tools to create visually striking compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, layered paper-like forms create sculptural reliefs with deep recessed openings, profile silhouettes, and landscapes embedded inside them. The style combines graphic illustrative edges with tactile surface texture, strong shadow separation, restrained blue-green or earthy palettes, and surreal dreamlike scale."},{"id":"karen-tarlton","name":"Karen Tarlton","cat":"painters","en":"Karen Tarlton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karen-tarlton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karen-tarlton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["light-cyan","red","orange","charcoal","muted-pink","green"],"intro":"Karen Tarlton is an American artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings, often depicting nature and wildlife. Her work is characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions, capturing the beauty and essence of the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable outdoor scenes are built from dense, visible impasto-like strokes, with foliage, blossoms, figures, umbrellas, and wet paths emerging through layered marks. The palette is consistently saturated and multicolored, while broad directional strokes and smaller dabs create an expressive, richly textured surface."},{"id":"martha-rosler","name":"Martha Rosler","cat":"photographers","en":"Martha Rosler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martha-rosler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martha-rosler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","landscapes","scenes","grain","subdued-colors","surreal","retro","collage","dark"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","ochre","muted-cyan","beige","red"],"intro":"Martha Rosler is an influential American artist known for her work in photography, video, and performance art. She gained prominence in the 1970s with her politically charged and socially conscious pieces that often critique consumer culture, war, and the role of women in society. Rosler's work is characterized by its incisive commentary and innovative use of media, making her a significant figure in contemporary art.","observation":"The style combines richly detailed, photographic-looking landscapes and decayed architectural settings with an aged, grainy print texture, subdued warm colors, and strong retro coloration. Surreal juxtapositions⁠—brightly dressed figures, obsolete objects, ruined spaces, and vast natural vistas⁠—are assembled with a tactile collage sensibility and an unsettling, dreamlike mood."},{"id":"alberto-campo-baeza","name":"Alberto Campo Baeza","cat":"architects","en":"Alberto Campo Baeza","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alberto-campo-baeza.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alberto-campo-baeza","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","dark-brown","beige","muted-blue","dark-blue","brown"],"intro":"Alberto Campo Baeza is a renowned Spanish architect known for his minimalist and modernist architectural designs. His work often emphasizes simplicity, light, and the use of natural materials, creating spaces that are both functional and aesthetically pleasing. Baeza's architectural philosophy focuses on the essential elements of architecture, such as light, space, and proportion, which are evident in his numerous projects across the globe.","observation":"The style presents monumental architectural spaces with crisp geometric masses, pale stone or concrete surfaces, and carefully controlled perspective. Photorealistic detail, strong sunlight, deep cast shadows, and restrained earthy colors create a cinematic sense of scale, softened by sparse trees, sky, and distant terrain."},{"id":"mark-ryden","name":"Mark Ryden","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Ryden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-ryden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-ryden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","floral","portraits","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-ochre","muted-olive","brown","muted-orange","silver","rust","yellow"],"intro":"Mark Ryden is an American painter known for his distinctive style that blends pop culture with surrealism. His work often features a mix of whimsical and eerie elements, drawing on themes from childhood, fairy tales, and Victorian aesthetics. Ryden's paintings are characterized by their meticulous detail and dreamlike quality, often incorporating fantastical creatures and childlike figures.","observation":"The style combines softly modeled, highly detailed portraiture with visible painterly texture, giving the figures a porcelain-doll quality and solid, sculptural presence. Subdued, earthy backgrounds and pastel garments support ornate clothing, floral decoration, woodland settings, and surreal child-animal pairings across the sheet."},{"id":"brian-bolland","name":"Brian Bolland","cat":"illustrators","en":"Brian Bolland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-bolland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-bolland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","crosshatching","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","comics"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","dark-blue","charcoal","white","dark-red"],"intro":"Brian Bolland is a British comic book artist known for his detailed and realistic style, particularly in the superhero genre. He gained prominence with his work on \"Judge Dredd\" and \"Batman: The Killing Joke,\" which showcased his ability to blend intricate line work with expressive characters and dramatic storytelling. Bolland's influence extends across the comic book industry, where his precise and impactful illustrations have left a lasting mark.","observation":"The style uses highly expressive comic-book portraiture with bold contouring, fine ink hatching, dense facial detail, and dramatically cropped close-ups. Saturated purples, blues, greens, and reds are pushed against deep black shadows, giving the character faces an intense, menacing theatricality."},{"id":"ruben-ireland","name":"Ruben Ireland","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ruben Ireland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ruben-ireland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ruben-ireland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","cream","white","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Ruben Ireland is a contemporary illustrator known for his distinctive style that blends digital techniques with traditional influences. His work often features dark, surreal themes and is recognized for its bold, minimalist approach. Ireland's illustrations typically explore themes of fantasy and mystery, often focusing on enigmatic female figures.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, graphic portraiture with stark black-and-white contrast, pale faces, severe dark clothing, and expressive fashion-like silhouettes. Fine facial lines, feathers, windblown hair, and sharply cut shadows create an elegant but surreal raven-themed mood against sparse backgrounds."},{"id":"fernando-botero","name":"Fernando Botero","cat":"painters","en":"Fernando Botero","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fernando-botero.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fernando-botero","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","orange","red","deep-rust","grey","blue"],"intro":"Fernando Botero is a renowned Colombian artist known for his distinctive style of depicting figures in exaggerated, voluminous forms. His work often explores themes of political critique, social commentary, and cultural identity, using humor and satire to convey his messages. Botero's art is characterized by its bold colors, smooth textures, and a unique blend of realism and abstraction, making his figures instantly recognizable.","observation":"The style uses painterly, visibly textured surfaces with fine linear marks, saturated colors, and carefully rendered clothing, foliage, and animal fur. It repeatedly presents close, cropped portraits of highly stylized, rounded figures in decorative costumes, often accompanied by pets or flowers, with expressive proportions and calm, mask-like expressions."},{"id":"tomie-depaola","name":"Tomie dePaola","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tomie dePaola","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tomie-depaola.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tomie-depaola","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","subdued-colors","retro","drawing","cute"],"colours":["ochre","pale-orange","brown","orange","vivid-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Tomie dePaola is a beloved American author and illustrator known for his children's books, including the popular \"Strega Nona\" series. His work is characterized by its charming and whimsical illustrations, often depicting scenes from folklore and fairy tales, with a focus on storytelling and character development.","observation":"The style uses dense storybook compositions populated by expressive, slightly whimsical characters and animals, with recurring domestic and rural vignettes. Fine ink-like outlines, crosshatched shading, colored-pencil grain, and softly muted earthy colors give the clean illustrative forms a tactile retro picture-book appearance."},{"id":"cleve-gray","name":"Cleve Gray","cat":"painters","en":"Cleve Gray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cleve-gray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cleve-gray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink","geometric"],"colours":["pale-yellow","vivid-red","beige","brown","deep-blue","dark-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Cleve Gray is an American abstract painter known for his contributions to the Color Field movement and abstract expressionism. Born in 1918, Gray's work is characterized by bold use of color and dynamic compositions, often exploring the emotional impact of color and form.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated blue, red, black, cream, and ochre fields are built from forceful gestural strokes, scraped areas, drips, and broad palette-knife marks. The compositions use large geometric blocks and stark contrasts, with fragmented, nonrepresentational forms that feel energetic and slightly unreal."},{"id":"fritz-zuber-buhler","name":"Fritz Zuber-Buhler","cat":"painters","en":"Fritz Zuber-Buhler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fritz-zuber-buhler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fritz-zuber-buhler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","floral","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","ochre","light-orange","white"],"intro":"Fritz Zuber-Buhler was a Swiss painter known for his detailed and romantic depictions of young women and children. He was active during the 19th century and is associated with the academic art movement, often creating works that exude a sense of innocence and beauty. His paintings are characterized by their meticulous attention to detail and soft, harmonious color palettes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, realistic oil-paint handling with visible brushwork, carefully modelled faces, fabrics, flowers, and animal fur. Dark, warm backgrounds and strong light-shadow modelling create an intimate, old-fashioned portrait mood, while floral adornment, lace, foliage, fruit, and refined costumes provide decorative narrative detail."},{"id":"eugen-chisnicean","name":"Eugen Chisnicean","cat":"painters","en":"Eugen Chisnicean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eugen-chisnicean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eugen-chisnicean","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","grey","muted-blue","dark-brown","bone-white","red","light-lime"],"intro":"Eugen Chisnicean is a contemporary artist known for his evocative landscape and urban scenes. His work often captures the essence of European street life, blending traditional techniques with a modern sensibility. Chisnicean's art is characterized by its rich textures and atmospheric compositions, inviting viewers to explore the quiet beauty of everyday settings.","observation":"Across all four views, the city is rendered with visible, broad, energetic paint strokes and thickly textured surfaces, combining strong architectural detail with loose expressive marks. Saturated reds and blues, sharp light-dark contrasts, reflective streets, and active pedestrian scenes give the images a vivid, cinematic urban atmosphere."},{"id":"clay-bennett","name":"Clay Bennett","cat":"illustrators","en":"Clay Bennett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clay-bennett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clay-bennett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["white","bone-white","brown","beige","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Clay Bennett is a renowned American editorial cartoonist known for his insightful and often humorous takes on political and social issues. His work is characterized by its sharp wit and clear visual storytelling, often using caricature to highlight the absurdities of contemporary life.","observation":"The style uses polished editorial illustration with fine ink-like contours, controlled flat color, and soft modelling rather than visible paint texture. Human figures are carefully rendered with expressive gestures and faces, while symbolic situations are staged against spacious, simplified backgrounds in a restrained palette with strong light-dark separation."},{"id":"audrey-kawasaki","name":"Audrey Kawasaki","cat":"painters","en":"Audrey Kawasaki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/audrey-kawasaki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/audrey-kawasaki","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","light-orange","orange","brown","ochre","red"],"intro":"Audrey Kawasaki is a contemporary artist known for her distinctive style that blends elements of Japanese manga and Art Nouveau. Her work often features ethereal portraits of young women, characterized by their dreamy expressions and intricate details. Kawasaki's art is celebrated for its delicate linework and the subtle interplay of innocence and sensuality.","observation":"The style combines tightly cropped female portraits with dense botanical framing, flowing hair, and ornamental natural motifs. Fine contour lines, flat yet softly varied color areas, and extensive decorative detail create an illustrative, vintage-inspired fantasy look with muted earthy pink, green, cream, and black tones."},{"id":"kawacy","name":"Kawacy","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kawacy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kawacy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kawacy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-rust","grey","pale-orange","orange"],"intro":"Kawacy is a digital illustrator known for creating intricate and expressive artwork, often featuring fantasy and anime-inspired themes. Their work is characterized by detailed line work, vibrant colors, and a whimsical, ethereal atmosphere that draws from Japanese pop culture and fantasy genres.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines richly visible fine brushwork with highly detailed, expressive close-up character portraits. Saturated warm metallic accents, dark clothing, flowers and butterflies create a vivid, dreamy fantasy atmosphere, while dramatic cropping and strong light-dark contrast give the compositions intensity."},{"id":"richard-misrach","name":"Richard Misrach","cat":"photographers","en":"Richard Misrach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-misrach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-misrach","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Richard Misrach is an influential American photographer known for his large-scale color photographs that explore the relationship between humans and the environment. His work often focuses on the American West, capturing the beauty and complexity of its landscapes while addressing themes of environmental change and human impact.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic landscape photography with expansive aerial or elevated compositions, restrained cool tones, and atmospheric haze. Strong natural contrasts⁠—glowing lava against dark rock, red water against pale mineral shores, and warm dunes beneath cool skies⁠—give the scenes a dramatic yet quiet sense of scale."},{"id":"stephan-pastis","name":"Stephan Pastis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stephan Pastis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephan-pastis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephan-pastis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-brown","orange","silver","red"],"intro":"Stephan Pastis is a renowned American cartoonist, best known for creating the popular comic strip \"Pearls Before Swine.\" His work is celebrated for its witty humor, satirical edge, and engaging characters, often reflecting on everyday life and societal quirks.","observation":"The style combines warmly lit, realistic portrait photography with vividly colored, boldly outlined cartoon characters and comic-panel imagery. Dense studio environments, expressive creatures, flat color areas, and hand-drawn textures create a playful, surreal illustrated-world quality alongside photographic detail."},{"id":"trey-ratcliff","name":"Trey Ratcliff","cat":"photographers","en":"Trey Ratcliff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/trey-ratcliff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/trey-ratcliff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-cyan","muted-cyan","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Trey Ratcliff is a renowned photographer known for his pioneering work in HDR (High Dynamic Range) photography. His images often capture vibrant landscapes and cityscapes, blending reality with a touch of fantasy. Ratcliff's work has been widely recognized for its vivid colors and intricate details, making him a significant figure in the world of digital photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is highly realistic and richly detailed, presenting grand natural and architectural landscapes with cinematic compositions. Saturated colors, dramatic sunlight, reflective water, atmospheric mist, and monumental scenery give the images an expansive, epic quality."},{"id":"carl-barks","name":"Carl Barks","cat":"illustrators","en":"Carl Barks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-barks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-barks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-brown","ochre","light-yellow","grey"],"intro":"Carl Barks is a renowned American cartoonist and illustrator best known for his work on Disney's \"Donald Duck\" comics. Born in 1901, Barks created many beloved characters and stories, earning him the nickname \"The Duck Man.\" His work has had a lasting impact on the world of comics and animation, influencing generations of artists and storytellers.","observation":"The style combines richly visible, broad painterly strokes with highly readable cartoon character design and dense environmental detail. Saturated greens, blues, reds, and warm browns create vivid, high-contrast storybook scenes, while expressive poses and bustling group interactions give every image an adventurous narrative energy."},{"id":"josephine-wall","name":"Josephine Wall","cat":"painters","en":"Josephine Wall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josephine-wall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josephine-wall","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","beige","dark-red","pale-orange","rust","dark-blue"],"intro":"Josephine Wall is a contemporary English artist known for her fantasy art, which often features dreamlike and whimsical elements. Her work is characterized by intricate details and vibrant colors, drawing inspiration from nature, mythology, and the cosmos. Wall's paintings often depict ethereal landscapes and mythical creatures, blending reality with imagination.","observation":"The style combines richly visible, fine painterly strokes with densely layered floral, feather, lace, and jewel-like ornament. Repeated feminine portraits and profiles merge into lush botanical surroundings, using saturated jewel tones, delicate highlights, and luminous fantasy details to create an ornate, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"bonnie-marris","name":"Bonnie Marris","cat":"painters","en":"Bonnie Marris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bonnie-marris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bonnie-marris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","animals","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","grey","muted-ochre","muted-blue"],"intro":"Bonnie Marris is an American artist renowned for her realistic wildlife paintings, capturing the essence and beauty of animals in their natural habitats. Her work often reflects a deep appreciation for nature and a commitment to environmental conservation, making her a prominent figure in contemporary wildlife art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly and naturalistic, with visible directional brushwork defining fur, hair, grasses, foliage, and cloud forms. Wildlife is presented in dramatic close-up compositions against rugged outdoor settings, using earthy colors, strong light-dark separation, and expressive animal poses."},{"id":"odd-nerdrum","name":"Odd Nerdrum","cat":"painters","en":"Odd Nerdrum","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/odd-nerdrum.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/odd-nerdrum","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-brown","orange","deep-rust"],"intro":"Odd Nerdrum is a Norwegian figurative painter known for his detailed and classical approach to art, often drawing inspiration from the Old Masters. His work is characterized by its focus on the human condition, existential themes, and a unique blend of realism and surrealism, often incorporating mythological and historical elements.","observation":"Across all four images, solemn figures emerge from near-black backgrounds in richly textured, visibly brushed paint. Warm umbers, browns, muted reds, and flesh tones are set against strong shadow, with dramatic directional light emphasizing weathered faces, heavy garments, and an austere, mournful mood."},{"id":"al-hirschfeld","name":"Al Hirschfeld","cat":"illustrators","en":"Al Hirschfeld","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/al-hirschfeld.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/al-hirschfeld","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","comics","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","black","grey"],"intro":"Al Hirschfeld was an American caricaturist best known for his black and white portraits of celebrities and Broadway stars. His work was characterized by fluid lines and a playful, satirical style that captured the essence of his subjects with minimal detail.","observation":"The style uses elegant black-and-white fashion illustration with finely controlled ink contours, selective solid blacks, stippling, and crosshatched shading. Stylized women have elongated forms, dramatic eyes, sculpted hairstyles, elaborate clothing, and poised theatrical gestures, while generous white space keeps the compositions crisp and graphic."},{"id":"henry-wessel","name":"Henry Wessel","cat":"photographers","en":"Henry Wessel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henry-wessel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henry-wessel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["grey","silver","white","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Henry Wessel is an American photographer known for his work capturing the subtleties of everyday life in the American West. His photography often explores themes of suburbia, landscape, and the ordinary moments that define human experience. Wessel's work is characterized by its straightforward, unembellished style, often employing black and white film to emphasize form and composition.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photography with crisp realism, hard sunlight, and strong tonal separation. Wide, carefully composed urban scenes combine posed figures with sparse suburban infrastructure, palms, utility lines, older cars, and dry mountain surroundings, creating a cinematic documentary atmosphere."},{"id":"holly-andres","name":"Holly Andres","cat":"photographers","en":"Holly Andres","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/holly-andres.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/holly-andres","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-olive","ochre","deep-red","light-lime","blue","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Holly Andres is a contemporary American photographer known for her narrative-driven images that often explore themes of childhood and femininity. Her work is characterized by its cinematic quality, meticulous attention to detail, and the use of vibrant color palettes that evoke a sense of nostalgia and whimsy.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic domestic tableaux in richly furnished midcentury interiors, with carefully staged figures, clothing, and period objects. Deep green and red palettes, patterned surfaces, warm practical lamps, and sharply angled window light create a dark, nostalgic atmosphere with strong contrast and selective luminous highlights."},{"id":"greg-girard","name":"Greg Girard","cat":"photographers","en":"Greg Girard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-girard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-girard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["dark-green","black","dark-cyan","dark-brown","dark-red","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Greg Girard is a Canadian photographer known for his evocative images capturing the essence of urban life, particularly in Asian cities. His work often explores themes of modernity, urbanization, and the interplay of light and shadow in cityscapes. Girard's photography is characterized by a keen eye for detail and a deep understanding of the environments he captures, making his images both visually striking and thought-provoking.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses cinematic realism to depict rain-drenched urban scenes with vintage cars, aging storefronts, and dense overhead wiring. Heavy teal shadows contrast with red neon and practical lights, while wet reflections, mist, motion blur, and atmospheric haze create a bleak, nocturnal mood."},{"id":"akos-major","name":"Akos Major","cat":"photographers","en":"Akos Major","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/akos-major.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/akos-major","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","mist","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["silver","grey","white","charcoal"],"intro":"Akos Major is a contemporary photographer known for his minimalist and serene landscape photography. His work often features tranquil scenes with a focus on simplicity and elegance, capturing the beauty of nature with a refined eye.","observation":"The style is realistic and cinematic, built around sparse coastal landscapes, strong receding perspective, and repeated lamp-post geometry. Desaturated blue-green tones, broad empty spaces, and dense fog create a quiet, dreamy atmosphere across the pier, shoreline, tidal flats, and wet boardwalk scenes."},{"id":"janet-delaney","name":"Janet Delaney","cat":"photographers","en":"Janet Delaney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/janet-delaney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/janet-delaney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","mist","motion","grain","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-green","grey","brown","silver","muted-rust","orange"],"intro":"Janet Delaney is an American photographer known for her work capturing urban landscapes and the social dynamics within them. Her photography often focuses on the transformation of cities and the communities within them, particularly during periods of change and development. Delaney's work has been exhibited widely and is recognized for its insightful portrayal of urban life.","observation":"Across the images, realistic urban scenes are framed like carefully composed film stills, with isolated figures, period details, and layered architectural settings. Muted green, brown, and blue tones are punctuated by warm practical lights, while rain, haze, reflective pavement, and visible grain create a moody, nostalgic atmosphere."},{"id":"gerry-johansson","name":"Gerry Johansson","cat":"photographers","en":"Gerry Johansson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerry-johansson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerry-johansson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","brown","charcoal","black","beige"],"intro":"Gerry Johansson is a Swedish photographer known for his minimalist and documentary approach to capturing landscapes and urban environments. His work often focuses on the quiet, understated beauty of everyday scenes, emphasizing form, light, and composition.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses monochrome photographic realism with strong tonal contrast, restrained compositions, and isolated human figures. Spacious environments, unusual lamp-filled or architectural settings, coastal and rural landscapes, atmospheric haze, and subtle film grain create a cinematic, surreal sense of quiet unease."},{"id":"larry-macdougall","name":"Larry MacDougall","cat":"illustrators","en":"Larry MacDougall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-macdougall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-macdougall","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","grey","silver","light-orange","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Larry MacDougall is a Canadian illustrator known for his work in fantasy art, particularly in children's books and games. His illustrations often feature whimsical and enchanting themes, drawing inspiration from folklore and mythology.","observation":"These images use richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with fine, controlled brushwork, dense environmental detail, and expressive character rendering. Earthy, restrained colors are punctuated by strong light-dark contrasts, while monumental forests, cliffs, castles, snowy roads, and robed figures create an expansive storybook fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"molly-harrison","name":"Molly Harrison","cat":"illustrators","en":"Molly Harrison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/molly-harrison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/molly-harrison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","red","beige","charcoal","dark-red"],"intro":"Molly Harrison is an illustrator known for her enchanting and whimsical fantasy art. Her work often features ethereal figures, nature elements, and a dreamlike quality that captivates viewers. Harrison's illustrations are characterized by intricate details and a soft color palette, often depicting mythical creatures and fairy tale motifs.","observation":"The style combines intimate, highly detailed female portraiture with botanical adornments, birds, berries, flowers, and flowing hair. Fine ink-like outlines and visible hand-rendered texture define the forms, while soft layered color, delicate shading, and ornate natural motifs create a romantic fantasy illustration aesthetic."},{"id":"laurie-greasley","name":"Laurie Greasley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Laurie Greasley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laurie-greasley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laurie-greasley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","sci-fi","surreal"],"colours":["grey","dark-blue","black","red","pink","blue"],"intro":"Laurie Greasley is a contemporary illustrator known for his intricate and vivid depictions of futuristic and science fiction themes. His work often explores the intersection of technology and human experience, creating immersive worlds that captivate the viewer with their detail and imagination.","observation":"The style uses dense comic-book linework, crisp contour drawing, and selectively flat color fields to describe elaborate futuristic environments and machinery. Strong black outlines and high contrast structure a vivid palette of electric blue, coral pink, orange, and teal, producing a surreal, dystopian science-fiction atmosphere across both urban and extraterrestrial scenes."},{"id":"jessica-backhaus","name":"Jessica Backhaus","cat":"photographers","en":"Jessica Backhaus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jessica-backhaus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jessica-backhaus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","urban","motion","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["red","dark-cyan","dark-red","grey","dark-green"],"intro":"Jessica Backhaus is a contemporary German photographer known for her vibrant and contemplative works, often exploring themes of memory and perception. Her photography is characterized by a keen eye for color and composition, capturing the interplay of light and shadow in everyday scenes.","observation":"The style uses realistic photographic surfaces and close, cropped views of urban and recreational spaces, with rain, puddles, glass, and water turning architecture into layered reflections. Saturated coral-red and turquoise dominate, reinforced by hard sunlight, deep shadows, strong diagonals, and visible fine grain; the repeated reflections give the scenes a subtly surreal quality."},{"id":"franklin-booth","name":"Franklin Booth","cat":"illustrators","en":"Franklin Booth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/franklin-booth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/franklin-booth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Franklin Booth was an American illustrator known for his intricate pen-and-ink drawings that emulated the appearance of wood engravings. Active in the early 20th century, Booth's work is celebrated for its detailed linework and romantic, often fantastical themes. His illustrations often appeared in books and magazines, contributing significantly to the Golden Age of American Illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense black-and-white ink drawing with fine contour work, crosshatched shading, and strongly controlled highlights and shadows. Elaborate fantasy landscapes⁠—ancient trees, cliffs, ruins, and cloaked figures⁠—are rendered with expressive, highly textured detail and a consistently dark atmosphere."},{"id":"matt-mahurin","name":"Matt Mahurin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Matt Mahurin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-mahurin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-mahurin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","painterly","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","fantasy","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-olive","black","beige","muted-green"],"intro":"Matt Mahurin is a renowned American illustrator, photographer, and filmmaker known for his distinctive and evocative visual style. His work often explores themes of social justice, politics, and the human condition, utilizing a blend of surrealism and realism to create thought-provoking imagery. Mahurin's illustrations have appeared in numerous publications, and his artistic influence extends across various media.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses a painterly, filmic treatment with heavily muted green-gray colors, deep shadows, and soft atmospheric light. Dense fog obscures distant buildings and figures, while isolated cloaked silhouettes, sparse trees, birds, and recurring red accents create a dark, uncanny fantasy mood."},{"id":"filippo-minelli","name":"Filippo Minelli","cat":"photographers","en":"Filippo Minelli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/filippo-minelli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/filippo-minelli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","light-blue","muted-red","pink","grey","red","orange"],"intro":"Filippo Minelli is an Italian contemporary artist known for his conceptual and environmental art. His work often explores the intersection of nature and human intervention, using elements like smoke to create striking visual contrasts.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic landscape imagery with highly detailed billowing smoke rendered in saturated pinks, corals, oranges, and cool blue-greens. Expansive mountain settings, atmospheric haze, and explosive cloud movement create surreal scenes while retaining photographic texture and strong visual depth."},{"id":"ando-fuchs","name":"Ando Fuchs","cat":"photographers","en":"Ando Fuchs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ando-fuchs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ando-fuchs","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Ando Fuchs is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative black and white imagery that often explores themes of solitude and mystery within urban environments. His work is characterized by a strong sense of narrative and atmosphere, often drawing comparisons to the film noir genre and the works of classic photographers like Henri Cartier-Bresson.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome, filmic, and strongly contrast-driven, using monumental urban architecture to frame solitary silhouetted figures. Dense fog, selective focus, grain, wet surfaces, and blown-out openings create a bleak, noir-like atmosphere with recurring deep shadows and luminous distant space."},{"id":"eleanor-fortescue-brickdale","name":"Eleanor Fortescue-Brickdale","cat":"painters","en":"Eleanor Fortescue-Brickdale","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eleanor-fortescue-brickdale.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eleanor-fortescue-brickdale","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Eleanor Fortescue-Brickdale was a British artist and illustrator associated with the late Pre-Raphaelite movement. Known for her detailed and romantic style, she often depicted scenes from literature, mythology, and history, characterized by rich colors and intricate details. Her work reflects a fascination with the medieval and the mythical, often incorporating themes of love and beauty.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and highly detailed, with visible fine brushwork modeling faces, hair, fabrics, foliage, and reflective ornament. It combines subdued, warm colors with ornate costumes and dense floral settings, presenting dreamy classical figures in romantic garden vignettes."},{"id":"dan-mumford","name":"Dan Mumford","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dan Mumford","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-mumford.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-mumford","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","dark-pink","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Dan Mumford is a contemporary illustrator known for his intricate and vibrant artwork, often featuring fantasy and sci-fi themes. He has worked with various clients in the music and entertainment industries, creating album covers, posters, and other visual media.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly detailed, fine-lined fantasy environments with expressive painted textures and dramatic dark-versus-crimson lighting. Vast infernal landscapes, gothic structures, turbulent water, and supernatural skies are framed as epic scenes, with internal light sources such as lava, windows, and the moon creating vivid luminous accents."},{"id":"nate-beeler","name":"Nate Beeler","cat":"illustrators","en":"Nate Beeler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nate-beeler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nate-beeler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing"],"colours":["black","charcoal","blue","deep-red","grey","muted-orange"],"intro":"Nate Beeler is an American editorial cartoonist known for his sharp political satire and expressive illustrations. His work often appears in newspapers and online platforms, where he tackles contemporary political and social issues with wit and insight.","observation":"The style uses strongly outlined, graphic comic-book drawing with dense crosshatching, expressive faces, and heavily blocked shadows. A restrained teal, red, black, and ochre palette is pushed by high contrast, while detailed figures, monuments, city objects, and theatrical settings create a dramatic editorial narrative."},{"id":"imants-tillers","name":"Imants Tillers","cat":"painters","en":"Imants Tillers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/imants-tillers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/imants-tillers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","bone-white","charcoal","red","blue"],"intro":"Imants Tillers is an Australian artist known for his conceptual and postmodern approach to art. He often explores themes of identity, culture, and memory through his work, utilizing a distinctive style that incorporates text and imagery in layered compositions. Tillers has been influential in the Australian art scene and has exhibited internationally, contributing significantly to contemporary art discourse.","observation":"The style combines heavily worked, visibly scraped and brushed paint with layered architectural imagery, fine linear marks, and collage-like overlaps. Muted teal, ochre, blue, and rust tones unify urban rooftops, monumental interiors, figures, and structural grids into expressive, slightly surreal compositions."},{"id":"winifred-nicholson","name":"Winifred Nicholson","cat":"painters","en":"Winifred Nicholson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/winifred-nicholson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/winifred-nicholson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","patterns","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","muted-yellow","silver","dark-olive","rust"],"intro":"Winifred Nicholson was a British painter known for her vibrant use of color and light, often depicting landscapes and still lifes with a focus on flowers and natural elements. Her work is characterized by a modernist approach, blending elements of post-impressionism with a personal, intimate style that reflects her love of nature and domestic scenes.","observation":"The style uses visible, delicate paint strokes and a lightly textured canvas surface, combining softly blended backgrounds with clearly articulated flowers, leaves, branches, and vase forms. Across garden views and floral still lifes, it favors a muted, airy palette with abundant botanical detail and loose illustrative contours."},{"id":"tamara-de-lempicka","name":"Tamara de Lempicka","cat":"painters","en":"Tamara de Lempicka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tamara-de-lempicka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tamara-de-lempicka","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","orange","black","grey","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Tamara de Lempicka was a Polish painter known for her distinctive Art Deco style, characterized by bold colors, geometric forms, and a focus on portraits. Her work often depicted the glamour and sophistication of the 1920s and 1930s, capturing the essence of the Jazz Age with a modernist flair. Lempicka's paintings are celebrated for their elegance and the way they blend classical elements with a modern sensibility.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped female portraits with dramatic eyes, red lips, angular features, and fashion-forward hats or scarves. Smooth modeled shading is combined with visible fine paint texture, clean graphic contours, saturated jewel-like colors, and a polished vintage magazine-illustration feel."},{"id":"raymond-briggs","name":"Raymond Briggs","cat":"illustrators","en":"Raymond Briggs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raymond-briggs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raymond-briggs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","urban","fine-lines","grain","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["brown","black","red","grey","muted-ochre","pale-orange"],"intro":"Raymond Briggs is a renowned British illustrator and author, best known for his work in children's literature. His most famous works include \"The Snowman\" and \"Father Christmas,\" which have become beloved classics. Briggs's illustrations often feature whimsical and gentle storytelling, capturing the imaginations of both children and adults alike.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses textured, visibly worked paint with fine linear detail and a grainy, print-like surface. Muted winter colors, recurring urban snow scenes, expressive character poses, and vintage clothing create a moody retro storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"stuart-lippincott","name":"Stuart Lippincott","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stuart Lippincott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stuart-lippincott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stuart-lippincott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","light-cyan","dark-cyan","dark-red","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Stuart Lippincott is a contemporary digital artist known for his imaginative and surreal illustrations. His work often explores themes of fantasy and science fiction, creating dreamlike worlds that captivate the viewer with their intricate details and vibrant colors.","observation":"The style is cinematic and highly realistic, using expansive compositions, solitary figures, and monumental landscapes to create a strong sense of scale. Deep blue-green shadows contrast with intense orange-red light sources, while mist, clouds, reflections, and atmospheric haze produce a dark, dreamy, otherworldly mood."},{"id":"bastien-grivet","name":"Bastien Grivet","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bastien Grivet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bastien-grivet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bastien-grivet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","surreal"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-red","red","grey","pale-orange"],"intro":"Bastien Grivet is a contemporary artist known for his work in concept art and visual development, often contributing to the entertainment industry. His expertise lies in creating immersive and imaginative environments that blend elements of fantasy and science fiction.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic, photorealistic worldbuilding with immense vertical architecture, rugged geological forms, and tiny human figures to establish monumental scale. Deep shadowed foregrounds contrast with orange atmospheric light, glowing city details, reflective surfaces, and persistent haze, creating a bleak yet awe-inspiring science-fiction landscape."},{"id":"philip-lorca-dicorcia","name":"Philip-Lorca diCorcia","cat":"photographers","en":"Philip-Lorca diCorcia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philip-lorca-dicorcia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philip-lorca-dicorcia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","muted-ochre","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Philip-Lorca diCorcia is an American photographer known for his innovative approach to photography, blending documentary and staged elements to create compelling narratives. His work often explores themes of urban life, identity, and the mundane aspects of everyday existence, capturing moments that blur the line between reality and fiction.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is cinematic and realistic, built from nocturnal urban scenes with solitary or paired characters placed in intimate interiors and streets. Moody teal-and-amber lighting, strong contrast, practical glowing lamps and signage, reflective wet surfaces, and selective background blur create a dark, atmospheric film-still quality."},{"id":"romain-trystram","name":"Romain Trystram","cat":"illustrators","en":"Romain Trystram","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/romain-trystram.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/romain-trystram","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","blue","dark-red","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Romain Trystram is a contemporary illustrator known for his vibrant and futuristic digital artworks. His work often explores themes of sci-fi and surrealism, characterized by bold colors and imaginative landscapes. Trystram's unique style combines elements of fantasy and modern digital techniques to create visually striking compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines cinematic science-fiction worldbuilding with monumental architecture, vast landscapes, and tiny silhouetted figures that emphasize scale. Saturated blue and red light, strong dark-to-bright contrast, internal architectural glow, reflective surfaces, and atmospheric haze create a dramatic, surreal sense of place."},{"id":"mitsumasa-anno","name":"Mitsumasa Anno","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mitsumasa Anno","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mitsumasa-anno.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mitsumasa-anno","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","black","bone-white","grey","ochre","orange"],"intro":"Mitsumasa Anno is a renowned Japanese illustrator and author, celebrated for his unique and imaginative picture books. His work often explores themes of nature, culture, and mathematics, presented through intricate and whimsical illustrations that captivate both children and adults alike.","observation":"The style combines densely packed, highly detailed illustrative drawing with fine dark linework, vivid yet slightly weathered colors, and ornate surface patterning. It moves between botanical scenes, dressed figures, industrial architecture, and fantastical cities while maintaining layered compositions, decorative contours, and a storybook sense of wonder."},{"id":"anne-geddes","name":"Anne Geddes","cat":"photographers","en":"Anne Geddes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-geddes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-geddes","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","floral","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors","fantasy","cute","dreamy"],"colours":["vivid-rust","light-orange","olive","red","muted-blue","dark-olive"],"intro":"Anne Geddes is a renowned Australian photographer known for her distinctive and whimsical portraits of infants. Her work often features babies in imaginative and fantastical settings, frequently incorporating elements of nature such as flowers and leaves. Geddes's photography has been celebrated for its unique blend of creativity and tenderness, capturing the innocence and purity of newborns in a style that is both recognizable and beloved worldwide.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, detailed photographic-looking tableaux of sleeping newborns nestled inside or dressed as oversized flowers. Saturated floral colors, tactile petals and knit fabrics, soft focus, and gentle studio-like lighting create a cute, dreamy fairytale mood across the set."},{"id":"geof-darrow","name":"Geof Darrow","cat":"illustrators","en":"Geof Darrow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/geof-darrow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/geof-darrow","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["grey","silver","brown","muted-ochre","blue","red"],"intro":"Geof Darrow is an American comic book artist and designer known for his highly detailed and intricate line work. His career includes collaborations with notable writers and contributions to both comics and film, where his unique style has left a significant impact. Darrow's work is characterized by its meticulous attention to detail and often features complex, densely packed scenes that invite viewers to explore every inch.","observation":"The style combines densely packed speculative environments with expressive, highly controlled line drawing and vivid blue, orange, and pale lilac color contrasts. Bold ink contours, intricate mechanical details, crowded vertical compositions, and surreal characters create energetic fantasy scenes that feel both illustrative and in motion."},{"id":"jean-baptiste-greuze","name":"Jean-Baptiste Greuze","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Baptiste Greuze","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-baptiste-greuze.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-baptiste-greuze","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","bone-white","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Jean-Baptiste Greuze was a French painter known for his genre scenes and portraits, often depicting domestic life and emotional expressions. Active during the 18th century, Greuze's work is characterized by its detailed realism and emotional depth, reflecting the sensibilities of the Rococo and Neoclassical movements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modeled oil-paint surfaces with visible fine brushwork, carefully rendered hair, skin, and fabric, and expressive upward or sidelong gazes. Close-cropped portraits emerge from dark warm backgrounds through subdued earthy colors, selective highlights, and strong tonal contrast, with classical drapery and elaborate hairstyles reinforcing the formal painted character."},{"id":"henri-gaudier-brzeska","name":"Henri Gaudier Brzeska","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Henri Gaudier Brzeska","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-gaudier-brzeska.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-gaudier-brzeska","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","still-life","subdued-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["silver","brown","white","black","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Henri Gaudier Brzeska was a French sculptor known for his innovative and expressive works during the early 20th century. He was a prominent figure in the modernist movement, contributing significantly to the development of avant-garde art before his untimely death during World War I. Gaudier Brzeska's work is characterized by bold, abstract forms and a strong influence of primitivism, often exploring the human figure in dynamic and expressive ways.","observation":"The style presents stylized human figures as solid, carved or modeled sculptures, combining geometric planes, pierced negative openings, and strongly simplified anatomy. Materials range from rough warm stone to dark polished surfaces, shown in restrained earth tones against clean gallery-like backgrounds with soft directional lighting."},{"id":"sanne-sannes","name":"Sanne Sannes","cat":"photographers","en":"Sanne Sannes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sanne-sannes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sanne-sannes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","silver"],"intro":"Sanne Sannes was a Dutch photographer known for his experimental and erotic black-and-white photography during the 1960s. His work often explored themes of intimacy, sensuality, and psychological depth, capturing the essence of the counterculture movement of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses tightly cropped photographic portraits in black and white, with faces overlapping in intimate, fashion-editorial arrangements. Strong tonal contrast, soft focus, visible film grain, and shadow-heavy lighting create a moody cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"bernie-wrightson","name":"Bernie Wrightson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bernie Wrightson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bernie-wrightson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bernie-wrightson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","motion","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","beige","bone-white","white"],"intro":"Bernie Wrightson is renowned for his work as an illustrator, particularly in the horror genre. He co-created the character Swamp Thing for DC Comics and is celebrated for his detailed pen and ink illustrations, especially those for Mary Shelley's \"Frankenstein.\" His style is characterized by intricate line work and a gothic atmosphere, making him a pivotal figure in horror illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a dense monochrome fantasy illustration built from visible brush and ink-like marks, with scratchy highlights, heavy blacks, and sharply modeled organic forms. Dramatic close encounters between enormous creatures and tangled forest terrain create forceful motion, grim mood, and an epic sense of scale."},{"id":"carl-holsoe","name":"Carl Holsoe","cat":"painters","en":"Carl Holsoe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-holsoe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-holsoe","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Carl Holsoe was a Danish painter known for his serene and introspective interior scenes, often featuring solitary figures. His work is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail, a subdued color palette, and a focus on the quiet beauty of domestic life during the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly brushwork to depict quiet domestic interiors with recurring female figures, desks, windows, and period clothing. Strong shafts of natural light cut through deep brown shadows, creating a moody, intimate atmosphere with carefully observed furnishings and fabric detail."},{"id":"john-william-waterhouse","name":"John William Waterhouse","cat":"painters","en":"John William Waterhouse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-william-waterhouse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-william-waterhouse","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","muted-brown","dark-red","light-orange","grey","dark-blue"],"intro":"John William Waterhouse was a British painter associated with the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood, known for his depictions of classical and literary themes. Born in 1849, Waterhouse's work is characterized by its romantic and detailed portrayals of mythological and historical subjects, often featuring women in natural settings.","observation":"The style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, with layered fine strokes modeling faces, fabric, foliage, stone, and water. Romantic female figures and garden settings are composed as lush, detailed vignettes, using deep earthy reds, greens, and browns offset by pale skin and occasional blue or crimson garments."},{"id":"elke-vogelsang","name":"Elke Vogelsang","cat":"photographers","en":"Elke Vogelsang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elke-vogelsang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elke-vogelsang","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","fashion","portraits","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-blue","brown","black","beige","red","bone-white"],"intro":"Elke Vogelsang is a renowned German photographer known for her captivating and humorous pet portraits, particularly of dogs. Her work often highlights the unique personalities and expressions of her subjects, bringing a sense of joy and playfulness to the viewer.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely detailed studio portraits of greyhounds, with crisp fur, expressive eyes, and tactile knitted or woven clothing. Close framing, simple colored backdrops, and saturated accessory accents create a polished, playful fashion-portrait look."},{"id":"lori-nix","name":"Lori Nix","cat":"photographers","en":"Lori Nix","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lori-nix.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lori-nix","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","brown","silver","olive","muted-orange"],"intro":"Lori Nix is an American photographer known for her intricate dioramas and miniature worlds. Her work often explores themes of urban decay and nature reclaiming human spaces, creating a narrative that is both eerie and captivating. Nix's photography has been exhibited widely and is celebrated for its meticulous detail and imaginative storytelling.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic environments where abandoned architecture and domestic spaces are reclaimed by dense vegetation. Subdued, mossy colors, atmospheric light, and warm window or sunset glow create a cinematic, dreamy sense of surreal inhabitation across urban ruins, interiors, and waterfront structures."},{"id":"john-batho","name":"John Batho","cat":"photographers","en":"John Batho","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-batho.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-batho","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","ink","dark","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["black","bone-white","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"John Batho is a renowned French photographer known for his innovative use of color and light in photography. His work often explores the interplay between reality and abstraction, creating images that challenge the viewer's perception and understanding of the photographic medium.","observation":"Across the sheet, stark black-and-white tonal separation, broad areas of negative space, and grainy atmospheric softness create a bleak, dreamlike mood. Portraits and tiny solitary figures dissolve into fog, water, blur, and expressive ink-like marks, combining photographic-looking forms with restless linear and splattered textures."},{"id":"robert-zemeckis","name":"Robert Zemeckis","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Robert Zemeckis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-zemeckis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-zemeckis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","glow","mist","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","dark-blue","muted-ochre","dark-rust","muted-blue"],"intro":"Robert Zemeckis is an American filmmaker known for his innovative use of special effects and storytelling in films such as \"Back to the Future\" and \"Forrest Gump.\" His work often blends fantasy with reality, creating engaging and visually compelling narratives that have captivated audiences worldwide.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible, energetic brushwork with cinematic compositions and strongly expressive faces or silhouettes. Deep red, amber, and blue hues, heavy contrast, atmospheric mist, and selective internal light create a dark, epic sense of suspense across both character moments and ominous landscapes."},{"id":"caspar-david-friedrich","name":"Caspar David Friedrich","cat":"painters","en":"Caspar David Friedrich","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/caspar-david-friedrich.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/caspar-david-friedrich","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","backlighting","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","dark-blue","orange","grey"],"intro":"Caspar David Friedrich was a German Romantic landscape painter, known for his allegorical landscapes that often feature contemplative figures silhouetted against dramatic skies. His work is characterized by its exploration of the sublime, nature, and the human condition, often conveying themes of solitude and introspection.","observation":"The style presents vast, highly atmospheric landscapes with monumental rock formations, ancient forests, and tiny solitary figures that emphasize scale and isolation. Subdued, moody palettes shift between blue-green haze and warm orange backlight, while mist, deep foreground shadows, and carefully framed negative space create an epic, cinematic fantasy mood."},{"id":"larry-carlson","name":"Larry Carlson","cat":"various-artists","en":"Larry Carlson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-carlson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-carlson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","muted-red","dark-brown","blue","red","grey"],"intro":"Larry Carlson is a contemporary artist known for his psychedelic and surreal digital artworks. His work often explores themes of fantasy, cosmic landscapes, and dreamlike scenarios, blending intricate details with vibrant colors to create immersive visual experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable landscapes and figures dissolve into intensely saturated, flowing bands of color, intricate organic textures, and cosmic patterning. Visible brush-like striations, warped perspective, radiant internal light, and dramatic sunset contrasts create a richly detailed, dreamlike surrealism."},{"id":"christian-coigny","name":"Christian Coigny","cat":"photographers","en":"Christian Coigny","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-coigny.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-coigny","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver"],"intro":"Christian Coigny is a renowned Swiss photographer known for his elegant and timeless black and white portraits. His work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, capturing the essence of his subjects with a minimalist and classical approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, bright directional light, and a restrained, dramatic interior mood. Solitary figures in dark clothing are composed as cinematic tableaux against aged walls, heavy furniture, curtains, and sharply defined architectural shadows, with visible film grain softening the otherwise high contrast."},{"id":"martina-hoogland-ivanow","name":"Martina Hoogland Ivanow","cat":"photographers","en":"Martina Hoogland Ivanow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martina-hoogland-ivanow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martina-hoogland-ivanow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-green","muted-green","orange","light-yellow"],"intro":"Martina Hoogland Ivanow is a Swedish photographer known for her evocative and atmospheric imagery. Her work often explores themes of isolation, nature, and the human condition, capturing a sense of mystery and introspection. Ivanow's photography is celebrated for its unique blend of dreamlike qualities and a painterly approach, making her a distinctive voice in contemporary photography.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic portrait photography with intimate framing, selective focus, and strongly controlled light. Muted teal, brown, and amber tones, deep shadows, tactile fabrics, aged interiors, and emotionally charged gestures create a dark, theatrical atmosphere across the four images."},{"id":"william-zorach","name":"William Zorach","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"William Zorach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-zorach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-zorach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","white","light-orange","ochre"],"intro":"William Zorach was an American sculptor and painter known for his contributions to modernist art in the early to mid-20th century. Born in Lithuania in 1887, he immigrated to the United States and became a prominent figure in the development of American modernism. Zorach's work often focused on the human form, exploring themes of nature, family, and spirituality through a blend of traditional and avant-garde techniques.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents expressive human heads and figures as solid carved objects, emphasizing weight, volume, angular planes, and visible stone or wood texture. Warm earthy materials, restrained gallery-like backgrounds, and strong directional lighting give the sculptures a realistic yet stylized museum-display presence."},{"id":"aubrey-beardsley","name":"Aubrey Beardsley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Aubrey Beardsley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aubrey-beardsley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aubrey-beardsley","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","religious","drawing","ink","symmetry"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","pale-orange","brown","beige"],"intro":"Aubrey Beardsley was an influential English illustrator and author known for his distinct black and white illustrations. He was a leading figure in the Aesthetic and Decadent movements of the late 19th century, often associated with Art Nouveau. His work is characterized by its intricate detail, erotic themes, and use of bold contrasts.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed black ink drawing on a cream or white ground, with bold silhouettes, dense crosshatching, and intricate ornamental foliage and clothing. Elegant figures occupy theatrical garden or architectural scenes, arranged with strong vertical framing, dramatic contrast, and a dark decorative atmosphere."},{"id":"richard-kern","name":"Richard Kern","cat":"photographers","en":"Richard Kern","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-kern.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-kern","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","erotic","retro"],"colours":["muted-orange","dark-brown","rust","black","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Richard Kern is an American photographer and filmmaker known for his provocative and intimate portraits that often explore themes of sexuality and subculture. Emerging from the underground scene in New York City during the 1980s, Kern's work has been influential in both art and fashion photography, characterized by its raw, candid style.","observation":"The style uses realistic, intimate photographic portraits with intrusive close cropping, direct gazes, awkward body language, and visibly staged yet candid-feeling domestic scenes. Warm, darkened colors, harsh flash, selective focus, and analog grain create a raw, nostalgic, slightly unsettling atmosphere."},{"id":"danny-oconnor","name":"Danny O'Connor","cat":"various-artists","en":"Danny O'Connor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/danny-oconnor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/danny-oconnor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["silver","brown","grey","beige","black","red"],"intro":"Danny O'Connor is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and expressive portraits. His work often features a blend of traditional and digital techniques, creating dynamic compositions that explore themes of identity and emotion. O'Connor's style is characterized by bold color palettes and intricate detailing, capturing the viewer's attention with a unique fusion of realism and abstraction.","observation":"The style combines tightly cropped, highly realistic facial features with visibly layered paint, delicate brushwork, and a dense web of gestural lines. Cool blue-gray neutrals are punctuated by saturated orange and red marks, creating an expressive, fractured, slightly surreal portrait treatment."},{"id":"martin-ansin","name":"Martin Ansin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Martin Ansin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-ansin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-ansin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","deep-red","light-orange","dark-brown","charcoal","vivid-red"],"intro":"Martin Ansin is a contemporary illustrator known for his detailed and dynamic artwork, often featured in movie posters and pop culture illustrations. His work is recognized for its intricate line work and vibrant color palettes, capturing the essence of cinematic and comic book aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, expressive portraits and character groupings are built from visible directional paint strokes, angular fine linework, and densely layered forms. Saturated reds, oranges, deep blues, and teal-greens create a high-contrast illustrated-painterly look, with dramatic cropping and overlapping figures giving the compositions poster-like energy."},{"id":"shigeo-fukuda","name":"Shigeo Fukuda","cat":"designers","en":"Shigeo Fukuda","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shigeo-fukuda.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shigeo-fukuda","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Shigeo Fukuda is a renowned Japanese graphic designer and sculptor known for his optical illusions and minimalist style. Born in 1932, Fukuda became famous for his ability to create thought-provoking designs that often played with perception and space. His work is characterized by a clever use of negative space and visual puns, making him a significant figure in modern graphic design.","observation":"The style uses stark, graphic silhouettes of suited human figures against saturated red or cream fields, with hard-edged flat color and extreme black-and-light contrast. Repeated bodies, elongated shadows, cropped framing, and diagonal gestures create a tense sense of motion and theatrical mass movement."},{"id":"rolf-armstrong","name":"Rolf Armstrong","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rolf Armstrong","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rolf-armstrong.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rolf-armstrong","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["muted-orange","black","bone-white","dark-brown","red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Rolf Armstrong was an American artist known for his influential pin-up art and glamorous portraits, particularly during the early to mid-20th century. His work often featured idealized depictions of women, capturing the essence of the Jazz Age and Hollywood glamour. Armstrong's art was characterized by its vibrant colors, detailed rendering, and a focus on feminine beauty, making him a prominent figure in the world of illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses polished, painterly portraiture with softly blended modeling and clearly visible fine brushwork. Glamorous close-up women are framed through period-styled hats, short dark hair, fur and jewelry, with saturated red accents balanced by creamy neutrals and atmospheric blue-green backgrounds."},{"id":"nick-veasey","name":"Nick Veasey","cat":"photographers","en":"Nick Veasey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nick-veasey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nick-veasey","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","sculptural","patterns","still-life","glow","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","sci-fi","negative-space"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","muted-blue"],"intro":"Nick Veasey is a British photographer known for his innovative use of X-ray technology to create striking images that reveal the hidden structures of everyday objects. His work often explores themes of transparency and the unseen, challenging viewers to reconsider their perceptions of the world around them.","observation":"The style presents isolated mechanical objects as translucent, X-ray-like technical cutaways, with dense fine linework revealing internal components. A cool blue monochrome glow against deep black creates stark contrast and generous negative space, while repeated object arrangements give the sheet a catalog or diagrammatic character."},{"id":"jean-baptiste-corot","name":"Jean-Baptiste Corot","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Baptiste Corot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-baptiste-corot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-baptiste-corot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","charcoal","silver","beige","olive"],"intro":"Jean-Baptiste Corot was a French painter known for his landscape paintings and contributions to the Barbizon School. His work is characterized by a delicate balance between realism and romanticism, often capturing the serene beauty of the natural world with a focus on light and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents expansive pastoral landscapes with dense trees, reflective water, and occasional tiny figures, rendered as richly layered oil-like paintings. Subdued earth tones, soft atmospheric haze, luminous breaks in the sky, and visible fine brushwork create a tranquil, dreamy classical mood."},{"id":"kim-ki-duk","name":"Kim Ki-Duk","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Kim Ki-Duk","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kim-ki-duk.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kim-ki-duk","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","brown","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Kim Ki-Duk was a South Korean filmmaker known for his provocative and visually striking films that often explore themes of isolation, identity, and societal issues. His work is characterized by a unique blend of realism and surrealism, often focusing on the darker aspects of human nature and society.","observation":"The style uses emotionally intense, realistic portrait photography with cinematic framing, extreme close-ups, and shallow focus. Dark shadows, selective muted color alongside monochrome imagery, visible grain, and weathered facial detail create a somber, raw atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"charles-vess","name":"Charles Vess","cat":"illustrators","en":"Charles Vess","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-vess.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-vess","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","grey","muted-olive","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Charles Vess is an American illustrator and comic artist renowned for his work in fantasy art. His illustrations often feature mythological themes and have been published in various books, graphic novels, and magazines. Vess is celebrated for his intricate line work and ability to bring fantastical worlds to life, making him a prominent figure in the realm of fantasy illustration.","observation":"Richly painted fantasy scenes combine dense woodland detail, twisting roots, expressive figures, and uncanny creatures. Fine contour work, layered foliage, dramatic dark-and-light contrasts, and moody green, blue, red, and ochre colors create an eerie, dreamlike storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"joe-webb","name":"Joe Webb","cat":"various-artists","en":"Joe Webb","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joe-webb.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joe-webb","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","retro","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","charcoal","muted-orange","dark-cyan"],"intro":"Joe Webb is a contemporary British artist known for his hand-made collages that juxtapose vintage imagery with modern themes. His work often explores the relationship between humanity and nature, blending elements of surrealism and pop art to create thought-provoking pieces.","observation":"The style combines staged, cinematic tableaux with surreal cosmic landscapes, oversized planets, and small human figures. Muted teal, cream, pink, and rust tones, deep black space, pronounced shadows, and pervasive film grain give the images a tactile retro-photographic character."},{"id":"kathy-fornal","name":"Kathy Fornal","cat":"photographers","en":"Kathy Fornal","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kathy-fornal.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kathy-fornal","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","glow","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","dark-brown","grey","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Kathy Fornal is a contemporary artist known for her ethereal and romantic visual style. Her work often explores themes of fantasy and surrealism, blending elements of nature and feminine beauty with a dreamy aesthetic.","observation":"The style combines softly painterly, highly detailed portraiture with muted teal, cream, and autumnal brown tones. Dreamlike women in elaborate lace dresses are presented in intimate, atmospheric tableaux, with warm luminous light, woodland settings, and gently aged decorative textures."},{"id":"mark-shaw","name":"Mark Shaw","cat":"photographers","en":"Mark Shaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-shaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-shaw","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","bone-white","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Mark Shaw was a renowned American photographer known for his work in fashion and celebrity photography during the mid-20th century. He gained fame for his elegant and sophisticated images, often capturing the glamour and style of the 1950s and 1960s. Shaw's work appeared in prominent publications such as Life magazine, and he was celebrated for his ability to portray the grace and charm of his subjects, including many iconic figures of the era.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic portrait photography with carefully staged period costumes, richly decorated interiors, and a restrained palette that shifts between monochrome, warm reds, and shadowed neutrals. Strong directional lighting, selective focus, motion blur, and ornate architectural detail create a polished, nostalgic fashion-editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"j-e-h-macdonald","name":"J. E. H. MacDonald","cat":"painters","en":"J. E. H. MacDonald","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/j-e-h-macdonald.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/j-e-h-macdonald","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","landscapes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","brown","muted-blue","pale-orange","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"J. E. H. MacDonald was a Canadian painter and a founding member of the Group of Seven, known for his vibrant and expressive landscape paintings that capture the natural beauty of Canada. His work is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a deep appreciation for the Canadian wilderness.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive forest-and-lake landscapes are built from visible, directional paint strokes, with textured surfaces and strongly simplified yet readable forms. Cool blue and slate tones are repeatedly warmed by peach, orange, and yellow sky light, producing bold silhouettes, reflective water, and a dreamy atmospheric mood."},{"id":"christine-comyn","name":"Christine Comyn","cat":"painters","en":"Christine Comyn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christine-comyn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christine-comyn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["cream","light-orange","orange","dark-brown","beige","brown","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Christine Comyn is a Belgian artist known for her expressive and romantic portraiture, often focusing on the beauty and emotional depth of her subjects. Her work is characterized by a blend of realism and impressionistic techniques, capturing intimate moments with a delicate touch.","observation":"Across all four portraits, recognizable faces emerge from visible, directional paint strokes, scraped passages, and sketch-like fine lines. The restrained beige, peach, grey, and rust palette, cropped framing, and partially unfinished edges create an expressive, contemporary painted-portrait look."},{"id":"leon-bakst","name":"Leon Bakst","cat":"painters","en":"Leon Bakst","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leon-bakst.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leon-bakst","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","rust","dark-red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Leon Bakst was a Russian painter and scene-and-costume designer, renowned for his work with the Ballets Russes. His designs were characterized by vibrant colors, exotic themes, and intricate patterns, which had a significant influence on fashion and theater in the early 20th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly dressed figures are presented in highly decorative portrait and fashion compositions, with elaborate textiles, jewelry, feathers, and fur. Visible brushwork combines finely controlled detail with expressive, fluid strokes, while saturated reds, blues, oranges, and greens stand out against restrained cream or deep teal grounds."},{"id":"jerry-n-uelsmann","name":"Jerry N. Uelsmann","cat":"photographers","en":"Jerry N. Uelsmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jerry-n-uelsmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jerry-n-uelsmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","epic","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["charcoal","black","silver","grey"],"intro":"","observation":"Across all four renders, highly realistic rocky landscapes and seascapes are transformed into impossible spatial arrangements, with arches, openings, inversions, and floating structures recurring throughout. Stark monochrome values, deep shadows, brilliant cloud highlights, and violently textured water create a grand, ominous surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"john-cassaday","name":"John Cassaday","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Cassaday","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-cassaday.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-cassaday","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-brown","orange","blue","grey"],"intro":"John Cassaday is an American comic book artist known for his work on titles such as \"Astonishing X-Men\" and \"Planetary.\" His style is characterized by a realistic approach to comic art, with detailed line work and expressive character portrayals. Cassaday's contributions to the comic book industry have earned him numerous awards and recognition.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic comic-book illustration with heavy black contouring, sharply defined shapes, dense linework, and selectively flat color. Saturated reds and blues are pushed against deep shadows and warm orange backgrounds, while expressive faces, heroic poses, crowded character groupings, and dramatic city or sky settings create a bold narrative presentation."},{"id":"paul-cesar-helleu","name":"Paul-Cesar Helleu","cat":"painters","en":"Paul-Cesar Helleu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-cesar-helleu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-cesar-helleu","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","beige"],"intro":"Paul-Cesar Helleu was a French artist known for his elegant portraits of society women during the Belle Époque period. His work is characterized by its delicate use of pastels and fine lines, capturing the grace and sophistication of his subjects. Helleu's portraits often depict women in fashionable attire, emphasizing their beauty and elegance with a soft, romantic touch.","observation":"The style combines refined profile portraiture with visible fine drawing lines, delicate brushwork, and softly built tonal shading on a warm cream ground. Large black hats, dark garments, fur textures, and restrained blush accents create a dramatic yet elegant vintage fashion-illustration effect."},{"id":"ansel-adams","name":"Ansel Adams","cat":"photographers","en":"Ansel Adams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ansel-adams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ansel-adams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","silver","white"],"intro":"Ansel Adams was a renowned American photographer and environmentalist, best known for his black-and-white landscape photographs of the American West, particularly Yosemite National Park. His work is celebrated for its clarity, depth, and the use of the Zone System, a technique he developed to achieve a perfect balance of light and shadow. Adams's photography played a significant role in the conservation movement, highlighting the beauty and grandeur of the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is realistic, highly detailed monochrome landscape photography with strong tonal contrast and a cinematic sense of scale. Rugged mountains, forests, water, clouds, and waterfalls are rendered with crisp textures, atmospheric mist, reflective surfaces, and occasional luminous shafts of light."},{"id":"lotte-reiniger","name":"Lotte Reiniger","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lotte Reiniger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lotte-reiniger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lotte-reiniger","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","backlighting","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","fantasy","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Lotte Reiniger was a pioneering German filmmaker known for her groundbreaking work in silhouette animation. Born in 1899, she is celebrated for creating the first feature-length animated film, \"The Adventures of Prince Achmed,\" using intricate paper cutouts and stop-motion techniques. Her work is characterized by its enchanting storytelling and innovative visual style, which has influenced generations of animators.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome photography-like imagery, with figures and twisted vegetation reduced to sharply defined silhouettes against luminous backlit haze. Dense woodland layers, reflective water, hanging vines, and theatrical fantasy characters create a dark, cinematic fairytale atmosphere."},{"id":"eugene-de-blaas","name":"Eugene de Blaas","cat":"painters","en":"Eugene de Blaas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eugene-de-blaas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eugene-de-blaas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["muted-brown","dark-brown","black","muted-orange","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Eugene de Blaas was an Italian painter known for his genre paintings and portraits, often depicting scenes of Venetian life. Born in 1843 in Albano, Italy, he became renowned for his detailed and realistic style, capturing the charm and elegance of his subjects with a romantic touch.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly layered oil-paint handling with visible, finely controlled brushwork, tactile fabric, skin, masonry, and floral detail. Warm, restrained earth tones are enlivened by red and pink accents, while close, intimate female portraits are staged against rustic architectural settings with a nostalgic classical feel."},{"id":"john-paul-caponigro","name":"John Paul Caponigro","cat":"photographers","en":"John Paul Caponigro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-paul-caponigro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-paul-caponigro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","floral","landscapes","portraits","glow","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","bone-white"],"intro":"John Paul Caponigro is an American photographer known for his unique blend of traditional and digital photographic techniques. He is recognized for his work that explores the relationship between nature and the human experience, often incorporating elements of surrealism and abstraction. His art is celebrated for its introspective quality and its ability to evoke a sense of wonder and contemplation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome imagery with deep blacks, luminous highlights, and highly realistic natural textures. Forests, fog, foliage, and partially concealed organic forms create a somber, dreamlike mood, with atmospheric glow and surreal juxtapositions between landscape, portrait, and botanical imagery."},{"id":"guy-billout","name":"Guy Billout","cat":"illustrators","en":"Guy Billout","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-billout.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-billout","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["ochre","black","dark-olive","dark-brown","grey","rust"],"intro":"Guy Billout is a French illustrator known for his surreal and thought-provoking works that often feature unexpected twists and meticulous detail. His illustrations have been widely published in magazines and books, showcasing his unique ability to blend reality with fantasy in a way that is both visually striking and intellectually engaging.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, finely drawn contour work and ink-like crosshatching to describe richly populated scenes, with flat-to-lightly modulated earthy colors and a printed, aged texture. Ordinary figures, animals, vehicles, interiors, and landscapes are arranged with a quietly uncanny storybook quality, combining nostalgic clothing and settings with surreal juxtapositions."},{"id":"frans-masereel","name":"Frans Masereel","cat":"printmakers","en":"Frans Masereel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frans-masereel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frans-masereel","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Frans Masereel was a Belgian artist known for his impactful woodcuts and printmaking, particularly during the early 20th century. His work often explored themes of social justice, human struggle, and urban life, characterized by bold lines and stark contrasts. Masereel's art is celebrated for its expressive power and ability to convey complex narratives through simple yet striking imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white graphic illustration with heavy contour lines, angular forms, and dense crosshatched shadows. Urban streets, crowds, buildings, and sharply framed character portraits create a dramatic noir-like visual language, with solid black shapes and white highlights carrying most of the modelling."},{"id":"frances-brundage","name":"Frances Brundage","cat":"illustrators","en":"Frances Brundage","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frances-brundage.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frances-brundage","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","pastel-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["bone-white","orange","rust","dark-brown","silver","beige"],"intro":"Frances Brundage was an American illustrator known for her charming and sentimental depictions of children and fairy-tale scenes. Her work, primarily during the late 19th and early 20th centuries, often featured delicate and detailed portrayals of young children in idyllic settings, capturing a sense of innocence and whimsy.","observation":"Across all four renders, softly idealized child portraits are painted with visible, delicate brushwork, layered textures, and careful attention to hair, lace, skin, and flowers. The palette is predominantly pastel, with rosy complexions, pale blues, creams, and pinks creating a sentimental, dreamy atmosphere around the floral arrangements and ornate clothing."},{"id":"ed-brubaker","name":"Ed Brubaker","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ed Brubaker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-brubaker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-brubaker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","vivid-red","dark-teal","pale-yellow","deep-red"],"intro":"Ed Brubaker is a renowned American comic book writer known for his work in crime and noir genres. He has contributed significantly to the comic book industry with titles like \"Criminal\" and \"The Fade Out,\" often collaborating with artist Sean Phillips. Brubaker's storytelling is characterized by its gritty realism, complex characters, and intricate plots, making him a prominent figure in modern comics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses forceful painterly brushwork, rough visible strokes, strongly simplified shapes, and sharply cropped portrait compositions. Saturated reds, deep blacks, and occasional teal-blue accents create a high-contrast, brooding atmosphere, while bold facial gestures and angular highlights give the figures an expressive, graphic intensity."},{"id":"liu-ye","name":"Liu Ye","cat":"painters","en":"Liu Ye","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/liu-ye.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/liu-ye","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-green","blue","muted-green","ochre","brown","vivid-orange","light-yellow"],"intro":"Liu Ye is a contemporary Chinese painter known for his whimsical and introspective works that often feature childlike figures in surreal settings. His art is characterized by a blend of Eastern and Western influences, with a focus on simplicity, subtlety, and emotional depth. Liu Ye's paintings often explore themes of innocence, solitude, and contemplation, capturing a sense of quiet mystery and introspection.","observation":"The style combines simplified, childlike figures with richly textured painted surfaces, saturated blocks of blue, green, red, and yellow, and strongly geometric settings. Spacious compositions, isolated characters, odd scale relationships, and quietly uncanny encounters create a dreamy surreal mood across both the portraits and narrative scenes."},{"id":"mary-charles","name":"Mary Charles","cat":"painters","en":"Mary Charles","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-charles.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-charles","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-olive","charcoal","ochre","bone-white","rust","red"],"intro":"Mary Charles is a fictional representation inspired by a blend of artistic styles, often associated with folk and naïve art traditions. Her work is characterized by a whimsical and enchanting portrayal of nature, often integrating elements of fantasy and surrealism. The style reflects a deep connection to rural and pastoral themes, celebrating the beauty and simplicity of the natural world.","observation":"The style combines illustrative, finely painted forms with visible brush texture, dense botanical detail, and richly layered ornamental surfaces. Saturated autumnal and floral colors unify portraits, village landscapes, gardens, and nocturnal scenes into a lush, storybook-like visual world."},{"id":"theo-prins","name":"Theo Prins","cat":"illustrators","en":"Theo Prins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theo-prins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theo-prins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-teal","silver","muted-ochre","orange"],"intro":"Theo Prins is a contemporary artist known for his work in digital painting and concept art, often exploring themes of urban environments and futuristic settings. His art is characterized by detailed and immersive landscapes that evoke a sense of mystery and wonder.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense vertical cityscapes are built from visible, broad, textured strokes and broken architectural marks, giving the scenes an expressive painted quality. Warm orange light contrasts with deep teal shadows, while flooded streets, colossal structures, tangled infrastructure and distant terrain create a grand, speculative urban-world atmosphere."},{"id":"skottie-young","name":"Skottie Young","cat":"illustrators","en":"Skottie Young","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/skottie-young.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/skottie-young","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink","cute"],"colours":["white","bone-white","beige","brown","muted-green","red","light-lime"],"intro":"Skottie Young is a renowned American comic book artist and illustrator known for his unique and whimsical style. He has worked with major publishers like Marvel Comics, creating distinctive cover art and illustrations that capture the imagination with their playful and exaggerated features.","observation":"The style combines expressive character illustration with dense, scratchy ink drawing, heavy contour lines, and abundant cross-detail in clothing, gear, creatures, and props. Whimsical goblin-like adventurers and animal companions are rendered with oversized eyes, playful proportions, selective vivid color, and mostly open paper backgrounds."},{"id":"casey-baugh","name":"Casey Baugh","cat":"painters","en":"Casey Baugh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/casey-baugh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/casey-baugh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","portraits","glow","mist","painterly","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","orange"],"intro":"Casey Baugh is an American artist known for his realistic and emotive portrait paintings. His work often explores the interplay of light and shadow, capturing the subtleties of human expression and mood. Baugh's paintings are celebrated for their technical precision and the ability to convey a deep sense of intimacy and introspection.","observation":"These intimate portraits combine visible painterly texture with softly modeled faces, loose hair, and expressive, slightly melancholic poses. A subdued brown-black palette is punctuated by warm candlelike glows, smoke, and shallow-focus highlights, while distressed vertical marks and dark clothing unify the four images."},{"id":"kehinde-wiley","name":"Kehinde Wiley","cat":"painters","en":"Kehinde Wiley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kehinde-wiley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kehinde-wiley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","olive","dark-brown","grey","vivid-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Kehinde Wiley is an American portrait painter known for his highly naturalistic paintings of Black people. His work often references classical portraiture, reimagining traditional settings with contemporary subjects. Wiley's art explores themes of identity, power, and representation, challenging historical narratives and celebrating Black culture.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, painterly portraiture with dense botanical decoration, making the figures and their patterned clothing emerge from luxuriant floral walls. Saturated oranges, reds, blues, and deep greens, ornate fabrics and jewelry, and carefully arranged framed or seated compositions create a bold, lavish fashion-editorial effect."},{"id":"claire-basler","name":"Claire Basler","cat":"painters","en":"Claire Basler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claire-basler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claire-basler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","patterns","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","brown","charcoal","beige","muted-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Claire Basler is a contemporary French artist known for her large-scale floral paintings. Her work often explores the relationship between nature and art, capturing the ephemeral beauty of flowers and plants with a delicate touch and a keen eye for detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, loosely arranged flowers and slender stems fill the frame in richly layered, painterly passages. Visible brushwork, fine linear stems, softened blue-gray grounds, and gentle pastel-like blooms create an expressive, dreamlike botanical style rather than a clean or photographic one."},{"id":"steve-kelley","name":"Steve Kelley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Steve Kelley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-kelley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-kelley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","landscapes","portraits","urban","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["red","black","muted-blue","brown","pale-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Steve Kelley is a renowned American cartoonist and illustrator known for his work in political and editorial cartoons. His real-life counterpart has contributed significantly to various publications, showcasing a sharp wit and keen observational skills. Kelley has been recognized for his ability to capture the essence of contemporary issues through his art.","observation":"The style combines clean geometric construction, flat saturated color fields, and strongly simplified figures with emphatic dark outlines and shadows. Surreal juxtapositions, oversized architectural or anatomical forms, formal clothing, and sparse urban-desert settings recur across the sheet, producing a bold, graphic, dreamlike look."},{"id":"ben-quilty","name":"Ben Quilty","cat":"painters","en":"Ben Quilty","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ben-quilty.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ben-quilty","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["orange","silver","charcoal","beige","red","blue"],"intro":"Ben Quilty is an Australian contemporary artist known for his expressive and bold painting style. He often explores themes of identity, masculinity, and the human condition through his work. Quilty's paintings are characterized by their vivid colors, textured surfaces, and dynamic compositions, often focusing on close-up portraits and emotional intensity.","observation":"Across all four renders, close-up faces are built from visibly worked paint, with directional strokes, ridges, and layered impasto rather than smooth digital surfaces. Saturated flesh tones, cool blues, dark accents, and abrupt blocks of color create expressive, partially abstract portraits whose features remain recognizable while dissolving into energetic brushwork."},{"id":"leonid-afremov","name":"Leonid Afremov","cat":"painters","en":"Leonid Afremov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leonid-afremov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leonid-afremov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["deep-rust","charcoal","muted-blue","rust","light-cyan","orange"],"intro":"Leonid Afremov is a Belarusian-born artist known for his vibrant and colorful palette knife paintings. His work is characterized by its use of bold colors and expressive, impressionistic style, often depicting romantic and nostalgic scenes of urban life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly broad, layered brushstrokes to build expressive rainy urban and park scenes. Saturated orange, red, and blue color fields contrast strongly, while glowing street lamps, umbrellas, wet pavement, and reflections create recurring cinematic depth and movement."},{"id":"patrick-caulfield","name":"Patrick Caulfield","cat":"printmakers","en":"Patrick Caulfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patrick-caulfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patrick-caulfield","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","floral","patterns","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","vivid-red","deep-blue","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Patrick Caulfield is a renowned British painter and printmaker known for his distinctive style that combines elements of pop art with a modernist approach. His work often features bold colors, simplified forms, and a focus on everyday objects and scenes, capturing a unique blend of realism and abstraction.","observation":"The style uses clean, graphic outlines and broad flat color fields, dominated by saturated cobalt blue, red-orange, and black with stark contrast. Interior still lifes are densely arranged with plants, furniture, lamps, vessels, and tableware, combining geometric framing with decorative botanical patterns and crisp retro illustration."},{"id":"steve-mccurry","name":"Steve McCurry","cat":"photographers","en":"Steve McCurry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-mccurry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-mccurry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-blue","silver"],"intro":"Steve McCurry is a renowned American photographer best known for his evocative color photography and iconic images, such as the \"Afghan Girl\" featured on the cover of National Geographic. His work often captures the human condition and cultural diversity, with a focus on conflict zones and traditional lifestyles. McCurry's photography is characterized by its vivid colors, striking compositions, and the ability to convey deep emotion and narrative.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and finely detailed, using close-up portrait framing, textured fabrics, aged masonry, and expressive direct gazes. Dark earthy colors, deep shadows, and strong directional light create a somber cinematic mood, with occasional livestock reinforcing the intimate rural setting."},{"id":"carole-spandau","name":"Carole Spandau","cat":"painters","en":"Carole Spandau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carole-spandau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carole-spandau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","dark-olive","blue","red","ochre","dark-magenta"],"intro":"Carole Spandau is a Canadian painter known for her vibrant and expressive depictions of urban life and landscapes. Her work often captures the essence of Montreal's neighborhoods, blending impressionistic techniques with a modern flair. Spandau's paintings are characterized by their bold use of color and dynamic compositions, bringing everyday scenes to life with a unique artistic vision.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly saturated color and visible, broad, directional paint strokes to build lively houses, gardens, trees, and seasonal scenery. Architectural forms remain readable but are energized by expressive marks, dense botanical detail, and strong contrasts between cool blues and warm reds, oranges, and pinks."},{"id":"sean-bagshaw","name":"Sean Bagshaw","cat":"photographers","en":"Sean Bagshaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sean-bagshaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sean-bagshaw","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","brown","silver","orange"],"intro":"Sean Bagshaw is a renowned landscape photographer known for his captivating and dramatic images of natural scenes. His work often features stunning vistas, dynamic lighting, and meticulous attention to detail, capturing the beauty and grandeur of the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive mountain wilderness is depicted with richly visible paint strokes, layered forms, and highly textured rocks, trees, water, and snow. Saturated sunset oranges contrast with cool blue-green shadows, while luminous reflections and atmospheric distance create an expressive, dramatic landscape style."},{"id":"noriyoshi-ohrai","name":"Noriyoshi Ohrai","cat":"illustrators","en":"Noriyoshi Ohrai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/noriyoshi-ohrai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/noriyoshi-ohrai","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","red","muted-blue","orange"],"intro":"Noriyoshi Ohrai is a renowned Japanese illustrator, celebrated for his dynamic and detailed artwork, particularly in the realms of science fiction and fantasy. His work gained international recognition through iconic movie posters, including those for the Star Wars series, where his vivid imagination and intricate detailing brought fantastical worlds to life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, hand-painted detail with broad, visible brushwork, dramatic lighting, and strongly expressive faces and creatures. Saturated reds and blues cut through predominantly dark scenes, blending heroic fantasy imagery, monsters, armored figures, alien environments, and futuristic cityscapes into energetic cinematic tableaux."},{"id":"anton-semenov","name":"Anton Semenov","cat":"illustrators","en":"Anton Semenov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anton-semenov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anton-semenov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","silver"],"intro":"Anton Semenov is a contemporary Russian artist known for his digital illustrations that delve into the surreal and macabre. His work often features haunting, dreamlike imagery that explores themes of identity and the subconscious. Semenov's art is characterized by its intricate detail and atmospheric depth, drawing inspiration from both traditional and modern influences.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, volumetric creatures and monumental environments with tactile fabric, ribbed surfaces, weathered stone, and carefully modeled anatomy. Restrained gray-brown color, deep shadows, selective illumination, and large areas of emptiness create a bleak, monumental atmosphere, while close portrait framing alternates with tiny figures dwarfed by vast forms."},{"id":"nicolai-fechin","name":"Nicolai Fechin","cat":"painters","en":"Nicolai Fechin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicolai-fechin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicolai-fechin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Nicolai Fechin is a renowned Russian-American artist known for his expressive and detailed portraiture. Born in 1881 in Russia, Fechin became celebrated for his ability to capture the emotional depth and character of his subjects. His work is characterized by a unique blend of Russian and American influences, with a focus on texture, color, and dynamic compositions. Fechin's art often reflects the cultural and historical context of the early 20th century, showcasing his mastery in both traditional and modern techniques.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from richly visible oil-paint brushwork, with layered strokes shaping faces, hair, fur, feathers, and clothing. Closely cropped, expressive portraits use subdued earth tones punctuated by pale skin and occasional red or blue accents, with strong light-dark separation and highly textured surfaces."},{"id":"mark-bagley","name":"Mark Bagley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mark Bagley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-bagley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-bagley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","urban","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","charcoal","cream","grey","red","ochre","olive"],"intro":"Mark Bagley is an American comic book artist known for his work on Marvel Comics' Spider-Man series. He gained prominence in the 1990s and has been celebrated for his dynamic and expressive style, contributing significantly to the visual identity of Spider-Man and other superhero characters.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses energetic comic-book drawing with heavy ink contours, visibly brushed shading, saturated red and blue costumes, and stark dark-light contrast. Crowded superhero figures are arranged in dramatic airborne or combat poses against angular city backgrounds, creating a forceful sense of motion and expressive anatomy."},{"id":"satoru-takizawa","name":"Satoru Takizawa","cat":"illustrators","en":"Satoru Takizawa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/satoru-takizawa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/satoru-takizawa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-teal","beige","silver","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Satoru Takizawa is a contemporary illustrator known for his intricate and imaginative works that often blend elements of fantasy and science fiction. His art is characterized by detailed line work and a deep exploration of surreal and futuristic themes, making him a notable figure in the world of modern illustration.","observation":"Across all four images, recognizable figures and urban settings are rendered with visible, fluid paint strokes, layered textures, and expressive, slightly dreamlike distortions. The palette is restrained in blue-green, charcoal, and pale cream, punctuated by skin tones and warm orange accents, with strong dark-versus-light separation and recurring waterlike or smoky movement."},{"id":"agnes-cecile","name":"Agnes Cecile","cat":"painters","en":"Agnes Cecile","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/agnes-cecile.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/agnes-cecile","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","bone-white","white","muted-blue","dark-blue"],"intro":"Agnes Cecile is an Italian contemporary artist known for her emotive watercolor portraits. Her work often explores themes of identity and emotion, utilizing fluid brushstrokes and vibrant colors to convey a sense of movement and depth.","observation":"Across all four portraits, translucent watercolor washes, visible paper texture, and bleeding pigment create a distinctly painterly surface. Fine sketch-like contour lines define the cropped faces, while saturated blue, coral, and pink accents give the expressive close-ups a vivid, illustrative character."},{"id":"charles-conder","name":"Charles Conder","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Conder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-conder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-conder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-brown","beige","light-orange","silver","vivid-red"],"intro":"Charles Conder was an English-born Australian painter, lithographer, and designer, known for his role in the Heidelberg School art movement, which is often referred to as Australian Impressionism. He was born on October 24, 1868, and became known for his plein air landscapes and depictions of leisure scenes, capturing the light and color of the Australian environment with a distinctive impressionistic style.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is built from visible, layered brushwork with softened edges and impressionistic simplification of faces, clothing, architecture, and landscape. Muted pastel and earth tones, elegant period clothing, and loosely arranged social vignettes create a refined, atmospheric, dreamlike mood."},{"id":"friendswithyou","name":"FriendsWithYou","cat":"various-artists","en":"FriendsWithYou","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/friendswithyou.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/friendswithyou","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","vivid-colors","fantasy","cute"],"colours":["silver","muted-blue","red","dark-blue","charcoal","yellow"],"intro":"FriendsWithYou is a collaborative art duo founded by Samuel Borkson and Arturo Sandoval III in 2002. Known for their whimsical and colorful art, they create immersive installations, sculptures, and paintings that aim to spread joy and positivity. Their work often features playful characters and fantastical worlds, drawing inspiration from pop culture, spirituality, and childhood memories.","observation":"The style depicts cheerful, rounded plush-like characters with simplified faces, oversized eyes, and strongly saturated multicolored fur. Fine, individually visible fibers give the forms a tactile sculptural quality, while soft atmospheric settings, playful grouping, and expressive poses create a whimsical illustrative fantasy look."},{"id":"martin-schoeller","name":"Martin Schoeller","cat":"photographers","en":"Martin Schoeller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-schoeller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-schoeller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","rust","muted-orange","dark-brown","black","brown"],"intro":"Martin Schoeller is a renowned German photographer known for his distinctive close-up portraits that capture the essence of his subjects with striking clarity and detail. His work often features celebrities and everyday people alike, presented in a way that emphasizes the individuality and humanity of each person. Schoeller's style is characterized by its hyper-realistic approach, often using high-resolution techniques to bring out the intricate details of the human face.","observation":"This style presents highly realistic, tightly framed character portraits with exceptionally legible skin texture, wrinkles, pores, hair, and facial hair. Soft neutral lighting and pale backgrounds keep attention on direct gazes and individualized features, while shallow focus gently separates the faces from their surroundings."},{"id":"brent-stirton","name":"Brent Stirton","cat":"photographers","en":"Brent Stirton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brent-stirton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brent-stirton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["silver","black","brown","grey","ochre","light-yellow","red"],"intro":"Brent Stirton is a renowned South African photographer known for his work in photojournalism and wildlife photography. His images often focus on issues related to conservation, health, and cultural identity, capturing powerful narratives through his lens. Stirton's work has been featured in numerous prestigious publications and has earned him multiple awards for his impactful storytelling and visual artistry.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic photography with detailed animal and human subjects, carefully composed scenes, and selective focus. Muted earthy colors, strong natural contrast, dramatic skies, firelight, and occasional luminous sources create an atmospheric documentary-like intensity across the varied settings."},{"id":"henry-roderick-newman","name":"Henry Roderick Newman","cat":"painters","en":"Henry Roderick Newman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henry-roderick-newman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henry-roderick-newman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-ochre","dark-brown","black","bone-white","red","grey"],"intro":"Henry Roderick Newman was an American painter known for his detailed and atmospheric landscapes, often depicting scenes from Italy and the Middle East. His work is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail and a romantic sensibility, capturing the light and atmosphere of the locations he painted.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered portraiture with dense, decorative surroundings, using visible delicate brushwork to describe faces, fur, lace, patterned textiles, and ornamental objects. Its subdued yet richly varied palette, layered fabrics, floral motifs, and classical costume create an opulent, tactile, old-world atmosphere across the portraits and narrative tableaux."},{"id":"veronika-pinke","name":"Veronika Pinke","cat":"photographers","en":"Veronika Pinke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/veronika-pinke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/veronika-pinke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","deep-red","ochre"],"intro":"Veronika Pinke is a fictional representation of a photographer known for her evocative and surreal imagery. Her work often explores themes of nature, solitude, and fantasy, creating a dreamlike atmosphere that captivates viewers.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic imagery with expansive compositions, small solitary subjects, and dramatic skies or atmospheric backgrounds. Deep shadows, subdued earthy tones, selective red accents, backlighting, and hazy air create a moody, dreamlike sense of scale and movement."},{"id":"randolph-caldecott","name":"Randolph Caldecott","cat":"illustrators","en":"Randolph Caldecott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/randolph-caldecott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/randolph-caldecott","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["light-orange","brown","muted-ochre","beige","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Randolph Caldecott was a renowned 19th-century English illustrator known for his influential work in children's literature. His illustrations are celebrated for their lively and humorous style, often depicting scenes from nursery rhymes and fairy tales. Caldecott's work played a significant role in the development of children's book illustrations during the Victorian era, and his legacy continues to influence illustrators today.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines finely drawn ink contours with transparent, textured watercolor-like washes and a restrained earthy palette punctuated by red garments and mushrooms. It depicts densely populated storybook tableaux of children, animals, cottages, and domestic settings, with expressive gestures, period clothing, and an old-fashioned folkloric atmosphere."},{"id":"isabelle-arsenault","name":"Isabelle Arsenault","cat":"illustrators","en":"Isabelle Arsenault","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isabelle-arsenault.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isabelle-arsenault","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Isabelle Arsenault is a renowned Canadian illustrator known for her work in children's literature. Her illustrations often feature a blend of whimsy and introspection, capturing the imagination of both children and adults. Arsenault's style is characterized by its delicate lines, soft color palettes, and a unique ability to convey emotion and narrative through visual art.","observation":"The style combines visibly brushed, textured paint with fine, scratchy drawn lines and simplified illustrative figures. Dark woodland forms and black animals contrast sharply with muted gray-green surroundings and selective red or pink accents, creating a detailed, expressive fantasy-storybook atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"dave-gibbons","name":"Dave Gibbons","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dave Gibbons","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dave-gibbons.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dave-gibbons","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","halftone","dark"],"colours":["brown","grey","blue","light-yellow","ochre","pink"],"intro":"Dave Gibbons is a renowned British comic book artist and writer, best known for his work on the groundbreaking graphic novel 'Watchmen' alongside writer Alan Moore. His career spans several decades, during which he has contributed to numerous influential comic series and has become a pivotal figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense comic-book linework, heavy black shadows, halftone texture, and sharply bounded blocks of saturated color. It combines dramatic close-up characters with gritty urban scenes, poster-like typography, and expressive, distorted perspectives."},{"id":"guy-ritchie","name":"Guy Ritchie","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Guy Ritchie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-ritchie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-ritchie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","dark-green","muted-green","dark-brown","ochre","pale-lime"],"intro":"Guy Ritchie is a British filmmaker known for his distinctive style in crime films, often characterized by fast-paced storytelling, witty dialogue, and complex plots. He gained fame with movies such as \"Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels\" and \"Snatch,\" which showcase his flair for blending humor with action-packed sequences.","observation":"The style is consistently cinematic and realistic, using close character portraits and urban narrative scenes with dense period detail. Muted green-brown palettes, amber practical lights, deep shadows, selective focus, smoke, and wet surfaces create a brooding, film-like atmosphere across all four renders."},{"id":"claudia-tremblay","name":"Claudia Tremblay","cat":"illustrators","en":"Claudia Tremblay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claudia-tremblay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claudia-tremblay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","red","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Claudia Tremblay is a contemporary illustrator known for her enchanting and whimsical art style. Her work often features delicate and expressive portraits, drawing inspiration from nature and folk influences. Tremblay's illustrations are celebrated for their dreamy and gentle atmosphere, capturing a sense of innocence and fantasy.","observation":"This style combines expressive, highly detailed portrait faces with dense botanical framing, birds, berries, and flowers. Visible fine sketch lines sit over richly textured, painterly color, creating an illustrative storybook quality with vivid reds, blues, greens, and warm skin tones."},{"id":"louella-pettway","name":"Louella Pettway","cat":"painters","en":"Louella Pettway","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louella-pettway.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louella-pettway","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","ethnic-poc","fashion","patterns","still-life","grain","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","muted-ochre","red","muted-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Louella Pettway is a renowned American artist known for her contributions to the Gee's Bend quilting collective, a group celebrated for their unique and vibrant quilts that reflect African American culture and history. Her work is characterized by bold colors, intricate patterns, and a deep connection to her cultural heritage, often drawing inspiration from the landscapes and community life of the American South.","observation":"The style presents richly textured textile assemblages, with vivid patchwork fabrics, visible stitching, frayed edges, and densely layered patterns. It combines documentary-like realism with intimate scenes of quilted wall hangings, sculptural garments, and people surrounded by handmade cloth works."},{"id":"mark-catesby","name":"Mark Catesby","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mark Catesby","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-catesby.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-catesby","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","floral","landscapes","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","dark-olive","brown","ochre","muted-yellow","dark-red"],"intro":"Mark Catesby was an English naturalist and illustrator known for his pioneering work in documenting the flora and fauna of North America during the 18th century. His most notable work, \"The Natural History of Carolina, Florida and the Bahama Islands,\" was the first published account of the natural history of North America, featuring detailed illustrations and descriptions of various species.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, finely rendered birds and botanical specimens with dense ornamental foliage and flowers. Restrained earthy greens, creams, reds, and pinks unify the compositions, while delicate linework and visible painted modeling give them the character of classic natural-history plates arranged as decorative panels."},{"id":"enki-bilal","name":"Enki Bilal","cat":"illustrators","en":"Enki Bilal","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/enki-bilal.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/enki-bilal","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","dark-red","white"],"intro":"Enki Bilal is a French comic book artist and film director known for his distinctive style that blends science fiction with surreal and dark themes. His work often explores futuristic and dystopian settings, characterized by intricate detailing and a unique visual narrative.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, visibly worked paint with delicate ink-like contouring and fine hatching, producing richly textured faces, clothing, and machinery. Portrait-oriented compositions are tightly cropped and expressive, using restrained earthy colors with sharp dark-versus-light contrasts and recurring science-fiction costume and mechanical details."},{"id":"shaun-tan","name":"Shaun Tan","cat":"illustrators","en":"Shaun Tan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shaun-tan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shaun-tan","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","urban","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","beige","dark-brown","muted-orange","orange"],"intro":"Shaun Tan is an acclaimed Australian illustrator and author known for his surreal and thought-provoking works. His stories often explore complex themes through imaginative and fantastical imagery, blending elements of the real and the surreal to create unique visual narratives.","observation":"The style combines visibly textured, brush-worked surfaces with muted teal, blue, brown, and rust tones, punctuated by warm internal lights. It repeatedly places surreal giant creatures and uncanny inhabitants in misty, densely layered urban streets, using atmospheric perspective and expressive, storybook-like staging."},{"id":"friedensreich-hundertwasser","name":"Friedensreich Hundertwasser","cat":"various-artists","en":"Friedensreich Hundertwasser","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/friedensreich-hundertwasser.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/friedensreich-hundertwasser","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["charcoal","deep-blue","vivid-red","olive","dark-red","grey"],"intro":"Friedensreich Hundertwasser was an Austrian artist and architect known for his unique and colorful designs that often incorporated organic forms and vibrant colors. He was a proponent of environmentalism and believed in creating harmony between nature and human habitation. His work is characterized by its rejection of straight lines and conventional forms, favoring instead a more whimsical and imaginative approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines saturated, high-contrast color with dense hand-painted marks, heavy dark contours, and recurring geometric blocks and concentric forms. Urban facades, roads, windows, and occasional figures are flattened into expressive abstract compositions with broad, visibly worked strokes and intricate patterning."},{"id":"valerio-adami","name":"Valerio Adami","cat":"painters","en":"Valerio Adami","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/valerio-adami.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/valerio-adami","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["vivid-red","muted-blue","light-orange","black","dark-brown","green","deep-blue"],"intro":"Valerio Adami is an Italian painter known for his bold, graphic style that often incorporates elements of pop art and modernism. His works are characterized by flat areas of color, sharp outlines, and a focus on narrative and symbolism, often exploring themes of politics, literature, and history.","observation":"Across all four renders, stylized figures and faces are built from simplified angular forms, thick black contour lines, and strongly contrasted blocks of saturated color. Visible brush texture gives the flat, graphic shapes a hand-painted surface, while repeated patterns, exaggerated eyes and noses, and unusual color choices create an expressive surreal character.】【。}】【。ുവനന്തപുരം＿国产assistant 񟿿}"},{"id":"bob-peak","name":"Bob Peak","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bob Peak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-peak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-peak","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-blue","muted-blue","dark-red","bone-white"],"intro":"Bob Peak is a renowned American illustrator known for revolutionizing the art of movie posters. He was instrumental in shaping the visual language of film advertising during the 1960s and 1980s, creating iconic images for films like \"Apocalypse Now\" and \"Star Trek.\" His work is characterized by a dynamic and expressive style that blends realism with fantasy, often using vivid colors and bold compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable faces and figures are built from forceful, visible brushwork, with broad strokes and rough, textured edges. A saturated blue-and-orange palette, deep black shadow, and stark tonal contrast give the portraits an intense, expressive presence."},{"id":"kerem-beyit","name":"Kerem Beyit","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kerem Beyit","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kerem-beyit.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kerem-beyit","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-brown","black","grey","silver","red"],"intro":"Kerem Beyit is a renowned illustrator known for his detailed and imaginative fantasy artwork. His work often features intricate designs and vivid storytelling, drawing inspiration from mythological and historical themes. Beyit has contributed to various projects, including book covers, game art, and concept designs, showcasing his ability to blend realism with fantastical elements.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly rendering with dense environmental detail, dramatic lighting, and strongly saturated contrasts between icy blues, ember orange, and volcanic red. Each image presents an epic fantasy situation with monumental architecture, rugged landscapes, creatures, and figures arranged like cinematic concept-art scenes."},{"id":"barry-blitt","name":"Barry Blitt","cat":"illustrators","en":"Barry Blitt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barry-blitt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barry-blitt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","funny"],"colours":["bone-white","white","muted-ochre","charcoal","grey","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Barry Blitt is a Canadian-American cartoonist and illustrator known for his satirical and humorous illustrations, often featured on the covers of The New Yorker. His work is characterized by a distinctive style that combines fine lines and watercolor techniques to create detailed and expressive caricatures that comment on contemporary political and social issues.","observation":"Across all four renders, loose watercolor washes are contained by fine, irregular ink lines, with visible paper texture and selectively dense detail. The style is expressive and satirical, using exaggerated faces, animated gestures, crowded situations, and subdued earthy colors against generous off-white space."},{"id":"naoko-takeuchi","name":"Naoko Takeuchi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Naoko Takeuchi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/naoko-takeuchi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/naoko-takeuchi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","vivid-colors"],"colours":["light-orange","black","bone-white","muted-olive","orange","red"],"intro":"Naoko Takeuchi is a renowned Japanese manga artist best known for creating the popular series \"Sailor Moon.\" Her work has significantly influenced the magical girl genre and has been celebrated for its unique blend of fantasy, romance, and adventure.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed illustrative linework with delicate contours, expressive faces, flowing hair, elaborate jewelry, and richly patterned clothing. Saturated reds, greens, blues, and warm skin tones sit within carefully arranged portrait and social vignettes, often surrounded by flowers and decorative objects."},{"id":"dave-mckean","name":"Dave McKean","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dave McKean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dave-mckean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dave-mckean","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-red","ochre","muted-yellow","orange"],"intro":"Dave McKean is a British illustrator, photographer, comic book artist, graphic designer, filmmaker, and musician. He is renowned for his distinctive style that combines elements of collage, drawing, painting, and digital art. McKean has worked on a variety of projects, including book covers, graphic novels, and album art, often collaborating with writer Neil Gaiman. His work is characterized by its surreal and often dark aesthetic, blending fantasy with reality in a unique and compelling way.","observation":"Across all four images, heavily worked paint and broad, visible strokes create distressed surfaces, tactile fabric, and starkly modelled faces. The style combines near-black robes and shadowed figures with rusty reds, ochres, and isolated flames, presenting expressive, unsettling character scenes with distorted anatomy and surreal theatrical symbolism."},{"id":"michael-parkes","name":"Michael Parkes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Michael Parkes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-parkes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-parkes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","light-yellow","dark-ochre","dark-rust"],"intro":"Michael Parkes is an American artist known for his unique blend of fantasy and realism, often incorporating mythological themes and figures into his work. His art is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail and a dreamlike quality that invites viewers into a world of imagination and wonder.","observation":"Across all four images, elegant female figures and pale birds are rendered with delicate contour lines, softly modelled faces, and richly layered fabrics. The subdued cream, ochre, olive, and rust palette, elaborate headwear, botanical decoration, and flowing drapery create a refined, ornate, dreamlike illustrative style."},{"id":"sam-raimi","name":"Sam Raimi","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Sam Raimi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sam-raimi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sam-raimi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","muted-blue","muted-ochre","pink","dark-red"],"intro":"Sam Raimi is a renowned American filmmaker known for his work in the horror and superhero genres. He gained fame with the \"Evil Dead\" series and later directed the \"Spider-Man\" trilogy, which became a significant influence on modern superhero films. Raimi's style often combines horror elements with humor and dynamic storytelling, making his films both thrilling and entertaining.","observation":"Across the renders, recognizable figures and cinematic close-ups are treated with visible, energetic paint strokes and a heavily textured surface. Saturated reds, pinks, and cool blues stand against deep shadows, creating expressive, dramatic scenes with strong contrast and a dark, atmospheric mood."},{"id":"louis-rhead","name":"Louis Rhead","cat":"illustrators","en":"Louis Rhead","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-rhead.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-rhead","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","landscapes","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","dark-olive","dark-brown","red","charcoal","light-orange"],"intro":"Louis Rhead was an English-born American illustrator and author, known for his contributions to book illustration and poster design during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work is characterized by its intricate detail and decorative style, often drawing inspiration from the Art Nouveau movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly layered, decorative illustration with visible fine contour lines, dense floral detail, patterned fabrics, and stylized female figures. Saturated reds, oranges, teal blues, and greens create a vivid, high-contrast palette, while landscapes and botanical elements interweave with ornamental portrait compositions."},{"id":"suzuki-harunobu","name":"Suzuki Harunobu","cat":"printmakers","en":"Suzuki Harunobu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/suzuki-harunobu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/suzuki-harunobu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","floral","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","religious","retro","drawing","symmetry"],"colours":["orange","pale-orange","muted-ochre","dark-brown","brown","rust"],"intro":"Suzuki Harunobu was a Japanese ukiyo-e artist from the Edo period, known for his innovative use of color and the development of the full-color nishiki-e print. He is celebrated for his delicate and graceful depictions of women, often set in intimate and serene domestic scenes, capturing the subtleties of everyday life in 18th century Japan.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses finely drawn outlines, restrained flat color, and aged paper-like grounds to present elegant figures, flowers, birds, and garden settings. Dense textile patterns, botanical details, and carefully arranged silhouettes create a decorative, traditional print-like appearance with a muted earthy palette."},{"id":"jamie-heiden","name":"Jamie Heiden","cat":"photographers","en":"Jamie Heiden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jamie-heiden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jamie-heiden","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","mist","grain","painterly","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["grey","silver","brown","muted-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Jamie Heiden is a contemporary photographer known for her evocative and narrative-driven imagery. Her work often explores themes of solitude and the passage of time, capturing the quiet beauty of rural landscapes and everyday moments.","observation":"Across all four renders, rural winter landscapes are treated with visible painterly texture, softened atmospheric haze, and a grainy, weathered surface. Muted blue-gray and dusky peach skies, stark leafless trees, and isolated farm structures create a quiet, bleak, expressive mood."},{"id":"fu-baoshi","name":"Fu Baoshi","cat":"painters","en":"Fu Baoshi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fu-baoshi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fu-baoshi","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["animals","characters","landscapes","mist","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","beige","bone-white","charcoal"],"intro":"Fu Baoshi was a renowned Chinese painter known for his unique style that blended traditional Chinese painting techniques with modern influences. Born in 1904, Fu Baoshi was a prominent figure in 20th-century Chinese art, celebrated for his expressive landscapes and innovative use of ink and brushwork. His work often reflected themes of nature, solitude, and Chinese philosophy, making significant contributions to the development of modern Chinese painting.","observation":"These landscapes combine visible ink-and-wash brushwork with restrained, earthy blue-grey tones, delicate linear branches, and large fields of pale negative space. Mist-softened distance, sparse human and animal figures, and calligraphic red seals create a contemplative traditional scroll-like atmosphere across all four images."},{"id":"arthur-claude-strachan","name":"Arthur Claude Strachan","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur Claude Strachan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-claude-strachan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-claude-strachan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-ochre","yellow","grey","silver","red"],"intro":"Arthur Claude Strachan was a British painter known for his picturesque watercolors of English cottages and rural landscapes. His works often depicted idyllic scenes filled with lush gardens, quaint architecture, and serene natural settings, capturing the essence of the English countryside.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visible brushwork and delicate layered strokes to depict idyllic cottage gardens, flower-filled landscapes, and rural homes. Bright yet natural colors, abundant botanical detail, soft sunlight, and gently romantic compositions create a lush, nostalgic, dreamlike atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"olivier-rousteing","name":"Olivier Rousteing","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Olivier Rousteing","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olivier-rousteing.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olivier-rousteing","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","glow","high-contrast","metallic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","orange","brown","muted-brown","muted-blue"],"intro":"Olivier Rousteing is a renowned French fashion designer, best known for his work as the creative director of Balmain. He is celebrated for his bold and glamorous designs that often incorporate intricate detailing and luxurious materials. Rousteing has been influential in modernizing the brand while maintaining its rich heritage, and he is recognized for his innovative approach to fashion.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic fashion portraits centered on sharply tailored black garments covered in dense gold embroidery, sequins, brocade, and metal-like ornament. Dramatic directional lighting, dark or warm studio backgrounds, controlled poses, and selective highlights give the images a cinematic luxury-editorial presence."},{"id":"martin-margiela","name":"Martin Margiela","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Martin Margiela","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-margiela.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-margiela","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","grain","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["silver","beige","charcoal","brown"],"intro":"Martin Margiela is a Belgian fashion designer known for his avant-garde and deconstructivist approach to fashion. He founded the fashion house Maison Martin Margiela, which became renowned for its innovative and unconventional designs that challenged traditional fashion norms. Margiela's work often features deconstruction, anonymity, and a focus on the conceptual aspects of clothing, making him a pivotal figure in contemporary fashion.","observation":"The style combines restrained studio photography with sculptural, deconstructed fashion: raw, frayed textiles and transparent plastic conceal or reshape the human body. Muted off-white and gray tones, tactile material detail, cropped portraits, and an uncanny surreal mood unify the four renders."},{"id":"eric-drooker","name":"Eric Drooker","cat":"illustrators","en":"Eric Drooker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-drooker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-drooker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","charcoal","dark-red","red","dark-green"],"intro":"Eric Drooker is an American painter and graphic novelist known for his evocative and socially conscious artwork. His work often explores themes of urban life, social justice, and the human condition, blending traditional painting techniques with modern digital methods.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly graphic, expressive city scenes with dense crosshatched texture, emphatic contour lines, and strongly distorted perspective. Saturated red, teal, blue, and green areas are set against deep shadows, creating a dark, surreal atmosphere populated by silhouetted or partially modeled figures and recurring urban architecture."},{"id":"stefanie-schneider","name":"Stefanie Schneider","cat":"photographers","en":"Stefanie Schneider","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stefanie-schneider.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stefanie-schneider","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","retro","collage","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-cyan","dark-brown","rust","charcoal","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Stefanie Schneider is a contemporary German photographer known for her distinctive use of expired Polaroid film, creating images with a unique, dreamlike quality. Her work often explores themes of nostalgia, memory, and identity, capturing moments that feel both timeless and ephemeral.","observation":"The style uses dreamlike cinematic photography with faded, moody color grading, soft focus, visible film grain, and distressed analog-film artifacts. Portraits and figures are placed in expansive rural settings with windblown clothing and hair, creating a nostalgic, surreal collage-like atmosphere."},{"id":"greg-tocchini","name":"Greg Tocchini","cat":"illustrators","en":"Greg Tocchini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-tocchini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-tocchini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","muted-ochre","rust","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Greg Tocchini is an acclaimed comic book artist known for his work on titles such as \"The Last Days of American Crime\" and \"Low.\" His style is characterized by dynamic compositions and a vivid use of color, often blending elements of science fiction and fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, expressive character portraits are built from visible, layered brushwork, fine sketch-like contours, and dense overlapping marks. The palette consistently combines deep greens and umbers with ochre skin, vivid orange accents, and sharp light-dark contrasts, while tight cropping and flowing hair give the compositions energetic fashion-editorial intensity."},{"id":"jakub-rozalski","name":"Jakub Rozalski","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jakub Rozalski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jakub-rozalski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jakub-rozalski","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["silver","grey","brown","white"],"intro":"Jakub Rozalski is a contemporary Polish artist known for his unique blend of historical and fantastical elements, often incorporating themes of folklore and alternate history. His work frequently features rural landscapes juxtaposed with futuristic technology, creating a distinctive and immersive visual narrative.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly textured, painterly surfaces with cinematic compositions built around immense machines, tiny cloaked figures, and expansive winter terrain. Subdued blue-gray and brown tones, selective red accents, heavy mist, and softened distant forms create a bleak, atmospheric fantasy mood."},{"id":"sou-fujimoto","name":"Sou Fujimoto","cat":"architects","en":"Sou Fujimoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sou-fujimoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sou-fujimoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","glow","light-colors","sci-fi","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["grey","dark-green","silver","muted-olive","muted-blue"],"intro":"Sou Fujimoto is a renowned Japanese architect known for his innovative and conceptual approach to architecture. His work often explores the relationship between nature and architecture, creating spaces that are both functional and aesthetically pleasing. Fujimoto's designs are characterized by their lightness, transparency, and integration with the environment, reflecting a modern and minimalist style.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic architectural scenes built from transparent cubic structures, crisp geometric planes, and layered glass façades. Bright natural light, pale blue tones, abundant vegetation, and small human figures create a detailed, airy, dreamlike vision of a futuristic urban environment."},{"id":"tomer-hanuka","name":"Tomer Hanuka","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tomer Hanuka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tomer-hanuka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tomer-hanuka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","muted-teal","brown","muted-ochre","orange","red"],"intro":"Tomer Hanuka is an Israeli illustrator and cartoonist known for his vibrant and detailed artwork. His work often explores themes of fantasy, surrealism, and modern culture, blending intricate linework with bold color palettes. Hanuka's illustrations have been featured in numerous publications and have earned him a reputation for his unique visual storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, crowded figurative compositions with expressive poses, dramatic faces, and recurring surreal juxtapositions. Heavy ink-like contouring, flat yet richly varied color fields, and vivid red, teal, orange, and blue accents give the imagery a graphic comic quality, while abundant small forms and overlapping figures create a highly detailed surface."},{"id":"gilbert-garcin","name":"Gilbert Garcin","cat":"photographers","en":"Gilbert Garcin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gilbert-garcin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gilbert-garcin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","geometric","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["grey","silver","black","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Gilbert Garcin was a French photographer known for his surreal and introspective photographic works. He began his artistic career later in life, creating thought-provoking images that often explore themes of identity, time, and the human condition. Garcin's work is characterized by its simplicity and profound philosophical undertones, often using himself as the subject in his compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark monochrome landscapes combine isolated human figures with oversized geometric structures and uncanny repeated motifs. Deep shadows, grain, large areas of empty sky, and sharply defined silhouettes create a bleak, surreal, filmic atmosphere."},{"id":"oleg-zhivetin","name":"Oleg Zhivetin","cat":"painters","en":"Oleg Zhivetin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oleg-zhivetin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oleg-zhivetin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","ochre","red","bone-white","grey","blue"],"intro":"Oleg Zhivetin is a contemporary artist known for his unique blend of surrealism and symbolism, often exploring themes of human emotion and mythology. His work is characterized by intricate compositions and a rich, evocative color palette that draws from Eastern European cultural motifs.","observation":"Across all four images, elegant female figures are rendered with smooth, stylized faces against densely patterned, faceted surroundings. Rich reds, ochres, blues, and greens fill ornate textiles and backgrounds, while fine linear detail and visible surface texture give the illustrative portraits a decorative, dreamlike quality."},{"id":"sandra-silberzweig","name":"Sandra Silberzweig","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sandra Silberzweig","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sandra-silberzweig.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sandra-silberzweig","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["red","yellow","charcoal","blue","vivid-red","muted-teal"],"intro":"Sandra Silberzweig is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and imaginative artworks that often explore themes of spirituality and consciousness. Her work is characterized by bold colors, intricate patterns, and a unique blend of abstract and figurative elements.","observation":"The style combines vivid, highly saturated color with dense, hand-painted texture, thick dark contours, and flat graphic color blocks. Across the sheet, faces, floral forms, creature-like figures, patterns, and architectural fragments are compressed into crowded, expressive compositions with repeated eyes, circles, checkerboards, and radial motifs."},{"id":"joel-pett","name":"Joel Pett","cat":"illustrators","en":"Joel Pett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joel-pett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joel-pett","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","subdued-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["pale-blue","grey","charcoal","bone-white","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Joel Pett is an American cartoonist known for his editorial cartoons that often provide satirical commentary on political and social issues. His work is characterized by a sharp wit and a distinctive illustrative style, which has earned him recognition and accolades in the field of cartooning.","observation":"The style uses rough, hand-drawn cartoon figures with thick black ink contours, sparse facial features, and selectively crosshatched texture. Muted flat colors, odd proportions, and surreal comic situations create a dry, whimsical fantasy tone across the scenes."},{"id":"brian-michael-bendis","name":"Brian Michael Bendis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Brian Michael Bendis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-michael-bendis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-michael-bendis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Brian Michael Bendis is a renowned American comic book writer and artist, known for his influential work in the comic book industry. He has contributed significantly to major comic book franchises and has been a pivotal figure in modernizing comic book storytelling.","observation":"The style combines strongly inked comic-book contours with vivid, high-contrast color and visibly rough, directional paintwork. Dense ensembles of expressive characters, urban settings, action poses, and overlapping montage-like compositions create an energetic, richly textured superhero aesthetic."},{"id":"marian-kamensky","name":"Marian Kamensky","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marian Kamensky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marian-kamensky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marian-kamensky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["brown","grey","ochre","blue","red","orange"],"intro":"Marian Kamensky is a renowned illustrator known for his surreal and imaginative works that often blend reality with fantasy. His art is characterized by a unique style that merges detailed illustrations with whimsical and dreamlike elements, creating scenes that are both playful and thought-provoking.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines carefully rendered, illustrative linework with visible painted texture and richly detailed surreal situations. Strong saturated color, monumental geometric framing, expansive landscapes, and recurring human figures create imaginative, dreamlike tableaux that remain clearly representational."},{"id":"brom","name":"Brom","cat":"illustrators","en":"Brom","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brom.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brom","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["muted-ochre","brown","black","muted-blue","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Brom is an American fantasy artist known for his dark and gothic style, often featuring fantastical and surreal elements. His work is characterized by a blend of horror and fantasy, with intricate details and a moody atmosphere. Brom's illustrations have been widely used in novels, games, and films, contributing significantly to the visual language of modern fantasy art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily visible, broad painterly strokes to build monumental dark-fantasy characters, worn armor, ragged cloth, and skeletal details. Muted earth colors are pushed against deep shadows and occasional red accents, with dramatic atmospheric backgrounds and imposing portrait-like compositions creating a grim, mythic mood."},{"id":"howard-arkley","name":"Howard Arkley","cat":"painters","en":"Howard Arkley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howard-arkley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howard-arkley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","floral","landscapes","patterns","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","halftone","geometric"],"colours":["blue","dark-green","brown","vivid-red","light-orange","muted-pink","pink"],"intro":"Howard Arkley was an Australian artist known for his vibrant paintings of suburban life. His work often depicted the mundane aspects of domestic architecture with a unique and colorful twist, making the ordinary extraordinary. Arkley's style is characterized by bold colors, intricate patterns, and a pop art influence, capturing the essence of Australian suburbia with a playful and surreal touch.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly saturated flat colors, heavy black contour lines, and crisp geometric shapes to depict exuberant tropical residential neighborhoods and interiors. Dense patterned foliage, tiled roofs, dotted surfaces, and halftone-like textures create a richly decorative, retro graphic illustration.】【。}સablytyped<style>"},{"id":"demetre-chiparus","name":"Demetre Chiparus","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Demetre Chiparus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/demetre-chiparus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/demetre-chiparus","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","metallic","vivid-colors","classical","negative-space"],"colours":["white","dark-brown","muted-ochre","brown","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Demetre Chiparus was a Romanian sculptor known for his Art Deco bronze and ivory sculptures, often depicting dancers and figures inspired by the Ballets Russes and ancient Egyptian art. His works are characterized by their elegance, intricate detailing, and the use of luxurious materials.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, sculptural fashion figures and portrait busts with elongated anatomy, richly patterned garments, mosaics, and lustrous metallic or glazed surfaces. Strong saturated reds, blues, greens, and bronze tones stand crisply against expansive white studio space, giving the objects a decorative, finely crafted illustrative presence."},{"id":"madeline-weinrib","name":"Madeline Weinrib","cat":"designers","en":"Madeline Weinrib","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/madeline-weinrib.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/madeline-weinrib","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","patterns","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","subdued-colors","retro","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","black","bone-white","dark-brown","charcoal","deep-red"],"intro":"Madeline Weinrib is a renowned American designer known for her sophisticated and artistic approach to textiles and interiors. She has made significant contributions to contemporary design, drawing inspiration from global cultures and traditional craftsmanship. Weinrib's work is celebrated for its vibrant patterns, rich colors, and eclectic style, often incorporating elements of folk art and bohemian influences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style centers on bold, highly symmetrical geometric textile patterns displayed as wall hangings, rugs, and upholstery. Strong flat areas of indigo, black, red, and cream, thick graphic marks, and repeated motifs create a decorative retro interior-art language, with lightly irregular printed surfaces adding material character."},{"id":"saul-leiter","name":"Saul Leiter","cat":"photographers","en":"Saul Leiter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/saul-leiter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/saul-leiter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","silver","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Saul Leiter was an influential American photographer and painter known for his pioneering work in color photography. Born in 1923, Leiter's career spanned several decades, during which he captured the vibrancy and complexity of urban life, particularly in New York City. His work is celebrated for its innovative use of color and composition, often incorporating reflections and abstract elements that evoke a sense of intimacy and mystery.","observation":"A cinematic, realistic night-city style built from rain-slick surfaces, reflective glass, blurred pedestrians, and streaking traffic. Cool teal shadows are repeatedly contrasted with warm orange and red practical lights, while shallow focus, atmospheric moisture, motion blur, and film-like grain create an intimate, melancholy urban mood."},{"id":"mark-rothko","name":"Mark Rothko","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Rothko","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-rothko.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-rothko","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","patterns","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","deep-red","black","dark-red","vivid-orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Mark Rothko was an American painter known for his contributions to abstract expressionism, particularly through his color field paintings. Born in 1903 in Latvia, Rothko emigrated to the United States, where he developed his signature style characterized by large, luminous rectangles of color. His work is celebrated for its emotional depth and meditative qualities, often evoking a profound sense of introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses large geometric color fields arranged in a rigid grid, with recurring rectangular panels and strong horizontal and vertical divisions. Saturated reds and oranges are layered with deep near-black areas, while visible brush texture, softened transitions, and rough edges keep the geometry painterly rather than mechanically flat."},{"id":"franco-fontana","name":"Franco Fontana","cat":"photographers","en":"Franco Fontana","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/franco-fontana.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/franco-fontana","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-blue","dark-cyan","vivid-red","ochre","silver","dark-ochre"],"intro":"Franco Fontana is an Italian photographer known for his vibrant color photography and abstract landscapes. His work often features bold colors and geometric compositions, capturing the essence of places with a unique and modernist perspective.","observation":"The style combines realistic, lightly grainy imagery with strongly geometric architecture and broad, carefully balanced areas of sky and landscape. Saturated red, blue, yellow, and white surfaces create high contrast, while sparse compositions and flat-roofed buildings give the scenes a graphic, retro editorial character."},{"id":"andy-warhol","name":"Andy Warhol","cat":"various-artists","en":"Andy Warhol","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andy-warhol.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andy-warhol","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["vivid-red","muted-cyan","black","light-red","dark-red","cream","green"],"intro":"Andy Warhol was an American artist and leading figure in the visual art movement known as pop art. He is best known for his iconic works featuring consumer goods and celebrities, utilizing techniques such as silkscreen printing to create mass-produced art. Warhol's work explores the relationship between artistic expression, culture, and advertisement, making him a pivotal figure in 20th-century art.","observation":"The style uses bold, screenprint-like portrait graphics with flat blocks of saturated color, stark black shadows, and selectively retained facial detail. Rough ink edges, visible grain, and painted-paper wear give the repeated close-up faces a retro poster quality."},{"id":"vania-zouravliov","name":"Vania Zouravliov","cat":"illustrators","en":"Vania Zouravliov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vania-zouravliov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vania-zouravliov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","muted-orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Vania Zouravliov is a contemporary artist known for his intricate and detailed illustrations that blend elements of gothic and romantic aesthetics. His work often features elaborate compositions with a strong focus on linework and ornamentation, drawing inspiration from European art history and mythology.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed ink-like linework, stippling, and dense ornamental patterning to depict elegant female figures amid flowers, foliage, elaborate garments, and luxurious textures. A restricted black, ivory, and sepia palette with strong tonal contrast gives the portraits a dark, antique, richly decorative character."},{"id":"maurice-sendak","name":"Maurice Sendak","cat":"illustrators","en":"Maurice Sendak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maurice-sendak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maurice-sendak","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Maurice Sendak was a renowned American illustrator and writer, best known for his children's book \"Where the Wild Things Are.\" His work is celebrated for its imaginative storytelling and unique artistic style, which often features fantastical creatures and whimsical narratives that captivate both children and adults alike.","observation":"Across the sheet, dense pen-and-ink linework, fine hatching, and crosshatched shadows define furry horned creatures and small human and animal companions. The restricted monochrome palette, crowded woodland settings, exaggerated eyes and teeth, and fanciful yet unsettling character designs give the style a dark storybook-fantasy mood."},{"id":"darwyn-cooke","name":"Darwyn Cooke","cat":"illustrators","en":"Darwyn Cooke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/darwyn-cooke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/darwyn-cooke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-brown","orange","red","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Darwyn Cooke was a Canadian comic book writer, artist, and animator known for his work on DC Comics characters, particularly in the series \"DC: The New Frontier.\" His distinctive style is celebrated for its retro aesthetic, drawing inspiration from the mid-20th century and classic pulp fiction.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic comic-book illustration with heavy black outlines, sharply segmented flat color, and dense urban detail. Saturated reds, oranges, and cool blues combine with stark shadow shapes to create a retro noir city atmosphere populated by sharply posed, fashionably dressed characters."},{"id":"spencer-tunick","name":"Spencer Tunick","cat":"photographers","en":"Spencer Tunick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/spencer-tunick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/spencer-tunick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","epic","geometric"],"colours":["red","dark-red","grey","black","silver"],"intro":"Spencer Tunick is an American photographer known for his large-scale installations featuring nude figures in public spaces. His work often explores themes of individuality, community, and the human form, challenging societal norms and perceptions of nudity.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, cinematic environments with surreal scenes of immense crowds filling monumental architecture and rural landscapes. Strong repetition, vast scale, geometric structures, and saturated pink-to-red figures create an uncanny yet visually coherent epic effect."},{"id":"giuseppe-penone","name":"Giuseppe Penone","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Giuseppe Penone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giuseppe-penone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giuseppe-penone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","landscapes","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","beige","silver","ochre","white"],"intro":"Giuseppe Penone is an Italian sculptor and a prominent figure in the Arte Povera movement, known for his exploration of the relationship between nature and art. His works often incorporate natural materials such as wood, stone, and leaves, emphasizing the organic processes of growth and decay.","observation":"The style presents monumental dead trees and logs as realistic, highly detailed sculptural installations inside vast modern gallery spaces. Subdued natural wood tones and pale architecture are punctuated by strong sunlight, deep shadows, and cinematic wide-angle compositions that emphasize scale and spatial drama."},{"id":"paolo-uccello","name":"Paolo Uccello","cat":"painters","en":"Paolo Uccello","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paolo-uccello.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paolo-uccello","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","scenes","motion","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","muted-ochre","muted-orange","silver"],"intro":"Paolo Uccello was an Italian painter and mathematician known for his pioneering work on visual perspective in art. Born in 1397, he was a key figure of the Early Renaissance , celebrated for his use of perspective to create depth and dimension in his paintings. His works often feature intricate compositions and a fascination with geometric forms, blending Gothic and Renaissance styles.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and densely detailed, with visible brushwork, textured surfaces, elaborate costumes, architecture, and tightly packed historical crowds. Restrained earthy reds, blacks, creams, and browns are punctuated by strong contrast, while battles, processions, fire, and monumental buildings create an expressive, epic sense of movement and drama."},{"id":"andy-singer","name":"Andy Singer","cat":"illustrators","en":"Andy Singer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andy-singer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andy-singer","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Andy Singer is an American cartoonist known for his satirical and thought-provoking illustrations. His work often explores themes of modern society, technology, and the environment, using a distinctive black-and-white style that combines humor with social commentary.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense black-and-white engraved linework, with fine parallel hatching, stippling, and sharply controlled outlines building every surface. Familiar landscapes and solitary figures are disrupted by surreal changes of scale and impossible juxtapositions, presented in high-contrast compositions with expansive dark skies and dramatic geometric forms."},{"id":"candice-olson","name":"Candice Olson","cat":"designers","en":"Candice Olson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/candice-olson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/candice-olson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","floral","still-life","urban","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","dark-olive","pale-orange","grey"],"intro":"Candice Olson is a renowned Canadian interior designer known for her work on television and her elegant, sophisticated design style. She is celebrated for creating luxurious yet livable spaces that blend traditional and contemporary elements.","observation":"The style presents richly furnished interior spaces with realistic materials, layered decor, and carefully composed architectural framing. Deep greens, blue upholstery, warm brass, and amber lighting create a subdued, moody atmosphere, while botanical surfaces, artwork, rugs, and ornamental furniture add dense visual richness."},{"id":"paul-ranson","name":"Paul Ranson","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Ranson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-ranson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-ranson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","landscapes","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","deep-red","vivid-rust","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Paul Ranson was a French painter and a prominent member of the Nabi group, known for his symbolic and decorative approach to art. Born in 1861, Ranson's work often featured mystical and religious themes, characterized by bold colors and stylized forms. His contributions to the Symbolist movement and his role in the development of the Art Nouveau style have left a lasting impact on the art world.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense botanical landscapes are built from richly layered foliage, intricate fine contours, and decorative, clearly painted surface texture. Saturated oranges, reds, purples, and deep greens create a high-contrast fantasy atmosphere, while gnarled dark trees, glowing openings, and abundant flowers unify the compositions."},{"id":"vladimir-tretchikoff","name":"Vladimir Tretchikoff","cat":"painters","en":"Vladimir Tretchikoff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vladimir-tretchikoff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vladimir-tretchikoff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-green","ochre","olive","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Vladimir Tretchikoff was a Russian-born South African artist known for his popular and commercial art, often characterized by vibrant colors and exotic themes. He gained fame in the mid-20th century with works like \"The Chinese Girl,\" which became one of the best-selling art prints of all time. Tretchikoff's art often featured a blend of Eastern and Western influences, reflecting his diverse cultural experiences.","observation":"The style combines richly visible paint texture with crisp illustrative contours, dense ornamental fabrics, and carefully rendered hair and facial features. Saturated teal, red, blue, and gold dominate the palette, reinforced by strong shadow shapes and glamorous close-up portrait compositions with a retro fashion-poster feel."},{"id":"irmgard-schoendorf-welch","name":"Irmgard Schoendorf Welch","cat":"various-artists","en":"Irmgard Schoendorf Welch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/irmgard-schoendorf-welch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/irmgard-schoendorf-welch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","vivid-red","dark-red","beige","dark-teal","light-orange"],"intro":"Irmgard Schoendorf Welch is a contemporary artist known for her unique blend of surreal and fantasy elements in her work. Her art often explores whimsical and dreamlike themes, characterized by intricate details and vivid color palettes. Her style is influenced by European art movements, particularly those from the early 20th century.","observation":"Across all four portraits, angular facial planes and layered geometric forms are rendered with visible painterly texture and fine drawn detailing. Saturated reds, blues, violets, and blacks create a high-contrast, expressive look, while floral and textile-like motifs add ornate decorative richness to the surreal compositions."},{"id":"leszek-bujnowski","name":"Leszek Bujnowski","cat":"photographers","en":"Leszek Bujnowski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leszek-bujnowski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leszek-bujnowski","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white","charcoal","brown"],"intro":"Leszek Bujnowski is a contemporary Polish photographer known for his surreal and imaginative digital artworks. His work often blends elements of fantasy with reality, creating dreamlike scenarios that challenge perceptions and evoke a sense of wonder.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic, realistic environments with subdued earthy tones, atmospheric haze, and monumental natural forms. Small solitary figures and animals are set against vast landscapes, creating a dark, dreamy, uncanny sense of scale."},{"id":"michael-cho","name":"Michael Cho","cat":"illustrators","en":"Michael Cho","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-cho.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-cho","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["dark-cyan","black","grey","pale-yellow","orange"],"intro":"Michael Cho is a Canadian illustrator and cartoonist known for his distinctive comic book style and vibrant illustrations. He has worked on various projects, including comic book covers and graphic novels, and is celebrated for his bold use of color and clean, expressive lines.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses graphic, illustrative forms with heavy dark contours, angular shapes, and dense directional hatching. A restrained teal-blue and warm amber palette, strong light-dark separation, rain or atmospheric texture, and cinematic urban or wilderness scenes create a dark, expressive mood."},{"id":"jean-etienne-liotard","name":"Jean-Etienne Liotard","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Etienne Liotard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-etienne-liotard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-etienne-liotard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["grey","brown","muted-brown","beige","black","red"],"intro":"Jean-Etienne Liotard was an 18th-century Swiss painter known for his exquisite portraiture and mastery of pastel techniques. His works often depicted European aristocracy and were characterized by their detailed realism and delicate use of color. Liotard's style was influenced by the Rococo and neoclassical movements, and he was celebrated for his ability to capture the elegance and grace of his subjects.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and realistic, with visible fine brushwork modeling faces, fabric, lace, upholstery, and architectural details. Restrained earthy and blue-red colors, formal portrait poses, elaborate clothing, and period interiors create a refined classical courtly atmosphere across the four images."},{"id":"agnieszka-lorek","name":"Agnieszka Lorek","cat":"photographers","en":"Agnieszka Lorek","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/agnieszka-lorek.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/agnieszka-lorek","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","metallic","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","beige","silver","black","dark-green"],"intro":"Agnieszka Lorek is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and fantasy-inspired imagery. Her work often blends elements of nature with a surreal aesthetic, creating dreamlike portraits that evoke a sense of otherworldly beauty.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic close-up portraits in subdued teal, ivory, bronze, and gold tones, with shallow focus and softly atmospheric backgrounds. It is defined by densely layered, ornate costume styling⁠—lace veils, metallic adornments, floral and butterfly ornaments, feathers, and intricate textured fabrics⁠—creating a classical fantasy fashion effect."},{"id":"mika-ninagawa","name":"Mika Ninagawa","cat":"photographers","en":"Mika Ninagawa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mika-ninagawa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mika-ninagawa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","floral","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","dreamy"],"colours":["red","black","dark-red","muted-blue","deep-blue"],"intro":"Mika Ninagawa is a renowned Japanese photographer and filmmaker known for her vibrant and colorful style. Her work often explores themes of beauty, nature, and Japanese culture, blending traditional and contemporary elements. Ninagawa's photography is celebrated for its vivid color palettes and imaginative compositions, making her a prominent figure in the world of art and fashion photography.","observation":"The style uses intensely saturated floral color, dramatic red-and-blue lighting, and close-up portrait framing. Faces and blossoms merge through translucent overlays, shallow focus, and collage-like layering, creating a dreamy, surreal, highly expressive photographic effect."},{"id":"moises-levy","name":"Moises Levy","cat":"photographers","en":"Moises Levy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/moises-levy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/moises-levy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","silver","white","black"],"intro":"Moises Levy is a contemporary photographer known for his striking black and white landscape photography. His work often explores themes of nature and architecture, capturing the interplay between light and shadow in serene and contemplative compositions.","observation":"The style is monochrome coastal landscape photography with dramatic tonal separation, richly resolved rock and timber textures, and expansive areas of softly blurred water and sky. Long-exposure motion turns the sea into smooth luminous bands, while solitary human figures and strong leading lines create a quiet, contemplative sense of scale."},{"id":"anthony-burrill","name":"Anthony Burrill","cat":"designers","en":"Anthony Burrill","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anthony-burrill.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anthony-burrill","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","letters","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","light-yellow","cream","black","dark-blue","rust"],"intro":"Anthony Burrill is a renowned British graphic designer and printmaker known for his distinctive typographic style and impactful visual communication. His work often combines bold lettering with simple, yet powerful messages, making him a prominent figure in contemporary design. Burrill's designs have been exhibited globally, and he has collaborated with various brands and organizations, bringing his unique aesthetic to a wide audience.","observation":"The style is built around oversized geometric lettering, clean flat color blocks, and forceful black-versus-bright color contrast. Across the four designs, distressed grain, imperfect ink texture, rough edges, tight cropping, and occasional tilted or tightly stacked type give the posters a retro printed character."},{"id":"jean-paul-goude","name":"Jean-Paul Goude","cat":"photographers","en":"Jean-Paul Goude","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-paul-goude.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-paul-goude","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","epic"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","silver","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Jean-Paul Goude is a French graphic designer, illustrator, photographer, and advertising film director known for his work in fashion and advertising. He gained prominence for his innovative and visually striking campaigns, often blending elements of fantasy and reality. His collaborations with celebrities and fashion icons have left a significant mark on visual culture.","observation":"This style presents highly staged fashion tableaux with sculptural garments, extravagant hats, umbrellas and strongly posed figures. Saturated reds, blacks and florals are set against clean architectural or sky backdrops, with crisp photographic detail, dramatic scale and high-contrast editorial lighting."},{"id":"max-rive","name":"Max Rive","cat":"photographers","en":"Max Rive","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/max-rive.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/max-rive","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","brown","muted-blue","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Max Rive is a renowned landscape photographer known for his breathtaking images of mountainous terrains and dramatic natural scenes. His work often captures the grandeur and beauty of remote landscapes, showcasing the interplay of light and shadow in stunning detail.","observation":"The style presents vast, highly detailed mountain landscapes with a realistic, cinematic sense of scale and dramatic aerial viewpoints. Deep blue shadows, warm sunlit highlights, glowing rivers and water, heavy cloud formations, and atmospheric mist create an epic, expressive mood across all four views."},{"id":"ori-gersht","name":"Ori Gersht","cat":"photographers","en":"Ori Gersht","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ori-gersht.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ori-gersht","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","floral","still-life","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Ori Gersht is a contemporary photographer known for his innovative approach to capturing moments of beauty and destruction. His work often explores themes of memory, history, and the passage of time, using photography as a medium to create thought-provoking and visually striking images.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly varied flower arrangements are presented as realistic still lifes disrupted by explosive motion, scattering petals, stems, water, and fragments through dark space. Saturated blooms and sharply illuminated debris stand out against near-black backgrounds, combining dense natural detail with an uncanny, surreal sense of destruction."},{"id":"dorothy-lathrop","name":"Dorothy Lathrop","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dorothy Lathrop","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dorothy-lathrop.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dorothy-lathrop","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","grey","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Dorothy Lathrop was an American illustrator and author known for her enchanting and detailed illustrations, particularly in children's books. Her work often featured animals and nature, reflecting her deep appreciation for the natural world. Lathrop's illustrations were characterized by their fine lines and delicate detailing, capturing a sense of whimsy and wonder that resonated with both children and adults.","observation":"The style combines richly layered, visibly brushed paint with dense forest detail, elegant figures, and elaborate flowering vegetation. Deep blue-green shadows, muted earth tones, occasional warm highlights, and luminous lanterns or moonlight create a theatrical, dreamlike woodland atmosphere across the four images."},{"id":"paul-souders","name":"Paul Souders","cat":"photographers","en":"Paul Souders","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-souders.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-souders","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["muted-blue","pale-blue","black","charcoal","beige"],"intro":"Paul Souders is a renowned wildlife photographer known for his stunning images of nature and wildlife, particularly in extreme environments such as the Arctic. His work often captures the beauty and majesty of animals in their natural habitats, bringing attention to environmental and conservation issues.","observation":"The style is cinematic and highly realistic, combining crisp wildlife detail with expansive Arctic landscapes, deep icy water, and dramatic glacier formations. Cool subdued blue-gray tones dominate, with occasional warm atmospheric light, mist, selective focus, and layered depth creating a moody documentary-like sense of scale."},{"id":"jim-kazanjian","name":"Jim Kazanjian","cat":"photographers","en":"Jim Kazanjian","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-kazanjian.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-kazanjian","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","landscapes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["white","silver","grey","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Jim Kazanjian is a contemporary artist known for his surreal and fantastical photographic compositions. He creates intricate and imaginative landscapes by digitally manipulating and layering photographs, often featuring architectural elements in unexpected and dreamlike settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, elaborate gothic houses are treated as monumental, dimensional structures embedded in or suspended above harsh rocky landscapes. The monochrome tonal range, stark lighting, dead trees, smoke, and immense skies create a bleak, surreal fantasy atmosphere with cinematic environmental scale."},{"id":"tyler-edlin","name":"Tyler Edlin","cat":"various-artists","en":"Tyler Edlin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tyler-edlin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tyler-edlin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","glow","motion","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","charcoal","muted-ochre","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Tyler Edlin is a contemporary artist known for his work in concept art and illustration, often focusing on fantastical and imaginative themes. His art is characterized by detailed environments and richly developed characters, frequently drawing inspiration from fantasy and science fiction genres.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly surfaces with abundant environmental detail, saturated natural color, and dramatic warm-cool lighting. Sweeping landscapes, monumental skies, fantastical figures, and dynamic creatures are composed like epic cinematic concept art, balancing intimate foreground detail against immense atmospheric vistas."},{"id":"bill-carman","name":"Bill Carman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bill Carman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-carman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-carman","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","muted-brown","bone-white","deep-rust"],"intro":"Bill Carman is a contemporary artist known for his whimsical and surreal illustrations. His work often features fantastical elements, blending the boundaries between reality and imagination. Carman's art is characterized by intricate details and a unique sense of humor, often incorporating elements of fantasy and surrealism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses finely modelled, visibly brushed painting with dense surface detail, ornamental fabrics, and carefully staged figures. Pale, elongated faces, restrained earthy reds and browns, dark clothing, and theatrical yet somber settings create a mysterious gothic-fantasy mood with an antique portrait sensibility."},{"id":"tom-wesselmann","name":"Tom Wesselmann","cat":"painters","en":"Tom Wesselmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-wesselmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-wesselmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["white","vivid-red","beige","dark-blue","light-orange","red","dark-green"],"intro":"Tom Wesselmann is a prominent American artist known for his contributions to the Pop Art movement. Emerging in the 1960s, Wesselmann's work often features bold colors, simplified forms, and a focus on consumer culture and everyday objects. His art is characterized by a playful yet critical approach to themes of sexuality and advertising, making him a key figure in modern art history.","observation":"Across all four renders, brightly saturated primary colors, hard-edged geometric forms, and clean graphic contours turn familiar food and household objects into constructed still-life arrangements. The objects have convincing volume and cast shadows, while repeated stripes, panels, and layered shapes create a bold retro display aesthetic."},{"id":"sparth","name":"Sparth","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sparth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sparth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sparth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","grey","silver","orange"],"intro":"Sparth is a renowned digital artist known for his contributions to the science fiction and concept art genres. His work often features futuristic landscapes and imaginative designs, blending elements of fantasy and technology. Sparth has been influential in the gaming and film industries, creating visuals that inspire and captivate audiences with their visionary approach.","observation":"The style combines cinematic science-fiction worldbuilding with enormous industrial architecture, sparse human figures, and strongly staged environmental compositions. Broad, visible painterly strokes, distressed surfaces, dense structural detail, and stark value contrasts create a gritty, monumental look, shifting between near-monochrome cold scenes and smoky blue-orange dusk."},{"id":"deborah-azzopardi","name":"Deborah Azzopardi","cat":"painters","en":"Deborah Azzopardi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/deborah-azzopardi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/deborah-azzopardi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","fashion","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","erotic"],"colours":["black","light-orange","vivid-red","dark-red","muted-blue","dark-brown"],"intro":"Deborah Azzopardi is a contemporary British artist known for her vibrant and playful pop art style. Her work often features bold colors and expressive subjects, capturing moments of humor and seduction. Azzopardi's art has been widely recognized for its unique blend of comic book aesthetics and fine art techniques, making her a distinctive figure in the modern art scene.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses tightly cropped glamour portraits with thick black contour lines, crisp flat color blocks, and selective angular shading. Saturated red, black, peach, and blue dominate, while glossy lips, nails, eyes, hair, accessories, and fashion details create a bold, seductive comic-book finish."},{"id":"tsutomu-nihei","name":"Tsutomu Nihei","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tsutomu Nihei","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tsutomu-nihei.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tsutomu-nihei","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","sci-fi","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","silver","grey"],"intro":"Tsutomu Nihei is a Japanese manga artist known for his distinctive style that blends science fiction with intricate architectural designs. He is renowned for works like \" Blame !\" and \"Knights of Sidonia,\" which showcase his ability to create vast, dystopian worlds filled with complex structures and haunting atmospheres.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense black-and-white ink drawing combines fine contour lines, crosshatching, scraped textures, and stark tonal blocks. Grotesque humanoid figures and massive mechanical or architectural forms are packed into dramatic, claustrophobic sci-fi scenes with extreme perspective and intense contrast."},{"id":"diane-von-furstenberg","name":"Diane von Furstenberg","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Diane von Furstenberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/diane-von-furstenberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/diane-von-furstenberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","fashion","portraits","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["black","muted-red","dark-brown","vivid-red","silver","red"],"intro":"Diane von Furstenberg is a renowned Belgian fashion designer best known for her iconic wrap dress, which became a symbol of women's liberation in the 1970s. Her designs are celebrated for their bold prints, vibrant colors, and effortless elegance. Over the decades, she has remained a significant figure in the fashion industry, influencing trends and empowering women through her work.","observation":"The style combines fashion-editorial portraiture with highly expressive painted and drawn treatments, shifting between saturated flat color, loose brushwork, and monochrome sketching. Strong black contours, vivid red accents, oversized accessories, patterned clothing, and close-cropped faces create a graphic, glamorous collage-like visual language."},{"id":"mandy-disher","name":"Mandy Disher","cat":"photographers","en":"Mandy Disher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mandy-disher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mandy-disher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","still-life","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","grey","dark-olive","muted-ochre","silver","rust"],"intro":"Mandy Disher is a renowned photographer known for her exquisite floral photography, capturing the delicate beauty of flowers with a unique artistic vision. Her work often emphasizes the intricate details and natural elegance of botanical subjects, creating images that are both visually stunning and emotionally evocative.","observation":"The style presents flowers as highly realistic botanical close-ups, with intricate petal veins, stamens, seed heads, and fine stems rendered in delicate detail. Soft focus, muted sage-green backdrops, pale blossoms, and gentle natural lighting create an airy, dreamy still-life mood across the compositions."},{"id":"cecily-brown","name":"Cecily Brown","cat":"painters","en":"Cecily Brown","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cecily-brown.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cecily-brown","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["orange","bone-white","beige","dark-brown","brown","red"],"intro":"Cecily Brown is a contemporary British painter known for her dynamic and expressive works that explore themes of sexuality, desire, and human interaction. Her paintings often feature abstracted figures and vivid colors, drawing inspiration from both classical and modern art movements. Brown's work is characterized by its energetic brushwork and layered compositions, creating a sense of movement and intensity.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style is a highly tactile abstract painting built from thick, visibly directional strokes, scraped passages, drips, and layered impasto. Saturated coral, orange, cream, teal, black, and earthy tones collide in dense, energetic compositions where fragmented hints of forms remain embedded within expressive painterly marks."},{"id":"johannes-vermeer","name":"Johannes Vermeer","cat":"painters","en":"Johannes Vermeer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johannes-vermeer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johannes-vermeer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Johannes Vermeer was a Dutch painter from the 17th century, renowned for his masterful use of light and color in domestic interior scenes. He is celebrated for his meticulous attention to detail and his ability to capture the serene beauty of everyday life. Vermeer's works often feature women engaged in simple, yet intimate activities, and are characterized by their calm, contemplative atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents carefully observed interior scenes with women absorbed in reading or writing, rendered with convincing anatomy, fabric, wood, and ceramic detail. Visible brushwork and fine surface modeling combine with restrained blue, cream, and brown colors and strong directional window light, producing deep shadows and luminous highlights."},{"id":"benjamin-lacombe","name":"Benjamin Lacombe","cat":"illustrators","en":"Benjamin Lacombe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/benjamin-lacombe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/benjamin-lacombe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-red","brown","pale-orange","red"],"intro":"Benjamin Lacombe is a contemporary French illustrator known for his distinctive and whimsical style, often drawing inspiration from fairy tales and classic literature. His works are characterized by their surreal and gothic elements, featuring delicate and expressive characters set in richly detailed environments.","observation":"These portraits combine visible brush texture and finely rendered faces, clothing, birds, flowers, and ornamental accessories into dense, decorative compositions. Restrained teal, black, cream, and deep red tones are punctuated by warm highlights and strong dark-light contrast, producing an uncanny, storybook fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"george-lucas","name":"George Lucas","cat":"filmmakers","en":"George Lucas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-lucas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-lucas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-brown","grey","orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"George Lucas is an American filmmaker and entrepreneur best known for creating the Star Wars and Indiana Jones franchises. He is a pivotal figure in the development of modern special effects and digital filmmaking, founding Industrial Light & Magic and Lucasfilm. Lucas's work has had a profound influence on the science fiction genre and popular culture.","observation":"The style uses visibly textured, directional paintwork to render highly detailed faces, worn fabrics, machinery, and rugged environments with convincing volume. Subdued earth tones, deep shadows, and selective warm highlights create an expressive, epic fantasy atmosphere across both intimate character portraits and expansive ruined landscapes."},{"id":"claire-droppert","name":"Claire Droppert","cat":"photographers","en":"Claire Droppert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claire-droppert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claire-droppert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","black","grey","charcoal","dark-blue"],"intro":"Claire Droppert is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and surreal imagery. Her work often explores themes of nature, solitude, and human connection, capturing moments that evoke a sense of tranquility and introspection. Droppert's photography is characterized by its dreamy and painterly quality, often incorporating elements of fantasy and symbolism.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic compositions with dramatic storm-cloud skies, dark teal tones, selective highlights, and strongly controlled contrast. Surreal animal encounters and solitary figures are staged in misty landscapes with crisp foreground detail, atmospheric distance, and a dreamlike, slightly ominous mood."},{"id":"mikhail-vrubel","name":"Mikhail Vrubel","cat":"painters","en":"Mikhail Vrubel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mikhail-vrubel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mikhail-vrubel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","light-orange","charcoal","rust","dark-red"],"intro":"Mikhail Vrubel is a renowned Russian painter associated with the Symbolist movement. Born in 1856, he is celebrated for his unique style that blends elements of Romanticism and Art Nouveau , often exploring themes of mythology and folklore. Vrubel's work is characterized by its intricate detail, vibrant color palette, and a dreamlike quality that captures the imagination.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly layered, visibly worked paint with directional strokes and a built-up, tactile surface. It combines densely arranged female figures, expressive poses, dark romantic clothing, flowers, and atmospheric fantasy-like settings in subdued earth tones with recurring blue and red accents."},{"id":"tracy-reese","name":"Tracy Reese","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Tracy Reese","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tracy-reese.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tracy-reese","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-green","beige","dark-green","dark-brown","black","rust"],"intro":"Tracy Reese is an American fashion designer known for her elegant and vibrant designs that often incorporate bold colors and intricate patterns. Her work is celebrated for its feminine and sophisticated aesthetic, appealing to a diverse audience. Reese's designs have been worn by influential figures and have been featured in numerous fashion publications, highlighting her impact on the fashion industry.","observation":"The style combines editorial fashion portraiture with richly patterned, botanical garments, sculptural accessories, and carefully staged full-length poses. Saturated teal, orange, pink, and green hues sit against spacious backgrounds, while fine drawn botanical marks and painterly, collage-like surfaces add ornamental complexity."},{"id":"matt-bors","name":"Matt Bors","cat":"illustrators","en":"Matt Bors","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-bors.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-bors","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing"],"colours":["black","muted-cyan","brown","light-orange","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Matt Bors is an American cartoonist and editor known for his incisive and satirical comic strips. He has contributed to various publications, often focusing on political and social issues with a humorous twist. Bors is recognized for his ability to blend humor with sharp commentary, making his work both entertaining and thought-provoking.","observation":"The style uses dense comic-book drawing with heavy black contours, flat yet strongly saturated color blocks, and selective crosshatched texture. It repeatedly combines expressive faces, crowded political scenes, animal-headed allegories, urban landmarks, and dramatic fire or protest imagery in a bold, high-contrast graphic-novel treatment."},{"id":"nigel-van-wieck","name":"Nigel van Wieck","cat":"painters","en":"Nigel van Wieck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nigel-van-wieck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nigel-van-wieck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-red","muted-cyan","red","vivid-red","muted-orange"],"intro":"Nigel van Wieck is an American painter known for his evocative and atmospheric works that often depict solitary figures in urban settings. His paintings are characterized by a strong sense of narrative and mood, drawing comparisons to the works of Edward Hopper.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible painterly brushwork with graphic, illustrative shapes, saturated red-and-teal color, and forceful light-dark separation. Fashionably dressed figures appear in cinematic, staged situations, with retro automobiles, interiors, and bold geometric shadows reinforcing the polished mid-century atmosphere."},{"id":"nico-delort","name":"Nico Delort","cat":"illustrators","en":"Nico Delort","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nico-delort.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nico-delort","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","landscapes","mist","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Nico Delort is a contemporary French illustrator known for his intricate and atmospheric black and white illustrations. His work often draws from literary and mythological themes, employing a detailed and narrative style that evokes a sense of mystery and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental cavernous landscapes are rendered in stark black and white, with intense tonal separation, luminous openings, and deep shadow. Tiny cloaked figures establish scale amid towering rock formations, mist-filled voids, celestial elements, and dreamlike, impossible terrain."},{"id":"arnold-bocklin","name":"Arnold Bocklin","cat":"painters","en":"Arnold Bocklin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arnold-bocklin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arnold-bocklin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","ochre","white","muted-blue","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Arnold Bocklin was a Swiss symbolist painter known for his fantastical and mythological scenes, often imbued with a sense of mystery and melancholy. Born in 1827, Bocklin's work is characterized by its vivid imagination and detailed execution, drawing on themes from classical mythology and romanticism. His paintings often depict dreamlike landscapes, solitary figures, and ancient ruins, creating an atmosphere that is both haunting and serene.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly surfaces and fine, visible brushwork to build dense romantic landscapes of ruins, water, figures, and monumental stone architecture. Muted earth tones, deep shadows, selective warm reds, and strong light-dark contrasts create a solemn, dreamlike atmosphere with classical and fantastical overtones."},{"id":"sachin-teng","name":"Sachin Teng","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sachin Teng","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sachin-teng.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sachin-teng","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","cream","dark-brown","vivid-red","muted-olive","orange"],"intro":"Sachin Teng is a contemporary illustrator known for his unique blend of surreal and fantasy elements, often incorporating detailed and expressive characters. His work is characterized by a fusion of traditional and digital techniques, creating intricate and imaginative visuals.","observation":"Across all four renders, expressive close-up portraits are built from energetic, visible paint strokes, angular graphic shapes, and sharply cropped compositions. Saturated orange, teal, cream, and dark green dominate, with bold outlines, flat color blocks, and layered botanical, bird, and clothing fragments creating a dense illustrative surface."},{"id":"mary-quant","name":"Mary Quant","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Mary Quant","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-quant.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-quant","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["cream","orange","black","yellow","deep-rust","brown"],"intro":"Mary Quant is a renowned British fashion designer credited with popularizing the miniskirt and hot pants in the 1960s. She played a pivotal role in the mod and youth fashion movements, bringing bold and playful designs to the forefront of British culture. Her work is characterized by its vibrant colors, geometric patterns, and innovative use of materials, making her a key figure in the Swinging Sixties.","observation":"The style combines polished fashion portraiture with simplified graphic illustration, uniting realistic faces and hair with flat, sharply separated color fields. Saturated orange, pink, green, yellow, and black create a bold retro look, reinforced by geometric bob hairstyles, oversized patterns, stylized clothing, and repeated editorial poses."},{"id":"jean-pierre-gibrat","name":"Jean-Pierre Gibrat","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jean-Pierre Gibrat","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-pierre-gibrat.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-pierre-gibrat","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Jean-Pierre Gibrat is a French comic artist and graphic novelist known for his detailed and expressive illustrations. His work often explores themes of romance, history, and human relationships, set against richly detailed backdrops.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly layered painted surfaces, fine contour work, and dense decorative detail to depict elegantly dressed figures in intimate interior or café-like settings. Subdued earth tones are punctuated by deep blacks and selective reds, while hats, textiles, flowers, wallpaper, newspapers, and furnishings create an ornate, period-styled atmosphere."},{"id":"inez-and-vinoodh","name":"Inez and Vinoodh","cat":"photographers","en":"Inez and Vinoodh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/inez-and-vinoodh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/inez-and-vinoodh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","white","vivid-red","silver","grey","dark-red","yellow"],"intro":"Inez and Vinoodh is a renowned Dutch photography duo known for their innovative and provocative work in fashion and art photography. Their real-life counterparts, Inez van Lamsweerde and Vinoodh Matadin , have collaborated with major fashion magazines and brands, creating iconic images that blend art and fashion with a unique and recognizable style.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped, realistic editorial portraits with tactile fur, hair, and fabric rendered in abundant detail. Most images are stark monochrome with strong tonal contrast and spacious pale backgrounds, while expressive faces, unconventional styling, and one vivid orange variation create an intense, fashion-forward mood."},{"id":"steve-ditko","name":"Steve Ditko","cat":"illustrators","en":"Steve Ditko","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-ditko.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-ditko","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","vivid-red","muted-green","dark-brown","orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Steve Ditko is a renowned American comic book artist and writer, best known for co-creating Spider-Man and Doctor Strange for Marvel Comics. His work is characterized by its unique style, featuring intricate line work, dynamic compositions, and a distinctive approach to character design. Ditko's influence on the comic book industry is profound, with his creations becoming iconic figures in popular culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense comic-book imagery with thick black contouring, visible ink texture, flat saturated color blocks, and intense contrast. Surreal masked characters, repeated eyes, cosmic forms, and organic patterns create a psychedelic, crowded visual language with hand-drawn irregularity."},{"id":"gail-gibbons","name":"Gail Gibbons","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gail Gibbons","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gail-gibbons.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gail-gibbons","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","floral","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["green","dark-green","lime","vivid-red","red","blue"],"intro":"Gail Gibbons is a renowned American author and illustrator, celebrated for her children's books that often explore educational themes. Her work is characterized by a clear, engaging style that combines informative content with vibrant illustrations, making complex topics accessible to young readers.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly saturated botanical colour with dense, layered garden imagery and clearly drawn contours. Broad painted shapes, visible brush texture, and selectively flattened colour create an exuberant illustrative look, with flowers, foliage, water, architecture, and birds packed into richly detailed compositions."},{"id":"dan-hillier","name":"Dan Hillier","cat":"various-artists","en":"Dan Hillier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-hillier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-hillier","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","portraits","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","black","white","bone-white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Dan Hillier is a contemporary artist known for his intricate and surreal artworks that often blend Victorian themes with fantastical elements. His work is characterized by detailed line work and a unique fusion of human and natural forms, creating a dreamlike and mysterious atmosphere.","observation":"The style combines stark monochrome portraiture with densely rendered botanical growth that obscures or replaces parts of the face and head. Fine ink-like linework, intricate natural detail, crisp tonal contrast, and restrained studio compositions create a surreal yet graphic appearance across all four images."},{"id":"wassily-kandinsky","name":"Wassily Kandinsky","cat":"painters","en":"Wassily Kandinsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wassily-kandinsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wassily-kandinsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["cream","black","blue","red","beige","light-orange"],"intro":"Wassily Kandinsky is considered one of the pioneers of abstract art. Born in Russia in 1866, he later moved to Germany, where he became a key figure in the development of modern art. Kandinsky's work is characterized by its bold use of color, geometric shapes, and a focus on the emotional impact of art. His paintings often explore the relationship between color and form, creating dynamic compositions that evoke a sense of movement and energy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines abstract geometric arrangements with vivid color, strong black linear marks, circles, grids, arcs, and sharply angled planes. Some areas use clean, flat color while others visibly retain brushwork and textured paint, producing an expressive, layered, slightly surreal composition."},{"id":"mariko-mori","name":"Mariko Mori","cat":"various-artists","en":"Mariko Mori","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mariko-mori.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mariko-mori","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","glow","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["grey","bone-white","pale-blue","red","charcoal"],"intro":"Mariko Mori is a contemporary Japanese artist known for her work that blends technology, spirituality, and futuristic themes. Her art often explores the intersection of human consciousness and the universe, utilizing a mix of traditional Japanese aesthetics and modern digital techniques. Mori's installations and sculptures frequently incorporate light, sound, and interactive elements, creating immersive experiences that invite contemplation and introspection.","observation":"The style presents surreal fashion tableaux as polished, highly realistic 3D installations, combining human figures with oversized spherical, bubble-like and architectural forms. Glossy reflective surfaces, pastel pink-and-blue color, soft illumination and unusual scale create a playful futuristic dreamworld."},{"id":"charlie-bowater","name":"Charlie Bowater","cat":"illustrators","en":"Charlie Bowater","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charlie-bowater.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charlie-bowater","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","orange","grey"],"intro":"Charlie Bowater is a contemporary illustrator known for her enchanting and detailed digital artwork, often featuring fantasy themes and characters. Her work is celebrated for its romantic realism and expressive portrayal of mythical subjects, capturing the imagination of viewers worldwide.","observation":"A richly painterly portrait style combines finely visible brushwork with detailed facial features, hair strands, fabric, and lace. The images use moody blue, brown, and ember-orange palettes, strong directional light, luminous highlights, and deep shadows to create an expressive, dramatic atmosphere."},{"id":"david-aja","name":"David Aja","cat":"illustrators","en":"David Aja","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-aja.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-aja","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","dark-red","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"David Aja is a Spanish comic book artist known for his work on Marvel Comics' \"Hawkeye\" series. His style is characterized by a minimalist approach, strong use of color, and a focus on storytelling through visual elements. Aja's work often features bold lines and a graphic quality that enhances the narrative.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses a stark graphic-novel treatment: heavy black ink contours, simplified flat color fields, rough dry-brush textures, and an aggressively limited red, black, orange, and cyan palette. Strong silhouettes, cropped character portraits, urban backdrops, and deep tonal contrast create a brooding, dramatic visual language."},{"id":"india-mahdavi","name":"India Mahdavi","cat":"designers","en":"India Mahdavi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/india-mahdavi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/india-mahdavi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","glow","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["deep-red","red","black","dark-olive","olive","light-red"],"intro":"India Mahdavi is a renowned French designer known for her vibrant and eclectic interior designs. Her work is characterized by a unique blend of colors, textures, and forms, often incorporating elements of modernism and eclecticism. She has gained international acclaim for her innovative approach to design, creating spaces that are both functional and visually striking.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents richly colored interior spaces with strong geometric architecture, repeated arches, fluting, ribbed surfaces, and rounded sculptural furniture. Warm architectural lighting and glowing fixtures intensify the saturated pink, green, mustard, and coral palette, while the detailed, polished visualization gives the spaces a retro hospitality-lounge character."},{"id":"jackie-ormes","name":"Jackie Ormes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jackie Ormes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jackie-ormes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jackie-ormes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","retro"],"colours":["pale-orange","grey","white","black","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jackie Ormes was a pioneering African American cartoonist and the first African American woman to produce a syndicated comic strip. Her work, including the popular \"Torchy Brown\" and \"Patty-Jo 'n' Ginger,\" was known for its social commentary and portrayal of African American life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses clean, expressive line drawing with strongly defined contours, flat blocks of saturated color, and densely described hair, clothing, and facial features. It consistently presents stylized mid-century fashion figures and portraits with dramatic poses, graphic makeup, patterned garments, and a lightly aged print or magazine surface."},{"id":"frank-capra","name":"Frank Capra","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Frank Capra","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-capra.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-capra","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Frank Capra was an influential American film director known for his work during the Golden Age of Hollywood. He is celebrated for his ability to blend comedy and drama, often focusing on themes of optimism and the human spirit. His films, such as \"It's a Wonderful Life\" and \"Mr. Smith Goes to Washington,\" are considered classics and have left a lasting impact on American cinema.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, bright highlights, and visible grain. Dramatic close-ups, low angles, silhouetted figures, and layered dreamlike scenes create an intense, noir-like cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"diane-arbus","name":"Diane Arbus","cat":"photographers","en":"Diane Arbus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/diane-arbus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/diane-arbus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["grey","black","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Diane Arbus was an American photographer known for her poignant and often unsettling portraits of marginalized individuals and subcultures. Her work in the mid-20th century challenged traditional notions of beauty and normalcy, capturing the raw and intimate aspects of her subjects' lives. Arbus's photography is celebrated for its ability to evoke deep emotional responses and its influence on modern photographic practices.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome photography with pronounced grain, selective focus, and strong tonal contrast. It combines carefully staged character portraits with vintage clothing, theatrical props, and deadpan expressions, often placing fashion-forward figures against ordinary urban or suburban settings."},{"id":"tiago-hoisel","name":"Tiago Hoisel","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tiago Hoisel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tiago-hoisel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tiago-hoisel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","charcoal","black","orange"],"intro":"Tiago Hoisel is a Brazilian illustrator known for his humorous and exaggerated caricatures. His work often features vibrant colors and playful compositions, capturing the essence of his subjects with a unique blend of realism and fantasy.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, polished illustrative rendering with fine hair, skin, fabric, and prop textures, while exaggerating anatomy into expressive caricature. Strong facial distortions, vivid naturalistic color, dramatic gestures, and carefully staged interiors give the portraits an energetic grotesque-comic character."},{"id":"iwona-lifsches","name":"Iwona Lifsches","cat":"painters","en":"Iwona Lifsches","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/iwona-lifsches.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/iwona-lifsches","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","fashion","floral","landscapes","scenes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["light-blue","dark-olive","vivid-red","ochre","blue","dark-red","pink"],"intro":"Iwona Lifsches is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and whimsical paintings that often depict idyllic landscapes and charming village scenes. Her work is characterized by a playful use of color and a dreamlike quality that invites viewers into a fantastical world.","observation":"Across the renders, simplified village architecture, rounded trees, abundant flowers, and elegantly dressed figures are painted with saturated, high-contrast colors and strong geometric shapes. Visible directional brush texture gives the clean illustrative forms a tactile, hand-painted surface, while recurring gardens, paths, and buildings create lively storybook scenes."},{"id":"catherine-nolin","name":"Catherine Nolin","cat":"painters","en":"Catherine Nolin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/catherine-nolin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/catherine-nolin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-olive","red","ochre","light-orange","black","muted-blue"],"intro":"Catherine Nolin is an American artist known for her richly detailed and whimsical paintings that often feature domestic scenes and nature motifs. Her work is celebrated for its intricate compositions and vibrant use of color, drawing inspiration from folk and naïve art traditions.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with dense, decorative compositions packed with flowers, patterned fabrics, furnishings, portraits, animals, and still-life objects. Saturated reds, greens, blues, and pinks sit in strong contrast, while crisp illustrative contours and finely worked details give the scenes a polished storybook quality."},{"id":"mary-fedden","name":"Mary Fedden","cat":"painters","en":"Mary Fedden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-fedden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-fedden","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","muted-blue","red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Mary Fedden is a renowned British artist known for her distinctive still life and landscape paintings. Born in 1915, she studied at the Slade School of Fine Art and later became a prominent figure in the British art scene. Her work is celebrated for its whimsical charm, bold use of color, and playful compositions, often depicting domestic and rural scenes with a unique modernist flair.","observation":"These interiors combine visible, varied brushwork with graphic outlines, flat color blocks, and strongly patterned surfaces. Saturated reds, pinks, blues, and greens organize densely arranged still lifes of flowers, plants, ceramics, furniture, and domestic animals, with geometric backdrops and ornamental fabrics adding visual rhythm."},{"id":"andy-russell","name":"Andy Russell","cat":"painters","en":"Andy Russell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andy-russell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andy-russell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","floral","landscapes","patterns","glow","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-blue","dark-red","red","ochre","silver"],"intro":"Andy Russell is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and imaginative landscapes that often blend elements of fantasy and surrealism. His work is characterized by intricate details and a vivid color palette, creating dreamlike scenes that transport viewers to otherworldly realms.","observation":"Across all four images, richly textured paint and dense decorative detail shape fantastical landscapes, celestial motifs, plants, and symbolic radial forms. Saturated jewel-like colours, strong outlines, repeated curves, ornamental framing, and luminous suns or moons give the style a vivid, dreamlike, highly designed character."},{"id":"david-rees","name":"David Rees","cat":"painters","en":"David Rees","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-rees.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-rees","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","patterns","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-orange","muted-rust","silver","brown","red","blue"],"intro":"David Rees is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and expressive portraiture. His work often explores themes of identity and emotion, utilizing bold colors and dynamic compositions to capture the essence of his subjects. Rees's style is characterized by a blend of traditional and modern techniques, creating a unique visual language that resonates with viewers.","observation":"The style combines close-up female portraiture with visible, layered paint: fine facial modelling is interrupted by energetic black sketch lines, splatters, scratches, and broad blocks of pink, blue, coral, and red. Cropped faces, overlapping marks, and expressive eyes create an intense, contemporary mixed-media appearance across all four renders."},{"id":"alice-pike-barney","name":"Alice Pike Barney","cat":"painters","en":"Alice Pike Barney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alice-pike-barney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alice-pike-barney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","ornate","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","grey","rust"],"intro":"Alice Pike Barney is an American painter known for her contributions to the cultural life of Washington, D.C., in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. Her work often explored themes of femininity and beauty, and she was a prominent figure in the American art scene, promoting the arts and supporting other artists.","observation":"Across all four portraits, visible directional brushwork builds faces, hair, flowers, feathers, and richly textured garments rather than clean graphic shapes. The subdued, dark palette is enlivened by expressive pinks, blues, and reds, while close cropping and decorative accessories give the portraits an elegant, ornamental character."},{"id":"lynda-barry","name":"Lynda Barry","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lynda Barry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lynda-barry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lynda-barry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage","drawing"],"colours":["pale-orange","muted-ochre","black","orange","red","grey","deep-blue"],"intro":"Lynda Barry is an American cartoonist, author, and teacher known for her distinctive style that blends humor with poignant storytelling. Her work often explores themes of childhood, memory, and the human experience, using a unique combination of text and imagery. Barry's contributions to the world of comics and graphic novels have earned her a dedicated following and critical acclaim.","observation":"The style combines densely packed, expressive portraits with vivid, sometimes clashing colors and heavy black contour lines. Visible ink-like drawing, fine hatching, colored-pencil or painted textures, handwritten page fragments, and collage-like layering give the images a tactile sketchbook quality."},{"id":"gary-larson","name":"Gary Larson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gary Larson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gary-larson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gary-larson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","muted-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Gary Larson is an American cartoonist known for his single-panel comic series \"The Far Side,\" which was syndicated in newspapers from 1980 to 1995. His work is characterized by its offbeat humor, anthropomorphic animals, and unexpected scenarios. Larson's cartoons often explore themes of absurdity and satire, making them a staple of American pop culture.","observation":"These pictures use expressive, finely drawn comic-book illustration with crisp ink contours, dense crosshatched texture, and carefully rendered environmental details. The palette is generally muted and earthy, with occasional stronger color, while each panel presents an absurd, deadpan situation involving anthropomorphic animal characters."},{"id":"tom-whalen","name":"Tom Whalen","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tom Whalen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-whalen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-whalen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-blue","pale-yellow","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Tom Whalen is an American illustrator known for his distinctive graphic style that often features bold colors and geometric designs. His work is heavily influenced by pop culture, particularly comic books and movies, and he is recognized for creating striking poster art that captures the essence of the subjects he portrays.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vivid navy, coral, orange, cream, and black in sharply separated geometric blocks with heavy graphic outlines and selective textured hatching. It combines dense cinematic poster-like scenes, close-up characters, futuristic machinery, and architectural or spacecraft details into energetic diagonal compositions with a retro science-fiction feel."},{"id":"alvin-lustig","name":"Alvin Lustig","cat":"designers","en":"Alvin Lustig","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alvin-lustig.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alvin-lustig","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","light-yellow","vivid-red","dark-blue","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Alvin Lustig is an influential American graphic designer known for his innovative approach to book cover design and typography during the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by a modernist aesthetic, combining abstract forms with bold color palettes. Lustig's designs have left a lasting impact on the field of graphic design, particularly in the areas of visual communication and branding.","observation":"Across the sheet, the style uses graphic flat-color forms, heavy black contours, geometric patterning, and strongly limited but saturated red, orange, blue, cream, and black. Repeated facial motifs and sharply framed portrait silhouettes are treated like retro print compositions, with a consistent grainy paper or screenprint texture and stark contrast."},{"id":"joep-bertrams","name":"Joep Bertrams","cat":"illustrators","en":"Joep Bertrams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joep-bertrams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joep-bertrams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","beige","silver","pale-yellow","dark-red"],"intro":"Joep Bertrams is a Dutch cartoonist known for his political cartoons and illustrations. His work often features sharp satire and commentary on current events, capturing the essence of political figures and societal issues with humor and insight.","observation":"The style uses finely controlled pen-and-ink drawing with dense crosshatching, scratchy contour lines, and selectively muted washes on an aged paper-like ground. It combines expressive caricature, anthropomorphic animals, crowds, monumental architecture, and heightened political-allegorical situations in richly packed scenes."},{"id":"leo-and-diane-dillon","name":"Leo and Diane Dillon","cat":"illustrators","en":"Leo and Diane Dillon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leo-and-diane-dillon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leo-and-diane-dillon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","red","dark-blue","light-orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Leo and Diane Dillon was an American husband-and-wife illustrator team known for their diverse and innovative artwork. They made significant contributions to children's literature, creating illustrations that often explored themes of diversity and multiculturalism. Their work is characterized by a unique blend of styles and techniques, reflecting a wide range of cultural influences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured, hand-rendered surfaces with dense ornamental detail, fine contouring, and strongly saturated jewel-like colors. Repeated black cat figures, elaborate costumes, patterned environments, and occasional centered symmetry create a theatrical, fantastical mood with stark dark silhouettes against vivid grounds."},{"id":"zaha-hadid","name":"Zaha Hadid","cat":"architects","en":"Zaha Hadid","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zaha-hadid.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zaha-hadid","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","motion","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","dark-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Zaha Hadid is a renowned architect known for her groundbreaking and innovative designs. Born in Baghdad in 1950, she became the first woman to receive the Pritzker Architecture Prize in 2004. Her work is characterized by its futuristic and fluid forms, often incorporating bold, sweeping curves and dynamic structures. Hadid's architectural style has left a significant impact on contemporary architecture, influencing a new wave of design thinking.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style transforms forms into energetic, abstract sweeps of liquid-metal geometry, combining sharp bands with flowing aerodynamic curves. Saturated red, navy, black, white, and silver-like highlights create a bold, high-contrast futuristic appearance, while the distorted spaces and improbable structures give the images a surreal sci-fi character."},{"id":"henry-darger","name":"Henry Darger","cat":"painters","en":"Henry Darger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henry-darger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henry-darger","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["pale-orange","muted-brown","ochre","black","red","grey"],"intro":"Henry Darger was an American writer and artist known for his posthumously discovered works of outsider art. He is most famous for his massive, illustrated fantasy manuscript \"The Story of the Vivian Girls,\" which depicts an epic battle between good and evil. Darger's work is characterized by its vivid imagination, intricate details, and a unique blend of innocence and darkness, often featuring childlike figures and fantastical creatures.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a densely populated, painterly narrative panorama built from fine drawn contours, visible brush texture, and layered hand-painted color. It combines crowded processions, riders, fantastical creatures, villages, flowers, and theatrical figures in expressive, dreamlike scenes with ornate surface detail and strong movement."},{"id":"nicolas-poussin","name":"Nicolas Poussin","cat":"painters","en":"Nicolas Poussin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicolas-poussin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicolas-poussin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","dark-blue","blue","beige"],"intro":"Nicolas Poussin was a French painter born in 1594, renowned for his classical style and influence on the Baroque movement. He is best known for his historical and religious paintings, characterized by clarity, logic, and order. Poussin's works often depict scenes from the Bible, mythology, and ancient history, and he is celebrated for his masterful use of color and composition.","observation":"These images use richly visible, broad painterly strokes to build monumental rocky landscapes, voluminous clouds, weathered ruins, and expressive robed figures. Warm earth tones contrast with blue skies and deep shadows, while dramatic group actions and sacred-looking encounters give the scenes an epic, classical religious character."},{"id":"ludwig-favre","name":"Ludwig Favre","cat":"photographers","en":"Ludwig Favre","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ludwig-favre.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ludwig-favre","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-cyan","bone-white","dark-red","charcoal","red","blue"],"intro":"Ludwig Favre is a contemporary photographer known for his vibrant and atmospheric images that often capture urban and natural landscapes with a surreal twist. His work is characterized by a unique use of color and light, creating dreamlike scenes that blend reality with fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, film-like architectural photography with stark geometric masses, clean planes, and sculptural concrete forms. Saturated pinks, reds, turquoise, and cyan are set against hard sunlight and deep shadows, producing a bold, highly composed urban-coastal atmosphere."},{"id":"fairfield-porter","name":"Fairfield Porter","cat":"painters","en":"Fairfield Porter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fairfield-porter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fairfield-porter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","beige","charcoal","ochre","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Fairfield Porter was an American painter and art critic known for his representational style that captured the essence of domestic life and landscapes in mid-20th century America. His work often depicted serene and intimate scenes, characterized by a subtle use of color and light, reflecting a modern realist approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional paint strokes and layered, textured color to depict sunlit domestic interiors, gardens, people, and landscapes. Its restrained natural palette, lively foliage, and softly impressionistic handling create detailed but relaxed scenes connected by open windows, garden views, and warm daylight."},{"id":"peter-mohrbacher","name":"Peter Mohrbacher","cat":"illustrators","en":"Peter Mohrbacher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-mohrbacher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-mohrbacher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","dark-brown","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Peter Mohrbacher is an American artist known for his visionary and surrealistic fantasy art. He gained recognition for his work on Magic: The Gathering and his personal project, Angelarium, which explores mythological and celestial themes through intricate and imaginative illustrations.","observation":"Across all four images, monumental ritualistic humanoid figures emerge from smoky, otherworldly environments, rendered with visible broad, gestural paint strokes and dense textural detail. The consistent teal, charcoal, and ember-orange palette, internal glowing marks, dramatic gestures, and distorted anatomy create an intense dark-fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"francoise-nielly","name":"Francoise Nielly","cat":"painters","en":"Francoise Nielly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francoise-nielly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francoise-nielly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","orange","deep-red","vivid-red","pink","muted-cyan","light-lime"],"intro":"Francoise Nielly is a contemporary French artist known for her vibrant and expressive portraits. Her work is characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions, often created using a palette knife technique. Nielly's art captures the intensity and emotion of her subjects, making her a prominent figure in modern portraiture.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces are built from vigorous, visible paint strokes and angular slabs of color. Saturated pinks, reds, oranges, blues, and greens are sharply opposed by heavy dark marks, producing an intense, graphic, expressive portrait style."},{"id":"friedel-dzubas","name":"Friedel Dzubas","cat":"painters","en":"Friedel Dzubas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/friedel-dzubas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/friedel-dzubas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","cream","pale-orange","vivid-rust","muted-green","orange","teal"],"intro":"Friedel Dzubas was a German-born American painter known for his contributions to the Color Field movement and abstract expressionism. His work often featured large, sweeping areas of color and a focus on the emotional impact of abstraction. Dzubas's paintings are characterized by their vibrant hues and dynamic compositions, reflecting the post-war art scene in America.","observation":"Across all four works, broad abstract color fields and translucent painted layers sit on pale grounds, with energetic thin linear marks weaving through them. The style combines vivid accents and geometric bands with visible brushwork, scraped edges, and loosely drawn contours rather than depicting recognizable subjects."},{"id":"hajime-isayama","name":"Hajime Isayama","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hajime Isayama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hajime-isayama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hajime-isayama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","illustrative","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","painterly","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","white","grey","orange"],"intro":"Hajime Isayama is a Japanese manga artist best known for creating the popular series \"Attack on Titan.\" His work is characterized by intense storytelling, complex characters, and a unique blend of horror and fantasy elements. Isayama's art style often features detailed line work and dynamic compositions that convey a sense of urgency and drama.","observation":"The style is built around tightly cropped, emotionally intense faces, with expressive eyes, tangled hair, and rugged facial texture dominating the compositions. Visible ink-like linework, fine hatching, and painterly color marks combine illustrative drawing with dark, high-impact tonal contrasts and occasional vivid warm or cool accents."},{"id":"yoshiyuki-tomino","name":"Yoshiyuki Tomino","cat":"illustrators","en":"Yoshiyuki Tomino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yoshiyuki-tomino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yoshiyuki-tomino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","motion","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","drawing"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-brown","bone-white","grey","rust","muted-blue"],"intro":"Yoshiyuki Tomino is a renowned Japanese animator and director, best known for creating the iconic \"Mobile Suit Gundam \" series. His work has significantly influenced the mecha genre in anime, blending intricate storytelling with innovative mechanical designs. Tomino's contributions to animation have left a lasting impact on both Japanese and global pop culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured paint with fine, assertive linework and densely layered science-fiction character scenes. Saturated blue, red, orange, and white forms stand out against dark space or shadowed environments, while dramatic poses, machines, and debris create a kinetic space-opera atmosphere."},{"id":"tom-lovell","name":"Tom Lovell","cat":"painters","en":"Tom Lovell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-lovell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-lovell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","pale-yellow","ochre","brown","grey"],"intro":"Tom Lovell is an American illustrator and painter known for his detailed and realistic depictions of historical and narrative scenes. His work often captures moments from American history, particularly the Old West, and has been featured in magazines and books. Lovell's style is characterized by its precise attention to detail and ability to convey emotion and story through composition and color.","observation":"The style uses richly visible, broad oil-paint strokes to model expressive faces, clothing, foliage, and machinery with warm cream highlights against deep olive and brown shadows. Each image presents a densely composed, narrative scene of elegantly dressed people in romantic or adventurous encounters, with polished illustrative clarity and a nostalgic period atmosphere."},{"id":"apollonia-saintclair","name":"Apollonia Saintclair","cat":"illustrators","en":"Apollonia Saintclair","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/apollonia-saintclair.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/apollonia-saintclair","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","drawing","ink"],"colours":["grey","white","black","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Apollonia Saintclair is a contemporary artist known for her intricate and evocative illustrations, often exploring themes of sensuality and introspection. Her work is characterized by bold linework and a monochromatic palette, creating a striking visual impact.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome ink drawing with extremely fine contour work, stippling, and dense crosshatching to model faces, hair, fabric, foliage, and architecture. It combines tightly cropped intimate portraits and figure scenes with carefully observed urban or domestic details, keeping a graphic illustrative clarity while retaining rich tonal texture."},{"id":"paul-barson","name":"Paul Barson","cat":"photographers","en":"Paul Barson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-barson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-barson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","bone-white","deep-rust","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Paul Barson is a contemporary photographer known for capturing ethereal and intimate floral compositions. His work often explores the delicate balance between nature and art, creating a unique visual language that resonates with viewers.","observation":"The style presents flowers as realistic botanical close-ups, with finely resolved petals, stamens, stems, and foliage against expansive near-black backgrounds. Low-key illumination picks out pale petals and occasional warm orange blooms, while shallow focus and soft bokeh create a moody, dramatic photographic look."},{"id":"henry-selick","name":"Henry Selick","cat":"illustrators","en":"Henry Selick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henry-selick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henry-selick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","scenes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","dark-ochre","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Henry Selick is an acclaimed American director, producer, and writer known for his work in stop-motion animation. He is best recognized for directing films such as \"The Nightmare Before Christmas\" and \"Coraline,\" which showcase his distinctive style that blends dark fantasy with whimsical storytelling. Selick's work often features intricate handcrafted elements, creating immersive and fantastical worlds that captivate audiences with their unique charm.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents tactile, handcrafted puppet-like characters with elongated bodies, exaggerated eyes, gaunt faces, and distressed clothing. Dramatic low-key lighting, deep shadows, selective glow, and muted dark tones create a cinematic gothic-fantasy mood, while crowded ensemble scenes and surreal proportions reinforce the uncanny handmade quality."},{"id":"tracie-grimwood","name":"Tracie Grimwood","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tracie Grimwood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tracie-grimwood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tracie-grimwood","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-teal","muted-cyan","silver","dark-brown","rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"Tracie Grimwood is an illustrator known for her enchanting and whimsical artwork, often featuring nature and fantasy themes. Her work is characterized by detailed compositions and a dreamy atmosphere, capturing the imagination with a unique blend of realism and fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible textured brushwork with fine drawn marks, densely layering plants, animals, figures, and woodland settings. Cool blue-green nocturnal hues are punctuated by saturated coral and red accents, creating a richly detailed, dreamy storybook fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"daarken","name":"Daarken","cat":"illustrators","en":"Daarken","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daarken.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daarken","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","bone-white","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Daarken is a contemporary illustrator known for his work in fantasy art, particularly within the realms of gaming and conceptual design. His real-life counterpart, Michael Lim, has contributed to numerous projects, creating evocative and immersive visuals that capture the imagination.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured, painterly surfaces with finely controlled brushwork, strong detail, and dramatic close cropping. Deep teal-black shadows, subdued dusty highlights, and selective warm accents create a moody, high-contrast cinematic atmosphere spanning portraits, animals, and urban or natural scenes."},{"id":"stuart-immonen","name":"Stuart Immonen","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stuart Immonen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stuart-immonen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stuart-immonen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","bold-lines","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","brown","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Stuart Immonen is a renowned Canadian comic book artist known for his work with major publishers like Marvel and DC Comics. His career spans several decades, during which he has contributed to iconic series such as \"Ultimate Spider-Man\" and \"All-New X-Men.\" Immonen's art is celebrated for its versatility, dynamic composition, and ability to convey emotion and action effectively.","observation":"The style is a densely packed comic-book illustration language, combining sharply defined character silhouettes with expressive faces, dramatic poses, and heavy black-and-white contrast. Ink-like linework, crosshatched shadows, rough brush textures, and occasional saturated red areas create a forceful graphic-novel appearance across both ensemble scenes and portraits."},{"id":"ted-gore","name":"Ted Gore","cat":"photographers","en":"Ted Gore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ted-gore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ted-gore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","dark-brown","cream","ochre"],"intro":"Ted Gore is a renowned landscape photographer known for his striking and immersive images that capture the beauty and majesty of natural environments. His work often features dramatic landscapes, vibrant colors, and a keen attention to detail, making him a prominent figure in contemporary photography.","observation":"The style presents vast, realistic fantasy landscapes with monumental mountains, deep valleys, and carefully layered environmental detail. Moody blue-gray atmospheres are punctuated by warm sunset, fire, and reflected light, while mist, dramatic clouds, and cinematic compositions create an epic sense of scale."},{"id":"guy-bourdin","name":"Guy Bourdin","cat":"photographers","en":"Guy Bourdin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-bourdin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-bourdin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","fashion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","geometric"],"colours":["dark-red","dark-blue","black","muted-teal","blue"],"intro":"Guy Bourdin was a French fashion photographer known for his provocative and surreal imagery, particularly in the 1970s and 1980s. His work often featured bold colors, striking compositions, and a unique blend of eroticism and mystery, making him a significant figure in the world of fashion photography.","observation":"A realistic fashion-photography style built around saturated red, turquoise, and blue, with hard sunlight and sharply defined shadows. Geometric architecture, cropped bodies, dramatic angles, and strong color blocking give the images a bold, cinematic editorial presence."},{"id":"terry-dodson","name":"Terry Dodson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Terry Dodson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/terry-dodson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/terry-dodson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","white","charcoal","ochre","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Terry Dodson is a renowned American comic book artist known for his work on titles such as \"Wonder Woman\" and \"X-Men.\" His style is characterized by dynamic compositions, expressive characters, and a vibrant use of color. Dodson's illustrations often feature strong female protagonists and are celebrated for their detailed line work and engaging storytelling.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines finely drawn contour lines with visible delicate brushwork, layered hatching, and selectively painted color on a warm paper ground. Expressive faces, flowing windblown hair, dramatic costume details, and cropped bust framing give the illustrations a polished yet energetic fashion-character quality."},{"id":"zena-holloway","name":"Zena Holloway","cat":"photographers","en":"Zena Holloway","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zena-holloway.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zena-holloway","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","silver","brown"],"intro":"Zena Holloway is a renowned underwater photographer known for her ethereal and dreamlike imagery. Her work often features models submerged in water, capturing the fluidity and grace of movement beneath the surface. Holloway's photography is celebrated for its unique blend of fantasy and reality, creating captivating visual narratives that transport viewers to otherworldly realms.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic underwater photography with intricate bubbles, wet hair, skin, and billowing white fabric rendered in fine detail. Dark teal water and bright white garments create strong contrast, while suspended bodies and swirling currents give the images an expressive, dreamlike sense of motion."},{"id":"austin-briggs","name":"Austin Briggs","cat":"illustrators","en":"Austin Briggs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/austin-briggs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/austin-briggs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","pale-yellow","brown","white","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Austin Briggs is an American illustrator known for his work in the mid-20th century, particularly in the realms of advertising, magazines, and comic strips. His illustrations often captured the essence of American life during his time, characterized by a strong narrative style and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses loose, visibly worked paint with broad gestural strokes and occasional dark, emphatic contour marks. It focuses on tightly cropped, emotionally expressive figures and intimate interactions, using restrained earthy colors with strong black and charcoal masses."},{"id":"yayoi-kusama","name":"Yayoi Kusama","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Yayoi Kusama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yayoi-kusama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yayoi-kusama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","patterns","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","religious","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["vivid-red","deep-red","red","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Yayoi Kusama is a renowned Japanese artist known for her extensive work in sculpture, painting, and installation art. Her career spans several decades, during which she has become famous for her use of polka dots and infinity installations. Kusama's work often explores themes of self-obliteration, repetition, and the infinite, drawing from her own experiences and mental health struggles.","observation":"The style combines intensely saturated red, black, and white with relentless circular repetition, producing a vivid, high-contrast, surreal environment. Oversized glossy spheres, dotted walls and floors, mirrors, and repeated motifs create immersive geometric scenes, while the occasional frontal portrait and small human figures establish scale."},{"id":"alex-alemany","name":"Alex Alemany","cat":"painters","en":"Alex Alemany","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-alemany.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-alemany","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","orange","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Alex Alemany is a Spanish painter known for his unique blend of realism and surrealism. His work often explores themes of fantasy and dreams, creating intricate and detailed compositions that captivate viewers with their ethereal beauty.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly layered, visible brushwork to create luminous figures, birds, clouds, fabric, and fantastical settings. Saturated warm and cool colors, glowing light, expressive gestures, and dreamlike symbolic details give the scenes an elaborate storybook quality."},{"id":"charles-dana-gibson","name":"Charles Dana Gibson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Charles Dana Gibson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-dana-gibson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-dana-gibson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","silver","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Charles Dana Gibson is an American illustrator best known for creating the 'Gibson Girl,' a representation of the idealized American woman of the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work was widely published in magazines and became a cultural icon, influencing fashion and societal views on femininity during that era.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome ink-like drawing with fine contour lines, selective dark masses, and delicate hatching to build expressive female portraits and fashion figures. Large white areas and varied close-up compositions emphasize elegant hairstyles, facial profiles, and lightly sketched garments while maintaining strong black-and-white contrast."},{"id":"wally-wood","name":"Wally Wood","cat":"illustrators","en":"Wally Wood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wally-wood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wally-wood","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","white","silver","bone-white"],"intro":"Wally Wood was a prominent American comic book artist and writer, known for his work in the mid-20th century. He was a key figure in the development of science fiction and fantasy comics, contributing to publications such as EC Comics and Mad magazine. Wood's style is characterized by its detailed line work, dynamic compositions, and imaginative storytelling, making him a significant influence in the world of comic art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a dense black-and-white comic illustration built from bold contours, fine directional hatching, ink washes, and stark blocks of shadow. It combines exaggerated facial expressions, monsters, glamorous figures, and perilous action into crowded pulp-horror tableaux with exceptionally high contrast and intricate linework."},{"id":"leon-bonnat","name":"Leon Bonnat","cat":"painters","en":"Leon Bonnat","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leon-bonnat.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leon-bonnat","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","erotic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","orange","deep-red","bone-white"],"intro":"Leon Bonnat was a French painter known for his portraits and historical scenes, active during the 19th century. He was a prominent figure in academic art and was recognized for his realistic style and detailed brushwork. Bonnat's works often depicted dramatic and emotional subjects, reflecting the romanticism and realism of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured oil-paint surfaces, fine visible brushwork, carefully modeled faces, and dense dark hair against near-black grounds. Warm flesh tones and deep reds create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while tightly cropped, emotionally charged figures and expressive gazes give the portraits an intimate classical drama."},{"id":"wang-guangyi","name":"Wang Guangyi","cat":"painters","en":"Wang Guangyi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wang-guangyi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wang-guangyi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","muted-cyan","blue","dark-red","white"],"intro":"Wang Guangyi is a prominent Chinese contemporary artist known for his involvement in the Political Pop art movement. His work often critiques and reflects on the intersection of consumer culture and communist ideology, blending Western pop art aesthetics with Chinese propaganda imagery. His pieces frequently feature bold colors and iconic imagery, drawing on the visual language of political posters.","observation":"The style uses graphic, poster-like illustration with very thick black contours, sharply simplified facial planes, and flat red-and-blue color blocks. Dense crowds and emphatic gestures are rendered with high contrast and a rough granular print texture, producing a forceful comics-like visual language across both close portraits and mass scenes."},{"id":"william-morris","name":"William Morris","cat":"designers","en":"William Morris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-morris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-morris","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["charcoal","ochre","dark-ochre","pale-yellow","beige","red"],"intro":"William Morris was a British textile designer, poet, and social activist, known for his significant contributions to the Arts and Crafts Movement in the 19th century. His work emphasized craftsmanship and traditional techniques, often featuring intricate patterns and natural motifs. Morris's designs have had a lasting impact on decorative arts and continue to be celebrated for their beauty and complexity.","observation":"The style combines densely layered botanical wallpaper with carefully rendered birds, flowers, berries, and foliage. Fine linear marks and delicate brushwork describe plumage and petals, while subdued blue-green, cream, rust, and ochre tones create an ornate, cohesive decorative surface."},{"id":"louis-kahn","name":"Louis Kahn","cat":"architects","en":"Louis Kahn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-kahn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-kahn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","motion","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","geometric"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Louis Kahn was a renowned American architect known for his monumental and monolithic style. His work is characterized by the use of simple geometric forms, a focus on materiality, and the interplay of light and shadow. Kahn's designs often incorporate large, open spaces and are celebrated for their spiritual and philosophical depth.","observation":"The style presents monumental interior architecture with realistic, highly detailed rendering, emphasizing raw concrete, brick, ramps, columns, and vast window grids. Warm subdued colors, strong sunlight, deep shadows, and carefully framed geometric spaces create a cinematic, sculptural atmosphere, with occasional human figures providing scale and motion."},{"id":"josh-adamski","name":"Josh Adamski","cat":"photographers","en":"Josh Adamski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josh-adamski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josh-adamski","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","silhouette"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","grey","beige","orange","red"],"intro":"Josh Adamski is a contemporary photographer known for his ethereal and surreal imagery that often blends elements of nature with abstract forms. His work is characterized by a dreamlike quality, achieved through digital manipulation techniques that create a sense of motion and fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic coastal sunsets are transformed by strong directional smearing and flowing blur, making the water, clouds, and reflections appear to surge around small solitary figures. Saturated orange and teal light, deep shadows, glowing horizons, and recurring silhouettes create a cinematic, surreal atmosphere of vastness and isolation."},{"id":"alec-soth","name":"Alec Soth","cat":"photographers","en":"Alec Soth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alec-soth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alec-soth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","mist","bw-monochrome","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","white","black","silver","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Alec Soth is an American photographer known for his large-scale projects and portraits that capture the essence of American life. His work often explores themes of isolation, longing, and the human condition, with a focus on the landscapes and people of the United States. Soth's photographs are characterized by their narrative depth and emotional resonance, making him a significant figure in contemporary photography.","observation":"The style uses filmic, realistic photography with restrained monochrome or muted color, subdued natural light, and atmospheric outdoor settings. Its compositions place isolated figures and carefully dressed characters within ordinary suburban or rural environments, creating a quiet, eerie, dreamlike narrative mood."},{"id":"yonatan-frimer","name":"Yonatan Frimer","cat":"painters","en":"Yonatan Frimer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yonatan-frimer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yonatan-frimer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","fine-lines","flat-color","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics"],"colours":["black","white","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Yonatan Frimer is a contemporary artist known for his intricate maze art and optical illusions. His work often explores themes of perception and visual trickery, engaging viewers with complex patterns and designs.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white graphic illustration with heavy contour lines, crisp flat shapes, and dense interior hatching. It combines close-up character portraits with crowded urban or abstract settings, using dramatic negative space, extreme contrast, and intricate geometric or flowing line patterns."},{"id":"james-dietz","name":"James Dietz","cat":"painters","en":"James Dietz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-dietz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-dietz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","blue","bone-white","muted-blue","dark-rust"],"intro":"James Dietz is an American artist renowned for his detailed and historically rich paintings, often focusing on military and aviation themes. His work captures the essence of historical moments with a keen eye for detail and narrative depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, vigorous paint strokes and thickly built surfaces to depict densely detailed military and postwar scenes. Strong sunlight, deep shadows, earthy subdued colors, and expansive blue skies create a dramatic illustrative tableau with expressive, cinematic staging."},{"id":"barbara-kruger","name":"Barbara Kruger","cat":"various-artists","en":"Barbara Kruger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barbara-kruger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barbara-kruger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["letters","portraits","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","collage","halftone","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","red","brown","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Barbara Kruger is an American conceptual artist known for her distinctive use of text and image to critique consumerism, power structures, and gender roles. Her work often features bold, declarative statements overlaid on black-and-white photographs, creating a powerful visual and rhetorical impact.","observation":"The style combines oversized geometric typography with tightly cropped photographic eyes, lips, and faces in a forceful red, black, and cream palette. Screenprint-like halftone, grain, distressed surfaces, bold outlines, and collage-style overlaps give the compositions a retro graphic-poster character."},{"id":"stanley-spencer","name":"Stanley Spencer","cat":"painters","en":"Stanley Spencer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stanley-spencer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stanley-spencer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-brown","deep-rust","ochre","beige"],"intro":"Stanley Spencer was a British painter known for his distinctive style that combined elements of realism and surrealism. His works often depicted biblical scenes set in his hometown of Cookham, blending the sacred with the everyday. Spencer's paintings are characterized by their detailed and expressive figures, capturing both the spiritual and mundane aspects of life.","observation":"The style is a densely layered figurative painting filled with overlapping people, clothing, foliage, and small environmental details. Visible directional brushwork, strong light-dark contrasts, earthy reds and greens, and expressive faces give the crowded tableaux a theatrical, animated presence."},{"id":"chris-johanson","name":"Chris Johanson","cat":"painters","en":"Chris Johanson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-johanson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-johanson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","dark-green","blue","pink","red","light-orange","green"],"intro":"Chris Johanson is an American artist known for his vibrant and expressive works that often explore themes of urban life and human interaction. Emerging from the Mission School art movement in San Francisco, Johanson's art is characterized by its use of bold colors, abstract forms, and a playful yet critical approach to contemporary society.","observation":"Across all four works, saturated colors, thick visible paint, and emphatic dark marks build dense, fragmented scenes populated by figures, animals, and symbolic shapes. Broad directional strokes and irregular geometric blocks give the compositions an expressive, dreamlike energy, while layered textures and patterned areas keep the surfaces richly active."},{"id":"alex-maleev","name":"Alex Maleev","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alex Maleev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-maleev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-maleev","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-red","deep-red","muted-orange"],"intro":"Alex Maleev is a Bulgarian comic book artist known for his work on various Marvel Comics series, including 'Daredevil.' His style is characterized by a gritty, realistic approach that often incorporates elements of noir and crime fiction.","observation":"Across all four portraits, thick, visibly worked paint builds angular figures from rough, energetic strokes, scraped textures, and near-black shadows. A restrained teal, charcoal, and red palette creates stark contrast and a grim, surreal mood, with faces obscured by masks, blindfolds, goggles, or heavy shadow."},{"id":"azzedine-alaia","name":"Azzedine Alaia","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Azzedine Alaia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/azzedine-alaia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/azzedine-alaia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","dark","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","muted-ochre","beige"],"intro":"Azzedine Alaia is a renowned Tunisian-born fashion designer known for his mastery in sculptural tailoring and innovative designs that celebrate the female form. He gained prominence in the 1980s and became a significant figure in the fashion industry, often referred to as the 'King of Cling' for his form-fitting creations.","observation":"The style presents avant-garde black garments as monumental, highly structured sculptures displayed on mannequins in grand museum-like interiors. Strong black-and-white contrast, repeated ribbing and beadwork, dramatic symmetry, and elaborate silhouettes create a theatrical, darkly elegant fashion-gallery aesthetic."},{"id":"peter-doig","name":"Peter Doig","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Doig","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-doig.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-doig","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","patterns","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","muted-olive","dark-brown","beige","ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"Peter Doig is a contemporary Scottish painter known for his evocative and dreamlike landscapes. His works often blend elements of reality and imagination, creating a unique and contemplative atmosphere. Doig's paintings are characterized by their rich textures, vibrant colors, and a sense of mystery, often drawing inspiration from his surroundings and personal experiences.","observation":"Across all four views, recognizable urban and garden landscapes are rendered with visibly built-up, directional paint marks and broad, rough strokes. Dense vertical trunks, reflective water, foliage, flowers, and facades create layered scenes in earthy greens and browns, punctuated by warm lights and strong dark-to-light contrasts."},{"id":"harmony-korine","name":"Harmony Korine","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Harmony Korine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harmony-korine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harmony-korine","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","grain","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["silver","grey","red","charcoal","ochre","vivid-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Harmony Korine is an American filmmaker, screenwriter, and artist known for his work in independent cinema. His films often explore themes of youth culture, societal taboos, and surreal narratives, characterized by a distinctive visual style that blends realism with the bizarre. Korine's work has been influential in the realm of avant-garde and experimental film, earning him a reputation for pushing the boundaries of conventional storytelling.","observation":"Across all four works, the style is vigorously abstract and painterly, built from thick palette-knife swaths, scraped layers, drips, splatters, and visible directional strokes. Saturated pinks, turquoise, orange, lime, and deep blue collide in dense, energetic compositions with recurring dots, graphic marks, and overlapping organic shapes."},{"id":"angie-lewin","name":"Angie Lewin","cat":"printmakers","en":"Angie Lewin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/angie-lewin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/angie-lewin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","grey","bone-white","orange","red"],"intro":"Angie Lewin is a British printmaker and designer known for her intricate botanical prints and nature-inspired artworks. Her work often features detailed depictions of wildflowers and plants, capturing the essence of the British countryside with a modern twist. Lewin's art is celebrated for its delicate lines and harmonious compositions, drawing inspiration from both natural landscapes and traditional printmaking techniques.","observation":"A densely packed botanical tapestry combines hand-painted brush texture with fine outlined forms, flat color passages, and abundant small floral details. Muted blue-grey grounds are enlivened by coral-red, cream, ochre, and black accents, while repeated stems, umbels, berries, and stylized birds create an ornate patterned rhythm."},{"id":"justine-kurland","name":"Justine Kurland","cat":"photographers","en":"Justine Kurland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/justine-kurland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/justine-kurland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","white","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Justine Kurland is an American photographer known for her evocative and narrative-driven images that often explore themes of freedom, nature, and the American landscape. Her work frequently features young women and children in expansive natural settings, capturing a sense of adventure and introspection.","observation":"The style is realistic and cinematic, using candid outdoor compositions, natural light, and a subdued earthy palette with a gently moody atmosphere. Shallow focus, soft film-like rendering, and casually observed human activity give the images an intimate, documentary-like sense of lived experience."},{"id":"irina-ionesco","name":"Irina Ionesco","cat":"photographers","en":"Irina Ionesco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/irina-ionesco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/irina-ionesco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","still-life","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["silver","black","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Irina Ionesco is a French photographer known for her provocative and surreal portraits, often featuring elaborate costumes and dramatic lighting. Her work is characterized by a gothic and erotic aesthetic, exploring themes of femininity and mystique. Ionesco's photography has been influential in both fashion and art circles, blending elements of surrealism and gothic glamour.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome portrait photography with grain, deep shadows, and strong tonal separation. Elaborate sculptural headwear, fur, feathers, jewellery, and densely textured garments create ornate, theatrical character studies, often arranged as tightly cropped groups or layered tableaux."},{"id":"albert-watson","name":"Albert Watson","cat":"photographers","en":"Albert Watson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-watson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-watson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Albert Watson is a renowned Scottish photographer known for his striking portraits and fashion photography. His work often features high-contrast lighting and a distinctive monochrome style, capturing the essence of his subjects with precision and elegance. Watson's photography has been widely published in magazines and exhibited in galleries around the world, making him a prominent figure in contemporary photography.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white portrait photography with forceful directional lighting, deep shadows, and highly textured skin and hair. Tight framing, direct gazes, dark garments, and subdued backgrounds create an intense, brooding cinematic mood across the portraits."},{"id":"charley-harper","name":"Charley Harper","cat":"illustrators","en":"Charley Harper","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charley-harper.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charley-harper","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","animals","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["muted-cyan","cream","black","vivid-red","beige","rust"],"intro":"Charley Harper is a renowned American artist known for his unique style of minimal realism, often depicting wildlife and nature. His work is characterized by geometric shapes, bold colors, and a playful approach to composition. Harper's art has been influential in the mid-century modern design movement, and his illustrations have appeared in various publications and exhibitions.","observation":"Across all four renders, birds are reduced to angular graphic forms and layered into dense, geometric compositions. Strong red, blue, black, white, and cream blocks create high contrast, while bold drawn lines, flat color, hatching, distressed marks, and collage-like overlaps give the images a screenprinted illustrative character."},{"id":"aliza-razell","name":"Aliza Razell","cat":"photographers","en":"Aliza Razell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aliza-razell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aliza-razell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-cyan","black","dark-cyan","bone-white","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Aliza Razell is a contemporary artist known for her imaginative and surreal photographic compositions. She often explores themes of mythology and fantasy, creating visually striking images that blend reality with dreamlike elements.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, photorealistic compositions with solitary figures placed in expansive landscapes and exaggerated natural phenomena. Teal-blue atmospheric tones, selective red accents, soft haze, shallow focus, and flowing fabric create a dreamy surrealism, while wind, drifting seeds, clouds, and trailing garments provide a persistent sense of motion."},{"id":"laurent-parcelier","name":"Laurent Parcelier","cat":"painters","en":"Laurent Parcelier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laurent-parcelier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laurent-parcelier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["blue","grey","dark-green","muted-ochre","silver","red"],"intro":"Laurent Parcelier is a contemporary French painter known for his vibrant and atmospheric landscapes. His work often captures the serene beauty of rural and urban settings, using light and color to create a sense of warmth and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured brushwork combines with crisp architectural details, dense foliage, and abundant flowers. Saturated blues, greens, corals, and warm sunlight create expressive high-contrast courtyard scenes with a dreamy, garden-filled atmosphere."},{"id":"jen-sorensen","name":"Jen Sorensen","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jen Sorensen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jen-sorensen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jen-sorensen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing"],"colours":["dark-ochre","black","orange","charcoal","red","grey"],"intro":"Jen Sorensen is a contemporary American cartoonist and illustrator known for her insightful and often humorous commentary on social and political issues. Her work is characterized by its sharp wit and distinctive visual style, making her a prominent figure in the world of editorial cartoons and graphic storytelling.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed comic-book drawing with heavy black outlines, dense interior hatching, expressive faces and gestures, and clean, mostly flat color fields. Saturated reds, greens, and blues are pushed against deep shadows, while crowded urban, domestic, and wilderness settings combine realistic figures with surreal creatures and layered narrative action."},{"id":"mike-judge","name":"Mike Judge","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mike Judge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-judge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-judge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink","geometric"],"colours":["silver","brown","orange","cream","dark-olive","light-yellow","vivid-red"],"intro":"Mike Judge is a renowned American animator, writer, and director known for creating popular animated television series such as \"Beavis and Butt-Head\" and \"King of the Hill.\" His work often explores themes of American culture, suburban life, and social satire, characterized by a distinctive comedic style.","observation":"The style uses densely drawn comic panels with thick, irregular black contours, expressive faces, and flat but richly varied blocks of color. Ink-like linework, crosshatched texture, paper grain, and eccentric human-animal groupings give the illustrations a handmade, offbeat character."},{"id":"gered-mankowitz","name":"Gered Mankowitz","cat":"photographers","en":"Gered Mankowitz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gered-mankowitz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gered-mankowitz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-green","deep-rust","silver","muted-orange"],"intro":"Gered Mankowitz is a renowned British photographer, best known for his iconic portraits of rock and roll musicians from the 1960s and 1970s. His work captures the essence of the music scene during this vibrant era, featuring legendary artists such as Jimi Hendrix and The Rolling Stones. Mankowitz's photography is celebrated for its intimate and expressive portrayal of cultural icons, often characterized by dramatic lighting and a strong sense of mood.","observation":"The style uses realistic, tightly cropped editorial portraits with intense direct gazes, strong facial detail, and dramatic light-dark separation. Warm rust, red, brown, and black tones dominate, while patterned garments, oversized accessories, textured hair, and fur create a tactile, fashion-focused surface."},{"id":"john-romita-jr","name":"John Romita Jr","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Romita Jr","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-romita-jr.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-romita-jr","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","sci-fi","retro","ink"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","vivid-red","dark-red","orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"John Romita Jr is a renowned comic book artist known for his work with Marvel Comics, particularly on titles like Spider-Man, Iron Man, and Daredevil. His style is characterized by dynamic compositions, bold lines, and a strong sense of motion, contributing significantly to the superhero genre.","observation":"This style uses densely packed comic-book compositions with strongly outlined figures, flat blocks of saturated color, and extensive ink hatching. High contrast, dramatic poses, retro print texture, and cosmic or alien settings give the imagery a vivid, pulp-science-fiction energy."},{"id":"kevin-nowlan","name":"Kevin Nowlan","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kevin Nowlan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kevin-nowlan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kevin-nowlan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","orange","dark-blue","vivid-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Kevin Nowlan is an American comic book artist known for his distinctive style and contributions to the comic book industry. His work is celebrated for its clean lines, expressive characters, and dynamic compositions. Nowlan has collaborated with various publishers and is recognized for his ability to blend traditional and modern comic art techniques.","observation":"The style is a dense, vividly colored comic-book illustration built from heavy black ink contours, flat color blocks, and sharply contrasting shadows. It combines posed character portraits with crowded action scenes and urban backdrops, using expressive anatomy, costume details, and a lightly weathered printed texture throughout."},{"id":"keisai-eisen","name":"Keisai Eisen","cat":"printmakers","en":"Keisai Eisen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/keisai-eisen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/keisai-eisen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","ink"],"colours":["light-orange","charcoal","black","beige","white","dark-red"],"intro":"Keisai Eisen was a Japanese ukiyo-e artist of the late Edo period, known for his bijin-ga, or portraits of beautiful women. His works are celebrated for their detailed depiction of fashion and elegance, capturing the essence of the time with a refined aesthetic.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses highly detailed illustrative linework, crisp flat color areas, and dark ink contours on a warm paper-like ground. Deep indigo, muted red, cream, and black recur throughout, with patterned garments, stylized waves, foliage, architecture, and dramatic layered compositions creating a richly decorative Japanese print appearance."},{"id":"edmund-dulac","name":"Edmund Dulac","cat":"illustrators","en":"Edmund Dulac","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edmund-dulac.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edmund-dulac","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-olive","dark-blue","ochre","grey"],"intro":"Edmund Dulac is a renowned French illustrator known for his contributions to the Golden Age of Illustration. Born in 1882, he gained fame for his enchanting and detailed illustrations in books such as \"The Arabian Nights\" and \"The Rubaiyat of Omar Khayyam.\" Dulac's work is characterized by its rich color palettes, intricate details, and a dreamy, ethereal quality that brings fairy tales and myths to life.","observation":"The style combines visibly textured, layered paint with delicate dark linework, dense organic detail, and richly ornamental surfaces. Subdued blue-green, brown, and umber hues create a moody, dreamlike atmosphere around mythic figures, fantastical creatures, tangled forests, and elaborate storybook settings."},{"id":"guido-guidi","name":"Guido Guidi","cat":"photographers","en":"Guido Guidi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guido-guidi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guido-guidi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","urban","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["ochre","light-orange","dark-olive","cyan","muted-cyan","black","rust"],"intro":"Guido Guidi is an Italian photographer known for his work in landscape and architectural photography. His approach often involves capturing the subtle beauty of everyday scenes, focusing on the interplay between light, space, and form. Guidi's work is characterized by a contemplative and introspective quality, often exploring themes of time and memory within the context of Italian landscapes and architecture.","observation":"The style uses realistic, filmic photography with restrained warm-and-teal colour, pronounced sunlight and deep architectural shadows. It consistently frames weathered coastal buildings, roads, wires, and an occasional vintage car in carefully composed, slightly nostalgic urban scenes, with visible grain reinforcing the retro atmosphere."},{"id":"mai-thu-perret","name":"Mai Thu Perret","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Mai Thu Perret","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mai-thu-perret.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mai-thu-perret","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["ornate","sculptural","characters","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","pink","blue","deep-red","black"],"intro":"Mai Thu Perret is a Swiss contemporary artist known for her multidisciplinary approach, blending sculpture, painting, and installation art. Her work often explores themes of feminism, utopianism, and the intersection of art and craft, drawing inspiration from various cultural and historical sources.","observation":"The style presents surreal contemporary gallery installations with oversized sculptural forms, anonymous monochrome figures, and tactile fabric-like surfaces. Strong blocks of pink, red, blue, and black contrast with spacious white interiors, while geometric arrangements and repeated textures create a clean yet uncanny visual language."},{"id":"sam-toft","name":"Sam Toft","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sam Toft","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sam-toft.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sam-toft","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","silver","bone-white","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Sam Toft is a British artist known for her whimsical and charming illustrations, often featuring a character named Mr. Mustard. Her work is characterized by its playful and imaginative style, capturing everyday moments with a touch of humor and warmth. Toft's illustrations have been widely appreciated for their unique storytelling and distinctive visual language.","observation":"These softly muted narrative paintings combine elongated, simplified figures and animals with delicate drawn outlines, visible brush texture, and weathered, tactile surfaces. Sparse winter settings, restrained earth tones, and small red accents create a whimsical yet melancholy storybook atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"rebecca-guay","name":"Rebecca Guay","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rebecca Guay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rebecca-guay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rebecca-guay","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-brown","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Rebecca Guay is an American illustrator known for her work in fantasy art, particularly in the realms of graphic novels and trading card games. Her distinct style often incorporates elements of mythology and folklore, characterized by a delicate and detailed approach that has been widely celebrated in the fantasy art community.","observation":"The style combines finely controlled illustrative linework with visible painterly texture, building densely layered portraits and figures into ornate botanical compositions. Muted earthy greens, creams, browns, and rust tones unify the elaborate hair, foliage, patterned garments, and fantastical forms."},{"id":"philippe-faraut","name":"Philippe Faraut","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Philippe Faraut","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philippe-faraut.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philippe-faraut","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Philippe Faraut is a contemporary sculptor known for his realistic and expressive clay portraits. His work often focuses on human figures, capturing intricate details and emotional depth. Faraut's sculptures are celebrated for their lifelike quality and the artist's ability to convey subtle expressions and textures.","observation":"Across all four renders, close-up portraits combine lifelike faces with visibly modelled clay-like surfaces, thick sculpted hair, and layered drapery. The restrained beige and taupe palette, dark backgrounds, dramatic lighting, and classical bust-like framing give the images a tactile yet dreamlike presence."},{"id":"ryan-mcginley","name":"Ryan McGinley","cat":"photographers","en":"Ryan McGinley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryan-mcginley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryan-mcginley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","muted-blue","light-orange","dark-olive","dark-blue"],"intro":"Ryan McGinley is an American photographer known for his vibrant and youthful images that often capture the essence of freedom and self-expression. Emerging in the early 2000s, McGinley's work is celebrated for its exploration of youth culture and its candid, often intimate portrayal of his subjects. His photography frequently features themes of nature, adventure, and the human form, often with an ethereal and whimsical quality.","observation":"The style uses naturalistic photographic portraiture with intimate close-ups, low angles, and faces partially immersed in foliage, grass, sky, or water. Saturated seasonal colors, warm sunlight, shallow focus, and visible film grain give the images an expressive, tactile, slightly nostalgic outdoor atmosphere."},{"id":"albrecht-durer","name":"Albrecht Durer","cat":"printmakers","en":"Albrecht Durer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albrecht-durer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albrecht-durer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","beige","dark-ochre","black","red","ochre"],"intro":"Albrecht Durer was a German painter, printmaker, and theorist of the German Renaissance. He is renowned for his high-quality woodcut prints and his contributions to the development of printmaking as an art form. Durer's work is characterized by its detail, precision, and incorporation of classical themes, often reflecting the religious and cultural shifts of his time.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered natural-history illustration with richly layered, painterly foliage and animal textures. Sepia ink linework, parchment grounds, restrained earthy color, and dense botanical ornament recur across the portraits, specimens, woodland scenes, and anatomical imagery."},{"id":"marjane-satrapi","name":"Marjane Satrapi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marjane Satrapi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marjane-satrapi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marjane-satrapi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics"],"colours":["black","grey","white","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Marjane Satrapi is an Iranian-born French graphic novelist, illustrator, and filmmaker, best known for her autobiographical graphic novel 'Persepolis.' Her work often explores themes of identity, culture, and personal history, drawing from her experiences growing up in Iran during and after the Islamic Revolution.","observation":"The style uses stark graphic-novel illustration with fine black contouring, selective crosshatching, and large areas of flat black, white, and restrained gray-beige. Repeated pale, dark-haired figures and cats appear in tightly framed interior and urban scenes, with exaggerated eyes, angular faces, dense architectural detail, and strong black-and-white contrast."},{"id":"pierre-joseph-redoute","name":"Pierre-Joseph Redoute","cat":"painters","en":"Pierre-Joseph Redoute","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-joseph-redoute.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-joseph-redoute","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","bone-white","red","muted-olive","dark-olive"],"intro":"Pierre-Joseph Redoute was a renowned Belgian painter and botanist, celebrated for his exquisite botanical illustrations. Active during the late 18th and early 19th centuries, Redoute is best known for his detailed and realistic depictions of flowers, particularly roses, which earned him the title \"The Raphael of Flowers.\" His work was highly influential in both artistic and scientific communities, bridging the gap between art and botany.","observation":"The style presents flowers as finely observed botanical studies, combining delicate visible brushwork with precise illustrative drawing and abundant petal, leaf, and stem detail. Soft, subdued pinks, creams, greens, and occasional blue accents sit against spacious pale backgrounds, giving the compositions an elegant classical-natural-history character."},{"id":"victor-nizovtsev","name":"Victor Nizovtsev","cat":"painters","en":"Victor Nizovtsev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/victor-nizovtsev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/victor-nizovtsev","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","dark-brown","rust","dark-blue","blue"],"intro":"Victor Nizovtsev is a Russian painter known for his enchanting and whimsical artworks that often draw inspiration from mythology and fairy tales. His work is characterized by a rich use of color and intricate detailing, creating a dreamlike atmosphere that captivates viewers. Nizovtsev's paintings often feature fantastical elements and are celebrated for their imaginative and ethereal qualities.","observation":"These portraits combine visibly textured, directional brushwork with saturated blue, orange, red, and gold color, producing a richly layered painted surface. Elaborate costumes, floral headpieces, masks, jewels, patterned textiles, and sparkling details create an ornate, theatrical fantasy style across all four images."},{"id":"melissa-launay","name":"Melissa Launay","cat":"illustrators","en":"Melissa Launay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/melissa-launay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/melissa-launay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-olive","charcoal","bone-white","red","grey"],"intro":"Melissa Launay is a contemporary artist known for her enchanting and detailed illustrations that often explore themes of nature and whimsy. Her work is characterized by a rich use of color and intricate patterns, drawing inspiration from both folk art and the natural world. Launay's art often features vibrant landscapes and imaginative scenes, capturing a sense of wonder and tranquility.","observation":"A richly painterly garden style combines dense, finely visible brushwork with saturated reds, pinks, blues, and greens. Multiple cats are integrated into an overflowing meadow of individually described flowers and foliage, with a soft pastoral landscape behind them."},{"id":"aaron-westerberg","name":"Aaron Westerberg","cat":"painters","en":"Aaron Westerberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aaron-westerberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aaron-westerberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","deep-red","muted-ochre","dark-brown","dark-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Aaron Westerberg is a contemporary American painter known for his figurative and portrait work, often characterized by a classical approach combined with modern sensibilities. His paintings typically explore the subtleties of human expression and emotion, rendered with a keen attention to detail and a refined use of color and light.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style relies on visible, layered brushwork with richly textured surfaces and softly modeled faces. Dark interiors, warm brown and red tones, black clothing, and isolated candlelight create an intimate, moody atmosphere, while expressive poses and carefully styled garments give the portraits a theatrical character."},{"id":"amanda-blake","name":"Amanda Blake","cat":"painters","en":"Amanda Blake","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amanda-blake.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amanda-blake","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["orange","bone-white","grey","ochre","black","dark-red"],"intro":"Amanda Blake is a contemporary artist known for her whimsical and surreal paintings that often feature elongated figures and dreamlike settings. Her work is characterized by a blend of fantasy and reality, creating a unique narrative style that draws viewers into a world of imagination and emotion.","observation":"The style combines childlike, front-facing portraiture with softly distorted proportions, oversized eyes, rosy cheeks, and simplified facial features. Visible brushwork and thickly built paint create a tactile surface, while muted pastel pinks, creams, reds, and blue-grays support floral clothing, bouquets, and whimsical character groupings."},{"id":"matthias-jung","name":"Matthias Jung","cat":"photographers","en":"Matthias Jung","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matthias-jung.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matthias-jung","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["white","muted-cyan","ochre","dark-olive","brown","grey","red"],"intro":"Matthias Jung is a contemporary German artist known for his surreal and imaginative photomontages, often blending architectural elements with dreamlike landscapes. His work explores the boundaries of reality and fantasy, creating whimsical and thought-provoking compositions.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, carefully detailed architectural scenes with solitary, decaying towers set against expansive rural landscapes. Subdued natural colors, clear cinematic light, and strange gravity-defying or otherwise impossible buildings create a dreamy, surreal atmosphere while preserving convincing material texture and architectural weight."},{"id":"chris-labrooy","name":"Chris LaBrooy","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris LaBrooy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-labrooy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-labrooy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","vivid-colors","surreal","retro","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-cyan","muted-teal","light-orange","brown","dark-ochre"],"intro":"Chris LaBrooy is a contemporary artist known for his innovative use of digital tools to create surreal and imaginative 3D artworks. His work often explores themes of architecture and design, blending reality with fantasy to produce visually striking pieces.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, finely detailed environments with dreamlike impossible scenes: vintage buses and cable cars float above deserts, hills, and settlements. Strong pastel and turquoise color contrasts, expansive skies, sculptural forms, and cinematic low-angle framing give the images a nostalgic yet surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"carl-brenders","name":"Carl Brenders","cat":"painters","en":"Carl Brenders","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-brenders.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-brenders","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","brown","silver","rust"],"intro":"Carl Brenders is a Belgian wildlife artist known for his highly detailed and realistic depictions of animals in their natural habitats. His work often focuses on the intricate details of fur, feathers, and the natural environment, capturing the essence of wildlife with precision and care. Brenders's art has been celebrated for its lifelike quality and has been influential in the field of wildlife art.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic animal rendering with dense, tactile fur detail and expressive close-up faces. Restrained cool colors, deep shadows, and strong light-dark contrast create a dark, dramatic wilderness atmosphere, while snowy streams and rocky forest settings provide recurring natural context."},{"id":"harold-edgerton","name":"Harold Edgerton","cat":"photographers","en":"Harold Edgerton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harold-edgerton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harold-edgerton","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","still-life","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Harold Edgerton was an American electrical engineer and photographer known for his pioneering work in high-speed photography and strobe lighting. His innovations allowed for the capture of fast-moving subjects with remarkable clarity, contributing significantly to both scientific research and artistic photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, transparent vessels and everyday objects are captured at the instant of explosive liquid, powder, or fruit impact. The style is monochrome and highly realistic, with extreme tonal contrast, crisp suspended particles, reflective glass, and a granular high-speed-photography texture against near-black backgrounds."},{"id":"peter-saville","name":"Peter Saville","cat":"designers","en":"Peter Saville","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-saville.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-saville","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","floral","glow","fine-brushstrokes","grain","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","vivid-red","blue","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Peter Saville is a renowned British graphic designer known for his influential work in the music industry, particularly with Factory Records. His iconic album covers for bands like Joy Division and New Order have left a lasting impact on visual culture, blending modernist aesthetics with a unique sense of style.","observation":"The style uses intensely saturated blue, red, orange, and pink against near-black grounds, with glowing highlights and strong tonal separation. Organic flowers and fabric-like forms are rendered through visible, finely striated brushwork, soft grain, dramatic close cropping, and surreal abstraction."},{"id":"marjorie-miller","name":"Marjorie Miller","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marjorie Miller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marjorie-miller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marjorie-miller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","floral","fine-lines","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","light-orange","beige","ochre","rust"],"intro":"Marjorie Miller is a fictional or hypothetical illustrator, possibly inspired by real-life artists known for their work in fantasy and surrealism. Her style might draw from historical art movements, blending traditional techniques with modern digital tools to create unique visual narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed illustrative scenes with crisp, delicate contouring, dense botanical ornament, and layered decorative surfaces. Muted earth, blue-grey, cream, and orange tones create a dark woodland atmosphere, while robed figures, animals, and oversized flowers give the imagery a fantastical, storybook quality."},{"id":"jenny-saville","name":"Jenny Saville","cat":"painters","en":"Jenny Saville","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jenny-saville.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jenny-saville","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","silver","dark-brown","muted-blue","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Jenny Saville is a contemporary British painter known for her large-scale depictions of the human form. Her work often explores themes of body image, identity, and the human condition, with a focus on flesh and the physicality of the human body. Saville's paintings are characterized by their bold, expressive brushwork and a realistic yet distorted portrayal of her subjects, often using a muted color palette dominated by flesh tones.","observation":"The style presents intense, tightly cropped human faces through highly visible, directional brushwork and layered paint, balancing recognizable anatomy with rough, partially abstracted passages. Vivid coral, pink, blue, and brown tones, occasional drips, and assertive linear marks give the portraits an emotionally charged, gestural presence."},{"id":"florence-broadhurst","name":"Florence Broadhurst","cat":"designers","en":"Florence Broadhurst","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/florence-broadhurst.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/florence-broadhurst","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","fantasy","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["pale-lime","muted-teal","dark-olive","orange","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Florence Broadhurst was an Australian designer known for her bold and innovative wallpaper and textile designs. Born in 1899, she gained international recognition for her vibrant and eclectic patterns that often featured floral and geometric motifs. Her work was characterized by a unique blend of Eastern and Western influences, making her a prominent figure in the design world until her death in 1977.","observation":"The style combines dense botanical arrangements with clean, graphic illustration, using fine ink-like contouring and flat, carefully layered color. Large flowers, branching foliage, and occasional birds are arranged as a decorative repeat against spacious colored grounds, with a vivid teal, coral, cream, and mustard palette."},{"id":"matt-molloy","name":"Matt Molloy","cat":"photographers","en":"Matt Molloy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-molloy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-molloy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","motion","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-red","black","orange","muted-blue","dark-brown"],"intro":"Matt Molloy is a Canadian photographer known for his innovative technique of time-stacking, where he combines hundreds of photos to create stunning, painterly images of the sky. His work often features dramatic cloud formations and vibrant colors, capturing the passage of time in a single frame.","observation":"Across all four landscapes, the sky and reflections are transformed into sweeping, vortex-like bands of visible color, giving the scenes an energetic long-exposure feel. Vivid sunset pinks, oranges, and cool blues combine with luminous horizons, grounded by quiet fields, trees, and water."},{"id":"brian-m-viveros","name":"Brian M. Viveros","cat":"illustrators","en":"Brian M. Viveros","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-m-viveros.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-m-viveros","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","dark-brown","muted-orange","muted-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Brian M. Viveros is a contemporary American artist known for his detailed and surreal portraits of empowered women. His work often features elements of pop surrealism and lowbrow art, characterized by a blend of erotic and dark themes.","observation":"Across all four portraits, richly visible brushwork models faces, hair, fabric, jewelry, and smoke with layered, tactile detail. Saturated reds, blacks, creams, and skin tones create a high-contrast, theatrical look, while elaborate accessories, makeup, and garments give the close-up compositions an ornate fashion-editorial character."},{"id":"elaine-lustig-cohen","name":"Elaine Lustig Cohen","cat":"designers","en":"Elaine Lustig Cohen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elaine-lustig-cohen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elaine-lustig-cohen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","pale-yellow","light-orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Elaine Lustig Cohen was an influential American graphic designer and artist known for her work in modernist design. She made significant contributions to the field of graphic design, particularly in the mid-20th century, with her innovative use of typography and abstract forms. Her work often incorporated elements of European modernism, and she was a key figure in the post-war design movement in the United States.","observation":"The style uses highly simplified portrait fragments and geometric abstractions, built from clean flat-color blocks in a vivid red, black, cream, and occasional blue palette. Heavy black contours, stark contrast, cropped framing, and subtle print-like grain give the images a bold retro poster and screenprint character."},{"id":"winfred-rembert","name":"Winfred Rembert","cat":"painters","en":"Winfred Rembert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/winfred-rembert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/winfred-rembert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","vivid-red","dark-red","orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Winfred Rembert was an African American artist known for his vivid depictions of the Southern United States, often drawing from his own life experiences. His work is characterized by the use of leather tooling and vibrant colors, capturing scenes of African American life and culture.","observation":"The style combines vividly saturated, high-contrast colors with flattened illustrative compositions and strongly outlined figures, buildings, trees, and clothing. Broad, visibly textured paint marks fill the scenes, producing a richly layered, expressive surface across tropical landscapes, communal gatherings, floral growth, and architectural settings."},{"id":"the-coen-brothers","name":"The Coen Brothers","cat":"filmmakers","en":"The Coen Brothers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/the-coen-brothers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/the-coen-brothers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","muted-olive","dark-brown","pale-yellow","ochre"],"intro":"The Coen Brothers is a renowned filmmaking duo known for their distinctive storytelling and unique cinematic style. They have created numerous critically acclaimed films that often blend elements of dark comedy, crime, and drama. Their work is characterized by sharp dialogue, memorable characters, and a keen eye for detail, making them influential figures in contemporary cinema.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, expressive drawn portraits with assertive ink-like outlines, simplified flat color areas, and strongly contrasted red, teal, cream, and black tones. Faces, hair, clothing, and props are rendered with dense directional marks over a subtly grainy paper-like surface, creating a rugged retro poster and editorial-illustration feel."},{"id":"filip-hodas","name":"Filip Hodas","cat":"various-artists","en":"Filip Hodas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/filip-hodas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/filip-hodas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","silver","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Filip Hodas is a digital artist known for his imaginative and surreal landscapes that often blend elements of science fiction and fantasy. His work is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail and a unique ability to create otherworldly scenes that captivate the viewer.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed, realistic-looking cinematic landscapes with monumental mountains, reflective water, and carefully staged surreal structures. Cool blue environments are punctuated by vivid red-orange terrain and vegetation, strong atmospheric light, and occasional internal glows, creating an epic science-fiction sense of scale."},{"id":"philippe-druillet","name":"Philippe Druillet","cat":"illustrators","en":"Philippe Druillet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philippe-druillet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philippe-druillet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-red","muted-blue","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Philippe Druillet is a renowned French comic book artist and illustrator, celebrated for his groundbreaking work in the science fiction genre. His unique style blends intricate line work with vivid, surreal imagery, often exploring themes of fantasy and cosmic exploration. Druillet's contributions to the world of comics have left a lasting impact, influencing numerous artists and shaping the visual language of sci-fi art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses tightly framed supernatural portraits built from dense black linework, ornate organic ornament, and crisp graphic shapes. Saturated cobalt blue and coral-red dominate against near-black grounds, with glowing eyes, horns, radial devices, and elaborate headdresses creating a vivid, high-contrast dark-fantasy language."},{"id":"jim-daly","name":"Jim Daly","cat":"painters","en":"Jim Daly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-daly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-daly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Jim Daly is an American artist known for his nostalgic and heartwarming depictions of rural life and childhood. His work often captures the innocence and simplicity of past eras, focusing on themes of family, nature, and everyday moments.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and highly detailed, with visible fine brushwork describing hair, fur, lace, wood, and fabric. Dark, subdued interiors are punctuated by warm lamplight and window light, while intimate domestic scenes, children, and cats are arranged with expressive, narrative feeling."},{"id":"jane-burch-cochran","name":"Jane Burch Cochran","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jane Burch Cochran","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jane-burch-cochran.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jane-burch-cochran","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","muted-ochre","light-orange","red","orange"],"intro":"Jane Burch Cochran is an American artist known for her vibrant and imaginative quilts and mixed media artworks. Her work often incorporates elements of folk art and storytelling, drawing inspiration from her Appalachian roots and personal experiences. Cochran's pieces are celebrated for their intricate patterns, bold colors, and narrative depth.","observation":"Across all four images, richly textured paint and discernible brushwork combine with fine drawn contours and illustrative, storybook forms. Saturated reds, pinks, greens, and ochres create expressive garden and rural scenes populated by stylized figures, with dense flowers, foliage, and decorative patterning throughout."},{"id":"kurt-geiger","name":"Kurt Geiger","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Kurt Geiger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kurt-geiger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kurt-geiger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","still-life","metallic","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","grey","charcoal","muted-rust","dark-red"],"intro":"Kurt Geiger is a renowned British footwear and accessories brand known for its bold and innovative designs. Established in 1963, the brand has become synonymous with luxury and contemporary fashion, offering a wide range of stylish shoes and accessories that cater to a diverse clientele.","observation":"The style presents extravagant high-heeled shoes as polished fashion still lifes, isolated against expansive white space with crisp product-render clarity. Rich floral textiles, reflective metallic surfaces, spikes, and crystal details create a lavish, highly decorative look, while clean contours and controlled reflections keep the compositions graphic and illustrative."},{"id":"lucy-grossmith","name":"Lucy Grossmith","cat":"painters","en":"Lucy Grossmith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucy-grossmith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucy-grossmith","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","pastel-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-olive","bone-white","ochre","dark-olive","red"],"intro":"Lucy Grossmith is a contemporary artist known for her charming and whimsical depictions of rural landscapes. Her work often features idyllic scenes filled with vibrant wildflowers, rolling hills, and quaint cottages, capturing the serene beauty of the English countryside.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely painted spring landscapes with abundant wildflowers, soft pastel color, and visible delicate brushwork. Natural scenes are richly layered with cottages, flowering trees, ponds, butterflies, foxes, or dogs, creating a gentle, dreamy storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"alvar-aalto","name":"Alvar Aalto","cat":"architects","en":"Alvar Aalto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alvar-aalto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alvar-aalto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","subdued-colors","retro","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","black","white","dark-brown","beige","blue"],"intro":"Alvar Aalto was a Finnish architect and designer, known for his significant contributions to modern architecture and design. He was a key figure in the development of Nordic modernism, blending functionality with organic forms and natural materials. Aalto's works often reflect a deep connection with nature, emphasizing harmony and simplicity.","observation":"The style presents architectural spaces as highly realistic, carefully composed photographs with strong geometric structure and sculptural curved forms. Warm natural light, subdued earthy colors, crisp material textures, and cinematic viewpoints consistently emphasize the buildings’ relationship with surrounding trees, sky, paths, and landscaped grounds."},{"id":"cathy-wilcox","name":"Cathy Wilcox","cat":"illustrators","en":"Cathy Wilcox","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cathy-wilcox.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cathy-wilcox","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","bone-white","light-cyan","beige","grey","lime","red"],"intro":"Cathy Wilcox is an Australian illustrator and cartoonist known for her work in newspapers and children's books. Her illustrations often feature a whimsical and playful style, capturing everyday life with humor and insight.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines translucent watercolor washes with loose, visible ink contours on textured paper. Crowded, narrative scenes use expressive gestures, simplified elongated figures, fine irregular linework, and restrained blue-green and ochre colors punctuated by red accents."},{"id":"michael-borremans","name":"Michael Borremans","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Borremans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-borremans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-borremans","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","muted-yellow","deep-red"],"intro":"Michael Borremans is a contemporary Belgian artist known for his enigmatic and meticulously crafted paintings that often explore themes of isolation and introspection. His work is characterized by a surreal yet realistic style, drawing viewers into a world that is both familiar and unsettling, often featuring solitary figures in ambiguous settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, figures are modeled with visible, directional paint strokes and richly textured fabric, set against nearly black backgrounds. The restrained brown, cream, and red palette, strong light-dark separation, cropped portrait framing, and obscured or downcast faces create a somber, theatrical mood."},{"id":"carlos-cruz-diez","name":"Carlos Cruz-Diez","cat":"painters","en":"Carlos Cruz-Diez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carlos-cruz-diez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carlos-cruz-diez","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","scenes","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","dark-rust","dark-green","vivid-red","muted-green","dark-blue"],"intro":"Carlos Cruz-Diez is a Venezuelan artist known for his innovative contributions to kinetic and optical art. His work focuses on the dynamic nature of color and its interaction with the viewer, often creating immersive experiences that challenge perceptions of static color.","observation":"Across all four renders, repeating vertical rods and rectilinear partitions create immersive geometric interiors, with silhouettes and reflections integrated into the architecture. Saturated red, cyan, green, and blue illumination produces strong contrast, luminous color, and layered striped shadows in a futuristic, cinematic presentation."},{"id":"john-bauer","name":"John Bauer","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Bauer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-bauer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-bauer","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","grey","rust"],"intro":"John Bauer was a Swedish painter and illustrator, renowned for his work in fairy tale art and his depictions of Nordic folklore. Born in 1882, Bauer's illustrations are characterized by their mystical and enchanting qualities, often featuring mythical creatures and dark, forested landscapes. His work has had a lasting influence on the genre of fantasy illustration.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with densely described forests, rocks, fur, hair, and twisted branches. Muted blue-green and brown tones, deep shadows, and isolated pale figures create a brooding fairy-tale atmosphere, while oversized creatures and monumental trees give the scenes an epic, surreal scale."},{"id":"william-heath-robinson","name":"William Heath Robinson","cat":"illustrators","en":"William Heath Robinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-heath-robinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-heath-robinson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","funny"],"colours":["muted-orange","grey","cream","brown","silver","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"William Heath Robinson was a British illustrator and cartoonist known for his humorous and elaborate drawings of complex machines and whimsical inventions. Born in 1872, Robinson's work often depicted fantastical contraptions and imaginative scenes, earning him a reputation as a master of intricate and humorous illustration. His style is characterized by detailed line work and a playful approach to everyday objects and scenarios.","observation":"The style combines densely populated spectacle scenes with delicate, tightly controlled ink drawing and selectively vivid red accents against muted blue-gray and cream grounds. Fine outlines, intricate machinery and costumes, exaggerated poses, and busy physical action give the pictures an expressive, humorous circus-like energy."},{"id":"ed-freeman","name":"Ed Freeman","cat":"photographers","en":"Ed Freeman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-freeman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-freeman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","dark-blue","brown","grey","deep-red","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Ed Freeman is a contemporary photographer known for his surreal and hyper-realistic imagery, often focusing on landscapes and architectural subjects. His work frequently explores themes of isolation and nostalgia, capturing the essence of American culture through a unique lens.","observation":"A cinematic, realistic roadside style built around isolated desert businesses, vintage cars, and broad storm-filled skies. Subdued blue-green and rust palettes, strong warm-versus-cool contrast, and small glowing signs or lamps create a dark, nostalgic atmosphere with expansive horizons and carefully staged compositions."},{"id":"bijou-karman","name":"Bijou Karman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bijou Karman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bijou-karman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bijou-karman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-olive","light-orange","orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Bijou Karman is an illustrator known for her distinctive style that blends contemporary and retro elements. Her work often features bold colors, stylized figures, and a whimsical, dreamlike atmosphere. Karman's illustrations are characterized by their unique blend of modern and vintage aesthetics, often incorporating floral motifs and fashion influences.","observation":"These portraits combine saturated red, green, black, and cream with strongly outlined, flattened shapes and visibly textured paint. Repeated floral backdrops, patterned clothing, animals, and decorative objects create dense, ornamental compositions, while stylized faces and assertive poses give the scenes an expressive graphic quality."},{"id":"victor-moscoso","name":"Victor Moscoso","cat":"illustrators","en":"Victor Moscoso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/victor-moscoso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/victor-moscoso","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-blue","blue","red","pink"],"intro":"Victor Moscoso is a renowned artist and graphic designer, best known for his vibrant and psychedelic poster art from the 1960s. He was a key figure in the San Francisco counterculture movement, creating iconic concert posters and album covers that captured the spirit of the era. Moscoso's work is characterized by its bold use of color, intricate patterns, and surreal imagery, often incorporating elements of pop art and optical illusions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly saturated coral, blue, pink, and yellow against near-black grounds, with stark flat color, heavy graphic contours, and visible granular print texture. Portraits and figures are integrated with concentric geometry, radial ornaments, dense decorative patterns, and surreal cosmic or architectural motifs."},{"id":"terry-isaac","name":"Terry Isaac","cat":"painters","en":"Terry Isaac","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/terry-isaac.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/terry-isaac","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","beige","dark-blue","bone-white"],"intro":"Terry Isaac is a renowned wildlife artist known for his realistic and detailed depictions of animals in their natural habitats. His work often focuses on the beauty and intricacy of the natural world, capturing the essence of wildlife through meticulous attention to detail and composition.","observation":"Across all four renders, wildlife is depicted with convincing anatomy and dense natural detail, using visible fine brushwork to model fur, feathers, bark, rocks, and reflected water. The subdued, cool woodland palette and shadowed backgrounds create a quiet, dreamy atmosphere while maintaining realistic animal forms and painterly surface texture."},{"id":"david-bromley","name":"David Bromley","cat":"painters","en":"David Bromley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-bromley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-bromley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","collage","drawing"],"colours":["pale-orange","black","ochre","brown","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"David Bromley is an Australian artist known for his vibrant and expressive paintings, often focusing on portraits and figurative work. His art blends elements of pop culture with a unique painterly style, capturing the essence of contemporary life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines expressive close-up portraiture with heavy black contour drawing, vivid red-and-blue accents, and visibly distressed painted surfaces. Cropped faces, poster-like graphic blocks, typography fragments, scratches, and layered paper textures create a dense retro editorial-collage effect."},{"id":"del-kathryn-barton","name":"Del Kathryn Barton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Del Kathryn Barton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/del-kathryn-barton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/del-kathryn-barton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","patterns","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["beige","red","black","muted-red","muted-blue","vivid-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Del Kathryn Barton is an acclaimed Australian artist known for her vibrant and detailed paintings that often explore themes of femininity and nature. Her work is characterized by intricate patterns, bold colors, and a surreal aesthetic that blends fantasy with reality.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed close-up portraiture with dense ornamental patterning, floral forms, textile-like surfaces, and surreal hybrid details. Vivid reds, corals, blues, pinks, and golds are reinforced by black negative pockets and strong fine linework, while painterly marks and layered decorative textures keep the images tactile and richly embellished."},{"id":"fred-calleri","name":"Fred Calleri","cat":"painters","en":"Fred Calleri","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fred-calleri.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fred-calleri","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["light-lime","black","ochre","dark-brown","muted-green","rust"],"intro":"Fred Calleri is a contemporary American artist known for his whimsical and nostalgic paintings that often depict scenes from mid-20th century America. His work is characterized by a blend of realism and imaginative elements, capturing the charm and simplicity of bygone eras with a modern twist.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents posed, character-focused portraits with carefully designed clothing, hats, props, and patterned backgrounds. Visible directional brushwork and softly textured paint give the faces, garments, and objects a rich hand-painted finish, while the muted palette and vintage styling unify the sheet."},{"id":"john-lautner","name":"John Lautner","cat":"architects","en":"John Lautner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-lautner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-lautner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","landscapes","urban","glow","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","dark-olive","beige","silver","ochre"],"intro":"John Lautner was an influential American architect known for his innovative and futuristic designs that seamlessly integrated with their natural surroundings. His work is characterized by organic forms, bold structures, and a visionary approach to residential architecture. Lautner's designs often feature expansive glass walls, curvilinear shapes, and a harmonious blend of indoor and outdoor spaces, reflecting a deep connection with the environment.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic architectural scenes with richly detailed tropical vegetation, warm timber, expansive glazing, and strong geometric roof forms. Saturated natural greens and warm sunlight create a cinematic, luminous atmosphere, while indoor and outdoor spaces flow together around pools, courtyards, and furnished living areas."},{"id":"victoria-frances","name":"Victoria Frances","cat":"illustrators","en":"Victoria Frances","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/victoria-frances.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/victoria-frances","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","brown","muted-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Victoria Frances is a Spanish illustrator known for her gothic and fantasy-themed artwork. Her work often features ethereal and mysterious elements, drawing inspiration from gothic literature and romanticism. Frances's art is characterized by its intricate detailing and dark, moody atmospheres, often depicting mythical and nature-infused themes.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, expressive portraiture with visible fine linear rendering, delicate painterly texture, and softly subdued natural colors punctuated by deep shadows and occasional red accents. Close-cropped faces, flowing hair, flowers, feathers, lace, and animal motifs create an ornate, dreamlike fantasy atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"andrew-ferez","name":"Andrew Ferez","cat":"illustrators","en":"Andrew Ferez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrew-ferez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrew-ferez","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","grey","rust","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Andrew Ferez is an illustrator known for his intricate and surreal artwork that often blends elements of fantasy and mythology. His work is characterized by detailed line work and a dreamlike quality that invites viewers into imaginative worlds.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible painterly strokes with dense, ornate detail and highly imaginative fantasy worldbuilding. Organic roots, monumental architecture, machinery, creatures, and atmospheric clouds merge into sculptural forms, while moody teal-and-rust colors are punctuated by strong internal glows."},{"id":"andy-marlette","name":"Andy Marlette","cat":"illustrators","en":"Andy Marlette","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andy-marlette.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andy-marlette","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","black","grey","vivid-red","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Andy Marlette is a contemporary cartoonist and illustrator known for his engaging and often humorous visual storytelling. His work often features a blend of satire and whimsy, capturing the imagination with bold lines and vibrant colors.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses graphic comic-book drawing with heavy black contour lines, flat saturated color fields, and dense ink hatching for texture and volume. Exaggerated anatomy, grotesque creatures, caricatured figures, and forceful action create an expressive, confrontational visual tone."},{"id":"paul-pelletier","name":"Paul Pelletier","cat":"illustrators","en":"Paul Pelletier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-pelletier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-pelletier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","dark-brown","grey","orange","red"],"intro":"Paul Pelletier is a renowned comic book artist known for his dynamic and detailed illustrations in the superhero genre. He has worked with major comic book publishers, contributing to popular series and characters. Pelletier's work is characterized by bold linework, vivid colors, and a keen eye for action-packed scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, visibly brushed fantasy imagery with elaborate organic textures, dramatic creatures, and imposing robed figures. Deep teal, brown, crimson, and black hues are punctuated by intense fire and magical light, creating high-contrast, ominous scenes with an epic, supernatural atmosphere."},{"id":"abigail-larson","name":"Abigail Larson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Abigail Larson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abigail-larson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abigail-larson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","deep-red","red","bone-white"],"intro":"Abigail Larson is an American illustrator known for her distinctive gothic and fantasy-inspired artwork. Her work often features dark, whimsical themes and intricate details, drawing inspiration from fairy tales, gothic literature, and the Victorian era.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses finely drawn, ink-like contours and dense illustrative detail to depict elegant, dramatically posed figures in elaborate dark clothing. A restrained palette of black, cream, olive, brown, and rust red, together with strong tonal contrast and flowing hair and fabric, creates a somber romantic mood."},{"id":"zhang-daqian","name":"Zhang Daqian","cat":"painters","en":"Zhang Daqian","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zhang-daqian.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zhang-daqian","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","mist","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-teal","muted-green","bone-white","cyan","white","orange"],"intro":"Zhang Daqian is a renowned Chinese painter known for his mastery in traditional Chinese painting techniques, particularly in ink and wash. Born in 1899, he is celebrated for his ability to blend classical Chinese styles with modern influences, creating works that are both timeless and innovative. His art often features landscapes, figures, and nature, capturing the essence of Chinese culture and aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive mountain and coastal landscapes are built from visible, gestural paint and ink washes, with fine dark branches and craggy rock marks punctuating broad atmospheric passages. Deep teal and charcoal masses contrast with pale mist and occasional warm orange light, producing a moody, dreamlike sense of immense terrain and weather."},{"id":"rupert-vandervell","name":"Rupert Vandervell","cat":"photographers","en":"Rupert Vandervell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rupert-vandervell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rupert-vandervell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","urban","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Rupert Vandervell is a contemporary photographer known for his striking black and white imagery that often explores urban environments and human figures within them. His work is characterized by a minimalist approach, focusing on the interplay of light and shadow to create dramatic and contemplative scenes.","observation":"The style is stark, high-contrast black-and-white photography built around geometric modernist architecture, hard sunlight, and long graphic shadows. Elegantly dressed figures recur as small moving accents within spacious urban compositions, giving the images a polished editorial and filmic atmosphere."},{"id":"clare-elsaesser","name":"Clare Elsaesser","cat":"painters","en":"Clare Elsaesser","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clare-elsaesser.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clare-elsaesser","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-cyan","muted-olive","dark-brown","red","black","orange"],"intro":"Clare Elsaesser is a contemporary artist known for her evocative and dreamlike paintings that often explore themes of femininity and nature. Her work is characterized by a soft, painterly style that combines elements of realism with surreal and introspective imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines expressive, painterly portraiture with visible fine brushwork, tactile surface texture, and carefully modeled faces, clothing, and animals. Saturated reds and oranges contrast with cool blue-green grounds, while cropped editorial compositions and decorative floral or rural settings give the images a polished fashion-illustration character."},{"id":"toshio-saeki","name":"Toshio Saeki","cat":"illustrators","en":"Toshio Saeki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/toshio-saeki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/toshio-saeki","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","patterns","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","pale-orange","muted-teal","muted-brown","dark-blue"],"intro":"Toshio Saeki is a Japanese artist known for his provocative and surreal illustrations that often explore themes of eroticism and horror. His work is characterized by a unique blend of traditional Japanese art with modern and subversive elements, making him a prominent figure in the underground art scene.","observation":"The style uses graphic, illustrative portraits with thick black contour lines, flat yet strongly contrasted color fields, and selective fine hatching for clothing, hair, and ornamental surfaces. Repeated black hair, red garments, pale faces, turquoise grounds, animals, and skull imagery create a dramatic, gothic mood while retaining a polished poster-like clarity."},{"id":"brett-walker","name":"Brett Walker","cat":"photographers","en":"Brett Walker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brett-walker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brett-walker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","portraits","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","collage","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Brett Walker is a photographer known for his distinctive style that often explores themes of identity and emotion through intense and evocative imagery. His work is characterized by a gritty realism and a focus on the human face, capturing raw and unfiltered expressions.","observation":"A stark black-and-white portrait style built from extreme close-ups, deep shadows, bright highlights, and pronounced grain. Faces are repeatedly disrupted by layered reflections, liquid-like distortions, scraped textures, and painterly or collage-like marks, creating an intense, fragmented mood."},{"id":"pablo-lobato","name":"Pablo Lobato","cat":"illustrators","en":"Pablo Lobato","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pablo-lobato.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pablo-lobato","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","pale-orange","red","muted-teal","light-orange"],"intro":"Pablo Lobato is an Argentine illustrator known for his distinctive and bold artistic style. His work often features geometric shapes and vibrant colors, drawing inspiration from modernist and pop art movements. Lobato's illustrations are characterized by their playful and imaginative nature, often depicting abstract portraits and mythical figures.","observation":"The style uses graphic, poster-like illustrations built from flat blocks of saturated red, black, cream, and teal, with strong geometric framing and heavy ink-like outlines. Repeated portraits, figures, and black cats are rendered with angular simplified forms, selective crosshatched detail, and a distressed grain that gives the otherwise clean shapes a vintage printed feel."},{"id":"tomi-ungerer","name":"Tomi Ungerer","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tomi Ungerer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tomi-ungerer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tomi-ungerer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-blue","pale-yellow","dark-ochre"],"intro":"Tomi Ungerer is a renowned French illustrator and author, celebrated for his unique and often provocative style. Born in 1931 in Strasbourg, Ungerer gained fame for his children's books, political posters, and satirical illustrations. His work is characterized by a blend of humor, social commentary, and a distinctive visual style that has influenced generations of artists.","observation":"The style uses bold, hand-drawn outlines and flat, strongly contrasting color fields, with scratchy internal marks that give the creatures tactile fur, scales, and ragged silhouettes. Across the scenes, oversized fantastical animals and eccentric humanoid figures create a darkly playful storybook mood, combining graphic simplicity with abundant expressive detail."},{"id":"millie-marotta","name":"Millie Marotta","cat":"illustrators","en":"Millie Marotta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/millie-marotta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/millie-marotta","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["red","bone-white","dark-green","olive","muted-blue"],"intro":"Millie Marotta is a renowned illustrator known for her intricate and nature-inspired artwork, often featuring detailed depictions of flora and fauna. Her work has gained popularity through adult coloring books, where her detailed line art invites creativity and relaxation.","observation":"The style combines densely packed botanical and animal subjects with finely drawn outlines, visible pencil-like strokes, and softly layered painted color. Saturated coral, pink, blue, green, and cream hues create an ornate tropical pattern, while the close cropping and repeated leaves and flowers make each composition feel like a richly illustrated textile or natural-history plate."},{"id":"serge-marshennikov","name":"Serge Marshennikov","cat":"painters","en":"Serge Marshennikov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/serge-marshennikov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/serge-marshennikov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Serge Marshennikov is a contemporary Russian artist known for his exquisite portraiture, focusing primarily on the female form. His work is characterized by a blend of classical techniques and modern sensibilities, often drawing comparisons to the romanticism of the 19th century. Marshennikov's paintings are celebrated for their delicate attention to detail, soft color palettes, and the serene, contemplative expressions of his subjects.","observation":"The style presents intimate, highly realistic portraits with softly modelled faces, restrained earthy whites and browns, and dramatic separation against near-black backgrounds. Visible fine brushwork gives the translucent gauze, frayed edges, loose hair, and skin a tactile, finely worked surface, while classical portrait compositions and direct gazes create a solemn, timeless mood."},{"id":"monica-bonvicini","name":"Monica Bonvicini","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Monica Bonvicini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/monica-bonvicini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/monica-bonvicini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","glow","high-contrast","subdued-colors","epic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","grey","silver","black","beige","white"],"intro":"Monica Bonvicini is an Italian contemporary artist known for her provocative and thought-provoking installations that often explore themes of architecture, power, and gender. Her work frequently incorporates industrial materials and challenges the viewer's perception of space and structure.","observation":"The style presents large-scale installation scenes as highly realistic, meticulously detailed architectural photographs, combining ornate historic interiors with industrial chains, chandeliers, and sculptural metal forms. Restrained neutral tones, strong daylight contrast, reflective surfaces, and luminous highlights give the spaces a cinematic, monumental presence."},{"id":"justin-gerard","name":"Justin Gerard","cat":"illustrators","en":"Justin Gerard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/justin-gerard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/justin-gerard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","charcoal","brown","silver","orange","olive"],"intro":"Justin Gerard is an illustrator known for his detailed and imaginative fantasy art, often featuring whimsical characters and mythical creatures. His work is celebrated for its intricate detailing and vibrant color palettes, drawing inspiration from classic fairy tales and folklore. Gerard's illustrations often depict fantastical worlds filled with adventure and wonder, capturing the imagination of audiences worldwide.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with densely layered natural textures, monumental fantasy figures, and expansive wilderness settings. Strong warm-versus-cool color contrasts, luminous skies, atmospheric mist, and dramatic scale give the scenes an epic, expressive storybook quality."},{"id":"mario-bava","name":"Mario Bava","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Mario Bava","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mario-bava.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mario-bava","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","crosshatching","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","deep-red","vivid-red","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Mario Bava was an influential Italian filmmaker known for his work in the horror genre, particularly in the 1960s and 1970s. He is often credited with pioneering the giallo film style, which combines elements of horror, mystery, and thriller. Bava's films are characterized by their atmospheric tension, innovative use of color and lighting, and a distinctive visual flair that has inspired many filmmakers.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces and eyes are rendered with forceful black contours, visible brush texture, ink-like hatching, and rough tonal buildup. Saturated reds, oranges, blue-greens, and deep blacks create stark contrast, while fragmented framing and exaggerated expressions give the portraits a dark, confrontational graphic-narrative character."},{"id":"martine-johanna","name":"Martine Johanna","cat":"painters","en":"Martine Johanna","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martine-johanna.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martine-johanna","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","floral","patterns","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-red","charcoal","red","muted-cyan","vivid-red"],"intro":"Martine Johanna is a contemporary Dutch artist known for her vibrant and emotive portraits that often explore themes of femininity and introspection. Her work is characterized by a blend of realism and surrealism, capturing the delicate balance between the real and the imagined.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, painterly close-up portraits with delicate visible linework and fine, layered brushstrokes. Saturated coral, turquoise, pink, cream, and blue hues unify the expressive faces, floral framing, patterned fabrics, and tightly cropped fashion-editorial compositions."},{"id":"jack-davison","name":"Jack Davison","cat":"photographers","en":"Jack Davison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-davison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-davison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Jack Davison is a contemporary photographer known for his innovative and experimental approach to portraiture and fine art photography. His work often explores themes of identity and human expression, utilizing techniques such as double exposure and high contrast to create striking visual narratives. Davison's photography is recognized for its emotive depth and unique style that challenges traditional boundaries.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome photography with deep blacks, pale fog, and strong tonal separation. Intimate portraits and distant solitary figures are framed cinematically, with windblown hair, obscured faces, shallow focus, and a bleak atmospheric shoreline setting."},{"id":"paul-kenton","name":"Paul Kenton","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Kenton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-kenton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-kenton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","dark-red","orange","red"],"intro":"Paul Kenton is a contemporary British artist known for his vibrant cityscapes and expressive use of color. His work often captures the dynamic energy of urban environments, blending impressionistic techniques with a modern sensibility. Kenton's paintings are celebrated for their bold compositions and vivid palettes, which bring to life the bustling atmosphere of cities around the world.","observation":"The style combines highly visible, broad paint strokes with scratched, energetic contour lines and dense layered detail. Saturated reds and blues cut through dark urban settings, while rainy reflections, traffic, figures, and close-up faces are rendered with a dramatic, expressive intensity."},{"id":"daniel-merriam","name":"Daniel Merriam","cat":"painters","en":"Daniel Merriam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daniel-merriam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daniel-merriam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","muted-ochre","silver","bone-white","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Daniel Merriam is an American artist known for his fantastical and surreal paintings, often featuring dreamlike architecture and whimsical characters. His work is characterized by intricate detail and a romantic, imaginative style that draws inspiration from Victorian and Edwardian aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly detailed, ornate fantasy architecture with elegant figures, elaborate costumes, gardens, and theatrical interiors. Fine linear detailing and painterly texture build dense layered surfaces, while a cool blue-green palette with coral and cream accents gives the scenes a dreamy, lavish, storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"marta-bevacqua","name":"Marta Bevacqua","cat":"photographers","en":"Marta Bevacqua","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marta-bevacqua.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marta-bevacqua","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","floral","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-brown","dark-green","silver"],"intro":"Marta Bevacqua is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and dreamlike imagery. Her work often explores themes of femininity and nature, capturing moments of serene beauty and delicate emotion. Bevacqua's photography is characterized by its soft focus, natural lighting, and detailed compositions, creating a sense of intimacy and whimsy.","observation":"The style uses intimate, highly realistic close-up portrait photography with natural skin texture, freckles, wet hair, and emotionally direct expressions. Subdued teal-green and earthy tones, cinematic framing, shallow focus, reflective water, and foreground foliage create a moody, tactile atmosphere across all four images."},{"id":"ridley-scott","name":"Ridley Scott","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Ridley Scott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ridley-scott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ridley-scott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-cyan","black","grey","brown","muted-ochre","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Ridley Scott is a renowned British filmmaker known for his work in the science fiction and historical drama genres. He has directed iconic films such as \"Alien,\" \" Blade Runner ,\" and \"Gladiator,\" which are celebrated for their visual style, storytelling, and innovative use of technology. Scott's films often explore themes of human struggle, technology, and the future, making him a pivotal figure in modern cinema.","observation":"The style is cinematic and photorealistic, built around immense icy landscapes, intimate weathered faces, and monumental surreal objects. Desaturated blue-green shadows, strong dark-to-light contrast, atmospheric mist, and isolated points of warm or luminous light create a bleak, epic sense of scale."},{"id":"andy-kehoe","name":"Andy Kehoe","cat":"illustrators","en":"Andy Kehoe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andy-kehoe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andy-kehoe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","charcoal","deep-rust","rust","dark-cyan"],"intro":"Andy Kehoe is an American artist known for his enchanting and surreal illustrations that often explore themes of fantasy and nature. His work is characterized by a unique blend of whimsy and darkness, creating immersive worlds filled with mythical creatures and dreamlike landscapes.","observation":"Across all four images, dense leafless forests and sparse figures or wolves are rendered with visible fine linear marks, textured brushwork, and a limited rust-orange and deep-teal palette. Strongly lit skies and near-black silhouettes create a brooding, folkloric atmosphere with recurring high contrast and layered woodland depth."},{"id":"hans-heysen","name":"Hans Heysen","cat":"painters","en":"Hans Heysen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-heysen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-heysen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","muted-blue","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Hans Heysen was an Australian artist renowned for his landscape paintings, particularly those depicting the Australian bush and eucalyptus trees. Born in 1877 in Germany, he emigrated to Australia as a child and became a leading figure in Australian art. Heysen's work is celebrated for its detailed and realistic portrayal of the natural environment, capturing the unique light and atmosphere of the Australian landscape.","observation":"The style is a richly painterly landscape treatment, with visible directional brushwork building eucalyptus bark, tangled foliage, rocky ground, and distant hills. Warm earth tones and softened blue skies create a classical, atmospheric pastoral scene, while dense natural detail and expressive strokes give the trees strong presence across all four views."},{"id":"erwin-blumenfeld","name":"Erwin Blumenfeld","cat":"photographers","en":"Erwin Blumenfeld","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erwin-blumenfeld.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erwin-blumenfeld","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","collage","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","muted-orange","grey","muted-brown","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Erwin Blumenfeld was a renowned German-American photographer known for his influential work in fashion photography during the mid-20th century. His innovative techniques and striking compositions made significant contributions to the visual language of fashion magazines, particularly in the 1940s and 1950s. Blumenfeld's work is characterized by its experimental approach, often incorporating elements of surrealism and modernism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped fashion portraits with detailed skin, hair, makeup, and fabric rendered in a cinematic photographic manner. Muted cool tones are punctuated by vivid red lipstick and clothing, while veils, overlapping exposures, shallow focus, grain, and strong directional shadows create a dreamy collage-like editorial mood."},{"id":"isaac-cruikshank","name":"Isaac Cruikshank","cat":"illustrators","en":"Isaac Cruikshank","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isaac-cruikshank.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isaac-cruikshank","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","classical","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["muted-ochre","brown","charcoal","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"Isaac Cruikshank was a Scottish painter and caricaturist known for his satirical prints and illustrations during the late 18th and early 19th centuries. He was part of a family of artists, including his son George Cruikshank , who also became a prominent figure in the world of caricature. Isaac's works often depicted social and political themes, using humor and exaggeration to comment on the society of his time.","observation":"The style combines densely populated historical scenes with finely drawn ink outlines, crosshatching, and restrained hand-colored tones. Elaborate costumes, architecture, gestures, and social activity create a richly detailed, expressive illustrated look with the visual character of an old colored engraving."},{"id":"susan-seddon-boulet","name":"Susan Seddon Boulet","cat":"painters","en":"Susan Seddon Boulet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/susan-seddon-boulet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/susan-seddon-boulet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","red","dark-brown","dark-blue","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Susan Seddon Boulet was an American artist known for her visionary and mythological paintings. Born in Brazil in 1941, she moved to the United States and became renowned for her unique style that blends fantasy, mythology, and spiritual themes. Her work often features intricate details, rich textures, and a deep connection to nature and the mystical world.","observation":"The style combines intensely rendered close-up portraits with visible fine brushwork, granular surface texture, and delicate linear detail in feathers, hair, fabric, and botanical forms. Deep blue, black, copper, and rust tones create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while ornamental layering and surreal facial adornments give the images a dreamlike, ceremonial quality."},{"id":"robert-swain-gifford","name":"Robert Swain Gifford","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Swain Gifford","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-swain-gifford.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-swain-gifford","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["black","white","bone-white","muted-ochre","brown","dark-brown","light-orange"],"intro":"Robert Swain Gifford was an American landscape painter known for his evocative depictions of nature. Born in 1840, he became a prominent figure in the Hudson River School and Luminism movements, capturing the serene beauty of the American wilderness with a focus on light and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four images, richly textured paint builds expansive landscapes of wooded hills, water, and open countryside beneath dramatic skies. Muted earth tones and deep shadows are repeatedly punctuated by glowing low sun, reflective water, and warm atmospheric light, creating a contemplative, dreamlike grandeur."},{"id":"andreas-gursky","name":"Andreas Gursky","cat":"photographers","en":"Andreas Gursky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andreas-gursky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andreas-gursky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["silver","black","grey","beige","brown","dark-rust"],"intro":"Andreas Gursky is a renowned German photographer known for his large-scale, high-resolution images that capture the complexity and vastness of contemporary landscapes and architecture. His work often explores themes of globalization, consumerism, and the human impact on the environment, using a detached and analytical approach to document the world.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic scenes with monumental scale, strong geometric architecture, and dense environmental detail. A restrained, slightly moody palette, atmospheric distance, and carefully staged gallery-like compositions recur across the mountain market, library, industrial city, and museum views, giving ordinary spaces a surreal sense of enormity."},{"id":"john-buscema","name":"John Buscema","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Buscema","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-buscema.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-buscema","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["white","beige","black","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"John Buscema is a renowned American comic book artist, best known for his work with Marvel Comics. He played a significant role in shaping the visual style of iconic characters like Conan the Barbarian and the Avengers. His dynamic compositions and powerful character designs have left a lasting impact on the comic book industry.","observation":"The style uses energetic black ink drawing with thick contour lines, dense hatching, and aggressively blocked shadows on pale paper. Grotesque muscular characters, dramatic expressions, and action-oriented poses create a dark, high-contrast comic-book intensity across both crowded scenes and close-up portraits."},{"id":"lucien-clergue","name":"Lucien Clergue","cat":"photographers","en":"Lucien Clergue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucien-clergue.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucien-clergue","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","silver","grey"],"intro":"Lucien Clergue is a renowned French photographer known for his pioneering work in the field of photography. He was a key figure in the development of modern photography in France and was closely associated with the avant-garde art scene. Clergue's work often explored themes of the human form, nature, and the interplay of light and shadow, earning him a significant place in the history of photography.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped, realistic black-and-white portrait photography with faces layered across the frame. Strong directional light creates hard bands of shadow and highlight, while visible grain and skin texture give the images a raw, tactile intensity."},{"id":"james-barnor","name":"James Barnor","cat":"photographers","en":"James Barnor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-barnor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-barnor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","urban","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["silver","charcoal","grey","dark-brown","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"James Barnor is a pioneering Ghanaian photographer known for his influential work capturing the vibrant culture and social changes in Ghana and the United Kingdom from the 1950s to the 1970s. His photography spans studio portraits, street photography, and photojournalism, highlighting the African diaspora and post-colonial identity.","observation":"A realistic, richly detailed fashion-photography style focused on posed Black models in vividly patterned clothing, sculptural hats, and sunglasses. Tropical urban settings, saturated color, strong sunlight, and vintage architectural and automotive details give the images a polished retro editorial character."},{"id":"georges-lepape","name":"Georges Lepape","cat":"illustrators","en":"Georges Lepape","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-lepape.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-lepape","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","muted-blue","charcoal","black","red"],"intro":"Georges Lepape was a French illustrator and designer known for his work in the early 20th century, particularly in fashion illustration and poster art. He was associated with the Art Deco and Art Nouveau movements, creating elegant and stylized images that captured the essence of Parisian culture and fashion. His illustrations often featured graceful figures, intricate patterns, and a refined use of color, contributing significantly to the visual culture of his time.","observation":"The style uses highly composed fashion portraits with flattened, clean-edged shapes, fine contouring, and dense decorative patterning in hats, garments, and accessories. A restrained blue, cream, black, and red palette combines with strong dark outlines and selective contrast, while textured surfaces and woodland backdrops give the illustrations a richly printed, vintage character."},{"id":"richard-corben","name":"Richard Corben","cat":"illustrators","en":"Richard Corben","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-corben.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-corben","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","landscapes","glow","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","vivid-red","dark-brown","red","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Richard Corben is an influential American illustrator and comic book artist known for his distinctive style that combines elements of fantasy, horror, and science fiction. His work is characterized by its bold use of color, surreal imagery, and detailed compositions, often exploring themes of the macabre and the fantastical. Corben's contributions to the comic book industry have earned him a dedicated following and critical acclaim.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, sculptural monumental forms with surreal cosmic landscapes and imposing humanoid faces. Saturated orange, red, teal, and violet hues, deep shadows, internal planetary glow, and visible grain create a dramatic retro science-fiction poster atmosphere."},{"id":"roger-bezombes","name":"Roger Bezombes","cat":"painters","en":"Roger Bezombes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-bezombes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-bezombes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["beige","vivid-red","dark-green","grey","yellow","dark-blue","magenta"],"intro":"Roger Bezombes was a French painter and sculptor known for his vibrant and colorful works that often incorporated elements of surrealism and abstraction. His art was characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a playful yet sophisticated approach to form and subject matter.","observation":"Across all four works, saturated floral and still-life imagery is built from energetic painted marks, thick dark contours, and sharply bounded blocks of color. Dense botanical detail and decorative patterns coexist with geometric collage-like planes, producing a vivid, expressive, hand-painted surface."},{"id":"harry-clarke","name":"Harry Clarke","cat":"illustrators","en":"Harry Clarke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harry-clarke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harry-clarke","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","muted-ochre","deep-blue","dark-red","orange","green"],"intro":"Harry Clarke is an Irish illustrator and stained glass artist known for his distinctive style that combines elements of Art Nouveau and Gothic Revival. Born in 1889, Clarke gained recognition for his intricate and richly detailed illustrations, often depicting fantastical and dark themes. His work in stained glass is celebrated for its vibrant colors and elaborate designs, making him a significant figure in early 20th-century art.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely ornamented figures and settings are built from fine ink-like contours, jewel-toned flat color, and intricate textile, floral, and stained-glass patterns. The compositions feel theatrical and dreamlike, combining pale portrait faces, heavy dark garments, lavish embellishment, and strong red-blue-black contrast."},{"id":"christian-dior","name":"Christian Dior","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Christian Dior","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-dior.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-dior","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","still-life","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors"],"colours":["beige","brown","muted-orange","black","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Christian Dior was a renowned French fashion designer, best known for founding the iconic fashion house Dior. He revolutionized women's fashion in the post-World War II era with his \"New Look,\" which emphasized femininity through cinched waists and full skirts. Dior's influence extended beyond clothing to perfumes and accessories, establishing a legacy that continues to shape the fashion industry.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic couture garments in an opulent exhibition setting, with intricate floral fabrics, layered tulle, sculptural silhouettes, and lavish chandelier interiors. Warm subdued lighting, reflective mirrors, shallow focus, and softly blurred background displays create a polished editorial and museum-display atmosphere."},{"id":"iurie-belegurschi","name":"Iurie Belegurschi","cat":"photographers","en":"Iurie Belegurschi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/iurie-belegurschi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/iurie-belegurschi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","epic"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","brown","grey","pale-orange","light-yellow"],"intro":"Iurie Belegurschi is a renowned photographer known for capturing the breathtaking landscapes of Iceland. His work often features dramatic natural scenes, showcasing the beauty and power of the environment.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and cinematic, presenting expansive volcanic landscapes with dense geological and ground detail. Moody blue-black terrain is repeatedly contrasted with saturated sunset light, reflective water, low cloud, and atmospheric mist to create an epic, dramatic wilderness mood."},{"id":"anders-zorn","name":"Anders Zorn","cat":"painters","en":"Anders Zorn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anders-zorn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anders-zorn","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","muted-brown","light-orange","silver","red"],"intro":"Anders Zorn is a renowned Swedish painter known for his masterful portraits and genre scenes, particularly those depicting the natural beauty and cultural life of his native Sweden. Born in 1860, Zorn's work is celebrated for its impressionistic style, characterized by loose brushwork and a keen attention to the effects of light and shadow. He gained international acclaim for his ability to capture the essence of his subjects with both realism and emotional depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from visible, directional paint strokes that model faces, fabric, foliage, and water with a richly textured surface. Warm ochres, creams, browns, blacks, and muted reds create a subdued, moody palette with strong light-dark separation, while cropped social scenes and portraits emphasize elegant figures, gestures, and atmospheric settings."},{"id":"rafael-moneo","name":"Rafael Moneo","cat":"architects","en":"Rafael Moneo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rafael-moneo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rafael-moneo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","epic","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","beige","bone-white","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Rafael Moneo is a renowned Spanish architect known for his innovative and modernist approach to architecture. He has made significant contributions to contemporary architecture with his designs that emphasize geometric forms, spatial harmony, and the integration of structures within their environments. Moneo's work often reflects a deep understanding of historical context while pushing the boundaries of modern design.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental architectural spaces with stark geometric masses, repeated columns, deep recesses, and carefully controlled perspective. Subdued stone and concrete tones are punctuated by warm terracotta surfaces, while strong directional sunlight creates high-contrast bands, long shadows, and a cinematic sense of scale around tiny human figures."},{"id":"yanjun-cheng","name":"Yanjun Cheng","cat":"various-artists","en":"Yanjun Cheng","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yanjun-cheng.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yanjun-cheng","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","grey","brown","dark-red","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Yanjun Cheng is a contemporary artist known for exploring themes of identity and emotion through digital media. Cheng's work often reflects a blend of traditional and modern influences, creating a unique visual language that resonates with audiences worldwide.","observation":"These close-up character portraits combine softly rendered facial features with clearly visible, layered brushwork in the hair, clothing, and surrounding accents. Saturated coral, turquoise, blue, and warm white highlights create an expressive, luminous, dreamlike finish against subdued gray-green grounds."},{"id":"peter-max","name":"Peter Max","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Max","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-max.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-max","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","motion","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","vivid-red","dark-olive","pink","rust","light-yellow"],"intro":"Peter Max is a German-American artist known for his vibrant use of color and psychedelic imagery. Emerging in the 1960s, Max became a prominent figure in the pop art movement, often incorporating elements of counterculture and cosmic themes into his work. His art is characterized by bold lines, vivid colors, and a unique blend of realism and fantasy, making him a significant influence in both the art world and popular culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, thick visible brushwork and built-up paint create highly tactile, expressive images that move between stylized landscapes, figures, and abstracted forms. Saturated orange, pink, blue, green, and yellow dominate, with strong contrasts, energetic gestures, and dreamlike compositions combining recognizable motifs with painterly distortion."},{"id":"rob-liefeld","name":"Rob Liefeld","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rob Liefeld","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rob-liefeld.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rob-liefeld","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","white","beige","black","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Rob Liefeld is a prominent American comic book artist and writer, best known for his work on titles such as 'X-Force' and 'Deadpool.' He gained fame in the 1990s for his dynamic and bold art style, characterized by exaggerated anatomy and energetic compositions. Liefeld is a co-founder of Image Comics, a company that revolutionized the comic book industry by giving creators more control over their work.","observation":"The style presents dramatic comic-book character studies with forceful contours, dense crosshatching, and energetic sketch-like marks on a pale paper ground. Most renders are monochrome with strong tonal contrast, while the single red-accented portrait retains the same ink-heavy, expressive construction and selectively vivid color."},{"id":"clara-peeters","name":"Clara Peeters","cat":"painters","en":"Clara Peeters","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clara-peeters.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clara-peeters","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","still-life","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Clara Peeters is a renowned 17th-century Flemish painter known for her exquisite still life works. She was one of the few female artists of her time to gain recognition, and her paintings are celebrated for their intricate detail and realistic portrayal of everyday objects, often featuring food, flowers, and ornate tableware.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly arranged still lifes are rendered with visible painterly texture, lifelike modelling, and dense small details. Dark backgrounds, restrained earthy colours, strong light-dark separation, reflective glass and metal, patterned porcelain, fruit, bread, fish, and draped linen create a somber, sumptuous presentation."},{"id":"mitch-dobrowner","name":"Mitch Dobrowner","cat":"photographers","en":"Mitch Dobrowner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mitch-dobrowner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mitch-dobrowner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","silver"],"intro":"Mitch Dobrowner is an acclaimed American photographer known for his striking black and white landscape photography. His work often captures the grandeur and power of natural phenomena, particularly storms and vast landscapes, with a focus on the American Southwest. Dobrowner's images are celebrated for their dramatic compositions and meticulous attention to detail, earning him numerous awards and exhibitions worldwide.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental storm landscapes in highly realistic monochrome, with dense cloud structure and sharply modelled atmospheric detail. Extreme black-and-white contrast, dramatic internal illumination, rain curtains, and expansive horizons create a dark, cinematic, epic sense of scale."},{"id":"michael-bay","name":"Michael Bay","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Michael Bay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-bay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-bay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Michael Bay is an American filmmaker known for his high-octane action films, characterized by explosive visual effects and dynamic cinematography. He has directed numerous blockbuster movies, including the \" Transformers \" series, which are renowned for their large-scale action sequences and visual spectacle.","observation":"Across the sheet, recognizable subjects are rendered with energetic, visibly worked paint: broad strokes, scraped passages, splatters, and fractured edges disrupt otherwise readable figures, buildings, machines, and landscapes. The style relies on strong dark-light separation and moody, cinematic color, combining dense surface detail with expressive abstraction and occasional futuristic imagery."},{"id":"vittorio-reggianini","name":"Vittorio Reggianini","cat":"painters","en":"Vittorio Reggianini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vittorio-reggianini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vittorio-reggianini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-brown","dark-olive","beige","black","bone-white","grey","red"],"intro":"Vittorio Reggianini was an Italian painter known for his detailed and elegant depictions of upper-class life during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His works often featured refined interiors and social gatherings, capturing the essence of the Victorian and Edwardian eras with a focus on fashion and decor. Reggianini's paintings are characterized by their academic realism and romantic style, with a meticulous attention to detail and a warm, inviting color palette.","observation":"The style combines richly visible paint handling with finely rendered faces, fabrics, lace, flowers, and carved furnishings. It presents elegant figures in opulent interiors through warm, restrained colors, strong light-dark structure, and highly composed portrait-like scenes."},{"id":"adam-hughes","name":"Adam Hughes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Adam Hughes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adam-hughes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adam-hughes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","rust","dark-brown","dark-red","light-orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Adam Hughes is a renowned American comic book artist and illustrator known for his work on titles such as Wonder Woman and Catwoman. His style is characterized by its attention to detail, dynamic compositions, and a focus on strong, glamorous female characters. Hughes's illustrations often feature a blend of realism and stylization, with an emphasis on expressive facial expressions and elegant poses.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with sharp fine linework and expressive facial modelling. Close-cropped fashion portraits combine vivid reds, blacks, and warm skin tones with strong contrast, graphic accessories, and assertive poses."},{"id":"john-pitre","name":"John Pitre","cat":"painters","en":"John Pitre","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-pitre.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-pitre","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["blue","dark-cyan","black","grey","light-orange","brown"],"intro":"John Pitre is an American artist known for his visionary and surrealistic paintings that often explore themes of fantasy and science fiction. His work is characterized by intricate details and a vivid color palette, creating immersive and otherworldly scenes that captivate the viewer's imagination.","observation":"These images use richly textured, painterly landscapes filled with immense cliffs, floating architecture, cloud seas, waterfalls, and tiny human figures that emphasize the monumental scale. Saturated turquoise, blue, coral, and orange hues combine with internal beams of light, luminous horizons, and atmospheric mist to create an epic, dreamlike fantasy world."},{"id":"katy-grannan","name":"Katy Grannan","cat":"photographers","en":"Katy Grannan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/katy-grannan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/katy-grannan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","landscapes","portraits","scenes","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","charcoal","muted-blue","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Katy Grannan is an American photographer known for her intimate and revealing portraits that often explore themes of identity and the human condition. Her work is characterized by a focus on natural lighting and a deep connection with her subjects, capturing their essence in a raw and honest manner.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed photographic scenes with carefully staged but naturalistic figures, strong sunlight, and long graphic shadows. Muted earth tones are punctuated by vivid reds and patterned clothing, while weathered architecture, open landscapes, and expansive skies create a quietly cinematic, editorial mood."},{"id":"paolo-veronese","name":"Paolo Veronese","cat":"painters","en":"Paolo Veronese","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paolo-veronese.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paolo-veronese","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-red","muted-brown","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Paolo Veronese was an Italian Renaissance painter known for his large-scale historical and religious paintings. Born in 1528 in Verona, he became one of the leading figures of the Venetian school of painting. Veronese's work is characterized by its vivid color palette, intricate compositions, and dramatic use of light and shadow. His masterpieces often depict grand scenes filled with figures, capturing the opulence and grandeur of the Venetian Republic.","observation":"Across the sheet, densely populated historical tableaux are rendered with visible painterly strokes, richly modelled figures, elaborate costumes, and heavily decorated architectural settings. Warm reds, browns, creams, and deep shadows create strong contrast, while expressive gestures and selective illumination give the scenes a theatrical, emotionally charged presence."},{"id":"andre-kohn","name":"Andre Kohn","cat":"painters","en":"Andre Kohn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andre-kohn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andre-kohn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","muted-brown","dark-brown","black","dark-red"],"intro":"Andre Kohn is a contemporary artist known for his expressive and elegant figurative paintings. His work often focuses on capturing the grace and beauty of the human form, particularly in moments of quiet reflection and solitude. Kohn's style is characterized by a blend of realism and impressionism, using fine brushstrokes and a rich, earthy color palette to create intimate and contemplative scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the scenes use visibly built-up paint with broad, directional strokes, scraped textures, and loose expressive edges. Rainy urban settings, cropped pedestrians, umbrellas, and reflective pavement recur in a restrained cream-and-brown ground punctuated by vivid red accents, giving the fashion-focused street tableaux a dynamic, dreamlike quality."},{"id":"takashi-miike","name":"Takashi Miike","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Takashi Miike","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/takashi-miike.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/takashi-miike","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","charcoal","dark-brown","rust","dark-red"],"intro":"Takashi Miike is a prolific Japanese filmmaker known for his diverse and often controversial body of work, spanning genres such as horror, thriller, and action. His films are characterized by their bold storytelling, intense themes, and unique visual style, often incorporating elements of violence and surrealism. Miike has directed over 100 films, including notable titles like 'Audition' and 'Ichi the Killer,' which have garnered international acclaim.","observation":"This style uses realistic, cinematic portrait imagery with extreme close-ups, selective focus, and strongly cropped compositions. Heavy red-blue lighting, deep shadows, visible film grain, wet textures, and distressed makeup create a dark, tense horror atmosphere across the sheet."},{"id":"junya-ishigami","name":"Junya Ishigami","cat":"architects","en":"Junya Ishigami","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/junya-ishigami.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/junya-ishigami","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","scenes","mist","painterly","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-olive","dark-olive","bone-white","olive","dark-green","rust"],"intro":"Junya Ishigami is a renowned Japanese architect known for his innovative and nature-inspired designs. His work often explores the boundaries between architecture and the natural environment, creating spaces that are both functional and poetic. Ishigami's approach is characterized by a minimalist aesthetic, where simplicity and complexity coexist, often incorporating elements like transparency and lightness.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly layered garden landscapes with pale architectural structures, abundant trees, flowers, and carefully clipped shrubs. Fine illustrative detail is softened by a dreamy, misty atmosphere and a lightly painterly, translucent treatment, creating airy depth and a quiet sense of spaciousness."},{"id":"jeff-wall","name":"Jeff Wall","cat":"photographers","en":"Jeff Wall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeff-wall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeff-wall","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","muted-brown","dark-brown","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Jeff Wall is a Canadian artist known for his large-scale backlit photographs and his pioneering work in conceptual photography. His work often explores themes of urban life, history, and social dynamics, blending elements of documentary and staged photography to create complex narratives.","observation":"The style is cinematic and naturalistic, presenting richly staged domestic scenes with carefully composed wide frames, period interiors, and candid human interactions. Muted green, brown, and amber tones, deep shadows, warm practical light, selective focus, and visible film grain give the images a nostalgic yet uneasy dramatic atmosphere."},{"id":"jacques-rivette","name":"Jacques Rivette","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Jacques Rivette","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacques-rivette.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacques-rivette","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","rust","dark-brown","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Jacques Rivette is a renowned French filmmaker, known for his influential work in the French New Wave movement. His films often explore themes of reality and fiction, characterized by their complex narratives and innovative storytelling techniques. Rivette's work is celebrated for its depth and the way it challenges conventional cinematic forms.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic portrait photography with intimate, tightly cropped faces and observational candid moments. Strong directional light, deep shadows, selective focus, and visible film grain create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, alternating monochrome frames with restrained warm color."},{"id":"susan-kare","name":"Susan Kare","cat":"designers","en":"Susan Kare","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/susan-kare.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/susan-kare","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","patterns","still-life","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","retro","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","grey"],"intro":"Susan Kare is an American graphic designer known for her pioneering work in the field of computer iconography. She played a crucial role in the development of the original Macintosh computer, creating many of its iconic interface elements and fonts. Her designs are celebrated for their simplicity, clarity, and functionality, which have left a lasting impact on digital design.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses crisp black outlines, flat white fields, and sparse monochrome pixel-like shading to depict isolated retro technology, plants, vehicles, and everyday objects. Fine geometric linework and carefully arranged icon-like objects create a detailed yet spacious catalog or sprite-sheet appearance."},{"id":"christopher-ryan-mckenney","name":"Christopher Ryan McKenney","cat":"photographers","en":"Christopher Ryan McKenney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christopher-ryan-mckenney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christopher-ryan-mckenney","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","grey","dark-brown","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Christopher Ryan McKenney is a contemporary photographer known for his surreal and conceptual imagery. His work often explores themes of identity, existence, and the uncanny, using photography as a medium to create thought-provoking visual narratives.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic photography with subdued, moody color grading, shallow focus, and atmospheric mist or smoke. Repeatedly centered veiled figures in neglected rural settings combine tactile period clothing and uncanny face coverings with surreal, dreamlike staging."},{"id":"greg-rucka","name":"Greg Rucka","cat":"illustrators","en":"Greg Rucka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-rucka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-rucka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","orange","red","beige"],"intro":"Greg Rucka is a renowned American comic book writer and novelist, known for his work on popular series such as \"Wonder Woman,\" \"Batman,\" and \"Lazarus.\" His storytelling often explores themes of justice, morality, and complex character dynamics, earning him a reputation for crafting compelling narratives within the superhero and crime genres.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses densely detailed comic-book illustration with forceful ink lines, crosshatched textures, expressive faces, and strongly posed costumed characters. Deep blacks and warm orange, red, and ochre accents create a high-contrast, darkly dramatic visual language with graphic panel-like compositions."},{"id":"louis-wain","name":"Louis Wain","cat":"painters","en":"Louis Wain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-wain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-wain","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["red","light-orange","grey","charcoal","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Louis Wain was an English artist known for his distinctive and whimsical illustrations of anthropomorphized cats. Born in 1860, Wain's work gained popularity in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, capturing the public's imagination with his playful and often surreal depictions of feline subjects. His art evolved over time, reflecting both his personal experiences and broader societal changes, and he remains a celebrated figure in the world of illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, directional brushstrokes to build shaggy cat fur, flowers, and swirling ornamental grounds. Saturated coral, teal, blue, green, and pink hues combine with exaggerated eyes and expressions, producing dense, decorative, surreal animal portraits."},{"id":"virgil-finlay","name":"Virgil Finlay","cat":"illustrators","en":"Virgil Finlay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/virgil-finlay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/virgil-finlay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","ink"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Virgil Finlay is a renowned American illustrator known for his intricate and detailed pen-and-ink drawings, primarily in the science fiction, fantasy, and horror genres. His work was prominently featured in pulp magazines during the mid-20th century, where he gained acclaim for his unique ability to blend fine art techniques with commercial illustration.","observation":"The style combines densely detailed, high-contrast black-and-white portrait imagery with fine engraved linework, crosshatching, stippling, and ink-like tonal texture. Faces, hands, animal traits, and cosmic motifs overlap in a surreal collage, producing an intense, grotesque, visually crowded effect."},{"id":"alasdair-gray","name":"Alasdair Gray","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alasdair Gray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alasdair-gray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alasdair-gray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","pale-orange","muted-blue","rust","dark-blue"],"intro":"Alasdair Gray is a renowned Scottish writer, artist, and cultural figure known for his unique contributions to literature and visual arts. His work often blends elements of fantasy and realism, exploring themes of identity, politics, and society. Gray's illustrations are characterized by intricate line work and imaginative compositions, reflecting his literary background and artistic vision.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses dense illustrative linework, cleanly bounded color areas, and strong, varied color to build highly detailed portrait scenes. Expressive faces and poses are embedded in richly cluttered interiors or decorative environments filled with books, textiles, objects, and architectural motifs."},{"id":"gianfranco-ferre","name":"Gianfranco Ferre","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Gianfranco Ferre","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gianfranco-ferre.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gianfranco-ferre","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","ochre","muted-olive","bone-white","dark-brown"],"intro":"Gianfranco Ferre is an Italian fashion designer known for his architectural approach to fashion design. Often referred to as the 'architect of fashion,' Ferre's work is characterized by its structured forms and innovative use of materials. He was a prominent figure in the fashion world, particularly noted for his time as the stylistic director of Christian Dior.","observation":"The style is polished, realistic fashion editorial imagery built around sculptural garments, tactile textiles, and carefully posed figures. Restrained dark and earthy tones, strong light-dark separation, expansive pale backgrounds, and unusual low or cropped viewpoints give the images a dramatic, cinematic presence."},{"id":"jocelyn-hobbie","name":"Jocelyn Hobbie","cat":"painters","en":"Jocelyn Hobbie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jocelyn-hobbie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jocelyn-hobbie","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","black","brown","muted-blue","deep-red","vivid-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Jocelyn Hobbie is an American artist known for her vibrant and intricate paintings that often explore themes of beauty and femininity. Her work is characterized by a blend of realism and surrealism, with a focus on detailed portraiture and decorative elements.","observation":"The style combines highly polished, illustrative portraiture with dense floral decoration and boldly patterned clothing. Saturated reds, blues, creams, and blacks create strong graphic contrast, while fine contours, controlled shading, and repeated botanical motifs give the compositions an ornate fashion-editorial character."},{"id":"patrick-demarchelier","name":"Patrick Demarchelier","cat":"photographers","en":"Patrick Demarchelier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patrick-demarchelier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patrick-demarchelier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Patrick Demarchelier is a renowned French fashion photographer known for his work with high-profile magazines and fashion houses. His photography is celebrated for its elegance, simplicity, and ability to capture the essence of his subjects, often featuring celebrities and models in iconic poses.","observation":"The style is a dark, highly realistic fashion-editorial portrait treatment built around monumental black garments, oversized feathered hats, ruffles, and sculptural silhouettes. Muted studio backgrounds, strong tonal separation, restrained black-and-ivory color, and carefully rendered textile textures give the portraits a dramatic, ornate, almost theatrical presence."},{"id":"greg-hildebrandt","name":"Greg Hildebrandt","cat":"illustrators","en":"Greg Hildebrandt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-hildebrandt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-hildebrandt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","rust","dark-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Greg Hildebrandt is an American artist known for his work in fantasy and science fiction illustration, often collaborating with his twin brother, Tim. The Hildebrandt brothers gained fame for their contributions to the \"Lord of the Rings\" calendars and various comic book covers, establishing themselves as prominent figures in the world of imaginative art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly layered, visibly brushed paint with fine directional strokes, dense costume and architectural detail, and highly expressive faces and gestures. Deep blue-violet shadows contrast with hot amber firelight and red fabrics, creating dramatic fantasy scenes with a dark, theatrical atmosphere."},{"id":"matt-rhodes","name":"Matt Rhodes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Matt Rhodes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-rhodes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-rhodes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","rust","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Matt Rhodes is a contemporary illustrator known for his work in the video game industry, particularly as a lead concept artist. His style is characterized by a strong narrative focus, often incorporating elements of fantasy and mythology.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines densely worked fantasy environments and figures with forceful dark linework, layered textures, and dramatic, expressive compositions. Saturated copper, orange, red, and deep blue-green hues are pushed into strong light-dark contrasts, with glowing suns, fires, and backlit skies creating an epic atmosphere."},{"id":"cory-loftis","name":"Cory Loftis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Cory Loftis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cory-loftis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cory-loftis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","dark-brown","beige","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Cory Loftis is a contemporary illustrator known for his work in animation and character design. He has contributed to various films and projects, showcasing a unique style that blends whimsical elements with detailed character portrayals.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional paint strokes to build richly textured figures, clothing, animals, and environments. Muted blue-gray, brown, black, and rust tones are punctuated by warm orange light, while expressive faces, dramatic poses, and fantasy character details create a brooding illustrated atmosphere."},{"id":"meredith-frampton","name":"Meredith Frampton","cat":"painters","en":"Meredith Frampton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/meredith-frampton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/meredith-frampton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["pale-yellow","grey","ochre","dark-ochre","charcoal","rust"],"intro":"Meredith Frampton was a British painter known for his precise and elegant portraits, often depicting figures with a serene and timeless quality. His work is characterized by meticulous attention to detail and a refined, neoclassical style that captures the essence of early 20th-century portraiture.","observation":"This style combines softly modeled, painterly portraiture with highly controlled illustrative composition, recurring women, pigeons, botanical forms, and carefully designed garments. Muted blue-gray, cream, rust, and ochre tones, fine linear detail, sculptural hairstyles, and close cropping create an elegant, theatrical, dreamlike fashion tableau."},{"id":"richard-anuszkiewicz","name":"Richard Anuszkiewicz","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Anuszkiewicz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-anuszkiewicz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-anuszkiewicz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["vivid-red","red","vivid-orange","magenta","ochre","muted-red","blue","olive"],"intro":"Richard Anuszkiewicz is an American painter known for his contributions to the Op Art movement. Born in 1930, he is celebrated for his vibrant use of color and geometric compositions that create optical illusions. His work often explores the interaction of colors and the visual effects they produce, making him a key figure in the development of perceptual art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from repeated concentric rectangular outlines arranged with strict geometric symmetry. Saturated, high-energy colors shift between nested bands while clean, fine lines and mostly flat fields create a graphic optical effect of depth and recession."},{"id":"david-burdeny","name":"David Burdeny","cat":"photographers","en":"David Burdeny","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-burdeny.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-burdeny","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["minimalist","landscapes","motion","flat-color","subdued-colors","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-cyan","silver","charcoal","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"David Burdeny is a Canadian photographer known for his stunning landscape and architectural photography. His work often explores themes of isolation and tranquility, capturing scenes with a unique sense of calm and balance. Burdeny has exhibited his work internationally, gaining recognition for his ability to transform ordinary scenes into extraordinary visual experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style reduces expansive coastal landscapes to sparse, flowing bands of water, sand, cloud, and horizon. Restrained blue-grey and sandy tones, broad empty areas, smooth gradients, and gently blurred motion create a quiet, dreamlike sense of abstraction."},{"id":"alisa-burke","name":"Alisa Burke","cat":"painters","en":"Alisa Burke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alisa-burke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alisa-burke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","charcoal","red","dark-brown","vivid-red","light-orange","olive","deep-blue"],"intro":"Alisa Burke is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and expressive art that often incorporates floral motifs and intricate patterns. Her work is characterized by a whimsical and imaginative style, blending elements of fantasy and surrealism with a focus on nature and femininity.","observation":"Across all four renders, expressive close-up portraits combine visible paint, translucent washes, splatters, and dense fine black linework. Vivid coral, turquoise, pink, blue, and orange shapes collide with floral and fashion-like motifs, producing a richly layered mixed-media illustration with surreal decorative intrusions."},{"id":"camilla-derrico","name":"Camilla d'Errico","cat":"illustrators","en":"Camilla d'Errico","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/camilla-derrico.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/camilla-derrico","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["light-pink","white","beige","orange","red","brown"],"intro":"Camilla d'Errico is a contemporary Canadian artist known for her unique blend of pop surrealism and fantasy illustration. Her work often features whimsical characters, vibrant colors, and intricate details, drawing inspiration from manga, comics, and nature.","observation":"This style combines highly detailed, softly painterly portraiture with fine, controlled brushwork and luminous pastel-bright color. Close-up feminine figures are consistently surrounded by flowers, butterflies, fantastical creatures, and elaborate hair, creating a dreamy botanical-fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"grant-wood","name":"Grant Wood","cat":"painters","en":"Grant Wood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/grant-wood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/grant-wood","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","bone-white","grey","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Grant Wood was an American painter best known for his works depicting the rural American Midwest. Born in 1891, Wood became a prominent figure in the Regionalism art movement during the early 20th century. His most famous painting, \"American Gothic,\" is a quintessential example of his style, characterized by its detailed and realistic portrayal of rural life.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, representational oil-paint rendering with visible fine brushwork, textured surfaces, and carefully modelled faces, clothing, buildings, and vegetation. Restrained earth tones, strong light-dark separation, formal frontal posing, and meticulously structured rural backgrounds give the portraits a solemn, iconic presence."},{"id":"christy-lee-rogers","name":"Christy Lee Rogers","cat":"photographers","en":"Christy Lee Rogers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christy-lee-rogers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christy-lee-rogers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-teal","grey","dark-red","muted-ochre","silver"],"intro":"Christy Lee Rogers is a contemporary photographer known for her distinctive underwater photography that combines elements of painting and photography. Her work often explores themes of beauty, movement, and the human form, capturing subjects submerged in water with a painterly aesthetic.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly surfaces with highly detailed, expressive portraits and flowing fabric, flowers, water, and vapor. Deep teal shadows, restrained jewel-like reds, strong contrast, and luminous highlights create a dark, dreamlike fantasy atmosphere across all four images."},{"id":"francisco-goya","name":"Francisco Goya","cat":"painters","en":"Francisco Goya","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francisco-goya.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francisco-goya","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Francisco Goya was a Spanish painter and printmaker, renowned for his dark and expressive works that often depicted the tumultuous social and political landscape of his time. Born in 1746, Goya's art evolved from cheerful and light-hearted themes to more somber and haunting subjects, reflecting his disillusionment with society. He is considered a precursor to modern art movements, influencing both Romanticism and Expressionism.","observation":"The style uses heavily textured, visible brushwork and broad, gestural strokes to model imposing figures and animals from deep shadow. Muted earth tones, dark teal grounds, and stark warm highlights create a grave, monumental mood, with expressive faces and horned forms presented like dramatic painted portraits."},{"id":"masami-teraoka","name":"Masami Teraoka","cat":"painters","en":"Masami Teraoka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/masami-teraoka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/masami-teraoka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","motion","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["pale-orange","black","beige","ochre","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Masami Teraoka is a Japanese-American contemporary artist known for his work that blends traditional Japanese ukiyo-e styles with modern themes. Born in 1936 in Japan, Teraoka's art often explores cultural and social issues, using a unique fusion of Eastern and Western artistic techniques.","observation":"The style combines finely drawn, highly ornamental figures with densely patterned garments, flowers, animals, and swirling natural forms. Saturated reds, blues, creams, and dark neutrals are bounded by delicate lines, while waves, hair, fabric, and foliage create continuous flowing motion across the compositions."},{"id":"chen-yifei","name":"Chen Yifei","cat":"painters","en":"Chen Yifei","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chen-yifei.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chen-yifei","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","dark-red","bone-white"],"intro":"Chen Yifei was a prominent Chinese artist known for his realistic and romanticized depictions of Chinese culture and history. His works often feature detailed portraits and scenes that reflect traditional Chinese aesthetics, capturing the essence of his cultural heritage through a refined and elegant style.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses visible, richly textured brushwork to model faces, fabric, jewelry, and dark interiors with a strongly painterly surface. Restrained earthy tones are punctuated by deep shadows and occasional red or ivory garments, while expressive poses and elaborate traditional clothing give the images a formal, dramatic character."},{"id":"paul-klee","name":"Paul Klee","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Klee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-klee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-klee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["red","rust","light-red","orange","grey","brown"],"intro":"Paul Klee was a Swiss-born German artist known for his highly individual style that was influenced by movements such as expressionism, cubism, and surrealism. Klee's work often features a playful and whimsical quality, characterized by his use of geometric forms, vibrant colors, and symbolic imagery. His art is celebrated for its imaginative and dreamlike qualities, often incorporating elements of fantasy and abstraction.","observation":"The style combines geometric abstraction with strongly simplified houses, faces, and architectural forms arranged as dense patchworks. Saturated coral, red, ochre, teal, blue, and pink areas are separated by dark drawn lines, while visible canvas texture and uneven paint surfaces keep the flat shapes tactile and handmade."},{"id":"aires-mateus","name":"Aires Mateus","cat":"architects","en":"Aires Mateus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aires-mateus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aires-mateus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","black","brown","dark-blue","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Aires Mateus is a renowned architectural firm based in Portugal, known for its minimalist and modernist approach to design. The firm, founded by brothers Manuel and Francisco Aires Mateus, has gained international recognition for its innovative and thoughtful architectural solutions that emphasize simplicity, functionality, and the harmonious integration of structures with their surroundings.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental pale-concrete structures dominate sparse landscapes and courtyards, with severe geometric planes, deep shadows, and tiny human figures establishing scale. The restrained earthy palette is punctuated by blue skies and warm low sunlight, while pools, trees, clouds, and long shadows add cinematic atmosphere and depth."},{"id":"nan-goldin","name":"Nan Goldin","cat":"photographers","en":"Nan Goldin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nan-goldin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nan-goldin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","bone-white","grey","rust"],"intro":"Nan Goldin is an influential American photographer known for her deeply personal and candid portraiture. Her work often explores themes of identity, intimacy, and the human condition, capturing moments of raw emotion and vulnerability. Goldin's photography is renowned for its vivid color palette and intimate, often autobiographical, subject matter, providing a window into the lives of her subjects and her own experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is candid, realistic portrait photography in a dark urban interior, with tightly cropped faces, spontaneous expressions, and documentary-like social moments. Warm red and amber light, deep shadows, reflective surfaces, shallow focus, and visible film grain create a nostalgic analog-nightlife look."},{"id":"mati-klarwein","name":"Mati Klarwein","cat":"painters","en":"Mati Klarwein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mati-klarwein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mati-klarwein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","landscapes","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","deep-rust","orange","rust","grey","deep-blue"],"intro":"Mati Klarwein is known for his visionary and surreal artwork, often blending cultural and spiritual themes. His work is characterized by intricate details, vibrant colors, and a fusion of various cultural influences, reflecting his diverse background and experiences.","observation":"The style combines densely layered painted imagery with intricate fine linework, ornamental framing, and highly saturated reds, blues, and golds. Monumental eyes, faces, animals, rivers, cities, and landscapes are arranged in dramatic symmetrical or radial compositions, with strong contrast and surreal spatial transformations."},{"id":"will-bullas","name":"Will Bullas","cat":"various-artists","en":"Will Bullas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/will-bullas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/will-bullas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","dark-rust","muted-cyan","black","ochre","dark-brown"],"intro":"Will Bullas is an American artist known for his humorous and whimsical watercolor paintings, often featuring animals in anthropomorphic settings. His work is characterized by a playful and imaginative approach, blending fine art techniques with a lighthearted perspective.","observation":"The style combines carefully rendered, painterly figures and animals with subtly rough, tactile surfaces and restrained earthy colors punctuated by strong reds and blues. Sparse stage-like settings, long shadows, unusual scale relationships, and anthropomorphic pairings create a quietly surreal, theatrical mood across the images."},{"id":"bob-coonts","name":"Bob Coonts","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bob Coonts","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-coonts.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-coonts","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","red","beige","dark-red","vivid-red","olive"],"intro":"Bob Coonts is an American artist known for his vibrant and colorful paintings, often featuring animals and nature. His work is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a playful, whimsical style that combines elements of realism with abstract forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly saturated color with energetic, visibly broad paint strokes and dark, emphatic linear contours. It treats portraits, animals, textiles, and flowers as densely layered decorative subjects, using angular planes, patterned surfaces, and dramatic contrast rather than naturalistic modeling."},{"id":"amy-sherald","name":"Amy Sherald","cat":"painters","en":"Amy Sherald","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amy-sherald.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amy-sherald","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","portraits","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["blue","black","green","red","bone-white","vivid-red"],"intro":"Amy Sherald is an American painter known for her distinctive portraits that explore themes of race and identity. Her work often features African American subjects depicted in a stylized, surreal manner with a focus on individuality and cultural pride. Sherald gained widespread recognition for her official portrait of former First Lady Michelle Obama, which exemplifies her unique approach to portraiture.","observation":"The style uses graphic, poster-like portraiture with vivid complementary colours, hard-edged shapes, and strongly simplified dark figures. Repeated stripes, checks, dots, foliage, hats, headwraps, and elaborate garments create an ornamental fashion-editorial language across the portraits, while high contrast keeps facial features and silhouettes striking."},{"id":"stefan-gesell","name":"Stefan Gesell","cat":"photographers","en":"Stefan Gesell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stefan-gesell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stefan-gesell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","charcoal","dark-red"],"intro":"Stefan Gesell is a contemporary photographer known for his dark and surreal imagery. His work often explores themes of fantasy and the macabre, blending human and natural elements in a unique and expressive manner.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped portraiture with dense tactile detail in skin, hair, grime, blood, and distressed fabric. Dark, desaturated color grading, strong contrast, and directional illumination create a grim, physically immediate atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"juliana-nan","name":"Juliana Nan","cat":"photographers","en":"Juliana Nan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/juliana-nan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/juliana-nan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","patterns","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["light-red","dark-cyan","muted-blue","red","brown","black"],"intro":"","observation":"Across all four renders, oversized flowers fill the frame with layered, visibly modeled petals and abundant fine brushwork. Saturated coral, blush, white, and teal hues combine with translucent, fluid contours and pockets of open background to create a luminous, dreamlike botanical style."},{"id":"giorgio-morandi","name":"Giorgio Morandi","cat":"painters","en":"Giorgio Morandi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giorgio-morandi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giorgio-morandi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","still-life","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","black","brown","silver","dark-brown"],"intro":"Giorgio Morandi was an Italian painter and printmaker known for his still life compositions, focusing on simple subjects like bottles, vases, and bowls. His work is characterized by a subtle use of color and a meticulous attention to form and composition, often conveying a sense of quiet introspection and timelessness.","observation":"Across all four renders, carefully arranged bottles and vessels form quiet still-life compositions on simple shelves and plinths. The subdued earth-tone palette, soft directional light, restrained backgrounds, and visible painted texture give the images a tactile, hand-rendered quality while preserving clear illustrative shapes."},{"id":"maxfield-parrish","name":"Maxfield Parrish","cat":"illustrators","en":"Maxfield Parrish","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maxfield-parrish.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maxfield-parrish","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","grain","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","blue","dark-blue","brown","orange","silver"],"intro":"Maxfield Parrish was an American painter and illustrator known for his distinctive saturated hues and idealized neo-classical imagery. His work often featured fantastical landscapes and figures, capturing a dreamlike quality that became highly popular in the early 20th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents expansive mountainous landscapes with monumental gnarled trees, towering clouds, and tiny solitary figures. Painterly texture, visible grain, deep shadowed silhouettes, and restrained blue-orange twilight create a cinematic, dreamlike atmosphere with strong scale and drama."},{"id":"georgia-okeeffe","name":"Georgia O'Keeffe","cat":"painters","en":"Georgia O'Keeffe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georgia-okeeffe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georgia-okeeffe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","grey","deep-red","charcoal","orange"],"intro":"Georgia O'Keeffe is a renowned American artist known for her distinctive paintings of enlarged flowers, New York skyscrapers, and New Mexico landscapes. Her work is celebrated for its clarity and precision, often focusing on the beauty of nature and the subtlety of form and color. O'Keeffe's style is characterized by a unique blend of realism and abstraction, making her one of the most significant figures in American modernism.","observation":"Across all four renders, landscapes are reduced to sweeping, simplified masses of mountains, dunes, cliffs, and clouds, with expressive contouring and a tactile painted surface. The style uses restrained earth tones, flat-edged color regions, and gentle internal shading to create graphic yet hand-painted scenery."},{"id":"barbara-chichester","name":"Barbara Chichester","cat":"various-artists","en":"Barbara Chichester","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barbara-chichester.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barbara-chichester","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","portraits","scenes","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","charcoal","muted-orange","dark-red","silver","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Barbara Chichester is an artist known for her vibrant and imaginative digital artworks that often explore themes of nature and fantasy. Her work is characterized by a blend of surreal and dreamy elements, creating a unique visual experience that captivates viewers.","observation":"The style combines highly rendered botanical, animal, and portrait imagery with visible painterly textures, layered surfaces, and ornamental floral framing. Rich reds, dusty blues, pale pinks, and muted greens create a lush but softened palette, while surreal juxtapositions and dreamlike compositions blend natural-history detail with decorative fantasy."},{"id":"martin-deschambault","name":"Martin Deschambault","cat":"illustrators","en":"Martin Deschambault","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-deschambault.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-deschambault","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-blue","charcoal","muted-blue","grey","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Martin Deschambault is a contemporary artist known for his work in the field of concept art and illustration, particularly within the science fiction genre. His art often explores futuristic themes and imaginative worlds, showcasing a blend of detailed environments and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad visible brushwork, layered texture, and energetic strokes give the landscapes a richly painterly, expressive finish. Monumental cliffs, castles, forests, and distant cities are staged as cinematic fantasy scenes, using saturated blues, greens, and orange light to emphasize scale, atmosphere, and adventure."},{"id":"jasmine-becket-griffith","name":"Jasmine Becket-Griffith","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jasmine Becket-Griffith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jasmine-becket-griffith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jasmine-becket-griffith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","deep-red","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Jasmine Becket-Griffith is a contemporary artist known for her distinctive style that blends elements of fantasy and gothic themes. Her work often features wide-eyed characters set in surreal and whimsical environments, drawing inspiration from fairy tales and pop culture.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, visibly brushed painting with polished illustrative forms, ornate costumes, floral framing, and intensely saturated jewel colors. Doll-like female portraits recur with oversized eyes, porcelain complexions, theatrical makeup, and whimsical storybook props, creating a romantic fantasy-surreal mood."},{"id":"nike-savvas","name":"Nike Savvas","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Nike Savvas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nike-savvas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nike-savvas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","fashion","patterns","urban","glow","fine-lines","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","orange","red","silver"],"intro":"Nike Savvas is an Australian contemporary artist known for her large-scale installations that explore the interplay of color, light, and space. Her work often involves the use of vibrant materials and dynamic forms, creating immersive experiences that challenge perceptions and engage viewers in a dialogue with the environment.","observation":"The style presents large-scale, immersive textile installations in realistically rendered gallery and industrial interiors. Dense fine lines form transparent grids, curtains, and draped volumes, with vivid color gradients, layered translucency, and strong architectural daylight creating luminous spatial effects."},{"id":"ivan-kramskoi","name":"Ivan Kramskoi","cat":"painters","en":"Ivan Kramskoi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ivan-kramskoi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ivan-kramskoi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Ivan Kramskoi was a prominent Russian painter and art critic, known for his role in the Peredvizhniki movement, which sought to bring art to the people by organizing traveling exhibitions. His work often focused on portraits and genre scenes, capturing the essence of Russian society in the 19th century with a deep sense of realism and emotional depth.","observation":"The style combines realistic, highly detailed portraiture with visible painterly texture in faces, hair, lace, and richly worked fabrics. Dark earthy tones, deep blacks, muted reds, and occasional metallic gold create a solemn classical atmosphere, while tightly framed figures and expressive, direct gazes give the images a dramatic presence."},{"id":"ludwig-bemelmans","name":"Ludwig Bemelmans","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ludwig Bemelmans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ludwig-bemelmans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ludwig-bemelmans","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","motion","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","dark-green","red","white","ochre"],"intro":"Ludwig Bemelmans was an Austrian-born American writer and illustrator, best known for his \"Madeline\" series of children's books. His work is characterized by a whimsical and playful style, often depicting scenes of Paris with a charming and humorous touch.","observation":"These scenes use vigorous, visible brushwork with broad strokes, loose dark contour lines, and richly layered but selectively simplified architectural and natural details. Saturated reds, greens, blues, and yellows give the urban streets, gardens, canals, and markets a lively expressive energy, while recurring figures, vehicles, flowers, and foliage create animated narrative scenes."},{"id":"andreas-franke","name":"Andreas Franke","cat":"photographers","en":"Andreas Franke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andreas-franke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andreas-franke","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","glow","mist","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-green","black","silver"],"intro":"Andreas Franke is an Austrian photographer known for his innovative and surreal underwater photography. He often combines elements of fantasy and reality to create dreamlike scenes that challenge perceptions and evoke a sense of wonder. His work frequently explores themes of isolation and beauty within decayed or submerged settings, capturing the imagination of viewers worldwide.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic cinematic tableaux of grand interiors submerged beneath water, combining decaying architecture, furniture, plants, books, fish and elegantly posed figures. Deep teal-green tones, shafts of underwater light, glowing particulate bubbles and atmospheric haze create a moody surreal sense of suspended time."},{"id":"john-george-brown","name":"John George Brown","cat":"painters","en":"John George Brown","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-george-brown.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-george-brown","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","grey","light-yellow","dark-rust"],"intro":"John George Brown is a renowned American painter known for his depictions of everyday life, particularly focusing on children and street scenes during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His works are celebrated for their detailed realism and sentimental portrayal of subjects, capturing the innocence and charm of childhood in a rapidly industrializing society.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, layered textures, and finely observed faces, clothing, wood, foliage, and sky. Subdued earth tones are shaped by strong light-dark contrasts, creating expressive rural narrative scenes with an old-fashioned, monumental character."},{"id":"robert-vonnoh","name":"Robert Vonnoh","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Vonnoh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-vonnoh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-vonnoh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","ochre","silver","grey","rust","pink"],"intro":"Robert Vonnoh was an American Impressionist painter known for his vibrant landscapes and portraits. Born in 1858, Vonnoh studied art in Paris and became associated with the Impressionist movement, bringing its techniques and styles back to the United States. His work is characterized by a focus on natural light and color, often depicting rural scenes with a lively and expressive brushwork.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, broken brushwork to describe gardens, trees, cottages, and figures with luminous natural detail. Saturated seasonal color, dappled sunlight, dense flowering vegetation, and softly idealized yet recognizable settings create a romantic, dreamlike garden atmosphere."},{"id":"dario-argento","name":"Dario Argento","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Dario Argento","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dario-argento.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dario-argento","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","portraits","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-brown","dark-red","deep-red","red"],"intro":"Dario Argento is an influential Italian filmmaker known for his work in the horror and thriller genres, particularly within the giallo subgenre. His films are characterized by their vivid use of color, suspenseful narratives, and intricate plots, often blending elements of horror with psychological tension. Argento's work has left a lasting impact on the horror genre, influencing filmmakers worldwide.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped, realistic portrait photography with saturated red gel lighting, occasional blue highlights, and deep near-black shadows. Heavy grain, shallow focus, glossy skin and lips, and confrontational close-up framing give the images a dark, cinematic, high-impact mood."},{"id":"wayne-barlowe","name":"Wayne Barlowe","cat":"illustrators","en":"Wayne Barlowe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wayne-barlowe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wayne-barlowe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","brown","muted-blue","deep-red","muted-red"],"intro":"Wayne Barlowe is an acclaimed American artist known for his imaginative and detailed depictions of alien worlds and creatures. His work often explores the boundaries of science fiction and fantasy, creating intricate and otherworldly visuals that captivate audiences. Barlowe's illustrations have been featured in books, films, and galleries, showcasing his unique ability to blend realism with the fantastical.","observation":"The style presents colossal, biologically strange creatures with heavily textured, brushworked surfaces and dense anatomical detail. Dramatic low-angle compositions, intense red-and-blue color contrasts, and tiny scale references create an ominous, surreal fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"eric-canete","name":"Eric Canete","cat":"illustrators","en":"Eric Canete","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-canete.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-canete","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","grey","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Eric Canete is an illustrator and comic book artist known for his dynamic and expressive style. His work often features intricate line work and a strong sense of motion, bringing characters and scenes to life with vivid detail. Canete has contributed to various comic book series and has a distinctive approach that blends elements of fantasy and science fiction.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses intricate black ink linework on an almost entirely white ground, with fine contour lines, crosshatched shadows, and sharply concentrated dark accents. It depicts expressive fantasy characters and creatures in dynamic, diagonally composed action tableaux, while generous untouched paper remains around the densely rendered forms."},{"id":"nickolas-muray","name":"Nickolas Muray","cat":"photographers","en":"Nickolas Muray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nickolas-muray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nickolas-muray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","ochre","red","dark-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Nickolas Muray was a Hungarian-American photographer known for his pioneering work in color portraiture during the early 20th century. He gained fame for his portraits of celebrities and public figures, capturing the glamour and elegance of the era. Muray's work is characterized by its vivid colors and refined compositions, contributing significantly to the development of modern fashion photography.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, realistic studio portraits with ornate floral interiors, elaborate clothing, and carefully staged props. Rich reds, creams, dark greens, and warm subdued tones create a moody vintage-glamour atmosphere, while directional lighting and shallow focus give the compositions a polished cinematic quality."},{"id":"helen-musselwhite","name":"Helen Musselwhite","cat":"various-artists","en":"Helen Musselwhite","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helen-musselwhite.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helen-musselwhite","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","landscapes","glow","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","dark-brown","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Helen Musselwhite is a contemporary British artist known for her intricate paper sculptures and layered works that often explore themes of nature and whimsy. Her art is celebrated for its detailed craftsmanship and imaginative compositions, drawing inspiration from the natural world and folklore.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly layered botanical forms, architecture, birds, and landscapes are arranged as highly detailed decorative tableaux. Clean graphic contours, dimensional cut-paper-like layering, deep blue-green grounds, and coral, cream, and orange accents create an ornate illustrative style with a dreamy storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"ravi-zupa","name":"Ravi Zupa","cat":"printmakers","en":"Ravi Zupa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ravi-zupa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ravi-zupa","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","epic"],"colours":["beige","light-orange","black","dark-brown","vivid-red","orange"],"intro":"Ravi Zupa is an American artist known for his eclectic style that combines elements from various cultures and historical periods. His work often features intricate details and a blend of traditional and contemporary techniques, drawing inspiration from printmaking, collage, and mixed media.","observation":"The style combines densely packed narrative imagery with ornate decorative surfaces, dramatic figures, animals, and sweeping action. Strong red, cream, black, and muted teal contrasts are organized through heavy ink-like outlines, flat illustrative color, intricate hatching, scrollwork, and poster-like framing."},{"id":"florence-harrison","name":"Florence Harrison","cat":"illustrators","en":"Florence Harrison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/florence-harrison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/florence-harrison","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","pale-orange","black","muted-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Florence Harrison is a renowned illustrator known for her work during the early 20th century, particularly in the Art Nouveau and Pre-Raphaelite styles. Her illustrations often depicted themes from mythology, fairy tales, and romantic poetry, characterized by their intricate details and delicate use of color. Harrison's work is celebrated for its ethereal quality and its ability to capture the imagination with its dreamlike and whimsical elements.","observation":"The style combines richly layered, visibly painted surfaces with fine illustrative linework, densely ornamented clothing, foliage, and flowers. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and creams create a vivid, high-contrast palette around idealized figures, while floral framing and scenic glimpses give the images a dreamy, fantastical romanticism."},{"id":"thomas-kinkade","name":"Thomas Kinkade","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Kinkade","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-kinkade.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-kinkade","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","brown","black","pale-orange","ochre"],"intro":"Thomas Kinkade is an American painter known for his idyllic and luminous landscapes, often depicting pastoral settings, cottages, and seascapes. His work is characterized by its use of light and color, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Kinkade's paintings are celebrated for their nostalgic and romantic qualities, resonating with a wide audience who appreciate his serene and comforting scenes.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly environments with fine visible brushwork, dense architectural and botanical detail, and expressive atmospheric lighting. Warm lanterns and windows glow against cool mist, blue-green shadows, and sunset skies, creating dreamy fantasy landscapes with layered depth and storybook grandeur."},{"id":"michael-hutter","name":"Michael Hutter","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Hutter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-hutter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-hutter","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","dark-olive","red","deep-rust","orange"],"intro":"Michael Hutter is a contemporary artist known for his intricate and surreal works that often blend elements of fantasy and dark humor. His art is characterized by detailed compositions and a unique fusion of historical and fantastical themes, drawing inspiration from European art traditions and mythological narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, fine linework with visibly textured, painterly surfaces and heavily ornamented forms. Muted blue-green and ochre grounds are punctuated by intense red-orange costumes and organic structures, creating elaborate fantasy scenes that feel surreal, monumental, and richly populated."},{"id":"augustus-edwin-mulready","name":"Augustus Edwin Mulready","cat":"painters","en":"Augustus Edwin Mulready","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/augustus-edwin-mulready.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/augustus-edwin-mulready","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","dark-red","rust"],"intro":"Augustus Edwin Mulready was a British painter known for his genre scenes and depictions of everyday life during the Victorian era. His works often portrayed the social conditions and domestic settings of 19th-century England, capturing the nuances of family life and community interactions with a keen eye for detail and narrative.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, layered surfaces, and finely modeled faces, clothing, animals, and masonry. Dark, earthy settings are punctuated by warm reds and selective highlights, while groups of figures are arranged as expressive narrative tableaux in rustic historical environments."},{"id":"issey-miyake","name":"Issey Miyake","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Issey Miyake","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/issey-miyake.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/issey-miyake","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","motion","fine-brushstrokes","vivid-colors","fantasy","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","grey","dark-red","black","brown","orange"],"intro":"Issey Miyake is a renowned Japanese fashion designer known for his innovative approach to clothing design, particularly his use of pleats and technology-driven fabrics. His work often blends traditional Japanese aesthetics with modern techniques, resulting in unique and forward-thinking fashion pieces that have influenced the global fashion industry.","observation":"The style presents fashion figures in a realistic studio setting, with garments treated as highly sculptural forms built from dense, finely ridged pleats. Saturated colors, sweeping fabric movement, unusual headwear, and generous neutral space create an expressive editorial look that balances wearable figures with fantastical silhouettes."},{"id":"harry-siddons-mowbray","name":"Harry Siddons Mowbray","cat":"painters","en":"Harry Siddons Mowbray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harry-siddons-mowbray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harry-siddons-mowbray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","dark-red","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Harry Siddons Mowbray was an American painter known for his murals and decorative work in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His style often incorporated classical themes and was influenced by the Renaissance and the Aesthetic Movement. Mowbray's work is characterized by its detailed and refined execution, often depicting allegorical and historical subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible fine brushwork modeling faces, hair, fabric, flowers, and reflective ornament. It favors closely framed female portraits and fashion scenes in subdued, moody interiors, combining elaborate costume and floral decoration with dense classical-looking detail."},{"id":"ilya-repin","name":"Ilya Repin","cat":"painters","en":"Ilya Repin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ilya-repin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ilya-repin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["brown","black","deep-red","muted-ochre","orange","red"],"intro":"Ilya Repin was a prominent Russian realist painter of the 19th century, known for his historical and social scenes. His works often depicted the lives of ordinary people, capturing the essence of Russian society and culture during his time. Repin's paintings are celebrated for their detailed realism and emotional depth, making him one of the most influential artists of his era.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with broad visible strokes, dense layered figures, and strongly modeled faces and fabrics. Dark interiors, warm reds, earthy browns, and sharp highlights create a dramatic devotional atmosphere, while elaborate garments, floral adornments, and architectural details give the scenes an ornate classical character."},{"id":"cuno-amiet","name":"Cuno Amiet","cat":"painters","en":"Cuno Amiet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cuno-amiet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cuno-amiet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","charcoal","muted-olive","muted-blue","bone-white"],"intro":"Cuno Amiet is a Swiss painter known for his vibrant use of color and contributions to modern art movements such as Post- Impressionism and Fauvism. Born in 1868, Amiet was a pioneer in Swiss modern art, often focusing on landscapes and portraits with a distinctive, expressive style. His works are celebrated for their bold color palettes and dynamic compositions, reflecting a deep appreciation for nature and human emotion.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses visible, directional paint strokes and built-up texture to render vivid landscapes with energetic, expressive color. Broad masses of coral, pink, blue, green, and violet are balanced by finer marks in trees, water, foliage, and architecture, creating richly textured pastoral and coastal scenes."},{"id":"melvin-sokolsky","name":"Melvin Sokolsky","cat":"photographers","en":"Melvin Sokolsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/melvin-sokolsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/melvin-sokolsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","backlighting","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","retro"],"colours":["beige","muted-green","dark-green","silver","brown","black","deep-red"],"intro":"Melvin Sokolsky is an American photographer known for his innovative and surreal fashion photography, particularly during the 1960s. His work often features models in whimsical and imaginative settings, utilizing creative techniques to produce striking and memorable images. Sokolsky's photography is celebrated for its unique blend of realism and fantasy, capturing the essence of fashion in a transformative way.","observation":"The style presents theatrical fashion tableaux with suspended or dynamically posed figures, oversized dresses, and carefully composed vintage interiors or streets. Cinematic framing, strong backlighting, selective red-and-green color accents, and occasional monochrome treatment create a surreal, retro editorial mood."},{"id":"david-downton","name":"David Downton","cat":"illustrators","en":"David Downton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-downton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-downton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["fashion","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","black","muted-orange","brown","rust"],"intro":"David Downton is a renowned British fashion illustrator known for his elegant and expressive portraits of high-profile figures in the fashion industry. His work is celebrated for its sophisticated style and has been featured in numerous prestigious publications and exhibitions worldwide.","observation":"The style combines elegant fashion portraiture with loose, visible brushwork, sketch-like contours, and broad black-and-white masses. Restrained cream, black, blush, and occasional red or orange accents create a refined editorial mood, while abundant blank ground and cropped poses keep the compositions airy and graphic."},{"id":"milton-caniff","name":"Milton Caniff","cat":"illustrators","en":"Milton Caniff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/milton-caniff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/milton-caniff","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","comics","erotic","ink"],"colours":["white","black","pale-yellow","silver","beige","charcoal"],"intro":"Milton Caniff was an influential American cartoonist known for his work on comic strips such as 'Terry and the Pirates' and 'Steve Canyon.' His storytelling and artistic style left a significant mark on the comic industry, particularly during the mid-20th century. Caniff's work is celebrated for its dramatic flair, expressive characters, and intricate line work, which contributed to the development of the adventure comic genre.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive comic-book illustration with strong black ink contours, dense shadow shapes, and crosshatched modelling on paper-like grounds. It consistently presents tightly cropped, sensual couples and character portraits with dramatic poses, fashionable clothing, and high-contrast monochrome treatment."},{"id":"dan-matutina","name":"Dan Matutina","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dan Matutina","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-matutina.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-matutina","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","characters","landscapes","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","charcoal","muted-teal","muted-yellow","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Dan Matutina is a Filipino illustrator and designer known for his distinctive style that blends geometric shapes with textured overlays. His work often features bold colors and a mix of digital and traditional techniques, creating a unique visual language that has been recognized internationally.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark geometric masses and tiny isolated figures to create surreal, monumental landscapes with strong contrasts and abundant atmospheric space. Saturated teal, rust, ochre, and coral are arranged in clean graphic blocks, while coarse grain and distressed surface texture give the flat shapes a tactile printed quality."},{"id":"robert-mangold","name":"Robert Mangold","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Mangold","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-mangold.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-mangold","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","minimalist","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","vivid-red","cream","white","pale-yellow","green"],"intro":"Robert Mangold is an American minimalist artist known for his geometric abstractions and use of subtle color palettes. He emerged as a significant figure in the 1960s, contributing to the development of minimalism and post-painterly abstraction. His works often explore the relationship between form, color, and space, using simple shapes and lines to create complex visual experiences.","observation":"The style uses pared-back geometric compositions built from circles, arcs, grids, and intersecting curves on square canvases. Strong red, yellow, and green fields contrast with cream grounds, while clean ruled outlines and subtly tactile painted surfaces combine graphic precision with restrained material texture."},{"id":"alicja-kwade","name":"Alicja Kwade","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Alicja Kwade","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alicja-kwade.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alicja-kwade","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","light-colors","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","white"],"intro":"Alicja Kwade is a contemporary artist known for her thought-provoking sculptures and installations that explore themes of perception, time, and reality. Her work often incorporates everyday materials transformed into enigmatic and surreal forms, challenging viewers to question their understanding of the physical world.","observation":"The style presents monumental rocks and architectural interiors with highly realistic textures, carefully controlled geometry, and a restrained earthy palette. Strong daylight creates crisp pools of illumination and deep shadows, while spacious compositions and sparse arrangements give the scenes a quiet, sculptural presence."},{"id":"christopher-shy","name":"Christopher Shy","cat":"various-artists","en":"Christopher Shy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christopher-shy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christopher-shy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","glow","mist","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-green","muted-teal","teal","dark-ochre"],"intro":"Christopher Shy is an American artist known for his work in graphic novels, concept art, and illustration. He is recognized for his distinctive style that blends elements of fantasy, horror, and science fiction, often exploring dark and surreal themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily textured, broad painterly strokes, deep teal-green shadows, and restrained rust-orange accents to create a brooding, dreamlike atmosphere. Figures and environments dissolve into mist, luminous turquoise patches, and expressive abstract marks, giving the scenes a spectral fantasy quality."},{"id":"peter-bagge","name":"Peter Bagge","cat":"illustrators","en":"Peter Bagge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-bagge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-bagge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","ink"],"colours":["black","light-orange","red","muted-blue","dark-brown","olive"],"intro":"Peter Bagge is an American cartoonist known for his influential work in the alternative comics scene, particularly during the 1980s and 1990s. His most notable creation is the comic series \"Hate,\" which captured the zeitgeist of Generation X with its satirical and often humorous take on contemporary life.","observation":"The style is a densely packed comic illustration built from expressive grotesque character portraits, heavy black ink contours, and clean flat color areas. Highly saturated colors, sharp contrast, exaggerated anatomy, and abundant facial details create a loud, chaotic collage-like visual rhythm across all four renders."},{"id":"tim-walker","name":"Tim Walker","cat":"photographers","en":"Tim Walker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-walker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-walker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","grey","brown","muted-red","charcoal","dark-red"],"intro":"Tim Walker is a renowned British fashion photographer known for his fantastical and elaborate photographic style. His work often features whimsical and dreamlike imagery, characterized by intricate set designs and imaginative narratives. Walker's photography has been featured in prestigious publications like Vogue, and he is celebrated for his ability to blend fashion with storytelling, creating images that are both visually stunning and conceptually rich.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, ornate fashion tableaux with realistic photographic rendering and a surreal, dreamlike theatricality. Elaborate garments, oversized headpieces, feathers, clouds, smoke, balloons, and antique interiors create visually rich scenes with saturated pastel accents and soft luminous atmosphere."},{"id":"carolee-schneemann","name":"Carolee Schneemann","cat":"various-artists","en":"Carolee Schneemann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carolee-schneemann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carolee-schneemann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","beige","charcoal","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Carolee Schneemann is a renowned American artist known for her pioneering work in performance art, experimental film, and the exploration of the human body. Her work often challenges traditional boundaries and addresses themes of sexuality, gender, and the female experience. Schneemann's groundbreaking approach has had a significant impact on contemporary art and feminist discourse.","observation":"The style combines intimate photographic portraiture with theatrical, surreal imagery and visibly layered mixed-media surfaces. Dramatic red and shadowed lighting, expressive faces, dense gallery details, and collage-like overlays give the sheet a moody, cinematic intensity."},{"id":"ernesto-neto","name":"Ernesto Neto","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ernesto Neto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernesto-neto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernesto-neto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","fashion","patterns","scenes","glow","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["deep-rust","ochre","dark-brown","rust","bone-white","dark-teal"],"intro":"Ernesto Neto is a Brazilian contemporary artist known for his large-scale, immersive installations that often incorporate organic forms and textiles. His work explores themes of nature, human interaction, and sensory experience, inviting viewers to engage with the art physically and emotionally.","observation":"Across all four renders, vast woven and knitted mesh forms create an immersive gallery-like environment of organic arches, columns, tunnels, and draped structures. Dense openwork textures, ornamental surface patterns, saturated warm colors, and light filtering through the fibers give the style a tactile, sculptural, dreamlike character."},{"id":"laura-makabresku","name":"Laura Makabresku","cat":"photographers","en":"Laura Makabresku","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laura-makabresku.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laura-makabresku","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","beige","brown","silver","muted-brown"],"intro":"Laura Makabresku is a contemporary Polish photographer known for her ethereal and surreal imagery. Her work often explores themes of fantasy, nature, and the human psyche, blending elements of romanticism and symbolism to create dreamlike narratives.","observation":"The style uses intimate, tightly cropped photographic portraits with shallow focus, soft candlelike illumination, and dark atmospheric backgrounds. Muted earthy colors, pale skin, tousled hair, delicate fabrics, flowers, and tactile interactions create a sensual, melancholy visual mood."},{"id":"henry-justice-ford","name":"Henry Justice Ford","cat":"illustrators","en":"Henry Justice Ford","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henry-justice-ford.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henry-justice-ford","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","pale-orange","silver","beige"],"intro":"Henry Justice Ford was a British illustrator and artist known for his work in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. He gained prominence for his illustrations in Andrew Lang's \"Fairy Books,\" where his detailed and imaginative depictions of mythological and fantastical scenes captured the Victorian fascination with fairy tales and legends. Ford's work is characterized by intricate line work and a romantic style that blends elements of fantasy and historical illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a densely detailed monochrome illustration built from fine ink lines, crosshatching, and strong black-and-white contrast. It presents theatrical, darkly atmospheric character scenes with elaborate costumes, expressive faces, crowded staging, and richly textured surfaces."},{"id":"william-eggleston","name":"William Eggleston","cat":"photographers","en":"William Eggleston","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-eggleston.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-eggleston","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["muted-cyan","black","dark-ochre","bone-white","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"William Eggleston is an influential American photographer known for his pioneering work in color photography. He played a crucial role in legitimizing color as a medium for fine art photography during the 1970s. Eggleston's work is characterized by its focus on the mundane and everyday aspects of life, often capturing the essence of the American South with a unique perspective that emphasizes color, composition, and the beauty of ordinary scenes.","observation":"The style is photographic and cinematic, presenting sunlit small-town streets with vintage cars, pedestrians, utility infrastructure, and carefully framed architectural details. Saturated reds and blues, deep shadows, warm late-day light, and a retro roadside atmosphere give the images a strongly nostalgic visual character."},{"id":"j-j-abrams","name":"J. J. Abrams","cat":"filmmakers","en":"J. J. Abrams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/j-j-abrams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/j-j-abrams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","moody-colors","subdued-colors","sci-fi","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","grey","vivid-red","red"],"intro":"J. J. Abrams is an American filmmaker known for his work in science fiction and action genres. He has directed and produced numerous films and television series, including popular franchises such as \"Star Wars\" and \"Star Trek.\" Abrams is recognized for his dynamic storytelling, innovative use of special effects, and ability to blend action with emotional depth.","observation":"The style combines filmic, realistic portraiture with atmospheric post-apocalyptic environments and recurring solitary figures. Muted earth tones, deep shadows, warm orange light, and selective painterly treatment create a brooding, dreamlike science-fiction mood across both photographic-looking and illustrated imagery."},{"id":"jean-antoine-houdon","name":"Jean-Antoine Houdon","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jean-Antoine Houdon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-antoine-houdon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-antoine-houdon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Jean-Antoine Houdon was a renowned French sculptor known for his neoclassical style and realistic portraiture. Active during the late 18th and early 19th centuries, Houdon created lifelike busts and statues of prominent figures such as Voltaire, George Washington, and Benjamin Franklin. His works are celebrated for their precise anatomical accuracy and expressive detail, capturing the essence of his subjects with remarkable skill.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic sculptural portraits with convincingly modelled marble and bronze surfaces, finely carved facial features, hair, and drapery. Restrained earth and stone tones, museum-like settings, dark backgrounds, and directional light create a solemn, high-contrast presentation with classical monumental framing."},{"id":"konstantin-makovsky","name":"Konstantin Makovsky","cat":"painters","en":"Konstantin Makovsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/konstantin-makovsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/konstantin-makovsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Konstantin Makovsky was a prominent Russian painter of the 19th century, known for his detailed and vibrant depictions of Russian history and society. He was a key figure in the Peredvizhniki movement, which sought to bring art to the people and often focused on social realism and historical themes. Makovsky's works are celebrated for their rich color palettes and intricate detailing, capturing the opulence and spirit of the Russian aristocracy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured oil-paint handling to depict closely framed female portraits in elaborate clothing and jewel-covered headdresses. Warm subdued colors, delicate facial modeling, layered brushwork, and dense surface ornament create a luxurious, classical costume-portrait appearance."},{"id":"marc-silvestri","name":"Marc Silvestri","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marc Silvestri","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-silvestri.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-silvestri","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","black","bone-white","beige","dark-red","rust"],"intro":"Marc Silvestri is a renowned American comic book artist and writer, best known for his work with Marvel Comics and as a co-founder of Image Comics. He gained fame for his dynamic and detailed illustrations in series like 'X-Men' and 'Wolverine,' and later for his own creations such as 'Cyberforce' and 'The Darkness.' Silvestri's style is characterized by its expressive line work and intricate detail, contributing significantly to the visual language of modern comics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, highly legible linework to build expressive fantasy characters, beasts, armor, hair, fur, and grotesque organic forms. Black ink-like contours and hatching create strong contrast, while selective saturated reds, oranges, teals, and greens intensify the dramatic, dark-fantasy imagery."},{"id":"dave-stevens","name":"Dave Stevens","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dave Stevens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dave-stevens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dave-stevens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["black","orange","dark-brown","bone-white","red","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Dave Stevens is an American illustrator and comic book artist best known for creating \"The Rocketeer.\" His work is celebrated for its detailed and dynamic style, often drawing inspiration from 1950s Americana and pin-up art. Stevens's illustrations are characterized by their vivid colors, intricate line work, and a blend of realism with stylized elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly textured paint with fine illustrative and ink-like contours, producing expressive, highly detailed character portraits. Saturated reds, blues, creams, and deep blacks create strong contrast, while glamorous styling, dramatic makeup, and fashion-focused poses give the images a polished editorial character."},{"id":"dion-lee","name":"Dion Lee","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Dion Lee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dion-lee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dion-lee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","grey","beige","brown"],"intro":"Dion Lee is an Australian fashion designer known for his innovative and architectural approach to clothing design. His work often features a blend of traditional tailoring with modern techniques, creating pieces that are both functional and aesthetically striking. Lee has gained international acclaim for his ability to merge structure with fluidity, often incorporating elements of geometry and minimalism into his collections.","observation":"The style is realistic, highly detailed fashion portraiture built around sculptural silhouettes, translucent fabrics, and sharply tailored geometric garments. Cool restrained tones, clean studio backgrounds, selective focus, and controlled high-contrast lighting give the images a polished editorial quality."},{"id":"gustave-boulanger","name":"Gustave Boulanger","cat":"painters","en":"Gustave Boulanger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-boulanger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-boulanger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","muted-brown","dark-brown","pale-orange","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Gustave Boulanger is a 19th-century French painter known for his academic style and historical subjects, often depicting scenes from ancient Rome and Greece. His works are characterized by meticulous attention to detail, classical themes, and a refined painterly technique.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, naturalistic oil-paint rendering with visible directional brushwork, carefully modelled figures, and dense costume and architectural detail. Warm earth tones, reds, creams, and deep shadows create an atmospheric, theatrical mood, while recurring women in elaborate draped garments are staged in ancient-looking settings with strong narrative poses."},{"id":"rineke-dijkstra","name":"Rineke Dijkstra","cat":"photographers","en":"Rineke Dijkstra","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rineke-dijkstra.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rineke-dijkstra","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["muted-cyan","black","beige","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Rineke Dijkstra is a renowned Dutch photographer known for her striking portraiture that captures the essence of her subjects with a blend of vulnerability and strength. Her work often explores themes of identity, transition, and the passage of time, focusing on individuals in moments of transformation or self-discovery. Dijkstra's portraits are celebrated for their honesty and the subtle interplay of emotion and environment.","observation":"A realistic, highly detailed editorial portrait style combines restrained blue-green surroundings with richly textured, vintage-inspired clothing. The subjects are posed with direct, serious expressions in carefully composed close-ups and full-body interior scenes, using soft photographic light and a muted, slightly melancholic palette."},{"id":"robert-munsch","name":"Robert Munsch","cat":"illustrators","en":"Robert Munsch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-munsch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-munsch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","drawing"],"colours":["ochre","bone-white","dark-ochre","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"Robert Munsch is a Canadian author known for his children's books, which have captivated young readers worldwide with their humor and heartwarming stories. His works often explore themes of family, childhood, and imagination, making them beloved classics in children's literature.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly colored, hand-painted illustration with fine ink-like outlines, visible brush texture, and densely observed clothing, faces, interiors, and outdoor settings. It favors lively narrative scenes populated by expressive children and animals, with warm, nostalgic storybook staging and animated gestures."},{"id":"alfred-stieglitz","name":"Alfred Stieglitz","cat":"photographers","en":"Alfred Stieglitz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-stieglitz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-stieglitz","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","scenes","urban","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Alfred Stieglitz was a pioneering American photographer and a key figure in the development of modern photography. He was instrumental in establishing photography as a recognized art form and was known for his contributions to the Photo-Secession movement. Stieglitz's work often focused on the interplay between the natural and urban environments, capturing the essence of early 20th-century America.","observation":"The style presents dramatic urban waterfront scenes in near-monochrome, with dense smoke, reflective water, and strongly backlit silhouettes creating stark tonal separation. Grain, atmospheric softness, period clothing, old vehicles, and monumental city architecture give the images a cinematic vintage-documentary appearance."},{"id":"bas-princen","name":"Bas Princen","cat":"photographers","en":"Bas Princen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bas-princen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bas-princen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","silver","brown","beige","orange"],"intro":"Bas Princen is a Dutch photographer known for his striking architectural and landscape photography. His work often explores the intersection of urban environments and natural landscapes, capturing the subtle interactions between human-made structures and their surroundings. Princen's photographs are characterized by their minimalist composition, precise framing, and an acute attention to detail, often highlighting the stark beauty of modernist architecture.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic architectural spaces with monumental concrete forms, precise geometry, and carefully controlled natural light. Muted earthy tones, deep shadows, reflective surfaces, and dense environmental detail create an austere yet atmospheric gallery-like mood across both interiors and framed urban or garden views."},{"id":"jeremiah-ketner","name":"Jeremiah Ketner","cat":"painters","en":"Jeremiah Ketner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeremiah-ketner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeremiah-ketner","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","bone-white","muted-teal","red","pink","blue","dark-green"],"intro":"Jeremiah Ketner is an American artist known for his whimsical and enchanting paintings that often feature dreamlike characters and vibrant colors. His work is characterized by a blend of pop surrealism and kawaii aesthetics, drawing inspiration from both Western and Japanese cultures.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional brushwork to build highly saturated portraits and floral compositions, with flowing hair, luminous accents, and richly layered botanical detail. The faces and small fantastical companions are idealized and expressive, combining polished rendering with a whimsical fairytale mood."},{"id":"garry-trudeau","name":"Garry Trudeau","cat":"illustrators","en":"Garry Trudeau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/garry-trudeau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/garry-trudeau","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","orange","silver","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Garry Trudeau is an American cartoonist best known for creating the comic strip 'Doonesbury.' His work is recognized for its satirical take on politics and culture, often blending humor with social commentary. Trudeau has been a prominent figure in the world of comics since the 1970s, earning numerous awards for his contributions to the art form.","observation":"The style uses densely packed comic-panel compositions with strongly outlined figures, expressive faces, and abundant small narrative details. Flat, slightly muted yet varied colors are reinforced by heavy ink contours, crosshatched shadows, and sharply separated areas of light and dark across urban, rural, and crowd scenes."},{"id":"barry-windsor-smith","name":"Barry Windsor-Smith","cat":"illustrators","en":"Barry Windsor-Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barry-windsor-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barry-windsor-smith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","dark-red","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Barry Windsor-Smith is a renowned British comic book illustrator and painter, known for his work on Marvel Comics' \"Conan the Barbarian\" and other titles. His style is characterized by intricate linework, detailed textures, and a blend of fantasy and realism, making him a significant figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, highly descriptive linework to build expressive character portraits, elaborate clothing, hair, armor, and crowded ornamental surroundings. Strong black contours, fine ink-like strokes, selective crosshatching, saturated reds and blues, and dramatic light-dark separation give the images an intense fantasy-illustration presence."},{"id":"thomas-theodor-heine","name":"Thomas Theodor Heine","cat":"illustrators","en":"Thomas Theodor Heine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-theodor-heine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-theodor-heine","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["silver","black","brown","beige","muted-orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Thomas Theodor Heine was a German painter, illustrator, and caricaturist, known for his work with the satirical magazine Simplicissimus. His style is characterized by its sharp wit, detailed line work, and often satirical undertones, reflecting the socio-political climate of early 20th-century Germany.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses stark black-and-white illustration with occasional restrained ochre and grey, heavy ink contours, dense crosshatching, and intricate engraved textures. Anthropomorphic animals and uncanny human-animal situations create a theatrical, surreal storybook mood, with strong silhouettes and densely composed scenes."},{"id":"chris-van-allsburg","name":"Chris Van Allsburg","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris Van Allsburg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-van-allsburg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-van-allsburg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Chris Van Allsburg is an American illustrator and writer known for his children's books, including \"The Polar Express\" and \"Jumanji.\" His work is characterized by its detailed pencil drawings and imaginative storytelling, often blending elements of fantasy and reality.","observation":"Across all four panels, richly detailed monochrome scenes combine ordinary domestic interiors with impossible changes of scale, floating environments, and isolated human figures. Strong light-dark contrasts, visible grain, atmospheric clouds, and carefully staged perspectives give the illustrative imagery a cinematic, dreamlike unease."},{"id":"russ-heath","name":"Russ Heath","cat":"illustrators","en":"Russ Heath","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/russ-heath.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/russ-heath","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","bone-white","grey","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Russ Heath was an American comic book artist known for his work in the mid-20th century, particularly during the Golden Age of Comics. He contributed significantly to war comics and was celebrated for his detailed and realistic style, which brought a unique depth to the comic book medium. Heath's work is characterized by its meticulous line work and dynamic compositions, often capturing the intensity and drama of the narratives he illustrated.","observation":"The style uses forceful, rough painterly strokes, heavy black contours, and strongly modeled faces and clothing to create dramatic wartime character imagery. Muted earth colors and occasional red accents contrast with stark monochrome panels, while dense textures, exaggerated expressions, and cropped close-up framing give the pictures a gritty vintage pulp-illustration feel."},{"id":"herb-ritts","name":"Herb Ritts","cat":"photographers","en":"Herb Ritts","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herb-ritts.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herb-ritts","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Herb Ritts was an influential American fashion photographer known for his iconic black-and-white portraits and editorial work. His photography often featured celebrities and models, capturing their elegance and charisma with a distinctive style that emphasized form and texture. Ritts's work is celebrated for its timeless quality and has been featured in numerous fashion magazines and exhibitions worldwide.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast portrait photography with tightly cropped faces, stark studio backgrounds, and intensely direct gazes. Fine skin texture, wet or tousled hair, glossy materials, dramatic makeup, and visible grain create a dark, tactile editorial mood."},{"id":"greg-capullo","name":"Greg Capullo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Greg Capullo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-capullo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-capullo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","dark-brown","pink","rust","dark-blue"],"intro":"Greg Capullo is an American comic book artist known for his work on titles such as 'Spawn' and 'Batman.' His dynamic and detailed style has made him a prominent figure in the comic book industry, influencing both peers and fans alike. Capullo's work is characterized by its bold linework, dramatic compositions, and a keen attention to muscular anatomy and shadow play.","observation":"Across all four images, imposing humanoid and monstrous figures are rendered with visible, energetic brushwork, scratchy contour marks, and heavily modeled dark forms. The style combines high-contrast theatrical lighting with intense color clashes, distorted anatomy, and expressive fantasy imagery."},{"id":"graciela-rodo-boulanger","name":"Graciela Rodo Boulanger","cat":"painters","en":"Graciela Rodo Boulanger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/graciela-rodo-boulanger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/graciela-rodo-boulanger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["brown","light-yellow","charcoal","ochre","red","silver"],"intro":"Graciela Rodo Boulanger is a Bolivian painter and printmaker known for her whimsical and colorful depictions of children and animals. Her work often features playful and imaginative scenes, characterized by a distinctive use of color and form that reflects her cultural heritage and personal style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines heavily textured, visibly painted surfaces with fine linear detail, patterned textiles, and collage-like decorative backgrounds. Pale, stylized figures with elongated features share the scenes with birds and other small objects, while saturated reds, blues, greens, and oranges create a whimsical, dreamlike surrealism."},{"id":"john-blanche","name":"John Blanche","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Blanche","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-blanche.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-blanche","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","cream","grey","black","brown","red"],"intro":"John Blanche is a renowned British illustrator and art director, best known for his work in the fantasy genre, particularly for Games Workshop. His distinctive style has influenced the visual identity of many fantasy games and publications, making him a pivotal figure in the development of modern fantasy art.","observation":"The style depicts grotesque fantasy figures and creatures assembled from bones, decayed anatomy, ragged fabric, feathers, and tangled organic fragments. Visible paint marks range from broad gestural sweeps to fine intricate strokes, combining muted blue-green grounds with rust-red accents, deep shadows, and intensely detailed surfaces."},{"id":"bo-bartlett","name":"Bo Bartlett","cat":"painters","en":"Bo Bartlett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bo-bartlett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bo-bartlett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["muted-cyan","grey","brown","light-yellow","rust","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Bo Bartlett is an American realist painter known for his large-scale works that explore themes of American life, culture, and identity. His paintings often feature a blend of realism and surrealism, capturing the essence of everyday scenes with a contemplative and introspective approach. Bartlett's work is characterized by its narrative quality, inviting viewers to delve into the stories behind the images.","observation":"The style combines realistic, expressive portraiture with visible painterly brushwork and richly modelled fabric, hair, skin, and feathers. Figures are staged against expansive coastal skies and sea horizons in a restrained blue, coral, ochre, and cream palette, with strong profile poses and carefully composed fashion details."},{"id":"guido-crepax","name":"Guido Crepax","cat":"illustrators","en":"Guido Crepax","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guido-crepax.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guido-crepax","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","fashion","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","retro","ink"],"colours":["black","white","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Guido Crepax is an Italian comic book artist known for his distinctive and influential work in the European comics scene. He gained fame for his character Valentina, a photographer whose stories often explored themes of eroticism and surrealism. Crepax's style is characterized by intricate line work, a cinematic approach to storytelling, and a focus on psychological depth.","observation":"A high-contrast black-and-white fashion illustration style, built from crisp ink contours, fine hatching, and dense crosshatched shadows. Dramatic close-up portraits, stylized bobbed hair, hats, fur, and patterned garments create an expressive retro editorial mood with strongly graphic silhouettes and selective facial detail."},{"id":"william-h-johnson","name":"William H. Johnson","cat":"painters","en":"William H. Johnson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-h-johnson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-h-johnson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","vivid-red","pale-orange","dark-blue","ochre"],"intro":"","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped portraits and figures in saturated blocks of red, blue, green, black, and ochre, with angular facial planes and emphatic dark contours. Visible, built-up brushwork gives the flat graphic shapes a tactile painted surface, while repeated faces, clothing patterns, and overlapping crops create a dense, expressive arrangement."},{"id":"cornell-capa","name":"Cornell Capa","cat":"photographers","en":"Cornell Capa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cornell-capa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cornell-capa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey"],"intro":"Cornell Capa was a renowned photographer known for his work in photojournalism and his dedication to capturing humanistic and socially relevant themes. Born in Hungary, he moved to the United States and became a prominent figure in documentary photography, often focusing on political and social issues. He was a member of Magnum Photos and played a significant role in preserving the legacy of his brother, Robert Capa.","observation":"Across all four images, stark black-and-white photography uses hard directional light, deep shadows, and sharply cut silhouettes to create an intense, filmic atmosphere. Rough architectural spaces frame solitary or partially concealed figures, while candid gestures, unusual viewpoints, and visible grain give the scenes a documentary yet psychologically charged quality."},{"id":"becky-cloonan","name":"Becky Cloonan","cat":"illustrators","en":"Becky Cloonan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/becky-cloonan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/becky-cloonan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","vivid-red","brown","muted-cyan","light-orange"],"intro":"Becky Cloonan is an acclaimed comic book artist and writer known for her work on titles such as \"Gotham Academy\" and \"The Punisher.\" She has a distinctive style characterized by intricate line work and a gothic aesthetic, often exploring themes of fantasy and the supernatural.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses graphic ink-like contouring, flattened color blocks, and dense directional marks to create intense, expressive faces and flowing hair. A restricted palette of near-black, coral red, orange, and teal produces stark contrast, while tangled branches, flowers, and hair add layered ornamental texture around the figures."},{"id":"duane-hanson","name":"Duane Hanson","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Duane Hanson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/duane-hanson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/duane-hanson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","muted-orange","beige","muted-brown","orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Duane Hanson is an American sculptor known for his hyperrealistic sculptures depicting ordinary people in everyday settings. His work often explores themes of consumerism, social issues, and the human condition, capturing the essence of American life in the 20th century. Hanson's sculptures are characterized by their meticulous attention to detail and life-like appearance, often using materials such as fiberglass and resin to achieve a striking realism.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic photography with carefully staged everyday tableaux, understated retro clothing, and richly readable fabric and prop details. Wide compositions leave generous negative space around casually posed characters, while warm subdued colors and directional light create a gently theatrical, high-contrast atmosphere."},{"id":"darren-aronofsky","name":"Darren Aronofsky","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Darren Aronofsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/darren-aronofsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/darren-aronofsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","beige","dark-red","dark-olive"],"intro":"Darren Aronofsky is an acclaimed American filmmaker known for his intense and often surreal storytelling. His films frequently explore themes of obsession, identity, and the human condition, with a distinctive visual style that combines realism with dreamlike elements. Aronofsky's work is characterized by its psychological depth and innovative narrative techniques, making him a prominent figure in contemporary cinema.","observation":"The style combines painterly, visibly directional brushwork with expressive portraiture and surreal transformations, repeatedly merging human figures with flames, smoke, water, flowers, and fragmented textures. A dark teal, charcoal, and ember-red palette, strong light⁠–dark separation, and isolated pale backgrounds give the images a dramatic, dreamlike intensity."},{"id":"tang-yau-hoong","name":"Tang Yau Hoong","cat":"designers","en":"Tang Yau Hoong","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tang-yau-hoong.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tang-yau-hoong","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","glow","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark","dreamy","silhouette"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-cyan","muted-cyan","blue","silver"],"intro":"Tang Yau Hoong is a Malaysian artist and illustrator known for his clever use of negative space and minimalist design. His work often explores themes of nature, surrealism, and human interaction with the environment. He has gained recognition for his ability to convey complex ideas through simple yet powerful imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dark teal-blue scenes with stark silhouettes, luminous internal light sources, and strongly separated highlights and shadows. Familiar landscapes and tiny human figures are combined with impossible scale shifts and floating or submerged elements, giving the images a cinematic, surreal dream quality with visible grain."},{"id":"norm-breyfogle","name":"Norm Breyfogle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Norm Breyfogle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norm-breyfogle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norm-breyfogle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","brown","muted-orange","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Norm Breyfogle was an American comic book artist known for his work on Batman during the late 1980s and early 1990s. His dynamic and expressive style contributed significantly to the visual identity of the character, blending elements of realism with bold, illustrative techniques. Breyfogle's work is celebrated for its dramatic compositions and detailed line work, which brought a unique intensity to the superhero genre.","observation":"The style is dense, graphic comic-book illustration built from heavy ink contours, flat saturated color blocks, and forceful black shadow shapes. Exaggerated faces, costumes, monsters, and action fragments crowd the compositions, with strong contrast, energetic diagonals, and abundant fine interior hatching creating a dark, surreal intensity."},{"id":"hans-hollein","name":"Hans Hollein","cat":"architects","en":"Hans Hollein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-hollein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-hollein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","glow","metallic"],"colours":["brown","muted-blue","dark-brown","grey","ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Hans Hollein was an Austrian architect and designer known for his innovative and postmodern architectural works. He was a key figure in the development of modern architecture in the 20th century, blending art and architecture in unique ways. Hollein's work often challenged traditional architectural norms, incorporating elements of sculpture and design to create bold and futuristic structures.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is photographic and highly realistic, focused on monumental contemporary architecture and urban scenes. Polished metallic cladding, curved forms, and mirrored surfaces catch warm sunlight and reflect surrounding buildings, producing a sculptural, cinematic cityscape with strong geometric structure."},{"id":"christopher-corr","name":"Christopher Corr","cat":"illustrators","en":"Christopher Corr","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christopher-corr.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christopher-corr","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","charcoal","pink","dark-blue","orange","grey"],"intro":"Christopher Corr is a contemporary British artist known for his vibrant and colorful illustrations. His work often features whimsical and fantastical elements, drawing inspiration from folk art and cultural traditions. Corr's unique style is characterized by a playful use of color and pattern, creating joyful and imaginative scenes that captivate viewers.","observation":"A densely packed painted collage of stylized animals and flowers uses vivid, saturated colors, geometric simplification, and repeated decorative motifs. Thick dark outlines, flat color blocks, and clearly visible brush marks give the figures a graphic yet handmade, expressive character."},{"id":"alberto-vargas","name":"Alberto Vargas","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alberto Vargas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alberto-vargas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alberto-vargas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["cream","orange","pale-orange","rust","dark-brown","black"],"intro":"Alberto Vargas was a Peruvian-American painter known for his iconic pin-up art, particularly during the 1940s and 1950s. His work became synonymous with the glamour and allure of Hollywood, capturing the essence of mid-20th-century beauty standards. Vargas's illustrations were celebrated for their elegance, sensuality, and detailed artistry, often featuring glamorous women in stylish poses.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style presents glamorous female beauty portraits with carefully rendered faces, luxuriant curled hair, polished makeup, and occasional floral adornment. Visible brush texture and delicate contour drawing combine with softly modeled skin, warm muted colors, and cream paper-like grounds, giving the images a refined vintage fashion-illustration character."},{"id":"stanley-donwood","name":"Stanley Donwood","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stanley Donwood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stanley-donwood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stanley-donwood","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","beige","vivid-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Stanley Donwood is a British artist known for his distinctive and evocative artwork, particularly his collaborations with the band Radiohead. His work often explores themes of nature, dystopia, and the interplay between the organic and the man-made, using a unique blend of traditional and digital techniques.","observation":"Across all four images, stark black-and-white landscapes are disrupted by intense red accents, with heavy drawn lines and broad, visibly worked paint creating a rough, tactile surface. Repeated stripes, warped contours, solitary figures, and exaggerated natural forms give the scenes a surreal, ominous atmosphere."},{"id":"richard-burlet","name":"Richard Burlet","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Burlet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-burlet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-burlet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","collage","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-red","bone-white","beige","blue"],"intro":"Richard Burlet is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and intricate portraits. His work often combines elements of collage and mixed media to create detailed and ornamental compositions. Burlet's art is characterized by its bold use of color and textural contrasts, drawing inspiration from art deco and modern portraiture.","observation":"The style combines highly cropped fashion portraits with oversized geometric hats, strong red-blue-black color blocking, and intense eye-level contrasts. Painterly surface texture, cracked and distressed materials, decorative patterned fragments, and layered rectangular collage elements give the otherwise clean illustrative forms a richly tactile, vintage editorial quality."},{"id":"lee-friedlander","name":"Lee Friedlander","cat":"photographers","en":"Lee Friedlander","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-friedlander.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-friedlander","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Lee Friedlander is an influential American photographer known for his innovative work in the field of street photography. Born in 1934, Friedlander has been recognized for his ability to capture the complexity and chaos of urban environments, often using reflections and shadows to create layered compositions. His work is characterized by a documentary style that offers a unique perspective on American life, particularly during the 1960s and 1970s.","observation":"A monochrome photographic style built around stark tonal separation, deep shadows, and bright reflected highlights, with visible grain reinforcing its vintage character. Framing through car windows and mirrors creates layered, cinematic urban scenes, while selective focus, close portraits, and unusual reflections give the images a tense, observational mood."},{"id":"peter-elson","name":"Peter Elson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Peter Elson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-elson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-elson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-blue","brown","dark-blue","bone-white","grey","ochre","pink"],"intro":"Peter Elson was a renowned British science fiction illustrator known for his intricate and imaginative depictions of futuristic spacecraft and alien worlds. His work, primarily from the late 20th century, has been celebrated for its technical precision and vivid storytelling, often gracing the covers of popular science fiction novels.","observation":"The style presents expansive science-fiction environments with cinematic scale, realistic textures, saturated color, and strong warm-cool contrast. Monumental alien landscapes, spacecraft, moons, and explorers are rendered with detailed surfaces, dramatic atmospheric lighting, and a sense of movement and adventure."},{"id":"charles-burton-barber","name":"Charles Burton Barber","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Burton Barber","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-burton-barber.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-burton-barber","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","pale-yellow","muted-ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Charles Burton Barber is a renowned 19th-century English painter known for his charming and sentimental depictions of children and animals. His work is characterized by its detailed realism and warm, affectionate portrayal of domestic life, often capturing the tender interactions between young children and their pets. Barber's paintings are celebrated for their technical skill and ability to evoke emotion, making them beloved examples of Victorian art.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and realistic, with visible fine brushwork modelling faces, fur, lace, wood, and velvet. Warm subdued colors, deep shadows, and selective highlights create intimate, densely populated domestic scenes featuring children and dogs in carefully rendered period interiors."},{"id":"luis-barragan","name":"Luis Barragan","cat":"architects","en":"Luis Barragan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luis-barragan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luis-barragan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-red","muted-blue","red","black"],"intro":"Luis Barragan was a renowned Mexican architect known for his modernist designs that blend traditional Mexican elements with minimalist aesthetics. His work is characterized by bold colors, geometric forms, and an emphasis on light and shadow, creating spaces that are both functional and visually striking. Barragan's architecture often incorporates natural elements, reflecting his belief in the harmony between built environments and nature.","observation":"The style presents sunlit architectural courtyards as crisp, realistic scenes built from monumental geometric planes, saturated pinks, reds, and oranges, and strong angular shadows. Reflective pools, staircases, textured stucco, and sparse vegetation add detailed surface interest while the repeated axial framing and clear blue skies create a cinematic, graphic sense of order."},{"id":"bill-sienkiewicz","name":"Bill Sienkiewicz","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bill Sienkiewicz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-sienkiewicz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-sienkiewicz","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","vivid-red","charcoal","ochre","bone-white","dark-blue"],"intro":"Bill Sienkiewicz is an American artist known for his groundbreaking work in comic book illustration, particularly during the 1980s. His innovative style blends traditional comic art with fine art techniques, creating a unique and expressive visual language. Sienkiewicz has worked on a variety of notable titles, including \"Elektra: Assassin\" and \"New Mutants,\" and is celebrated for his ability to push the boundaries of comic art.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style relies on aggressive, visibly layered brushwork, scraped surfaces, and gestural marks that partially dissolve facial features into dark abstract masses. Saturated reds, oranges, blues, and blacks create a stark, brooding contrast, while fragmented anatomy and overlapping shapes give the portraits an intense, surreal character."},{"id":"george-shaw","name":"George Shaw","cat":"painters","en":"George Shaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-shaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-shaw","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","grain","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"George Shaw is a contemporary British artist known for his detailed and realistic paintings of suburban landscapes. He often captures the quiet, overlooked corners of urban and suburban environments, bringing attention to the mundane and the everyday. His work is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail and a somber, reflective mood, often evoking a sense of nostalgia and melancholy.","observation":"The style is realistic and filmic, with subdued blue-green darkness offset by warm amber streetlights and reflections. Wet roads, bare trees, light mist, and fine grain create a moody atmospheric treatment across both urban park scenes and quieter wooded roads."},{"id":"jules-olitski","name":"Jules Olitski","cat":"painters","en":"Jules Olitski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jules-olitski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jules-olitski","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","ornate","patterns","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["vivid-red","deep-red","white","dark-magenta","muted-orange","dark-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Jules Olitski was an American abstract painter known for his innovative use of color and texture. Born in Russia in 1922, Olitski became a prominent figure in the Color Field movement, contributing significantly to post-painterly abstraction. His work is characterized by its vibrant colors, ethereal quality, and dynamic compositions, often exploring the interplay of light and space.","observation":"The style is abstract and painterly, built from saturated red, orange, indigo, and crimson fields with soft gradients, broad gestural marks, and visibly textured pigment. Organic masses, dark silhouettes, and irregular edges recur across the canvases, balancing dense expressive areas against expanses of luminous color and negative space."},{"id":"cathy-locke","name":"Cathy Locke","cat":"painters","en":"Cathy Locke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cathy-locke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cathy-locke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-brown","muted-teal","red","light-orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"Cathy Locke is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and expressive portraiture. Her work often explores themes of identity, emotion, and personal narratives, utilizing a blend of realism and abstraction to convey depth and complexity.","observation":"Across the portraits, figures, architecture, and watery landscapes, the style relies on visible directional brushwork, textured paint, and expressive, loosely defined edges. Saturated teal, vermilion, coral, and orange are set against deep shadows, with luminous candles and reflected light creating a dramatic, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"axel-vervoordt","name":"Axel Vervoordt","cat":"designers","en":"Axel Vervoordt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/axel-vervoordt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/axel-vervoordt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","silver"],"intro":"Axel Vervoordt is a renowned Belgian interior designer and art dealer known for his minimalist and timeless design philosophy. He has a distinctive approach that blends Eastern and Western aesthetics, often incorporating elements of wabi-sabi and zen into his work. Vervoordt's style emphasizes natural materials, subtle textures, and a harmonious balance between space and objects, creating environments that are both serene and introspective.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, carefully composed interior photography with abundant architectural and material detail. Restrained earthy colors, dramatic daylight and shadow, aged masonry, timber, stone, ceramics, and linen create a dark, atmospheric blend of monumental industrial space and minimalist furnishing."},{"id":"russell-young","name":"Russell Young","cat":"various-artists","en":"Russell Young","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/russell-young.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/russell-young","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","portraits","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","halftone"],"colours":["black","red","orange","beige","brown"],"intro":"Russell Young is a contemporary British-American artist known for his large-scale silkscreen paintings that explore themes of fame, celebrity, and cultural identity. His work often features iconic figures from popular culture, rendered in bold and striking compositions that draw on the aesthetics of pop art and postmodernism.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped glamour portraits with graphic, high-contrast treatment, shifting between vivid pink, warm color, and stark black-and-white. Visible grain, halftone-like dot texture, glittering highlights, and emphatic dark features give the images a retro printed-poster quality."},{"id":"peter-nottrott","name":"Peter Nottrott","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Nottrott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-nottrott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-nottrott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["light-orange","silver","muted-red","red","blue","charcoal"],"intro":"Peter Nottrott is a contemporary German artist known for his vibrant and expressive abstract paintings. His work often features dynamic compositions and bold color palettes, drawing inspiration from nature and the emotional impact of color and form.","observation":"The style is built from vigorous, highly visible broad brushstrokes and thick impasto-like ridges, with colors dragged and fanned into explosive radial movement. Saturated coral, orange, turquoise, blue, pink, and lavender passages create an expressive abstract surface that occasionally incorporates a sharply rendered portrait without losing the surrounding painterly turbulence."},{"id":"pieter-bruegel-the-elder","name":"Pieter Bruegel the Elder","cat":"painters","en":"Pieter Bruegel the Elder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pieter-bruegel-the-elder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pieter-bruegel-the-elder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","muted-olive","ochre","silver","red"],"intro":"Pieter Bruegel the Elder was a renowned Flemish painter of the 16th century, celebrated for his detailed and vivid depictions of peasant life and landscapes. His works often contained moral allegories and were characterized by their intricate compositions, filled with numerous figures and bustling scenes. Bruegel's paintings are a testament to the Northern Renaissance , blending realism with imaginative elements.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, old-master-like painting with subdued earthy color, fine brushwork, and densely populated scenes. It combines landscapes, village life, animals, food, and human activity into crowded narrative vignettes, often arranged as uncanny composite juxtapositions with a weathered, cracked surface."},{"id":"martin-schongauer","name":"Martin Schongauer","cat":"printmakers","en":"Martin Schongauer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-schongauer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-schongauer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","portraits","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","classical","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","brown"],"intro":"Martin Schongauer was a German engraver and painter from the 15th century, known for his detailed and intricate engravings. His work is characterized by fine lines and a high level of detail, often depicting religious and mythological themes. Schongauer's engravings were influential in the development of printmaking in Europe and inspired later artists such as Albrecht Dürer.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed monochrome ink drawing on a warm, antique paper ground, with delicate contour lines, dense hatching, and crosshatching shaping faces, fabric, animals, and architecture. It combines classical-looking portrait studies and elaborate fantastical scenes with grotesque composite figures, ornamental details, and surreal visual juxtapositions."},{"id":"jacques-monory","name":"Jacques Monory","cat":"painters","en":"Jacques Monory","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacques-monory.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacques-monory","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["black","blue","dark-blue","deep-blue"],"intro":"Jacques Monory was a French painter and filmmaker known for his contributions to the narrative figuration movement. His work often explored themes of violence, death, and the passage of time, characterized by a cinematic style and a distinctive blue color palette.","observation":"Across all four images, broad visible brushwork builds nocturnal urban and garden settings in a strongly unified deep-blue palette. High contrast, wet reflections, isolated figures, and small pools of warm or pink light create atmospheric, cinematic scenes with a quiet sense of movement and solitude."},{"id":"yener-torun","name":"Yener Torun","cat":"photographers","en":"Yener Torun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yener-torun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yener-torun","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","dark-brown","muted-blue","rust","orange","green"],"intro":"Yener Torun is a contemporary photographer known for his vibrant and geometric compositions that explore urban landscapes. His work often highlights the interplay between architecture and human presence, focusing on the minimalist and colorful aspects of cityscapes. Torun's photography captures the essence of modern urban environments, emphasizing symmetry, bold colors, and clean lines.","observation":"The style presents brightly painted urban apartment facades in a realistic, sharply composed photographic manner. Strong geometric blocks, repeated windows, hard sunlight, and deep shadows create graphic structure, while occasional pedestrians add scale and quiet narrative movement."},{"id":"ryohei-hase","name":"Ryohei Hase","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ryohei Hase","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryohei-hase.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryohei-hase","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-teal","beige","grey","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"Ryohei Hase is a contemporary Japanese illustrator known for his intricate and surreal artwork that often blends fantasy and reality. His work is characterized by a unique style that merges detailed realism with dreamlike, otherworldly elements, creating a distinctive visual narrative.","observation":"Across all four renders, pale rabbit-like creatures and human-animal figures emerge from deep teal darkness in dense, visibly brushed layers. The style relies on turbulent flowing fur, expressive anatomy, dramatic diagonals, muted cool colors with occasional red warmth, and a dreamlike but ominous fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"anne-redpath","name":"Anne Redpath","cat":"painters","en":"Anne Redpath","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-redpath.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-redpath","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","scenes","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","rust","blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Anne Redpath is a renowned Scottish painter known for her vibrant and expressive works, often depicting domestic interiors and landscapes. Born in 1895, she became a prominent figure in the Scottish art scene, celebrated for her unique use of color and texture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from visible oil-paint strokes and a textured, layered surface, with expressive marks defining flowers, buildings, vessels, and distant terrain. A restrained blue-gray palette is punctuated by red and orange accents, while loosely composed landscapes and still lifes share the same tactile brushwork and softly atmospheric treatment."},{"id":"kazumasa-nagai","name":"Kazumasa Nagai","cat":"designers","en":"Kazumasa Nagai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kazumasa-nagai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kazumasa-nagai","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","landscapes","patterns","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","blue","dark-blue","vivid-red","pink","light-yellow"],"intro":"Kazumasa Nagai is a renowned Japanese graphic designer known for his innovative and bold visual style. His work often incorporates elements of surrealism and fantasy, characterized by vibrant colors and intricate patterns. Nagai's designs have significantly influenced modern graphic design, particularly in Japan, where his unique approach has left a lasting impact.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines flat graphic shapes, dense stippled grain, intense coral-and-blue color, and stark black grounds. Repeated arches, rings, stripes, and radiating paths create symmetrical or strongly centered surreal landscapes with monumental organic forms and tiny figures for scale."},{"id":"dan-mcpharlin","name":"Dan McPharlin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dan McPharlin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-mcpharlin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-mcpharlin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","glow","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","vivid-rust","grey","vivid-orange","orange"],"intro":"Dan was born in Adelaide, Australia in 1977. After studying Visual Arts at university he began working as an independent artist and designer. Working across various media, he developed a unique style of work that drew on early modernism, science ﬁction, surrealism and victoriana.","observation":"The style presents dramatic, realistic science-fiction landscapes with monumental rock formations, tiny explorers, spacecraft, and enormous celestial bodies. Strong geometric compositions, expansive negative space, saturated orange-and-teal color contrasts, and hard directional light create a cinematic sense of scale and isolation."},{"id":"mondo-guerra","name":"Mondo Guerra","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Mondo Guerra","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mondo-guerra.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mondo-guerra","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","orange","red","beige","muted-blue","pink","light-lime"],"intro":"Mondo Guerra is an American fashion designer known for his innovative and bold designs. He gained fame as a contestant on the reality TV show \"Project Runway,\" where his unique style and creative approach to fashion were widely recognized. Guerra's work often features vibrant colors, intricate patterns, and a playful mix of textures, reflecting his personal flair and artistic vision.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly graphic portraiture with crisp heavy outlines, flat yet richly layered color blocks, and selective modeled shading. Saturated reds, pinks, turquoise, orange, and black-and-white contrasts combine with dense fashion, jewelry, hair, and tattoo details in a retro pin-up-inspired presentation."},{"id":"elsa-bleda","name":"Elsa Bleda","cat":"photographers","en":"Elsa Bleda","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elsa-bleda.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elsa-bleda","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","dark-green","muted-teal","dark-brown","cyan","vivid-red"],"intro":"Elsa Bleda is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and moody urban landscapes, often capturing the enigmatic beauty of nighttime cityscapes. Her work frequently explores themes of solitude and introspection, using color and light to create a dreamlike atmosphere.","observation":"A cinematic, realistic style built around dim urban interiors and exterior views, with teal-green ambient darkness contrasted by warm amber and red practical lights. Haze, reflections, selective focus, and partially obscured figures create a quiet, nocturnal atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"dieter-rams","name":"Dieter Rams","cat":"designers","en":"Dieter Rams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dieter-rams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dieter-rams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","still-life","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-green","grey","beige","brown","light-yellow","deep-rust"],"intro":"Dieter Rams is a renowned German industrial designer, best known for his work with Braun and his influence on modern design principles. His design philosophy, often summarized by the phrase \"less, but better,\" emphasizes simplicity, functionality, and timelessness. Rams's work has significantly impacted the field of industrial design, inspiring generations of designers and shaping the aesthetics of contemporary consumer products.","observation":"The style presents vintage consumer electronics as carefully arranged studio still lifes, rendered with realistic materials, fine mechanical detail, and softly controlled lighting. Muted cream, olive, and teal tones, centered compositions, rounded forms, and selective focus create a nostalgic product-photography feel."},{"id":"marimekko","name":"Marimekko","cat":"designers","en":"Marimekko","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marimekko.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marimekko","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","floral","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","bone-white","light-orange","dark-blue","deep-blue","pink"],"intro":"Marimekko is a Finnish design company renowned for its original prints and colors, founded in 1951. It gained international fame in the 1960s for its bold, vibrant patterns and has since become an iconic name in fashion and home decor, celebrated for its innovative approach to textile design.","observation":"The style combines graphic floral illustration with visibly brushed, textured petals and leaves. Saturated orange, red, pink, blue, black, and green shapes are arranged in dense repeating botanical compositions, using bold contours, flat color fields, patterned interiors, and expressive hand-painted marks."},{"id":"boris-groh","name":"Boris Groh","cat":"illustrators","en":"Boris Groh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/boris-groh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/boris-groh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","grain","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","bone-white","beige","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Boris Groh is a contemporary artist known for his dark and surreal illustrations. His work often explores themes of decay, fantasy, and the otherworldly, drawing inspiration from gothic and fantastical realism.","observation":"Across the four scenes, the style combines heavily textured, painterly surfaces with cinematic compositions, deep blue-green shadows, and recurring red-orange light sources. Hooded figures, ruined architecture, snow, fog, and distant silhouettes create a dark fantasy atmosphere with strong contrast and a gritty film-grain finish."},{"id":"raymond-depardon","name":"Raymond Depardon","cat":"photographers","en":"Raymond Depardon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raymond-depardon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raymond-depardon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["grey","white","charcoal","silver","black"],"intro":"Raymond Depardon is a renowned French photographer and filmmaker known for his documentary work and humanist approach. His career spans decades, capturing the essence of everyday life and significant historical events with a keen eye for detail and emotion. Depardon's work often explores themes of solitude, urban landscapes, and the human condition, making him a pivotal figure in contemporary photography.","observation":"A stark black-and-white photographic style combines restrained rural landscapes with formally composed portraits and quietly uncanny situations. Grain, deep tonal contrast, selective focus, overcast light, and recurring dark clothing create a bleak, cinematic atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"kazimir-malevich","name":"Kazimir Malevich","cat":"painters","en":"Kazimir Malevich","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kazimir-malevich.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kazimir-malevich","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","minimalist","patterns","flat-color","bw-monochrome","geometric","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["bone-white","vivid-red","black","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Kazimir Malevich was a Russian avant-garde artist and art theorist, known for founding the Suprematist movement. His work focused on basic geometric forms and a limited color palette, aiming to convey pure artistic feeling rather than visual depiction of objects.","observation":"The style uses stark geometric shapes, flat black and red areas, and simplified angular silhouettes arranged with strong asymmetry and generous negative space. Clean graphic edges and a restrained, poster-like palette are softened by a subtle worn paper or print texture across the images."},{"id":"michel-comte","name":"Michel Comte","cat":"photographers","en":"Michel Comte","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michel-comte.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michel-comte","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Michel Comte is a renowned Swiss photographer known for his work in fashion and portrait photography. He has collaborated with numerous high-profile fashion magazines and brands, capturing iconic images that blend elegance with a touch of edginess.","observation":"A monochrome, high-contrast portrait style combines sharply rendered faces and skin texture with dramatic black garments, oversized hats, fur, and windswept hair. The compositions are fashion-editorial and often tightly cropped, using plain gray backgrounds, direct gazes, and deep shadows to create a dark, sculptural mood."},{"id":"alida-akers","name":"Alida Akers","cat":"painters","en":"Alida Akers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alida-akers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alida-akers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["red","dark-green","muted-olive","muted-violet","light-orange","silver"],"intro":"Alida Akers is an artist known for her vibrant and intricate depictions of nature, often blending elements of fantasy and realism. Her work is characterized by a detailed and painterly approach, with a focus on floral and natural themes that evoke a sense of whimsy and wonder.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense botanical imagery is built from vivid, saturated color, clearly visible painted strokes, and fine contour lines. Oversized flowers, layered foliage, and occasional distant garden or mountain landscapes create an exuberant, decorative style that combines illustrative flat shapes with richly textured painterly surfaces."},{"id":"michael-sowa","name":"Michael Sowa","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Sowa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-sowa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-sowa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","dark-olive","olive"],"intro":"Michael Sowa is a German artist known for his whimsical and surreal paintings, often featuring animals in unusual settings. His work is characterized by a blend of humor and mystery, creating a unique narrative style that has gained international recognition.","observation":"The style is filmic and naturalistic, using deep green-black shadows, muted dusk colors, isolated warm lights, and occasional silhouetted figures or animals. Mist, reflective water, wooded settings, and carefully staged encounters create a quiet, dreamlike sense of mystery across all four scenes."},{"id":"sidney-sime","name":"Sidney Sime","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sidney Sime","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sidney-sime.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sidney-sime","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","mist","crosshatching","fine-lines","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Sidney Sime was a British artist and illustrator known for his fantastical and darkly imaginative works, often associated with the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His illustrations frequently accompanied the writings of Lord Dunsany, and he was celebrated for his intricate line work and atmospheric compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental fantasy landscapes are built from dense, finely worked lines and layered cloud forms, with deep black silhouettes set against luminous atmospheric openings. The restricted monochrome palette, stark tonal contrast, misty depth, and tiny human figures create an epic, dreamlike sense of scale."},{"id":"henri-de-toulouse-lautrec","name":"Henri de Toulouse-Lautrec","cat":"painters","en":"Henri de Toulouse-Lautrec","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-de-toulouse-lautrec.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-de-toulouse-lautrec","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","red","muted-green","rust","orange","brown"],"intro":"Henri de Toulouse-Lautrec was a French painter, printmaker, draughtsman, and illustrator known for his depictions of the bohemian lifestyle of late 19th-century Paris. He is celebrated for capturing the vibrant and dynamic atmosphere of the Moulin Rouge and other Parisian nightlife venues, often focusing on performers and patrons. His work is characterized by expressive lines, vivid colors, and a unique ability to convey the personality and mood of his subjects.","observation":"The style combines highly visible, broad, layered brushwork with fine dark contour lines, producing expressive, illustrative portraits and crowded social scenes. Saturated coral, turquoise, black, cream, and red dominate, with strong tonal contrasts and densely arranged clothing, faces, furnishings, and gestures."},{"id":"ted-rall","name":"Ted Rall","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ted Rall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ted-rall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ted-rall","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","vivid-red","light-orange","blue","dark-brown","yellow"],"intro":"Ted Rall is an American cartoonist and author known for his editorial cartoons and graphic novels. His work often features political and social commentary, providing a satirical take on contemporary issues. Rall's cartoons have been published in various newspapers and magazines, where he uses his distinctive style to engage readers with thought-provoking content.","observation":"The style uses dense comic-book drawing with thick black contours, vivid flat color blocks, and selective crosshatching for texture and shadow. Crowded character compositions, exaggerated faces, fashionable clothing, and strong red-blue-yellow contrasts give the images a bold retro editorial energy."},{"id":"anton-pieck","name":"Anton Pieck","cat":"painters","en":"Anton Pieck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anton-pieck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anton-pieck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","urban","glow","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["brown","grey","black","white","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Anton Pieck was a Dutch painter and graphic artist known for his nostalgic and detailed illustrations, often depicting historical European settings and fairy tales. His works are characterized by their romantic and whimsical nature, capturing the charm of bygone eras with intricate details and a warm color palette.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, hand-painted surfaces with delicate dark linework and densely articulated architecture. Muted blue-grey winter tones are punctuated by warm window and lantern light, creating atmospheric, storybook medieval streets filled with snow, figures, and layered urban detail."},{"id":"hal-foster","name":"Hal Foster","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hal Foster","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hal-foster.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hal-foster","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","silver","white","charcoal","brown","beige"],"intro":"Hal Foster is a renowned American illustrator and comic strip artist, best known for creating the classic adventure strip \"Prince Valiant.\" His work is celebrated for its detailed and realistic depiction of medieval settings and characters, blending narrative storytelling with artistic precision. Foster's influence extends into the realms of fantasy and adventure art, where his style has inspired generations of artists.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome ink-like linework, dense hatching, and sharply separated blacks and pale grounds to create a highly detailed, dramatic graphic-novel effect. Dynamic action, monumental figures, turbulent landscapes, and deep shadows give the imagery an expressive, ominous, epic character."},{"id":"orlan","name":"Orlan","cat":"various-artists","en":"Orlan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/orlan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/orlan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","metallic"],"colours":["silver","beige","black","dark-red","brown","rust"],"intro":"Orlan is a contemporary French artist known for her provocative works that explore themes of identity, the body, and transformation. She is renowned for using her own body as a canvas, often incorporating elements of performance art and body modification to challenge societal norms and beauty standards.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped fashion portraits with elaborate facial painting, graphic linework, and lavish jewellery. Strong colour blocking, selective monochrome treatment, high contrast, and visible metallic ornament create a theatrical editorial effect across the set."},{"id":"mindy-sommers","name":"Mindy Sommers","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mindy Sommers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mindy-sommers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mindy-sommers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","patterns","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","red","deep-red"],"intro":"Mindy Sommers is an artist known for her intricate and decorative designs, often blending elements of fantasy and nature. Her work is characterized by a rich use of color and detailed patterns, drawing inspiration from historical art movements.","observation":"Dense botanical compositions fill the frame with oversized poppies, layered petals, foliage, stems, and seed pods, rendered with visible fine brushwork and richly textured surfaces. Dark grounds and black blossoms contrast with subdued reds, creams, pinks, and muted greens, while repeated floral forms create an ornate patterned effect."},{"id":"moto-hagio","name":"Moto Hagio","cat":"illustrators","en":"Moto Hagio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/moto-hagio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/moto-hagio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["pale-orange","black","rust","beige","brown","dark-blue"],"intro":"Moto Hagio is a pioneering Japanese manga artist, renowned for her influential work in the shoujo manga genre. She played a crucial role in shaping the genre with her emotionally complex narratives and innovative art style, contributing significantly to the manga revolution of the 1970s.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, fine-lined illustrative portraiture with elegant, idealized faces, elaborate hair, and richly decorated clothing. Saturated reds, greens, creams, and blacks create strong contrast, while abundant flowers and foliage turn the compositions into ornate botanical frames."},{"id":"josef-kote","name":"Josef Kote","cat":"painters","en":"Josef Kote","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josef-kote.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josef-kote","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["muted-cyan","bone-white","beige","charcoal","ochre","rust"],"intro":"Josef Kote is an Albanian-born artist known for his vibrant and expressive paintings, often featuring bold color palettes and dynamic compositions. His work is characterized by a unique blend of realism and abstraction, capturing the essence of his subjects with fluid brushstrokes and vivid hues.","observation":"Across the sheet, recognizable people, boats, and waterfront settings are built from broad, visible strokes and broken blocks of paint. The subdued blue-gray grounds are enlivened by warm orange accents, while forms remain representational but loosely fragmented and expressive."},{"id":"greg-gorman","name":"Greg Gorman","cat":"photographers","en":"Greg Gorman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-gorman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-gorman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Greg Gorman is a renowned American photographer known for his distinctive black-and-white portraits of celebrities and fashion icons. His work is characterized by its dramatic lighting, elegant composition, and intimate portrayal of subjects, often capturing the essence of Hollywood glamour.","observation":"The style is a highly realistic, monochrome portrait treatment built around intense close-ups, deep blacks, bright facial highlights, and sharply rendered hair and fabric textures. Windblown hair, fur, and feathered clothing create movement and tactile drama, while tight cropping and dark backgrounds give the images a bold, fashion-editorial mood."},{"id":"gustave-de-jonghe","name":"Gustave de Jonghe","cat":"painters","en":"Gustave de Jonghe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-de-jonghe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-de-jonghe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Gustave de Jonghe was a Belgian painter known for his detailed genre scenes and portraits, often depicting intimate and domestic settings. Born in 1829, he became a prominent figure in the 19th-century European art scene, celebrated for his ability to capture the subtleties of human emotion and social interaction within his works.","observation":"Richly painterly scenes depict elegantly dressed women in lavish, densely furnished interiors. Visible brushwork builds complex fabrics, lace, floral upholstery, wallpaper, wood, and porcelain, while a subdued, moody palette and carefully posed figures create a refined classical atmosphere."},{"id":"rosso-fiorentino","name":"Rosso Fiorentino","cat":"painters","en":"Rosso Fiorentino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rosso-fiorentino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rosso-fiorentino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","muted-brown","orange","red","pale-orange"],"intro":"Rosso Fiorentino was an Italian Mannerist painter of the early 16th century, known for his dramatic and expressive style. He was a significant figure in the Florentine school and contributed to the development of Mannerism with his innovative use of color and composition.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces and figures are modeled with visible oil-paint texture, delicate brushwork, and finely resolved facial features. Restrained earth tones are punctuated by strong reds, while dramatic illumination and deep shadows create an expressive, somber intensity."},{"id":"fumihiko-maki","name":"Fumihiko Maki","cat":"architects","en":"Fumihiko Maki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fumihiko-maki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fumihiko-maki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","silver","white","brown","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Fumihiko Maki is a renowned Japanese architect known for his modernist approach and innovative designs. He has contributed significantly to contemporary architecture, blending traditional Japanese aesthetics with modern techniques. Maki's work often emphasizes simplicity, functionality, and the harmonious integration of buildings with their surroundings.","observation":"This style presents monumental architectural spaces through stark geometric masses, rectilinear grids, and carefully balanced compositions. Predominantly monochrome tones, deep shadows, bright white surfaces, and crisp structural detail create a sculptural, high-contrast visual language across both interiors and exterior plazas."},{"id":"flora-waycott","name":"Flora Waycott","cat":"painters","en":"Flora Waycott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/flora-waycott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/flora-waycott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","landscapes","patterns","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","bone-white","dark-ochre","ochre","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Flora Waycott is a contemporary illustrator known for her whimsical and detailed artwork that often features nature and botanical themes. Her work is characterized by a playful and gentle aesthetic, drawing inspiration from folk art and traditional decorative styles.","observation":"A richly painterly botanical style combines visible directional brushwork with densely layered flowers, leaves, patterned vessels, and occasional landscape vignettes. Saturated coral, orange, pink, cream, and deep teal hues create a decorative, exuberant surface, while fine drawn accents and varied floral textures keep the compositions intricate and expressive."},{"id":"tod-browning","name":"Tod Browning","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Tod Browning","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tod-browning.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tod-browning","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Tod Browning was an American film director known for his work in the silent and early sound eras of Hollywood. He is best remembered for his contributions to the horror genre, particularly his films \"Dracula\" (1931) and \"Freaks\" (1932). Browning's work often explored themes of the macabre and the bizarre, drawing on his experiences in vaudeville and the circus.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white imagery with deep shadows, bright facial highlights, and a pronounced film-grain texture. It combines tightly staged horror tableaux and portrait-like close-ups with selective focus, period interiors, theatrical expressions, and strongly directional lighting."},{"id":"michael-hussar","name":"Michael Hussar","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Hussar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-hussar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-hussar","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","pale-orange","deep-red","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Michael Hussar is an American contemporary artist known for his dark and provocative paintings that explore themes of beauty, decay, and the macabre. His work often features haunting portraits with a gothic and surreal aesthetic, characterized by a masterful use of chiaroscuro and intricate detailing.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses visible, layered brushwork to render theatrical figures in elaborate ruffs, feathers, hats, jewelry, and richly constructed costumes. Pale faces, deep black grounds, red accents, and stark lighting create a moody, high-contrast fantasy atmosphere with ornate stage-like character design."},{"id":"ben-aronson","name":"Ben Aronson","cat":"painters","en":"Ben Aronson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ben-aronson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ben-aronson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","beige","pale-yellow","ochre"],"intro":"Ben Aronson is an American painter known for his urban landscapes and cityscapes that capture the essence of contemporary life. His work often features dynamic compositions, rich textures, and a keen observation of light and shadow, bringing a sense of realism and immediacy to his paintings.","observation":"Across all four views, the scenes are rendered with visible, broad, textural brushwork and strongly shaped blocks of light and shadow. Warm amber illumination, deep blue-black shadows, wet reflections, dense urban architecture, and cinematic viewpoints create a moody, atmospheric city-at-night character."},{"id":"carlos-latuff","name":"Carlos Latuff","cat":"illustrators","en":"Carlos Latuff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carlos-latuff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carlos-latuff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","ochre","muted-blue","cream","vivid-red","blue","green"],"intro":"Carlos Latuff is a Brazilian political cartoonist known for his provocative and bold illustrations that often address global political issues, conflicts, and social justice themes. His work is characterized by its clear, impactful messages and a distinctive style that combines elements of traditional cartooning with modern digital techniques.","observation":"The style uses graphic, comic-like drawing with thick black contour lines, flat saturated color fields, and energetic crosshatched marks for shadow and texture. Dramatic political and military scenes are composed with expressive figures, strong diagonals, crowded groupings, and stark red, black, white, green, and blue contrasts."},{"id":"pietro-bernini","name":"Pietro Bernini","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Pietro Bernini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pietro-bernini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pietro-bernini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","grey"],"intro":"Pietro Bernini is a renowned Italian sculptor from the late Renaissance and early Baroque periods, known for his intricate marble sculptures and religious themes. His work often depicted biblical and mythological subjects, characterized by expressive detail and dynamic compositions.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, three-dimensional marble busts in tightly cropped, portrait-like views, emphasizing expressive faces, elaborate curling hair, beards, and windswept drapery. Strong directional lighting creates deep shadows and bright stone highlights, while dark museum-like surroundings and restrained warm tones give the images a dramatic, monumental atmosphere."},{"id":"al-williamson","name":"Al Williamson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Al Williamson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/al-williamson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/al-williamson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","sci-fi","ink"],"colours":["black","white","grey","yellow","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Al Williamson is renowned for his work as a comic book artist, particularly known for his contributions to the science fiction and fantasy genres. His distinctive style is characterized by detailed line work and a strong sense of adventure and otherworldliness. Williamson's illustrations often feature intricate backgrounds and dynamic compositions, bringing to life the fantastical worlds of his imagination.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed graphic illustration with forceful ink contours, crosshatched shading, and stark high-contrast lighting. It combines mostly monochrome drawing with selective red or green color treatments, presenting dramatic human characters and alien landscapes in a retro-futurist science-fiction mood."},{"id":"richard-billingham","name":"Richard Billingham","cat":"photographers","en":"Richard Billingham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-billingham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-billingham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","beige","dark-brown","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"Richard Billingham is a British photographer and artist known for his candid and intimate portrayal of family life, particularly through his series \"Ray's A Laugh,\" which documents his parents and their home in the West Midlands. His work often explores themes of working-class life, domesticity, and the passage of time, capturing raw and unfiltered moments with a deeply personal touch.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed interior photography with cinematic framing, strong environmental storytelling, and visible film-like grain. Muted green, brown, red, and ochre tones, deep shadows, and selective focus give the cluttered domestic scenes a moody, lived-in atmosphere."},{"id":"dan-abnett","name":"Dan Abnett","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dan Abnett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-abnett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-abnett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","beige","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Dan Abnett is a British author and comic book writer known for his work in science fiction and fantasy genres. He has contributed to various comic book series and novels, particularly within the Warhammer 40,000 universe and Marvel Comics. Abnett's storytelling often involves intricate plots and richly developed characters.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a richly textured, painterly vision of heavily armored figures and ruined industrial battlefields, built from broad visible strokes and dense mechanical detail. Deep blacks, rust, crimson and occasional cold highlights create high-contrast, oppressive scenes with an expressive, monumental sci-fi mood."},{"id":"isay-weinfeld","name":"Isay Weinfeld","cat":"architects","en":"Isay Weinfeld","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isay-weinfeld.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isay-weinfeld","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","glow","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-brown","beige","silver","olive"],"intro":"Isay Weinfeld is a renowned Brazilian architect known for his modernist and contemporary designs that often integrate natural elements and emphasize simplicity and functionality. His work is characterized by clean lines, open spaces, and a seamless blend of indoor and outdoor environments, reflecting a deep connection with nature.","observation":"The style presents photorealistic architectural scenes with strong horizontal and vertical geometry, open-plan concrete structures, warm wood surfaces, and dense tropical landscaping. Subdued natural colors, crisp daylight, deep shaded areas, and occasional architectural lighting create a polished cinematic atmosphere across the views."},{"id":"olafur-eliasson","name":"Olafur Eliasson","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Olafur Eliasson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olafur-eliasson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olafur-eliasson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","metallic","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","deep-rust","dark-brown","muted-ochre","orange","silver"],"intro":"Olafur Eliasson is a Danish-Icelandic artist known for his large-scale installation art that often incorporates elements of light, water, and air temperature to enhance the viewer's experience. His work explores the relationship between the natural world and human perception, often creating immersive environments that challenge the viewer's understanding of space and reality.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental faceted spheres as highly realistic, sculptural installations in spacious modern gallery interiors. Reflective metallic surfaces, geometric fragmentation, intense internal light, and prismatic reflections create ornate detail, vivid color, and strong contrast."},{"id":"ambrosius-bosschaert","name":"Ambrosius Bosschaert","cat":"painters","en":"Ambrosius Bosschaert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ambrosius-bosschaert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ambrosius-bosschaert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","floral","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","white","red","dark-ochre","muted-orange"],"intro":"Ambrosius Bosschaert was a Dutch painter known for his exquisite still life paintings, particularly those featuring flowers. He was a pioneer in the genre of floral still life during the Dutch Golden Age , and his works are celebrated for their meticulous detail and vibrant color.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely layered flower arrangements are painted with delicate, visible brushwork and realistic petal and foliage modeling. Restrained jewel-like reds, oranges, whites, pinks, and blues emerge from near-black grounds, producing strong contrast and an ornate, antique still-life appearance."},{"id":"coby-whitmore","name":"Coby Whitmore","cat":"illustrators","en":"Coby Whitmore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/coby-whitmore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/coby-whitmore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","black","light-orange","rust","muted-brown","muted-green"],"intro":"Coby Whitmore is a renowned American illustrator known for his work in magazines during the mid-20th century. He was celebrated for his depictions of fashionable and glamorous women, contributing significantly to the visual culture of the 1950s and 1960s. His work often appeared in publications such as 'The Saturday Evening Post' and 'Good Housekeeping', where his style became synonymous with elegance and sophistication.","observation":"The style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork and fine strokes to model glamorous faces, hair, clothing, and accessories with expressive, slightly idealized features. Restrained cream, black, teal, and warm flesh tones create a vintage fashion-illustration mood, while tight cropping and intimate poses give the portraits dramatic impact."},{"id":"gerald-harvey-jones","name":"Gerald Harvey Jones","cat":"painters","en":"Gerald Harvey Jones","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerald-harvey-jones.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerald-harvey-jones","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","beige","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Gerald Harvey Jones is an American artist known for his nostalgic and romantic depictions of historical American scenes. His work often features detailed and painterly techniques, capturing the essence of a bygone era with warmth and elegance.","observation":"Across all four views, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork shaping dense architectural and street detail. A subdued blue-green atmosphere is punctuated by warm amber lamps, windows, and reflections, while rain, mist, and crowded urban activity create a cinematic nocturnal mood."},{"id":"elizabeth-shippen-green","name":"Elizabeth Shippen Green","cat":"illustrators","en":"Elizabeth Shippen Green","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elizabeth-shippen-green.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elizabeth-shippen-green","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-orange","black","muted-brown","dark-green","charcoal","dark-red"],"intro":"Elizabeth Shippen Green was an American illustrator known for her work during the Golden Age of Illustration. She was one of the first women to be employed by a major American magazine, Harper's Monthly, and was renowned for her detailed and imaginative illustrations, often depicting women in romantic and whimsical settings.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with delicate directional brushwork, highly detailed faces, fabrics, flowers, and foliage. Cropped female figures are arranged in dense decorative compositions, combining saturated jewel-like colors with ornamental botanical motifs and expressive, elegant poses."},{"id":"georges-rochegrosse","name":"Georges Rochegrosse","cat":"painters","en":"Georges Rochegrosse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-rochegrosse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-rochegrosse","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","light-orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Georges Rochegrosse was a French painter and illustrator known for his dramatic historical and mythological scenes. Born in 1859, he gained recognition for his vivid and detailed works that often depicted intense and emotional narratives. His style was influenced by academic realism and orientalism, capturing the grandeur and complexity of his subjects with meticulous attention to detail.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses visibly built-up oil paint, broad directional strokes, and textured, broken edges to model figures, animals, clothing, and landscapes. Its restrained earthy palette, dramatic light, expressive faces, and narrative arrangements give the scenes a richly atmospheric, traditional illustrative character."},{"id":"richard-edward-miller","name":"Richard Edward Miller","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Edward Miller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-edward-miller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-edward-miller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-ochre","muted-ochre","bone-white","grey","black","red"],"intro":"Richard Edward Miller was an American painter associated with the American Impressionism movement. Born in 1875, he was known for his vibrant use of color and light, often depicting women in intimate, domestic settings. His work was characterized by a soft, painterly style and a focus on the play of light and shadow, reflecting his time spent in France and his exposure to European art movements.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly visible, layered brushwork to depict elegantly dressed women in sunlit domestic interiors and garden rooms. Vivid floral colors, strong light-dark contrasts, abundant furnishings and flowers, and expressive fine strokes create detailed, atmospheric scene paintings with a classical decorative sensibility."},{"id":"howard-terpning","name":"Howard Terpning","cat":"painters","en":"Howard Terpning","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howard-terpning.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howard-terpning","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","muted-ochre","grey","silver"],"intro":"Howard Terpning is an American painter known for his realistic and detailed depictions of Native American life and culture. Born in 1927, Terpning has been celebrated for his ability to capture the spirit and history of the American West, often focusing on the lives and traditions of indigenous peoples. His work is characterized by a deep respect for his subjects and a commitment to historical accuracy, making him a prominent figure in Western art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly broad, broken paint strokes and layered texture to create expressive, richly atmospheric scenes. Subdued earth tones, cool blues, and deep shadows frame mounted figures, horses, and expansive wilderness settings with a grand, narrative sense of scale."},{"id":"virginia-frances-sterrett","name":"Virginia Frances Sterrett","cat":"illustrators","en":"Virginia Frances Sterrett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/virginia-frances-sterrett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/virginia-frances-sterrett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","brown","light-orange","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Virginia Frances Sterrett was an American illustrator known for her enchanting and detailed illustrations, often depicting fairy tales and fantastical scenes. Her work is characterized by a delicate and intricate style, with a focus on whimsical and dreamlike imagery. Sterrett's illustrations are celebrated for their ethereal quality and imaginative compositions, making her a notable figure in early 20th-century illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured painted surfaces with fine contouring, dense ornamental detail, and saturated jewel-like colors against moody blue shadows. Elegant figures inhabit dreamy, theatrical fantasy tableaux filled with flowers, flowing garments, luminous points of light, water, and elaborate decorative motifs."},{"id":"anne-bachelier","name":"Anne Bachelier","cat":"illustrators","en":"Anne Bachelier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-bachelier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-bachelier","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","motion","painterly","moody-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white","grey","rust"],"intro":"Anne Bachelier is a contemporary French artist known for her surreal and fantastical paintings that often explore themes of transformation and mythology. Her work is characterized by a unique blend of dreamlike imagery and detailed brushwork, creating a distinctive style that has captivated audiences worldwide.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, sweeping paint strokes to shape elongated figures and billowing garments, with forms dissolving into atmospheric backgrounds. Dark, muted grounds are energized by red, white, blue, and ember-orange accents, while gestures, flames, and trailing fabric create a dreamlike sense of motion."},{"id":"antoni-gaudi","name":"Antoni Gaudi","cat":"architects","en":"Antoni Gaudi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antoni-gaudi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antoni-gaudi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","urban","vivid-colors","classical","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","muted-blue","black","rust"],"intro":"Antoni Gaudi was a renowned Spanish architect known for his distinctive and innovative architectural style, which is characterized by organic shapes, vibrant colors, and intricate details. His work is a hallmark of Catalan Modernism, with famous structures like the Sagrada Familia and Park Güell in Barcelona showcasing his unique approach to architecture.","observation":"The style presents richly detailed architectural photographs with highly organic, sculptural facades, elaborate ornament, irregular geometry, and intensely textured mosaic surfaces. Realistic lighting and materials anchor the fantastical, expressive buildings in urban settings, while close crops and unusual forms create a dreamy visual effect."},{"id":"darek-zabrocki","name":"Darek Zabrocki","cat":"illustrators","en":"Darek Zabrocki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/darek-zabrocki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/darek-zabrocki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","beige","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Darek Zabrocki is a contemporary artist known for his work in digital illustration and concept art. His style is characterized by a focus on detailed and atmospheric compositions, often exploring themes of fantasy and science fiction. Zabrocki has contributed to various entertainment industries, creating visual narratives that captivate audiences with their depth and creativity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured, painterly surfaces with cinematic framing, dense environmental detail, and a consistently dark, atmospheric palette. Mist, rain, smoke, and storm clouds soften distant forms while small warm light sources punctuate cool blue-green surroundings, creating epic scenes of decay, isolation, and fantastical industrial architecture."},{"id":"alejandro-jodorowsky","name":"Alejandro Jodorowsky","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Alejandro Jodorowsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alejandro-jodorowsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alejandro-jodorowsky","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","muted-cyan","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Alejandro Jodorowsky is a Chilean-French filmmaker, playwright, actor, author, and musician known for his avant-garde and surreal films. He gained international fame with works such as \"El Topo\" and \"The Holy Mountain,\" which are celebrated for their unique blend of mysticism, symbolism, and psychedelic imagery. Jodorowsky's contributions to film and art extend beyond traditional boundaries, often exploring themes of spirituality, consciousness, and the human experience.","observation":"The style combines visibly textured, old-master-like painting with dense, expressive scenes populated by ominous masked figures, animals, and theatrical costumes. Earthy, muted colors are punctuated by vivid red garments and deep shadows, while surreal juxtapositions and weathered surfaces create a dark, folkloric atmosphere."},{"id":"melozzo-da-forli","name":"Melozzo da Forli","cat":"painters","en":"Melozzo da Forli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/melozzo-da-forli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/melozzo-da-forli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","scenes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","dark-brown","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Melozzo da Forli was an Italian Renaissance painter known for his mastery of perspective and fresco techniques. He was active during the 15th century and is celebrated for his contributions to religious and mythological art, particularly in his use of foreshortening and dynamic compositions.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and densely detailed, with visible brushwork modeling faces, fabric, stone, and architectural ornament. It presents grand, crowded religious-historical tableaux in restrained earth tones punctuated by deep reds, blues, and golds, emphasizing ceremonial gestures, elaborate costumes, and monumental interiors."},{"id":"joel-sartore","name":"Joel Sartore","cat":"photographers","en":"Joel Sartore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joel-sartore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joel-sartore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","portraits","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-cyan","dark-brown","muted-ochre","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Joel Sartore is a renowned American photographer, speaker, author, and conservationist known for his work with National Geographic. He is the founder of the Photo Ark, a project aimed at documenting species before they disappear. Sartore's work focuses on wildlife and conservation, capturing the beauty and plight of animals around the world.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, densely detailed bird portraits with exceptionally crisp feather, eye, and beak rendering. Strong directional lighting and predominantly black backgrounds create dramatic high contrast, while varied frontal, profile, and close-up compositions keep the birds isolated and imposing."},{"id":"tove-jansson","name":"Tove Jansson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tove Jansson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tove-jansson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tove-jansson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-green","black","muted-cyan","muted-ochre","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Tove Jansson was a Finnish-Swedish author, illustrator, and artist, best known for creating the beloved Moomin series. Her work spans across various mediums, including novels, comic strips, and paintings, reflecting her unique blend of whimsy and depth. Jansson's illustrations are celebrated for their imaginative worlds and endearing characters, capturing the hearts of both children and adults worldwide.","observation":"The style combines dense, hand-painted landscape detail with visible directional brushwork, fine drawn accents, and expressive, slightly stylized forms. Saturated blue-green environments are punctuated by coral flowers, red roofs, mushrooms, boats, and whimsical white creatures, creating richly layered storybook scenery."},{"id":"luigi-ghirri","name":"Luigi Ghirri","cat":"photographers","en":"Luigi Ghirri","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luigi-ghirri.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luigi-ghirri","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["cyan","orange","brown","muted-cyan","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Luigi Ghirri is an influential Italian photographer known for his pioneering work in color photography. His images often explore the relationship between reality and perception, capturing everyday scenes with a unique sense of simplicity and depth. Ghirri's work is characterized by its use of color, composition, and a contemplative approach to the mundane, making him a significant figure in the world of contemporary photography.","observation":"The style uses realistic, carefully composed architectural photography with strong geometric blocks, expansive blue sky, and deliberate negative space. Saturated wall colors are tempered by a restrained, slightly faded palette, hard sunlight, deep shadows, and a consistent fine-grain texture."},{"id":"paul-cezanne","name":"Paul Cezanne","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Cezanne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-cezanne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-cezanne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-green","black","muted-olive","pale-orange","grey","ochre"],"intro":"Paul Cezanne was a French artist and Post-Impressionist painter whose work laid the foundations for the transition from 19th-century Impressionism to a new and radically different world of art in the 20th century. He is often credited with forming the bridge between late 19th-century Impressionism and the early 20th century's new line of artistic inquiry, Cubism. His unique method of building form with color and his analytical approach to nature influenced the art of Cubists, Fauvists, and successive generations of avant-garde artists.","observation":"Across the portraits, musical scenes, still life, and village views, the images share visibly broad, textured brushstrokes and expressive, loosely built forms. Earthy greens, ochres, creams, and muted blues unify the compositions, while dense foliage, architecture, figures, and atmospheric skies create a richly detailed illustrative-painterly surface."},{"id":"rick-owens","name":"Rick Owens","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Rick Owens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rick-owens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rick-owens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["white","silver","charcoal","brown","beige","black"],"intro":"Rick Owens is an American fashion designer known for his avant-garde and gothic aesthetic. His work often features a dark, minimalist style with a focus on innovative silhouettes and luxurious materials. Owens has been influential in the fashion industry for his unique approach to design, blending elements of grunge, glamour, and high fashion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, carefully detailed full-body fashion portraits with oversized, sculptural fabric silhouettes. Restrained black, ivory, and grey tones, stark studio or gallery settings, and directional lighting create a severe, moody, editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"pier-paolo-pasolini","name":"Pier Paolo Pasolini","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Pier Paolo Pasolini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pier-paolo-pasolini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pier-paolo-pasolini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","portraits","urban","grain","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","collage","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","vivid-red","bone-white","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Pier Paolo Pasolini was an influential Italian filmmaker, poet, writer, and intellectual known for his controversial and thought-provoking works. His films often explored themes of sexuality, religion, and politics, challenging societal norms and conventions. Pasolini's unique perspective and bold storytelling made him a significant figure in the world of cinema and literature.","observation":"The style combines cinematic, grainy portrait photography with stark editorial collage and aggressively painted, ink-like portrait treatments. Across the sheet, deep shadows, red-and-black contrasts, torn paper, rough brush textures, and tightly framed male figures create a moody, retro visual language."},{"id":"john-wilhelm","name":"John Wilhelm","cat":"photographers","en":"John Wilhelm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-wilhelm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-wilhelm","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","brown","beige","silver"],"intro":"John Wilhelm is a contemporary Swiss photographer known for his imaginative and surreal digital compositions. His work often features whimsical and fantastical elements, blending reality with fantasy to create unique visual narratives.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, detailed photographic rendering with cinematic low-angle compositions, expressive children, and animals placed in unusual storybook situations. Cool subdued tones, dramatic skies, strong subject separation, selective focus, and carefully staged interactions create a dreamy yet visually intense atmosphere."},{"id":"octavio-ocampo","name":"Octavio Ocampo","cat":"painters","en":"Octavio Ocampo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/octavio-ocampo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/octavio-ocampo","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","light-orange","grey","brown","ochre"],"intro":"Octavio Ocampo is a Mexican surrealist painter known for his metamorphic style, where he combines multiple images into a single cohesive piece. His work often features intricate illusions and transformations, drawing inspiration from Mexican culture and mythology.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly textured, directional paintwork with sharply constructed geometric forms and dense surreal juxtapositions. Saturated blue, red, ochre, and sky tones heighten the expressive faces, birds, monumental ruins, and fragmented architectural spaces."},{"id":"ann-demeulemeester","name":"Ann Demeulemeester","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Ann Demeulemeester","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ann-demeulemeester.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ann-demeulemeester","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","grey","brown","beige"],"intro":"Ann Demeulemeester is a renowned Belgian fashion designer known for her avant-garde and gothic-inspired clothing. She emerged as a prominent figure in the fashion world as part of the Antwerp Six, a group of influential designers who graduated from the Royal Academy of Fine Arts in Antwerp. Her work is characterized by its poetic and rebellious spirit, often incorporating dark, flowing fabrics and a minimalist aesthetic.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is realistic, cinematic fashion photography focused on dramatic runway presentation and sculptural, heavily layered garments. A subdued black-and-white palette, distressed textile textures, selective focus, and shadowy staging create a dark, surreal editorial mood."},{"id":"kerby-rosanes","name":"Kerby Rosanes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kerby Rosanes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kerby-rosanes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kerby-rosanes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","muted-ochre","brown","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Kerby Rosanes is a contemporary illustrator known for his intricate and imaginative doodle art. His work often features detailed line drawings that blend fantasy and surreal elements, creating whimsical and playful compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly intricate pen-and-ink linework, with fine contour lines, crosshatched shading, and densely layered organic forms. Surreal combinations of animals, plants, architecture, and fantastical creatures create elaborate monochrome worlds that feel both illustrative and expressive."},{"id":"robert-lyn-nelson","name":"Robert Lyn Nelson","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Lyn Nelson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-lyn-nelson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-lyn-nelson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-cyan","muted-blue","brown","silver","orange"],"intro":"Robert Lyn Nelson is an American artist known for his pioneering work in the genre of marine art. He gained recognition for his unique style that combines realistic depictions of underwater life with imaginative and surreal elements, creating a dreamlike fusion of oceanic and terrestrial worlds.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly fantasy environments with dense architectural and natural detail across expansive land-and-sea vistas. Saturated blue, turquoise, coral, and amber hues are intensified by glowing windows, sunlight, fires, and sunset reflections, while surreal underwater settlements and monumental cliffside structures create an otherworldly sense of scale."},{"id":"kevin-mcneal","name":"Kevin McNeal","cat":"photographers","en":"Kevin McNeal","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kevin-mcneal.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kevin-mcneal","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-indigo","dark-brown","dark-red","muted-blue","light-red"],"intro":"Kevin McNeal is a renowned landscape photographer known for his vibrant and dynamic images of natural scenes. His work often captures the beauty of the American wilderness, showcasing dramatic skies, lush vegetation, and stunning vistas. McNeal's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey the majesty and tranquility of nature, often utilizing techniques such as high dynamic range and meticulous post-processing to enhance the visual impact of his images.","observation":"The style presents expansive, highly realistic mountain landscapes with dense foreground wildflowers, sharply defined peaks, and richly saturated seasonal color. Dramatic sunrise and sunset illumination, glowing cloud formations, atmospheric mist, and strong light-dark contrast create an epic, cinematic sense of scale across all four views."},{"id":"chuck-jones","name":"Chuck Jones","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chuck Jones","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chuck-jones.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chuck-jones","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","light-orange","bone-white","ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Chuck Jones was a renowned American animator and director, best known for his work on the Looney Tunes and Merrie Melodies series during the Golden Age of American animation. His iconic characters, such as Bugs Bunny, Daffy Duck, and the Road Runner, are celebrated for their humor and personality, contributing significantly to the world of animated cartoons.","observation":"Across the sheet, expressive ink contours and loose watercolor washes combine delicate drawing with visibly worked, textured paper. The imagery is populated by animated animal characters and lively natural settings, with fine gestural lines, selective dark fills, and restrained red, blue, and green accents."},{"id":"chris-bachalo","name":"Chris Bachalo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris Bachalo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-bachalo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-bachalo","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","white","brown","red","vivid-orange","ochre"],"intro":"Chris Bachalo is a renowned comic book artist known for his distinctive style and contributions to major comic series. His work often features intricate line work, dynamic compositions, and a unique blend of fantasy and surreal elements.","observation":"The style uses densely layered character portraits rendered as graphic ink illustrations, with heavy contour lines, scratchy interior marks, and sharply blocked areas of black, white, orange, and red. Strong facial expressions, dramatic cropping, distressed textures, and surreal character combinations give the sheet an intense comic-book poster quality."},{"id":"bernard-tschumi","name":"Bernard Tschumi","cat":"architects","en":"Bernard Tschumi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bernard-tschumi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bernard-tschumi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","red","dark-red","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Bernard Tschumi is a renowned architect and educator known for his influential contributions to contemporary architecture. Born in Switzerland and active primarily in France and the United States, Tschumi is celebrated for his theoretical approach and innovative designs that challenge conventional architectural norms. His work often explores the relationship between space, movement, and human interaction, making him a pivotal figure in the field of deconstructivism.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental urban architecture is fragmented into dense, surreal compositions of arches, towers, ramps, and overlapping structural planes. Saturated red, black, white, and gray dominate, reinforced by stark contrast, geometric forms, graphic linework, and an illustrative architectural-collage treatment."},{"id":"joe-jusko","name":"Joe Jusko","cat":"illustrators","en":"Joe Jusko","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joe-jusko.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joe-jusko","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","red","dark-red","dark-violet","dark-green","orange"],"intro":"Joe Jusko is a renowned American illustrator, celebrated for his dynamic and detailed comic book art. He is particularly known for his work with Marvel Comics, where his vivid and realistic portrayals of superheroes have captivated audiences. Jusko's art is characterized by its bold use of color, intricate detail, and dramatic compositions, making him a standout figure in the world of fantasy and comic book illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, directional brushwork with dense, tactile detail and forceful dark contours. Saturated reds, greens, blues, and purples collide with deep shadows, presenting theatrical fantasy-horror characters in tightly framed, expressive close-ups."},{"id":"omar-galliani","name":"Omar Galliani","cat":"painters","en":"Omar Galliani","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/omar-galliani.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/omar-galliani","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","portraits","fine-lines","grain","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","collage","dark"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","dark-blue","dark-brown"],"intro":"Omar Galliani is an Italian artist known for his large-scale drawings and intricate use of graphite and charcoal. His work often explores themes of beauty, mystery, and the human condition, blending classical techniques with contemporary sensibilities.","observation":"A dark, subdued portrait style combines close-up faces with expressive painterly surfaces, scratched marks, dry-brush textures, and grain. Fragmented overlays, smears, and obscured features create a distressed collage-like appearance, with occasional blue and rust-red accents against strong shadow and highlight contrast."},{"id":"laura-callaghan","name":"Laura Callaghan","cat":"illustrators","en":"Laura Callaghan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laura-callaghan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laura-callaghan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","red","brown","orange","vivid-red","muted-blue","deep-blue"],"intro":"Laura Callaghan is an Irish illustrator known for her vibrant and detailed works that often explore themes of femininity and contemporary life. Her illustrations are characterized by intricate patterns, bold colors, and a strong narrative quality, often depicting women in various settings.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with fine illustrative linework, saturated reds, oranges, pinks, greens, and blues, and densely layered botanical and textile patterns. Portraits and domestic scenes are integrated into ornate floral environments, with expressive faces, decorative clothing, and abundant small surface details creating a lush, maximal composition."},{"id":"heather-galler","name":"Heather Galler","cat":"painters","en":"Heather Galler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/heather-galler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/heather-galler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","dark-olive","olive","muted-cyan","magenta","ochre"],"intro":"Heather Galler is a contemporary American artist known for her vibrant and whimsical folk art style. Her work often features bold colors, intricate patterns, and a playful approach to subjects ranging from animals to landscapes. Galler's art is celebrated for its joyful and uplifting qualities, drawing inspiration from traditional folk art and modern aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a densely packed botanical collage of oversized flowers and leaves, rendered in intensely saturated color with graphic black contours and repeated decorative motifs. Broad painted marks, flat color areas, patterned petals, and radial or geometric flower centers create an exuberant, highly ornamental surface."},{"id":"harun-farocki","name":"Harun Farocki","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Harun Farocki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harun-farocki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harun-farocki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","retro","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","beige","charcoal","muted-brown","brown","muted-blue"],"intro":"Harun Farocki was a German filmmaker and media artist known for his critical approach to visual culture and media. His work often explored themes of surveillance, war, and the impact of technology on society. Farocki's films and installations are characterized by their analytical style and use of found footage, creating a dialogue between images and their socio-political contexts.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is photographic and strongly cinematic, using grainy, retro-looking imagery, moody brown and gray tones, and pronounced light⁠–shadow separation. Faces and figures are framed through extreme close-ups, silhouettes, reflections, projection-like overlays, and shallow focus, giving the images a tense, fragmented film-still quality."},{"id":"ale-giorgini","name":"Ale Giorgini","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ale Giorgini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ale-giorgini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ale-giorgini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","vivid-red","muted-teal","ochre","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Ale Giorgini is an Italian illustrator known for his distinctive style that merges pop culture with geometric forms. His work often features iconic characters and scenes, rendered in a unique blend of cubism and pop art influences. Giorgini's illustrations are characterized by bold lines, flat colors, and a playful, dynamic energy that resonates with audiences worldwide.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses densely packed character portraits and figures, built from angular simplified forms with heavy black contouring and clean, flat color blocks. Saturated reds, teals, ochres, and blacks create a high-contrast retro graphic look, while varied expressions, clothing, accessories, and facial details keep the crowded compositions energetic and expressive."},{"id":"auguste-herbin","name":"Auguste Herbin","cat":"painters","en":"Auguste Herbin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/auguste-herbin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/auguste-herbin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","illustrative","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["vivid-red","deep-blue","charcoal","pale-orange","dark-red","pink"],"intro":"Auguste Herbin is a French painter known for his contributions to the abstract art movement, particularly in the early to mid-20th century. He was a prominent figure in the development of geometric abstraction and was associated with movements such as Cubism and Orphism. Herbin's work is characterized by its use of bold colors, geometric forms, and a strong sense of composition, often exploring the relationship between color and form.","observation":"The style is built from crisp geometric shapes, clean linear divisions, and flat, saturated blocks of contrasting color. Repeated circles, arches, stripes, grids, and stylized botanical forms create dense but orderly abstract compositions with frequent bilateral or radial balance."},{"id":"christian-riese-lassen","name":"Christian Riese Lassen","cat":"illustrators","en":"Christian Riese Lassen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-riese-lassen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-riese-lassen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["blue","dark-blue","charcoal","muted-magenta","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Christian Riese Lassen is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and detailed depictions of marine life and oceanic landscapes. His work often features a blend of realism and fantasy, capturing the beauty and mystery of the underwater world. Lassen's art is celebrated for its intricate details and vivid color palettes, often inspired by his Hawaiian surroundings.","observation":"These images use richly layered, painterly scenery with fine visible texture, saturated blue-and-orange light, and luminous sunsets or moonlight. Tropical seas, cliffs, palms, reefs, and dolphins are presented as grand, dynamic fantasy landscapes with strong atmospheric depth and abundant environmental detail."},{"id":"jessica-drossin","name":"Jessica Drossin","cat":"photographers","en":"Jessica Drossin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jessica-drossin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jessica-drossin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","glow","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Jessica Drossin is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and romantic portraiture. Her work often features dreamy, fantasy-like themes, capturing the delicate beauty of her subjects in natural settings. Drossin's photography is characterized by a soft focus and warm, earthy color palettes, creating a serene and intimate atmosphere.","observation":"The style is cinematic and photorealistic, built around softly focused woodland portraits and narrative tableaux with richly textured clothing, hair, foliage, and animal detail. Warm low sunlight, atmospheric haze, subdued earthy tones, and glowing highlights give the images a romantic, dreamlike woodland mood."},{"id":"boris-mikhailov","name":"Boris Mikhailov","cat":"photographers","en":"Boris Mikhailov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/boris-mikhailov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/boris-mikhailov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-green","silver","beige","dark-brown","muted-teal"],"intro":"Boris Mikhailov is a renowned Ukrainian photographer known for his compelling and often provocative exploration of post-Soviet society. His work frequently delves into themes of identity, history, and the human condition, capturing the raw and unvarnished realities of life in Eastern Europe. Mikhailov's photography is celebrated for its ability to blend documentary realism with a deeply personal and artistic vision, making him one of the most influential photographers of his generation.","observation":"The style uses realistic, grainy photographic portraiture with subdued teal, brown, and ochre tones, often staged in richly furnished, aging interiors. Formal poses, period garments, framed paintings, and unsettling animal-headed figures create a dark, surreal, cinematic mood across the set."},{"id":"mead-schaeffer","name":"Mead Schaeffer","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mead Schaeffer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mead-schaeffer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mead-schaeffer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-red","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Mead Schaeffer was an American illustrator known for his work during the early to mid-20th century. He gained prominence for his contributions to magazines and books, creating vivid and dynamic illustrations that often depicted adventurous and dramatic scenes. Schaeffer's work is characterized by its attention to detail and ability to convey emotion and narrative through composition and color.","observation":"Across all four images, figures and social situations are rendered with visible, directional brushwork and strongly modelled forms. Deep shadows, warm reds, ochres, and olive-brown tones create a somber, theatrical atmosphere, while dense interiors and period clothing give each scene a richly constructed, classical feeling."},{"id":"katia-chausheva","name":"Katia Chausheva","cat":"photographers","en":"Katia Chausheva","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/katia-chausheva.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/katia-chausheva","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","muted-olive","ochre","light-lime"],"intro":"Katia Chausheva is a contemporary photographer known for her evocative and ethereal portraiture. Her work often explores themes of introspection and beauty, drawing inspiration from classical and romantic art movements. Chausheva's photography is characterized by its soft focus and delicate textures, creating a dreamlike quality that resonates with viewers.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic portraiture with tightly cropped faces, intimate profiles, and dramatic woodland settings. Deep green-brown tones, strong shadow, diffuse backlit haze, selective focus, and visible grain create a somber, atmospheric film still quality."},{"id":"amy-sillman","name":"Amy Sillman","cat":"painters","en":"Amy Sillman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amy-sillman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amy-sillman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","ochre","charcoal","light-pink","blue"],"intro":"Amy Sillman is an American contemporary artist known for her vibrant and dynamic abstract paintings. Her work often explores themes of color, form, and gesture, blending elements of abstraction with figuration. Sillman's art is characterized by its bold use of color, expressive brushwork, and a playful yet contemplative approach to composition.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses layered, visibly brushed paint with large interlocking geometric fragments, translucent washes, and energetic hand-drawn contour lines. Saturated oranges, blues, greens, pinks, and dark neutrals alternate with pale grounds, creating an expressive abstract collage-like surface that balances flat color fields against tactile texture."},{"id":"jon-burgerman","name":"Jon Burgerman","cat":"designers","en":"Jon Burgerman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jon-burgerman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jon-burgerman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","cute","funny"],"colours":["silver","dark-blue","pink","vivid-red","light-yellow","blue","light-lime","green"],"intro":"Jon Burgerman is a British artist known for his playful and whimsical doodle art, often characterized by bold lines and vibrant colors. His work spans various mediums, including illustration, painting, and digital art, and he has collaborated with numerous brands and organizations worldwide. Burgerman's style is recognized for its humorous and surreal characters, often depicted in crowded, dynamic compositions that reflect a sense of joy and spontaneity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses densely packed cartoon-like monster characters with exaggerated eyes, mouths, teeth, and irregular geometric bodies. Saturated colors, thick dark outlines, flat color blocks, and visible brush texture create a playful, hand-painted, highly expressive surface."},{"id":"ellen-von-unwerth","name":"Ellen von Unwerth","cat":"photographers","en":"Ellen von Unwerth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ellen-von-unwerth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ellen-von-unwerth","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","bone-white","beige","deep-red","ochre"],"intro":"Ellen von Unwerth is a renowned German photographer known for her distinctive style in fashion and editorial photography. Her work often features bold, glamorous, and erotic themes, capturing the essence of femininity and allure. Von Unwerth has worked with numerous high-profile fashion magazines and brands, contributing significantly to the visual culture of the fashion industry.","observation":"The style is highly staged editorial fashion photography, combining intimate beauty close-ups with posed full-body portraits in opulent interiors. It uses strong contrast, selective color against black-and-white imagery, ornate surroundings, dramatic makeup, lace garments, and a dark glamorous mood with a slightly retro luxury feel."},{"id":"sergio-toppi","name":"Sergio Toppi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sergio Toppi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sergio-toppi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sergio-toppi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","scenes","motion","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","silver","white","blue","grey","red"],"intro":"Sergio Toppi is an Italian illustrator and comic artist known for his distinctive and intricate style. His work often features detailed line work, surreal imagery, and a strong narrative presence, making him a significant figure in the world of graphic novels and illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense ink-like linework, crosshatching, and heavy dark contours create a stark graphic fantasy style. Monumental creatures and bundled travelers dominate snowy, windswept scenes, with extreme black-and-white contrast and occasional restricted blue or red fields intensifying the bleak, epic atmosphere."},{"id":"kees-van-dongen","name":"Kees van Dongen","cat":"painters","en":"Kees van Dongen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kees-van-dongen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kees-van-dongen","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","fashion","portraits","bold-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["vivid-red","light-red","black","blue","deep-blue","muted-red"],"intro":"Kees van Dongen was a Dutch-French painter known for his vibrant and expressive portraits, often associated with the Fauvist movement. Born in the late 19th century, van Dongen became renowned for his bold use of color and striking depictions of women, capturing the essence of early 20th-century glamour and modernism. His works often featured exaggerated features and a vivid color palette, contributing to the dynamic and emotive quality of his art.","observation":"Across all four images, stylized female portraits are built from vivid blue, coral, pink, black, and cream shapes, with forceful dark contours and visibly textured brushwork. Dramatic hats, bobbed hair, makeup, fur, feathers, and patterned clothing create a glamorous fashion-portrait vocabulary, while simplified faces and assertive poses keep the treatment graphic and expressive."},{"id":"ikenaga-yasunari","name":"Ikenaga Yasunari","cat":"painters","en":"Ikenaga Yasunari","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ikenaga-yasunari.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ikenaga-yasunari","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","ochre","brown","muted-brown","pale-orange","red"],"intro":"Ikenaga Yasunari is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his exquisite portraits that blend traditional and modern techniques. His work often features delicate line work and a focus on serene, introspective female figures, drawing inspiration from both classical Japanese art and contemporary aesthetics.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped female portraits rendered with delicate, highly controlled linework, subtle facial modeling, and a fine grain that gives the images a tactile printed surface. Dark hair and clothing contrast with warm skin and richly patterned floral garments, whose dense red, blue, and ochre ornament creates an intimate, decorative mood."},{"id":"karel-thole","name":"Karel Thole","cat":"painters","en":"Karel Thole","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karel-thole.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karel-thole","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","red","beige","vivid-red"],"intro":"Karel Thole is a renowned illustrator and painter known for his work in science fiction and fantasy art. Born in the Netherlands, Thole gained fame for his imaginative and surreal cover art for books and magazines, particularly in the mid-20th century. His distinctive style often blends elements of the surreal with detailed and fantastical imagery, creating a unique visual language that has influenced many artists in the genre.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds richly detailed speculative landscapes from monumental cliffs, stairways, ruins, machinery, and tiny human figures. Deep blue shadows and saturated orange-red highlights create a stark, cinematic contrast, while grain, graphic edges, and collage-like spatial invention give the scenes a surreal retro-futurist atmosphere."},{"id":"tadao-ando","name":"Tadao Ando","cat":"architects","en":"Tadao Ando","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tadao-ando.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tadao-ando","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","high-contrast","dreamy","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","blue","olive"],"intro":"Tadao Ando is a renowned Japanese architect known for his minimalist designs that emphasize simplicity, natural light, and the integration of architecture with nature. His work often features the use of concrete, creating spaces that are both serene and contemplative. Ando's designs are characterized by their geometric precision and thoughtful use of light and shadow, reflecting his deep appreciation for Japanese aesthetics and Zen philosophy.","observation":"The style presents monumental concrete architecture with precise geometric forms, dramatic apertures, and carefully balanced negative space. Photorealistic, cinematic framing emphasizes sculptural surfaces, strong light-and-shadow contrasts, reflective water, and quiet landscape views."},{"id":"sulamith-wulfing","name":"Sulamith Wulfing","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sulamith Wulfing","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sulamith-wulfing.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sulamith-wulfing","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","brown","black","grey","red"],"intro":"Sulamith Wulfing is a German artist known for her ethereal and mystical illustrations, often depicting fairy-tale and mythological themes. Her work is characterized by delicate lines, intricate details, and a dreamlike quality that transports viewers into enchanted worlds filled with magical beings and nature.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, painterly portraiture with dense botanical and animal detail, using delicate lines and subtle brushwork to weave faces into tangled woodland surroundings. Muted earthy colors, pale skin, soft expressions, and intimate cropping create a dreamy, fairy-tale atmosphere across the portraits and character scenes."},{"id":"elisabeth-fredriksson","name":"Elisabeth Fredriksson","cat":"painters","en":"Elisabeth Fredriksson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elisabeth-fredriksson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elisabeth-fredriksson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","patterns","portraits","glow","mist","high-contrast","subdued-colors","collage","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","silver","dark-cyan","grey","orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Elisabeth Fredriksson is a Swedish artist known for her vibrant and imaginative digital artwork. Her work often features bold colors, geometric patterns, and a blend of surreal and fantasy elements. Fredriksson's art is celebrated for its modern and expressive style, drawing inspiration from nature and contemporary design.","observation":"The style combines photographic mountain and portrait imagery with graphic collage layering, angular geometric frameworks, and metallic copper-gold accents. A restrained dark teal, slate, black, and warm metallic palette creates strong contrast, while mist, moonlight, and distressed stone or paper textures give the compositions an atmospheric tactile finish."},{"id":"sergio-aragones","name":"Sergio Aragones","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sergio Aragones","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sergio-aragones.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sergio-aragones","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","motion","fine-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","ink","funny","geometric"],"colours":["cream","bone-white","ochre","brown","grey","rust"],"intro":"Sergio Aragones is a Spanish cartoonist and writer, best known for his contributions to MAD Magazine and his creation of the comic book series \"Groo the Wanderer.\" Renowned for his quick wit and distinctive style, Aragones has been a significant figure in the world of humor and satire comics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is densely packed with whimsical characters, creatures, architecture, and miniature incidents, unified by precise ink outlines and lively colored illustration. Exaggerated anatomy, impossible scale, expressive faces, and overlapping action give the images a humorous fantasy-storybook energy."},{"id":"john-duncan","name":"John Duncan","cat":"painters","en":"John Duncan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-duncan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-duncan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","black","dark-brown","red","grey"],"intro":"John Duncan is a Scottish painter known for his contributions to the Celtic Revival and Symbolist movements. His work often features mythological themes, drawing on Celtic legends and medieval history, characterized by intricate detail and a romantic, ethereal quality.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, painterly figures with dense ornamental surfaces, flowing textiles, floral patterning, and richly layered backgrounds. Saturated jewel tones, graceful poses, decorative linework, and dreamlike mythic imagery give the scenes an elegant illustrated-fantasy character."},{"id":"suzanne-valadon","name":"Suzanne Valadon","cat":"painters","en":"Suzanne Valadon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/suzanne-valadon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/suzanne-valadon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","deep-red","ochre","red","beige"],"intro":"Suzanne Valadon was a French painter and model, known for her bold and vibrant works that often depicted intimate and personal scenes. Born in 1865, she became the first woman painter admitted to the Société Nationale des Beaux-Arts. Valadon was a self-taught artist whose work was characterized by strong lines, rich colors, and a unique perspective on the female form, often drawing inspiration from her own life experiences and surroundings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible oil-paint brushwork with vivid reds, greens, blues, and deep blacks. Women are presented in expressive portrait and seated-scene compositions, surrounded by flowers, patterned textiles, ceramics, and decorative interiors, with strong contours and dense surface detail."},{"id":"kyffin-williams","name":"Kyffin Williams","cat":"painters","en":"Kyffin Williams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kyffin-williams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kyffin-williams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","grey","bone-white","ochre","beige"],"intro":"Kyffin Williams was a renowned Welsh painter known for his evocative landscapes of Wales, often depicting the rugged terrain and moody skies of the region. His work is characterized by bold, expressive brushstrokes and a limited color palette that captures the essence of the Welsh countryside.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily textured, visible paint with broad directional strokes to build rugged mountain landscapes and small white cottages. The subdued charcoal, cream, ochre, and occasional green palette, simplified architectural shapes, and dense rocky terrain create a strongly illustrative yet tactile pastoral scene."},{"id":"albert-bierstadt","name":"Albert Bierstadt","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Bierstadt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-bierstadt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-bierstadt","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["grey","black","dark-ochre","ochre","bone-white","light-orange"],"intro":"Albert Bierstadt was a German-American painter known for his large landscapes of the American West. He was a prominent member of the Hudson River School, an art movement characterized by romanticized portrayals of nature. Bierstadt's work often depicted the grandeur and beauty of the American wilderness, capturing the vastness and majesty of the landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental mountain valleys, forests, lakes, and waterfalls are rendered with richly visible paint texture and dense natural detail. Dramatic cloud masses, shafts of sunlight, warm highlights, deep shadows, and atmospheric haze give the landscapes an epic, cinematic fantasy grandeur."},{"id":"ozwald-boateng","name":"Ozwald Boateng","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Ozwald Boateng","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ozwald-boateng.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ozwald-boateng","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-red","deep-red","bone-white","vivid-red"],"intro":"Ozwald Boateng is a renowned British fashion designer known for his innovative and vibrant approach to menswear. He has been influential in modernizing classic tailoring with bold colors and contemporary designs. Boateng's work often reflects a fusion of traditional craftsmanship and modern aesthetics, making him a prominent figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"A highly realistic, editorial portrait style built around sharply tailored menswear, sculptural hats, sunglasses, and carefully staged poses. Deep jewel tones, dramatic directional lighting, strong shadows, and ornate interiors create a luxurious, cinematic atmosphere with repeated axial portrait compositions."},{"id":"raphael","name":"Raphael","cat":"painters","en":"Raphael","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raphael.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raphael","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","light-orange","rust","grey"],"intro":"Raphael was an Italian painter and architect of the High Renaissance , celebrated for his clarity of form, ease of composition, and visual achievement of the Neoplatonic ideal of human grandeur. His work is admired for its harmony and balance, and he is considered one of the great masters of Western art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modelled oil-paint surfaces, naturalistic faces, and fine, controlled brushwork. Dark backgrounds and restrained earthy color make the illuminated skin, fabrics, and flowers stand out, while classical clothing and tightly cropped portrait compositions reinforce the old-master atmosphere."},{"id":"paul-delvaux","name":"Paul Delvaux","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Delvaux","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-delvaux.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-delvaux","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","muted-blue","dark-blue","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Paul Delvaux was a Belgian painter known for his surrealist works that often depicted dreamlike scenes with classical architecture and figures. His art is characterized by a unique blend of realism and fantasy, often featuring mysterious and tranquil atmospheres. Delvaux's paintings frequently explore themes of solitude and introspection, with a focus on the human figure and architectural elements.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, realistic cinematic scene-building, with carefully staged architecture, railway tracks, gardens, and solitary figures creating a coherent storybook world. Cool subdued blues, deep shadows, selective warm lamps, and hazy moonlit atmosphere give every render a dark, dreamy, vintage-mystery mood."},{"id":"gabriel-pacheco","name":"Gabriel Pacheco","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gabriel Pacheco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gabriel-pacheco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gabriel-pacheco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","charcoal","brown","silver"],"intro":"Gabriel Pacheco is a contemporary illustrator known for his surreal and dreamlike visual narratives. His work often explores themes of introspection and fantasy, characterized by a unique blend of whimsy and melancholy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines subdued, moody colors with visibly textured, painterly surfaces and carefully constructed illustrative figures. Surreal character-and-animal encounters, elongated proportions, pale faces, dark clothing, and sparse winter settings create a quiet, dreamlike unease."},{"id":"paul-rumsey","name":"Paul Rumsey","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Rumsey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-rumsey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-rumsey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Paul Rumsey is a contemporary British artist known for his intricate and surreal drawings that explore themes of the grotesque and the fantastical. His work often delves into the realms of the subconscious, creating a unique blend of dark surrealism and detailed fantasy.","observation":"Across all four images, anguished human figures are rendered in stark monochrome with dense fine linework, crosshatched shadows, and visibly rough, paper-like texture. Extreme close-ups, tilted heads, deep blacks, and theatrical expressions create an unsettling surreal mood, while the recurring hand-drawn marks unify the portraits."},{"id":"eric-lafforgue","name":"Eric Lafforgue","cat":"photographers","en":"Eric Lafforgue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-lafforgue.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-lafforgue","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Eric Lafforgue is a renowned French photographer known for his striking portraits and documentary-style images that capture the diverse cultures and peoples of the world. His work often focuses on remote and isolated communities, bringing their unique stories and traditions to a global audience through vivid and intimate photography.","observation":"This style uses highly realistic, sharply detailed black-and-white portrait photography with strong tonal contrast and intimate close framing. It emphasizes direct gazes, textured skin, expressive traditional adornment, wrapped textiles, and selective focus, while one wider image extends the same documentary portrait language into a blurred public setting."},{"id":"rafal-olbinski","name":"Rafal Olbinski","cat":"painters","en":"Rafal Olbinski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rafal-olbinski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rafal-olbinski","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["blue","charcoal","muted-blue","beige","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Rafal Olbinski is a Polish-born painter and illustrator known for his surreal and imaginative works. His art often features dreamlike scenes that blend reality with fantasy, drawing on classical and contemporary influences. Olbinski's style is characterized by its meticulous detail and symbolic imagery, often exploring themes of human emotion and existential reflection.","observation":"Across all four renders, carefully modelled figures and birds inhabit bright seaside landscapes, with visible fine brushwork, textured surfaces, and richly layered details. The recurring obscured faces, floating or transformed objects, and impossible juxtapositions create a dreamlike surreal style with saturated blue skies and strong cinematic compositions."},{"id":"ettore-sottsass","name":"Ettore Sottsass","cat":"architects","en":"Ettore Sottsass","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ettore-sottsass.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ettore-sottsass","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["silver","white","beige","charcoal","rust","vivid-yellow","teal"],"intro":"Ettore Sottsass was an influential Italian architect and designer, known for his pivotal role in the Memphis Group, a design collective that emerged in the 1980s. His work is characterized by bold colors, geometric shapes, and a playful approach to design, which challenged traditional aesthetics and embraced a postmodern style.","observation":"The style presents brightly colored, carefully balanced geometric constructions as polished sculptural still lifes. Strong symmetry, clean flat color, varied stone and terrazzo textures, and repeated slabs, columns, cylinders, and stripes create a highly designed architectural look against minimal studio backgrounds."},{"id":"james-r-eads","name":"James R. Eads","cat":"illustrators","en":"James R. Eads","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-r-eads.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-r-eads","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-cyan","black","brown","grey","rust"],"intro":"James R. Eads is an American artist known for his vibrant and mystical illustrations that often explore themes of nature and the cosmos. His work is characterized by a unique blend of traditional and digital techniques, creating a distinctive style that resonates with contemporary audiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured landscapes are built from visible, directional brushstrokes that curl through the sky, water, and foliage. Deep teal shadows contrast with warm amber lights, lanterns, and celestial glows, creating detailed, dreamlike nocturnal scenes with small human figures and boats."},{"id":"pennie-smith","name":"Pennie Smith","cat":"photographers","en":"Pennie Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pennie-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pennie-smith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Pennie Smith is a renowned British photographer known for her iconic images of the punk rock era, particularly her work with bands like The Clash. Her photography captures the raw energy and spirit of the music scene during the late 1970s and early 1980s.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome portrait photography with deep shadows, blown highlights, and a distinctly analog, grainy surface. Reflective interiors, blurred backgrounds, selective focus, and off-center close framing create an intimate, nocturnal cinematic mood."},{"id":"fausto-puglisi","name":"Fausto Puglisi","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Fausto Puglisi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fausto-puglisi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fausto-puglisi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-lines","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","white","beige","dark-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Fausto Puglisi is an Italian fashion designer known for his bold and extravagant designs that often incorporate vibrant colors and intricate patterns. His work is characterized by a fusion of classical and contemporary elements, creating a unique aesthetic that is both luxurious and avant-garde. Puglisi has gained recognition for his ability to blend opulence with modernity, making a significant impact on the fashion industry.","observation":"The style combines polished runway photography with fashion-illustration imagery, consistently centered on models wearing dramatic, highly embellished garments. Saturated red, pink, black, white, and gold accents, intricate textile patterns, oversized shapes, fringe, jewelry, and sharply defined drawn contours create an extravagant editorial look."},{"id":"roger-dean","name":"Roger Dean","cat":"illustrators","en":"Roger Dean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-dean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-dean","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","landscapes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["blue","brown","grey","muted-blue","red","bone-white"],"intro":"Roger Dean is a renowned British artist and designer, celebrated for his distinctive album cover art, particularly for progressive rock bands like Yes and Asia. His work is characterized by fantastical landscapes, surreal architecture, and vibrant color palettes, often blending elements of science fiction and fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents vast, fantastical landscapes with monumental cliffs, unusual trees, reflective water, and occasional elegant birds. Richly textured, painterly surfaces combine with saturated blue, lavender, pink, and coral hues to create a dreamy, surreal, and epic atmosphere."},{"id":"walter-simonson","name":"Walter Simonson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Walter Simonson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walter-simonson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walter-simonson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-ochre","beige","muted-blue","ochre","red"],"intro":"Walter Simonson is an American comic book writer and artist, renowned for his work on Marvel Comics' Thor and other superhero titles. His distinctive style, characterized by dynamic compositions and bold line work, has made a significant impact on the comic book industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses densely packed comic-book compositions with heavy black contouring, intricate ink detail, and strongly expressive heroic or monstrous figures. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and oranges are set against deep darks, producing a vivid, high-contrast illustrated look with fantastical action tableaux."},{"id":"abstract-d-oyley","name":"Abstract D'Oyley","cat":"painters","en":"Abstract D'Oyley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abstract-d-oyley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abstract-d-oyley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","sculptural","landscapes","portraits","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["deep-red","black","vivid-red","orange","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Abstract D'Oyley is a contemporary painter known for their abstract expressionist works. Their paintings often feature bold colors and dynamic brushstrokes, creating a sense of movement and emotion on the canvas. D'Oyley's work has been exhibited in galleries and museums around the world, including the Museum of Modern Art in New York and the Tate Modern in London. They have also been the recipient of numerous awards and grants for their contributions to the art world. D'Oyley's work is often compared to that of Jackson Pollock and Willem de Kooning , as they share a similar approach to abstract expressionism. However, D'Oyley's use of color and composition sets them apart from their predecessors. Their most famous work, The Dance of Color, is a large-scale painting that has been praised for its vibrant energy and emotional impact. D'Oyley continues to be an influential figure in the contemporary art scene, pushing the boundaries of abstract painting and inspiring a new generation of artists.","observation":"Across all four renders, thick visible paint and broad, energetic strokes build highly textured surfaces, with expressive contours and occasional palette-knife-like ridges. Saturated oranges, reds, blues, and blacks create strong contrast, while the subjects shift between eyes, a tree, architecture, and a skyline without losing the same dramatic, impasto-heavy treatment."},{"id":"sergio-pininfarina","name":"Sergio Pininfarina","cat":"designers","en":"Sergio Pininfarina","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sergio-pininfarina.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sergio-pininfarina","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","scenes","urban","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","dark-brown","muted-orange","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"Sergio Pininfarina was an influential Italian automobile designer, renowned for his work with Ferrari and other prestigious car manufacturers. He played a pivotal role in shaping the aesthetic and functional design of luxury vehicles, leaving a lasting legacy in the automotive industry.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic automotive scenes with sleek concept cars staged in elegant architectural courtyards and gardens. Richly reflective surfaces, dramatic sunlight, strong dark-to-light contrast, selective focus, and carefully composed fashion-editorial framing give the images a polished luxury showcase quality."},{"id":"daria-endresen","name":"Daria Endresen","cat":"photographers","en":"Daria Endresen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daria-endresen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daria-endresen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","brown"],"intro":"Daria Endresen is a contemporary artist known for her evocative and surreal photographic works. Her art often explores themes of introspection, emotion, and the human psyche, using a blend of digital manipulation and traditional photographic techniques to create haunting and thought-provoking images.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, cinematic portraiture with subdued green, grey, cream and brown tones, deep shadows, and carefully staged theatrical settings. Flowing garments, loose hair, candlelight, textured surfaces and expressive poses create a dark, dreamy, old-world atmosphere, with selective focus and finely resolved material detail."},{"id":"martin-lewis","name":"Martin Lewis","cat":"printmakers","en":"Martin Lewis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-lewis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-lewis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","backlighting","glow","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Martin Lewis is an Australian-born American artist known for his mastery in printmaking, particularly etching and drypoint. He gained recognition for his detailed and atmospheric depictions of urban life in New York City during the early 20th century. Lewis's work is characterized by its strong use of light and shadow, creating a sense of depth and mood that captures the essence of city life.","observation":"The style is monochrome and strongly cinematic, using deep blacks, brilliant lamp and moon highlights, reflective wet streets, and atmospheric rain or fog. Recurring silhouettes, period urban architecture, bridges, vehicles, ships, and pedestrians create a moody retro city narrative with dramatic backlighting and luminous haze."},{"id":"carolyn-blish","name":"Carolyn Blish","cat":"painters","en":"Carolyn Blish","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carolyn-blish.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carolyn-blish","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","dark-green","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white","ochre","red"],"intro":"Carolyn Blish is an American artist known for her watercolor paintings that often depict serene and idyllic scenes of nature and rural life. Her work is characterized by a gentle, painterly style that captures the beauty of the natural world, often focusing on landscapes, flowers, and children in peaceful settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, layered brushwork to portray softly lit women among abundant garden flowers. Warm, slightly muted colors, loose fine strokes, floral framing, and intimate cropped compositions create a romantic, dreamy illustrative atmosphere."},{"id":"gilbert-shelton","name":"Gilbert Shelton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gilbert Shelton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gilbert-shelton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gilbert-shelton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","patterns","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["black","brown","red","bone-white","yellow","dark-blue","olive"],"intro":"Gilbert Shelton is an American cartoonist and one of the leading figures in the underground comix movement of the 1960s and 1970s. He is best known for creating \"The Fabulous Furry Freak Brothers,\" a comic series that became emblematic of the counterculture era. Shelton's work is characterized by its satirical humor, detailed illustrations, and vibrant storytelling, often reflecting the social and political climate of his time.","observation":"The style uses densely packed illustrative drawings with thick black contour lines, intricate surface patterns, and highly saturated contrasting colors. It combines eccentric character portraits and narrative scenes with floral ornament, theatrical costumes, surreal juxtapositions, and poster-like graphic energy."},{"id":"jacek-yerka","name":"Jacek Yerka","cat":"painters","en":"Jacek Yerka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacek-yerka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacek-yerka","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","landscapes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-blue","ochre","silver","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Jacek Yerka is a contemporary Polish painter known for his surreal and fantastical landscapes. His work often blends elements of reality with dream-like scenarios, creating a unique and imaginative visual experience. Yerka's paintings are characterized by meticulous detail and a vivid color palette, drawing inspiration from both classical and modern artistic movements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured, painterly buildings and vegetation with highly saturated skies, warm masonry, and strong light-dark separation. Fantastic floating environments, tree-grown homes, monumental clouds, and warped architecture create a detailed, dreamlike world while retaining convincing volumetric depth and landscape composition."},{"id":"john-lowrie-morrison","name":"John Lowrie Morrison","cat":"painters","en":"John Lowrie Morrison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-lowrie-morrison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-lowrie-morrison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["deep-blue","blue","dark-blue","muted-red","vivid-red","ochre"],"intro":"John Lowrie Morrison is a contemporary Scottish painter known for his vibrant and expressive landscapes, often depicting the Scottish countryside with bold colors and dynamic compositions. His work is characterized by a lively use of color and a painterly style that captures the essence of the natural environment.","observation":"Across the four views, recognizable coastal and urban settings are built from highly visible, layered paint strokes, with rough, directional marks giving buildings, water, foliage, and sky a tactile surface. The style consistently contrasts deep cobalt and violet surroundings with saturated orange, red, and pink accents from windows, streetlights, sunsets, and reflected light, producing an expressive nocturnal atmosphere."},{"id":"rhads","name":"RHADS","cat":"illustrators","en":"RHADS","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rhads.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rhads","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["dark-blue","muted-blue","muted-rust","orange","brown","pale-orange"],"intro":"RHADS is a digital artist known for creating imaginative and atmospheric illustrations that often blend elements of fantasy and surrealism. Their work typically features expansive landscapes, vibrant color palettes, and a sense of narrative that invites viewers to explore the depicted worlds.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive grasslands and tiny solitary figures are dominated by monumental cloud formations, rendered with visible broad, energetic brushwork. Saturated blue, orange, and peach hues, strong light-dark contrast, and glowing sunset illumination give the landscapes an expressive, grand, almost cinematic sense of scale."},{"id":"phil-tippett","name":"Phil Tippett","cat":"various-artists","en":"Phil Tippett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/phil-tippett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/phil-tippett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","sci-fi"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Phil Tippett is a renowned visual effects supervisor and producer, known for his pioneering work in stop-motion animation and creature design. He has contributed to iconic films such as \"Star Wars\" and \" Jurassic Park ,\" where his innovative techniques have left a lasting impact on the industry.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, densely detailed sculptural scenes built from weathered machinery, salvaged metal, grime, and organic debris. Warm practical lamps, dark backgrounds, muted earthy colors, selective focus, and strong tonal contrast give the workshop and finished-creature images a cinematic, tactile atmosphere."},{"id":"andrey-remnev","name":"Andrey Remnev","cat":"painters","en":"Andrey Remnev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrey-remnev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrey-remnev","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","patterns","portraits","flat-color","metallic","vivid-colors","surreal","classical"],"colours":["orange","brown","dark-brown","grey","deep-blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Andrey Remnev is a contemporary Russian painter known for his unique blend of traditional and modern techniques. His work often draws inspiration from Russian iconography and European art history, creating a distinctive style that is both classical and contemporary.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines highly ornamental costumes and patterned textile backgrounds with saturated blue, red, and gold color blocking. Faces and figures are rendered with smooth, masklike clarity, while metallic-looking surfaces, crackled textures, symbolic flowers, and birds create a surreal, richly decorated tableau."},{"id":"lars-von-trier","name":"Lars von Trier","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Lars von Trier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lars-von-trier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lars-von-trier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"Lars von Trier is a Danish filmmaker known for his provocative and innovative contributions to cinema. His work often explores themes of existentialism, human psychology, and societal norms, characterized by a distinctive style that blends realism with surrealism. Von Trier is a prominent figure in the Dogme 95 movement, which emphasizes traditional storytelling and naturalistic techniques.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic imagery with restrained blue-green darkness, selective red or white accents, and strong atmospheric depth. Fog, smoke, bare trees, dense forest, isolated figures, and spacious framing create a bleak, ominous visual narrative across both outdoor landscapes and interior tableaux."},{"id":"paul-nicklen","name":"Paul Nicklen","cat":"photographers","en":"Paul Nicklen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-nicklen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-nicklen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["dark-cyan","black","muted-blue","muted-cyan","brown","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Paul Nicklen is a renowned Canadian photographer and marine biologist known for his stunning wildlife photography, particularly in polar regions. His work often highlights the beauty and fragility of the natural world, focusing on themes of conservation and environmental awareness.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and cinematic, using close, immersive waterline perspectives, crisp animal detail, and dramatic contrasts between icy blues, dark water, and warm reflected light. Dynamic swimming action, turbulent water, ice formations, and occasional internal glow create an adventurous, high-impact visual language across the set."},{"id":"paul-gustav-fischer","name":"Paul Gustav Fischer","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Gustav Fischer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-gustav-fischer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-gustav-fischer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","ochre","dark-red","olive"],"intro":"Paul Gustav Fischer is a Danish painter known for his depictions of city life and intimate domestic scenes. Born in 1860, Fischer's work often captures the essence of Copenhagen and other European cities, reflecting the lifestyle and architecture of the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His paintings are characterized by a naturalistic style with a focus on light and atmosphere, often portraying scenes of everyday life with a sense of elegance and detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible brushwork, layered tonal detail, and soft yet expressive handling of figures, architecture, foliage, and wet surfaces. It consistently combines subdued atmospheric colors with warmer luminous accents, presenting narrative urban and garden scenes populated by carefully dressed characters."},{"id":"jessica-roux","name":"Jessica Roux","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jessica Roux","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jessica-roux.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jessica-roux","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","silver","brown","beige","grey","dark-brown"],"intro":"Jessica Roux is an illustrator known for her intricate and nature-inspired artwork. Her work often features detailed botanical elements, whimsical themes, and a soft, muted color palette that evokes a sense of nostalgia and romanticism. Roux's illustrations are characterized by fine lines and delicate shading, creating a dreamy and ethereal atmosphere.","observation":"The style combines highly rendered, visibly brushed portraiture with intimate close-up compositions, intricate lace, hair, feathers, flowers, and branching foliage. Its subdued, earthy palette and dark botanical settings create a dreamy, romantic atmosphere, while recurring animals and floral adornments give the portraits a fantastical natural-symbolic character."},{"id":"saul-tepper","name":"Saul Tepper","cat":"illustrators","en":"Saul Tepper","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/saul-tepper.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/saul-tepper","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","pale-yellow","dark-red"],"intro":"Saul Tepper is a renowned American illustrator known for his work during the Golden Age of Illustration. His art often depicted scenes of American life with a focus on narrative and character-driven compositions. Tepper's illustrations were widely published in magazines and advertisements, capturing the essence of mid-20th century America.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, energetic brushwork to depict crowded social scenes with expressive faces, elaborate clothing, and strong light-dark separation. Muted earth tones are punctuated by deep reds and warm highlights, while layered figures, hats, architecture, and gestures create a richly populated classical atmosphere."},{"id":"ferris-plock","name":"Ferris Plock","cat":"painters","en":"Ferris Plock","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ferris-plock.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ferris-plock","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","light-orange","rust","grey","charcoal","vivid-red"],"intro":"Ferris Plock is an American artist known for his unique blend of traditional and contemporary art styles. His work often features intricate details and a whimsical approach, drawing inspiration from various cultural and historical sources. Plock's art is characterized by its playful yet detailed nature, often incorporating elements of fantasy and surrealism.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely packed figures and objects are constructed from intricate patterns, costume-like textiles, mechanical fragments, and decorative motifs. Fine contour lines, clean graphic color areas, and saturated coral, blue, red, and cream tones create an illustrative collage effect, while surreal combinations and oversized forms give the style a fantastical character."},{"id":"alvaro-siza","name":"Alvaro Siza","cat":"architects","en":"Alvaro Siza","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alvaro-siza.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alvaro-siza","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-blue","pale-yellow","brown","muted-brown","blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Alvaro Siza is a renowned Portuguese architect known for his modernist and minimalist designs. His work is characterized by clean lines, functional forms, and a deep respect for the surrounding environment. Siza's architecture often integrates seamlessly with its context, reflecting a thoughtful balance between innovation and tradition.","observation":"The style presents monumental modern architecture as crisp, realistic architectural photography, emphasizing geometric planes, sculptural massing, stairways, and deep spatial recesses. Warm pale concrete, saturated blue skies, strong sunlight, and pronounced shadows create a restrained but high-contrast atmosphere, with small human figures reinforcing the scale."},{"id":"catherine-pooler","name":"Catherine Pooler","cat":"designers","en":"Catherine Pooler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/catherine-pooler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/catherine-pooler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","orange","red","muted-cyan","brown","ochre","light-yellow"],"intro":"Catherine Pooler is a designer known for her vibrant and imaginative artistic style. Her work often incorporates elements of fantasy and surrealism, creating a unique blend of modern and whimsical aesthetics. Pooler's designs are characterized by their intricate detailing and vivid color palettes, often drawing inspiration from nature and mythical themes.","observation":"The style combines visibly layered acrylic-like paint, translucent watercolor washes, fine drawn outlines, and collage-like surface textures. Saturated coral, pink, teal, blue, and green hues support expressive floral studies, butterfly imagery, and a tightly cropped portrait, with ornamental marks and metallic-looking flecks adding tactile richness."},{"id":"karl-blossfeldt","name":"Karl Blossfeldt","cat":"photographers","en":"Karl Blossfeldt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karl-blossfeldt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karl-blossfeldt","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","drawing","ink","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","black","bone-white","charcoal","beige"],"intro":"Karl Blossfeldt was a German photographer known for his close-up photographs of plants and flora. His work is celebrated for its detailed and artistic representation of natural forms, often highlighting the intricate patterns and structures found in nature. Blossfeldt's photographs were influential in the New Objectivity movement, emphasizing clarity and precision in capturing the beauty of the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, enlarged botanical specimens are isolated against generous backgrounds and rendered in monochrome with strong tonal separation. Fine, ink-like lines, engraved textures, and carefully modelled petal and leaf forms give the plants a detailed, darkly dramatic natural-history-plate appearance."},{"id":"luke-chueh","name":"Luke Chueh","cat":"painters","en":"Luke Chueh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luke-chueh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luke-chueh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","silver","bone-white","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Luke Chueh is a contemporary artist known for his unique blend of pop surrealism and lowbrow art. His work often features anthropomorphic characters, combining elements of humor and melancholy. Chueh's art is characterized by its clean lines, soft color palettes, and a distinctive style that merges cute and dark themes.","observation":"The style uses visibly brushed, textured paint with soft, fine strokes to depict simplified animal-like characters in sparse, uncanny encounters. Muted gray and pastel tones, isolated figures, exaggerated scale, and occasional stark red accents create a dreamy but quietly unsettling atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"marc-adamus","name":"Marc Adamus","cat":"photographers","en":"Marc Adamus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-adamus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-adamus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","backlighting","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-blue","muted-blue","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Marc Adamus is a renowned landscape photographer known for his breathtaking and dramatic nature photography. His work often captures the grandeur and beauty of remote wilderness areas, utilizing advanced photographic techniques to create images that are both technically impressive and emotionally evocative.","observation":"The style presents expansive mountain and volcanic landscapes with highly realistic, finely resolved terrain, rock, snow, vegetation, and water. Strong sunrise and sunset backlighting creates luminous beams, vivid orange and pink skies, deep shadows, mist-filled valleys, and a grand cinematic sense of scale."},{"id":"simon-bisley","name":"Simon Bisley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Simon Bisley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/simon-bisley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/simon-bisley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","red","muted-blue","beige","bone-white","vivid-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Simon Bisley is a renowned British comic book artist known for his dynamic and muscular art style, particularly in the fantasy and science fiction genres. His work often features bold, expressive characters and intricate details, making him a significant figure in the world of graphic novels and comics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly rough, directional paint strokes to build densely detailed, strongly modeled monstrous figures and armor. Dark, cool grounds are cut by saturated red, orange, and blue accents, with harsh contrast, expressive faces, heavy contours, and abundant spikes, fur, bone, and metal ornament."},{"id":"warren-keelan","name":"Warren Keelan","cat":"photographers","en":"Warren Keelan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/warren-keelan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/warren-keelan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","landscapes","mist","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","pale-orange","grey","orange"],"intro":"Warren Keelan is a renowned Australian photographer known for his breathtaking seascapes and ocean imagery. His work captures the dynamic and ever-changing nature of the sea, often focusing on the interplay of light and water. Keelan's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey the power and beauty of the ocean, making him a prominent figure in marine photography.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, densely textured ocean waves with dramatic curling forms, turbulent foam, and airborne spray. Dark teal water, warm orange light, strong tonal contrast, and misty atmospheric spray create a cinematic, powerful sense of motion across all four renders."},{"id":"benedick-bana","name":"Benedick Bana","cat":"illustrators","en":"Benedick Bana","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/benedick-bana.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/benedick-bana","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["beige","grey","black","white","brown","rust"],"intro":"Benedick Bana is a contemporary digital artist known for his dynamic and futuristic illustrations, often featuring sci-fi and fantasy themes. His work is characterized by bold compositions, intense contrasts, and a focus on character design, making him a notable figure in the digital art community.","observation":"Across all four renders, dark armored figures are built from energetic, visibly layered brushwork and sharply broken marks, with broad strokes defining both bodies and trailing motion. Restrained beige, gray, and black tones dominate, punctuated by occasional orange highlights and strong light-dark separation, giving the fantasy warriors a grim, kinetic presence."},{"id":"alfred-wallis","name":"Alfred Wallis","cat":"painters","en":"Alfred Wallis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-wallis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-wallis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","charcoal","bone-white","beige","grey","black"],"intro":"Alfred Wallis was a British fisherman and self-taught artist known for his distinctive naive style, depicting maritime scenes and landscapes. Born in 1855 in Devon, England, Wallis began painting in his later years, using materials like cardboard and household paint. His work is characterized by its simplicity, bold outlines, and flat perspective, capturing the essence of the Cornish coast and seafaring life.","observation":"Across all four renders, maritime scenes are built from simplified, strongly outlined boats, lighthouses, and clustered harbor buildings. Muted blue, cream, black, and umber hues sit on visibly worked paint surfaces, with broad marks, scraped texture, and aged crackle giving the illustrations a weathered, tactile finish."},{"id":"rafael-albuquerque","name":"Rafael Albuquerque","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rafael Albuquerque","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rafael-albuquerque.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rafael-albuquerque","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","deep-red","dark-teal","silver","light-yellow"],"intro":"Rafael Albuquerque is a Brazilian comic book artist known for his work on titles such as \"American Vampire\" and \"Batman.\" His style is characterized by a dynamic and expressive approach, often incorporating bold lines and dramatic contrasts.","observation":"Across all four renders, figurative portraits and full-body characters are built from forceful angular shapes, deep black masses, and vivid crimson, teal, and blue accents. Broad, visible brushwork, scraped textures, hard graphic contours, and fragmented backgrounds create an expressive, high-contrast painted illustration with a dark, surreal charge."},{"id":"helen-cottle","name":"Helen Cottle","cat":"painters","en":"Helen Cottle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helen-cottle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helen-cottle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","brown","grey","deep-red"],"intro":"Helen Cottle is an artist known for her expressive and emotive paintings, often focusing on the interplay of light and shadow. Her work frequently explores themes of solitude and introspection, capturing moments of quiet reflection with a distinctive use of color and texture.","observation":"Across all four images, loose visible brushwork and textured paint create atmospheric rainy scenes, with gray surroundings sharply punctuated by red umbrellas, coats, and flowers. Reflective pavement, softened distance, bare trees, and recurring figures give the style a moody, narrative urban-poetic character."},{"id":"frank-cho","name":"Frank Cho","cat":"illustrators","en":"Frank Cho","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-cho.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-cho","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","pale-yellow","black","brown"],"intro":"Frank Cho is a renowned comic book artist and writer known for his work on series like 'Liberty Meadows' and 'Mighty Avengers.' His art is celebrated for its dynamic compositions, detailed line work, and expressive characters, often featuring strong female protagonists.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses highly rendered black-and-white portrait drawing with precise contour lines, dense hatching, and strong pools of ink against a warm paper ground. Glamorous, fashion-oriented figures are posed in cropped compositions, with flowing hair, clothing details, accessories, and occasional macabre imagery adding a dark, graphic edge."},{"id":"pierre-jacques-pelletier","name":"Pierre-Jacques Pelletier","cat":"painters","en":"Pierre-Jacques Pelletier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-jacques-pelletier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-jacques-pelletier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","silver","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Pierre-Jacques Pelletier is a contemporary artist known for his imaginative and surrealistic approach to painting. His works often explore themes of fantasy and mythology, blending realistic techniques with dreamlike elements to create evocative and thought-provoking imagery.","observation":"The style presents grand fantasy landscapes with monumental cliffs, castles, waterfalls, clouds, and tiny human figures, combining dark teal shadows with amber, orange, and icy highlights. Visible brushwork and atmospheric haze give the scenes a richly painterly, highly detailed surface, while internal light sources and strong tonal contrasts create an epic, dreamlike mood."},{"id":"bob-englehart","name":"Bob Englehart","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bob Englehart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-englehart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-englehart","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","bw-monochrome","comics","drawing","funny","geometric"],"colours":["white","silver","olive","light-lime","grey","black","rust"],"intro":"Bob Englehart is an American cartoonist known for his editorial cartoons and humorous illustrations. His work often features sharp wit and social commentary, making him a recognizable figure in the world of political and editorial art.","observation":"The style uses energetic cartoon drawing with thick, irregular black contours, expressive faces, exaggerated proportions, and clear visual storytelling. Most images rely on black-and-white ink and sparse hatching, while the colored panel retains the same graphic linework with a restrained flat palette and geometric interiors."},{"id":"alexander-payne","name":"Alexander Payne","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Alexander Payne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexander-payne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexander-payne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","cyan","grey","rust","pale-orange","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Alexander Payne is an American filmmaker known for his work in the film industry, particularly in the genre of comedy-drama. He has received critical acclaim for his ability to blend humor with poignant storytelling, often focusing on human relationships and personal journeys. Some of his notable films include 'Sideways,' 'The Descendants,' and 'Nebraska,' which have earned him several awards and nominations.","observation":"The style combines cinematic portrait framing with a graphic, illustrative treatment: strong contour lines, simplified painted shapes, selective texture, and carefully observed facial features. Across the photographic and drawn-looking scenes, it favors moody warm shadows, high contrast, thoughtful figures, and urban architectural settings with a restrained retro-editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"kilian-eng","name":"Kilian Eng","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kilian Eng","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kilian-eng.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kilian-eng","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","epic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","muted-magenta","dark-red","red","orange"],"intro":"Kilian Eng is a Swedish illustrator known for his intricate and imaginative digital artworks, often exploring themes of science fiction and fantasy. His work is characterized by detailed line work, vibrant color palettes, and surreal landscapes, drawing inspiration from both futuristic and mythological elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds vast fantastical landscapes from densely worked architectural ruins, cavernous rock formations, arches, pillars, and distant spires. Fine contour-like marks and painterly texture give the scenes an expressive, intricately layered surface, while deep blue-black shadows contrast with coral, orange, and pink luminous areas for a moody, epic atmosphere."},{"id":"maia-flore","name":"Maia Flore","cat":"photographers","en":"Maia Flore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maia-flore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maia-flore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","landscapes","scenes","motion","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","muted-cyan","brown","deep-red","charcoal"],"intro":"Maia Flore is a contemporary French photographer known for her imaginative and dreamlike imagery. Her work often explores themes of fantasy and surrealism, creating ethereal worlds that blend reality with the fantastical. Flore's photography has been exhibited internationally, capturing the attention of audiences with her unique visual narratives.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic photography with expansive compositions, cool hazy environments, and striking red accents in clothing, balloons, and furniture. Dreamlike surreal situations are staged with isolated figures, flowing fabric, windblown hair, atmospheric smoke, and generous negative space."},{"id":"ed-emshwiller","name":"Ed Emshwiller","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ed Emshwiller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-emshwiller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-emshwiller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","grey","red","dark-brown","silver","ochre","light-yellow"],"intro":"Ed Emshwiller was an American artist and filmmaker known for his work in science fiction illustration and experimental film. His illustrations graced the covers of numerous science fiction magazines in the 1950s and 1960s, making him a significant figure in the genre. Emshwiller's work is celebrated for its imaginative and detailed depictions of futuristic worlds and technology.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines strongly visible, broad painterly strokes with tightly composed illustrative storytelling, dramatic character close-ups, and high-contrast lighting. Saturated reds, oranges, greens, and blues reinforce a vivid retro pulp mood, moving between glamorous portraits, automobile scenes, and fantastical action tableaux."},{"id":"rackstraw-downes","name":"Rackstraw Downes","cat":"painters","en":"Rackstraw Downes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rackstraw-downes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rackstraw-downes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","olive","light-yellow","silver","rust"],"intro":"Rackstraw Downes is a British-born American painter known for his panoramic landscapes and meticulous attention to detail. His work often captures the vastness and complexity of urban and rural environments, focusing on the interplay of light and space.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly observed rural landscapes with dense foliage, layered hills, cottages, and occasional human activity. Visible brushwork and fine, descriptive marks create a softly expressive, sunlit atmosphere, with deep greenery and warm highlights giving the scenes a dreamy, cinematic sense of place."},{"id":"bruno-barbey","name":"Bruno Barbey","cat":"photographers","en":"Bruno Barbey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruno-barbey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruno-barbey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","motion","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","bone-white","muted-ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Bruno Barbey is a renowned French photographer known for his vibrant and evocative images that capture the essence of different cultures around the world. A member of Magnum Photos, Barbey's work spans decades and continents, documenting the human condition with a keen eye for color and composition. His photographs often explore themes of cultural identity, daily life, and the interplay of light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is cinematic and realistic, presenting densely composed urban vignettes with people caught in candid, story-like moments. Warm, subdued colors, weathered architecture, hard directional sunlight, and deep shadows create a gritty retro street-photography atmosphere."},{"id":"nick-knight","name":"Nick Knight","cat":"photographers","en":"Nick Knight","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nick-knight.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nick-knight","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","muted-red","charcoal","grey","brown","red"],"intro":"Nick Knight is a renowned British fashion photographer known for his innovative and artistic approach to photography. He has worked with some of the most prestigious fashion houses and magazines, creating iconic images that blend art and fashion. Knight's work often explores themes of beauty, identity, and transformation, using cutting-edge technology and creative techniques to push the boundaries of traditional photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, fashion-like human figures dissolve into dense bouquets and translucent fabric, with visible brushwork, layered textures, and energetic directional strokes. Pale backgrounds and generous negative space heighten the dreamy, surreal effect while pinks, blues, reds, and dark accents create expressive floral movement."},{"id":"coles-phillips","name":"Coles Phillips","cat":"illustrators","en":"Coles Phillips","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/coles-phillips.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/coles-phillips","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","black","red","dark-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Coles Phillips was an American artist and illustrator known for his distinctive style during the early 20th century. He gained fame for his 'fadeaway girl' technique, where the subject's clothing would blend into the background, creating a unique visual effect. His work was prominently featured in magazines and advertisements, capturing the fashion and lifestyle of the era.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered painted surfaces with clean illustrative shapes, controlled outlines, and selectively flat blocks of muted coral, blue, green, cream, and black. It emphasizes elegant fashion portraits with wide-brim hats, patterned textiles, decorative interiors, and carefully arranged animals, using dense surface detail and cropped geometric compositions with a nostalgic vintage feel."},{"id":"james-brooks","name":"James Brooks","cat":"painters","en":"James Brooks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-brooks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-brooks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","ornate","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","black","vivid-red","pale-orange","red","beige"],"intro":"James Brooks is an American abstract painter known for his contributions to the Abstract Expressionist movement. Born in 1906, Brooks developed a style characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions, often incorporating elements of chance and spontaneity. His work is celebrated for its expressive use of form and color, reflecting the energy and innovation of mid-20th-century American art.","observation":"Across all four panels, large abstract forms are built from forceful black, red, orange, cream, and ochre paint, with visible scraping, ridges, drips, and directional strokes. The compositions feel energetic and tactile, balancing broad flat masses against distressed marks and layered painterly surfaces."},{"id":"lucas-foglia","name":"Lucas Foglia","cat":"photographers","en":"Lucas Foglia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucas-foglia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucas-foglia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","black","brown","dark-brown","beige"],"intro":"Lucas Foglia is an American photographer known for his exploration of human interaction with nature and rural environments. His work often delves into themes of identity, solitude, and the relationship between people and their surroundings, capturing the essence of American rural life with a contemplative and introspective approach.","observation":"The style is cinematic and highly realistic, combining carefully staged human situations with expansive rural landscapes, weathered structures, animals, and dense natural textures. Muted earthy colors, soft atmospheric light, occasional shallow focus, and spacious compositions create a quiet, dreamlike melancholy across all four renders."},{"id":"robert-campin","name":"Robert Campin","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Campin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-campin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-campin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","deep-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Robert Campin was a pioneering figure in early Netherlandish painting, active during the early 15th century. Often identified with the Master of Flémalle, Campin is known for his detailed and realistic approach, which laid the groundwork for the Northern Renaissance. His works are characterized by meticulous attention to detail, realistic textures, and the use of oil paints to achieve depth and richness in color. Campin's paintings often depict religious themes, domestic interiors, and everyday life, reflecting the cultural and societal contexts of his time.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely modeled oil painting with visible surface texture, minute facial detail, and carefully rendered fabrics, objects, and architecture. Dark interiors and deep shadows are punctuated by restrained jewel-like reds and blues, while devotional figures, skulls, books, and ornate Gothic surroundings create a solemn, densely composed atmosphere."},{"id":"tracy-scott","name":"Tracy Scott","cat":"designers","en":"Tracy Scott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tracy-scott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tracy-scott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","vivid-red","dark-red","muted-cyan","ochre","dark-blue"],"intro":"Tracy Scott is a contemporary designer known for her vibrant and imaginative artistic style. Her work often incorporates elements of fantasy and surrealism, creating visually striking pieces that captivate audiences with their bold use of color and intricate details.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated flowers, foliage, faces, and animal forms are densely interwoven into highly decorative portraits and organic compositions. Visible directional brushwork, heavy contouring, layered color patches, and curling geometric shapes create an expressive, surreal painted surface."},{"id":"julian-opie","name":"Julian Opie","cat":"various-artists","en":"Julian Opie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julian-opie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julian-opie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","silhouette"],"colours":["blue","black","dark-blue","silver","vivid-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Julian Opie is a British artist known for his distinctive style of simplified portraits and figures, often characterized by bold outlines and flat colors. His work is influenced by pop art and graphic design, and he has been a prominent figure in contemporary art since the late 20th century. Opie's art often explores themes of modern identity and urban life, capturing the essence of individuals through minimalistic yet expressive forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses clean, poster-like flat colour with very heavy black contouring and simplified, graphic figures. Saturated blue grounds, strong red and blue clothing accents, deep silhouettes, and long angular shadows create a high-contrast urban atmosphere with a sense of movement and visual storytelling."},{"id":"albert-uderzo","name":"Albert Uderzo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Albert Uderzo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-uderzo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-uderzo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","funny"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","orange","muted-cyan","dark-red"],"intro":"Albert Uderzo was a renowned French comic book artist and scriptwriter, best known for co-creating the \"Asterix\" series with René Goscinny. His work is celebrated for its vibrant and humorous depiction of ancient Gaul, filled with lively characters and imaginative storytelling. Uderzo's style is characterized by its dynamic compositions, expressive characters, and detailed backgrounds, making his work a staple in the world of Franco-Belgian comics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely packed adventure scenes with exaggerated cartoon characters, fantastical creatures, and energetic action. Strong black contouring, vivid color blocks, expressive poses, and a visibly rough painted surface create a bold comic-illustration look."},{"id":"david-shepherd","name":"David Shepherd","cat":"painters","en":"David Shepherd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-shepherd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-shepherd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","grey","bone-white","beige","muted-ochre"],"intro":"David Shepherd was a renowned British wildlife artist known for his realistic and detailed paintings of animals and landscapes. He was celebrated for his ability to capture the essence of wildlife and his commitment to conservation efforts, which often inspired his work.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visible brushwork with highly detailed, lifelike animal forms and expressive wildlife compositions. Muted earthy colors, atmospheric haze, dramatic skies, and warm directional light give the savanna scenes a solemn, cinematic-feeling grandeur while retaining a hand-painted illustrative character."},{"id":"james-bama","name":"James Bama","cat":"painters","en":"James Bama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-bama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-bama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","backlighting","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","silver","charcoal","beige","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"James Bama is an American artist known for his realistic portrayals of Western and Native American subjects. Born in 1926, Bama's work is celebrated for its meticulous detail and ability to capture the essence of his subjects. His art often reflects themes of the American West, showcasing cowboys, Native Americans, and frontier life.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic character imagery with heavily weathered textures, dark earthy colors, and strong contrast between shadowed figures and pale skies. Mist, haze, and backlighting create a bleak, monumental frontier atmosphere, while recurring riders, horses, skulls, and sparse landscapes reinforce the epic western mood."},{"id":"sophie-taeuber-arp","name":"Sophie Taeuber-Arp","cat":"painters","en":"Sophie Taeuber-Arp","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sophie-taeuber-arp.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sophie-taeuber-arp","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","ornate","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","light-orange","vivid-red","muted-blue","orange","teal"],"intro":"Sophie Taeuber-Arp was a Swiss artist, painter, sculptor, and dancer, known for her contributions to the Dada movement and her involvement with the Bauhaus school. Her work is characterized by geometric abstraction and a playful use of color and form, often incorporating elements of dance and movement. Taeuber-Arp's innovative approach to art and design has made her a significant figure in modernist art history.","observation":"Across all four works, the style uses bold geometric abstraction built from clean-edged circles, semicircles, rectangles, stripes, and strong vertical or horizontal divisions. Saturated primary and mustard tones contrast with black and cream, while the visible woven surface gives the flat, poster-like shapes a tactile textile character."},{"id":"peter-dundas","name":"Peter Dundas","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Peter Dundas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-dundas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-dundas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","red","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Peter Dundas is a renowned fashion designer known for his glamorous and opulent designs. He has worked with several high-profile fashion houses and is celebrated for his bold use of color, intricate detailing, and luxurious fabrics. Dundas's work often features a blend of modern and historical influences, creating a unique and captivating aesthetic.","observation":"Across all four renders, fashion portraits are presented with highly realistic faces and richly worked garments, especially lace, embroidery, brocade, ruffles, and jewelry. Fine painterly texture, subdued jewel-like colors, gilded accents, and dim tapestry-filled interiors create an ornate, old-world editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"stik","name":"Stik","cat":"street-artists","en":"Stik","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stik.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stik","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","surreal","funny"],"colours":["blue","brown","black","silver","dark-blue","bone-white"],"intro":"Stik is a contemporary street artist known for his simplistic yet expressive stick figure murals. His work often reflects themes of community and social issues, using minimalistic forms to convey powerful messages. Stik's art is recognizable for its bold lines and geometric shapes, often painted on urban walls across cities.","observation":"The style combines vivid blue mural grounds with stark, flat black or cream figures built from simple circles, elongated bodies, and heavy hand-painted outlines. Repeated faceless characters, exaggerated scale, visible wall texture, and occasional paint drips create a bold, humorous, surreal presence integrated into real urban architecture."},{"id":"guo-pei","name":"Guo Pei","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Guo Pei","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guo-pei.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guo-pei","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","metallic","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","grey","silver","brown","black","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Guo Pei is a renowned Chinese fashion designer known for her intricate and opulent creations that blend traditional Chinese aesthetics with modern haute couture. Her work often features elaborate embroidery, luxurious fabrics, and dramatic silhouettes, drawing inspiration from historical and cultural themes.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic fashion portraits built around monumental, sculptural gowns with dense ornamental surface work, metallic gold detailing, and elaborate headpieces. Soft cinematic lighting, shallow backgrounds, reflective floors, and restrained cream, blue, and gold tones create a dreamy couture-gallery atmosphere."},{"id":"raqib-shaw","name":"Raqib Shaw","cat":"painters","en":"Raqib Shaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raqib-shaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raqib-shaw","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["dark-brown","charcoal","grey","dark-blue","red","orange"],"intro":"Raqib Shaw is a contemporary artist known for his intricate and opulent paintings that often explore themes of fantasy, mythology, and cultural fusion. Born in Calcutta, India, and raised in Kashmir, Shaw's work is characterized by its elaborate detailing and vibrant color palettes, drawing inspiration from both Eastern and Western art traditions.","observation":"The style is an intensely layered, painterly fantasy tableau, packed with finely rendered flora, animals, riders, architectural details, and flowing organic forms. Saturated coral, turquoise, cobalt, and deep green create a vivid ornamental surface, while graceful movement and elaborate decoration give the scenes a dreamlike, epic character."},{"id":"gerda-wegener","name":"Gerda Wegener","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gerda Wegener","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerda-wegener.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerda-wegener","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["pale-orange","orange","rust","beige","charcoal","dark-brown"],"intro":"Gerda Wegener was a Danish illustrator and painter known for her Art Nouveau style and portraits that often featured elegant and fashionable women. Her work is celebrated for its decorative elements and exploration of gender and beauty, often depicting her partner, Lili Elbe.","observation":"The style combines finely outlined, illustrative portraiture with visible painted texture and densely patterned floral decoration. Saturated coral, teal, cream, and green hues, elegant period clothing, cropped compositions, and ornamental botanical surroundings create a polished vintage fashion-poster look."},{"id":"charles-courtney-curran","name":"Charles Courtney Curran","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Courtney Curran","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-courtney-curran.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-courtney-curran","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","blue","red"],"intro":"Charles Courtney Curran was an American painter known for his depictions of women in idyllic outdoor settings. Born in 1861, Curran was a prominent figure in American Impressionism , celebrated for his ability to capture light and atmosphere in his works. His paintings often feature serene landscapes and domestic scenes, reflecting the tranquility and beauty of everyday life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses luminous, richly layered garden scenes with expressive female figures and abundant flowers. Visible brushwork, broken color, and fine directional strokes create a painterly yet representational surface, while strong sunlight and deep foliage produce vivid color and emphatic contrast."},{"id":"howard-schatz","name":"Howard Schatz","cat":"photographers","en":"Howard Schatz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howard-schatz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howard-schatz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","scenes","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["deep-red","black","red","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Howard Schatz is a renowned American photographer known for his innovative work in the fields of dance, fashion, and underwater photography. His images often explore the human form and movement, capturing the grace and fluidity of dancers and athletes. Schatz's work is celebrated for its technical precision and artistic vision, making him a prominent figure in contemporary photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, human figures are enveloped by enormous billowing red textiles that behave like sculptural waves, creating a highly dynamic sense of motion. Saturated coral-red fabric stands out against stark black, white, or charcoal grounds, with realistic bodies, dramatic studio lighting, and densely layered folds producing an expressive, dreamlike fashion-performance aesthetic."},{"id":"joel-meyerowitz","name":"Joel Meyerowitz","cat":"photographers","en":"Joel Meyerowitz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joel-meyerowitz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joel-meyerowitz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","urban","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-brown","silver","ochre","blue"],"intro":"Joel Meyerowitz is an influential American photographer known for his pioneering work in color photography. Born in 1938, Meyerowitz has been a significant figure in the field of street photography, capturing the essence of urban life with a keen eye for color and composition. His work often focuses on the everyday moments of city life, bringing a sense of vibrancy and realism to his images.","observation":"These photographic scenes use cinematic framing, selective focus, and visible film grain to evoke an atmospheric mid-century urban world. Muted teal, amber, brown, and occasional pink tones, along with tailored clothing, vintage cars, drifting steam, and hazy city backgrounds, create a restrained retro mood across all four renders."},{"id":"glenn-murcutt","name":"Glenn Murcutt","cat":"architects","en":"Glenn Murcutt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/glenn-murcutt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/glenn-murcutt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","grey","silver","orange"],"intro":"Glenn Murcutt is an Australian architect renowned for his environmentally sensitive and sustainable designs. His work often emphasizes harmony with the natural environment, utilizing materials and forms that reflect the Australian landscape. Murcutt's designs are celebrated for their simplicity and functionality, often incorporating elements like natural light and ventilation to enhance the living experience.","observation":"The style combines realistic architectural imagery with dense, highly legible environmental detail and cinematic natural light. Repeated woodland buildings are presented through layered, collage-like compositions with visible grain, rough texture, strong shadows, and occasional surreal distortions of structure and perspective."},{"id":"geoff-johns","name":"Geoff Johns","cat":"illustrators","en":"Geoff Johns","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/geoff-johns.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/geoff-johns","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","glow","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-cyan","rust","light-yellow","green"],"intro":"Geoff Johns is a prominent American comic book writer and producer known for his work with DC Comics. He has been influential in shaping modern superhero narratives, contributing to iconic series such as Green Lantern, The Flash, and Justice League. Johns has also played a significant role in adapting comic book stories for film and television, making him a key figure in contemporary pop culture.","observation":"The style is densely packed superhero comic-book illustration, combining bold ink contours with fine, visible brushwork and sharply modeled anatomy. Saturated costume colors, deep shadows, bright energy effects, and tightly layered figures create an expressive, high-contrast ensemble composition."},{"id":"lois-dodd","name":"Lois Dodd","cat":"painters","en":"Lois Dodd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lois-dodd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lois-dodd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-olive","olive","grey","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Lois Dodd is an American painter known for her plein air landscapes and intimate depictions of everyday life. Born in 1927, she is a prominent figure in the New York art scene, recognized for her ability to capture the subtleties of light and atmosphere in her work. Dodd's paintings often feature rural and domestic scenes, reflecting a deep connection to her surroundings and a keen observation of the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, energetic brushwork to build dense gardens, trees, houses, and surrounding countryside. Saturated greens are punctuated by warm reds, oranges, pinks, and blues, while simplified but recognizable forms create lively illustrative scenes with abundant botanical detail."},{"id":"frederick-varley","name":"Frederick Varley","cat":"painters","en":"Frederick Varley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederick-varley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederick-varley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","beige","bone-white","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Frederick Varley was a Canadian painter and a founding member of the Group of Seven, known for his expressive and vivid landscapes. Born in 1881, Varley was instrumental in shaping Canadian art in the early 20th century, focusing on the natural beauty of the Canadian wilderness and human emotion. His work often features dynamic compositions and a rich color palette that captures the essence of the landscapes and people he portrayed.","observation":"Across all four renders, forest and mountain landscapes are built from clearly visible, directional paint strokes with richly textured surfaces and strongly contrasted dark trees, pale sky, blue water, and warm earth tones. The scenes remain representational and densely observed, while expressive color variation and vigorous marks give the wilderness imagery a handcrafted, illustrative quality."},{"id":"dmitri-danish","name":"Dmitri Danish","cat":"painters","en":"Dmitri Danish","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dmitri-danish.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dmitri-danish","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","rust","orange","silver"],"intro":"Dmitri Danish is a contemporary artist known for his evocative urban landscapes and atmospheric street scenes. His works often capture the essence of European cities, blending realism with impressionistic techniques to create a sense of nostalgia and romance. Danish's paintings are characterized by their rich textures, vibrant colors, and a unique ability to convey the mood and atmosphere of the settings he portrays.","observation":"Across all four views, the city is rendered with visible, broad directional paint strokes that build up architecture, rain, reflections, and figures into a richly textured surface. Warm lamps and shop lights cut through cool gray mist and subdued surroundings, while crowded wet streets, umbrellas, and deep perspective give the scenes a cinematic, atmospheric sense of movement."},{"id":"harley-earl","name":"Harley Earl","cat":"designers","en":"Harley Earl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harley-earl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harley-earl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","metallic","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["grey","black","cream","beige","dark-ochre"],"intro":"Harley Earl was an influential American automotive designer known for his pioneering work in car design, particularly during the mid-20th century. He was instrumental in introducing the concept of the 'concept car' and played a significant role in shaping the aesthetic of American automobiles, including the introduction of tailfins and the use of chrome.","observation":"The style combines highly polished, realistic automotive renderings with finely drawn concept-art treatments, consistently emphasizing streamlined mid-century cars, chrome, reflective paint, and dramatic tailfins. Settings alternate between cinematic outdoor vistas and clean presentation spaces, while the sketch-like render adds delicate linework and visible brush washes without changing the overall retro design language."},{"id":"tillie-walden","name":"Tillie Walden","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tillie Walden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tillie-walden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tillie-walden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","ink"],"colours":["red","charcoal","black","muted-blue","dark-blue","muted-pink"],"intro":"Tillie Walden is an acclaimed American cartoonist and illustrator known for her graphic novels and unique storytelling style. Her work often explores themes of identity, personal growth, and the passage of time, earning her recognition and awards in the comics community.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic comic-like linework, clean flat color blocks, and dense ink detailing to build atmospheric outdoor scenes. A consistently limited but saturated palette of coral pink, dusty blue, teal, and near-black creates strong contrast, while cinematic framing and recurring solitary figures give the images a quiet narrative quality."},{"id":"anna-bocek","name":"Anna Bocek","cat":"painters","en":"Anna Bocek","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anna-bocek.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anna-bocek","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["orange","red","dark-rust","black","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Anna Bocek is a contemporary Polish artist known for her vibrant and expressive portraits. Her work often explores themes of identity and emotion, using bold colors and dynamic compositions to capture the essence of her subjects. Bocek's paintings are characterized by their intense focus on facial expressions and the interplay of light and shadow, creating a sense of depth and movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces are built from energetic, visible brushwork, angular paint planes, and dark drawn contours. Saturated coral, orange, cream, teal, and black create a high-contrast, expressive portrait style with fragmented yet recognizable features."},{"id":"pier-luigi-nervi","name":"Pier Luigi Nervi","cat":"architects","en":"Pier Luigi Nervi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pier-luigi-nervi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pier-luigi-nervi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey","white"],"intro":"Pier Luigi Nervi was an Italian engineer and architect known for his innovative use of reinforced concrete and his contributions to modernist architecture. He is celebrated for his ability to combine engineering precision with architectural beauty, creating structures that are both functional and aesthetically pleasing.","observation":"The style presents monumental architectural interiors in stark black and white, with highly realistic detail and strong geometric perspective. Repeating ribs, arches, columns, and latticework create a sculptural sense of mass, while deep shadows, blown architectural light, fine surface grain, and tiny human figures heighten the cinematic scale."},{"id":"brian-k-vaughan","name":"Brian K. Vaughan","cat":"illustrators","en":"Brian K. Vaughan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-k-vaughan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-k-vaughan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","comics","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","dark-brown","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Brian K. Vaughan is an acclaimed American comic book and television writer, known for his work on series such as \"Y: The Last Man,\" \"Saga,\" and \"Ex Machina.\" His storytelling often blends elements of science fiction, fantasy, and drama, earning him numerous awards and a dedicated fan base.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic-novel illustration with assertive ink contours, angular anatomy, dense hatching, and sharply cropped cinematic compositions. A restrained teal, coral, ochre, black, and cream palette, combined with deep shadows and selective warm lighting, gives the character-driven scenes a brooding, theatrical intensity."},{"id":"fritz-hansen","name":"Fritz Hansen","cat":"designers","en":"Fritz Hansen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fritz-hansen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fritz-hansen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","fashion","still-life","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","black","brown","dark-brown","white"],"intro":"Fritz Hansen is a renowned Danish furniture design company, established in 1872, known for its high-quality craftsmanship and iconic designs. The company has collaborated with famous designers like Arne Jacobsen and Hans Wegner , contributing significantly to the Scandinavian design movement with pieces that emphasize functionality, simplicity, and beauty.","observation":"The style presents sculptural furniture in carefully composed, photorealistic interiors, emphasizing smooth organic curves, rich wood grain, leather surfaces, and architectural space. Restrained earth tones, strong directional daylight, deep shadows, and crisp material detail give the renders a refined editorial and cinematic quality."},{"id":"erez-marom","name":"Erez Marom","cat":"photographers","en":"Erez Marom","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erez-marom.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erez-marom","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","muted-blue","light-orange","brown"],"intro":"Erez Marom is a renowned photographer known for his breathtaking landscape photography, capturing the raw beauty of nature in remote locations around the world. His work often explores the interplay between light and shadow, creating dramatic and ethereal images that transport viewers to otherworldly realms.","observation":"The style presents dramatic, highly realistic wilderness landscapes with dense natural detail, deep blue-black shadows, and vivid sunset highlights. Cinematic wide compositions emphasize immense rock formations, turbulent water, ice, reflections, and atmospheric storm light, giving the scenes an epic, slightly surreal sense of scale."},{"id":"massimo-vignelli","name":"Massimo Vignelli","cat":"designers","en":"Massimo Vignelli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/massimo-vignelli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/massimo-vignelli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","patterns","portraits","urban","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["cream","vivid-red","black","muted-ochre","deep-blue","vivid-orange","green"],"intro":"Massimo Vignelli was an influential Italian designer known for his work in graphic design, furniture, and interior design. He was a proponent of modernist design principles and believed in the power of simplicity and clarity in design. Vignelli's work is characterized by its use of geometric forms, bold typography, and a limited color palette, often employing black, white, and red.","observation":"The style combines realistic urban photography and portraiture with bold, hard-edged geometric graphics in saturated red, blue, black, and cream. Flat color fields, oversized circles and angular bands, tiled architectural settings, and a subtle grain unify the varied compositions into a graphic editorial look."},{"id":"jon-kudelka","name":"Jon Kudelka","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jon Kudelka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jon-kudelka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jon-kudelka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","grey","black","white","red"],"intro":"Jon Kudelka is a renowned Australian cartoonist and illustrator known for his sharp wit and satirical commentary on political and social issues. His work often appears in major publications, where he uses humor and keen observation to critique contemporary society.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses dense ink drawing, heavy contour lines, and extensive crosshatching to build richly textured urban and subterranean scenes. A restrained blue-gray palette with selective red and warm accents, stark darkness, and strange oversized forms creates an ominous, surreal mood while maintaining clearly staged narrative situations."},{"id":"darrell-k-sweet","name":"Darrell K. Sweet","cat":"illustrators","en":"Darrell K. Sweet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/darrell-k-sweet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/darrell-k-sweet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-brown","rust","beige","orange"],"intro":"Darrell K. Sweet was an American artist known for his work in fantasy and science fiction illustration. He gained prominence for his cover art on numerous popular fantasy novels, including the \"Wheel of Time\" series by Robert Jordan. Sweet's style is characterized by its rich detail and vivid depictions of fantastical worlds, often featuring heroic characters and mythical creatures.","observation":"Across the four renders, richly visible brushwork builds dense fantasy scenes with rugged stone, carved wood, clothing, foliage, and architecture. Saturated blue, orange, and red light creates dramatic illuminated focal points against deep shadows, while monumental castles, dragons, mountain valleys, and story-like figures give the style an epic narrative scale."},{"id":"capability-brown","name":"Capability Brown","cat":"architects","en":"Capability Brown","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/capability-brown.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/capability-brown","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","ochre","silver","cream","muted-blue"],"intro":"Capability Brown was an influential 18th-century English landscape architect known for revolutionizing the design of gardens and parks. He is celebrated for his naturalistic approach, creating harmonious landscapes that seamlessly integrated with the surrounding environment. His work often featured rolling lawns, serpentine lakes, and strategically placed trees, embodying the ideals of the English picturesque movement.","observation":"The style presents expansive garden landscapes with classical pavilions, ponds, lawns, and dense mature trees, rendered with visible painterly texture and abundant natural detail. Subdued greens and warm earth tones are balanced by luminous blue skies and monumental clouds, creating a serene, dreamlike atmosphere with carefully composed architectural vistas."},{"id":"fernand-fonssagrives","name":"Fernand Fonssagrives","cat":"photographers","en":"Fernand Fonssagrives","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fernand-fonssagrives.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fernand-fonssagrives","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Fernand Fonssagrives is a renowned French photographer known for his elegant and sophisticated fashion photography during the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by a refined aesthetic, often capturing the grace and poise of his subjects with a keen eye for detail and composition.","observation":"This style uses stark black-and-white portrait photography with forceful graphic bands of light and shadow crossing tightly cropped faces. High contrast, visible grain, selective focus, and tactile knit textures create an intense, fashion-editorial mood while preserving realistic facial detail."},{"id":"chris-foss","name":"Chris Foss","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris Foss","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-foss.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-foss","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi"],"colours":["brown","blue","charcoal","grey","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Chris Foss is a British illustrator renowned for his distinctive science fiction artwork, particularly his book covers and spaceship designs. His work is characterized by vibrant colors, intricate mechanical details, and a futuristic aesthetic that has influenced the visual language of sci-fi media.","observation":"Across all four renders, heavily detailed orange spacecraft dominate expansive alien landscapes and star-filled space. Visible brush texture, luminous exhaust, vivid complementary colors, strong dark-light contrast, and dynamic cinematic angles give the scenes a dramatic retro-futurist science-fiction character."},{"id":"erin-hanson","name":"Erin Hanson","cat":"painters","en":"Erin Hanson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erin-hanson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erin-hanson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","blue","brown","orange","light-blue","pink"],"intro":"Erin Hanson is a contemporary American artist known for her vibrant and expressive landscape paintings. She is recognized for her unique style that combines elements of impressionism and post-impressionism, often depicting the natural beauty of the American West. Hanson's work is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a painterly approach that captures the essence of the landscapes she portrays.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive rural landscapes are built from highly visible, layered brush marks, with expressive strokes shaping fields, clouds, trees, and sky. Saturated blue-violet, coral, pink, and gold hues create a luminous, dreamlike atmosphere, while dark branching silhouettes and winding paths provide strong graphic structure."},{"id":"mike-deodato","name":"Mike Deodato","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mike Deodato","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-deodato.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-deodato","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","charcoal","cream","orange"],"intro":"Mike Deodato is a Brazilian comic book artist known for his work on major superhero titles for publishers like Marvel and DC Comics. His style is characterized by its dynamic compositions, detailed linework, and expressive character depictions, making him a prominent figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily textured, visible brushwork and fine directional marks to build dramatic humanoid figures with exaggerated anatomy and energetic poses. Dark backgrounds, deep shadows, and sharp warm-cool highlights create a high-contrast fantasy battle mood, while loose hair, weapons, and diagonal gestures reinforce motion."},{"id":"misha-gordin","name":"Misha Gordin","cat":"photographers","en":"Misha Gordin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/misha-gordin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/misha-gordin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","landscapes","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","epic","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","silver","black"],"intro":"Misha Gordin is a Latvian photographer known for his conceptual and surreal imagery. His work often explores themes of identity, existentialism, and the human condition through meticulously crafted photomontages. Gordin's photography is characterized by its monochromatic palette, dramatic compositions, and a deep sense of introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark monochrome imagery combines monumental repeated human forms with tiny solitary figures, producing an uncanny sense of scale and ritualized order. High contrast, sculptural textures, vast landscapes, dramatic cloud formations, and atmospheric haze give the scenes a bleak, surreal, epic presence."},{"id":"wes-wilson","name":"Wes Wilson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Wes Wilson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wes-wilson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wes-wilson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-red","vivid-red","blue","beige","orange"],"intro":"Wes Wilson is known as a pioneering American artist, particularly famous for his psychedelic rock concert posters in the 1960s. His work is characterized by vibrant colors, swirling patterns, and innovative typography, which became iconic representations of the counterculture movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, faces and eyes are reduced into intensely colored, distorted geometric forms, combining radial ornament, flowing stripes, checkerboards, and block-like collage structures. Heavy dark outlines, flat color regions, and selective textured shading create a forceful graphic appearance, with symmetry and repetition recurring throughout the compositions."},{"id":"marion-peck","name":"Marion Peck","cat":"painters","en":"Marion Peck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marion-peck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marion-peck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-ochre","ochre","black","bone-white","dark-red","grey"],"intro":"Marion Peck is an American painter known for her distinctive pop surrealist style, often characterized by whimsical and fantastical elements. Her work frequently features dreamlike scenes and figures, blending innocence with a touch of the surreal.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, old-master-like painting with highly detailed portraits of children in elaborate historical-looking costumes and fantastical animal pairings. Muted green, brown, cream, and red tones, ornamental fabrics, theatrical props, and shadowy woodland settings create a whimsical yet uncanny storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"jean-sebastien-rossbach","name":"Jean-Sebastien Rossbach","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jean-Sebastien Rossbach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-sebastien-rossbach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-sebastien-rossbach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-red","red","beige"],"intro":"Jean-Sebastien Rossbach is a contemporary French illustrator known for his work in fantasy and science fiction genres. His art often features intricate details and vibrant colors, blending traditional and digital techniques to create immersive and imaginative worlds. Rossbach has contributed to various book covers, concept art, and illustrations, gaining recognition for his unique style and ability to evoke emotion through his art.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses dense, visible brushwork to build highly detailed, expressive character portraits with rough, tactile surfaces. Dark earthy tones, intense reds, strong light⁠–shadow contrasts, and elaborate bone, metal, feather, and fabric adornments create a grim, fantastical, surreal mood."},{"id":"brian-kesinger","name":"Brian Kesinger","cat":"illustrators","en":"Brian Kesinger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-kesinger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-kesinger","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","motion","fine-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["pale-yellow","white","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","black","brown"],"intro":"Brian Kesinger is an American illustrator and author known for his work with Disney and his unique steampunk-inspired art. His illustrations often combine whimsical characters with intricate mechanical designs, drawing inspiration from Victorian aesthetics and fantasy themes.","observation":"The style combines densely packed fantasy adventure scenes with expressive character acting, imaginative creatures, and elaborate mechanical contraptions. Fine ink contours, sketch-like hatching, selective watercolor-like washes, and warm paper-toned grounds give the illustrations a lively, handcrafted storybook quality, while diagonal poses and flying fragments create constant motion."},{"id":"george-barbier","name":"George Barbier","cat":"illustrators","en":"George Barbier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-barbier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-barbier","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","patterns","fine-lines","vivid-colors","retro","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","charcoal","grey","brown","red","deep-red"],"intro":"George Barbier was a prominent French illustrator and designer, renowned for his contributions to the Art Deco movement during the early 20th century. His work often featured elegant and stylized figures, capturing the essence of the Roaring Twenties with a focus on fashion, theater, and luxury. Barbier's illustrations are celebrated for their intricate details, vibrant colors, and sophisticated compositions, making him a key figure in the world of decorative arts.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, illustrative drawing with crisp fine contour lines, flattened color areas, and densely patterned surfaces. Fashionable figures and elaborate garments dominate the compositions, surrounded by geometric architecture, botanical motifs, and richly decorative interiors in a strong blue, coral, cream, and black palette."},{"id":"adriaen-brouwer","name":"Adriaen Brouwer","cat":"painters","en":"Adriaen Brouwer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adriaen-brouwer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adriaen-brouwer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","beige","light-yellow"],"intro":"Adriaen Brouwer was a Flemish painter known for his genre scenes depicting peasant life and tavern scenes during the 17th century. His work is characterized by its expressive portrayal of human emotions, lively compositions, and use of chiaroscuro to create depth and contrast. Brouwer's paintings often capture the boisterous and earthy atmosphere of social gatherings, with a focus on humor and the human condition.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style depicts crowded, animated tavern scenes through richly worked paint, visible broad strokes, and dense detail in faces, clothing, vessels, and furnishings. Warm earthy browns and ochres dominate, with strong light-dark contrasts and expressive gestures creating a rowdy, theatrical atmosphere."},{"id":"ray-collins","name":"Ray Collins","cat":"photographers","en":"Ray Collins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ray-collins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ray-collins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","landscapes","mist","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","silver"],"intro":"Ray Collins is an Australian photographer known for his captivating images of the ocean, particularly focusing on waves and the interplay of light and water. His work often captures the raw power and beauty of the sea, earning him recognition in the field of nature photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is highly realistic and densely detailed, depicting immense turbulent ocean waves with curling forms, spray, foam, and dark storm-filled skies. Deep teal tones, heavy shadows, bright highlights, and visible sea mist create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while the compositions emphasize powerful motion and monumental scale."},{"id":"tarsila-do-amaral","name":"Tarsila do Amaral","cat":"painters","en":"Tarsila do Amaral","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tarsila-do-amaral.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tarsila-do-amaral","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","bone-white","vivid-red","orange","dark-blue","muted-green"],"intro":"Tarsila do Amaral is a renowned Brazilian painter, a leading figure in Latin American modernism, and a key member of the \"Anthropophagic Movement.\" Her work is celebrated for its vibrant colors and unique blend of Brazilian cultural themes with modernist aesthetics.","observation":"The style combines flat, graphic shapes and strong contour lines with visible painted texture, creating stylized portraits and lush botanical settings. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and oranges dominate, while geometric foliage, oversized flowers, decorative patterns, and carefully arranged frontal compositions give the images an ornate, expressive character."},{"id":"paul-cadden","name":"Paul Cadden","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Cadden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-cadden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-cadden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","collage","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Paul Cadden is a Scottish artist known for his hyperrealistic drawings that often focus on everyday scenes and people. His work is characterized by meticulous detail and a commitment to capturing the subtleties of human expression and urban life, often using graphite and pencil to achieve a photorealistic effect.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white portrait photography with strong tonal separation, visible grain, and dense facial detail. Multiple elderly faces, reflections, and overlapping exposures are layered into cinematic, psychologically intense compositions with a somber, weathered atmosphere."},{"id":"richard-phillips","name":"Richard Phillips","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Phillips","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-phillips.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-phillips","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["orange","pale-orange","brown","rust","red","blue","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Richard Phillips is an American contemporary artist known for his large-scale, glossy paintings that often draw inspiration from popular culture and media imagery. His work is characterized by a hyperrealistic style that blends elements of pop art and postmodernism, often exploring themes of beauty, celebrity, and consumerism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses tightly cropped beauty portraits with saturated peach, pink, blue, and coral accents, strong light-dark modeling, and emphatic makeup details. Visible directional brushwork and fine hair and eyelash marks combine painterly skin rendering with clean illustrative contours and a bold editorial impact."},{"id":"alex-katz","name":"Alex Katz","cat":"painters","en":"Alex Katz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-katz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-katz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-green","black","ochre","light-yellow","olive","bone-white","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Alex Katz is an American figurative artist known for his large-scale portraits and landscapes. Born in 1927, Katz's work is characterized by its flatness of form, bold colors, and minimalistic approach. His style has been influential in the development of Pop Art and has been celebrated for its ability to capture the essence of modern American life.","observation":"The style combines simplified, graphic portrait forms with visible directional brushwork and lightly textured painted surfaces. Saturated greens, ochres, oranges, and blacks create vivid color blocks, while dense tropical foliage frames the women in tightly cropped fashion-like compositions."},{"id":"paola-pivi","name":"Paola Pivi","cat":"various-artists","en":"Paola Pivi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paola-pivi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paola-pivi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","fashion","scenes","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["red","silver","beige","dark-red","light-pink","deep-blue"],"intro":"Paola Pivi is an Italian contemporary artist known for her eclectic and often whimsical works that challenge perceptions and explore the boundaries of reality. Her art spans various mediums, including installations, photography, and sculpture, often incorporating elements of surprise and humor.","observation":"The style presents oversized bears as realistic, solidly modelled figures with highly visible shaggy fur and strongly saturated, often monochromatic color schemes. Clean gallery interiors, polished floors, controlled lighting, and carefully staged groupings give the surreal animal subjects the appearance of sculptural exhibition pieces."},{"id":"lisa-congdon","name":"Lisa Congdon","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lisa Congdon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lisa-congdon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lisa-congdon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","red","vivid-red","black","muted-cyan","olive","deep-blue"],"intro":"Lisa Congdon is a contemporary American artist, illustrator, and author known for her colorful and whimsical style. She has gained recognition for her vibrant illustrations and pattern designs, often drawing inspiration from nature and folk art. Congdon's work spans various mediums, including painting, drawing, and digital art, and she is celebrated for her ability to blend playful motifs with bold colors.","observation":"This style combines exuberant painted botanicals with dense geometric patterning, using saturated coral, pink, orange, blue, green, and black-and-white accents. Bold hand-drawn outlines, flat color blocks, visible brush texture, and repeated stripes, checks, dots, and grids create a richly layered, expressive collage-like surface."},{"id":"rudolf-olgiati","name":"Rudolf Olgiati","cat":"architects","en":"Rudolf Olgiati","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rudolf-olgiati.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rudolf-olgiati","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","motion","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","beige","white"],"intro":"Rudolf Olgiati was a Swiss architect known for his modernist approach and influence on contemporary architecture. His work often emphasized simplicity, geometric forms, and a harmonious relationship with the surrounding environment, reflecting the principles of modernism.","observation":"The style presents monumental, geometric architecture as highly realistic architectural photography, with massive planes, deep recesses, and carefully framed mountain views. Restrained earthy colors, stark sunlight, heavy shadows, and tiny solitary figures emphasize scale, stillness, and sculptural mass across both interior and exterior views."},{"id":"james-gillray","name":"James Gillray","cat":"illustrators","en":"James Gillray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-gillray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-gillray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","comics","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["pale-yellow","muted-ochre","brown","muted-brown","orange","red"],"intro":"James Gillray was a prominent British caricaturist and printmaker known for his satirical works during the late 18th and early 19th centuries. His illustrations often targeted political figures and social issues, employing humor and exaggeration to critique the society of his time. Gillray's work is celebrated for its wit and detailed etching techniques, making him a significant figure in the history of political satire.","observation":"The style uses densely packed, expressive caricature figures rendered with crisp fine ink lines, crosshatching, and hand-colored fills. Restrained earthy colors, strong tonal contrast, exaggerated gestures, and elaborate period costumes give the scenes the look of a richly detailed satirical print."},{"id":"brian-de-palma","name":"Brian De Palma","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Brian De Palma","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-de-palma.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-de-palma","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","deep-red","brown","vivid-red","muted-blue","pink"],"intro":"Brian De Palma is a renowned American filmmaker known for his work in the suspense and thriller genres. His films often explore themes of voyeurism, deception, and psychological tension, drawing inspiration from directors like Alfred Hitchcock. De Palma's distinctive style combines elaborate set pieces, intricate camera movements, and a keen sense of visual storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is cinematic and photographic, built from tightly cropped faces, intense gazes, dramatic shadows, and layered visual fragments. Saturated red and blue lighting, strong tonal contrast, shallow focus, and visible analog grain create a dark, tense film-still atmosphere."},{"id":"jon-foster","name":"Jon Foster","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jon Foster","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jon-foster.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jon-foster","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","orange","red","bone-white"],"intro":"Jon Foster is an acclaimed American illustrator known for his work in fantasy and science fiction genres. His art is characterized by a blend of traditional and digital techniques, often depicting fantastical and surreal scenes with a strong narrative element. Foster's work has been featured in numerous publications, and he has received several awards for his contributions to the field of illustration.","observation":"Across the sheet, densely arranged figures and faces are rendered with visible, directional brushwork, layered textures, and highly expressive gestures. Warm ochres, reds, and copper tones contrast with deep shadows and sharp highlights, creating dramatic, mythic tableaux with an illustrative yet richly painted surface."},{"id":"richard-hamilton","name":"Richard Hamilton","cat":"various-artists","en":"Richard Hamilton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-hamilton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-hamilton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","dark-brown","charcoal","muted-cyan","red"],"intro":"Richard Hamilton is a British artist known as a pioneer of the Pop Art movement. His work often explores themes of consumer culture and media influence, blending elements of fine art with popular imagery. Hamilton's innovative approach to art includes the use of collage and mixed media, making him a significant figure in 20th-century art.","observation":"The style combines expressive, visibly worked paint with dense collage-like layering, breaking figures, objects, and settings into overlapping geometric panels. Saturated reds, deep blacks, creams, and blue accents create strong contrast, while broad gestural marks, scraped textures, and partial facial occlusion give the scenes a fractured surreal energy."},{"id":"yann-arthus-bertrand","name":"Yann Arthus-Bertrand","cat":"photographers","en":"Yann Arthus-Bertrand","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yann-arthus-bertrand.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yann-arthus-bertrand","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-green","green","muted-green","grey","brown"],"intro":"Yann Arthus-Bertrand is a renowned French photographer and environmentalist known for his stunning aerial photography and dedication to capturing the beauty of the Earth from above. His work often highlights environmental issues and the intricate patterns of nature, bringing attention to the planet's diverse landscapes and ecosystems.","observation":"The style presents expansive aerial landscapes with highly realistic terrain, dense surface detail, and vivid contrasts between emerald vegetation, dark volcanic ground, pale sediment, and blue-green water. Braided channels, deltas, lagoons, and wetlands create sweeping natural patterns, while cinematic aerial framing and selective atmospheric softness emphasize scale and depth."},{"id":"werner-bischof","name":"Werner Bischof","cat":"photographers","en":"Werner Bischof","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/werner-bischof.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/werner-bischof","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Werner Bischof was a renowned Swiss photographer known for his humanist approach and striking black-and-white imagery. He was a member of Magnum Photos and is celebrated for his poignant documentation of post-war Europe and Asia. His work often focused on the human condition, capturing moments of everyday life with a deep sense of empathy and artistry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, bright shafts of sunlight, and strongly backlit figures. It presents atmospheric urban street scenes with weathered stone architecture, human activity, and selective background softness in a dramatic documentary-cinematic manner."},{"id":"laurel-burch","name":"Laurel Burch","cat":"illustrators","en":"Laurel Burch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laurel-burch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laurel-burch","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","floral","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","deep-blue","black","dark-red","brown","orange"],"intro":"Laurel Burch was an American artist known for her distinctive, colorful, and whimsical designs that often featured animals and mythical creatures. She gained recognition for her vibrant and imaginative style, which was prominently displayed in her jewelry, paintings, and other artistic creations.","observation":"The style combines intensely saturated reds, blues, purples, and golds with thick black contour lines, angular facial planes, and clean graphic color blocks. Dense surface ornament, repeated eye motifs, floral elements, and visible painted texture give the flattened illustrative compositions a richly decorative, handcrafted character."},{"id":"ronald-wimberly","name":"Ronald Wimberly","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ronald Wimberly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ronald-wimberly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ronald-wimberly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["black","light-orange","muted-blue","red","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Ronald Wimberly is an American artist known for his work in comics and illustration, particularly focusing on themes of identity and culture. His notable works include graphic novels and contributions to various comic anthologies, where he often explores African American culture and urban life.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable faces and figures are built from forceful, heavily textured paint, with broad strokes, scraped surfaces, and emphatic dark contours. Saturated coral, blue, pink, black, and ochre blocks collide with collage-like fragments and cropped portrait compositions, producing an energetic, fragmented, surreal effect."},{"id":"jeff-smith","name":"Jeff Smith","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jeff Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeff-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeff-smith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-ochre","grey","pale-orange","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Jeff Smith is an American cartoonist best known for his comic book series \"Bone,\" which combines elements of fantasy and humor. His work is characterized by its engaging storytelling, expressive characters, and a unique blend of cartoon and epic fantasy styles.","observation":"Across all four images, richly textured painted surfaces and fine, deliberate marks describe colossal creatures, weathered structures, and small human figures with dramatic scale contrast. The restrained teal, ochre, and slate palette, atmospheric depth, and warm directional light create an expansive, melancholic fantasy-world feeling."},{"id":"steve-dillon","name":"Steve Dillon","cat":"illustrators","en":"Steve Dillon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-dillon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-dillon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","urban","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","pale-orange","dark-brown","orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"Steve Dillon was a renowned British comic book artist best known for his work on titles such as \"Preacher\" and \"Hellblazer.\" His distinctive style, characterized by clean lines and expressive characters, has left a lasting impact on the comic book industry.","observation":"The style uses highly rendered graphic-novel drawing with heavy ink lines, dense hatching, distressed textures, and stark shadow shapes. Saturated reds and occasional blue accents oppose black, cream, and tan, while portraits and urban character scenes are framed as dramatic poster-like panels."},{"id":"lizzie-fitch","name":"Lizzie Fitch","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Lizzie Fitch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lizzie-fitch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lizzie-fitch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","floral","scenes","still-life","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-ochre","black","ochre","bone-white","grey","red"],"intro":"Lizzie Fitch is an American artist known for her collaborative work with Ryan Trecartin, creating immersive multimedia installations that explore themes of identity, technology, and contemporary culture. Her work often involves a blend of video, sculpture, and performance, challenging traditional boundaries between different art forms.","observation":"The style combines richly crowded interiors and garden-like tableaux with antique furniture, botanical decoration, posed figures, animals, and sculptural objects. It is highly detailed and ornate, using muted earthy greens, pinks, creams, and metallic accents with a polished illustrative realism that makes the surreal arrangements feel physically staged."},{"id":"alexander-mcqueen","name":"Alexander McQueen","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Alexander McQueen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexander-mcqueen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexander-mcqueen","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","metallic","subdued-colors","cinematic","religious"],"colours":["silver","brown","beige","black"],"intro":"Alexander McQueen was a renowned British fashion designer known for his bold, theatrical, and often controversial designs. He was celebrated for his masterful tailoring, innovative techniques, and the dramatic, narrative-driven fashion shows that became his signature. McQueen's work often explored themes of nature, history, and the macabre, earning him a reputation as a visionary in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, softly lit fashion portraiture focused on elaborate white lace, beadwork, pearls, crystals, and reflective silver ornament. Restrained ivory and silver tones, selective focus, candlelit backgrounds, and tight editorial framing create a ceremonial, museum-like atmosphere across the portraits."},{"id":"amy-sol","name":"Amy Sol","cat":"painters","en":"Amy Sol","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amy-sol.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amy-sol","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","muted-orange","brown","pale-orange","ochre"],"intro":"Amy Sol is a contemporary artist known for her ethereal and whimsical paintings, often depicting young women in dreamlike settings. Her work is characterized by soft, muted color palettes and delicate, illustrative linework, drawing inspiration from nature and fantasy themes.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, softly painterly female portraits with ornate botanical and avian motifs. Muted sage, cream, charcoal, and rust tones, delicate linework, flowing hair, and carefully arranged floral or branch-like framing create a dreamy, romantic fantasy atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"steve-hanks","name":"Steve Hanks","cat":"painters","en":"Steve Hanks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-hanks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-hanks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","brown","muted-brown","muted-orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Steve Hanks is an American artist renowned for his watercolor paintings, particularly those depicting women and children in serene, intimate settings. His work is characterized by a high level of detail and a mastery of light and shadow, often evoking a sense of tranquility and introspection.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly visible paint strokes and layered texture to depict intimate coastal vignettes with strong naturalistic figures, clothing, rocks, and water. Warm earth tones, pale whites, and cool blue water are shaped by bright sunlight, producing a detailed, softly dreamy atmosphere with expressive, tactile brushwork."},{"id":"alma-thomas","name":"Alma Thomas","cat":"painters","en":"Alma Thomas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alma-thomas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alma-thomas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["pale-orange","red","grey","muted-ochre","dark-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Alma Thomas was an influential African American artist known for her vibrant abstract paintings. She was a key figure in the Washington Color School and made significant contributions to the world of modern art with her unique use of color and form. Her work often reflects themes of nature and space, characterized by bold, colorful patterns and a sense of movement.","observation":"The style uses vivid, hand-painted rectangular marks arranged into dense grids, vertical bands, and concentric rings. Repetition and geometric organization dominate, while visible brush texture and slightly irregular edges keep the colorful abstract compositions tactile rather than mechanically flat."},{"id":"catherine-holman","name":"Catherine Holman","cat":"painters","en":"Catherine Holman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/catherine-holman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/catherine-holman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","beige","red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Catherine Holman is a contemporary artist known for her charming and whimsical paintings that often depict idyllic rural scenes. Her work is characterized by a folk art style that captures the essence of pastoral life, with a focus on quaint cottages, lush gardens, and serene landscapes. Holman's paintings are celebrated for their ability to evoke a sense of nostalgia and simplicity, drawing viewers into a world of fantasy and tranquility.","observation":"The style combines finely controlled illustrative drawing with visible painterly texture, dense botanical detail, and carefully patterned clothing and interiors. Repeatedly staged figures, animals, houses, gardens, and domestic objects are arranged like richly decorated storybook tableaux, using restrained antique colors with strong reds, blacks, creams, and greens."},{"id":"nona-limmen","name":"Nona Limmen","cat":"photographers","en":"Nona Limmen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nona-limmen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nona-limmen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","characters","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","epic","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Nona Limmen is a contemporary photographer known for her evocative and atmospheric imagery. Her work often explores themes of mysticism, nature, and the gothic, creating a unique blend of the surreal and the melancholic. Limmen's photography is characterized by its dark, moody aesthetic and often features solitary figures set against natural backdrops.","observation":"The style is stark monochrome photography with deep blacks, luminous grey skies, and strong silhouetting of cloaked figures against misty natural settings. Sparse, cinematic compositions, windswept fabric and hair, ravens, and bleak woodland landscapes create a brooding, mythic atmosphere."},{"id":"knox-martin","name":"Knox Martin","cat":"painters","en":"Knox Martin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/knox-martin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/knox-martin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["pale-orange","black","vivid-red","beige","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Knox Martin is an American painter and sculptor known for his bold, colorful works that often incorporate elements of abstraction and pop art. Born in 1923, Martin became a prominent figure in the New York School of artists, contributing significantly to the abstract expressionist movement. His works are characterized by their vibrant color palettes, dynamic compositions, and playful forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines aggressively simplified faces and figures with vivid red, blue, yellow, pink, and black shapes, heavy irregular contours, and visibly worked paint surfaces. Dense overlapping marks, repeated eyes and facial fragments, and angular distortions create an expressive, surreal pictorial language that feels both graphic and handmade."},{"id":"anne-stokes","name":"Anne Stokes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Anne Stokes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-stokes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-stokes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","grey","silver","muted-blue","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Anne Stokes is a renowned British fantasy artist known for her captivating and detailed illustrations that often feature mythical and gothic themes. Her work is celebrated for its intricate designs and the enchanting worlds she creates, often drawing inspiration from folklore, mythology, and fantasy literature.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and highly detailed, with visible fine brushwork shaping feathers, scales, hair, fabric, and faces. Dark blue, crimson, white, and grey palettes create a moody, high-contrast fantasy atmosphere, while recurring winged figures and animals are presented in dramatic, intimate portrait compositions."},{"id":"martin-rowson","name":"Martin Rowson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Martin Rowson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-rowson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-rowson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","brown","light-cyan","beige","red","yellow"],"intro":"Martin Rowson is a British cartoonist and illustrator known for his sharp political satire and distinctive caricature style. His work often appears in major newspapers and magazines, where he uses humor and exaggeration to critique political figures and societal issues.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, hand-painted brush texture with energetic black contour drawing, vivid color, and strongly exaggerated anatomy. Crowded scenes of grotesque human, animal, and hybrid characters use theatrical expressions, dark tonal contrast, and fantastical surreal imagery."},{"id":"morris-hirshfield","name":"Morris Hirshfield","cat":"painters","en":"Morris Hirshfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/morris-hirshfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/morris-hirshfield","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","patterns","portraits","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","dark-ochre","black","rust","dark-blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Morris Hirshfield was an American self-taught artist known for his unique and imaginative style, often categorized under folk and naïve art. Born in Poland in 1872, he immigrated to the United States, where he eventually gained recognition for his vibrant and fantastical paintings. His work often features whimsical and dreamlike scenes, populated by animals and mythical creatures, rendered with meticulous detail and a distinctive, childlike perspective.","observation":"The style combines flattened, front-facing portraiture with elongated faces, emphatic eyes, bold outlines, and dense decorative patterning. Richly textured paint, vivid reds and blues, floral grounds, geometric textiles, and symbolic animal or mask-like figures create an ornate, surreal illustrative surface."},{"id":"david-chipperfield","name":"David Chipperfield","cat":"architects","en":"David Chipperfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-chipperfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-chipperfield","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","classical","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","dark-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"David Chipperfield is a renowned British architect known for his modernist and minimalist designs. He has received numerous awards for his work, which often emphasizes simplicity, functionality, and a strong connection to the surrounding environment. Chipperfield's architectural philosophy focuses on creating spaces that are both aesthetically pleasing and practical, often using materials like concrete, glass, and steel.","observation":"The style presents monumental architectural spaces with highly realistic materials, precise geometry, and carefully controlled perspective. Subdued earthy colors, deep architectural shadows, and warm directional light emphasize the weight and sculptural presence of concrete, brick, water, and large structural forms."},{"id":"gabriele-dellotto","name":"Gabriele Dell'otto","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gabriele Dell'otto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gabriele-dellotto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gabriele-dellotto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","realistic","animals","characters","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","dark-red","bone-white","charcoal","deep-red"],"intro":"Gabriele Dell'otto is an Italian illustrator and comic book artist known for his work with major comic publishers. His style is characterized by a blend of realism and fantasy, often focusing on superhero themes and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable masked heroes and dark birds are modeled with forceful, visible brushwork and expressive, gestural strokes. The palette is dominated by scarlet reds, black, and cream, with strong light-dark separation and a brooding, dramatic mood."},{"id":"luis-bunuel","name":"Luis Bunuel","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Luis Bunuel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luis-bunuel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luis-bunuel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Luis Bunuel is a renowned Spanish filmmaker known for his pioneering work in surrealist cinema. His films often explore themes of dreams, reality, and the subconscious, challenging conventional narrative structures and societal norms. Bunuel's collaborations with artists like Salvador Dali have left a lasting impact on the world of film and art, making him a key figure in 20th-century avant-garde movements.","observation":"Across the sheet, stark monochrome photography uses hard directional light, deep shadows, and sharply sculpted faces to create a brooding, theatrical atmosphere. Tight portrait framing alternates with staged interior scenes, using formal clothing, distressed architecture, and dramatic arrangements of figures to evoke dark film imagery."},{"id":"gil-kane","name":"Gil Kane","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gil Kane","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gil-kane.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gil-kane","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","black","pale-orange","muted-ochre","red","olive"],"intro":"Gil Kane is a renowned comic book artist known for his dynamic and expressive style, particularly in the superhero genre. He was instrumental in shaping the visual language of comics during the Silver Age, contributing to iconic characters and stories. His work is characterized by bold line work, dramatic compositions, and a keen sense of movement and anatomy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed comic-book drawing with heavy black contouring, dense crosshatched shading, and emphatic facial expressions. Saturated red, blue, and green flat color blocks contrast sharply with black ink and warm paper tones, while crowded character groupings and action-oriented compositions create a bold, dramatic look."},{"id":"jacques-tardi","name":"Jacques Tardi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jacques Tardi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacques-tardi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacques-tardi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white","orange","dark-brown","light-orange"],"intro":"Jacques Tardi is a renowned French comic artist and illustrator known for his distinctive style and storytelling. His works often explore historical themes, particularly focusing on the World Wars and Parisian settings, with a unique blend of realism and fantasy.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, graphic ink drawing with heavy black contours, crosshatched texture, and selectively flat, subdued blue, ochre, red, and grey color. Across the scenes, ornate urban architecture, period clothing, street lamps, carriages, and snowy or dusk-lit streets create cinematic vintage city vignettes with strong light-dark contrast."},{"id":"basil-wolverton","name":"Basil Wolverton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Basil Wolverton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/basil-wolverton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/basil-wolverton","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","pale-yellow","brown","grey","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Basil Wolverton was an American cartoonist and illustrator known for his distinctive and grotesque style. He gained fame for his work in comic books and magazines, particularly for his contributions to \"Mad\" magazine and his unique, bizarre character designs. Wolverton's art is characterized by its detailed line work, exaggerated features, and humorous, often surreal themes.","observation":"The style is a densely packed graphic illustration built from heavy black outlines, flat saturated color, and extensive crosshatched ink shading. Grotesque, surreal faces and repeated eye motifs crowd the frame, combining exaggerated anatomy with bold poster-like color blocks and a distressed printed texture."},{"id":"david-octavius-hill","name":"David Octavius Hill","cat":"photographers","en":"David Octavius Hill","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-octavius-hill.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-octavius-hill","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"David Octavius Hill was a Scottish painter and photographer, known for his pioneering work in early photography during the 19th century. He collaborated with Robert Adamson to create some of the first photographic portraits, capturing the essence of Victorian life and society. Hill's work is celebrated for its artistic composition and innovative use of the calotype process, which contributed significantly to the development of photography as an art form.","observation":"The style uses staged, highly realistic monochrome photography with dense period detail, strong tonal contrast, and a visibly aged sepia photographic surface. Carefully posed figures, theatrical expressions, historical clothing, and arranged indoor and outdoor settings give the images a dark, cinematic tableau quality."},{"id":"ingrid-baars","name":"Ingrid Baars","cat":"photographers","en":"Ingrid Baars","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ingrid-baars.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ingrid-baars","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","black","charcoal","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Ingrid Baars is a contemporary artist known for her unique blend of photography and digital art. Her work often explores themes of identity and cultural diversity, drawing inspiration from African art and mythology. Baars's art is characterized by its intricate details and surreal compositions, creating a bridge between traditional and modern aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, tightly framed character portraits with elaborate ceremonial headwear, jewelry, feathers, sculptural collars, and metallic body decoration. Dark studio backgrounds, restrained earthy colors, dramatic contrast, and carefully arranged symmetry give the images a moody, editorial, almost ritualistic presence."},{"id":"ginette-callaway","name":"Ginette Callaway","cat":"painters","en":"Ginette Callaway","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ginette-callaway.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ginette-callaway","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-ochre","charcoal","muted-magenta","violet","red","orange","pink"],"intro":"Ginette Callaway is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings, often featuring floral and natural themes. Her work is characterized by a bold use of color and a dynamic, impressionistic style that captures the essence of her subjects with emotional depth and vivid detail.","observation":"Across all four images, thick, visible paint strokes build richly layered gardens, flowers, cottages, and landscapes with energetic directional marks and a strongly tactile surface. Saturated pinks, oranges, purples, greens, and blues create an expressive, highly detailed style that balances recognizable scenery with loose, gestural handling."},{"id":"jessie-m-king","name":"Jessie M. King","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jessie M. King","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jessie-m-king.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jessie-m-king","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","pale-orange","brown","charcoal","grey","red"],"intro":"","observation":"Across all four renders, richly layered female portraits and tableaux are built from visible brushwork, delicate linework, elaborate fabrics, and abundant botanical ornament. The palette is generally restrained in cream, teal, olive, brown, and muted red, while flowing drapery and patterned surfaces create an ornate, dreamlike illustrative-painterly effect."},{"id":"raoul-de-keyser","name":"Raoul De Keyser","cat":"painters","en":"Raoul De Keyser","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raoul-de-keyser.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raoul-de-keyser","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","red","dark-blue","dark-green","light-yellow","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Raoul De Keyser is a Belgian painter known for his abstract and minimalist works that often explore the interplay of color and form. His art is characterized by a subtle yet expressive use of color and a focus on the simplicity of shapes and lines, reflecting a deep engagement with the materiality of painting.","observation":"Across all four works, broad blocks of saturated color are built up with visible paint ridges and directional brushwork. Recognizable figures, coastlines, water, foliage, and architectural views are simplified into angular, graphic shapes, with strong dark accents and an energetic hand-painted surface."},{"id":"maud-lewis","name":"Maud Lewis","cat":"painters","en":"Maud Lewis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maud-lewis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maud-lewis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","pale-orange","grey","red","ochre"],"intro":"Maud Lewis was a Canadian folk artist known for her brightly colored and charming depictions of rural life in Nova Scotia. Despite facing significant physical challenges and financial hardships, she created a joyful and whimsical body of work that has become beloved in Canadian art history. Her paintings often feature simple, yet vibrant scenes of nature, animals, and rural settings, capturing the essence of her surroundings with a unique and naive artistic style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses saturated, cheerful colors and dense flower-filled scenes populated by simplified animals, cottages, trees, and seasonal details. Broad, visible brushstrokes, flattened illustrative forms, and expressive outlines give the images a handmade storybook quality with a dreamy folk-fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"arnold-genthe","name":"Arnold Genthe","cat":"photographers","en":"Arnold Genthe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arnold-genthe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arnold-genthe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Arnold Genthe was a German-born American photographer known for his work in portrait photography and his documentation of San Francisco's Chinatown before and after the 1906 earthquake. His work is characterized by a soft focus and an ethereal quality, often capturing the essence of his subjects in a timeless manner.","observation":"A monochrome photographic style built around solitary figures in flowing dresses, framed in theatrical interior and garden settings. Strong backlight, deep shadows, grain, selective focus, and haze create a cinematic, dreamlike atmosphere with occasional double-exposure-like layering."},{"id":"fred-tomaselli","name":"Fred Tomaselli","cat":"painters","en":"Fred Tomaselli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fred-tomaselli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fred-tomaselli","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","orange","charcoal","dark-red"],"intro":"Fred Tomaselli is an American artist known for his intricate and vibrant works that often blend painting, collage, and resin. His art frequently explores themes of nature, the cosmos, and altered states of consciousness, creating a unique fusion of the organic and the psychedelic.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely built, visibly painted ornament with saturated jewel tones, metallic-looking accents, and a nearly black ground. Birds, flowers, stars, radiating spokes, and concentric arcs are arranged in intricate radial and geometric structures, producing a richly decorative and surreal cosmic tableau."},{"id":"edward-robert-hughes","name":"Edward Robert Hughes","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Robert Hughes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-robert-hughes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-robert-hughes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Edward Robert Hughes was a British painter associated with the Pre-Raphaelite movement, known for his detailed and ethereal works. Born in 1851, he was the nephew of Arthur Hughes and worked as an assistant to William Holman Hunt. Hughes's paintings often feature mythological and literary themes, characterized by their meticulous detail and vibrant use of color.","observation":"The style is richly painterly, with visible fine brushwork modeling faces, hair, lace, feathers, and dense vegetation. Romantic close-up figures merge with shadowed woodland foliage in subdued, earthy colors, producing a dreamy and softly mysterious atmosphere."},{"id":"ismail-inceoglu","name":"Ismail Inceoglu","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ismail Inceoglu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ismail-inceoglu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ismail-inceoglu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi"],"colours":["silver","charcoal","beige","dark-brown","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Ismail Inceoglu is a contemporary illustrator known for his evocative and atmospheric digital artworks. His work often explores themes of isolation, nature, and technology, creating immersive worlds that captivate viewers with their depth and detail.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, realistic cinematic environments with layered depth, atmospheric haze, and strong environmental storytelling. Muted blue-grey surroundings are punctuated by warm red-orange light, while ruined infrastructure, tangled wires, sparse figures, and recovering vegetation create a moody post-apocalyptic science-fiction world."},{"id":"piet-mondrian","name":"Piet Mondrian","cat":"painters","en":"Piet Mondrian","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/piet-mondrian.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/piet-mondrian","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["silver","vivid-red","dark-blue","light-yellow","muted-green","blue","ochre"],"intro":"Piet Mondrian was a Dutch painter known for his contribution to the De Stijl art movement and his development of a non-representational form called neoplasticism. His work is characterized by a grid of vertical and horizontal black lines and the use of primary colors. Mondrian's style was influential in the development of abstract art and modern design.","observation":"The style is abstract and geometric, built from thick black linear grids that divide vivid red, blue, yellow, white, and gray fields. Clean-edged blocks and circular arcs create a graphic, illustrative surface, while variations in grid density and subtle canvas texture add visual complexity across the four compositions."},{"id":"margaret-macdonald-mackintosh","name":"Margaret Macdonald Mackintosh","cat":"painters","en":"Margaret Macdonald Mackintosh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/margaret-macdonald-mackintosh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/margaret-macdonald-mackintosh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","black","bone-white","brown","deep-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Margaret Macdonald Mackintosh was a Scottish artist known for her work in the Art Nouveau movement. She was a prominent figure in the Glasgow School and collaborated frequently with her husband, Charles Rennie Mackintosh. Her work often featured symbolic and mystical themes, with a focus on feminine figures and nature-inspired motifs.","observation":"The style combines elongated, front-facing female figures with highly ornamental, panel-like compositions and repeated geometric framing. Richly patterned surfaces, floral motifs, flowing garments, fine linear detail, and restrained earth tones punctuated by red, blue, purple, and black create a decorative, archaic-looking painted illustration."},{"id":"wotto","name":"Wotto","cat":"illustrators","en":"Wotto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wotto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wotto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","bold-lines","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","charcoal","black","red"],"intro":"Wotto is an artist known for his unique and whimsical illustrations that often blend elements of fantasy and surrealism. His work typically features quirky characters and imaginative scenes that capture a sense of playful eccentricity. Wotto's style is characterized by detailed linework and vibrant colors, creating a visually engaging experience that appeals to a wide audience.","observation":"The style is a densely packed illustrative creature collage, combining cartoon-like monster anatomy, oversized eyes, tentacles, teeth, skulls, and repeated organic motifs. Thick contour lines, fine hatching, crisp graphic shapes, extreme contrast, and saturated coral, pink, teal, and orange areas create a vivid grotesque comic aesthetic, with one variation rendered in stark black and white."},{"id":"bill-durgin","name":"Bill Durgin","cat":"photographers","en":"Bill Durgin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-durgin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-durgin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-ochre","grey","dark-brown","light-orange","ochre","black"],"intro":"Bill Durgin is a contemporary American photographer known for his exploration of the human form through abstract and surreal compositions. His work often challenges traditional perceptions of identity and body image, utilizing unique poses and fabric manipulations to create thought-provoking visual narratives.","observation":"The style uses realistic, film-like studio photography with restrained earthy color, soft directional light, and large areas of quiet negative space. Concealed or turned-away figures, flowing wrinkled fabric, and carefully staged domestic settings create an intimate, surreal, slightly somber mood."},{"id":"quint-buchholz","name":"Quint Buchholz","cat":"painters","en":"Quint Buchholz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/quint-buchholz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/quint-buchholz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-blue","dark-blue","black","grey","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Quint Buchholz is a German painter and illustrator known for his surreal and dreamlike artworks. His work often explores themes of solitude, contemplation, and the metaphysical, using a distinctive style that blends realism with fantasy. Buchholz's paintings have been featured in numerous exhibitions and are celebrated for their evocative and thought-provoking imagery.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic-looking wide compositions with solitary figures placed against expansive landscapes and unusually large celestial forms. Muted blue, teal, rust, and pink tones, soft atmospheric light, visible grain, and restrained surreal details create a quiet, dreamlike melancholy."},{"id":"vanessa-beecroft","name":"Vanessa Beecroft","cat":"various-artists","en":"Vanessa Beecroft","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vanessa-beecroft.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vanessa-beecroft","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","silver","black","brown"],"intro":"Vanessa Beecroft is an Italian contemporary artist known for her provocative and often controversial performance art pieces, which frequently explore themes of identity, gender, and the human form. Her work often involves live models arranged in carefully choreographed formations, blurring the lines between art and life.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic photography with densely repeated human figures, sculptural pale faces, and carefully arranged group formations. Soft selective focus, restrained pink, white, and black tones, and occasional deep shadows create an eerie, dreamlike atmosphere while keeping tactile skin and fabric detail prominent."},{"id":"edwin-lord-weeks","name":"Edwin Lord Weeks","cat":"painters","en":"Edwin Lord Weeks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edwin-lord-weeks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edwin-lord-weeks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","light-orange","grey","rust"],"intro":"Edwin Lord Weeks was an American artist known for his Orientalist paintings, capturing the exotic and vibrant scenes of the Middle East and India during the late 19th century. His works are celebrated for their detailed depiction of architecture, landscapes, and cultural life, often infused with a romanticized view of the regions he explored.","observation":"These images use richly visible, broad painterly strokes to build sunlit architectural scenes filled with figures, animals, textiles, and intricate masonry. Warm earth tones, deep architectural shadows, and strong highlights create expressive, high-contrast tableaux with ornate domes, arches, columns, and reflective water."},{"id":"joan-miro","name":"Joan Miro","cat":"painters","en":"Joan Miro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joan-miro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joan-miro","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","animals","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","blue","black","vivid-red"],"intro":"Joan Miro was a Spanish painter, sculptor, and ceramicist born in Barcelona. Known for his distinct style that blends abstract art with Surrealism , Miro's work often features playful shapes, vivid colors, and a sense of spontaneity. His art is celebrated for its innovative approach and its ability to convey a childlike sense of wonder and imagination.","observation":"Across all four panels, bold geometric and biomorphic shapes are painted in saturated red, blue, yellow, black, and white, with recurring circles, eyes, bird-like figures, and abstract forms. Flat color fields are overlaid with expressive thin scribbles, splatters, and visible canvas texture, creating a lively surreal painted-collage effect."},{"id":"carne-griffiths","name":"Carne Griffiths","cat":"illustrators","en":"Carne Griffiths","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carne-griffiths.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carne-griffiths","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","light-orange","orange","dark-brown","grey","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Carne Griffiths is a contemporary British artist known for his intricate and expressive works that often explore the human form and emotion through the use of unconventional materials such as tea, ink, and alcohol. His art is characterized by a blend of fine lines and fluid forms, creating a sense of movement and depth.","observation":"The style combines highly rendered facial features with exposed, energetic drawing: fine graphite-like lines, ink contours, loose hair strokes, and translucent painterly washes overlap across the faces. Cropped portrait fragments sit against pale open grounds, using restrained earth, peach, blue, and orange hues while maintaining an expressive, slightly surreal tension between realism and abstraction."},{"id":"guillermo-del-toro","name":"Guillermo del Toro","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Guillermo del Toro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guillermo-del-toro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guillermo-del-toro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","vivid-red","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Guillermo del Toro is a renowned Mexican filmmaker, author, and artist known for his distinctive style that blends fantasy and horror. He has directed critically acclaimed films such as \"Pan's Labyrinth\" and \"The Shape of Water,\" which showcase his fascination with monsters, folklore, and the supernatural. Del Toro's work is characterized by its imaginative storytelling, rich visual detail, and a unique ability to blend the fantastical with the real.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly brushwork with dense character detail and expressive faces. Deep teal-black shadows are cut by saturated red and warm amber accents, creating high-contrast, dark-fantasy portrait scenes populated by ominous creatures and theatrical props."},{"id":"isaac-levitan","name":"Isaac Levitan","cat":"painters","en":"Isaac Levitan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isaac-levitan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isaac-levitan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-olive","silver","muted-blue","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Isaac Levitan was a Russian landscape painter, renowned for his ability to capture the mood and atmosphere of the Russian countryside. Born in 1860, Levitan became a key figure in the Russian landscape movement, known for his evocative and atmospheric depictions of nature. His works often reflect a deep connection to the natural world, characterized by a sense of tranquility and introspection.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents expansive rural landscapes with reflective water, rolling fields, trees, cottages, and towering clouds. Visible directional brushwork and finely layered paint give the scenes a richly textured, expressive surface, while the natural palette remains restrained and softly atmospheric."},{"id":"florine-stettheimer","name":"Florine Stettheimer","cat":"painters","en":"Florine Stettheimer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/florine-stettheimer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/florine-stettheimer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","fashion","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-green","light-orange","muted-ochre","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Florine Stettheimer was an American modernist painter known for her unique and whimsical style. She was active during the early 20th century and is celebrated for her vibrant and imaginative depictions of New York society. Stettheimer's work often features bold colors, elongated figures, and a playful, almost theatrical quality that captures the spirit of the Roaring Twenties.","observation":"The style combines visible fine brushwork with richly layered, decorative scenes packed with flowers, foliage, animals, architecture, and elegantly dressed figures. Saturated reds, pinks, greens, and blues are arranged in illustrative, dreamlike tableaux, with ornate surface patterning and a storybook sense of fantasy."},{"id":"george-henry-yewell","name":"George Henry Yewell","cat":"painters","en":"George Henry Yewell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-henry-yewell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-henry-yewell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","pale-yellow","beige","white"],"intro":"George Henry Yewell was an American painter known for his detailed and realistic depictions of landscapes and domestic scenes. Born in 1830, he became a significant figure in the 19th-century American art scene, particularly recognized for his contributions to the Hudson River School. His works often captured the serene beauty of rural life and nature, reflecting the cultural and societal values of his time.","observation":"The style presents richly rendered rural landscapes and working-life scenes with visible oil-paint texture, fine directional brushwork, and dense natural detail. Subdued, earthy colors shift into moody shadow, while dramatic skies, reflective water, and ornate gilded frames reinforce a stately classical atmosphere."},{"id":"rachel-ruysch","name":"Rachel Ruysch","cat":"painters","en":"Rachel Ruysch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rachel-ruysch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rachel-ruysch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","negative-space"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","deep-red","red"],"intro":"Rachel Ruysch was a renowned Dutch painter known for her exquisite still-life paintings, particularly those featuring flowers. Born in 1664, she became one of the most celebrated female artists of the Dutch Golden Age. Her works are characterized by their intricate detail, vibrant colors, and masterful use of light and shadow, often incorporating elements of symbolism and vanitas themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely layered flowers and foliage emerge from near-black grounds in richly worked, visibly painted surfaces. Fine brushwork models individual petals and leaves, while dramatic light, warm coral and cream blossoms, and deep shadow create an ornate, classical floral still-life character."},{"id":"helmut-newton","name":"Helmut Newton","cat":"photographers","en":"Helmut Newton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helmut-newton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helmut-newton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Helmut Newton was a German-Australian photographer known for his provocative and erotically charged black-and-white fashion photographs. His work often featured strong, confident women in glamorous settings, and he became one of the most influential fashion photographers of the 20th century.","observation":"A monochrome, high-contrast photographic style presents sharply dressed women in hats and sunglasses through tightly framed editorial portraits and urban tableaux. Strong window light, deep shadows, cigarette smoke, tailored clothing, and richly textured fur create a dramatic retro fashion atmosphere with cinematic composition."},{"id":"david-horsey","name":"David Horsey","cat":"illustrators","en":"David Horsey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-horsey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-horsey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","ink"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","muted-ochre","pale-orange","grey","rust"],"intro":"David Horsey is an American editorial cartoonist and commentator known for his work in political satire. He has won multiple Pulitzer Prizes for his insightful and often humorous depictions of political figures and events.","observation":"The style uses dense, finely hatched ink drawing with clean illustrative contours, exaggerated faces, and highly readable costume and architectural detail. Restrained earthy colors, strong light-dark separation, and tightly framed groups or portraits give the scenes an expressive, dramatic editorial character."},{"id":"alice-rahon","name":"Alice Rahon","cat":"painters","en":"Alice Rahon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alice-rahon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alice-rahon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-teal","dark-red","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Alice Rahon is a French-Mexican painter and poet associated with the Surrealist movement. Born in 1904, she became known for her dreamlike and fantastical works that often incorporated elements of mythology and folklore. Her art is characterized by a blend of surrealism and symbolism, creating a unique visual language that explores the subconscious and the mystical.","observation":"Across the four images, richly textured paint and fine, visible brushwork build dense botanical, textile, and architectural detail. Saturated reds, teals, blues, and blacks create an ornate, moody jewel-toned world populated by elongated figures, strange costumes, and fantastical gardens."},{"id":"sophie-blackall","name":"Sophie Blackall","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sophie Blackall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sophie-blackall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sophie-blackall","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","muted-ochre","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Sophie Blackall is an acclaimed illustrator and author known for her work in children's literature. She has won multiple awards, including the Caldecott Medal, for her distinctive and enchanting illustrations. Blackall's art often features whimsical and detailed depictions of characters and scenes, capturing the imagination of both children and adults alike.","observation":"Across all four panels, figures and animals are rendered as richly textured, hand-painted storybook scenes, with visible fine brushwork and densely layered botanical detail. The subdued woodland palette is punctuated by strong red and orange accents, while expressive faces, unusual animal companions, and vignette-like interactions give the style a fantastical narrative character."},{"id":"jean-delville","name":"Jean Delville","cat":"painters","en":"Jean Delville","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-delville.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-delville","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","religious","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","brown","bone-white","dark-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Jean Delville is a Belgian symbolist painter known for his mystical and allegorical works. His art often explores spiritual and philosophical themes, characterized by intricate details and ethereal compositions. Delville was a prominent figure in the Symbolist movement, contributing significantly to the development of this genre in the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"The style is richly painterly, with visible fine strokes, layered textures, and elaborate ornamental surfaces across solemn, tightly framed faces and garments. Muted blue, bronze, cream, and copper tones create a devotional, dreamlike atmosphere, while repeated veils, halos, headdresses, and overlapping figures push the portraits toward surreal symbolism."},{"id":"derek-jarman","name":"Derek Jarman","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Derek Jarman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/derek-jarman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/derek-jarman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","muted-blue","deep-red","beige","vivid-red","rust"],"intro":"Derek Jarman was a British filmmaker, artist, and activist known for his avant-garde and experimental approach to cinema. He was a prominent figure in the LGBTQ+ community and often explored themes of identity, sexuality, and politics in his work. Jarman's films are characterized by their bold visual style, poetic narratives, and innovative use of imagery and sound.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, grain-textured photography with solitary figures placed against expansive landscapes and stark, emotionally charged situations. Deep blue-grey surroundings are repeatedly cut by vivid rust, orange, and red accents, while smoke, firelight, weathering, and occasional painterly overlays create a dramatic, expressive tension."},{"id":"koloman-moser","name":"Koloman Moser","cat":"painters","en":"Koloman Moser","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/koloman-moser.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/koloman-moser","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["brown","pale-orange","muted-ochre","black","red"],"intro":"Koloman Moser was an influential Austrian artist and designer, known for his significant contributions to the Vienna Secession movement and the development of modern design. His work spanned various mediums, including painting, graphic design, and applied arts, characterized by a distinct blend of traditional and modern elements.","observation":"The style combines dense botanical and animal imagery with highly decorative, poster-like organization. Strong dark outlines, flat color areas, patterned surfaces, and a restricted but vivid palette of coral red, cream, navy, olive, and black give the pictures a graphic ornamental character."},{"id":"calvin-klein","name":"Calvin Klein","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Calvin Klein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/calvin-klein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/calvin-klein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["deep-red","beige","black","silver","bone-white","dark-brown"],"intro":"Calvin Klein is an American fashion designer renowned for his minimalist aesthetic and iconic brand, which has become synonymous with modern, casual elegance. His work in fashion design has significantly influenced contemporary style, particularly in the realms of jeans, underwear, and fragrance, establishing a global presence in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style combines polished editorial photography with highly designed fashion imagery, using precise close-ups, posed figures, translucent layered garments, and sculptural red materials. Strong saturated accents, controlled studio lighting, crisp surface detail, and unusual surreal arrangements create a dramatic, luxurious visual language across the set."},{"id":"kirsty-mitchell","name":"Kirsty Mitchell","cat":"photographers","en":"Kirsty Mitchell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kirsty-mitchell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kirsty-mitchell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","grey","silver","deep-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Kirsty Mitchell is a British fine art photographer known for her elaborate and fantastical photographic series, often inspired by fairy tales and the natural world. Her work is characterized by its intricate costumes, vivid colors, and dreamlike settings, creating immersive visual narratives that captivate the viewer.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, cinematic fashion tableaux in dense, mossy forests, combining realistic photographic rendering with fantastical, surreal costumes and oversized botanical headpieces. Muted woodland surroundings and moody colour schemes contrast with strongly coordinated red, blue, white, and monochrome costume palettes, while shallow focus gives the portraits a dreamlike editorial finish."},{"id":"dave-sim","name":"Dave Sim","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dave Sim","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dave-sim.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dave-sim","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","grey","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Dave Sim is a Canadian comic book writer and artist, best known for his work on the independent comic series \"Cerebus.\" His contributions to the comic book industry include pioneering self-publishing and exploring complex themes through his work. Sim's style is characterized by intricate line work and a distinctive narrative voice, making him a notable figure in the world of graphic novels.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white comic illustration with heavy ink contours, dense crosshatching, and highly controlled areas of solid black. Expressive faces, dramatic shadows, cluttered interiors, and carefully rendered props give the scenes a richly detailed, noir-like visual intensity."},{"id":"neal-adams","name":"Neal Adams","cat":"illustrators","en":"Neal Adams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/neal-adams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/neal-adams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","portraits","bold-lines","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","light-orange","beige","olive","red"],"intro":"Neal Adams was a renowned American comic book artist known for his influential work in the superhero genre, particularly with characters like Batman and Superman. His dynamic style and realistic portrayals brought a new level of sophistication to comic art, making him a pivotal figure in the industry.","observation":"The style uses highly expressive comic-book character imagery with forceful ink contours, dense hatching, scratchy marks, and carefully articulated facial and fur textures. Most panels use a limited cream, black, and sepia range, while selective saturated color⁠—especially green and red⁠—heightens the dramatic monster portraits."},{"id":"raphael-kirchner","name":"Raphael Kirchner","cat":"illustrators","en":"Raphael Kirchner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raphael-kirchner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raphael-kirchner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["light-orange","muted-orange","red","black","brown"],"intro":"Raphael Kirchner was an Austrian illustrator and painter, known for his Art Nouveau style and contributions to the Belle Époque period. He gained fame for his postcards and illustrations that often depicted elegant and sensuous female figures adorned with floral motifs, capturing the romantic and whimsical spirit of the early 20th century.","observation":"The style uses finely drawn, highly decorative figurative illustration with elegant female portraits, elaborate clothing, hats, lace, and floral motifs. Restrained coral, cream, rose, black, and muted blue-green tones unify the compositions, while fine contour lines, patterned surfaces, and flattened ornamental backgrounds create a vintage poster-like appearance."},{"id":"andres-serrano","name":"Andres Serrano","cat":"photographers","en":"Andres Serrano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andres-serrano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andres-serrano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","red","deep-red","muted-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Andres Serrano is an American photographer known for his provocative and often controversial works that explore themes of religion, sexuality, and identity. His most famous piece, \"Piss Christ,\" sparked widespread debate and discussion about the boundaries of art and freedom of expression.","observation":"The style uses intensely cropped, realistic portrait photography with tactile skin detail, wet highlights, shallow focus, and strong cinematic contrast. Saturated reds, deep blacks, and frontal dramatic lighting create an intimate, solemn, emotionally charged mood across the set."},{"id":"carlos-schwabe","name":"Carlos Schwabe","cat":"painters","en":"Carlos Schwabe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carlos-schwabe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carlos-schwabe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","bone-white","dark-blue","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Carlos Schwabe was a Swiss Symbolist painter known for his mystical and allegorical works. Born in 1866, Schwabe's art often explored themes of fantasy, mythology, and spirituality, characterized by intricate detailing and a dreamlike quality. His works are celebrated for their ethereal beauty and symbolic depth, contributing significantly to the Symbolist movement of the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"Across all four images, richly textured brushwork models expressive figures, elaborate garments, and turbulent natural surroundings with dense, finely observed surfaces. The restrained blue, ochre, cream, and brown palette creates a dark, romantic fantasy mood, while cinematic-scale compositions and swirling environmental forms lend the scenes an epic sense of movement."},{"id":"frida-kahlo","name":"Frida Kahlo","cat":"painters","en":"Frida Kahlo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frida-kahlo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frida-kahlo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","ethnic-poc","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-olive","dark-ochre","yellow","rust","muted-green","red"],"intro":"Frida Kahlo was a renowned Mexican painter known for her self-portraits and works inspired by nature and Mexican culture. Her art often explores themes of identity, postcolonialism, gender, class, and race in Mexican society. Kahlo's unique style combines elements of realism, symbolism, and surrealism, making her one of the most significant artists of the 20th century.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with highly detailed, ornamental portrait compositions, filling the frame with flowers, foliage, animals, jewelry, and patterned clothing. Saturated reds, greens, and blues create strong contrast, while frontal figures and dense botanical framing give the images a formal, iconic presence."},{"id":"lorser-feitelson","name":"Lorser Feitelson","cat":"painters","en":"Lorser Feitelson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lorser-feitelson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lorser-feitelson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["pale-orange","vivid-red","black","beige","deep-red","deep-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Lorser Feitelson was an influential American painter known for his role in the development of the Hard-edge painting style, a movement characterized by sharp transitions between color areas. His work often explored themes of abstraction and modernism, contributing significantly to the Los Angeles art scene in the mid-20th century.","observation":"Across all four works, the style uses vivid red, blue, black, and ochre in strongly contrasted, cleanly blocked shapes, with visible painted texture and angular, graphic contours. It presents stylized fashion-oriented portraits and figures, often partially obscured by drapery or shadow, combining illustrative flatness with emphatic painterly surface."},{"id":"simon-birch","name":"Simon Birch","cat":"painters","en":"Simon Birch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/simon-birch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/simon-birch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","muted-orange","dark-brown","charcoal","beige","red"],"intro":"Simon Birch is a contemporary artist known for his dynamic and expressive paintings that often explore themes of identity and emotion. His work is characterized by bold, energetic brushstrokes and a vivid color palette, capturing the intensity of human experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, faces and figures are built from energetic, visibly layered paint, with directional strokes breaking up forms and extending into the background. The restrained pale grounds contrast with saturated reds, corals, blues, and dark accents, while cropped portraits and loose garment and hair marks give the style an expressive, fashion-editorial intensity."},{"id":"sailor-jerry","name":"Sailor Jerry","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sailor Jerry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sailor-jerry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sailor-jerry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","fashion","floral","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["orange","bone-white","dark-brown","black","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Sailor Jerry is a renowned figure in the tattoo world, known for his pioneering work in the development of American traditional tattooing. His real name was Norman Collins, and he became famous for his bold, colorful designs that often featured nautical themes, pin-up girls, and iconic symbols like swallows and roses. His work has had a lasting influence on the tattoo industry and continues to inspire artists worldwide.","observation":"The style uses clean, heavy black outlines with compact areas of saturated red, orange, and muted cream, creating a bold graphic tattoo-flash appearance. Recognizable birds, flowers, hearts, ships, and other symbolic motifs are simplified into carefully arranged illustrative forms with selective black shading and strong contrast."},{"id":"alexander-girard","name":"Alexander Girard","cat":"designers","en":"Alexander Girard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexander-girard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexander-girard","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","retro","geometric"],"colours":["pale-yellow","vivid-red","red","brown","dark-blue","yellow"],"intro":"Alexander Girard was an influential American designer known for his work in textiles, furniture, and interior design. He was a key figure in mid-century modern design, celebrated for his vibrant use of color and playful patterns. Girard's work often incorporated elements of folk art and was characterized by its bold, geometric forms and innovative use of materials.","observation":"The style combines dense, highly varied decorative imagery with simplified geometric forms, crisp outlines, and mostly flat areas of saturated red, blue, yellow, green, and black against a warm cream ground. Repeated floral, animal, face, vessel, and abstract motifs are arranged like a richly packed pattern archive, with a slightly tactile printed or painted surface and a strong retro graphic character."},{"id":"stanley-kubrick","name":"Stanley Kubrick","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Stanley Kubrick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stanley-kubrick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stanley-kubrick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["dark-red","black","vivid-red","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Stanley Kubrick was an influential American filmmaker known for his meticulous craftsmanship and innovative storytelling. His films, such as \" 2001: A Space Odyssey ,\" \"A Clockwork Orange,\" and \"The Shining,\" are celebrated for their unique visual style and complex narratives, often exploring themes of existentialism, identity, and humanity's darker aspects.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines heavily textured painted surfaces with cinematic framing, deep red-and-black color, and stark directional lighting. Geometric environments, centered figures, and unsettling sci-fi situations create a surreal, claustrophobic mood with broad visible brushwork and dense surface detail."},{"id":"mikalojus-konstantinas-ciurlionis","name":"Mikalojus Konstantinas Ciurlionis","cat":"painters","en":"Mikalojus Konstantinas Ciurlionis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mikalojus-konstantinas-ciurlionis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mikalojus-konstantinas-ciurlionis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-blue","black","brown","grey","orange"],"intro":"Mikalojus Konstantinas Ciurlionis was a Lithuanian painter and composer known for his contributions to the Symbolist movement in the early 20th century. His work often explored themes of mysticism and spirituality, blending visual art with musical composition to create a unique, synesthetic experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily textured, visible brushwork in a dark blue nocturnal palette, punctuated by warm orange celestial or reflected light. Landscapes, water, silhouettes, and monumental architecture are treated with expressive vertical drips, radiating strokes, atmospheric haze, and dramatic high-contrast illumination."},{"id":"lucian-freud","name":"Lucian Freud","cat":"painters","en":"Lucian Freud","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucian-freud.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucian-freud","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","muted-brown","muted-ochre","black","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Lucian Freud is a renowned British painter known for his intense and unflinching portraits. Born in 1922, Freud was a leading figure in the London School of painters. His work is characterized by a focus on the human form, often depicting his subjects with raw, almost forensic detail. Freud's paintings are celebrated for their psychological depth and the masterful use of texture and color.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces are built from visible, directional brushwork and layered paint, with highly readable wrinkles, hair, skin, and clothing. The subdued earth-tone palette, deep shadows, and strained or introspective expressions create an intense, somber portrait style."},{"id":"toshio-shibata","name":"Toshio Shibata","cat":"photographers","en":"Toshio Shibata","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/toshio-shibata.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/toshio-shibata","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","dark-blue","blue","ochre"],"intro":"Toshio Shibata is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his large-format photographs that explore the relationship between nature and man-made structures. His work often focuses on the integration of infrastructure within natural landscapes, capturing the serene yet imposing presence of these constructions.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is cinematic and realistic, using subdued blue-green tones, warm highlights, deep shadows, and pronounced grain. Quiet landscapes and urban fragments are framed with strong leading lines, selective focus, and an ominous, contemplative atmosphere."},{"id":"olivier-valsecchi","name":"Olivier Valsecchi","cat":"photographers","en":"Olivier Valsecchi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olivier-valsecchi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olivier-valsecchi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"Olivier Valsecchi is a contemporary French photographer known for his ethereal and surreal imagery. His work often explores themes of transformation and the human form, using photography to create dreamlike and introspective compositions. Valsecchi's style is characterized by its use of chiaroscuro and high contrast lighting, which adds a dramatic and mysterious quality to his images.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely detailed portrait rendering with tactile skin and sculptural, translucent fabrics arranged as dramatic head coverings and collars. Restrained cream, charcoal, and deep teal tones, strong subject isolation, and obscured facial features create a moody, dreamy surrealism with an editorial fashion sensibility."},{"id":"josh-agle","name":"Josh Agle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Josh Agle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josh-agle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josh-agle","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","deep-red","muted-cyan","pale-orange","orange"],"intro":"Josh Agle is an American artist known for his distinctive style that blends mid-century modern aesthetics with pop culture influences. Often working under the pseudonym \"Shag,\" Agle's work is characterized by its vibrant colors, bold lines, and playful depictions of leisure and social scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic, poster-like illustrations with heavy dark outlines, sharply angular forms, and clean blocks of saturated red, orange, teal, black, and cream. It combines glamorous nightlife characters, cocktails, cats, architecture, and decorative urban vignettes with dense collage-like arrangements and restrained distressed texture, creating a bold retro comic atmosphere."},{"id":"gjon-mili","name":"Gjon Mili","cat":"photographers","en":"Gjon Mili","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gjon-mili.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gjon-mili","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","glow","mist","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Gjon Mili was an Albanian-American photographer known for his pioneering work in light photography and his innovative use of stroboscopic techniques. He collaborated with many artists and captured motion in a unique and expressive way, leaving a significant mark on the world of photography.","observation":"Across all four images, performers are rendered in stark monochrome with deep shadows, bright pools of light, and strongly sculpted silhouettes. Long-exposure light trails, drifting smoke, blurred fabric, and extended gestures make the photographic scenes feel kinetic and theatrical."},{"id":"cfa-voysey","name":"CFA Voysey","cat":"architects","en":"CFA Voysey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cfa-voysey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cfa-voysey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","landscapes","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-olive","dark-blue","pale-yellow","grey","dark-rust"],"intro":"CFA Voysey was an influential English architect and designer, known for his contributions to the Arts and Crafts Movement. Born in 1857, Voysey's work is characterized by its simplicity, functionality, and integration with nature. He designed a range of objects from furniture to wallpapers, emphasizing craftsmanship and natural motifs.","observation":"The style combines densely layered botanical imagery with a decorative garden-and-castle setting, using fine contour lines, patterned foliage, and carefully rendered plant details. Its restrained blue, green, cream, and muted red palette, flattened illustrative forms, and ornamental surface treatment create a richly composed classical botanical-design look."},{"id":"rose-wylie","name":"Rose Wylie","cat":"painters","en":"Rose Wylie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rose-wylie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rose-wylie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","light-orange","orange","muted-ochre","green","black","red"],"intro":"Rose Wylie is a British contemporary artist known for her large-scale, colorful paintings that often incorporate elements of pop culture and everyday life. Her work is characterized by a playful, childlike style that challenges traditional notions of composition and perspective, making her a distinctive figure in the modern art world.","observation":"The style combines rough, visibly brushed paint with loose black contour drawing and simplified, expressive forms. Faces, clothing, buildings, flowers, and animals are rendered in vivid, uneven blocks of color, with a deliberately handmade, childlike directness and tactile paper surface."},{"id":"margaret-tarrant","name":"Margaret Tarrant","cat":"illustrators","en":"Margaret Tarrant","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/margaret-tarrant.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/margaret-tarrant","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","cute","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","charcoal","light-orange","brown","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Margaret Tarrant was an English illustrator known for her charming and whimsical depictions of fairy tales and children's stories. Her work, primarily in the early to mid-20th century, often featured delicate watercolor illustrations that captured the innocence and wonder of childhood. Tarrant's illustrations are celebrated for their intricate details and soft color palettes, bringing to life the magical worlds of fairies and mythical creatures.","observation":"Across all four images, softly blended visible brushwork creates tender pastoral scenes populated by children, flowers, and gentle animals. The palette is restrained and luminous, with blue garments, warm skin tones, and natural greens supporting a nostalgic, dreamlike storybook mood."},{"id":"fang-lijun","name":"Fang Lijun","cat":"painters","en":"Fang Lijun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fang-lijun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fang-lijun","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["red","blue","dark-red","beige","charcoal"],"intro":"Fang Lijun is a contemporary Chinese artist known for his significant role in the Cynical Realism movement. His work often explores themes of modern Chinese society, identity, and the human condition, characterized by bold, expressive portraits and surreal, dreamlike scenarios.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly saturated pink, red, and blue colors with strongly modeled faces, dense repetition, and expressive laughter or grimaces. Fine, directional surface lines and visible painted texture give the exaggerated close-ups a tactile, surreal presence, while tight cropping and crowded arrangements intensify the effect."},{"id":"deana-lawson","name":"Deana Lawson","cat":"photographers","en":"Deana Lawson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/deana-lawson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/deana-lawson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-teal","grey","deep-red","ochre"],"intro":"Deana Lawson is a contemporary American photographer known for her powerful and intimate portraits that explore themes of identity, family, and cultural heritage. Her work often focuses on the African American experience, capturing the richness and complexity of her subjects' lives. Lawson's photographs are celebrated for their detailed composition and the way they challenge traditional notions of beauty and representation.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, carefully staged family portraits with formal poses, richly dressed figures, and densely decorated interiors filled with antique frames, patterned carpets, plants, and furniture. Deep teal, burgundy, black, cream, and muted earth tones create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while elaborate clothing and salon-like settings give the images a classical, opulent character."},{"id":"george-rodrigue","name":"George Rodrigue","cat":"painters","en":"George Rodrigue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-rodrigue.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-rodrigue","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","animals","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["blue","vivid-red","black","silver","muted-blue","deep-red"],"intro":"George Rodrigue is a renowned American artist best known for his iconic Blue Dog series, which became a symbol of Cajun culture and contemporary art. Born in Louisiana, Rodrigue's work often reflects the vibrant and unique culture of the American South, blending traditional and modern elements to create a distinctive style that resonates with a wide audience.","observation":"The style uses thick, visible paint strokes and rough black contouring to turn front-facing border collie portraits into bold graphic studies. Saturated cobalt blue, vermilion red, black, and white dominate, with simplified flat color shapes energized by expressive brush texture and varied formal accessories."},{"id":"zimoun","name":"Zimoun","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Zimoun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zimoun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zimoun","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","ochre","black","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Zimoun is a Swiss artist known for his innovative sound sculptures and installations. His work often explores the intersection of sound, space, and movement, creating immersive environments that engage the viewer's senses. Zimoun's installations typically incorporate simple mechanical systems, such as motors and cardboard boxes, to produce complex sonic experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents large-scale geometric installations in realistic, carefully composed exhibition interiors. Warm brown and amber tones, repeating box-like forms, strong architectural perspective, and selective candlelight create a subdued, moody, cinematic atmosphere with sculptural mass and rhythmic symmetry."},{"id":"lauren-faust","name":"Lauren Faust","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lauren Faust","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lauren-faust.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lauren-faust","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","floral","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","dark-blue","orange","violet","cream","red"],"intro":"Lauren Faust is an American animator, writer, and producer known for her work on popular animated series such as \" My Little Pony : Friendship Is Magic\" and \"The Powerpuff Girls.\" She is celebrated for her contributions to children's animation and her distinctive style that combines whimsical storytelling with vibrant visuals.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly colorful illustrative cartoon forms with crisp contour drawing, simplified flat-to-gently-shaded color areas, and exaggerated expressive eyes. It combines densely arranged fantasy characters and animal-like figures with decorative foliage, flowing hair, and playful storybook compositions."},{"id":"peter-holme-iii","name":"Peter Holme III","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Holme III","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-holme-iii.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-holme-iii","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","dark-brown","black","ochre","beige"],"intro":"Peter Holme III is a contemporary photographer known for his surreal and dreamlike landscapes that blend elements of fantasy and reality. His work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, using natural settings to evoke a sense of mystery and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is photographic and cinematic, pairing warm amber foliage and earth with deep blue skies, heavy cloud masses, and strong directional light. Broad landscapes are rendered with crisp natural detail, atmospheric haze, reflective water, and small isolated figures that heighten the dreamy, contemplative scale."},{"id":"anna-dittmann","name":"Anna Dittmann","cat":"illustrators","en":"Anna Dittmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anna-dittmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anna-dittmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","silver","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Anna Dittmann is a contemporary illustrator known for her ethereal and dreamlike digital artworks. Her work often features intricate details and a soft, flowing aesthetic that blends elements of fantasy and surrealism. Dittmann's illustrations are characterized by their delicate textures and expressive portraits, often integrating floral motifs and nature-inspired themes.","observation":"The style combines intimate close-up portraits with painterly, finely controlled brushwork, luminous skin, flowing hair, and elaborate floral or organic adornments. Saturated turquoise, coral, lavender, cream, and deep teal recur across the images, while sparkling overlays and surreal botanical compositions create a dreamy, otherworldly atmosphere."},{"id":"brian-mashburn","name":"Brian Mashburn","cat":"painters","en":"Brian Mashburn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-mashburn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-mashburn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["grey","silver","white","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Brian Mashburn is an American artist known for his intricate and atmospheric landscapes that often explore themes of nature, isolation, and the sublime. His work is characterized by a blend of realism and fantasy, creating hauntingly beautiful scenes that invite viewers to ponder the relationship between humanity and the natural world.","observation":"The style presents haunted, expansive landscapes in a soft painterly treatment, with subdued blue-gray tones, diffuse light, and pervasive fog obscuring distant forms. Gnarled trees, ravens, cliffs, cloaked figures, and gothic architecture create a dark, dreamlike, epic atmosphere across all four scenes."},{"id":"tsumori-chisato","name":"Tsumori Chisato","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Tsumori Chisato","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tsumori-chisato.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tsumori-chisato","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["ochre","bone-white","brown","red","vivid-rust","grey","light-yellow"],"intro":"Tsumori Chisato is a renowned Japanese fashion designer known for her playful and whimsical designs. She studied at Bunka Fashion College and worked under Issey Miyake before launching her own brand in 1990. Her work is characterized by colorful prints, intricate patterns, and a unique blend of Eastern and Western influences.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic fashion portraits with saturated, high-contrast color and exceptionally elaborate garments. Dense pattern mixing, layered textiles, appliqués, tassels, oversized forms, and sculptural silhouettes dominate the imagery, while clean illustrative definition keeps the clothing and faces sharply readable."},{"id":"travis-charest","name":"Travis Charest","cat":"illustrators","en":"Travis Charest","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/travis-charest.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/travis-charest","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white","blue"],"intro":"Travis Charest is a Canadian comic book artist known for his detailed and realistic style. He has worked on various notable projects, including 'WildC.A.T.s' and 'Metabarons,' and is recognized for his meticulous line work and intricate illustrations.","observation":"The style combines visible, directional paint strokes with dense ink-like linework, rugged textures, and strongly modeled forms. It favors dramatic close-up character compositions, moody dark palettes, and high-contrast lighting across both fantastical creatures and militarized science-fiction figures."},{"id":"robert-bissell","name":"Robert Bissell","cat":"illustrators","en":"Robert Bissell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-bissell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-bissell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","silver","brown","ochre","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Robert Bissell is a contemporary artist known for his imaginative and surreal depictions of animals and nature. His work often explores themes of transformation and the connection between humans and the natural world, using animals as metaphors for human experiences. Bissell's paintings are characterized by their dreamlike quality and meticulous attention to detail, creating a sense of wonder and introspection.","observation":"Across all four images, animals are rendered with richly visible fur and delicate, directional brushwork, set against expansive flower-filled meadows and luminous skies. The saturated blues, whites, greens, and warm browns, along with oversized clouds and gentle upward gazes, create a dreamy, storybook-like natural world."},{"id":"clark-little","name":"Clark Little","cat":"photographers","en":"Clark Little","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clark-little.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clark-little","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["grey","dark-brown","charcoal","muted-blue","rust","pale-orange"],"intro":"Clark Little is a renowned photographer known for his captivating images of ocean waves. Born in California and raised in Hawaii, Little has become famous for his ability to capture the beauty and power of the sea from unique perspectives. His work often involves getting up close to the waves, resulting in stunning, immersive photographs that highlight the dynamic nature of the ocean.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, highly detailed photography-like views from inside curling ocean waves, with strong flowing motion and dramatic sunset light. Saturated turquoise water, warm orange reflections, bright foam, and high contrast create an immersive cinematic surf perspective."},{"id":"xavier-dolan","name":"Xavier Dolan","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Xavier Dolan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/xavier-dolan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/xavier-dolan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-ochre","brown","muted-ochre","dark-teal","silver","vivid-red"],"intro":"Xavier Dolan is a Canadian filmmaker, actor, and screenwriter known for his emotionally charged and visually distinctive films. He has received numerous accolades for his work, including awards at the Cannes Film Festival. Dolan's films often explore themes of family, identity, and love, with a focus on LGBTQ+ narratives.","observation":"A cinematic photographic style built around intimate, emotionally charged portraits and extreme facial close-ups. Deep green, amber, and red lighting, strong shadow contrast, visible film grain, glowing practical lights, and shallow focus create a moody nocturnal atmosphere with candid, tightly cropped framing."},{"id":"brooke-shaden","name":"Brooke Shaden","cat":"photographers","en":"Brooke Shaden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brooke-shaden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brooke-shaden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","brown","deep-red","dark-brown","silver","pale-orange"],"intro":"Brooke Shaden is an American fine art photographer known for her surreal and fantastical imagery. Her work often explores themes of introspection and the human condition, utilizing digital manipulation to create dreamlike scenes that blur the line between reality and imagination.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic, realistic photography to stage surreal, emotionally charged tableaux in bleak outdoor settings. Muted teal, beige, and deep red tones, windblown fabric, scattered petals, selective focus, and dynamic poses create a dark, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"bill-henson","name":"Bill Henson","cat":"photographers","en":"Bill Henson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-henson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-henson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","muted-rust"],"intro":"Bill Henson is an Australian contemporary photographer known for his evocative and often controversial work that explores themes of adolescence, identity, and the human condition. His photographs are characterized by their moody atmospheres, dramatic lighting, and painterly qualities, often blurring the lines between reality and dreamlike states.","observation":"The style is a realistic, highly detailed portrait treatment built around intimate close-ups, natural skin texture, loose hair, and direct or slightly averted gazes. Subdued warm tones and deep shadows create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while shallow focus and heavy cropping keep attention on the face."},{"id":"benoit-paille","name":"Benoit Paille","cat":"photographers","en":"Benoit Paille","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/benoit-paille.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/benoit-paille","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","dark-olive","muted-blue","charcoal","dark-rust"],"intro":"Benoit Paille is a contemporary photographer known for his unique approach to capturing landscapes and human emotions. His work often explores themes of isolation and introspection, using light and color to create atmospheric and evocative imagery.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, using subdued blue-green and brown palettes, deep shadows, selective warm lights, and strong atmospheric contrast. Mist, rain-darkened foliage, storm clouds, snow, and isolated human-scale details create a bleak, dreamlike rural mood across the forest and countryside scenes."},{"id":"beth-moon","name":"Beth Moon","cat":"photographers","en":"Beth Moon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/beth-moon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/beth-moon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","brown","black","silver"],"intro":"Beth Moon is a contemporary photographer known for her captivating images of ancient trees and landscapes. Her work often explores themes of time, nature, and the cosmos, capturing the beauty and mystery of the natural world in a timeless manner. Moon's photography has been exhibited internationally and is celebrated for its unique blend of realism and surrealism.","observation":"The style presents monumental baobabs and dry savanna landscapes in a highly realistic, photographic manner, with dramatic framing and strongly modeled bark and branches. A monochrome tonal range, deep shadows, bright moons, and atmospheric distance create a moody, cinematic sense of age and isolation across all four views."},{"id":"johanna-gullichsen","name":"Johanna Gullichsen","cat":"designers","en":"Johanna Gullichsen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johanna-gullichsen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johanna-gullichsen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["deep-red","bone-white","beige","black","red","grey"],"intro":"Johanna Gullichsen is a Finnish textile designer known for her innovative and contemporary approach to traditional weaving techniques. Her work often draws inspiration from Scandinavian design principles, emphasizing simplicity, functionality, and beauty.","observation":"The style presents densely arranged woven textile patterns built from geometric blocks, stripes, checks, and varied thread structures. Strong red, black, cream, and orange contrasts combine with clean graphic divisions, while raised yarn and visible weave give the surfaces a tactile, dimensional quality."},{"id":"yinka-ilori","name":"Yinka Ilori","cat":"designers","en":"Yinka Ilori","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yinka-ilori.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yinka-ilori","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["pink","teal","dark-blue","brown","red","ochre"],"intro":"Yinka Ilori is a British-Nigerian designer known for his vibrant and colorful work that often draws on his African heritage. He is recognized for his innovative use of color and pattern, creating pieces that blend traditional African aesthetics with contemporary design elements. His work spans various disciplines, including furniture design, architecture, and public art installations.","observation":"Across all four renders, boldly patterned portraits and fashion tableaux are built from saturated color blocks, graphic stripes, checks, spots, and sculptural garments. Visible brush texture softens the clean geometric shapes, while strong outlines, frontal poses, and oversized accessories give the scenes an assertive editorial character."},{"id":"maria-sibylla-merian","name":"Maria Sibylla Merian","cat":"illustrators","en":"Maria Sibylla Merian","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maria-sibylla-merian.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maria-sibylla-merian","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["cream","muted-orange","dark-olive","muted-ochre","red","grey"],"intro":"Maria Sibylla Merian was a pioneering naturalist and scientific illustrator from the 17th century, known for her detailed studies of insects and plants. Born in Germany, she later moved to the Netherlands, where she conducted extensive research on the life cycles of butterflies. Her work was groundbreaking in its combination of art and science, providing valuable insights into the natural world.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed botanical and insect studies with delicate fine-line drawing and visible painted modeling. Rich flowers, leaves, and wing patterns are arranged decoratively on a warm cream ground, producing an ornate, vivid, classical natural-history plate appearance."},{"id":"william-timlin","name":"William Timlin","cat":"illustrators","en":"William Timlin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-timlin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-timlin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","ochre","bone-white","red"],"intro":"William Timlin was an English artist and writer, known for his enchanting illustrations and architectural designs. Born in 1892, Timlin gained recognition for his work in the early 20th century, particularly with his book \"The Ship That Sailed to Mars,\" which showcased his unique blend of fantasy and detailed artistry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines finely worked, visibly painted surfaces with intricate linework, dense natural detail, and subdued woodland colors punctuated by warm reds and amber light. It presents dreamy fantasy scenes of elegant figures in richly textured garments set among castles, cliffs, rivers, and tangled forests, with a romantic, slightly melancholy atmosphere."},{"id":"paresh-nath","name":"Paresh Nath","cat":"illustrators","en":"Paresh Nath","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paresh-nath.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paresh-nath","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","ink"],"colours":["light-orange","grey","vivid-red","brown","dark-rust","blue"],"intro":"Paresh Nath is an Indian cartoonist and illustrator known for his satirical and humorous take on social and political issues. His work often features exaggerated characters and caricatures, capturing the essence of Indian society with a sharp wit and keen observation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses bold ink contours, flat yet strongly contrasted color blocks, and expressive caricature-like faces and gestures. The densely arranged domestic scenes combine comic-panel clarity with numerous small props, angular hatching, and vivid warm-versus-cool palettes."},{"id":"doug-chinnery","name":"Doug Chinnery","cat":"photographers","en":"Doug Chinnery","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/doug-chinnery.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/doug-chinnery","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","mist","motion","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","silver","white"],"intro":"Doug Chinnery is a contemporary British photographer known for his innovative approaches to landscape photography. His work often explores the boundaries of traditional photography through techniques like intentional camera movement and multiple exposures. Chinnery's images are celebrated for their painterly qualities and ability to evoke emotion through subtle manipulation of light and color.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is realistic and cinematic, using subdued blue-grey tones, strong light-dark separation, and brooding coastal weather. Long-exposure water, softened surf, misty distance, and carefully balanced horizons create a quiet but dramatic landscape mood, often reinforced by strong symmetry or receding lines."},{"id":"zemer-peled","name":"Zemer Peled","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Zemer Peled","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zemer-peled.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zemer-peled","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","floral","patterns","still-life","flat-color","subdued-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["white","silver","beige","dark-blue","muted-blue","blue"],"intro":"Zemer Peled is an Israeli sculptor known for her intricate ceramic works that explore the beauty and brutality of the natural world. Her pieces often feature sharp, delicate forms that are both inviting and intimidating, reflecting the duality of nature.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed floral forms as radial, sculptural arrangements built from hundreds of pointed, layered florets. Restrained blue, ivory, and warm cream tones, soft studio lighting, concentric symmetry, and close cropping give the images a decorative, pattern-like presence."},{"id":"gary-petersen","name":"Gary Petersen","cat":"painters","en":"Gary Petersen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gary-petersen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gary-petersen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","illustrative","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["pale-orange","vivid-orange","light-cyan","orange","violet","charcoal","light-pink"],"intro":"Gary Petersen is an American artist known for his vibrant and geometric abstract paintings. His work often explores the interplay of color and form, creating dynamic compositions that engage the viewer with their boldness and complexity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense abstract compositions built from interlocking arcs, rectangles, stripes, and looping geometric bands. Strong outlines, clean flat color fields, and vivid yet varied pastel-and-saturated hues create a graphic, layered, highly decorative effect."},{"id":"kawanabe-kyosai","name":"Kawanabe Kyosai","cat":"printmakers","en":"Kawanabe Kyosai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kawanabe-kyosai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kawanabe-kyosai","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","drawing","ink"],"colours":["pale-orange","grey","beige","charcoal","red","rust"],"intro":"Kawanabe Kyosai was a renowned Japanese artist and printmaker of the late Edo and early Meiji periods, known for his dynamic and often satirical works. His art often depicted scenes from Japanese folklore, mythology, and everyday life, characterized by bold lines, vibrant colors, and expressive characters.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense ink drawing and visible brushwork with expressive, mythic figures, animals, flames, waves, and mountainous settings. Restrained blue-green, beige, black, and red tones sit on a textured paper ground, while fine contour lines, calligraphic marks, and strong dark-light contrasts give the scenes an intricate classical print-like character."},{"id":"jack-hughes","name":"Jack Hughes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jack Hughes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-hughes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-hughes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","red","black","muted-cyan","muted-teal","muted-rust"],"intro":"Jack Hughes is a contemporary illustrator known for his distinctive style that blends modern and retro aesthetics. His work often features elegant and stylized portraits, drawing inspiration from mid-20th century fashion and culture. Hughes's illustrations are characterized by clean lines, smooth gradients, and a vivid color palette, often evoking a sense of nostalgia and cinematic glamour.","observation":"The style combines graphic editorial illustration with visible painterly strokes, simplified angular modeling, and strongly contrasting teal, coral, orange, black, and white blocks. Glamorous fashion portraits and posed figures are framed with generous flat negative space, dramatic cropping, oversized accessories, and a polished retro-magazine sensibility."},{"id":"bess-hamiti","name":"Bess Hamiti","cat":"photographers","en":"Bess Hamiti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bess-hamiti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bess-hamiti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-cyan","black","dark-red","orange","pale-orange"],"intro":"Bess Hamiti is a photographer known for his evocative landscape imagery that often blends elements of surrealism and fantasy. His work is characterized by a dreamlike quality, capturing the ethereal beauty of nature with a focus on mood and atmosphere.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic landscape imagery with vast negative space, tiny solitary figures, and dramatically oversized celestial forms. Deep teal skies and shadows contrast with saturated orange light, glowing moons, reflective water, and softly atmospheric clouds, giving the scenes a dreamy surreal quality."},{"id":"anna-silivonchik","name":"Anna Silivonchik","cat":"painters","en":"Anna Silivonchik","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anna-silivonchik.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anna-silivonchik","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["vivid-red","bone-white","ochre","dark-brown","grey","charcoal","blue"],"intro":"Anna Silivonchik is a contemporary artist known for her whimsical and fantastical style, often drawing inspiration from folklore and fairy tales. Her work is characterized by vibrant colors, intricate details, and a playful, imaginative atmosphere that captures the viewer's attention.","observation":"Across all four renders, softly idealized female portraits are interwoven with cats, birds, fruit, foliage, patterned garments, and architectural fragments in dense decorative compositions. Saturated reds, oranges, blues, and greens sit on visibly textured, layered paint surfaces, with delicate contour lines and intricate ornamental marks giving the images a handcrafted storybook quality."},{"id":"r-k-laxman","name":"R. K. Laxman","cat":"illustrators","en":"R. K. Laxman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/r-k-laxman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/r-k-laxman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","comics","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","grey","pale-orange","silver","black"],"intro":"R. K. Laxman is a renowned Indian cartoonist, best known for his creation \"The Common Man,\" a character that has become an iconic representation of the average Indian. His work, primarily featured in the Times of India, provided satirical commentary on Indian politics and society, capturing the essence of everyday life with humor and insight.","observation":"The style uses monochrome ink illustration with emphatic contour lines, loose crosshatching, and selectively dense texture to describe expressive people, interiors, and streets. It consistently reads as vintage newspaper cartooning: humorous observational scenes are arranged in panel-like compositions with simplified forms, lively gestures, and strong graphic contrast."},{"id":"george-perez","name":"George Perez","cat":"illustrators","en":"George Perez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-perez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-perez","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","sci-fi","fantasy","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-ochre","dark-red","dark-blue","red","orange"],"intro":"George Perez is a renowned comic book artist known for his work on major superhero titles, including \"The Avengers,\" \"Wonder Woman,\" and \"Crisis on Infinite Earths.\" His intricate and dynamic illustrations have made a significant impact on the comic book industry, earning him a reputation for detailed and vibrant storytelling.","observation":"A densely packed comic-book collage combines countless costumed characters, close-up faces, action poses, and overlapping fragments into a highly elaborate surface. Thick black contour lines, flat saturated color blocks, expressive anatomy, and selective hatching give the imagery a vivid, graphic-print appearance."},{"id":"lieke-van-der-vorst","name":"Lieke Van der Vorst","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lieke Van der Vorst","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lieke-van-der-vorst.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lieke-van-der-vorst","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["silver","beige","dark-red","brown","dark-olive"],"intro":"Lieke Van der Vorst is a contemporary illustrator known for her whimsical and detailed artwork that often features elements of nature and fantasy. Her work is characterized by a delicate and imaginative style that blends fine line work with soft, pastel color palettes.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, visibly brushed portraiture with expressive faces, elaborate floral adornment, and theatrical clothing. Saturated reds and greens stand out against recurring pale blue grounds, while delicate hair, fabric, petals, and botanical textures create a refined yet imaginative illustrative finish."},{"id":"stjepan-sejic","name":"Stjepan Sejic","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stjepan Sejic","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stjepan-sejic.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stjepan-sejic","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","muted-rust","brown","bone-white","grey","dark-rust"],"intro":"Stjepan Sejic is a Croatian comic book artist and writer known for his work on titles such as \"Witchblade\" and \"Sunstone.\" His style is characterized by a blend of digital painting and traditional comic art techniques, often featuring detailed character designs and expressive storytelling.","observation":"Across the sheet, close-up female characters are rendered with visibly layered brushwork, energetic fine linework, and loose sketch marks that give hair, fabric, and armor a tactile, hand-worked surface. Strongly contrasted dark clothing and shadows are balanced by warm skin and hair tones, creating an intense, moody fantasy portrait style."},{"id":"vincent-peters","name":"Vincent Peters","cat":"photographers","en":"Vincent Peters","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vincent-peters.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vincent-peters","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Vincent Peters is a renowned German photographer known for his evocative and cinematic portraits. His work often features high-profile celebrities and models, capturing them in intimate and dramatic settings. Peters's photography is characterized by its use of black and white, high contrast, and a focus on emotional depth, often drawing comparisons to classic Hollywood glamour.","observation":"The style is highly realistic monochrome portrait photography, combining crisp facial and fabric detail with stark highlights, deep shadows, and selective focus. Intimate poses, train interiors, reflections, and blurred lights create a moody, cinematic editorial atmosphere across all four images."},{"id":"wendy-vecchi","name":"Wendy Vecchi","cat":"designers","en":"Wendy Vecchi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wendy-vecchi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wendy-vecchi","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","collage","drawing"],"colours":["silver","charcoal","light-orange","brown","grey","red"],"intro":"Wendy Vecchi is a contemporary artist and designer known for her work in mixed media and crafting. Her style often incorporates elements of nature, vintage aesthetics, and intricate detailing, appealing to those interested in art journaling and scrapbooking. Vecchi's designs are celebrated for their imaginative and whimsical qualities, often featuring floral motifs and vivid colors.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines intimate, wide-eyed portrait figures and animal companions with dense, tactile mixed-media surfaces. Fine dark outlines, visible brush and paper texture, layered fabric-like collage elements, and muted yet punctuated colors create an expressive storybook-fantasy appearance."},{"id":"itzchak-tarkay","name":"Itzchak Tarkay","cat":"painters","en":"Itzchak Tarkay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/itzchak-tarkay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/itzchak-tarkay","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["vivid-red","muted-orange","muted-teal","black","dark-violet","orange","pink"],"intro":"Itzchak Tarkay was an Israeli painter known for his vibrant and expressive depictions of women in intimate settings. His work often features bold colors, fluid lines, and a unique blend of figurative and modernist styles, drawing inspiration from post-impressionism and fauvism.","observation":"Across all four panels, elegant female figures and fashionable clothing are rendered with strong black contours, simplified angular forms, and broad areas of saturated red, teal, blue, orange, and purple. Painterly surface texture sits beneath the graphic flat-color construction, while flowers, hats, cups, instruments, and architectural accents create a richly decorative retro tableau."},{"id":"conrad-roset","name":"Conrad Roset","cat":"illustrators","en":"Conrad Roset","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/conrad-roset.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/conrad-roset","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","pale-green","black","beige","muted-cyan","red"],"intro":"Conrad Roset is a contemporary Spanish artist known for his delicate and evocative illustrations, often exploring themes of femininity and nature. His work is characterized by a blend of traditional and digital techniques, creating a unique and modern aesthetic.","observation":"Across all four portraits, delicate drawn contours and loose, visibly painted marks combine realistic facial features with expressive abstraction. Saturated coral, turquoise, blue, and black create a vivid graphic palette, while flowers, splatters, drips, and overlaid blocks partially obscure the faces and add a surreal, collage-like tension."},{"id":"anato-finnstark","name":"Anato Finnstark","cat":"illustrators","en":"Anato Finnstark","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anato-finnstark.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anato-finnstark","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","muted-ochre","charcoal","grey","red"],"intro":"Anato Finnstark is a contemporary digital artist known for his evocative and fantastical illustrations that blend elements of surrealism and dark fantasy. His work often explores mythical themes and cosmic landscapes, creating immersive worlds that captivate the imagination.","observation":"Across all four images, visible brushwork, softened edges, and layered texture create a painterly, expressive storybook atmosphere. Dark blue, brown, and rust tones dominate, with stark pale figures and localized fiery light producing dramatic contrast, while recurring characters, birds, forests, and monumental settings give the style a surreal dark-fantasy character."},{"id":"arthur-john-elsley","name":"Arthur John Elsley","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur John Elsley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-john-elsley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-john-elsley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","beige","dark-ochre","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Arthur John Elsley is a renowned English painter known for his charming depictions of children and domestic scenes during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His works often capture the innocence and joy of childhood, set against idyllic and intimate backdrops. Elsley’s paintings are characterized by their detailed realism, soft color palettes, and a warm, nostalgic atmosphere that reflects the Victorian era’s sentimentality.","observation":"The style is richly painterly, with clearly visible broad strokes, layered fabric, fur, foliage, and softly modelled faces. Warm subdued colours, deep brown shadows, ornate domestic settings, and expressive group interactions create a nostalgic classical tableau-like atmosphere across the images."},{"id":"catrin-welz-stein","name":"Catrin Welz-Stein","cat":"various-artists","en":"Catrin Welz-Stein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/catrin-welz-stein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/catrin-welz-stein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","animals","fashion","portraits","painterly","pastel-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-teal","pale-lime","olive","beige","black","dark-olive","deep-red"],"intro":"Catrin Welz-Stein is a contemporary artist known for her unique digital collages that blend surrealism with fantasy elements. Her work often features dreamlike scenes that combine human figures with nature and whimsical motifs, creating a distinctive and imaginative visual style.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, painterly portraiture with carefully staged historical-looking costumes, lace, feathers, floral fabrics, and birds. Muted blue-green and cream hues, visible surface texture, and dreamlike distortions such as oversized hats and floating figures create an ornate surreal tableau."},{"id":"richard-meier","name":"Richard Meier","cat":"architects","en":"Richard Meier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-meier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-meier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","urban","high-contrast","light-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","silver","brown","muted-blue","light-blue","blue"],"intro":"Richard Meier is a renowned American architect known for his modernist designs characterized by geometric forms and extensive use of white. He gained prominence with projects like the Getty Center in Los Angeles and the High Museum of Art in Atlanta, which showcase his signature style emphasizing light and space.","observation":"The style is polished, realistic architectural photography with crisp geometry, abundant glass, white tiled surfaces, curved forms, and carefully composed symmetrical viewpoints. Bright coastal daylight creates clean shadows and strong contrast while emphasizing spacious atriums, monumental stairs, ocean views, and reflective surfaces."},{"id":"mark-riddick","name":"Mark Riddick","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mark Riddick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-riddick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-riddick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","landscapes","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","light-orange"],"intro":"Mark Riddick is a renowned illustrator known for his intricate and dark artwork, often associated with the metal music scene. His work is characterized by detailed line work and a macabre aesthetic, frequently featuring themes of death and the supernatural.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense monochrome fantasy illustration with fine engraved linework, intricate textures, and stark black-and-white contrast. Gothic figures, skulls, ravens, moons, barren landscapes, and monumental supernatural settings create a dark, epic visual language with heavily ornamented surfaces."},{"id":"yvonne-coomber","name":"Yvonne Coomber","cat":"painters","en":"Yvonne Coomber","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yvonne-coomber.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yvonne-coomber","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["olive","bone-white","light-blue","yellow","orange","pink"],"intro":"Yvonne Coomber is a contemporary British artist known for her vibrant and expressive floral paintings. Her work often draws inspiration from the natural beauty of the English countryside, capturing the essence of wildflower meadows and sunlit fields with a joyful and romantic flair.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely packed wildflowers and tall grasses are built from visible, delicate paint marks, with splattered pigment extending into softly blended skies. Saturated pinks, blues, oranges, and yellows create a luminous, cheerful meadow style, while atmospheric haze and glowing light give the scenes a dreamy depth."},{"id":"stephen-shore","name":"Stephen Shore","cat":"photographers","en":"Stephen Shore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-shore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-shore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["muted-cyan","dark-ochre","beige","ochre","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Stephen Shore is an American photographer known for his pioneering work in color photography. He gained prominence in the 1970s with his series \"Uncommon Places,\" which captured the mundane and overlooked aspects of American life. Shore's work is characterized by its attention to detail, use of color, and exploration of everyday scenes, contributing significantly to the acceptance of color photography in the art world.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is grounded in realistic, filmic roadside photography with warm subdued colors, strong sunlight, and a gently aged grain. Wide compositions pair sparse desert towns, vintage cars, utility lines, and distant mountains, creating a nostalgic mid-century roadside atmosphere."},{"id":"hugh-kretschmer","name":"Hugh Kretschmer","cat":"photographers","en":"Hugh Kretschmer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hugh-kretschmer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hugh-kretschmer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-brown","grey","black","dark-green","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Hugh Kretschmer is an American photographer known for his surreal and imaginative imagery that often blends elements of fantasy with reality. His work is characterized by a unique approach to storytelling, using visual metaphors and whimsical compositions to create thought-provoking and visually striking pieces.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely detailed studio tableaux with restrained olive, brown, cream, and green palettes, sculptural props, period-inspired furnishings, and carefully posed figures. Cinematic lighting and controlled compositions give the scenes a moody, dreamlike surrealism, especially through oversized lamps, clouds, trees, paper forms, and umbrellas used as uncanny fashion or architectural elements."},{"id":"koson-ohara","name":"Koson Ohara","cat":"painters","en":"Koson Ohara","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/koson-ohara.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/koson-ohara","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious","drawing","ink"],"colours":["pale-orange","brown","charcoal","ochre","grey","beige","red"],"intro":"Koson Ohara was a prominent Japanese artist known for his exquisite woodblock prints, particularly focusing on birds and flowers. He was part of the shin-hanga movement, which revitalized traditional ukiyo-e techniques with a modern twist, emphasizing natural beauty and intricate details.","observation":"The style combines finely observed birds and vegetation with visible ink lines, delicate brushwork, and softly washed color on a warm paper ground. Restrained earth, blue-gray, black, and vermilion accents, along with spare asymmetrical compositions, evoke traditional East Asian bird-and-flower scroll imagery."},{"id":"giorgio-de-chirico","name":"Giorgio de Chirico","cat":"painters","en":"Giorgio de Chirico","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giorgio-de-chirico.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giorgio-de-chirico","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["muted-cyan","black","brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Giorgio de Chirico was an Italian artist known for his metaphysical painting style that laid the groundwork for the Surrealist movement. Born in 1888, de Chirico's work often features enigmatic cityscapes, classical architecture, and dreamlike atmospheres, blending elements of the real and the imagined to evoke a sense of mystery and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines strongly geometric Mediterranean architecture with painterly, visibly textured surfaces and sharply simplified color planes. Saturated reds, ochres, deep blues, and dark openings create high-contrast, dreamlike scenes populated by small solitary figures, monumental clouds, arches, stairways, and seascapes."},{"id":"jody-bergsma","name":"Jody Bergsma","cat":"painters","en":"Jody Bergsma","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jody-bergsma.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jody-bergsma","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","brown","rust","dark-red"],"intro":"Jody Bergsma is an American artist known for her enchanting watercolor and ink illustrations that often feature mythical creatures and nature themes. Her work is characterized by a whimsical and ethereal quality, blending fantasy with elements of the natural world. Bergsma's art is celebrated for its intricate detailing and soft, pastel color palettes, creating a sense of tranquility and wonder.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with fine contour lines, densely layering fur, feathers, hair, leaves, and petals into ornate close-up portraits. A subdued cream, rust, sage, and blue-gray palette gives the animal and human subjects a romantic, fantastical, slightly surreal character."},{"id":"vincent-callebaut","name":"Vincent Callebaut","cat":"architects","en":"Vincent Callebaut","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vincent-callebaut.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vincent-callebaut","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-olive","beige","muted-blue","grey","silver"],"intro":"Vincent Callebaut is a visionary architect known for his innovative approach to sustainable and futuristic architecture. His designs often incorporate elements of biomimicry and eco-friendly technologies, aiming to create harmonious urban environments that integrate nature and technology.","observation":"This style presents an expansive futuristic waterfront city through highly realistic, cinematic views, combining monumental curved architecture, glass towers, elevated bridges, and dense tropical planting. Bright daylight, saturated greens and blues, and carefully rendered structural detail give the speculative forms a polished, sculptural presence across both intimate architectural views and sweeping aerial vistas."},{"id":"ralph-horsley","name":"Ralph Horsley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ralph Horsley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ralph-horsley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ralph-horsley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","rust","beige","light-orange","orange"],"intro":"Ralph Horsley is a renowned British illustrator known for his work in the fantasy genre, particularly in role-playing games and card games. His art is celebrated for its intricate detail and vivid storytelling, capturing the imagination of audiences worldwide.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly textured, directional paint strokes and richly modelled surfaces, combining broad energetic marks with finer strokes for faces, creatures, clothing, and architectural detail. Saturated reds, oranges, blues, and deep shadows create highly contrasted, theatrical fantasy scenes filled with active characters, animals, and dense narrative details."},{"id":"osamu-tezuka","name":"Osamu Tezuka","cat":"illustrators","en":"Osamu Tezuka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/osamu-tezuka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/osamu-tezuka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","pale-orange","dark-olive","silver","olive","muted-blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Osamu Tezuka is often referred to as the \"God of Manga\" and is a pivotal figure in the development of Japanese comics and animation. He was a prolific creator whose work laid the foundation for modern manga and anime, influencing countless artists and storytellers. His storytelling and artistic innovations have left a lasting impact on the industry, making him a celebrated icon in both Japan and around the world.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses tightly cropped character portraits with oversized expressive eyes, simplified facial forms, and decorative floral or patterned surroundings. Clean illustrative color areas combine with visible fine ink lines, crosshatching, and lightly textured paper, shifting between vivid color and graphic black-and-white treatments while retaining a nostalgic fashion-illustration feel."},{"id":"duy-huynh","name":"Duy Huynh","cat":"painters","en":"Duy Huynh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/duy-huynh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/duy-huynh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-green","charcoal","muted-green","muted-cyan","dark-brown","orange","rust"],"intro":"Duy Huynh is a contemporary artist known for his whimsical and surreal paintings that often explore themes of introspection and imagination. His work frequently features dreamlike scenarios with delicate, ethereal figures and glowing elements that evoke a sense of tranquility and wonder.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, softly textured brushwork and fine painted detail to build dreamlike scenes around solitary figures, oversized flowers, birds, and butterflies. A dark teal, green, and blue ground with muted orange and cream accents creates a melancholic atmosphere, while strange scale relationships and suspended natural elements give the compositions a surreal, storybook quality."},{"id":"fernand-khnopff","name":"Fernand Khnopff","cat":"painters","en":"Fernand Khnopff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fernand-khnopff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fernand-khnopff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","muted-ochre","pale-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Fernand Khnopff was a Belgian symbolist painter known for his enigmatic and dreamlike works. His art often explores themes of introspection and fantasy, characterized by meticulous detail and a soft, muted color palette. Khnopff's style is marked by its ethereal quality and a focus on the inner world of his subjects, often depicted in serene and contemplative poses.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and realistic, with visible fine brushwork, tactile fabric, and densely rendered interior details. Restrained brown, cream, and charcoal tones create a moody atmosphere, while strong window and lamplight produce dramatic contrast around poised female figures in formal interiors."},{"id":"peter-gric","name":"Peter Gric","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Gric","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-gric.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-gric","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy","epic","geometric"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Peter Gric is a contemporary painter and digital artist known for his intricate and surreal compositions that often explore themes of technology and the human form. His work is characterized by a fusion of organic and mechanical elements, creating a unique visual language that reflects on the future of humanity and its relationship with technology.","observation":"The style presents monumental, dreamlike architectural environments built from dense carved stone, recursive arches, vaults, and colossal sculptural forms. Strong perspective, dramatic shafts of light, warm earthy surfaces, and tiny human figures create an epic cinematic sense of scale across all four renders."},{"id":"miles-redd","name":"Miles Redd","cat":"designers","en":"Miles Redd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/miles-redd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/miles-redd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","patterns","still-life","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-green","grey","silver","dark-brown","rust","dark-olive","dark-red"],"intro":"Miles Redd is a renowned American interior designer known for his bold and eclectic style. He is celebrated for his ability to blend classical elements with modern sensibilities, creating spaces that are both luxurious and whimsical. Redd's work often features vibrant colors, rich textures, and a playful mix of patterns, making him a distinctive figure in the world of interior design.","observation":"The style presents richly layered interiors packed with ornate furniture, patterned fabrics, floral wall coverings, porcelain, mirrors, and decorative molding. Deep teal and green hues are accented by red, blue, cream, and metallic details, while painterly texture and softly irregular edges give the highly composed rooms an illustrated, hand-rendered character."},{"id":"caroll-spinney","name":"Caroll Spinney","cat":"various-artists","en":"Caroll Spinney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/caroll-spinney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/caroll-spinney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","cinematic","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-ochre","ochre","muted-cyan","yellow","rust"],"intro":"Caroll Spinney was an American puppeteer and cartoonist, best known for his portrayal of Big Bird and Oscar the Grouch on the children's television show \"Sesame Street.\" His work has left a lasting impact on children's entertainment, blending education with creativity and humor.","observation":"The style combines cinematic, realistic portrait staging with richly visible painterly brushwork and dense feather and fur textures. Saturated primary colors, expressive puppet faces, warm interior lighting, and occasional clean blue backdrops give the scenes a whimsical, theatrical fantasy character."},{"id":"norman-lindsay","name":"Norman Lindsay","cat":"painters","en":"Norman Lindsay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norman-lindsay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norman-lindsay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","erotic","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","pale-orange","beige","red"],"intro":"Norman Lindsay was an Australian artist, sculptor, and writer known for his imaginative and often controversial works. He was born in 1879 and became one of Australia's most celebrated artists, recognized for his paintings, etchings, and illustrations that frequently explored themes of mythology, fantasy, and sensuality.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines expressive portraiture with visibly worked paint and ink-like linework. Dark, moody tonal arrangements, dramatic facial shadows, intimate poses, and richly textured garments create a theatrical vintage-glamour atmosphere."},{"id":"david-adjaye","name":"David Adjaye","cat":"architects","en":"David Adjaye","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-adjaye.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-adjaye","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","brown","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"David Adjaye is a renowned British-Ghanaian architect known for his innovative and culturally resonant designs. He has worked on a variety of projects worldwide, including the National Museum of African American History and Culture in Washington, D.C. His architectural style often blends modernist principles with a deep understanding of cultural context, resulting in structures that are both functional and aesthetically striking.","observation":"The style presents monumental architectural forms with sharply angular geometry, heavy textured facades, deep recesses, and strongly sculptural massing. Photorealistic cinematic lighting combines subdued, moody surroundings with warm interior glow, reflective wet surfaces, landscaped greenery, and occasional atmospheric haze."},{"id":"mordecai-ardon","name":"Mordecai Ardon","cat":"painters","en":"Mordecai Ardon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mordecai-ardon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mordecai-ardon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","blue","ochre","red","orange"],"intro":"Mordecai Ardon is a renowned Israeli painter known for his abstract and symbolic works that often incorporate Jewish mysticism and historical themes. Born in Poland in 1896, Ardon studied at the Bauhaus and later moved to Jerusalem, where he became a significant figure in Israeli art. His paintings are characterized by their rich textures, vibrant colors, and complex symbolism, often reflecting his deep spiritual and cultural heritage.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable landscapes and creatures are built from heavily textured, visibly worked paint, with broad scraped marks and layered surfaces. The style combines saturated orange, red, teal, and blue with deep shadow, stark silhouettes, glowing circular moons, and simplified surreal forms."},{"id":"enoch-bolles","name":"Enoch Bolles","cat":"illustrators","en":"Enoch Bolles","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/enoch-bolles.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/enoch-bolles","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","painterly","vivid-colors","erotic","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","orange","vivid-red","dark-brown","muted-orange","charcoal"],"intro":"Enoch Bolles is an American illustrator known for his work in the early to mid-20th century, particularly for his pin-up art that graced the covers of magazines. His illustrations often featured glamorous and alluring women, capturing the essence of the era's fashion and beauty ideals.","observation":"The style combines visibly brushed, softly modelled painting with polished illustrative glamour: expressive faces, rosy skin, curled hair, and carefully rendered clothing dominate the compositions. Saturated reds, corals, creams, and greens create a warm vintage presentation, while cropped poses and fashion-focused styling give the portraits a theatrical, sensual character."},{"id":"peter-lindbergh","name":"Peter Lindbergh","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Lindbergh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-lindbergh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-lindbergh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","fashion","portraits","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["black","grey","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Peter Lindbergh is a renowned German photographer known for his influential work in fashion photography. He gained prominence in the late 20th century for his cinematic and realistic style, often capturing supermodels in natural and emotive settings. His work is characterized by a preference for black and white imagery, focusing on the raw beauty and individuality of his subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is stark monochrome editorial photography built around severe portraits, sculptural dark clothing, and urban architecture. Strong tonal separation, selective focus, cropped framing, and wind-tossed fabric create a cinematic, austere fashion mood."},{"id":"janet-echelman","name":"Janet Echelman","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Janet Echelman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/janet-echelman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/janet-echelman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","glow","motion","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","red","pink","dark-blue","deep-red"],"intro":"Janet Echelman is an American sculptor known for her innovative use of netting and fiber art to create large-scale, site-specific installations that interact with urban environments. Her work often explores the intersection of art and technology, utilizing materials that respond to environmental forces such as wind and light.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic urban photography as a stage for enormous translucent fabric forms suspended among skyscrapers. Saturated orange, coral, pink, and violet illumination makes the mesh glow, while sweeping folds and low-angle compositions create a dramatic sense of motion and surreal scale."},{"id":"adam-zyglis","name":"Adam Zyglis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Adam Zyglis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adam-zyglis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adam-zyglis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-olive","bone-white","beige","muted-brown"],"intro":"Adam Zyglis is a Pulitzer Prize-winning editorial cartoonist known for his insightful and often satirical illustrations. His work is recognized for its sharp wit and keen observations on political and social issues, often presented in a straightforward yet impactful style.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, visibly textured painting with fine drawn contours, earthy subdued colors, and expressive grotesque characters. Across portraits, workshop interiors, chaotic crowds, and monumental outdoor action, it favors dense fantasy world-building, weathered surfaces, exaggerated anatomy, and surreal comic drama."},{"id":"charles-andre-van-loo","name":"Charles-Andre van Loo","cat":"painters","en":"Charles-Andre van Loo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-andre-van-loo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-andre-van-loo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","grey","deep-rust","rust"],"intro":"Charles-Andre van Loo was an influential French painter of the 18th century, known for his contributions to the Rococo and Neoclassical styles. He was celebrated for his historical and mythological scenes, often commissioned by European royalty and nobility. His works are characterized by their elegance, detailed compositions, and harmonious color palettes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible brushwork, dense surface detail, and carefully modelled figures in ornate interiors or theatrical outdoor settings. Dark olive-brown shadows contrast with luminous skin, pale fabrics, and saturated blue, coral, and red garments, while elaborate costumes, gilded furnishings, dramatic gestures, and grand staging create a formal, expressive historical tableau."},{"id":"speedy-graphito","name":"Speedy Graphito","cat":"street-artists","en":"Speedy Graphito","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/speedy-graphito.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/speedy-graphito","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","comics","collage","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","blue","silver","red","yellow"],"intro":"Speedy Graphito is a French street artist known for his vibrant and eclectic style that blends elements of pop culture, graffiti, and surrealism. Emerging in the 1980s, he became a prominent figure in the post-graffiti movement, creating works that challenge consumer culture and mass media through bold and playful imagery.","observation":"The style combines densely layered graffiti and comic-book imagery with vivid primary colors, heavy black outlines, flat graphic shapes, and clearly visible paint texture. Repeated cartoon faces, symbols, tags, and overlapping motifs create a crowded, energetic collage-like surface across the entire sheet."},{"id":"masaccio","name":"Masaccio","cat":"painters","en":"Masaccio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/masaccio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/masaccio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","dark-red","black","muted-orange","brown","dark-blue"],"intro":"Masaccio was an influential Italian painter of the early Renaissance , known for his pioneering use of perspective and chiaroscuro. Born in 1401, he played a crucial role in the development of naturalism in art, creating works that emphasized realistic human figures and spatial depth. His frescoes, particularly those in the Brancacci Chapel, are celebrated for their innovative approach to composition and light.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, realistic painted figures with carefully modelled faces, individualized expressions, and visible fine brushwork. Restrained reds, ochres, browns, blues, and greens unify crowded historical group compositions, while worn architectural surfaces and textured paint give the images an aged, material presence."},{"id":"paul-laffoley","name":"Paul Laffoley","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Laffoley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-laffoley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-laffoley","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","patterns","fine-lines","vivid-colors","religious","drawing","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","bone-white","red","black","orange","dark-blue","deep-blue"],"intro":"Paul Laffoley was an American artist and architect known for his visionary and esoteric works that often combined elements of science, architecture, and mysticism. Born in 1935, Laffoley's art is characterized by its intricate detail and complex symbolism, drawing on themes of cosmology and metaphysics. His work is often associated with the visionary art movement and is noted for its intellectual depth and technical precision.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines highly detailed, ornate symbolic compositions with strong geometric structure, radial symmetry, and vivid red, blue, gold, and black color. Fine drawn lines, clean illustrative shapes, framed panels, eyes, celestial motifs, and winged or human figures create a ceremonial, icon-like visual language."},{"id":"stephen-wiltshire","name":"Stephen Wiltshire","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stephen Wiltshire","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-wiltshire.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-wiltshire","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","realistic","landscapes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Stephen Wiltshire is a renowned British architectural artist known for his ability to draw detailed cityscapes from memory. Born in 1974, he gained fame for his intricate and accurate depictions of urban environments, often capturing the essence of cities with remarkable precision.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable London and New York landmarks are rendered as highly detailed monochrome architectural illustrations. Fine pen-like linework, crosshatched shading, strong tonal contrast, and precise geometric structures give the city scenes a dense engraved or technical-drawing character."},{"id":"michael-sweerts","name":"Michael Sweerts","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Sweerts","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-sweerts.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-sweerts","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Michael Sweerts was a Flemish Baroque painter known for his detailed and realistic portraits and genre scenes. Active during the 17th century, his works often depicted everyday life with a focus on human expression and emotion. Sweerts's paintings are characterized by their fine brushwork, use of chiaroscuro, and a muted color palette that captures the subtleties of light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, hand-painted surfaces with fine, controlled brushwork, strong chiaroscuro, and a restrained brown-and-cream palette punctuated by occasional red. It consistently presents expressive, closely framed figures in period clothing and intimate interior scenes, with deep shadows and warm localized light creating a classical, somber atmosphere."},{"id":"sabine-weiss","name":"Sabine Weiss","cat":"photographers","en":"Sabine Weiss","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sabine-weiss.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sabine-weiss","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Sabine Weiss is a renowned Swiss-French photographer known for her contributions to humanist photography. Her work primarily focuses on capturing the essence of everyday life and human emotions, often in urban settings. Weiss's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey deep emotion and narrative through simple yet powerful imagery.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses stark monochrome photography with deep shadows, blown highlights, and strongly backlit figures. Fog, grain, cobblestones, historic urban streets, and small moments of pedestrian movement create a dark, cinematic atmosphere with layered depth."},{"id":"jil-sander","name":"Jil Sander","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Jil Sander","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jil-sander.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jil-sander","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","silver","black","brown","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jil Sander is a renowned German fashion designer known for her minimalist aesthetic and understated elegance. She founded her own fashion house in 1968 and became famous for her clean lines, neutral color palettes, and luxurious fabrics. Sander's designs often emphasize simplicity and functionality, making her a significant figure in modern fashion.","observation":"The style presents fashion-editorial portraits and runway scenes with realistic, carefully rendered fabric, faces, and oversized tailoring. Restrained cream, rust, sage, charcoal, and black tones, spacious studio settings, and controlled directional light create a quiet but assertive mood, while monumental silhouettes and close crops give the images cinematic presence."},{"id":"alan-aldridge","name":"Alan Aldridge","cat":"designers","en":"Alan Aldridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-aldridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-aldridge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","red","dark-red","dark-blue","grey","yellow"],"intro":"Alan Aldridge is a renowned British artist and graphic designer, celebrated for his vibrant and imaginative work during the 1960s and 1970s. Known for his contributions to album covers and book illustrations, Aldridge's style is characterized by its psychedelic and fantastical elements, often blending surreal imagery with pop culture references. His work is a hallmark of the counterculture movement, capturing the spirit of an era defined by creativity and experimentation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines intensely saturated color with dense, highly elaborate imagery and forceful graphic outlines. Portraits and theatrical figures are layered with patterned clothing, flowers, eyes, creatures, and fantastical environmental details, producing a vivid surreal illustration rather than a naturalistic scene."},{"id":"francesco-francavilla","name":"Francesco Francavilla","cat":"illustrators","en":"Francesco Francavilla","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francesco-francavilla.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francesco-francavilla","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-brown","charcoal","dark-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Francesco Francavilla is an Italian comic book artist and writer known for his work on titles such as \"Detective Comics,\" \"Black Panther,\" and \"The Black Beetle.\" His distinctive style is characterized by bold lines, vivid colors, and a strong noir influence, often drawing inspiration from pulp fiction and classic horror.","observation":"A highly graphic comic-book style uses thick ink contours, angular hatching, flat color blocks, and rough directional marks to define cloaked figures and burning environments. Saturated orange-red fire contrasts sharply with near-black silhouettes and deep blue-black shadows, creating an expressive, ominous fantasy atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"hipgnosis","name":"Hipgnosis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hipgnosis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hipgnosis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hipgnosis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","blue","muted-rust","muted-cyan","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Hipgnosis was a British art design group known for creating iconic album covers for rock bands in the 1970s and 1980s. Founded by Storm Thorgerson and Aubrey Powell, Hipgnosis became renowned for their innovative and surreal designs, often incorporating photographic elements and experimental techniques to create memorable visual experiences.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, wide compositions to stage uncanny encounters between human figures, animals, architecture, and vast natural settings. Saturated reds, blues, and pinks are tempered by dark water and heavy shadows, while grain, dramatic skies, and impossible juxtapositions create a dreamlike surrealism."},{"id":"jean-baptiste-simeon-chardin","name":"Jean-Baptiste-Simeon Chardin","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Baptiste-Simeon Chardin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-baptiste-simeon-chardin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-baptiste-simeon-chardin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Jean-Baptiste-Simeon Chardin was an 18th-century French painter renowned for his still life and genre paintings. His works are celebrated for their exquisite detail, subtle use of color, and ability to capture the quiet beauty of everyday life. Chardin's paintings often depict domestic scenes and simple objects, reflecting the values and aesthetics of the Age of Enlightenment.","observation":"Across the four images, objects and figures are rendered with visible, finely controlled brushwork, tactile surfaces, and carefully observed material textures. A restrained brown, cream, black, and metallic palette is organized by dramatic light against deep backgrounds, giving the domestic still lifes and working figure a quiet, somber classical gravity."},{"id":"gillian-wearing","name":"Gillian Wearing","cat":"various-artists","en":"Gillian Wearing","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gillian-wearing.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gillian-wearing","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["silver","black","dark-red","muted-rust","light-blue"],"intro":"Gillian Wearing is a British contemporary artist known for her conceptual art and photography. Her work often explores themes of identity, self-perception, and the human experience, frequently using real people and their stories as subjects. Wearing's art challenges the boundaries between public and private, often incorporating elements of documentary and performance art.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely detailed portrait photography with natural skin texture, carefully rendered hair, clothing, and facial features. It combines restrained muted colors and soft studio lighting with intimate close cropping, while occasional ornate interiors and dark garments introduce a subdued, cinematic mood."},{"id":"alfred-dehodencq","name":"Alfred Dehodencq","cat":"painters","en":"Alfred Dehodencq","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-dehodencq.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-dehodencq","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["brown","black","orange","grey","red"],"intro":"Alfred Dehodencq is a 19th-century French painter known for his vivid and emotive depictions of historical and cultural scenes. His works often explore themes of romance, drama, and the exotic, drawing inspiration from his travels in Spain and North Africa. Dehodencq's paintings are characterized by their rich color palettes, dynamic compositions, and a keen attention to detail, reflecting the influence of Romanticism and Realism.","observation":"The style presents richly textured oil-paint scenes with visible fine brushwork, warm earthy color, strong light-dark modeling, and carefully rendered fabrics, architecture, and landscapes. Portraits and travel-like tableaux are framed as ornate museum paintings, combining dark interiors with sunlit North African settings and elaborate period clothing."},{"id":"bob-layzell","name":"Bob Layzell","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bob Layzell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-layzell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-layzell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","dark-blue","beige","rust","orange"],"intro":"Bob Layzell is a renowned illustrator known for his work in the science fiction genre, particularly during the 1970s and 1980s. His illustrations often feature intricate details and imaginative depictions of futuristic worlds, spacecraft, and alien landscapes. Layzell's work has been influential in shaping the visual language of science fiction art, contributing to various book covers and publications.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly brushed, richly textured paint with dense mechanical detail and dramatic film-like compositions. Saturated orange, teal, violet, and blue light create high-contrast extraterrestrial scenes populated by astronauts, colossal spacecraft, alien landscapes, and monumental orbital structures."},{"id":"marko-manev","name":"Marko Manev","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marko Manev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marko-manev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marko-manev","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["animals","characters","landscapes","backlighting","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","epic","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white"],"intro":"Marko Manev is a contemporary artist known for his work in graphic design and illustration. His art often explores themes of surrealism and fantasy, creating immersive and atmospheric visuals that captivate audiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark monochrome landscapes place tiny silhouetted figures against immense cliffs, skies, and glowing banks of mist. Extreme backlighting, deep blacks, scattered stars, and broad empty space create a dark, surreal, monumental atmosphere."},{"id":"howard-pyle","name":"Howard Pyle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Howard Pyle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howard-pyle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howard-pyle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","silver","light-yellow","deep-red"],"intro":"Howard Pyle is a renowned American illustrator and author, known for his contributions to the Golden Age of Illustration. He was born in 1853 and became famous for his vivid and dramatic depictions of historical and mythical subjects, particularly those involving pirates and Arthurian legends. Pyle's work has had a lasting influence on the field of illustration, inspiring generations of artists with his detailed and narrative-driven style.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is built from vigorous visible brushwork, dense descriptive detail, and strongly modeled figures in dramatic action. Dark earthy passages are punctuated by luminous sky or forest light, while crowded historical-adventure scenes, expressive gestures, and rugged natural settings create an epic, emotionally charged appearance."},{"id":"raphael-lacoste","name":"Raphael Lacoste","cat":"illustrators","en":"Raphael Lacoste","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raphael-lacoste.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raphael-lacoste","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","brown","light-orange"],"intro":"Raphael Lacoste is a renowned art director and illustrator, best known for his work in the video game industry, particularly with the \"Assassin's Creed\" series. His expertise in creating immersive and detailed environments has earned him acclaim and numerous awards. Lacoste's work often blends historical elements with imaginative landscapes, showcasing his skill in digital art and concept design.","observation":"The style presents immense fantasy landscapes with monumental cliff cities, floating landforms, waterfalls, and tiny travelers that establish overwhelming scale. Highly detailed, realistic rendering combines cinematic wide compositions, vivid warm-and-cool lighting, atmospheric haze, reflective water, and dramatic vertical architecture."},{"id":"arthur-streeton","name":"Arthur Streeton","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur Streeton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-streeton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-streeton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","grey","bone-white","ochre","muted-blue","blue"],"intro":"Arthur Streeton was an Australian painter and a leading member of the Heidelberg School, known for his contributions to Australian Impressionism. Born in 1867, Streeton is celebrated for his plein air landscapes that capture the unique light and color of the Australian countryside. His works often depict serene and idyllic rural scenes, characterized by a mastery of light and a naturalistic approach.","observation":"These landscapes are rendered with visible, directional oil-paint brushwork, combining fine marks with softly blended atmospheric distance. Muted blue, ochre, green, and brown tones create sunlit pastoral vistas, with prominent eucalyptus trees, rolling terrain, water, and distant settlements recurring across the sheet."},{"id":"paco-rabanne","name":"Paco Rabanne","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Paco Rabanne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paco-rabanne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paco-rabanne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","backlighting","glow","high-contrast","metallic","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Paco Rabanne is a renowned Spanish fashion designer known for his innovative and unconventional designs. Born Francisco Rabaneda Cuervo, he gained fame in the 1960s with his use of unconventional materials like metal and plastic in clothing. Rabanne's work is characterized by its futuristic and avant-garde aesthetic, making significant contributions to the fashion industry.","observation":"The style is glossy, highly realistic fashion photography built around elaborate metallic garments, dense ornament, and mirror-like silver and gold surfaces. Tight portraits and low-angle runway compositions use dramatic sunlight, strong contrast, reflective highlights, and occasional backlighting to make the sculptural clothing feel imposing and luxurious."},{"id":"helene-schjerfbeck","name":"Helene Schjerfbeck","cat":"painters","en":"Helene Schjerfbeck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helene-schjerfbeck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helene-schjerfbeck","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Helene Schjerfbeck was a Finnish painter known for her modernist approach and expressive portraits. Her work often explored themes of introspection and solitude, characterized by a unique blend of realism and abstraction. Schjerfbeck's style evolved over her lifetime, reflecting influences from Symbolism and early modernism, and she is celebrated for her ability to convey deep emotion through minimalistic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses softly modeled portraiture with visible fine brushwork and a lightly textured, canvas-like surface. Restrained cream, brown, black, and flesh tones create a subdued, somber atmosphere, while close cropping and simplified backgrounds keep attention on the pale, introspective faces."},{"id":"andreas-levers","name":"Andreas Levers","cat":"photographers","en":"Andreas Levers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andreas-levers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andreas-levers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","dark-cyan","dark-red","muted-cyan","red"],"intro":"Andreas Levers is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative urban landscapes and atmospheric compositions. His work often explores themes of solitude and the interplay of light and shadow in modern environments, capturing the essence of urban life with a distinctive style.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, using restrained teal shadows against concentrated red-orange practical lights. Dense fog softens the urban architecture and creates layered depth, while wet streets, isolated figures, and strong pools of illumination give the scenes a dark, atmospheric mood."},{"id":"brian-despain","name":"Brian Despain","cat":"illustrators","en":"Brian Despain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-despain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-despain","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","mist","motion","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["dark-ochre","light-lime","grey","ochre","dark-brown","muted-cyan","rust"],"intro":"Brian Despain is an artist known for his imaginative and detailed illustrations, often featuring mechanical and fantastical elements. His work is characterized by a blend of traditional and digital techniques, creating a unique style that merges the whimsical with the mechanical.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured, painterly surfaces with elaborate steampunk machinery, airborne vessels, and weathered mechanical figures. Muted earth tones, atmospheric haze, dramatic smoke, and expansive cinematic compositions create a melancholy yet dreamlike epic world."},{"id":"andy-fairhurst","name":"Andy Fairhurst","cat":"illustrators","en":"Andy Fairhurst","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andy-fairhurst.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andy-fairhurst","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","backlighting","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","fantasy","symmetry"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","grey","ochre","cream"],"intro":"Andy Fairhurst is a contemporary digital illustrator known for his imaginative and visually striking artworks. His work often explores themes of fantasy and science fiction, creating immersive worlds that captivate viewers with their depth and detail.","observation":"The style uses painterly, highly textured cosmic landscapes with monumental vertical forms, tiny cloaked figures, and strongly centered or symmetrical compositions. Deep teal shadows, smoky atmospheric depth, and warm orange-white emissive light create a cinematic, high-contrast sense of awe and fantasy."},{"id":"john-marin","name":"John Marin","cat":"painters","en":"John Marin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-marin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-marin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","floral","landscapes","still-life","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["muted-orange","bone-white","beige","dark-brown","charcoal","rust","dark-red"],"intro":"John Marin is an influential American painter known for his dynamic and expressive watercolors and oils, often depicting landscapes and urban scenes with a modernist touch. His work is characterized by a vibrant use of color and a fluid, almost abstract style that captures the essence of his subjects with spontaneity and energy.","observation":"Across the four pictures, diluted watercolor washes and visible brushwork are reinforced by loose dark ink-like contour lines. The style combines expressive, semi-abstract simplification with subdued blue, gray, ochre, and red accents, depicting harbor scenes and domestic still lifes with open, gestural forms."},{"id":"felicia-simion","name":"Felicia Simion","cat":"photographers","en":"Felicia Simion","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/felicia-simion.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/felicia-simion","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","backlighting","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","silhouette"],"colours":["muted-cyan","silver","black","dark-cyan","blue","muted-orange"],"intro":"Felicia Simion is a contemporary photographer known for her evocative and surreal imagery that often explores themes of identity and emotion. Her work is characterized by a dreamy and ethereal quality, blending elements of fantasy and reality to create visually striking compositions.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic photography with a strongly blue-teal, moody palette punctuated by warm sunset highlights. Solitary figures are frequently rendered as silhouettes or partially obscured forms in misty landscapes, with shallow focus, backlighting, dramatic skies, and an introspective dreamlike mood."},{"id":"olimpia-zagnoli","name":"Olimpia Zagnoli","cat":"illustrators","en":"Olimpia Zagnoli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olimpia-zagnoli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olimpia-zagnoli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-blue","vivid-red","black","silver","deep-blue","muted-blue"],"intro":"Olimpia Zagnoli is an Italian illustrator known for her distinctive and colorful style, often incorporating bold geometric shapes and vibrant colors. Her work is characterized by a playful yet sophisticated aesthetic, drawing inspiration from modernist and pop art movements. Zagnoli's illustrations have been featured in numerous international publications and exhibitions, making her a prominent figure in contemporary illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic, highly controlled portrait illustration with crisp fine contours, simplified planes of light and shadow, and a limited but intensely saturated red, blue, black, and pale palette. Fashion-editorial faces, angular cropping, bold accessories, and a subtle grainy print texture give the images a polished yet tactile poster-like finish."},{"id":"michael-dudok-de-wit","name":"Michael Dudok de Wit","cat":"illustrators","en":"Michael Dudok de Wit","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-dudok-de-wit.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-dudok-de-wit","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","silhouette"],"colours":["black","rust","grey","muted-blue","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Michael Dudok de Wit is a renowned Dutch animator, director, and illustrator, known for his poetic and visually captivating animated films. His works often explore themes of solitude, nature, and the human condition, characterized by a minimalist yet expressive style. His most notable work, \"Father and Daughter,\" won an Academy Award for Best Animated Short Film.","observation":"The style uses cinematic landscape compositions rendered as textured graphic illustrations, with simplified dark silhouettes set against expansive skies, water, cliffs, and clouds. Muted blue, charcoal, and warm orange tones recur throughout, strengthened by granular film-like texture, strong tonal contrast, and luminous suns or moons near the horizon."},{"id":"elizabeth-gadd","name":"Elizabeth Gadd","cat":"photographers","en":"Elizabeth Gadd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elizabeth-gadd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elizabeth-gadd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["silver","black","charcoal","grey","dark-red","orange"],"intro":"Elizabeth Gadd is a contemporary Canadian photographer known for her breathtaking landscape photography that often features solitary figures in vast natural settings. Her work is characterized by a dreamy, ethereal quality that merges the boundaries between reality and fantasy, often exploring themes of solitude and introspection.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, built around subdued, moody tones with deep shadows, selective red accents, and isolated warm light sources. Misty wilderness landscapes, back-facing figures in flowing gowns, reflective water, and shallow atmospheric focus create a grand, dreamlike visual narrative."},{"id":"gertrude-abercrombie","name":"Gertrude Abercrombie","cat":"painters","en":"Gertrude Abercrombie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gertrude-abercrombie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gertrude-abercrombie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["charcoal","black","muted-ochre","silver","red"],"intro":"Gertrude Abercrombie was an American painter known for her enigmatic and surreal landscapes, often featuring solitary figures and dreamlike settings. Her work is characterized by a unique blend of magic realism and personal symbolism, drawing on themes of isolation and introspection. Born in 1909, Abercrombie's paintings reflect her own experiences and emotions, creating a distinct visual language that has captivated audiences.","observation":"These scenes combine dark, subdued rural landscapes with visible, layered brushwork and fine linear detail. Starkly isolated figures, animals, trees, and houses are arranged like uncanny tableaux, while pink and red garments provide sharp color accents against the moody blue-green surroundings."},{"id":"edward-weston","name":"Edward Weston","cat":"photographers","en":"Edward Weston","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-weston.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-weston","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Edward Weston was a pioneering American photographer known for his influential work in the early to mid-20th century. He is celebrated for his innovative approach to photography, emphasizing sharp detail, rich textures, and a focus on natural forms and the human figure. Weston was a key figure in the development of modernist photography and a founding member of Group f/64, which advocated for 'straight photography'⁠—a style characterized by sharp focus and clear detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, organic wood, stone, and shell-like forms are presented as solid, sculptural objects in stark monochrome. Dramatic directional lighting, deep black grounds, close cropping, and strongly tactile surface detail give the style a dark, high-contrast still-life character."},{"id":"thom-filicia","name":"Thom Filicia","cat":"designers","en":"Thom Filicia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thom-filicia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thom-filicia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","beige","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Thom Filicia is an American interior designer known for his innovative and stylish approach to home decor. He gained recognition through his work on television and various design projects, where he combines classic elements with modern sensibilities to create inviting and sophisticated spaces.","observation":"The style presents richly layered, highly realistic interior scenes with dark wood, patterned wall treatments, tailored upholstery, and abundant decorative objects. Warm lamps and candles create pools of glow against a moody earth-tone palette, while framed abstract art, textiles, and architectural molding give the rooms a polished, residential luxury."},{"id":"james-c-christensen","name":"James C. Christensen","cat":"illustrators","en":"James C. Christensen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-c-christensen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-c-christensen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","rust","dark-blue","silver"],"intro":"James C. Christensen was an American artist known for his whimsical and fantastical artwork that often drew inspiration from myths, legends, and fairy tales. His work is characterized by intricate detail, imaginative themes, and a unique blend of humor and fantasy.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and highly detailed, combining finely rendered figures, lavish fabrics, dense botanical growth, animals, and architectural fragments into fantastical tableaux. Saturated jewel-like colors, strong light-dark separation, delicate brushwork, and elaborate surface ornament give the scenes a dreamlike storybook grandeur."},{"id":"ruud-van-empel","name":"Ruud van Empel","cat":"photographers","en":"Ruud van Empel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ruud-van-empel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ruud-van-empel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","vivid-colors","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-green","black","olive","light-pink","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Ruud van Empel is a contemporary Dutch photographer known for his innovative and surreal digital art. His work often combines elements of photography, collage, and digital manipulation to create hyperrealistic and dreamlike images. Van Empel's art explores themes of identity, childhood, and nature, often featuring young subjects in lush, fantastical settings.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, finely rendered child portraits with dense, richly colored botanical settings. Formal frontal posing, elaborate floral clothing, intricate hairstyles, and abundant oversized leaves create an ornate, theatrical garden tableau across the renders."},{"id":"josephus-laurentius-dyckmans","name":"Josephus Laurentius Dyckmans","cat":"painters","en":"Josephus Laurentius Dyckmans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josephus-laurentius-dyckmans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josephus-laurentius-dyckmans","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","black","orange","red"],"intro":"Josephus Laurentius Dyckmans was a Belgian painter known for his detailed and realistic depictions of everyday life and domestic scenes. Born in 1811, Dyckmans was part of the 19th-century Romantic movement, often focusing on intimate and nostalgic portrayals of rural and urban settings. His works are characterized by their fine brushwork, balanced compositions, and a keen attention to detail, capturing the essence of European life during his time.","observation":"The style presents richly rendered oil-paint scenes and close details with visible brushwork, aged crackle, subdued warm browns, and deep shadow. Elaborate gilded frames, historical interiors, formal clothing, and expressive figures create a classical, museum-like atmosphere across the varied compositions."},{"id":"tomasz-alen-kopera","name":"Tomasz Alen Kopera","cat":"painters","en":"Tomasz Alen Kopera","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tomasz-alen-kopera.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tomasz-alen-kopera","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","brown","orange","dark-rust"],"intro":"Tomasz Alen Kopera is a contemporary Polish painter known for his surreal and fantastical artworks. His paintings often explore themes of nature, mythology, and the human condition, characterized by intricate details and a dreamlike quality. Kopera's work is celebrated for its imaginative realism and the way it blurs the line between reality and fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental humanoid faces and figures merge with bark, roots, branches, and autumn foliage, producing a richly textured fantasy portrait style. Fine, layered surface marks and sculptural modelling are set against dark backgrounds, with intense internal golden and blue-green light creating high-contrast, moody imagery."},{"id":"elie-saab","name":"Elie Saab","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Elie Saab","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elie-saab.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elie-saab","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","fine-lines","pastel-colors","fantasy","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","white","muted-red","brown","muted-blue"],"intro":"Elie Saab is a renowned Lebanese fashion designer known for his exquisite haute couture creations. He founded his fashion label in the early 1980s and quickly gained international acclaim for his luxurious and intricate designs. Saab's work often features elaborate embroidery, delicate lace, and opulent fabrics, making him a favorite among celebrities and royalty for red carpet events and weddings.","observation":"The style combines ethereal couture fashion imagery with delicate, pastel-toned surfaces, elaborate floral embellishment, beading, lace, and translucent layers. It shifts between softly lit editorial realism and airy fashion illustration, using elongated figures, sweeping trains, fine contour lines, and generous pale backgrounds."},{"id":"jae-lee","name":"Jae Lee","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jae Lee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jae-lee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jae-lee","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","characters","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","dark"],"colours":["white","black","bone-white","brown","beige","muted-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Jae Lee is a renowned comic book artist known for his distinctive style and contributions to major comic series. He has worked with prominent publishers, creating visually compelling and unique illustrations that have earned him a significant place in the comic book industry.","observation":"The style combines loose, visibly brushed and ink-like marks with stark, high-contrast compositions dominated by black clothing and shadow. Expressive, angular figures and dramatic embraces or confrontations are isolated against sparse pale or dark grounds, with occasional red and blue accents lending a graphic fantasy-comic intensity."},{"id":"art-spiegelman","name":"Art Spiegelman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Art Spiegelman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/art-spiegelman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/art-spiegelman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","dark-brown","rust","light-orange"],"intro":"Art Spiegelman is an American cartoonist, editor, and comics advocate, best known for his graphic novel \"Maus,\" which depicts his father's experiences during the Holocaust. Spiegelman's work often explores complex themes and is recognized for its innovative use of the comics medium to address serious historical and personal subjects.","observation":"The style is photographic and cinematic, using intimate portrait framing, shallow focus, strong contrast, and warm, moody interior lighting. Detailed studio backgrounds filled with framed drawings establish character and setting, while visible grain and occasional monochrome treatment give the images a documentary-like editorial texture."},{"id":"kenzo","name":"Kenzo","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Kenzo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kenzo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kenzo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["blue","vivid-red","bone-white","red","dark-blue","magenta"],"intro":"Kenzo is a renowned fashion designer known for blending traditional Japanese styles with modern Western fashion. Founded by Kenzo Takada, the brand is celebrated for its vibrant prints, bold colors, and eclectic designs that often incorporate elements from various cultures.","observation":"Across the four images, highly saturated cobalt and orange dominate against clean, contrasting backgrounds, while fashion-like figures and close portraits are surrounded by sculptural fabric, flowers, smoke, and paint-like forms. The style combines polished realistic faces and materials with surreal, expressive transformations and densely layered tactile details."},{"id":"nicholas-hilliard","name":"Nicholas Hilliard","cat":"painters","en":"Nicholas Hilliard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicholas-hilliard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicholas-hilliard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","dark-blue","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Nicholas Hilliard was a renowned English goldsmith and limner best known for his exquisite miniature portraits during the late 16th and early 17th centuries. His work is celebrated for its delicate detail and vibrant color, capturing the elegance and opulence of the Elizabethan court. Hilliard's portraits often featured intricate backgrounds and symbolic elements, reflecting the sitter's status and personality.","observation":"The style combines finely modeled portrait faces with extremely dense botanical decoration, lace, jewelry, pearls, and feathers. Saturated blues, reds, whites, and deep greens create a richly ornamental, dreamlike surface, while delicate brushwork and abundant small details give the images the appearance of elaborate painted court portraits."},{"id":"auguste-toulmouche","name":"Auguste Toulmouche","cat":"painters","en":"Auguste Toulmouche","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/auguste-toulmouche.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/auguste-toulmouche","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","beige","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Auguste Toulmouche was a French painter known for his detailed and elegant portrayals of fashionable women during the 19th century. His works often depicted scenes of domestic life and social gatherings, characterized by their refined elegance and attention to detail. Toulmouche was associated with the academic art movement and was celebrated for his ability to capture the luxurious fabrics and intricate details of his subjects' attire.","observation":"Across all four scenes, the style uses richly visible brushwork and fine strokes to render elaborate interiors, fabric, flowers, furniture, and figures with dense, tactile detail. Dark brown, red, and olive surroundings contrast strongly with pale dresses and focused areas of light, creating intimate, theatrical domestic tableaux with ornate period furnishings."},{"id":"david-finch","name":"David Finch","cat":"illustrators","en":"David Finch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-finch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-finch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","beige","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"David Finch is a renowned comic book artist known for his work with major publishers like Marvel and DC Comics. His style is characterized by detailed line work, dynamic compositions, and a strong emphasis on muscular anatomy and dramatic poses. Finch has contributed to iconic series such as Batman and X-Men, earning acclaim for his expressive and bold illustrations.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, hand-rendered ink-like marks, scratchy hatching, and strongly modeled anatomy to create dramatic heroic and monstrous figures. A restricted earthy palette, deep blacks, and sharp highlights give the illustrations a grim, monumental comic-book intensity."},{"id":"jan-van-eyck","name":"Jan Van Eyck","cat":"painters","en":"Jan Van Eyck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-van-eyck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-van-eyck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-red","deep-red","grey","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Jan Van Eyck is a renowned painter from the Northern Renaissance , celebrated for his pioneering work in oil painting and his meticulous attention to detail. Born in the late 14th century, Van Eyck's art is characterized by its realistic portrayal of figures and landscapes, as well as its intricate use of symbolism and religious themes. His works often feature rich color palettes and detailed textures, capturing the essence of the early Renaissance period in Flanders.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely painted portraiture with visible brush texture, carefully modelled faces, and richly rendered textiles. Restrained blue, brown, and red tones, elaborate ecclesiastical interiors, stained glass, manuscripts, and carved architectural details create a solemn classical religious atmosphere."},{"id":"william-wegman","name":"William Wegman","cat":"photographers","en":"William Wegman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-wegman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-wegman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","red","brown","black","grey","beige"],"intro":"William Wegman is an American artist known for his work in photography and video, particularly his whimsical and humorous portraits of Weimaraner dogs. His work often explores themes of anthropomorphism and humor, making him a unique figure in contemporary art.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed photographic portraiture with subdued, earthy colors and carefully controlled compositions. Weimaraner dogs are treated as fashion subjects, alternately framed in close-up studio settings, draped in textured fabrics, or posed against softly blurred natural backgrounds."},{"id":"miuccia-prada","name":"Miuccia Prada","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Miuccia Prada","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/miuccia-prada.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/miuccia-prada","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-red","black","bone-white","silver","muted-ochre","brown"],"intro":"Miuccia Prada is an influential Italian fashion designer and businesswoman, known for her innovative and forward-thinking approach to luxury fashion. She is the head designer of Prada and Miu Miu, and her work is celebrated for its blend of traditional craftsmanship with modern aesthetics. Prada's designs often incorporate bold colors, unique textures, and a mix of classic and contemporary elements, making her a pivotal figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style combines fashion-editorial portraiture with visible, energetic paint strokes and carefully described garments, accessories, and facial features. Saturated clothing and graphic backdrops create strong color contrasts, while simplified faces, elongated figures, and clean fashion compositions keep the imagery illustrative and polished."},{"id":"jeff-easley","name":"Jeff Easley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jeff Easley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeff-easley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeff-easley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["dark-red","black","vivid-rust","charcoal","light-orange"],"intro":"Jeff Easley is an American artist known for his work in fantasy illustration, particularly for Dungeons & Dragons. His art is characterized by its vivid detail, dramatic compositions, and epic themes, often depicting mythical creatures and heroic battles.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, layered texture, and densely described monstrous forms. Fiery orange illumination contrasts sharply with deep blue-black shadows, creating an intense, ominous epic-fantasy mood centered on demons, witches, volcanic terrain, and supernatural confrontations."},{"id":"james-avery","name":"James Avery","cat":"designers","en":"James Avery","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-avery.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-avery","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","still-life","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","metallic"],"colours":["charcoal","white","black","dark-brown","brown","silver"],"intro":"James Avery is a renowned American jewelry designer known for his handcrafted pieces that often feature Christian symbolism and intricate designs. He founded James Avery Artisan Jewelry, which has become a well-respected brand offering a wide range of jewelry items.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic jewelry product scenes with crisp metal reflections, intricate engraved ornament, and carefully rendered stone details. Dramatic directional lighting, dark earthy props, shallow focus, and strong contrast give the still lifes a luxurious, tactile, slightly rustic character."},{"id":"frans-hals","name":"Frans Hals","cat":"painters","en":"Frans Hals","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frans-hals.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frans-hals","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","dark-brown","ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Frans Hals was a Dutch Golden Age painter known for his lively and expressive portraits. Born in 1582 in Antwerp, he spent most of his life in Haarlem, where he became a prominent figure in the art world. Hals was celebrated for his ability to capture the vitality and character of his subjects with loose brushwork and a keen eye for detail. His works are characterized by their dynamic compositions and the use of chiaroscuro to create depth and realism.","observation":"Across all four portraits, thickly built paint and clearly visible directional brushwork model faces, hair, fabric, and hats with lively surface texture. The subdued earthy palette, tightly cropped framing, and exaggerated laughter or grimaces create an expressive, theatrical character-study style with classical costume details."},{"id":"anders-petersen","name":"Anders Petersen","cat":"photographers","en":"Anders Petersen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anders-petersen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anders-petersen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Anders Petersen is a renowned Swedish photographer known for his intimate and raw documentary style. His work often explores human relationships and urban life, capturing the essence of subcultures with a distinctive emotional depth. Petersen's photography is characterized by its high-contrast black and white imagery, often focusing on the gritty and unpolished aspects of life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, bright point lights, visible grain, and selective focus. Intimate close portraits of women in a dim bar are framed through reflections and foreground obstructions, producing a candid, nocturnal, cinematic mood."},{"id":"peter-kemp","name":"Peter Kemp","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Kemp","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-kemp.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-kemp","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","bone-white","muted-ochre","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Peter Kemp is a contemporary photographer known for his elaborate and theatrical portraiture. His work often draws inspiration from historical and fantasy themes, creating a unique blend of reality and imagination.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic portrait tableaux with richly textured fabrics, elaborate costumes, antique furnishings, and carefully arranged props. Deep green, brown, cream, and black tones create a moody, dark atmosphere, while warm localized light and theatrical staging give each composition a cinematic, period-room grandeur."},{"id":"george-cruikshank","name":"George Cruikshank","cat":"illustrators","en":"George Cruikshank","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-cruikshank.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-cruikshank","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","pale-yellow","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"George Cruikshank was a prominent British caricaturist and illustrator, known for his satirical work in the 19th century. His illustrations often provided social and political commentary, capturing the essence of Victorian England with a humorous and critical eye. Cruikshank's work is characterized by detailed etchings and a distinctive style that combines grotesque and exaggerated figures with intricate backgrounds.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is densely drawn and highly expressive, using fine ink lines, crosshatching, and selective hand-colored tones on an aged-paper ground. Crowded narrative scenes, exaggerated faces, theatrical gestures, and period costumes create a vivid archival-print character with strong dark-light contrasts."},{"id":"emily-henderson","name":"Emily Henderson","cat":"designers","en":"Emily Henderson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emily-henderson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emily-henderson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["orange","dark-olive","dark-blue","grey","bone-white","vivid-red","olive"],"intro":"Emily Henderson is a well-known interior designer and stylist, recognized for her ability to blend modern and vintage elements to create inviting and stylish spaces. Her work often features a playful mix of colors, patterns, and textures, making her a prominent figure in the design community.","observation":"The style combines vivid, high-contrast color with visibly broad, layered paint strokes and emphatic dark contours. It turns interiors, portraits, fashion, and floral settings into richly packed illustrative scenes, balancing recognizable forms with expressive, textural brushwork."},{"id":"marcantonio-raimondi","name":"Marcantonio Raimondi","cat":"printmakers","en":"Marcantonio Raimondi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marcantonio-raimondi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marcantonio-raimondi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","drawing","ink","geometric"],"colours":["brown","pale-orange","muted-orange","muted-ochre","black"],"intro":"Marcantonio Raimondi was an Italian engraver and printmaker known for his detailed and precise engravings during the Renaissance period. He collaborated with Raphael and is credited with popularizing the use of prints in art, allowing for the widespread distribution of artworks. His work often depicted mythological and religious themes, characterized by intricate linework and classical composition.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style resembles densely engraved or etched illustrations on aged sepia paper, built from extremely fine contour lines, crosshatching, and deep ink shadows. Circular medallion framing, crowded historical or mythic scenes, animal imagery, and elaborate botanical studies create an ornate, archival print-like character."},{"id":"frans-lanting","name":"Frans Lanting","cat":"photographers","en":"Frans Lanting","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frans-lanting.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frans-lanting","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-brown","dark-blue","rust","charcoal","orange","muted-magenta"],"intro":"Frans Lanting is a renowned wildlife photographer known for his stunning and evocative images of nature and wildlife. His work has been featured in National Geographic and other prestigious publications, capturing the beauty and diversity of the natural world. Lanting's photography often highlights the intricate relationships between species and their environments, emphasizing conservation and ecological awareness.","observation":"The style is photorealistic and cinematic, built around expansive African landscapes, wildlife, and distant human figures in carefully composed environmental scenes. Strong sunrise and sunset backlighting creates vivid orange-and-blue color contrasts, while mist, clouds, reflective water, and shallow focus give the images a dreamy atmospheric depth."},{"id":"christoffer-relander","name":"Christoffer Relander","cat":"photographers","en":"Christoffer Relander","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christoffer-relander.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christoffer-relander","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","portraits","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","brown","black","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Christoffer Relander is a Finnish photographer known for his innovative use of double exposure techniques. His work often explores themes of nature and identity, blending human figures with natural landscapes to create surreal and introspective imagery.","observation":"Across all four images, side-profile portraits merge seamlessly with dense forest scenes in a monochrome double-exposure treatment. Fine hair and tree branches create intricate organic edges, while strong dark-light separation and generous cream negative space give the compositions a surreal, dreamy stillness."},{"id":"frances-tipton-hunter","name":"Frances Tipton Hunter","cat":"illustrators","en":"Frances Tipton Hunter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frances-tipton-hunter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frances-tipton-hunter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","bone-white","grey","rust"],"intro":"Frances Tipton Hunter was an American illustrator known for her charming and detailed depictions of children and domestic life. Her work was prominent during the early to mid-20th century, contributing to magazines and children's books. Hunter's illustrations often captured the innocence and whimsy of childhood, characterized by a warm and inviting style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly built-up, directional brushwork with soft yet highly readable detail in faces, clothing, foliage, and fur. It combines intimate portraiture and everyday domestic scenes with gentle natural light, restrained pastel colors, and richly textured floral surroundings."},{"id":"mary-sibande","name":"Mary Sibande","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Mary Sibande","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-sibande.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-sibande","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","fashion","floral","vivid-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["blue","deep-blue","muted-rust","silver","dark-blue"],"intro":"Mary Sibande is a South African artist known for her work exploring themes of identity, race, and gender through sculpture and photography. Her art often features a fictional character, Sophie, who represents the complexities of post-apartheid South Africa. Sibande's work is recognized for its vivid use of color and intricate detailing, often incorporating elements of fashion and historical references.","observation":"The style presents surreal haute-couture figures in highly elaborate, sculptural garments, with enormous ruffles, folded fabric, floral forms, and theatrical headwear. Strong monochromatic color treatments⁠—especially saturated blue, alongside a white variation⁠—combine with expansive skies, fields, and dramatic editorial posing to create a dreamy, cinematic fashion-image aesthetic."},{"id":"anna-atkins","name":"Anna Atkins","cat":"photographers","en":"Anna Atkins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anna-atkins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anna-atkins","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","grain","subdued-colors","retro","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-blue","blue","muted-blue","silver"],"intro":"Anna Atkins is considered one of the first female photographers and is renowned for her pioneering work in botanical photography. Born in 1799 in England, she is best known for her use of the cyanotype process to create images of algae and other plants, which she published in her book \"Photographs of British Algae: Cyanotype Impressions.\" Her work is significant for its blend of art and science, and she is often credited with producing the first book illustrated with photographic images.","observation":"The style presents botanical specimens as pale white and blue silhouettes against a deep cyan ground, arranged with generous negative space like a collected herbarium sheet. Fine organic edges, subtle tonal variation, and an even granular surface give the flat graphic treatment a tactile, vintage photographic-print character."},{"id":"arthur-frank-mathews","name":"Arthur Frank Mathews","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur Frank Mathews","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-frank-mathews.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-frank-mathews","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","light-orange","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Arthur Frank Mathews is an American painter and one of the leading figures of the Arts and Crafts Movement in California. Known for his contributions to the American Art Nouveau style, Mathews's work often features harmonious compositions, soft color palettes, and themes that blend classical and mythological elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic figurative painting with visible, directional brushwork, softly broken edges, and richly modelled light. Scenes of women, interiors, gardens, and landscapes are composed with classical pictorial balance, restrained earth colours, strong shadow-to-light contrasts, and abundant tactile surface detail."},{"id":"nicholas-roerich","name":"Nicholas Roerich","cat":"painters","en":"Nicholas Roerich","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicholas-roerich.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicholas-roerich","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-blue","blue","charcoal","grey","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Nicholas Roerich was a Russian painter, writer, archaeologist, and philosopher known for his profound interest in Eastern spirituality and the Himalayas. Born in 1874, Roerich's work often depicted mystical landscapes and spiritual themes, reflecting his fascination with the natural world and human consciousness. His contributions to art and culture were significant, and he was a key figure in the Russian Symbolist movement.","observation":"The style uses visible, broad paint strokes and simplified yet richly modelled forms, combining rugged mountain vistas with small robed figures and decorative interiors. Saturated blues, coral reds, ochres, and rose highlights create strong graphic contrast, while ornamental fabrics and borders add dense visual detail."},{"id":"jacob-philipp-hackert","name":"Jacob Philipp Hackert","cat":"painters","en":"Jacob Philipp Hackert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacob-philipp-hackert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacob-philipp-hackert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","muted-blue","ochre","red"],"intro":"Jacob Philipp Hackert was a German painter known for his detailed and realistic landscapes. Born in 1737, Hackert became renowned for his ability to capture the beauty of nature with precision and depth. His works often depicted serene and majestic landscapes, reflecting the ideals of the Enlightenment and Romanticism.","observation":"The style presents grand, densely detailed landscapes with visible painterly texture, monumental trees, cliffs, mountains, water, and abundant vegetation. Subdued earth tones are enlivened by warm luminous sunlight, mist, and hazy atmospheric depth, giving the scenes a romantic, dreamlike fantasy character."},{"id":"arthur-szyk","name":"Arthur Szyk","cat":"illustrators","en":"Arthur Szyk","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-szyk.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-szyk","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","patterns","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-brown","ochre","bone-white","red","black","muted-blue"],"intro":"Arthur Szyk was a Polish-Jewish artist known for his detailed illustrations and political caricatures. Born in 1894, Szyk's work often focused on themes of social justice, Jewish culture, and historical events. His style is characterized by intricate detailing and vibrant colors, making his illustrations both visually striking and thematically rich.","observation":"The style is densely layered and vividly colored, combining highly rendered faces and animals with ornate costumes, patterned textiles, feathers, jewelry, and tiny embedded scenes. Visible fine brushwork and varied directional strokes give the crowded imagery a richly painted, tactile surface, while strong contrasts and theatrical expressions make the portraits feel flamboyant and fantastical."},{"id":"august-macke","name":"August Macke","cat":"painters","en":"August Macke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/august-macke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/august-macke","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","red","muted-olive","bone-white","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"August Macke was a German Expressionist painter known for his vibrant use of color and dynamic compositions. Born in 1887, Macke was a leading figure in the German Expressionist movement and a member of the Blaue Reiter group. His work often explored themes of modern life, nature, and the interplay of color and light. Macke's art is characterized by its bold, vivid palette and a unique blend of abstraction and realism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vigorous, visible brushwork to break landscapes, architecture, figures, and still-life details into angular, simplified forms. Saturated oranges, blues, greens, reds, and yellows sit in strongly contrasting blocks, while dark linear accents and broad strokes give the scenes a lively, graphic structure."},{"id":"craig-davison","name":"Craig Davison","cat":"illustrators","en":"Craig Davison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/craig-davison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/craig-davison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","brown","light-yellow","ochre","dark-olive","deep-rust"],"intro":"Craig Davison is a contemporary British artist known for his distinctive style that captures the essence of childhood and imagination. His work often features children in playful and imaginative scenarios, drawing inspiration from popular culture and everyday life. Davison's art is characterized by its narrative quality and ability to evoke nostalgia, making it relatable to a wide audience.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly broad, directional brushwork and layered paint to depict expressive children in theatrical, action-oriented compositions. Warm ochres, muted greens, reds, and browns unify the scenes, while exaggerated gestures, rugged costumes, and close facial expressions give the imagery an adventurous fantasy character."},{"id":"edward-bawden","name":"Edward Bawden","cat":"illustrators","en":"Edward Bawden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-bawden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-bawden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","floral","landscapes","patterns","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["beige","muted-olive","charcoal","yellow","dark-red","rust"],"intro":"Edward Bawden was a prominent British artist and illustrator known for his distinctive style that combined elements of modernism and traditional illustration. Born in 1903, Bawden's work spanned various mediums, including printmaking, watercolor, and illustration. He was renowned for his linocuts and contributions to book illustration, as well as his work as a war artist during World War II. Bawden's art often depicted scenes of British life, architecture, and landscapes, characterized by a unique blend of whimsy and precision.","observation":"The style combines densely detailed architectural and landscape vignettes with crisp drawn outlines, flat color blocks, and fine woodcut-like marks. Saturated reds, greens, ochres, and cool blues unify urban streets, rural hills, waterways, interiors, and botanical scenes in a decorative retro illustration language."},{"id":"takashi-homma","name":"Takashi Homma","cat":"photographers","en":"Takashi Homma","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/takashi-homma.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/takashi-homma","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","urban","glow","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-teal","grey","silver","rust"],"intro":"Takashi Homma is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his exploration of urban landscapes and the interplay between nature and city life. His work often captures the essence of contemporary Japanese culture, blending traditional elements with modern aesthetics. Homma's photography is celebrated for its ability to evoke a sense of nostalgia and introspection, often featuring serene and contemplative scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is photographic and cinematic, built around dark teal shadows, warm amber highlights, rain, mist, and reflective surfaces. Strong contrast, visible grain, selective focus, and luminous points of light create a moody, dreamlike atmosphere spanning seascapes, portraits, and urban night scenes."},{"id":"gustav-bauernfeind","name":"Gustav Bauernfeind","cat":"painters","en":"Gustav Bauernfeind","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustav-bauernfeind.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustav-bauernfeind","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","muted-blue","ochre","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Gustav Bauernfeind was a German painter known for his detailed and romantic depictions of Middle Eastern scenes and European landscapes during the 19th century. His works often captured the intricate architecture and vibrant life of the regions he visited, blending realism with a romanticized view of his subjects.","observation":"These images use richly textured, visible brushwork to render historical-looking streets, stone buildings, and figures with convincing volume and abundant small details. Warm earth tones, bright sunlight, and deep architectural shadows create a restrained but strongly contrasted, immersive scene."},{"id":"serge-najjar","name":"Serge Najjar","cat":"photographers","en":"Serge Najjar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/serge-najjar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/serge-najjar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","bone-white","black","muted-blue"],"intro":"Serge Najjar is a contemporary photographer known for his striking architectural compositions and minimalist style. His work often explores the interplay between human figures and urban environments, capturing the essence of modern cityscapes with a unique perspective.","observation":"The style presents monumental concrete architecture with sharply geometric masses, immense voids, and small isolated figures that establish human scale. Realistic material texture is paired with restrained earth tones, hard sunlight, deep shadows, and dramatic cinematic framing, producing an austere yet subtly surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"vinoodh-matadin","name":"Vinoodh Matadin","cat":"photographers","en":"Vinoodh Matadin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vinoodh-matadin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vinoodh-matadin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","charcoal","deep-red","beige","muted-red"],"intro":"Vinoodh Matadin is a renowned Dutch photographer, best known for his collaboration with Inez van Lamsweerde. Together, they have created iconic images that blend fashion, art, and photography, often exploring themes of identity and transformation. Their work is celebrated for its innovative approach and has been featured in numerous high-profile publications and exhibitions worldwide.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped portrait photography with expressive direct gazes, tactile skin and hair detail, and dramatic editorial styling. Strong dark-light separation, selective focus, and recurring red or richly textured fabric create an intense, moody visual identity across both monochrome and restrained-color treatments."},{"id":"valerie-hegarty","name":"Valerie Hegarty","cat":"painters","en":"Valerie Hegarty","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/valerie-hegarty.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/valerie-hegarty","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","floral","still-life","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","brown","white"],"intro":"Valerie Hegarty is an American contemporary artist known for her site-specific installations that often explore themes of decay and transformation. Her work frequently incorporates elements of nature and history, creating immersive environments that challenge perceptions of time and space.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, sculptural assemblages in which decayed architectural fragments, frames, trees, and abundant vegetation merge into fantastical still-life installations. Soft, subdued natural colors, pale gallery-like backgrounds, and careful realism give the scenes a dreamy, museum-diorama quality."},{"id":"kengo-kuma","name":"Kengo Kuma","cat":"architects","en":"Kengo Kuma","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kengo-kuma.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kengo-kuma","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","subdued-colors","epic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","orange","beige","white"],"intro":"Kengo Kuma is a renowned Japanese architect known for his innovative and sustainable designs that often integrate with natural surroundings. His work emphasizes harmony with nature, utilizing traditional materials in modern ways to create spaces that are both functional and aesthetically pleasing.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents monumental, photorealistic architectural interiors built from dense arrays of projecting wooden blocks and beams. Repetition, strong geometric perspective, axial organization, and warm natural light create a sculptural, immersive atmosphere, with people and glazing providing scale."},{"id":"peter-lik","name":"Peter Lik","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Lik","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-lik.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-lik","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","red","ochre","beige"],"intro":"Peter Lik is a renowned Australian photographer known for his stunning landscape photography. His work often captures the beauty of natural environments with a focus on vivid colors and dramatic compositions. Lik's photography has been widely acclaimed for its ability to evoke emotion and transport viewers to breathtaking locations around the world.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, richly detailed landscape imagery with saturated autumnal oranges, reds, and golds set against deep shadow. Strong directional light, luminous highlights, atmospheric haze, and dramatic terrain create an expansive, emotionally heightened natural-world look across all four renders."},{"id":"afarin-sajedi","name":"Afarin Sajedi","cat":"painters","en":"Afarin Sajedi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/afarin-sajedi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/afarin-sajedi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["beige","silver","muted-ochre","brown","grey","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Afarin Sajedi is a contemporary Iranian artist known for her evocative and surreal portraiture. Her work often explores themes of identity, culture, and the human condition, blending traditional and modern elements to create a unique visual language.","observation":"Across all four images, tightly cropped faces and elaborate garments are rendered with visible layered brushwork, tactile fabric folds, and finely modeled skin. Restrained creams, greys, muted blues, and reds are punctuated by metallic gold details, while unusual makeup, tears, and solemn expressions give the portraits an intense, theatrical mood."},{"id":"eric-zener","name":"Eric Zener","cat":"painters","en":"Eric Zener","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-zener.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-zener","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["dark-teal","silver","muted-teal","muted-green","muted-ochre","brown"],"intro":"Eric Zener is an American contemporary artist known for his hyperrealistic paintings, particularly those depicting water and swimmers. His work often explores themes of escape, tranquility, and the human connection with nature. Zener's paintings are characterized by their meticulous detail and vibrant use of color, capturing the play of light and water with stunning accuracy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines recognizable human figures and bodies with energetic, visibly worked paint strokes, especially in the turbulent water and spray. Saturated teal water, bright highlights, strong tonal contrasts, and overhead or submerged viewpoints create an expressive, dreamlike sense of motion."},{"id":"larry-zox","name":"Larry Zox","cat":"painters","en":"Larry Zox","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-zox.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-zox","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","blue","vivid-red","light-orange","ochre","black","magenta"],"intro":"Larry Zox is an American abstract painter known for his contributions to the Color Field movement and post-painterly abstraction. Born in 1937, Zox's work is characterized by bold geometric shapes and vibrant color palettes. He played a significant role in the development of hard-edge painting, a style marked by sharp transitions between colors and forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses energetic abstract compositions built from overlapping angular color fields and forceful diagonal gestures. Saturated primary and secondary colors sit on pale grounds, while visible broad brushwork, irregular edges, and shifting paint texture keep the geometry tactile rather than mechanically flat."},{"id":"hiromu-arakawa","name":"Hiromu Arakawa","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hiromu Arakawa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hiromu-arakawa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hiromu-arakawa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","grey","bone-white","orange","vivid-red","deep-rust"],"intro":"Hiromu Arakawa is a renowned Japanese manga artist best known for creating the popular series \"Fullmetal Alchemist.\" Her work is characterized by intricate storytelling, strong character development, and a unique blend of fantasy and science fiction elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses densely composed character illustrations with expressive faces, dramatic poses, heavy black linework, and ink-like hatching. Saturated reds, blues, oranges, and metallic grays create strong contrast, while armor, cloaks, and fantastical mechanical forms receive extensive descriptive detailing."},{"id":"cecil-b-demille","name":"Cecil B. DeMille","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Cecil B. DeMille","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cecil-b-demille.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cecil-b-demille","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","orange","white","vivid-red"],"intro":"Cecil B. DeMille was a pioneering American filmmaker known for his epic films and grand storytelling. He played a significant role in shaping the early Hollywood film industry, directing classics such as \"The Ten Commandments\" and \"Cleopatra.\" DeMille's work is characterized by its large-scale productions, elaborate sets, and dramatic narratives, often drawing on historical and biblical themes.","observation":"Across the four images, monumental landscapes and dramatic human tableaux are rendered with dense, visible brushwork, rugged textures, and strongly modeled forms. A dark, ochre-and-blue palette, deep shadows, atmospheric mist, and theatrical scale give the style an epic, emotionally charged quality."},{"id":"martiros-saryan","name":"Martiros Saryan","cat":"painters","en":"Martiros Saryan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martiros-saryan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martiros-saryan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","fashion","landscapes","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-blue","charcoal","orange","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Martiros Saryan was an Armenian painter known for his vibrant and expressive works that often depicted the landscapes and culture of Armenia. Born in 1880, Saryan became a prominent figure in Armenian art, blending elements of modernism and symbolism to create a unique visual language that celebrated the natural beauty and folklore of his homeland.","observation":"Across the four renders, the style combines strongly angular, fashion-oriented portraiture with a landscape scene, using saturated reds, blues, oranges, and deep shadows. Visible directional brushwork and textured paint surfaces coexist with clean graphic shapes, dark contouring, and tightly cropped, expressive compositions."},{"id":"eadweard-muybridge","name":"Eadweard Muybridge","cat":"photographers","en":"Eadweard Muybridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eadweard-muybridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eadweard-muybridge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary","retro","collage"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Eadweard Muybridge was a pioneering English photographer known for his groundbreaking work in motion photography. Born in 1830, he is most famous for his studies of animal locomotion, which laid the foundation for the development of motion pictures. His work captured sequences of movement in a way that had never been seen before, using multiple cameras to capture motion in stop-motion photographs.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast photographic imagery presented as archival sequential studies, with repeated figures and motion phases arranged in contact-sheet-like grids. Heavy grain, scratches, paper borders, and sepia ageing give the images a vintage documentary character, while dramatic lighting and sharply captured gestures make the movement feel cinematic."},{"id":"warwick-goble","name":"Warwick Goble","cat":"illustrators","en":"Warwick Goble","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/warwick-goble.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/warwick-goble","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","landscapes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","light-yellow","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Warwick Goble was a British illustrator known for his work in children's books and fairy tales during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His illustrations often featured delicate lines, soft colors, and a whimsical style that brought mythical and fantastical stories to life. Goble's work is celebrated for its enchanting quality and attention to detail, making him a prominent figure in the world of illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible brush texture, layered fabrics, foliage, feathers, and atmospheric woodland detail. Subdued earth and jewel tones, deep forest shadows, ornamental costumes, animals, and storybook figures create an ornate, dreamlike fantasy tableau with a classical decorative sensibility."},{"id":"james-wells-champney","name":"James Wells Champney","cat":"painters","en":"James Wells Champney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-wells-champney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-wells-champney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","beige","dark-rust","orange","rust"],"intro":"James Wells Champney was an American artist known for his work as a genre painter and illustrator in the late 19th century. He was recognized for his detailed and realistic depictions of everyday life, often focusing on domestic scenes and portraits. Champney's work is characterized by its fine brushwork and attention to detail, capturing the essence of the Victorian era.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured oil-paint handling, fine visible brushwork, layered tonal modeling, and carefully articulated faces, fabrics, jewelry, and environments. Warm, subdued earth colors and deep shadows create a romantic, slightly dramatic atmosphere, while posed figures and narrative settings are presented with classical pictorial composition."},{"id":"patrice-murciano","name":"Patrice Murciano","cat":"various-artists","en":"Patrice Murciano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patrice-murciano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patrice-murciano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["white","black","silver","muted-cyan","rust","pink","green"],"intro":"Patrice Murciano is a contemporary French artist known for his vibrant and expressive works that often explore themes of identity and emotion. His art is characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions, merging elements of pop art and surrealism to create striking visual experiences.","observation":"Across all four portraits, recognizable faces are built from energetic, visible brushwork, fine sketch-like contours, and splattered color rather than smooth photographic modeling. Saturated cyan, magenta, orange, and yellow accents collide with stark white or black grounds, producing a vivid, high-contrast mixed-media look with surreal painterly abstraction around the figures."},{"id":"kenneth-anger","name":"Kenneth Anger","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Kenneth Anger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kenneth-anger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kenneth-anger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","glow","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","deep-red","dark-red","muted-blue","muted-orange"],"intro":"Kenneth Anger is an influential American filmmaker and author known for his pioneering work in experimental cinema. His films often explore themes of mysticism, the occult, and LGBTQ+ identity, and he is recognized for his unique visual style and controversial subject matter.","observation":"The style uses theatrical, film-like portraiture with saturated red and blue illumination, deep shadows, and bright practical light sources such as flames. Close crops, intense expressions, ceremonial gestures, ornate costume details, and visible grain create a dark, occult atmosphere across the images."},{"id":"chris-friel","name":"Chris Friel","cat":"photographers","en":"Chris Friel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-friel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-friel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","landscapes","mist","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Chris Friel is a contemporary photographer known for his experimental and abstract approach to landscape photography. His work often explores themes of motion and emotion, creating images that are both visually striking and thought-provoking. Friel's unique style has earned him recognition in the field of fine art photography, where he continues to push the boundaries of traditional photographic techniques.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark monochrome landscapes combine deep blacks with luminous skies, creating a bleak, high-contrast atmosphere. Wind-swept grasses, smeared clouds, softened distance, and occasional silhouetted figures give the images a dynamic long-exposure quality and an ominous cinematic mood."},{"id":"jean-baptiste-monge","name":"Jean-Baptiste Monge","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jean-Baptiste Monge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-baptiste-monge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-baptiste-monge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["cream","brown","black","muted-ochre","bone-white","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Jean-Baptiste Monge is a French illustrator known for his enchanting and whimsical depictions of fantasy worlds. His work often features anthropomorphic animals and mythical creatures, drawing inspiration from European folklore and fairy tales. Monge's illustrations are characterized by their detailed rendering and charming narratives, making them popular in children's literature and fantasy art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly textured, finely controlled painted strokes to model eccentric anthropomorphic animal characters as bulky, tactile assemblages of fur, cloth, leather, wood, and scavenged objects. Muted earth colors, pale open backgrounds, and whimsical yet uncanny groupings give the scenes a dreamlike, surreal storybook quality."},{"id":"bridget-bate-tichenor","name":"Bridget Bate Tichenor","cat":"painters","en":"Bridget Bate Tichenor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bridget-bate-tichenor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bridget-bate-tichenor","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","muted-orange","vivid-red","grey","deep-red","charcoal"],"intro":"Bridget Bate Tichenor is known for her contributions to the surrealist movement, particularly within the context of Mexican art. Born in France, she later moved to Mexico, where she became part of a vibrant community of artists. Her work often explores themes of mysticism, mythology, and the subconscious, characterized by meticulous detail and a dreamlike quality.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses softly modelled, finely textured paint with visible delicate brushwork, elongated figures, and carefully rendered fabric and animal surfaces. Restrained blue, green, cream, and ochre grounds are punctuated by strong red garments and flowers, while enigmatic portrait arrangements and unusual human-animal pairings create a dreamlike fantasy mood."},{"id":"paul-lung","name":"Paul Lung","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Lung","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-lung.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-lung","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","black","rust","vivid-orange","violet"],"intro":"Paul Lung is a contemporary artist known for his hyper-realistic pencil drawings, often focusing on detailed portraits and animal subjects. His work is celebrated for its meticulous attention to detail and lifelike quality, capturing the essence of his subjects with precision and depth.","observation":"Across the sheet, richly layered flowers and figures are rendered with visible, fluid brushwork, soft blending, and expressive marks rather than clean graphic edges. Saturated blossoms stand against deep atmospheric grounds, while the portrait introduces stark monochrome ink-like handling within the same painterly, dreamlike visual language."},{"id":"marc-lagrange","name":"Marc Lagrange","cat":"photographers","en":"Marc Lagrange","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-lagrange.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-lagrange","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","white","beige","brown","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Marc Lagrange is a renowned Belgian photographer known for his evocative and sensual imagery. His work often explores themes of beauty, luxury, and intimacy, capturing the essence of his subjects with a unique blend of elegance and mystery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome, photographic, and intensely portrait-focused, with sculptural faces, controlled studio compositions, and strong tonal separation. Elaborate clothing, veils, floral accessories, and the crow create a dark, theatrical fashion-editorial mood against sparse neutral backdrops."},{"id":"alexandre-cabanel","name":"Alexandre Cabanel","cat":"painters","en":"Alexandre Cabanel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexandre-cabanel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexandre-cabanel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-brown","muted-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Alexandre Cabanel was a prominent French painter of the 19th century, known for his academic style and contributions to the Salon art exhibitions. He was celebrated for his mythological and historical subjects, often depicting idealized beauty and elegance. Cabanel's work is characterized by meticulous attention to detail, smooth brushwork, and a harmonious color palette, which made him a leading figure in the academic art movement.","observation":"Across the sheet, the style uses richly layered, visibly painted surfaces with fine brushwork, carefully modeled faces, and densely ornamented fabrics and accessories. Close-cropped figures are arranged in intimate, expressive groupings against dark grounds, with restrained jewel tones and warm highlights creating a classical, dramatic atmosphere."},{"id":"michael-breitung","name":"Michael Breitung","cat":"photographers","en":"Michael Breitung","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-breitung.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-breitung","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","muted-blue","light-blue","red"],"intro":"Michael Breitung is a contemporary photographer known for his captivating landscape photography. His work often features stunning natural scenes, capturing the beauty and majesty of the environment with a keen eye for detail and composition. Breitung's photography is characterized by its use of light and shadow, creating images that are both dramatic and serene.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is photographic and cinematic, built around carefully composed landscapes with strong leading lines, expansive water, and dramatic skies. Cool subdued tones and moody shadows dominate, while sunset, lamps, and reflected light provide controlled warm glow; mist, softened distance, and long-exposure-like water add atmosphere."},{"id":"frank-bramley","name":"Frank Bramley","cat":"painters","en":"Frank Bramley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-bramley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-bramley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","deep-red","red"],"intro":"Frank Bramley was an English painter associated with the Newlyn School, known for his genre paintings and use of natural light. Born in 1857, Bramley studied at the Lincoln School of Art and the Royal Academy of Fine Arts in Antwerp. His works often depicted domestic scenes and were characterized by their attention to detail and atmospheric quality.","observation":"Across all four scenes, recognizable figures and social settings are rendered with visible, broad, directional brushwork and richly built-up paint. Strong light-dark contrasts, muted earth tones with selective red and white accents, and lively gestural marks create an expressive, atmospheric realism."},{"id":"phil-jimenez","name":"Phil Jimenez","cat":"illustrators","en":"Phil Jimenez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/phil-jimenez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/phil-jimenez","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","brown","orange","dark-brown","red","bone-white"],"intro":"Phil Jimenez is a renowned American comic book artist and writer, known for his work on titles such as \"Wonder Woman\" and \"The Invisibles.\" His style is characterized by detailed line work and dynamic compositions, often featuring strong, heroic characters. Jimenez has contributed significantly to the comic book industry, earning acclaim for his intricate and expressive illustrations.","observation":"The style is densely packed comic-book illustration, built from forceful black contour lines, ink-like hatching, sharp facial features, and layered costume and armor details. Saturated reds, blues, oranges, and golds are pushed against deep shadows, while expressive poses and close-up portraits create a dramatic, energetic ensemble presentation."},{"id":"william-mortensen","name":"William Mortensen","cat":"photographers","en":"William Mortensen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-mortensen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-mortensen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"William Mortensen was an American photographer known for his controversial and imaginative work during the early to mid-20th century. He was often associated with the pictorialist movement and was known for his use of elaborate sets, costumes, and themes that drew from mythology, fantasy, and the occult. Mortensen's work was characterized by its dramatic lighting, surreal compositions, and a painterly quality that set him apart from his contemporaries.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses stark monochrome portraiture with theatrical poses, sculpted facial anatomy, deep shadows, and sharply illuminated skin and fabric. Grain, distressed texture, rocky settings, and stark black negative areas give the scenes a bleak, surreal, classically dramatic character."},{"id":"aline-kominsky-crumb","name":"Aline Kominsky-Crumb","cat":"illustrators","en":"Aline Kominsky-Crumb","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aline-kominsky-crumb.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aline-kominsky-crumb","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","comics","drawing"],"colours":["white","silver","brown","black","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Aline Kominsky-Crumb is an American cartoonist and illustrator, best known for her autobiographical comics which explore themes of feminism, sexuality, and female identity. Born in 1948 in Long Island, New York, Kominsky-Crumb began her career in the underground comix movement of the 1970s. She was a founding member of the all-female comic book collective Wimmen's Comix and later collaborated with her husband, the renowned cartoonist Robert Crumb , on a series of comics including Dirty Laundry Comics and Self-Loathing Comics. Kominsky-Crumb's work is characterized by its raw, confessional style and its unflinching exploration of the complexities of her personal life. Her alter ego, \"The Bunch,\" often serves as the protagonist of her stories, allowing her to examine her experiences as a woman, wife, and mother with humor and honesty. In addition to her work in comics, Kominsky-Crumb has also worked as an illustrator for various publications and has exhibited her artwork in galleries around the world. One of her most notable works is the graphic memoir Need More Love: A Graphic Memoir, which was published in 2007. The book chronicles her life from her childhood in the 1950s to her experiences in the counterculture movement of the 1960s and 1970s, and her subsequent career as an artist. Kominsky-Crumb's contribution to the field of comics and graphic novels has been recognized with numerous awards, including the Inkpot Award and the Harvey Award for Best Inker. Her work continues to be influential in the world of alternative comics and graphic storytelling.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed illustrative drawing with delicate black contours, dense crosshatching, and expressive facial features. Most panels are monochrome, while occasional clothing and background accents use vivid flat color; the images combine portrait closeups with lively, comic-like narrative scenes."},{"id":"beeple","name":"Beeple","cat":"various-artists","en":"Beeple","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/beeple.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/beeple","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","sci-fi"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","brown","muted-blue","red","light-red"],"intro":"Beeple is a digital artist known for his prolific work in the field of digital art and NFTs. He gained widespread recognition for his \"Everydays\" project, where he created a piece of digital art every day for over a decade. His work often explores themes of technology, society, and the future, blending elements of science fiction and surrealism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic, realistic environments with monumental architecture, tiny human figures, and strong atmospheric depth. A restrained teal-and-red palette, luminous vertical accents, heavy clouds, mist, and deep shadows create a dramatic science-fiction mood with carefully composed vast landscapes."},{"id":"david-palumbo","name":"David Palumbo","cat":"illustrators","en":"David Palumbo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-palumbo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-palumbo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","muted-orange","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"David Palumbo is a contemporary American illustrator known for his work in fantasy and science fiction genres. His art often features rich, detailed compositions with a focus on narrative and emotion. Palumbo's illustrations have been featured in various publications, including book covers and galleries, showcasing his ability to blend realism with imaginative themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible oil-like brushwork to build highly detailed, expressive character portraits. Deep shadows and subdued earth tones dominate, punctuated by strong reds and warm flesh tones, while tightly cropped groupings, period clothing, and intense gazes create a dark, dramatic mood."},{"id":"daryl-cagle","name":"Daryl Cagle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Daryl Cagle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daryl-cagle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daryl-cagle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","silver","grey","charcoal","black","red"],"intro":"Daryl Cagle is an American editorial cartoonist known for his work in political satire and commentary. He has contributed to numerous publications and is recognized for his distinctive style that combines humor with incisive social critique.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed pen-and-ink drawing with fine contour lines, crosshatched shading, and occasional restrained washes of color. It emphasizes expressive caricatural portraits and character groupings, exaggerating facial features and gestures while leaving the paper largely open around the figures."},{"id":"naomi-okubo","name":"Naomi Okubo","cat":"painters","en":"Naomi Okubo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/naomi-okubo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/naomi-okubo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-green","beige","orange","green","blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Naomi Okubo is a contemporary Japanese artist known for her vibrant and intricate paintings that often explore themes of identity and self-perception. Her work is characterized by a unique blend of traditional Japanese aesthetics and modern surrealism, creating a distinctive visual language that captivates viewers.","observation":"The style combines visible painterly brushwork with crisp illustrative contours, densely layering people, plants, furniture, textiles, and domestic objects. Saturated reds, blues, greens, pinks, and oranges, together with abundant floral and geometric patterns, create an ornate, exuberant indoor-garden atmosphere across all four scenes."},{"id":"anatoly-metlan","name":"Anatoly Metlan","cat":"painters","en":"Anatoly Metlan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anatoly-metlan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anatoly-metlan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-brown","brown","grey","pale-orange","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Anatoly Metlan is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and expressive paintings, often depicting scenes of leisure and beauty. His work is characterized by a rich use of color and dynamic compositions that capture moments of elegance and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vivid, sunlit color and visible directional brushwork to build richly textured coastal scenes. Elegant figures in flowing dresses and wide-brimmed hats are integrated with harbors, terraces, villas, flowers, and reflective water through expressive, painterly detail."},{"id":"greg-manchess","name":"Greg Manchess","cat":"illustrators","en":"Greg Manchess","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-manchess.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-manchess","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","pale-yellow","beige","red"],"intro":"Greg Manchess is a renowned American illustrator known for his dynamic and expressive paintings. His work often features bold, cinematic compositions and a painterly style that captures the essence of narrative illustration. Manchess's art has been widely recognized in the fields of publishing, advertising, and film, showcasing his ability to blend realism with imaginative storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly worked paint with energetic, directional strokes, strongly modelled figures, and dense, dramatic scenes. Dark earthy colors are punctuated by red, cream, and torchlit highlights, while theatrical poses, sweeping diagonals, and rugged environments create an epic, emotionally charged atmosphere."},{"id":"affandi","name":"Affandi","cat":"painters","en":"Affandi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/affandi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/affandi","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-brown","beige","red","ochre"],"intro":"Affandi was an influential Indonesian painter known for his expressive and emotional style, often associated with expressionism. His works are characterized by bold, sweeping brushstrokes and vibrant colors, capturing the essence of human emotion and experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable faces and figures are built from thick, highly visible paint strokes, scraped textures, and forceful dark linear marks. Saturated orange, green, yellow, white, and black create a high-contrast palette, while distorted features and turbulent gestures give the portraits an intense, surreal character."},{"id":"art-frahm","name":"Art Frahm","cat":"illustrators","en":"Art Frahm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/art-frahm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/art-frahm","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","ochre","muted-cyan","pale-yellow","rust"],"intro":"Art Frahm was an American commercial artist known for his pin-up paintings and advertising illustrations during the mid-20th century. His work often featured glamorous, idealized women in playful and humorous situations, capturing the spirit of 1950s Americana. Frahm's illustrations were widely popular and contributed to the visual culture of the post-war era, blending elements of fantasy and everyday life.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses visible, directional oil-paint strokes to render glamorous female figures with carefully modeled faces, hair, clothing, and props. Saturated reds, greens, and blues, strong light-dark separation, theatrical poses, and vintage domestic or leisure settings create a polished mid-century advertising-illustration feel."},{"id":"thierry-duval","name":"Thierry Duval","cat":"painters","en":"Thierry Duval","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thierry-duval.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thierry-duval","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","brown","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Thierry Duval is a contemporary French watercolor artist known for his detailed and atmospheric depictions of urban landscapes, particularly those of Paris. His work captures the essence of the city with a focus on light, reflection, and architectural beauty, often portraying scenes in a romantic and nostalgic manner.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents richly detailed Parisian cityscapes with painterly textures, softened atmospheric distance, and cinematic perspective. Cool dusk tones contrast with warm windows and streetlights, while rain-slick surfaces, reflective water, and monumental architecture create a moody, luminous urban atmosphere."},{"id":"igor-zenin","name":"Igor Zenin","cat":"photographers","en":"Igor Zenin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/igor-zenin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/igor-zenin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","black","dark-ochre","dark-red","muted-ochre","ochre"],"intro":"Igor Zenin is a photographer known for his evocative and atmospheric landscape photography, often characterized by a dreamy and surreal quality. His work frequently explores themes of nature, solitude, and reflection, capturing the essence of the natural world with a unique artistic vision.","observation":"The style uses realistic, richly detailed landscape imagery with atmospheric autumn palettes, soft mist, reflective water, and strong warm-to-cool tonal contrasts. Dramatic backlit skies, glowing horizons, and framing tree branches give the scenes a cinematic, dreamy stillness while retaining naturalistic detail."},{"id":"peter-jackson","name":"Peter Jackson","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Peter Jackson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-jackson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-jackson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","glow","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","beige","bone-white","muted-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Peter Jackson is a renowned filmmaker from New Zealand, best known for directing the epic ' The Lord of the Rings ' and 'The Hobbit' film trilogies. His work is characterized by its grand scale, intricate storytelling, and pioneering visual effects, which have significantly influenced the fantasy genre in cinema.","observation":"Across the portraits, interiors, and woodland setting, the style uses visibly worked paint, dense textural detail, and expressive faces with a restrained, earthy palette. Warm interior lights and small glowing lamps contrast with deep shadows, while the recurring storybook environments and figures create a dreamy fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"marc-chagall","name":"Marc Chagall","cat":"painters","en":"Marc Chagall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-chagall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-chagall","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-blue","grey","light-orange","muted-olive","red"],"intro":"Marc Chagall was a Russian-French artist known for his unique style that combined elements of Cubism , Symbolism, and Fauvism. Born in Belarus, Chagall's work often reflected his Jewish heritage and Eastern European roots. His paintings are characterized by dreamlike imagery, vibrant colors, and a whimsical, almost childlike quality. Chagall's art often explores themes of love, nostalgia, and fantasy, making use of symbolic and surreal elements.","observation":"The style combines heavily visible, broad paint strokes with fine dark contour drawing, producing richly textured yet readable figures, animals, foliage, and landscapes. Saturated blues, reds, greens, and whites heighten the expressive movement of the repeated outdoor scenes and animated poses."},{"id":"mick-rock","name":"Mick Rock","cat":"photographers","en":"Mick Rock","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mick-rock.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mick-rock","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["dark-red","black","rust","bone-white","dark-olive"],"intro":"Mick Rock is a renowned British photographer, celebrated for his iconic images of rock music legends from the 1970s. Known as \"The Man Who Shot the Seventies,\" Rock captured the essence of the glam rock era, photographing artists like David Bowie, Lou Reed, and Iggy Pop. His work is characterized by its vibrant colors, dynamic compositions, and the ability to convey the energy and charisma of his subjects.","observation":"The style is a highly detailed, realistic portrait treatment built around confrontational close-ups, vivid red and green accents, elaborate makeup, teased hair, jewelry, patterned garments, and theatrical styling. Strong contrast, direct gazes, tight cropping, and visible grain give the images a raw cinematic fashion-editorial intensity with a retro feel."},{"id":"ralph-rucci","name":"Ralph Rucci","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Ralph Rucci","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ralph-rucci.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ralph-rucci","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","moody-colors","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","dark-red","beige","brown"],"intro":"Ralph Rucci is an American fashion designer known for his luxurious and meticulously crafted couture garments. He has gained acclaim for his innovative designs that blend traditional techniques with modern aesthetics, often drawing inspiration from art and architecture. Rucci's work is characterized by its attention to detail, sophisticated silhouettes, and the use of high-quality materials.","observation":"The style combines realistic editorial fashion photography with sculptural, floor-length garments, severe silhouettes, and dramatic flowing fabric. Restrained studio settings and generous negative space emphasize the models and clothing, while black, red, and earthy tones create a moody, high-fashion atmosphere."},{"id":"jean-philippe-delhomme","name":"Jean-Philippe Delhomme","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jean-Philippe Delhomme","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-philippe-delhomme.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-philippe-delhomme","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","red","blue"],"intro":"Jean-Philippe Delhomme is a contemporary French artist and illustrator known for his vibrant and expressive works that often capture the essence of modern life and culture. His art is characterized by a painterly style that combines elements of realism and abstraction, often depicting scenes of leisure and everyday interactions.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable urban and figurative scenes are built from vigorous, visible paint strokes with roughly sketched fine contours and broad blocks of color. The style combines saturated coral, blue, and green accents with darker atmospheric passages, simplifying people, architecture, vegetation, and vehicles into expressive, gestural forms."},{"id":"felicien-rops","name":"Felicien Rops","cat":"painters","en":"Felicien Rops","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/felicien-rops.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/felicien-rops","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","pale-orange","black","beige","charcoal"],"intro":"Felicien Rops was a Belgian artist known for his etchings and illustrations that often explored themes of eroticism, symbolism, and the macabre. Born in 1833, Rops was a prominent figure in the Symbolist movement and was renowned for his ability to blend the grotesque with the beautiful, often challenging societal norms through his provocative and detailed works.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive, highly worked drawing with visible ink-like lines, dense hatching, and painterly tonal buildup. Restrained sepia, brown, cream, and black tones create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere around posed figures in theatrical interior scenes and period clothing."},{"id":"paolo-roversi","name":"Paolo Roversi","cat":"photographers","en":"Paolo Roversi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paolo-roversi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paolo-roversi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Paolo Roversi is an acclaimed Italian fashion photographer known for his ethereal and romantic imagery. His work often features a dreamy quality, blending classical beauty with a modern sensibility. Roversi has worked with numerous high-profile fashion magazines and brands, capturing the essence of elegance and mystery in his portraits.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style is an atmospheric editorial fashion treatment with realistic faces, elaborate dark garments, and restrained blue-gray, black, and cream tones. Strong tonal separation, generous plain backdrop, selective focus, and visible grain create a moody, cinematic studio look."},{"id":"carolina-herrera","name":"Carolina Herrera","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Carolina Herrera","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carolina-herrera.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carolina-herrera","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["white","grey","dark-blue","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Carolina Herrera is a renowned Venezuelan-American fashion designer known for her elegant and sophisticated designs. She established her fashion house in 1980 and quickly became famous for her chic and timeless collections, often featuring luxurious fabrics and refined silhouettes. Her work has been worn by numerous celebrities and public figures, solidifying her status as a leading figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"These fashion illustrations combine recognizable runway figures with expressive, visibly brushed paint and delicate rendering of faces, fabric, and garment construction. The style favors dramatic couture silhouettes, patterned textiles, and strong color accents against mostly clean, pale backgrounds, with loose fine brushwork defining the clothing and pose."},{"id":"douglas-kirkland","name":"Douglas Kirkland","cat":"photographers","en":"Douglas Kirkland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/douglas-kirkland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/douglas-kirkland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","deep-red","bone-white","muted-orange","rust","brown"],"intro":"Douglas Kirkland is a renowned photographer known for his iconic portraits of celebrities and his work in the film industry. His career spans several decades, during which he has captured some of the most famous faces in Hollywood, contributing significantly to the world of photography with his unique style and approach.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and sharply detailed, using close, tightly cropped portrait compositions with strong contrast and dark negative space. Saturated red fabric, black surroundings, tactile textiles, and expressive faces create a dramatic editorial mood, while the controlled lighting and selective focus give the images a cinematic fashion-photography finish."},{"id":"karen-knorr","name":"Karen Knorr","cat":"photographers","en":"Karen Knorr","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karen-knorr.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karen-knorr","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","grey","charcoal","black","silver","orange"],"intro":"Karen Knorr is a renowned photographer known for her work that explores themes of cultural heritage, power, and identity. Her photography often features opulent interiors and exotic animals, creating a dialogue between tradition and modernity. Knorr's work has been exhibited internationally and is celebrated for its intricate compositions and thought-provoking narratives.","observation":"The style uses realistic, richly detailed interiors with aged turquoise surfaces, carved architectural ornament, chandeliers, antique furnishings, and dramatic patterned floors. Large animals are placed in these grand, deserted rooms, creating a dark, dreamy, cinematic contrast between decaying luxury and quiet surreal presence."},{"id":"agathe-sorlet","name":"Agathe Sorlet","cat":"various-artists","en":"Agathe Sorlet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/agathe-sorlet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/agathe-sorlet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","fashion","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","pale-red","vivid-red","muted-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Agathe Sorlet is a contemporary French artist known for her minimalist and bold illustrations that often explore themes of love, intimacy, and human connection. Her work is characterized by its use of flat colors, simple lines, and a playful yet contemplative mood.","observation":"The style uses graphic, flat-color illustration with thick black contour lines, simplified facial features, and sharply cropped character compositions. A vivid red, blue, black, and pale-pink palette, angular geometry, and fashion-editorial clothing create a bold retro comic sensibility across portraits, interiors, and social scenes."},{"id":"frederick-hammersley","name":"Frederick Hammersley","cat":"painters","en":"Frederick Hammersley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederick-hammersley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederick-hammersley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","illustrative","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","bone-white","pale-orange","ochre","dark-brown"],"intro":"Frederick Hammersley is an American painter known for his contributions to abstract and geometric art. Born in 1919, he became a significant figure in the hard-edge painting movement, which emphasized clear, precise forms and vibrant color contrasts. Hammersley's work often explored the interplay between geometric shapes and color, creating a sense of rhythm and balance.","observation":"The style uses abstract geometric compositions built from large circles, arcs, rectangles, and sharply bounded color fields. Saturated orange, black, cream, green, blue, and brown are arranged in bold, mostly flat shapes, while subtle canvas texture and framed presentation add a tactile painted quality."},{"id":"matteo-massagrande","name":"Matteo Massagrande","cat":"painters","en":"Matteo Massagrande","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matteo-massagrande.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matteo-massagrande","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Matteo Massagrande is an Italian painter known for his detailed and atmospheric depictions of architectural interiors. His work often explores themes of time, memory, and decay, capturing the beauty of abandoned spaces with a meticulous attention to detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents richly observed, abandoned architectural interiors with peeling plaster, aged wood, climbing vegetation, and strong shafts of sunlight. Visible brushwork and textured surfaces combine realistic spatial detail with a subdued, shadow-heavy palette and sharply contrasted illuminated areas."},{"id":"glen-orbik","name":"Glen Orbik","cat":"illustrators","en":"Glen Orbik","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/glen-orbik.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/glen-orbik","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","orange"],"intro":"Glen Orbik was an American illustrator known for his work in comic book covers and pulp fiction art. His style is characterized by a strong sense of realism and dramatic composition, often depicting scenes with a cinematic flair. Orbik's illustrations are noted for their detailed rendering and use of light and shadow to create mood and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint to depict expressive figures and narrative character scenes. Muted ochres, browns, teal, and near-black shadows create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while close cropping, aged faces, and carefully rendered antique props give the images a classical, portrait-oriented gravity."},{"id":"anila-quayyum-agha","name":"Anila Quayyum Agha","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Anila Quayyum Agha","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anila-quayyum-agha.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anila-quayyum-agha","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","scenes","glow","subdued-colors","cinematic","religious","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Anila Quayyum Agha is a contemporary artist known for her intricate and thought-provoking installations that explore cultural, social, and gender issues. Her work often incorporates elements of Islamic art and architecture, reflecting her South Asian heritage. Agha's installations are celebrated for their ability to transform spaces through the use of light and shadow, creating immersive experiences that invite contemplation and introspection.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic architectural interiors built from dense geometric latticework, carved ornament, arches, and repeating rectangular perspectives. Warm subdued earth tones and luminous lanterns or screened openings cast intricate patterned shadows across reflective floors, with small robed figures emphasizing the scale and contemplative atmosphere."},{"id":"iris-van-herpen","name":"Iris van Herpen","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Iris van Herpen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/iris-van-herpen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/iris-van-herpen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-orange","silver","beige"],"intro":"Iris van Herpen is a Dutch fashion designer known for her innovative and avant-garde designs that blend technology and craftsmanship. She is celebrated for her use of 3D printing and laser cutting, creating garments that often resemble wearable sculptures. Her work is characterized by its futuristic and ethereal qualities, pushing the boundaries of traditional fashion design.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic fashion portraits centred on elaborate, sculptural garments built from countless fine, ribbed and lattice-like layers. Pale ivory and translucent materials stand out against a dark, softly blurred runway or exhibition setting, creating an ornate, surreal and dreamlike atmosphere with shallow focus."},{"id":"joan-snyder","name":"Joan Snyder","cat":"painters","en":"Joan Snyder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joan-snyder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joan-snyder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-orange","red","muted-brown","ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"Joan Snyder is an American painter known for her contributions to the feminist art movement and her expressive, abstract works. Born in 1940, Snyder's art often incorporates themes of nature, emotion, and personal narrative, using vibrant colors and dynamic compositions. Her work is characterized by a painterly style with bold brushstrokes and a focus on texture and layering.","observation":"Across all four works, saturated pinks, oranges, reds, blues, greens, and yellows are layered through broad painted masses, drips, splatters, and dense fine scribbles. The compositions remain nonrepresentational, combining energetic gestural movement with recurring outlined fragments, looping marks, and partially geometric color blocks on pale grounds."},{"id":"william-blake","name":"William Blake","cat":"painters","en":"William Blake","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-blake.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-blake","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","crosshatching","fine-lines","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-brown","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"William Blake was an English poet, painter, and printmaker, born in 1757, who is considered a seminal figure in the history of both the poetry and visual arts of the Romantic Age. Known for his expressive and mystical works, Blake's art often explored religious themes and visions, blending his unique style with intricate symbolism and imaginative subjects.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines dense, finely hatched drawing with ink-like contour work, textured surfaces, and strongly expressive distortions. Dark, mythic scenes use near-black grounds, fiery orange accents, giant eyes and demonic faces, while elaborate landscapes and figures are packed with engraved-looking detail."},{"id":"dave-coverly","name":"Dave Coverly","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dave Coverly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dave-coverly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dave-coverly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["silver","muted-ochre","dark-ochre","black","light-orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Dave Coverly is a well-known American cartoonist, celebrated for his syndicated comic strip \"Speed Bump.\" His work is characterized by a humorous and often whimsical take on everyday life, blending wit with a distinct illustrative style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses finely inked outlines, dense crosshatching, and carefully layered illustrative detail to depict whimsical encounters between people, dinosaurs, and strange objects. Restrained earthy and blue-green colors, storybook framing, and surreal juxtapositions give the scenes a nostalgic, fantastical comic-illustration character."},{"id":"davide-sorrenti","name":"Davide Sorrenti","cat":"photographers","en":"Davide Sorrenti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/davide-sorrenti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/davide-sorrenti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","realistic","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","white","silver"],"intro":"Davide Sorrenti was an influential photographer known for his work in the 1990s fashion scene, particularly associated with the 'heroin chic' aesthetic. His photography captured the raw and gritty aspects of youth culture, often focusing on intimate and emotional portraits.","observation":"The style is built from intensely cropped, realistic portrait photography with expressive faces, wet or windblown hair, visible skin texture, and direct, confrontational gazes. It alternates stark black-and-white treatment with a restrained teal-toned color image, using strong contrast, shadow, grain, and shallow focus for a raw, intimate editorial effect."},{"id":"marc-jacobs","name":"Marc Jacobs","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Marc Jacobs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-jacobs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-jacobs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","pink","beige","brown","white","red"],"intro":"Marc Jacobs is a renowned American fashion designer known for his influential and innovative contributions to the fashion industry. He has served as the creative director for several high-profile brands and is celebrated for his unique style that blends classic elegance with contemporary flair. His work often features bold colors, intricate patterns, and a playful yet sophisticated aesthetic that has garnered a global following.","observation":"The style combines highly saturated pinks, reds, blacks, and occasional pastel tones with dense, flamboyant fashion detailing. It shifts between cinematic runway and backstage photography and graphic fashion illustration, emphasizing expressive faces, oversized accessories, layered patterns, textured garments, and assertive silhouettes."},{"id":"raoul-dufy","name":"Raoul Dufy","cat":"painters","en":"Raoul Dufy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raoul-dufy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raoul-dufy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["blue","deep-blue","grey","light-red","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Raoul Dufy was a French Fauvist painter known for his vibrant use of color and depictions of leisure activities and coastal scenes. His work often captures the lively atmosphere of the French Riviera, combining elements of Fauvism and Post- Impressionism to create a unique, expressive style.","observation":"Across all four panels, recognizable coastal cities, waterways, boats, landmarks, vegetation, and street life are rendered with energetic, visible brushwork and loose fine-line accents. Strong blue, coral, pink, and ochre passages create a vivid unified palette, while overlapping architectural and nautical details give the compositions a lively, densely illustrated character."},{"id":"leo-putz","name":"Leo Putz","cat":"painters","en":"Leo Putz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leo-putz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leo-putz","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-brown","pale-yellow","orange"],"intro":"Leo Putz was an Austrian-German painter known for his contributions to Impressionism and Art Nouveau. Born in 1869, Putz was a prominent figure in the Munich Secession movement and was celebrated for his vibrant use of color and dynamic compositions. His works often depicted serene landscapes, intimate portraits, and scenes of everyday life, characterized by a painterly style and a keen interest in light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible directional brushwork and built-up paint to depict expressive female figures in richly furnished interior settings. Muted warm and dark colors are punctuated by strong light-dark contrasts, with carefully observed faces, clothing, hats, gestures, and intimate social situations arranged like polished painted portraits and vignettes."},{"id":"collier-schorr","name":"Collier Schorr","cat":"photographers","en":"Collier Schorr","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/collier-schorr.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/collier-schorr","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","symmetry"],"colours":["white","black","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Collier Schorr is an American photographer known for her work that often explores themes of identity, gender, and youth culture. Her photography is characterized by a blend of documentary and staged elements, capturing intimate and often provocative portraits that challenge conventional notions of beauty and identity.","observation":"The style is a stark, realistic studio portrait treatment built around tightly cropped, frontal faces and near-symmetrical compositions. Predominantly monochrome imagery, high contrast, plain backgrounds, dark clothing, direct gazes, and finely rendered skin and hair texture create a restrained editorial fashion look."},{"id":"carol-hagan","name":"Carol Hagan","cat":"painters","en":"Carol Hagan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carol-hagan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carol-hagan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","light-orange","muted-blue","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Carol Hagan is a contemporary American artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings, often depicting wildlife and western themes. Her work is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a painterly style that captures the essence of her subjects with emotion and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly built-up, directional paint strokes to depict birds, foliage, flowers, and still-life objects with energetic, expressive handling. Saturated oranges, reds, blues, and greens are set against deep shadows and bright highlights, while close cropping and layered brushwork give the scenes a rich, tactile intensity."},{"id":"ami-james","name":"Ami James","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ami James","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ami-james.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ami-james","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","charcoal","muted-orange","silver","red"],"intro":"Ami James is a renowned tattoo artist known for his bold and intricate designs. He gained fame through his appearances on reality TV shows focused on tattoo artistry, where his skill and distinctive style were showcased to a wide audience. James is recognized for his contributions to the tattoo industry and his ability to blend traditional and modern elements in his work.","observation":"The style combines realistic close-up photography with highly detailed illustrative tattoo designs, defined by crisp black contour lines, dense ornamental imagery, and saturated red, teal, blue, and orange accents. Portraits and body details are framed tightly, with selective focus and strong contrast emphasizing the tattoos as bold, layered compositions on skin."},{"id":"laurent-baheux","name":"Laurent Baheux","cat":"photographers","en":"Laurent Baheux","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laurent-baheux.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laurent-baheux","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["grey","silver","black","white","charcoal"],"intro":"Laurent Baheux is a renowned French photographer known for his striking black and white wildlife photography. His work often highlights the beauty and majesty of animals in their natural habitats, with a focus on conservation and environmental awareness.","observation":"The style uses realistic monochrome wildlife photography with strong tonal contrast, dramatic skies, and expansive savanna horizons. Animals are rendered with abundant natural texture, selective focus, atmospheric distance, and occasional silhouettes or rim lighting that create a cinematic sense of scale."},{"id":"cath-kidston","name":"Cath Kidston","cat":"designers","en":"Cath Kidston","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cath-kidston.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cath-kidston","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","fine-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","red","bone-white","muted-olive","olive","light-orange"],"intro":"Cath Kidston is a British designer known for her distinctive floral patterns and vintage-inspired homeware and fashion items. Her designs often feature bright, cheerful colors and nostalgic motifs, drawing inspiration from the English countryside and traditional British aesthetics.","observation":"A richly decorative floral pattern spreads bouquets and trailing stems across a pale blue ground, balancing dense flower clusters with generous open space. Saturated reds, pinks, creams, and leafy greens are rendered with visible painterly strokes, layered petal detail, and clean illustrative shapes."},{"id":"louis-sullivan","name":"Louis Sullivan","cat":"architects","en":"Louis Sullivan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-sullivan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-sullivan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","subdued-colors","classical","religious","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","black","dark-brown","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Louis Sullivan was an influential American architect, often referred to as the \"father of skyscrapers\" and \"father of modernism.\" He played a pivotal role in the development of architectural design in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, particularly in the Chicago School movement. Sullivan is renowned for his philosophy of \"form follows function\" and his richly ornamented facades that combine organic and geometric forms.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents densely carved architectural surfaces with layered foliage, rosettes, tracery, arches, and radial ornament. The restrained stone palette, strong axial organization, realistic depth, and crisp sculptural modelling make the imagery feel like detailed documentation of ornate sacred architecture."},{"id":"bert-stern","name":"Bert Stern","cat":"photographers","en":"Bert Stern","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bert-stern.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bert-stern","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","motion","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["white","vivid-red","dark-green","green","dark-red","muted-orange"],"intro":"Bert Stern was an influential American photographer known for his iconic portraits of celebrities and fashion photography. His work is characterized by a bold, glamorous style that captured the essence of 1960s fashion and culture.","observation":"The style uses realistic editorial photography with low-angle portrait framing, vivid garment colors, and expansive pale negative space. Wind-swept fabric and hair create a strong sense of motion, while dramatic cropping and sculptural clothing make the fashion presentation feel energetic and theatrical."},{"id":"chris-claremont","name":"Chris Claremont","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris Claremont","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-claremont.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-claremont","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","beige","orange","ochre"],"intro":"Chris Claremont is a renowned comic book writer, best known for his influential work on the X-Men series for Marvel Comics. His storytelling and character development have left a lasting impact on the comic book industry, making him a pivotal figure in the superhero genre.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, sharply detailed portrait photography with vivid colors, strong light-dark contrast, and selective background blur. Close framing, direct gazes, expressive facial texture, and saturated comic-book surroundings create an intense yet polished editorial portrait look."},{"id":"utagawa-hiroshige","name":"Utagawa Hiroshige","cat":"printmakers","en":"Utagawa Hiroshige","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/utagawa-hiroshige.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/utagawa-hiroshige","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","floral","landscapes","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","retro","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","pale-orange","muted-cyan","orange","beige"],"intro":"Utagawa Hiroshige was a renowned Japanese ukiyo-e artist, celebrated for his landscape prints and depictions of everyday life during the Edo period. His works are characterized by their innovative compositions, delicate color palettes, and a profound sense of tranquility and beauty, capturing the essence of Japanese culture and nature.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses crisp fine outlines, flat layered color, and dense engraved mark-making to depict expansive Japanese landscapes. Muted blue-green, salmon, cream, and charcoal tones combine with strong dark silhouettes, decorative cartouches, cherry blossoms, pine trees, and carefully tiered mountains and water."},{"id":"bjarne-melgaard","name":"Bjarne Melgaard","cat":"painters","en":"Bjarne Melgaard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bjarne-melgaard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bjarne-melgaard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["red","bone-white","grey","black","ochre","yellow","dark-blue","green"],"intro":"Bjarne Melgaard is a contemporary Norwegian artist known for his provocative and expressive works that often explore themes of identity, sexuality, and the human condition. His art is characterized by a raw and unfiltered approach, often incorporating elements of pop culture and subversive imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is intensely painterly and gestural, combining thick, visible brushstrokes with loose black linework, drips, scratches, and layered splashes. Saturated pinks, oranges, turquoise, red, and yellow dominate semi-abstract compositions that mix fragmented figures, eyes, faces, and graphic marks with a raw gallery-installation atmosphere."},{"id":"red-grooms","name":"Red Grooms","cat":"various-artists","en":"Red Grooms","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/red-grooms.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/red-grooms","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","epic","geometric"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","grey","red","black","ochre"],"intro":"Red Grooms is an American multimedia artist known for his colorful and humorous depictions of modern life. His work often incorporates elements of pop art and is characterized by its playful and satirical nature. Grooms's art spans various mediums, including painting, sculpture, and installation, and is celebrated for its vibrant energy and unique storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly built-up paint and rough, directional brushwork with dense collage-like assemblages of fabric, cardboard, paper, and sculptural forms. Saturated reds, blues, yellows, and pinks fill crowded urban tableaux populated by theatrical characters, oversized faces, flags, vehicles, and sun or rainbow motifs, producing an energetic carnival-like intensity."},{"id":"quentin-tarantino","name":"Quentin Tarantino","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Quentin Tarantino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/quentin-tarantino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/quentin-tarantino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","red","dark-red","bone-white","orange","beige"],"intro":"Quentin Tarantino is a renowned American filmmaker known for his distinctive style that blends elements of violence, dark humor, and non-linear storytelling. His films often pay homage to various genres, including crime, action, and westerns, and are characterized by their sharp dialogue and eclectic soundtracks. Tarantino's work has left a significant impact on modern cinema, earning him numerous awards and a dedicated fanbase.","observation":"The style combines visibly brushed, layered paint with graphic heavy outlines, sharply modeled faces, and densely arranged character portraits. Saturated red, cream, black, and ochre dominate, producing high contrast and an emphatic retro poster-like presentation with recurring firearms, suits, hats, and sunglasses."},{"id":"robby-cavanaugh","name":"Robby Cavanaugh","cat":"photographers","en":"Robby Cavanaugh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robby-cavanaugh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robby-cavanaugh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","deep-red"],"intro":"Robby Cavanaugh is a contemporary photographer known for his surreal and conceptual imagery that often explores themes of identity and transformation. His work is characterized by a dreamlike quality, blending reality with fantasy to create evocative visual narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines intimate female portraiture with dark, dreamlike symbolism: birds, branches, veils, fabric, and overlapping faces merge into psychologically charged compositions. Richly textured brushwork, layered surfaces, muted earth tones, and deep shadows create a melancholy, surreal atmosphere while preserving expressive facial detail."},{"id":"faiza-maghni","name":"Faiza Maghni","cat":"painters","en":"Faiza Maghni","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/faiza-maghni.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/faiza-maghni","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","dark-red","muted-brown","black","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Faiza Maghni is an Algerian artist known for her vibrant and intricate paintings that often explore themes of femininity and cultural identity. Her work is characterized by a blend of traditional and contemporary elements, creating a unique visual language that resonates with a wide audience.","observation":"Across all four portraits, finely delineated faces, animals, flowers, textiles, and jewelry are packed into richly ornamental compositions. Saturated jewel tones and strong dark outlines create a highly decorative illustrative surface, while the unusual animal companions and elaborate botanical headdresses give the style a fantastical, dreamlike character."},{"id":"fabienne-rivory","name":"Fabienne Rivory","cat":"various-artists","en":"Fabienne Rivory","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fabienne-rivory.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fabienne-rivory","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","grey","black","charcoal","white","deep-red"],"intro":"Fabienne Rivory is a contemporary artist known for her unique approach to blending photography and painting, creating ethereal and introspective works that explore themes of identity and memory. Her work often involves the use of digital manipulation and collage techniques to merge the real with the imaginary, resulting in a dreamlike quality.","observation":"Across all four renders, cinematic compositions place small solitary figures within vast, misty coastal or architectural spaces, creating pronounced negative space and a strong sense of isolation. Muted blue-gray tones, deep blacks, and selective red accents produce a dark, dreamy atmosphere, while birds, fog, reflections, and monumental ruins add expressive visual drama."},{"id":"aristarkh-lentulov","name":"Aristarkh Lentulov","cat":"painters","en":"Aristarkh Lentulov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aristarkh-lentulov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aristarkh-lentulov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","religious","epic","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","charcoal","red","deep-red","blue"],"intro":"Aristarkh Lentulov was a prominent Russian avant-garde artist known for his vibrant and dynamic compositions. Born in 1882, Lentulov was a key figure in the Russian avant-garde movement, contributing significantly to the development of modern art in Russia. His works often feature bold colors and geometric forms, reflecting influences from Cubism and Fauvism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional brushwork to build dense architectural panoramas from angular, faceted forms. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and ochres create an energetic urban-religious atmosphere, with churches, domes, spires, stairways, and small crowds layered into complex scenes."},{"id":"aron-wiesenfeld","name":"Aron Wiesenfeld","cat":"painters","en":"Aron Wiesenfeld","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aron-wiesenfeld.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aron-wiesenfeld","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","charcoal","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Aron Wiesenfeld is a contemporary American artist known for his evocative and atmospheric paintings. His work often features solitary figures in expansive landscapes, capturing a sense of introspection and mystery. Wiesenfeld's paintings are characterized by their detailed and painterly style, with a focus on mood and narrative.","observation":"The style combines realistic portraiture with visible, finely worked brush texture and subdued, moody earth tones. Solitary figures are placed in windswept fields or beside dark water, with cinematic framing, soft atmospheric depth, and a dreamy, melancholic sense of isolation."},{"id":"xu-beihong","name":"Xu Beihong","cat":"painters","en":"Xu Beihong","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/xu-beihong.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/xu-beihong","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","beige"],"intro":"Xu Beihong is a renowned Chinese painter and educator, celebrated for his contributions to modern Chinese art. He is known for integrating Western techniques with traditional Chinese painting, creating a unique style that emphasizes realism and expressive brushwork. Xu Beihong's works often depict historical and cultural themes, capturing the essence of Chinese life and philosophy.","observation":"The style uses vigorous ink-and-wash painting with broad, visible brushstrokes, layered dark horses, and expressive gestures that emphasize speed and force. Restrained black, grey, beige, and muted rust tones sit against generous parchment-like negative space, with calligraphic marks and red seals reinforcing the traditional scroll presentation."},{"id":"stevan-dohanos","name":"Stevan Dohanos","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stevan Dohanos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stevan-dohanos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stevan-dohanos","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","dark-red","ochre","bone-white","blue"],"intro":"Stevan Dohanos was an American illustrator known for his work on the covers of the Saturday Evening Post and his contributions to American realism in art. His illustrations often depicted everyday life in mid-20th century America, capturing the essence of the era with a focus on detail and narrative.","observation":"These images use richly visible, fine painterly strokes to build crowded figurative scenes filled with expressive faces, clothing, foliage, and small props. Strong warm-versus-dark contrasts and vivid reds, greens, and blues give the compositions dramatic focus while retaining a polished illustrative clarity and classical compositional density."},{"id":"miho-hirano","name":"Miho Hirano","cat":"painters","en":"Miho Hirano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/miho-hirano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/miho-hirano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","pastel-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-red","beige","brown","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Miho Hirano is a contemporary Japanese artist known for her ethereal and dreamlike portraits that often feature young women intertwined with nature. Her work is characterized by delicate brushwork and a soft, pastel color palette, creating a serene and whimsical atmosphere.","observation":"This style combines intimate close-up portraits with dense floral arrangements, using delicate linework, fine visible brushstrokes, and softly blended pastel color. Intricate botanical detail, ornamental layering, and dreamlike compositions make the faces feel woven into the surrounding flowers rather than simply placed against them."},{"id":"jimmy-margulies","name":"Jimmy Margulies","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jimmy Margulies","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jimmy-margulies.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jimmy-margulies","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Jimmy Margulies is a renowned American editorial cartoonist known for his sharp wit and insightful commentary on political and social issues. His work has been featured in numerous publications, earning him accolades for his ability to blend humor with critical observation.","observation":"This style uses highly detailed black-and-white ink drawing, with fine contour lines, dense crosshatching, and selective gray washes to model faces, hair, clothing, and fur. Strong portrait likenesses are presented against generous white space, combining formal head-and-shoulder studies with an occasional densely arranged cluster of figures."},{"id":"guy-aitchison","name":"Guy Aitchison","cat":"illustrators","en":"Guy Aitchison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-aitchison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-aitchison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","muted-yellow","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Guy Aitchison is a renowned tattoo artist and painter known for his intricate and colorful designs. He has made significant contributions to the tattoo industry, particularly in the realm of biomechanical and organic forms. His work is characterized by a unique blend of surrealism and vivid detail, often incorporating elements of fantasy and science fiction.","observation":"Across all four renders, faces and figures dissolve into dense, organic swirls, tendrils, and coral-like textures, producing a consistently surreal and fantastical appearance. Rich saturated reds, teals, greens, and oranges are built from visibly layered, fine painterly strokes, with deep dark recesses and bright highlights creating intense expressive contrast."},{"id":"ian-mcque","name":"Ian McQue","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ian McQue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ian-mcque.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ian-mcque","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","charcoal","light-blue","blue","red","orange"],"intro":"Ian McQue is a renowned concept artist and illustrator known for his work in the video game and film industries. His distinctive style often features imaginative and futuristic themes, blending elements of science fiction and fantasy. McQue's work is characterized by its intricate mechanical designs and vibrant color palettes, which have made him a prominent figure in the world of concept art.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense improvised structures rise as monumental vertical forms, combining painterly texture with fine drawn construction lines and highly legible mechanical details. Strong blue, red, ochre, and black accents create vivid contrast, while small travelers and sparse atmospheric landscapes give the scenes a fantastical science-fiction narrative scale."},{"id":"alessandra-sanguinetti","name":"Alessandra Sanguinetti","cat":"photographers","en":"Alessandra Sanguinetti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alessandra-sanguinetti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alessandra-sanguinetti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","landscapes","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["black","silver","dark-olive","dark-red","muted-ochre","dark-brown"],"intro":"Alessandra Sanguinetti is an Argentine-American photographer known for her evocative and narrative-driven work. Her photography often explores themes of childhood, memory, and identity, capturing intimate and contemplative moments in rural settings. Sanguinetti's work is recognized for its emotional depth and rich storytelling, often focusing on the lives of women and children.","observation":"The style uses richly colored, filmic photography with carefully composed portraits and small narrative scenes set in rustic interiors and overgrown countryside. Weathered textures, floral garments, soft natural light, selective focus, and dreamlike juxtapositions give the images a nostalgic yet slightly surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"pierre-jeanneret","name":"Pierre Jeanneret","cat":"designers","en":"Pierre Jeanneret","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-jeanneret.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-jeanneret","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["silver","beige","dark-brown","brown","rust"],"intro":"Pierre Jeanneret was a Swiss architect and furniture designer, known for his collaborative work with his cousin Le Corbusier. He played a significant role in the design of the city of Chandigarh, India, where he created iconic furniture pieces that are celebrated for their simplicity and functionality.","observation":"The style presents carefully constructed wooden lounge chairs as realistic product imagery, with crisp geometry, visible joinery, woven cane, and richly rendered wood grain. Restrained earthy colors and strong directional light create pronounced shadows across a minimal studio floor and wall, while the repeated angular framing gives the furniture a graphic, structured presence."},{"id":"karl-lagerfeld","name":"Karl Lagerfeld","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Karl Lagerfeld","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karl-lagerfeld.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karl-lagerfeld","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","beige","bone-white","brown","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Karl Lagerfeld was a renowned German fashion designer, artist, and photographer, celebrated for his work with luxury fashion brands such as Chanel and Fendi. Known for his distinctive personal style, Lagerfeld was a pivotal figure in the fashion industry, influencing trends with his innovative designs and creative vision.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, editorial portrait photography with theatrical couture, oversized eyewear, elaborate feathers, flowers, and sharply tailored silhouettes. Strong contrast, sculptural architectural settings, and dense surface ornament create a grand, staged fashion tableau with a restrained black-white palette punctuated by vivid pink and orange."},{"id":"mario-buatta","name":"Mario Buatta","cat":"designers","en":"Mario Buatta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mario-buatta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mario-buatta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","floral","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","grey","dark-red","muted-orange","silver"],"intro":"Mario Buatta was a renowned American interior designer, often dubbed the \"Prince of Chintz\" for his distinctive use of floral patterns and traditional English style. He was known for his maximalist approach, blending vibrant colors, antique furnishings, and layered textures to create warm and inviting spaces that exuded opulence and charm.","observation":"The style presents richly decorated traditional interiors with realistic furnishings, elaborate moldings, floral fabrics, wallpaper, antiques, and abundant layered accessories. Saturated blue, coral, green, and pink accents, carefully arranged room scenes, and crisp illustrative rendering give the spaces a polished, opulent character."},{"id":"gilbert-stuart","name":"Gilbert Stuart","cat":"painters","en":"Gilbert Stuart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gilbert-stuart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gilbert-stuart","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","ochre","pale-orange"],"intro":"Gilbert Stuart was an American painter, renowned for his portraits of prominent figures in the late 18th and early 19th centuries. He is best known for his iconic depiction of George Washington, which has become a symbol of American history. Stuart's work is characterized by its realistic portrayal, attention to detail, and the ability to capture the personality and stature of his subjects.","observation":"The style presents formal head-and-shoulders portraits with convincing facial modeling, subdued warm browns, deep blacks, and softly illuminated skin. Visible brushwork and gently blended transitions give the images a traditional painted surface, while powdered wigs, white cravats, and restrained poses reinforce a classical historical portrait character."},{"id":"frank-bowling","name":"Frank Bowling","cat":"painters","en":"Frank Bowling","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-bowling.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-bowling","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","ornate","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["ochre","bone-white","vivid-orange","red","muted-green"],"intro":"Frank Bowling is a renowned British-Guyanese artist known for his contributions to abstract expressionism and color field painting. His work often explores themes of identity, migration, and memory, using vibrant colors and dynamic compositions. Bowling has been celebrated for his innovative techniques and his ability to blend personal and historical narratives within his abstract works.","observation":"The style is built from highly saturated, layered paint with broad gestural strokes, scraped passages, visible drips, and varied surface texture. Loose abstract color fields combine with energetic vertical marks and translucent overlays, producing an expressive, immersive gallery-painting appearance."},{"id":"adolf-schreyer","name":"Adolf Schreyer","cat":"painters","en":"Adolf Schreyer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adolf-schreyer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adolf-schreyer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["white","black","grey","dark-brown","ochre","muted-orange"],"intro":"Adolf Schreyer was a 19th-century German painter known for his detailed and dramatic depictions of horses and military scenes. He gained recognition for his ability to capture the dynamic movement and spirit of equestrian subjects, often set against the backdrop of historical events. His works are characterized by a romantic realism, blending meticulous detail with a sense of drama and emotion.","observation":"These images use richly textured, visible brushwork with broad, energetic strokes to render dramatic desert processions, cavalry movement, and crowded encounters. Warm ochres, dusty browns, muted blues, and atmospheric distance create a subdued, cinematic sense of scale, while layered figures, animals, architecture, and terrain give the scenes dense visual detail."},{"id":"jeremy-lipking","name":"Jeremy Lipking","cat":"painters","en":"Jeremy Lipking","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeremy-lipking.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeremy-lipking","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","backlighting","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","grey","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Jeremy Lipking is a contemporary American painter known for his realistic and painterly portraits. He is celebrated for his ability to capture the subtle nuances of light and shadow, often focusing on the human figure within natural settings. Lipking's work is characterized by its fine brushwork and attention to detail, drawing inspiration from both classical and modern influences.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic female portraits are shaped with visible painterly strokes, soft edges, and expressive, slightly brooding poses. The palette stays restrained and dark, with black garments set against blue-gray or warm interior backgrounds and occasional strong light from behind or the side."},{"id":"niki-de-saint-phalle","name":"Niki de Saint Phalle","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Niki de Saint Phalle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/niki-de-saint-phalle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/niki-de-saint-phalle","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","sculptural","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["blue","muted-ochre","silver","charcoal","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Niki de Saint Phalle is a renowned French-American artist known for her vibrant and whimsical sculptures. Her work often incorporates bold colors and playful forms, reflecting themes of feminism and social commentary. She gained international recognition for her large-scale public art installations and her unique approach to art-making.","observation":"The style depicts sprawling outdoor environments filled with monumental, fantastical animal and human-like sculptures covered in colorful mosaic fragments, painted motifs, and tactile relief. Bright daylight, saturated colors, exaggerated forms, and low-angle compositions make the scenes feel playful, ornate, and surreal while retaining a strongly photographed, place-based setting."},{"id":"august-sander","name":"August Sander","cat":"photographers","en":"August Sander","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/august-sander.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/august-sander","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","white"],"intro":"August Sander was a German photographer known for his work in the early 20th century, particularly his portraits that documented German society. His approach was characterized by a straightforward and realistic style, capturing a wide range of social classes and professions, which became an important historical record of the era.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photographic portraiture with strong tonal contrast, visible grain, and carefully observed facial and fabric detail. Formal, direct gazes and restrained poses give the portraits a somber documentary character, while period clothing and weathered environments reinforce a bleak historical atmosphere."},{"id":"tim-shumate","name":"Tim Shumate","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tim Shumate","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-shumate.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-shumate","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","symmetry"],"colours":["light-orange","black","muted-brown","charcoal","deep-red","grey"],"intro":"Tim Shumate is an illustrator known for his unique blend of pop surrealism and fantasy elements. His work often features whimsical and detailed characters with a touch of gothic and fairy tale influences. Shumate's style is characterized by its vibrant colors, intricate details, and a playful yet mysterious atmosphere.","observation":"Highly detailed illustrative portraits combine fine drawn lines, smooth modeled shading, vivid jewel-like colors, and dense ornamental framing. Repeated roses, foliage, mirrors, clocks, cards, apples, and skulls create symmetrical, fantastical tableaux with a surreal storybook quality."},{"id":"john-sell-cotman","name":"John Sell Cotman","cat":"painters","en":"John Sell Cotman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-sell-cotman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-sell-cotman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["muted-blue","beige","charcoal","dark-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"John Sell Cotman was a prominent English painter and watercolorist, known for his contributions to the Romantic movement. Born in 1782, Cotman became renowned for his landscape paintings, which often depicted serene and picturesque scenes of the English countryside. His work is characterized by a delicate use of watercolor, fine brushwork, and a keen attention to detail, capturing the subtle play of light and shadow.","observation":"Across the sheet, expansive landscapes and old urban scenes are rendered with visible, energetic paint strokes, layered atmospheric distance, and richly articulated rock and masonry. The palette is restrained and often dusky, but punctuated by strong sunlight, glowing skies, and deep contrasting shadows."},{"id":"peregrine-heathcote","name":"Peregrine Heathcote","cat":"painters","en":"Peregrine Heathcote","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peregrine-heathcote.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peregrine-heathcote","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","grey","pale-yellow","brown","rust"],"intro":"Peregrine Heathcote is a contemporary British artist known for his nostalgic and cinematic paintings that often depict glamorous scenes from the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by a blend of realism and romanticism, capturing moments of elegance and leisure with a focus on detailed portraits and vintage settings.","observation":"The style combines richly visible, directional brushwork with polished illustrative figure drawing, giving clothing, hair, clouds, and reflective surfaces a tactile painted character. It consistently uses warm earthy accents against blue skies, cinematic portrait framing, and carefully rendered vintage clothing and travel props."},{"id":"mario-testino","name":"Mario Testino","cat":"photographers","en":"Mario Testino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mario-testino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mario-testino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["silver","black","dark-green","beige","dark-red","ochre","red"],"intro":"Mario Testino is a renowned Peruvian fashion and portrait photographer known for his work with major fashion magazines and celebrities. His photography is celebrated for its vibrant and glamorous style, often capturing the essence of luxury and elegance.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic editorial portraiture with elaborate couture, dense textile patterns, dramatic accessories, and richly decorated interiors. Saturated jewel tones, strong contrast, cinematic cropping, and expressive poses give the images a theatrical, slightly surreal fashion-story quality."},{"id":"charles-bibbs","name":"Charles Bibbs","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Bibbs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-bibbs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-bibbs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-red","vivid-red","muted-olive","ochre","dark-violet"],"intro":"Charles Bibbs is an American artist known for his vibrant and culturally rich artworks that celebrate African American heritage and identity. His work often features detailed and expressive portraits, capturing the essence of cultural pride and beauty.","observation":"Across all four portraits, saturated jewel tones, dense fine linework, and crisp graphic shapes render faces, hair, textiles, and accessories with highly ornamented surface detail. Elaborate headwear and patterned garments dominate the compositions, while strong dark outlines and deep shadows create a bold, high-contrast illustrative finish."},{"id":"barry-mcgee","name":"Barry McGee","cat":"street-artists","en":"Barry McGee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barry-mcgee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barry-mcgee","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-ochre","vivid-red","rust","bone-white","dark-brown","brown"],"intro":"Barry McGee is a renowned American street artist known for his vibrant and bold murals that often explore themes of urban life and culture. Emerging from the San Francisco art scene in the late 20th century, McGee's work is characterized by its distinctive use of geometric patterns, vivid colors, and a playful yet chaotic aesthetic. His art often incorporates elements of graffiti, pop art, and installation, reflecting the dynamic energy of the streets.","observation":"Across all four views, the style is an exuberant, highly detailed installation built from repeating geometric patterns, grids, checks, dots, and patchwork-like arrangements. Saturated reds dominate alongside black, white, blue, yellow, and green, with crisp graphic shapes and occasional visible painted texture across artworks, furniture, and sculptural forms."},{"id":"andy-goldsworthy","name":"Andy Goldsworthy","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Andy Goldsworthy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andy-goldsworthy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andy-goldsworthy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","patterns","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","red","beige","silver"],"intro":"Andy Goldsworthy is a British sculptor and environmentalist known for his site-specific installations involving natural materials. His work often explores the relationship between human beings and nature, using elements such as stones, leaves, and ice to create temporary sculptures that interact with the environment.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, richly detailed landscape imagery with saturated autumn reds and oranges set against dark stone, water, and shadow. Natural materials are arranged into uncanny circular and spiral formations, combining documentary-like texture and high contrast with a surreal, mysterious atmosphere."},{"id":"bill-traylor","name":"Bill Traylor","cat":"painters","en":"Bill Traylor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-traylor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-traylor","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["light-orange","bone-white","black","muted-orange","ochre","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Bill Traylor was an African American self-taught artist born into slavery in 1853 in Alabama. He began creating art in his later years, capturing scenes from his life and imagination using simple materials. His work is celebrated for its raw and expressive qualities, often depicting animals, people, and abstract shapes in a unique, narrative style.","observation":"The style uses rough, hand-painted black figures on aged tan paper, with visible bristly strokes, irregular edges, and stark contrast. Animals and hybrid creatures are simplified into bold, expressive silhouettes and angular outlines, with sparse red accents and an uncanny folkloric fantasy tone."},{"id":"yuriy-shevchuk","name":"Yuriy Shevchuk","cat":"painters","en":"Yuriy Shevchuk","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yuriy-shevchuk.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yuriy-shevchuk","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","blue","dark-brown","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Yuriy Shevchuk is a contemporary Ukrainian artist known for his expressive and detailed paintings that often depict scenes of rural life and intimate portraits. His work is characterized by a romantic realism and contemporary impressionism, capturing the essence of Eastern European culture and traditions.","observation":"Across the four images, vivid color and energetic, visible brushwork give the scenes a richly painted, tactile surface. Elaborate environments, expressive figures, animals, and dramatic lighting combine realistic spatial detail with a fantastical, storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"b-kliban","name":"B. Kliban","cat":"illustrators","en":"B. Kliban","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/b-kliban.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/b-kliban","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","comics","drawing","ink","funny"],"colours":["white","grey","silver","black","charcoal"],"intro":"B. Kliban is best known as an American cartoonist whose work gained popularity in the 1970s. He is particularly famous for his humorous and whimsical illustrations, often featuring cats and other anthropomorphic animals. Kliban's style is characterized by its playful and satirical nature, capturing the absurdity of everyday life with a unique blend of wit and artistry.","observation":"This style uses highly legible black ink drawings on white ground, with heavy contour lines, dense hatching, and crosshatching to model form and texture. Anthropomorphic animals dominate humorous everyday situations, combining exaggerated expressions and proportions with richly detailed domestic or outdoor settings."},{"id":"hubert-robert","name":"Hubert Robert","cat":"painters","en":"Hubert Robert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hubert-robert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hubert-robert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","mist","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","rust","silver","orange"],"intro":"Hubert Robert was an 18th-century French painter known for his landscapes and depictions of ruins. His work often featured grand architectural elements and a romanticized view of decay, capturing the beauty and mystery of ancient structures.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental ruined architecture is presented with richly textured, painterly surfaces and dense structural detail. Strong light from openings cuts through deep shadows and atmospheric haze, creating cinematic, epic views of vast ancient spaces with tiny figures for scale."},{"id":"mike-allred","name":"Mike Allred","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mike Allred","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-allred.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-allred","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","retro"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","ochre","red","vivid-red","blue"],"intro":"Mike Allred is a renowned American comic book artist and writer, best known for his work on titles such as \"Madman\" and \"X-Statix.\" His distinctive style is characterized by a blend of pop art and retro comic aesthetics, often featuring bold lines and vibrant colors. Allred's work has been influential in the comic book industry, celebrated for its unique visual flair and storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses flat, highly saturated color fields bounded by heavy black comic-book outlines, with crosshatched marks adding texture and volume. Crowded character arrangements, exaggerated masks and creatures, patterned clothing, and unsettling surreal scenarios create a retro graphic-narrative feel."},{"id":"david-wightman","name":"David Wightman","cat":"painters","en":"David Wightman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-wightman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-wightman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-brown","black","dark-blue","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"David Wightman is a contemporary British artist known for his vibrant and textured landscapes. His work often combines elements of abstraction and realism, utilizing bold colors and intricate patterns to create visually striking compositions. Wightman's art is characterized by its use of collaged wallpaper and acrylic paint, resulting in a unique blend of traditional and modern techniques.","observation":"Across the four images, recognizable natural and architectural subjects are rendered with vivid, high-contrast color and abundant visible brushwork. Dense flowers, foliage, ravens, mountains, and the overgrown house combine realistic detail with expressive, fantastical juxtapositions and swirling painted backgrounds."},{"id":"edward-s-curtis","name":"Edward S. Curtis","cat":"photographers","en":"Edward S. Curtis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-s-curtis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-s-curtis","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","backlighting","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","white","bone-white"],"intro":"Edward S. Curtis was an American photographer and ethnologist known for his extensive work documenting Native American peoples and cultures in the early 20th century. His work is celebrated for its historical significance and artistic quality, capturing the diverse traditions and lifestyles of indigenous tribes across North America. Curtis's photographs are often characterized by their sepia tones and detailed composition, providing a poignant glimpse into the lives of Native Americans during a time of significant cultural change.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome photography with a warm sepia cast, pronounced grain, deep shadows, and selective backlighting. It combines intimate, weathered portraits with cinematic wilderness scenes, emphasizing fur, feathers, textured clothing, mist, and solemn expressions."},{"id":"tyler-shields","name":"Tyler Shields","cat":"photographers","en":"Tyler Shields","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tyler-shields.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tyler-shields","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","fashion","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","epic","geometric"],"colours":["muted-teal","brown","blue","deep-red","dark-cyan","vivid-red"],"intro":"Tyler Shields is an American photographer known for his provocative and often controversial images that blend elements of glamour, violence, and surrealism. He has gained recognition for his work with celebrities and his ability to capture striking, thought-provoking visuals that challenge societal norms and expectations.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, cinematic fashion photography with saturated red-and-blue color blocking, hard sunlight, and crisp geometric compositions. Fashionably dressed women are placed in surreal, carefully staged environments, with repetition, dramatic scale, and strong perspective creating an uncanny editorial spectacle."},{"id":"cyril-rolando","name":"Cyril Rolando","cat":"various-artists","en":"Cyril Rolando","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cyril-rolando.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cyril-rolando","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-cyan","muted-blue","dark-red","red","pale-orange"],"intro":"Cyril Rolando is a French digital artist known for his surreal and fantastical artworks that often explore themes of emotion and imagination. His work is characterized by a dreamlike quality, blending elements of fantasy and reality to create evocative and introspective pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad visible brushwork builds towering clouds, turbulent water, and atmospheric environments with a richly textured painted surface. The style combines deep teal shadows with saturated coral, orange, pink, and blue highlights, using dramatic scale, tiny figures, and luminous skies to create expansive, dreamlike landscape scenes."},{"id":"shel-silverstein","name":"Shel Silverstein","cat":"illustrators","en":"Shel Silverstein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shel-silverstein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shel-silverstein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","grey","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Shel Silverstein was an American author, poet, and illustrator known for his whimsical and imaginative children's books, including \"The Giving Tree\" and \"Where the Sidewalk Ends.\" His work is characterized by its playful and often thought-provoking content, appealing to both children and adults.","observation":"The style uses stark black ink on a white ground, combining delicate contour drawing with dense crosshatching and rough, feather-like marks. Sparse compositions and large areas of empty paper frame surreal encounters between children, bearded figures, and oversized birds, giving the illustrations a quiet but uncanny storybook quality."},{"id":"marcin-sobas","name":"Marcin Sobas","cat":"photographers","en":"Marcin Sobas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marcin-sobas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marcin-sobas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","backlighting","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-olive","dark-olive","pale-yellow","ochre"],"intro":"Marcin Sobas is a contemporary photographer known for capturing stunning landscapes that evoke a sense of wonder and tranquility. His work often features the rolling hills and picturesque scenery of rural Europe, particularly Italy, and is characterized by a dreamy, painterly quality that blends realism with a touch of fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents realistic pastoral landscapes with smooth rolling hills, layered distance, and carefully placed trees or small buildings. Subdued green and amber tones, heavy atmospheric mist, and low backlighting create a moody yet dreamy, cinematic sense of depth."},{"id":"michael-de-adder","name":"Michael de Adder","cat":"illustrators","en":"Michael de Adder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-de-adder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-de-adder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","drawing"],"colours":["white","charcoal","black","silver","grey","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Michael de Adder is a Canadian editorial cartoonist known for his sharp wit and insightful commentary on political and social issues. His work often features a distinctive style that combines humor with a keen understanding of current events, making him a prominent figure in the world of illustration and cartooning.","observation":"These illustrations combine fine, scratchy ink drawing with translucent watercolor washes, dense textural hatching, and expressive caricatural faces and bodies. The restrained blue-gray, brown, and red palette contrasts with mostly white grounds, while recurring human-animal figures and theatrical situations give the images a darkly satirical narrative character."},{"id":"saturno-butto","name":"Saturno Butto","cat":"painters","en":"Saturno Butto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/saturno-butto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/saturno-butto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","collage","dark"],"colours":["black","deep-red","dark-red","muted-orange","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Saturno Butto is an Italian artist known for his provocative and darkly sensual paintings. His work often explores themes of eroticism, religion, and mythology, blending classical techniques with contemporary subjects.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines highly rendered faces with visible brushwork, cracked and distressed surfaces, and richly patterned textiles. Deep shadows and restrained reds, browns, blacks, and ochres create an intense, dramatic mood, while layered fabric and graphic facial markings give the close crops a collage-like, tactile quality."},{"id":"ronan-and-erwan-bouroullec","name":"Ronan and Erwan Bouroullec","cat":"designers","en":"Ronan and Erwan Bouroullec","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ronan-and-erwan-bouroullec.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ronan-and-erwan-bouroullec","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","vivid-colors","fantasy","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","black","white","red"],"intro":"Ronan and Erwan Bouroullec is a renowned French design duo known for their innovative approach to furniture and interior design. Their work often explores the relationship between space and form, incorporating organic shapes and a minimalist aesthetic. The Bouroullec brothers have collaborated with leading brands and have exhibited their designs in prestigious museums worldwide.","observation":"The style presents photorealistic, highly detailed architectural interiors organized around monumental curved screens, ribbed hanging surfaces, concrete columns, and sculptural furniture. Vivid red, coral, teal, and green accents contrast with expansive daylight, polished floors, and generous gallery-like negative space, while indoor gardens and suspended foliage introduce a fantastical atmosphere."},{"id":"rob-gonsalves","name":"Rob Gonsalves","cat":"painters","en":"Rob Gonsalves","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rob-gonsalves.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rob-gonsalves","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-olive","muted-ochre","grey","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Rob Gonsalves is a Canadian artist known for his imaginative and surreal paintings that often incorporate optical illusions and playful perspectives. His work is characterized by a seamless blend of reality and fantasy, creating dreamlike scenes that challenge the viewer's perception. Gonsalves's art has been celebrated for its creativity and technical precision, drawing comparisons to artists like M.C. Escher and Salvador Dali.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured painted scenes combine highly detailed architecture, formal gardens, and monumental trees with imaginative spatial arrangements. Saturated greens, blues, and warm stone tones, expressive brushwork, and carefully modeled surfaces create an ornate storybook world that remains representational while bending toward the surreal."},{"id":"max-bill","name":"Max Bill","cat":"designers","en":"Max Bill","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/max-bill.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/max-bill","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","illustrative","minimalist","patterns","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["white","dark-green","vivid-red","blue","light-yellow","vivid-orange","green"],"intro":"Max Bill was a Swiss architect, artist, painter, typeface designer, industrial designer, and graphic designer. He was a proponent of the Concrete Art movement, which emphasized geometric abstraction and the use of mathematical principles in art. Bill's work is characterized by its clean lines, precise forms, and a harmonious balance of colors and shapes, reflecting his background in the Bauhaus school and his commitment to modernist principles.","observation":"The style uses sharply defined geometric forms, especially squares, rectangles, triangles, and faceted cube-like structures, with clean graphic edges and broad areas of unmodulated color. Saturated primary and secondary hues are set against black and generous white grounds, producing a bold, minimalist, high-contrast visual language across all four compositions."},{"id":"larry-clark","name":"Larry Clark","cat":"photographers","en":"Larry Clark","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-clark.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-clark","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","urban","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","cream","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Larry Clark is an American photographer and filmmaker known for his raw and unfiltered portrayal of youth culture. His work often explores themes of adolescence, rebellion, and the darker aspects of teenage life. Clark's most notable works include the photo book \"Tulsa\" and the film \"Kids,\" both of which have had a significant impact on contemporary photography and cinema.","observation":"The style uses realistic black-and-white photography with strong contrast, deep shadows, visible grain, and direct or flash-like illumination. Candid, tightly cropped portraits of young people in urban settings create an intimate, spontaneous, and gritty retro-documentary feeling."},{"id":"paul-hedley","name":"Paul Hedley","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Hedley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-hedley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-hedley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","brown","bone-white","dark-rust"],"intro":"Paul Hedley is a contemporary British artist known for his figurative paintings, often focusing on the human form and intimate scenes. His work is characterized by a painterly style, capturing the nuances of light and shadow with expressive brushwork.","observation":"Across all four renders, the scenes are built from visible, directional paint strokes that model faces, clothing, architecture, and café details with a richly textured surface. Warm sunlight, vivid earth tones, and strong light-dark separation create lively social tableaux populated by elegantly dressed figures, with fashion and gestures carrying much of the visual emphasis."},{"id":"catherine-abel","name":"Catherine Abel","cat":"painters","en":"Catherine Abel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/catherine-abel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/catherine-abel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","floral","patterns","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","black","deep-red","muted-ochre","dark-blue","dark-brown"],"intro":"Catherine Abel is an Australian artist known for her contemporary take on classical and art deco styles. Her work often features elegant, stylized portraits that draw inspiration from early 20th-century glamour and modernism. Abel's paintings are characterized by their precise detailing and rich color palettes, often depicting feminine beauty and sophistication.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses polished illustrative portraiture with smooth modeled faces, crisp contours, saturated reds and blues, and strong light-dark separation. Glamorous retro fashion, bold geometric textiles, floral decoration, and carefully arranged tea-table or salon settings create a dense, ornamental visual surface."},{"id":"terrence-malick","name":"Terrence Malick","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Terrence Malick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/terrence-malick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/terrence-malick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","glow","motion","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","silver","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Terrence Malick is an American filmmaker known for his distinctive style that blends philosophical themes with stunning visual storytelling. His work often explores the relationship between humanity and nature, characterized by a contemplative and poetic approach. Malick's films are celebrated for their use of natural light, immersive landscapes, and a focus on existential questions, making him a unique voice in contemporary cinema.","observation":"The style is cinematic and naturalistic, using wide compositions, subdued blue-green and amber grading, and recurring solitary figures set against expansive coastlines, fields, and mountains. Low sun, backlighting, reflective water, heavy clouds, and deep silhouettes create a moody, contemplative, dreamlike atmosphere across the renders."},{"id":"dave-granlund","name":"Dave Granlund","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dave Granlund","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dave-granlund.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dave-granlund","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing","ink","funny"],"colours":["white","bone-white","muted-blue","charcoal","orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Dave Granlund is an American cartoonist known for his political cartoons and humorous illustrations. His work often features satirical commentary on current events and societal issues, capturing the essence of the topics with wit and clarity.","observation":"The style combines expressive caricatural drawing with fine ink contours, visible hatching, and loose watercolor-like color washes. Figures and faces are exaggerated, highly detailed, and animated, balancing mostly white backgrounds with vivid blue, red, orange, and ochre accents."},{"id":"keith-negley","name":"Keith Negley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Keith Negley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/keith-negley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/keith-negley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["black","silver","muted-teal","vivid-red","light-orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Keith Negley is a contemporary illustrator known for his bold and expressive style, often exploring themes of emotion and introspection. His work is characterized by a strong use of geometric shapes and vibrant colors, creating a distinctive visual language that resonates with modern audiences.","observation":"This style combines expressive painted surfaces with graphic, angular collage construction, layering translucent color fields, rough marks, and sharply cut geometric planes. Repeated human figures and profiles emerge from dense, high-contrast compositions dominated by teal, coral, ochre, cream, and black."},{"id":"greg-simkins","name":"Greg Simkins","cat":"painters","en":"Greg Simkins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-simkins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-simkins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-olive","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","light-yellow","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Greg Simkins is an American artist known for his distinctive style that blends elements of pop surrealism and fantasy. His work often features intricate details, imaginative creatures, and a whimsical narrative quality. Simkins's art is characterized by its vivid color palette and a unique ability to merge the fantastical with the real, creating worlds that are both enchanting and thought-provoking.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible, fine painterly brushwork with dense ornamental detail, deep shadow, and selective warm highlights. Anthropomorphic animals and hybrid creatures are staged like dramatic fantasy characters, surrounded by elaborate brass machinery, costumes, foliage, insects, and other surreal props."},{"id":"abbott-handerson-thayer","name":"Abbott Handerson Thayer","cat":"painters","en":"Abbott Handerson Thayer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abbott-handerson-thayer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abbott-handerson-thayer","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","orange"],"intro":"Abbott Handerson Thayer was an American artist known for his paintings of angels, landscapes, and portraits, often exploring themes of spirituality and nature. He was a prominent figure in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, contributing to the American Renaissance movement. Thayer's work is characterized by its romantic and symbolic qualities, often using soft lighting and muted colors to create a serene and contemplative atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the figures are portrayed as somber female portraits in a dark, earthy palette, with strong light falling across faces against near-black backgrounds. Visible brushwork, rough textured surfaces, and broad gestural strokes give the images a richly painted, expressive character, while the varied crops and poses preserve an intimate, theatrical mood."},{"id":"felice-varini","name":"Felice Varini","cat":"various-artists","en":"Felice Varini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/felice-varini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/felice-varini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","urban","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","classical","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["deep-red","dark-brown","muted-rust","black","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Felice Varini is a Swiss artist known for his large-scale geometric perspective-localized paintings in architectural and urban spaces. His work often involves creating optical illusions that can only be fully appreciated from a specific vantage point, challenging viewers' perceptions of space and form.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental vaulted interiors are treated as precise architectural spaces overlaid with bold red and occasional blue geometric forms. Strong perspective, repeated arches, saturated flat shapes, and sharp light-dark contrasts create a vivid, surreal intervention within classical stone settings."},{"id":"thomas-blackshear","name":"Thomas Blackshear","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Blackshear","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-blackshear.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-blackshear","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical","religious","symmetry"],"colours":["light-orange","brown","dark-brown","ochre","dark-blue","charcoal"],"intro":"Thomas Blackshear is an American artist known for his distinctive style that blends elements of Art Nouveau with contemporary themes. His work often explores themes of spirituality, identity, and cultural heritage, and he is celebrated for his ability to convey deep emotion and narrative through his art.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly worked paint combines visible brush texture with finely articulated anatomy, fabric, jewelry, and ornamental surfaces. Frontal or upward-facing figures are organized around large radiant circular halos, with strong dark-light modelling, saturated blue and ochre grounds, and lavish gold decoration creating a ceremonial sacred appearance."},{"id":"berenice-abbott","name":"Berenice Abbott","cat":"photographers","en":"Berenice Abbott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/berenice-abbott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/berenice-abbott","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["charcoal","black","white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Berenice Abbott is a renowned American photographer known for her black-and-white photography of New York City architecture and urban scenes. Her work captures the transformation of the city during the early 20th century, highlighting the interplay between old and new structures. Abbott's photography is celebrated for its clarity, precision, and ability to convey the dynamic energy of urban life.","observation":"A monochrome, high-contrast photographic style depicts dense urban streets, industrial rooftops, bridges, and early skyscrapers with strong architectural framing and deep perspective. Grain, haze, silhouettes, and backlit facades create a dark, cinematic sense of historical city life."},{"id":"pawel-kuczynski","name":"Pawel Kuczynski","cat":"painters","en":"Pawel Kuczynski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pawel-kuczynski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pawel-kuczynski","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","grain","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","grey","orange","dark-brown","ochre","dark-cyan","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Pawel Kuczynski is a Polish artist renowned for his satirical and thought-provoking illustrations. His work often explores themes of social and political commentary, using surreal and imaginative imagery to convey messages about modern society.","observation":"The style combines carefully modelled, painterly textures with stark geometric architecture, sparse compositions, and quietly uncanny juxtapositions of animals, people, and oversized objects. Muted ochres, rusts, teals, and dusky blues create a moody atmosphere, while persistent grain and soft atmospheric light give the scenes a tactile, dreamlike illustrated quality."},{"id":"pietro-perugino","name":"Pietro Perugino","cat":"painters","en":"Pietro Perugino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pietro-perugino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pietro-perugino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["ochre","dark-brown","muted-blue","black","deep-red","silver"],"intro":"Pietro Perugino was an Italian Renaissance painter known for his contributions to the development of the High Renaissance style. He was one of the leading painters of the Umbrian school and played a significant role in the early career of Raphael. Perugino's work is characterized by its serene compositions, graceful figures, and harmonious use of color, often depicting religious themes and portraits.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, realistic painted portraiture with fine, controlled brushwork, carefully modelled faces, and visible aged surface texture. Close-cropped figures in rich red garments and caps are set against blue skies, gold grounds, or compact historic architecture, creating a formal classical appearance."},{"id":"jan-davidsz-de-heem","name":"Jan Davidsz de Heem","cat":"painters","en":"Jan Davidsz de Heem","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-davidsz-de-heem.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-davidsz-de-heem","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","patterns","still-life","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-red","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Jan Davidsz de Heem was a prominent Dutch painter known for his intricate and opulent still life paintings during the Baroque period. Born in 1606, he became one of the most celebrated still life artists of the Dutch Golden Age , renowned for his ability to depict luxurious arrangements of flowers, fruits, and other objects with exceptional detail and realism. His works often symbolized the prosperity and transience of life, capturing the richness and beauty of everyday objects.","observation":"These richly painted floral still lifes fill the frame with dense layers of blossoms, leaves, vessels, fruit, and occasional symbolic objects. Saturated reds, pinks, oranges, and whites emerge against nearly black grounds, with visible brushwork, dramatic contrast, and elaborate surface detail creating a dark yet opulent mood."},{"id":"charles-dwyer","name":"Charles Dwyer","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Dwyer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-dwyer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-dwyer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["muted-ochre","beige","black","brown","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Charles Dwyer is an American artist known for his evocative and expressive portraiture. His work often combines elements of realism with impressionistic techniques, creating a unique visual language that captures the emotional depth and complexity of his subjects. Dwyer's art is celebrated for its rich textures, dynamic compositions, and the use of color to convey mood and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines tightly cropped female portraits with visibly worked, layered paint and delicate directional strokes. Muted teal, ochre, rust, cream, and charcoal tones support expressive faces, windblown hair, fragmented backgrounds, and subtly surreal overlaps between figures."},{"id":"peter-zumthor","name":"Peter Zumthor","cat":"architects","en":"Peter Zumthor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-zumthor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-zumthor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","dark-brown"],"intro":"Peter Zumthor is a renowned Swiss architect known for his minimalist and contextually sensitive designs. His work often emphasizes the use of natural materials and a deep connection to the surrounding environment, creating spaces that are both functional and contemplative. Zumthor's architecture is celebrated for its simplicity, attention to detail, and ability to evoke a sense of place.","observation":"The style presents monumental, highly geometric architecture as realistic, sculptural spaces with carefully resolved material textures and strong structural depth. Subdued earth tones, deep shadow, and sharply directed sunlight create a dark, cinematic atmosphere, while mountain landscapes and large voids heighten the sense of scale."},{"id":"helene-beland","name":"Helene Beland","cat":"painters","en":"Helene Beland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helene-beland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helene-beland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","silver","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Helene Beland is a contemporary artist known for her ethereal and romantic portraits that often blend elements of fantasy and nature. Her work is characterized by a delicate interplay of light and shadow, creating a dreamlike quality that invites viewers into a serene and introspective world.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visible brushwork with highly detailed, softly modelled portraiture and lavish costume decoration. Restrained jewel-toned colors, dark grounds, delicate facial expressions, and recurring flowers or animal companions create a dreamy, theatrical fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"daron-nefcy","name":"Daron Nefcy","cat":"illustrators","en":"Daron Nefcy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daron-nefcy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daron-nefcy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","floral","scenes","bold-lines","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy"],"colours":["pale-yellow","red","dark-red","black","muted-cyan","white"],"intro":"Daron Nefcy is an American animator and illustrator, best known for creating the animated television series \"Star vs. the Forces of Evil.\" Her work is characterized by vibrant colors, whimsical characters, and imaginative storytelling, often drawing inspiration from fantasy and magical themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive comic-like character illustration with crisp contour work, simplified forms, and vivid, strongly contrasting color blocks. It combines playful cartoon figures with elaborate fantasy creatures, foliage, costumes, and energetic ornamental shapes, ranging from dense ensemble scenes to more open character compositions."},{"id":"john-tenniel","name":"John Tenniel","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Tenniel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-tenniel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-tenniel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","comics","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","brown","silver","ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"John Tenniel was a prominent English illustrator and political cartoonist, best known for his work in the 19th century. He gained widespread recognition for his illustrations in Lewis Carroll's \"Alice's Adventures in Wonderland\" and \"Through the Looking-Glass.\" Tenniel's work is characterized by its intricate detail, imaginative subjects, and a blend of whimsy and satire, making a significant impact on Victorian illustration.","observation":"The style is a finely rendered storybook illustration built from delicate ink outlines, dense hatching, and expressive character posing. Most panels use stark black-and-white figures isolated against generous white space, while the single colored scene retains the same intricate linework and theatrical, fantastical animal characters."},{"id":"mothmeister","name":"Mothmeister","cat":"various-artists","en":"Mothmeister","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mothmeister.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mothmeister","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-brown","grey","silver","light-cyan","muted-cyan","brown"],"intro":"Mothmeister is a collaborative art project by a Belgian duo known for creating surreal and fantastical photographic portraits. Their work often features eerie, anthropomorphic creatures dressed in elaborate costumes and masks, blending elements of fantasy, horror, and dark humor.","observation":"The style presents surreal, fantastical characters as highly detailed photographic tableaux, combining animal-like masks and shaggy handmade costumes with expansive natural landscapes. Muted earth and sky tones, cinematic framing, selective focus, and realistic textures make the bizarre figures feel materially present and documentary-like."},{"id":"camille-rose-garcia","name":"Camille Rose Garcia","cat":"painters","en":"Camille Rose Garcia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/camille-rose-garcia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/camille-rose-garcia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["red","black","dark-brown","muted-yellow","muted-blue"],"intro":"Camille Rose Garcia is a contemporary American artist known for her distinctive blend of pop surrealism and lowbrow art. Her work often features a mix of whimsical and dark themes, drawing inspiration from fairy tales, cartoons, and vintage illustration. Garcia's art is characterized by its intricate detailing, vibrant colors, and a unique fusion of fantasy and reality.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated coral, pink, teal, and black pigments form expressive female portraits interwoven with abundant flowers and ornamental foliage. Visible directional brushwork, fine contour lines, dense layered detail, and surreal floral transformations give the imagery a richly painted, decorative intensity."},{"id":"peter-lippmann","name":"Peter Lippmann","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Lippmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-lippmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-lippmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","floral","still-life","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-brown","muted-yellow","ochre"],"intro":"Peter Lippmann is a renowned photographer known for his still life and portrait photography, often drawing inspiration from classical art and nature. His work is characterized by its meticulous attention to detail and a unique ability to blend traditional themes with a modern sensibility, creating images that are both timeless and contemporary.","observation":"The style uses richly detailed, realistic tableaux filled with antique furnishings, books, candles, birds, flowers, and encroaching vegetation. Deep greens, browns, and near-black shadows create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while theatrical arrangements and dense ornament make each scene feel like a dark botanical still life."},{"id":"louise-mcnaught","name":"Louise McNaught","cat":"painters","en":"Louise McNaught","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louise-mcnaught.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louise-mcnaught","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","animals","portraits","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","symmetry"],"colours":["pink","silver","grey","red","charcoal","blue"],"intro":"Louise McNaught is a contemporary British artist known for her vibrant and surreal depictions of wildlife. Her work often explores the relationship between nature and humanity, using bold colors and intricate details to create striking visual narratives. McNaught's art has been exhibited internationally and is celebrated for its unique blend of realism and fantasy.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, realistic animal portraiture with graphic, saturated neon color and dramatic contrast. Repeated deer heads and antlers are framed prominently, while glowing pink or blue accents and long dripping paint trails create a surreal mixed-media effect."},{"id":"frank-mccarthy","name":"Frank McCarthy","cat":"painters","en":"Frank McCarthy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-mccarthy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-mccarthy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-blue","muted-ochre","pale-orange","grey"],"intro":"Frank McCarthy is an American artist known for his vivid and dynamic depictions of the American West. His work often features Native American subjects, cowboys, and expansive landscapes, capturing the adventurous spirit of the frontier. McCarthy's paintings are celebrated for their attention to detail and dramatic compositions, making him a prominent figure in Western art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses energetic, visible brushwork to depict heroic mounted figures and animals in expansive mountainous settings. Strong light-dark contrasts, saturated sky and earth colors, dramatic low-angle compositions, and sweeping strokes create a monumental, action-filled sense of motion."},{"id":"howard-carter","name":"Howard Carter","cat":"various-artists","en":"Howard Carter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howard-carter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howard-carter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","beige","ochre","red"],"intro":"Howard Carter was a British archaeologist and Egyptologist, renowned for discovering the intact tomb of the 18th Dynasty Pharaoh, Tutankhamun, in 1922. His work significantly contributed to the field of Egyptology and brought ancient Egyptian culture into the public eye, sparking widespread interest and fascination.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely worked historical scenes with visible, loose paint handling and broad directional strokes. Warm ochres, browns, and bronze tones are pushed against deep shadows and selective shafts of light, giving the tableaux a dramatic, filmic atmosphere while retaining an illustrative, archaeological richness."},{"id":"agnes-lawrence-pelton","name":"Agnes Lawrence Pelton","cat":"painters","en":"Agnes Lawrence Pelton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/agnes-lawrence-pelton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/agnes-lawrence-pelton","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","characters","landscapes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["black","muted-red","dark-blue","grey","red"],"intro":"Agnes Lawrence Pelton was an American painter known for her abstract and spiritual works, often associated with the Transcendental Painting Group. Her art is characterized by luminous colors and symbolic forms that explore themes of spirituality and inner vision.","observation":"Across all four renders, simplified geometric forms and luminous celestial motifs are treated with visible textured paint, grain, and saturated orange-blue contrasts. The scenes combine dreamlike cosmic landscapes with elongated figures, glowing orbs, stark silhouettes, and strongly graphic composition."},{"id":"andrei-rublev","name":"Andrei Rublev","cat":"painters","en":"Andrei Rublev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrei-rublev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrei-rublev","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","religious","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","bone-white","grey","ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"Andrei Rublev was a renowned Russian icon painter of the 15th century, celebrated for his contributions to the Russian Orthodox Church's artistic heritage. His work is characterized by spiritual depth, harmonious composition, and a distinctive use of color and form that has influenced generations of artists.","observation":"The style combines heavily textured, visibly brushed surfaces with layered, densely detailed religious imagery, resembling weathered devotional paintings and fresco fragments. Dark earthy tones, deep blues, warm ochres, and stark highlights create a solemn, dramatic mood, while close portraits, bowed figures, halos, and crowded sacred scenes recur across the renders."},{"id":"satoshi-kon","name":"Satoshi Kon","cat":"illustrators","en":"Satoshi Kon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/satoshi-kon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/satoshi-kon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","urban","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","orange","vivid-red","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Satoshi Kon was a renowned Japanese filmmaker and animator known for his work in anime, including films like \" Perfect Blue \" and \"Paprika.\" His storytelling often explored themes of reality, identity, and the subconscious, blending fantasy with psychological depth.","observation":"The style combines densely layered portrait imagery with graphic, clean-edged drawing, heavy contour lines, and selectively flat color. Saturated reds, oranges, blacks, and warm skin tones create a high-contrast retro poster feel, while grain and intricate ornamental details add tactile density."},{"id":"edward-blair-wilkins","name":"Edward Blair Wilkins","cat":"illustrators","en":"Edward Blair Wilkins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-blair-wilkins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-blair-wilkins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","dark-brown","rust","vivid-red","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Edward Blair Wilkins is a fictional illustrator known for his imaginative and detailed artwork, often blending elements of science fiction and fantasy. His work is characterized by intricate designs and a vivid use of color, creating immersive worlds that captivate viewers.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly textured, broad painted strokes with dense costume, architectural, and environmental detail. Strong blue-orange and red-black color contrasts, looming silhouettes, dramatic lighting, and fantasy settings give the images an expressive, darkly epic character."},{"id":"willem-haenraets","name":"Willem Haenraets","cat":"painters","en":"Willem Haenraets","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/willem-haenraets.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/willem-haenraets","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","fashion","floral","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","grey","muted-orange","brown","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Willem Haenraets is a Dutch painter known for his romantic and impressionistic style, often depicting serene and intimate scenes. His works are characterized by soft colors, delicate brushwork, and a dreamy atmosphere, capturing moments of tranquility and romance.","observation":"Across all four renders, figures in elegant summer clothing and hats are depicted in relaxed social garden settings, surrounded by flowers and tableware. Broad, visible brushstrokes, softened edges, and richly layered paint create an expressive, luminous impression of fashion and leisure rather than precise realism."},{"id":"vincent-desiderio","name":"Vincent Desiderio","cat":"painters","en":"Vincent Desiderio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vincent-desiderio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vincent-desiderio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","light-yellow"],"intro":"Vincent Desiderio is an American contemporary realist painter known for his large-scale, narrative-driven works. His paintings often explore complex themes of human existence, blending classical techniques with modern sensibilities. Desiderio's work is characterized by its meticulous attention to detail and emotive depth, often drawing comparisons to the likes of Andrew Wyeth and Lucian Freud.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses dense, visible oil-like brushwork to render sleeping or collapsed figures, fabrics, foliage, and interiors with tactile detail. Subdued earthy colors, deep shadows, and selective highlights create an expressive, somber atmosphere, while the unusual arrangements of bodies and settings add a surreal theatrical quality."},{"id":"jean-nouvel","name":"Jean Nouvel","cat":"architects","en":"Jean Nouvel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-nouvel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-nouvel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","glow","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-red","brown","silver","rust","red"],"intro":"Jean Nouvel is a renowned French architect known for his innovative and contemporary designs. He has been influential in modern architecture, creating iconic structures that often incorporate bold and futuristic elements. His work is characterized by a strong emphasis on transparency, light, and the interplay of materials, making him a pivotal figure in the architectural world.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, realistic architectural imagery with cinematic framing, strong geometric grids, reflective glass, and dramatic red-warm illumination. Across the renders, buildings and interiors are repeatedly fragmented, mirrored, or spatially displaced, giving the urban scenes a surreal yet convincing appearance."},{"id":"cy-twombly","name":"Cy Twombly","cat":"painters","en":"Cy Twombly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cy-twombly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cy-twombly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","bone-white","red","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Cy Twombly is an influential American artist known for his abstract expressionist works that often incorporate scribbles, graffiti-like marks, and dynamic compositions. His art is characterized by a unique blend of gestural abstraction and classical themes, creating a distinctive visual language that has left a lasting impact on contemporary art.","observation":"Across the four renders, red and pink poppies emerge from pale, spacious grounds through vigorous gestural marks, visible brushwork, fine linear drawing, and long dripping stems. The style balances expressive painterly energy and layered surface detail with recurring negative space and a vivid crimson palette."},{"id":"lucia-heffernan","name":"Lucia Heffernan","cat":"painters","en":"Lucia Heffernan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucia-heffernan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucia-heffernan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","funny"],"colours":["grey","black","dark-red","dark-brown","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Lucia Heffernan is an artist known for her whimsical and imaginative paintings that often feature animals in humorous and surreal scenarios. Her work combines elements of realism with fantastical themes, creating a unique style that is both charming and thought-provoking.","observation":"The style uses richly visible oil-paint texture and fine, controlled brushwork to render eccentric anthropomorphic animal characters with expressive faces, elaborate costumes, and theatrical props. Saturated reds, pinks, greens, and warm browns contrast with recurring teal backgrounds, while ornate furnishings and humorous staged situations give the portraits a whimsical fantasy character."},{"id":"harry-watrous","name":"Harry Watrous","cat":"painters","en":"Harry Watrous","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harry-watrous.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harry-watrous","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","fashion","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-red","dark-brown","ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"Harry Watrous is an American painter known for his detailed and realistic works that often explore themes of solitude and introspection. His paintings frequently feature women in contemplative poses, set against serene and minimalist backgrounds, capturing a sense of mystery and nostalgia.","observation":"The style combines graphic, fashion-focused compositions with visible paint texture, simplified angular forms, and strongly blocked areas of red, black, ochre, blue, and green. Figures and birds are posed theatrically against sparse interiors, with bold silhouettes, deep shadows, and dramatic negative space creating an expressive editorial mood."},{"id":"amandine-van-ray","name":"Amandine van Ray","cat":"various-artists","en":"Amandine van Ray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amandine-van-ray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amandine-van-ray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","muted-olive","brown","beige","bone-white","silver"],"intro":"Amandine van Ray is a contemporary digital artist known for her ethereal and surreal portraits that blend fantasy with delicate realism. Her work often features young women adorned with intricate floral arrangements and dreamlike elements, creating a sense of whimsical beauty and tranquility.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic tableaux with expressive figures in flowing ivory garments, set against misty forests or dramatic cloudscapes. Subdued green, cream, and grey tones, soft atmospheric light, elaborate fabric texture, and mythic human-animal encounters create a dreamy, epic fantasy mood."},{"id":"dee-nickerson","name":"Dee Nickerson","cat":"painters","en":"Dee Nickerson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dee-nickerson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dee-nickerson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","floral","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Dee Nickerson is a contemporary British artist known for her whimsical and illustrative depictions of rural life. Her work often features pastoral scenes, capturing the essence of the English countryside with a unique blend of folk and naive art styles. Nickerson's paintings are celebrated for their charming simplicity and nostalgic atmosphere, often portraying everyday moments with a touch of fantasy and whimsy.","observation":"The style combines finely visible brushwork with delicate drawn contours, densely patterned garments, intricate foliage, and abundant small botanical and animal details. It uses a subdued, wintry palette with strong red, black, cream, and muted green accents, presenting elongated, expressive figures and birds in an ornate, storybook-like natural world."},{"id":"irving-penn","name":"Irving Penn","cat":"photographers","en":"Irving Penn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/irving-penn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/irving-penn","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","white","silver","charcoal","beige","grey"],"intro":"Irving Penn is an iconic American photographer known for his influential work in fashion, portraiture, and still life. His career spanned over six decades, during which he became renowned for his clean, elegant style and innovative use of light and composition. Penn's work has been featured in prominent publications such as Vogue, and he is celebrated for his ability to capture the essence of his subjects with simplicity and grace.","observation":"A monochrome, high-contrast fashion-photography style built around sculptural black clothing, oversized hats, severe poses, and stark studio backgrounds. The images combine sharply rendered faces and fabric textures with dramatic cropping, selective focus, and a dark, imposing editorial mood."},{"id":"tristan-eaton","name":"Tristan Eaton","cat":"street-artists","en":"Tristan Eaton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tristan-eaton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tristan-eaton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","floral","portraits","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","charcoal","vivid-red","blue","deep-red","orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"Tristan Eaton is an American artist known for his large-scale murals and street art. His work often combines elements of pop culture, surrealism, and vibrant color palettes, creating dynamic and engaging visual experiences. Eaton's art is celebrated for its bold use of color and intricate compositions, reflecting a deep connection to urban culture and contemporary themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces are built from vivid red, blue, orange, black, and cream shapes, with expressive painted features and dense ornamental overlays. Bold drawn contours, flat color blocks, visible brush textures, floral elements, fabric patterns, and fragmented geometric marks create a layered mixed-media portrait style."},{"id":"juan-gris","name":"Juan Gris","cat":"painters","en":"Juan Gris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/juan-gris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/juan-gris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","deep-rust","pale-orange","vivid-rust","muted-blue"],"intro":"Juan Gris was a Spanish painter and sculptor, closely associated with the Cubist movement. Born in 1887, he became known for his innovative approach to Cubism , often incorporating elements of collage and a distinctive use of color and form. Gris's work is characterized by its geometric shapes and a harmonious balance between abstraction and representation.","observation":"Across all four renders, musical instruments and studio objects are arranged as dense still lifes built from angular, interlocking shapes. Strong black contours and flat color blocks structure the compositions, while visible brush texture and layered painted surfaces keep the geometric forms tactile rather than purely graphic."},{"id":"mattias-adolfsson","name":"Mattias Adolfsson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mattias Adolfsson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mattias-adolfsson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mattias-adolfsson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["cream","bone-white","beige","brown","ochre","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Mattias Adolfsson is a Swedish illustrator known for his intricate and whimsical drawings that often depict fantastical worlds and imaginative scenes. His work is characterized by detailed line work and a playful, humorous style that captures the viewer's imagination.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds densely populated fantasy environments from fine black linework, clean illustrative shapes, and many tiny architectural and character details. Restrained cream grounds contrast with saturated red, orange, teal, and muted blue accents, while oversized creatures, impossible structures, and crowded vignettes create a whimsical surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"michael-deforge","name":"Michael DeForge","cat":"illustrators","en":"Michael DeForge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-deforge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-deforge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["pink","black","vivid-red","muted-blue","light-yellow","dark-brown"],"intro":"Michael DeForge is a Canadian cartoonist and illustrator known for his distinctive and surreal style. His work often explores themes of identity, society, and the bizarre, blending elements of fantasy and reality in a unique and thought-provoking manner. DeForge's comics and illustrations have been widely acclaimed for their originality and depth, making him a prominent figure in the world of indie comics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense surreal fantasy scenes with highly saturated, sharply separated colors and heavy black contouring. Flat graphic color fields are packed with bizarre creatures, eyes, tentacles, coral-like growths, and cosmic or underwater environments, producing an energetic illustrated world rather than a naturalistic one."},{"id":"amy-brown","name":"Amy Brown","cat":"illustrators","en":"Amy Brown","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amy-brown.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amy-brown","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-olive","muted-ochre","pale-yellow","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Amy Brown is a contemporary American fantasy artist known for her whimsical and enchanting fairy illustrations. Her work often features delicate, ethereal figures set in magical landscapes, drawing inspiration from folklore and nature.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly layered woodland scenes combine graceful fairy-like figures with animals, dense foliage, flowers, berries, mushrooms, and rocky natural forms. Fine drawn contours and visible painted texture create highly detailed, ornate imagery in an earthy, subdued palette, with a dreamy fantasy atmosphere and expressive flowing hair and garments."},{"id":"oxana-zaika","name":"Oxana Zaika","cat":"painters","en":"Oxana Zaika","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oxana-zaika.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oxana-zaika","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","ochre","muted-olive","charcoal","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Oxana Zaika is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and detailed paintings that often incorporate elements of fantasy and folklore. Her work is characterized by a rich use of color and intricate patterns, drawing inspiration from nature and mythology.","observation":"Across all four renders, finely drawn portraits, animals, flowers, birds, fruit, and richly patterned garments are densely interwoven into highly decorative compositions. Saturated jewel tones, intricate surface ornament, delicate outlines, and visible painted texture create a lush, tapestry-like illustrative style."},{"id":"anthony-gerace","name":"Anthony Gerace","cat":"various-artists","en":"Anthony Gerace","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anthony-gerace.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anthony-gerace","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","grain","vivid-colors","surreal","retro","collage","geometric"],"colours":["muted-cyan","bone-white","orange","ochre","rust","brown"],"intro":"Anthony Gerace is an artist known for his innovative approach to collage and photography. His work often explores themes of identity, memory, and perception through the use of fragmented imagery and layered compositions. Gerace's art is characterized by a distinctive style that combines elements of traditional collage with contemporary digital techniques.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed photographic portrait fragments with torn-paper collage, geometric overlays, and deliberately misaligned facial features. Saturated sky blues, coral skin tones, and pink or cream paper create a vivid retro-print feel, reinforced by visible grain and rough analog edges across all four images."},{"id":"aelbert-cuyp","name":"Aelbert Cuyp","cat":"painters","en":"Aelbert Cuyp","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aelbert-cuyp.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aelbert-cuyp","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","muted-blue","silver","light-orange","black","dark-ochre","ochre"],"intro":"Aelbert Cuyp was a prominent Dutch landscape painter of the 17th century, known for his idyllic depictions of the Dutch countryside. His works are celebrated for their luminous skies, serene atmospheres, and detailed portrayals of rural life, often featuring cattle and horses. Cuyp's art is a quintessential example of the Dutch Golden Age , capturing the tranquility and beauty of pastoral landscapes with a masterful use of light and color.","observation":"The style uses softly blended, visibly textured paint to render expansive pastoral and waterside landscapes with highly developed clouds, atmospheric distance, and many small human, animal, and architectural details. Muted blue, ochre, cream, and rose tones with warm directional light create a tranquil, slightly dreamy classical landscape mood."},{"id":"andrew-loomis","name":"Andrew Loomis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Andrew Loomis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrew-loomis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrew-loomis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","erotic","retro","drawing"],"colours":["white","grey","black","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Andrew Loomis was an influential American illustrator and author, renowned for his instructional art books that have guided countless artists. His work, primarily from the mid-20th century, is celebrated for its classical approach to figure drawing and portraiture.","observation":"These portraits use monochrome, high-contrast rendering with visible brushwork, fine contour lines, and softly modeled faces against light paper grounds. The polished hair, glamorous makeup, romantic poses, and intimate close-ups create a retro illustrative beauty-editorial feel with restrained sensuality."},{"id":"raoul-hausmann","name":"Raoul Hausmann","cat":"various-artists","en":"Raoul Hausmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raoul-hausmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raoul-hausmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","ornate","characters","portraits","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro","collage","geometric"],"colours":["muted-ochre","light-orange","black","brown","ochre","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Raoul Hausmann is a key figure in the Dada movement , known for his innovative contributions to photomontage and experimental art. Born in 1886 in Austria, he became a central figure in the Berlin Dada group, where he explored themes of technology, society, and the absurd through his art. His works often challenged traditional aesthetics and questioned the role of art in society.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely layered photographic fragments, printed matter, torn paper, and geometric color blocks build surreal character portraits. The restrained sepia, black, cream, and orange palette, strong tonal contrast, visible paper grain, and rough collage joins give the style a tactile retro editorial quality."},{"id":"neil-blevins","name":"Neil Blevins","cat":"various-artists","en":"Neil Blevins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/neil-blevins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/neil-blevins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","portraits","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-green","dark-teal","muted-olive","muted-cyan","light-cyan","red"],"intro":"Neil Blevins is a digital artist known for his work in visual effects and concept art, particularly within the realms of science fiction and fantasy. He has contributed to various high-profile projects in the entertainment industry, showcasing his expertise in creating immersive and imaginative worlds.","observation":"Across the landscapes and submerged portraits, the style combines visible, fluid brushwork with cinematic framing, deep teal-green color, and sharply contrasting luminous highlights. Mist, water reflections, glowing accents, and partially obscured faces create a dark, dreamlike atmosphere that remains richly detailed and emotionally expressive."},{"id":"anne-cotterill","name":"Anne Cotterill","cat":"painters","en":"Anne Cotterill","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-cotterill.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-cotterill","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-ochre","brown","bone-white","ochre","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Anne Cotterill is known for her detailed and vibrant floral paintings, often capturing the delicate beauty of flowers in still life compositions. Her work is celebrated for its realism and attention to detail, reflecting a deep appreciation for nature and botanical subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, abundant flowers and blue-and-white vessels are treated with visible, directional paint strokes and richly layered foliage. Saturated pinks, reds, greens, and blues, along with decorative ceramics and dense floral arrangements, create a lush classical still-life style."},{"id":"michael-carson","name":"Michael Carson","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Carson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-carson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-carson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","fashion","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","orange","muted-green","dark-red"],"intro":"Michael Carson is a contemporary American painter known for his expressive and emotive figurative works. His art often explores themes of introspection and human emotion, capturing moments of quiet reflection and personal connection. Carson's work is characterized by its painterly style, with a focus on the human form and a subtle use of color to convey mood and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses visible, broad, gestural paint strokes to build expressive portraits with simplified but convincing anatomy and clothing. Restrained teal, ochre, rust, cream, and black tones, strong shadow shapes, and tightly cropped editorial compositions create a moody, fashion-focused atmosphere."},{"id":"clifford-coffin","name":"Clifford Coffin","cat":"photographers","en":"Clifford Coffin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clifford-coffin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clifford-coffin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","landscapes","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro","dreamy"],"colours":["black","deep-red","brown","muted-cyan","beige","red"],"intro":"Clifford Coffin is remembered as a prominent fashion photographer known for his work with Vogue magazine during the mid-20th century. His photography is celebrated for its innovative use of light and composition, capturing the elegance and glamour of the fashion world. Coffin's work often featured bold and dramatic poses, set against striking backdrops, which helped define the visual style of fashion photography in his era.","observation":"These images use polished, filmic realism with carefully staged fashion tableaux, strong architectural framing, and an evocative vintage wardrobe. Rich reds, dusty pinks, deep greens, and coastal blues alternate between restrained natural scenes and highly saturated interiors, while dramatic scale, selective focus, and composed silhouettes create a dreamy editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"jillian-tamaki","name":"Jillian Tamaki","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jillian Tamaki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jillian-tamaki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jillian-tamaki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["black","red","pale-orange","brown","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Jillian Tamaki is a Canadian illustrator and cartoonist known for her work in graphic novels and comics. She has collaborated on several acclaimed projects, including 'Skim' and 'This One Summer ,' which have received numerous awards and recognition for their storytelling and artistic style.","observation":"The style uses dense ink-like linework, fine hatching, and heavy dark contours to build closely cropped portraits and feline figures. Strong black, cream, coral-red, and pink contrasts create a vivid illustrative surface, with floral backdrops and uncanny character combinations giving the images a surreal, dreamlike quality."},{"id":"liam-brazier","name":"Liam Brazier","cat":"illustrators","en":"Liam Brazier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/liam-brazier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/liam-brazier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","ochre","dark-red","silver","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Liam Brazier is a contemporary illustrator known for his distinctive digital art style that often features geometric and abstract elements. His work is characterized by bold colors and sharp, angular shapes, creating a unique visual language that is both modern and dynamic.","observation":"Across all four portraits, faces and clothing are constructed from sharply faceted planes, thin energetic marks, and graphic angular divisions. Saturated reds, corals, teals, and golds alternate with deep shadows and hard highlights, creating an intense, expressive low-poly illustrative look."},{"id":"alfred-kubin","name":"Alfred Kubin","cat":"printmakers","en":"Alfred Kubin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-kubin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-kubin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Alfred Kubin was an Austrian printmaker and illustrator known for his dark and fantastical imagery. Born in 1877, Kubin's work often explored themes of the macabre and surreal, reflecting the anxieties and existential concerns of his time. His style is characterized by intricate line work and a haunting atmosphere, drawing inspiration from both symbolism and expressionism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome, heavily textured linework with fine hatching and ink-like shading to build stark, dreamlike scenes. Familiar forms such as birds, eyes, and human figures are distorted through unnatural scale and eerie juxtapositions, creating a surreal and ominous visual language."},{"id":"frederick-catherwood","name":"Frederick Catherwood","cat":"painters","en":"Frederick Catherwood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederick-catherwood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederick-catherwood","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","brown","grey","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Frederick Catherwood was a British artist and architect known for his detailed drawings and paintings of ancient Mesoamerican ruins. He traveled extensively in the early 19th century, documenting the architecture and landscapes of regions such as Central America and the Middle East. His work provided valuable insights into ancient civilizations and contributed significantly to the field of archaeology.","observation":"These landscapes use richly textured, painterly surfaces and dense architectural and botanical detail to create monumental fantasy vistas. Soft atmospheric haze, luminous shafts of sunlight, waterfalls, and layered mountain depth give the scenes a cinematic, dreamlike scale."},{"id":"isaac-maimon","name":"Isaac Maimon","cat":"painters","en":"Isaac Maimon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isaac-maimon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isaac-maimon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing"],"colours":["vivid-red","red","muted-cyan","blue","light-orange","black"],"intro":"Isaac Maimon is an artist known for his vibrant and expressive depictions of Parisian café life. His work often features elegant figures in fashionable attire, capturing the essence of urban sophistication and social interaction. Maimon's paintings are characterized by their bold use of color and dynamic compositions, reflecting a deep appreciation for the lively atmosphere of cosmopolitan settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, fashionable women occupy richly layered social scenes, rendered with saturated jewel-like colors, forceful dark contours, and visible energetic brushwork. The compositions combine graphic flat color with painterly texture, emphasizing dramatic hats, elegant clothing, expressive poses, and closely cropped café or lounge settings."},{"id":"stanislaw-szukalski","name":"Stanislaw Szukalski","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Stanislaw Szukalski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stanislaw-szukalski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stanislaw-szukalski","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","classical"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","muted-blue","deep-red"],"intro":"Stanislaw Szukalski was a Polish sculptor and painter known for his intricate and symbolic works that often incorporated mythological and fantastical themes. His art was characterized by a unique blend of surrealism and symbolism, drawing on a wide array of cultural and historical references.","observation":"Across all four images, monumental faces and figures are rendered as heavily textured, carved or modeled forms, with dense ornamental details and frontal close-up framing. The palette is predominantly dark and restrained, punctuated by deep blue and red accents, while strong shadows and surreal combinations of masks, medallions, feathers, and avian forms create a ritualistic, mythic atmosphere."},{"id":"joe-kubert","name":"Joe Kubert","cat":"illustrators","en":"Joe Kubert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joe-kubert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joe-kubert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Joe Kubert was an influential American comic book artist and writer, renowned for his work on characters like Hawkman and Sgt. Rock. His career spanned several decades, during which he became known for his distinctive style and storytelling ability. Kubert also founded The Kubert School, an institution dedicated to teaching the art of cartooning and graphic storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed comic-book drawing with heavy ink lines, dense hatching, stark black-and-cream contrast, and strongly expressive faces and bodies. Dynamic diagonals, extreme foreshortening, crowded confrontations, and horror-inflected characters create a dark, kinetic visual language."},{"id":"eero-aarnio","name":"Eero Aarnio","cat":"designers","en":"Eero Aarnio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eero-aarnio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eero-aarnio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","deep-red","dark-green","grey","white","vivid-red"],"intro":"Eero Aarnio is a Finnish designer known for his innovative furniture designs that often incorporate bold, futuristic forms and vibrant colors. His work is characterized by a playful and optimistic approach to modernist design, making significant contributions to the mid-century modern movement. Aarnio's designs, such as the iconic Ball Chair, reflect a deep understanding of form and function, blending aesthetics with practicality.","observation":"The style presents a futuristic, highly realistic product-study aesthetic, with smooth sculptural forms, glossy white shells, and richly saturated red upholstery. Clean studio compositions, controlled lighting, strong highlights, and grounded shadows emphasize the chair’s rounded geometry and material contrast across all four views."},{"id":"carl-wilhelmson","name":"Carl Wilhelmson","cat":"painters","en":"Carl Wilhelmson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-wilhelmson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-wilhelmson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","beige","pale-yellow","orange","red"],"intro":"Carl Wilhelmson is a renowned Swedish painter known for his depictions of coastal and rural life in Sweden. His works often capture the serene and introspective nature of everyday scenes, reflecting the cultural and natural beauty of the Nordic region.","observation":"Across the portraits, interiors, gardens, and wooded landscapes, the style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork with fine, directional strokes and layered, tactile surfaces. It combines carefully observed figures and settings with vivid blue, orange, green, and red accents, detailed patterned fabrics, and expressive yet composed arrangements."},{"id":"leonora-carrington","name":"Leonora Carrington","cat":"painters","en":"Leonora Carrington","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leonora-carrington.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leonora-carrington","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","light-orange","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Leonora Carrington was a British-born Mexican artist and writer known for her surrealist works that often explore themes of magic, mythology, and the subconscious. Her paintings are characterized by fantastical creatures, dreamlike settings, and a unique blend of whimsy and mystery. Carrington's work is celebrated for its intricate detail, imaginative narratives, and its contribution to the surrealist movement.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style is a dark, highly textured painting populated by uncanny animal-human figures, ceremonial groups, and crowded fantastical tableaux. Muted earth, teal, and black tones are punctuated by strong red garments, while fine linear detail, visible brush texture, and starkly lit pale forms create an ominous, dreamlike intensity."},{"id":"gerrit-rietveld","name":"Gerrit Rietveld","cat":"architects","en":"Gerrit Rietveld","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerrit-rietveld.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerrit-rietveld","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","sculptural","patterns","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["silver","light-blue","beige","charcoal","brown","deep-red","yellow"],"intro":"Gerrit Rietveld is a renowned Dutch architect and designer, known for his contributions to the De Stijl movement and modern architecture. His work is characterized by its innovative use of geometric forms, primary colors, and a minimalist aesthetic. Rietveld's designs, such as the iconic Red and Blue Chair, exemplify his commitment to functionalism and simplicity, influencing modernist design principles.","observation":"The style uses crisp geometric architecture built from stacked cubic volumes, cantilevers, planar walls, and strongly orthogonal window grids. Bright primary-color accents contrast with white, black, and muted backgrounds, while clean drawn-like edges, hard shadows, and carefully arranged architectural details give the renders a polished illustrative quality."},{"id":"lisa-parker","name":"Lisa Parker","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lisa Parker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lisa-parker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lisa-parker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","muted-ochre","muted-blue","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Lisa Parker is a contemporary artist known for her enchanting fantasy illustrations that often feature mystical creatures and nature-inspired themes. Her work is celebrated for its detailed and imaginative depictions, drawing viewers into a world of magic and mystery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible painted texture with fine, controlled brushwork and densely layered natural and antique details. Dark blue-green woodland palettes, warm candlelit accents, and ornate objects create a mysterious storybook fantasy atmosphere populated by prominently posed animals and figures."},{"id":"monokubo","name":"Monokubo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Monokubo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/monokubo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/monokubo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","geometric"],"colours":["muted-orange","black","brown","white","grey","red"],"intro":"Monokubo is a contemporary illustrator known for creating whimsical and fantastical artworks that often incorporate elements of nature and mythology. Their work is characterized by a unique blend of detailed illustration and imaginative themes, drawing inspiration from both traditional and modern sources.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly detailed figurative tattoo imagery with expressive female faces, animals, skulls, and surreal graphic motifs. Fine ink contours, crosshatched shading, heavy black areas, and selective saturated red accents create an illustrative, high-impact appearance, while geometric shapes and collage-like overlaps add visual tension."},{"id":"jack-ziegler","name":"Jack Ziegler","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jack Ziegler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-ziegler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-ziegler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","scenes","urban","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing"],"colours":["muted-ochre","muted-cyan","charcoal","light-orange","vivid-red","red"],"intro":"Jack Ziegler is an American cartoonist known for his work in The New Yorker, where he contributed humorous and satirical cartoons for several decades. His style is characterized by a witty and whimsical approach to everyday situations, often incorporating a playful sense of humor and a keen observation of human nature.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense comic-like drawing with heavy black contours, vivid flat-to-lightly textured colors, and highly expressive grotesque characters and creatures. Elaborate urban and natural settings are packed with surreal details, distorted anatomy, oversized features, and energetic visual contrasts."},{"id":"henriette-ronner-knip","name":"Henriette Ronner-Knip","cat":"painters","en":"Henriette Ronner-Knip","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henriette-ronner-knip.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henriette-ronner-knip","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","portraits","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","white","muted-ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Henriette Ronner-Knip was a Dutch-Belgian painter known for her detailed and charming depictions of domestic animals, particularly cats. Born in 1821, she became one of the most celebrated animal painters of the 19th century, with her works often reflecting the intimate and playful nature of her subjects. Her paintings are characterized by their realistic and finely detailed style, capturing the essence of her animal subjects with warmth and affection.","observation":"The style presents cats in carefully arranged domestic portraits, rendered with visible oil-paint brushwork, rich fur texture, and softly modelled forms. Deep brown interiors, red upholstery, subdued warm colors, and dramatic shadow give all four images a moody, intimate character."},{"id":"brandon-kidwell","name":"Brandon Kidwell","cat":"photographers","en":"Brandon Kidwell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brandon-kidwell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brandon-kidwell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","portraits","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","dreamy","silhouette"],"colours":["black","white","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Brandon Kidwell is a contemporary photographer known for his conceptual and introspective works that often explore themes of identity and human connection. His real-life counterpart has gained recognition for his unique approach to photography, blending elements of surrealism and fine art to create thought-provoking images.","observation":"A monochrome double-exposure style combines stark profile silhouettes with forests, clouds, and distant solitary figures embedded inside the heads and bodies. High contrast, film grain, soft haze, and faded photographic layering create a surreal, introspective atmosphere across all four images."},{"id":"cicely-mary-barker","name":"Cicely Mary Barker","cat":"illustrators","en":"Cicely Mary Barker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cicely-mary-barker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cicely-mary-barker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-ochre","bone-white","muted-yellow","orange","red"],"intro":"Cicely Mary Barker was a renowned English illustrator best known for her enchanting illustrations of flower fairies. Born in 1895, she published numerous books featuring her delicate and imaginative depictions of fairies intertwined with botanical elements, capturing the imagination of children and adults alike.","observation":"The style combines finely drawn, storybook figures with lush botanical surroundings, using delicate contour lines, translucent watercolor-like washes, and visible textural brushwork. Repeated floral abundance, butterfly wings, soft woodland greens, and pastel pinks create an ornate, dreamy fantasy mood across the compositions."},{"id":"lee-mullican","name":"Lee Mullican","cat":"painters","en":"Lee Mullican","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-mullican.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-mullican","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","ornate","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-brown","beige","vivid-red","orange","blue"],"intro":"Lee Mullican is an American artist known for his contributions to the mid-20th century abstract expressionist movement. His work is characterized by intricate patterns, vibrant colors, and a unique blend of organic and geometric forms, often drawing inspiration from nature and cosmic themes.","observation":"The style combines dense, hand-painted surface texture with vivid red, orange, turquoise, and black contrasts. Abstract geometric and organic motifs⁠—especially circles, grids, radiating forms, and repeated patterns⁠—are layered into highly detailed compositions with strong drawn outlines and decorative, tactile surfaces."},{"id":"annette-schmucker","name":"Annette Schmucker","cat":"painters","en":"Annette Schmucker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/annette-schmucker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/annette-schmucker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","floral","landscapes","urban","glow","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","red","beige","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Annette Schmucker is a contemporary German artist known for her ethereal and dreamlike paintings that often blend realism with fantasy elements. Her work is characterized by a focus on delicate details and a vibrant color palette, often exploring themes of nature and introspection.","observation":"Across the floral and urban variations, the style uses saturated coral, red, turquoise, and violet with luminous internal highlights and deep contrasting passages. Visible brushwork, scraped texture, fine gestural lines, softened forms, and elongated reflections create an expressive, dreamlike fusion of recognizable subjects and abstraction."},{"id":"taylor-wessing","name":"Taylor Wessing","cat":"photographers","en":"Taylor Wessing","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/taylor-wessing.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/taylor-wessing","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","muted-green","grey","muted-ochre","dark-brown","silver","vivid-red"],"intro":"Taylor Wessing is a renowned international law firm known for its expertise in various legal fields, including intellectual property, technology, and media law. The firm has a strong presence in Europe and Asia, providing legal services to a diverse range of clients.","observation":"The style is photographic and portrait-driven, combining carefully posed figures with richly textured clothing, domestic interiors, and occasional street settings. Muted green and brown tones, soft selective focus, visible grain, and restrained cinematic lighting create a nostalgic, editorial atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"richard-doyle","name":"Richard Doyle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Richard Doyle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-doyle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-doyle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-ochre","brown","beige","bone-white","ochre","rust"],"intro":"Richard Doyle is a renowned 19th-century English illustrator known for his whimsical and detailed fairy tale illustrations. He was a significant figure in the Victorian era, contributing to the development of children's literature and fantasy art. Doyle's work often featured intricate designs, mythical creatures, and enchanting landscapes, capturing the imagination of both children and adults alike.","observation":"The style combines richly layered painted scenes with fine, visible brushwork, dense botanical detail, and vividly colored birds, animals, insects, and flowers. Natural-history observation is pushed into fantastical and surreal territory through hybrid creatures, theatrical human figures, and crowded storybook-like garden compositions."},{"id":"greg-nicotero","name":"Greg Nicotero","cat":"various-artists","en":"Greg Nicotero","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-nicotero.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-nicotero","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","muted-ochre","pale-orange"],"intro":"Greg Nicotero is a renowned American special effects creator, director, and producer, best known for his work in the horror genre. He has contributed significantly to the makeup and special effects industry, particularly in television series like \"The Walking Dead,\" where he has been instrumental in creating realistic and terrifying zombie effects.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, close-up character portraits of decayed humanoid creatures, with exceptionally detailed prosthetic textures, torn garments, tangled hair, and sculptural facial forms. Dark, subdued brown-green colors and strong directional lighting emphasize cavities, wrinkles, teeth, and wet-looking organic surfaces, while workshop and behind-the-scenes settings reinforce a practical-effects aesthetic."},{"id":"shawn-heinrichs","name":"Shawn Heinrichs","cat":"photographers","en":"Shawn Heinrichs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shawn-heinrichs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shawn-heinrichs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["dark-cyan","muted-cyan","dark-teal","muted-teal","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Shawn Heinrichs is a renowned conservationist, photographer, and filmmaker known for his work in ocean conservation. He has been instrumental in raising awareness about marine life and the threats it faces, often using his photography and film work to highlight the beauty and vulnerability of the ocean's inhabitants.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic underwater imagery with sharks presented in close, dramatic perspectives amid dense schools of fish and visible seabeds. Strong teal and blue water is punctuated by intense highlights and, in one variation, fiery orange illumination, while motion, suspended particles, and water-surface distortion create an immersive sense of depth and action."},{"id":"glenn-fabry","name":"Glenn Fabry","cat":"illustrators","en":"Glenn Fabry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/glenn-fabry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/glenn-fabry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","grey","vivid-red","dark-rust"],"intro":"Glenn Fabry is a renowned British comic book artist and illustrator, best known for his work on series such as \"Preacher\" and \"Hellblazer.\" His style is characterized by highly detailed and realistic depictions, often blending elements of horror and fantasy. Fabry's work is celebrated for its intricate linework and expressive character portrayals, making him a significant figure in the world of graphic novels.","observation":"The style combines heavily worked, expressive character portraiture with visible brush texture, fine drawn marks, and dense costume and anatomical detail. Dark blue-green shadows are set against intense orange-red grounds, producing high-contrast, moody horror-fantasy imagery across both painted and monochrome treatments."},{"id":"sabbas-apterus","name":"Sabbas Apterus","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sabbas Apterus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sabbas-apterus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sabbas-apterus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","black","brown","beige","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Sabbas Apterus is a fictional or conceptual artist known for a distinctive style that blends elements of fantasy and surrealism. The real-life counterpart of Sabbas Apterus may be an illustrator or digital artist whose work is characterized by dark, moody themes and intricate details, often exploring mythical and gothic subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, expressive portrait subjects are built from visible layered brushwork, with fine strokes shaping hair, skin, fabric, and smoke-like forms. Deep teal and black passages contrast with saturated coral, red, pink, and blue accents, producing a moody, fantastical atmosphere with richly textured surfaces and dramatic close framing."},{"id":"angus-mckie","name":"Angus McKie","cat":"illustrators","en":"Angus McKie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/angus-mckie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/angus-mckie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","grain","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","epic"],"colours":["brown","muted-blue","red","grey","pale-orange"],"intro":"Angus McKie is a renowned British illustrator known for his work in the science fiction genre, particularly during the 1970s and 1980s. His illustrations often feature futuristic and imaginative themes, characterized by detailed and vibrant depictions of spaceships, alien landscapes, and advanced technology. McKie's work has been influential in shaping the visual aesthetics of science fiction art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured painted surfaces with densely detailed alien landscapes and monumental retro-futurist architecture. Saturated orange, coral, and blue color contrasts, grainy print-like texture, dramatic scale, and tiny figures or vehicles create an epic, surreal science-fiction atmosphere."},{"id":"florence-knoll","name":"Florence Knoll","cat":"designers","en":"Florence Knoll","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/florence-knoll.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/florence-knoll","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","beige","muted-ochre","deep-red","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Florence Knoll is a renowned American architect and furniture designer, known for revolutionizing office interiors and modern furniture design in the mid-20th century. She played a pivotal role in the development of modernist design, blending architecture with furniture to create cohesive and functional spaces. Her work is characterized by clean lines, minimalist aesthetics, and a focus on functionality.","observation":"The style presents realistic, carefully detailed interior photographs of streamlined furniture in architectural settings. Strong geometric structure, balanced arrangements, hard sunlight, and pronounced cast shadows combine with restrained earth tones and occasional saturated upholstery, while tufting, chrome, and wood emphasize the furniture’s material solidity."},{"id":"daniel-kordan","name":"Daniel Kordan","cat":"photographers","en":"Daniel Kordan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daniel-kordan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daniel-kordan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","muted-blue","brown","light-blue","pale-red","rust"],"intro":"Daniel Kordan is a renowned photographer known for his breathtaking landscape photography that captures the beauty of nature in its most serene and majestic forms. His work often features remote and picturesque locations, showcasing his ability to blend natural light with stunning compositions.","observation":"The style presents expansive, highly realistic mountain landscapes with dense natural detail, dramatic cinematic skies, and carefully composed depth from foreground rocks or water to distant peaks. Moody blue, violet, and earthy tones are repeatedly punctuated by warm sunset light or small lantern glows, while mist and reflective water create an atmospheric, epic fantasy mood."},{"id":"jeanine-michna-bales","name":"Jeanine Michna-Bales","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jeanine Michna-Bales","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeanine-michna-bales.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeanine-michna-bales","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown"],"intro":"Jeanine Michna-Bales is an artist known for her evocative photography that explores themes of history, memory, and the unseen. Her work often delves into the hidden stories of the American landscape, capturing moments that are both haunting and beautiful.","observation":"The style is photographic and highly realistic, with densely rendered woodland vegetation, water, and tree textures. It consistently uses subdued, moody colors and strong night-time contrast, balancing deep forest shadows against glowing moonlight, stars, or warmly lit cabin windows in cinematic landscape compositions."},{"id":"alan-schaller","name":"Alan Schaller","cat":"photographers","en":"Alan Schaller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-schaller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-schaller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Alan Schaller is a contemporary photographer known for his striking black and white imagery that often explores themes of urban life and human solitude. His work is characterized by a strong use of contrast and light, creating dramatic and introspective compositions that capture the essence of modern cityscapes.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white architectural photography with severe tonal separation, hard shafts of sunlight, and deep shadow. Geometric concrete structures dominate the compositions, while small walking figures and their elongated shadows provide scale, movement, and a restrained cinematic tension."},{"id":"hikari-shimoda","name":"Hikari Shimoda","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hikari Shimoda","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hikari-shimoda.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hikari-shimoda","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["red","muted-cyan","muted-pink","charcoal","orange","green"],"intro":"Hikari Shimoda is a contemporary Japanese artist known for her unique blend of pop culture and fantasy elements, often exploring themes of childhood and innocence through her distinctive style. Her work frequently features childlike figures with large, expressive eyes, set against vibrant and surreal backgrounds.","observation":"The style uses intensely saturated, close-up character portraits rendered with visible layered brushwork and delicate directional strokes. Faces, hair, flowers, toys, stars, rainbows, and dripping paint are densely interwoven into surreal, emotionally charged compositions with luminous highlights and fantastical ornament."},{"id":"erwin-redl","name":"Erwin Redl","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Erwin Redl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erwin-redl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erwin-redl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","dark","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["deep-red","dark-red","black","vivid-red"],"intro":"Erwin Redl is an Austrian-born artist known for his innovative work with light and space. He explores the intersection of technology and art, creating immersive installations that challenge perceptions of space and reality. Redl's work often involves the use of LED lights to construct geometric forms that transform environments into dynamic, contemplative spaces.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive architectural interiors are defined by dense geometric grids of red point lights, reflective floors, and strong vanishing-point perspective. The realistic, cinematic treatment uses saturated crimson illumination, deep shadows, glowing light sources, and silhouetted visitors to create a dark futuristic exhibition atmosphere."},{"id":"julio-larraz","name":"Julio Larraz","cat":"painters","en":"Julio Larraz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julio-larraz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julio-larraz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-blue","silver","charcoal","blue","muted-blue","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Julio Larraz is a Cuban artist known for his surreal and often enigmatic paintings that blend elements of magical realism with contemporary themes. Born in Havana in 1944, Larraz's work is celebrated for its vivid use of color and meticulous attention to detail, often exploring themes of isolation, power, and the human condition.","observation":"Across all four renders, solitary white-clad figures occupy stark coastal settings dominated by deep blue water and sky, white surfaces, and broad areas of open space. Visible brushwork, textured paint, simplified monumental forms, and hard light create a restrained yet surreal, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"sylvain-sarrailh","name":"Sylvain Sarrailh","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sylvain Sarrailh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sylvain-sarrailh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sylvain-sarrailh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","painterly","light-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","blue","muted-blue","pale-orange","red"],"intro":"Sylvain Sarrailh is a contemporary artist known for his digital illustrations and concept art, often exploring themes of fantasy and science fiction. His work is characterized by vibrant colors, imaginative landscapes, and a sense of narrative depth.","observation":"These landscapes use luminous, saturated color and visible painterly texture to turn immense cloud banks, mountains, rivers, and flower fields into dreamy, fantastical vistas. Strong atmospheric perspective, glowing sunrise and sunset light, and tiny figures or settlements emphasize the grand scale across all four renders."},{"id":"edouard-cortes","name":"Edouard Cortes","cat":"painters","en":"Edouard Cortes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edouard-cortes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edouard-cortes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","black","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Edouard Cortes is known for his evocative paintings of Parisian street scenes, capturing the essence of the city through his impressionistic style. Born in France in 1882, Cortes became celebrated for his ability to depict the vibrant life and atmospheric conditions of Paris, often focusing on the interplay of light and shadow in urban settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a richly painterly urban tableau built from visible directional brushwork, softened edges, and dense architectural and street-level detail. Muted blue-grey air contrasts with warm orange window and lamp light, while rain, mist, reflective pavement, umbrellas, and autumn trees create a cinematic, atmospheric city mood."},{"id":"leni-riefenstahl","name":"Leni Riefenstahl","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Leni Riefenstahl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leni-riefenstahl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leni-riefenstahl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","epic"],"colours":["silver","black","charcoal","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Leni Riefenstahl was a German film director and photographer known for her pioneering work in the field of cinema, particularly during the 1930s and 1940s. She gained fame for her innovative techniques and controversial association with Nazi propaganda films, such as \"Triumph of the Will\" and \"Olympia.\" Her work is often studied for its artistic merit and technical prowess, despite the political implications.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome, high-contrast photographic imagery with pronounced film grain and cinematic staging. Portrait-like faces, monumental poses, flowing costumes, statuesque forms, and dramatic environmental compositions create an epic, theatrical mood."},{"id":"victor-enrich","name":"Victor Enrich","cat":"photographers","en":"Victor Enrich","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/victor-enrich.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/victor-enrich","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","motion","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["silver","muted-blue","charcoal","brown","beige","pale-orange"],"intro":"Victor Enrich is a contemporary Spanish artist known for his innovative architectural photography and digital manipulation. His work often explores the boundaries of reality and imagination, creating fantastical urban landscapes that challenge conventional perceptions of architecture.","observation":"The style presents photorealistic urban scenes in which familiar city architecture is dramatically warped, tilted, or collapsed into impossible structural forms. Crisp building detail, wide street views, strong perspective, and warm directional sunlight give the surreal distortions a convincing documentary-like physical presence."},{"id":"alex-strohl","name":"Alex Strohl","cat":"photographers","en":"Alex Strohl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-strohl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-strohl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","grey","muted-blue","silver","dark-rust"],"intro":"Alex Strohl is a renowned photographer known for his captivating landscape and adventure photography. His work often features remote and breathtaking natural settings, capturing the essence of exploration and solitude. Strohl's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey a sense of wonder and connection to the natural world.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic landscape photography with cool, subdued tones, deep atmospheric distance, and recurring mist or low cloud veiling the mountains. Vast alpine settings, reflective water, rugged rock, and tiny solitary figures create a moody sense of scale and quiet drama."},{"id":"dante-gabriel-rossetti","name":"Dante Gabriel Rossetti","cat":"painters","en":"Dante Gabriel Rossetti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dante-gabriel-rossetti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dante-gabriel-rossetti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","brown","muted-orange"],"intro":"Dante Gabriel Rossetti was a British painter, poet, and a founding member of the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood, a group that sought to revive the detail, color, and complexity of early Renaissance art. Born in 1828, Rossetti's work is characterized by its vivid colors, intricate details, and themes drawn from literature and mythology. His paintings often feature idealized, ethereal women, and he played a significant role in the Romantic movement in art.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, visibly painted surfaces with delicate directional brushwork, especially in the hair, leaves, and modeled faces. Dense overlapping portraits, dark leafy grounds, earthy reds and browns, and restrained highlights create an ornate, intimate, and classically styled atmosphere."},{"id":"francois-schuiten","name":"Francois Schuiten","cat":"illustrators","en":"Francois Schuiten","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francois-schuiten.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francois-schuiten","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","bone-white","ochre","dark-brown"],"intro":"Francois Schuiten is a Belgian comic book artist and illustrator known for his work in the graphic novel series 'Les Cités Obscures,' which explores intricate and fantastical urban landscapes. His style is characterized by detailed architectural drawings and a fascination with futuristic and surreal environments.","observation":"Across all four views, the style builds vast, impossible urban environments from sharply defined architectural forms, heavy linear contours, and dense repeating details. Strong warm-versus-cool color contrasts, dramatic shadowed arches, and monumental perspective make the scenes feel both richly illustrated and fantastical."},{"id":"jacques-callot","name":"Jacques Callot","cat":"printmakers","en":"Jacques Callot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacques-callot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacques-callot","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","classical","fantasy","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","cream","beige"],"intro":"Jacques Callot was a French printmaker and draftsman known for his detailed etchings and engravings. Born in 1592 in Nancy, France, Callot's work often depicted scenes of war, social life, and landscapes with a distinctive baroque style. His prints are characterized by intricate linework and a keen eye for detail, capturing the complexities of human experience and historical events.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome, sepia-toned ink drawing on aged paper, with delicate contour work and dense crosshatched shadows. It presents theatrical, ragged fantasy characters in posed groups and walking vignettes, framed like old illustrated plates with a strongly antique, storybook feeling."},{"id":"doug-aitken","name":"Doug Aitken","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Doug Aitken","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/doug-aitken.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/doug-aitken","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","dark-brown","pale-blue","red","deep-red"],"intro":"Doug Aitken is an American artist known for his innovative work in various media, including video, photography, sculpture, and installations. His art often explores themes of nature, technology, and the human experience, creating immersive environments that engage viewers in unique ways.","observation":"Across all four renders, photorealistic mountain landscapes are interrupted by stark, geometric mirror-clad structures that reflect and fragment the surrounding terrain. Saturated sunset and blue-hour color, strong tonal contrast, and monumental architectural forms create a surreal, futuristic atmosphere in otherwise remote natural settings."},{"id":"sigmar-polke","name":"Sigmar Polke","cat":"painters","en":"Sigmar Polke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sigmar-polke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sigmar-polke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage","ink","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","brown","black","olive","red","light-lime"],"intro":"Sigmar Polke is a renowned German artist known for his innovative and experimental approach to art, often blending various mediums and styles. Born in 1941, Polke's work spans painting, photography, and printmaking, characterized by a playful yet critical examination of consumer culture and mass media. His art often incorporates elements of pop art, conceptual art, and postmodernism, challenging traditional artistic boundaries.","observation":"The style combines heavily worked painterly surfaces with abstract, collage-like layering of dots, grids, drips, scratches, ink marks, and gestural brushwork. Strong black-and-cream contrasts are punctuated by saturated coral, blue, green, and orange, while botanical silhouettes and patterned fields recur as graphic overlays across the compositions."},{"id":"robert-motherwell","name":"Robert Motherwell","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Motherwell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-motherwell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-motherwell","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","muted-cyan","pale-orange"],"intro":"Robert Motherwell is a prominent American painter and printmaker, known for his significant contributions to the Abstract Expressionist movement. Born in 1915, he became a leading figure in the New York School, where his work was characterized by bold forms, expressive gestures, and a deep engagement with philosophical and literary themes. Motherwell's art often explored the tension between order and chaos, using a limited color palette and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four panels, saturated red, black, cream, and occasional blue are arranged in stark geometric blocks with heavy contrast. Large gestural black forms, rough brush edges, drips, scraped surfaces, and ink-like marks create an expressive abstract language that balances flat color fields with visibly worked paint."},{"id":"carmen-herrera","name":"Carmen Herrera","cat":"painters","en":"Carmen Herrera","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carmen-herrera.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carmen-herrera","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","patterns","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["cream","vivid-red","black","deep-blue","beige"],"intro":"Carmen Herrera is a Cuban-American painter known for her minimalist and geometric abstract works. Born in 1915, she gained recognition later in life for her precise and structured compositions, often utilizing bold colors and sharp lines. Her work is celebrated for its clarity and balance, reflecting influences from both Latin American and modernist art movements.","observation":"The style uses stark, hard-edged geometric fields arranged as diagonal wedges and bands, with large areas of saturated red, blue, black, and white. Clean flat-color shapes, strong contrast, and sparse compositions create a bold abstract graphic language across the canvases."},{"id":"ray-harryhausen","name":"Ray Harryhausen","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Ray Harryhausen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ray-harryhausen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ray-harryhausen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","beige","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Ray Harryhausen was a pioneering visual effects creator known for his groundbreaking work in stop-motion animation. His innovative techniques brought mythical creatures and epic battles to life in films such as \"Jason and the Argonauts\" and \"Clash of the Titans,\" leaving a lasting impact on the fantasy and adventure genres.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental reptilian creatures and tiny human figures are depicted in dense, dramatically staged environments of cliffs, water, smoke, and fortress ruins. The style combines visible broad painterly marks, dense textural detail, restrained sepia-blue coloring, and stark light-dark contrast for an expressive, cinematic sense of scale."},{"id":"bruce-weber","name":"Bruce Weber","cat":"photographers","en":"Bruce Weber","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruce-weber.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruce-weber","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","cinematic"],"colours":["grey","white","black","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Bruce Weber is an American fashion photographer and filmmaker known for his iconic black-and-white photographs. His work often features a blend of classic and contemporary styles, capturing the essence of American culture and fashion. Weber's images are celebrated for their intimate and romantic qualities, often portraying youthful beauty and natural settings.","observation":"A monochrome photographic style built around intimate, editorial portraits and character-driven scenes, with expressive faces, tactile clothing, and natural, unpolished environments. Fine grain, selective focus, soft daylight, and carefully composed close framing give the images a cinematic yet candid presence."},{"id":"ben-templesmith","name":"Ben Templesmith","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ben Templesmith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ben-templesmith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ben-templesmith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-green","deep-red","muted-green","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Ben Templesmith is an Australian comic book artist and writer, known for his work on titles such as \"30 Days of Night \" and \"Fell.\" His distinctive style often blends horror and fantasy elements, characterized by a unique approach to color and texture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly worked, directional paint with rough, layered surfaces and expressive marks. Dark teal, umber, rust, and ember-orange hues create brooding high-contrast portraits of uncanny robed figures, with internal firelight, smoke, and obscured faces reinforcing the ominous fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"horace-pippin","name":"Horace Pippin","cat":"painters","en":"Horace Pippin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/horace-pippin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/horace-pippin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","grey","beige","dark-brown","deep-red","yellow"],"intro":"Horace Pippin was an African American painter known for his works that often depicted scenes of everyday life, historical events, and personal experiences. Born in 1888, Pippin was largely self-taught and became recognized for his unique style that combined elements of folk art and social realism. His paintings often reflect his experiences as a soldier in World War I and his observations of African American life in the early 20th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, wintry landscapes are built from dense, delicate tree branches, dark figures and dogs, and carefully arranged rural or suburban settings. Visible brush texture and fine linear marks give the subdued blue-gray, brown, black, and snow-white palette a somber, nostalgic atmosphere, with occasional warm windows and red clothing as restrained accents."},{"id":"mao-hamaguchi","name":"Mao Hamaguchi","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mao Hamaguchi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mao-hamaguchi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mao-hamaguchi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-green","bone-white","beige","dark-brown","red","ochre"],"intro":"Mao Hamaguchi is a contemporary illustrator known for her ethereal and whimsical style, often incorporating elements of fantasy and surrealism. Her work is characterized by delicate linework, fine brushwork, and a dreamy atmosphere, often drawing inspiration from traditional Japanese motifs and modern surrealism.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, visible brushwork with close-up portraiture densely framed by flowers, foliage, patterned clothing, and small decorative objects. Saturated reds, greens, blues, and skin tones are set against deep shadows, creating an ornate, dreamlike and slightly uncanny botanical atmosphere."},{"id":"tithi-luadthong","name":"Tithi Luadthong","cat":"various-artists","en":"Tithi Luadthong","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tithi-luadthong.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tithi-luadthong","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-cyan","grey","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Tithi Luadthong is a contemporary artist known for his digital artworks that blend fantasy and surrealism. His work often features dreamlike landscapes and mystical themes, drawing inspiration from Southeast Asian culture and mythology.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured painterly surfaces with dense environmental detail and cinematic scene framing. Cool blue-green rain, mist, and shadow contrast with warm orange lamps and reflections, while small figures, umbrellas, foliage, and glowing lights create atmospheric narrative scenes."},{"id":"didier-lourenco","name":"Didier Lourenco","cat":"painters","en":"Didier Lourenco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/didier-lourenco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/didier-lourenco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","black","dark-red","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Didier Lourenco is a contemporary Spanish artist known for his distinctive style that combines elements of figurative and modernist art. His work often features elongated figures and stylized forms, drawing inspiration from Mediterranean life and landscapes. Lourenco's paintings are characterized by their rich color palettes and expressive compositions, capturing the essence of everyday life with a whimsical and introspective touch.","observation":"Across all four renders, elongated figures, angular faces, period clothing, and carefully arranged urban vignettes create a strongly illustrative yet visibly painted style. Fine dark contours, textured brushwork, restrained blue-gray and beige fields, and selective red or black accents unify the portraits, street scenes, bicycles, and musicians."},{"id":"catherine-hyde","name":"Catherine Hyde","cat":"illustrators","en":"Catherine Hyde","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/catherine-hyde.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/catherine-hyde","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","dark-brown","light-orange","orange"],"intro":"Catherine Hyde is a contemporary British artist known for her enchanting and atmospheric paintings that often explore themes of nature and mythology. Her work is characterized by a dreamlike quality, capturing the mystical essence of the natural world through her unique artistic style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses layered, visibly textured paint with fine marks to depict dark woodland scenes populated by animals and an occasional mysterious figure. Muted browns, blue-black shadows, and rusty orange light create a dreamy, folkloric atmosphere, while moonlit or sunset-lit focal points and dense bare branches add expressive, slightly uncanny drama."},{"id":"ray-johnson","name":"Ray Johnson","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ray Johnson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ray-johnson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ray-johnson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","vivid-red","orange","dark-green"],"intro":"Ray Johnson was an American artist known for his innovative work in collage and correspondence art, often considered a pioneer of the mail art movement. He was associated with the Neo-Dada and Pop Art movements, and his work frequently explored themes of identity, communication, and the blending of high and low culture.","observation":"A dense mixed-media collage style combines cropped photographic faces and hands with hand-drawn eyes, checkerboards, stripes, dots, and graphic geometric shapes. Strong black-and-cream contrast is interrupted by saturated coral, fluorescent pink, red, blue, and yellow, while torn edges, overlapping paper fragments, and varied printed textures create a tactile, assembled surface."},{"id":"miriam-schapiro","name":"Miriam Schapiro","cat":"painters","en":"Miriam Schapiro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/miriam-schapiro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/miriam-schapiro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","still-life","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","vivid-red","orange","dark-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Miriam Schapiro is a renowned artist known for her pioneering work in the feminist art movement and her contributions to the Pattern and Decoration art style. Born in Canada and later becoming a prominent figure in the United States, Schapiro's work often explores themes of femininity, identity, and cultural narratives. Her innovative use of collage and mixed media has made her a significant influence in contemporary art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely layered decorative motifs with vivid, strongly separated colors and crisp graphic shapes. Patchwork-like arrangements, textile patterns, florals, household objects, and geometric ornaments are flattened into an elaborate collage with high visual density and pronounced surface decoration."},{"id":"pol-ledent","name":"Pol Ledent","cat":"painters","en":"Pol Ledent","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pol-ledent.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pol-ledent","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["vivid-blue","blue","deep-blue","dark-blue","dark-green","ochre"],"intro":"Pol Ledent is a contemporary Belgian painter known for his vibrant and expressive landscapes. His work often features dynamic compositions and a rich color palette, capturing the essence of the European countryside with a modern impressionistic style.","observation":"These landscapes are built from visibly textured, energetic paint, with fine strokes, splatters, and layered marks describing grasses, flowers, cottages, and distant hills. A strongly blue, dreamlike atmosphere dominates all four views, punctuated by vivid orange flowers and occasional warm highlights."},{"id":"maria-lassnig","name":"Maria Lassnig","cat":"painters","en":"Maria Lassnig","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maria-lassnig.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maria-lassnig","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","sculptural","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","silver","grey","vivid-red","blue"],"intro":"Maria Lassnig was an Austrian painter known for her pioneering work in body awareness and self-portraiture. Her art often explored themes of identity, emotion, and the human condition, using vivid colors and expressive forms. Lassnig's work is celebrated for its introspective quality and its ability to convey deep psychological insights through visual means.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces are built from visible, directional paint strokes and raised-looking layers of pigment. Coral, pink, turquoise, orange, and green hues create vivid expressive color, while simplified yet volumetric facial planes keep the portraits recognizable without aiming for photorealism."},{"id":"andrew-salgado","name":"Andrew Salgado","cat":"painters","en":"Andrew Salgado","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrew-salgado.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrew-salgado","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-red","muted-red","black","bone-white","muted-blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Andrew Salgado is a contemporary Canadian artist known for his large-scale, expressive portraiture. His work often explores themes of identity, masculinity, and emotion, using bold colors and dynamic compositions to convey depth and intensity.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped human faces through thick, visibly layered paint, with energetic directional strokes breaking forms into angular color patches. Saturated reds, blues, and flesh tones create expressive, high-contrast portraits while retaining recognizable eyes, noses, mouths, and hair."},{"id":"albert-namatjira","name":"Albert Namatjira","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Namatjira","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-namatjira.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-namatjira","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","light-orange","brown","muted-blue","dark-red","orange"],"intro":"Albert Namatjira was a renowned Indigenous Australian artist, celebrated for his distinctive watercolor landscapes depicting the Australian outback. Born in 1902, he became one of the most famous Aboriginal artists, bridging cultural divides and bringing Indigenous art into the mainstream. His work is characterized by its vivid portrayal of the Australian landscape, capturing the unique light and color of the desert environment.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive mountain landscapes are depicted with strongly visible, broad, directional brushwork and a richly textured painted surface. Saturated rust, ochre, blue, cream, and green create high-contrast scenes, while crisp illustrative forms and abundant terrain and vegetation details give the vistas a carefully composed, storybook-like clarity."},{"id":"elena-kalis","name":"Elena Kalis","cat":"photographers","en":"Elena Kalis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elena-kalis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elena-kalis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","bone-white","muted-ochre","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Elena Kalis is a contemporary photographer known for her captivating underwater photography. Her work often features dreamlike and surreal elements, blending reality with fantasy to create ethereal and whimsical images. Kalis's photography explores themes of nature, innocence, and the mythical, often capturing subjects in fluid and dynamic underwater settings.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic underwater imagery, combining fashion-like figures and flowing garments with koi, rippling water, and submerged architectural spaces. Strong shafts of light, reflective distortions, selective focus, and vivid teal, white, orange, and red accents create a dreamy, surreal atmosphere of suspended motion."},{"id":"bill-bell","name":"Bill Bell","cat":"painters","en":"Bill Bell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-bell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-bell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","patterns","motion","painterly","vivid-colors","religious","epic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["muted-blue","dark-green","beige","dark-brown","white","rust"],"intro":"Bill Bell is an artist known for his whimsical and detailed illustrations, often depicting fantastical and surreal scenes. His work is characterized by a rich use of color and intricate detailing, creating immersive and imaginative worlds that captivate viewers.","observation":"These images use richly layered, visibly painted surfaces with saturated jewel-like color, dense ornament, and countless architectural, botanical, celestial, and mythic details. Monumental landscapes and symbolic figures are organized into sweeping circular, radial, and geometric compositions, giving the style an epic, sacred, visionary character."},{"id":"michael-leunig","name":"Michael Leunig","cat":"illustrators","en":"Michael Leunig","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-leunig.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-leunig","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","negative-space"],"colours":["blue","charcoal","muted-blue","dark-blue","dark-red","red","orange","olive"],"intro":"Michael Leunig is an Australian cartoonist, writer, painter, philosopher, and poet, known for his whimsical and thought-provoking cartoons. His work often features simple line drawings and explores themes of spirituality, humanity, and the absurdity of modern life. Leunig's cartoons have been published in various newspapers and books, making him a beloved figure in Australian culture.","observation":"These images use visibly built-up, scratchy paint with broad expressive marks, dense speckling, and strong outlines to create richly textured surfaces. Saturated blue, red, orange, and green forms stand sharply against large areas of sky, while oversized whimsical animals, distorted anatomy, and glowing celestial elements give the scenes a surreal, fantastical character."},{"id":"tom-gauld","name":"Tom Gauld","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tom Gauld","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-gauld.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-gauld","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","pale-orange","black","beige","brown"],"intro":"Tom Gauld is a British cartoonist and illustrator known for his distinctive style that combines humor, wit, and a minimalist approach. His work often appears in publications like The Guardian and The New Yorker, where he creates cartoons that explore themes of literature, science, and modern life with a unique blend of simplicity and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome black-and-cream illustration with dense fine linework, crosshatching, and strongly outlined forms. Surreal scenes pair immense creatures or landscapes with tiny figures, creating an ominous, dreamlike sense of scale against sparse pale spaces."},{"id":"naeem-khan","name":"Naeem Khan","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Naeem Khan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/naeem-khan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/naeem-khan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","metallic","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","black","ochre","dark-brown"],"intro":"Naeem Khan is a renowned Indian-American fashion designer known for his intricate and luxurious designs, often seen on red carpets and high-profile events. His work is celebrated for its rich embellishments, vibrant colors, and cultural influences, making him a prominent figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic couture fashion photography, with models posed on a runway in elaborate floor-length garments. Dense lace, embroidery, fringe, floral appliqué, and gold detailing create an ornate, richly textured surface, while subdued warm lighting, dark backdrops, and selective focus give the images a polished editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"trent-parke","name":"Trent Parke","cat":"photographers","en":"Trent Parke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/trent-parke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/trent-parke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Trent Parke is an acclaimed Australian photographer known for his innovative and evocative approach to street photography. He is a member of the prestigious Magnum Photos agency and has gained recognition for his ability to capture the essence of urban life through his lens. Parke's work often explores themes of memory, identity, and the passage of time, using a distinctive black-and-white style that emphasizes contrast and mood.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is monochrome, high-contrast street photography with cinematic framing, strong backlighting, deep silhouettes, and pronounced grain. Wet urban settings, fog, motion blur, and anonymous pedestrians create a nocturnal, atmospheric documentary feel."},{"id":"elizabeth-peyton","name":"Elizabeth Peyton","cat":"painters","en":"Elizabeth Peyton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elizabeth-peyton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elizabeth-peyton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","bone-white","orange","dark-brown","red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Elizabeth Peyton is an American contemporary artist known for her intimate and expressive portraits of friends, celebrities, and historical figures. Her work often captures the emotional and personal aspects of her subjects, using a style that blends realism with romanticism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses tightly cropped character portraits with vigorous, visibly directional paint marks and fine linear accents defining hair, eyes, and facial features. Saturated reds, blacks, warm skin tones, and occasional blue highlights create a high-contrast, expressive editorial look, with clothing and floral backdrops treated as bold painted shapes."},{"id":"jim-steranko","name":"Jim Steranko","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jim Steranko","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-steranko.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-steranko","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","collage","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","charcoal","vivid-red","muted-orange","blue","deep-red"],"intro":"Jim Steranko is an American artist known for his innovative work in the comic book industry, particularly during the 1960s. He is celebrated for his contributions to Marvel Comics, where he brought a dynamic and cinematic style to titles such as 'Nick Fury, Agent of S.H.I.E.L.D.' and 'Captain America.' Steranko's work is characterized by bold graphics, surreal imagery, and a distinctive use of color and composition that has influenced generations of artists.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily inked comic-book figures with thick contour lines, dense crosshatching, and aggressively simplified blocks of saturated red, blue, and black. Collaged newspaper textures, paint splatters, urban fragments, and dramatic masked or sunglassed characters create a confrontational graphic-poster atmosphere."},{"id":"jonathan-adler","name":"Jonathan Adler","cat":"designers","en":"Jonathan Adler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jonathan-adler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jonathan-adler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","metallic","vivid-colors","retro","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["white","silver","muted-ochre","muted-cyan","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Jonathan Adler is an American designer known for his eclectic and vibrant approach to interior design and home decor. He gained prominence for his pottery and expanded his brand to include furniture, lighting, and accessories, characterized by a playful yet sophisticated aesthetic. His work often features bold colors, geometric patterns, and a mix of modern and retro influences, making him a notable figure in contemporary design.","observation":"The style combines polished, realistic interior photography with sculptural, highly decorative furniture and ceramic objects. Geometric forms, repeated face and eye motifs, saturated blue and red accents, glossy white surfaces, and reflective gold details create a theatrical retro-modern presentation."},{"id":"raymond-loewy","name":"Raymond Loewy","cat":"designers","en":"Raymond Loewy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raymond-loewy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raymond-loewy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","scenes","urban","painterly","vivid-colors","sci-fi","retro"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-cyan","dark-brown","muted-orange","grey","orange"],"intro":"Raymond Loewy was a French-born American industrial designer, widely recognized for his pioneering work in streamlining and modernizing everyday objects. His designs spanned various industries, including automotive, aviation, and consumer goods, leaving a lasting impact on 20th-century design aesthetics. Loewy's work is characterized by sleek, aerodynamic forms and a futuristic vision that helped shape the modern landscape of design.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured painted surfaces with crisp illustrative architecture, streamlined cars, and densely constructed urban scenes. Saturated skies, coral and turquoise accents, reflective water, and dramatic sweeping curves create a cinematic retro-futurist vision of mid-century modern life."},{"id":"sally-storch","name":"Sally Storch","cat":"painters","en":"Sally Storch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sally-storch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sally-storch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","deep-red","pale-orange"],"intro":"Sally Storch is an American painter known for her evocative depictions of urban life and intimate scenes. Her work often captures the quiet moments of everyday life, focusing on the interplay of light and shadow to create a sense of nostalgia and reflection. Storch's paintings are characterized by their detailed realism and narrative quality, drawing viewers into the stories of her subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, layered brushwork to depict richly observed diner interiors and small human interactions. Dark green, brown, red, and ochre tones dominate, with strong window and lamp light creating cinematic contrast, period atmosphere, and expressive surface texture."},{"id":"arthur-sarnoff","name":"Arthur Sarnoff","cat":"illustrators","en":"Arthur Sarnoff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-sarnoff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-sarnoff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["charcoal","ochre","dark-brown","red","light-orange","grey"],"intro":"Arthur Sarnoff was a prominent American illustrator known for his work in advertising and magazine covers during the mid-20th century. His illustrations often depicted everyday life with a touch of humor and charm, capturing the essence of American culture during the 1950s and 1960s. Sarnoff's work is characterized by its vivid colors, detailed rendering, and a playful, nostalgic tone that resonated with audiences of his time.","observation":"The style combines visible, directional brushwork with polished figurative illustration, dense facial and clothing detail, and strongly posed characters. Saturated reds, corals, creams, greens, and blues are arranged with sharp tonal contrasts in tightly cropped, narrative scenes of midcentury travel and social life."},{"id":"paul-caponigro","name":"Paul Caponigro","cat":"photographers","en":"Paul Caponigro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-caponigro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-caponigro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Paul Caponigro is an American photographer known for his black-and-white landscape photography, often capturing the mystical and serene qualities of nature. His work is characterized by a deep connection to the natural world, and he is celebrated for his ability to convey the spiritual essence of his subjects through his lens.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white imagery with heavy grain, deep shadows, and sharply separated highlights. Natural landscapes, windswept trees, silhouettes, and a weathered human face are treated with dramatic photographic realism and recurring double-exposure-like overlays, creating a bleak, expressive mood."},{"id":"john-james-audubon","name":"John James Audubon","cat":"illustrators","en":"John James Audubon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-james-audubon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-james-audubon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","floral","landscapes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","muted-ochre","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"John James Audubon was a 19th-century American ornithologist, naturalist, and painter known for his extensive studies and illustrations of North American birds. His most famous work, \"The Birds of America,\" is celebrated for its detailed and lifelike depictions of avian species, contributing significantly to ornithology and natural history.","observation":"The style combines richly painted, highly realistic birds and flowers with dense botanical layering and finely observed plumage, petals, leaves, and branches. Saturated pinks, whites, greens, and blue sky create an ornate, classical natural-history tableau with dramatic overlapping forms and varied landscape glimpses."},{"id":"anna-maria-garthwaite","name":"Anna Maria Garthwaite","cat":"designers","en":"Anna Maria Garthwaite","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anna-maria-garthwaite.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anna-maria-garthwaite","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","light-orange","ochre","orange","dark-red","brown"],"intro":"Anna Maria Garthwaite was an influential 18th-century English textile designer known for her intricate floral patterns and contributions to the silk industry in Spitalfields, London. Her work is celebrated for its detailed and naturalistic depiction of botanical elements, which were often used in the production of luxurious silk fabrics.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed botanical illustration with visible fine linear rendering and softly layered, painterly color. Dense floral sprays, birds, branching stems, ornamental borders, and woven fabric texture create an ornate repeating textile pattern on a restrained cream ground."},{"id":"andrew-read","name":"Andrew Read","cat":"painters","en":"Andrew Read","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrew-read.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrew-read","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-orange","beige","white","dark-brown","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Andrew Read is an artist known for his intricate and detailed fantasy and gothic-inspired works. His style often incorporates elements of mythology and medieval themes, drawing on historical and fantastical subjects to create dramatic and expressive pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is highly realistic black-and-white drawing, built from dense fine lines, crosshatching, and carefully modelled tonal contrast. It emphasizes close-up portraits of faces and animals, with exceptionally detailed fur, hair, skin, and facial features on white paper."},{"id":"paula-scher","name":"Paula Scher","cat":"designers","en":"Paula Scher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paula-scher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paula-scher","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","letters","patterns","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["black","bone-white","vivid-red","dark-blue","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Paula Scher is a renowned American graphic designer and artist, celebrated for her innovative approach to typography and visual communication. She has been a pivotal figure in the design world, known for her bold and impactful designs that often incorporate elements of pop culture and urban landscapes. Scher's work spans various mediums, including print, branding, and environmental graphics, and she has been influential in shaping contemporary design aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines oversized graphic letterforms with dense abstract patterning, layered blocks, and fragmented collage-like surfaces. Saturated primary and fluorescent hues are set against black, white, and distressed textures, with heavy outlined shapes, flat color areas, and energetic painted marks creating a bold, high-contrast composition."},{"id":"arthur-dove","name":"Arthur Dove","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur Dove","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-dove.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-dove","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","landscapes","still-life","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","bone-white","orange","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Arthur Dove is considered one of the first American abstract painters, known for his innovative use of color and form to depict nature. Born in 1880, Dove's work often explored the relationship between organic forms and abstract shapes, making him a key figure in early American modernism. His approach was characterized by a focus on the spiritual and symbolic aspects of the natural world, using abstraction to convey his vision.","observation":"Across the four images, simplified landscapes and a vessel arrangement are built from large geometric shapes, dark silhouettes, and strongly contrasting navy, cream, rust, and orange areas. Visible broad brushwork and cracked, tactile paint surfaces give the graphic compositions an expressive, hand-painted character while retaining clear illustrative edges."},{"id":"naoto-hattori","name":"Naoto Hattori","cat":"painters","en":"Naoto Hattori","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/naoto-hattori.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/naoto-hattori","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["ochre","dark-ochre","yellow","dark-brown","black"],"intro":"Naoto Hattori is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his surreal and fantastical paintings. His work often features dreamlike scenes with intricate details and imaginative characters, blending elements of pop surrealism and lowbrow art. Hattori's unique style has garnered international recognition and a dedicated following.","observation":"The style presents surreal character portraits and creature busts as highly intricate, sculptural objects, with layered organic ornament, shells, tendrils, eyes, and finely modeled textures covering their surfaces. Restrained earthy greens, ochres, creams, and copper tones unify the sheet, while close cropping and expressive oversized eyes create an uncanny, fantastical presence."},{"id":"john-anster-fitzgerald","name":"John Anster Fitzgerald","cat":"painters","en":"John Anster Fitzgerald","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-anster-fitzgerald.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-anster-fitzgerald","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","motion","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","dark-green","beige","silver","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"John Anster Fitzgerald was a 19th-century English painter known for his fantastical and fairy-themed artworks. He was a prominent figure in the Victorian era, celebrated for his intricate and imaginative depictions of mythical creatures and dreamlike landscapes. Fitzgerald's work is characterized by its detailed and whimsical style, often exploring themes of fantasy and the supernatural.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly textured, gestural paintwork with densely layered flowers, foliage, birds, and fantastical garden settings. Saturated jewel tones are balanced by deep greens and atmospheric haze, while ornate natural detail, luminous openings, and lively flying creatures create a lush, dreamy, epic mood."},{"id":"jesper-ejsing","name":"Jesper Ejsing","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jesper Ejsing","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jesper-ejsing.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jesper-ejsing","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","brown","charcoal","silver","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Jesper Ejsing is a Danish illustrator known for his vibrant and detailed fantasy artwork. His work often features mythical creatures, epic battles, and richly textured environments, drawing inspiration from folklore and fantasy literature. Ejsing's illustrations have been widely recognized in the gaming and publishing industries, particularly for his contributions to role-playing games and fantasy book covers.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly broad, energetic brushstrokes to build richly textured fantasy characters, beasts, clothing, rock, ice, and sky. Saturated blues, reds, ochres, and earthy browns support dramatic action-filled compositions with monumental creatures and heroic figures."},{"id":"thomas-dodd","name":"Thomas Dodd","cat":"photographers","en":"Thomas Dodd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-dodd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-dodd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","floral","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","orange","grey","rust"],"intro":"Thomas Dodd is a contemporary photographer known for his ethereal and surreal imagery. His work often blends elements of fantasy and reality, creating dreamlike portraits that explore themes of mythology and symbolism. Dodd's photography is characterized by its painterly quality, achieved through digital manipulation and layering techniques.","observation":"The style uses intimate close-up portraits with visible painterly texture, delicate brushwork, and softly blended edges. Warm, subdued colors, deep backgrounds, glowing skin, windswept hair, flowers, and ornate clothing create a dreamy, emotionally charged atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"rene-gruau","name":"Rene Gruau","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rene Gruau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rene-gruau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rene-gruau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","fashion","portraits","bold-lines","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","retro","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["white","cream","black","dark-red","orange","deep-green"],"intro":"Rene Gruau was a renowned Italian-born fashion illustrator, celebrated for his elegant and bold illustrations that defined mid-20th-century fashion advertising. His work is characterized by a distinctive use of color, dramatic lines, and a flair for capturing the essence of haute couture. Gruau's illustrations graced the pages of leading fashion magazines and were pivotal in shaping the visual language of fashion illustration.","observation":"The style combines expressive fashion illustration with loose, visible brushwork, economical fine contours, and bold blocks of saturated red, black, and occasional green. Elongated female figures, glamorous clothing, dramatic hats and accessories are isolated against generous cream or white negative space, creating a retro editorial feel."},{"id":"lisa-pressman","name":"Lisa Pressman","cat":"painters","en":"Lisa Pressman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lisa-pressman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lisa-pressman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","ornate","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","light-yellow","red","ochre","muted-teal","charcoal","dark-blue"],"intro":"Lisa Pressman is a contemporary American artist known for her abstract and expressive paintings. Her work often explores themes of memory and emotion through layered textures and vibrant colors.","observation":"These abstract compositions combine saturated blocks of turquoise, coral, red, ochre, pink, and blue with dense, layered paint textures. Broad gestural strokes, drips, scratches, thin linear marks, geometric fragments, and recurring circles create an energetic, richly worked surface across all four renders."},{"id":"steve-rude","name":"Steve Rude","cat":"illustrators","en":"Steve Rude","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-rude.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-rude","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","deep-red","bone-white","vivid-red","dark-blue","green"],"intro":"Steve Rude is an American comic book artist and illustrator known for his work on titles such as \"Nexus\" and \"The Moth.\" His style is characterized by a blend of classic comic book aesthetics and fine art techniques, often drawing inspiration from the Golden and Silver Ages of comics. Rude's work is celebrated for its dynamic compositions, vibrant color palettes, and expressive character portrayals.","observation":"The style combines graphic-comic illustration with visible painted texture, thick contouring, sharply modeled faces, and forceful blocks of saturated red, blue, green, and magenta. Across the portraits and character groupings, deep shadows and selective highlights create a dark, theatrical retro-noir intensity."},{"id":"jmw-turner","name":"J.M.W. Turner","cat":"painters","en":"J.M.W. Turner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jmw-turner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jmw-turner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["beige","orange","dark-brown","black","rust"],"intro":"J.M.W. Turner was a renowned British painter known for his expressive and atmospheric landscapes and seascapes. Born in 1775, he became a leading figure in the Romantic movement, celebrated for his innovative use of light and color. Turner's work often depicted the power and beauty of nature, capturing the sublime and dramatic interplay of light, weather, and landscape.","observation":"Across all four renders, atmospheric landscapes and harbor scenes dissolve into broad, visible paint strokes, textured surfaces, and softened edges. Dark smoky skies are punctuated by intense orange light sources whose reflections stretch across the water, creating a brooding, monumental mood."},{"id":"howard-chaykin","name":"Howard Chaykin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Howard Chaykin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howard-chaykin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howard-chaykin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","light-orange","rust","brown","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Howard Chaykin is a renowned American comic book artist and writer, known for his innovative storytelling and distinctive visual style. Emerging in the 1970s, Chaykin gained prominence with works like \"American Flagg!\" and \"The Shadow,\" which showcased his ability to blend genres and push the boundaries of traditional comic narratives. His influence on the industry is notable, with a career spanning several decades and a legacy of inspiring future generations of comic creators.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines expressive painted brushwork with comic-book composition, heavy contour lines, and dense hatching. Saturated reds and blues are set against deep blacks, producing high-contrast portraits and character scenes with a gritty, dramatic graphic-novel feel."},{"id":"dan-clowes","name":"Dan Clowes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dan Clowes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-clowes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-clowes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro"],"colours":["light-orange","black","muted-cyan","muted-brown","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"Dan Clowes is an American cartoonist and illustrator known for his work in the alternative comics scene. He gained prominence with his comic book series \"Eightball\" and graphic novels like \"Ghost World,\" which was adapted into a film. Clowes's work often explores themes of alienation, identity, and suburban life, characterized by a distinctive drawing style and satirical tone.","observation":"The style uses strongly outlined, flat-color comic illustration with saturated retro hues, dense cross-line texture, and heavy dark accents. Cropped portrait compositions, expressive faces, period clothing, and occasional narrative settings create a polished vintage graphic-novel feel across the sheet."},{"id":"brothers-hildebrandt","name":"Brothers Hildebrandt","cat":"illustrators","en":"Brothers Hildebrandt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brothers-hildebrandt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brothers-hildebrandt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","muted-magenta","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Brothers Hildebrandt is a renowned duo of American artists known for their iconic fantasy illustrations, particularly in the realm of science fiction and fantasy art. They gained fame for their work on ' The Lord of the Rings ' calendars and various other fantasy projects, leaving a lasting impact on the genre with their detailed and imaginative style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly fantasy environments with dense natural and architectural detail. Deep blue-violet shadows contrast with vivid orange firelight and sunset, while hooded figures, monumental trees, mountain terrain, and glowing gateways create a dramatic sense of adventure and movement."},{"id":"scott-naismith","name":"Scott Naismith","cat":"painters","en":"Scott Naismith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/scott-naismith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/scott-naismith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","red","light-blue","orange","charcoal","pale-orange"],"intro":"Scott Naismith is a contemporary Scottish artist known for his vibrant and expressive landscape paintings. His work often explores the dynamic interplay of light and color, drawing inspiration from the dramatic skies and coastal scenes of Scotland. Naismith's approach combines traditional techniques with a modern sensibility, resulting in pieces that are both visually striking and emotionally resonant.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive coastal landscapes are built from visible, broad, directional brushwork and richly layered paint. Highly saturated oranges, pinks, blues, and violets create expressive sunset light, glowing reflections, and a dreamy atmosphere around the mountainous horizons and turbulent clouds."},{"id":"leroy-grannis","name":"LeRoy Grannis","cat":"photographers","en":"LeRoy Grannis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leroy-grannis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leroy-grannis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","motion","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","bone-white","grey","silver","dark-brown","muted-ochre"],"intro":"LeRoy Grannis is renowned for his iconic surf photography, capturing the essence of the California surf scene during the 1960s. His work is celebrated for its vibrant portrayal of surf culture, documenting the energy and spirit of the era. Grannis's images are characterized by their dynamic compositions, often featuring surfers in action against the backdrop of the ocean.","observation":"The style uses realistic, filmic ocean imagery with dramatic wave scale, energetic action, and warm vintage color grading. Strong teal water, amber highlights, visible grain, and carefully framed human or vehicle scale create a nostalgic yet epic coastal-surf atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"bjarke-ingels","name":"Bjarke Ingels","cat":"architects","en":"Bjarke Ingels","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bjarke-ingels.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bjarke-ingels","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","symmetry"],"colours":["muted-blue","black","dark-blue","bone-white","brown","pale-blue"],"intro":"Bjarke Ingels is a Danish architect known for his innovative and sustainable design approach. He is the founder of the Bjarke Ingels Group (BIG), a Copenhagen and New York-based group of architects, designers, and builders. Ingels is recognized for integrating sustainable development with bold, contemporary architecture, often characterized by playful and practical designs.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic architectural scenes with monumental futuristic buildings arranged along waterfronts. Cool blue dusk, warm interior illumination, reflective water, and strong geometric massing create a cinematic, atmospheric contrast across both urban and snowy settings."},{"id":"jackie-morris","name":"Jackie Morris","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jackie Morris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jackie-morris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jackie-morris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["ochre","black","brown","pale-yellow","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Jackie Morris is a British illustrator and author known for her enchanting and detailed artwork, often inspired by nature and mythology. Her work is celebrated for its ability to evoke a sense of wonder and connection to the natural world, often featuring animals and mythical creatures.","observation":"The style combines richly layered, visibly painted animal portraits with delicate fine brushwork, intricate botanical ornament, and softly aged, earthy colors. Animals are posed dramatically against decorative grounds, with flowing fur and manes, floral garlands, and occasional gold-toned surfaces giving the images a romantic, fantastical, classically decorative character."},{"id":"james-nizam","name":"James Nizam","cat":"photographers","en":"James Nizam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-nizam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-nizam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","scenes","urban","glow","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","black","white","grey"],"intro":"James Nizam is a contemporary artist known for his innovative use of light and space in photography. His work often explores architectural forms and the manipulation of light, creating surreal and thought-provoking images that challenge perceptions of reality.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses monochrome, high-contrast photographic compositions with deep shadows and intensely luminous architectural or technological elements. Surreal installations, solitary figures, geometric structures, mist, and isolated light sources create a dark, cinematic dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"lori-earley","name":"Lori Earley","cat":"painters","en":"Lori Earley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lori-earley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lori-earley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","silver","muted-blue","black","dark-blue"],"intro":"Lori Earley is a contemporary artist known for her unique blend of surrealism and portraiture. Her work often features elongated figures and expressive eyes, creating a distinctive style that has captivated audiences worldwide. Earley's paintings explore themes of beauty, emotion, and fantasy, often incorporating elements of gothic and pop surrealism.","observation":"The style presents ethereal female portraits with exceptionally smooth, finely rendered faces, flowing hair, elaborate lace garments, and oversized floral adornments. Cool blue-gray and ivory tones create a dreamy, subdued atmosphere, while delicate brushwork and dense ornamental details give the imagery a romantic fantasy character."},{"id":"arthur-hughes","name":"Arthur Hughes","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur Hughes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-hughes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-hughes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-ochre","dark-red","ochre","beige"],"intro":"Arthur Hughes was a British painter associated with the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood, known for his romantic and detailed depictions of nature and figures. Born in 1832, Hughes's work often featured themes of beauty and innocence, with a focus on intricate detail and vibrant color. His paintings are celebrated for their dreamlike quality and emotional depth, capturing the essence of the Victorian era.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, visible brushwork to create highly detailed portraits of red-haired women surrounded by dense foliage, flowers, and occasional medieval architecture. Deep earthy reds, greens, and blues, ornate patterned clothing, soft faces, and storybook woodland settings give the images a romantic, dreamy, classical-fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"gris-grimly","name":"Gris Grimly","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gris Grimly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gris-grimly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gris-grimly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-green","muted-ochre","pale-yellow","dark-olive","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Gris Grimly is an American illustrator and author known for his distinctive gothic and whimsical style, often drawing inspiration from classic horror and fairy tales. His work is characterized by dark humor, intricate details, and a unique blend of the macabre and the fantastical.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely detailed, hand-rendered fantasy scenes with fine ink-like linework, weathered textures, and expressive, elongated figures. Muted teal, ochre, rust, and charcoal tones create a gloomy storybook atmosphere, while crooked architecture, tangled vegetation, eccentric costumes, and strange animal companions give the imagery a surreal folkloric character."},{"id":"maggie-taylor","name":"Maggie Taylor","cat":"various-artists","en":"Maggie Taylor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maggie-taylor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maggie-taylor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["muted-green","black","dark-olive","silver","muted-olive","dark-red"],"intro":"Maggie Taylor is an American artist known for her distinctive digital collages that blend photography and surrealism. Her works often explore themes of memory, dreams, and the passage of time, creating whimsical and thought-provoking images.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, old-fashioned portraiture with visible painterly texture, subdued blue-green and brown tones, and recurring black birds, formal clothing, and windswept rural settings. Its carefully composed figures and uncanny animal pairings create a dark, melancholic, subtly surreal atmosphere across both close portraits and narrative scenes."},{"id":"alyssa-monks","name":"Alyssa Monks","cat":"painters","en":"Alyssa Monks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alyssa-monks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alyssa-monks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","painterly","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["beige","silver","black","brown","muted-rust","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Alyssa Monks is a contemporary American painter known for her hyperrealistic portraits that often incorporate water and glass to create a sense of distortion and intimacy. Her work explores themes of identity, emotion, and the human experience, using oil paint to achieve a striking level of detail and realism.","observation":"The style presents intensely cropped, near-photorealistic faces with highly visible skin, hair, water, and droplet detail. Cool, restrained colors, dramatic contrast, and tactile painterly marks create an intimate, emotionally charged effect, while the fragmented multi-face arrangements lend the portraits a surreal quality."},{"id":"gaston-le-touche","name":"Gaston Le Touche","cat":"painters","en":"Gaston Le Touche","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gaston-le-touche.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gaston-le-touche","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","deep-rust","rust","beige"],"intro":"Gaston Le Touche was a French painter known for his Impressionist style, focusing on intimate social gatherings and elegant scenes. His works often depicted the leisurely life of the Belle Époque, capturing moments of joy and tranquility with a delicate touch.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured painterly surfaces, visible fine strokes, and expressive but recognizable figures in intimate social interiors. Deep green-brown shadows are set against concentrated amber and orange candlelight, with strong internal light sources and dramatic silhouettes creating a dark, atmospheric mood."},{"id":"chris-burkard","name":"Chris Burkard","cat":"photographers","en":"Chris Burkard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-burkard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-burkard","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-cyan","grey","muted-blue","silver","orange","ochre"],"intro":"Chris Burkard is a renowned American photographer known for his stunning landscape and adventure photography. His work often captures the beauty and power of nature, focusing on remote and rugged environments. Burkard's photography is celebrated for its vivid colors, dynamic compositions, and the ability to evoke a sense of awe and adventure.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic landscape photography with dramatic coastal and alpine vistas, often placing a tiny solitary person against monumental terrain. Cool blue and slate tones are balanced by warm sunrise or sunset light, with strong tonal contrast, atmospheric skies, reflective water, and selective focus creating an epic, moody sense of scale."},{"id":"shigeru-ban","name":"Shigeru Ban","cat":"architects","en":"Shigeru Ban","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shigeru-ban.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shigeru-ban","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","backlighting","glow","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","ochre","silver","light-orange","beige"],"intro":"Shigeru Ban is a renowned Japanese architect known for his innovative use of materials and commitment to sustainable design. He gained international recognition for his work with paper and cardboard tubes, creating structures that are both functional and environmentally friendly. Ban's approach often emphasizes simplicity, elegance, and a deep respect for nature, making him a prominent figure in contemporary architecture.","observation":"The style presents expansive, realistic architectural interiors with highly detailed timber lattices, repeating geometric openings, and monumental branching arches. Warm natural wood, abundant glazing, strong sunlight, and deep perspective create a bright cinematic atmosphere, while the recurring structural patterns give the spaces a sculptural and ornate character."},{"id":"debbie-criswell","name":"Debbie Criswell","cat":"painters","en":"Debbie Criswell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/debbie-criswell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/debbie-criswell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["charcoal","black","light-yellow","brown","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Debbie Criswell is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and whimsical folk art style. Her work often features charming depictions of rural life, capturing the essence of community and nature with a touch of fantasy. Criswell's paintings are characterized by their detailed and illustrative approach, often incorporating elements of naive art.","observation":"The style combines visibly directional paint strokes with crisp illustrative contours, dense surface detail, and saturated autumnal reds, greens, creams, and blacks. It stages surreal narrative tableaux with fashion figures, animals, vehicles, and richly patterned natural settings, using ornamental textures and dramatic, graphic shapes throughout."},{"id":"oliver-stone","name":"Oliver Stone","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Oliver Stone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oliver-stone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oliver-stone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["black","red","muted-red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Oliver Stone is an American filmmaker known for his provocative and often controversial films. He has directed numerous acclaimed movies, including \"Platoon,\" \"JFK,\" and \"Natural Born Killers,\" which explore themes of war, politics, and media. Stone's work is characterized by its bold storytelling, intense subject matter, and a distinctive visual style that often incorporates historical and political commentary.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, intensely detailed portrait photography with close, often cropped views of an older man’s weathered face. Moody warm tones, strong facial modeling, dark surroundings, selective focus, and red practical lights create a cinematic, dramatic studio atmosphere."},{"id":"chris-ryniak","name":"Chris Ryniak","cat":"various-artists","en":"Chris Ryniak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-ryniak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-ryniak","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-yellow","brown","muted-green","ochre","rust"],"intro":"Chris Ryniak is an American artist known for his whimsical and imaginative creature designs. His work often features playful and endearing characters with a distinct fantasy element, capturing the charm and curiosity of mythical beings.","observation":"The style presents whimsical alien characters as tactile, highly modelled figures, with wrinkled skin, bumps, folds, and glossy oversized eyes rendered in convincing three-dimensional detail. Soft studio lighting, shallow focus, pastel bodies, and coral-orange accents give the portraits a polished miniature or creature-sculpture appearance while preserving their expressive, slightly grotesque charm."},{"id":"jamie-baldridge","name":"Jamie Baldridge","cat":"photographers","en":"Jamie Baldridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jamie-baldridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jamie-baldridge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","scenes","glow","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["grey","dark-green","dark-ochre","black","muted-ochre","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Jamie Baldridge is an American photographer known for his surreal and narrative-driven photographic works. His art often explores themes of fantasy, dreamscapes, and the human condition, blending traditional photographic techniques with digital manipulation to create otherworldly images.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly surfaces with carefully staged, cinematic tableaux populated by period-like clothing, antique furniture, birds, cages, and suspended lights. Subdued teal, brown, cream, and ochre tones, dramatic illumination, and surreal juxtapositions create an ornate, atmospheric dream world."},{"id":"georges-hobeika","name":"Georges Hobeika","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Georges Hobeika","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-hobeika.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-hobeika","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","subdued-colors"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver","grey","red"],"intro":"Georges Hobeika is a renowned Lebanese fashion designer known for his exquisite haute couture creations. His designs often feature luxurious fabrics, intricate detailing, and a blend of traditional and contemporary styles, making him a prominent figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style presents elegant, highly detailed couture fashion portraits in softly lit studio settings, with full-length figures and sweeping trains carefully arranged against uncluttered neutral backdrops. Intricate floral embroidery, lace, sheer panels, fitted waists, and restrained pastel tones create a refined, decorative editorial look while the realistic rendering preserves fabric texture and garment structure."},{"id":"pierre-et-gilles","name":"Pierre et Gilles","cat":"photographers","en":"Pierre et Gilles","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-et-gilles.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-et-gilles","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","religious","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","beige","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Pierre et Gilles is a renowned artistic duo known for their unique blend of photography and painting, creating highly stylized and theatrical portraits. Their work often explores themes of fantasy, mythology, and identity, using vibrant colors and elaborate settings to craft dreamlike images.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, painterly portraiture with dense floral environments, ornate clothing, and saturated jewel-like colors. Dramatic halos and radiant light turn the figures into dreamy, devotional-looking icons, while strong contrast and tightly packed botanical framing give the images a lavish, theatrical presence."},{"id":"thomas-ascott","name":"Thomas Ascott","cat":"illustrators","en":"Thomas Ascott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-ascott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-ascott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","black","beige","dark-brown"],"intro":"Thomas Ascott is a fictional or hypothetical artist, possibly created as a representation of a particular style or artistic concept. There is no known real-life artist by this name, and it may be used for illustrative purposes or as a pseudonym in various contexts.","observation":"A richly painterly, highly detailed style combines carefully rendered youthful figures, animals, costumes, and natural settings with muted, moody colors. Surreal interventions such as concealed faces, birds perched on people, and oversized headwear create an uncanny storybook atmosphere, while patterned fabrics and branching trees add dense ornamental texture."},{"id":"tadanori-yokoo","name":"Tadanori Yokoo","cat":"designers","en":"Tadanori Yokoo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tadanori-yokoo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tadanori-yokoo","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","collage"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","rust","dark-brown","light-orange"],"intro":"Tadanori Yokoo is a renowned Japanese graphic designer and artist known for his vibrant and eclectic style that blends elements of pop art, psychedelia, and traditional Japanese motifs. Emerging in the 1960s, Yokoo's work is characterized by its bold use of color, intricate patterns, and a unique fusion of Eastern and Western cultural references. His art often explores themes of identity, spirituality, and the human experience, making him a pivotal figure in the world of modern art and design.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured painted imagery with collage-like layering, visible cutout edges, and strongly saturated complementary colors. Familiar landscapes, figures, animals, flowers, and cosmic or volcanic elements are recombined into surreal, narrative scenes with dramatic contrast and expressive, dreamlike juxtapositions."},{"id":"lucia-rafanelli","name":"Lucia Rafanelli","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lucia Rafanelli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucia-rafanelli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucia-rafanelli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","muted-yellow","dark-olive","grey","red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Lucia Rafanelli is an artist known for her evocative and intricate illustrations that blend elements of fantasy and realism. Her work often explores themes of femininity, nature, and introspection, drawing inspiration from historical art movements and cultural motifs.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with highly detailed, expressive close-up portraits embedded in dense tropical foliage, textiles, flowers, and butterflies. Dark green surroundings and moody blue, red, and orange accents create an uncanny, dreamlike atmosphere, while flames, painted skin, and botanical framing push the imagery toward surreal fantasy."},{"id":"pam-hawkes","name":"Pam Hawkes","cat":"painters","en":"Pam Hawkes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pam-hawkes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pam-hawkes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","dark-brown","muted-ochre","black","grey"],"intro":"Pam Hawkes is a contemporary British artist known for her ethereal and introspective portraits. Her work often draws inspiration from classical and Renaissance art, blending traditional techniques with modern sensibilities to create hauntingly beautiful images.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped, highly realistic portraits with visible fine brushwork, softly modeled faces, and a richly textured, aged surface. Muted earth colors, elaborate headwear, fabrics, feathers, and ornament give the images a classical, decorative character while the repeated close-up framing keeps attention on the faces."},{"id":"mcbess","name":"mcbess","cat":"illustrators","en":"mcbess","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mcbess.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mcbess","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","animals","patterns","urban","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","beige","brown","light-orange","dark-brown","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"mcbess is a contemporary illustrator and musician known for his distinctive black and white style that combines elements of surrealism and humor. His real-life work often features whimsical characters and intricate details, drawing inspiration from both vintage cartoons and modern pop culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is dense black-and-white illustrative linework with fine contours, cross-like hatching, and strongly controlled areas of solid black. It combines surreal, highly detailed figures and creatures into crowded compositions, spanning tattoos and murals while retaining a graphic ink-and-woodcut character."},{"id":"thomas-daniell","name":"Thomas Daniell","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Daniell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-daniell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-daniell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","religious","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","silver","grey","black","light-orange"],"intro":"Thomas Daniell was an English landscape painter and engraver known for his depictions of Indian architecture and landscapes during the British colonial period. He traveled extensively in India with his nephew William Daniell, producing a series of aquatints that captured the grandeur and exoticism of the subcontinent's scenery and architecture.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive tropical waterscapes are rendered as richly layered, finely brushed paintings with warm atmospheric light, distant haze, and carefully articulated architecture, boats, foliage, and mountains. The grand framing, monumental terrain, and softly glowing skies give the scenes a romantic, dreamlike, cinematic sense of scale."},{"id":"iren-horrors","name":"Iren Horrors","cat":"illustrators","en":"Iren Horrors","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/iren-horrors.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/iren-horrors","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","fantasy","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","bone-white","charcoal","brown","red"],"intro":"Iren Horrors is an artist known for her distinctive dark and gothic style, often exploring themes of fantasy and surrealism. Her work is characterized by intricate detailing and a moody atmosphere, drawing inspiration from mythological and folklore elements.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed illustrative tattoo imagery with fine ink lines, dense blackwork, and selectively muted red accents. Portrait-like female figures, dark fantasy motifs, animals, and elaborate surrounding scenes recur across the renders, giving the work a gothic, tightly composed character."},{"id":"alison-bechdel","name":"Alison Bechdel","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alison Bechdel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alison-bechdel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alison-bechdel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","fine-lines","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","silver","grey","black","muted-red","red"],"intro":"Alison Bechdel is an American cartoonist known for her long-running comic strip \"Dykes to Watch Out For\" and her graphic memoir \"Fun Home,\" which explores themes of family, identity, and sexuality. Her work often delves into personal and societal issues, earning her critical acclaim and a significant place in the world of graphic storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive drawn portraits with strong black contouring, ink-like linework, and dense crosshatched shading. It combines clean illustrative color in one scene with mostly monochrome sketch treatment elsewhere, placing thoughtful seated figures in richly furnished interiors and urban surroundings."},{"id":"luc-besson","name":"Luc Besson","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Luc Besson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luc-besson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luc-besson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-blue","beige","red"],"intro":"Luc Besson is a French filmmaker known for his distinctive visual style and contribution to the science fiction and action genres. He has directed and produced numerous films, including 'The Fifth Element' and 'Lucy,' which are celebrated for their imaginative storytelling and striking visual effects. Besson's work often blends elements of fantasy and futuristic technology, creating immersive cinematic experiences.","observation":"The style is cinematic and naturalistic, built around tightly framed faces, selective focus, and richly detailed skin, hair, and fabric textures. Moody red-and-blue illumination, deep shadows, luminous practical lights, and visible film grain create an intense, nocturnal atmosphere across both intimate portraits and crowded character scenes."},{"id":"alex-hirsch","name":"Alex Hirsch","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alex Hirsch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-hirsch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-hirsch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","charcoal","dark-brown","orange","rust"],"intro":"Alex Hirsch is an American animator, voice actor, and writer, best known for creating the animated television series \"Gravity Falls.\" His work is characterized by its unique blend of mystery, humor, and supernatural elements, appealing to both children and adults.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, visibly brushed storybook painting with exaggerated cartoon figures, grotesque fantasy creatures, and highly expressive faces and poses. Dark teal environments are cut by intense orange firelight and glowing eyes, while layered textures, cluttered backgrounds, and surreal monster imagery create a dramatic, ominous adventure mood."},{"id":"guy-rose","name":"Guy Rose","cat":"painters","en":"Guy Rose","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-rose.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-rose","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","muted-blue","charcoal","beige","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Guy Rose was an American Impressionist painter known for his vibrant landscapes and serene depictions of the California coast and French countryside. Born in 1867, he became a prominent figure in the American Impressionism movement, studying in Paris and later establishing himself in California. His works are characterized by their soft color palettes, fluid brushwork, and a keen sensitivity to light and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly visible, broad paint strokes to render women in white summer clothing within lush flowering gardens and sunlit outdoor settings. Saturated floral colors, strong dappled light, deep foliage shadows, and detailed natural textures create an expressive yet realistic atmosphere."},{"id":"jules-feiffer","name":"Jules Feiffer","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jules Feiffer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jules-feiffer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jules-feiffer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","grey","black"],"intro":"Jules Feiffer is an American cartoonist and author known for his incisive social commentary and distinctive illustrative style. He gained fame through his long-running comic strip in The Village Voice, and his work spans various media, including plays, children's books, and screenplays. Feiffer's art often explores themes of urban life, relationships, and societal norms, characterized by a witty and satirical tone.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive black ink drawing on largely untouched white paper, with fine, restless contours, selective hatching, and occasional dense black silhouettes. Figures and small narrative actions are placed in spacious, sparsely described settings, combining observational urban sketching with slightly surreal, offbeat character details."},{"id":"r-kenton-nelson","name":"R. Kenton Nelson","cat":"painters","en":"R. Kenton Nelson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/r-kenton-nelson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/r-kenton-nelson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","rust","ochre","pale-yellow","muted-blue"],"intro":"R. Kenton Nelson is a contemporary American painter known for his distinctive style that combines elements of realism with a nostalgic nod to mid-20th-century American culture. His work often features urban scenes and figures, capturing the elegance and sophistication of a bygone era with a modern twist. Nelson's paintings are characterized by their vivid color palette, precise compositions, and a focus on the human form, often evoking a sense of introspection and narrative.","observation":"The style combines polished illustrative figures with visible painterly texture, crisp fine contouring, and dense clothing and architectural detail. Strong sunlight, deep shadows, saturated rust, ochre, green, and blue hues, and carefully structured geometric interiors create a retro, film-like atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"tim-biskup","name":"Tim Biskup","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tim Biskup","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-biskup.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-biskup","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-cyan","vivid-red","muted-blue","light-orange","red","magenta"],"intro":"Tim Biskup is an American artist known for his vibrant and whimsical style, often associated with the lowbrow and pop surrealism movements. His work is characterized by a playful yet chaotic aesthetic, drawing inspiration from cartoons, pop culture, and abstract forms. Biskup's art often features bold colors, geometric shapes, and fantastical creatures, making it both visually striking and conceptually intriguing.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense surreal imagery with vivid coral, turquoise, orange, and deep blue color fields. Distorted animals, characters, eyes, towers, and ornamental forms are packed together in graphic compositions, while visible broad paint strokes and strong dark contours give the work a tactile mural-like surface."},{"id":"john-brack","name":"John Brack","cat":"painters","en":"John Brack","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-brack.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-brack","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","brown","deep-red","ochre","pale-yellow"],"intro":"John Brack is an Australian painter known for his distinctive style that captures the essence of urban life and human interaction. His work often reflects the social and cultural milieu of mid-20th century Australia, characterized by a focus on everyday scenes and figures. Brack's paintings are noted for their geometric forms, subdued color palettes, and introspective mood, often portraying the isolation and contemplation inherent in modern city life.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, graphic illustration with fine outlines, clean flat color fields, angular construction, and selective textural patterning in clothing and surfaces. A subdued ochre, brown, red, black, and cream palette with strong dark-light separation gives the recurring portraits and crowded interior scenes a dramatic retro-fashion character."},{"id":"carlo-crivelli","name":"Carlo Crivelli","cat":"painters","en":"Carlo Crivelli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carlo-crivelli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carlo-crivelli","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","fantasy","retro"],"colours":["light-orange","ochre","dark-brown","black","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Carlo Crivelli was an Italian Renaissance painter known for his detailed and ornate style, often incorporating religious themes and figures. Born in Venice around 1430, Crivelli's work is characterized by its use of tempera and gold leaf, creating rich and textured compositions. His paintings are noted for their intricate detail, vibrant colors, and a distinct blend of Gothic and Renaissance elements.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered portraiture with densely packed ornamental costumes, floral framing, birds, jewels, feathers, and textile patterns. Visible crackling, delicate linework, layered decorative surfaces, and saturated reds, greens, blues, and golds give the imagery an antique yet fantastical painted character."},{"id":"solve-sundsbo","name":"Solve Sundsbo","cat":"photographers","en":"Solve Sundsbo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/solve-sundsbo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/solve-sundsbo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-green","beige","brown","dark-olive"],"intro":"Solve Sundsbo is a renowned Norwegian fashion photographer known for his innovative and experimental approach to photography. His work often features bold, striking imagery that pushes the boundaries of traditional fashion photography, incorporating elements of surrealism and fantasy.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic close-up portraits transformed by elaborate botanical, insect, aquatic, and metallic adornments. Dark, subdued earthy colors, dramatic shadow, tactile natural textures, and carefully arranged headpieces create a dreamy, surreal fashion-editorial mood."},{"id":"frances-hodgkins","name":"Frances Hodgkins","cat":"painters","en":"Frances Hodgkins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frances-hodgkins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frances-hodgkins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","landscapes","still-life","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","muted-brown","rust","red","brown","muted-blue"],"intro":"Frances Hodgkins was a New Zealand-born painter known for her modernist approach and vibrant use of color. She was an influential figure in the early 20th century art scene, particularly in Europe, where she spent much of her career. Her work often explored themes of domestic life and social interactions, characterized by a unique blend of post-impressionism and modernism.","observation":"Across the four panels, the style is built from visible, energetic brushwork with broad strokes, layered paint, and emphatic dark contours. Saturated blues, corals, pinks, greens, and oranges unify floral still lifes, interiors, and garden views, while dense botanical detail and patterned furnishings create an abundant decorative surface."},{"id":"daniel-eskridge","name":"Daniel Eskridge","cat":"various-artists","en":"Daniel Eskridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daniel-eskridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daniel-eskridge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","grey","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Daniel Eskridge is an artist known for his digital artwork that often explores themes of fantasy and surrealism. His work is characterized by detailed and painterly techniques, creating immersive and imaginative worlds that captivate viewers with their epic landscapes and mythical characters.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, highly realistic fantasy imagery with monumental architecture and tiny solitary figures set against immense landscapes. Warm bronze light, strong backlighting, atmospheric haze, dramatic cloud formations, and deep shadows create an epic, melancholic sense of scale."},{"id":"verner-panton","name":"Verner Panton","cat":"designers","en":"Verner Panton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/verner-panton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/verner-panton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","patterns","still-life","glow","vivid-colors","sci-fi","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["deep-red","vivid-red","black","silver","beige","ochre","deep-blue"],"intro":"Verner Panton is a renowned Danish designer known for his innovative and futuristic approach to interior design and furniture. Born in 1926, Panton's work is characterized by bold colors, geometric shapes, and a playful, avant-garde style that challenged conventional design norms of his time. He is best known for his pioneering use of plastics and his iconic designs, such as the Panton Chair, which reflect his vision of a modern, vibrant living environment.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vivid red-orange, highly volumetric forms built from repeated rounded modules, ribs, and bulbous organic geometry. The objects are presented as polished, futuristic interior design with strong symmetry, reflective surfaces, dramatic illumination, and dense repeating patterns."},{"id":"aldo-rossi","name":"Aldo Rossi","cat":"architects","en":"Aldo Rossi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aldo-rossi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aldo-rossi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","urban","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["silver","dark-brown","red","black","deep-red","muted-orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Aldo Rossi was an influential Italian architect and designer known for his contributions to postmodern architecture. He was celebrated for his theoretical writings and his ability to blend historical forms with modernist principles. Rossi's work often reflected a deep understanding of urban landscapes and the cultural significance of architecture.","observation":"This style combines strongly geometric architectural forms with vivid coral-red buildings, blue skies, and sharply controlled blocks of color. Visible brush texture and fine surface grain soften the otherwise illustrative, hard-edged construction, while monumental juxtapositions, tiny figures, and unusual combinations of historic and modern structures create a surreal urban atmosphere."},{"id":"paul-lehr","name":"Paul Lehr","cat":"illustrators","en":"Paul Lehr","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-lehr.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-lehr","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","muted-blue","dark-red","grey","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Paul Lehr is an American illustrator known for his science fiction and fantasy artwork, particularly his book covers from the mid-20th century. His work often features imaginative and surreal landscapes, blending elements of the natural world with futuristic and otherworldly themes.","observation":"These landscapes combine visible, textured brushwork with densely layered vegetation, rock, architecture, and atmospheric depth. Saturated teal, cobalt, coral, and orange colors create strong contrast, while internal glowing suns, pools, and cavernous lights give the scenes a luminous dreamlike and epic fantasy character."},{"id":"mike-ploog","name":"Mike Ploog","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mike Ploog","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-ploog.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-ploog","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","ochre","grey","vivid-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Mike Ploog is an American artist known for his work in comic books, storyboards, and film design. He gained prominence in the 1970s for his contributions to Marvel Comics, particularly on titles like \"Ghost Rider\" and \"Man-Thing.\" Ploog's style is characterized by its dynamic compositions and detailed renderings, often featuring fantastical and supernatural elements.","observation":"These images use densely layered, painterly fantasy illustration with finely worked faces, creatures, armor, fur, stone, and rugged architecture. Strong dark masses are cut by saturated reds, oranges, and cool blues, while dramatic firelight and monumental character arrangements create an epic, ominous atmosphere."},{"id":"marcel-duchamp","name":"Marcel Duchamp","cat":"painters","en":"Marcel Duchamp","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marcel-duchamp.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marcel-duchamp","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","brown","dark-brown","black"],"intro":"Marcel Duchamp is a pivotal figure in modern art, known for his influence on the Dada and Surrealist movements. His work challenged traditional perceptions of art with innovative concepts like the 'readymade,' where ordinary objects were elevated to art status. Duchamp's approach was marked by a playful yet profound questioning of art's role and meaning, making him a key figure in the transition to contemporary art.","observation":"The style presents carefully composed, photorealistic gallery views of intricate assemblage sculptures built from aged wood, wire, metal, and mechanical-looking parts. Subdued earthy tones, crisp fine lines, geometric structures, and dramatic directional sunlight create strong cast shadows and a sculptural, museum-documentation feel."},{"id":"steven-meisel","name":"Steven Meisel","cat":"photographers","en":"Steven Meisel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steven-meisel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steven-meisel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","subdued-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","beige","dark-rust"],"intro":"Steven Meisel is a renowned American fashion photographer known for his work with Vogue and his influence on the fashion industry. He has photographed numerous high-profile campaigns and is celebrated for his ability to capture the essence of fashion and beauty through his lens.","observation":"The style combines realistic editorial portraiture with richly ornamented, theatrical costume design: elaborate hats, feathers, flowers, dark garments, and heavily textured fabrics recur throughout the sheet. Restrained sepia, charcoal, and earthy tones, formal poses, dramatic studio framing, and antique furnishings give the portraits a dark, cinematic, old-world atmosphere."},{"id":"heinrich-kley","name":"Heinrich Kley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Heinrich Kley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/heinrich-kley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/heinrich-kley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","beige"],"intro":"Heinrich Kley was a German illustrator and painter known for his imaginative and often satirical works. Active during the late 19th and early 20th centuries, Kley gained recognition for his unique style that blended fantasy and reality, often depicting whimsical and grotesque scenes with a touch of humor. His works have been influential in both fine art and popular culture, inspiring many artists and animators.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed black-and-white ink drawing, with fine contour lines, dense crosshatching, and strong tonal contrast on a warm parchment-like ground. Grotesque fantasy characters and creatures are arranged in dramatic, active encounters, giving the images an expressive, dark, storybook quality."},{"id":"lynsey-addario","name":"Lynsey Addario","cat":"photographers","en":"Lynsey Addario","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lynsey-addario.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lynsey-addario","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","landscapes","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","rust","muted-blue","white","red"],"intro":"Lynsey Addario is an acclaimed American photojournalist known for her work in conflict zones and her focus on human rights issues. Her photography often captures the resilience and struggles of people in war-torn areas, bringing attention to global conflicts and humanitarian crises.","observation":"The style is grounded, realistic cinematic portraiture with carefully observed faces, worn fabrics, rugged terrain, and strong environmental context. Muted earth tones, warm directional sunlight, deep shadows, selective focus, and densely textured clothing and rubble create a tense, dramatic atmosphere across the portraits and wider scenes."},{"id":"carl-kleiner","name":"Carl Kleiner","cat":"photographers","en":"Carl Kleiner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-kleiner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-kleiner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","floral","patterns","still-life","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-teal","bone-white","muted-olive","dark-red","vivid-red","ochre"],"intro":"Carl Kleiner is a Swedish photographer and artist known for his distinctive approach to still life and abstract photography. His work often explores the interplay of color, shape, and form, creating visually striking compositions that challenge traditional perceptions of everyday objects. Kleiner's style is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail and a playful yet structured aesthetic, making his work both thought-provoking and visually appealing.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic still-life objects with deliberately arranged geometric blocks, platforms, circles, and architectural planes. Saturated teal, coral, orange, and red hues are set against strong directional light, producing crisp shadows and a bold, sculptural studio look."},{"id":"stan-berenstain","name":"Stan Berenstain","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stan Berenstain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stan-berenstain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stan-berenstain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","bold-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["dark-olive","dark-ochre","muted-blue","rust","pale-orange","yellow"],"intro":"Stan Berenstain is best known as the co-creator of the beloved children's book series, \"The Berenstain Bears,\" alongside his wife, Jan Berenstain. Their work has been cherished by generations for its engaging stories and relatable family themes, often focusing on moral and educational lessons. The Berenstain Bears series is characterized by its charming illustrations and heartwarming narratives.","observation":"The style is richly detailed storybook illustration, combining vivid colors with expressive, ink-like bold outlines and dense textural marks. It presents anthropomorphic bear characters in active narrative scenes alongside expansive landscapes, using lively compositions, strong color accents, and a fantastical woodland atmosphere."},{"id":"ryoichi-kurokawa","name":"Ryoichi Kurokawa","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ryoichi Kurokawa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryoichi-kurokawa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryoichi-kurokawa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","scenes","urban","mist","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","geometric","silhouette"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Ryoichi Kurokawa is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his innovative work in audiovisual art. His creations often explore the intersection of sound and visual media, pushing the boundaries of digital art through immersive installations and performances.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental architectural and natural forms are reduced to stark black-and-white compositions, with tiny human silhouettes establishing scale. Vertical streaks, blurred crowds, reflective surfaces, and flowing wave-like textures create a cinematic sense of motion, while deep shadows and large voids make the scenes feel bleak and otherworldly."},{"id":"luca-giordano","name":"Luca Giordano","cat":"painters","en":"Luca Giordano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luca-giordano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luca-giordano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["baroque","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","orange","silver","red"],"intro":"Luca Giordano was an Italian Baroque painter known for his prolific output and dynamic compositions. Born in Naples in 1634, he was a master of the Baroque style, characterized by dramatic use of light and shadow, rich color palettes, and expressive figures. Giordano's work often depicted religious and mythological themes, and he was renowned for his ability to capture movement and emotion in his paintings.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely populated religious scenes are rendered with vigorous, visible brushwork, dramatic gestures, and richly modelled human figures. Deep brown shadows contrast with warm highlights and occasional saturated blues and reds, while sweeping diagonals, billowing drapery, and clouded skies create theatrical movement and grandeur."},{"id":"george-underwood","name":"George Underwood","cat":"painters","en":"George Underwood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-underwood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-underwood","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","brown","grey","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"George Underwood is a British artist known for his distinctive style that blends surrealism with classical influences. He has worked as a painter and illustrator, creating album covers and fine art pieces that often explore themes of fantasy and introspection. Underwood's work is characterized by its dreamlike quality and attention to detail, drawing inspiration from historical art movements.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped, mannequin-like portraits in elaborate sculptural hoods and layered garments, with restrained earth tones punctuated by red accents. Fine, tactile brushwork models faces and textiles while repeated surface patterns and carefully arranged folds give the images a decorative, classical fashion-portrait character."},{"id":"jan-fabre","name":"Jan Fabre","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jan Fabre","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-fabre.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-fabre","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","glow","metallic","vivid-colors","cinematic","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["brown","grey","black","ochre","dark-blue","white"],"intro":"Jan Fabre is a contemporary Belgian artist known for his multidisciplinary approach, encompassing theater, performance, and visual arts. His work often explores themes of metamorphosis, the human body, and the interplay between life and death, using a variety of materials and techniques to create thought-provoking pieces.","observation":"The style presents monumental animal and humanoid forms as highly detailed, physically modeled sculptures assembled from reflective metallic fragments, alternating saturated blue and gold surfaces. They are staged like cinematic museum installations in lavish palace interiors, where chandeliers, windows, marble, and ornate architectural decoration amplify the sculptures’ scale and luminous materiality."},{"id":"guerrilla-girls","name":"Guerrilla Girls","cat":"various-artists","en":"Guerrilla Girls","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guerrilla-girls.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guerrilla-girls","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","brown","red","ochre","deep-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Guerrilla Girls is an anonymous group of feminist, female artists devoted to fighting sexism and racism within the art world. Formed in 1985, they are known for their provocative and humorous posters, books, and public appearances, often using gorilla masks to conceal their identities. Their work challenges the status quo and highlights the underrepresentation of women and minority artists in galleries and museums.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped studio portraits with dramatic contrast, saturated red and pink backdrops, and intensely textured black fur. Gorilla-like characters are presented as fashion-forward, confrontational figures through tailored clothing, leopard print, exaggerated makeup, and conspicuous teeth."},{"id":"hans-baldung","name":"Hans Baldung","cat":"painters","en":"Hans Baldung","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-baldung.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-baldung","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-orange","rust","black","dark-brown","dark-ochre","muted-blue"],"intro":"Hans Baldung is a German painter and printmaker associated with the Northern Renaissance. Known for his distinctive style, Baldung's work often features allegorical and mythological themes, characterized by intricate detail and a fascination with the supernatural. His paintings frequently explore themes of mortality, sensuality, and the mystical, often incorporating symbolic elements and vivid imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly rendered oil-paint surfaces with fine, visible brushwork, craquelure, and exceptionally detailed skin, fur, hair, and fabric. Tightly cropped faces and fantastical animal-headed or horned figures are modeled with strong light-dark contrast, subdued earthy colors, and an expressive, old-master-like theatricality."},{"id":"jessica-durrant","name":"Jessica Durrant","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jessica Durrant","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jessica-durrant.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jessica-durrant","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","motion","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","black","beige","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jessica Durrant is a contemporary illustrator known for her vibrant and expressive watercolor works. Her art often explores themes of fashion and beauty, capturing the essence of modern femininity with a unique blend of fluidity and precision. Durrant's work has been featured in various fashion magazines and collaborations with well-known brands, establishing her as a prominent figure in the world of fashion illustration.","observation":"The style combines expressive female profile portraits with loose ink drawing and translucent watercolor washes, leaving large white areas around the figures. Fine hair lines, splattered marks, deep black birds, and selective red or orange accents create a high-energy contrast between delicate modelling and graphic gestures."},{"id":"jackson-pollock","name":"Jackson Pollock","cat":"painters","en":"Jackson Pollock","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jackson-pollock.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jackson-pollock","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","brown","dark-brown","orange","red"],"intro":"Jackson Pollock was an influential American painter and a major figure in the abstract expressionist movement. Known for his unique style of drip painting, Pollock's work is characterized by chaotic patterns and dynamic energy. His innovative techniques and expressive use of color have left a lasting impact on the art world.","observation":"The style is intensely abstract and painterly, built from dense overlapping drips, splashes, broad gestures, scraped passages, and fine web-like marks. Across the renders, vivid rust, orange, ochre, white, black, and blue-gray pigments create high-contrast, energetic surfaces with little empty space and no stable representational subject."},{"id":"john-lavery","name":"John Lavery","cat":"painters","en":"John Lavery","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-lavery.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-lavery","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-ochre","bone-white","red"],"intro":"John Lavery was an Irish painter known for his portraits and landscapes, capturing the elegance and refinement of the Edwardian era. His works often feature detailed and realistic depictions, with a focus on light and atmosphere, contributing to the impressionistic realism style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, broad oil-paint strokes to model realistic figures, clothing, foliage, architecture, and reflective water. It combines subdued greens, creams, browns, and pinks with strong light-dark contrasts, detailed period clothing, and composed social scenes presented with a classical illustrative polish."},{"id":"hito-steyerl","name":"Hito Steyerl","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Hito Steyerl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hito-steyerl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hito-steyerl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["dark-cyan","rust","black","silver","muted-blue","olive","vivid-red","green"],"intro":"Hito Steyerl is a German filmmaker, visual artist, and writer known for her work that explores the intersections of art, technology, and politics. Her films and installations often critique the influence of digital media and globalization, blending documentary techniques with speculative narratives. Steyerl's work is recognized for its intellectual depth and engagement with contemporary issues.","observation":"A realistic photographic portrait style built around tightly cropped faces, direct gazes, and vivid environmental settings. Strong color contrast, apparent flash illumination, selective focus, and occasional luminous screen reflections give the portraits a cinematic, contemporary feel."},{"id":"shusei-nagaoka","name":"Shusei Nagaoka","cat":"illustrators","en":"Shusei Nagaoka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shusei-nagaoka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shusei-nagaoka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","landscapes","glow","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","retro","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","dark-red","red","magenta"],"intro":"Shusei Nagaoka was a renowned Japanese illustrator known for his vibrant and imaginative album cover art, particularly in the 1970s and 1980s. His work often featured futuristic and surreal themes, blending elements of fantasy and science fiction with a distinctive retro style. Nagaoka's illustrations are celebrated for their intricate details and vivid color palettes, capturing the imagination of audiences worldwide.","observation":"Across the renders, dark blue twilight scenes combine vivid red and pink light with stark black geometric forms, reflective surfaces, and glowing celestial spheres. The clean illustrative shapes, retro-futurist staging, strong contrast, and visible grain create a dreamy, surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"karel-zeman","name":"Karel Zeman","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Karel Zeman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karel-zeman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karel-zeman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","mist","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Karel Zeman was a Czech filmmaker and animator known for his innovative use of special effects and imaginative storytelling. His work often combined live-action with animation, creating fantastical worlds that captivated audiences. Zeman's films, such as \"Journey to the Beginning of Time\" and \"The Fabulous World of Jules Verne,\" are celebrated for their creativity and visual style, blending elements of fantasy and science fiction.","observation":"A highly detailed, monochrome-sepia fantasy style combining dramatic character portraits with vast floating fortresses, airships, cliffs, and cloud-filled vistas. Fine etched-like textures, strong tonal contrast, atmospheric haze, and layered cinematic compositions give the imagery an aged, visionary storybook quality."},{"id":"joseph-kosuth","name":"Joseph Kosuth","cat":"various-artists","en":"Joseph Kosuth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joseph-kosuth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joseph-kosuth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","scenes","urban","backlighting","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-brown","cream","orange","red"],"intro":"Joseph Kosuth is an American conceptual artist known for his pioneering work in the field of conceptual art. His art often explores the relationship between language and meaning, challenging traditional notions of art by focusing on ideas rather than aesthetic objects. Kosuth's work is characterized by its intellectual rigor and philosophical depth, often incorporating text and language as central elements.","observation":"A realistic, cinematic photographic style built around stark portraits and imposing industrial interiors. Warm amber or red illuminated text and linear fixtures cut through deep shadows, with strong backlighting, selective focus, and a restrained dark palette creating a tense, futuristic atmosphere."},{"id":"don-martin","name":"Don Martin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Don Martin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/don-martin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/don-martin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","patterns","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","pale-orange","grey","ochre","brown","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Don Martin is a renowned American cartoonist known for his distinctive and humorous illustrations, particularly in MAD Magazine. His work is characterized by exaggerated features, slapstick humor, and a unique style that has left a lasting impact on the world of cartooning.","observation":"The style combines densely packed, grotesque cartoon creatures with exaggerated anatomy, frantic expressions, and highly active compositions. Heavy black ink outlines, crosshatched textures, and flat blocks of vivid color create an energetic comic-illustration appearance, shifting in places toward monochrome pen-and-ink detail."},{"id":"peter-marino","name":"Peter Marino","cat":"architects","en":"Peter Marino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-marino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-marino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","scenes","metallic","vivid-colors","classical","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","black","brown","bone-white","ochre","deep-rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"Peter Marino is an American architect known for his modern and luxurious designs, often incorporating art and fashion elements into his architectural projects. He has worked on flagship stores for luxury brands and is recognized for his bold use of materials and innovative design approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly realistic, richly detailed luxury interiors filled with classical architectural ornament, marble, chandeliers, and displayed sculpture. Reflective metallic surfaces, saturated accent colors, strong axial viewpoints, and geometric flooring create a polished, grand, museum-like atmosphere."},{"id":"nate-berkus","name":"Nate Berkus","cat":"designers","en":"Nate Berkus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nate-berkus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nate-berkus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["beige","silver","muted-brown","dark-brown","black"],"intro":"Nate Berkus is a renowned American interior designer, author, and television personality known for his approachable and sophisticated design style. He gained widespread recognition through his appearances on \"The Oprah Winfrey Show\" and his own television programs. Berkus is celebrated for his ability to blend classic and modern elements, creating spaces that are both elegant and inviting.","observation":"The style is highly realistic interior photography with carefully composed, geometric rooms, abundant architectural detail, and sculptural contemporary furnishings. A restrained palette of creams, browns, black, and deep green is enlivened by strong daylight, dark window frames, fireplaces, wood, stone, and autumn foliage."},{"id":"ambrogio-lorenzetti","name":"Ambrogio Lorenzetti","cat":"painters","en":"Ambrogio Lorenzetti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ambrogio-lorenzetti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ambrogio-lorenzetti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious","geometric"],"colours":["ochre","dark-brown","brown","grey","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Ambrogio Lorenzetti was an Italian painter active during the early 14th century, known for his contributions to the Sienese School and the development of early Renaissance art. His works often depicted religious themes and civic allegories, characterized by their detailed narrative style and use of perspective.","observation":"The style uses finely rendered, visibly aged paint with delicate linework, restrained earth-and-sky colors, and densely described figures, architecture, and foliage. Formal compositions combine religious or courtly vignettes with expansive townscapes, using elongated forms, patterned surfaces, and repeated arches and towers."},{"id":"bob-mackie","name":"Bob Mackie","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Bob Mackie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-mackie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-mackie","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","charcoal","red","beige","orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Bob Mackie is an American fashion designer known for his extravagant and glamorous costumes, particularly for celebrities and entertainers. His work is characterized by bold colors, intricate detailing, and a flair for the dramatic, often seen on stages and red carpets.","observation":"Across all four renders, elongated fashion figures are defined by energetic fine linework, visible brush marks, and sweeping, feather-like costume forms. Saturated reds, blacks, blues, and oranges contrast with generous white space, while sequins, beads, feathers, and layered fabrics create ornate, highly detailed couture silhouettes."},{"id":"walt-kelly","name":"Walt Kelly","cat":"illustrators","en":"Walt Kelly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walt-kelly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walt-kelly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","subdued-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["pale-yellow","dark-olive","muted-yellow","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Walt Kelly was an American cartoonist best known for creating the comic strip 'Pogo.' His work is celebrated for its wit, political satire, and charming characters, often set in the Okefenokee Swamp. Kelly's illustrations are characterized by their detailed line work and expressive character designs.","observation":"The style uses expressive cartoon characters with thick, lively ink contours, energetic hatching, and selectively applied watercolor-like washes on a warm, aged-paper ground. Across the scenes, exaggerated faces, physical gestures, dense swamp foliage, and humorous animal interactions create a detailed storybook-comic feeling."},{"id":"remedios-varo","name":"Remedios Varo","cat":"painters","en":"Remedios Varo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/remedios-varo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/remedios-varo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","deep-red","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Remedios Varo was a Spanish-Mexican surrealist artist known for her mystical and fantastical paintings. Born in Spain, she later moved to Mexico, where she became a prominent figure in the surrealist movement. Her work often features dreamlike scenes, combining elements of fantasy, science, and the occult, with a distinct focus on the mystical and the mysterious.","observation":"The style is densely painted and old-master-like, with visible brush texture, fine linear detail, muted earthy colors, and deep shadow. It combines elaborate gothic interiors, theatrical figures, birds, cages, and uncanny scale shifts into dark, dreamlike tableaux with richly decorated surfaces."},{"id":"gabriele-viertel","name":"Gabriele Viertel","cat":"photographers","en":"Gabriele Viertel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gabriele-viertel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gabriele-viertel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","collage","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","silver"],"intro":"Gabriele Viertel is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and surreal portraiture. Her work often explores the boundaries between reality and fantasy, creating dreamlike images that captivate viewers with their emotional depth and intricate details.","observation":"Across all four renders, close-up human figures and faces dissolve into one another through translucent fabric, stray hair, and layered exposures. The subdued, dark palette and sharp light-dark contrasts create a melancholic, dreamlike portrait style, while visible fine brushwork and surface texture give the imagery a tactile, painterly finish."},{"id":"aaron-mcgruder","name":"Aaron McGruder","cat":"illustrators","en":"Aaron McGruder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aaron-mcgruder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aaron-mcgruder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","muted-orange","vivid-red","muted-blue","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Aaron McGruder is an American cartoonist and writer, best known for creating the comic strip \"The Boondocks.\" His work often explores themes of race, politics, and culture, using satire and humor to address complex societal issues. McGruder's distinctive style combines sharp wit with bold, expressive visuals, making a significant impact on both the comic and television industries.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible, directional paint strokes with graphic dark outlining, dense character and environmental detail, and strongly saturated blue, orange, red, and black contrasts. It favors expressive Black characters in forceful poses, mixing close portrait framing with crowded urban disaster scenes and energetic smoke, fire, and debris."},{"id":"albert-edelfelt","name":"Albert Edelfelt","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Edelfelt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-edelfelt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-edelfelt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","charcoal","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Albert Edelfelt was a Finnish painter known for his naturalistic style and ability to capture light and atmosphere. He was a prominent figure in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, contributing significantly to the Finnish art scene and gaining international recognition. Edelfelt's works often depicted scenes of Finnish life, landscapes, and portraits, characterized by their detailed realism and emotional depth.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines richly visible brushwork with carefully observed figures, clothing, foliage, water, and interiors. Warm natural light, deep shadow, restrained earth-and-jewel colors, and lively gestural marks create intimate narrative scenes with a classical, finely rendered atmosphere."},{"id":"stephen-mackey","name":"Stephen Mackey","cat":"painters","en":"Stephen Mackey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-mackey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-mackey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","light-yellow","muted-ochre","red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Stephen Mackey is a contemporary artist known for his surreal and whimsical paintings that often explore themes of fantasy and mystery. His work is characterized by a delicate balance of dark and light elements, creating an ethereal atmosphere that invites viewers into a dreamlike world. Mackey's paintings often feature enigmatic characters and symbolic objects, drawing inspiration from Victorian and mythological motifs.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, softly blended oil-paint surfaces with delicate brushwork, subdued jewel-toned backgrounds, and carefully modeled pale faces. Formal portrait compositions combine ornate historical clothing, powdered hair, flowers, fruit, and birds with an uncanny, dreamlike elegance."},{"id":"charlie-adlard","name":"Charlie Adlard","cat":"illustrators","en":"Charlie Adlard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charlie-adlard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charlie-adlard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","white","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Charlie Adlard is a renowned British comic book artist, best known for his work on 'The Walking Dead' series. His distinctive style has made a significant impact on the comic book industry, earning him a place among the top illustrators in the field. Adlard's work is characterized by its expressive line work and ability to convey intense emotion and atmosphere.","observation":"A stark black-and-white ink style built from heavy contour lines, dense hatching, and sharply divided areas of light and shadow. It applies the same gritty, highly detailed graphic treatment to urban alley scenes and intense close-up portraits, creating a dark, confrontational atmosphere."},{"id":"jeeyoung-lee","name":"JeeYoung Lee","cat":"various-artists","en":"JeeYoung Lee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeeyoung-lee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeeyoung-lee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","fashion","floral","landscapes","scenes","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-blue","silver","muted-pink","blue","red"],"intro":"JeeYoung Lee is a South Korean artist known for her intricate and imaginative installation art. She creates elaborate sets in her small studio, transforming ordinary spaces into surreal dreamscapes. Her work often explores themes of personal identity, memory, and Korean folklore, using handcrafted elements to build immersive environments that challenge the boundaries between reality and fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds highly detailed dreamlike environments from dense, tactile floral and biomorphic forms, with tiny human figures providing scale. Saturated pink, blue, and coral palettes, theatrical settings, and sculptural textures make each image feel like an otherworldly fashion tableau rather than a naturalistic landscape."},{"id":"marianne-north","name":"Marianne North","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marianne North","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marianne-north.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marianne-north","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-olive","red","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Marianne North was a pioneering English naturalist and botanical artist, known for her extensive travels and detailed paintings of exotic plants. Born in 1830, she traveled to various continents, capturing the diverse flora she encountered with precision and vividness. Her work is celebrated for its scientific accuracy and artistic beauty, providing a unique glimpse into the natural world of the 19th century.","observation":"A richly painterly botanical style combines visible directional brushwork with densely layered flowers, foliage, pots, and distant mountain scenery. Saturated pinks, reds, oranges, and greens create an expressive, ornamental abundance, while the repeated garden-and-mountain compositions maintain a lush panoramic feel."},{"id":"igor-morski","name":"Igor Morski","cat":"illustrators","en":"Igor Morski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/igor-morski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/igor-morski","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","landscapes","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","dark-ochre","brown","light-yellow","muted-cyan","silver"],"intro":"Igor Morski is a Polish graphic designer and illustrator known for his surreal and imaginative works. He has gained recognition for his unique style that often combines elements of fantasy and reality, creating thought-provoking and visually striking images. His work often explores themes of identity, nature, and the human condition, using a blend of traditional and digital techniques.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental human faces and architectural forms are presented as weathered, cracked stone structures integrated into vast floating cliffs and landscapes. The highly realistic surface detail, tiny scale figures, dramatic vistas, and impossible spatial arrangements create a surreal, fantastical cinematic style with restrained earthy colors."},{"id":"john-leech","name":"John Leech","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Leech","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-leech.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-leech","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","beige","pale-yellow","black","brown"],"intro":"John Leech was a British caricaturist and illustrator known for his work in the 19th century, particularly his contributions to \"Punch\" magazine. His illustrations often depicted Victorian society with humor and satire, capturing the essence of the era's social dynamics and cultural nuances.","observation":"The style uses expressive, highly detailed ink drawing with fine contour lines, dense crosshatching, and occasional translucent washes on warm, aged paper. It presents theatrical full-body characters in small urban narrative scenes, balancing heavily worked figures and settings against broad areas of negative space."},{"id":"mary-katrantzou","name":"Mary Katrantzou","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Mary Katrantzou","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-katrantzou.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-katrantzou","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","fine-lines","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["grey","white","silver","charcoal","muted-rust","olive","red"],"intro":"Mary Katrantzou is a Greek fashion designer known for her innovative use of digital prints and bold, colorful designs. She gained prominence in the fashion world for her unique approach to textile design, often incorporating intricate patterns and vibrant colors into her collections. Katrantzou's work is celebrated for its creativity and ability to transform traditional fashion elements into modern, avant-garde pieces.","observation":"The style combines polished fashion-editorial realism with densely patterned, ornamental garments and dramatic sculptural silhouettes. Botanical and architectural imagery is layered across the clothing in vivid blues, oranges, greens, and creams, while the sheet alternates clean runway-style photography with fine-lined fashion-illustration treatments."},{"id":"herman-miller","name":"Herman Miller","cat":"designers","en":"Herman Miller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herman-miller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herman-miller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","floral","scenes","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-green","dark-green","vivid-red","bone-white","dark-red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Herman Miller is a renowned American company known for its innovative and iconic furniture designs, particularly in the mid-century modern style. Established in the early 20th century, the company has been a pioneer in creating ergonomic and aesthetically pleasing office and home furnishings. Herman Miller's designs are characterized by their functionality, comfort, and timeless appeal, often collaborating with famous designers like Charles and Ray Eames.","observation":"The style presents carefully arranged interior scenes with realistic, sculptural furniture, abundant tropical foliage, and strong geometric architecture. Saturated orange, green, cream, and wood tones combine with crisp daylight, clean compositions, and highly resolved material detail for a polished editorial look."},{"id":"augustus-edwin-john","name":"Augustus Edwin John","cat":"painters","en":"Augustus Edwin John","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/augustus-edwin-john.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/augustus-edwin-john","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-red","black","brown","muted-ochre","pale-orange"],"intro":"Augustus Edwin John was a prominent Welsh painter and draughtsman, known for his portraits and figure paintings in the early 20th century. He was associated with the post-impressionist movement and became one of the leading British artists of his time, celebrated for his expressive and detailed style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured oil-paint handling with visible directional brushwork, carefully modeled faces, and dense fabric and background detail. Cropped, closely framed figures and direct or sidelong gazes create an intimate, expressive portrait mood, while earthy reds, olives, creams, and muted blues unify the palette."},{"id":"alvaro-castagnet","name":"Alvaro Castagnet","cat":"painters","en":"Alvaro Castagnet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alvaro-castagnet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alvaro-castagnet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","portraits","scenes","urban","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","charcoal","grey","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Alvaro Castagnet is a renowned Uruguayan watercolor artist known for his vibrant and expressive style. He has gained international acclaim for his ability to capture the essence of a scene with bold brushstrokes and a vivid color palette. Castagnet's work often features urban landscapes and figures, rendered with a dynamic and fluid approach that emphasizes light and atmosphere.","observation":"Across the portraits and city views, the style combines visibly layered, directional paintwork with cinematic framing and dense architectural detail. Subdued blue-gray surroundings are punctuated by intense orange-red lights, reflected across wet streets and softened by mist, creating a dark, atmospheric urban mood."},{"id":"garry-winogrand","name":"Garry Winogrand","cat":"photographers","en":"Garry Winogrand","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/garry-winogrand.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/garry-winogrand","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro"],"colours":["black","bone-white","charcoal","grey","beige"],"intro":"Garry Winogrand was an influential American street photographer known for his vivid portrayal of mid-20th-century American life. His work captured the dynamic and often chaotic energy of urban environments, focusing on candid moments and the everyday interactions of people in public spaces. Winogrand's photography is celebrated for its spontaneity, authenticity, and ability to convey the spirit of the time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome, high-contrast photographic scenes of fashionably dressed people moving through dense city streets. Tight crops, candid expressions, vintage vehicles, selective focus, and visible film grain create a retro, cinematic street-documentary appearance."},{"id":"vittore-carpaccio","name":"Vittore Carpaccio","cat":"painters","en":"Vittore Carpaccio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vittore-carpaccio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vittore-carpaccio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","scenes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","muted-ochre","muted-blue","deep-red","silver"],"intro":"Vittore Carpaccio was an Italian painter of the Venetian school, active during the late 15th and early 16th centuries. He is best known for his large-scale narrative paintings and detailed depictions of contemporary Venetian life. Carpaccio's work is characterized by its vivid storytelling, meticulous attention to detail, and use of perspective, capturing both the grandeur and the everyday life of Venice during the Renaissance.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and densely detailed, depicting grand historic city architecture, crowded public scenes, waterways, and monumental religious buildings. Warm earth tones, deep shadows, blue skies, fine linear structure, and visible textured brushwork give the scenes an elaborate old-master architectural-painting character."},{"id":"craigie-aitchison","name":"Craigie Aitchison","cat":"painters","en":"Craigie Aitchison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/craigie-aitchison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/craigie-aitchison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","landscapes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-blue","dark-green","white","pink","vivid-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Craigie Aitchison is a renowned British painter known for his distinctive style characterized by simple forms, vibrant colors, and a focus on landscapes and figures. His work often features a unique blend of abstraction and representation, capturing a sense of tranquility and introspection.","observation":"Across all four images, simplified geometric landscapes and isolated forms are rendered with visible fine paint texture, saturated pinks, blues, oranges, and greens, and stark tonal contrasts. Strong central axes, vanishing paths, luminous circular motifs, and expansive fields of empty space create a surreal, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"lynd-ward","name":"Lynd Ward","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lynd Ward","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lynd-ward.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lynd-ward","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","characters","landscapes","urban","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","geometric","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Lynd Ward was an American artist and storyteller known for his pioneering work in the field of wordless novels, using wood engravings to create narrative art. His work is often associated with the expressionist movement and is recognized for its dramatic use of light and shadow, as well as its exploration of social and existential themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark black-and-white imagery combines angular urban structures and monumental landscapes with tiny silhouetted figures. Dense directional hatching, extreme tonal contrast, radiating light, and distorted geometric perspectives create a dark, dramatic, highly graphic atmosphere."},{"id":"graham-gercken","name":"Graham Gercken","cat":"painters","en":"Graham Gercken","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/graham-gercken.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/graham-gercken","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["light-blue","deep-red","muted-pink","brown","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Graham Gercken is an Australian landscape painter known for his vivid and expressive depictions of natural scenes. His work often captures the serene beauty of the Australian landscape, with a focus on light, color, and atmosphere. Gercken's paintings are characterized by their painterly style and use of broad brushstrokes to convey the essence of the scene rather than detailed realism.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured paint builds dense autumn forests with broad, visible strokes and expressive marks. Saturated scarlet foliage contrasts with cool blue-grey mist, while tiny solitary figures and wet paths create a recurring dreamy, atmospheric narrative."},{"id":"gediminas-pranckevicius","name":"Gediminas Pranckevicius","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gediminas Pranckevicius","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gediminas-pranckevicius.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gediminas-pranckevicius","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","brown","charcoal","grey","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Gediminas Pranckevicius is a Lithuanian illustrator known for his imaginative and detailed digital artworks. His work often explores fantastical themes and surreal landscapes, blending elements of reality with whimsical and dreamlike imagery.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic fantasy cityscapes with dense vertical architecture, waterways, bridges, boats, and layered distant structures. Cool blue-green dusk tones contrast with warm glowing windows and lanterns, while mist, reflections, weathered surfaces, and dramatic silhouettes create a cinematic, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"james-rosenquist","name":"James Rosenquist","cat":"painters","en":"James Rosenquist","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-rosenquist.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-rosenquist","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["vivid-red","pale-red","red","grey","dark-red","light-orange","blue"],"intro":"James Rosenquist is an American artist known for his contributions to the Pop Art movement. His work often incorporates elements of advertising and consumer culture, using a collage-like approach to create large-scale paintings that challenge the boundaries between fine art and commercial imagery. Rosenquist's art is characterized by its vibrant colors, fragmented compositions, and the juxtaposition of seemingly unrelated objects.","observation":"The style combines densely layered floral imagery with vigorous, visibly broad paint strokes, splatters, streaks, and thick built-up color. Saturated reds, oranges, pinks, blues, and whites create a high-contrast, expressive surface, while cropped blooms and radial arrangements push the botanical subject toward surreal abstraction."},{"id":"chuck-sperry","name":"Chuck Sperry","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chuck Sperry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chuck-sperry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chuck-sperry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","bold-lines","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["black","orange","muted-ochre","vivid-rust","dark-blue","deep-red"],"intro":"Chuck Sperry is a renowned American artist known for his vibrant and intricate screen prints, often associated with the rock poster movement. His work is celebrated for its psychedelic aesthetics and detailed compositions, drawing inspiration from the counterculture of the 1960s.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces are built from saturated, contrasting color fields, dense decorative motifs, and strongly articulated eyes, hair, and facial features. Fine ink-like hatching and bold contour lines give the portraits an illustrative, ornamental surface, while floral elements and surreal patterning merge with the figures."},{"id":"luke-jerram","name":"Luke Jerram","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Luke Jerram","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luke-jerram.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luke-jerram","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","glow","metallic","subdued-colors","classical","epic","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","grey","silver","muted-ochre","black"],"intro":"Luke Jerram is a British artist known for his innovative and large-scale public artworks that often incorporate elements of science and technology. His works span various mediums, including glass, and are exhibited worldwide. Jerram's art often explores the boundaries between art and science, creating pieces that are both visually striking and intellectually engaging.","observation":"The style presents photorealistic, monumental installations made from translucent, bubble-like material inside richly ornamented historic interiors. Warm natural light, reflective surfaces, and carefully composed architectural symmetry emphasize the sculptures’ scale and luminous volume, with occasional people providing human scale."},{"id":"william-wray","name":"William Wray","cat":"illustrators","en":"William Wray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-wray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-wray","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","muted-teal","dark-red","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"William Wray is an American artist known for his work in painting and illustration, often capturing urban landscapes and scenes with a unique blend of realism and impressionism. His work frequently explores themes of solitude and introspection within the bustling environment of city life.","observation":"Across all four renders, gritty urban night scenes are built from visible, broad, distressed brushwork and heavily textured surfaces. Deep blue-green shadows contrast with saturated red-orange lights, while rain-slick streets, reflections, utility wires, and low-rise buildings create a moody, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"wayne-thiebaud","name":"Wayne Thiebaud","cat":"painters","en":"Wayne Thiebaud","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wayne-thiebaud.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wayne-thiebaud","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","still-life","urban","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-cyan","light-orange","beige","charcoal","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Wayne Thiebaud is an American painter known for his colorful works depicting commonplace objects, particularly food items, in a style that combines elements of realism and pop art. Born in 1920, Thiebaud's work is characterized by its vibrant color palette and thick application of paint, creating a sense of texture and depth. His paintings often explore themes of consumerism and the American experience, capturing the essence of mid-20th century culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable urban, coastal, and still-life subjects are transformed into intensely colorful painted compositions. Visible directional brushwork, raised-looking paint, outlined forms, and repeated sweeping curves create a tactile, expressive sense of motion while preserving dense architectural detail."},{"id":"mana-neyestani","name":"Mana Neyestani","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mana Neyestani","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mana-neyestani.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mana-neyestani","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","silver","white","black","deep-red"],"intro":"Mana Neyestani is an Iranian cartoonist and illustrator known for his poignant and often politically charged works. His illustrations often reflect themes of social justice and human rights, drawing from his personal experiences and cultural background.","observation":"Across all four images, finely drawn ink lines, dense crosshatching, and engraving-like textures construct highly detailed monochrome scenes. The compositions use surreal shifts of scale and symbolic crowds of birds, sheep, and people, with stark white areas and deep blacks producing a dark, high-contrast theatrical mood."},{"id":"julius-shulman","name":"Julius Shulman","cat":"photographers","en":"Julius Shulman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julius-shulman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julius-shulman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","retro","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-blue","grey","dark-brown","beige"],"intro":"Julius Shulman is a renowned American architectural photographer known for his iconic images of mid-century modern architecture. His work has played a significant role in popularizing modernist architecture, particularly in Southern California, capturing the essence of the era's design and lifestyle.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic architectural scenes with crisp geometric structures, expansive glazing, cantilevered roofs, and strong horizontal horizons. Warm dusk or dawn light, restrained earthy colors, reflective water, and occasional city lights create a cinematic, nostalgic atmosphere while generous open space emphasizes the buildings and their views."},{"id":"pat-bagley","name":"Pat Bagley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Pat Bagley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pat-bagley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pat-bagley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","drawing"],"colours":["white","bone-white","grey","beige","black","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Pat Bagley is an American cartoonist known for his political and editorial cartoons. His work often features sharp wit and commentary on current events, making him a prominent figure in the world of illustration and satire.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines loose, highly visible drawing lines with translucent, brushy color washes and dense facial detail. Exaggerated caricatural figures, strong dark contours, selective navy and red accents, and mostly white backgrounds create an energetic editorial-illustration feel."},{"id":"paul-poiret","name":"Paul Poiret","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Paul Poiret","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-poiret.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-poiret","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","vivid-colors","retro","collage"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","black","red","muted-cyan","blue"],"intro":"Paul Poiret was a pioneering French fashion designer known for his innovative and liberating designs in the early 20th century. He is often credited with freeing women from the constraints of corsets and introducing a more natural silhouette. Poiret's work was characterized by its bold use of color, luxurious fabrics, and oriental influences, making him a key figure in the development of modern fashion.","observation":"The style combines vintage fashion portraiture with graphic, highly patterned clothing and strong illustrative linework. It alternates vivid hand-drawn color panels with monochrome photographic imagery, unified as a retro editorial collage with decorative textiles, simplified faces, and densely arranged garment details."},{"id":"shomei-tomatsu","name":"Shomei Tomatsu","cat":"photographers","en":"Shomei Tomatsu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shomei-tomatsu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shomei-tomatsu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","collage","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Shomei Tomatsu is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his compelling black and white images that capture the essence of post-war Japan. His work often explores themes of identity, culture, and the impact of war, using a distinctive style characterized by high contrast and emotional depth. Tomatsu's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey powerful narratives through simple yet evocative compositions.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome photographic imagery with deep blacks, blown highlights, visible grain, and occasional scratched or distressed surface texture. Repeated faces, profiles, and figures are layered through double-exposure-like composites, combining intimate close-ups, blurred motion, silhouettes, and shadowy outdoor settings into a tense cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"alex-janvier","name":"Alex Janvier","cat":"painters","en":"Alex Janvier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-janvier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-janvier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","pale-yellow","orange","grey","vivid-red","dark-blue","green"],"intro":"Alex Janvier is a celebrated Canadian artist known for his vibrant abstract paintings that often incorporate indigenous themes and symbolism. Born in 1935, Janvier is a member of the Dene Suline and Saulteaux First Nations and has been a significant figure in the contemporary art scene, blending traditional indigenous art with modernist techniques.","observation":"Across all four renders, vivid liquid-like ribbons and marbled color fields produce abstract organic compositions with energetic motion and occasional circular structures. Fine contour lines coexist with broad painted bands and flat color areas, while generous cream negative space keeps the dense swirling forms visually legible."},{"id":"helen-lundeberg","name":"Helen Lundeberg","cat":"painters","en":"Helen Lundeberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helen-lundeberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helen-lundeberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","landscapes","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy","epic","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","grey","dark-red","dark-blue","red","orange"],"intro":"Helen Lundeberg is an American painter known for her contributions to the Post- Surrealism movement. Her work often explores themes of introspection and solitude, characterized by precise compositions and a refined use of color. Lundeberg's art is celebrated for its clarity and thoughtful exploration of space and form, making her a significant figure in 20th-century American art.","observation":"The style combines clean geometric architecture and monumental sculptural forms with expansive, dreamlike landscapes, floating spheres, reflective water, and oversized celestial shapes. Saturated coral, pink, turquoise, and deep blue hues are heightened by hard directional light and strong shadows, while finely rendered surfaces and atmospheric clouds keep the surreal scenes tactile and cinematic in scale."},{"id":"kinuko-y-craft","name":"Kinuko Y. Craft","cat":"painters","en":"Kinuko Y. Craft","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kinuko-y-craft.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kinuko-y-craft","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","rust","grey","blue"],"intro":"Kinuko Y. Craft is a renowned Japanese-born American illustrator and painter, celebrated for her intricate and fantastical artwork. Her work often features mythological and fairy tale themes, rendered with exquisite detail and a romantic style. Craft's illustrations have graced the covers of numerous books, magazines, and opera posters, earning her a distinguished place in the world of fantasy art.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with densely layered floral, textile, and natural details, creating an ornate, tactile surface. Elegant female figures, open books, and small fantastical elements are woven into saturated jewel tones, deep shadows, and localized magical glints, producing a dreamy illustrative fantasy mood."},{"id":"hedi-slimane","name":"Hedi Slimane","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Hedi Slimane","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hedi-slimane.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hedi-slimane","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","white","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Hedi Slimane is a renowned French fashion designer and photographer, known for his influential work in the fashion industry. He has held prominent positions at major fashion houses, including Yves Saint Laurent and Dior Homme, where he revolutionized menswear with his slim silhouettes and rock-inspired aesthetics. Slimane's impact extends beyond fashion design to photography, where his distinctive black-and-white portraits capture the essence of modern elegance and youth culture.","observation":"The style is a stark black-and-white portrait treatment built around tightly cropped faces, dramatic tonal separation, and direct, intense gazes. Messy hair, skin texture, bold styling, hard shadows, and occasional environmental highlights give the images a raw, fashion-editorial cinematic edge."},{"id":"thornton-utz","name":"Thornton Utz","cat":"painters","en":"Thornton Utz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thornton-utz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thornton-utz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-orange","deep-red","red","grey"],"intro":"Thornton Utz was an American illustrator and painter known for his work in the mid-20th century. He gained recognition for his magazine covers and advertisements, capturing the essence of American life with a keen eye for detail and narrative. His style often depicted everyday scenes with a touch of humor and warmth, making him a beloved figure in American art.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visibly brushed paint with carefully described figures, clothing, rocks, and atmospheric landscapes. Strong dark⁠–light separation, restrained olive and charcoal passages, and recurring scarlet accents give the images a brooding, dramatic intensity, while monumental compositions make both the portraits and wilderness feel epic."},{"id":"nigo","name":"Nigo","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Nigo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nigo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nigo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","characters","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["white","beige","charcoal","muted-cyan","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Nigo is a renowned Japanese fashion designer, music producer, and entrepreneur, best known for founding the streetwear brand A Bathing Ape (BAPE). His influence extends beyond fashion into music and art, where he has collaborated with numerous artists and brands, shaping contemporary street culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and collectible objects are covered in energetic, multicolored paint marks and distressed surface texture. The style combines vivid color, sculptural toy-like forms, dense material detail, and bold expressive presentation, shifting between gallery-like object portraits and theatrical character scenes."},{"id":"ton-dubbeldam","name":"Ton Dubbeldam","cat":"painters","en":"Ton Dubbeldam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ton-dubbeldam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ton-dubbeldam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","brown","muted-blue","beige","rust"],"intro":"Ton Dubbeldam is a contemporary Dutch painter known for his vibrant and imaginative works that often blend elements of fantasy and reality. His art is characterized by a unique use of color and light, creating dreamlike scenes that captivate the viewer's imagination.","observation":"Across all four views, the style combines densely layered winter park and city scenery with visible fine marks, branching linework, and richly textured painted surfaces. Cool blue twilight dominates, punctuated by vivid orange windows, lamps, and low sunlight, creating luminous reflections and a dreamy, expressive atmosphere."},{"id":"adrian-ghenie","name":"Adrian Ghenie","cat":"painters","en":"Adrian Ghenie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adrian-ghenie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adrian-ghenie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","muted-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Adrian Ghenie is a contemporary Romanian painter known for his expressive and often unsettling works that explore themes of history, memory, and identity. His paintings are characterized by a blend of figuration and abstraction, utilizing a rich palette and dynamic compositions to convey psychological depth and tension.","observation":"Across the sheet, recognizable people and interiors dissolve into dense, aggressively worked paint, with broad directional strokes, scraping, drips, and partially obscured forms. Deep greens, blacks, browns, and reds create a heavy, high-contrast atmosphere, while fragmented faces and unstable spatial details give the scenes a surreal, emotionally charged quality."},{"id":"edgar-degas","name":"Edgar Degas","cat":"painters","en":"Edgar Degas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edgar-degas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edgar-degas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Edgar Degas was a prominent French artist known for his contributions to the Impressionist movement, particularly through his depictions of dancers and everyday scenes. Born in 1834, Degas's work is characterized by its focus on movement, light, and the human form, often capturing intimate moments with a sense of immediacy and realism. His innovative use of composition and perspective, along with his mastery of mediums such as oil, pastel, and charcoal, has left a lasting impact on the art world.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional paint strokes and a softly built-up surface to depict ballet dancers in restrained backstage scenes. Muted browns, creams, dusty pinks, and pale blues, deep shadows, cropped poses, and understated theatrical light create a quiet, intimate mood."},{"id":"lee-bontecou","name":"Lee Bontecou","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Lee Bontecou","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-bontecou.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-bontecou","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","sculptural","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["brown","muted-orange","bone-white","muted-ochre","black"],"intro":"Lee Bontecou is an American sculptor known for her innovative use of materials and her exploration of the intersection between organic and mechanical forms. Her work often incorporates industrial materials, creating a distinctive style that challenges traditional boundaries in sculpture. Bontecou's pieces are celebrated for their complexity and the way they evoke both natural and man-made worlds.","observation":"Across all four works, the style builds abstract radial compositions from concentric cavities, sweeping arcs, and interlocking geometric fragments. Subdued ivory, charcoal, and brown tones combine with visible broad painted marks, heavy drawn contours, hatching, and layered relief-like surfaces to suggest worn mechanical or architectural structures."},{"id":"kevin-siers","name":"Kevin Siers","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kevin Siers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kevin-siers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kevin-siers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["black","brown","yellow","beige","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Kevin Siers is a renowned American editorial cartoonist known for his sharp political satire and distinctive illustrative style. His work often appears in newspapers and has earned him numerous accolades, including the Pulitzer Prize for Editorial Cartooning.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses expressive editorial caricature with exaggerated facial anatomy, strong ink contours, dense crosshatching, and selectively muted color. Figures and allegorical creatures are arranged in active political vignettes, with rough paper texture, dramatic gestures, and high contrast giving the drawings a satirical, surreal intensity."},{"id":"todd-nauck","name":"Todd Nauck","cat":"illustrators","en":"Todd Nauck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/todd-nauck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/todd-nauck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","dark-blue","yellow","red"],"intro":"Todd Nauck is a renowned American comic book artist known for his work on titles such as \"Young Justice\" and \"Spider-Man.\" His dynamic style and detailed illustrations have made him a prominent figure in the comic book industry, especially noted for his vibrant character depictions and engaging storytelling.","observation":"The style uses energetic comic-book illustration with thick, dark ink contours, dense hatching, selective flat color, and visible watercolor-like washes on a paper ground. Figures are tightly cropped into dramatic, expressive poses, with saturated costume colors, strong contrast, and abundant anatomical and costume detail across the sheet."},{"id":"ladislav-sutnar","name":"Ladislav Sutnar","cat":"designers","en":"Ladislav Sutnar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ladislav-sutnar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ladislav-sutnar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","characters","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","silhouette"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","orange","brown","grey"],"intro":"Ladislav Sutnar was a Czech designer known for his pioneering work in information design and typography. He played a significant role in the development of modernist design principles, focusing on clarity and functionality. Sutnar's contributions to graphic design and his innovative use of typography have left a lasting impact on the field.","observation":"The style uses stark, graphic silhouettes and large geometric shapes arranged in tightly cropped, poster-like compositions. Saturated red-orange fields contrast with near-black forms, while flat color, rough print-like grain, and occasional gray textured areas create a tactile screenprinted appearance."},{"id":"thomas-ruff","name":"Thomas Ruff","cat":"photographers","en":"Thomas Ruff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-ruff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-ruff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","black","bone-white","brown","muted-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Thomas Ruff is a German photographer known for his explorations in digital photography and manipulation. His work often challenges traditional perceptions of photography by incorporating technology and new media, creating images that are both striking and thought-provoking. Ruff's approach to photography is characterized by a focus on detail and a willingness to experiment with form and technique.","observation":"The style combines softly rendered editorial portraits with highly embellished floral and couture elements, balancing pale blue-gray grounds against dark botanical arrangements and warm copper highlights. Fine, layered surface detail, delicate fabric and petal textures, and occasional vertical distortion give the images a dreamy, slightly surreal fashion-editorial character."},{"id":"gary-panter","name":"Gary Panter","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gary Panter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gary-panter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gary-panter","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","dark-green","red","dark-blue","yellow"],"intro":"Gary Panter is an American artist and illustrator known for his influential work in the punk art movement and underground comics scene. He gained prominence in the 1980s with his distinctive style that blends elements of surrealism, pop culture, and a raw, expressive aesthetic. His work often features chaotic compositions and bold, exaggerated characters, making a significant impact on the visual language of alternative comics and art.","observation":"Across all four works, dense hand-painted marks, thick outlines, and broad energetic strokes build crowded compositions of distorted faces, creatures, and repeated motifs. Vivid pinks, blues, greens, reds, and yellows sit in high-contrast flat shapes, while scribbled textures and layered patterns give the pictures an expressive, surreal intensity."},{"id":"jeremy-mann","name":"Jeremy Mann","cat":"painters","en":"Jeremy Mann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeremy-mann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeremy-mann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","scenes","urban","mist","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-green","muted-green","dark-brown","dark-rust","light-lime"],"intro":"Jeremy Mann is a contemporary American painter known for his atmospheric urban scenes and emotive portraits. His work often captures the essence of city life through a unique blend of realism and impressionistic techniques, creating a sense of mood and narrative in each piece.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense urban streets are treated with visible vertical and horizontal paint strokes, softened edges, and layered reflective surfaces. The subdued green-gray palette is punctuated by warm lamps, red signals, and vehicle lights, while rain, mist, pedestrians, and traffic create a dark cinematic street atmosphere."},{"id":"dave-dorman","name":"Dave Dorman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dave Dorman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dave-dorman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dave-dorman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","grey","silver","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"Dave Dorman is an American illustrator renowned for his work in the science fiction, fantasy, and comic book genres. He is particularly famous for his detailed and dynamic paintings, often depicting iconic characters and scenes from popular culture, including Star Wars and other fantasy universes. Dorman's art is celebrated for its vivid realism and imaginative scope, making him a prominent figure in contemporary illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible broad strokes, layered textures, and expressive modeling of faces, clothing, rocks, and water. Saturated teal, blue, orange, and gold tones combine with strong light-dark contrast, luminous environmental effects, and dynamic fantasy scenes populated by heroic or monstrous figures."},{"id":"luigi-russolo","name":"Luigi Russolo","cat":"painters","en":"Luigi Russolo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luigi-russolo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luigi-russolo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","landscapes","urban","motion","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","brown","red","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Luigi Russolo was an Italian painter and composer, known as a key figure in the Futurist movement. Born in 1885, he was a pioneer in the exploration of noise and sound, famously creating the \"Art of Noises,\" which influenced both visual and auditory arts. His work often reflected the dynamism and energy of modern life, capturing the essence of the early 20th century's technological advancements.","observation":"Across all four renders, architectural and urban forms are fragmented into forceful geometric planes, radiating lines, arcs, and spirals. Saturated orange, red, blue, and green dominate with sharp dark-light contrasts, while dense visible strokes give the images a richly textured, hand-painted surface and a strong sense of movement."},{"id":"emily-balivet","name":"Emily Balivet","cat":"painters","en":"Emily Balivet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emily-balivet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emily-balivet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["dark-ochre","brown","orange","rust","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Emily Balivet is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and mystical paintings that often explore themes of mythology, femininity, and nature. Her work is characterized by intricate details, rich colors, and a blend of fantasy and realism.","observation":"Highly detailed portrait compositions combine finely drawn contours with richly layered botanical, avian, textile, and jewelry motifs. Vivid jewel tones, flowing organic curves, and dense ornamental surfaces create an elegant fantastical atmosphere across all four renders."},{"id":"giovanni-segantini","name":"Giovanni Segantini","cat":"painters","en":"Giovanni Segantini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giovanni-segantini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giovanni-segantini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","muted-ochre","muted-blue","dark-green"],"intro":"Giovanni Segantini was an Italian painter known for his Symbolist works and his innovative use of Divisionism, a technique characterized by the separation of colors into individual dots or patches which interact optically. Born in 1858, Segantini's art often depicted pastoral and mountainous landscapes, reflecting his deep connection to nature and the rural life of the Alps.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint to depict monumental landscapes and small, solemn human figures in expansive settings. Earthy, subdued colors, dramatic mountain forms, radiant skies, and carefully rendered natural details create a classical, epic atmosphere."},{"id":"nicolas-delort","name":"Nicolas Delort","cat":"illustrators","en":"Nicolas Delort","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicolas-delort.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicolas-delort","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","mist","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Nicolas Delort is a contemporary French illustrator known for his intricate and detailed black-and-white artworks. His style often draws inspiration from classic engravings and the romanticism of the 19th century, creating a bridge between traditional techniques and modern storytelling. Delort's work is characterized by its meticulous linework and dramatic compositions, often exploring themes of fantasy and the surreal.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental cavernous landscapes and wave-like rock formations dwarf tiny travelers, creating a grand, surreal sense of scale. The stark monochrome treatment, deep shadows, luminous openings, fine surface detail, and flowing terrain give the scenes a dark, dramatic, graphic quality."},{"id":"gilbert-williams","name":"Gilbert Williams","cat":"painters","en":"Gilbert Williams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gilbert-williams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gilbert-williams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","landscapes","glow","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-olive","orange","dark-brown","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Gilbert Williams is a contemporary American artist known for his visionary and fantastical landscapes. His work often features ethereal and mystical themes, drawing inspiration from nature and the cosmos. Williams's art is characterized by its intricate detailing and vibrant color palettes, creating dreamlike scenes that transport viewers to otherworldly realms.","observation":"The style combines richly layered fantasy landscapes and character tableaux with visible painterly texture, fine delineation, and exceptionally dense ornamental detail. Saturated jewel-like colors, warm internal lights, elaborate costumes, and monumental trees create a dreamlike, epic fairytale atmosphere across all four renders."},{"id":"robert-capa","name":"Robert Capa","cat":"photographers","en":"Robert Capa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-capa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-capa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["grey","black","white","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Robert Capa was a renowned Hungarian-American war photographer and photojournalist, famous for his gripping images of 20th-century conflicts. Born in 1913, Capa co-founded Magnum Photos and covered five wars, including the Spanish Civil War and World War II. His work is celebrated for its raw, emotional power and ability to capture the human experience amidst chaos.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is stark black-and-white photographic realism with strong tonal separation, visible grain, and carefully staged cinematic framing. It combines close portraiture with crowded action scenes, using shallow focus, dramatic expressions, and layered foreground and background figures to create a documentary-like sense of immediacy."},{"id":"ferdinand-knab","name":"Ferdinand Knab","cat":"painters","en":"Ferdinand Knab","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ferdinand-knab.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ferdinand-knab","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","grey","red","bone-white","vivid-red"],"intro":"Ferdinand Knab was a German painter known for his romantic landscapes and architectural scenes. Born in 1834, Knab's work often depicted historical and mythological themes, characterized by a detailed and atmospheric style. His paintings frequently featured ruins and lush natural settings, capturing a sense of mystery and nostalgia.","observation":"These images use richly painterly, highly detailed rendering with monumental environments, deep atmospheric perspective, and dramatic light. Strong contrasts between shadowed stone interiors and luminous skies, waterfalls, or sunbeams create an epic fantasy mood across both natural and architectural scenes."},{"id":"ito-shinsui","name":"Ito Shinsui","cat":"printmakers","en":"Ito Shinsui","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ito-shinsui.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ito-shinsui","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","muted-blue","brown","red"],"intro":"Ito Shinsui was a prominent Japanese artist known for his contributions to the shin-hanga movement, which revitalized traditional ukiyo-e woodblock printing in the early 20th century. His work often depicted beautiful women, known as bijin-ga, capturing the grace and elegance of Japanese femininity with a modern sensibility. Shinsui's art is celebrated for its delicate line work, refined color palettes, and the harmonious integration of traditional and contemporary elements.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses finely drawn, illustrative portraiture with delicate ink-like outlines, restrained colors, and broad areas of warm paper-toned negative ground. Elaborately patterned kimonos, sculpted black hairstyles, floral ornaments, and selective red and blue accents create a decorative, carefully composed presentation."},{"id":"cecilia-beaux","name":"Cecilia Beaux","cat":"painters","en":"Cecilia Beaux","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cecilia-beaux.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cecilia-beaux","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Cecilia Beaux was an American portrait painter known for her elegant and insightful depictions of high society in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. She was one of the most successful female artists of her time, often compared to her contemporary, John Singer Sargent. Beaux's work is characterized by its delicate brushwork, refined color palette, and ability to capture the personality and status of her subjects.","observation":"Across all four portraits, thickly worked paint builds the women, gowns, and furnishings through visible directional strokes and layered tonal variation. The restrained cream, gray, brown, and black palette, deep interiors, and intimate reclining poses create a quiet, somber atmosphere while preserving expressive faces and richly textured fabric."},{"id":"roger-mayne","name":"Roger Mayne","cat":"photographers","en":"Roger Mayne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-mayne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-mayne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","scenes","urban","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","beige","silver","white"],"intro":"Roger Mayne was a British photographer known for his impactful street photography, particularly capturing the essence of post-war urban life in Britain. His work is celebrated for its candid portrayal of everyday scenes, focusing on the vibrancy and resilience of working-class communities.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with pronounced grain, deep shadows, and a weathered vintage-print character. Children in motion dominate gritty urban street scenes, framed with documentary immediacy and cinematic action-focused compositions."},{"id":"federico-fellini","name":"Federico Fellini","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Federico Fellini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/federico-fellini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/federico-fellini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","vivid-red","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Federico Fellini was an influential Italian filmmaker known for his distinctive style that blended fantasy and baroque images with earthiness. His films often explored themes of memory, dreams, and the subconscious, earning him critical acclaim and a lasting legacy in the world of cinema.","observation":"The style uses stark, high-contrast black-and-white portrait photography with deep shadows, selective focus, visible grain, and intensely lit facial features. Its formal suits, fedora hats, theatrical expressions, tight framing, and occasional red backdrop create a dark, retro cinematic mood."},{"id":"signe-wilkinson","name":"Signe Wilkinson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Signe Wilkinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/signe-wilkinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/signe-wilkinson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","motion","fine-lines","vivid-colors","drawing","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["white","pale-blue","grey","bone-white","brown","olive","rust"],"intro":"Signe Wilkinson is a renowned American editorial cartoonist known for her sharp wit and insightful commentary. She became the first female cartoonist to win the Pulitzer Prize for Editorial Cartooning in 1992, and her work often addresses social and political issues with humor and clarity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses lively fine ink lines, lightly textured color washes, and expressive, slightly exaggerated characters and creatures. The scenes are densely populated storybook adventures with whimsical anthropomorphic animals, strong gestures, pale blue open backgrounds, and recurring olive-green and warm earth tones."},{"id":"mark-brooks","name":"Mark Brooks","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mark Brooks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-brooks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-brooks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","ochre","silver","light-orange"],"intro":"Mark Brooks is a renowned comic book artist and illustrator known for his detailed and dynamic artwork, often associated with major comic publishers. His work is characterized by a strong sense of realism combined with fantastical elements, making him a prominent figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"The style uses richly visible, layered brushwork to render dramatic female character portraits with intense gazes, dark costumes, and elaborate accessories. Warm ember tones against deep blacks and cool blue accents create a high-contrast, moody fantasy atmosphere, while fine painterly marks add both facial definition and ornate surface texture."},{"id":"tim-okamura","name":"Tim Okamura","cat":"painters","en":"Tim Okamura","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-okamura.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-okamura","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","brown","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"Tim Okamura is a contemporary Canadian artist known for his realistic depictions of African American and minority subjects, often blending traditional portraiture techniques with urban themes and graffiti elements. His work explores identity, culture, and the human experience, capturing the essence of modern urban life.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines highly textured, visible paintwork with dense surface detail in hair, skin, textiles, jewelry, and weathered backgrounds. Warm earthy colors, direct gazes, close cropping, and richly patterned clothing create an expressive fashion-portrait look with an ornate, tactile finish."},{"id":"richard-parkes-bonington","name":"Richard Parkes Bonington","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Parkes Bonington","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-parkes-bonington.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-parkes-bonington","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","brown","muted-blue","silver","black"],"intro":"Richard Parkes Bonington was a British Romantic landscape painter known for his atmospheric and detailed depictions of coastal scenes and landscapes. Born in 1802, Bonington was a key figure in the Romantic movement, influencing both British and French art. His work is celebrated for its delicate use of light and color, capturing the transient effects of weather and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses loose, visible brushwork and softly blended atmospheric paint to depict expansive coastal, harbor, and urban settings. Warm ochres, dusty neutrals, and blue-grey shadows create a subdued, nostalgic mood, while expressive architectural silhouettes, reflective water, clouds, and tiny figures provide richly layered scene detail."},{"id":"anne-packard","name":"Anne Packard","cat":"painters","en":"Anne Packard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-packard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-packard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","silver","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Anne Packard is an American painter known for her evocative seascapes and landscapes, often depicting the serene and contemplative beauty of coastal New England. Her work is characterized by a minimalist approach, focusing on the interplay of light and shadow, and capturing the essence of the sea and sky.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad visible brushwork and softened edges give the seascapes a painterly, atmospheric character. Restrained blue-green, gray, cream, and ochre tones, low horizons, and drifting clouds create a calm, dreamy coastal mood, while the sailboats and rippling water provide gentle motion."},{"id":"bart-sears","name":"Bart Sears","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bart Sears","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bart-sears.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bart-sears","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","brown","light-orange","dark-brown","rust","muted-blue"],"intro":"Bart Sears is a renowned comic book artist and illustrator known for his dynamic and detailed artwork in the comic book industry. He has contributed to various popular comic series and is recognized for his strong, expressive characters and intricate linework.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense fine linework with visible painterly texture, producing highly detailed fantasy scenes full of expressive characters, creatures, and dramatic action. Saturated colors, strong light-dark contrasts, elaborate costumes, and energetic compositions give the images a vivid comic-book and mythic-adventure feel."},{"id":"howard-chandler-christy","name":"Howard Chandler Christy","cat":"painters","en":"Howard Chandler Christy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howard-chandler-christy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howard-chandler-christy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["light-orange","brown","black","muted-brown","muted-olive","deep-red"],"intro":"Howard Chandler Christy was an American artist and illustrator known for his portraits and depictions of women, particularly during the early 20th century. His work was characterized by a romantic and glamorous style, often capturing the elegance and beauty of his subjects. Christy gained fame for his \"Christy Girl\" illustrations, which became iconic representations of American femininity and grace.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, with layered, directional strokes shaping faces, fabric, flowers, and dark interiors. It consistently presents elegant, formally dressed women in cropped portrait compositions, using restrained jewel and earth tones with selective strong contrast and lavish period styling."},{"id":"martin-scorsese","name":"Martin Scorsese","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Martin Scorsese","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-scorsese.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-scorsese","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-brown","rust","light-orange"],"intro":"Martin Scorsese is an acclaimed American filmmaker known for his influential contributions to cinema, particularly in the genres of crime and drama. His works often explore themes of identity, guilt, and redemption, and are characterized by their innovative use of camera techniques and storytelling. Scorsese has directed numerous iconic films, including \"Taxi Driver,\" \"Goodfellas,\" and \"The Departed,\" earning him a place among the most respected directors in the history of film.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to render stern, highly detailed character portraits with strong facial modeling and dramatic shadow. Saturated red, black, cream, and deep blue dominate the palette, while tight crops, formal poses, and graphic background blocks give the images a bold editorial presence."},{"id":"ann-veronica-janssens","name":"Ann Veronica Janssens","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ann Veronica Janssens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ann-veronica-janssens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ann-veronica-janssens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","urban","glow","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["red","silver","beige","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Ann Veronica Janssens is a Belgian contemporary artist known for her immersive installations that explore light and perception. Her work often involves manipulating space and light to create unique sensory experiences, encouraging viewers to engage with their surroundings in new ways.","observation":"The style presents realistic architectural interiors transformed by translucent geometric installations and saturated pink, orange, and cyan illumination. Clean gallery spaces, reflective concrete floors, glowing surfaces, and occasional silhouetted visitors create a futuristic, surreal exhibition atmosphere."},{"id":"nicholas-alan-cope","name":"Nicholas Alan Cope","cat":"various-artists","en":"Nicholas Alan Cope","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicholas-alan-cope.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicholas-alan-cope","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","silver","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Nicholas Alan Cope is a contemporary photographer known for his striking and minimalist imagery. His work often explores themes of abstraction and surrealism, creating a unique visual language that challenges traditional perceptions of photography. Cope's style is characterized by its use of monochrome palettes, geometric forms, and a focus on texture and light.","observation":"The style presents anonymous, faceless figures wrapped in extensive black fabric, rendered with realistic textile detail and stark monochrome contrast. Spacious studio-like compositions, deep shadows, and sweeping or windblown cloth create a dark, cinematic sense of movement and isolation."},{"id":"bruce-mclean","name":"Bruce McLean","cat":"painters","en":"Bruce McLean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruce-mclean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruce-mclean","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","floral","patterns","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-orange","olive","vivid-red","pink","deep-blue","light-lime"],"intro":"Bruce McLean is a renowned Scottish sculptor and painter, known for his innovative approach to art. Born in 1944, McLean has been a significant figure in the contemporary art scene, challenging traditional art forms and exploring new mediums. His work often incorporates humor and irony, reflecting his critical stance on the art establishment.","observation":"Across all four renders, domestic interiors and object arrangements are built from intensely saturated blocks of color, heavy black contouring, and visible, layered brush marks. Geometric panels, furniture, plants, lamps, and flowers collide in dense, high-contrast compositions that combine flat color fields with rough painterly texture."},{"id":"georges-lacombe","name":"Georges Lacombe","cat":"painters","en":"Georges Lacombe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-lacombe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-lacombe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","landscapes","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-red","pale-orange","beige","red"],"intro":"Georges Lacombe is a French painter and sculptor associated with the Symbolist movement. He was known for his unique style that often incorporated elements of nature and mythology, creating works that were both decorative and deeply symbolic. Lacombe was part of the Nabis group, which sought to break away from traditional art forms and explore more abstract and expressive techniques.","observation":"Across the sheet, richly textured paint and fine visible brushwork build dense forests, dramatic landscapes, and stylized human figures. Saturated oranges, reds, greens, and deep blues create strong contrast, while decorative foliage, simplified forms, and fantasy-like settings give the images an expressive illustrated character."},{"id":"john-howe","name":"John Howe","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Howe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-howe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-howe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["muted-blue","black","dark-cyan","grey","silver"],"intro":"John Howe is a renowned illustrator and conceptual artist, best known for his work on J.R.R. Tolkien's Middle-earth. His illustrations have been instrumental in shaping the visual representation of Tolkien's world, contributing significantly to the art direction of film adaptations. Howe's style is characterized by its meticulous attention to detail, atmospheric depth, and a profound sense of the mythical and epic.","observation":"This style presents sweeping, highly detailed fantasy landscapes with monumental mountains, castles, waterfalls, ancient trees, and recurring dragons. Painterly textures, cool blue-green tones, atmospheric mist, and shafts of warm light create an expansive, epic sense of scale."},{"id":"donatella-versace","name":"Donatella Versace","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Donatella Versace","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/donatella-versace.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/donatella-versace","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","drawing"],"colours":["black","beige","ochre","brown","white","deep-red"],"intro":"Donatella Versace is an Italian fashion designer and the current vice president and chief designer of the Versace Group. She is known for her bold and glamorous fashion designs, which have become synonymous with luxury and opulence. Donatella has played a significant role in maintaining the legacy of the Versace brand, following the tragic death of her brother, Gianni Versace.","observation":"The style combines glossy editorial portrait photography with highly polished fashion illustration, presenting blonde female figures in luxurious, ornate clothing and jewelry. Strong poses, dramatic black backgrounds, rich red and gold accents, and crisp fine linework create a glamorous, high-fashion look across the set."},{"id":"gustave-le-gray","name":"Gustave Le Gray","cat":"photographers","en":"Gustave Le Gray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-le-gray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-le-gray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy","silhouette"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","light-orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Gustave Le Gray was a pioneering French photographer known for his innovations in early photography, particularly in landscape and seascape photography. He was one of the first to use the waxed paper negative process and is celebrated for his ability to capture the interplay of light and shadow, creating atmospheric and dramatic images that were ahead of his time.","observation":"Across all four images, realistic coastal scenes are rendered in a restrained sepia-brown palette with heavy tonal contrast, deep silhouettes, and softly atmospheric distance. Dramatic cloud formations, reflective water, grain, and cinematic framing give the set a nostalgic, dreamlike mood while preserving photographic detail."},{"id":"philip-jones-griffiths","name":"Philip Jones Griffiths","cat":"photographers","en":"Philip Jones Griffiths","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philip-jones-griffiths.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philip-jones-griffiths","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","white","silver","grey"],"intro":"Philip Jones Griffiths is a renowned Welsh photojournalist best known for his work during the Vietnam War. His impactful images captured the human side of conflict, highlighting the struggles and resilience of those affected. His work is characterized by a deep empathy and a commitment to revealing the truth through his lens.","observation":"A stark black-and-white photographic style uses severe tonal contrast, deep shadows, visible grain, and atmospheric haze to create bleak, filmic scenes. Tight character portraits are embedded in war-damaged environments, with smoke, rubble, ruined structures, and selective focus reinforcing the documentary realism."},{"id":"gentile-bellini","name":"Gentile Bellini","cat":"painters","en":"Gentile Bellini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gentile-bellini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gentile-bellini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","ochre","dark-red","grey"],"intro":"Gentile Bellini was an Italian painter of the Renaissance , known for his detailed portraits and historical scenes. He was a prominent figure in the Venetian school and played a significant role in the cultural exchange between Venice and the Ottoman Empire.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, painterly portraiture with visible fine brushwork, aged crackle surfaces, and richly patterned ceremonial clothing. Restrained earth tones are punctuated by strong reds, while close-packed figures, architectural settings, and religious-cultural imagery create a formal historical tableau."},{"id":"barbara-takenaga","name":"Barbara Takenaga","cat":"painters","en":"Barbara Takenaga","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barbara-takenaga.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barbara-takenaga","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","floral","patterns","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","bone-white","beige","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Barbara Takenaga is an American contemporary artist known for her intricate abstract paintings that often explore cosmic themes and patterns. Her work is characterized by meticulous detail and a vibrant use of color, creating dynamic visual experiences that draw viewers into imaginative realms.","observation":"The style combines densely layered, painterly micro-strokes with bead-like dots, looping lines, and radial organic structures. A restrained blue-black, ivory, and copper palette is enriched by metallic-looking highlights and luminous centers, producing intricate floral and cellular abstractions with a surreal, tactile surface."},{"id":"pierre-cardin","name":"Pierre Cardin","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Pierre Cardin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-cardin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-cardin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["white","black","light-red","dark-red","vivid-red","grey"],"intro":"Pierre Cardin is a renowned French fashion designer known for his avant-garde style and space-age designs. Born in 1922, Cardin's work has been influential in shaping modern fashion, particularly in the 1960s and 1970s. His designs often feature bold geometric shapes and futuristic elements, reflecting his interest in innovation and the future.","observation":"The style presents highly sculptural fashion portraits with exaggerated hats, masks, collars, and body-contouring garments that turn clothing into bold geometric forms. Clean studio backgrounds, tightly cropped poses, saturated pink and orange against black and white, and strong directional contrast give the images a polished, cinematic editorial character."},{"id":"grete-stern","name":"Grete Stern","cat":"photographers","en":"Grete Stern","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/grete-stern.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/grete-stern","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage"],"colours":["beige","brown","black"],"intro":"Grete Stern was a German-born Argentine photographer known for her pioneering work in photomontage and surrealism. She was a significant figure in the avant-garde movement and contributed to the development of modern photography in Latin America. Her work often explored themes of identity, dreams, and the subconscious, using innovative techniques to create thought-provoking images.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped photographic portraits arranged as surreal, confrontational collages, with faces partially obscured by hands, foliage, masks, and oversized objects. Strong monochrome contrast, coarse grain, sepia toning, and tactile textures give the images an aged, cinematic editorial character."},{"id":"ernst-haeckel","name":"Ernst Haeckel","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ernst Haeckel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernst-haeckel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernst-haeckel","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","flat-color","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","classical","symmetry"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","ochre","dark-ochre","red"],"intro":"Ernst Haeckel was a German biologist, naturalist, and artist known for his detailed and intricate illustrations of marine organisms and other natural forms. His work contributed significantly to the field of biological illustration and helped popularize the study of natural history in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. Haeckel's illustrations are celebrated for their scientific accuracy and artistic beauty, blending the boundaries between art and science.","observation":"The style presents densely packed botanical and marine forms as ornate natural-history plates, combining intricate fine linework with carefully controlled illustrative color. Radial symmetry, repeated organic structures, cream paper or black grounds, and vivid red-orange accents create a decorative, encyclopedic specimen-display quality."},{"id":"emmanuelle-moureaux","name":"Emmanuelle Moureaux","cat":"architects","en":"Emmanuelle Moureaux","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emmanuelle-moureaux.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emmanuelle-moureaux","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","scenes","glow","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["red","muted-red","silver","dark-red","brown","orange"],"intro":"Emmanuelle Moureaux is a renowned French architect and designer known for her innovative use of color and space. She has gained recognition for her vibrant installations that explore the interplay of light, color, and form, often creating immersive environments that engage viewers on multiple sensory levels.","observation":"Across all four views, the style depicts expansive indoor installation spaces built from dense, repeated strands, tiles, and translucent panels arranged into geometric curtains and corridors. Saturated color gradients, luminous openings, clean architectural forms, and a slightly unreal dreamlike presentation make the environments feel like monumental interactive galleries."},{"id":"orla-kiely","name":"Orla Kiely","cat":"designers","en":"Orla Kiely","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/orla-kiely.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/orla-kiely","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-olive","pale-yellow","vivid-orange","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Orla Kiely is an Irish designer known for her distinctive patterns and prints, often featuring bold, retro-inspired motifs. Her work spans fashion, homeware, and accessories, characterized by a playful use of color and form that has become iconic in contemporary design.","observation":"The style combines crisp, graphic illustration with densely repeated floral and circular motifs, using strong geometric symmetry and clean flat color. A restrained retro palette of olive, cream, black, mustard, and orange is enriched by textile-like surface grain, while stylized fashion figures, accessories, and botanical arrangements create a coordinated editorial world."},{"id":"john-constable","name":"John Constable","cat":"painters","en":"John Constable","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-constable.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-constable","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","bone-white","charcoal","dark-ochre","ochre","dark-rust"],"intro":"John Constable was an English Romantic painter born in 1776, renowned for his landscape paintings that captured the beauty of the English countryside. His works often depicted rural scenes with a focus on natural light and atmospheric effects, contributing significantly to the Romantic movement in art. Constable's paintings are celebrated for their detailed portrayal of nature and their emotional depth, often featuring the landscapes of Suffolk, where he was born.","observation":"These landscapes are rendered with visible, layered brushwork, especially in the clouds, grasses, and tree masses, giving the scenes a richly painted surface. Broad pastoral vistas, monumental cloud formations, warm earth tones, and shifting sunlight create a dramatic, dreamy, and expansive atmosphere across all four views."},{"id":"eiko-ishioka","name":"Eiko Ishioka","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Eiko Ishioka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eiko-ishioka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eiko-ishioka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","silver","muted-rust","brown","dark-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Eiko Ishioka was a renowned Japanese art director and costume designer known for her bold and innovative work in film, theater, and advertising. Her unique style often blended traditional Japanese elements with contemporary aesthetics, earning her international acclaim and numerous awards, including an Academy Award for Best Costume Design.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped portrait photography with tactile skin, fur, fabric, and elaborate costume details rendered sharply. Saturated reds, deep blacks, icy whites, and metallic accents create bold contrast, while sculptural headwear and unconventional makeup give the images an ornate, avant-garde fashion-editorial character."},{"id":"carey-chen","name":"Carey Chen","cat":"various-artists","en":"Carey Chen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carey-chen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carey-chen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","landscapes","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","dark-blue","silver","grey","red"],"intro":"Carey Chen is an artist known for his vibrant and detailed depictions of marine life and underwater scenes. His work often features a realistic yet expressive style, capturing the beauty and diversity of oceanic environments. Chen is celebrated for his ability to bring the underwater world to life with vivid colors and intricate details, making his art both educational and visually stunning.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and densely layered, with broad visible strokes shaping a fantastical underwater world full of marine life, coral, foliage, and rushing water. Saturated blues, turquoise, pinks, and oranges are pushed by luminous highlights and strong contrast, creating an energetic, dreamlike, epic sense of motion."},{"id":"alexandre-deschaumes","name":"Alexandre Deschaumes","cat":"photographers","en":"Alexandre Deschaumes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexandre-deschaumes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexandre-deschaumes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","silver","charcoal","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Alexandre Deschaumes is a renowned French photographer known for his evocative and atmospheric landscape photography. His work often captures the ethereal beauty of nature, blending elements of fantasy and reality to create dreamlike scenes that evoke a sense of wonder and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents vast, realistic mountain landscapes with monumental cliffs, deep valleys, and carefully resolved rocky and vegetation textures. Dark atmospheric palettes, strong light-and-shadow contrasts, drifting mist, and cinematic scale create an epic, dreamlike sense of wilderness."},{"id":"frank-lloyd-wright","name":"Frank Lloyd Wright","cat":"architects","en":"Frank Lloyd Wright","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-lloyd-wright.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-lloyd-wright","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","glow","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-green","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Frank Lloyd Wright was a pioneering American architect known for his innovative designs and contributions to modern architecture. He developed the concept of organic architecture, which sought harmony between human habitation and the natural world. Wright's most famous works include Fallingwater and the Guggenheim Museum, showcasing his unique approach to integrating structures with their surroundings.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic architectural scenes with detailed, sculptural modern structures embedded in lush natural terrain. Warm interior glow, reflective water, deep forest shadows, and cinematic compositions create a dramatic yet harmonious relationship between geometric buildings and organic landscapes."},{"id":"edmonia-lewis","name":"Edmonia Lewis","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Edmonia Lewis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edmonia-lewis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edmonia-lewis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","beige","white","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Edmonia Lewis was a pioneering American sculptor of African-American and Native American heritage, active in the 19th century. She is renowned for her neoclassical sculptures that often explored themes of cultural identity and historical narratives. Her work gained recognition for its intricate detail and expressive portrayal of figures, contributing significantly to American art and culture.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, close-up portrait busts rendered as pale, weighty marble sculpture, with carefully modelled faces, curls, sheep wool, and cascading fabric. Subdued stone tones, neutral backgrounds, soft directional light, and varied cropped poses create a polished classical-gallery appearance across the sheet."},{"id":"beatriz-milhazes","name":"Beatriz Milhazes","cat":"painters","en":"Beatriz Milhazes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/beatriz-milhazes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/beatriz-milhazes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","bone-white","red","dark-blue","vivid-red","yellow","green"],"intro":"Beatriz Milhazes is a contemporary Brazilian artist known for her vibrant and colorful works that blend elements of Brazilian culture with modernist influences. Her art often incorporates motifs from nature, carnival, and tropicalia, creating a unique fusion that reflects her cultural heritage. Milhazes's work is characterized by its intricate patterns, bold colors, and a sense of joyful exuberance.","observation":"A densely packed, highly colorful collage style combines flat graphic shapes, bold outlines, painted textures, and repeated geometric motifs. Checkerboards, concentric circles, floral forms, stripes, dots, grids, and layered decorative fragments create an exuberant, surreal visual field with little empty space."},{"id":"nicholas-hely-hutchinson","name":"Nicholas Hely Hutchinson","cat":"painters","en":"Nicholas Hely Hutchinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicholas-hely-hutchinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicholas-hely-hutchinson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","dark-brown","muted-olive","light-red","red"],"intro":"Nicholas Hely Hutchinson is a contemporary British artist known for his vibrant and idyllic landscape paintings. His work often features pastoral scenes that evoke a sense of nostalgia and tranquility, drawing inspiration from the English countryside. Hutchinson's style is characterized by a harmonious blend of color and form, creating a dreamlike quality that captures the essence of rural life.","observation":"Across all four renders, softly visible brushwork builds richly textured hills, grasses, trees, and atmospheric skies in a cohesive painted storybook landscape style. Cool blue and mauve twilight dominates, punctuated by warm glowing windows and scattered lights, while mist, solitary figures, and slightly uncanny details create a dreamy surreal mood."},{"id":"justin-gaffrey","name":"Justin Gaffrey","cat":"painters","en":"Justin Gaffrey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/justin-gaffrey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/justin-gaffrey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["light-teal","bone-white","dark-olive","muted-green","olive","orange"],"intro":"Justin Gaffrey is a contemporary American artist known for his unique approach to painting, often using a palette knife to create textured and vibrant landscapes. His work is characterized by thick applications of paint, resulting in a three-dimensional effect that brings his subjects to life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the scenes are built from visible, layered paint strokes, with sweeping directional marks shaping skies, water, foliage, and petals. Saturated turquoise, orange, yellow, green, and cream create expressive coastal garden landscapes whose recognizable natural forms remain slightly dreamlike and fluid."},{"id":"laurie-simmons","name":"Laurie Simmons","cat":"photographers","en":"Laurie Simmons","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laurie-simmons.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laurie-simmons","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","retro"],"colours":["brown","grey","silver","muted-orange","muted-green","rust"],"intro":"Laurie Simmons is an American artist and photographer known for her staged photographs featuring dolls and miniature scenes. Her work often explores themes of domesticity, gender roles, and consumer culture, using meticulously crafted sets and props to create narrative-driven images. Simmons's art is recognized for its unique blend of realism and fantasy, often evoking a sense of nostalgia and surrealism.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic mannequin and doll tableaux with carefully staged vintage interiors, fashion displays, and domestic props. Strong directional lighting, deep shadows, selective warm lamp glow, and restrained retro colors create a cinematic yet uncanny atmosphere, while the dense costumes and set dressing add visual specificity."},{"id":"ken-fulk","name":"Ken Fulk","cat":"designers","en":"Ken Fulk","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ken-fulk.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ken-fulk","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-green","dark-red","brown","deep-red","bone-white"],"intro":"Ken Fulk is a renowned American designer known for his extravagant and whimsical interior designs. His work often blends traditional and contemporary elements, creating spaces that are both luxurious and imaginative. Fulk's style is characterized by bold colors, intricate patterns, and a playful mix of textures and materials, making him a standout figure in the world of design.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly layered, highly decorated interiors with dark jewel-toned colors, deep shadows, and warm highlights. The imagery has a polished painterly-illustrative finish, emphasizing velvet, carved wood, floral surfaces, chandeliers, patterned rugs, and carefully staged vintage furnishings."},{"id":"andreas-rocha","name":"Andreas Rocha","cat":"various-artists","en":"Andreas Rocha","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andreas-rocha.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andreas-rocha","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","muted-blue","brown","orange","silver","lime"],"intro":"Andreas Rocha is a contemporary digital artist known for his captivating fantasy landscapes and atmospheric scenes. His work often features intricate details and a strong sense of mood, drawing inspiration from fantasy literature and medieval themes.","observation":"The style presents vast, cinematic fantasy landscapes with highly realistic rocky terrain, monumental peaks, waterfalls, castles, and mountain settlements. Cool blue atmospheric shadows contrast with warm sunset or torchlight accents, while mist, dramatic clouds, and towering forms create an epic, dreamlike sense of scale."},{"id":"teamlab","name":"teamLab","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"teamLab","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/teamlab.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/teamlab","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","glow","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","grey","muted-blue","red","dark-red"],"intro":"teamLab is a Japanese interdisciplinary art collective known for creating immersive digital art installations that blend art, technology, and nature. Established in 2001, the group consists of artists, programmers, engineers, CG animators, mathematicians, and architects. They aim to explore the relationship between humans and the world through interactive and participatory experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely packed oversized flowers and drifting petals form immersive, dreamlike environments with small silhouetted figures for scale. Saturated coral, pink, and blue hues stand out against deep teal darkness, while internal luminous effects, reflections, and airborne motion create a theatrical cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"omar-victor-diop","name":"Omar Victor Diop","cat":"photographers","en":"Omar Victor Diop","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/omar-victor-diop.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/omar-victor-diop","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-green","black","dark-brown","muted-olive","ochre","dark-cyan"],"intro":"Omar Victor Diop is a contemporary Senegalese photographer known for his vibrant and culturally rich portraits that explore themes of identity, history, and fashion. His work often incorporates elements of traditional African attire and modern aesthetics, creating a unique blend that highlights the beauty and diversity of African cultures.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, carefully staged fashion portraits with richly patterned garments, elaborate hats, jewelry, and abundant floral decoration. Saturated jewel and mustard tones, strong tonal contrast, and studio-like compositions give the four images a polished, theatrical editorial presence."},{"id":"fra-angelico","name":"Fra Angelico","cat":"painters","en":"Fra Angelico","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fra-angelico.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fra-angelico","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["orange","ochre","black","dark-brown","rust","muted-blue"],"intro":"Fra Angelico is a renowned Italian painter of the early Renaissance , celebrated for his religious artworks that blend Gothic and Renaissance styles. Born Guido di Pietro, he became a Dominican friar and was known for his devout spirituality, which deeply influenced his art. His works are characterized by their serene beauty, detailed execution, and use of color to convey spiritual themes.","observation":"The style presents densely detailed religious scenes with carefully modelled figures, architectural settings, halos, robes, and layered crowds. It uses a subdued earthy palette with luminous gold accents, fine painterly brushwork, and an aged, craquelured surface that evokes devotional wall and panel painting."},{"id":"raphaelle-peale","name":"Raphaelle Peale","cat":"painters","en":"Raphaelle Peale","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raphaelle-peale.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raphaelle-peale","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","floral","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-ochre","ochre","pale-orange","dark-rust"],"intro":"Raphaelle Peale is considered one of the first professional still life painters in America. Born in 1774, he was part of the famous Peale family of artists. His work is known for its meticulous detail and realistic representation of everyday objects, often infused with a sense of intimacy and quietude. Peale's paintings typically feature fruits, vegetables, and other domestic items, rendered with a keen eye for texture and subtlety.","observation":"These images use richly layered, realistic oil-paint rendering with visible fine brushwork, tactile surfaces, and carefully described object details. Warm brown, olive, cream, and muted red tones are set against deep shadow, while dramatic directional light gives the still-life arrangements a solemn, classical atmosphere."},{"id":"jorn-utzon","name":"Jorn Utzon","cat":"architects","en":"Jorn Utzon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jorn-utzon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jorn-utzon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","beige","grey","black"],"intro":"Jorn Utzon was a Danish architect renowned for designing the Sydney Opera House, a masterpiece of modern architecture. His work is celebrated for its innovative use of organic forms and integration with the surrounding environment, reflecting a deep understanding of both structural design and aesthetic harmony.","observation":"The style presents monumental waterfront architecture as realistic, highly detailed architectural imagery, emphasizing sculptural shell forms, repeated ribs, and strong geometric silhouettes. Subdued warm neutrals, reflective water, dramatic skies, and low sunlight give the views a cinematic, atmospheric quality while preserving crisp structural detail."},{"id":"amy-judd","name":"Amy Judd","cat":"painters","en":"Amy Judd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amy-judd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amy-judd","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","charcoal","beige","muted-blue","grey","deep-red"],"intro":"Amy Judd is a contemporary artist known for her ethereal and surreal portraits that often blend human forms with elements of nature. Her work explores themes of femininity and fantasy, creating a unique visual language that captivates viewers with its delicate and dreamlike quality.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely rendered portraiture with dense feather textures treated as extravagant sculptural garments and headpieces. Restrained blue, ivory, skin, and occasional deep red create a dreamlike surreal mood, while repeated doves and obscured eyes give the compositions a theatrical, symbolic quality."},{"id":"guy-coheleach","name":"Guy Coheleach","cat":"painters","en":"Guy Coheleach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-coheleach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-coheleach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","light-yellow","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Guy Coheleach is an American wildlife artist renowned for his realistic and detailed depictions of animals. His work often focuses on capturing the essence and beauty of wildlife in their natural habitats. Coheleach's art is celebrated for its intricate detail and vibrant portrayal of the natural world, making him a prominent figure in the field of wildlife art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly detailed natural forms with expressive, visibly built-up brushwork and strong dark-versus-light contrast. Portrait-like animal and human figures merge with skulls, feathers, antlers, mushrooms, and dense autumn vegetation into dramatic fantasy assemblages with substantial sculptural depth."},{"id":"thomas-rowlandson","name":"Thomas Rowlandson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Thomas Rowlandson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-rowlandson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-rowlandson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","retro","drawing"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","black","muted-orange","beige","muted-brown"],"intro":"Thomas Rowlandson was an English artist and caricaturist known for his satirical and humorous depictions of 18th-century British society. His works often featured exaggerated characters and lively scenes, capturing the social and political atmosphere of his time with wit and detail.","observation":"The style combines finely drawn outlines with loose watercolor-like washes, visible paper texture, and restrained earthy colors. Across interiors, social gatherings, and outdoor scenes, it packs expressive figures, clothing, animals, and architectural details into lively, crowded compositions with a gently comic character."},{"id":"jean-honore-fragonard","name":"Jean-Honore Fragonard","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Honore Fragonard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-honore-fragonard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-honore-fragonard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","scenes","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","grey","ochre","silver","rust"],"intro":"Jean-Honore Fragonard was an 18th-century French painter and printmaker, renowned for his exuberant and hedonistic Rococo style. His works often depicted playful, romantic scenes with a focus on lightness and fluidity, capturing the spirit of the French aristocracy during the Enlightenment period. Fragonard's paintings are characterized by their intricate details, vibrant colors, and a sense of movement and joy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible brushwork, layered textures, and densely ornamented foliage, flowers, fabric, and architectural details. Classical-looking figures inhabit dramatic garden and grotto tableaux, animated by flowing gestures, birds, swirling cloth, and strong luminous contrasts between saturated sky tones and deep shadows."},{"id":"gary-bunt","name":"Gary Bunt","cat":"painters","en":"Gary Bunt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gary-bunt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gary-bunt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","dark-olive","bone-white","ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Gary Bunt is a contemporary British artist known for his evocative paintings that often depict scenes of rural life and community interactions. His work is characterized by a unique blend of naïve art and contemporary realism, capturing the essence of everyday moments with a nostalgic and introspective touch.","observation":"A consistently painterly, textured treatment uses visible directional brushwork, fine drawn contours, and restrained green, gray, brown, and black hues. Quiet outdoor vignettes combine leafless trees, reflective water, paths, bridges, houses, and solitary figures into atmospheric, melancholic scenes with occasional warm window lights and vivid red accents."},{"id":"eduardo-paolozzi","name":"Eduardo Paolozzi","cat":"various-artists","en":"Eduardo Paolozzi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eduardo-paolozzi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eduardo-paolozzi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","illustrative","ornate","sculptural","characters","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","charcoal","red","yellow","green","deep-blue"],"intro":"Eduardo Paolozzi is a Scottish sculptor and artist known for his pioneering work in pop art and collage. Born in 1924, Paolozzi's art often reflects themes of industrialization, technology, and mass media. He is recognized for his bold use of color and geometric forms, creating works that are both playful and thought-provoking. His influence extends across various art movements, including modernism and futurism.","observation":"This style combines densely packed geometric abstraction with vivid, strongly separated colors and intricate fine-line detailing. Repeated architectural reliefs, carved faces, mechanical forms, grids, circles, and ornamental panels give the imagery a monumental sculptural presence while retaining a graphic, flat-color clarity."},{"id":"doug-hyde","name":"Doug Hyde","cat":"painters","en":"Doug Hyde","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/doug-hyde.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/doug-hyde","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["sculptural","characters","fine-brushstrokes","subdued-colors","cute","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","blue","grey","deep-red","ochre"],"intro":"Doug Hyde is a contemporary British artist known for his distinctive and emotive style. His work often features simple, rounded characters that convey warmth and positivity. Hyde's art has gained popularity for its ability to evoke strong emotional connections, often focusing on themes of love, friendship, and family.","observation":"The style presents simplified, toy-like dog characters as softly modelled, tactile forms with rounded bodies, sparse facial features, and visible fine fur or brush texture. Restrained backgrounds and moody lighting create a gentle, slightly melancholic atmosphere, while the occasional red garment provides a controlled accent."},{"id":"lee-bermejo","name":"Lee Bermejo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Lee Bermejo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-bermejo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-bermejo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","rust","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Lee Bermejo is a contemporary American comic book artist known for his detailed and realistic illustrations, often working with major publishers like DC Comics. His work is characterized by a gritty and expressive style, bringing a cinematic quality to the pages of graphic novels and comics.","observation":"Across the sheet, tightly cropped human and monstrous faces are rendered with dense, visible brushwork, tactile skin and hair, and intensely exaggerated expressions. The dark, earthy palette and sharp light-to-shadow transitions create a grim, fantastical portrait style with surreal grotesque distortions."},{"id":"david-hettinger","name":"David Hettinger","cat":"painters","en":"David Hettinger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-hettinger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-hettinger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-brown","muted-ochre","silver","rust"],"intro":"David Hettinger is an American painter known for his realistic and impressionistic works that often depict intimate and contemplative scenes of everyday life. His paintings are characterized by a focus on light and shadow, capturing the quiet moments of domestic settings with a sense of introspection and serenity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly layered paint with directional, broken brushwork and richly varied surface texture. It combines intimate domestic scenes and garden interiors with saturated greens, oranges, and blues, strong light-dark contrasts, abundant botanical detail, and expressive seated figures."},{"id":"ambrosius-benson","name":"Ambrosius Benson","cat":"painters","en":"Ambrosius Benson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ambrosius-benson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ambrosius-benson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-red","ochre","beige"],"intro":"Ambrosius Benson is a Flemish painter from the Renaissance period, known for his detailed portraits and religious works. He was active in the early 16th century and is associated with the Northern Renaissance movement, contributing significantly to the art scene in Bruges with his refined technique and elegant compositions.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped, highly realistic painted portraits and figure groups with exceptionally careful rendering of faces, hands, feathers, fur, and woven fabrics. Dark grounds and strong light-dark separation make the subdued reds, browns, blacks, and pale flesh tones especially prominent, while fine brushwork and a subtly aged surface give the images a richly finished, historical appearance."},{"id":"gabriel-isak","name":"Gabriel Isak","cat":"photographers","en":"Gabriel Isak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gabriel-isak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gabriel-isak","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-cyan","pale-blue","muted-blue","black","silver"],"intro":"Gabriel Isak is a contemporary photographer known for his surreal and introspective imagery. His work often explores themes of solitude, identity, and the human psyche, using minimalistic and symbolic compositions to evoke deep emotional responses.","observation":"Across all four images, solitary figures are placed within vast, carefully composed landscapes and architectural thresholds, creating a cinematic sense of scale and isolation. Desaturated blue twilight, heavy atmospheric fog, deep shadows, and distant luminous skies produce a dreamy, dark, otherworldly mood with expansive negative space."},{"id":"eduardo-souto-moura","name":"Eduardo Souto Moura","cat":"architects","en":"Eduardo Souto Moura","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eduardo-souto-moura.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eduardo-souto-moura","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-red","silver","deep-red","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Eduardo Souto Moura is a renowned Portuguese architect known for his modernist approach and integration of structures with their natural surroundings. He has received numerous accolades, including the prestigious Pritzker Architecture Prize, and is celebrated for his innovative designs that blend simplicity with functionality.","observation":"The style presents monumental architectural spaces with severe geometric forms, deep recesses, and carefully controlled perspectives. Strong sunlight creates stark contrasts between near-black shadow and saturated red surfaces, while tiny isolated figures and large areas of emptiness emphasize scale, solitude, and sculptural mass."},{"id":"lisa-golightly","name":"Lisa Golightly","cat":"painters","en":"Lisa Golightly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lisa-golightly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lisa-golightly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","muted-blue","cyan","charcoal","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Lisa Golightly is an artist known for her evocative and intimate portraiture, often focusing on the subtleties of human expression and emotion. Her work typically features soft, muted color palettes and a painterly style that captures the essence of her subjects with a gentle touch.","observation":"These images use softly textured, hand-painted surfaces with delicate brushwork, simplified yet recognizable figures, and carefully placed vivid accents against expansive blue-gray grounds. The recurring isolated characters, animals, unusual pairings, and large areas of open space create a refined, quietly surreal storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"cristobal-balenciaga","name":"Cristobal Balenciaga","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Cristobal Balenciaga","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cristobal-balenciaga.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cristobal-balenciaga","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","fashion","portraits","grain","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["brown","beige","bone-white","black"],"intro":"Cristobal Balenciaga was a renowned Spanish fashion designer, often hailed as the 'master of haute couture.' Known for his innovative designs and impeccable craftsmanship, Balenciaga's work has left a lasting impact on the fashion industry. His creations are characterized by their sculptural quality, attention to detail, and the use of luxurious fabrics, which have influenced countless designers and fashion houses.","observation":"The style presents highly composed fashion portraits built around exaggerated, sculptural silhouettes, enveloping capes, dramatic hats, and tactile bouclé or feathered fabrics. Muted cream, charcoal, and black tones, controlled studio lighting, soft shadows, and visible photographic grain give the images a restrained, vintage editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"gil-bruvel","name":"Gil Bruvel","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Gil Bruvel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gil-bruvel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gil-bruvel","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","brown","dark-blue","black","muted-blue"],"intro":"Gil Bruvel is a contemporary artist known for his innovative sculptures and paintings that explore the boundaries of form and space. His work often incorporates fluid lines and intricate patterns, creating a sense of movement and depth.","observation":"The style presents expressive female portrait busts as highly detailed, surreal sculptures, combining smooth modeled faces with dense architectural fragments, coils, ribbons, and block-like ornament. A restrained blue, white, and gray palette, dramatic close cropping, and strong volumetric construction unify the gallery-like compositions."},{"id":"eleanor-antin","name":"Eleanor Antin","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Eleanor Antin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eleanor-antin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eleanor-antin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","black","brown","muted-blue","ochre","red"],"intro":"Eleanor Antin is an American artist known for her work in performance art, film, and installation art. She explores themes of identity, gender, and history through a variety of mediums, often incorporating elements of narrative and character. Her work is characterized by its conceptual depth and engagement with social and cultural issues.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, editorial photography with carefully staged figures, formal poses, and strong environmental settings. It alternates restrained color with stark monochrome, emphasizing high contrast, generous negative space, vintage clothing, and a slightly uncanny, fashion-focused mood."},{"id":"yuri-shwedoff","name":"Yuri Shwedoff","cat":"various-artists","en":"Yuri Shwedoff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yuri-shwedoff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yuri-shwedoff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","scenes","glow","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["charcoal","pale-blue","grey","black","white","dark-red"],"intro":"Yuri Shwedoff is a contemporary artist known for his evocative and atmospheric digital paintings. His work often explores themes of science fiction and fantasy, characterized by a blend of realism and surrealism. Shwedoff's art frequently depicts solitary figures in vast, desolate landscapes, creating a sense of isolation and introspection.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic imagery with subdued blue-gray tones, heavy atmosphere, and carefully controlled pools of warm light. Vast negative space, fog-softened distance, cliffs, cloaked figures, and isolated portraits create a dark, dreamlike sense of mystery across the scenes."},{"id":"nora-heysen","name":"Nora Heysen","cat":"painters","en":"Nora Heysen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nora-heysen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nora-heysen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","black","muted-blue","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Nora Heysen is an Australian artist known for her still life and portrait paintings. She was the first woman to win the Archibald Prize in 1938 and served as an official war artist during World War II. Her work is characterized by its detailed realism and sensitivity to light and color.","observation":"These scenes use visible, varied brushwork to render recognizable rural landscapes, gardens, trees, and figures with a naturalistic yet expressive softness. Warm earth tones, pale blues, and sunlit highlights unify the compositions, while dense foliage and textured vegetation create a richly painted surface."},{"id":"akira-kurosawa","name":"Akira Kurosawa","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Akira Kurosawa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/akira-kurosawa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/akira-kurosawa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["white","black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Akira Kurosawa was a renowned Japanese filmmaker, widely regarded as one of the most influential directors in the history of cinema. His career spanned over five decades, during which he directed numerous critically acclaimed films, including \" Seven Samurai ,\" \"Rashomon,\" and \"Ikiru.\" Kurosawa's work is celebrated for its innovative storytelling, masterful use of cinematography, and profound exploration of human nature and societal themes.","observation":"A stark monochrome photographic style built around highly realistic, intensely textured warrior portraits and action scenes. Hard contrast, visible grain, shallow focus, smoke, spray, and deep shadows create a gritty cinematic battlefield atmosphere across both intimate close-ups and wider confrontations."},{"id":"wendy-froud","name":"Wendy Froud","cat":"various-artists","en":"Wendy Froud","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wendy-froud.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wendy-froud","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","muted-ochre","silver","grey"],"intro":"Wendy Froud is a renowned artist and sculptor known for her work in fantasy art and puppetry. She has contributed to iconic films like 'The Dark Crystal' and 'Labyrinth,' where her creations brought mythical creatures to life. Her work often features intricate details and a deep connection to folklore and nature.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, sculptural fantasy portraits of fae-like characters, with faces, birds, feathers, roots, and distressed textiles rendered as tangible layered materials. Muted earthy colors, dark backgrounds, intimate framing, and delicate surface strokes create an atmospheric, handcrafted woodland-surreal appearance."},{"id":"daniel-arsham","name":"Daniel Arsham","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Daniel Arsham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daniel-arsham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daniel-arsham","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver","grey"],"intro":"Daniel Arsham is a contemporary American artist known for his work in sculpture, architecture, and performance art. He often explores themes of decay and the passage of time, creating pieces that blend the past with the future. His work frequently involves the use of materials like plaster and crystal, and he is recognized for his innovative approach to art and design.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, monumental white sculptural installations in expansive gallery-like spaces, pairing intricate broken surfaces and fabric folds with deliberately tiny or faceless human figures. Restrained white and gray tones, dramatic scale contrasts, circular relief forms, and large areas of surrounding space create a surreal, solemn, museum-like atmosphere."},{"id":"sandy-welch","name":"Sandy Welch","cat":"painters","en":"Sandy Welch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sandy-welch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sandy-welch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["grey","black","dark-brown","red","vivid-red","violet"],"intro":"Sandy Welch is a renowned British screenwriter known for her adaptations of classic literature for television. Her work often involves intricate character development and rich storytelling.","observation":"Across the sheet, recognizable portraits, figures, and flowers are built from energetic, visibly layered paint with abundant texture and loose linear marks. Saturated coral, pink, turquoise, violet, and orange hues create an expressive, dreamlike style in which realistic facial features coexist with abstracted backgrounds and decorative floral forms."},{"id":"kaws","name":"KAWS","cat":"designers","en":"KAWS","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kaws.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kaws","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["brown","pale-magenta","grey","deep-red","pink","orange"],"intro":"KAWS is a contemporary artist known for his work in street art, sculpture, and design. His real-life counterpart, Brian Donnelly, has gained international recognition for his unique style that blends pop culture and fine art. KAWS's work often features reimagined cartoon characters and is characterized by bold colors and playful themes. His art crosses the boundaries between commercial and fine art, making it accessible to a wide audience.","observation":"The style presents oversized, rounded humanoid sculptures with simplified geometric anatomy, heavy black facial marks, and a highly polished, dimensional surface. Across the renders they appear as realistic gallery or studio installations, while one brightly colored furry variation adds surreal, playful contrast without changing the monumental sculptural character."},{"id":"aaron-jasinski","name":"Aaron Jasinski","cat":"painters","en":"Aaron Jasinski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aaron-jasinski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aaron-jasinski","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","dark-brown","yellow","red","ochre"],"intro":"Aaron Jasinski is an American artist known for his whimsical and imaginative paintings that often blend elements of pop culture with surreal and fantastical themes. His work is characterized by vibrant colors, playful compositions, and a unique ability to capture the viewer's imagination through detailed and expressive characters.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, built from broad, visible strokes and energetic swirling marks. Saturated orange, coral, teal, and green dominate, with strong dark-light separation and densely populated scenes combining expressive human characters, animals, costumes, and fantastical details."},{"id":"alexander-rodchenko","name":"Alexander Rodchenko","cat":"various-artists","en":"Alexander Rodchenko","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexander-rodchenko.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexander-rodchenko","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","beige"],"intro":"Alexander Rodchenko was a Russian artist, sculptor, photographer, and graphic designer, known for his pioneering work in the Constructivist movement. His innovative approach to art and design emphasized geometric abstraction and the use of modern materials and techniques. Rodchenko's work often explored themes of industrialization and urbanization, reflecting the dynamic changes in Soviet society during the early 20th century.","observation":"The style combines stark monochrome portrait fragments with angular, layered collage shapes and dramatic cropping. Heavy contrast, visible grain, rough linework, and overlapping photographic and graphic elements create an expressive, surreal editorial image language."},{"id":"mark-waid","name":"Mark Waid","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mark Waid","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-waid.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-waid","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","light-orange","red","charcoal"],"intro":"Mark Waid is a renowned American comic book writer known for his work on titles such as \"The Flash,\" \"Kingdom Come,\" and \"Daredevil.\" His storytelling is celebrated for its depth, character development, and innovative narratives that have significantly influenced the comic book industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense comic-book character imagery with visibly worked paint, broad directional strokes, heavy contouring, and strongly expressive faces and poses. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and oranges are pushed against deep shadows, creating high-energy scenes that feel dramatic, fantastical, and densely packed with action."},{"id":"stephen-quiller","name":"Stephen Quiller","cat":"painters","en":"Stephen Quiller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-quiller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-quiller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-blue","dark-brown","rust","muted-magenta","pale-orange"],"intro":"Stephen Quiller is an American painter known for his innovative use of color and his expertise in water media. He has developed a unique color wheel and is recognized for his ability to capture the essence of landscapes through vibrant and expressive techniques. Quiller's work often explores the interplay of light and color, creating dynamic and engaging compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive mountain and woodland landscapes are built from visible, directional brushwork, angular marks, and richly layered painted surfaces. Saturated orange, coral, blue, violet, and green accents create vivid high contrast, while fine dark lines define trees, branches, grasses, rocks, and reflected water."},{"id":"natalia-drepina","name":"Natalia Drepina","cat":"photographers","en":"Natalia Drepina","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/natalia-drepina.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/natalia-drepina","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","scenes","mist","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","brown","grey"],"intro":"Natalia Drepina is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and dreamlike portraits that often incorporate elements of nature and fantasy. Her work is characterized by a romantic and introspective style, capturing the delicate beauty and mystery of her subjects.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, using subdued, moody color, deep shadows, selective light, and atmospheric backgrounds to create a dreamlike, melancholy mood. Carefully composed portraits and narrative scenes place pale figures, white garments, flowers, water, butterflies, and tangled branches within richly textured natural settings."},{"id":"ilya-mashkov","name":"Ilya Mashkov","cat":"painters","en":"Ilya Mashkov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ilya-mashkov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ilya-mashkov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","dark-red","ochre","red","bone-white","dark-blue"],"intro":"Ilya Mashkov is a renowned Russian painter associated with the Russian avant-garde and post-impressionism movements. Born in 1881, he was a prominent member of the Jack of Diamonds group, known for his bold use of color and expressive brushwork. Mashkov's works often depict vibrant still lifes and landscapes, characterized by their dynamic compositions and rich textures.","observation":"Across the four images, richly visible brushwork combines thick, directional strokes with precise drawn contours and densely layered detail. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and oranges animate portraits, patterned clothing, floral settings, domestic scenes, and architectural backgrounds, giving the style an ornate, expressive character."},{"id":"matthew-barney","name":"Matthew Barney","cat":"various-artists","en":"Matthew Barney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matthew-barney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matthew-barney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["silver","brown","beige","muted-red","rust"],"intro":"Matthew Barney is an American contemporary artist known for his innovative and often provocative multimedia works. His art combines performance, sculpture, and film, exploring themes of mythology, identity, and transformation. Barney's most notable work, the \"Cremaster Cycle,\" is a series of five films that blend surreal imagery with complex narratives.","observation":"The style presents theatrical, surreal characters and monumental sculptural props in expansive studio or gallery interiors. It relies on densely layered textiles, feathers, scraps, and found materials, with subdued natural light and restrained pink, white, gray, and rust tones creating an elaborate, otherworldly atmosphere."},{"id":"john-harris","name":"John Harris","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Harris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-harris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-harris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["blue","dark-blue","charcoal","silver","orange"],"intro":"John Harris is a renowned British artist known for his science fiction book covers and imaginative landscapes. His work often features vast, otherworldly environments that evoke a sense of wonder and exploration. Harris's art is characterized by its epic scale, intricate details, and a unique blend of realism and surrealism.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive frozen landscapes are treated with visible painterly strokes, softened atmospheric haze, and deep blue tonal fields punctuated by orange fire or light. Small solitary figures and monumental vertical forms create a cinematic, dreamlike sense of scale, while mist and strong dark-light contrasts make the scenes feel bleak yet epic."},{"id":"alex-andreev","name":"Alex Andreev","cat":"various-artists","en":"Alex Andreev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-andreev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-andreev","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","sci-fi","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["grey","silver","black","muted-orange","white"],"intro":"Alex Andreev is a contemporary digital artist known for his surreal and imaginative works that often explore themes of science fiction and fantasy. His art is characterized by a unique blend of the familiar and the fantastical, creating immersive worlds that challenge the viewer's perception of reality.","observation":"The style presents cinematic, realistic environments with monumental floating objects and structures dwarfing tiny human figures. Muted, heavy tones, dramatic scale, atmospheric fog, and carefully rendered industrial and rocky textures create a bleak yet dreamlike science-fiction mood."},{"id":"eddie-campbell","name":"Eddie Campbell","cat":"illustrators","en":"Eddie Campbell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eddie-campbell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eddie-campbell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","cream","charcoal","brown","beige","ochre","red"],"intro":"Eddie Campbell is a renowned comic book artist and writer, known for his work on graphic novels such as \"From Hell\" and \"Bacchus.\" His artistic style often blends detailed line work with expressive storytelling, contributing significantly to the graphic novel genre.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and faces are built from vigorous, visible brushwork, rough contour marks, and broad blocks of dark and muted colour. The style combines expressive, semi-realistic portraiture with stark value contrast, heavy clothing silhouettes, and an intentionally raw, sketch-like painted surface."},{"id":"alejandro-burdisio","name":"Alejandro Burdisio","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alejandro Burdisio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alejandro-burdisio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alejandro-burdisio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","urban","motion","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["silver","muted-blue","bone-white","brown","grey","ochre","red"],"intro":"Alejandro Burdisio is an Argentine illustrator known for his imaginative and detailed depictions of futuristic and surreal urban landscapes. His work often combines elements of science fiction with whimsical and playful themes, creating a unique blend of fantasy and reality.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with dense mechanical and architectural detail, using expressive forms and saturated sky blues, rust reds, and warm cloud light. Wide cinematic scenes present fantastical floating cities, vehicles, and travelers with strong depth, motion, and an expansive sense of wonder."},{"id":"tina-barney","name":"Tina Barney","cat":"photographers","en":"Tina Barney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tina-barney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tina-barney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Tina Barney is an American photographer known for her large-scale portraits capturing intimate moments within affluent American and European families. Her work often explores themes of family dynamics and social status, using a documentary style that blends personal and cultural narratives.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and cinematic, presenting carefully posed family groups in richly furnished, traditional interiors. Warm lamp light, deep shadows, subdued earthy colors, patterned upholstery, dark wood, books, and framed paintings create an elegant, densely detailed atmosphere."},{"id":"todd-mcfarlane","name":"Todd McFarlane","cat":"illustrators","en":"Todd McFarlane","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/todd-mcfarlane.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/todd-mcfarlane","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","white","brown","grey","dark-red","muted-brown"],"intro":"Todd McFarlane is a Canadian comic book creator, artist, writer, and entrepreneur, best known for his work on \"The Amazing Spider-Man\" and for creating the character Spawn. He is a prominent figure in the comic book industry, having co-founded Image Comics and revolutionized the way artists are compensated for their work. McFarlane's distinctive style and storytelling have made him a celebrated and influential figure in the world of comics.","observation":"The style combines dense, expressive ink drawing with heavily textured, painterly surfaces and forceful dark-versus-light contrast. Recurring skeletal or masked characters, ragged capes and wings, skulls, monsters, and ruined environments create a bleak, fantastical tableau; the colored variation adds saturated crimson against deep blacks and earthy greens, while the monochrome variants preserve the same stark graphic language."},{"id":"henri-le-sidaner","name":"Henri Le Sidaner","cat":"painters","en":"Henri Le Sidaner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-le-sidaner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-le-sidaner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","urban","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical"],"colours":["charcoal","black","brown","silver","ochre","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Henri Le Sidaner was a French painter known for his post-impressionist style, often associated with the Intimism movement. Born in 1862, he developed a unique approach that focused on capturing the subtle interplay of light and atmosphere in domestic and garden settings. His works are characterized by their serene and contemplative mood, often depicting quiet, intimate scenes of everyday life.","observation":"Across the scenes, densely textured brushwork builds quiet waterside towns, stone buildings, trees, and distant hills with a richly painted surface. Cool blue-green twilight is punctuated by warm window and lantern light, whose reflections stretch across the water beneath soft atmospheric haze."},{"id":"meredith-marsone","name":"Meredith Marsone","cat":"painters","en":"Meredith Marsone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/meredith-marsone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/meredith-marsone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["beige","silver","grey","brown","red"],"intro":"Meredith Marsone is a contemporary artist known for her emotive and detailed portraiture. Her work often explores themes of identity and the human condition, using a painterly approach that combines realism with surreal elements. Marsone's art is characterized by its soft brushwork and delicate layering, creating an ethereal quality that invites introspection.","observation":"Across all four images, tightly cropped faces are rendered with visible brushwork, layered paint, and tactile canvas texture. Muted blue, beige, and coral tones, translucent overlays, fragmented facial planes, and botanical details create an expressive, dreamlike portrait style."},{"id":"george-hoyningen-huene","name":"George Hoyningen-Huene","cat":"photographers","en":"George Hoyningen-Huene","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-hoyningen-huene.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-hoyningen-huene","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["grey","white","beige","charcoal","black","silver"],"intro":"George Hoyningen-Huene was a prominent fashion photographer known for his work in the early to mid-20th century. Born in Russia and later working in Paris and New York, he became a key figure in fashion photography, contributing to magazines like Vogue and Harper's Bazaar. His style was characterized by a sophisticated elegance, often employing dramatic lighting and classical compositions.","observation":"A monochrome fashion-photography style built around hard directional sunlight, deep shadows, and sharply projected architectural patterns. The staged portraits use sculptural interiors, elegant garments, dramatic poses, and cinematic high-contrast framing to create a polished, glamorous atmosphere."},{"id":"finnian-macmanus","name":"Finnian MacManus","cat":"illustrators","en":"Finnian MacManus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/finnian-macmanus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/finnian-macmanus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","bone-white","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Finnian MacManus is a contemporary concept artist known for his work in film and video game design. He has contributed to major projects in the entertainment industry, showcasing his ability to create intricate and imaginative worlds.","observation":"Across all four renders, immense ruined architectural environments are presented with highly detailed, realistic surfaces, monumental arches, carved stone, and deep spatial recession. Cool blue and warm ember-red lighting, glowing fires, misty air, and tiny robed figures create a cinematic, epic atmosphere with strong contrast and ornate sculptural construction."},{"id":"lina-bo-bardi","name":"Lina Bo Bardi","cat":"architects","en":"Lina Bo Bardi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lina-bo-bardi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lina-bo-bardi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","black","deep-red","red","beige","silver"],"intro":"Lina Bo Bardi was a renowned Italian-born Brazilian modernist architect known for her innovative and human-centered designs. Her works are celebrated for their integration with nature, use of local materials, and cultural sensitivity. Some of her most famous projects include the São Paulo Museum of Art and the SESC Pompéia.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed architectural photography with strong geometric framing and sculptural concrete forms. Saturated red surfaces, warm sunlight, and deep shadows create a bold, cinematic atmosphere across galleries, courtyards, and industrial interiors."},{"id":"bruno-munari","name":"Bruno Munari","cat":"designers","en":"Bruno Munari","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruno-munari.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruno-munari","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","vivid-red","orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Bruno Munari was an Italian artist and designer known for his contributions to modernist design and his innovative approach to visual communication. His work spans various disciplines, including painting, sculpture, and industrial design, and he is celebrated for his playful and experimental style that often incorporates elements of Futurism and Constructivism.","observation":"The style combines clean geometric cut-paper forms, flat primary colors, fine ruled lines, and stark black-and-white photographic fragments. Spacious cream grounds and collage-like overlaps unify portraits, abstract faces, circles, triangles, and patterned garments into a playful but sharply graphic visual language."},{"id":"christopher-bucklow","name":"Christopher Bucklow","cat":"various-artists","en":"Christopher Bucklow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christopher-bucklow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christopher-bucklow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","glow","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-red","red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Christopher Bucklow is a contemporary British artist known for his unique approach to photography and art, often exploring themes of light and perception. His work frequently involves innovative techniques that challenge traditional boundaries of visual representation.","observation":"The style presents human busts and profiles formed from dense, sparkling particles against nearly black grounds. Strong blue, red, pink, and orange illumination creates glowing contours and dramatic contrast, while grainy specks and dissolving edges give the portraits a cosmic, surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"mike-peters","name":"Mike Peters","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mike Peters","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-peters.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-peters","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","surreal"],"colours":["black","grey","light-orange","dark-brown","vivid-red","olive"],"intro":"Mike Peters is an American cartoonist known for his work in comic strips and editorial cartoons. He has gained recognition for his distinctive style, which often combines humor with social and political commentary.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses bold black contour lines, clean graphic shapes, and strongly saturated blocks of red, orange, teal, green, and cream. Dense ornamental compositions combine animals, skulls, waves, flames, and foliage with a vintage tattoo-flash sensibility, while repeated motifs and exaggerated forms create a surreal illustrative effect."},{"id":"delphine-diallo","name":"Delphine Diallo","cat":"photographers","en":"Delphine Diallo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/delphine-diallo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/delphine-diallo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-red","brown","deep-red","ochre","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Delphine Diallo is a contemporary French-Senegalese photographer known for her work that explores themes of identity, culture, and empowerment. Her photography often blends elements of surrealism, fantasy, and cultural symbolism, creating a unique visual narrative that celebrates diversity and heritage.","observation":"The style combines highly posed portraiture and fashion with dense botanical and textile ornament, using oversized headpieces, sculptural garments, flowers, butterflies, and patterned backdrops. Saturated reds, ochres, navy, and black are arranged in bold graphic blocks with strong contrast, while the elaborate styling and surreal scale make each composition feel theatrical and dreamlike."},{"id":"charles-rennie-mackintosh","name":"Charles Rennie Mackintosh","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Rennie Mackintosh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-rennie-mackintosh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-rennie-mackintosh","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","drawing","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","muted-brown","dark-violet","red","black"],"intro":"Charles Rennie Mackintosh was a Scottish architect, designer, and artist, renowned for his influence on the Art Nouveau movement and his distinctive style that combined traditional Scottish elements with modernist aesthetics. Born in 1868, Mackintosh became a key figure in the Glasgow School, contributing to architecture, furniture, and interior design with his innovative and elegant designs.","observation":"Across all four renders, botanical forms are arranged as highly decorative plates and dense floral compositions, with elongated stems, repeated motifs, and occasional axial symmetry. Saturated jewel-like petals sit within flat, lightly textured fields, defined by delicate ink contours and intricate ornamental linework."},{"id":"romaine-brooks","name":"Romaine Brooks","cat":"painters","en":"Romaine Brooks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/romaine-brooks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/romaine-brooks","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","bone-white","beige","brown"],"intro":"Romaine Brooks was an American painter known for her distinctive portraits and use of muted color palettes. Born in 1874, she spent much of her life in Europe, particularly in Paris and Italy, where she became part of the bohemian and artistic circles of the early 20th century. Her work often explored themes of identity and gender, with a focus on androgynous figures and aristocratic settings.","observation":"The style uses subdued, moody oil-paint surfaces with visible fine brushwork, softly blended modeling, and richly textured dark fabrics. Across the portraits, restrained formal poses, pale faces, black clothing, hats, and muted architectural backgrounds create a somber classical atmosphere."},{"id":"atelier-olschinsky","name":"Atelier Olschinsky","cat":"illustrators","en":"Atelier Olschinsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/atelier-olschinsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/atelier-olschinsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","geometric"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","dark-green","light-yellow","red"],"intro":"Atelier Olschinsky is a creative studio based in Vienna, Austria, known for its innovative design and illustration work. Founded by Peter Olschinsky and Verena Weiss, the studio specializes in a variety of visual disciplines, including graphic design, illustration, and photography. Their work often explores the intersection of art and technology, resulting in visually striking and conceptually rich creations.","observation":"Across all four renders, architectural forms dissolve into dense, abstract urban structures through aggressive vertical smearing, fractured geometry, and layered block-like marks. The palette is dark and moody with strong teal, rust, coral, and cream contrasts, while broad gestural strokes and digital-looking distortions create a restless, kinetic surface."},{"id":"matthaus-merian-the-elder","name":"Matthaus Merian the Elder","cat":"illustrators","en":"Matthaus Merian the Elder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matthaus-merian-the-elder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matthaus-merian-the-elder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","vivid-colors","classical","drawing"],"colours":["pale-yellow","brown","muted-ochre","beige","rust","deep-rust"],"intro":"Matthaus Merian the Elder was a Swiss-born engraver and publisher known for his detailed and precise engravings and etchings during the 17th century. He is celebrated for his topographical works and maps, as well as his contributions to the field of natural history illustration, particularly through his depictions of flora and fauna.","observation":"The style combines densely detailed natural-history imagery with fine engraved linework, crosshatching, and hand-colored illustrative forms. Exotic animals, birds, insects, flowers, and tropical plants are arranged as ornamental vignettes against a warm cream ground, producing a vivid yet archival decorative effect."},{"id":"dolce-gabbana","name":"Dolce Gabbana","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Dolce Gabbana","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dolce-gabbana.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dolce-gabbana","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-brown","muted-orange","white","vivid-red"],"intro":"Dolce Gabbana is a renowned Italian luxury fashion house founded in 1985 by designers Domenico Dolce and Stefano Gabbana. Known for its bold and glamorous designs, the brand has become synonymous with Italian elegance and opulence, often drawing inspiration from Mediterranean culture and traditional Italian motifs.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, ornate couture with saturated reds, greens, golds, and jewel tones, presenting models in dramatic runway and close-up portrait compositions. Rich floral embroidery, brocade, lace, crowns, and oversized jewelry dominate the imagery, while strong directional lighting, selective focus, and polished realism give it a luxurious editorial finish."},{"id":"charley-toorop","name":"Charley Toorop","cat":"painters","en":"Charley Toorop","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charley-toorop.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charley-toorop","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","rust","orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Charley Toorop is a Dutch painter known for her intense and expressive portraits, often capturing the psychological depth and emotional intensity of her subjects. Her work is characterized by a modernist approach, with a focus on realism and expressionism, reflecting the social and cultural milieu of early 20th-century Europe.","observation":"The style presents tightly packed, cropped portraits with exaggerated facial features, intense gazes, and overlapping compositions. Visible directional brushwork builds the hair, skin, and clothing, while earthy muted colors, deep shadows, and sharp highlights create a dramatic, expressive painted surface."},{"id":"oleg-shuplyak","name":"Oleg Shuplyak","cat":"painters","en":"Oleg Shuplyak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oleg-shuplyak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oleg-shuplyak","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","dark-ochre","muted-green","ochre","muted-yellow","dark-rust"],"intro":"Oleg Shuplyak is a Ukrainian artist known for his unique optical illusion paintings that cleverly blend portraits with landscapes. His works often incorporate hidden images, creating a dual visual experience that challenges the viewer's perception. Shuplyak's art is celebrated for its imaginative and playful approach, drawing inspiration from classical techniques and surrealism.","observation":"These images use richly built-up, visible brushwork with dense, fine surface detail and strongly expressive faces and gestures. Human figures merge with foliage, hair, water, and animals in swirling, dreamlike compositions, combining earthy shadows with saturated orange, teal, green, and cream hues."},{"id":"michael-kaluta","name":"Michael Kaluta","cat":"illustrators","en":"Michael Kaluta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-kaluta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-kaluta","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["muted-ochre","brown","bone-white","muted-blue","black","red"],"intro":"Michael Kaluta is an American artist known for his work in comic books and fantasy illustration. He gained prominence in the 1970s for his distinctive style that combines intricate linework and detailed compositions. Kaluta's work often features themes of fantasy, mythology, and adventure, making him a revered figure in the world of illustrative art.","observation":"The style is densely illustrative, built from exceptionally fine ink-like outlines, intricate surface detail, and layered ornamental costumes, creatures, architecture, and jewelry. Saturated reds, blues, violets, and ochres alternate with deep shadows, giving the crowded fantasy tableaux a dramatic, expressive intensity."},{"id":"katharina-grosse","name":"Katharina Grosse","cat":"various-artists","en":"Katharina Grosse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/katharina-grosse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/katharina-grosse","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["red","beige","charcoal","dark-red","silver"],"intro":"Katharina Grosse is a renowned German artist known for her large-scale, site-specific installations that transform spaces with vibrant color and dynamic forms. Her work often involves the use of spray paint to create immersive environments that challenge perceptions of space and color.","observation":"Across all four views, expansive industrial interiors are transformed by vivid draped fabrics and paint-like color fields. Broad, directional strokes, smeared floors, strong daylight, and exaggerated flowing forms create an energetic, surreal installation-like atmosphere."},{"id":"angelica-kauffman","name":"Angelica Kauffman","cat":"painters","en":"Angelica Kauffman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/angelica-kauffman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/angelica-kauffman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Angelica Kauffman was an 18th-century Swiss Neoclassical painter known for her history paintings and portraits. She was one of the founding members of the Royal Academy in London and gained significant recognition for her work, which often depicted mythological and allegorical subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modeled oil-paint surfaces, visible yet refined brushwork, and softly blended skin and fabric. Warm earth tones, dark grounds, and selective highlights create an expressive, dramatic atmosphere, while idealized figures, flowing drapery, and occasional landscape settings evoke classical painted tableaux."},{"id":"gio-ponti","name":"Gio Ponti","cat":"designers","en":"Gio Ponti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gio-ponti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gio-ponti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["silver","muted-orange","brown","grey","dark-cyan","rust"],"intro":"Gio Ponti was an influential Italian architect, industrial designer, furniture designer, artist, and publisher. He played a significant role in shaping 20th-century Italian design and architecture, known for his innovative approach and integration of art and functionality. Ponti's work spanned various fields, including designing buildings, furniture, and household items, and he was a key figure in the modernist movement.","observation":"The style presents highly crafted furniture as realistic studio product imagery, combining sculptural mid-century silhouettes with bold geometric color blocking and richly varied wood, veneer, and metallic surfaces. Repeated angular inlays, tapered legs, brass details, and restrained interiors create a cohesive decorative vocabulary across the four renders."},{"id":"frederic-remington","name":"Frederic Remington","cat":"painters","en":"Frederic Remington","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederic-remington.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederic-remington","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","muted-ochre","black","orange"],"intro":"Frederic Remington was an American painter, illustrator, sculptor, and writer known for his depictions of the American Old West. His work often featured cowboys, Native Americans, and the U.S. Cavalry, capturing the rugged and adventurous spirit of the frontier. Remington's art is celebrated for its dynamic compositions and realistic portrayals of Western life.","observation":"Across all four renders, riders and horses are described with vigorous, visibly broad paint strokes, rough edges, and strongly modelled forms. The restrained earth-and-sand palette, deep horse and clothing shadows, and energetic movement give the scenes a dramatic, epic presence."},{"id":"ben-goossens","name":"Ben Goossens","cat":"photographers","en":"Ben Goossens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ben-goossens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ben-goossens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","ochre","silver","black"],"intro":"Ben Goossens is a Belgian photographer known for his surreal and imaginative photo manipulations. His work often explores dreamlike and fantastical themes, drawing inspiration from surrealist art and psychological concepts. Goossens's photography is characterized by its meticulous attention to detail and the creation of otherworldly scenes that challenge the viewer's perception of reality.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic imagery with restrained earthy-blue tones, dramatic cloud formations, and expansive horizons that dwarf isolated human figures. Carefully balanced compositions, surreal impossible objects, and generous negative space create a quiet, uncanny dreamlike atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"aaron-blaise","name":"Aaron Blaise","cat":"painters","en":"Aaron Blaise","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aaron-blaise.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aaron-blaise","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","ochre","muted-brown","light-orange"],"intro":"Aaron Blaise is an acclaimed animator and artist known for his work on several major animated films.","observation":"Across all four renders, animals are portrayed with visible, broad, directional brushwork and richly modelled fur, giving the images a vigorous hand-painted surface. Warm earth tones, deep shadows, bright fur highlights, and rugged rocky settings create a dramatic, dark wildlife-fantasy mood with strongly expressive faces and poses."},{"id":"bill-gekas","name":"Bill Gekas","cat":"photographers","en":"Bill Gekas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-gekas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-gekas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","deep-rust","bone-white"],"intro":"Bill Gekas is an acclaimed Australian photographer known for his fine art portraiture, often drawing inspiration from classical paintings. His work is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail, capturing the essence of his subjects with a timeless quality.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic portraits and small narrative scenes with children in rustic, historically styled clothing. Warm brown and ochre tones, subdued light, tactile fabric and wood textures, shallow focus, and carefully arranged props create a dark, nostalgic atmosphere across all four renders."},{"id":"megan-massacre","name":"Megan Massacre","cat":"various-artists","en":"Megan Massacre","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/megan-massacre.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/megan-massacre","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","floral","portraits","bold-lines","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","black","dark-brown","silver","grey"],"intro":"Megan Massacre is a renowned tattoo artist and television personality known for her vibrant and intricate tattoo designs. She gained fame through her appearances on reality TV shows focused on tattoo artistry, where her unique style and personality captivated audiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses crisp, heavy black contouring with controlled interior linework and largely flat, saturated fills. It combines highly detailed female faces, skulls, roses, and botanical forms into dense ornamental tattoo compositions, with strong reds, pinks, blues, and dark shading."},{"id":"angus-mcbean","name":"Angus McBean","cat":"photographers","en":"Angus McBean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/angus-mcbean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/angus-mcbean","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","beige","silver"],"intro":"Angus McBean is a renowned Welsh photographer known for his innovative and surreal portrait photography, particularly in the mid-20th century. His work often featured theatrical and dreamlike elements, blending fantasy with reality. McBean was celebrated for his portraits of celebrities and his unique approach to composition and lighting.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome, high-contrast portrait photography with dramatic close framing and deep shadows. Elaborate veils, masks, patterned fabrics, and animal motifs create a dark theatrical mood, while realistic facial detail and selective background softness give the images a cinematic presence."},{"id":"marcel-janco","name":"Marcel Janco","cat":"various-artists","en":"Marcel Janco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marcel-janco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marcel-janco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","patterns","bold-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["muted-ochre","dark-brown","muted-orange","black","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Marcel Janco was a Romanian and Israeli visual artist, architect, and art theorist, known for his significant contributions to the Dada movement. Born in 1895, he was a founding member of the Dada group in Zurich and later became a prominent figure in the development of modern art in Israel. Janco's work is characterized by its innovative use of collage, abstraction, and a distinctive geometric style that often explored themes of identity and emotion.","observation":"The style combines rough, visibly worked paint with angular, abstracted figures and heavily simplified facial features. Across the paintings and sculptures, subdued earthy colors, bold geometric forms, carved or built-up surfaces, and recurring graphic patterns create a primitive, museum-like sculptural language."},{"id":"victor-horta","name":"Victor Horta","cat":"architects","en":"Victor Horta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/victor-horta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/victor-horta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","silver","ochre","brown"],"intro":"Victor Horta is considered one of the pioneers of the Art Nouveau movement, known for his innovative architectural designs that harmoniously blend structure and decoration. Born in Belgium, Horta's work is characterized by the use of organic forms, intricate ironwork, and a seamless integration of art and architecture. His buildings, such as the Hôtel Tassel in Brussels, are celebrated for their flowing lines and ornamental details.","observation":"Across all four renders, the interiors are densely ornamented and highly dimensional, with sweeping organic curves, carved wood, elaborate railings, stained glass, and warm interior illumination. The subdued brown-and-amber palette, candlelike glow, and subtly distorted architecture create an uncanny, dreamlike grandeur."},{"id":"jimmy-chin","name":"Jimmy Chin","cat":"photographers","en":"Jimmy Chin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jimmy-chin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jimmy-chin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","motion","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","epic"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Jimmy Chin is a renowned American photographer, filmmaker, and professional climber known for his work in capturing the beauty and challenges of extreme environments. His photography often features breathtaking landscapes and daring feats of human endurance, particularly in the realms of climbing and mountaineering. Chin's work has been featured in numerous publications and films, showcasing his ability to blend artistic vision with technical expertise in challenging conditions.","observation":"The style presents immense alpine landscapes with highly realistic, sharply resolved rock, snow, ice, and climbing equipment. Dramatic aerial viewpoints, strong light-dark separation, cloud-filled depths, and tiny climbers create a cinematic, kinetic sense of danger and epic scale."},{"id":"nicolas-de-stael","name":"Nicolas de Stael","cat":"painters","en":"Nicolas de Stael","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicolas-de-stael.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicolas-de-stael","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["blue","muted-blue","bone-white","silver","red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Nicolas de Stael was a French painter known for his abstract landscapes and use of thick impasto. Born in 1914 in Saint Petersburg, Russia, he became a prominent figure in post-war European art. His work is characterized by bold color contrasts and a unique approach to abstraction, often blending elements of landscape with non-representational forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses abstract geometric blocks and bands rendered with visible, tactile paint buildup. Cool blues dominate, punctuated by vivid red, coral, white, and black accents, while scraped edges, palette-knife textures, and irregular overlaps keep the composition expressive rather than mechanically flat."},{"id":"yoann-lossel","name":"Yoann Lossel","cat":"painters","en":"Yoann Lossel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yoann-lossel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yoann-lossel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Yoann Lossel is a contemporary French artist known for his intricate and ethereal works that often incorporate elements of mythology and fantasy. His art is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail and a distinctive use of gold leaf, creating a luminous and otherworldly quality.","observation":"Across all four renders, shadowed figures and faces emerge from heavily worked, visibly textured paint, with broad gestural strokes, splatters, scraping, and layered marks. A restrained charcoal, brown, gray, and antique-gold palette creates a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while ornate costume details and surreal fantasy imagery give the portraits a ritualistic, otherworldly presence."},{"id":"rem-koolhaas","name":"Rem Koolhaas","cat":"architects","en":"Rem Koolhaas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rem-koolhaas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rem-koolhaas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-orange","muted-green","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Rem Koolhaas is a renowned Dutch architect and urbanist, known for his innovative and often unconventional approach to architecture. He is the founder of the Office for Metropolitan Architecture (OMA) and has been influential in shaping modern urban landscapes with projects like the Seattle Central Library and the CCTV Headquarters in Beijing.","observation":"The style combines monumental urban architecture with sharply geometric framing, dramatic perspective, and tiny human figures that emphasize scale. Saturated red, teal, blue, and amber accents, strong light-dark separation, reflective surfaces, and layered or fractured viewpoints create a cinematic yet surreal architectural atmosphere."},{"id":"tony-moore","name":"Tony Moore","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tony Moore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tony-moore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tony-moore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Tony Moore is an American comic book artist known for his work on popular series such as 'The Walking Dead' and 'Fear Agent.' His style is characterized by detailed linework and a strong sense of narrative, often blending horror and science fiction elements.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, expressive character portraiture with fine drawn lines, richly textured surfaces, and layered surreal fantasy settings. It shifts between stark monochrome and warm, cool-toned color treatments while preserving dramatic faces, eccentric costumes, and dense visual storytelling."},{"id":"mr-brainwash","name":"Mr. Brainwash","cat":"street-artists","en":"Mr. Brainwash","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mr-brainwash.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mr-brainwash","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","black","red","orange","muted-blue","olive"],"intro":"Mr. Brainwash is a pseudonym for a French street artist known for his vibrant and eclectic style that blends elements of pop art and street art. He gained fame through his appearances in the documentary \"Exit Through the Gift Shop\" and is recognized for his use of iconic imagery and cultural references.","observation":"The style combines dense, visibly built-up paint surfaces with graphic portraiture, bold outlines, flat color blocks, ink-like marks, and collage-like layering. Saturated pinks, blues, reds, yellows, and greens collide with stark black-and-white passages, while drips, splatters, graffiti gestures, and repeated pop-cultural figures create an energetic, expressive surface."},{"id":"milton-glaser","name":"Milton Glaser","cat":"designers","en":"Milton Glaser","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/milton-glaser.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/milton-glaser","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","retro"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","dark-blue","pale-yellow","light-orange","olive"],"intro":"Milton Glaser is a renowned American graphic designer, best known for his iconic \"I ❤ NY\" logo and his influential work in the field of graphic design. Born in 1929, Glaser co-founded the New York Magazine and Push Pin Studios, leaving a lasting impact on visual communication and design aesthetics. His work is characterized by bold colors, playful forms, and a deep understanding of visual storytelling.","observation":"The style uses bold, flat graphic shapes and intensely saturated color bands to construct repeated side-profile portraits. Black silhouettes, clean contour lines, and slightly distressed print texture create a high-contrast retro poster appearance, while the exaggerated flowing hair makes the imagery surreal and ornamental."},{"id":"fabio-hurtado","name":"Fabio Hurtado","cat":"painters","en":"Fabio Hurtado","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fabio-hurtado.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fabio-hurtado","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-orange","muted-ochre","black","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Fabio Hurtado is a contemporary Spanish painter known for his distinctive style that blends elements of surrealism and realism. His work often features elongated figures and serene landscapes, capturing intimate and introspective moments with a nostalgic touch.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines elongated, sculptural faces and simplified geometric features with finely rendered, tactile paint texture. Restrained cream, rust, black, and muted blue tones are punctuated by red accents, while elaborate hats, collars, and patterned fabrics create a decorative fashion-portrait vocabulary."},{"id":"esao-andrews","name":"Esao Andrews","cat":"painters","en":"Esao Andrews","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/esao-andrews.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/esao-andrews","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-teal","black","dark-brown","beige","rust","white"],"intro":"Esao Andrews is an American painter known for his surreal and often darkly whimsical artworks. His paintings frequently explore themes of fantasy, nature, and the uncanny, often featuring anthropomorphic figures and dreamlike landscapes. Andrews's work is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail and a narrative quality that invites viewers into his imaginative worlds.","observation":"Across all four images, richly visible brushwork builds dramatic figures, animals, foliage, and swirling atmospheric backgrounds, with a dense yet cohesive painted surface. Saturated reds and oranges stand against deep teal and blue-green grounds, while high contrast, expressive gestures, and fantastical situations give the style a darkly theatrical quality."},{"id":"joe-heller","name":"Joe Heller","cat":"illustrators","en":"Joe Heller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joe-heller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joe-heller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","vivid-colors","comics","ink","funny"],"colours":["white","silver","grey","brown","orange","charcoal","vivid-red"],"intro":"Joe Heller is an illustrator known for his whimsical and detailed artwork, often featuring fantastical themes and characters. His work is characterized by a playful and imaginative style that draws from elements of folklore and mythology.","observation":"The style combines finely hatched ink drawing with loose watercolor washes, leaving substantial white paper visible around expressive figures. Exaggerated anatomy, caricatured faces, eccentric creatures, and energetic group interactions give the illustrations a humorous, theatrical comic character."},{"id":"robert-polidori","name":"Robert Polidori","cat":"photographers","en":"Robert Polidori","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-polidori.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-polidori","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","scenes","urban","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","dark-green","grey","black","deep-red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Robert Polidori is a renowned Canadian-American photographer known for his large-scale color photographs of human habitats and environments. His work often explores themes of decay, history, and the passage of time, capturing the essence of spaces that have been transformed by human activity and natural forces.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents richly detailed, photorealistic interiors of a decaying grand residence, combining ornate architectural decoration with peeling surfaces, antique furnishings, and dramatic colored rooms. The subdued, heavy atmosphere and cinematic framing are repeatedly disrupted by surreal birds inhabiting the abandoned spaces."},{"id":"declan-shalvey","name":"Declan Shalvey","cat":"illustrators","en":"Declan Shalvey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/declan-shalvey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/declan-shalvey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","red","light-orange","charcoal","deep-red"],"intro":"Declan Shalvey is an acclaimed Irish comic book artist and writer known for his work on titles such as \"Moon Knight,\" \"Injection,\" and \"Deadpool.\" His distinctive style often combines bold line work with dynamic compositions, contributing to the narrative depth and visual impact of his stories.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses graphic illustration with crisp fine linework, dense textural marks, and stark black silhouettes against saturated coral, blue, and white fields. Monumental landscapes, tiny isolated figures, and strong geometric structures create a dramatic, ominous sense of scale and motion."},{"id":"drew-brophy","name":"Drew Brophy","cat":"illustrators","en":"Drew Brophy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/drew-brophy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/drew-brophy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-blue","green","red","dark-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Drew Brophy is an American artist known for his vibrant surf-inspired art and pioneering techniques in surfboard painting. His work often features bold colors and dynamic compositions, capturing the essence of ocean life and surf culture. Brophy has been influential in the world of surf art, blending traditional painting methods with modern styles to create unique, eye-catching pieces.","observation":"Across all four images, dense visible brushwork builds richly layered fantasy environments with saturated tropical colors, strong dark-light contrasts, and flowing contours. Dramatic flames, glowing windows, sunsets, and crashing water give the scenes energetic movement and an epic, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"olivier-theyskens","name":"Olivier Theyskens","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Olivier Theyskens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olivier-theyskens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olivier-theyskens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Olivier Theyskens is a renowned Belgian fashion designer known for his gothic and romantic aesthetic. He has worked with several high-profile fashion houses and is celebrated for his innovative designs that blend historical references with modern sensibilities.","observation":"The style presents fashion-editorial portraits in a realistic, cinematic manner, centered on elongated figures wearing sculptural, heavily layered gowns with sheer and distressed-looking textiles. Across the renders, subdued gray, black, and pale tones, selective focus, soft architectural light, and flowing fabric create a dark, dreamy atmosphere with a sense of movement."},{"id":"erich-hartmann","name":"Erich Hartmann","cat":"photographers","en":"Erich Hartmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erich-hartmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erich-hartmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","bone-white","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Erich Hartmann is a renowned photographer known for his work with Magnum Photos. Born in Germany, he gained recognition for his poignant black and white images that often explored themes of human experience and existentialism. His work is characterized by a deep understanding of light and shadow, capturing moments that are both intimate and universal.","observation":"The style combines visible, energetic brushwork with dense descriptive detail and strongly staged narrative compositions. Restrained earthy color, deep shadows, and dramatic light create a moody, cinematic atmosphere, while recurring isolated figures and impossible suspended events lend the scenes a surreal, expressive quality."},{"id":"jimmy-nelson","name":"Jimmy Nelson","cat":"photographers","en":"Jimmy Nelson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jimmy-nelson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jimmy-nelson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","subdued-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Jimmy Nelson is a renowned British photographer known for his work documenting indigenous cultures around the world. His photography captures the beauty and diversity of tribal communities, often highlighting their traditional attire and rituals. Nelson's work is celebrated for its vivid detail and respectful portrayal of cultural identities.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and richly detailed, presenting tightly framed character portraits with expressive faces, layered fur clothing, elaborate beadwork, and animal companions. Subdued earthy colors, dramatic directional light, and cold mountainous settings create a dark, epic, cinematic atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"maxime-maufra","name":"Maxime Maufra","cat":"painters","en":"Maxime Maufra","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maxime-maufra.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maxime-maufra","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-olive","silver","grey","charcoal","ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Maxime Maufra is a French painter known for his impressionistic landscapes and marine scenes. Born in 1861, Maufra was associated with the post-impressionist movement and often depicted the rugged coastlines and rural settings of Brittany, France. His work is characterized by vivid colors, expressive brushwork, and a keen observation of natural light and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses richly visible, directional brushwork to build bright coastal and rural landscapes, with textured vegetation, clouds, water, and architecture. The scenes are representational yet expressive, combining finely observed detail with saturated greens, blues, reds, and ochres and a traditional landscape-painting sensibility."},{"id":"raymond-swanland","name":"Raymond Swanland","cat":"illustrators","en":"Raymond Swanland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raymond-swanland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raymond-swanland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","brown","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Raymond Swanland is an American illustrator known for his work in the fantasy and science fiction genres. His art is characterized by dynamic compositions, vivid colors, and intricate details, often depicting epic scenes and mythical characters. Swanland has contributed to book covers, video games, and other media, establishing a distinctive style that blends realism with fantastical elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vigorous, visible broad brushstrokes to build highly detailed fantasy characters and turbulent environments. Dark earthy hues are punctuated by intense red-orange fire and energy, with strong contrast, internal glows, and dynamic sweeping forms creating an expressive battle-scene atmosphere."},{"id":"morag-myerscough","name":"Morag Myerscough","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Morag Myerscough","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/morag-myerscough.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/morag-myerscough","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","urban","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["beige","dark-olive","red","dark-red","ochre","blue","green"],"intro":"Morag Myerscough is a renowned British designer and artist known for her bold and colorful installations. Her work often transforms public spaces with vibrant patterns and geometric designs, creating immersive environments that engage communities and celebrate urban culture. Myerscough's distinctive style combines elements of architecture, graphic design, and art to produce dynamic and interactive experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is defined by intensely saturated color blocking, bold geometric patterns, and repeated stripes, checks, spots, and irregular graphic motifs. Architectural interiors, outdoor structures, furniture, and sculptural objects are transformed into dense, playful, highly dimensional installations with clean illustrative surfaces and surreal oversized forms."},{"id":"alex-gross","name":"Alex Gross","cat":"painters","en":"Alex Gross","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-gross.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-gross","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","patterns","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","black","muted-red","blue","dark-red","vivid-red","olive"],"intro":"Alex Gross is a contemporary American artist known for his pop surrealist paintings that often explore themes of consumerism, globalization, and the human condition. His work is characterized by a blend of vintage aesthetics and modern commentary, often featuring figures from popular culture and historical references.","observation":"This style combines highly rendered, painterly portraiture with saturated reds, blues, pinks, and greens and strongly separated light and dark values. Crowded groups and tightly cropped individual faces are unified by graphic repeating motifs, patterned clothing, exaggerated makeup, and expressive direct gazes."},{"id":"prudence-heward","name":"Prudence Heward","cat":"painters","en":"Prudence Heward","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/prudence-heward.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/prudence-heward","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","landscapes","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","orange","dark-brown","bone-white","muted-blue","vivid-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Prudence Heward was a Canadian painter known for her powerful and emotive portraits, particularly of women. Born in 1896, she was a prominent figure in the Canadian art scene during the early 20th century, associated with the Beaver Hall Group. Heward's work is celebrated for its bold use of color and strong, expressive depictions of her subjects, often exploring themes of identity and femininity.","observation":"Across the portraits and landscapes, visible oil-paint texture combines with angular forms, strong contouring, and expressive, simplified facial planes. The palette is earthy and restrained but punctuated by saturated reds, while deep shadows and bright flesh tones create a forceful, high-contrast appearance."},{"id":"tamas-dezso","name":"Tamas Dezso","cat":"photographers","en":"Tamas Dezso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tamas-dezso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tamas-dezso","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["silver","grey","brown","beige","charcoal"],"intro":"Tamas Dezso is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative and atmospheric images that often explore themes of decay and transition in post-communist Eastern Europe. His work captures the haunting beauty of abandoned spaces and the resilience of nature reclaiming urban environments.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic compositions set in bleak winter landscapes, with subdued natural light, muted earthy colors, and persistent atmospheric mist. Weathered buildings, sparse vegetation, isolated people, and animals are arranged as uncanny narrative tableaux, giving the scenes a dark, dreamlike and monumental character."},{"id":"amy-earles","name":"Amy Earles","cat":"illustrators","en":"Amy Earles","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amy-earles.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amy-earles","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","pale-orange","muted-ochre","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Amy Earles is an artist known for her intricate and whimsical illustrations that often explore themes of fantasy and the surreal. Her work is characterized by a blend of gothic and fairy tale elements, creating a unique and enchanting visual style.","observation":"Across all four images, finely rendered figures and animals occupy richly patterned woodland scenes, with visible brush texture, delicate linework, and ornamental clothing and foliage. The restrained beige, charcoal, cream, and red palette creates strong dark-light separation and a consistently shadowed, gothic mood."},{"id":"vilhelm-hammershoi","name":"Vilhelm Hammershoi","cat":"painters","en":"Vilhelm Hammershoi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vilhelm-hammershoi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vilhelm-hammershoi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Vilhelm Hammershoi was a Danish painter known for his poetic and subdued interior scenes, often featuring solitary figures. His work is characterized by a limited color palette, careful attention to light and shadow, and a sense of quiet introspection. Hammershoi's paintings often depict sparse, elegantly simple rooms, capturing a unique atmosphere of calm and contemplation.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses softly visible paint texture and fine, layered brushwork to depict quiet interior scenes with solitary figures and carefully arranged furniture. Muted brown, charcoal, and grey tones are shaped by strong window light, deep shadows, and long shafts of illumination, creating a restrained, melancholic cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"iryna-yermolova","name":"Iryna Yermolova","cat":"painters","en":"Iryna Yermolova","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/iryna-yermolova.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/iryna-yermolova","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","brown","dark-brown","bone-white","muted-blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Iryna Yermolova is a contemporary artist known for her expressive and bold portraiture. Her work often features vivid colors and dynamic compositions, capturing the essence of her subjects with a modern twist.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and social moments dissolve into vigorous, visible paint handling, with broad and finer strokes building faces, clothing, props, and fragmented surroundings. Saturated coral, orange, turquoise, violet, and green accents stand against deep shadows, while angular planes and scraped-looking marks create an energetic, expressive surface."},{"id":"alain-laboile","name":"Alain Laboile","cat":"photographers","en":"Alain Laboile","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alain-laboile.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alain-laboile","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Alain Laboile is a French photographer known for his intimate and evocative black and white images that capture the essence of childhood and family life. His work often focuses on his own family, exploring themes of innocence, freedom, and the simple joys of rural living.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome, realistic and filmic, with strong light-dark separation, natural sunlight and selective background blur. Candid child-centered compositions combine intimate portrait framing with kinetic movement, windswept hair, animals and sharply cast shadows."},{"id":"jim-henson","name":"Jim Henson","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Jim Henson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-henson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-henson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","funny"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","brown","red","orange"],"intro":"Jim Henson was an American puppeteer, animator, and filmmaker, best known for creating the Muppets. His innovative work in puppetry and television brought beloved characters like Kermit the Frog and Miss Piggy to life, influencing generations of children's entertainment. Henson's creative vision extended to films, television, and beyond, leaving a lasting impact on popular culture.","observation":"The style combines richly visible, broad painterly strokes with dense fur, feathers, fabric, and facial detail, giving the puppet-like characters a tactile handcrafted presence. Saturated reds, oranges, greens, and blues stand out against dark backgrounds, while exaggerated eyes and expressive poses create a humorous fantasy character-portrait effect."},{"id":"grant-morrison","name":"Grant Morrison","cat":"illustrators","en":"Grant Morrison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/grant-morrison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/grant-morrison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","fantasy","ink"],"colours":["black","grey","bone-white","rust","dark-brown","dark-magenta"],"intro":"Grant Morrison is a renowned Scottish comic book writer known for his innovative and often surreal storytelling. His work spans various genres, including superhero comics, where he has contributed to iconic series such as 'Batman' and 'The Invisibles.' Morrison is celebrated for his complex narratives and exploration of themes like identity and reality.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed comic-book character imagery with expressive faces, heavy ink contours, dense crosshatched shading, and strongly graphic color blocks. Deep blacks and saturated orange, teal, purple, and red create a high-contrast occult-fantasy mood, while repeated supernatural figures and symbolic motifs give the compositions a surreal, poster-like intensity."},{"id":"cimabue","name":"Cimabue","cat":"painters","en":"Cimabue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cimabue.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cimabue","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","religious","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","orange","black","rust","deep-blue"],"intro":"Cimabue was an Italian painter and mosaicist from Florence, regarded as one of the pioneers of the Italian Renaissance. Active during the late 13th century, Cimabue is known for his contributions to the development of a more naturalistic style, moving away from the Byzantine tradition. His works often feature religious themes and are characterized by their solemnity and spiritual depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces emerge from heavily worked, aged-looking painted surfaces, with visible brush direction, craquelure, layered pigment, and metallic-looking gold decoration. The subdued earth tones, deep shadows, solemn expressions, halos, and ornamental fragments create a devotional portrait style with strong material texture and sculptural modelling."},{"id":"erwin-wurm","name":"Erwin Wurm","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Erwin Wurm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erwin-wurm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erwin-wurm","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["beige","silver","brown","pale-orange","dark-brown","muted-blue"],"intro":"Erwin Wurm is an Austrian artist known for his unique approach to sculpture and installation art. His work often explores themes of the human condition, identity, and consumer culture, using humor and absurdity to challenge conventional perceptions of art. Wurm's sculptures frequently involve everyday objects and human figures in exaggerated or distorted forms, creating a playful yet thought-provoking experience for the viewer.","observation":"Across all four renders, carefully staged figures sit or stand in a sparse contemporary gallery, their faces concealed by oversized fabric, wooden, or sack-like forms. The realistic photographic treatment uses subdued earthy and blue tones, crisp geometric furniture, soft directional light, and long shadows, giving the fashion-focused scenes a surreal, anonymous quality."},{"id":"kazuki-takamatsu","name":"Kazuki Takamatsu","cat":"painters","en":"Kazuki Takamatsu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kazuki-takamatsu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kazuki-takamatsu","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","silhouette"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","silver","dark-blue","white"],"intro":"Kazuki Takamatsu is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his unique blend of traditional and digital techniques. His work often explores themes of innocence and melancholy, utilizing a distinctive monochrome palette to create ethereal and dreamlike compositions. Takamatsu's art is characterized by its intricate layering and depth, achieved through a combination of hand-painted and digital methods.","observation":"The style centers on softly blurred, high-contrast photographic silhouettes and intimate human gestures, frequently framed in profile or close embrace. Backlighting, translucent fabric, deep shadows, and a fine grain unify the mostly monochrome imagery, with one cool blue variation retaining the same atmospheric treatment."},{"id":"mert-and-marcus","name":"Mert and Marcus","cat":"photographers","en":"Mert and Marcus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mert-and-marcus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mert-and-marcus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","portraits","glow","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","dark-red","blue","deep-red","ochre"],"intro":"Mert and Marcus is a renowned photography duo known for their influential work in the fashion industry. They are celebrated for their bold, glamorous, and often surreal images that have graced the pages of top fashion magazines and campaigns for luxury brands. Their work is characterized by a sophisticated use of color, dramatic lighting, and a keen eye for detail, often pushing the boundaries of conventional fashion photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from hyper-realistic extreme close-up portraits with saturated blue and red lighting, glossy skin, and deep black shadows. Strong cropping, direct gazes, vivid lips, and sharply resolved facial texture create an intense, dark, high-impact editorial look."},{"id":"stephan-martiniere","name":"Stephan Martiniere","cat":"illustrators","en":"Stephan Martiniere","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephan-martiniere.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephan-martiniere","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","orange","brown","beige","blue","rust"],"intro":"Stephan Martiniere is a renowned French concept artist and illustrator known for his work in the science fiction and fantasy genres. He has contributed to numerous films, video games, and books, creating vivid and imaginative worlds that captivate audiences with their complexity and detail.","observation":"This style presents vast, highly detailed science-fiction vistas with monumental floating cities, planetary bodies, cloud seas, and towering architectural forms. Saturated sunset and twilight colors, strong light-dark separation, atmospheric depth, and luminous windows or energy beams create a cinematic sense of scale and grandeur."},{"id":"grayson-perry","name":"Grayson Perry","cat":"various-artists","en":"Grayson Perry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/grayson-perry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/grayson-perry","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","scenes","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-orange","black","muted-blue","red","pink"],"intro":"Grayson Perry is a British contemporary artist known for his ceramic vases, tapestries, and cross-dressing. His work often explores themes of identity, gender, and social commentary, blending traditional craft with modern narratives. Perry is recognized for his bold use of color and intricate detail, often incorporating autobiographical elements and cultural critiques into his art.","observation":"This style combines highly saturated colors and dense, hand-drawn linework with flat, graphic areas of color and intricate decorative patterning. It fills both studio interiors and urban panoramas with layered characters, landmarks, small activities, and fantastical visual details, creating a vivid, surreal, collage-like richness."},{"id":"mark-ruwedel","name":"Mark Ruwedel","cat":"photographers","en":"Mark Ruwedel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-ruwedel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-ruwedel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","white","silver","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Mark Ruwedel is an American photographer known for his exploration of landscapes and human impact on the environment. His work often focuses on the remnants of human activity in natural settings, capturing the intersection of nature and culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photographic realism to depict isolated human-made forms in broad, arid landscapes. Strong tonal contrast, visible grain, spacious compositions, and carefully resolved weathered surfaces give the scenes a cinematic, quietly uncanny sense of monumental desolation."},{"id":"lowell-herrero","name":"Lowell Herrero","cat":"painters","en":"Lowell Herrero","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lowell-herrero.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lowell-herrero","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-ochre","muted-blue","bone-white","dark-olive","ochre","light-yellow"],"intro":"Lowell Herrero was an American painter known for his vibrant and whimsical depictions of rural life. His work often featured exaggerated forms and playful compositions, capturing the charm and simplicity of pastoral settings with a unique blend of realism and folk art influences.","observation":"These images use richly textured, visible brushwork and fine strokes to create detailed, storybook-like rural scenes with saturated primary colors. Ordinary farm landscapes are made surreal through oversized animals, unusual human-animal encounters, and strongly composed pastoral settings beneath expansive cloud-filled skies."},{"id":"roa","name":"ROA","cat":"street-artists","en":"ROA","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roa","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","realistic","animals","scenes","urban","fine-lines","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","grey","black","muted-orange","pale-blue","blue","red"],"intro":"ROA is a Belgian street artist known for his large-scale, monochromatic murals of animals. His work is often found in urban environments, where he uses public spaces to create thought-provoking pieces that explore themes of wildlife and nature.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic animal depictions with dense, finely rendered black ink-like linework and strong illustrative contours. These monumental wildlife murals are integrated into weathered urban architecture, using monochrome figures against sunlit brick, stucco, and graffiti-covered walls."},{"id":"jim-warren","name":"Jim Warren","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jim Warren","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-warren.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-warren","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","brown","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Jim Warren is an American artist known for his imaginative and surrealistic paintings that often blend fantasy with realism. His work is characterized by vibrant colors, dreamlike scenes, and a whimsical approach to traditional subjects. Warren's art has been featured in various exhibitions and has gained a significant following for its unique style and creativity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, layered brushwork to build monumental waves and towering clouds, with richly textured surfaces and expressive movement. Saturated turquoise, coral, lavender, and deep blue are driven by glowing sunset light, producing expansive, dreamlike seascapes with epic scale."},{"id":"sebastiao-salgado","name":"Sebastiao Salgado","cat":"photographers","en":"Sebastiao Salgado","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sebastiao-salgado.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sebastiao-salgado","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","epic"],"colours":["silver","grey","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Sebastiao Salgado is a renowned Brazilian photographer known for his striking black and white images that document social issues, landscapes, and human conditions around the world. His work often focuses on themes of globalization, migration, and the environment, capturing the dignity and resilience of people in challenging circumstances.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed black-and-white photography with stark tonal separation and monumental cinematic compositions. Vast landscapes, towering clouds, mist, reflective water, and strongly framed animals or riders create an epic, atmospheric sense of scale."},{"id":"charles-gleyre","name":"Charles Gleyre","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Gleyre","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-gleyre.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-gleyre","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-brown","muted-ochre","pale-yellow","red"],"intro":"Charles Gleyre was a Swiss artist known for his contributions to the academic art scene of the 19th century. He was a prominent figure in the Romantic movement, celebrated for his historical and mythological subjects. Gleyre's works often featured grand compositions, rich color palettes, and detailed figures, reflecting his classical training and imaginative approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modelled, visible oil-paint strokes with dense costume, architectural, and environmental detail. It combines luminous saturated colors and dramatic light-dark separation with theatrical portraits, grand landscapes, ornate settings, and emotionally charged scenes."},{"id":"julie-doucet","name":"Julie Doucet","cat":"illustrators","en":"Julie Doucet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julie-doucet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julie-doucet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","floral","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["brown","pale-orange","muted-ochre","red","vivid-red","pink","deep-green","deep-blue"],"intro":"Julie Doucet is a Canadian cartoonist and artist known for her influential work in the alternative comics scene, particularly in the 1990s. Her autobiographical and often surreal narratives have made a significant impact on feminist and underground comic movements. Doucet's distinctive style combines bold lines and detailed illustrations, often exploring themes of identity, dreams, and personal experiences.","observation":"The style combines visibly hand-painted color fields with forceful black outlines, dense hatching, and deliberately naive, expressive faces. Bright reds, greens, pinks, and yellows organize crowded portraits, cats, floral motifs, clothing patterns, food, and interior details into graphic, poster-like compositions."},{"id":"n-c-wyeth","name":"N. C. Wyeth","cat":"illustrators","en":"N. C. Wyeth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/n-c-wyeth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/n-c-wyeth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","muted-orange","orange","blue"],"intro":"N. C. Wyeth was a prominent American illustrator and painter, known for his vivid and dramatic depictions of adventure and mythology. He was a key figure in the Golden Age of American Illustration, creating iconic images for classic novels such as \"Treasure Island\" and \"Robin Hood.\" Wyeth's work is characterized by its bold use of color, dynamic compositions, and a strong sense of narrative.","observation":"Across all four images, sweeping visible brushwork builds dramatic maritime scenes with strongly contrasted blue shadows and fiery orange light. Broad, energetic strokes, backlit figures, turbulent weather, and diagonally organized action give the style an epic, cinematic sense of movement."},{"id":"dain","name":"DAIN","cat":"street-artists","en":"DAIN","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","patterns","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","ink"],"colours":["beige","brown","pink","muted-blue","vivid-red","light-lime"],"intro":"DAIN is a contemporary street artist known for blending urban aesthetics with pop culture elements. His work often features layered imagery and vibrant colors, creating a unique visual language that resonates with modern audiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, close-up female portraits are fragmented by dense layers of vivid painted marks, drips, ink, paper-like scraps, and hard-edged color blocks. Broad gestural strokes, high contrast, and repeated eyes and facial fragments create an expressive mixed-media collage with a surreal, visually crowded surface."},{"id":"jean-beraud","name":"Jean Beraud","cat":"painters","en":"Jean Beraud","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-beraud.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-beraud","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Jean Beraud was a French painter known for his depictions of Parisian life during the Belle Époque. He captured the bustling streets, elegant cafes, and lively dance halls of late 19th-century Paris, often focusing on the fashionable and social aspects of the city. His works are characterized by their detailed realism and vibrant portrayal of urban scenes, offering a glimpse into the cultural and societal dynamics of the time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, broad painterly strokes to depict realistic urban scenes filled with fashionable figures, architectural detail, and atmospheric street activity. A subdued palette of blacks, browns, creams, and greys is punctuated by vivid red garments and hats, with strong light-dark contrast and reflective rain-wet surfaces."},{"id":"catherine-opie","name":"Catherine Opie","cat":"photographers","en":"Catherine Opie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/catherine-opie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/catherine-opie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","silver","muted-rust","dark-brown","muted-blue","charcoal"],"intro":"Catherine Opie is an American photographer known for her powerful portraits and landscapes that explore themes of identity, community, and the American urban experience. Her work often delves into the complexities of social norms and personal expression, capturing both the intimate and the public spheres of life.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, intimate portrait photography with tactile skin, hair, and fabric detail, often cropped very close to the subjects. It combines subdued natural colors with strong light-dark separation, shallow focus, and visible photographic grain, moving between stark daylight and warm, blurred evening interiors."},{"id":"demna-gvasalia","name":"Demna Gvasalia","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Demna Gvasalia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/demna-gvasalia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/demna-gvasalia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["deep-red","vivid-red","black","silver","beige","charcoal"],"intro":"Demna Gvasalia is a renowned fashion designer known for his innovative and avant-garde approach to fashion. He has been a leading figure in the fashion industry, particularly recognized for his work with Balenciaga and his own brand, Vetements. Gvasalia's designs often challenge traditional norms, blending streetwear with high fashion and incorporating elements of social commentary.","observation":"A realistic, fashion-editorial photographic style built around hooded figures in bulky technical outerwear, with faces partly concealed by hoods, masks, or sunglasses. Saturated reds and oranges, stark flash-like contrast, industrial settings, and tightly composed portraits give the images a bold, cinematic presence."},{"id":"alasdair-mclellan","name":"Alasdair McLellan","cat":"photographers","en":"Alasdair McLellan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alasdair-mclellan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alasdair-mclellan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","symmetry"],"colours":["white","grey","black","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Alasdair McLellan is a renowned British fashion photographer known for his evocative and intimate portraits. His work often captures the essence of British youth culture and has been featured in numerous high-profile fashion magazines and exhibitions. McLellan's photography is characterized by its clean composition, emotional depth, and a keen eye for detail, making him a prominent figure in contemporary photography.","observation":"The style is a stark black-and-white photographic portrait treatment, using close, frontal head-and-shoulder compositions, plain backgrounds, and strong tonal contrast. Fine skin texture, freckles, hair, and clothing weave remain sharply legible, giving the images a restrained editorial fashion character."},{"id":"david-lloyd-glover","name":"David Lloyd Glover","cat":"painters","en":"David Lloyd Glover","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-lloyd-glover.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-lloyd-glover","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-olive","dark-blue","blue","rust","bone-white","olive"],"intro":"David Lloyd Glover is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and detailed landscape paintings. His work often features lush gardens, serene rivers, and colorful foliage, capturing the beauty of nature with a unique impressionistic style. Glover's paintings are celebrated for their use of vivid colors and expressive brushwork, creating a sense of depth and movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional paint strokes to build richly layered lakeside and garden scenes, with dense vegetation and finely observed small details. Saturated blues, greens, violets, and warm floral accents create a bright, idyllic atmosphere, while sweeping landscapes and intimate outdoor settings give the images a dreamy illustrative quality."},{"id":"richard-anderson","name":"Richard Anderson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Richard Anderson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-anderson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-anderson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","grey","silver","black","muted-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Richard Anderson is a contemporary illustrator known for his dynamic and textured digital artwork, often blending elements of fantasy and sci-fi. His work is characterized by bold compositions and a painterly style that captures dramatic and intense scenes, frequently featuring heroic figures and imaginative settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines heavily textured, visible brushwork with expressive fantasy scene-making: monumental ruins, small wandering figures, and expansive atmospheric spaces. Its restrained gray-green palette is punctuated by vivid orange accents, while deep silhouettes and bright openings create stark, dramatic contrast."},{"id":"judy-blame","name":"Judy Blame","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Judy Blame","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/judy-blame.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/judy-blame","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","high-contrast","metallic","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Judy Blame is a renowned British fashion designer and stylist known for his innovative approach to fashion and accessory design. Emerging in the 1980s, Blame became a pivotal figure in the punk and post-punk scenes, celebrated for his DIY ethos and subversive style. His work often incorporated found objects and unconventional materials, challenging traditional notions of fashion and art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines realistic editorial portrait photography with heavily embellished, assembled clothing and accessories. Dense chains, metal objects, painted surfaces, patched textiles, piercings, and masks create an ornate, tactile look, reinforced by hard contrast, visible grain, saturated red-and-blue accents, and frequent black backgrounds."},{"id":"dorothea-tanning","name":"Dorothea Tanning","cat":"painters","en":"Dorothea Tanning","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dorothea-tanning.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dorothea-tanning","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["dark-ochre","black","beige","brown","light-yellow","grey"],"intro":"Dorothea Tanning is an American painter, sculptor, and writer associated with the Surrealist movement. Her work often explores themes of dreamscapes, psychological depth, and fantastical imagery, characterized by a unique blend of realism and surrealism. Tanning's art is known for its intricate details, imaginative compositions, and exploration of the subconscious mind.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint with layered, expressive strokes and carefully described surfaces. Muted earth tones, deep teal shadows, and rust-red accents create a dark theatrical mood, while uncanny scale shifts, symbolic objects, and staged natural settings give the scenes a surreal, dreamlike character."},{"id":"flora-borsi","name":"Flora Borsi","cat":"photographers","en":"Flora Borsi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/flora-borsi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/flora-borsi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","floral","portraits","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-red","brown","charcoal","beige","silver","red"],"intro":"Flora Borsi is a contemporary Hungarian photographer known for her surreal and conceptual photographic art. Her work often explores themes of identity, reality, and fantasy, blending human and animal elements to create dreamlike images.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely detailed close-up portraiture with subdued, dark color fields and strong light-to-shadow separation. Dramatic floral arrangements, veils, hats, knitwear, and foliage partially conceal or frame the faces, creating a bold, uncanny fashion-editorial mood."},{"id":"natalie-shau","name":"Natalie Shau","cat":"illustrators","en":"Natalie Shau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/natalie-shau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/natalie-shau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","symmetry"],"colours":["black","light-blue","grey","deep-red","dark-blue","bone-white"],"intro":"Natalie Shau is a contemporary artist known for her digital illustrations that blend elements of surrealism, fantasy, and gothic aesthetics. Her work often features intricate details, dark themes, and a mysterious atmosphere, drawing inspiration from various cultural and historical influences.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, meticulously detailed portraiture with frontal, near-symmetrical compositions and elaborate couture-like costumes. Dense lace, flowers, butterflies, jewelry, masks, and sculptural headpieces create a fantastical, surreal theatricality, while strongly controlled red-black and icy blue-white palettes give the portraits an intense visual identity."},{"id":"david-rowe","name":"David Rowe","cat":"illustrators","en":"David Rowe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-rowe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-rowe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","grey","beige","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"David Rowe is an illustrator known for his distinctive style that blends elements of surrealism and fantasy with a darkly humorous twist. His work often features exaggerated characters and whimsical narratives, creating a unique visual language that is both playful and unsettling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines intensely rendered character portraits with visible directional brushwork, loose sketch lines, scraped textures, and dripping paint. Strong teal, coral, red, and black accents create a vivid, high-contrast surface, while uncanny figures, ravens, smoke-like forms, and distorted facial details give the portraits a dark surreal mood."},{"id":"francois-morellet","name":"Francois Morellet","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Francois Morellet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francois-morellet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francois-morellet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["sculptural","characters","glow","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","grey","bone-white","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Francois Morellet was a French artist known for his contributions to geometric abstraction and kinetic art. Born in 1926, he became a prominent figure in the post-war art scene, utilizing mathematical systems and industrial materials to create dynamic and interactive works. Morellet's art often explored the interplay of light and space, challenging viewers' perceptions through optical illusions and minimalist aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, glowing linear tubes form sparse geometric installations in large, industrial gallery spaces. The photographic presentation emphasizes architectural scale, reflective floors, strong diagonals, and luminous light sources, with one render introducing vivid neon colors while the others use restrained white illumination."},{"id":"harvey-kurtzman","name":"Harvey Kurtzman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Harvey Kurtzman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harvey-kurtzman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harvey-kurtzman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","brown","black","dark-brown"],"intro":"Harvey Kurtzman was an influential American cartoonist and editor, best known for creating Mad Magazine. His work is celebrated for its satirical edge and innovative storytelling, which left a lasting impact on the world of comics and humor.","observation":"Across the sheet, expressive human and animal characters appear in densely furnished interior scenes, rendered with vigorous pen-like contours, fine hatching, and strongly modeled black-and-white contrast. One colored panel retains the same intricate illustrative drawing language, with muted earthy reds, greens, and browns supporting the abundant props and theatrical poses."},{"id":"pedro-friedeberg","name":"Pedro Friedeberg","cat":"various-artists","en":"Pedro Friedeberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pedro-friedeberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pedro-friedeberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","deep-rust","ochre","red","beige"],"intro":"Pedro Friedeberg is a Mexican artist known for his surreal and fantastical works that often incorporate architectural elements and intricate patterns. His art is characterized by a whimsical and imaginative approach, blending influences from surrealism and pop art, and is recognized for its vivid colors and detailed compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines vividly painted, sculptural furniture and objects with bold black outlines, flat color fields, stripes, concentric circles, and repeated eye motifs. The dense geometric ornament and theatrical orange, coral, blue, and black palette create a surreal, retro decorative interior language."},{"id":"ivan-chermayeff","name":"Ivan Chermayeff","cat":"designers","en":"Ivan Chermayeff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ivan-chermayeff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ivan-chermayeff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","ink","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","bone-white","blue","dark-blue","deep-blue"],"intro":"Ivan Chermayeff is a renowned graphic designer known for his influential work in corporate branding and visual identity. He co-founded the design firm Chermayeff & Geismar & Haviv, which created iconic logos for companies like NBC, Mobil, and Chase Bank. His style is characterized by bold, simple shapes and a strong use of color, reflecting a modernist approach to design.","observation":"The style uses bold geometric blocks, stark black silhouettes, and saturated cobalt, red, black, and cream hues. Clean graphic shapes are combined with visible ink-like scuffs, dry texture, and slightly irregular painted edges, giving the compositions a forceful retro print character."},{"id":"ted-mckeever","name":"Ted McKeever","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ted McKeever","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ted-mckeever.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ted-mckeever","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["beige","black","charcoal","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"Ted McKeever is an American comic book artist and writer known for his distinctive and unconventional style, often exploring dark and surreal themes. His work is characterized by bold, expressive lines and a unique approach to storytelling that challenges traditional comic book aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white ink drawing with heavy, expressive lines, crosshatched shading, and visibly rough brush textures. Hooded or obscured figures inhabit bleak, uncanny scenes, with deep shadows, stark silhouettes, and distressed tonal washes creating a consistently dark and surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"patrick-woodroffe","name":"Patrick Woodroffe","cat":"illustrators","en":"Patrick Woodroffe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patrick-woodroffe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patrick-woodroffe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","muted-orange","grey","muted-blue","orange"],"intro":"Patrick Woodroffe is a renowned British artist and illustrator known for his intricate and imaginative fantasy artwork. His work often features detailed depictions of mythical creatures, surreal landscapes, and fantastical architecture, blending elements of science fiction and fantasy.","observation":"The style combines highly visible painted texture with extremely dense, finely drawn detail, ornamental surfaces, and layered fantastical environments. Saturated oranges, reds, blues, and greens are pushed against deep shadows, while eccentric characters, animals, machinery, architecture, and landscapes merge into surreal storybook tableaux."},{"id":"david-cox","name":"David Cox","cat":"painters","en":"David Cox","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-cox.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-cox","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","beige","dark-brown"],"intro":"David Cox was a prominent British landscape painter of the 19th century, known for his contributions to the development of English watercolor painting. His works often depicted the natural beauty of the British countryside, capturing the changing moods of the landscape with a keen eye for atmospheric effects.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, softly blended atmospheric skies, and layered oil-like texture. It favors subdued earthy colors, dramatic weather, reflective water, and expansive landscape compositions rendered with a classical, atmospheric sense of place."},{"id":"tim-lahan","name":"Tim Lahan","cat":"designers","en":"Tim Lahan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-lahan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-lahan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["white","light-yellow","blue","vivid-red","brown","light-cyan","vivid-green"],"intro":"Tim Lahan is a contemporary American artist and designer known for his playful and vibrant illustrations. His work often features bold colors and simple shapes, creating a unique blend of humor and surrealism. Lahan's designs have been widely recognized in the fields of graphic design and illustration, contributing to various commercial and artistic projects.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses highly saturated flat color fields, simplified shapes, and thick black contour lines to create a bold graphic-cartoon appearance. The subjects are presented as playful illustrative vignettes with minimal internal shading and strong poster-like color blocking."},{"id":"bob-ross","name":"Bob Ross","cat":"painters","en":"Bob Ross","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-ross.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-ross","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","silver","muted-blue","orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Bob Ross was an American painter and television host, best known for his instructional TV program \"The Joy of Painting,\" where he taught viewers how to create serene landscape paintings using a wet-on-wet oil painting technique. His calm demeanor and encouraging style made him a beloved figure in popular culture, and his work continues to inspire artists and enthusiasts around the world.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive mountain-and-lake landscapes are rendered with visible, broad painterly strokes and richly textured natural detail. Saturated warm and cool lighting, dramatic peaks, reflective water, and atmospheric depth give the scenes a dreamy, epic, cinematic character."},{"id":"chad-knight","name":"Chad Knight","cat":"various-artists","en":"Chad Knight","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chad-knight.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chad-knight","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","landscapes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["blue","dark-blue","muted-blue","brown","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Chad Knight is a contemporary digital artist known for his intricate 3D sculptures and digital art pieces. His work often explores themes of identity, technology, and the human form, blending surreal elements with hyper-realistic details to create visually striking compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental humanoid forms combine solid sculptural volume with intricate lattices, woven structures, spikes, and fragmented architectural surfaces. The scenes use vivid blue skies, warm cloud light, strong contrast, and painterly texture to create surreal, dreamlike scale and a cinematic sense of isolation."},{"id":"henry-moret","name":"Henry Moret","cat":"painters","en":"Henry Moret","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henry-moret.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henry-moret","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","silver","dark-olive","muted-rust","red"],"intro":"Henry Moret was a French painter associated with the Impressionist and Post-Impressionist movements. Born in 1856, he is best known for his vibrant and expressive landscapes of the Brittany coast, capturing the natural beauty and light of the region. Moret's work often features bold colors and dynamic compositions, reflecting his keen observation of nature and mastery of color.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to depict expansive coastal landscapes with energetic strokes and luminous, saturated color. Fine marks articulate grasses, flowers, rocks, waves, and distant headlands while maintaining broad scenic compositions and an expressive sense of atmosphere."},{"id":"anna-and-elena-balbusso","name":"Anna and Elena Balbusso","cat":"illustrators","en":"Anna and Elena Balbusso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anna-and-elena-balbusso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anna-and-elena-balbusso","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","grey","dark-red","vivid-red","orange"],"intro":"Anna and Elena Balbusso is a renowned Italian twin sister duo known for their award-winning illustrations. They have worked on numerous projects, including book covers and editorial illustrations, and are celebrated for their unique style that blends traditional and contemporary techniques.","observation":"A dense, surreal portrait style built from overlapping facial fragments, profiles, silhouettes, and geometric colour blocks. Saturated red, teal, black, and ochre are pushed into high contrast, while bold graphic contours, visible linework, distressed grain, and layered print-like textures give the images an expressive collage character."},{"id":"alejandro-aravena","name":"Alejandro Aravena","cat":"architects","en":"Alejandro Aravena","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alejandro-aravena.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alejandro-aravena","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","brown","black","silver","muted-blue","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Alejandro Aravena is a renowned Chilean architect known for his innovative and sustainable architectural designs. He has been recognized globally for his contributions to modern architecture, particularly in the context of social housing and urban development. Aravena's work often emphasizes simplicity, functionality, and the integration of natural elements into urban spaces.","observation":"The style presents monumental raw-concrete architecture with severe geometric masses, deep recesses, cantilevers, and strongly sculptural depth. Realistic architectural framing, subdued earth tones, atmospheric skies, sparse surroundings, and tiny figures emphasize scale and quiet cinematic isolation."},{"id":"alan-parry","name":"Alan Parry","cat":"painters","en":"Alan Parry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-parry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-parry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","silver","muted-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Alan Parry is a fictional or conceptual artist, possibly inspired by real-life painters known for their depiction of serene landscapes and rural life. His work might draw from historical or cultural contexts, reflecting a deep connection with nature and the countryside.","observation":"These images combine meticulously rendered garden and woodland settings with visible painterly texture, subdued atmospheric colour, and carefully articulated foliage, bark, and ground surfaces. Solitary figures and animals recur within uncanny, dreamlike compositions, giving the scenes a quiet, dark, surreal mood."},{"id":"leiji-matsumoto","name":"Leiji Matsumoto","cat":"illustrators","en":"Leiji Matsumoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leiji-matsumoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leiji-matsumoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","sci-fi","drawing"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-rust","bone-white","rust","blue"],"intro":"Leiji Matsumoto is a renowned Japanese manga artist and creator, best known for his work in the science fiction genre. His most famous creations include \" Space Battleship Yamato \" and \" Galaxy Express 999 ,\" which have had a significant impact on both Japanese and global pop culture. Matsumoto's work is characterized by its intricate detailing, imaginative storytelling, and a distinctive blend of futuristic and nostalgic elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, visibly brushed surfaces with fine contour work and forceful graphic illustration. Dramatic close-up characters, heavy blacks, restricted rust-blue highlights, cosmic settings, armor, weapons, and skull imagery create an intense space-opera mood."},{"id":"zao-wou-ki","name":"Zao Wou-Ki","cat":"painters","en":"Zao Wou-Ki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zao-wou-ki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zao-wou-ki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","landscapes","mist","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","grey","brown","blue","charcoal","rust"],"intro":"Zao Wou-Ki was a Chinese-French painter known for his abstract works that blend Eastern and Western influences. Born in Beijing in 1920, he moved to Paris in 1948, where he became associated with the Lyrical Abstraction movement. His paintings are celebrated for their dynamic compositions and use of color, often evoking natural landscapes and emotional depth.","observation":"Across all four works, broad gestural paint marks and built-up textured surfaces dissolve coastal and oceanic forms into atmospheric, near-abstract landscapes. The restrained blue, gray, cream, black, and rust palette, with misty horizons and turbulent dark masses, gives the series an expressive and dreamlike mood."},{"id":"piero-fornasetti","name":"Piero Fornasetti","cat":"designers","en":"Piero Fornasetti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/piero-fornasetti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/piero-fornasetti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","sculptural","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["white","silver","beige","charcoal","bone-white","light-orange"],"intro":"Piero Fornasetti was an Italian painter, sculptor, interior decorator, and engraver known for his whimsical and surreal designs. He was born in 1913 and became famous for his distinctive style that often featured classical imagery, particularly faces, and architectural elements. His work is characterized by a blend of humor and elegance, often incorporating repetitive motifs and optical illusions.","observation":"The style combines highly symmetrical portrait faces with dense, mechanically precise dot and line patterns, rendered in stark black and white with occasional gold accents. Graphic illustrative surfaces are applied to sculptural ceramic-like objects, producing an ornate, surreal display-object quality across the sheet."},{"id":"jean-prouve","name":"Jean Prouve","cat":"designers","en":"Jean Prouve","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-prouve.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-prouve","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["beige","white","grey","brown","black","orange"],"intro":"Jean Prouve is a renowned French designer and architect known for his innovative contributions to modern architecture and furniture design. His work is characterized by a focus on functionality, simplicity, and the use of industrial materials. Prouve's designs often incorporate metal and wood, reflecting a blend of craftsmanship and industrial production techniques. His influence extends into modernist movements and has left a lasting impact on design aesthetics worldwide.","observation":"The style presents furniture and architectural objects as realistic, carefully staged still lifes with strong volumetric form and tactile materials. Restrained earth tones, directional light, deep shadows, and spacious interior compositions give the renders a cinematic industrial-design atmosphere."},{"id":"james-nares","name":"James Nares","cat":"painters","en":"James Nares","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-nares.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-nares","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","sculptural","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["white","dark-blue","black","muted-blue","grey"],"intro":"James Nares is a British artist known for his dynamic and gestural painting style. Born in 1953, Nares has been a prominent figure in the contemporary art scene, particularly recognized for his large-scale brushstroke paintings that capture motion and energy. His work often explores the relationship between movement and stillness, creating a visual dialogue that is both captivating and thought-provoking.","observation":"Across all four renders, thick sculptural paint forms sweep and curl through the frame in highly abstract compositions. Broad, visibly directional brushstrokes, heavy impasto, deep navy and black tones, and pale highlights create a forceful sense of motion against generous cream-colored negative space."},{"id":"kate-greenaway","name":"Kate Greenaway","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kate Greenaway","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kate-greenaway.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kate-greenaway","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","light-yellow","dark-olive","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Kate Greenaway was a renowned 19th-century English illustrator and author, celebrated for her charming and idyllic depictions of children and rural life. Her work, characterized by delicate lines and soft colors, became immensely popular in children's books and greeting cards, influencing the style of children's illustration for generations.","observation":"The style combines delicate ink-like contour drawing with softly layered, visibly worked color and a lightly textured painted surface. It consistently depicts richly detailed pastoral scenes of children in period clothing, surrounded by flowers, gardens, baskets, and countryside, using a restrained natural palette and gentle storybook composition."},{"id":"valerio-olgiati","name":"Valerio Olgiati","cat":"architects","en":"Valerio Olgiati","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/valerio-olgiati.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/valerio-olgiati","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","minimalist","realistic","sculptural","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","white","beige"],"intro":"Valerio Olgiati is a Swiss architect known for his minimalist and conceptual designs. His work often emphasizes the use of light, space, and form to create contemplative and introspective environments. Olgiati's architectural style is characterized by clean lines, geometric forms, and a focus on materiality, often drawing from modernist influences.","observation":"The style presents monumental, geometric architectural spaces with massive concrete planes, deep recesses, stairways, and carefully framed openings. Restrained earth-toned materials are shaped by strong directional sunlight and dense shadow, while tiny solitary figures emphasize the scale and cinematic, contemplative atmosphere."},{"id":"henri-manguin","name":"Henri Manguin","cat":"painters","en":"Henri Manguin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-manguin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-manguin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","floral","landscapes","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-olive","grey","light-yellow","brown","red"],"intro":"Henri Manguin was a French painter associated with the Fauvist movement, known for his vibrant use of color and expressive brushwork. Born in 1874, Manguin was part of a group of artists who emphasized painterly qualities and strong color over representational accuracy. His work often depicted serene landscapes, intimate interiors, and lively coastal scenes, capturing the essence of the Mediterranean with a joyful and vivid palette.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly built-up paint with broad, directional brushwork, lively edges, and strongly varied yet harmonious color. It combines garden landscapes, domestic interiors, floral arrangements, and fashionably dressed figures in richly filled, narrative compositions, with simplified but readable forms and expressive painted surfaces."},{"id":"paul-zizka","name":"Paul Zizka","cat":"photographers","en":"Paul Zizka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-zizka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-zizka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Paul Zizka is a renowned Canadian photographer known for his breathtaking landscape and adventure photography. His work often captures the majestic beauty of the Canadian Rockies, focusing on nightscapes and the natural phenomena of the northern lights. Zizka's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey the grandeur and solitude of the wilderness, inspiring a sense of wonder and exploration.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic landscape photography with imposing alpine terrain, deep blue twilight tones, and strong contrast between cold ambient light and small warm sources. Carefully framed vistas, caves, lakes, and valleys create an epic, dreamy atmosphere, while stars, moving water, mist, and illuminated figures add visual drama."},{"id":"ruth-orkin","name":"Ruth Orkin","cat":"photographers","en":"Ruth Orkin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ruth-orkin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ruth-orkin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Ruth Orkin is a renowned American photographer and filmmaker, celebrated for her evocative black and white images that capture the essence of mid-20th century urban life. Her work often focuses on candid moments, portraying the vibrancy and complexity of city streets, particularly in New York City. Orkin's photography is recognized for its narrative quality, often telling stories through the lens of everyday life and human interactions.","observation":"The style presents realistic black-and-white urban street scenes with strong tonal contrast, candid-looking figures, and carefully composed cinematic framing. Fine film grain, selective focus, midcentury clothing, and dense pedestrian activity give the images an archival documentary character."},{"id":"carsten-witte","name":"Carsten Witte","cat":"photographers","en":"Carsten Witte","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carsten-witte.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carsten-witte","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-red","bone-white","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Carsten Witte is a contemporary photographer known for his striking and evocative portraiture. His work often explores themes of beauty, mystery, and the human form, utilizing high-contrast lighting and detailed textures to create captivating images.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, detailed fashion portraits with tightly cropped faces, tactile hair and fabric, and selectively blurred backgrounds. Dark, moody color grading, strong contrast, subtle grain, and dramatic studio lighting give all four images an intense editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"paul-fusco","name":"Paul Fusco","cat":"photographers","en":"Paul Fusco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-fusco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-fusco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","retro","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-olive","silver","dark-brown","grey","ochre"],"intro":"Paul Fusco was an American photojournalist known for his poignant and humanistic photography. He gained significant recognition for his work with Magnum Photos, capturing powerful images that documented social issues and historical events, including the funeral train of Robert F. Kennedy.","observation":"The style is cinematic and photorealistic, using subdued earthy colors, natural twilight, and dense environmental detail to create an atmospheric rural world. Vintage objects, isolated figures, and quietly uncanny situations are staged within expansive overgrown landscapes, giving the images a dreamy surreal quality with a retro visual character."},{"id":"giotto","name":"Giotto","cat":"painters","en":"Giotto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giotto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giotto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","metallic","subdued-colors","classical","religious","symmetry"],"colours":["ochre","brown","dark-brown","black","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Giotto was an Italian painter and architect from Florence during the Late Middle Ages. He is considered one of the first great artists of the Italian Renaissance , known for his advancements in realism and expression in art. Giotto's work marked a departure from the Byzantine style, introducing more naturalistic forms and emotional depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style evokes devotional panel imagery through solemn close-up faces, halos, elongated features, and richly patterned garments. Fine linear detailing, crackled painted surfaces, aged blue-and-earth pigments, and lustrous gold-like ornament create a heavily worked, tactile appearance."},{"id":"jaume-capdevila","name":"Jaume Capdevila","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jaume Capdevila","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jaume-capdevila.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jaume-capdevila","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","drawing","dark","geometric"],"colours":["beige","pale-yellow","vivid-red","black","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Jaume Capdevila is a Spanish cartoonist and illustrator known for his distinctive and expressive style. His work often explores themes of surrealism and fantasy, blending humor with a critical eye on society. Capdevila's illustrations are characterized by their bold and imaginative use of line and color, often depicting exaggerated characters and whimsical scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly rough, broad paint strokes with dark drawn contours, angular shapes, and fragmented yet highly detailed scenes. Earthy ochres, charcoal blacks, cream, and occasional saturated red create an expressive, slightly ominous atmosphere, while active gestures, flying birds, and unstable compositions add motion."},{"id":"go-nagai","name":"Go Nagai","cat":"illustrators","en":"Go Nagai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/go-nagai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/go-nagai","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","ink"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-blue","dark-red","bone-white","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Go Nagai is a renowned Japanese manga artist and writer, celebrated for his pioneering work in the manga and anime industry. He is best known for creating influential series such as 'Devilman,' 'Mazinger Z,' and 'Cutie Honey,' which have had a lasting impact on the genres of mecha and horror in Japanese pop culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses sharply outlined comic-book figures, angular anatomy, flat saturated reds and blues, and deep black shadow masses. Energetic diagonals, foreshortened poses, speed-like marks, and rough ink texture give the images a dramatic pulp-fantasy intensity."},{"id":"jos-collignon","name":"Jos Collignon","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jos Collignon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jos-collignon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jos-collignon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","drawing"],"colours":["brown","beige","cream","muted-cyan","dark-red"],"intro":"Jos Collignon is a Dutch cartoonist and illustrator known for his political cartoons and satirical illustrations. He has contributed to various newspapers and publications, offering a unique perspective on social and political issues through his art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, energetic ink drawing with expressive illustrated figures, buildings, clothing, and small narrative details. Restrained blue, cream, grey, black, and red-orange colors are organized into graphic flat areas, while heavy outlines, fine hatching, and selective high contrast give the scenes a lively, weathered urban character."},{"id":"gustave-baumann","name":"Gustave Baumann","cat":"printmakers","en":"Gustave Baumann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-baumann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-baumann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","landscapes","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","light-orange","brown","orange","rust"],"intro":"Gustave Baumann was an American printmaker and painter known for his colorful woodcut prints depicting the landscapes and cultural life of the American Southwest. Born in Germany in 1881, he emigrated to the United States and became a key figure in the Arts and Crafts Movement, celebrated for his mastery of color and technique in printmaking.","observation":"Across all four images, expansive mountain landscapes are rendered as highly graphic illustrations with flattened color fields, strong contour lines, dense hatch marks, and selectively intricate foliage and rock textures. A vivid orange-and-blue palette, pronounced tonal contrast, and poster-like framing give the scenes a bold retro print character."},{"id":"lotta-jansdotter","name":"Lotta Jansdotter","cat":"designers","en":"Lotta Jansdotter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lotta-jansdotter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lotta-jansdotter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","fashion","floral","patterns","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","ochre","vivid-red","red","deep-red"],"intro":"Lotta Jansdotter is a contemporary designer known for her distinctive Scandinavian-inspired patterns and designs. Her work often features simple, organic motifs that draw inspiration from nature, particularly the flora and fauna of her native Sweden. Jansdotter's designs are celebrated for their minimalist aesthetic and have been applied to a variety of mediums, including textiles, ceramics, and paper goods.","observation":"The style presents richly arranged textile-design materials and fabric samples, combining tactile woven surfaces with graphic botanical, floral, and eye motifs. Strong black outlines, flat blocks of saturated red, navy, mustard, white, and pink, and visibly hand-rendered ink-like marks create a bold illustrative print aesthetic."},{"id":"anna-pugh","name":"Anna Pugh","cat":"painters","en":"Anna Pugh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anna-pugh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anna-pugh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-olive","dark-green","grey","ochre","rust","red","blue"],"intro":"Anna Pugh is a contemporary English painter known for her vibrant and whimsical depictions of the countryside. Her works often feature lush landscapes, charming cottages, and an array of flora and fauna, capturing the essence of rural life with a touch of fantasy and nostalgia.","observation":"These images use richly visible, directional brushwork and fine strokes to build densely layered meadows, gardens, villages, and animals. Saturated reds, greens, pinks, and blues create an exuberant storybook atmosphere, while expressive natural forms and abundant flowers unify the pastoral scenes."},{"id":"franz-xaver-winterhalter","name":"Franz Xaver Winterhalter","cat":"painters","en":"Franz Xaver Winterhalter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/franz-xaver-winterhalter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/franz-xaver-winterhalter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Franz Xaver Winterhalter was a renowned German painter known for his flattering portraits of royalty and upper-class society in the mid-19th century. His works are characterized by their elegance, attention to detail, and the romantic portrayal of his subjects, often set against lush, idyllic backgrounds.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, finely controlled painted surfaces to depict elegantly posed women in elaborate gowns, jewelry, and lace. Dark, warm interiors and restrained cream, red, brown, and blue tones create a solemn, luxurious atmosphere, while intricate costume details and soft portrait lighting dominate the compositions."},{"id":"monir-shahroudy-farmanfarmaian","name":"Monir Shahroudy Farmanfarmaian","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Monir Shahroudy Farmanfarmaian","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/monir-shahroudy-farmanfarmaian.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/monir-shahroudy-farmanfarmaian","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","metallic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["white","bone-white","beige","muted-orange","brown","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Monir Shahroudy Farmanfarmaian is an Iranian artist known for her innovative mirror mosaics and geometric patterns that blend traditional Persian art with modern aesthetics. Her work often reflects the cultural and artistic heritage of Iran, incorporating elements of Islamic architecture and design.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed decorative wall objects built from reflective mirror fragments, polygonal facets, and radial or concentric geometric arrangements. Repeated symmetry, fine divisions, metallic surfaces, and ornate mosaic-like patterning give the pieces a sculptural, jewel-like appearance in carefully staged interiors."},{"id":"thomas-barbey","name":"Thomas Barbey","cat":"photographers","en":"Thomas Barbey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-barbey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-barbey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["grey","silver","white","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Thomas Barbey is a contemporary photographer known for his surreal and imaginative photomontages. His work often combines elements of fantasy and reality, creating dreamlike images that challenge perceptions and evoke curiosity. Barbey's art is characterized by meticulous attention to detail and a playful approach to composition, often incorporating architectural elements and landscapes in unexpected ways.","observation":"Across all four renders, highly realistic architectural and natural forms are placed in impossible floating landscapes above a cloud-filled ocean. The monochrome treatment, deep tonal contrast, monumental scale, and towering cloud formations create a surreal, dreamlike atmosphere with dense visual detail."},{"id":"mab-graves","name":"Mab Graves","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mab Graves","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mab-graves.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mab-graves","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["beige","silver","grey","charcoal","muted-red","red"],"intro":"Mab Graves is a contemporary American artist known for her pop surrealist works that often feature whimsical and fantastical themes. Her art is characterized by a blend of innocence and mystery, often depicting youthful figures in dreamlike settings.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, painterly portraiture with delicate visible brushwork, softly blended skin, luminous eyes, and idealized feminine faces. Muted pastel clothing and skin tones are contrasted by lush floral framing, lace, ribbons, and occasional birds, creating a romantic, ornamental fantasy mood."},{"id":"nancy-noel","name":"Nancy Noel","cat":"painters","en":"Nancy Noel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nancy-noel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nancy-noel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-orange","dark-ochre","muted-olive","rust","deep-rust","brown"],"intro":"Nancy Noel is an American artist known for her enchanting portraits and depictions of children and animals, often set against lush, natural backdrops. Her work is characterized by a gentle, ethereal quality that captures the innocence and wonder of childhood. Noel's paintings often incorporate elements of fantasy and nature, creating a dreamlike atmosphere that resonates with viewers.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines softly visible brushwork with highly detailed portraiture, elaborate costume, floral decoration, lace, feathers, pearls, and reflective ornament. Muted teal, cream, coral, and red hues unify the richly embellished compositions, which frame faces and figures in a classical, fashion-focused manner."},{"id":"miroslav-tichy","name":"Miroslav Tichy","cat":"photographers","en":"Miroslav Tichy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/miroslav-tichy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/miroslav-tichy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","charcoal","bone-white"],"intro":"Miroslav Tichy was a Czech photographer known for his unconventional and clandestine approach to photography. Using homemade cameras crafted from found materials, Tichy captured candid images of women in his hometown of Kyjov, often focusing on themes of voyeurism and the everyday. His work gained recognition for its raw, unpolished aesthetic and the unique perspective it offered on post-war Eastern European life.","observation":"The style presents documentary-like photographic scenes and portraits with heavy grain, soft focus, motion blur, and distressed archival surfaces. Muted monochrome and sepia tones, strong shadows, scratches, creases, and faded exposure create a dark, nostalgic retro atmosphere across the images."},{"id":"robert-doisneau","name":"Robert Doisneau","cat":"photographers","en":"Robert Doisneau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-doisneau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-doisneau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Robert Doisneau was a renowned French photographer known for his humanist approach to street photography. He captured the essence of everyday life in Paris, often focusing on intimate and candid moments. Doisneau's work is celebrated for its warmth, humor, and keen observation of human interactions.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast street photography with candid urban encounters, layered compositions, and a strong sense of filmic observation. Selective focus, visible grain, period clothing, and dramatic foreground framing give the scenes a documentary realism and a dark, atmospheric mood."},{"id":"guercino","name":"Guercino","cat":"painters","en":"Guercino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guercino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guercino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","religious","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-orange","red","charcoal"],"intro":"Guercino was an Italian Baroque painter known for his dynamic compositions and dramatic use of light and shadow. Born Giovanni Francesco Barbieri in 1591, he was a leading figure in the Baroque movement, celebrated for his expressive and emotional works that often depicted religious themes and figures. His mastery of chiaroscuro and his ability to convey human emotion made him a prominent artist of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modeled oil-paint surfaces, visible broad strokes, dramatic light against deep shadow, and warm earth tones punctuated by red and blue garments. Figures are arranged in emotionally charged, theatrical religious or historical tableaux, with expressive gestures, elaborate drapery, and densely layered scenes."},{"id":"chris-ofili","name":"Chris Ofili","cat":"painters","en":"Chris Ofili","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-ofili.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-ofili","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","ornate","floral","patterns","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-blue","vivid-red","dark-green","bone-white","olive"],"intro":"Chris Ofili is a British artist known for his vibrant and intricate paintings that often explore themes of identity, culture, and spirituality. His work is characterized by the use of rich colors, detailed patterns, and a blend of traditional and contemporary elements. Ofili's art often incorporates African influences and addresses complex societal issues.","observation":"These images use intensely saturated, high-contrast color with visible layered brushwork, poured textures, branching lines, and granular dots. Organic botanical and cellular forms flow into surreal abstract compositions, with luminous specks and glowing color accents punctuating the dense surfaces."},{"id":"zack-snyder","name":"Zack Snyder","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Zack Snyder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zack-snyder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zack-snyder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","backlighting","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","orange","brown"],"intro":"Zack Snyder is an American filmmaker known for his distinctive visual style and work on superhero films such as \"300,\" \"Man of Steel,\" and \"Justice League.\" His films are characterized by their epic scale, dramatic storytelling, and a strong emphasis on visual aesthetics. Snyder's approach often includes high-contrast lighting, slow-motion sequences, and a focus on powerful, heroic figures.","observation":"A cinematic, photorealistic style built around dark teal shadows and intense orange firelight, with strong contrast, atmospheric smoke, rain, and drifting embers. Cloaked figures and ruined environments are framed as epic, emotionally charged scenes, often using silhouettes, backlighting, and reflective wet surfaces."},{"id":"alessandro-mendini","name":"Alessandro Mendini","cat":"designers","en":"Alessandro Mendini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alessandro-mendini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alessandro-mendini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["beige","white","grey","rust","brown","dark-blue","pink"],"intro":"Alessandro Mendini is an influential Italian designer and architect known for his contributions to postmodern design and the Memphis Group. His work often blends art, architecture, and design, characterized by bold colors, geometric patterns, and a playful aesthetic. Mendini's designs are celebrated for their imaginative and whimsical qualities, making significant impacts on contemporary design.","observation":"Across all four renders, sculptural furniture and decorative objects combine rounded, playful volumes with strong geometric paneling and densely patterned surfaces. Saturated primary and secondary colors, thick graphic outlines, flat color fields, checkerboards, stripes, spots, and animal-like motifs create a highly decorative illustrative look in bright gallery interiors."},{"id":"charles-gwathmey","name":"Charles Gwathmey","cat":"architects","en":"Charles Gwathmey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-gwathmey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-gwathmey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","urban","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["muted-blue","dark-blue","brown","cream","orange","grey"],"intro":"Charles Gwathmey was an influential American architect known for his contributions to modernist architecture. He was part of the New York Five, a group of architects who were prominent in the late 20th century. Gwathmey's work is characterized by its bold geometric forms and innovative use of space, often incorporating elements of abstraction and minimalism.","observation":"The style combines crisp geometric architecture with strongly structured, poster-like compositions and saturated blue, cream, orange, and charcoal colors. Hard sunlight, deep shadows, and a visible grainy print texture give the scenes a cinematic retro feel, while the clean planes and simplified forms remain distinctly illustrative."},{"id":"mark-lague","name":"Mark Lague","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Lague","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-lague.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-lague","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","dark-brown","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Mark Lague is a contemporary Canadian artist known for his impressionistic cityscapes and urban scenes. His work often captures the dynamic energy and atmosphere of bustling city life, using bold brushstrokes and vibrant colors to convey movement and light.","observation":"The style depicts dense urban street scenes with rain, traffic, reflective pavement, and towering buildings, rendered through visible broad brushwork and vertical scraped or streaked marks. Cool, subdued city tones are repeatedly punctuated by strong orange-red lights, with misty distance, luminous reflections, and high contrast creating an expressive, cinematic-feeling atmosphere without relying on photographic realism."},{"id":"robert-bechtle","name":"Robert Bechtle","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Bechtle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-bechtle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-bechtle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","beige","rust","grey"],"intro":"Robert Bechtle is an American painter known for his photorealistic depictions of suburban life. His work captures the essence of everyday scenes with meticulous attention to detail, often focusing on the quiet, unassuming moments of American life. Bechtle's paintings are celebrated for their ability to transform the mundane into something profound and contemplative.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed photographic street scenes with subdued, warm colors and pronounced sunlight-shadow contrast. Urban architecture, mature greenery, and vintage vehicles are framed with a nostalgic retro sensibility, while visible grain gives the images an aged film texture."},{"id":"daisuke-yokota","name":"Daisuke Yokota","cat":"various-artists","en":"Daisuke Yokota","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daisuke-yokota.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daisuke-yokota","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Daisuke Yokota is a contemporary Japanese photographer known for his experimental approach to photography, often incorporating techniques such as layering and digital manipulation to create ethereal and introspective images. His work explores themes of memory, identity, and the passage of time, often resulting in haunting and surreal visuals.","observation":"Across all four images, monochrome figures emerge from heavy grain, soft focus, fog, and stark pools of light. Obscured faces, blurred motion, reflective darkness, and atmospheric exposure create a dreamy, bleak, cinematic mood."},{"id":"vivienne-tam","name":"Vivienne Tam","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Vivienne Tam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vivienne-tam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vivienne-tam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","floral","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","silver","grey","charcoal","muted-red","red"],"intro":"Vivienne Tam is a renowned fashion designer known for her East-meets-West aesthetic, blending traditional Chinese elements with modern fashion. Her work often incorporates cultural motifs and innovative designs, making her a prominent figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style is polished, realistic fashion photography combining runway views with tightly framed model portraits. It emphasizes richly patterned floral garments, lace and sheer fabric details, shallow focus, softly lit neutral backgrounds, and saturated red, blue, and cream tones."},{"id":"pete-turner","name":"Pete Turner","cat":"photographers","en":"Pete Turner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pete-turner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pete-turner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","grain","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","silhouette"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-blue","dark-red","beige","orange"],"intro":"Pete Turner is a renowned American photographer known for his pioneering work in color photography. His innovative use of color and composition has influenced many in the field of visual arts. Turner's work often features bold, vibrant hues and striking contrasts, making his images instantly recognizable and impactful.","observation":"Across all four images, recognizable landscapes and urban settings are rendered with visible painterly texture, distressed grain, and expressive, simplified forms. A restrained blue-black palette is sharply interrupted by saturated vermilion light, reflections, and horizons, often filtered through haze and silhouettes to create a brooding atmospheric glow."},{"id":"brooke-didonato","name":"Brooke DiDonato","cat":"photographers","en":"Brooke DiDonato","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brooke-didonato.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brooke-didonato","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","grey","beige","muted-teal","deep-red"],"intro":"Brooke DiDonato is a contemporary photographer known for her surreal and introspective imagery. Her work often explores themes of identity and the human condition, using dreamlike compositions and a soft, muted color palette to create a sense of mystery and introspection. DiDonato's photographs frequently feature hidden or obscured faces, inviting viewers to delve into the narrative and emotional depth of her pieces.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, carefully staged photographic tableaux with unusual bodily arrangements and surreal intrusions such as smoke, branches, birds, and oversized floral elements. Muted teal, cream, brown, and red tones, strong directional light, deep shadows, and spacious interior backdrops create a dark, cinematic fashion-editorial mood."},{"id":"margaret-keane","name":"Margaret Keane","cat":"painters","en":"Margaret Keane","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/margaret-keane.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/margaret-keane","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","grain","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","muted-orange","orange","dark-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Margaret Keane is an American artist known for her distinctive paintings of subjects with large, expressive eyes. Her work gained popularity in the 1960s and became emblematic of a unique style that blends elements of kitsch and pop culture.","observation":"The style combines softly painterly, finely rendered portraiture with doll-like faces, oversized glassy eyes, and subdued rosy-beige colors. Close crops, layered figures and cats, delicate linework, and a visible grainy paint texture create a wistful, dreamlike atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"anne-dewailly","name":"Anne Dewailly","cat":"painters","en":"Anne Dewailly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-dewailly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-dewailly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","brown","black","red","deep-red","dark-red"],"intro":"Anne Dewailly is a contemporary artist known for her ethereal and romantic portraiture. Her work often features young women in serene and introspective poses, capturing a sense of calm and beauty.","observation":"The style presents intimate, highly detailed female portraits with softly modelled faces, delicate visible brushwork, and elaborate floral and fabric adornments. Muted cream, blush, charcoal, and deep red tones create a romantic, slightly melancholic atmosphere, while cropped compositions keep the gaze and tactile textiles dominant."},{"id":"isaac-julien","name":"Isaac Julien","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Isaac Julien","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isaac-julien.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isaac-julien","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","dreamy","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-cyan","dark-blue","blue","black","pale-blue"],"intro":"Isaac Julien is a contemporary British artist and filmmaker known for his innovative work in film and video art. His work often explores themes of identity, race, and history, blending elements of documentary and fiction to create visually compelling narratives.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, highly realistic landscape imagery with cool blue grading, deep shadows, and strong contrast. Solitary figures are repeatedly placed against monumental mountains, shorelines, and reflective water, creating a dreamy, enigmatic sense of scale; several views frame the landscapes as large projected or architectural scenes."},{"id":"rob-rogers","name":"Rob Rogers","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rob Rogers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rob-rogers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rob-rogers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","subdued-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","dark-brown","orange","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Rob Rogers is a renowned American editorial cartoonist known for his sharp political satire and commentary. His work often addresses contemporary social and political issues, using humor and caricature to provoke thought and discussion. Rogers's cartoons have been featured in numerous publications, earning him a reputation for his bold and insightful visual critiques.","observation":"The style uses densely detailed comic-book drawing with heavy ink contours, extensive crosshatching, and expressive caricatured figures. Muted blue-grey and ochre colors are punctuated by stark highlights and fiery accents, while turbulent waves, crowds, debris, and architectural fragments create dramatic narrative scenes."},{"id":"erte","name":"Erte","cat":"various-artists","en":"Erte","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erte.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erte","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","patterns","portraits","flat-color","high-contrast","metallic","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","pale-yellow","dark-blue","muted-brown","dark-rust","dark-red"],"intro":"Erte was a Russian-born French artist and designer, known for his influential work in fashion, jewelry, graphic arts, costume, and set design. His full name was Romain de Tirtoff, and he was a prominent figure in the Art Deco movement, celebrated for his elegant and glamorous designs that often featured intricate patterns and luxurious materials.","observation":"Across all four images, stylized female figures are rendered with clean graphic shapes, strong dark outlines, and flat areas of saturated red, blue, black, and cream. Dense beadwork, sequins, metallic accents, feathers, peacock eyes, and repeating dots create an ornate, highly decorative fashion-portrait language."},{"id":"peter-mitchev","name":"Peter Mitchev","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Mitchev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-mitchev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-mitchev","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["beige","muted-brown","charcoal","orange","grey","red"],"intro":"Peter Mitchev is a contemporary artist known for his unique blend of surrealism and fantasy, often incorporating elements of mythology and abstraction into his work. His style is characterized by a painterly approach with detailed and expressive compositions that evoke a sense of mystery and introspection.","observation":"The style combines tightly composed female portraits with angular, interlocking planes and carefully flattened blocks of color. Rich crackled surface texture, fine contouring, decorative clothing and headwear, and selective painterly modelling create an ornate, surreal collage-like finish across all four renders."},{"id":"daniel-f-gerhartz","name":"Daniel F. Gerhartz","cat":"painters","en":"Daniel F. Gerhartz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daniel-f-gerhartz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daniel-f-gerhartz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-brown","dark-brown","ochre","muted-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Daniel F. Gerhartz is an American painter known for his evocative and romantic portrayals of figures, often set against lush natural backdrops. His work is characterized by a classical approach to realism, with a focus on capturing the emotional depth and beauty of his subjects. Gerhartz's paintings are celebrated for their masterful use of light and color, bringing a sense of warmth and intimacy to his compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional paint strokes to build richly textured figures, foliage, fabric, furniture, and flowers. Warm highlights emerge from otherwise deep earthy shadows, while densely arranged social and domestic scenes combine elegant historical clothing with gardens, books, music, and floral detail."},{"id":"phoebe-philo","name":"Phoebe Philo","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Phoebe Philo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/phoebe-philo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/phoebe-philo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","negative-space"],"colours":["black","white","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Phoebe Philo is a renowned British fashion designer known for her influential work at brands like Céline, where she championed minimalist and sophisticated designs. Her approach to fashion has been celebrated for its focus on clean lines, luxurious materials, and a modern aesthetic that resonates with contemporary women.","observation":"A consistent black-and-white studio portrait style uses realistic rendering, stark tonal separation, and restrained gray backdrops with generous negative space. The subjects are posed calmly in sculptural, oversized black garments, producing a bold, minimalist fashion-editorial impression across all four images."},{"id":"alex-pardee","name":"Alex Pardee","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alex Pardee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-pardee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-pardee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["white","red","blue","muted-cyan","light-yellow","charcoal","vivid-red"],"intro":"Alex Pardee is an American artist known for his unique style that blends elements of horror, pop culture, and surrealism. His work often features grotesque and fantastical creatures, characterized by vibrant colors and intricate details. Pardee's art has been influential in various media, including album covers, comics, and films, making him a prominent figure in the contemporary art scene.","observation":"Across all four renders, grotesque creature faces and hybrid monsters are built from saturated rainbow paint, heavy dark outlines, and visibly energetic strokes. Melting drips, splashes, exaggerated mouths, teeth, horns, eyes, and tentacles create a surreal, highly expressive fantasy style with strong contrast against white grounds."},{"id":"thomas-heatherwick","name":"Thomas Heatherwick","cat":"architects","en":"Thomas Heatherwick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-heatherwick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-heatherwick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","urban","subdued-colors","sci-fi","surreal","epic","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","beige","silver","muted-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Thomas Heatherwick is a renowned British designer and architect known for his innovative and imaginative approach to architecture and design. He founded Heatherwick Studio, which has been responsible for a variety of high-profile projects, including the design of the UK Pavilion at the Shanghai Expo 2010 and the new London Routemaster bus. His work often blurs the boundaries between architecture, sculpture, and urban design, emphasizing creativity and sustainability.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic architectural visualizations centered on monumental, biomorphic wooden structures integrated with dense modern cityscapes and greenery. Rich ribbed and layered surfaces make the forms feel sculptural and tactile, while dramatic scale, curved geometry, and surreal futuristic proportions create an imposing civic-fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"billy-childish","name":"Billy Childish","cat":"painters","en":"Billy Childish","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/billy-childish.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/billy-childish","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","dark-olive","grey","charcoal","orange","rust"],"intro":"Billy Childish is a British artist, musician, and writer known for his prolific output and distinctive style. He has been a significant figure in the punk and garage rock scenes and is recognized for his raw, expressive art that often explores themes of identity and emotion. Childish's work spans various mediums, including painting, music, and literature, and he has been associated with movements such as Stuckism.","observation":"Across the sheet, representational landscapes, figures, and animals are rendered with dense, visible brushwork and strongly articulated dark contours. Saturated teal, ochre, coral, and blue-green passages combine with swirling strokes, elongated forms, and richly packed natural details to create an expressive painted surface."},{"id":"george-tooker","name":"George Tooker","cat":"painters","en":"George Tooker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-tooker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-tooker","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["vivid-red","muted-brown","dark-red","brown","deep-red","light-orange"],"intro":"George Tooker is an American painter known for his distinctive style that blends elements of magic realism and social commentary. His work often explores themes of alienation, bureaucracy, and the human condition, using a meticulous technique that combines the precision of Renaissance art with modernist sensibilities. Tooker's paintings frequently depict figures in urban settings, capturing a sense of introspective isolation and quiet tension.","observation":"The style uses tightly packed portrait compositions with carefully modelled faces, strong frontal or side-lit shadows, and recurring red garments that create visual unity. It combines controlled, illustrative forms with visible oil-like surface texture, muted earth tones, and occasional intense red accents."},{"id":"gordon-parks","name":"Gordon Parks","cat":"photographers","en":"Gordon Parks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gordon-parks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gordon-parks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","urban","backlighting","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Gordon Parks is a renowned American photographer, filmmaker, and writer, celebrated for his impactful work in documenting social issues and the African American experience. Born in 1912, Parks became the first African American staff photographer for Life magazine, where he captured powerful images that highlighted racial and economic disparities. His work is characterized by its deep empathy and narrative strength, often focusing on themes of civil rights, poverty, and the human condition.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is stark monochrome photography built around deep shadows, bright window light, and strongly directional contrast. Layered framing through windows, mirrors, furniture, and blurred foregrounds gives the portraits a cinematic, observational atmosphere, with shallow focus and visible grain reinforcing the noir-like mood."},{"id":"antonio-lopez","name":"Antonio Lopez","cat":"illustrators","en":"Antonio Lopez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antonio-lopez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antonio-lopez","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","drawing","ink"],"colours":["beige","black","charcoal","pale-yellow","ochre","vivid-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Antonio Lopez is a renowned fashion illustrator known for his influential work in the 20th century. He was celebrated for his vibrant and dynamic illustrations that captured the essence of fashion and culture. Lopez's work often featured bold colors and expressive lines, making him a pivotal figure in the world of fashion illustration.","observation":"The style combines intensely expressive portraiture with visibly handmade surfaces: broad painted forms, fine drawn marks, charcoal-like linework, and layered collage fragments. Faces are repeatedly cropped, fractured, and overlaid with angular planes and saturated red, teal, black, and ochre accents, producing a tactile, high-contrast surreal effect."},{"id":"jerry-pinkney","name":"Jerry Pinkney","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jerry Pinkney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jerry-pinkney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jerry-pinkney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["rust","black","orange","pale-yellow","dark-brown","beige"],"intro":"Jerry Pinkney is an acclaimed American illustrator known for his rich and detailed illustrations, often focusing on African American themes and stories. His work spans children's literature, where he brings stories to life with vibrant and expressive imagery, earning numerous awards for his contributions to the field.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to build expressive close-up portraits with finely observed faces, curls, fabrics, and floral motifs. Warm saturated colors, delicate linear accents, and tightly cropped overlapping compositions create a dense, illustrative painted surface across the set."},{"id":"kate-spade","name":"Kate Spade","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Kate Spade","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kate-spade.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kate-spade","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","white","pale-red","black","ochre","orange","dark-green"],"intro":"Kate Spade is an iconic American fashion designer known for her vibrant and playful designs, particularly in handbags and accessories. She founded her brand in 1993, which quickly became synonymous with chic and colorful style, appealing to a wide audience with its unique blend of classic elegance and modern flair.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines saturated pinks, reds, blacks, and greens with visible painted brushwork and crisp dark contour lines. It presents glamorous fashion figures and accessories in richly decorated compositions, using floral motifs, polka dots, gold hardware, and expressive surface texture."},{"id":"william-aldophe-bouguereau","name":"William-Aldophe Bouguereau","cat":"painters","en":"William-Aldophe Bouguereau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-aldophe-bouguereau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-aldophe-bouguereau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","cream","grey"],"intro":"William-Aldophe Bouguereau was a French academic painter known for his realistic genre paintings and mythological themes. His work is characterized by a polished technique, idealized figures, and a focus on the human form, often depicting scenes of rural life and classical subjects with a refined elegance.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, softly blended oil-paint rendering with delicate brushwork, carefully modelled skin, and richly articulated folds of fabric. Repeated veiled female figures, intimate maternal poses, subdued tones, and dark or restrained backgrounds create a quiet, emotionally expressive portrait style with classical devotional overtones."},{"id":"jan-toorop","name":"Jan Toorop","cat":"painters","en":"Jan Toorop","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-toorop.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-toorop","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","rust","grey"],"intro":"Jan Toorop was a Dutch-Indonesian painter known for his Symbolist works and contributions to the Art Nouveau movement. Born in 1858, he became a prominent figure in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, blending European and Javanese influences in his art. His work often features intricate patterns, elongated figures, and a mystical atmosphere, reflecting his unique cultural background and artistic vision.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed portraiture with dense ornamental surfaces, flowing textiles, botanical motifs, and tightly controlled fine linework. Visible brush marks and layered color give the figures a painterly presence, while the decorative patterns, restrained earth tones, and occasional saturated accents create a richly embellished classical illustration."},{"id":"peter-halley","name":"Peter Halley","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Peter Halley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-halley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-halley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","illustrative","ornate","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["beige","pink","light-yellow","vivid-orange","blue","green"],"intro":"Peter Halley is an American artist known for his contributions to the Neo-Geo movement in the 1980s. His work often explores themes of geometry, technology, and modern urban life, using bold colors and abstract forms to create a dialogue between architectural spaces and social structures.","observation":"Across all four works, the style uses brightly saturated flat colour arranged into tightly interlocking geometric blocks, with crisp black outlines and repeated stripes, grids, dots, and nested shapes. The compositions are graphic and illustrative, balancing playful decorative patterning with occasional pseudo-architectural depth and surreal spatial constructions."},{"id":"dino-valls","name":"Dino Valls","cat":"painters","en":"Dino Valls","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dino-valls.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dino-valls","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","beige","muted-cyan","ochre","deep-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Dino Valls is a contemporary Spanish painter known for his intricate and psychologically charged portraits. His work often explores themes of identity, emotion, and the human condition, drawing inspiration from historical art movements and classical techniques.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines realistic facial modeling with visible fine painterly strokes and unusually rich surface detail. Pale faces, restrained colors, lace and embroidered clothing, dark hair, and gold decorative surroundings create a formal, antique-looking portrait language with ornate framing and direct, frontal gazes."},{"id":"charles-francois-daubigny","name":"Charles-Francois Daubigny","cat":"painters","en":"Charles-Francois Daubigny","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-francois-daubigny.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-francois-daubigny","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","brown","grey","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Charles-Francois Daubigny was a 19th-century French painter known for his landscape paintings and association with the Barbizon School. His work often depicted serene rural scenes, capturing the natural beauty of the French countryside with a focus on light and atmosphere. Daubigny's influence extended to the Impressionists, as he was one of the early adopters of painting en plein air, directly from nature.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive rural landscapes are built from visible, softly textured brushwork, with carefully observed trees, water, fields, and cloud formations. Muted earth tones and blue-grey skies are repeatedly animated by warm sunset light, reflective surfaces, and an atmospheric, dreamlike sense of depth."},{"id":"tanya-shatseva","name":"Tanya Shatseva","cat":"painters","en":"Tanya Shatseva","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tanya-shatseva.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tanya-shatseva","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","beige","pink","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Tanya Shatseva is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and surrealistic paintings that often explore themes of fantasy and mysticism. Her work is characterized by a unique blend of traditional and digital techniques, resulting in visually striking compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces and figures emerge through dense, highly visible painted strokes, with hair, facial features, and surrounding forms interwoven into the surface. Saturated teal, blue, coral, pink, and orange create an intense, dreamlike effect, while expressive gazes and surreal flowing hair unify the portraits."},{"id":"boris-kustodiev","name":"Boris Kustodiev","cat":"painters","en":"Boris Kustodiev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/boris-kustodiev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/boris-kustodiev","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["light-orange","muted-ochre","charcoal","grey","red","deep-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Boris Kustodiev was a Russian painter and stage designer, known for his vibrant depictions of Russian life and culture during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His works often portrayed festive scenes, traditional costumes, and the rich architectural heritage of Russia, capturing the spirit and atmosphere of his homeland.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, built from visible broad strokes, layered color, and energetic mark-making. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and floral tones depict elegant figures, gardens, architecture, and lively outdoor gatherings with a nostalgic classical-revival atmosphere."},{"id":"alex-maclean","name":"Alex MacLean","cat":"photographers","en":"Alex MacLean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-maclean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-maclean","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","black","brown","dark-red","red","muted-orange"],"intro":"Alex MacLean is an American photographer known for his aerial photography that captures the complex relationship between the natural and built environments. His work often explores themes of urbanization, environmental change, and human impact on the landscape, providing a unique perspective from above.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed, realistic aerial compositions with dense architecture, strong geometric masses, and vivid, carefully contrasted color. Warm directional light, richly varied rooftops, and elevated viewpoints give the scenes a cinematic, expansive quality while preserving readable urban and natural details."},{"id":"james-gunn","name":"James Gunn","cat":"filmmakers","en":"James Gunn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-gunn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-gunn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","dark-blue","silver","ochre"],"intro":"James Gunn is an American filmmaker known for his work in the superhero and sci-fi genres, particularly with films like \"Guardians of the Galaxy.\" His style often blends humor, action, and a strong sense of character development.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic portrait rendering with dense organic textures, sculpted facial forms, and carefully lit character close-ups. Dark earthy palettes are punctuated by saturated teal, red, and amber illumination, with glowing eyes and embers creating strong contrast and a fantastical science-fiction atmosphere."},{"id":"phil-koch","name":"Phil Koch","cat":"photographers","en":"Phil Koch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/phil-koch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/phil-koch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","floral","landscapes","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-red","black","dark-blue","muted-red","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Phil Koch is a photographer known for his captivating landscape photography that often features dramatic skies and vibrant colors. His work captures the beauty of rural and natural settings, emphasizing the grandeur of the environment.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic landscape imagery with intensely saturated reds, blues, oranges, and golds. Dramatic cloud masses, radiant sunbeams, strong light-dark separation, and richly textured fields create an expressive, cinematic-feeling sense of scale and atmosphere."},{"id":"henri-edmond-cross","name":"Henri-Edmond Cross","cat":"painters","en":"Henri-Edmond Cross","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-edmond-cross.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-edmond-cross","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","pale-orange","grey","charcoal","blue","rust"],"intro":"Henri-Edmond Cross was a French painter and a leading figure in the Neo-Impressionist movement. Known for his vibrant landscapes and use of pointillism, Cross's work often depicted idyllic scenes of the French countryside and coastlines. His technique involved placing small dots of color side by side, allowing the viewer's eye to blend them into a cohesive image.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses dense, visible short brush marks and broken color to construct bright coastal landscapes, with strong blues, pinks, creams, and warm oranges. The scenes remain clearly representational and carefully composed, while simplified silhouettes, patterned strokes, and cleanly separated color areas give them an illustrative clarity."},{"id":"zak-noyle","name":"Zak Noyle","cat":"photographers","en":"Zak Noyle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zak-noyle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zak-noyle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["dark-teal","dark-cyan","muted-cyan","brown","silver","orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Zak Noyle is a renowned surf photographer known for capturing the dynamic and vibrant world of surfing. His work often features breathtaking images of surfers riding massive waves, showcasing the beauty and power of the ocean. Noyle's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey the thrill and energy of the surf culture, making him a prominent figure in the field.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and cinematic, using close, immersive viewpoints inside and beneath powerful curling waves. Vivid teal water, bright sunlight, deep shadows, and reflective spray create strong contrast, while crisp surface detail and selective blur heighten the sense of motion and depth."},{"id":"jeffrey-catherine-jones","name":"Jeffrey Catherine Jones","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jeffrey Catherine Jones","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeffrey-catherine-jones.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeffrey-catherine-jones","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","epic","silhouette"],"colours":["black","orange","muted-ochre","bone-white","muted-blue","muted-teal"],"intro":"Jeffrey Catherine Jones is an American artist known for her work in fantasy and science fiction illustration. Her style is often compared to that of fine art painters, blending elements of surrealism and fantasy with a unique, expressive touch. Jones's work has been influential in both the comic book industry and the broader field of illustration, earning her a place among the most respected artists in her genre.","observation":"Across all four images, heavily textured paint and loose, directional brushwork build brooding scenes of cloaked figures and riders against stark terrain. Strong silhouettes, deep blacks, and restrained earth-and-teal colors create an epic, ominous cinematic mood, with wind and atmospheric haze adding movement and scale."},{"id":"takashi-murakami","name":"Takashi Murakami","cat":"various-artists","en":"Takashi Murakami","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/takashi-murakami.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/takashi-murakami","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","characters","floral","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-blue","red","brown","yellow","vivid-red"],"intro":"Takashi Murakami is a renowned Japanese contemporary artist known for his distinctive style that merges traditional Japanese art with modern pop culture. He is the founder of the Superflat movement, which combines elements of fine art and commercial culture. Murakami's work often features bright colors, cartoon-like characters, and a playful yet critical approach to consumerism and popular culture.","observation":"The style combines intensely saturated color, heavy outlined graphic shapes, and flat cartoon-like forms with an extraordinarily dense field of flowers, faces, creatures, and repeated motifs. Across the renders, playful character imagery merges with surreal landscapes and abstract patterning, producing a maximal, collage-like surface packed with visual detail."},{"id":"peter-dombrovskis","name":"Peter Dombrovskis","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Dombrovskis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-dombrovskis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-dombrovskis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","muted-olive","silver"],"intro":"Peter Dombrovskis is a renowned Australian photographer known for his breathtaking landscape photography, particularly of the Tasmanian wilderness. His work played a significant role in the environmental conservation movement in Australia, capturing the beauty and fragility of natural landscapes.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and richly detailed, presenting lush old-growth forests with layered canopies, moss, rocks, streams, and reflective water. Subdued green, blue, and earthy tones are softened by pervasive mist and diffuse luminous light, creating tranquil, atmospheric landscape scenes with selective softness in the distance."},{"id":"wrdsmth","name":"WRDSMTH","cat":"street-artists","en":"WRDSMTH","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wrdsmth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wrdsmth","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","urban","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","collage"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","muted-ochre","red","blue"],"intro":"WRDSMTH is a contemporary street artist known for his thought-provoking and emotive text-based artworks. His works often combine poignant phrases with visual elements, creating a unique blend of street art that resonates with urban audiences. WRDSMTH's art is characterized by its bold use of typography and its ability to convey deep emotions and narratives through simple yet powerful imagery.","observation":"The style combines heavily textured, hand-painted mural surfaces with graphic illustration, thick black contours, distressed paper, and layered poster-like collage elements. Across the scenes, saturated red, black, cream, and grey dominate, with expressive marks, paint drips, newspaper text, and urban wall settings creating a rough retro street-art character."},{"id":"malcolm-teasdale","name":"Malcolm Teasdale","cat":"painters","en":"Malcolm Teasdale","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/malcolm-teasdale.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/malcolm-teasdale","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","muted-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Malcolm Teasdale is a contemporary artist known for his evocative urban landscapes and cityscapes. His work often captures the essence of city life, focusing on the interplay of light and shadow in urban settings. Teasdale's paintings are characterized by their detailed brushwork and textured surfaces, often depicting scenes of everyday life in bustling cities.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents atmospheric urban streets and rooftops through visibly textured, broad paint strokes, dense architectural detail, and expressive handling. A subdued, moody palette of charcoal, brown, gray, and cream is punctuated by window light and red garments, with wet pavement, rain, snow, and haze reinforcing the dark wintry mood."},{"id":"sam-guay","name":"Sam Guay","cat":"painters","en":"Sam Guay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sam-guay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sam-guay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","floral","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","grey","pale-orange","red"],"intro":"Sam Guay is an artist known for creating intricate and ethereal works that often explore themes of fantasy and mythology. Their art is characterized by a blend of traditional and digital techniques, resulting in detailed and expressive compositions that captivate the viewer.","observation":"Across the sheet, densely layered female figures, animals, foliage, and floral forms are rendered with crisp, fine contour lines and intricate ornamental surface detail. The earthy, autumnal palette combines muted blue-greys and browns with concentrated reds, while stark dark shapes and luminous pale areas create a dramatic, fantastical atmosphere."},{"id":"robert-frank","name":"Robert Frank","cat":"photographers","en":"Robert Frank","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-frank.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-frank","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Robert Frank is a renowned Swiss-American photographer and filmmaker, best known for his book \"The Americans,\" which offers a profound and critical view of American society in the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by its candid and unorthodox style, capturing the raw and often overlooked aspects of everyday life.","observation":"The style is stark black-and-white documentary photography, built around candid human encounters framed through automobile windows. Strong tonal contrast, visible film grain, selective focus, reflective glass, and tightly cropped compositions create an intimate, observational, retro-cinematic mood."},{"id":"marc-davis","name":"Marc Davis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marc Davis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-davis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-davis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","light-orange","muted-ochre","black"],"intro":"Marc Davis is a renowned American animator and one of Disney's original \"Nine Old Men,\" known for his work on classic animated films such as \"Cinderella,\" \"Sleeping Beauty,\" and \"101 Dalmatians.\" His contributions to character design and animation have left a lasting impact on the industry, making him a pivotal figure in the history of animation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive pen-and-ink drawing with fine contours, crosshatched shadows, and dense hand-rendered texture on warm parchment-like grounds. It combines exaggerated creature and character designs with subdued sepia coloring, giving the fantastical scenes a detailed, whimsical storybook quality."},{"id":"elina-brotherus","name":"Elina Brotherus","cat":"photographers","en":"Elina Brotherus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elina-brotherus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elina-brotherus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["dark-green","brown","black","beige","dark-brown","white"],"intro":"Elina Brotherus is a Finnish photographer known for her introspective and contemplative self-portraits. Her work often explores themes of identity, solitude, and the relationship between the individual and the environment. Brotherus's photography is characterized by its serene and nostalgic atmosphere, often incorporating elements of nature and art history.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic photography with expressive staged tableaux, moody green-and-brown interiors, and sharply controlled contrast. Period garments, decaying architectural details, dramatic gestures, and selective close focus create an eerie, emotionally charged visual narrative."},{"id":"miss-aniela","name":"Miss Aniela","cat":"photographers","en":"Miss Aniela","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/miss-aniela.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/miss-aniela","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","classical","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-green","dark-teal","brown","silver","rust"],"intro":"Miss Aniela is a contemporary photographer known for her surreal and fantastical imagery. Her work often blends elements of fashion, fine art, and digital manipulation to create dreamlike scenes that challenge the boundaries between reality and imagination.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic tableaux set in lavish historical interiors, with dense ornament, elaborate fabrics, mirrors, chandeliers, floral decoration, and dramatic architectural framing. Deep teal and red dominate the moody palette, while strong window light and shadow create a dreamy, theatrical atmosphere around elegantly posed figures."},{"id":"amanda-sage","name":"Amanda Sage","cat":"painters","en":"Amanda Sage","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amanda-sage.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amanda-sage","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-blue","dark-red","rust","yellow","muted-olive"],"intro":"Amanda Sage is a contemporary visionary artist known for her intricate and detailed paintings that often explore themes of spirituality and consciousness. Her work is characterized by a unique blend of surrealism and fantasy, often incorporating vibrant colors and complex patterns. Sage's art invites viewers into a world of introspection and mystical exploration, reflecting her deep interest in the interconnectedness of life.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed botanical forms with expressive human faces, fusing skin, leaves, veins, tendrils, and floral structures into dense organic compositions. Saturated orange, purple, teal, and green hues, crisp fine linework, and decorative surface patterning create an ornate, surreal fantasy illustration language."},{"id":"john-gould","name":"John Gould","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Gould","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-gould.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-gould","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","floral","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","dark-olive","charcoal","brown"],"intro":"John Gould was a renowned 19th-century English ornithologist and bird artist known for his extensive work in documenting bird species. His illustrations are celebrated for their scientific accuracy and artistic beauty, contributing significantly to the field of ornithology. Gould's work is characterized by detailed depictions of birds, often set against lush, natural backgrounds, reflecting both his scientific interests and artistic talents.","observation":"The style combines finely observed, realistic bird forms with delicate drawn contours and visible fine brushwork. Richly detailed plumage and botanical surroundings are rendered in a softly muted cream-and-green setting, punctuated by saturated blue, red, and orange feathers and arranged like elegant natural-history illustrations."},{"id":"marcel-mouly","name":"Marcel Mouly","cat":"painters","en":"Marcel Mouly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marcel-mouly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marcel-mouly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","blue","muted-cyan","red","pink","teal"],"intro":"Marcel Mouly is a renowned French painter known for his vibrant use of color and dynamic compositions. Born in 1918, Mouly's work is often associated with the Fauvist and Cubist movements, reflecting a bold and expressive style that captures the essence of modern European life. His paintings are celebrated for their vivid color palettes and energetic brushwork, making him a significant figure in 20th-century art.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable interiors, streets, boats, figures, and objects are reduced to angular blocks and energetic painted marks. The style relies on highly saturated complementary colors, deep dark accents, thick contour-like strokes, and broad visible brushwork, creating vivid, dynamic scenes with a graphic illustrative structure."},{"id":"jan-mankes","name":"Jan Mankes","cat":"painters","en":"Jan Mankes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-mankes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-mankes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["brown","grey","black","light-yellow","ochre"],"intro":"Jan Mankes was a Dutch painter known for his serene and introspective works, often depicting quiet domestic scenes and nature. Born in 1889, Mankes's art is characterized by its delicate brushwork and subtle use of color, creating a sense of tranquility and introspection. His works are considered part of the Symbolist movement, and he is often noted for his ability to convey deep emotion through minimalistic compositions.","observation":"The style uses subdued, moody oil-paint surfaces with visible fine brushwork, textured grounds, restrained contrast, and carefully rendered faces and clothing. It repeatedly places pale, solemn figures in sparse, uncanny vignettes, using stark black garments, bare branches, flowers, and isolated architectural spaces to create a quiet, melancholic surrealism."},{"id":"yang-yongliang","name":"Yang Yongliang","cat":"painters","en":"Yang Yongliang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yang-yongliang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yang-yongliang","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","black","silver","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Yang Yongliang is a contemporary Chinese artist known for his innovative digital artworks that blend traditional Chinese aesthetics with modern techniques. His work often explores themes of urbanization and environmental change, using digital manipulation to create intricate and surreal landscapes that reflect both ancient and contemporary influences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents vast monochrome mountain landscapes with towering, sharply articulated rock pillars, tiny settlements, trees, waterfalls, and layered atmospheric clouds. Strong tonal contrast and dense environmental detail are softened by pervasive mist, creating an otherworldly, dreamlike landscape illustration."},{"id":"david-salle","name":"David Salle","cat":"printmakers","en":"David Salle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-salle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-salle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","still-life","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["grey","muted-ochre","charcoal","pale-orange","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"David Salle is an American painter and printmaker known for his postmodern approach, blending various styles and media to create complex, layered works. He emerged in the 1980s as a significant figure in the Neo-Expressionist movement, often incorporating elements of popular culture, art history, and personal imagery into his paintings.","observation":"Across the sheet, recognizable faces, objects, plants, and vehicles are fractured into energetic, overlapping planes with heavy drawn contours. Broad visible brushwork, scraped textures, vivid orange, teal, pink, blue, and red accents, and collage-like paneling create a dense, expressive illustrative surface."},{"id":"kylli-sparre","name":"Kylli Sparre","cat":"photographers","en":"Kylli Sparre","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kylli-sparre.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kylli-sparre","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","charcoal","black","grey","brown"],"intro":"Kylli Sparre is an Estonian photographer known for her ethereal and surreal imagery that often explores themes of nature and introspection. Her work is characterized by a dreamlike quality, blending reality with fantasy, and often features solitary figures in expansive landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic photographic compositions with muted, dark tones, soft atmospheric haze, and isolated figures set against expansive natural environments. Movement from birds, wind, water, and fabric combines with dreamlike, surreal imagery while retaining convincing photographic texture and shallow focus."},{"id":"tara-donovan","name":"Tara Donovan","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tara Donovan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tara-donovan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tara-donovan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","minimalist","sculptural","landscapes","patterns","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","silver","brown","white"],"intro":"Tara Donovan is an American artist known for her innovative use of everyday materials to create large-scale sculptures and installations. Her work often explores the intersection of art and nature, using items like plastic cups, pencils, and buttons to form intricate, organic structures that transform spaces and challenge perceptions of materiality.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style turns an airy gallery into a monochromatic sculptural environment of cascading strands, rippled textile-like terrain, and pleated floral forms. Fine linear textures and densely layered surfaces create tactile detail while restrained ivory tones, spacious compositions, and soft daylight keep the overall effect quiet, dreamy, and surreal."},{"id":"norman-ackroyd","name":"Norman Ackroyd","cat":"painters","en":"Norman Ackroyd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norman-ackroyd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norman-ackroyd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","landscapes","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","grain","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["beige","black","charcoal","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Norman Ackroyd is a renowned British artist known for his mastery in etching and aquatint. Born in 1938, Ackroyd has gained acclaim for his evocative landscape prints, often depicting the rugged coastlines and remote islands of the British Isles. His work is characterized by a deep appreciation for nature's power and beauty, rendered with meticulous detail and a dramatic sense of light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four images, towering coastal cliffs and small boats emerge from turbulent water in a restrained near-monochrome palette. Broad, visibly worked strokes, grainy tonal texture, dramatic light-dark separation, and atmospheric haze give the seascapes an expressive, bleak, ink-wash-like character."},{"id":"helmut-lang","name":"Helmut Lang","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Helmut Lang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helmut-lang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helmut-lang","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Helmut Lang is an Austrian fashion designer known for his minimalist and deconstructivist approach to fashion. He gained prominence in the 1990s for his innovative use of materials and clean lines, influencing the fashion industry with his avant-garde designs. Lang's work often features a monochromatic palette and a focus on structure and form.","observation":"The style is realistic, editorial fashion photography with highly textured garments, oversized silhouettes, and experimental fringe contrasted with sharply tailored pieces. A restrained white, grey, and black palette, gallery-like interiors, crisp modeling, and occasional strong tonal contrast give the images a severe, sculptural presentation."},{"id":"alexandr-averin","name":"Alexandr Averin","cat":"painters","en":"Alexandr Averin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexandr-averin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexandr-averin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","dark-olive","muted-ochre","dark-brown","charcoal","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Alexandr Averin is a Russian painter known for his impressionistic style, focusing on serene and romantic scenes often depicting young women in natural settings. His works are characterized by their soft color palettes and delicate brushwork, capturing the essence of leisure and beauty.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, luminous highlights, and layered color shaping faces, fabric, water, and flowers. It consistently presents romantic female figures in elaborate outdoor or interior garden settings, combining detailed floral surroundings with expressive, sunlit atmosphere and elegant clothing."},{"id":"charles-maurice-detmold","name":"Charles Maurice Detmold","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Maurice Detmold","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-maurice-detmold.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-maurice-detmold","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","muted-brown","muted-orange","orange","white"],"intro":"Charles Maurice Detmold is known for his intricate and imaginative illustrations, often depicting nature and animals with a fantastical twist. His work is characterized by detailed line work and a delicate use of color, creating scenes that are both realistic and dreamlike. Detmold's illustrations often feature elements of fantasy and whimsy, drawing inspiration from the natural world and mythology.","observation":"These images combine richly visible brushwork with fine drawn contours, dense botanical ornament, and carefully rendered animals. Saturated reds, creams, blues, and greens shift into darker atmospheric scenes while maintaining an ornate, storybook-like fantasy character."},{"id":"fritz-lang","name":"Fritz Lang","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Fritz Lang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fritz-lang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fritz-lang","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","sci-fi","dark","epic"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","silver","white"],"intro":"Fritz Lang was a pioneering Austrian-German filmmaker known for his influential work in the early 20th century, particularly in the genres of expressionism and film noir. His notable films include \"Metropolis\" and \"M,\" which are celebrated for their innovative use of visuals and thematic depth. Lang's work often explored themes of fate, identity, and the human psyche, leaving a lasting impact on the cinematic landscape.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome, highly cinematic and realistic, with monumental ruined architecture, small silhouetted figures, and dense industrial detail. Stark blacks against blown shafts of light, mist-filled air, reflective surfaces and immense scale create a bleak, epic science-fiction atmosphere."},{"id":"retna","name":"Retna","cat":"street-artists","en":"Retna","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/retna.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/retna","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","letters","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","beige","white","vivid-red"],"intro":"Retna is an American street artist known for his distinctive calligraphic style that blends various cultural scripts and urban influences. His work often features a unique alphabet, drawing from hieroglyphics, Arabic, Hebrew, and Asian calligraphy, creating a visually striking fusion of text and imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense abstract glyphs and pseudo-letterforms with stark geometric organization, heavy outlines, and forceful black-and-white contrast accented by red. Broad, visibly dragged brush marks, drips, scuffs, and uneven painted surfaces give the otherwise flat, poster-like blocks an expressive, distressed character."},{"id":"donato-giancola","name":"Donato Giancola","cat":"illustrators","en":"Donato Giancola","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/donato-giancola.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/donato-giancola","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","ochre","pale-yellow","rust"],"intro":"Donato Giancola is a contemporary American artist known for his work in the fantasy genre. He is celebrated for his ability to blend classical techniques with modern themes, creating detailed and immersive illustrations that often draw from historical and mythological sources.","observation":"Across all four renders, expressive close-up figures are built from visible, layered brushwork, with richly textured fabrics, hair, skin, and fantastical forms. Dark backgrounds, warm ochre highlights, cool accents, and strong illumination create a moody, dreamlike portrait style with dense surface detail."},{"id":"francis-manapul","name":"Francis Manapul","cat":"illustrators","en":"Francis Manapul","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francis-manapul.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francis-manapul","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing"],"colours":["black","cream","red","orange","dark-brown","grey"],"intro":"Francis Manapul is a renowned comic book artist and writer known for his work with major comic publishers. His style is characterized by dynamic compositions, vibrant colors, and a strong sense of motion, often featuring iconic superhero characters.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines expressive portrait drawing with visible, energetic brushwork, fine linear accents, and layered painterly texture. Saturated reds, greens, blues, and oranges are set against pale grounds with strong dark-light separation, while tightly cropped faces and overlapping figures create an intense editorial character-study effect."},{"id":"franklin-carmichael","name":"Franklin Carmichael","cat":"painters","en":"Franklin Carmichael","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/franklin-carmichael.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/franklin-carmichael","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-ochre","charcoal","pale-yellow","muted-blue","silver","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Franklin Carmichael was a Canadian artist and a founding member of the Group of Seven, known for his vibrant depictions of the Canadian landscape. His work often focused on the natural beauty of Ontario, capturing the essence of the wilderness with expressive color and form.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, broad paint strokes to construct richly layered mountain and forest landscapes. Saturated blues, greens, ochres, and oranges create expressive contrast, while dense tree, rock, cloud, and terrain marks give the scenes a detailed, tactile surface."},{"id":"todd-hido","name":"Todd Hido","cat":"photographers","en":"Todd Hido","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/todd-hido.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/todd-hido","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-teal","dark-cyan","brown","muted-cyan","ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Todd Hido is an American contemporary photographer known for his evocative and atmospheric images, often capturing suburban landscapes and interiors. His work frequently explores themes of isolation and introspection, using natural lighting and long exposures to create a distinctive mood.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic, realistic night photography with a strongly teal-and-amber palette, deep shadows, and isolated pools of warm artificial light. Fog softens the rural roadside houses, utility poles, trees, and older cars, creating a quiet, bleak, retro small-town atmosphere."},{"id":"andrew-robinson","name":"Andrew Robinson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Andrew Robinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrew-robinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrew-robinson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","pale-yellow","brown","ochre","red"],"intro":"Andrew Robinson is a contemporary illustrator known for his work in graphic novels and fantasy art. His style often blends elements of surrealism and fantasy, creating visually compelling narratives that are rich in detail and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily visible, directional brushwork and rough, layered paint texture to build expressive character portraits and narrative figures. Dark costumes and deep shadows are set against pale cream grounds with restrained rust-red accents, producing a stark, somber atmosphere and strongly modelled faces."},{"id":"james-welling","name":"James Welling","cat":"various-artists","en":"James Welling","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-welling.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-welling","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","floral","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","vivid-red","orange","muted-green","brown","dark-green","magenta","blue"],"intro":"James Welling is an American artist known for his innovative approach to photography and his exploration of color, light, and abstraction. His work often blurs the boundaries between photography and other art forms, creating visually striking and thought-provoking pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, flowers dissolve into luminous, translucent layers with visible painted strokes and softened, bleeding edges. Saturated reds, oranges, pinks, blues, and greens create an expressive floral abstraction, while overlapping blooms and ghosted forms produce a dreamy, glowing atmosphere."},{"id":"berthe-morisot","name":"Berthe Morisot","cat":"painters","en":"Berthe Morisot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/berthe-morisot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/berthe-morisot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","beige","pale-orange","ochre","dark-brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Berthe Morisot was a prominent French Impressionist painter, known for her delicate and intimate portrayals of domestic life and landscapes. She was one of the few women in the Impressionist movement and played a significant role in its development. Her work is characterized by a light touch and a focus on capturing fleeting moments, often depicting women and children in everyday settings.","observation":"Across the sheet, figures and domestic moments are rendered with clearly visible, directional paint strokes and a richly built-up surface. The subdued warm palette, softened edges, layered clothing, and intimate groupings create expressive portrait scenes with abundant material detail."},{"id":"paulus-potter","name":"Paulus Potter","cat":"painters","en":"Paulus Potter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paulus-potter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paulus-potter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","beige","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Paulus Potter was a Dutch painter known for his detailed depictions of animals and rural landscapes during the Dutch Golden Age. Born in 1625, Potter became renowned for his ability to capture the essence of pastoral life, often focusing on the harmonious relationship between animals and their natural surroundings. His works are celebrated for their realistic portrayal and intricate detail, contributing significantly to the genre of landscape painting in the 17th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modelled, realistic oil-paint handling with visible fine brushwork, layered textures, and an aged craquelured surface. Subdued earth tones, warm highlights, deep shadows, dramatic skies, and carefully staged rural or architectural scenes give the images a classical, atmospheric grandeur."},{"id":"nina-chanel-abney","name":"Nina Chanel Abney","cat":"painters","en":"Nina Chanel Abney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nina-chanel-abney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nina-chanel-abney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","deep-blue","bone-white","vivid-orange","red","green"],"intro":"Nina Chanel Abney is a contemporary American artist known for her vibrant and bold paintings that explore themes of race, gender, and politics. Her work often features a mix of abstraction and figuration, using bright colors and geometric shapes to create dynamic compositions. Abney's art is celebrated for its ability to address complex social issues with a playful yet poignant approach.","observation":"The style combines visibly brush-textured paint with graphic, clean-edged shapes, heavy outlines, and strongly geometric color blocking. Saturated oranges, pinks, blues, greens, and reds create high contrast across expressive portraits and character scenes, often layered with patterned clothing, plants, instruments, and abstract backgrounds."},{"id":"anni-albers","name":"Anni Albers","cat":"printmakers","en":"Anni Albers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anni-albers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anni-albers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","pale-yellow","beige","brown","dark-red","silver"],"intro":"Anni Albers was a renowned textile artist and printmaker, known for her innovative work in weaving and design. Born in Germany, she became a pivotal figure in the Bauhaus movement, blending traditional craft with modernist principles. Her work is celebrated for its intricate patterns, geometric forms, and exploration of color and texture.","observation":"The style presents tightly framed textile studies with strongly geometric stripes, grids, diamonds, and irregular block patterns. Saturated rust, cream, charcoal, and blue-gray yarns are rendered with crisp graphic organization while highly visible fibers and woven relief provide tactile dimensionality."},{"id":"bernardo-bellotto","name":"Bernardo Bellotto","cat":"painters","en":"Bernardo Bellotto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bernardo-bellotto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bernardo-bellotto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","scenes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-blue","brown","black","silver","muted-ochre","muted-orange"],"intro":"Bernardo Bellotto is a renowned Italian painter and printmaker, known for his detailed and realistic landscapes and cityscapes. Born in 1722, Bellotto was a nephew and pupil of the famous Canaletto , and he carried on the tradition of creating vedute, or detailed paintings of city views. His works are characterized by their precision, atmospheric clarity, and masterful use of perspective.","observation":"The style presents expansive architectural cityscapes and waterfront views with densely rendered Baroque buildings, domes, towers, statues, and small period-dressed figures. Visible brush texture, softened atmospheric distance, warm stone, subdued earth tones, and luminous blue skies give the scenes a richly painted, historical illustration quality."},{"id":"utagawa-kunisada","name":"Utagawa Kunisada","cat":"printmakers","en":"Utagawa Kunisada","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/utagawa-kunisada.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/utagawa-kunisada","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["black","light-orange","charcoal","red","dark-brown","grey"],"intro":"Utagawa Kunisada was a prominent Japanese ukiyo-e artist of the Edo period, known for his vibrant and detailed woodblock prints. He was one of the most popular and prolific artists of his time, specializing in portraits of kabuki actors, beautiful women, and scenes from Japanese folklore and history.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic flat-color shapes, assertive ink outlines, and densely patterned surfaces in a richly layered woodblock-like composition. Saturated vermilion, turquoise, cream, and black create strong contrast around stylized faces, costumes, animals, waves, and decorative motifs."},{"id":"jaehyo-lee","name":"Jaehyo Lee","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jaehyo Lee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jaehyo-lee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jaehyo-lee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","grey","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Jaehyo Lee is a South Korean sculptor known for his innovative use of natural materials, particularly wood, to create large-scale, intricate sculptures that often explore the relationship between nature and form. His work is characterized by its organic shapes and meticulous craftsmanship, reflecting a deep connection to the natural world.","observation":"The style presents large, tactile wooden sculptures with highly legible grain, cut ends, hollow forms, and assembled log structures. They are rendered realistically in softly lit gallery interiors, using subdued earthy browns and strong volumetric detail to emphasize material weight, craftsmanship, and scale."},{"id":"alfred-hitchcock","name":"Alfred Hitchcock","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Alfred Hitchcock","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-hitchcock.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-hitchcock","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","red","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Alfred Hitchcock was a renowned British filmmaker known for his mastery of suspense and psychological thrillers. He directed numerous iconic films such as \"Psycho,\" \"Vertigo,\" and \"The Birds,\" which have left a lasting impact on the film industry. Hitchcock's work is characterized by its innovative use of camera angles, lighting, and narrative techniques to create tension and intrigue.","observation":"The style combines stark, high-contrast monochrome portraiture with heavily modelled faces, dark suits, and ravens, while one variation shifts into saturated red and green paint. Across the sheet, expressive distortions, close cropping, visible brush texture, and theatrical shadow make the imagery feel ominous and psychologically charged."},{"id":"arthur-melville","name":"Arthur Melville","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur Melville","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-melville.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-melville","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","dark-blue","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Arthur Melville is a Scottish painter known for his innovative watercolor techniques and vibrant use of color. He was a key figure in the development of the Glasgow Boys, a group of influential artists in the late 19th century. Melville's work often depicted exotic and atmospheric scenes, drawing inspiration from his travels across Europe and the Middle East.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly worked paint with broad, broken strokes, rough texture, and expressive edge handling. Dark figures and architecture are set against moody blue, gray, and earthen palettes, with selective warm illumination creating strongly contrasted, atmospheric narrative scenes."},{"id":"steven-spielberg","name":"Steven Spielberg","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Steven Spielberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steven-spielberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steven-spielberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi"],"colours":["grey","brown","black","bone-white","ochre","red"],"intro":"Steven Spielberg is a renowned American filmmaker known for his influential works in the film industry. He has directed numerous iconic movies, including 'Jaws,' 'E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial,' ' Jurassic Park ,' and 'Schindler's List.' Spielberg's films often explore themes of adventure, fantasy, and the human experience, making him one of the most successful and respected directors in Hollywood.","observation":"The style presents photorealistic, cinematic adventure scenes with strong narrative staging, expressive faces and large-scale environmental threats. Moody blue, brown and green grading, glowing practical lights, mist, rain and atmospheric haze create high-contrast film-still drama across both intimate character moments and sweeping landscapes."},{"id":"georges-braque","name":"Georges Braque","cat":"painters","en":"Georges Braque","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-braque.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-braque","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","still-life","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["pale-orange","black","beige","dark-brown","ochre","grey"],"intro":"Georges Braque was a French painter and sculptor who played a pivotal role in the development of Cubism alongside Pablo Picasso. Born in 1882, Braque's work is characterized by its focus on fragmented forms and the exploration of perspective, which challenged traditional representations in art.","observation":"Across all four panels, recognizable still-life objects, birds, flowers, and instruments are broken into angular overlapping planes and compressed into dense arrangements. Thick, visible paint strokes and built-up texture give the images a tactile handmade surface, while a restrained palette of cream, black, gray, blue, ochre, and orange unifies the varied subjects."},{"id":"gertrude-jekyll","name":"Gertrude Jekyll","cat":"designers","en":"Gertrude Jekyll","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gertrude-jekyll.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gertrude-jekyll","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-olive","beige","olive","muted-blue","pink"],"intro":"Gertrude Jekyll was a renowned British horticulturist and garden designer, known for her influential work in garden design during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. She collaborated with architect Edwin Lutyens and was a key figure in the Arts and Crafts movement, emphasizing natural beauty and harmonious planting.","observation":"The style consistently presents lush cottage-garden landscapes densely packed with flowering plants, using vivid pinks, blues, greens, and warm sunlight. Some views retain a soft, photographic depth while others translate the same subject into visible, directional brushwork, giving the set a richly textured and dreamy garden-painting character."},{"id":"jacques-amans","name":"Jacques Amans","cat":"painters","en":"Jacques Amans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacques-amans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacques-amans","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","silver","charcoal","dark-red"],"intro":"Jacques Amans was a French portrait painter known for his work in the 19th century, particularly in New Orleans. His style is characterized by detailed and realistic portrayals, often capturing the elegance and sophistication of his subjects. Amans's work is noted for its classical composition and refined technique, making him a prominent figure in the art scene of his time.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly portraiture with theatrical costume design, dense ornament, and carefully staged interiors. Deep greens, blacks, reds, and ivory create a subdued, moody palette, while strong light-dark separation gives the figures and fabrics a dramatic classical presence."},{"id":"edwin-austin-abbey","name":"Edwin Austin Abbey","cat":"painters","en":"Edwin Austin Abbey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edwin-austin-abbey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edwin-austin-abbey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","deep-red","dark-red"],"intro":"Edwin Austin Abbey was an American artist known for his illustrations and paintings, particularly those depicting Shakespearean and Victorian subjects. Born in 1852, Abbey's work is characterized by its historical accuracy, detailed compositions, and dramatic use of light and shadow. He was a prominent figure in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, contributing significantly to the art of book illustration and mural painting.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly layered oil-paint texture, fine controlled brushwork, and dense detail to depict elegantly dressed figures in richly decorated interiors. Deep shadows and subdued, earthy colors are punctuated by dramatic reds and whites, with ornamental clothing, architecture, and theatrical social scenes creating a refined classical mood."},{"id":"thomas-nast","name":"Thomas Nast","cat":"illustrators","en":"Thomas Nast","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-nast.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-nast","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","drawing","ink"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","bone-white"],"intro":"Thomas Nast was a German-born American caricaturist and editorial cartoonist often considered the \"Father of the American Cartoon.\" He was influential in shaping public opinion during the 19th century, particularly through his work with Harper's Weekly. Nast is known for his satirical and political cartoons that addressed issues such as corruption, slavery, and civil rights, and he is credited with creating the modern image of Santa Claus and popularizing the symbols of the Republican elephant and Democratic donkey.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense black-and-white engraved drawing with fine contour lines, crosshatched shadows, and strongly modeled faces and clothing. Crowded social scenes combine human and animal-headed characters in expressive, satirical tableaux, with high contrast and abundant small details."},{"id":"paul-kaptein","name":"Paul Kaptein","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Paul Kaptein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-kaptein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-kaptein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","muted-ochre","muted-brown","bone-white","muted-orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Paul Kaptein is an Australian sculptor known for his intricate wood carvings that explore themes of time, space, and identity. His works often feature distorted human forms, creating a dialogue between the physical and the metaphysical.","observation":"Across all four renders, human busts and faces are presented as highly dimensional carved forms, with visible wood grain running through the skin and elaborate draped fabric. The restrained ivory and peach palette, soft studio lighting, close cropping, and flowing layered folds create a refined, dreamlike sculptural style."},{"id":"david-sims","name":"David Sims","cat":"photographers","en":"David Sims","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-sims.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-sims","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"David Sims is a renowned British fashion photographer known for his influential work in the fashion industry. His photography is characterized by a stark, minimalist style and often features high-profile fashion models and celebrities. Sims's work has been featured in numerous prestigious fashion magazines and campaigns, making him a significant figure in contemporary fashion photography.","observation":"A stark monochrome portrait style built around close-up faces, black garments, windblown hair, and strongly directional shadows. High contrast, restrained backgrounds, visible grain, and selective focus create an austere, cinematic fashion-editorial mood."},{"id":"charles-wysocki","name":"Charles Wysocki","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Wysocki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-wysocki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-wysocki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","rust","brown","muted-brown","silver","pale-orange"],"intro":"Charles Wysocki is an American painter known for his distinctive folk art style that captures the charm and simplicity of rural American life. His works often depict idyllic scenes filled with quaint buildings, bustling towns, and pastoral landscapes, reflecting a nostalgic view of 19th-century America. Wysocki's art is celebrated for its detailed and whimsical portrayal of Americana, characterized by warm tones and a rich narrative quality.","observation":"A richly detailed, painterly yet clearly representational style depicts expansive New England townscapes with layered hills, dense autumn trees, historic houses, waterways, and everyday activity. Fine architectural details, crisp linear accents, warm saturated foliage, and carefully arranged panoramic scenes give the images an illustrative realism with a nostalgic classical character."},{"id":"georges-seurat","name":"Georges Seurat","cat":"painters","en":"Georges Seurat","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-seurat.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-seurat","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","dark-green","grey","charcoal","black","muted-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Georges Seurat was a French post-impressionist painter known for pioneering the technique of pointillism. Born in 1859, he developed a unique style characterized by the meticulous application of small dots of color, which blend at a distance to create luminous and vibrant scenes. His most famous work, \"A Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte,\" exemplifies his innovative approach to color and light.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses dense, visible dabs of paint to build foliage, water, figures, and light through broken color rather than smooth blending. It combines carefully arranged outdoor vignettes with small, simplified people and strong atmospheric depth, producing a vivid yet softly shimmering surface."},{"id":"michael-kors","name":"Michael Kors","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Michael Kors","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-kors.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-kors","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","muted-orange","ochre","dark-brown","white","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Michael Kors is an American fashion designer known for his luxury sportswear and accessories. He founded his brand in 1981 and gained fame for his chic and sophisticated style, often seen on celebrities and fashion enthusiasts worldwide. Kors's designs are characterized by their timeless elegance, practicality, and luxurious appeal, making them a staple in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style combines polished fashion photography with editorial fashion illustration, presenting sharply styled models, garments, and accessories through confident, high-contrast compositions. Neutral and dark palettes, dramatic lighting, shallow focus, close cropping, and luxurious material textures give the images a glossy, cinematic fashion-editorial character."},{"id":"emile-claus","name":"Emile Claus","cat":"painters","en":"Emile Claus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emile-claus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emile-claus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","bone-white","muted-ochre","dark-olive","silver"],"intro":"Emile Claus was a Belgian painter known for his vibrant and luminous landscapes, often associated with the Luminism movement. Born in 1849, Claus became a prominent figure in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, celebrated for his ability to capture the essence of light and atmosphere in rural settings. His work is characterized by a focus on natural beauty and a keen attention to detail, reflecting the tranquility and harmony of the countryside.","observation":"These landscapes use visible, broken brushwork and fine layered strokes to describe trees, water, cottages, and flowering fields with a richly painterly surface. Soft sunlight, reflective water, atmospheric distance, and gentle haze unify the scenes in a luminous, restrained pastoral style."},{"id":"philip-pearlstein","name":"Philip Pearlstein","cat":"painters","en":"Philip Pearlstein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philip-pearlstein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philip-pearlstein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-orange","beige","dark-brown","ochre","brown"],"intro":"Philip Pearlstein is an American painter known for his modern realist style, particularly his nude figure paintings. Born in 1924, Pearlstein's work is characterized by its detailed and unidealized depiction of the human form, often focusing on the interplay of light and shadow on skin. His approach to realism has been influential in the development of contemporary figurative painting.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable people are depicted with convincing anatomy and carefully observed facial features, clothing, and surroundings. Visible directional brushwork and layered, broken paint marks give the portraits a tactile, painterly surface, while warm subdued earth tones and natural window light unify the intimate studio and vehicle settings."},{"id":"revok","name":"Revok","cat":"street-artists","en":"Revok","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/revok.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/revok","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","realistic","patterns","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","blue","bone-white","charcoal","vivid-red","light-yellow","green"],"intro":"Revok is a prominent street artist known for his innovative and bold geometric designs. Emerging from the vibrant street art scene in Los Angeles, Revok has made significant contributions to the evolution of graffiti, blending traditional techniques with modern aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, vivid geometric murals cover urban brick and concrete walls in dense arrangements of overlapping shapes, patterns, and bold outlined forms. The style combines flat, clean-edged color fields with expressive painted marks and occasional figurative fragments, presented as realistic street-level scenes."},{"id":"christopher-wren","name":"Christopher Wren","cat":"architects","en":"Christopher Wren","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christopher-wren.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christopher-wren","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","silver","grey","dark-brown","muted-orange","orange"],"intro":"Christopher Wren was a renowned English architect of the 17th century, celebrated for his role in rebuilding London after the Great Fire of 1666. He is best known for designing St. Paul's Cathedral and numerous other churches and buildings in London, showcasing a blend of classical and baroque architectural styles.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental domes and historic urban architecture are built from visible, broad, gestural paint strokes with scraped and broken edges. The restrained blue-gray, stone, black, and burnt-orange palette combines detailed architectural structure with expressive distortion, strong light-dark contrast, and occasional surreal compositional shifts."},{"id":"terry-gilliam","name":"Terry Gilliam","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Terry Gilliam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/terry-gilliam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/terry-gilliam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","bone-white","muted-brown","orange","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Terry Gilliam is a renowned filmmaker, animator, and member of the Monty Python comedy troupe, known for his distinctive visual style and imaginative storytelling. His work often blends elements of fantasy and surrealism, creating unique and memorable cinematic experiences. Gilliam's films, such as \"Brazil\" and \"The Adventures of Baron Munchausen,\" are celebrated for their intricate visual designs and satirical narratives.","observation":"The style combines highly expressive close-up portraits with dense, surreal collage-like surroundings packed with mechanical, fantastical, and graphic fragments. Strong ink outlines, selective flat color, cross-media texturing, and dramatic tonal contrast make the faces feel simultaneously illustrated and intensely tactile."},{"id":"holton-rower","name":"Holton Rower","cat":"painters","en":"Holton Rower","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/holton-rower.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/holton-rower","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","ornate","sculptural","patterns","bold-lines","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["white","muted-ochre","charcoal","red","vivid-orange","green"],"intro":"Holton Rower is an American artist known for his innovative 'pour paintings,' which involve pouring paint over surfaces to create vibrant, layered artworks. His work often explores the interplay of color and form, resulting in dynamic and visually captivating pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses exuberant radial abstractions built from tightly nested, undulating bands of saturated color. Fine contour-like lines and raised, sculptural surfaces create ornate flower or cellular forms, with strong bilateral or radial organization and occasional irregular drips."},{"id":"gregoire-guillemin","name":"Gregoire Guillemin","cat":"various-artists","en":"Gregoire Guillemin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gregoire-guillemin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gregoire-guillemin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","halftone"],"colours":["light-orange","blue","black","vivid-red","cream"],"intro":"Gregoire Guillemin is a contemporary French artist known for his vibrant pop art style that draws inspiration from comic books and mass media. His work often explores themes of consumerism and celebrity culture, using bold colors and graphic designs to create striking visual narratives.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped portrait faces rendered as bold graphic illustrations, with heavy black contour lines, flat color blocks, and vivid red, blue, black, and skin-tone contrasts. Halftone dot shading and dense stippling add printed texture and tonal modeling while preserving the poster-like, comic-book clarity."},{"id":"raymond-pettibon","name":"Raymond Pettibon","cat":"illustrators","en":"Raymond Pettibon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raymond-pettibon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raymond-pettibon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","black","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Raymond Pettibon is an American artist known for his work in the punk rock scene and his distinctive ink drawings. His art often explores themes of violence, sexuality, and the absurd, with a style that combines elements of comic books and fine art. Pettibon gained prominence in the 1980s, particularly for his album cover designs for bands like Black Flag, and his work continues to influence contemporary art and culture.","observation":"Across all four images, densely packed figures and active situations are rendered with vigorous black ink contours, hatching, and large gestural strokes. Stark white grounds and heavy dark masses create high contrast, while occasional red or blue versions preserve the same expressive, rough-lined graphic language."},{"id":"mike-grell","name":"Mike Grell","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mike Grell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-grell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-grell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","grey","bone-white","orange","dark-green"],"intro":"Mike Grell is a renowned American comic book artist and writer, known for his work on series such as \"Green Arrow\" and \"The Warlord.\" His distinctive style blends realistic figures with fantastical elements, often featuring strong, heroic characters and intricate backgrounds. Grell's contributions to the comic book industry have been influential, particularly in the realm of fantasy and adventure genres.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vigorous visible brushwork, strong directional strokes, and dense descriptive detail to depict heroic fantasy characters in dramatic close-up compositions. Saturated greens, reds, blues, and oranges are set against deep shadows, while expressive faces, windblown hair, weapons, feathers, and fur reinforce an epic, energetic mood."},{"id":"philip-treacy","name":"Philip Treacy","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Philip Treacy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philip-treacy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philip-treacy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","black","grey","muted-ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Philip Treacy is a renowned Irish milliner known for his innovative and extravagant hat designs. He has created hats for celebrities, royalty, and fashion shows, making significant contributions to contemporary fashion. His work is celebrated for its creativity, craftsmanship, and the ability to transform headwear into art.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic editorial portraits with sculptural, oversized headwear made from feathers, flowers, and finely striated fabric. Restrained backgrounds and controlled studio lighting heighten the contrast between pale surfaces, deep blacks, and saturated red floral accents, while close crops and profile views give the images a polished fashion-magazine character."},{"id":"harry-weisburd","name":"Harry Weisburd","cat":"painters","en":"Harry Weisburd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harry-weisburd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harry-weisburd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","cream","dark-red","vivid-red","muted-blue","orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"Harry Weisburd is an artist known for his evocative and expressive works that often explore themes of urban life and personal introspection. His style is characterized by a cinematic quality, with a focus on mood and atmosphere, often drawing comparisons to the film noir genre. Weisburd's work captures the essence of mid-20th-century American culture, blending realism with expressive elements to convey deep emotional narratives.","observation":"Across all four images, stylized portraits are built from vigorous, visible brushwork, thick dark contours, and broad strokes that leave the painted surface apparent. Saturated reds, blues, oranges, and pinks stand sharply against near-black grounds, creating an intense, theatrical mood with simplified yet strongly expressive faces and clothing."},{"id":"refik-anadol","name":"Refik Anadol","cat":"various-artists","en":"Refik Anadol","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/refik-anadol.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/refik-anadol","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","muted-blue","charcoal","light-blue","red"],"intro":"Refik Anadol is a contemporary media artist and designer known for his innovative use of data and technology to create immersive art installations. Born in Turkey, Anadol has gained international recognition for his work that explores the intersection of art, science, and technology.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, cinematic environments with immense icy landscapes, ruined classical architecture, and tiny silhouetted people that emphasize scale. Deep teal shadows, strong contrast, and localized blue or coral illumination create a moody, fantastical atmosphere, while flowing ice and cloud-like formations give every scene a surreal sense of motion and grandeur."},{"id":"herbert-bayer","name":"Herbert Bayer","cat":"designers","en":"Herbert Bayer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herbert-bayer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herbert-bayer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","patterns","portraits","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","collage","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","light-yellow","vivid-red","muted-ochre","dark-blue","muted-blue","green"],"intro":"Herbert Bayer was an Austrian-American graphic designer, painter, photographer, and architect, known for his association with the Bauhaus school. He played a significant role in shaping modern graphic design and visual communication, emphasizing functionality and simplicity. Bayer's work is characterized by a blend of typography, photography, and geometric forms, reflecting the innovative spirit of the early 20th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines hard-edged geometric abstraction with vivid blocks of red, blue, green, yellow, and black. Portrait fragments, mountains, and circular forms are flattened into layered poster-like compositions, with visible print grain and collage-like overlaps giving the clean geometry a tactile retro surface."},{"id":"eugene-galien-laloue","name":"Eugene Galien-Laloue","cat":"painters","en":"Eugene Galien-Laloue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eugene-galien-laloue.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eugene-galien-laloue","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","glow","mist","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","muted-orange","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Eugene Galien-Laloue was a French painter known for his picturesque depictions of Parisian street scenes during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His works often capture the bustling yet intimate atmosphere of the city, characterized by detailed architectural elements and a focus on everyday life. Galien-Laloue's paintings are celebrated for their use of light and color, creating a sense of nostalgia and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses visibly broad, textured paint strokes to build dense winter city scenes with softened edges and expressive atmosphere. Subdued blue-gray and brown tones are punctuated by glowing amber lamps, shop windows, and reflections on rain- and snow-wet streets, creating a filmic urban mood."},{"id":"claude-parent","name":"Claude Parent","cat":"architects","en":"Claude Parent","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claude-parent.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claude-parent","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Claude Parent is a renowned French architect known for his radical and innovative designs, particularly in the field of modern architecture. He was a pioneer of the oblique function, which challenged traditional architectural norms by emphasizing sloped surfaces and dynamic forms. Parent's work often explored the relationship between space and movement, creating structures that were both functional and visually striking.","observation":"Across all four views, monumental concrete structures are rendered in stark black and white, with hard sunlight carving deep shadows beneath angular overhangs and cantilevered forms. High viewpoints, dramatic diagonals, sparse skies, and tiny people emphasize the buildings’ sculptural mass and geometric complexity, while visible grain gives the images a tactile photographic character."},{"id":"robert-delaunay","name":"Robert Delaunay","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Delaunay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-delaunay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-delaunay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","vivid-rust","dark-blue","dark-green","orange","light-yellow"],"intro":"Robert Delaunay was a French artist known for his pioneering work in abstract art and the development of Orphism , a movement characterized by the use of strong colors and geometric shapes. Born in 1885, Delaunay's work focused on the exploration of color and form, often creating dynamic compositions that emphasized the visual effects of color interaction. His innovative approach influenced many artists and contributed significantly to the modern art movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, overlapping concentric rings and arcs form dense abstract geometric compositions, with cropped circular motifs filling the picture plane. Strong saturated reds, oranges, blues, greens, yellows, and pinks sit on a pale ground, while visible brush texture and slightly irregular edges keep the graphic shapes tactile rather than mechanically flat."},{"id":"duro-olowu","name":"Duro Olowu","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Duro Olowu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/duro-olowu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/duro-olowu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","floral","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-green","grey","dark-red","red","ochre","deep-blue"],"intro":"Duro Olowu is a Nigerian-born, London-based fashion designer known for his vibrant and eclectic designs that celebrate African prints and textiles. He gained international acclaim for his unique approach to fashion, blending traditional African patterns with contemporary styles. Olowu's work is characterized by bold colors, intricate patterns, and a keen sense of cultural storytelling, making him a prominent figure in the global fashion scene.","observation":"The style presents richly staged fashion portraits with highly patterned garments, oversized accessories, botanical surroundings, and dense decorative surfaces. Saturated colors, strong tonal contrast, crisp illustrative rendering, and elaborate textile and floral detail create a bold, maximalist editorial look across the four images."},{"id":"eugene-delacroix","name":"Eugene Delacroix","cat":"painters","en":"Eugene Delacroix","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eugene-delacroix.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eugene-delacroix","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Eugene Delacroix was a leading French Romantic artist known for his expressive brushwork and vibrant use of color. His works often depicted dramatic and emotional scenes, drawing inspiration from literature, history, and mythology. Delacroix's art is characterized by its dynamic compositions and bold contrasts, which convey a sense of movement and intensity.","observation":"Across the sheet, the images use visibly layered, directional brushwork to model expressive faces, clothing, and turbulent landscape forms. Dark earthy tones, selective reds and whites, strong light-dark separation, and tightly cropped character groupings create a dramatic, old-fashioned painted appearance."},{"id":"bill-eppridge","name":"Bill Eppridge","cat":"photographers","en":"Bill Eppridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-eppridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-eppridge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","white","beige","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Bill Eppridge was an American photojournalist known for his impactful and evocative images, particularly those capturing significant moments in American history. He is perhaps best known for his work documenting the 1960s, including the civil rights movement and the assassination of Robert F. Kennedy.","observation":"The style is cinematic fashion photography built around low-angle viewpoints, dramatic cropping, candid movement, and strong geometric poses. Most frames use stark black-and-white contrast and visible grain, while the color portrait retains shallow focus, blurred city lights, and a period-styled editorial mood."},{"id":"francesco-clemente","name":"Francesco Clemente","cat":"painters","en":"Francesco Clemente","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francesco-clemente.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francesco-clemente","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","portraits","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["pale-orange","red","vivid-red","black","deep-red","grey"],"intro":"Francesco Clemente is an Italian contemporary artist known for his work in the Transavanguardia movement. His art often explores themes of spirituality, identity, and human experience, utilizing a diverse range of mediums and styles. Clemente's work is characterized by its vivid colors, symbolic imagery, and a blend of Eastern and Western influences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly rough, layered paint with graphic dark outlines, saturated reds, pinks, blues, and blacks, and strongly contrasted facial features. Close-up portraits and figures are distorted through repeated eyes, masks, markings, and organic patterning, producing an intense surreal effect while retaining recognizable faces."},{"id":"harvey-dunn","name":"Harvey Dunn","cat":"painters","en":"Harvey Dunn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harvey-dunn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harvey-dunn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","orange","beige"],"intro":"Harvey Dunn was an American painter and teacher known for his powerful and evocative depictions of rural American life. Born in 1884 in South Dakota, Dunn studied under Howard Pyle and became a prominent illustrator and artist. His works often reflect themes of the American frontier, capturing the spirit and struggles of early 20th-century life.","observation":"Across all four scenes, the style uses visibly broad, directional brushwork to model figures, clothing, architecture, rain, and reflective streets. It combines subdued, shadow-heavy colors with warm points of illumination and strong tonal contrast, while crowded outdoor situations and expressive character groupings create a lively narrative atmosphere."},{"id":"carrie-graber","name":"Carrie Graber","cat":"painters","en":"Carrie Graber","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carrie-graber.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carrie-graber","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["deep-rust","black","ochre","dark-ochre","rust","muted-lime"],"intro":"Carrie Graber is an artist known for her evocative and intimate portrayals of contemporary life, often focusing on the human figure and domestic settings. Her work is characterized by a warm color palette and a painterly approach that captures the subtle nuances of light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and environments are painted with visible directional brushwork, simplified but convincing anatomy, and strong warm-versus-dark contrasts. The recurring red, amber, and green palette, theatrical interior and nighttime lighting, fashionable clothing, and staged poses create a polished cinematic mood."},{"id":"aline-smithson","name":"Aline Smithson","cat":"photographers","en":"Aline Smithson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aline-smithson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aline-smithson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-ochre","black","muted-cyan","bone-white","muted-green","deep-red"],"intro":"Aline Smithson is a contemporary American photographer known for her fine art portraiture and conceptual photography. Her work often explores themes of identity, memory, and nostalgia, using a blend of traditional and digital techniques to create evocative and thought-provoking images.","observation":"The style combines cinematic, highly staged portraiture with richly decorated interiors and pastoral settings, using elaborate costumes, antiques, flowers, birds, and patterned surfaces as visual motifs. Saturated reds and greens contrast with pale skies and dresses, while carefully composed tableaux and slightly uncanny juxtapositions create a dreamy, surreal editorial mood."},{"id":"tsukioka-yoshitoshi","name":"Tsukioka Yoshitoshi","cat":"printmakers","en":"Tsukioka Yoshitoshi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tsukioka-yoshitoshi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tsukioka-yoshitoshi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","religious","drawing","ink","symmetry"],"colours":["black","muted-orange","brown","pale-orange","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Tsukioka Yoshitoshi was a renowned Japanese artist and printmaker, celebrated for his innovative and dramatic ukiyo-e woodblock prints during the late Edo and early Meiji periods. His works often depicted historical scenes, folklore, and supernatural themes, characterized by their vivid detail and emotional depth.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses dense, highly detailed illustrative drawing with assertive ink outlines, flat but richly varied color areas, and strong dark-versus-light contrast. Ornate costumes, calligraphic panels, theatrical figures, and dynamic mythic imagery fill the compositions with a vividly decorative woodblock-print character."},{"id":"mathew-brady","name":"Mathew Brady","cat":"photographers","en":"Mathew Brady","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mathew-brady.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mathew-brady","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","white","black","silver"],"intro":"Mathew Brady was a pioneering American photographer known for his documentation of the American Civil War and his portraits of prominent figures of the 19th century. His work is considered foundational in the field of photojournalism, capturing the stark realities of war and the personalities of his time with a meticulous eye for detail and composition.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly realistic black-and-white period portraits staged in an outdoor camp setting, with crisp faces and clothing against softly blurred backgrounds. Strong tonal contrast, visible photographic grain, formal poses, and selective focus give the images a cinematic archival-photograph character."},{"id":"brett-weston","name":"Brett Weston","cat":"photographers","en":"Brett Weston","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brett-weston.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brett-weston","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver"],"intro":"Brett Weston is an influential American photographer known for his black and white landscapes and abstract compositions. As the son of renowned photographer Edward Weston , Brett developed a distinct style characterized by high contrast and sharp focus, capturing the intricate details of natural forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents stark monochrome coastal landscapes with highly realistic textures and strongly controlled contrast. Fine geological striations, eroded formations, surf, channels, and dunes are emphasized through dramatic framing, deep shadows, and a grainy photographic finish."},{"id":"john-olsen","name":"John Olsen","cat":"painters","en":"John Olsen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-olsen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-olsen","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","landscapes","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["orange","bone-white","beige","rust","dark-brown","black"],"intro":"John Olsen is an Australian artist known for his vibrant and expressive landscape paintings. His work often captures the essence of the Australian environment, blending abstraction with recognizable natural forms. Olsen's style is characterized by dynamic compositions and a vivid color palette, reflecting his deep connection to the land.","observation":"Across the sheet, loosely representational landscapes and organic forms dissolve into energetic abstract marks, with visibly layered paint, drips, splatters, scraping, and broad directional strokes. A warm orange-and-ochre palette is punctuated by blue, black, and pale ground, while delicate linear gestures and dense surface incident give the work an expressive, richly worked character."},{"id":"william-kay-blacklock","name":"William Kay Blacklock","cat":"painters","en":"William Kay Blacklock","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-kay-blacklock.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-kay-blacklock","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-brown"],"intro":"William Kay Blacklock is a British painter known for his detailed and romantic depictions of rural life and domestic scenes. His works often feature women in serene, natural settings, capturing a sense of nostalgia and beauty. Blacklock's style is influenced by the Pre-Raphaelite movement, characterized by its attention to detail, vibrant colors, and idealized subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible brushwork and fine, varied strokes to build luminous gardens, figures, architecture, and abundant flowers. Saturated floral colors, dappled sunlight, and densely layered natural detail create expressive, leisurely garden scenes with a classical pastoral atmosphere."},{"id":"don-maitz","name":"Don Maitz","cat":"illustrators","en":"Don Maitz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/don-maitz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/don-maitz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","dark-red","orange","muted-magenta"],"intro":"Don Maitz is an American artist known for his work in science fiction and fantasy illustration. He has created iconic cover art for numerous books and is celebrated for his imaginative and detailed style that brings fantastical worlds to life.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured brushwork models monumental wizard characters, rugged terrain, elaborate architecture, and cosmic environments. Saturated blue, violet, orange, and gold colors combine with sharp light-dark contrasts and internal celestial or magical light sources, creating grand, otherworldly fantasy scenes."},{"id":"david-renshaw","name":"David Renshaw","cat":"painters","en":"David Renshaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-renshaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-renshaw","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["blue","charcoal","muted-blue","red","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"David Renshaw is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and romantic landscape paintings. His works often depict idyllic countryside scenes, characterized by their rich color palettes and whimsical atmospheres. Renshaw's paintings are celebrated for their ability to evoke a sense of tranquility and nostalgia, drawing viewers into a world of serene beauty.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible painterly texture with finely resolved landscape detail, saturated blue, coral, pink, and orange color, and luminous sunset or twilight atmospheres. Romantic balloon motifs, distant figures, cottages, castles, and expansive hills are arranged as dreamy, storybook-like scenes with expressive skies and a gently fantastical mood."},{"id":"laurent-grasso","name":"Laurent Grasso","cat":"painters","en":"Laurent Grasso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laurent-grasso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laurent-grasso","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","glow","high-contrast","metallic","moody-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","black","rust","beige","orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"Laurent Grasso is a contemporary French artist known for his multidisciplinary approach, exploring themes of perception, temporality, and the unseen. His work often incorporates elements of science, history, and the supernatural, creating immersive experiences that challenge viewers' understanding of reality.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic gallery-like scenes combine dark, moody palettes with dramatic orange or blue illumination, reflective glass, and heavily ornamented metallic frames. Surreal sculptural objects⁠—spheres, floating geometry, and volcanic rocks⁠—are placed within atmospheric landscapes and presented with strong contrast and museum-display staging."},{"id":"tory-burch","name":"Tory Burch","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Tory Burch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tory-burch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tory-burch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","bone-white","rust","dark-olive","charcoal"],"intro":"Tory Burch is an American fashion designer, businesswoman, and philanthropist known for her preppy-bohemian style and luxury lifestyle brand. She founded her company in 2004, and it has since become a global fashion empire, offering a wide range of products including clothing, handbags, shoes, and accessories. Her designs often feature bold colors, graphic prints, and a blend of classic and modern elements.","observation":"The style combines polished fashion-editorial portraiture with richly decorated interiors, dense botanical motifs, patterned garments, and carefully staged domestic scenes. Saturated jewel tones and warm low-key lighting create a luxurious, slightly moody atmosphere, while painterly illustrated passages and visible textile-like brushwork soften the otherwise realistic presentation."},{"id":"bruce-munro","name":"Bruce Munro","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Bruce Munro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruce-munro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruce-munro","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","backlighting","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","rust","grey","muted-blue","silver"],"intro":"Bruce Munro is a renowned British artist known for his large-scale light-based installations. His work often explores themes of memory, moments of shared human experience, and the intersection of light and landscape. Munro's installations have been exhibited in various locations worldwide, captivating audiences with their immersive and enchanting qualities.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic twilight landscapes are transformed by dense fields and clusters of glowing glass spheres, with warm amber illumination set against cool blue-green woodland shadows. Cinematic backlighting, selective focus, reflective surfaces, and atmospheric depth create a dreamy, fantastical installation-like mood."},{"id":"georges-melies","name":"Georges Melies","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Georges Melies","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-melies.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-melies","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Georges Melies was a pioneering French filmmaker and illusionist, renowned for his innovative use of special effects and narrative storytelling in early cinema.","observation":"Across all four renders, enormous sculpted faces and moons dominate theatrical, uncanny scenes populated by tiny performers and dense crowds. The style is monochrome and strongly grainy, with stark tonal contrast, rough modeled surfaces, expressive grotesque features, and film-like spectacle."},{"id":"malcolm-liepke","name":"Malcolm Liepke","cat":"painters","en":"Malcolm Liepke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/malcolm-liepke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/malcolm-liepke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-olive","pale-orange","orange","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Malcolm Liepke is a contemporary American painter known for his expressive and intimate portraits. His work often explores themes of human emotion and connection, characterized by rich color palettes and a painterly style. Liepke's art is celebrated for its ability to capture the subtleties of human expression and the complexity of personal relationships.","observation":"Across all four portraits, visible brush marks and built-up paint give the images a strongly painterly surface, with refined strokes shaping faces, hair, clothing, and textured backgrounds. The palette is restrained but punctuated by red lips and warm skin, while deep black garments and hair create expressive high-contrast compositions with tightly cropped, fashion-oriented poses."},{"id":"russ-mills","name":"Russ Mills","cat":"illustrators","en":"Russ Mills","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/russ-mills.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/russ-mills","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","drawing","ink","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","bone-white","brown","beige","white","red"],"intro":"Russ Mills is a contemporary British artist known for his dynamic and expressive illustrations that blend traditional and digital techniques. His work often explores themes of identity and emotion, characterized by bold compositions and a distinctive use of color.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines partially recognizable faces with aggressive, visible brushwork, ink-like linework, scratches, and splattered red accents. A restrained black, grey, red, and off-white palette, strong tonal contrast, cropped compositions, and generous blank ground create an intense, fractured atmosphere."},{"id":"bill-plympton","name":"Bill Plympton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bill Plympton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-plympton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-plympton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","subdued-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["pale-orange","beige","brown","ochre","muted-red"],"intro":"Bill Plympton is an American animator and cartoonist known for his distinctive hand-drawn animation style and satirical humor. He gained prominence in the late 20th century with his independent animated films and shorts, which often feature surreal and exaggerated characters. Plympton's work is characterized by its unique blend of humor and grotesque imagery, making him a notable figure in the world of animation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive grotesque characters and animals drawn with fine ink contours, dense hatching, and selectively muted watercolor-like fills on a paper-toned ground. Exaggerated eyes, teeth, beaks, and facial expressions create a darkly whimsical fantasy-comic mood, with scenes ranging from close-up creature portraits to small groups and staged vignettes."},{"id":"jo-ann-callis","name":"Jo Ann Callis","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jo Ann Callis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jo-ann-callis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jo-ann-callis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-green","muted-ochre","deep-red","dark-brown","light-yellow"],"intro":"Jo Ann Callis is an American photographer and artist known for her evocative and often surreal imagery. Her work frequently explores themes of domesticity, femininity, and the human body, using a variety of photographic techniques to create intimate and thought-provoking compositions.","observation":"These photographs use carefully staged, fashion-editorial tableaux with richly detailed period interiors, controlled poses, and recurring red accents against muted green surroundings. Cinematic directional light, deep shadows, and tactile fabrics create a moody, surreal tension while keeping the figures and objects sharply realistic."},{"id":"giovanni-battista-piranesi","name":"Giovanni Battista Piranesi","cat":"painters","en":"Giovanni Battista Piranesi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giovanni-battista-piranesi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giovanni-battista-piranesi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","epic","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver"],"intro":"Giovanni Battista Piranesi was an Italian artist known for his etchings of Rome and its ancient architecture. Born in 1720, he became famous for his detailed and imaginative depictions of classical ruins and fantastical architectural scenes. His work is characterized by a blend of realism and fantasy, often exploring themes of grandeur and decay.","observation":"The style depicts vast, densely layered architectural ruins rendered in stark black and white, with monumental arches, columns, bridges, and tiny human figures creating an overwhelming sense of scale. Fine drawn lines, crosshatched shadows, and extreme tonal contrast give the scenes an engraved, highly expressive intensity while preserving intricate structural detail."},{"id":"rex-ray","name":"Rex Ray","cat":"designers","en":"Rex Ray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rex-ray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rex-ray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["pale-yellow","muted-teal","dark-brown","vivid-red","charcoal","ochre"],"intro":"Rex Ray was an American artist and designer known for his vibrant and eclectic works that blend elements of fine art and graphic design. His work often features bold colors, abstract forms, and intricate patterns, drawing inspiration from mid-century modern design and pop art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines vivid teal, coral, orange, and red with dense geometric arrangements of birds, flowers, leaves, and other organic forms. Fine drawn lines, visible scratches, layered paper-like textures, and painterly marks create an expressive collage surface, while flattened silhouettes and surreal juxtapositions keep the imagery graphic and dreamlike."},{"id":"georges-de-la-tour","name":"Georges de La Tour","cat":"painters","en":"Georges de La Tour","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-de-la-tour.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-de-la-tour","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","deep-rust","red","ochre"],"intro":"Georges de La Tour was a French Baroque painter known for his mastery of chiaroscuro and his depictions of religious and genre scenes. Active in the 17th century, he is celebrated for his ability to create serene and contemplative atmospheres through the use of light and shadow. His works often feature intimate domestic settings, capturing the quiet dignity of everyday life.","observation":"The style uses richly modeled, painterly figures and fabrics against expanses of near-black, with warm amber and crimson tones concentrated around candle flames and faces. Across the scenes, expressive gestures, period clothing, and carefully arranged groups create intimate, theatrical tableaus with strong light-dark separation and visible painted texture."},{"id":"marco-mazzoni","name":"Marco Mazzoni","cat":"painters","en":"Marco Mazzoni","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marco-mazzoni.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marco-mazzoni","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","floral","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","cream","grey","beige","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Marco Mazzoni is an Italian artist known for his intricate and surreal portraits that often incorporate elements of nature, particularly flowers and foliage. His work is characterized by a delicate use of colored pencils, creating soft, dreamlike images that explore themes of identity and the human connection to nature.","observation":"These images combine finely rendered, painterly birds and bird-like figures with abundant feather, hair, and petal detail. Muted teal, cream, blush, and coral tones sit against spacious pale backgrounds, while delicate linear strands and floral forms create an ethereal, ornamental fantasy mood."},{"id":"hector-guimard","name":"Hector Guimard","cat":"architects","en":"Hector Guimard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hector-guimard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hector-guimard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","floral","patterns","urban","metallic","subdued-colors","classical","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","dark-olive","white","black","dark-red","deep-rust"],"intro":"Hector Guimard was a prominent French architect and designer, best known for his work in the Art Nouveau style. Born in 1867, he gained fame for his innovative and ornamental designs, particularly the iconic entrances to the Paris Métro. Guimard's work is characterized by its organic forms, intricate details, and harmonious integration with the surrounding environment.","observation":"The style depicts elaborate architectural structures with highly detailed, sculptural frameworks of curling botanical metalwork, ribbed arches, and translucent glass. Compositions are strongly frontal and symmetrical, combining subdued bronze, green, and glass tones with richly ornamental surfaces and carefully rendered material detail."},{"id":"benito-jacovitti","name":"Benito Jacovitti","cat":"illustrators","en":"Benito Jacovitti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/benito-jacovitti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/benito-jacovitti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","orange","muted-brown","red","muted-blue","black","pink"],"intro":"Benito Jacovitti was an Italian comic artist and illustrator known for his humorous and satirical style. He gained popularity for his work in comic strips and magazines, creating iconic characters and absurd scenarios that entertained readers across Europe. Jacovitti's work is characterized by its exaggerated and grotesque features, often incorporating elements of satire and social commentary.","observation":"The style uses densely packed comic-book scenes with exaggerated characters, expressive faces, thick black ink contours, and crisp flat colour areas. Saturated primary hues, strong light-dark separation, visible paper and print wear, and varied panel-like compositions create a lively retro illustration feel across all four renders."},{"id":"joao-ruas","name":"Joao Ruas","cat":"painters","en":"Joao Ruas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joao-ruas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joao-ruas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","pale-orange","brown","muted-ochre","grey","rust"],"intro":"Joao Ruas is a Brazilian contemporary artist known for his intricate and surreal artworks that often explore themes of mythology and fantasy. His work is characterized by a blend of traditional and digital techniques, creating a unique style that is both detailed and expressive.","observation":"The style combines intensely detailed, expressive portraiture with visible fine drawing and layered painterly brushwork. Weathered faces, skeletal or bird motifs, torn fabrics, stark shadows, and restrained teal, rust, black, and parchment tones create a brooding surreal atmosphere across the four images."},{"id":"andrea-palladio","name":"Andrea Palladio","cat":"architects","en":"Andrea Palladio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrea-palladio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrea-palladio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","beige","pale-orange","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Andrea Palladio was a renowned Italian architect of the Renaissance , known for his influential designs and architectural treatises. His work, characterized by classical Roman principles, has left a lasting impact on Western architecture, giving rise to the Palladian style. Palladio's designs are celebrated for their symmetry, perspective, and harmonious proportions, drawing inspiration from ancient Roman architecture.","observation":"The style presents monumental classical architecture with carefully structured, often axial compositions, emphasizing domes, columns, pediments, arches, sculpture, and staircases. It combines restrained stone and sepia tones with finely drawn contours, architectural precision, and lightly weathered illustrative surfaces."},{"id":"david-hurn","name":"David Hurn","cat":"photographers","en":"David Hurn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-hurn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-hurn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"David Hurn is a renowned British documentary photographer known for his candid and insightful images capturing everyday life and cultural shifts. He gained prominence in the 1960s, contributing significantly to the Magnum Photos agency. Hurn's work is celebrated for its humanist approach, often highlighting the subtleties of human interaction and societal changes.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast observational photography with visible film grain, selective focus, and carefully composed candid portraits. Urban settings, reflective glass, cropped figures, textured clothing, and subdued expressions create a cinematic documentary atmosphere across the sheet."},{"id":"michael-aram","name":"Michael Aram","cat":"designers","en":"Michael Aram","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-aram.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-aram","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","animals","floral","still-life","high-contrast","metallic","fantasy"],"colours":["white","charcoal","grey","black","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Michael Aram is a renowned American designer known for his intricate metalwork and sculptural designs. His work often draws inspiration from nature, blending artistic expression with functional design. Aram's pieces are celebrated for their detailed craftsmanship and unique ability to transform everyday objects into art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly detailed sculptural still lifes combining polished metal, dark stone, vessels, branches, birds, and blossoms. Strong gold, silver, black, and white contrasts, ornamental natural forms, and carefully arranged display compositions give the work a luxurious fantastical character."},{"id":"george-condo","name":"George Condo","cat":"painters","en":"George Condo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-condo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-condo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-cyan","silver","black","bone-white","muted-ochre","red","deep-blue"],"intro":"George Condo is an American contemporary visual artist known for his eclectic and imaginative style that blends traditional European painting with American pop culture. His work often explores themes of psychological states and the human condition, characterized by distorted figures and surreal compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, expressive distorted characters are built from vividly colored, irregular shapes, heavy outlines, and energetic painterly strokes. Scratched marks, drips, layered textures, and exaggerated facial features create a surreal, clown-like fantasy world with strong contrast and dense visual activity."},{"id":"zhang-kechun","name":"Zhang Kechun","cat":"photographers","en":"Zhang Kechun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zhang-kechun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zhang-kechun","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","brown","beige","grey","silver"],"intro":"Zhang Kechun is a contemporary Chinese photographer known for his evocative and surreal imagery that often explores themes of identity, nature, and urbanization. His work captures the essence of modern Chinese society, reflecting on the rapid changes and environmental transformations occurring within the country.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic scenes with subdued, cool earth tones, heavy fog, and broad areas of atmospheric negative space. Monumental rocks and severe concrete structures are framed geometrically against sparse landscapes, with tiny solitary figures and distant buildings creating an uncanny, bleak sense of scale."},{"id":"ryan-stegman","name":"Ryan Stegman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ryan Stegman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryan-stegman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryan-stegman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","brown","red","dark-indigo","pale-orange"],"intro":"Ryan Stegman is a contemporary comic book artist known for his work with Marvel Comics, particularly on series like \"Spider-Man\" and \"Venom.\" His style is characterized by dynamic compositions, bold linework, and a keen attention to detail, making him a prominent figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense comic-book illustration with heavy black contouring, energetic hatching, splattered marks, and strongly modeled anatomy. Saturated reds, purples, and blacks are pushed into stark contrast, while exaggerated poses, tendrils, claws, and monstrous figures create a dark, kinetic fantasy mood."},{"id":"tom-thomson","name":"Tom Thomson","cat":"painters","en":"Tom Thomson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-thomson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-thomson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-violet","black","dark-brown","bone-white","orange","red"],"intro":"Tom Thomson was a Canadian artist known for his influential role in the development of Canadian landscape painting. He was closely associated with the Group of Seven, a collective of artists who sought to capture the unique beauty of the Canadian wilderness. Thomson's work is celebrated for its vibrant color, dynamic brushwork, and evocative depictions of the natural world.","observation":"Across all four landscapes, thick visible paint marks build snowy forests, bare trunks, distant water, and dramatic skies with energetic directional strokes. The style combines vivid orange and coral light with cool violet-blue shadows, using dense dark tree silhouettes and richly textured, expressive surfaces."},{"id":"ron-english","name":"Ron English","cat":"street-artists","en":"Ron English","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ron-english.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ron-english","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","urban","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-cyan","bone-white","red","grey","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Ron English is a contemporary American artist known for his work in street art, pop surrealism, and cultural commentary. He is recognized for his satirical and humorous reinterpretations of popular cultural icons and consumer imagery. English's art often explores themes of advertising, media influence, and consumer culture, blending elements of fine art and street art to create thought-provoking pieces.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, visibly painted surfaces with saturated reds, yellows, blues, and skin tones, giving the figures a glossy, sculptural presence. It consistently frames expressive clown and mascot portraits against bright skies and urban landmarks, combining theatrical poses, oversized props, and strong visual contrast."},{"id":"a-j-casson","name":"A. J. Casson","cat":"painters","en":"A. J. Casson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/a-j-casson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/a-j-casson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["pale-orange","charcoal","dark-brown","grey","muted-blue","ochre"],"intro":"A. J. Casson was a Canadian painter known for his landscapes and as a member of the Group of Seven, a group of Canadian landscape painters in the early 20th century. His work is celebrated for its depiction of the Canadian wilderness and rural life, often characterized by vibrant colors and a distinctive style.","observation":"Across all four views, the style combines clearly visible, directional paint strokes with crisp illustrative forms, building richly textured autumn landscapes and hillside villages. Saturated oranges, ochres, deep greens, and cool blues are arranged in strong light-dark contrasts, with detailed architecture, trees, rocky ground, and reflective water defining the scenes."},{"id":"edward-tufte","name":"Edward Tufte","cat":"various-artists","en":"Edward Tufte","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-tufte.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-tufte","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","patterns","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","drawing","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","cream","red"],"intro":"Edward Tufte is an American statistician and professor emeritus of political science, statistics, and computer science at Yale University. He is renowned for his work in data visualization and information design, authoring several influential books on the subject. Tufte's contributions have significantly shaped how complex data is presented in a clear and accessible manner.","observation":"Across all four renders, delicate lines, particles, dots, and plotted curves form abstract diagrammatic fields on expansive pale grounds. The restrained palette is punctuated by strong red, blue, orange, or black marks, while arcs, grids, and directional flows create a precise yet energetic visual language."},{"id":"cecilie-manz","name":"Cecilie Manz","cat":"designers","en":"Cecilie Manz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cecilie-manz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cecilie-manz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","minimalist","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","glow","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","brown","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Cecilie Manz is a renowned Danish designer known for her minimalist and functional approach to design. Her work often emphasizes simplicity, practicality, and elegance, drawing inspiration from Scandinavian traditions and modernist principles. Manz has received numerous awards for her contributions to contemporary design, and her creations are celebrated for their timeless quality and understated beauty.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, carefully composed interior scenes with restrained earthy colors, strong architectural geometry, and abundant natural wood, plaster, stone, and concrete textures. Soft directional daylight and glowing pendant lamps create a cinematic atmosphere, while sculptural furniture and sparse still-life arrangements give the spaces a refined minimalist character."},{"id":"ian-howorth","name":"Ian Howorth","cat":"painters","en":"Ian Howorth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ian-howorth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ian-howorth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","dark-cyan","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Ian Howorth is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative and nostalgic imagery, often capturing the essence of British life with a cinematic touch. His work frequently explores themes of memory, solitude, and the passage of time, drawing inspiration from mid-20th century aesthetics and personal narratives.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic night photography with deep teal shadows, warm red-orange practical lights, and strong contrast. Rain, reflective pavement, mist, selective focus, and solitary figures create recurring urban scenes with a tense, nocturnal atmosphere."},{"id":"james-tissot","name":"James Tissot","cat":"painters","en":"James Tissot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-tissot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-tissot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","dark-red","bone-white"],"intro":"James Tissot was a French painter and illustrator known for his detailed and elegant depictions of fashionable society in the late 19th century. Born in 1836, Tissot gained popularity for his portraits and genre scenes that captured the social customs and clothing of his time, particularly in Paris and London. His works often reflect the opulence and sophistication of the Victorian and Belle Époque eras, showcasing his mastery in capturing the nuances of light and texture.","observation":"The style is richly painterly, built from visible directional brushwork and layered, expressive strokes that give clothing, foliage, faces, and accessories a tactile surface. Crowded outdoor social scenes combine subdued natural greens and creams with deep blacks and vivid reds, using strong light-dark contrast, elaborate period clothing, and dense overlapping detail."},{"id":"bryan-hitch","name":"Bryan Hitch","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bryan Hitch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bryan-hitch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bryan-hitch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","muted-rust","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Bryan Hitch is a renowned British comic book artist known for his work on major superhero titles. His detailed and dynamic style has made significant contributions to the comic book industry, particularly in the superhero genre. Hitch is celebrated for his realistic and cinematic approach to comic art, which has influenced many artists and storytellers in the field.","observation":"A dense comic-book style combines heavy black contouring with intricate interior hatching, textured anatomy, and strongly modeled forms. Saturated blues, reds, oranges, and greens are pushed against deep shadows, while crowded heroic and monstrous figures create an energetic, epic ensemble composition."},{"id":"peter-blake","name":"Peter Blake","cat":"illustrators","en":"Peter Blake","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-blake.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-blake","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["pale-orange","brown","dark-brown","ochre","beige","vivid-red"],"intro":"Peter Blake is a British artist known for his significant contributions to the pop art movement. Born in 1932, he is celebrated for his vibrant and eclectic works that often incorporate elements of popular culture, music, and collage. Blake's most famous work includes the album cover for The Beatles' \"Sgt. Pepper's Lonely Hearts Club Band,\" which exemplifies his distinctive style of combining various cultural icons and imagery.","observation":"The style combines dense, exuberant collage-like compositions with visibly built-up paint, rough brush marks, and richly layered historical and popular imagery. Saturated reds, blues, and creams, strong contrast, theatrical faces, flags, crowds, landmarks, badges, and printed ephemera create an expressive, commemorative scrapbook effect."},{"id":"larry-poons","name":"Larry Poons","cat":"painters","en":"Larry Poons","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-poons.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-poons","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","sculptural","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["pale-orange","beige","orange","muted-ochre","rust","grey"],"intro":"Larry Poons is an American abstract painter known for his vibrant and energetic works. Emerging in the 1960s, Poons became associated with the Color Field movement and was recognized for his innovative use of color and form. His work often features dynamic compositions with a focus on movement and rhythm, contributing significantly to the development of abstract expressionism.","observation":"The style is an abstract, highly tactile painting built from thick impasto, dragged and layered pigment, and recurring vertical streaks. Pastel and jewel-like colors intermingle in dense marbled textures, with fragmentary forms emerging from the expressive, sculptural surface."},{"id":"wlad-safronow","name":"Wlad Safronow","cat":"painters","en":"Wlad Safronow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wlad-safronow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wlad-safronow","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["rust","silver","vivid-red","brown","dark-blue","blue"],"intro":"Wlad Safronow is a contemporary artist known for his unique approach to digital art, blending traditional painting techniques with modern technology to create vibrant and imaginative works. His style often incorporates elements of surrealism and fantasy, characterized by bold colors and intricate details.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines close-up female portraits with angular, geometric construction, heavy dark outlines, and vivid blocks of jewel-toned color. Dense textile patterns, ornamental garments, and lightly textured surfaces make the graphic illustrations feel decorative and richly layered."},{"id":"l-birge-harrison","name":"L. Birge Harrison","cat":"painters","en":"L. Birge Harrison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/l-birge-harrison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/l-birge-harrison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","pale-yellow","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"L. Birge Harrison was an American painter known for his contributions to the Tonalist movement, focusing on atmospheric landscapes and the effects of light. Born in 1854, Harrison's work often depicted serene and moody scenes, capturing the subtle nuances of nature.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses visibly textured, painterly surfaces and layered natural detail to create atmospheric twilight landscapes. Restrained blue-green and brown tones, isolated figures, deep woods, mist, and small warm light sources produce a dark, dreamy, quietly epic mood."},{"id":"georg-baselitz","name":"Georg Baselitz","cat":"painters","en":"Georg Baselitz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georg-baselitz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georg-baselitz","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","orange","vivid-red","dark-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Georg Baselitz is a renowned German painter and sculptor known for his expressive and often provocative works. Emerging in the post-war art scene, Baselitz became a key figure in the Neo-Expressionist movement. His art is characterized by its bold use of color, dynamic compositions, and a focus on the human figure, often exploring themes of identity, history, and the human condition.","observation":"Across all four works, the style is intensely abstract and expressive, built from visible, heavily textured paint, scraping, drips, and vigorous overlapping marks. Saturated reds, blues, blacks, and warm pinks or whites create forceful contrasts, while fragmented forms remain suggestive rather than fully representational."},{"id":"kris-knight","name":"Kris Knight","cat":"painters","en":"Kris Knight","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kris-knight.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kris-knight","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","pastel-colors","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["light-blue","bone-white","black","red","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Kris Knight is a contemporary Canadian painter known for his ethereal and romantic portraiture. His work often explores themes of identity, youth, and nature, characterized by soft brushwork and delicate detailing. Knight's paintings have been exhibited internationally, and he is recognized for his unique blend of classical and contemporary styles.","observation":"These are highly detailed, close-cropped painted portraits with visible fine brushwork, luminous skin, expressive eyes, and richly rendered curls and petals. Soft blue negative space and pastel pinks contrast with occasional deep foliage or red fabric, while flowers, leaves, and elaborate clothing create a decorative fashion-editorial character."},{"id":"jessica-rossier","name":"Jessica Rossier","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jessica Rossier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jessica-rossier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jessica-rossier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["dark-blue","grey","muted-blue","black","silver","dark-olive"],"intro":"Jessica Rossier is a contemporary artist known for her digital illustrations that often explore themes of fantasy and science fiction. Her work is characterized by its detailed and cinematic quality, often depicting vast, otherworldly landscapes and epic scenes.","observation":"The style presents vast, photorealistic fantastical landscapes with monumental cliffs, snowy peaks, cloud oceans, and enormous celestial bodies. Strong cinematic lighting combines vivid blue-and-gold color, deep shadow, glowing horizons, and atmospheric haze to create epic scale and surreal world-building."},{"id":"alice-pasquini","name":"Alice Pasquini","cat":"street-artists","en":"Alice Pasquini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alice-pasquini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alice-pasquini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","collage","drawing"],"colours":["muted-orange","black","muted-teal","dark-brown","rust","light-blue"],"intro":"Alice Pasquini is an Italian street artist known for her vibrant and expressive murals that often depict emotional and introspective themes. Her work is characterized by a focus on human figures, particularly women, and explores themes of connection, intimacy, and the human experience. Pasquini's art can be found on walls across the globe, where she uses a combination of spray paint and mixed media to create layered and textured compositions.","observation":"Across all four panels, expressive close-up portraits combine heavy black drawn contours with visibly broad, layered paint strokes and richly textured wall surfaces. Saturated teal, orange, ochre, blue, and red create a vivid street-mural effect, while poster fragments, graffiti, and overlapping marks give the compositions a collage-like urban character."},{"id":"adi-granov","name":"Adi Granov","cat":"illustrators","en":"Adi Granov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adi-granov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adi-granov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","bone-white","charcoal","muted-ochre","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Adi Granov is a renowned comic book artist and illustrator, best known for his work with Marvel Comics, particularly his contributions to the Iron Man series. His distinctive style combines realistic rendering with dynamic compositions, making him a prominent figure in the world of contemporary comic art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional paint strokes to build highly rendered character portraits with expressive faces, textured hair, clothing, and props. Dark, cool shadows contrast with warm skin and hair tones, while loose marks and rough off-white grounds preserve a hand-painted concept-art feel."},{"id":"kris-van-assche","name":"Kris Van Assche","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Kris Van Assche","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kris-van-assche.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kris-van-assche","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","collage"],"colours":["black","white","bone-white","beige","brown","muted-green","deep-red"],"intro":"Kris Van Assche is a Belgian fashion designer known for his work with high-end fashion houses and his own label. He has made significant contributions to contemporary menswear, blending classic tailoring with modern aesthetics. Van Assche's designs often feature clean lines, innovative textures, and a minimalist approach, reflecting his unique vision in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style combines expressive painted portraiture with visible brushwork, layered textile and paper-like collage treatments, and selectively sharp facial detail. Restrained earthy colors, pale negative backgrounds, cropped compositions, and fashion-editorial clothing give the series a tactile, contemporary look."},{"id":"park-chan-wook","name":"Park Chan Wook","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Park Chan Wook","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/park-chan-wook.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/park-chan-wook","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-green","brown","deep-red","silver"],"intro":"Park Chan Wook is a renowned South Korean filmmaker known for his distinctive style and masterful storytelling. He gained international acclaim for films such as \"Oldboy\" and \"The Handmaiden,\" which are celebrated for their intricate plots, visual flair, and exploration of complex themes. His work often delves into the darker aspects of human nature, combining elements of suspense, drama, and psychological depth.","observation":"A cinematic, realistic style built around moody teal-and-red grading, deep shadows, warm practical lights, and selective focus. Portraits and tense group scenes are framed through mirrors, doorways, and blurred foreground figures, with ornate interiors and fine film grain reinforcing the dark, theatrical atmosphere."},{"id":"gaston-bussiere","name":"Gaston Bussiere","cat":"painters","en":"Gaston Bussiere","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gaston-bussiere.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gaston-bussiere","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","rust","light-orange","orange"],"intro":"Gaston Bussiere was a French painter and illustrator known for his works that often depicted mythological and literary themes. Born in 1862, Bussiere was associated with the Symbolist movement and was influenced by the Pre-Raphaelites. His art is characterized by its romantic and mystical qualities, often featuring ethereal figures and lush, dreamlike landscapes.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses richly layered, visible brushwork to build luminous faces, elaborate garments, jewelry, and textured backgrounds. Dark, earthy colors are punctuated by warm firelight and selective red-orange illumination, while ornate costume and expressive, idealized poses create a romantic fantasy mood."},{"id":"ryan-sook","name":"Ryan Sook","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ryan Sook","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryan-sook.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryan-sook","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","pale-orange","red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Ryan Sook is a contemporary illustrator known for his work in comic books and graphic novels. His style often blends elements of fantasy and surrealism, creating visually striking and imaginative compositions. Sook's work is characterized by its detailed line work and expressive character designs, often drawing on mythological and fantastical themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense ink-like linework with visible painterly texture, angular anatomy, and strongly expressive figures. A restricted palette of coral, rust, charcoal, and deep blue is pushed through stark light-dark contrasts, creating crowded gothic-horror scenes with theatrical, macabre fantasy imagery."},{"id":"kara-walker","name":"Kara Walker","cat":"painters","en":"Kara Walker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kara-walker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kara-walker","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","epic","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["black","beige","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"Kara Walker is a renowned American contemporary artist known for her exploration of race, gender, and identity through her distinctive silhouette art. Her work often addresses historical narratives and social commentary, using stark black-and-white imagery to provoke thought and discussion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white illustrative silhouettes against expansive pale grounds, with heavy contours and sharply cut graphic shapes. It combines theatrical figures, sweeping gowns, trees, cliffs, and distant scenery into grand, surreal tableaux with strong negative space and an ink-like, paper-cut visual character."},{"id":"norval-morrisseau","name":"Norval Morrisseau","cat":"painters","en":"Norval Morrisseau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norval-morrisseau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norval-morrisseau","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","animals","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["blue","black","vivid-red","green","dark-red","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Norval Morrisseau was a Canadian Indigenous artist, known for founding the Woodland School of Art. His work is celebrated for its vibrant colors, spiritual themes, and depiction of Anishinaabe culture and mythology. Morrisseau's art often features bold lines and symbolic imagery, reflecting his deep connection to his heritage and the natural world.","observation":"Across all four panels, brightly saturated animals and organic forms are reduced to bold, graphic shapes enclosed by heavy black contour lines. The imagery remains abstract and expressive, with flat color areas combined with visible hand-painted texture, concentric circular motifs, and densely arranged decorative forms."},{"id":"robert-henri","name":"Robert Henri","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Henri","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-henri.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-henri","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-orange","muted-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Robert Henri was an influential American painter and teacher, known for his leadership in the Ashcan School of American Realism. He was a key figure in the early 20th century art scene, advocating for a more realistic and unidealized portrayal of urban life and everyday people. Henri's work often focused on portraiture, capturing the essence and character of his subjects with expressive brushwork and a keen eye for detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork to model expressive female portraits against nearly black grounds. Warm flesh tones, deep browns, charcoal blacks, and occasional red or cream accents create a subdued, moody palette with strong light-dark separation, while fur, fabric, and hair are rendered through layered, energetic strokes."},{"id":"michael-shainblum","name":"Michael Shainblum","cat":"photographers","en":"Michael Shainblum","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-shainblum.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-shainblum","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","silhouette"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","deep-blue","red","blue"],"intro":"Michael Shainblum is a renowned photographer known for his breathtaking landscape and astrophotography. His work often captures the majestic beauty of natural environments, blending technical skill with artistic vision to create stunning images that evoke a sense of wonder and exploration.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic landscape photography with dramatic night skies, saturated twilight colors, deep shadows, and luminous celestial detail. Monumental rock formations, misty distance, reflective water, and small human silhouettes create a recurring sense of scale and quiet adventure across the four scenes."},{"id":"thomas-hart-benton","name":"Thomas Hart Benton","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Hart Benton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-hart-benton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-hart-benton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","dark-blue","light-orange","muted-ochre","ochre"],"intro":"Thomas Hart Benton was an influential American painter and muralist, known for his association with the Regionalist art movement. His works often depicted scenes of everyday life in the United States, capturing the spirit and struggles of rural America during the early to mid-20th century. Benton's style is characterized by dynamic compositions, bold forms, and a vivid color palette that brings to life the landscapes and people of his time.","observation":"Across all four images, expansive rural landscapes are rendered with visible, broad, sculpted brushwork and strongly articulated cloud forms. Saturated greens, blues, ochres, and reds, together with deep shadows and bright cloud highlights, create an expressive, monumental illustrative style with a classical pastoral grandeur."},{"id":"jordan-grimmer","name":"Jordan Grimmer","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jordan Grimmer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jordan-grimmer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jordan-grimmer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","muted-blue","charcoal","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Jordan Grimmer is a contemporary artist known for his imaginative and detailed digital artworks, often exploring themes of fantasy and science fiction. His work is characterized by rich textures, vibrant colors, and a strong sense of atmosphere, making him a notable figure in the realm of concept art and digital illustration.","observation":"The style presents immense, highly detailed fantasy landscapes with realistic textures, dramatic cinematic scale, and monumental mountains, cliffs, ruins, and waterfalls. Atmospheric mist, luminous cloud edges, and moody blue-green tones create a grand, otherworldly sense of depth, often punctuated by tiny cloaked figures for scale."},{"id":"grandma-moses","name":"Grandma Moses","cat":"painters","en":"Grandma Moses","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/grandma-moses.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/grandma-moses","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["white","bone-white","silver","beige","dark-olive","ochre","red"],"intro":"Grandma Moses is a renowned American folk artist known for her charming and nostalgic depictions of rural life. Born Anna Mary Robertson Moses in 1860, she began painting in her late 70s and quickly gained fame for her vibrant and detailed portrayals of pastoral scenes. Her work is celebrated for its simplicity, vivid colors, and heartfelt representation of American country life.","observation":"These pictures use a finely rendered, painterly illustrative style with delicate linework, visible brush texture, and carefully described architectural and natural details. Broad rural landscapes are arranged as calm, layered views of villages, farms, hills, and winter activities, using restrained greens, whites, grays, and occasional red buildings."},{"id":"geof-kern","name":"Geof Kern","cat":"photographers","en":"Geof Kern","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/geof-kern.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/geof-kern","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","bone-white","white","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Geof Kern is a renowned American photographer known for his imaginative and surreal imagery. His work often blends elements of fine art and commercial photography, creating unique and thought-provoking compositions. Kern's style is characterized by its narrative quality and meticulous attention to detail, often drawing inspiration from surrealism and mid-20th century aesthetics.","observation":"The style uses monochrome, filmic-looking photographic tableaux with restrained tonal range, dramatic skies, and expansive horizons. Ordinary clothing and landscapes are combined with carefully staged, impossible actions and scale relationships, creating a dreamy, quietly unsettling surrealism."},{"id":"robert-bateman","name":"Robert Bateman","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Bateman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-bateman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-bateman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","muted-blue","black"],"intro":"Robert Bateman is a renowned Canadian naturalist and painter, celebrated for his realistic depictions of wildlife and nature. His work often highlights the beauty and intricacy of the natural world, capturing animals in their habitats with remarkable detail and accuracy. Bateman's paintings have been influential in promoting environmental awareness and conservation efforts.","observation":"Across all four renders, wildlife is depicted with convincing anatomy and richly observed feathers or fur, set against cold, rugged natural environments. Visible paint texture and fine directional strokes model the animals and weathered vegetation, while subdued blue-gray, brown, and charcoal tones create a somber, atmospheric mood."},{"id":"david-brayne","name":"David Brayne","cat":"painters","en":"David Brayne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-brayne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-brayne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-teal","muted-brown","dark-green","muted-ochre","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"David Brayne is a contemporary British artist known for his evocative landscape and figurative paintings. His work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, capturing the essence of rural and coastal life with a distinctive style that blends realism with impressionistic elements.","observation":"The style combines visibly built-up, scratchy paint with broad, expressive marks and subdued blue-green, brown, cream, and red tones. Sparse, stage-like scenes place isolated figures and animals against expansive horizons, using elongated silhouettes, ambiguous spaces, and surreal juxtapositions to create a moody, dreamlike tension."},{"id":"otl-aicher","name":"Otl Aicher","cat":"designers","en":"Otl Aicher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/otl-aicher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/otl-aicher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["cream","black","charcoal","silver","dark-blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Otl Aicher is a renowned German graphic designer and typographer, best known for his work on the 1972 Munich Olympics. He was a key figure in the development of modernist design in Germany and a co-founder of the Ulm School of Design, which played a significant role in shaping post-war European design.","observation":"The style is abstract and geometric, built from crisp circles, squares, arcs, grids, dots, and repeated modular forms. It relies on flat color, stark black-and-white contrast, occasional saturated red and blue, and precise fine-line constructions, with clean poster-like edges throughout."},{"id":"tim-flach","name":"Tim Flach","cat":"photographers","en":"Tim Flach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-flach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-flach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Tim Flach is a renowned British photographer known for his distinctive and intimate portraits of animals. His work often explores the relationship between humans and animals, capturing the unique personalities and emotions of his subjects. Flach's photography is celebrated for its technical precision and artistic depth, making him a prominent figure in contemporary wildlife and animal portraiture.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped animal portraits with exceptionally detailed fur, feathers, skin, and eyes. Strong studio-like contrast against a dark teal ground makes the predominantly white subjects feel sculptural and dramatic, while shallow focus emphasizes their faces and surface texture."},{"id":"daphne-odjig","name":"Daphne Odjig","cat":"painters","en":"Daphne Odjig","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daphne-odjig.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daphne-odjig","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","floral","landscapes","patterns","motion","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["blue","vivid-red","light-orange","charcoal","grey","dark-brown"],"intro":"Daphne Odjig is a renowned Canadian artist of Indigenous descent, celebrated for her contributions to contemporary Indigenous art. Her work often explores themes of community, mythology, and nature, drawing inspiration from her Ojibwa heritage. Odjig's distinctive style combines elements of modernism with traditional Indigenous motifs, creating a unique visual language that has earned her a prominent place in the art world.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated reds, oranges, blues, and creams are shaped into energetic swirling forms, dense motifs, and strongly outlined organic figures. Visible broad paint strokes and layered, tactile color give both the abstract compositions and the landscape scene a richly hand-painted character."},{"id":"derek-gores","name":"Derek Gores","cat":"various-artists","en":"Derek Gores","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/derek-gores.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/derek-gores","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["beige","silver","vivid-red","brown","black","red"],"intro":"Derek Gores is an American artist known for his innovative collage techniques, blending elements of realism and abstraction. His work often explores themes of beauty, fashion, and consumer culture, using recycled magazines and other materials to create intricate and layered compositions.","observation":"The style combines recognizable fashion figures and urban settings with heavily built-up, collage-like painted surfaces. Broad, visible strokes, pasted-paper textures, fragmented geometry, and forceful red, black, white, and gray contrasts create an expressive editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"louis-stettner","name":"Louis Stettner","cat":"photographers","en":"Louis Stettner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-stettner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-stettner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Louis Stettner was an American photographer known for his street photography and humanist approach, capturing the essence of urban life in both New York and Paris. His work often focused on the everyday moments of ordinary people, reflecting a deep empathy and connection to his subjects. Stettner's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey emotion and narrative through simple yet powerful compositions.","observation":"The style is stark monochrome documentary photography, using deep blacks, bright window light, pronounced grain, and selective focus. Candid passengers and musicians are framed tightly within subway interiors, with reflections, poles, and layered windows creating an intimate, cinematic sense of urban life."},{"id":"michael-bierut","name":"Michael Bierut","cat":"designers","en":"Michael Bierut","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-bierut.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-bierut","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","sculptural","patterns","urban","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","bone-white","grey","dark-blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"Michael Bierut is a renowned American graphic designer, known for his impactful contributions to contemporary design. He has worked with prestigious firms and clients, bringing a modernist approach to branding and visual communication. Bierut's work is characterized by its clarity, wit, and strategic thinking, making him a leading figure in the design world.","observation":"The style combines crisp, flat geometric shapes with vivid primary colors, heavy black accents, oversized letterforms, and repeated stripe or curve patterns. Across the renders, these graphic designs appear as large-scale gallery installations and posters, with strong contrast and occasional dimensional presentation in the exhibition setting."},{"id":"heidi-swapp","name":"Heidi Swapp","cat":"various-artists","en":"Heidi Swapp","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/heidi-swapp.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/heidi-swapp","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","patterns","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["white","bone-white","light-teal","ochre","brown","red"],"intro":"Heidi Swapp is a well-known designer and entrepreneur in the crafting industry, recognized for her innovative products and creative approach to scrapbooking and paper crafting. She has made significant contributions to the DIY and crafting community, inspiring many with her unique style and creative techniques.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with vivid turquoise, coral, pink, black, and metallic gold accents. Floral assemblages, illustrated birds, paint tools, paper, and overlapping canvas panels create dense overhead still lifes with collage-like layering and energetic broad brushwork."},{"id":"brian-skerry","name":"Brian Skerry","cat":"photographers","en":"Brian Skerry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-skerry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-skerry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["dark-cyan","muted-cyan","black","silver","dark-brown"],"intro":"Brian Skerry is a renowned underwater photographer known for his captivating images of marine life and ocean environments. His work often highlights the beauty and fragility of underwater ecosystems, bringing attention to conservation issues. Skerry's photographs have been featured in numerous publications, including National Geographic, where he has contributed extensively to marine stories.","observation":"The style is photorealistic and cinematic, using immersive underwater viewpoints, strong teal-blue color, bright shafts of light, and deep shadow for dramatic contrast. Large marine animals, divers, bubbles, ice, kelp, and schooling fish are rendered with abundant textural detail, often combining intimate close-ups with expansive environmental views and selective focus."},{"id":"hengki-koentjoro","name":"Hengki Koentjoro","cat":"photographers","en":"Hengki Koentjoro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hengki-koentjoro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hengki-koentjoro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","epic","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Hengki Koentjoro is an Indonesian photographer known for his captivating black and white landscapes that explore the interplay between light and shadow. His work often features serene and mysterious scenes, capturing the essence of nature and human interaction within it. Koentjoro's photography is celebrated for its minimalist approach and ethereal quality, often evoking a sense of tranquility and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic monochrome landscape photography with deep blacks, luminous whites, and strongly simplified silhouettes. Expansive water, fog, cloud, and sky create large areas of negative space, while tiny boats, people, trees, and palms provide scale and quiet narrative movement."},{"id":"richard-s-johnson","name":"Richard S. Johnson","cat":"painters","en":"Richard S. Johnson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-s-johnson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-s-johnson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","dark-ochre","dark-olive","bone-white","brown","ochre","red"],"intro":"Richard S. Johnson is a contemporary American painter known for his romantic and impressionistic style. His work often features ethereal depictions of feminine beauty, blending classical techniques with modern sensibilities. Johnson's paintings are characterized by their dreamy and serene atmospheres, often incorporating floral elements and soft, pastel color palettes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, energetic brushwork to build richly layered gardens, figures, and flowing dresses. Warm sunlight, saturated greens, pinks, and whites create a romantic, dreamlike atmosphere, while the repeated women and floral settings feel like graceful classical tableaux."},{"id":"jon-mcnaughton","name":"Jon McNaughton","cat":"painters","en":"Jon McNaughton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jon-mcnaughton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jon-mcnaughton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","light-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Jon McNaughton is an American artist known for his politically charged paintings that often depict patriotic themes and historical figures. His work frequently sparks discussion and debate due to its bold and sometimes controversial subject matter.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, visibly layered oil-paint-like brushwork with broad strokes, tactile surfaces, and expressive modeling of faces, clothing, crowds, and weather. Restrained earthy colors are punctuated by fire, red ties, and flags, while strong light-dark contrasts and theatrical arrangements create dark, cinematic historical tableaus."},{"id":"wyndham-lewis","name":"Wyndham Lewis","cat":"painters","en":"Wyndham Lewis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wyndham-lewis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wyndham-lewis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","light-yellow","muted-brown","grey","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Wyndham Lewis was a British painter and writer, known for his role in the Vorticist movement, which combined elements of Cubism and Futurism. His work often explored themes of modernity and industrialization, characterized by bold geometric forms and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable people and urban settings are constructed from sharply faceted geometric planes, with strong reds, teals, creams, and blacks creating a vivid, high-contrast effect. Visible directional brushwork and textured paint give the graphic compositions a hand-painted surface, while the recurring figures, vehicles, and street activity create an expressive narrative quality."},{"id":"mark-hearld","name":"Mark Hearld","cat":"various-artists","en":"Mark Hearld","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-hearld.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-hearld","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-blue","silver","charcoal","light-orange","red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Mark Hearld is a contemporary British artist known for his vibrant and imaginative works that draw inspiration from the natural world and British folklore. He is celebrated for his use of collage, printmaking, and mixed media, creating pieces that are both decorative and narrative in nature.","observation":"The style combines visible, directional paint strokes with finely drawn outlines and selectively flat, graphic color shapes. Dense tropical birds, foliage, flowers, and patterned plumage fill the frame in an ornate, layered arrangement, using saturated reds, blues, creams, and dark accents for an energetic decorative effect."},{"id":"taras-loboda","name":"Taras Loboda","cat":"painters","en":"Taras Loboda","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/taras-loboda.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/taras-loboda","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","illustrative","ornate","fashion","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["deep-red","black","charcoal","rust","beige"],"intro":"Taras Loboda is a contemporary Ukrainian artist known for his expressive and vibrant paintings, often focusing on the human form and emotional depth. His work is characterized by a blend of traditional techniques and modern sensibilities, capturing the essence of his subjects with bold colors and dynamic compositions.","observation":"The style uses intensely saturated red, black, and gold with stark contrast, painterly surface marks, and graphic, assertive shapes. Fashion portraits are tightly cropped and repeatedly obscure the faces with hats, gloves, fabric, or shadow, creating a bold, mysterious, surreal presentation."},{"id":"brandon-mably","name":"Brandon Mably","cat":"designers","en":"Brandon Mably","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brandon-mably.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brandon-mably","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["vivid-red","dark-green","deep-blue","ochre","dark-pink","green"],"intro":"Brandon Mably is a renowned textile designer known for his vibrant and bold patterns. He has collaborated extensively with Kaffe Fassett , contributing to the world of contemporary textile arts with his unique and colorful designs.","observation":"The style is a densely packed botanical fantasy built from highly saturated colors, clean graphic shapes, and abundant decorative patterning. Flowers, leaves, coral-like forms, and branching silhouettes overlap almost completely, combining flat color areas with fine internal marks, stippling, and intricate surface motifs."},{"id":"marc-simonetti","name":"Marc Simonetti","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marc Simonetti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-simonetti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-simonetti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","grey","rust","muted-ochre","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Marc Simonetti is a renowned French illustrator and concept artist, best known for his work in fantasy and science fiction genres. He has contributed to various high-profile projects, including book covers for popular series such as \"A Song of Ice and Fire\" by George R.R. Martin. Simonetti's work is characterized by its vivid imagination, intricate details, and a strong sense of atmosphere.","observation":"The style presents immense fantasy cityscapes with monumental architecture, deep chasms, bridges, waterfalls, and small human figures that emphasize scale. Rich blue shadows contrast with warm lantern and firelight, while atmospheric haze, intricate structures, and cinematic depth create an epic, immersive realism."},{"id":"pacita-abad","name":"Pacita Abad","cat":"painters","en":"Pacita Abad","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pacita-abad.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pacita-abad","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","vivid-red","muted-green","dark-blue","red","charcoal"],"intro":"Pacita Abad was a renowned Filipino artist known for her vibrant and colorful paintings, often incorporating traditional Filipino patterns and themes. Her work is celebrated for its bold use of color and intricate details, reflecting her diverse cultural influences and personal experiences.","observation":"The style combines highly saturated colors with dense, painterly surface work, filling portraits and floral forms with layered patterns, fine marks, and textile-like textures. Faces are stylized and expressive, while flowers, clothing, and foliage interlock into ornate, nearly collage-like compositions with strong graphic contours."},{"id":"nathan-wirth","name":"Nathan Wirth","cat":"photographers","en":"Nathan Wirth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nathan-wirth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nathan-wirth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Nathan Wirth is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative black and white landscapes. His work often explores themes of solitude and tranquility, capturing the beauty and mystery of natural settings through a minimalist lens. Wirth's photography is characterized by its use of long exposure techniques, creating ethereal and dreamlike images that invite viewers to pause and reflect.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white landscape photography with deep shadows, luminous highlights, and expansive compositions. Mist, distant terrain, solitary trees or figures, and carefully placed light create a bleak, monumental, contemplative atmosphere."},{"id":"clarence-gagnon","name":"Clarence Gagnon","cat":"painters","en":"Clarence Gagnon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clarence-gagnon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clarence-gagnon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["muted-blue","silver","grey","charcoal","light-orange","ochre"],"intro":"Clarence Gagnon was a Canadian painter known for his vivid depictions of rural Quebec landscapes. Born in 1881, Gagnon studied in Paris and became renowned for his ability to capture the serene beauty of the Canadian countryside, particularly its winter scenes. His work is characterized by a harmonious blend of color and light, often portraying the quiet charm of village life amidst snow-covered landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured oil paint with visible directional brushwork, carefully described architecture, snow, trees, and figures. Cool blue-violet shadows contrast with bright snow and occasional warm accents, while steep village landscapes and nostalgic winter scenes are composed with realistic yet painterly clarity."},{"id":"christophe-vacher","name":"Christophe Vacher","cat":"illustrators","en":"Christophe Vacher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christophe-vacher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christophe-vacher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","ochre","charcoal","light-orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"Christophe Vacher is a French artist known for his work in the animation industry and his evocative fantasy landscapes. His art often explores themes of mythology and the fantastical, blending traditional painting techniques with digital mediums to create immersive worlds.","observation":"The style presents vast fantasy landscapes with highly detailed, realistic environmental rendering and cinematic vertical compositions. Monumental cliffs, floating landforms, waterfalls, ruins, and colossal trees are shaped by dramatic warm-versus-cool lighting, glowing skies, deep shadows, and atmospheric mist, with tiny figures reinforcing the epic scale."},{"id":"philipp-plein","name":"Philipp Plein","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Philipp Plein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philipp-plein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philipp-plein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","still-life","high-contrast","metallic","subdued-colors","dark","symmetry"],"colours":["white","brown","black","beige"],"intro":"Philipp Plein is a German fashion designer known for his extravagant and edgy designs. His brand is synonymous with luxury and bold aesthetics, often incorporating elements like skulls and metallic embellishments. Plein's work is characterized by its opulence, combining high fashion with a rock and roll edge.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, highly embellished fashion pieces as polished product imagery, with black leather, dense studs, spikes, metallic ornament, and recurring skull motifs. Strong symmetry, centered framing, crisp detail, and stark light backgrounds create a bold luxury-gothic presentation, while the sneaker render adds dramatic dark-to-light contrast and reflective surfaces."},{"id":"bethany-lowe","name":"Bethany Lowe","cat":"designers","en":"Bethany Lowe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bethany-lowe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bethany-lowe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-brown","black","rust","orange"],"intro":"Bethany Lowe is an American designer known for her whimsical and nostalgic holiday decorations, often inspired by vintage and folk art traditions. Her work typically features handcrafted elements that evoke a sense of nostalgia and charm, appealing to collectors and enthusiasts of Americana and vintage aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents richly dressed, handmade-looking Halloween dolls and clown-like figures as carefully staged tabletop tableaux. Visible fabric texture, frayed edges, stitched faces, feathers, painted details, and dimensional modelling create a tactile, ornate surface, while subdued autumn colors and warm, shadowy candlelit interiors give the scenes a dark theatrical mood."},{"id":"felipe-pantone","name":"Felipe Pantone","cat":"various-artists","en":"Felipe Pantone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/felipe-pantone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/felipe-pantone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","patterns","glow","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","silver","charcoal","vivid-red","blue","pink","light-green"],"intro":"Felipe Pantone is an Argentine-Spanish contemporary artist known for his dynamic and visually striking works that blend elements of kinetic art, graffiti, and digital aesthetics. His art often explores themes of technology, speed, and the digital age, characterized by bold colors and geometric patterns.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines hard-edged geometric blocks, stripes, checkerboards, and color bars with aggressive digital distortion and dense pattern overlays. Saturated rainbow hues collide with deep black and white, while selective gradients, pixel breakup, and reflective surfaces create a vivid, high-contrast, surreal visual language."},{"id":"mamoru-oshii","name":"Mamoru Oshii","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mamoru Oshii","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mamoru-oshii.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mamoru-oshii","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","silver","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Mamoru Oshii is a renowned Japanese filmmaker and screenwriter, best known for his work in anime and live-action films. His influential projects include \"Ghost in the Shell,\" which has left a significant mark on the science fiction genre. Oshii's storytelling often explores themes of technology, identity, and existentialism, blending philosophical depth with visually striking narratives.","observation":"Across the sheet, expressive painted-and-drawn character portraits combine rough brush texture, heavy contouring, distressed surfaces, and dense mechanical detail. The palette is predominantly dark and moody, punctuated by stark highlights and red accents, while masks, armor, tubing, and futuristic urban elements create a grim science-fiction atmosphere."},{"id":"antonio-mora","name":"Antonio Mora","cat":"various-artists","en":"Antonio Mora","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antonio-mora.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antonio-mora","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","portraits","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","white","silver","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Antonio Mora is a contemporary artist known for his unique approach to digital art, often blending human and natural elements to create surreal and introspective pieces. His work is characterized by a seamless integration of photographic elements, resulting in a dreamlike quality that challenges the viewer's perception of reality.","observation":"A monochrome double-exposure style merges close-up female portraits with dense city architecture, mountains, trees, and clouds. High tonal contrast, translucent overlays, drifting hair, and softly fading edges create a detailed yet dreamy surreal collage."},{"id":"sam-kieth","name":"Sam Kieth","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sam Kieth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sam-kieth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sam-kieth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["cream","black","brown","beige","olive","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Sam Kieth is an American comic book writer and illustrator, best known for his work on \"The Maxx,\" a comic book series that blends elements of fantasy, horror, and psychological drama. His distinctive style is characterized by its surreal and expressive qualities, often featuring exaggerated characters and dreamlike settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines expressive ink drawing with visibly rough, layered brushwork, fine contour lines, splatters, and distressed paper-like texture. Dark, grotesque figures and animal forms dominate pale grounds, with restrained earthy color, stark black masses, and occasional orange or red accents creating a macabre fantasy mood."},{"id":"filip-dujardin","name":"Filip Dujardin","cat":"photographers","en":"Filip Dujardin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/filip-dujardin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/filip-dujardin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","sci-fi","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","brown","beige","dark-olive","olive"],"intro":"Filip Dujardin is a Belgian photographer known for his unique approach to architectural photography. He is recognized for creating surreal and imaginative structures through digital manipulation, blending reality with fantasy to challenge perceptions of architecture and space.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic architectural imagery with subdued colors, overcast light, and carefully observed concrete, brick, glass, and vegetation textures. Monumental apartment structures are isolated in expansive landscapes, using generous negative space and restrained, centered compositions to create a surreal, quietly dystopian atmosphere."},{"id":"anne-brigman","name":"Anne Brigman","cat":"photographers","en":"Anne Brigman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-brigman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-brigman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","backlighting","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Anne Brigman was an American photographer known for her pioneering work in the early 20th century. She was a prominent figure in the Pictorialist movement, which sought to elevate photography to the level of fine art. Brigman's work often featured ethereal images of women in natural settings, emphasizing a mystical connection with nature. Her photographs are celebrated for their poetic quality and innovative use of composition and light.","observation":"A cinematic, monochrome visual style built from monumental coastal landscapes, isolated figures, and stark silhouettes against luminous storm-filled skies. Heavy grain, deep blacks, strong backlighting, and veiled sea mist give every image a bleak, mythic atmosphere with expansive negative space."},{"id":"oskar-kokoschka","name":"Oskar Kokoschka","cat":"painters","en":"Oskar Kokoschka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oskar-kokoschka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oskar-kokoschka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-ochre","grey","dark-brown","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Oskar Kokoschka is an Austrian painter and playwright known for his intense expressionist portraits and landscapes. His work is characterized by bold brushstrokes, vivid colors, and a deep exploration of human emotion and psychological depth. Kokoschka's art often reflects the turbulent historical context of early 20th-century Europe, capturing the essence of the human condition with raw intensity.","observation":"Across the four renders, the style is defined by heavily worked, visible paint with directional strokes and raised impasto, combining vivid reds, blues, greens, and ochres. Faces, figures, and landscapes remain recognisable but are distorted and vigorously reconstructed through expressive marks, layered color, and dense painterly texture."},{"id":"liu-xiaodong","name":"Liu Xiaodong","cat":"painters","en":"Liu Xiaodong","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/liu-xiaodong.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/liu-xiaodong","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-olive","dark-olive","muted-blue","bone-white","charcoal","rust"],"intro":"Liu Xiaodong is a contemporary Chinese painter known for his large-scale, realistic portraits and scenes that capture the nuances of modern life. His work often explores themes of identity, culture, and the human condition, with a focus on the everyday experiences of ordinary people. Liu's paintings are characterized by their expressive brushwork and attention to detail, offering a vivid portrayal of his subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable people and outdoor settings are built from visible, broad, directional paint strokes, with thick textured passages in foliage, clothing, and architecture. Saturated blues, greens, whites, and warm skin tones create a lively sunlit mood, while candid gestures and cropped compositions convey movement and everyday activity."},{"id":"tim-noble","name":"Tim Noble","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tim Noble","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-noble.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-noble","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","brown","silver","orange"],"intro":"Tim Noble is a contemporary British artist known for his innovative approach to sculpture and installation art. He often collaborates with Sue Webster, creating works that explore themes of identity, perception, and the human condition. Their art frequently involves the use of found objects and light to create shadow sculptures that challenge viewers' perceptions.","observation":"Across all four renders, tall humanoid forms are built from tangled wire, scraps of fabric, branches, and skeletal frameworks, giving the style a highly detailed, physically assembled sculptural quality. Muted gallery spaces, hard directional sunlight, strong cast shadows, and generous empty backgrounds create a stark, uncanny atmosphere around the surreal figures."},{"id":"edoardo-tresoldi","name":"Edoardo Tresoldi","cat":"architects","en":"Edoardo Tresoldi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edoardo-tresoldi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edoardo-tresoldi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","motion","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-blue","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Edoardo Tresoldi is an Italian artist known for his large-scale wire mesh sculptures that blend art and architecture. His works often explore the relationship between the human form and architectural spaces, creating ethereal and contemplative experiences for viewers.","observation":"Across all four views, realistic architectural settings are overlaid with immense translucent, wire-like glowing structures that reconstruct or echo the surrounding monuments. Warm orange illumination, dusk or dim interiors, moving visitors, and long-exposure blur create a cinematic, dreamlike sense of temporary monumental installation."},{"id":"christian-lacroix","name":"Christian Lacroix","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Christian Lacroix","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-lacroix.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-lacroix","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","patterns","portraits","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","black","red","dark-blue","yellow"],"intro":"Christian Lacroix is a renowned French fashion designer celebrated for his opulent and theatrical couture creations. Known for his vibrant use of color, intricate detailing, and innovative designs, Lacroix has left a significant mark on the fashion industry since the late 20th century, often drawing inspiration from historical and cultural themes.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed editorial fashion imagery with exuberant floral textiles, patterned garments, sculptural headpieces, and densely decorated interiors. It repeatedly mixes photographic portraiture with illustrative, cut-paper-like collage elements, producing a vivid, ornate, surreal presentation."},{"id":"walter-crane","name":"Walter Crane","cat":"illustrators","en":"Walter Crane","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walter-crane.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walter-crane","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","floral","patterns","fine-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["muted-olive","brown","ochre","red","dark-brown","light-orange"],"intro":"Walter Crane was an English artist and book illustrator, known for his contributions to the Arts and Crafts Movement and his work in children's book illustrations. Born in 1845, Crane's work is characterized by its intricate line work, vibrant colors, and incorporation of classical and mythological themes. His illustrations often feature detailed floral patterns and elegant, flowing figures, making him a prominent figure in the Art Nouveau movement.","observation":"The style uses finely inked, illustrative figures and animals embedded in dense botanical compositions, with elaborate costumes and repeating decorative patterns. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and ochres, together with precise contouring and ornamental detail, create a lush storybook fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"grigory-gluckmann","name":"Grigory Gluckmann","cat":"painters","en":"Grigory Gluckmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/grigory-gluckmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/grigory-gluckmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","orange","pale-orange"],"intro":"Grigory Gluckmann was a Russian-born painter known for his evocative and intimate portrayals of human figures, often focusing on themes of solitude and introspection. His work is characterized by a soft, painterly style with a focus on delicate lighting and detailed textures, reflecting influences from both Russian and French art traditions.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses finely rendered faces with visible, delicate brushwork and a tactile, roughened surface. Subdued brown, black, and flesh tones are set against deep backgrounds, producing high contrast and a classical, somber mood in tightly cropped compositions."},{"id":"piet-parra","name":"Piet Parra","cat":"various-artists","en":"Piet Parra","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/piet-parra.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/piet-parra","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["blue","vivid-red","black","pale-cyan","light-red","red"],"intro":"Piet Parra is a contemporary Dutch artist known for his vibrant and playful illustrations, often featuring surreal and abstract elements. His work is characterized by bold colors, geometric shapes, and a distinctive style that blends pop art with modernist influences. Parra's art often explores themes of urban culture and fantasy, creating a unique visual language that is both whimsical and thought-provoking.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses saturated color blocks, thick black contouring, and simplified geometric forms to build highly expressive faces and creatures. Clean illustrative shapes are combined with a visible painted or canvas-like surface texture, while crowded compositions, exaggerated eyes, and surreal distortions create a lively graphic effect."},{"id":"hense","name":"HENSE","cat":"street-artists","en":"HENSE","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hense.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hense","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["blue","beige","charcoal","pink","vivid-red","orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"HENSE is a contemporary street artist known for his vibrant and abstract murals that transform urban spaces. His work often incorporates bold colors and dynamic shapes, creating a sense of movement and energy. HENSE's art bridges the gap between street art and fine art, making his pieces recognizable in various public settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, large urban wall murals combine vivid saturated colors with abstract, expressive forms, overlapping geometric fragments, gestural marks, and occasional floral-like shapes. Broad visible strokes, flat color fields, drips, and splatters create a layered hand-painted surface, while the street-facing buildings and people at work establish the mural context."},{"id":"norman-parkinson","name":"Norman Parkinson","cat":"photographers","en":"Norman Parkinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norman-parkinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norman-parkinson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","landscapes","scenes","light-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["muted-blue","silver","ochre","beige","black","dark-brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Norman Parkinson was a renowned British fashion and portrait photographer, known for his innovative and influential work in the mid-20th century. His photography was characterized by a sense of elegance, glamour, and a playful approach to fashion, which helped redefine the genre. Parkinson's work appeared in major publications like Vogue and Harper's Bazaar, and he was celebrated for his ability to capture the spirit of the times with a unique blend of sophistication and whimsy.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic fashion photography with carefully staged figures in flowing garments and oversized hats. Soft sunlight, pale coastal colors, ornate interiors, and expansive skies create a dreamy, aspirational atmosphere, while the detailed settings and monumental compositions give the images an epic editorial quality."},{"id":"harry-furniss","name":"Harry Furniss","cat":"illustrators","en":"Harry Furniss","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harry-furniss.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harry-furniss","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","light-orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Harry Furniss is a renowned British illustrator known for his satirical and humorous drawings, particularly during the Victorian era. His work often appeared in publications like Punch magazine, where he became famous for his caricatures and detailed illustrations that captured the social nuances of his time.","observation":"The style uses densely composed figurative scenes rendered in black, white, and warm sepia with emphatic ink contours, fine hatching, and deep tonal contrasts. Numerous formally dressed characters, expressive faces, and overlapping social situations create the feel of richly detailed illustrated tableaux on textured paper."},{"id":"vladimir-volegov","name":"Vladimir Volegov","cat":"painters","en":"Vladimir Volegov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vladimir-volegov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vladimir-volegov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","pastel-colors"],"colours":["muted-orange","beige","dark-olive","bone-white","grey","rust"],"intro":"Vladimir Volegov is a contemporary Russian artist known for his impressionistic and romantic paintings, often depicting serene and intimate scenes of feminine beauty. His works are characterized by a delicate use of color, fine brushwork, and a focus on light and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, broad, energetic paint strokes to build richly textured gardens, dresses, foliage, water, and architecture. Soft pinks, creams, greens, and blues create a luminous pastel atmosphere, while elegant female figures and summery outdoor scenes provide a consistent romantic narrative."},{"id":"ronnie-landfield","name":"Ronnie Landfield","cat":"painters","en":"Ronnie Landfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ronnie-landfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ronnie-landfield","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["vivid-red","charcoal","grey","red","orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"Ronnie Landfield is an American painter known for his contributions to the Lyrical Abstraction movement. His work often features vibrant color fields and expressive forms, drawing inspiration from both natural landscapes and emotional experiences.","observation":"The style combines vivid, highly saturated color with visible, energetic paint handling: broad swaths, fine linear strokes, splatters, drips, and marbled transitions recur throughout the sheet. It moves between recognizable woodland scenery and increasingly abstract organic compositions, retaining dense, expressive layering and strong contrast across all four renders."},{"id":"bill-schorr","name":"Bill Schorr","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bill Schorr","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-schorr.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-schorr","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","white","beige","grey","dark-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Bill Schorr is a renowned American cartoonist known for his work in editorial cartoons and comic strips. His career spans several decades, during which he has contributed to various newspapers and publications, often infusing humor and satire into his illustrations.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed character portraiture with expressive faces, busy workroom settings, and surreal animal or botanical imagery. It shifts between finely lined, ink-like illustration and richly textured color portraiture, alongside stark monochrome treatments, while retaining dense compositions and an imaginative, slightly uncanny mood."},{"id":"gabriele-munter","name":"Gabriele Munter","cat":"painters","en":"Gabriele Munter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gabriele-munter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gabriele-munter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["red","charcoal","muted-green","bone-white","muted-blue","deep-blue"],"intro":"Gabriele Munter was a German expressionist painter associated with the early 20th-century art movement known as Der Blaue Reiter. Her work is characterized by bold colors, simplified forms, and a focus on emotional expression. Munter's paintings often depict landscapes and village scenes, capturing the essence of rural life with a vibrant and dynamic approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vivid, high-contrast colors and visibly broad, directional brushwork to build simplified rural landscapes, clustered villages, and winding roads. Strong dark contours, expressive shapes, and thick painted texture give the scenes a boldly illustrative, slightly dreamlike character."},{"id":"bernard-buffet","name":"Bernard Buffet","cat":"painters","en":"Bernard Buffet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bernard-buffet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bernard-buffet","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","portraits","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","painterly","subdued-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["brown","grey","black","bone-white","muted-ochre","ochre"],"intro":"Bernard Buffet is a renowned French painter known for his distinctive style characterized by stark lines and a somber palette. Emerging in the post-war era, Buffet's work often reflects themes of existentialism and urban isolation, capturing the mood of mid-20th century Europe. His paintings frequently depict urban landscapes and still lifes, marked by a unique blend of expressionism and realism.","observation":"The style combines muted blue-gray and ochre painting with dense, scratchy black linework, crosshatched shading, and visibly textured surfaces. Repeated urban views emphasize Paris-like rooftops, churches, waterways, boats, and bare trees, while the occasional portrait uses the same angular outlines and restrained palette."},{"id":"audemars-piguet","name":"Audemars Piguet","cat":"designers","en":"Audemars Piguet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/audemars-piguet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/audemars-piguet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","still-life","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","grey","silver"],"intro":"Audemars Piguet is a renowned Swiss watchmaker known for its luxury timepieces and innovative designs. Established in 1875, the brand has a rich heritage in crafting high-quality watches that combine traditional techniques with modern aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents luxury wristwatches as highly realistic macro still lifes, with dense mechanical detail, sculptural cases, and richly textured natural settings. Subdued earthy colors, metallic highlights, strong contrast, and selective focus create a dark, premium product-photography atmosphere."},{"id":"victor-brauner","name":"Victor Brauner","cat":"painters","en":"Victor Brauner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/victor-brauner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/victor-brauner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-brown","charcoal","vivid-rust","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Victor Brauner is a Romanian-born surrealist painter known for his association with the surrealist movement in France. His work often explores themes of mythology, dreams, and the subconscious, characterized by a unique blend of symbolism and abstraction. Brauner's art is marked by its imaginative and often enigmatic quality, reflecting his interest in the mystical and the irrational.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines roughly textured painted surfaces with flat, saturated geometric shapes and strong dark outlines. It repeatedly uses elongated mask-like figures, staring eyes, radiating forms, and fanciful bird or animal creatures in densely arranged, surreal compositions."},{"id":"aryz","name":"Aryz","cat":"street-artists","en":"Aryz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aryz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aryz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","drawing"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","red","muted-cyan","pale-blue","dark-blue"],"intro":"Aryz is a contemporary Spanish street artist known for his large-scale murals and distinctive style that blends surrealism with urban art. His work often features fantastical creatures and vibrant colors, making him a prominent figure in the street art scene.","observation":"Across all four renders, large figurative murals transform weathered urban facades with densely layered portrait imagery, anatomical and mechanical motifs, and occasional lettering. Strong black contour lines, clean graphic color fields, saturated teal-coral-pink palettes, and expressive distorted faces give the work a comic-like illustrative energy, while the surrounding rubble and buildings anchor it in real streetscapes."},{"id":"oleg-cassini","name":"Oleg Cassini","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Oleg Cassini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oleg-cassini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oleg-cassini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","beige"],"intro":"Oleg Cassini is a renowned fashion designer known for his elegant and sophisticated designs. He gained fame as a designer for Jacqueline Kennedy, creating iconic looks that defined an era of American fashion. Cassini's work is characterized by its timeless elegance, luxurious fabrics, and meticulous attention to detail.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic bridal fashion imagery with elaborate lace, embroidery, beading, veils, and sculpted silhouettes rendered in restrained ivory and cream tones. Models are posed like polished editorial or runway portraits, with a mixture of soft studio light, dramatic interiors, and cinematic framing."},{"id":"nicola-samori","name":"Nicola Samori","cat":"painters","en":"Nicola Samori","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicola-samori.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicola-samori","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Nicola Samori is an Italian contemporary artist known for his haunting and evocative paintings that often explore themes of decay and transformation. His work is characterized by a unique blend of classical techniques and modern sensibilities, drawing inspiration from Baroque art and contemporary expressionism.","observation":"Across all four portraits, faces and upper bodies emerge from near-black grounds through layered, visibly directional brushwork. Muted charcoal, umber, blue-gray, and chalky white create a somber atmosphere, while sweeping paint obscures the eyes and partially dissolves the figures into expressive, surreal forms."},{"id":"beth-conklin","name":"Beth Conklin","cat":"various-artists","en":"Beth Conklin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/beth-conklin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/beth-conklin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["grey","muted-olive","black","dark-brown","muted-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Beth Conklin is a contemporary artist known for her unique style that blends elements of fantasy and surrealism. Her work often explores themes of nature, childhood, and the whimsical, creating a dreamlike atmosphere that captivates viewers.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly portraiture with carefully staged, storybook tableaux. Restrained turquoise, cream, brown, and red hues, elaborate period-like clothing, bare branches, birds, and softly atmospheric backgrounds create an uncanny, dreamlike mood across the set."},{"id":"gino-severini","name":"Gino Severini","cat":"painters","en":"Gino Severini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gino-severini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gino-severini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","bone-white","grey","brown","red","dark-blue","pink"],"intro":"Gino Severini was an Italian painter and a leading figure in the Futurist movement. Born in 1883, Severini was known for his dynamic compositions that captured the essence of movement and modern life. His work often incorporated elements of Cubism and Neo- Impressionism , reflecting his interest in both the scientific and emotional aspects of art.","observation":"Across all four renders, crowded human scenes are broken into angular, faceted planes with vigorous visible brushwork and a richly textured paint surface. Saturated reds, blues, blacks, creams, and ochres create a dense geometric rhythm, while recognizable figures and architecture remain partially legible within the expressive fragmentation."},{"id":"david-mould","name":"David Mould","cat":"photographers","en":"David Mould","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-mould.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-mould","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","muted-ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"David Mould is a photographer known for capturing ethereal and atmospheric landscapes. His work often explores the interplay of light and nature, creating scenes that evoke a sense of tranquility and introspection. Mould's photography is characterized by its soft focus and muted color palettes, which contribute to the dreamlike quality of his images.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is photographic and cinematic, built around quiet lake landscapes with layered trees, reflective water, and strong atmospheric depth. Subdued earthy colors, isolated warm sunlight, dark silhouettes, and pervasive mist create a moody, contemplative sense of stillness."},{"id":"james-paick","name":"James Paick","cat":"various-artists","en":"James Paick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-paick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-paick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","subdued-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","white","muted-ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"James Paick is a renowned concept artist known for his work in the entertainment industry, particularly in video games and films. His expertise lies in creating immersive and detailed environments that capture the imagination and transport viewers to fantastical worlds.","observation":"The style depicts immense vertical cityscapes where futuristic towers, monumental ruins, bridges, cliffs, and waterfalls merge into one densely layered environment. It uses cinematic framing, realistic architectural detail, cool misty distance, subdued stone tones, and sharply contrasted warm internal lights to create an epic science-fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"tara-mcpherson","name":"Tara McPherson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tara McPherson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tara-mcpherson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tara-mcpherson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["muted-cyan","muted-green","black","orange","vivid-red","red"],"intro":"Tara McPherson is an American artist known for her distinctive pop surrealist style, often featuring whimsical and ethereal themes. Her work is characterized by dreamlike imagery, blending elements of fantasy and surrealism with a touch of darkness. McPherson's art often explores themes of innocence and wonder, drawing inspiration from mythology, nature, and contemporary pop culture.","observation":"The style combines highly saturated turquoise, coral, pink, red, and black with clean graphic shapes, strong outlines, and visible painted texture. Close-up female portraits are richly embellished with flowing hair, dramatic makeup, birds, flowers, and decorative motifs, producing a bold surreal fashion-illustration effect."},{"id":"gerhard-richter","name":"Gerhard Richter","cat":"various-artists","en":"Gerhard Richter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerhard-richter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerhard-richter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","bone-white","dark-brown","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Gerhard Richter is a renowned German visual artist known for his diverse and innovative approaches to painting. Born in 1932, Richter's work spans various styles, including abstract and photorealistic painting. He is celebrated for his ability to blend different techniques, creating a unique visual language that challenges traditional boundaries in art. His contributions have significantly influenced contemporary art, making him one of the most important artists of the 20th and 21st centuries.","observation":"Across all four images, recognizable scenes dissolve into heavily dragged, layered paint, with broad horizontal and vertical strokes creating a fluid, dreamlike distortion. The restrained teal, charcoal, coral, and amber palette gives the series a moody atmosphere, while reflected lights and partial figures or objects remain suspended within the abstracted surfaces."},{"id":"oscar-niemeyer","name":"Oscar Niemeyer","cat":"architects","en":"Oscar Niemeyer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oscar-niemeyer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oscar-niemeyer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","subdued-colors","epic","geometric"],"colours":["brown","black","white","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Oscar Niemeyer was a renowned Brazilian architect known for his distinctive modernist designs, characterized by bold curves and innovative use of concrete. His work played a pivotal role in shaping the architectural landscape of Brazil, particularly through his contributions to the design of Brasília, the country's capital. Niemeyer's designs are celebrated for their fluid forms and integration with the surrounding environment, reflecting a unique blend of functionality and artistic expression.","observation":"The style presents monumental, sculptural architecture through realistic visualization, with sweeping geometric curves, ramps, cantilevers, and reflecting water rendered in highly detailed materials. Warm, subdued earth tones, dramatic sunlight, tropical and coastal settings, and tiny human figures give the scenes a cinematic, epic sense of scale."},{"id":"petah-coyne","name":"Petah Coyne","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Petah Coyne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/petah-coyne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/petah-coyne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","floral","still-life","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","muted-blue","dark-brown","orange","black"],"intro":"Petah Coyne is an American sculptor known for her intricate and expressive works that often incorporate organic materials. Her sculptures frequently explore themes of nature, femininity, and transformation, blending elements of the surreal and the baroque to create hauntingly beautiful pieces.","observation":"The style presents fantastically elaborate chandelier-like still lifes, densely layered with crystal, candle flames, flowers, vines, and dangling ornamental forms. Subdued, dusky surroundings contrast with warm internal candlelight and translucent sculptural surfaces, producing a surreal yet materially convincing installation-like appearance."},{"id":"andreas-vesalius","name":"Andreas Vesalius","cat":"illustrators","en":"Andreas Vesalius","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andreas-vesalius.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andreas-vesalius","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige","orange"],"intro":"Andreas Vesalius was a Flemish anatomist and physician, renowned for his work in the field of human anatomy. He is best known for his groundbreaking book \"De humani corporis fabrica,\" published in 1543, which laid the foundation for modern anatomy. Vesalius's meticulous dissections and detailed illustrations revolutionized the understanding of the human body during the Renaissance.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense anatomical portraiture built from precise ink lines, crosshatching, and tightly controlled shading. Mostly monochrome black, white, and sepia tones, strong contrast, cropped profiles, and aged paper grounds give the illustrations the character of detailed anatomical plates."},{"id":"vincent-di-fate","name":"Vincent Di Fate","cat":"illustrators","en":"Vincent Di Fate","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vincent-di-fate.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vincent-di-fate","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","muted-blue","rust","orange","silver","vivid-red"],"intro":"Vincent Di Fate is an acclaimed American artist and illustrator known for his work in science fiction and fantasy art. His career spans several decades, during which he has contributed to book covers, magazines, and other media, establishing himself as a prominent figure in speculative fiction illustration.","observation":"The style combines visibly broad, directional paint strokes with richly layered, expressive rendering of faces, clothing, rock, and snow. Saturated reds, cobalt blues, and orange-gold light create strong contrast, while recurring monumental landscapes, solitary travelers, and dramatic portraits give the images a sweeping fantastical atmosphere."},{"id":"mario-sorrenti","name":"Mario Sorrenti","cat":"photographers","en":"Mario Sorrenti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mario-sorrenti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mario-sorrenti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["silver","black","beige","charcoal","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Mario Sorrenti is an Italian fashion photographer known for his evocative and sensual imagery. He gained prominence in the 1990s with his work for major fashion magazines and brands, capturing intimate and striking portraits that often explore themes of beauty and emotion.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, extreme close-up beauty portraits with sharply resolved skin, hair, eyelashes, makeup, and moisture. It alternates stark black-and-white and saturated color treatments, with strong contrast, visible grain, selective focus, and tightly cropped compositions that make facial texture and glossy highlights dominant."},{"id":"george-digalakis","name":"George Digalakis","cat":"photographers","en":"George Digalakis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-digalakis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-digalakis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["minimalist","realistic","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","white","silver","black"],"intro":"George Digalakis is a contemporary photographer known for his minimalist and surreal landscape photography. His work often features solitary elements in serene natural settings, capturing a sense of tranquility and mystery. Digalakis's images are characterized by their use of negative space, high contrast, and a monochrome palette, creating an ethereal and contemplative atmosphere.","observation":"The style is monochrome landscape photography built around long-exposure water, stark tonal separation, and isolated silhouettes. Vast negative space, softened atmospheric distance, reflective surfaces, and sparse human structures create a quiet, bleak, contemplative mood across the renders."},{"id":"emil-carlsen","name":"Emil Carlsen","cat":"painters","en":"Emil Carlsen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emil-carlsen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emil-carlsen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","portraits","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","muted-green","light-orange","silver"],"intro":"Emil Carlsen was a Danish-American painter known for his still lifes and landscapes, often characterized by a serene and contemplative quality. Born in 1853, Carlsen became a prominent figure in American Impressionism and was influenced by the Barbizon School. His works are celebrated for their delicate brushwork and subtle use of color, capturing the quiet beauty of everyday scenes.","observation":"Across the four images, recognizable figures, objects, and landscapes are rendered with visible oil-paint texture, delicate brushwork, and softly modelled forms. The palette consistently uses muted blue-green, brown, cream, and charcoal tones, with restrained lighting and dark, atmospheric backgrounds creating a quiet, contemplative mood."},{"id":"edward-moran","name":"Edward Moran","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Moran","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-moran.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-moran","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","muted-brown","beige","orange"],"intro":"Edward Moran was an American painter known for his maritime art and seascapes, active in the 19th century. His works often depicted dramatic ocean scenes, capturing the interplay of light and atmosphere, and he was a significant figure in American art during his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly surfaces and dense natural detail to depict monumental coastlines under turbulent skies. Strong warm-cool contrasts, glowing celestial light, crashing water, and imposing cliffs create an epic, fantastical sense of scale and motion."},{"id":"lillian-bassman","name":"Lillian Bassman","cat":"photographers","en":"Lillian Bassman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lillian-bassman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lillian-bassman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","silhouette"],"colours":["white","black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Lillian Bassman is renowned for her innovative contributions to fashion photography, particularly during the mid-20th century. Her work is celebrated for its ethereal quality and unique use of light and shadow, which brought a painterly touch to her photographic compositions. Bassman's images often featured elegant and graceful female figures, capturing the essence of fashion with a distinctively artistic flair.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with large silhouettes, blown-out backgrounds, and deep graphic shadows. Fashion figures, hats, and poised gestures are treated as dramatic, cinematic forms, with selective softness, motion blur, and visible grain adding an atmospheric editorial quality."},{"id":"erin-gregory","name":"Erin Gregory","cat":"painters","en":"Erin Gregory","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erin-gregory.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erin-gregory","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-cyan","charcoal","bone-white","red","pink","olive"],"intro":"Erin Gregory is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and expressive floral paintings. Her work often combines elements of realism and abstraction, creating a unique style that captures the beauty and complexity of flowers and nature. Gregory's paintings are characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a sense of movement and life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly layered, directional paint strokes to build lush flowers, foliage, and a flamingo in saturated coral, pink, turquoise, and green. The compositions are densely packed and expressive, with recognizable botanical forms softened into energetic, richly textured painted shapes."},{"id":"martin-rak","name":"Martin Rak","cat":"photographers","en":"Martin Rak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-rak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-rak","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["grey","black","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Martin Rak is a contemporary photographer known for his captivating landscape photography, often capturing the serene and mystical beauty of nature. His work is characterized by an ethereal quality, focusing on the interplay of light and shadow in natural settings.","observation":"The style uses monochrome, realistic landscape photography with strong tonal separation, deep shadows, and luminous pale fog. Rolling farmland, isolated trees, distant ridges, and occasional paths are arranged as atmospheric cinematic vistas, with mist creating layered depth and a quiet, moody sense of scale."},{"id":"salvatore-ferragamo","name":"Salvatore Ferragamo","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Salvatore Ferragamo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/salvatore-ferragamo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/salvatore-ferragamo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","fashion","still-life","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","black","dark-red","orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Salvatore Ferragamo was an Italian fashion designer known for his innovative and artistic approach to footwear and accessories. He founded the luxury brand Ferragamo, which became synonymous with elegance and craftsmanship. Ferragamo's designs often featured unique materials and were celebrated for their comfort and style, making him a pivotal figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style presents luxury handbags and high-heeled shoes as polished editorial product still lifes, combining clean illustrative contours with flat, saturated reds and browns, glossy material highlights, and dark graphic outlines. Strong geometric cropping, generous pale negative space, ornate embossed textures, and dramatic directional shadows give the arrangements a sculptural, fashion-catalogue feel."},{"id":"gerrit-dou","name":"Gerrit Dou","cat":"painters","en":"Gerrit Dou","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerrit-dou.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerrit-dou","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","still-life","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Gerrit Dou was a Dutch Baroque painter, born in 1613 in Leiden, Netherlands. He was a prominent figure of the Dutch Golden Age and a pupil of Rembrandt. Known for his exquisite attention to detail and mastery of light, Dou specialized in genre scenes and portraits, often depicting domestic interiors and everyday life with remarkable precision.","observation":"These scenes use richly visible paint texture, dense object detail, and expressive figures arranged in dark, crowded interiors. Warm candle and window light cuts through deep shadows, with muted brown, amber, and orange tones creating a dramatic, old-world atmosphere."},{"id":"claude-lorrain","name":"Claude Lorrain","cat":"painters","en":"Claude Lorrain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claude-lorrain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claude-lorrain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","brown","blue","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Claude Lorrain was a French painter known for his landscape paintings that captured the beauty of nature with a classical and idealized approach. He was born in 1600 and became a prominent figure in the Baroque period, celebrated for his ability to depict light and atmosphere in his works. Lorrain's paintings often included mythological and pastoral themes, reflecting the grandeur and tranquility of the natural world.","observation":"These landscapes use richly textured, visible brushwork with finely rendered ruins, vegetation, water, and monumental cloud formations. Warm atmospheric light, expansive vistas, and balanced foreground-to-distance staging create a grand, romantic, dreamlike sense of antiquity."},{"id":"felice-beato","name":"Felice Beato","cat":"photographers","en":"Felice Beato","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/felice-beato.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/felice-beato","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","religious","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-orange","beige","muted-brown"],"intro":"Felice Beato was a pioneering photographer known for his early work in East Asia and the Near East during the 19th century. He is recognized for his documentary photography, capturing significant historical events and cultural scenes with a distinctive style that blends realism with artistic composition. Beato's work provides a valuable visual record of the cultures and landscapes of his time, often characterized by a focus on detail and a deep understanding of the subjects he portrayed.","observation":"The style presents highly composed studio portraits with elaborate Japanese garments, floral headpieces, ceremonial props, and strongly sculpted poses. Sepia-toned monochrome, deep shadows, restrained highlights, visible grain, and generous empty backdrops give the images an antique, theatrical photographic character."},{"id":"vasily-vereshchagin","name":"Vasily Vereshchagin","cat":"painters","en":"Vasily Vereshchagin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vasily-vereshchagin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vasily-vereshchagin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-blue","brown","black","ochre","light-orange","grey","red"],"intro":"Vasily Vereshchagin was a renowned Russian painter known for his realistic and detailed depictions of war and cultural life in the 19th century. His works often focused on the themes of conflict and the human condition, capturing the harsh realities of war and the diverse cultures he encountered during his travels. Vereshchagin's art was characterized by its vivid detail, historical accuracy, and powerful emotional impact.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines heavily textured, painterly rendering with finely observed fabrics, masonry, armor, and weathered surfaces. Strong directional light, deep shadows, dusty desert settings, and imposing costumed figures create a cinematic, bleak fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"bridget-riley","name":"Bridget Riley","cat":"painters","en":"Bridget Riley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bridget-riley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bridget-riley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","illustrative","patterns","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","psychedelic-colors","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["silver","black","teal","light-red","blue","grey"],"intro":"Bridget Riley is a renowned British painter known for her distinctive contributions to the Op Art movement. Her work is characterized by its exploration of optical illusions, creating dynamic visual experiences that challenge the viewer's perception. Riley's art often features geometric patterns and vibrant color schemes, making her a pivotal figure in 20th-century art.","observation":"The style is built from repeated, bold, undulating bands that bend, compress, and fan across the image like an optical pattern. Clean graphic edges and mostly flat, saturated color create a vivid illustrative effect, with alternating monochrome and multicolored treatments unified by the same rhythmic wave structure."},{"id":"kevin-carter","name":"Kevin Carter","cat":"photographers","en":"Kevin Carter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kevin-carter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kevin-carter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Kevin Carter was a South African photojournalist known for his impactful and often controversial images that highlighted the struggles and suffering in Africa during the late 20th century. He was part of the Bang-Bang Club, a group of photographers who documented the violent last days of apartheid in South Africa. Carter's most famous photograph, which won him a Pulitzer Prize, depicted a starving child and a vulture in Sudan, sparking widespread discussion about the ethics of photojournalism.","observation":"Across all four panels, documentary-like human and animal subjects are rendered with distressed painterly surfaces, visible broad strokes, rough textures, and selective photographic realism. Earthy muted tones, heavy shadows, and stark tonal contrasts create a somber, emotionally charged atmosphere, while the compositions combine intimate figures, wildlife, and weathered environments."},{"id":"luca-della-robbia","name":"Luca della Robbia","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Luca della Robbia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luca-della-robbia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luca-della-robbia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","floral","portraits","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver","bone-white","dark-blue","black"],"intro":"Luca della Robbia was an Italian sculptor from the early Renaissance , renowned for his pioneering work in glazed terracotta. His art is characterized by its delicate balance of realism and idealism, often depicting religious and allegorical themes with a serene and harmonious quality. Della Robbia's work is celebrated for its innovative use of color and glazing techniques, which brought a unique vibrancy and durability to his sculptures.","observation":"The style presents devotional female figures and angels as richly modelled relief sculpture, with convincing carved volume, layered drapery, facial features, and ornamental floral surrounds. Repeated ivory, blue, and turquoise surfaces, architectural niches, and aged patina unify the panels into an ornate, classical religious display."},{"id":"david-mann","name":"David Mann","cat":"painters","en":"David Mann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-mann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-mann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","orange","dark-brown","muted-blue"],"intro":"David Mann was an American artist known for his iconic depictions of motorcycle culture and the biker lifestyle. His work, often featured in magazines like Easyriders, captured the spirit of freedom and rebellion associated with the open road and Harley-Davidson motorcycles. Mann's art is celebrated for its detailed realism and ability to convey the essence of the biker community.","observation":"The style combines visibly broad, textured paint strokes with highly detailed, expressive depictions of motorcycle riders and gleaming machines. Saturated reds, oranges, blues, and metallic highlights create bold, high-contrast compositions, while windblown clothing, hair, dust, and tightly cropped viewpoints convey motion and rugged road energy."},{"id":"pierre-soulages","name":"Pierre Soulages","cat":"painters","en":"Pierre Soulages","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-soulages.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-soulages","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","ochre","pale-orange","dark-rust"],"intro":"Pierre Soulages is a renowned French painter known for his unique approach to abstract art, particularly his exploration of the color black. Born in 1919, Soulages developed a distinctive style characterized by his use of 'noir-lumiere' or 'black light,' where he manipulates black paint to create texture and light reflections. His work is celebrated for its boldness and depth, contributing significantly to the abstract expressionist movement.","observation":"The style is an abstract composition of overlapping geometric slabs, dominated by near-black, umber, ochre, and rust tones with stark light openings. Broad, directional brushstrokes, scraped texture, uneven edges, and visible paint buildup give the block structure a raw, heavily worked surface."},{"id":"slinkachu","name":"Slinkachu","cat":"street-artists","en":"Slinkachu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/slinkachu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/slinkachu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","brown","beige","black","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Slinkachu is a British street artist known for his miniature installations and photography that capture tiny figures in urban environments. His work often explores themes of loneliness and isolation within the bustling cityscape, creating a unique blend of street art and photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic miniature figures interact with enormous everyday objects in carefully staged, cinematic close-ups. Muted earthy colors, strong material detail, selective focus, and unusual scale create a whimsical yet surreal visual effect."},{"id":"erik-nitsche","name":"Erik Nitsche","cat":"designers","en":"Erik Nitsche","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erik-nitsche.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erik-nitsche","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","landscapes","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","black","muted-brown","orange","muted-green","vivid-red"],"intro":"Erik Nitsche was a Swiss-born graphic designer known for his innovative and modernist approach to design, particularly in the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by a strong use of geometric forms, vibrant colors, and a clear, communicative style. Nitsche's designs were influential in the fields of advertising, publishing, and corporate identity, most notably for his work with General Dynamics.","observation":"The style combines hard-edged geometric forms and flat, saturated color blocks with photographic clouds, sea, and desert imagery. Surreal scale, collage-like layering, strong teal-orange contrasts, and an all-over grainy print texture unify the four compositions."},{"id":"anton-raphael-mengs","name":"Anton Raphael Mengs","cat":"painters","en":"Anton Raphael Mengs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anton-raphael-mengs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anton-raphael-mengs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","muted-orange","red","charcoal"],"intro":"Anton Raphael Mengs was an 18th-century German painter, renowned for his neoclassical style and significant influence on European art. Born in 1728, Mengs became a prominent figure in the transition from Rococo to Neoclassicism , known for his detailed portraits and mythological scenes. His work often featured classical themes, executed with precision and a refined use of color, contributing to the Enlightenment's artistic ideals.","observation":"The style presents highly rendered painted portraits with lifelike faces, delicate skin modeling, luminous eyes, and finely articulated hair and fabric. Dark grounds and concentrated light create strong contrast, while rich red, cream, blue, and muted green garments provide restrained color accents and an expressive, theatrical mood."},{"id":"noell-oszvald","name":"Noell Oszvald","cat":"photographers","en":"Noell Oszvald","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/noell-oszvald.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/noell-oszvald","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["white","grey","silver","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Noell Oszvald is a contemporary photographer known for her striking black and white imagery that often explores themes of solitude and introspection. Her work is characterized by minimalism and a strong sense of composition, often featuring solitary figures in stark, geometric environments.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark black garments and figures are set against pale, nearly empty environments, creating a severe monochrome style with strong silhouettes and deep tonal contrast. Spacious compositions, architectural geometry, ocean horizons, and hard directional light give the fashion imagery a cinematic, enigmatic mood."},{"id":"francisco-de-zurbaran","name":"Francisco de Zurbaran","cat":"painters","en":"Francisco de Zurbaran","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francisco-de-zurbaran.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francisco-de-zurbaran","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","rust","ochre","light-yellow"],"intro":"Francisco de Zurbaran was a Spanish painter known for his religious works and still lifes, active during the Baroque period. Born in 1598, he became renowned for his use of chiaroscuro and tenebrism, creating dramatic contrasts between light and shadow. His paintings often depicted monastic figures and saints, characterized by a serene and contemplative atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly modeled, painterly figures and objects against deep, nearly black grounds, with warm umbers, ochres, cream, and occasional orange. Strong directional light creates high contrast and expressive poses, while fine brushwork and visible surface texture give the portraits, devotional gestures, robes, and still-life details a traditional painted presence."},{"id":"kevin-maguire","name":"Kevin Maguire","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kevin Maguire","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kevin-maguire.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kevin-maguire","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing"],"colours":["grey","orange","black","vivid-red","muted-blue","bone-white"],"intro":"Kevin Maguire is a renowned comic book artist known for his work in the superhero genre, particularly with DC Comics. He gained fame for his expressive character designs and dynamic storytelling, contributing significantly to titles like \"Justice League International.\" His style is characterized by humor, detailed linework, and a unique ability to capture the personalities of his characters.","observation":"The style uses densely packed caricatured figures with exaggerated facial expressions, heavy black contours, selective hatching, and clean areas of saturated red, blue, cream, and green. Multiple close-up and group arrangements create an energetic comic-panel feel, with flat graphic color contrasted against finely rendered clothing, hair, and architectural details."},{"id":"robert-wyland","name":"Robert Wyland","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Wyland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-wyland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-wyland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","blue","muted-blue","cream","muted-orange"],"intro":"Robert Wyland is an American artist known for his large-scale murals of marine life, often referred to as \"Whaling Walls.\" His work focuses on ocean conservation and the beauty of the underwater world, capturing the essence of marine environments through detailed and vibrant depictions.","observation":"The style combines richly visible, broad painterly strokes with saturated ocean blues, coral reds, and peach-gold light. Dramatic whale encounters, swirling water, luminous sunbeams, and rounded or vortex-like compositions create an expansive, fantastical underwater world with strong motion and dense environmental detail."},{"id":"petros-afshar","name":"Petros Afshar","cat":"designers","en":"Petros Afshar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/petros-afshar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/petros-afshar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","drawing","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["pale-yellow","black","pale-orange","brown","ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"Petros Afshar is a contemporary designer known for his innovative and visually striking digital artworks. His work often explores themes of futurism and surrealism, blending geometric forms with bold color palettes to create dynamic and engaging compositions. Afshar's style is characterized by a unique combination of abstract and illustrative elements, making his pieces both visually appealing and conceptually intriguing.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly symmetrical, vertically organized mechanical forms with dense schematic detailing, concentric geometry, and precise fine linework. Flat cream, black, teal, red, and ochre shapes create a bold high-contrast graphic language that merges futuristic machinery, architectural silhouettes, and cosmic or ritual symbolism."},{"id":"john-philip-falter","name":"John Philip Falter","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Philip Falter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-philip-falter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-philip-falter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","dark-rust","light-orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"John Philip Falter was an American illustrator known for his work on the covers of the Saturday Evening Post. His art often depicted scenes of everyday American life, capturing the essence of mid-20th century culture with a focus on detail and narrative.","observation":"The style uses richly worked, realistic painting with visible directional brushwork, carefully modeled figures, and dense situational detail. Dark interiors and strongly lit faces or garments create emphatic contrast, while period clothing, urban settings, and everyday group activities give the scenes a nostalgic mid-century character."},{"id":"jim-mahfood","name":"Jim Mahfood","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jim Mahfood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-mahfood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-mahfood","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","collage","ink"],"colours":["black","pale-orange","brown","red","vivid-red","muted-violet","magenta"],"intro":"Jim Mahfood is an American comic book artist and illustrator known for his unique style that blends elements of street art, graffiti, and pop culture. His work often features bold lines, vibrant colors, and a dynamic, energetic feel, making him a distinctive figure in the world of comics and illustration.","observation":"The style combines expressive comic-like portraiture with dense black ink linework, flat color blocks, and visibly layered painted textures. Repeated close-up figures, fragmented panel-like arrangements, vivid red and purple accents, and strong black⁠–beige contrast give the sheet an energetic mixed-media graphic quality."},{"id":"milton-h-greene","name":"Milton H. Greene","cat":"photographers","en":"Milton H. Greene","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/milton-h-greene.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/milton-h-greene","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","negative-space"],"colours":["black","dark-green","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Milton H. Greene was an American fashion and celebrity photographer, renowned for his iconic images of Marilyn Monroe and other Hollywood stars during the 1950s and 1960s. His work is celebrated for its elegance, intimacy, and ability to capture the essence of his subjects, often blending fashion with fine art photography.","observation":"The style uses highly staged fashion portraiture with dramatic, filmic lighting, deep green-black backgrounds, and restrained cream, blush, and red accents. Elaborate lace and tulle garments, expressive poses, sparse theatrical sets, and botanical props create a moody, romantic tableau with strong movement and contrast."},{"id":"joel-rea","name":"Joel Rea","cat":"painters","en":"Joel Rea","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joel-rea.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joel-rea","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","muted-blue","silver","dark-blue"],"intro":"Joel Rea is an Australian contemporary artist known for his hyper-realistic and surreal paintings that often explore themes of nature, human emotion, and existentialism. His work is characterized by meticulous detail and a dramatic use of light and color, creating a sense of epic narrative and emotional depth.","observation":"A painterly, highly detailed style builds monumental landscapes from visible directional strokes, textured snow, turbulent water, fur, and billowing cloud forms. Subdued blue-gray tones, deep shadows, and cinematic scale contrast tiny solitary figures with an enormous white tiger and overwhelming natural formations, creating a dreamy, emotionally charged atmosphere."},{"id":"dean-ellis","name":"Dean Ellis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dean Ellis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dean-ellis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dean-ellis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-teal","black","muted-cyan","charcoal","bone-white","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Dean Ellis was an American illustrator known for his work in science fiction art, particularly during the mid-20th century. His illustrations often graced the covers of science fiction novels, capturing the imagination of readers with his visionary depictions of futuristic worlds and space exploration. Ellis's style is characterized by its detailed and imaginative compositions, often featuring cosmic landscapes and advanced technological themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the images use visible, directional brushwork and a heavily textured painted surface, combining subdued teal, blue, brown, and rust tones with sharp highlights and deep shadows. Solitary figures, birds, vehicles, and stark landscapes are arranged as cinematic vignettes with expansive sky or landscape space, creating a bleak, dreamlike atmosphere and a strong sense of visual movement."},{"id":"jeffrey-smart","name":"Jeffrey Smart","cat":"painters","en":"Jeffrey Smart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeffrey-smart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeffrey-smart","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","still-life","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","muted-blue","orange","dark-cyan","rust"],"intro":"Jeffrey Smart is an Australian painter known for his precise and detailed depictions of urban landscapes. His work often features stark, geometric compositions that explore themes of modernity and isolation. Smart's paintings are characterized by their meticulous attention to detail and use of vibrant color, capturing the essence of urban life with a unique blend of realism and abstraction.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic imagery with warm low-angle sunlight, deep shadows, and a restrained, slightly moody palette. Carefully composed architectural and landscape scenes combine crisp structural geometry with nostalgic domestic details, expansive skies, and an atmosphere of quiet solitude."},{"id":"eric-ravilious","name":"Eric Ravilious","cat":"painters","en":"Eric Ravilious","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-ravilious.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-ravilious","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","beige","grey","bone-white","muted-ochre","orange"],"intro":"Eric Ravilious was an English painter, designer, and wood engraver known for his distinctive style that captured the essence of the English countryside. Born in 1903, Ravilious became renowned for his watercolors and woodcuts, often depicting rural and coastal scenes. His work is characterized by its delicate lines, muted color palette, and a sense of nostalgia, reflecting the landscapes and interiors of early 20th-century England.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents expansive winter landscapes through dense, expressive linework and visibly textured, print-like painted surfaces. Restrained gray-green and ochre colors are punctuated by strong dark trees and luminous snow, while repeated curves, radiating marks, and layered hills create a rhythmic, dreamlike sense of movement."},{"id":"david-altmejd","name":"David Altmejd","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"David Altmejd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-altmejd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-altmejd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["beige","silver","bone-white","brown","rust","light-yellow"],"intro":"David Altmejd is a Canadian sculptor known for his intricate and fantastical creations. His work often explores themes of transformation and the human condition, utilizing a range of materials to create complex, layered sculptures that challenge perceptions of form and space.","observation":"The style presents portrait busts as dense, fantastical assemblages of translucent, paper-like, glassy, floral, and wiry elements. Fine linear details and sharply layered surfaces create an expressive, surreal sculptural effect, with pastel grounds offset by saturated turquoise, coral, pink, and metallic-looking accents."},{"id":"odilon-redon","name":"Odilon Redon","cat":"painters","en":"Odilon Redon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/odilon-redon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/odilon-redon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-rust","dark-brown","grey","brown","ochre","blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Odilon Redon was a French symbolist painter and printmaker known for his dreamlike and fantastical imagery. Born in 1840, Redon's work often explored themes of imagination and spirituality, utilizing a rich color palette and intricate detail. His art is characterized by its ethereal quality and symbolic content, bridging the gap between reality and the dream world.","observation":"Across all four renders, flowers and loose botanical forms emerge from heavily textured, visibly painted surfaces, with expressive brushwork, scratch-like marks, and layered pigment. The palette combines earthy, dark grounds with striking cobalt, coral, orange, and pink accents, balancing recognizable floral arrangements against increasingly abstract painterly passages."},{"id":"renzo-piano","name":"Renzo Piano","cat":"architects","en":"Renzo Piano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/renzo-piano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/renzo-piano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","sci-fi","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","silver","grey","brown","beige","light-orange"],"intro":"Renzo Piano is an Italian architect renowned for his innovative designs and sustainable architectural solutions. He is celebrated for projects like the Centre Pompidou in Paris and The Shard in London, which showcase his commitment to blending technology with artistic expression.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic architectural scenes with crisp structural detail, strong geometric repetition, and cinematic wide-angle compositions. Cool subdued tones, reflective glass, dramatic sky light, and occasional warm sunset illumination give the futuristic conservatories an atmospheric yet photographic presence."},{"id":"luigi-loir","name":"Luigi Loir","cat":"painters","en":"Luigi Loir","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luigi-loir.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luigi-loir","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-blue","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Luigi Loir is a French painter known for his atmospheric depictions of Parisian life during the Belle Époque. His works often capture the essence of urban scenes, focusing on the interplay of light and shadow in cityscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly textured, painterly brushwork to build atmospheric urban and semi-rural scenes with dense architectural and environmental detail. Muted earth, blue, and mauve tones are punctuated by warm red and amber lamps, while mist, rain-slick surfaces, silhouettes, and reflected light create a consistently dark, evocative mood."},{"id":"arthur-hacker","name":"Arthur Hacker","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur Hacker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-hacker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-hacker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","brown","muted-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Arthur Hacker is a notable English painter known for his works in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. He was associated with the New English Art Club and was known for his portraits, genre scenes, and mythological subjects. His style often reflected the romantic and symbolic tendencies of his time, with a focus on detailed and expressive compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible brushwork and delicate fine strokes to build realistic female portraits with luminous skin, flowing fabric, hair, and abundant flowers. Deep woodland shadows contrast with warm highlights and muted earthy colors, creating a romantic, dreamy atmosphere with carefully layered natural detail."},{"id":"victoria-crowe","name":"Victoria Crowe","cat":"painters","en":"Victoria Crowe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/victoria-crowe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/victoria-crowe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","pale-yellow","beige","muted-ochre","dark-brown"],"intro":"Victoria Crowe is a renowned Scottish painter known for her evocative and atmospheric works that often explore themes of nature, time, and memory. Her paintings are celebrated for their intricate details and the way they capture the essence of the Scottish landscape and its cultural heritage.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visible paintwork and fine, controlled brushstrokes to build dense woodland, clothing, fur, and facial detail. Restrained rust, charcoal, ochre, and grey-brown colors create a sombre, gothic atmosphere, with recurring solitary figures, ravens, and stark wintry or autumnal landscapes."},{"id":"henrietta-harris","name":"Henrietta Harris","cat":"painters","en":"Henrietta Harris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henrietta-harris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henrietta-harris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","charcoal","bone-white","muted-orange","red","grey"],"intro":"Henrietta Harris is a contemporary artist known for her unique approach to portraiture, often incorporating elements of surrealism and distortion. Her work explores themes of identity and human expression, using delicate techniques and a soft color palette to create ethereal and introspective pieces.","observation":"Across all four portraits, finely drawn hair, skin, fabric, and facial features are rendered with delicate, visible strokes and a softly painted surface. The restrained pastel palette and clean backgrounds emphasize expressive poses, obscured faces, and surreal distortions such as overlapping hands and fragmented facial forms."},{"id":"romulo-royo","name":"Romulo Royo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Romulo Royo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/romulo-royo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/romulo-royo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","black","brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","grey"],"intro":"Romulo Royo is a contemporary Spanish artist known for his intricate and imaginative works that often blend fantasy with realism. His art is characterized by detailed and expressive portrayals, often exploring themes of beauty and mystery.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines visible, layered brushwork with finely rendered facial features, hair, fur, and fabric. Muted earthy colors, close cropping, and softly atmospheric backgrounds create an expressive, dreamy character-portrait mood with a slightly fantastical feel."},{"id":"giorgio-armani","name":"Giorgio Armani","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Giorgio Armani","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giorgio-armani.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giorgio-armani","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","white","charcoal","muted-blue","beige"],"intro":"Giorgio Armani is an influential Italian fashion designer known for his clean, tailored lines and sophisticated style. He founded his company, Armani, in 1975, and it has since become one of the most prestigious names in the fashion industry. Armani's designs are celebrated for their elegance and timeless appeal, often characterized by a minimalist aesthetic and luxurious fabrics.","observation":"The style combines polished fashion-editorial realism with occasional fashion-illustration treatment, consistently presenting elongated models in full-body runway compositions. Restrained blacks, greys, and icy blues, dramatic catwalk lighting, graphic garment structure, and detailed textile surfaces create a sophisticated, high-contrast mood."},{"id":"john-pawson","name":"John Pawson","cat":"architects","en":"John Pawson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-pawson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-pawson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["minimalist","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","dark-brown","white","beige","orange"],"intro":"John Pawson is a renowned British architect known for his minimalist approach to design. His work emphasizes simplicity, light, and space, often characterized by clean lines and a restrained color palette. Pawson's architectural philosophy focuses on creating environments that promote calmness and contemplation.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark geometric architecture is presented with restrained, realistic, filmic compositions and generous negative space. Subdued earthy tones, deep shadows, warm interior illumination, and carefully framed openings create a contemplative, atmospheric mood, while solitary figures provide scale."},{"id":"beryl-cook","name":"Beryl Cook","cat":"painters","en":"Beryl Cook","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/beryl-cook.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/beryl-cook","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","patterns","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["rust","dark-brown","orange","black","silver","red","blue"],"intro":"Beryl Cook is a celebrated British artist known for her distinctive style that humorously captures everyday life. Her work often features bold, exaggerated figures and vibrant scenes, drawing inspiration from the people and social interactions she observed around her. Cook's paintings are characterized by their playful and whimsical nature, often depicting lively social gatherings and domestic settings.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with clean illustrative contours and finely rendered fabric patterns. Saturated reds, pinks, greens, and oranges dominate crowded, tightly cropped portraits of expressive, fashionably dressed figures, giving the scenes a theatrical and socially observant character."},{"id":"dan-flavin","name":"Dan Flavin","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Dan Flavin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-flavin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-flavin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["dark-red","deep-red","vivid-red","brown","red"],"intro":"Dan Flavin was an American minimalist artist known for his innovative use of fluorescent light to create sculptural installations. His work often explored the relationship between light and space, transforming architectural environments with his signature glowing tubes. Flavin's art challenged traditional notions of sculpture by using industrial materials and emphasizing the interplay of light and color.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark geometric interiors are shaped by repeating vertical neon tubes, deep perspective, and polished reflective floors. Saturated red-orange illumination dominates, with occasional cyan and pink accents creating luminous, high-contrast, futuristic gallery-like spaces."},{"id":"alex-toth","name":"Alex Toth","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alex Toth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-toth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-toth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["white","black","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Alex Toth was an influential American cartoonist and illustrator, renowned for his work in comic books and animation. His career spanned several decades, during which he contributed to a variety of genres, including superhero, adventure, and science fiction. Toth was particularly known for his minimalist yet expressive style, which emphasized strong lines and effective use of negative space, setting a high standard in the comic industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white ink drawing with heavy silhouettes, bold contour work, and dense directional hatching. Grim cloaked characters, skeletal imagery, stark lighting, and rugged settings create a dark supernatural storybook atmosphere, while the varied scenes retain a highly graphic, high-contrast look."},{"id":"gary-hume","name":"Gary Hume","cat":"painters","en":"Gary Hume","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gary-hume.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gary-hume","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","still-life","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","black","pale-green","teal","vivid-rust","magenta"],"intro":"Gary Hume is a British artist known for his bold use of color and simplified forms. He emerged as a leading figure in the Young British Artists movement in the late 1980s and 1990s. Hume's work often features flat surfaces and vibrant colors, exploring themes of abstraction and representation.","observation":"The style uses graphic, poster-like compositions with large flat color fields, sharply simplified silhouettes, and heavy dark contours. Saturated coral, turquoise, orange, red, and black create strong contrast, while selective painterly texture and rough interior marks add expressive visual energy to portraits and still-life scenes."},{"id":"robert-williams","name":"Robert Williams","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Williams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-williams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-williams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","madness"],"colours":["brown","grey","bone-white","dark-brown","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Robert Williams is an American painter and cartoonist known for his contributions to the lowbrow art movement and pop surrealism. His work often combines elements of surrealism, fantasy, and underground comics, creating a distinctive style that is both bold and detailed. Williams's art is characterized by its vivid colors, intricate details, and imaginative themes, often drawing from American counterculture and psychedelic influences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a densely packed, highly expressive painted fantasy tableau, combining human figures, animals, vehicles, flames, flowers, skulls, and monstrous forms in turbulent arrangements. Broad visible strokes, saturated reds and blues, strong dark-light separation, and sweeping movement make the imagery feel chaotic, energetic, and dreamlike."},{"id":"grinling-gibbons","name":"Grinling Gibbons","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Grinling Gibbons","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/grinling-gibbons.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/grinling-gibbons","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","floral","patterns","still-life","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-ochre","beige","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Grinling Gibbons was a renowned English sculptor and wood carver, celebrated for his intricate and detailed carvings in the Baroque style. Born in 1648, Gibbons became known for his work on St. Paul's Cathedral, Windsor Castle, and Hampton Court Palace. His mastery of wood carving, particularly in creating lifelike representations of flowers, fruits, and foliage, established him as one of the most skilled artisans of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, flowers and foliage appear as densely layered, three-dimensional carved or modelled forms, with petal ridges and leaf veins catching the light. The restrained ivory, beige, and brown palette against deep shadow gives the ornate floral arrangements a richly decorative, classical interior character."},{"id":"sherree-valentine-daines","name":"Sherree Valentine-Daines","cat":"painters","en":"Sherree Valentine-Daines","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sherree-valentine-daines.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sherree-valentine-daines","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","bone-white","beige","dark-brown","ochre","red"],"intro":"Sherree Valentine-Daines is a contemporary British artist known for her impressionistic and figurative paintings that capture the essence of leisure and family life. Her works often depict joyful scenes of children and families enjoying outdoor activities, characterized by a vibrant and expressive style. Valentine-Daines has gained recognition for her ability to convey emotion and movement through her skilled use of color and brushwork.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional brushwork to model figures, clothing, hats, and foliage with lively painterly energy. Saturated reds, whites, greens, and warm skin tones create high-contrast outdoor scenes populated by elegantly dressed figures, with detailed garments and accessories presented through cropped, informal compositions."},{"id":"adam-neate","name":"Adam Neate","cat":"painters","en":"Adam Neate","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adam-neate.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adam-neate","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","charcoal","muted-ochre","vivid-red","deep-red","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Adam Neate is a British visual artist known for his innovative approach to street art and painting. Emerging from the streets of London, Neate gained recognition for his distinctive style that combines elements of cubism, expressionism, and graffiti. His work often explores themes of identity and human emotion, rendered through a unique blend of traditional and unconventional materials.","observation":"Across all four portraits, recognizable faces and upper bodies are broken into angular planes, sweeping bands, and dense directional streaks. The style combines vivid red, cyan, blue, and yellow with deep shadows, heavy contrast, and energetic painterly marks, producing a bold surreal and digitally distorted effect."},{"id":"ralph-lauren","name":"Ralph Lauren","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Ralph Lauren","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ralph-lauren.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ralph-lauren","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","epic"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Ralph Lauren is an iconic American fashion designer known for his timeless and sophisticated style, often associated with luxury and preppy aesthetics. He founded the Ralph Lauren Corporation, which has become a global leader in fashion, offering a wide range of products including clothing, accessories, and home furnishings. His designs are celebrated for their classic elegance and attention to detail, drawing inspiration from American heritage and equestrian themes.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, editorial fashion imagery with carefully posed models, tactile tailored garments, and richly decorated interiors or runway settings. A subdued brown, olive, charcoal, and cream palette, warm atmospheric lighting, selective focus, and occasional equestrian motifs give the images a polished, cinematic luxury."},{"id":"geoffrey-beene","name":"Geoffrey Beene","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Geoffrey Beene","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/geoffrey-beene.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/geoffrey-beene","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["beige","black","bone-white","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Geoffrey Beene was an influential American fashion designer known for his innovative and elegant designs. Born in 1927, Beene's work was characterized by its simplicity, sophistication, and attention to detail. He was a pioneer in the fashion industry, often blending traditional techniques with modern aesthetics, and his designs were celebrated for their architectural precision and luxurious fabrics.","observation":"The style presents highly constructed fashion portraits with sculptural garments, oversized hats, concealed faces, and strong geometric silhouettes. Restrained black, cream, red, and ochre tones are reinforced by high contrast, fine linear fabric detail, and a grainy editorial finish, producing a polished retro fashion-image aesthetic."},{"id":"walter-van-beirendonck","name":"Walter Van Beirendonck","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Walter Van Beirendonck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walter-van-beirendonck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walter-van-beirendonck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","characters","fashion","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["silver","beige","charcoal","grey","red","vivid-red","ochre","deep-blue"],"intro":"Walter Van Beirendonck is a renowned Belgian fashion designer known for his bold and avant-garde creations. He is one of the Antwerp Six, a group of influential designers who graduated from the Royal Academy of Fine Arts in Antwerp. Van Beirendonck's work often incorporates vibrant colors, unconventional materials, and a playful approach to fashion, making him a standout figure in the industry.","observation":"The style presents eccentric, fully costumed humanoid figures as carefully composed character portraits, combining vivid color blocking with highly tactile knitted, fringed, shaggy and fuzzy surfaces. Exaggerated masks, elongated forms and concealed faces create a surreal, expressive fashion-editorial effect, while the photographic framing and industrial interiors keep the figures grounded in physical space."},{"id":"hugh-ferriss","name":"Hugh Ferriss","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hugh Ferriss","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hugh-ferriss.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hugh-ferriss","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Hugh Ferriss is an American architect and illustrator known for his influential architectural renderings that shaped visions of modern skyscrapers and urban landscapes in the early 20th century. His work is characterized by dramatic shading, monumental forms, and a visionary approach to architectural design.","observation":"The style presents monumental urban architecture in stark black-and-white, built from severe verticals, stepped forms, deep silhouettes, and blinding atmospheric light. Grain, haze, and soft tonal bleeding give the graphic geometric structures a cinematic, dystopian sense of scale, while tiny figures and waterlines reinforce the overwhelming immensity of the city."},{"id":"milton-avery","name":"Milton Avery","cat":"painters","en":"Milton Avery","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/milton-avery.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/milton-avery","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["black","light-pink","red","beige","muted-blue","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Milton Avery is an American modernist painter known for his unique style that bridges abstraction and representation. He was active in the mid-20th century and is celebrated for his use of color and simplified forms, often depicting landscapes and figures with a serene, contemplative quality.","observation":"Across all four renders, simplified landscapes and small human figures are built from broad geometric masses, dark silhouettes, and softly subdued pink, lilac, green, blue, and red hues. Visible directional brushwork and textured paint surfaces soften the clean shapes, creating a quiet, dreamlike surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"charles-marville","name":"Charles Marville","cat":"photographers","en":"Charles Marville","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-marville.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-marville","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","white"],"intro":"Charles Marville was a renowned 19th-century French photographer, celebrated for his documentation of Paris before and during the massive urban renewal led by Baron Haussmann. His work is notable for capturing the city's transformation, focusing on its architecture, streets, and everyday life.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents tightly framed, highly realistic old-city streets with dense weathered masonry, repeating street lamps, cobblestones, and dramatic receding perspectives. Subdued brown-black tones, deep shadows, bright hazy distance, fine surface texture, and slight photographic grain create a somber, atmospheric, film-like character."},{"id":"javier-mariscal","name":"Javier Mariscal","cat":"illustrators","en":"Javier Mariscal","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/javier-mariscal.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/javier-mariscal","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","characters","floral","patterns","motion","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing","funny","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","vivid-red","blue","muted-teal","green","orange"],"intro":"Javier Mariscal is a renowned Spanish designer and artist known for his vibrant and playful approach to art and design. Born in Valencia, Spain, in 1950, Mariscal gained international recognition for his work in various fields, including graphic design, illustration, and interior design. He is perhaps best known for creating Cobi, the official mascot of the 1992 Barcelona Olympics, which showcased his distinctive style characterized by bold colors and whimsical forms.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines saturated color fields with rough, visible brushwork and heavy hand-drawn black contours. Faces, figures, flowers, buildings, and vehicles are simplified into energetic geometric shapes, with playful distortions, layered marks, and dense mural-like compositions."},{"id":"paul-catherall","name":"Paul Catherall","cat":"illustrators","en":"Paul Catherall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-catherall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-catherall","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","landscapes","scenes","urban","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","red","muted-blue","pale-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Paul Catherall is a contemporary British printmaker and illustrator known for his striking architectural prints. His work often features iconic landmarks and urban landscapes, rendered in a bold and graphic style that emphasizes clean lines and vibrant colors. Catherall's art has been exhibited widely and is celebrated for its modernist aesthetic and meticulous attention to detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style reduces urban architecture to sharply outlined geometric planes, repeating structural forms, and dramatic perspective. Saturated coral, navy, cream, and black create a high-contrast graphic palette, with hard sunlight and elongated shadows giving the city scenes a cinematic, poster-like intensity."},{"id":"olivier-coipel","name":"Olivier Coipel","cat":"illustrators","en":"Olivier Coipel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olivier-coipel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olivier-coipel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","bone-white","orange","brown","rust","deep-red"],"intro":"Olivier Coipel is a renowned French comic book artist known for his work with major publishers like Marvel Comics. He has contributed to popular series such as \"Thor\" and \"The Avengers,\" earning acclaim for his dynamic and detailed illustrations that bring superhero stories to life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines expressive painted surfaces with fine, energetic ink-like contour lines and selectively rough, sketchy marks. It uses dramatic close-up character portraiture, strong red-black contrasts, and moody fantasy-comic imagery, while the ensemble panel adds dense layered figures and theatrical visual intensity."},{"id":"hannah-dale","name":"Hannah Dale","cat":"illustrators","en":"Hannah Dale","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hannah-dale.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hannah-dale","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["bone-white","white","brown","muted-ochre","dark-brown"],"intro":"Hannah Dale is a contemporary British illustrator known for her charming and detailed depictions of wildlife. Her work often features animals rendered with a delicate touch, capturing the essence of British countryside fauna. Dale's illustrations are celebrated for their intricate details and whimsical charm, making them popular in various forms of merchandise and publications.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed animal portraiture with visible, delicate watercolor-like brushwork and splattered pigment on lightly textured paper. Restrained earthy colors, soft unfinished edges, and expressive faces give the wildlife imagery a gentle storybook and dreamy character."},{"id":"francois-boucher","name":"Francois Boucher","cat":"painters","en":"Francois Boucher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francois-boucher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francois-boucher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["baroque","detailed","expressive","ornate","landscapes","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","muted-blue","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Francois Boucher was a prominent French painter of the Rococo style, known for his idyllic and voluptuous paintings of classical themes, decorative allegories, and pastoral scenes. His work often depicted the playful and romantic aspects of 18th-century aristocratic life, characterized by soft colors, delicate brushwork, and a light-hearted, elegant atmosphere.","observation":"Across the four renders, the style uses richly textured oil-paint surfaces, broad visible strokes, dramatic light and dark modeling, and densely worked foliage, fabric, clouds, and terrain. Classical portraits and expansive landscapes are presented with theatrical compositions, saturated earthy colors, expressive figures, and ornate gilded framing."},{"id":"tommy-hilfiger","name":"Tommy Hilfiger","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Tommy Hilfiger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tommy-hilfiger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tommy-hilfiger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","blue","black","beige","vivid-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Tommy Hilfiger is a renowned American fashion designer known for his classic American style and preppy aesthetic. He founded the Tommy Hilfiger Corporation in 1985, which became a global brand recognized for its red, white, and blue logo and its influence on American fashion. Hilfiger's designs often incorporate elements of pop culture and are characterized by their casual elegance and youthful appeal.","observation":"The style combines realistic editorial portraiture with vivid red, white, and blue color blocking, strong sunlight, and pronounced contrast. Low-angle viewpoints, close crops, clean studio grounds, and highly styled sportswear give the images the polished impact of a fashion campaign."},{"id":"george-ault","name":"George Ault","cat":"painters","en":"George Ault","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-ault.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-ault","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","urban","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","dark","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","muted-blue","brown","pale-yellow","red"],"intro":"George Ault was an American painter known for his precisionist style, capturing the stark beauty and isolation of rural and urban landscapes during the early 20th century. His work often reflects the quiet, contemplative mood of the interwar period, with a focus on architectural forms and the interplay of light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses sharply simplified architectural forms, strong geometric masses, clean illustrative edges, and deep cast shadows. A restrained, earthy palette of brick red, blue-grey, cream, and near-black is reinforced by high contrast and a subtle printed grain, creating a quiet retro urban atmosphere."},{"id":"polixeni-papapetrou","name":"Polixeni Papapetrou","cat":"photographers","en":"Polixeni Papapetrou","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/polixeni-papapetrou.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/polixeni-papapetrou","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","floral","scenes","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["blue","silver","muted-ochre","grey","brown","red"],"intro":"Polixeni Papapetrou was an Australian photographer known for her work exploring themes of identity, childhood, and the intersection of reality and fantasy. Her photography often featured elaborate costumes and settings, creating a dreamlike quality that challenged perceptions of reality.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic photography with vivid colors, crisp natural daylight, and expansive outdoor landscapes. Surreal floral costumes and impossible head coverings are staged as dreamlike fashion tableaux, balancing highly detailed botanical textures against stark dead branches, open sky, and distant horizons."},{"id":"constantin-kousnetzoff","name":"Constantin Kousnetzoff","cat":"painters","en":"Constantin Kousnetzoff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/constantin-kousnetzoff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/constantin-kousnetzoff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-brown","bone-white","vivid-red","ochre","blue"],"intro":"Constantin Kousnetzoff is a Russian painter known for his evocative landscapes and atmospheric scenes. His work often captures the essence of Russian rural life and historical settings, blending realism with a touch of romanticism and symbolism.","observation":"Across the four images, the style is consistently painterly and richly textured, with visible strokes ranging from fine detail to broad impasto-like marks. It combines subdued, moody color harmonies with expressive portraits and dramatic winter landscapes, while dense scenes and layered surfaces give the images a tactile, handcrafted presence."},{"id":"giorgetto-giugiaro","name":"Giorgetto Giugiaro","cat":"designers","en":"Giorgetto Giugiaro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giorgetto-giugiaro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giorgetto-giugiaro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","urban","high-contrast","metallic","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","beige","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"Giorgetto Giugiaro is an influential Italian automotive designer known for his groundbreaking work in car design. He has been a pivotal figure in the automotive industry, contributing to the design of numerous iconic vehicles. Giugiaro's designs are celebrated for their innovative and futuristic approach, often blending sleek aesthetics with functional engineering.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, detailed automotive scenes with sharply geometric, wedge-shaped forms, reflective metal surfaces, and strong cinematic lighting. Moody earth tones, deep shadows, occasional saturated red illumination, and imposing natural or concrete backdrops give the images a dramatic retro-futurist atmosphere."},{"id":"lyonel-feininger","name":"Lyonel Feininger","cat":"painters","en":"Lyonel Feininger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lyonel-feininger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lyonel-feininger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","bone-white","brown","orange","red"],"intro":"Lyonel Feininger was a German-American painter and leading figure of the Bauhaus movement, known for his distinctive style that blended elements of expressionism and cubism. Born in 1871, Feininger initially worked as a caricaturist and comic strip artist before transitioning to painting. His works often feature architectural forms and urban landscapes, characterized by angular shapes and a unique interplay of light and shadow.","observation":"The style combines densely textured, visibly painted surfaces with sharply faceted architecture and fragmented, geometric perspective. Restrained blue-green and umber tones are punctuated by coral-red light, while silhouettes, towers, bridges, and layered urban forms create an expressive, atmospheric cityscape with a surreal sense of scale."},{"id":"joram-roukes","name":"Joram Roukes","cat":"painters","en":"Joram Roukes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joram-roukes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joram-roukes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["silver","grey","charcoal","red","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Joram Roukes is a contemporary Dutch artist known for his dynamic and surreal compositions that explore themes of identity and modern society. His work often features a blend of collage, painting, and digital manipulation, creating a unique visual language that resonates with urban culture and contemporary identity.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable riders, horses, and costume elements emerge from energetic layers of broad, visible brushwork, splatters, drips, and fragmented shapes. Saturated coral-reds and cool blues create forceful contrast, while cropped, active poses give the series a kinetic, expressive, fantastical character."},{"id":"alexey-brodovitch","name":"Alexey Brodovitch","cat":"photographers","en":"Alexey Brodovitch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexey-brodovitch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexey-brodovitch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["black","white","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Alexey Brodovitch was a Russian-born photographer, designer, and art director, best known for his work with Harper's Bazaar where he revolutionized magazine design with innovative layouts and typography. His influence extended to many areas of visual culture, including photography and graphic design, where his modernist approach left a lasting impact.","observation":"This style combines stark black-and-white portrait photography with geometric collage, obscuring and recombining faces through rectangular cutouts, overlays, and repeated eyes. Heavy shadows, grain, paper-like texture, bold graphic shapes, and occasional brush-edged circular framing create a severe, surreal editorial mood."},{"id":"clifford-harper","name":"Clifford Harper","cat":"illustrators","en":"Clifford Harper","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clifford-harper.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clifford-harper","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing"],"colours":["black","dark-green","dark-blue","vivid-red","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Clifford Harper is a British illustrator known for his distinctive graphic style and contributions to various publications. His work often features bold lines and intricate details, capturing both political and fantastical themes. Harper's illustrations have been widely recognized for their unique blend of realism and imagination.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic, print-like illustration with heavy contour lines, dense hatching, stippling, and sharply separated blocks of saturated red, blue, cream, and dark green. The scenes are richly packed with symbolic eyes, ravens, monumental landscapes, figures, books, and uncanny architectural or natural forms, giving the compositions a dramatic surreal-fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"paul-verhoeven","name":"Paul Verhoeven","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Paul Verhoeven","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-verhoeven.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-verhoeven","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","muted-orange","dark-brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Paul Verhoeven is a renowned Dutch filmmaker known for his provocative and often controversial films. His work spans a variety of genres, including science fiction, thriller, and drama. Verhoeven is acclaimed for his ability to blend satirical and social commentary with mainstream entertainment, creating films that challenge audiences while providing compelling narratives.","observation":"Across all four portraits, thick, directional paint marks build faces, hair, clothing, and backgrounds into a heavily textured surface. The subdued palette of blacks, greys, flesh tones, and red accents is organized by stark contrast, cropped framing, obscured features, and unsettling surreal interventions."},{"id":"henrik-fisker","name":"Henrik Fisker","cat":"designers","en":"Henrik Fisker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henrik-fisker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henrik-fisker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","urban","glow","fine-lines","high-contrast","metallic","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","muted-blue","muted-orange","muted-rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"Henrik Fisker is a renowned automotive designer known for his work on luxury cars and electric vehicles. He has contributed to the design of several iconic vehicles and is recognized for his innovative approach to car design.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, polished automotive imagery with cinematic low-angle compositions, reflective metallic surfaces, and strong directional lighting. Luxury cars are presented as dramatic subjects alongside sharply dressed figures, showroom settings, palm-lined roads, and concept-design artwork, with saturated paint colors and finely resolved body details."},{"id":"eva-hesse","name":"Eva Hesse","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Eva Hesse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eva-hesse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eva-hesse","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","fine-lines","subdued-colors","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-brown","beige","dark-brown","bone-white","ochre","silver"],"intro":"Eva Hesse was a German-born American sculptor known for her pioneering work in materials such as latex, fiberglass, and plastics. Her innovative approach to sculpture and her exploration of themes like impermanence and fragility have left a lasting impact on the art world, particularly within the movements of postminimalism and process art.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents expansive gallery installations made from translucent, loosely woven and frayed textiles. Neutral earth tones, fine linear fibers, layered hanging forms, and generous architectural space create a quiet, immersive, dreamlike atmosphere, rendered with realistic lighting and sculptural depth."},{"id":"etienne-jules-marey","name":"Etienne-Jules Marey","cat":"photographers","en":"Etienne-Jules Marey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/etienne-jules-marey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/etienne-jules-marey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","motion","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","grey","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Etienne-Jules Marey was a pioneering French scientist and photographer known for his work in chronophotography, a technique that captures multiple phases of movement in a single image. His studies in motion and physiology contributed significantly to the fields of photography and cinematography, influencing both scientific and artistic communities.","observation":"Across all four panels, organic feather and bird-like forms dissolve into swirling, radial abstractions built from dense fine lines and visible brushwork. The stark black-and-white treatment, strong tonal separation, and repeated circular motion create a dramatic, dreamlike visual language."},{"id":"edouard-vuillard","name":"Edouard Vuillard","cat":"painters","en":"Edouard Vuillard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edouard-vuillard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edouard-vuillard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","rust","beige","deep-red","red"],"intro":"Edouard Vuillard was a French painter and a prominent member of the Nabis group, known for his intimate domestic interiors and use of pattern and color. His work often depicted the quiet, everyday life of the French bourgeoisie, capturing the essence of domesticity with a unique blend of post-impressionist and intimist styles.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly furnished domestic interiors are built from visible, directional brushwork and dense layers of pattern, fabric, furniture, flowers, and small objects. Strong reds and dark neutrals are balanced by muted creams and greens, while figures and cats recur within elaborate, intimate room scenes."},{"id":"i-m-pei","name":"I. M. Pei","cat":"architects","en":"I. M. Pei","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/i-m-pei.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/i-m-pei","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","high-contrast","epic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","white","orange"],"intro":"I. M. Pei is a renowned architect known for his innovative and modernist designs. Born in China and later becoming a prominent figure in American architecture, Pei is celebrated for his use of geometric forms and integration of natural light. His works include iconic structures such as the Louvre Pyramid in Paris and the Bank of China Tower in Hong Kong, which exemplify his commitment to modernism and functionality.","observation":"The style presents monumental architectural interiors as highly realistic, cinematic spaces, dominated by sharp geometric volumes, dramatic cantilevers, skylights, and expansive glazing. Strong perspective, axial compositions, polished reflective surfaces, and intense light-and-shadow contrasts give the scenes a sculptural, grand, and meticulously designed appearance."},{"id":"philip-taaffe","name":"Philip Taaffe","cat":"various-artists","en":"Philip Taaffe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philip-taaffe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philip-taaffe","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","muted-olive","orange","dark-red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Philip Taaffe is an American artist known for his vibrant and intricate works that often incorporate elements of abstraction and pattern. His art is characterized by a blend of historical references and contemporary techniques, creating a unique visual language that is both decorative and thought-provoking.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a densely layered botanical pattern language combining vivid floral imagery, concentric radial ornaments, geometric grids, and repeated decorative motifs. Painted texture and fine linear marks coexist with flat color blocks, producing an ornate, highly saturated collage-like surface with expressive, slightly surreal plant forms."},{"id":"larry-burrows","name":"Larry Burrows","cat":"photographers","en":"Larry Burrows","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-burrows.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-burrows","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","mist","motion","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","silver","grey","rust"],"intro":"Larry Burrows was a British photojournalist known for his impactful coverage of the Vietnam War. His work was characterized by a deep empathy for his subjects and a commitment to capturing the human side of conflict. Burrows's photographs were published in Life magazine, where they brought the realities of war to the forefront of public consciousness.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic, realistic war imagery with densely detailed figures, equipment, smoke, fire, and devastated terrain. A moody teal-and-orange palette, strong light-dark contrast, atmospheric haze, selective focus, and visible grain give the scenes a gritty photographic quality."},{"id":"yusaku-kamekura","name":"Yusaku Kamekura","cat":"designers","en":"Yusaku Kamekura","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yusaku-kamekura.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yusaku-kamekura","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","letters","patterns","flat-color","bw-monochrome","retro","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","bone-white","vivid-red","blue","deep-blue"],"intro":"Yusaku Kamekura is a renowned Japanese graphic designer known for his innovative and influential work in the field of design. He played a significant role in shaping modern Japanese graphic design, particularly noted for his contributions to the 1964 Tokyo Olympics' visual identity. His designs often blend traditional Japanese aesthetics with modernist principles, creating a unique and timeless visual language.","observation":"Across the sheet, bold geometric forms, hard-edged color blocks, repeated curves, circles, and stripes create a strongly graphic abstract language. The designs alternate vivid red-and-blue poster palettes with stark black-and-white compositions, while fine printed texture and occasional facial fragments add tactile detail to the otherwise flat, symmetrical layouts."},{"id":"cassius-marcellus-coolidge","name":"Cassius Marcellus Coolidge","cat":"painters","en":"Cassius Marcellus Coolidge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cassius-marcellus-coolidge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cassius-marcellus-coolidge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","scenes","still-life","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-brown","white","ochre","beige","vivid-red"],"intro":"Cassius Marcellus Coolidge is best known for his whimsical paintings of anthropomorphized dogs engaged in human activities, particularly in his 'Dogs Playing Poker' series. Born in 1844, Coolidge's work is characterized by its humorous and lighthearted approach, capturing everyday scenes with a playful twist. His unique style has made a lasting impact on popular culture, often being referenced and parodied in various media.","observation":"Across all four images, the style presents humorous tableaux of anthropomorphic dogs and other animals gathered around card tables, rendered as richly textured oil paintings. Deep green, brown, and red tones, dramatic interior lighting, dense fur and fabric detail, and ornate frames create a dark, museum-like classical atmosphere."},{"id":"magdalena-abakanowicz","name":"Magdalena Abakanowicz","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Magdalena Abakanowicz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/magdalena-abakanowicz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/magdalena-abakanowicz","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","white","beige","dark-brown","brown","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Magdalena Abakanowicz was a renowned Polish sculptor known for her innovative use of textiles and organic materials to create large-scale, abstract sculptures. Her work often explores themes of identity, humanity, and the collective experience, reflecting the socio-political landscape of post-war Europe.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental, faceless humanoid sculptures made from heavily textured, roughly woven and frayed material. They are depicted realistically in spacious industrial gallery interiors, with subdued earth tones, dramatic dark variants, strong material detail, and repeated figures arranged as an immersive installation."},{"id":"m-f-husain","name":"M. F. Husain","cat":"painters","en":"M. F. Husain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/m-f-husain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/m-f-husain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","bone-white","dark-blue","brown","vivid-red","ochre"],"intro":"M. F. Husain is a renowned Indian painter known for his modernist approach and vibrant depictions of Indian culture and mythology. Often referred to as the 'Picasso of India,' Husain's work is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a unique blend of traditional and contemporary themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and active group scenes are broken into angular, collage-like planes with thick dark contours and visibly worked paint surfaces. Saturated blue, red, green, black, and cream create forceful contrast, while fragmented anatomy, compressed space, and gestural poses give the images an expressive, slightly surreal energy."},{"id":"julian-schnabel","name":"Julian Schnabel","cat":"painters","en":"Julian Schnabel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julian-schnabel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julian-schnabel","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["grey","pale-orange","muted-rust","black","deep-red"],"intro":"Julian Schnabel is an American painter and filmmaker known for his contribution to the Neo-Expressionist art movement. He gained prominence in the late 20th century with his large-scale paintings that often incorporate unconventional materials and techniques, such as broken plates and thick layers of paint. Schnabel's work is characterized by its bold, expressive style and often explores themes of identity, history, and the human condition.","observation":"Across the renders, thick, visibly built-up paint and broad directional strokes give both portraits and abstract works a tactile, sculptural surface. Muted pinks, blue-grays, creams, blacks, and deep reds recur in expressive, densely layered compositions that mix recognizable figures with fractured, surreal painterly abstraction."},{"id":"bouchra-jarrar","name":"Bouchra Jarrar","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Bouchra Jarrar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bouchra-jarrar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bouchra-jarrar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Bouchra Jarrar is a renowned French fashion designer known for her elegant and sophisticated designs. She has worked with prestigious fashion houses and established her own label, gaining recognition for her minimalist yet luxurious approach to fashion. Jarrar's work often emphasizes clean lines, exquisite tailoring, and a refined aesthetic that reflects her commitment to craftsmanship and innovation.","observation":"The style is polished, realistic fashion photography with highly detailed couture garments staged in opulent interiors. Warm, subdued tones, deep shadows, and selective highlights create a cinematic editorial mood, while bold silhouettes and dramatic poses give the compositions a strong graphic presence."},{"id":"toni-frissell","name":"Toni Frissell","cat":"photographers","en":"Toni Frissell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/toni-frissell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/toni-frissell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","scenes","backlighting","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["white","grey","silver","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Toni Frissell was an American photographer known for her fashion photography, portraits, and World War II images. Her work appeared in major magazines like Vogue and Harper's Bazaar, and she was celebrated for her ability to capture elegance and movement in her subjects.","observation":"The style is monochrome, photographic, and highly cinematic, using strong tonal contrast, selective focus, and expansive coastal settings. Flowing white garments, hats, reflections, and gestures are emphasized through motion and backlighting, producing a dreamy, fashion-editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"mary-jane-ansell","name":"Mary Jane Ansell","cat":"painters","en":"Mary Jane Ansell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-jane-ansell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-jane-ansell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","silver","beige","brown","dark-brown"],"intro":"Mary Jane Ansell is a contemporary British painter known for her detailed and ethereal portraits that blend classical techniques with modern sensibilities. Her work often features serene and introspective female subjects, capturing a timeless elegance and youthful innocence.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely resolved portraiture with softly modeled faces, individual hair strands, fabric folds, and delicate floral or butterfly details. Restrained cream, black, brown, and muted red tones stand out against dark studio grounds, with strong tonal separation and carefully composed fashion-editorial framing."},{"id":"joachim-patinir","name":"Joachim Patinir","cat":"painters","en":"Joachim Patinir","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joachim-patinir.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joachim-patinir","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","landscapes","scenes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","light-blue","grey","dark-brown","olive"],"intro":"Joachim Patinir was a Flemish painter known for pioneering the landscape genre during the Northern Renaissance. His works are characterized by panoramic views, intricate details, and a harmonious blend of natural and architectural elements. Patinir's landscapes often serve as backdrops for religious narratives, reflecting the spiritual and cultural milieu of 16th-century Europe.","observation":"The style presents expansive, highly detailed fantasy landscapes with monumental cliffs, alpine ranges, castles, villages, forests, and reflective water arranged in richly layered vistas. Visible brush texture and carefully modeled natural forms give the scenes a polished, old-master-like painterly realism, while saturated greens and autumn reds remain softened by an atmospheric blue distance."},{"id":"alfred-guillou","name":"Alfred Guillou","cat":"painters","en":"Alfred Guillou","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-guillou.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-guillou","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["beige","silver","brown","black","dark-brown"],"intro":"Alfred Guillou is a French painter known for his realistic depictions of Breton life, particularly focusing on the daily activities and interactions of fishermen and their families. Born in 1844 in Concarneau, France, Guillou was a prominent figure in the 19th-century art scene, contributing to the genre of academic realism with his detailed and emotive works.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork modelling faces, fabric, water, and sky. Muted coastal colors, expressive figures, and active shoreline tasks create detailed, classical-looking maritime scenes with a soft atmospheric light."},{"id":"otto-dix","name":"Otto Dix","cat":"painters","en":"Otto Dix","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/otto-dix.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/otto-dix","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","orange","brown","dark-brown","beige","rust"],"intro":"Otto Dix was a German painter and printmaker, known for his harshly realistic depictions of Weimar society and the brutality of war. Born in 1891, Dix became a prominent figure in the New Objectivity movement, which sought to portray the world with unsentimental realism. His works often explored themes of violence, social decay, and the human condition, reflecting his experiences as a soldier in World War I.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily textured, visibly built-up paint to depict crowded fields of distorted faces and figures. Broad expressive strokes, earthy subdued colors, strong light-dark separation, and grotesque exaggeration create an intense, unsettling surreal mood."},{"id":"alexej-von-jawlensky","name":"Alexej von Jawlensky","cat":"painters","en":"Alexej von Jawlensky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexej-von-jawlensky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexej-von-jawlensky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","red","dark-blue","light-orange","teal"],"intro":"Alexej von Jawlensky was a Russian expressionist painter known for his vivid use of color and abstracted portraits. He was a key figure in the early 20th-century avant-garde movement and a member of the Blaue Reiter group, which played a significant role in the development of modern art.","observation":"Across all four renders, faces are reduced to boldly outlined, abstract planes of saturated color, with distorted features and cropped portrait framing. Visible brush marks and rough, built-up paint give the clean graphic shapes a strongly tactile, expressive surface."},{"id":"ray-donley","name":"Ray Donley","cat":"painters","en":"Ray Donley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ray-donley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ray-donley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","religious","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","orange"],"intro":"Ray Donley is an American artist known for his evocative and haunting portraits that often explore themes of identity and emotion. His work is characterized by a deep engagement with the human psyche, utilizing dramatic lighting and expressive brushwork to convey intense emotional states.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily textured, visible brushwork and expressive, densely modeled figures arranged as solemn theatrical tableaux. A subdued brown-black palette, isolated candle and fire glow, and extreme light-dark contrast create a ritualistic, ominous grandeur, with central characters and surrounding witnesses repeatedly staged like sacred drama."},{"id":"johfra-bosschart","name":"Johfra Bosschart","cat":"illustrators","en":"Johfra Bosschart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johfra-bosschart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johfra-bosschart","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["grey","black","dark-brown","rust","light-yellow"],"intro":"Johfra Bosschart is a Dutch painter known for his surreal and fantastical works, often incorporating esoteric and mythological themes. His art is characterized by intricate details and a visionary style that blends elements of fantasy and symbolism.","observation":"The style presents vast, fantastical landscapes with monumental rock formations, impossible architecture, celestial bodies, and immense cloud-filled horizons. Rich painterly textures, intricate environmental detail, saturated blue-green and amber palettes, strong atmospheric depth, and luminous suns create a cinematic, epic sense of scale."},{"id":"chris-dyer","name":"Chris Dyer","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris Dyer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-dyer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-dyer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","patterns","bold-lines","vivid-colors","religious","drawing","symmetry"],"colours":["red","brown","muted-green","blue","orange"],"intro":"Chris Dyer is a Peruvian-Canadian artist known for his vibrant and psychedelic artwork that often explores themes of spirituality and consciousness. His work is characterized by a fusion of cultural influences, drawing inspiration from indigenous art, street culture, and visionary experiences. Dyer's art is celebrated for its intricate details, bold colors, and the ability to evoke a sense of wonder and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses densely packed, symmetrical mask-like faces built from bold outlines, clean graphic shapes, and elaborate ornamental patterns. Highly saturated rainbow colors, exaggerated eyes and teeth, horns, flames, and curling forms create an intense psychedelic character design language applied to both garments and portrait-like figures."},{"id":"thomas-benjamin-kennington","name":"Thomas Benjamin Kennington","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Benjamin Kennington","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-benjamin-kennington.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-benjamin-kennington","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","pale-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Thomas Benjamin Kennington is a British painter known for his genre scenes and portraits, often depicting domestic life and social issues of the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work is characterized by a realistic style, capturing the subtleties of human expression and the intricacies of Victorian society.","observation":"Across all four images, figures and interiors are rendered with visible, layered brushwork, finely observed faces, fabrics, flowers, and reflective details. The compositions use subdued warm colors, deep shadow, selective highlights, and intimate posed interactions to create a richly atmospheric, melancholic portrait style."},{"id":"alan-moir","name":"Alan Moir","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alan Moir","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-moir.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-moir","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["silver","beige","grey","brown","red","olive","dark-blue"],"intro":"Alan Moir is an acclaimed Australian cartoonist known for his political cartoons and illustrations, often characterized by sharp wit and insightful commentary. His work has been featured in major publications, and he has received numerous awards for his contributions to the field of illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines loose, visibly physical paint with energetic ink and charcoal-like linework. Desaturated atmospheric grounds and heavily worked architectural or landscape forms are punctuated by vivid red and other bright gestural accents, producing expressive, dreamlike scenes with rough, unstable edges."},{"id":"mark-wallinger","name":"Mark Wallinger","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Mark Wallinger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-wallinger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-wallinger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","white","black","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Mark Wallinger is a British artist known for his diverse and thought-provoking works that often explore themes of identity, politics, and perception. His art spans various mediums, including sculpture, painting, and video, and he has been recognized for his ability to engage with contemporary social issues through a conceptual lens.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, meticulously detailed museum interiors populated by monumental sculptural installations and small human figures for scale. Restrained neutral tones, polished surfaces, strong architectural framing, and selective glowing or dramatic lighting create a dark, contemplative gallery atmosphere."},{"id":"randal-spangler","name":"Randal Spangler","cat":"illustrators","en":"Randal Spangler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/randal-spangler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/randal-spangler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-orange","silver","dark-blue","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Randal Spangler is an illustrator known for his whimsical and fantastical artwork, often featuring imaginative creatures and dreamlike settings. His work is characterized by intricate details and vibrant colors, bringing to life enchanting worlds filled with magic and wonder. Spangler's art has captured the hearts of many, drawing inspiration from fantasy literature and storybook illustrations.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with dense, ornate detail, saturated jewel-like colors, and luminous cloud-filled atmospheres. It consistently builds epic fantasy tableaux from elaborate architecture, airborne vehicles, gardens, figures, and decorative machinery, with a dreamy, storybook sense of scale."},{"id":"carl-larsson","name":"Carl Larsson","cat":"painters","en":"Carl Larsson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-larsson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-larsson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","pale-orange","muted-ochre","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Carl Larsson is a renowned Swedish painter and interior designer, celebrated for his depiction of idyllic family life and domestic scenes. Born in 1853, Larsson became a leading figure in the Arts and Crafts movement, known for his detailed and colorful watercolors that capture the essence of Swedish rural life. His works often feature his own family and home, providing a warm and intimate glimpse into everyday life in Sweden during the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"The style combines visible, delicate brushwork with fine contour lines and softly blended, subdued colors, creating richly observed domestic interiors. Repeated scenes of women engaged in everyday activities are densely furnished with flowers, ceramics, textiles, and warm window light, giving the images an intimate, graceful illustrative character."},{"id":"ugo-rondinone","name":"Ugo Rondinone","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Ugo Rondinone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ugo-rondinone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ugo-rondinone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","sculptural","characters","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","blue","red","pale-blue","dark-blue"],"intro":"Ugo Rondinone is a Swiss-born contemporary artist known for his diverse body of work, which includes sculpture, painting, and installation art. His creations often explore themes of time, space, and the human condition, blending elements of surrealism and minimalism to evoke emotional and contemplative responses.","observation":"The style presents monumental, roughly modelled head-like sculptures with pronounced facial features and heavy, rock-textured surfaces. Stark architectural spaces and small human figures establish scale, while saturated blue, red, and white forms create a bold, surreal installation-like atmosphere."},{"id":"robert-rauschenberg","name":"Robert Rauschenberg","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Rauschenberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-rauschenberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-rauschenberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","vivid-red","orange","dark-brown","beige","charcoal"],"intro":"Robert Rauschenberg was an influential American artist known for his innovative use of materials and techniques. He was a key figure in the transition from Abstract Expressionism to later modern movements such as Pop Art. Rauschenberg's work often combined painting with found objects, photographs, and other media, challenging traditional boundaries in art.","observation":"Across all four works, the style combines large geometric color fields with energetic painterly gestures, scraped surfaces, drips, and collage-like paper textures. Saturated reds, oranges, blacks, and blues stand sharply against cream grounds, producing bold, tactile abstractions with both flat blocks and heavily worked passages."},{"id":"thom-browne","name":"Thom Browne","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Thom Browne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thom-browne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thom-browne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["grey","beige","silver","charcoal","black","dark-brown"],"intro":"Thom Browne is an American fashion designer known for his innovative and often theatrical approach to menswear and womenswear. His designs are characterized by a blend of classic tailoring with avant-garde elements, often challenging traditional norms in fashion.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic editorial portraiture with theatrical, avant-garde costume design and carefully constructed character styling. Strong checks, stripes, ruffles, feathers, oversized accessories, and patriotic color accents create a detailed, ornate, fashion-focused visual language, photographed with cinematic composition and polished studio lighting."},{"id":"ryan-hewett","name":"Ryan Hewett","cat":"painters","en":"Ryan Hewett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryan-hewett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryan-hewett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","muted-blue","black","grey","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Ryan Hewett is a contemporary South African artist known for his expressive and abstract portraiture. His work often explores themes of identity and emotion, using a distinctive style that combines bold colors and fragmented forms.","observation":"Across all four portraits, thickly built paint and clearly directional strokes break faces and clothing into angular, energetic planes. The style combines recognizable close-up character studies with vivid coral, turquoise, blue, and black accents, leaving rough, partially unfinished edges and visible surface texture."},{"id":"charles-robinson","name":"Charles Robinson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Charles Robinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-robinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-robinson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white","deep-red","blue"],"intro":"Charles Robinson is a renowned British illustrator known for his contributions to the Golden Age of Illustration. His work is celebrated for its intricate detail, enchanting themes, and connection to fairy tales and folklore. Robinson's illustrations often feature delicate line work and a romantic, whimsical style that captures the imagination.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines finely drawn, illustrative figures with visible painted texture, dense ornamental surfaces, patterned fabrics, and elaborate costumes. Muted jewel tones, dark interiors, elegant poses, and richly decorated architectural settings create a theatrical, nostalgic atmosphere with strong decorative linework."},{"id":"john-ruskin","name":"John Ruskin","cat":"painters","en":"John Ruskin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-ruskin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-ruskin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","landscapes","portraits","mist","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-blue","muted-blue","bone-white","black","brown","blue"],"intro":"John Ruskin was a prominent 19th-century English art critic, social thinker, and philanthropist, known for his influential works on art and architecture. He played a significant role in the Victorian art world, advocating for the appreciation of nature and the Gothic revival in architecture. Ruskin's writings and lectures had a profound impact on the development of the Arts and Crafts Movement and the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood.","observation":"Across the landscapes and portrait, the style combines recognizable forms with visible, gestural paint marks, fine linear accents, and layered watercolor-like washes. Cool blue and slate tones dominate, with restrained ochre warmth, atmospheric haze, rugged terrain, and an expressive, slightly fantastical mood."},{"id":"li-wei","name":"Li Wei","cat":"various-artists","en":"Li Wei","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/li-wei.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/li-wei","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","mist","motion","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","brown","muted-blue","charcoal","beige","muted-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Li Wei is a contemporary Chinese artist known for his gravity-defying photographs that blend performance art with digital manipulation. His work often explores themes of urbanization, modernity, and the human condition, capturing surreal and whimsical scenes that challenge perceptions of reality.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic imagery with subdued, moody color and soft atmospheric haze over densely layered urban environments. Human figures are isolated in expressive midair poses, creating a dreamy, surreal tension against weathered buildings, rooftops, monuments, and expansive skies."},{"id":"d-w-griffith","name":"D. W. Griffith","cat":"filmmakers","en":"D. W. Griffith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/d-w-griffith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/d-w-griffith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver"],"intro":"D. W. Griffith was a pioneering American filmmaker, best known for his groundbreaking work in the early 20th century. He is often credited with transforming the art of cinema through innovative narrative techniques and is most famous for directing \"The Birth of a Nation\" and \"Intolerance.\" Griffith's work laid the foundation for modern filmmaking, influencing generations of directors with his use of close-ups, cross-cutting, and large-scale productions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white portraiture with deep shadows, blown highlights, visible grain, and distressed film texture. Tight, emotionally intense faces and figures are staged like eerie cinematic stills, combining selective focus and dramatic lighting with surreal, unsettling expressions."},{"id":"gifford-beal","name":"Gifford Beal","cat":"painters","en":"Gifford Beal","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gifford-beal.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gifford-beal","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-brown","silver","grey","muted-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Gifford Beal is an American painter known for his vibrant and lively depictions of landscapes and scenes, particularly those capturing the essence of coastal and rural life in the United States. His work is often associated with American Impressionism , characterized by its expressive use of color and light. Beal's paintings frequently explore themes of nature, community, and the interplay between humans and their environments, reflecting a deep appreciation for the beauty of everyday life.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses visibly built-up oil-paint strokes, broad directional marks, and expressive color to describe winter streets, architecture, and social scenes. Strong blue-white shadows contrast with warm windows and café lights, while dense urban detail and ornate presentation give the set a traditionally framed, gallery-painting character."},{"id":"germaine-richier","name":"Germaine Richier","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Germaine Richier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/germaine-richier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/germaine-richier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["silver","grey","beige","black","brown","white"],"intro":"Germaine Richier was a French sculptor known for her innovative and expressive works that often explored themes of human existence and transformation. Born in 1902, she studied under Antoine Bourdelle and became one of the prominent figures in post-war European art. Richier's sculptures are characterized by their abstract forms and textured surfaces, often conveying a sense of movement and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents elongated, contorted humanoid sculptures with rough, heavily worked surfaces and dramatic gestural poses. Dark bronze-brown tones, strong directional lighting, and sparse gallery-like settings emphasize the figures’ skeletal structure, movement, and expressive distortion."},{"id":"george-nelson","name":"George Nelson","cat":"designers","en":"George Nelson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-nelson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-nelson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["silver","brown","black","ochre","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"George Nelson is a renowned American industrial designer and architect, known for his influential contributions to modernist design during the mid-20th century. He played a pivotal role in shaping the aesthetics of the post-war era, collaborating with major furniture companies and creating iconic pieces that emphasized functionality and simplicity.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly surfaces with crisp geometric organization and strong, saturated color contrasts. It moves between architectural vistas, symbolic geometric compositions, and surreal sculptural objects, treating each with fine linear detail, tactile patina, and carefully arranged gallery-like framing."},{"id":"david-mack","name":"David Mack","cat":"illustrators","en":"David Mack","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-mack.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-mack","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","orange","muted-cyan","beige","red","charcoal"],"intro":"David Mack is a contemporary American artist and writer known for his work in comic books and graphic novels. He is recognized for his unique artistic style that often incorporates elements of collage, watercolor, and ink, creating a distinctive and expressive visual narrative.","observation":"Across all four portraits, translucent watercolor washes, visible paper texture, and fine ink contours create an expressive mixed-media look. Cropped faces are repeatedly interrupted by flowing abstract shapes, splashes, and graphic marks, with saturated coral and blue accents giving the style a surreal, emotionally charged character."},{"id":"john-william-godward","name":"John William Godward","cat":"painters","en":"John William Godward","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-william-godward.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-william-godward","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","subdued-colors","classical","erotic"],"colours":["bone-white","deep-red","muted-ochre","red","black","grey"],"intro":"John William Godward was a British painter known for his classical style, often depicting women in serene, ancient settings. He was associated with the late Victorian neoclassical movement and was influenced by the works of Lawrence Alma-Tadema and Frederic Leighton. Godward's paintings are characterized by their meticulous attention to detail, use of vibrant colors, and romanticized portrayals of antiquity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly refined, representational painting with softly blended skin, visible fine brushwork, and meticulously rendered folds, jewelry, hair, stone, and tile. Warm reds, oranges, creams, and muted blues support idealized female portraits posed within richly decorated classical architectural settings, with an ornate, sensual presentation."},{"id":"jack-gaughan","name":"Jack Gaughan","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jack Gaughan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-gaughan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-gaughan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","dark-red","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Jack Gaughan is a renowned illustrator known for his work in science fiction and fantasy art. His illustrations have graced the covers of numerous science fiction novels and magazines, capturing the imaginations of readers with his vivid and imaginative depictions of otherworldly scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly textured, brush-painted surfaces with dense fantastical worldbuilding, monumental architecture, and immense planetary landscapes. Strong dark-light separation and saturated reds, blues, and oranges give the scenes an epic, surreal atmosphere, while recurring figures and structures provide narrative scale."},{"id":"norman-lewis","name":"Norman Lewis","cat":"painters","en":"Norman Lewis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norman-lewis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norman-lewis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["brown","red","dark-red","muted-teal","muted-green","muted-orange"],"intro":"Norman Lewis was an influential African American painter known for his contributions to abstract expressionism and his involvement in the Harlem Renaissance. His work often explored themes of cultural identity and social justice, using abstract forms and vibrant colors to convey complex narratives.","observation":"Across all four works, abstract compositions combine visibly layered paint, rough textured surfaces, and broad gestural strokes with recurring blocks, vertical marks, and fragmented forms. The palette is strongly saturated but often deep and atmospheric, especially in the red-black and teal-orange contrasts, while the compositions remain expressive and nonrepresentational."},{"id":"david-burnett","name":"David Burnett","cat":"photographers","en":"David Burnett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-burnett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-burnett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","grey","silver","dark-brown"],"intro":"David Burnett is a renowned American photojournalist known for his compelling and diverse body of work, capturing significant historical events and cultural moments. With a career spanning several decades, Burnett has documented everything from political upheavals to Olympic Games, earning numerous accolades for his impactful storytelling through photography.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic photography with a dark, moody tonal range, often emphasizing deep shadows, stark highlights, and occasional muted earth tones. Fashion-led figures are placed in dramatic architectural or outdoor settings, with flowing fabric, expressive poses, selective focus, and motion blur creating a tense, theatrical atmosphere."},{"id":"herman-brood","name":"Herman Brood","cat":"illustrators","en":"Herman Brood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herman-brood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herman-brood","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","red","silver","blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Herman Brood is a Dutch musician, painter, and cultural icon known for his energetic performances and distinctive visual art style. Emerging from the post-punk and rock scene, Brood became a symbol of rebellion and artistic expression in the Netherlands during the late 20th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines vivid, high-saturation color fields with aggressively gestural black outlines and visibly worked paint surfaces. Fragmented faces and figures emerge from overlapping flat blocks, broad strokes, drips, scratches, and spontaneous linear marks, creating an expressive abstracted portrait language."},{"id":"antonio-canova","name":"Antonio Canova","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Antonio Canova","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antonio-canova.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antonio-canova","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","beige"],"intro":"Antonio Canova was an Italian neoclassical sculptor, renowned for his marble sculptures that delicately rendered the human form. Born in 1757, Canova's work epitomized the neoclassical style, characterized by its classical beauty, grace, and idealized forms. His sculptures often drew inspiration from mythology and history, capturing the elegance and emotion of his subjects with remarkable precision and detail.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, sculptural portrait busts with finely resolved curls, facial anatomy, carved drapery, and visible marble texture. Subdued ivory and beige tones are set against dark museum-like surroundings with directional, cinematic lighting and selective background blur."},{"id":"gail-potocki","name":"Gail Potocki","cat":"painters","en":"Gail Potocki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gail-potocki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gail-potocki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","muted-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Gail Potocki is an American artist known for her contemporary symbolist paintings. Her work often explores themes of beauty, decay, and the human condition, drawing inspiration from 19th-century aesthetics and the Pre-Raphaelite movement. Potocki's paintings are characterized by their rich color palettes, intricate details, and emotive subjects, often incorporating elements of nature and symbolism.","observation":"Across all four images, intimate portraits are rendered with visible, richly layered brushwork, especially in the faces, feathers, foliage, and elaborate clothing. A subdued green, cream, and black palette, deep shadowed backgrounds, and expressive gazes create a dark, romantic atmosphere, while ravens and dense botanical details reinforce the ornate visual language."},{"id":"guido-reni","name":"Guido Reni","cat":"painters","en":"Guido Reni","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guido-reni.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guido-reni","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","brown","light-orange","muted-ochre","grey","deep-red"],"intro":"Guido Reni was an Italian painter of the Baroque period, known for his classical and idealized style. Born in Bologna in 1575, Reni became one of the most celebrated artists of his time, renowned for his religious and mythological works. His paintings are characterized by their graceful figures, serene compositions, and masterful use of light and shadow, reflecting the influence of both the Renaissance and the Baroque.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modelled oil-paint surfaces, fine visible brushwork, and dense anatomical and fabric detail. Dramatically foreshortened figures, upward gazes, twisting gestures, deep shadows, and warm flesh against dark teal grounds create an emotionally heightened religious tableau."},{"id":"john-berkey","name":"John Berkey","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Berkey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-berkey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-berkey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","glow","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["muted-cyan","black","charcoal","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"John Berkey was an American artist known for his distinctive science fiction illustrations, particularly his depictions of futuristic space scenes. His work has been influential in shaping the visual language of science fiction, with a career spanning several decades and contributions to both book covers and film concept art.","observation":"Across all four renders, vast science-fiction environments are built with dense, visible brushwork, layered mechanical structures, and expansive cinematic vistas. Strong teal, blue, orange, and white contrasts create luminous atmospheric scenes, while tiny figures and monumental spacecraft emphasize scale, motion, and an epic dreamlike mood."},{"id":"james-gilleard","name":"James Gilleard","cat":"illustrators","en":"James Gilleard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-gilleard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-gilleard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi"],"colours":["charcoal","red","muted-blue","pale-orange","dark-red","muted-pink"],"intro":"James Gilleard is a contemporary illustrator known for his distinctive style that blends elements of retro-futurism with modern digital techniques. His work often features vibrant colors and geometric forms, creating a unique visual language that captures the imagination. Gilleard's illustrations are characterized by their detailed compositions and a nostalgic yet futuristic aesthetic.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, cinematic city and architectural vistas with realistic spatial depth, crisp geometric structures, and small human figures that establish scale. Saturated coral, amber, and teal color contrasts, luminous sunset illumination, atmospheric haze, and a fine grain overlay give the scenes a polished yet tactile retro-futurist mood."},{"id":"anselm-feuerbach","name":"Anselm Feuerbach","cat":"painters","en":"Anselm Feuerbach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anselm-feuerbach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anselm-feuerbach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","dark-brown","light-orange","grey"],"intro":"Anselm Feuerbach was a German painter known for his classical and romantic style, often focusing on mythological and historical subjects. Born in 1829, Feuerbach was a leading figure in 19th-century European art, celebrated for his detailed and realistic portrayals. His works are characterized by a serene and melancholic mood, often depicting introspective figures in historical settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly painted, realistic female portraits with visible brushwork, modeled faces, and expressive gazes. Earthy, subdued colors, dramatic shadow, dark clothing, and historical-looking drapery create a somber classical portrait atmosphere."},{"id":"richard-lippold","name":"Richard Lippold","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Richard Lippold","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-lippold.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-lippold","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-ochre","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Richard Lippold was an American sculptor known for his intricate wire sculptures that often explored themes of space and abstraction. His work is characterized by its geometric precision and a sense of ethereal lightness, often drawing inspiration from architecture and celestial forms.","observation":"The style presents monumental wire and thread installations in spacious architectural interiors, rendered with photographic realism, precise fine lines, and strong geometric structure. Restrained warm-gray tones, deep shadows, bright window light, and abundant negative space create a cinematic, contemplative surrealism, with occasional human figures used to establish scale."},{"id":"john-lurie","name":"John Lurie","cat":"painters","en":"John Lurie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-lurie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-lurie","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","dark-green","muted-teal","ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"John Lurie is an American musician, painter, and actor known for his work in the avant-garde jazz scene and his roles in independent films. He co-founded the Lounge Lizards, a jazz ensemble, and has appeared in films such as \"Stranger Than Paradise.\" Lurie is also recognized for his unique painting style, which often explores surreal and whimsical themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, natural landscapes and flower-filled growth are rendered with visible, layered brushwork, scraped textures, and expressive marks. Saturated flower colors punctuate moody blue-green and near-black grounds, while fine twig and stem lines create a dense, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"richard-hambleton","name":"Richard Hambleton","cat":"street-artists","en":"Richard Hambleton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-hambleton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-hambleton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","charcoal","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"Richard Hambleton is known as a pioneering street artist who emerged in the 1980s. He gained fame for his shadowy figures painted on the streets of New York, often referred to as the 'Shadowman.' His work is characterized by its bold, expressive style and its exploration of themes related to identity and urban life.","observation":"Across all four renders, rough gestural paint, splatters, drips, and broad strokes build fragmented human forms from dense black and pale fields. The stark monochrome palette and extreme tonal separation make the faceless figures feel ominous, surreal, and highly expressive."},{"id":"kelly-wearstler","name":"Kelly Wearstler","cat":"designers","en":"Kelly Wearstler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kelly-wearstler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kelly-wearstler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","dark-brown","grey","silver","rust"],"intro":"Kelly Wearstler is an American interior designer known for her bold and eclectic style, often characterized by a mix of modern glamour and vintage elements. Her work spans various design disciplines, including residential, commercial, and hospitality projects, and she is celebrated for her ability to blend different textures, patterns, and colors in innovative ways.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents richly layered luxury interiors with realistic materials, sculptural furniture, dramatic veined stone, and strong geometric patterning. Deep green, black, cream, and warm brown tones create a moody atmosphere, while pendant lamps and wall sconces provide localized pools of glow."},{"id":"charles-ginner","name":"Charles Ginner","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Ginner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-ginner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-ginner","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","ochre","beige","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Charles Ginner was a British painter known for his contributions to the Camden Town Group and his distinctive post-impressionist style. Born in 1878, Ginner's work often depicted urban scenes and landscapes with a focus on vibrant color and detailed brushwork. His paintings are characterized by a strong sense of structure and form, often capturing the essence of early 20th-century British life.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visibly brushed paint with crisp illustrative construction and dense, carefully observed detail. Saturated reds, greens, blues, and floral colors unify scenes of picturesque architecture, cultivated gardens, canal reflections, and warmly furnished interiors, with decorative surfaces and fine marks throughout."},{"id":"don-mccullin","name":"Don McCullin","cat":"photographers","en":"Don McCullin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/don-mccullin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/don-mccullin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","white","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Don McCullin is a renowned British photojournalist known for his powerful images of conflict and social issues. His work spans several decades, capturing the harsh realities of war and human suffering with a poignant and unflinching eye. McCullin's photography often focuses on marginalized communities and war-torn regions, bringing attention to the struggles and resilience of people in dire circumstances.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photography with heavy grain, deep shadows, and bright blown-out skies to create a harsh documentary realism. Close, emotionally intense portraits are set against ruined urban landscapes, smoke, fire, and rubble, with selective softness and atmospheric haze reinforcing the bleak wartime mood."},{"id":"doug-marlette","name":"Doug Marlette","cat":"illustrators","en":"Doug Marlette","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/doug-marlette.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/doug-marlette","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","muted-yellow","black","white","vivid-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Doug Marlette is known for his work as a Pulitzer Prize-winning editorial cartoonist and creator of the comic strip 'Kudzu.' His career spanned several decades, during which he became a prominent figure in American cartooning, known for his sharp wit and insightful commentary on social and political issues.","observation":"The style is a highly detailed comic illustration built from forceful black ink contours, dense crosshatched marks, and expressive caricatural faces and creatures. Vivid flat-to lightly modulated colors, strong contrast, and dynamic narrative scenes give the sheet an energetic fantasy-adventure feel."},{"id":"jack-ohman","name":"Jack Ohman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jack Ohman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-ohman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-ohman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-cyan","vivid-red","red","dark-red","pale-orange"],"intro":"Jack Ohman is a renowned American cartoonist and illustrator, known for his work as an editorial cartoonist. His career spans several decades, during which he has received numerous awards for his insightful and often humorous commentary on political and social issues. Ohman's work is characterized by its sharp wit and ability to capture the essence of contemporary events and personalities.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic comic-book portraiture with thick black contouring, aggressively simplified flat color, and visible crosshatched marks. Saturated coral red and slate blue dominate against deep black shadows, producing high contrast, tightly cropped male figures, crowds, and tense expressions with a distressed printed texture."},{"id":"larry-towell","name":"Larry Towell","cat":"photographers","en":"Larry Towell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-towell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-towell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Larry Towell is a renowned Canadian photographer known for his work in documentary photography. He is a member of Magnum Photos and has gained recognition for capturing intimate and powerful images that explore themes of family, rural life, and social issues. His work often focuses on marginalized communities and personal stories, bringing a humanistic approach to his subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is stark black-and-white photography with strong tonal separation, visible grain, and selective focus. Candid portraits and loosely observed moments are composed with documentary spontaneity, blurred movement, foreground occlusion, and emotionally charged expressions."},{"id":"h-a-brendekilde","name":"H. A. Brendekilde","cat":"painters","en":"H. A. Brendekilde","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/h-a-brendekilde.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/h-a-brendekilde","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","muted-blue","silver","beige","ochre"],"intro":"H. A. Brendekilde is a Danish painter known for his naturalistic and romantic depictions of rural life and landscapes. His work often features detailed portrayals of nature and figures, capturing the essence of Nordic culture and mythology. Brendekilde's paintings are characterized by their use of light and shadow, creating a sense of depth and realism.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, richly detailed landscape imagery with cool, dark blue-grey atmospheres punctuated by warm amber lights. Dense bare branches, reflective wet ground, misty depth, and looming architecture create a cinematic, melancholic mood across both rural and village settings."},{"id":"george-grosz","name":"George Grosz","cat":"painters","en":"George Grosz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-grosz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-grosz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","ochre","rust","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"George Grosz was a German artist known for his caricatural drawings and paintings that critiqued the social and political climate of the Weimar Republic. His work often depicted the corruption and decadence of Berlin society in the 1920s, using a style that combined elements of Expressionism and Dada.","observation":"The style is a dense, crowded painted tableau of expressive, often caricatured faces and costumed figures, with overlapping forms filling nearly every area. Broad visible brushwork, strong facial distortion, saturated reds and greens, and sharp dark-light contrasts create a theatrical, energetic retro character."},{"id":"gerald-scarfe","name":"Gerald Scarfe","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gerald Scarfe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerald-scarfe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerald-scarfe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["white","beige","muted-cyan","green","black","red","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Gerald Scarfe is a renowned British cartoonist and illustrator known for his distinctive and satirical style. His work often features bold lines and exaggerated characters, capturing the essence of political and social commentary. Scarfe has contributed to various publications and projects, making a significant impact in the world of illustration and caricature.","observation":"The style combines expressive fashion-illustration drawing with loose, visible ink lines, splashes, washes, and broad painted marks. Elongated, surreal figures and creature-like faces stand out against generous white space, using vivid turquoise, magenta, red, orange, and green accents with strong black contouring."},{"id":"guy-denning","name":"Guy Denning","cat":"painters","en":"Guy Denning","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-denning.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-denning","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","beige","muted-orange"],"intro":"Guy Denning is a contemporary British artist known for his expressive and emotive portraiture. His work often explores themes of identity, emotion, and the human condition, using a distinctive style that combines elements of realism and abstraction. Denning's paintings are characterized by their intense emotional impact and dynamic use of color and composition.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped faces as emotionally intense portrait studies, combining subdued near-monochrome tones with deep blacks and stark highlights. Dense fine linework, crosshatching, ink-like marks, and visibly worked painterly surfaces create a distressed, layered texture, with fragmented angular blocks adding a surreal edge."},{"id":"kurt-hutton","name":"Kurt Hutton","cat":"photographers","en":"Kurt Hutton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kurt-hutton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kurt-hutton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["silver","black","charcoal","grey","white"],"intro":"Kurt Hutton is a renowned photographer known for his influential work in the mid-20th century. He was a pioneer in photojournalism, capturing candid moments and everyday life with a humanistic approach. His work often focused on the subtleties of human expression and the nuances of urban environments, making significant contributions to the field of documentary photography.","observation":"The style uses high-contrast black-and-white photography with carefully posed, fashion-conscious figures in urban streets and elegant café interiors. Selective focus, grain, dramatic cropping, and bright highlights create a polished cinematic mood while keeping faces and clothing strongly defined."},{"id":"rebeca-saray","name":"Rebeca Saray","cat":"photographers","en":"Rebeca Saray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rebeca-saray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rebeca-saray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","silver","muted-cyan","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Rebeca Saray is a contemporary Spanish photographer known for her surreal and fantastical portraiture. Her work often blends elements of fantasy with intricate details, creating a unique visual narrative that captivates and intrigues viewers. Saray's photography is characterized by its vivid color palettes and dramatic compositions, often drawing inspiration from mythological and baroque influences.","observation":"The style is highly detailed and realistic, presenting dark fantasy portraits and character tableaux with elaborate costumes, headdresses, jewelry, and animal companions. Muted blue, brown, black, and deep red tones, ornate interiors, soft atmospheric smoke, and selective focus create a moody, dreamlike theatricality."},{"id":"albert-dros","name":"Albert Dros","cat":"photographers","en":"Albert Dros","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-dros.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-dros","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","backlighting","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","rust","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Albert Dros is a contemporary photographer known for his breathtaking landscape photography, often capturing the ethereal beauty of natural and urban environments. His work is characterized by vibrant colors, dramatic lighting, and meticulous attention to detail, which has earned him recognition in the field of photography.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, photorealistic compositions of solitary figures in expansive natural settings, with flowing garments and expressive gestures creating a romantic, dreamlike atmosphere. Moody dusk palettes, strong backlighting, glowing skies, reflective water, and atmospheric haze recur across the renders, balancing dark silhouettes with warm luminous highlights."},{"id":"elmer-bischoff","name":"Elmer Bischoff","cat":"painters","en":"Elmer Bischoff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elmer-bischoff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elmer-bischoff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-green","dark-brown","beige","rust","orange"],"intro":"Elmer Bischoff is an American painter known for his role in the Bay Area Figurative Movement, which emerged in the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by a shift from abstract expressionism to a more figurative style, focusing on human figures and interior scenes. Bischoff's paintings often explore themes of introspection and human relationships, using a distinctive palette and expressive brushwork.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses vigorous, visibly layered brushwork to reduce people and places to broad, expressive shapes. Deep teal and black shadows contrast with saturated orange, red, green, and turquoise passages, creating atmospheric urban scenes with dramatic interior and evening light."},{"id":"nobuyoshi-araki","name":"Nobuyoshi Araki","cat":"photographers","en":"Nobuyoshi Araki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nobuyoshi-araki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nobuyoshi-araki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","erotic"],"colours":["white","black","orange","silver","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Nobuyoshi Araki is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his provocative and often controversial work, which explores themes of sexuality, life, and death. His photography is characterized by its bold and intimate portrayal of subjects, often blurring the lines between art and eroticism. Araki's work has been influential in both the art world and popular culture, making him a pivotal figure in contemporary photography.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped editorial portraits with vivid red-dominant color, strong contrast, and tactile skin and fabric detail. Intimate poses, floral adornments, dramatic makeup, shallow focus, and visible photographic grain give the images a sensual, cinematic fashion-editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"jeanloup-sieff","name":"Jeanloup Sieff","cat":"photographers","en":"Jeanloup Sieff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeanloup-sieff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeanloup-sieff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Jeanloup Sieff is a renowned French photographer known for his work in fashion, portraiture, and nudes. His career spanned several decades, during which he captured iconic images for major magazines and fashion houses. Sieff's style is characterized by its elegant composition, use of black and white, and a focus on the human form, often with a sensual and intimate approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is stark black-and-white editorial portrait photography, built from close crops, direct gazes, and strong blocks of shadow against bright highlights. Visible grain, shallow focus, dramatic makeup, dark clothing, and occasional urban or automotive settings give the images a moody, cinematic fashion character."},{"id":"sherry-akrami","name":"Sherry Akrami","cat":"photographers","en":"Sherry Akrami","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sherry-akrami.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sherry-akrami","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Sherry Akrami is a contemporary photographer known for her evocative and surreal imagery. Her work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, utilizing a monochromatic palette to enhance the emotional depth of her subjects. Akrami's photography is characterized by its cinematic quality and dramatic use of light and shadow, creating a haunting and ethereal atmosphere.","observation":"A stark monochrome style combines dramatic tonal contrast with immense cloud formations, fog, and lonely figures set against desolate landscapes. The images feel cinematic and dreamlike, using surreal scale, dissolving forms, and implied movement to create a bleak, epic atmosphere."},{"id":"peter-shire","name":"Peter Shire","cat":"various-artists","en":"Peter Shire","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-shire.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-shire","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["silver","white","red","brown","muted-blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"Peter Shire is an American artist and designer known for his contributions to the Memphis Group, a design collective that emerged in the 1980s. Shire's work often blends elements of architecture, sculpture, and design, characterized by bold colors, geometric shapes, and playful forms. His creations span various mediums, including ceramics, furniture, and public art installations, reflecting a postmodern aesthetic that challenges traditional design conventions.","observation":"Across all four renders, brightly colored geometric objects are arranged as dense, carefully balanced sculptural still lifes. Clean graphic edges, bold stripes, checkerboards, flat color blocks, and occasional marble or terrazzo textures combine an illustrative look with playful surreal construction."},{"id":"john-crome","name":"John Crome","cat":"painters","en":"John Crome","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-crome.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-crome","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-blue","silver","orange"],"intro":"John Crome was a prominent English landscape painter and a leading figure of the Norwich School of painters, active during the late 18th and early 19th centuries. Known for his naturalistic and detailed depictions of the English countryside, Crome's work often highlighted the beauty of rural life and the serene landscapes of Norfolk.","observation":"These landscapes use visibly textured, painterly surfaces and densely rendered foliage, clouds, water, and distant terrain. Strong atmospheric light shifts between cool blue haze and warm amber glow, creating deep shadows, luminous openings, and an expansive, idealised pastoral grandeur."},{"id":"johan-messely","name":"Johan Messely","cat":"painters","en":"Johan Messely","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johan-messely.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johan-messely","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-olive","grey","beige","brown","blue","red"],"intro":"Johan Messely is a contemporary Belgian painter known for his vibrant and atmospheric landscapes and cityscapes. His work is characterized by a masterful use of light and color, often depicting charming European settings with a romantic flair.","observation":"The style combines richly visible, broad painterly strokes with highly detailed garden architecture and abundant flowers. Vivid color, dappled sunlight, and luminous shafts through foliage create a romantic, slightly dreamlike courtyard atmosphere across all four renders."},{"id":"limbourg-brothers","name":"Limbourg brothers","cat":"painters","en":"Limbourg brothers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/limbourg-brothers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/limbourg-brothers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","religious","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver","dark-blue","blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Limbourg brothers were renowned medieval manuscript illuminators from the Netherlands, active in the early 15th century. They are best known for their work on the 'Très Riches Heures du Duc de Berry,' a richly decorated book of hours that exemplifies the International Gothic style. Their art is characterized by intricate details, vivid colors, and a blend of realism and fantasy, capturing the essence of medieval courtly life and religious themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly detailed, jewel-toned painted scenes with intricate medieval architecture, ceremonial figures, patterned garments, and abundant flowers. Fine descriptive marks, ornamental surfaces, balanced arrangements, and luminous blue, red, white, and gold accents give the images the character of richly illuminated courtly tableaux."},{"id":"christine-ellger","name":"Christine Ellger","cat":"photographers","en":"Christine Ellger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christine-ellger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christine-ellger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","charcoal","dark-brown","pale-orange","silver","rust"],"intro":"Christine Ellger is a contemporary photographer known for her imaginative and surreal landscapes. Her work often blends elements of fantasy and reality, creating dreamlike scenes that captivate viewers with their intricate details and ethereal quality.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic landscape imagery with richly detailed environments, dramatic cloud formations, and strong atmospheric depth. Moody blue-gray or amber palettes, glowing backlight, mist, and small human figures create a dreamy fantastical sense of scale and adventure across the scenes."},{"id":"wolfgang-weingart","name":"Wolfgang Weingart","cat":"designers","en":"Wolfgang Weingart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wolfgang-weingart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wolfgang-weingart","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","cream","bone-white","charcoal","brown","beige"],"intro":"Wolfgang Weingart is a renowned Swiss graphic designer known for his influential role in the development of the New Wave typography movement. His work is characterized by experimental approaches to typography and design, breaking away from the rigid constraints of traditional Swiss design.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses stark black-and-cream abstraction built from oversized geometric and organic shapes, with strong negative space and emphatic contouring. Flat graphic fields alternate with visible ink and dry-brush texture, while the extreme tonal contrast and repeated curves, blocks, and cutout-like forms create a bold, surreal visual language."},{"id":"petra-cortright","name":"Petra Cortright","cat":"various-artists","en":"Petra Cortright","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/petra-cortright.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/petra-cortright","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","floral","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["blue","muted-blue","light-pink","charcoal","muted-ochre","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Petra Cortright is an American artist known for her work in digital media, including video, painting, and internet-based art. Her pieces often explore the intersection of technology and traditional art forms, utilizing digital tools to create vibrant and layered compositions. Cortright's work is characterized by its playful and experimental approach, often incorporating elements of internet culture and digital aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, floral arrangements emerge from saturated blue grounds through visible, layered paint, combining recognizable blossoms with splashes, drips, fragmented marks, and fluid distortions. The style is richly detailed and expressive, balancing delicate flower forms against energetic broad strokes and scattered abstract texture."},{"id":"abanindranath-tagore","name":"Abanindranath Tagore","cat":"painters","en":"Abanindranath Tagore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abanindranath-tagore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abanindranath-tagore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","ochre","grey","orange"],"intro":"Abanindranath Tagore was a prominent Indian artist and a leading figure in the Bengal School of Art. Born in 1871, he played a crucial role in the revival of traditional Indian art forms during the early 20th century. His work is characterized by its incorporation of Indian themes and techniques, blending them with influences from Western art. Tagore's paintings often depict scenes from Indian mythology, history, and culture, and he is celebrated for his contributions to the cultural renaissance in India.","observation":"Across all four images, muted sepia, rust, blue-gray, and black tones form atmospheric narrative scenes with expressive figures, animals, trees, and distant landscapes. Fine ink-like contours, visible brushy washes, rough grain, and strong silhouettes create a dark, vintage storybook impression."},{"id":"frederick-john-kiesler","name":"Frederick John Kiesler","cat":"designers","en":"Frederick John Kiesler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederick-john-kiesler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederick-john-kiesler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","still-life","grain","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","muted-brown","dark-brown","ochre","black","red"],"intro":"Frederick John Kiesler is an Austrian-American architect, designer, and artist known for his innovative and avant-garde contributions to architecture and design. He was a prominent figure in the 20th century, recognized for his experimental approach and his role in the development of modernist architecture and design.","observation":"The style presents imposing abstract wooden figures as solid, hand-carved sculptures, with heavy mass, hollow openings, angular contours, and visibly weathered grain. Restrained earth tones, dramatic gallery lighting, and carefully staged pedestal views give the works a museum-documentary realism while preserving their strange, surreal character."},{"id":"olivier-mosset","name":"Olivier Mosset","cat":"various-artists","en":"Olivier Mosset","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olivier-mosset.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olivier-mosset","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","minimalist","sculptural","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["deep-blue","white","vivid-red","beige","dark-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Olivier Mosset is a Swiss artist known for his contributions to the minimalist and abstract art movements. He is recognized for his exploration of geometric forms and monochromatic palettes, often focusing on the simplicity and purity of shapes and colors.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style reduces imagery to large, hard-edged geometric forms in saturated red, blue, yellow, and white. It combines flat graphic color blocking with occasional dimensional presentation, especially the cube and gallery installation, creating a stark, playful, slightly unreal visual language."},{"id":"monique-lhullier","name":"Monique Lhullier","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Monique Lhullier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/monique-lhullier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/monique-lhullier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","pastel-colors"],"colours":["white","bone-white","beige","black","brown"],"intro":"Monique Lhullier is a renowned fashion designer known for her exquisite bridal and evening wear. Her designs are celebrated for their elegance, romanticism, and intricate detailing, making her a prominent figure in the world of high fashion.","observation":"The style combines delicate fashion illustration with visible watercolor-like brushwork, fine ink contours, and softly layered pastel shading. It focuses on elegant female models and elaborate white couture, emphasizing floral embellishment, translucent fabric, ruffles, and sweeping dress silhouettes."},{"id":"ottavio-missoni","name":"Ottavio Missoni","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Ottavio Missoni","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ottavio-missoni.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ottavio-missoni","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","sculptural","fashion","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-ochre","grey","black","dark-red","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Ottavio Missoni was an Italian fashion designer renowned for his colorful knitwear designs and pioneering work in the fashion industry. He co-founded the Missoni brand, which became famous for its distinctive patterns and vibrant color palettes, often inspired by abstract art and traditional Italian craftsmanship.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured woven and tufted textiles dominate, combining saturated colors with dense geometric, wavy, and zigzag motifs. The style treats fabric as both surface decoration and three-dimensional form, extending across garments, furniture, wall hangings, and gallery-like displays."},{"id":"marc-allante","name":"Marc Allante","cat":"painters","en":"Marc Allante","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-allante.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-allante","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["white","muted-cyan","black","pink","vivid-red","dark-blue","green","light-yellow"],"intro":"Marc Allante is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and expressive style that combines traditional Chinese ink techniques with Western watercolor and digital art. His work often explores themes of nature, emotion, and the human experience, characterized by fluid forms and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four images, recognizable figures are built from energetic black ink contours and silhouettes, then disrupted by exuberant splashes, broad painted marks, and long vertical drips. The style combines vivid, high-contrast color with a white ground, expressive gesture, and deliberately raw mixed-media texture."},{"id":"jaume-plensa","name":"Jaume Plensa","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jaume Plensa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jaume-plensa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jaume-plensa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","metallic","epic","geometric"],"colours":["grey","black","beige","blue","silver","dark-olive"],"intro":"Jaume Plensa is a renowned Spanish artist and sculptor known for his large-scale public art installations. His work often explores themes of identity, human experience, and communication, utilizing materials such as steel, glass, and light to create immersive and thought-provoking pieces. Plensa's sculptures are celebrated for their ability to engage with their surroundings and evoke a sense of introspection and wonder.","observation":"The style presents monumental, highly detailed metal head sculptures as realistic outdoor public artworks, emphasizing their solid volume while exposing intricate mesh and cut-metal construction. Bright daylight, reflective metallic surfaces, clean architectural surroundings, and small human figures establish a grand, cinematic sense of scale."},{"id":"margaret-bourke-white","name":"Margaret Bourke-White","cat":"photographers","en":"Margaret Bourke-White","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/margaret-bourke-white.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/margaret-bourke-white","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["grey","silver","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Margaret Bourke-White was a pioneering American photographer and documentary photographer, known for her work with Life magazine and her striking images of industrial and architectural subjects. She was one of the first female war correspondents and her work often captured the spirit of the early 20th century, focusing on themes of industrialization and urbanization.","observation":"A stark black-and-white industrial style built from dense machinery, towering factory structures, smoke, and workers captured in forceful low-angle compositions. Strong backlighting and deep silhouettes create high contrast, while documentary realism, visible motion, and dramatic atmospheric steam give the scenes a monumental, cinematic intensity."},{"id":"dorothea-lange","name":"Dorothea Lange","cat":"photographers","en":"Dorothea Lange","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dorothea-lange.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dorothea-lange","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","silver","black"],"intro":"Dorothea Lange was an influential American documentary photographer and photojournalist, best known for her Depression-era work for the Farm Security Administration. Her photographs humanized the consequences of the Great Depression and influenced the development of documentary photography.","observation":"The style is stark black-and-white documentary portraiture, using hard sunlight, deep shadows, and pronounced tonal contrast to emphasize weathered faces and worn fabric. Tight, candid framing through train windows creates intimate human scenes, with selective focus and fine photographic grain reinforcing the observational realism."},{"id":"fred-sandback","name":"Fred Sandback","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Fred Sandback","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fred-sandback.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fred-sandback","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","urban","glow","flat-color","high-contrast","geometric"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","brown","silver","white","dark-red"],"intro":"Fred Sandback is known for his minimalist sculptures that explore the perception of space using simple materials like yarn and wire. His work often involves creating spatial illusions and redefining architectural spaces, emphasizing the viewer's interaction with the art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents spacious contemporary gallery interiors with crisp geometric architecture, strong perspective, and sparse compositions. Photorealistic surfaces and directional daylight are overlaid with precise red linear grids and occasional cyan or coral illumination, creating a restrained architectural-installation aesthetic."},{"id":"coco-chanel","name":"Coco Chanel","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Coco Chanel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/coco-chanel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/coco-chanel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["black","bone-white","red","muted-orange","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Coco Chanel is a renowned French fashion designer known for her revolutionary contributions to women's fashion. She is celebrated for popularizing a chic, minimalist style that emphasized comfort and elegance, including the iconic Chanel No. 5 perfume and the Chanel suit. Her influence extends beyond fashion, impacting modern aesthetics and cultural attitudes towards femininity and luxury.","observation":"The style combines highly textured, visibly brushed paint with graphic illustration: bold dark contours, simplified facial planes, and dramatic black-and-white contrast are punctuated by coral and red accents. Across the portraits, glamorous fashion, pearls, hats, sunglasses, and cigarettes are arranged in poster-like compositions, with some panels incorporating collage fragments and geometric blocks."},{"id":"laura-ashley","name":"Laura Ashley","cat":"designers","en":"Laura Ashley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laura-ashley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laura-ashley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","floral","still-life","subdued-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","beige","grey"],"intro":"Laura Ashley was a renowned Welsh fashion designer and businesswoman, known for her distinctive floral patterns and romantic, vintage-inspired designs. She founded the Laura Ashley brand, which became synonymous with a quintessentially British style, characterized by its use of soft fabrics, delicate prints, and a nostalgic aesthetic that drew inspiration from the English countryside and Victorian era.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, carefully composed traditional interiors filled with layered furniture, floral fabrics, panelled walls, moldings, rugs, and lamps. Its restrained blue-green, cream, and warm wood palette combines decorative richness with orderly architectural framing and soft natural window light."},{"id":"samuel-peploe","name":"Samuel Peploe","cat":"painters","en":"Samuel Peploe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/samuel-peploe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/samuel-peploe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","scenes","still-life","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-green","beige","bone-white","red","charcoal"],"intro":"Samuel Peploe was a Scottish painter known for his role as one of the Scottish Colourists, a group of artists who brought a modernist approach to Scottish painting in the early 20th century. His work is characterized by bold colors, expressive brushwork, and a focus on still life and landscape subjects. Peploe's art reflects the influence of French Impressionism and Post- Impressionism , particularly the works of artists like Cézanne and Matisse.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable floral, domestic, and urban subjects are built from visible, directional brushwork and layered paint, with softened but often lively color relationships. The compositions are richly filled with plants, vessels, fruit, architecture, and textiles, combining observational detail with loose, expressive edges and a decorative illustrative clarity."},{"id":"linnea-strid","name":"Linnea Strid","cat":"painters","en":"Linnea Strid","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/linnea-strid.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/linnea-strid","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","glow","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-red","bone-white","light-blue","red","dark-brown","charcoal"],"intro":"Linnea Strid is a contemporary Swedish artist known for her hyperrealistic paintings that often explore themes of water and human emotion. Her work is characterized by meticulous attention to detail and a focus on capturing the interplay between light and liquid.","observation":"The style uses intensely close, realistic facial portraits rendered with exceptionally fine detail, emphasizing pores, eyelashes, wet hair, droplets, and reflective water. Bright blue eyes and warm skin tones contrast with cool transparent streams, while liquid distortion and sharp highlights create an expressive, glossy, almost tactile surface."},{"id":"doris-salcedo","name":"Doris Salcedo","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Doris Salcedo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/doris-salcedo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/doris-salcedo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","subdued-colors","surreal","dark","epic","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","silver","dark-brown","beige","white"],"intro":"Doris Salcedo is a Colombian sculptor known for her profound and thought-provoking installations that explore themes of memory, trauma, and loss. Her work often reflects on the political and social issues of her native Colombia, addressing the impact of violence and displacement. Salcedo's art is characterized by its use of everyday objects transformed into powerful symbols of absence and remembrance.","observation":"The style uses realistic, finely rendered architectural spaces filled with weathered wooden chairs and frames, often arranged in precarious towers or stark rows. Subdued brown and gray tones, strong geometric structure, dramatic scale, and expansive empty areas create a surreal, bleak, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"tom-killion","name":"Tom Killion","cat":"printmakers","en":"Tom Killion","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-killion.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-killion","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","landscapes","glow","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","beige","muted-cyan","orange","dark-green"],"intro":"Tom Killion is a contemporary American printmaker known for his intricate woodcut and linocut prints that capture the beauty of the California landscape. His work often reflects the influence of traditional Japanese printmaking techniques, combined with a deep appreciation for the natural world and a commitment to environmental themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive natural vistas are rendered as richly detailed illustrations with fine, ink-like contour lines, dense foliage texture, and strongly saturated blue-and-orange color contrasts. Monumental clouds, glowing sunsets, cliffs, water, and stylized trees create expressive, dreamlike landscapes with a fantastical, slightly surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"alaya-gadeh","name":"Alaya Gadeh","cat":"various-artists","en":"Alaya Gadeh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alaya-gadeh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alaya-gadeh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","glow","fine-lines","metallic","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","dreamy"],"colours":["orange","red","dark-green","beige","muted-teal","dark-red"],"intro":"Alaya Gadeh is an artist known for her intricate and vibrant digital artworks that often explore themes of cultural fusion and symbolism. Her work is characterized by a rich tapestry of colors and patterns, drawing inspiration from various cultural and mythological sources.","observation":"The style combines richly saturated turquoise, coral, red, and gold with dense textile, jewelry, floral, and embroidered details. Close-up portraits and lush garden imagery are layered through translucent fabric-like overlays and collage-like juxtapositions, producing a dreamy, ornate, tactile surrealism."},{"id":"joseph-farquharson","name":"Joseph Farquharson","cat":"painters","en":"Joseph Farquharson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joseph-farquharson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joseph-farquharson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","light-orange"],"intro":"Joseph Farquharson was a Scottish painter known for his evocative landscapes, often depicting the Scottish Highlands. Born in 1846, he became renowned for his winter scenes and mastery of light, capturing the serene beauty of nature. His works are characterized by their detailed realism and atmospheric quality, making him a significant figure in 19th-century landscape painting.","observation":"The style is richly realistic and highly detailed, presenting dramatic wilderness landscapes with strong tonal contrast, deep shadow, and warm shafts of light. Deer and expansive natural settings are rendered with cinematic atmosphere, misty depth, expressive skies, and luminous backlighting."},{"id":"maurice-tabard","name":"Maurice Tabard","cat":"photographers","en":"Maurice Tabard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maurice-tabard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maurice-tabard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","silver"],"intro":"Maurice Tabard is a renowned French photographer known for his innovative contributions to the Surrealist and Modernist movements in photography. Born in 1897, Tabard's work is characterized by his experimental techniques, including photomontage and solarization, which he used to create dreamlike and abstract images. His photography often explores themes of identity and psychological introspection, making him a significant figure in the avant-garde art scene of the early 20th century.","observation":"Across all four images, stark monochrome photography combines deep silhouettes with luminous windows, water, or misty openings, creating a strongly backlit, high-contrast look. Solitary figures inhabit quiet interiors and winter landscapes, while reflections, bare branches, and soft atmospheric haze give the scenes a dreamlike, unsettling mood."},{"id":"saul-steinberg","name":"Saul Steinberg","cat":"illustrators","en":"Saul Steinberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/saul-steinberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/saul-steinberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","retro","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-orange","cream","beige","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Saul Steinberg was an American artist and illustrator known for his work in The New Yorker, where he contributed drawings and covers for nearly six decades. His art is characterized by a unique blend of humor, surrealism, and social commentary, often exploring themes of identity, architecture, and urban life. Steinberg's work is celebrated for its wit, creativity, and the ability to convey complex ideas through simple lines and forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, intricate fine-line drawings build dense, eccentric urban scenes populated by tiny figures and exaggerated architectural or bodily forms. The restrained black, grey, and beige palette resembles ink on aged paper, with crosshatched shading, occasional red accents, and surreal scale shifts creating a whimsical dreamlike effect."},{"id":"eric-fischl","name":"Eric Fischl","cat":"painters","en":"Eric Fischl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-fischl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-fischl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","grey","white","muted-ochre","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Eric Fischl is an American painter known for his provocative and emotionally charged works that explore themes of suburban life and human interaction. Born in 1948, Fischl gained prominence in the 1980s with his figurative paintings that often depict intimate and psychologically complex scenes. His work is characterized by a realistic style with a focus on the human figure, capturing moments of tension and introspection.","observation":"Across the four images, recognizable figures are built from visible, directional brushwork with broken edges and layered paint, combining illustrative clarity with an expressive, painterly surface. Saturated reds, oranges, greens, and deep neutrals anchor tightly cropped portraits and posed scenes, while light and dark strokes are used boldly to model faces, clothing, skin, and reflected surroundings."},{"id":"santiago-calatrava","name":"Santiago Calatrava","cat":"architects","en":"Santiago Calatrava","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/santiago-calatrava.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/santiago-calatrava","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","dark-blue","muted-blue"],"intro":"Santiago Calatrava is a renowned Spanish architect and engineer known for his distinctive and innovative designs that often incorporate elements of both architecture and structural engineering. His work is characterized by its organic forms, sweeping curves, and a futuristic aesthetic that often resembles living organisms or natural structures. Calatrava's designs can be seen in various iconic structures around the world, including bridges, museums, and transportation hubs.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed architectural photography with strong geometric repetition, sweeping curves, and carefully controlled perspective. Dramatic contrast, selective monochrome treatment, reflective surfaces, and expansive skies or dark negative space give the structures a monumental, cinematic presence."},{"id":"maya-deren","name":"Maya Deren","cat":"photographers","en":"Maya Deren","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maya-deren.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maya-deren","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Maya Deren was an influential American filmmaker and choreographer known for her avant-garde and experimental films in the 1940s and 1950s. Her work often explored themes of identity, ritual, and the subconscious, blending dance and dreamlike sequences to create a unique cinematic experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white portrait photography with deep blacks, bright highlights, and pronounced grain. Tight crops, profile views, expressive poses, and hard directional light create an intimate, dramatic editorial mood."},{"id":"philippe-parreno","name":"Philippe Parreno","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Philippe Parreno","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philippe-parreno.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philippe-parreno","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","scenes","urban","glow","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","muted-blue"],"intro":"Philippe Parreno is a contemporary French artist known for his innovative and interdisciplinary approach to art. His work often explores the boundaries between reality and fiction, utilizing various media such as film, sculpture, and installation to create immersive experiences. Parreno's art is characterized by its conceptual depth and engagement with time, space, and perception.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic architectural scenes in vast industrial interiors, combining monumental scale with dense ornamental detail. Warm chandelier light glows against dark, cool surroundings, producing strong contrast, reflective surfaces, and a moody, grand atmosphere."},{"id":"josef-albers","name":"Josef Albers","cat":"printmakers","en":"Josef Albers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josef-albers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josef-albers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","illustrative","minimalist","patterns","still-life","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["pale-orange","vivid-red","deep-red","dark-brown","vivid-orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Josef Albers was a German-American artist and educator known for his work in color theory and geometric abstraction. He was a leading figure in the Bauhaus movement and later taught at Black Mountain College and Yale University. Albers is best known for his series \"Homage to the Square,\" which explored the interaction of color through nested squares.","observation":"The style is reduced to nested, centered rectangular forms with strong bilateral symmetry and large, clean-edged areas of saturated red, orange, and occasional blue. The compositions feel flat and graphic, while subtle tonal shifts and framed gallery presentation add depth without disrupting the minimalist geometric structure."},{"id":"lalla-essaydi","name":"Lalla Essaydi","cat":"photographers","en":"Lalla Essaydi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lalla-essaydi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lalla-essaydi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","classical"],"colours":["black","deep-red","dark-brown","charcoal","dark-red","beige"],"intro":"Lalla Essaydi is a Moroccan-born artist known for her exploration of gender roles and cultural identity through photography. Her work often features women in elaborate settings, blending traditional Islamic art with contemporary themes to challenge stereotypes and provoke thought.","observation":"The style presents richly staged female portraits in opulent interiors, combining realistic facial detail with dense brocade, embroidery, carved wood, carpets, and ornamental borders. Deep reds and blues, warm shadows, close framing, and selective dramatic lighting create an atmospheric, cinematic sense of luxurious historical costume and décor."},{"id":"chris-riddell","name":"Chris Riddell","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris Riddell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-riddell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-riddell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","grey","brown","muted-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Chris Riddell is a renowned British illustrator and author, celebrated for his distinctive style in children's books and political cartoons. He has won numerous awards, including the prestigious Kate Greenaway Medal. Riddell's work is characterized by its intricate line work, whimsical characters, and imaginative storytelling, often featuring fantastical and surreal elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed ink drawing with delicate contour lines, dense hatching, and expressive, exaggerated faces and figures. Mostly pale or monochrome passages are punctuated by restrained red, blue, and ochre accents, while portraits, fantastical characters, and animal companions dominate the tightly cropped compositions."},{"id":"mark-briscoe","name":"Mark Briscoe","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Briscoe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-briscoe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-briscoe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["light-orange","black","dark-brown","charcoal","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Mark Briscoe is a professional wrestler known for his dynamic presence in the ring and his contributions to the world of wrestling.","observation":"The style combines heavily visible, directional paint strokes with crisp dark contour lines and densely worked surfaces. Saturated reds, blues, ochres, and deep greens create expressive, storybook scenes populated by animals, figures, and stylized landscapes, while repeated swirling marks give clouds, sky, foliage, and fur a tactile rhythm."},{"id":"ben-nicholson","name":"Ben Nicholson","cat":"painters","en":"Ben Nicholson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ben-nicholson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ben-nicholson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","ornate","patterns","flat-color","subdued-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["muted-yellow","bone-white","brown","ochre","black","dark-brown"],"intro":"Ben Nicholson is a renowned British painter known for his abstract and geometric compositions. He was a leading figure in the modernist movement, contributing significantly to the development of abstract art in the 20th century. His work often features a harmonious blend of geometric forms and muted color palettes, reflecting his interest in spatial relationships and architectural elements.","observation":"The style uses a dense abstract arrangement of geometric blocks, circles, arcs, and bands in a restrained earthy palette. Flat, clean-edged forms are layered like cut paper, while distressed surface texture and subtle tonal variation give the composition a tactile, aged-material quality."},{"id":"ghada-amer","name":"Ghada Amer","cat":"painters","en":"Ghada Amer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ghada-amer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ghada-amer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","patterns","motion","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","drawing","ink"],"colours":["red","bone-white","ochre","vivid-red","grey"],"intro":"Ghada Amer is an Egyptian-born artist known for her work that explores themes of gender, sexuality, and cultural identity. Her art often combines painting and embroidery, challenging traditional notions of femininity and art-making.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style relies on dense, hand-drawn-looking vertical lines, drips, loops, and tangled marks layered into energetic abstract fields. Saturated reds, blues, oranges, greens, and pinks stand against pale grounds, with occasional gallery-like spatial settings and reflective floors reinforcing the large-scale installation feel."},{"id":"patrick-kelly","name":"Patrick Kelly","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Patrick Kelly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patrick-kelly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patrick-kelly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["white","dark-red","yellow","black","red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Patrick Kelly was an influential American fashion designer known for his bold, colorful designs and playful aesthetic. Born in 1954, Kelly gained prominence in the 1980s and became the first American to be admitted to the Chambre Syndicale du Prêt-à-Porter in Paris. His work often incorporated elements of pop culture, humor, and references to African-American heritage, making him a celebrated figure in the fashion world.","observation":"The style presents highly theatrical character portraits as elaborate, sculptural fashion constructions, combining oversized headpieces, ruffles, flowers, balloons, painted faces, and glossy molded surfaces. Saturated primary colors, strong material contrasts, and exaggerated silhouettes create an expressive surreal spectacle against a clean studio background."},{"id":"wolfgang-suschitzky","name":"Wolfgang Suschitzky","cat":"photographers","en":"Wolfgang Suschitzky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wolfgang-suschitzky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wolfgang-suschitzky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey","white"],"intro":"Wolfgang Suschitzky was an Austrian-born photographer and cinematographer known for his work capturing the essence of urban life in mid-20th century London. His photography often focused on the everyday moments and the human condition, using black-and-white film to emphasize contrast and mood.","observation":"A monochrome, high-contrast photographic style built around silhouetted figures in rain-darkened urban streets. Backlighting, reflective pavement, deep shadows, and atmospheric haze create a moody cinematic sense of suspense across the scenes."},{"id":"benoit-b-mandelbrot","name":"Benoit B. Mandelbrot","cat":"painters","en":"Benoit B. Mandelbrot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/benoit-b-mandelbrot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/benoit-b-mandelbrot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","ornate","sculptural","landscapes","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Benoit B. Mandelbrot was a Polish-born French-American mathematician known for his work on fractals and chaos theory. He introduced the concept of fractal geometry, which describes complex structures that look similar at any scale. Mandelbrot's work has had a significant impact on various fields, including mathematics, physics, finance, and art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely textured, painterly surfaces with monumental architectural and geological forms that dissolve into abstract, swirling structures. Subdued blue, copper, cream, and brown tones, elaborate ornament, carved-looking relief, and strong directional flow create an epic, dreamlike sense of ancient ruins transformed into fractal landscapes."},{"id":"william-clarke-wontner","name":"William Clarke Wontner","cat":"painters","en":"William Clarke Wontner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-clarke-wontner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-clarke-wontner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","bone-white","muted-rust","dark-brown","dark-red","rust"],"intro":"William Clarke Wontner was an English painter known for his portraits and orientalist themes, active during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work often depicted romanticized and exotic scenes, characterized by detailed and intricate compositions. Wontner's paintings are celebrated for their fine brushwork and rich color palettes, reflecting the academic realism and orientalist movements of his time.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses softly modelled faces and visible, delicate brushwork, with richly textured fabrics, veils, pearls, and jeweled adornments. Muted jewel tones against dark backgrounds create an elegant, intimate presentation, while the close cropping keeps attention on the women’s expressions and ornamental costume."},{"id":"justina-blakeney","name":"Justina Blakeney","cat":"designers","en":"Justina Blakeney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/justina-blakeney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/justina-blakeney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","patterns","scenes","glow","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","light-orange","grey","dark-red","rust","olive"],"intro":"Justina Blakeney is an American designer, artist, and author known for her vibrant and eclectic style, often incorporating bold colors and patterns with a bohemian flair. She has gained recognition for her work in interior design and her unique approach to blending cultural influences with contemporary aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four interiors, the style is richly layered and highly decorative, combining dense tropical foliage with patterned fabrics, ornate furnishings, vivid jewel tones, and warm natural light. Clean illustrative shapes and selectively flat areas give the scenes a polished, graphic quality while preserving abundant small decorative details."},{"id":"jeff-soto","name":"Jeff Soto","cat":"street-artists","en":"Jeff Soto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeff-soto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeff-soto","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","grey","muted-brown","red","muted-blue","light-lime"],"intro":"Jeff Soto is an American artist known for his vibrant and surreal artwork that blends elements of pop culture, nature, and fantasy. His work often features a mix of traditional painting techniques and modern digital methods, creating a unique visual style that has been exhibited worldwide.","observation":"The style combines visible, directional brushwork with densely layered organic detail, creating richly textured fantasy creatures and overgrown environments. Saturated blues, pinks, corals, and turquoise glow against deep shadow, while exaggerated eyes, horns, fur, and plant forms give the imagery a surreal and expressive character."},{"id":"jan-svankmajer","name":"Jan Svankmajer","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Jan Svankmajer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-svankmajer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-svankmajer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","ochre","orange"],"intro":"Jan Svankmajer is a Czech filmmaker and artist known for his distinctive surrealist style, combining animation and live action. His works often explore themes of fantasy, absurdity, and the macabre, drawing inspiration from folklore and mythology. Svankmajer's films are characterized by their unique use of stop-motion animation and claymation, creating a dream-like and often unsettling atmosphere that challenges conventional storytelling.","observation":"The style presents densely populated, grotesque tableaux with realistic sculptural figures, animals, puppets, and anatomical curiosities arranged like theatrical or museum displays. Warm, subdued sepia-brown color, strong directional lighting, deep shadows, and tactile aged materials give the scenes a cinematic, macabre, surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"gustave-eiffel","name":"Gustave Eiffel","cat":"architects","en":"Gustave Eiffel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-eiffel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-eiffel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","dark-cyan","silver"],"intro":"Gustave Eiffel was a French civil engineer and architect, best known for designing the Eiffel Tower in Paris. Born in 1832, Eiffel's work in structural engineering and architecture has left a lasting legacy, particularly in the field of iron construction. His innovative designs and contributions to the construction of bridges, viaducts, and buildings have made him a pivotal figure in modern architecture.","observation":"The style is highly detailed and realistic, using cinematic compositions, monumental architecture, and carefully controlled atmospheric depth. It combines subdued, moody color grading with stark contrast, reflective surfaces, mist, and selective lights to create an ominous yet spectacular urban-fantasy mood across both daylight and night scenes."},{"id":"piet-oudolf","name":"Piet Oudolf","cat":"various-artists","en":"Piet Oudolf","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/piet-oudolf.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/piet-oudolf","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","landscapes","glow","mist","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","silver","dark-brown","grey","violet"],"intro":"Piet Oudolf is a renowned Dutch garden designer and plant expert, celebrated for his innovative approach to landscape design. Known for his naturalistic style, Oudolf emphasizes the use of perennial plants and grasses, creating gardens that change with the seasons. His work is characterized by an emphasis on texture, structure, and the subtle beauty of plant life, often incorporating native species to enhance biodiversity.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and richly detailed, presenting expansive wildflower meadows with layered grasses, flowering plants, trees, and softly receding woodland. Warm low sunlight, gentle atmospheric haze, and saturated seasonal colors give the landscapes a cinematic, luminous character."},{"id":"justin-roiland","name":"Justin Roiland","cat":"illustrators","en":"Justin Roiland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/justin-roiland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/justin-roiland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","olive","red","muted-teal","dark-magenta","light-magenta","light-green"],"intro":"Justin Roiland is a well-known animator, voice actor, and writer, best recognized for co-creating the animated television series \"Rick and Morty.\" His work is characterized by a unique blend of humor, science fiction, and surrealism, often featuring bizarre and imaginative worlds.","observation":"The style uses brightly saturated comic-book color, heavy black contouring, and flat-to-lightly shaded illustrative forms. Grotesque, exaggerated creatures and characters fill kinetic fantasy scenes, combining neon glow, cosmic environments, slime-like textures, and surreal anatomical distortions."},{"id":"ricardo-bofill","name":"Ricardo Bofill","cat":"architects","en":"Ricardo Bofill","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ricardo-bofill.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ricardo-bofill","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["deep-red","black","dark-brown","light-red","red","blue"],"intro":"Ricardo Bofill is a renowned Spanish architect known for his innovative and visionary architectural designs. Born in 1939, Bofill founded the architecture firm Ricardo Bofill Taller de Arquitectura, which has produced iconic works worldwide. His style often incorporates elements of surrealism and modernism, blending geometric forms with organic elements to create unique and imaginative spaces.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and architectural, presenting monumental pink stucco buildings through geometric, tightly framed views. Strong Mediterranean sunlight, saturated coral surfaces, deep shadows, reflective water, and carefully placed palms, cypresses, and desert plants create a vivid resort-like atmosphere."},{"id":"charline-von-heyl","name":"Charline von Heyl","cat":"painters","en":"Charline von Heyl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charline-von-heyl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charline-von-heyl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","floral","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-orange","bone-white","black","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Charline von Heyl is a contemporary German artist known for her innovative and dynamic approach to painting. Her work often explores the boundaries of abstraction and figuration, creating complex compositions that challenge traditional artistic conventions. Von Heyl's paintings are celebrated for their vibrant color palettes, bold forms, and layered textures, reflecting a deep engagement with the possibilities of visual language.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated orange, yellow, pink, black, and white forms combine gestural paint handling with graphic checkerboards, dots, grids, and irregular linework. Dense floral and organic motifs overlap geometric patches in an energetic, collage-like arrangement, with visible brush marks, drips, scraping, and layered surface texture."},{"id":"sarah-joncas","name":"Sarah Joncas","cat":"painters","en":"Sarah Joncas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sarah-joncas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sarah-joncas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","beige","charcoal","grey","vivid-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Sarah Joncas is a contemporary Canadian artist known for her captivating and emotive portraits that often blend elements of realism and fantasy. Her work frequently explores themes of identity, femininity, and introspection, characterized by a unique style that combines detailed rendering with imaginative elements.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, painterly portraiture with delicate visible strokes defining hair, skin, eyes, and lips. Cropped faces dominate the frame, combining expressive gazes with vivid accent colors, softly modeled features, and flowing strands that create movement around the subjects."},{"id":"ferdinand-du-puigaudeau","name":"Ferdinand du Puigaudeau","cat":"painters","en":"Ferdinand du Puigaudeau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ferdinand-du-puigaudeau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ferdinand-du-puigaudeau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","silhouette"],"colours":["black","brown","rust","dark-blue","light-orange","beige"],"intro":"Ferdinand du Puigaudeau was a French painter known for his luminous landscapes and evocative use of light. Born in 1864, he was associated with the Impressionist and Post-Impressionist movements, capturing the serene beauty of the French countryside and coastal scenes. His works often depict tranquil settings with a focus on atmospheric effects and subtle color transitions.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is richly painterly, built from visible fine strokes and layered texture, with dense woodland detail and atmospheric depth. Twilight scenes combine warm orange light with deep blue-violet shadows, mist, luminous points, and recurring dark human silhouettes to create a quiet, mysterious mood."},{"id":"zandra-rhodes","name":"Zandra Rhodes","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Zandra Rhodes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zandra-rhodes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zandra-rhodes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","patterns","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["charcoal","deep-red","dark-brown","beige","pink","red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Zandra Rhodes is a renowned British fashion designer known for her bold and colorful textile designs. Emerging in the late 1960s, she became a key figure in the fashion world with her distinctive style that combines vibrant colors and intricate patterns. Rhodes's work is celebrated for its innovative use of fabrics and embellishments, making her a pioneer in the fashion industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly saturated color with dense ornamental costume design, intricate textile patterning, fringe, beads, and layered accessories. Clean graphic outlines and mostly flat, boldly colored forms give the fashion scenes an illustrative, retro editorial character, while the museum-like interiors and elaborate displays add visual richness."},{"id":"sergio-leone","name":"Sergio Leone","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Sergio Leone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sergio-leone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sergio-leone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["red","black","rust","orange","dark-brown","cream"],"intro":"Sergio Leone was an Italian film director, producer, and screenwriter, renowned for his work in the Spaghetti Western genre. He is best known for his films like \"The Good, the Bad and the Ugly\" and \"Once Upon a Time in the West,\" which are celebrated for their epic storytelling, innovative cinematography, and memorable musical scores.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and western settings are painted with visible, broad, energetic strokes and rough, distressed surface texture. Saturated rust-orange fields, deep shadows, and occasional blue clothing create a forceful graphic contrast, while generous empty backgrounds and cinematic character framing emphasize the lone-gunslinger mood."},{"id":"steven-klein","name":"Steven Klein","cat":"photographers","en":"Steven Klein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steven-klein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steven-klein","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-cyan","muted-blue","deep-red","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Steven Klein is an American photographer known for his provocative and often controversial fashion and celebrity portraits. His work is characterized by a dark, surreal aesthetic that challenges conventional beauty standards and explores themes of power and identity. Klein's collaborations with high-profile fashion magazines and brands have cemented his status as a leading figure in contemporary photography.","observation":"The style is a highly realistic, cinematic fashion-editorial treatment built around tightly cropped portraits and staged character vignettes. Cold blue-gray surroundings, deep shadows, saturated red accents, glossy latex, sculptural garments, metallic details, and distressed makeup create a dark, confrontational mood with strong textural detail."},{"id":"konstantin-chaykin","name":"Konstantin Chaykin","cat":"designers","en":"Konstantin Chaykin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/konstantin-chaykin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/konstantin-chaykin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","still-life","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","metallic","moody-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","pale-orange"],"intro":"Konstantin Chaykin is a renowned Russian watchmaker and inventor, celebrated for his innovative and intricate timepieces. Known for his unique designs and technical prowess, Chaykin has made significant contributions to the world of horology, often blending traditional craftsmanship with avant-garde aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents ornate mechanical watches as highly realistic luxury-product close-ups, with intricate engraved faces, exposed gears, figurative motifs, and reflective metal surfaces. Warm, moody lighting and shallow focus isolate the watches against softly blurred surroundings, while fine dial markings and polished materials create a richly detailed, classical impression."},{"id":"tim-white","name":"Tim White","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tim White","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-white.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-white","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["blue","dark-blue","charcoal","light-red","muted-blue","brown"],"intro":"Tim White is a renowned British illustrator known for his science fiction and fantasy artwork. His work has graced the covers of numerous books, capturing the imaginations of readers with his vivid and detailed depictions of otherworldly scenes. White's illustrations often feature intricate landscapes and cosmic elements, blending realism with fantastical themes.","observation":"The style presents expansive, cinematic alien landscapes with immense rock formations, monumental ruins, distant moons, and tiny travelers or creatures establishing scale. Realistic texturing and atmospheric depth are paired with vivid blue-and-orange color contrasts, glowing celestial elements, and a dreamy yet imposing science-fiction fantasy mood."},{"id":"fatima-ronquillo","name":"Fatima Ronquillo","cat":"painters","en":"Fatima Ronquillo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fatima-ronquillo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fatima-ronquillo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","beige","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Fatima Ronquillo is a contemporary artist known for her unique blend of classical and surreal elements in her paintings. Her work often features romantic and whimsical themes, drawing inspiration from European art history and mythology. Ronquillo's paintings are characterized by their delicate brushwork, fine detailing, and rich, layered textures, creating a dreamlike atmosphere.","observation":"The style presents idealized child portraits with softly modeled faces, restrained earthy color, and visible delicate brushwork. Elaborate lace collars, floral adornments, patterned garments, dense foliage, and pale companion animals create an ornate, theatrical, old-fashioned fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"michal-karcz","name":"Michal Karcz","cat":"illustrators","en":"Michal Karcz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michal-karcz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michal-karcz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Michal Karcz is a contemporary artist known for his surreal and fantastical digital landscapes. His work often blends photography with digital manipulation to create otherworldly scenes that evoke a sense of mystery and exploration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic, realistic-looking landscapes with deep shadows, strong warm-versus-cool color contrast, and monumental rock formations. Atmospheric mist, glowing suns or light shafts, tiny solitary figures, and expansive compositions create an ominous, epic, surreal sense of scale."},{"id":"emile-vernon","name":"Emile Vernon","cat":"painters","en":"Emile Vernon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emile-vernon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emile-vernon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","light-orange","dark-brown","muted-ochre","ochre","white"],"intro":"Emile Vernon is known for his exquisite portraits and floral compositions, often capturing the delicate beauty of women in idyllic settings. His work is characterized by a romantic and classical style, with a focus on detailed and painterly techniques that highlight the elegance and grace of his subjects.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, visible brushwork to create refined portraits of elegantly dressed women surrounded by flowers, birds, and domestic animals. Soft skin, flowing fabrics, floral ornament, and warm dark garden backgrounds produce a tender, dreamy mood with classical decorative richness."},{"id":"pierre-pellegrini","name":"Pierre Pellegrini","cat":"photographers","en":"Pierre Pellegrini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-pellegrini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-pellegrini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","white","black","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Pierre Pellegrini is a contemporary photographer known for his minimalist and serene landscape photography, often capturing the quiet beauty of nature in black and white.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome photography with deep black tree trunks against luminous fog, producing strong tonal contrast and a bleak, contemplative mood. Repeated rows of trees, mirrored water, and receding paths create disciplined geometric perspectives, while mist dissolves distant landscapes and small human or architectural silhouettes."},{"id":"jeremy-geddes","name":"Jeremy Geddes","cat":"painters","en":"Jeremy Geddes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeremy-geddes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeremy-geddes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","mist","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","beige","brown","muted-orange"],"intro":"Jeremy Geddes is an Australian painter known for his hyperrealistic and surreal paintings, often depicting figures in dreamlike or suspended states. His work frequently explores themes of isolation and the intersection of the human form with urban and cosmic environments.","observation":"Across all four renders, human figures are caught in explosive leaps, falls, and disintegration, with broad visible strokes and heavily textured, painterly surfaces. Earthy dark tones, sharp light-dark separation, swirling dust, and suspended debris create a dramatic, surreal sense of motion and weightlessness."},{"id":"hassan-hajjaj","name":"Hassan Hajjaj","cat":"various-artists","en":"Hassan Hajjaj","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hassan-hajjaj.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hassan-hajjaj","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","scenes","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","dark-green","dark-brown","charcoal","red","ochre"],"intro":"Hassan Hajjaj is a Moroccan-British artist known for his vibrant and eclectic works that blend traditional and contemporary elements. Often referred to as the ' Andy Warhol of Marrakech,' Hajjaj's art explores themes of identity, culture, and globalization through photography, fashion, and installation art.","observation":"Across all four renders, vividly colored figures and garments are staged within richly decorated interiors dominated by repeating tilework, florals, checks, stripes, and geometric patterns. The compositions are highly symmetrical and fashion-editorial, with clean illustrative forms, strong color blocking, and a retro-magazine sensibility."},{"id":"pieter-claesz","name":"Pieter Claesz","cat":"painters","en":"Pieter Claesz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pieter-claesz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pieter-claesz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","still-life","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","bone-white","deep-rust"],"intro":"Pieter Claesz was a prominent Dutch still life painter of the 17th century, known for his detailed and realistic depictions of everyday objects. His work is characterized by the use of chiaroscuro and a focus on vanitas themes, reflecting the transient nature of life. Claesz's paintings often feature intricate arrangements of food, glassware, and other domestic items, rendered with a meticulous attention to light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly arranged tabletop still lifes are rendered with visible painterly texture, dense object detail, and carefully modelled glass, ceramic, metal, food, and fabric. A restrained brown-black palette, deep shadows, and selective warm highlights create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere with lavishly layered surfaces and props."},{"id":"nicolas-mignard","name":"Nicolas Mignard","cat":"painters","en":"Nicolas Mignard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicolas-mignard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicolas-mignard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","portraits","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Nicolas Mignard was a 17th-century French painter known for his baroque style and detailed compositions. He was part of a family of artists and contributed significantly to the French art scene with his mythological and religious works, often characterized by their elegant and expressive figures.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly painterly surfaces, finely observed faces, fabric, flowers, and furnishings against near-black grounds. Dramatic chiaroscuro, warm selective highlights, elaborate historical dress, and dense ornamental detail create a solemn, theatrical portrait-and-still-life atmosphere."},{"id":"annick-bouvattier","name":"Annick Bouvattier","cat":"painters","en":"Annick Bouvattier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/annick-bouvattier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/annick-bouvattier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["ochre","dark-brown","light-orange","black","red"],"intro":"Annick Bouvattier is a contemporary French painter known for her evocative portraits and use of light. Her work often focuses on the intimate and emotional aspects of her subjects, capturing a sense of serenity and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses intimate female portraiture with warm, subdued ochre and rose tones, carefully modeled skin, and richly textured clothing and accessories. Fine painterly strokes describe hair, fabric, petals, and facial features, combining classical portrait sensibility with expressive, tightly cropped compositions."},{"id":"paul-lovering","name":"Paul Lovering","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Lovering","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-lovering.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-lovering","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","ink"],"colours":["muted-orange","bone-white","grey","black","dark-brown","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Paul Lovering is a contemporary artist known for his emotive and expressive watercolor portraits. His work often explores themes of human emotion and identity, capturing the psychological depth of his subjects through a distinctive style that combines fine brushstrokes with fluid, dripping effects.","observation":"Across all four portraits, translucent watercolor washes, pigment blooms, and visible paper texture create a tactile, hand-painted surface. Fine ink contours and loose hatch-like marks define the eyes, hair, and facial structure, while muted earth tones with blue-green shadows give the close-cropped faces an expressive, intimate intensity."},{"id":"jeanne-mammen","name":"Jeanne Mammen","cat":"painters","en":"Jeanne Mammen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeanne-mammen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeanne-mammen","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","muted-orange","grey","bone-white","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jeanne Mammen was a German painter and illustrator known for her depictions of the vibrant and often tumultuous life of Berlin during the Weimar Republic. Her work is characterized by its keen observation of social dynamics and the roles of women in urban settings. Mammen's art often reflects the cultural and political atmosphere of her time, capturing the essence of interwar Germany with a unique blend of realism and stylization.","observation":"The style combines richly visible painted brushwork with crisp illustrative contours, densely rendering fashionable figures, clothing, fur, hats, and accessories. Saturated reds, oranges, blues, and greens contrast with dark garments, while elegant poses, stylized faces, and crowded social settings create a glamorous vintage fashion mood."},{"id":"roz-chast","name":"Roz Chast","cat":"illustrators","en":"Roz Chast","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roz-chast.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roz-chast","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","geometric"],"colours":["grey","muted-ochre","bone-white","charcoal","olive","orange","blue"],"intro":"Roz Chast is an American cartoonist and illustrator known for her distinctive style and humorous take on everyday life. Her work often appears in publications like The New Yorker, where she has contributed numerous cartoons and covers. Chast's illustrations are characterized by their detailed line work, quirky characters, and insightful commentary on modern society.","observation":"The style combines dense, hand-drawn linework with softly textured, layered color and visible hatch marks, giving every face, object, and architectural detail a tactile illustrated surface. Repeatedly crowded compositions, exaggerated expressions, framed viewpoints, and unexpected eye and animal motifs create an expressive, subtly surreal narrative world."},{"id":"norman-bel-geddes","name":"Norman Bel Geddes","cat":"designers","en":"Norman Bel Geddes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norman-bel-geddes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norman-bel-geddes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","scenes","urban","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","beige","silver"],"intro":"Norman Bel Geddes was an influential American theatrical and industrial designer known for his futuristic and innovative concepts, particularly in the realm of urban planning and transportation. He played a significant role in shaping the visual language of the 20th century through his visionary designs, which often featured streamlined, aerodynamic forms and a strong emphasis on functionality and modernity.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental futuristic architecture and layered transportways dominate, built from sweeping curves, strong verticals, and deeply sculptural forms. The monochrome, high-contrast treatment, visible grain, and cinematic framing give the dense urban scenes a dramatic retro-futurist atmosphere."},{"id":"carel-willink","name":"Carel Willink","cat":"painters","en":"Carel Willink","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carel-willink.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carel-willink","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","beige","dark-blue"],"intro":"Carel Willink was a Dutch painter known for his magic realism, characterized by detailed and precise depictions of imaginary landscapes and architectural scenes. His works often convey a sense of mystery and timelessness, blending classical elements with surreal atmospheres.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, meticulously detailed interiors and formal portraits with cinematic framing, deep shadows, and restrained earthy color. Repeated arches, reflective surfaces, antique furnishings, patterned fabrics, and botanical architecture create an ornate, symmetrical atmosphere, while impossible reflections and suspended objects introduce a subtle surreal quality."},{"id":"christi-belcourt","name":"Christi Belcourt","cat":"painters","en":"Christi Belcourt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christi-belcourt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christi-belcourt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","black","grey","dark-brown","red","vivid-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Christi Belcourt is a Métis visual artist known for her intricate paintings that celebrate the natural world and Indigenous culture. Her work often incorporates floral patterns and vibrant colors, drawing inspiration from traditional beadwork and embroidery.","observation":"The style combines densely packed botanical and animal imagery with highly saturated coral, turquoise, cream, and deep blue hues. Clean illustrative shapes, fine contour lines, patterned surfaces, and ornamental detailing create a decorative, collage-like fantasy tableau across all four renders."},{"id":"michael-graves","name":"Michael Graves","cat":"architects","en":"Michael Graves","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-graves.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-graves","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","urban","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["blue","dark-blue","brown","silver","deep-red","red"],"intro":"Michael Graves was an influential American architect and designer, known for his contributions to postmodern architecture. He was a key figure in the New York Five, a group of architects who championed modernist principles. Graves's work is characterized by its playful use of color, historical references, and a blend of classical and modern elements.","observation":"The style uses crisp, geometric architecture rendered with clean illustrative edges, flat saturated color, and strong sunlight-shadow contrast. Across the scenes, ordinary buildings are transformed into surreal architectural constructions with impossible stairways, cutaway interiors, dramatic clouds, and vividly colored urban or coastal settings."},{"id":"stan-brakhage","name":"Stan Brakhage","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Stan Brakhage","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stan-brakhage.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stan-brakhage","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","floral","grain","painterly","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","orange","dark-brown","muted-blue","dark-blue","pink"],"intro":"Stan Brakhage was an influential American filmmaker known for his experimental and avant-garde works. His films often explored themes of perception and consciousness, using innovative techniques such as hand-painted frames and collage to create unique visual experiences. Brakhage's work has had a lasting impact on the world of experimental cinema, inspiring countless filmmakers with his bold and unconventional approach.","observation":"Across the sheet, oversized flowers are rendered in saturated reds, oranges, blues, and pinks with dramatic dark areas and luminous highlights. Painterly blur, expressive color bleeding, grain, and damaged-film overlays merge the botanical imagery into a surreal collage of macro photography and exposed negatives."},{"id":"louis-ritman","name":"Louis Ritman","cat":"painters","en":"Louis Ritman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-ritman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-ritman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","beige","pale-orange","red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Louis Ritman is an American Impressionist painter known for his vibrant depictions of women and gardens. Born in 1889, Ritman studied in Paris and was influenced by French Impressionism. His works often feature soft, luminous colors and delicate brushwork, capturing serene and intimate moments.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly dressed women occupy domestic interiors and garden settings, surrounded by flowers, patterned fabrics, ceramics, and furnishings. The style is defined by saturated red, blue, green, and cream hues, dense decorative surfaces, and clearly visible broad, directional brushwork that gives the scenes a lively, tactile painted presence."},{"id":"toyo-ito","name":"Toyo Ito","cat":"architects","en":"Toyo Ito","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/toyo-ito.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/toyo-ito","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","glow","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","pale-blue","dark-blue","dark-olive","beige","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Toyo Ito is a renowned Japanese architect known for his innovative and conceptual designs that blend organic forms with modern technology. His work often explores the relationship between the physical and virtual worlds, creating spaces that are both functional and aesthetically striking. Ito has been awarded numerous prestigious accolades, including the Pritzker Architecture Prize, recognizing his significant contributions to contemporary architecture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly realistic architectural scenes featuring sculptural, experimental buildings with either biomorphic curves or sharply faceted glass geometry. Cool subdued daylight and blue-hour tones contrast with warm interior glow, while dense urban surroundings and vegetation ground the surreal forms in believable street-level settings."},{"id":"charles-angrand","name":"Charles Angrand","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Angrand","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-angrand.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-angrand","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["dark-green","brown","muted-yellow","rust","black","orange"],"intro":"Charles Angrand is a French painter known for his contributions to the Neo-Impressionist movement, particularly in the technique of pointillism. Born in 1854, Angrand was a contemporary of Georges Seurat and Paul Signac , and he played a significant role in the development of post-impressionist art in France. His works often depict serene landscapes and everyday scenes, characterized by meticulous attention to color and light.","observation":"Across all four images, richly textured paint builds forests, foliage, garments, and figures from visible directional strokes and clustered marks. The scenes combine strong dark verticals with glowing woodland light, saturated autumn reds and ochres, and simplified, enigmatic figures that give the landscapes a dreamlike, slightly surreal character."},{"id":"iris-scott","name":"Iris Scott","cat":"painters","en":"Iris Scott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/iris-scott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/iris-scott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","landscapes","glow","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-blue","charcoal","brown","muted-blue","red","orange"],"intro":"Iris Scott is an American contemporary painter known for her unique finger painting technique, which she uses to create vibrant and textured works. Her art often features vivid colors and dynamic compositions, drawing inspiration from nature and everyday life. Scott's work has gained recognition for its expressive style and innovative approach to traditional painting methods.","observation":"Across all four images, visible directional brushwork and layered paint create a richly painterly, expressive surface. Saturated blue, teal, coral, and gold hues animate woodland, water, flowers, and animals, with luminous highlights and energetic strokes suggesting movement and enchantment."},{"id":"alan-fletcher","name":"Alan Fletcher","cat":"designers","en":"Alan Fletcher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-fletcher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-fletcher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["cream","vivid-red","dark-blue","black","light-orange","green"],"intro":"Alan Fletcher is a renowned British graphic designer known for his influential work in the field of visual communication. He co-founded the design firm Pentagram and contributed significantly to modern graphic design. Fletcher's approach combined wit, simplicity, and a deep understanding of visual language, making him a pivotal figure in 20th-century design.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated primary and secondary colors form bold geometric shapes, circles, stripes, arcs, and splattered marks on an off-white ground. Broad visible brushwork, drips, rough edges, and energetic drawn lines combine flat color blocks with gestural painterly texture."},{"id":"jules-pascin","name":"Jules Pascin","cat":"painters","en":"Jules Pascin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jules-pascin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jules-pascin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","white"],"intro":"Jules Pascin was a Bulgarian-born artist known for his work in early 20th-century Paris. He was associated with the Montparnasse art scene and is recognized for his expressive and intimate portrayals of social gatherings and bohemian life. Pascin's work often captures the essence of Parisian nightlife and the artistic circles of his time, characterized by a blend of post-impressionism and expressionism.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines visibly worked paint with fine drawn contours, loose brushwork, and expressive, slightly rough facial rendering. It favors tightly cropped portraits and figure groups in restrained earthy colors, with period clothing, varied poses, and richly textured framed-picture surfaces."},{"id":"bunny-yeager","name":"Bunny Yeager","cat":"photographers","en":"Bunny Yeager","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bunny-yeager.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bunny-yeager","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","muted-blue","dark-blue","brown","rust"],"intro":"Bunny Yeager is a renowned American photographer and model, famous for her work in the 1950s and 1960s. She gained recognition for her pin-up photography, capturing iconic images of women, including the famous Bettie Page. Yeager's work is celebrated for its playful and glamorous portrayal of femininity, often set against beachy backdrops and featuring vibrant, stylish clothing of the era.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic beach photography with retro pin-up fashion, carefully posed figures, and low-angle or slightly voyeuristic framing. Most renders use subdued monochrome or warm faded color, with visible film grain, soft focus, strong sunlight, and wind-driven movement in clothing and hair."},{"id":"oleg-oprisco","name":"Oleg Oprisco","cat":"photographers","en":"Oleg Oprisco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oleg-oprisco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oleg-oprisco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-brown","silver","muted-ochre","dark-rust","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Oleg Oprisco is a renowned Ukrainian photographer known for his surreal and dreamlike imagery. His work often features ethereal landscapes and meticulously crafted scenes that evoke a sense of fantasy and wonder. Oprisco's photography is characterized by its use of natural settings, vibrant colors, and a strong narrative element, making each image feel like a story captured in a single frame.","observation":"The style uses atmospheric, film-like portrait photography with softly diffused focus, warm autumnal grading, and restrained earthy colors. Dreamlike rural scenes combine carefully styled period clothing, windblown hair, drifting leaves or suspended objects, and shallow depth of field for a romantic, uncanny mood."},{"id":"robert-adams","name":"Robert Adams","cat":"photographers","en":"Robert Adams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-adams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-adams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["grey","white","charcoal","silver","beige"],"intro":"Robert Adams is an American photographer known for his stark and evocative black-and-white images of the American West. His work often explores themes of environmental change, suburban expansion, and the relationship between humans and nature. Adams's photography is characterized by its minimalist composition, sharp focus, and contemplative mood, capturing the quiet beauty and subtle drama of everyday landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with strong tonal separation, visible grain, and carefully observed rural roadside details. Wide compositions emphasize isolation, aging buildings and vehicles, receding roads, utility lines, and dramatic skies, giving the scenes a bleak, cinematic documentary character with a retro feel."},{"id":"john-trumbull","name":"John Trumbull","cat":"painters","en":"John Trumbull","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-trumbull.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-trumbull","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","black","muted-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"John Trumbull was an American artist known for his historical paintings, particularly those depicting the American Revolutionary War. Born in 1756, he became a prominent figure in early American art, capturing pivotal moments and figures from the nation's history. His works are characterized by their attention to detail, dramatic compositions, and historical accuracy, making him a key contributor to the visual documentation of American history.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and densely layered, with broad visible strokes modeling faces, uniforms, horses, smoke, and turbulent clouds. Dramatic lighting, dark atmospheric masses, saturated reds, and sweeping gestures create an epic, emotionally charged battlefield tableau across all four renders."},{"id":"mort-drucker","name":"Mort Drucker","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mort Drucker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mort-drucker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mort-drucker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","orange","light-orange","dark-brown","grey"],"intro":"Mort Drucker is renowned for his work as a caricaturist and illustrator, particularly known for his contributions to Mad Magazine. His style is characterized by its humorous and exaggerated portrayals of celebrities and public figures, often capturing the essence of his subjects with remarkable accuracy and wit.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed, expressive caricature portraits with exaggerated facial features, dense hair, and theatrical clothing. Fine ink-like contouring and hatching are combined with restrained hand-colored washes, giving the illustrations a vintage editorial feel while preserving strong graphic silhouettes and lively character expressions."},{"id":"gregory-colbert","name":"Gregory Colbert","cat":"photographers","en":"Gregory Colbert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gregory-colbert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gregory-colbert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Gregory Colbert is a Canadian filmmaker and photographer known for his work that explores the relationship between humans and animals. His most famous project, \"Ashes and Snow,\" is an ongoing exhibition of photographic artworks and films that depict the poetic interactions between people and wildlife.","observation":"These images use a realistic, highly detailed photographic treatment with subdued earth tones, soft haze, and cinematic framing. Monumental elephants dwarf isolated robed figures across sparse desert settings, creating a dark, surreal sense of scale and quiet ritual."},{"id":"alphonse-osbert","name":"Alphonse Osbert","cat":"painters","en":"Alphonse Osbert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alphonse-osbert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alphonse-osbert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","muted-brown","pale-orange","ochre"],"intro":"Alphonse Osbert is a French Symbolist painter known for his ethereal landscapes and mystical themes. Born in 1857, Osbert's work often features serene, dreamlike settings with a focus on nature and solitude. His paintings are characterized by their soft color palettes and contemplative mood, reflecting the Symbolist movement's emphasis on emotion and spirituality.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines softly textured, visibly painted surfaces with highly composed illustrative scenes of solitary figures, trees, and water. A subdued, dusk-heavy palette contrasts deep silhouettes with warm amber light, while fine detail, patterned fabric, reflective lakes, and atmospheric woodland settings create a melancholic, dreamlike mood."},{"id":"lynn-hershman-leeson","name":"Lynn Hershman Leeson","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Lynn Hershman Leeson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lynn-hershman-leeson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lynn-hershman-leeson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","metallic","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["rust","black","dark-brown","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Lynn Hershman Leeson is an American artist and filmmaker known for her pioneering work in new media and interactive art. Her career spans several decades, during which she has explored themes of identity, technology, and the human experience. Leeson has been a significant figure in the feminist art movement and is recognized for her innovative use of digital media and technology in art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, tightly framed portraits with saturated orange, red, green, and silver accents, elaborate makeup, wigs, and reflective costume materials. Strong directional lighting, selective focus, and expressive poses create a cinematic editorial atmosphere, while metallic embellishment and dense tactile textures make the images visually opulent."},{"id":"john-frederick-lewis","name":"John Frederick Lewis","cat":"painters","en":"John Frederick Lewis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-frederick-lewis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-frederick-lewis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","rust","dark-red","grey"],"intro":"John Frederick Lewis was a British painter known for his detailed and vibrant depictions of Orientalist themes. Born in 1804, he became famous for his richly detailed scenes of Middle Eastern life, often characterized by intricate architectural settings and lush, colorful textiles. His work is celebrated for its precision and the romanticized portrayal of exotic locales, capturing the Victorian fascination with the East.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, visibly worked paint with fine, varied brushstrokes to describe people, textiles, architecture, foliage, and ornamental objects. Its earthy reds, ochres, creams, greens, and blues support densely decorated interiors and sunlit architectural scenes, with expressive portrait-like figures arranged in elaborate settings."},{"id":"mario-botta","name":"Mario Botta","cat":"architects","en":"Mario Botta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mario-botta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mario-botta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Mario Botta is a renowned Swiss architect known for his innovative and geometric architectural designs. His work often features bold forms and a strong sense of structure, combining modernist and postmodernist elements. Botta's designs are characterized by their use of natural materials, such as brick and stone, and a deep understanding of light and space.","observation":"The style presents monumental, surreal architectural interiors as stark black-and-white photographic spaces, using repeated horizontal bands, sweeping curves, arches, and sharply structured geometry. Hard sunlight cuts through openings to create graphic shadow patterns, while deep recesses, vast vaults, and tiny figures establish a dark, imposing sense of scale."},{"id":"charles-addams","name":"Charles Addams","cat":"illustrators","en":"Charles Addams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-addams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-addams","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","white"],"intro":"Charles Addams was an American cartoonist known for his darkly humorous and macabre characters, most famously the Addams Family. His work often appeared in The New Yorker, where he became celebrated for his unique blend of humor and horror, capturing the absurdity of suburban life with a gothic twist.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense black-and-white pen illustration with fine contour lines, crosshatched shading, and strongly controlled light-dark contrast. It combines richly furnished interiors and bleak exterior settings with formal characters and surreal visual incidents, creating a theatrical, unsettling storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"hayv-kahraman","name":"Hayv Kahraman","cat":"painters","en":"Hayv Kahraman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hayv-kahraman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hayv-kahraman","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","metallic","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-orange","brown","black","ochre","beige","white","dark-red"],"intro":"Hayv Kahraman is an Iraqi artist known for her evocative paintings that explore themes of identity, gender, and cultural heritage. Her work often reflects her experiences as a member of the Iraqi diaspora, blending traditional Middle Eastern aesthetics with contemporary art practices. Kahraman's art is recognized for its intricate details and symbolic narratives, often featuring female figures that challenge and redefine cultural norms.","observation":"The style uses finely outlined, graphic figures with clean, mostly flat color fields and dense ornamental patterning in clothing and backgrounds. Restrained beige, black, green, and red tones are enriched by lustrous gold-like decoration, while elegant cropped portraits and fashion-focused poses create a refined, decorative tableau."},{"id":"christian-schad","name":"Christian Schad","cat":"painters","en":"Christian Schad","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-schad.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-schad","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","muted-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Christian Schad is a German painter associated with the New Objectivity movement, known for his realistic and detailed portraits that often reflect the social dynamics of the Weimar Republic era. His work is characterized by a precise and objective style, capturing the essence of his subjects with clarity and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents polished figurative portraits with carefully modelled faces, refined clothing, and dense period-specific surface detail. Visible fine brushwork, restrained earthy colour, decorative textiles, and tightly cropped arrangements give the images a vintage fashion-portrait character."},{"id":"alfred-sisley","name":"Alfred Sisley","cat":"painters","en":"Alfred Sisley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-sisley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-sisley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","muted-olive","silver","grey","beige"],"intro":"Alfred Sisley was a French Impressionist painter known for his landscape paintings that captured the serene beauty of the French countryside. Born in 1839, Sisley spent much of his life in France, where he developed a style characterized by delicate brushwork and a focus on natural light. His works often depict rivers, rural paths, and the changing seasons, reflecting a deep appreciation for nature.","observation":"These landscapes are rendered with clearly visible, varied brushwork that builds trees, clouds, water reflections, and architecture from luminous broken strokes. Bright blue skies, fresh greens, and warm highlights create an airy, sunlit atmosphere, while broad river views and small human activities give each image a tranquil sense of place."},{"id":"anthony-thieme","name":"Anthony Thieme","cat":"painters","en":"Anthony Thieme","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anthony-thieme.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anthony-thieme","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","light-orange","grey","silver","red"],"intro":"Anthony Thieme was an American painter known for his impressionistic landscapes and seascapes, particularly capturing the essence of New England's coastal scenes. Born in 1888 in the Netherlands, he moved to the United States where he became a prominent figure in American Impressionism , celebrated for his vibrant use of color and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses visible, broad oil-like strokes to build richly observed historic streets, waterfronts, architecture, and figures. Warm sunlight, strong shadow patterns, reflective water, and selectively softened details create a vivid yet restrained painterly atmosphere with a classical sense of place."},{"id":"emeric-pressburger","name":"Emeric Pressburger","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Emeric Pressburger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emeric-pressburger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emeric-pressburger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","silver"],"intro":"Emeric Pressburger was a Hungarian-British screenwriter, film director, and producer, renowned for his collaborations with Michael Powell. Together, they created some of the most innovative and visually striking films in British cinema, such as \"The Red Shoes\" and \"Black Narcissus.\" Pressburger's work is celebrated for its rich storytelling, vivid use of color, and imaginative narrative structures.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome photography with deep blacks, blown highlights, dramatic backlighting, and atmospheric haze. Figures in period clothing inhabit expansive maritime and urban scenes, creating a brooding, filmic sense of scale, movement, and narrative."},{"id":"sergei-eisenstein","name":"Sergei Eisenstein","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Sergei Eisenstein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sergei-eisenstein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sergei-eisenstein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","backlighting","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Sergei Eisenstein was a pioneering Soviet filmmaker and film theorist, renowned for his innovative use of montage and his influential works such as \"Battleship Potemkin\" and \"October.\" His contributions to the art of cinema have left a lasting impact on film editing and narrative techniques, making him a central figure in the history of film.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is stark black-and-white cinematic photography with deep shadows, bright backlight, visible grain, and strong tonal separation. It favors dramatic staged action, imposing architecture, expressive figures, and layered environments that feel monumental, theatrical, and dark."},{"id":"patricia-polacco","name":"Patricia Polacco","cat":"illustrators","en":"Patricia Polacco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patricia-polacco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patricia-polacco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["orange","bone-white","dark-brown","brown","vivid-red","grey"],"intro":"Patricia Polacco is an American author and illustrator known for her children's books that often draw on her rich family history and cultural heritage. Her stories frequently explore themes of family, tradition, and the power of storytelling, resonating with readers of all ages. Polacco's work is celebrated for its heartfelt narratives and distinctive artistic style, which combines elements of folk art with detailed, expressive illustrations.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines softly visible paint and pencil-like texture with delicate outlined drawing, modestly muted colors, and densely observed clothing, faces, interiors, and street details. It consistently feels like an illustrated storybook world, with expressive children and adults presented in nostalgic period dress and bustling everyday scenes."},{"id":"roger-vivier","name":"Roger Vivier","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Roger Vivier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-vivier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-vivier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","fashion","still-life","fine-lines","metallic","vivid-colors","fantasy","negative-space"],"colours":["white","muted-blue","muted-pink","muted-ochre","dark-red","brown","light-yellow"],"intro":"Roger Vivier is a renowned French fashion designer celebrated for his innovative shoe designs, particularly the stiletto heel. His work has been influential in the world of high fashion, blending elegance with avant-garde creativity.","observation":"The style combines highly ornate, sculptural footwear with dense gemstone, crystal, metallic, and floral embellishment. It alternates between polished product-like realism and fine-lined fashion illustration, using vivid accents, reflective surfaces, clean backgrounds, and generous negative space to make the extravagant shoes the focus."},{"id":"tsuguharu-foujita","name":"Tsuguharu Foujita","cat":"painters","en":"Tsuguharu Foujita","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tsuguharu-foujita.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tsuguharu-foujita","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","brown","black","orange","red"],"intro":"Tsuguharu Foujita was a Japanese-French painter and printmaker known for his unique blend of Eastern and Western art styles. He gained prominence in the early 20th century, particularly in Paris, where he became associated with the École de Paris. Foujita's work is characterized by its delicate line work, soft color palettes, and a harmonious fusion of Japanese and European artistic traditions.","observation":"The style combines delicate, highly visible ink linework and crosshatched modelling with restrained, earthy colour washes on a paper-like ground. It focuses on expressive close-up portraits and character groupings, often pairing pale faces and elaborate hair or clothing with cats and strong dark accents."},{"id":"kenojuak-ashevak","name":"Kenojuak Ashevak","cat":"painters","en":"Kenojuak Ashevak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kenojuak-ashevak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kenojuak-ashevak","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","dark-blue","grey","vivid-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Kenojuak Ashevak is a celebrated Inuit artist from Canada, renowned for her pioneering work in modern Indigenous art. Born in 1927, she became one of the first Inuit women to achieve international recognition for her art, which often features themes from Inuit mythology and nature. Ashevak's work is characterized by its vibrant colors, intricate patterns, and depictions of animals and spiritual figures, reflecting her cultural heritage and storytelling traditions.","observation":"Across all four renders, birds are reduced to highly stylized, graphic forms with sweeping contours, emphatic outlines, and repeated feather motifs. Saturated navy, red, yellow, and black sit against ample cream paper, while selective stippling and ink-like texture add material richness without losing the flat illustrative design."},{"id":"raymond-leech","name":"Raymond Leech","cat":"painters","en":"Raymond Leech","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raymond-leech.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raymond-leech","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Raymond Leech is a contemporary artist known for his evocative and romantic paintings, often capturing moments of intimacy and elegance. His work is characterized by a focus on human figures, rich color palettes, and a sense of narrative that draws viewers into the scene.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, visibly broad paint strokes to build fashionable figures and lively social encounters in warm, shadow-heavy interiors. Strong light-dark separation, earthy browns, cream highlights, and recurring red garments create an expressive retro atmosphere, while cinematic framing and cropped group compositions give the scenes a film-still quality."},{"id":"minjae-lee","name":"Minjae Lee","cat":"illustrators","en":"Minjae Lee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/minjae-lee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/minjae-lee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","negative-space"],"colours":["white","light-orange","muted-blue","black","grey","red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Minjae Lee is a contemporary South Korean artist known for his vibrant and expressive illustrations. His work often features intricate detailing and bold color palettes, creating a dynamic and captivating visual experience. Lee's art is recognized for its unique blend of traditional and digital techniques, resulting in a modern aesthetic that resonates with a wide audience.","observation":"Across all four portraits, realistic facial features are interwoven with energetic painted passages, thin gestural lines, splatters, and collage-like fragments. Saturated cyan, coral, red, black, and lavender accents stand sharply against broad white negative space, creating an expressive and slightly surreal mixed-media appearance."},{"id":"ryan-gander","name":"Ryan Gander","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Ryan Gander","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryan-gander.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryan-gander","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","subdued-colors","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","white","beige","brown"],"intro":"Ryan Gander is a contemporary British artist known for his diverse and conceptual approach to art. His work often challenges conventional perceptions and engages with themes of narrative, imagination, and the everyday. Gander's practice spans a wide range of media, including sculpture, installation, and performance, and he is recognized for his ability to weave complex ideas into his art.","observation":"The style presents large, highly tactile sculptural tableaux in sparse contemporary gallery interiors, rendered with realistic lighting and a restrained ivory, gray, and charcoal palette. Human figures, birds, fabric, concrete, and small narrative actions are arranged as quiet, dreamlike installations with ample negative space and carefully observed material detail."},{"id":"bruno-catalano","name":"Bruno Catalano","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Bruno Catalano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruno-catalano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruno-catalano","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","black","grey","muted-brown","pale-orange"],"intro":"Bruno Catalano is a French sculptor known for his unique and thought-provoking sculptures that often depict travelers with missing parts of their bodies, symbolizing the concept of journey and identity. His works are celebrated for their ability to evoke a sense of mystery and introspection, inviting viewers to contemplate the themes of migration and displacement.","observation":"The style presents expressive human figures and heads as heavily weathered, fragmented sculptures, with torn clothing, cracked surfaces, and rough layered textures. Strong natural sunlight, restrained blue-gray and rust colors, isolated compositions, and open backgrounds give the scenes a realistic yet dreamlike, monumental quality."},{"id":"jason-edmiston","name":"Jason Edmiston","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jason Edmiston","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jason-edmiston.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jason-edmiston","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-red","red","dark-cyan","muted-blue","orange"],"intro":"Jason Edmiston is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and detailed illustrations, often drawing inspiration from pop culture, horror, and fantasy genres. His work is characterized by a bold use of color and a meticulous attention to detail, making his pieces both striking and memorable.","observation":"The style combines highly visible fine brushwork with richly rendered, densely detailed faces, hair, clothing, and props. Saturated reds, blues, oranges, and greens stand out against dark grounds, while extreme expressions, grotesque fantasy figures, and tight portrait framing create an intense theatrical effect."},{"id":"rob-hefferan","name":"Rob Hefferan","cat":"painters","en":"Rob Hefferan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rob-hefferan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rob-hefferan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Rob Hefferan is a contemporary British artist known for his realistic and romantic paintings. His work often captures intimate moments with a focus on elegance and luxury, characterized by detailed and expressive brushwork.","observation":"These images use visibly broad, textured brushwork with richly modelled fabric, skin, wood, and architectural surfaces. Dark interiors and heavy curtains are cut by strong daylight, while elegant figures in elaborate gowns create theatrical, narrative tableaux with a restrained warm palette."},{"id":"hiroshi-sugimoto","name":"Hiroshi Sugimoto","cat":"photographers","en":"Hiroshi Sugimoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hiroshi-sugimoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hiroshi-sugimoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["ornate","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","epic","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","white","charcoal","silver","grey"],"intro":"Hiroshi Sugimoto is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his exploration of time, memory, and the metaphysical through his minimalist and conceptual photography. He is celebrated for his long-exposure techniques and large-format cameras, which capture serene and contemplative images that often explore themes of nature, architecture, and the passage of time.","observation":"The style is stark, monochrome and highly realistic, built around deep blacks, silvery highlights and strong atmospheric haze. Vast negative spaces, isolated light sources and monumental natural or architectural forms create a dark, cinematic-feeling sense of mystery and scale, while ornate structural details appear selectively within the shadows."},{"id":"ivan-marchuk","name":"Ivan Marchuk","cat":"painters","en":"Ivan Marchuk","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ivan-marchuk.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ivan-marchuk","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","silver","orange"],"intro":"Ivan Marchuk is a renowned Ukrainian artist known for his unique style that blends elements of surrealism and fantasy. His work often explores themes of nature, humanity, and the intricate connections between the two, using detailed textures and layered compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely layered, painterly textures with extremely fine, etched-looking linework and elaborate natural and architectural forms. Its subdued charcoal palette is punctuated by occasional burnt-orange light, while twisted trees, ruins, roots, and ships create a dark, fantastical atmosphere with surreal scale and composition."},{"id":"david-yarrow","name":"David Yarrow","cat":"photographers","en":"David Yarrow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-yarrow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-yarrow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["brown","white","bone-white","black","beige"],"intro":"David Yarrow is a renowned wildlife photographer known for his striking black-and-white images of animals in their natural habitats. His work often captures the majesty and power of wildlife, with a particular focus on large mammals such as lions, elephants, and tigers. Yarrow's photography is celebrated for its dramatic composition and high resolution, bringing viewers face-to-face with the raw beauty of nature.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, monochrome wildlife portraiture with crisp animal features, rich fur texture, and strong tonal contrast. Close frontal views and carefully staged human-and-animal encounters create a cinematic gallery atmosphere, while selective focus and layered framing emphasize scale and presence."},{"id":"christophe-jacrot","name":"Christophe Jacrot","cat":"photographers","en":"Christophe Jacrot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christophe-jacrot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christophe-jacrot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-blue","grey","silver","dark-brown","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Christophe Jacrot is a contemporary photographer known for capturing atmospheric urban scenes, often focusing on rainy and snowy conditions. His work highlights the interplay between light and shadow, creating a moody and introspective atmosphere.","observation":"These photographic scenes use a cinematic urban viewpoint, with dark, muted blue-gray tones punctuated by red signals and warm streetlights. Falling snow or rain, wet reflections, selective softness, and visible grain create a moody, atmospheric sense of movement through wintry city streets."},{"id":"daniela-uhlig","name":"Daniela Uhlig","cat":"illustrators","en":"Daniela Uhlig","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daniela-uhlig.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daniela-uhlig","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","grey","rust","bone-white","black","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Daniela Uhlig is a contemporary German illustrator known for her detailed and imaginative digital artworks. Her work often features whimsical and surreal elements, blending fantasy with reality in a unique and captivating style.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines highly recognizable faces with visible, layered brushwork, delicate hair strokes, and richly textured skin. Muted blue-gray grounds contrast with vivid orange, red, and floral accents, while dramatic patches of light and shadow give the intimate close-ups an expressive, painterly presence."},{"id":"gabriel-dawe","name":"Gabriel Dawe","cat":"various-artists","en":"Gabriel Dawe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gabriel-dawe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gabriel-dawe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","urban","glow","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","rust","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Gabriel Dawe is a contemporary artist known for his large-scale installations that explore the connection between fashion, architecture, and art. Born in Mexico City, Dawe's work often reflects his cultural heritage, utilizing vibrant colors and intricate patterns to create immersive experiences. His installations, primarily made with colorful threads, are celebrated for their ability to transform spaces and engage viewers in a dialogue about perception and reality.","observation":"The style presents realistic architectural interiors transformed by saturated rainbow light and sweeping, luminous structures. Strong geometric perspective, reflective surfaces, and repeated vertical or arcing forms create an immersive installation-like atmosphere, while the vivid illumination contrasts with darker surrounding spaces."},{"id":"art-baltazar","name":"Art Baltazar","cat":"illustrators","en":"Art Baltazar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/art-baltazar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/art-baltazar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","retro","cute","funny"],"colours":["muted-cyan","bone-white","black","white","red","light-yellow","pink"],"intro":"Art Baltazar is a renowned comic book artist and writer known for his work in the comic book industry, particularly for creating family-friendly and humorous stories. He has contributed significantly to the world of comics with his distinctive style and engaging storytelling.","observation":"The style is a colorful comic illustration built from thick black contours, clean flat color areas, and highly exaggerated faces with oversized eyes and toothy smiles. It combines crowded character groupings, playful costumes, and anthropomorphic figures with vivid primary colors and occasional energetic, textured backgrounds."},{"id":"edward-okun","name":"Edward Okun","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Okun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-okun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-okun","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","pale-orange","muted-ochre","rust","dark-brown"],"intro":"Edward Okun is a Polish painter known for his contributions to the Symbolist movement in the early 20th century. His work often features romantic and mythological themes, characterized by detailed and expressive compositions. Okun's paintings are celebrated for their use of light and shadow, as well as their rich, earthy color palettes that evoke a sense of nostalgia and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, elegant women are depicted in richly furnished interiors with carefully styled clothing, patterned textiles, and composed, fashion-conscious poses. Visible oil-paint brushwork, layered textures, strong dark-light modeling, and dense decorative backgrounds give the portraits a refined yet expressive character."},{"id":"elaine-de-kooning","name":"Elaine de Kooning","cat":"painters","en":"Elaine de Kooning","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elaine-de-kooning.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elaine-de-kooning","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-brown","grey","charcoal","red","orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"Elaine de Kooning was an influential American artist and art critic, known for her vibrant and expressive abstract expressionist paintings. She was a key figure in the New York School and contributed significantly to the post-war art scene with her dynamic and gestural style.","observation":"Across all four works, vigorous, visible brushwork builds dense abstract compositions from overlapping angular marks, scraped passages, and thickly layered paint. The style combines pale grounds with saturated navy, coral, pink, ochre, red, and green accents, creating an energetic, emotionally charged, dreamlike surface."},{"id":"chiho-aoshima","name":"Chiho Aoshima","cat":"various-artists","en":"Chiho Aoshima","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chiho-aoshima.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chiho-aoshima","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","bone-white","grey","muted-ochre","blue","red","yellow"],"intro":"Chiho Aoshima is a Japanese artist known for her work in digital art, often associated with the Superflat movement. Her art typically features fantastical landscapes and dreamlike scenes, blending traditional Japanese aesthetics with contemporary pop culture influences. Aoshima's work is characterized by its vibrant colors, intricate details, and whimsical themes, often exploring the relationship between nature and the supernatural.","observation":"The style combines highly saturated blue, red, black, and white with dense, expressive painted marks and fine illustrative contours. Surreal combinations of animals, figures, flowers, fireworks, city imagery, and celestial elements fill the compositions with layered detail and strong contrast."},{"id":"tj-drysdale","name":"TJ Drysdale","cat":"photographers","en":"TJ Drysdale","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tj-drysdale.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tj-drysdale","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","light-orange","pale-orange"],"intro":"TJ Drysdale is a contemporary photographer known for his ethereal and cinematic style. His work often features dreamlike portraits set in natural environments, capturing a sense of fantasy and introspection. Drysdale's photography is characterized by its use of soft focus, warm tones, and natural lighting, creating a romantic and serene atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, figures in flowing dresses are placed in open fields and woodland under dramatic sunset skies. The photographic style relies on warm amber light, strong backlighting, deep silhouettes, glowing highlights, selective focus, and wind-driven movement to create a dreamy, emotionally expressive atmosphere."},{"id":"andre-masson","name":"Andre Masson","cat":"painters","en":"Andre Masson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andre-masson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andre-masson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","muted-orange","charcoal","grey","light-yellow","red"],"intro":"Andre Masson is a French artist known for his contributions to Surrealism and Abstract Expressionism. His work often explores themes of the subconscious, mythology, and the human condition, utilizing automatic drawing techniques and biomorphic forms. Masson's art is characterized by its fluid lines, dynamic compositions, and symbolic imagery, reflecting his interest in psychoanalysis and dream interpretation.","observation":"Across all four renders, energetic gestural brushwork builds dense abstract compositions from biomorphic shapes, splatters, drips, and curling lines. Vivid coral, turquoise, yellow, pink, and black pigments create strong contrast, while recognizable hints of eyes, faces, petals, and creatures dissolve into surreal, kinetic patterning."},{"id":"rashid-johnson","name":"Rashid Johnson","cat":"painters","en":"Rashid Johnson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rashid-johnson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rashid-johnson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","silhouette"],"colours":["dark-olive","bone-white","black","beige","ochre","vivid-red","olive"],"intro":"Rashid Johnson is an American artist known for his diverse body of work that explores themes of identity, race, and history. His art often incorporates a variety of materials and techniques, including photography, sculpture, and painting, to create layered and complex pieces that challenge viewers to consider cultural narratives and personal identity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines heavily built-up, visibly tactile paint with dense abstract layering, scraped marks, drips, grids, and gestural strokes. Strong black-and-white contrasts are punctuated by saturated red, green, orange, and yellow, while recurring silhouettes, foliage, geometric blocks, and fragmented letter-like marks create an expressive, energetic surface."},{"id":"romina-ressia","name":"Romina Ressia","cat":"photographers","en":"Romina Ressia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/romina-ressia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/romina-ressia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","bone-white","deep-red","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Romina Ressia is an Argentine photographer known for her unique blend of classical and contemporary elements in her work. She often explores themes of identity, time, and societal norms through her distinctive style, which combines historical references with modern aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, finely detailed fashion portraits against dark, subdued studio backgrounds, with dramatic tonal modeling and carefully posed figures. Elaborate ruffs, lace, brocade, textured dresses, jewelry, and saturated garment accents create an ornate, historically evocative appearance while retaining a polished editorial finish."},{"id":"richard-tuttle","name":"Richard Tuttle","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Tuttle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-tuttle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-tuttle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","sculptural","patterns","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","beige","bone-white","ochre","rust","light-yellow","dark-green"],"intro":"Richard Tuttle is an American postminimalist artist known for his unconventional use of materials and exploration of form and space. His work often challenges traditional boundaries of art, incorporating elements of sculpture, painting, and drawing to create unique, tactile experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents colorful abstract assemblages made from fabric, painted fragments, wood, and other visibly tactile materials. Fine suspended wires, irregular geometric forms, patchwork surfaces, and generous white gallery space create a sculptural, surreal installation aesthetic."},{"id":"ellsworth-kelly","name":"Ellsworth Kelly","cat":"painters","en":"Ellsworth Kelly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ellsworth-kelly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ellsworth-kelly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","minimalist","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","vivid-red","light-yellow","vivid-orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"Ellsworth Kelly was an influential American painter and sculptor known for his pioneering work in color field painting and minimalism. His art is characterized by simple forms, bold colors, and a focus on the spatial relationships between shapes. Kelly's work often explores the interaction of color and form, creating a sense of balance and harmony.","observation":"The style uses sparse abstract compositions built from large geometric forms in saturated primary and secondary colors. Clean edges, flat color fields, and generous white space create a bold, minimalist graphic appearance, with occasional overlaps and off-center cropping adding visual rhythm."},{"id":"james-abbott-mcneill-whistler","name":"James Abbott McNeill Whistler","cat":"painters","en":"James Abbott McNeill Whistler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-abbott-mcneill-whistler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-abbott-mcneill-whistler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","portraits","scenes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","muted-orange","muted-ochre","black","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"James Abbott McNeill Whistler was an American artist known for his paintings and etchings, particularly his use of color and the influence of the Aesthetic Movement. He was a key figure in the 19th-century art world, with works that often focused on tonal harmony and subtle compositions.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visibly brushed painting with finely drawn, sketch-like line work, moving between urban vignettes, interiors, portraits, and figure scenes. Across the sheet it favors subdued brown, cream, charcoal, and wine-red hues, atmospheric shadows, softly worn surfaces, and a classical theatrical mood."},{"id":"ruth-bernhard","name":"Ruth Bernhard","cat":"photographers","en":"Ruth Bernhard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ruth-bernhard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ruth-bernhard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","beige","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Ruth Bernhard is a renowned photographer known for her black-and-white images, particularly those exploring the female form. Born in Germany in 1905, she moved to the United States, where she became a significant figure in modernist photography. Bernhard's work is celebrated for its meticulous composition, elegant simplicity, and profound exploration of light and shadow.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped, realistic portrait photography in stark black and white, with hard directional light carving faces into bright highlights and deep shadows. Overlapping faces, hands, and fragmented framing create an intense, claustrophobic composition, while visible grain reinforces an analog photographic feel."},{"id":"theodore-gericault","name":"Theodore Gericault","cat":"painters","en":"Theodore Gericault","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theodore-gericault.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theodore-gericault","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","brown","light-yellow"],"intro":"Theodore Gericault was a French painter and lithographer, known for his pioneering work in the Romantic movement. Born in 1791, he is best remembered for his dramatic and expressive compositions, such as \"The Raft of the Medusa,\" which captured the intensity and emotion of human experience. Gericault's work often explored themes of heroism, suffering, and the darker aspects of human nature, making him a key figure in the transition from Neoclassicism to Romanticism.","observation":"The style uses heavily worked, visible oil-paint brushstrokes to model anguished faces, rumpled fabric, and stark props with tactile detail. Dark earthy colors, deep shadows, and sharply illuminated highlights create a theatrical, emotionally intense classical appearance across the portraits and dramatic situations."},{"id":"kiki-smith","name":"Kiki Smith","cat":"various-artists","en":"Kiki Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kiki-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kiki-smith","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","animals","characters","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","beige","black","brown","grey"],"intro":"Kiki Smith is an American artist known for her multidisciplinary approach, exploring themes of the human condition, nature, and the feminine experience. Her work often incorporates elements of mythology, spirituality, and the natural world, using a variety of materials and techniques to create intricate and evocative pieces.","observation":"Across the four renders, delicate ink-like linework and layered, visibly worked surfaces combine with washed, subdued blue-and-beige color. Human faces, airborne crows, suspended figures, and monumental sculpture are treated with expressive distortion and an uncanny, dreamlike sense of fragmentation."},{"id":"robert-colescott","name":"Robert Colescott","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Colescott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-colescott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-colescott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","light-orange","red","dark-brown","blue","muted-teal"],"intro":"Robert Colescott was an American painter known for his vibrant and provocative works that often addressed themes of race and identity. His art is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a satirical edge, exploring complex social issues through a unique visual language.","observation":"Across all four panels, recognizable figures and portrait-like faces emerge from thick, highly visible impasto and broad gestural strokes. Saturated coral, blue, turquoise, yellow, and black create a forceful, high-contrast collage-like field, with dense overlapping crowds and boldly simplified clothing and faces."},{"id":"alois-arnegger","name":"Alois Arnegger","cat":"painters","en":"Alois Arnegger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alois-arnegger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alois-arnegger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","bone-white","beige","dark-rust"],"intro":"Alois Arnegger was an Austrian painter known for his landscape paintings, particularly those depicting the Alps and Mediterranean scenes. Born in 1879, Arnegger's work is characterized by its romantic and idyllic portrayal of nature, often featuring majestic mountains, serene lakes, and lush greenery. His paintings are celebrated for their detailed and realistic style, capturing the beauty and tranquility of natural landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly painted, naturalistic landscapes with finely resolved foliage, architecture, water, snow, and atmospheric distance. Warm sunlight and reflective surfaces create a cinematic, dreamlike grandeur, while delicate brushwork and classical scenic compositions balance intimate human moments with expansive vistas."},{"id":"karel-appel","name":"Karel Appel","cat":"painters","en":"Karel Appel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karel-appel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karel-appel","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","sculptural","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","pale-orange","red","muted-cyan","dark-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Karel Appel was a Dutch painter and sculptor, known for his involvement with the avant-garde CoBrA movement. Born in 1921, Appel's work is characterized by its bold, expressive style and vivid use of color. He often employed a gestural approach, creating dynamic and emotionally charged compositions that challenged traditional artistic norms.","observation":"Across all four works, thick, built-up paint and broad directional strokes create highly tactile surfaces, with forceful black contours organizing vivid red, blue, yellow, pink, and cream shapes. Figurative hints such as eyes and creature-like faces merge with circular and angular abstractions, producing an energetic, surreal visual language."},{"id":"pierre-alechinsky","name":"Pierre Alechinsky","cat":"painters","en":"Pierre Alechinsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-alechinsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-alechinsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","motion","bold-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","charcoal","red","deep-blue","light-orange","green"],"intro":"Pierre Alechinsky is a Belgian artist known for his association with the CoBrA movement, which emphasized spontaneity and experimentation in art. His work often features vivid colors, dynamic forms, and a blend of abstract and figurative elements, reflecting a unique synthesis of European avant-garde traditions.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines dense abstract imagery with recognizable but fragmented faces, eyes, animals, and organic forms. Thick, highly visible brushwork and forceful black outlining build a vivid, tactile surface, while repeated stripes, grids, circles, and other geometric marks create energetic movement and visual congestion."},{"id":"margaret-preston","name":"Margaret Preston","cat":"painters","en":"Margaret Preston","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/margaret-preston.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/margaret-preston","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","landscapes","still-life","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","pale-orange","muted-blue","vivid-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Margaret Preston was an influential Australian artist known for her vibrant and modernist depictions of native flora and landscapes. She was a pioneer in the use of indigenous Australian motifs and techniques, integrating them into her work to create a unique style that celebrated the natural beauty of Australia. Her work often involved printmaking and woodcuts, which allowed her to explore bold and decorative compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly built-up paint with broad, directional strokes and heavy dark contour lines, giving flowers, trees, and vessels a graphic yet tactile presence. Saturated reds, blues, creams, and greens are arranged in dense, highly detailed compositions, often with decorative pottery and strongly patterned surfaces."},{"id":"hedi-xandt","name":"Hedi Xandt","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Hedi Xandt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hedi-xandt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hedi-xandt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","floral","portraits","glow","high-contrast","metallic","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-yellow","deep-red","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Hedi Xandt is a contemporary artist known for his striking and surreal sculptures that often blend elements of mythology and modernity. His work is characterized by a unique fusion of classical and contemporary styles, creating pieces that are both visually captivating and thought-provoking.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped portrait photography with elaborate floral and gold-leaf adornment covering faces, hair, and clothing. Dark backgrounds and strong tonal contrast make the metallic surfaces gleam, while muted black, ivory, and skin tones are punctuated by saturated red roses and dense ornamental detail."},{"id":"george-hurrell","name":"George Hurrell","cat":"photographers","en":"George Hurrell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-hurrell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-hurrell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"George Hurrell was a renowned American photographer known for his iconic portraits of Hollywood stars during the Golden Age of Hollywood. His work defined the glamour and allure of the era, capturing the essence of celebrity culture with dramatic lighting and exquisite detail.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast portrait photography with sculpted studio lighting, deep shadows, and selective focus. It consistently presents glamorous fashion figures in vintage-inspired clothing and theatrical poses, alternating intimate close-ups with cinematic environmental portraits."},{"id":"carly-cushnie","name":"Carly Cushnie","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Carly Cushnie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carly-cushnie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carly-cushnie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","muted-rust","black","beige","brown"],"intro":"Carly Cushnie is a renowned fashion designer known for her sleek, contemporary designs that emphasize clean lines and a modern aesthetic. As the co-founder of the fashion label Cushnie, she has made significant contributions to the fashion industry with her focus on empowering women through elegant and sophisticated clothing.","observation":"The style combines fashion-editorial portraiture with visible, controlled brushwork, fine contour marks, and layered tonal modeling on skin and fabric. Restrained beige, black, white, and brown tones, cropped poses, and generous blank backgrounds create an elegant, graphic presentation across all four renders."},{"id":"richard-eurich","name":"Richard Eurich","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Eurich","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-eurich.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-eurich","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","silver","muted-ochre","dark-brown"],"intro":"Richard Eurich is a British painter known for his detailed and atmospheric landscapes and seascapes. His work often captures the serene and contemplative beauty of the British countryside and coast, reflecting a deep connection to nature and the environment.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses softly textured, visibly painted surfaces and fine brushwork to depict quiet coastal and rural settings with dense architectural and natural detail. Muted, cool colors with restrained red accents, distant haze, solitary or rear-facing figures, and dreamlike juxtapositions create a contemplative atmosphere."},{"id":"utamaro","name":"Utamaro","cat":"printmakers","en":"Utamaro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/utamaro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/utamaro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","subdued-colors","classical","religious","drawing"],"colours":["pale-orange","black","muted-ochre","light-yellow","dark-red","brown"],"intro":"Utamaro was a renowned Japanese artist known for his ukiyo-e woodblock prints, particularly of beautiful women, during the Edo period. His work is celebrated for its delicate linework, elegant compositions, and insightful portrayals of female beauty and emotion.","observation":"Across all four images, finely ruled contours and mostly flat, carefully bounded color create a graphic illustrative appearance, with restrained beige, black, red, and muted gold tones. Cropped female portraits are presented through elaborate hairstyles, patterned garments, fans, and decorative accessories, while paper grain and seal-like marks reinforce a traditional print-inspired surface."},{"id":"will-eisner","name":"Will Eisner","cat":"illustrators","en":"Will Eisner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/will-eisner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/will-eisner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"Will Eisner is a pioneering figure in the world of comics and graphic novels, known for his influential work in the medium. He is credited with popularizing the term \"graphic novel\" and has left a lasting legacy with his innovative storytelling techniques and expressive art style. Eisner's work often explores themes of urban life and human emotion, blending narrative depth with visual artistry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily inked, graphic linework with dense crosshatching, bold contours, and dramatic blocks of shadow. Restrained sepia, charcoal, and slate tones are punctuated by occasional rust-red highlights, depicting atmospheric urban scenes and recurring solitary figures with a vintage crime-fiction mood."},{"id":"kurt-wenner","name":"Kurt Wenner","cat":"various-artists","en":"Kurt Wenner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kurt-wenner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kurt-wenner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","scenes","motion","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["brown","ochre","black","dark-brown","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Kurt Wenner is an American artist known for his innovative 3D pavement art and street painting. He gained prominence for his ability to create intricate, illusionistic artworks that transform flat surfaces into seemingly three-dimensional spaces. Wenner's work often draws on classical themes and techniques, blending them with modern elements to create visually stunning pieces that captivate audiences worldwide.","observation":"Across all four views, richly painted architectural scenes merge with real plazas, people, and buildings through elaborate trompe-l'oeil perspective. The style is highly detailed and painterly, with expressive figures, ornate classical structures, saturated warm colors, and dramatic distortions that make flat surfaces appear to open into deep interiors."},{"id":"norman-cornish","name":"Norman Cornish","cat":"painters","en":"Norman Cornish","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norman-cornish.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norman-cornish","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","pale-orange","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Norman Cornish was a British artist known for his depictions of the working-class life in the coal mining communities of Northern England. His work often captured the everyday experiences and social interactions of miners and their families, reflecting the cultural and social dynamics of the mid-20th century. Cornish's paintings are celebrated for their authenticity and emotional depth, offering a poignant glimpse into a bygone era.","observation":"The style combines heavily visible, broad paint strokes with expressive, weathered faces and densely layered urban settings. Dark blue-gray and brown tones dominate, punctuated by small orange-red accents, while strong light-dark contrasts and rough textured surfaces give the scenes a bleak, dramatic weight."},{"id":"kate-beaton","name":"Kate Beaton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kate Beaton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kate-beaton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kate-beaton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","grey","silver","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Kate Beaton is a Canadian cartoonist known for her webcomic \"Hark! A Vagrant,\" which blends humor with historical and literary themes. Her work often features witty commentary and playful reinterpretations of historical events and figures, earning her a dedicated following and critical acclaim.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome ink illustration with strongly outlined, expressive characters and plentiful crosshatched shading. It combines portrait-like close-ups with small narrative scenes, using exaggerated facial features, varied line weight, and textured black areas on a pale paper ground."},{"id":"eero-saarinen","name":"Eero Saarinen","cat":"architects","en":"Eero Saarinen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eero-saarinen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eero-saarinen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","white","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Eero Saarinen was a Finnish-American architect and industrial designer known for his innovative and sculptural designs. He played a significant role in shaping modern architecture during the mid-20th century, with notable works including the Gateway Arch in St. Louis and the TWA Flight Center at JFK Airport.","observation":"The style presents monumental modern architecture through realistic, cinematic photography, emphasizing sweeping curves, geometric window grids, sculptural concrete forms, and expansive negative space. Restrained earthy tones shift into moody dusk lighting, with strong silhouettes, long shadows, and carefully framed axial compositions reinforcing the buildings’ monumental scale."},{"id":"joseph-lorusso","name":"Joseph Lorusso","cat":"painters","en":"Joseph Lorusso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joseph-lorusso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joseph-lorusso","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","red","dark-red","ochre","pale-orange"],"intro":"Joseph Lorusso is a contemporary American painter known for his evocative and emotional depictions of human figures. His work often explores themes of intimacy, nostalgia, and the human condition, drawing inspiration from both classical and modern influences. Lorusso's paintings are characterized by their rich color palettes, expressive brushwork, and a focus on capturing the subtle nuances of human emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly built-up paint with broad, directional strokes, gestural faces, and richly textured clothing and interiors. Warm reds, ochres, olive greens, and near-black shadows create moody theatrical scenes, while tightly cropped groups and intimate gestures give the images a lively, narrative quality."},{"id":"chen-zhen","name":"Chen Zhen","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Chen Zhen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chen-zhen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chen-zhen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Chen Zhen was a Chinese-French contemporary artist known for his innovative and thought-provoking installations and sculptures. His work often explored themes of cultural identity, globalization, and the human condition, blending Eastern and Western philosophies. Chen Zhen's art is characterized by the use of found objects, mixed media, and a deep engagement with cultural and philosophical questions.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental sculptural assemblages occupy vast, derelict industrial interiors, combining rusted frameworks, torn fabric, rubble, and human figures with highly legible material detail. The subdued earthy palette, strong architectural geometry, cavernous negative space, and carefully staged illumination create a bleak, surreal, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"michael-cheval","name":"Michael Cheval","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Cheval","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-cheval.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-cheval","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["brown","grey","bone-white","blue","dark-rust"],"intro":"Michael Cheval is a contemporary artist known for his surreal and fantastical paintings that often explore themes of absurdity and whimsy. His work is characterized by a blend of classical techniques and imaginative storytelling, creating a unique visual experience that captivates viewers with its intricate details and playful narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured, visible brushwork with densely ornamented costumes, props, and architectural settings. Saturated reds and blues, bright skies, and strong light-dark separation create theatrical, fantastical tableaux populated by elaborately dressed characters and recurring airborne or maritime details."},{"id":"adam-martinakis","name":"Adam Martinakis","cat":"various-artists","en":"Adam Martinakis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adam-martinakis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adam-martinakis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","portraits","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","beige","black","red"],"intro":"Adam Martinakis is a contemporary digital artist known for his work in 3D digital art and computer-generated imagery. His art often explores themes of existence, human emotion, and the intersection of technology and humanity. Martinakis's work is characterized by its surreal and abstract nature, often depicting human figures in various states of transformation and interconnection.","observation":"The style presents tightly framed, sculptural human portraits whose faces and bodies merge with dense networks of roots, branches, fibers, and airborne fragments. Highly rendered surfaces, directional strands, dramatic contrast, and restrained gray-blue tones with occasional rust-red accents create an eerie, surreal sense of organic transformation and motion."},{"id":"arthur-elgort","name":"Arthur Elgort","cat":"photographers","en":"Arthur Elgort","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-elgort.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-elgort","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["white","silver","black","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Arthur Elgort is a renowned American fashion photographer known for his work with Vogue and other top fashion magazines. His style is characterized by a casual, snapshot-like quality that brings a sense of spontaneity and movement to fashion photography. Elgort's work often features models in natural settings, capturing candid moments that convey both elegance and ease.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome, high-contrast fashion photography with a filmic editorial atmosphere. It combines posed and candid female portraits with urban or intimate lifestyle settings, selective focus, strong shadow shapes, and visible photographic grain."},{"id":"josef-sudek","name":"Josef Sudek","cat":"photographers","en":"Josef Sudek","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josef-sudek.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josef-sudek","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Josef Sudek was a Czech photographer known for his atmospheric and poetic images, often capturing the quiet beauty of Prague and its surroundings. His work is characterized by a unique use of light and shadow, creating a sense of mystery and introspection. Sudek's photographs often feature landscapes, still lifes, and urban scenes, with a focus on mood and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome imagery with deep shadows, bright window light, and a distinctly grainy photographic surface. Overgrown branches and flowering vines partially veil old architectural windows, while haze, backlighting, and layered foliage create a dark, atmospheric woodland-interior mood."},{"id":"briton-riviere","name":"Briton Riviere","cat":"painters","en":"Briton Riviere","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/briton-riviere.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/briton-riviere","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Briton Riviere was a British artist known for his animal paintings and depictions of human-animal interactions during the Victorian era. His works often featured dramatic and emotional scenes, capturing the essence of animals with realism and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to model realistic dogs, fur, fabrics, and faces with careful observational detail. Its warm, subdued brown, red, cream, and black palette and intimate portrait-like arrangements create a classical, softly dramatic atmosphere."},{"id":"franz-marc","name":"Franz Marc","cat":"painters","en":"Franz Marc","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/franz-marc.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/franz-marc","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","characters","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["vivid-red","charcoal","muted-teal","blue","light-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"Franz Marc was a German painter and printmaker, a key figure in the German Expressionist movement and a founding member of Der Blaue Reiter group. Known for his vivid use of color and abstract forms, Marc often depicted animals, believing they were more spiritual and pure than humans. His work is characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions, reflecting his interest in spirituality and the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and faces dissolve into overlapping angular forms, while vigorous, visible brushwork gives the surfaces a tactile painted character. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and oranges, strong dark contours, and compressed diagonals create an intense, expressive, dreamlike style."},{"id":"michael-garmash","name":"Michael Garmash","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Garmash","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-garmash.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-garmash","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","brown","dark-brown","bone-white","black","ochre","red"],"intro":"Michael Garmash is a contemporary artist known for his romantic and impressionistic style, often focusing on portraits and scenes of feminine beauty. His work is characterized by a delicate balance of light and shadow, capturing intimate moments with a painterly touch. Garmash's art has been exhibited internationally, gaining recognition for its emotional depth and technical skill.","observation":"The style uses richly visible, layered brushwork with luminous highlights, softened edges, and expressive strokes that define faces, clothing, foliage, and flowers. It consistently combines elegant female figures with garden or terrace settings, vivid greens and reds, and detailed yet atmospheric painterly backgrounds."},{"id":"anselm-kiefer","name":"Anselm Kiefer","cat":"painters","en":"Anselm Kiefer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anselm-kiefer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anselm-kiefer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","silver","muted-orange","ochre","rust"],"intro":"Anselm Kiefer is a German painter and sculptor known for his large-scale works that explore themes of history, memory, and mythology. His art often incorporates materials like lead, straw, and ash, creating textured surfaces that evoke a sense of decay and transformation. Kiefer's work is deeply rooted in the post-war context of Germany, reflecting on cultural trauma and historical narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, natural landscapes are built from visible, thickly worked paint marks, with heavily textured trees, cliffs, masonry, and wet ground. The restrained charcoal, gray, brown, and ember-orange palette, strong light-dark separation, misty air, and traces of fire create a bleak, dramatic atmosphere."},{"id":"angelo-donghia","name":"Angelo Donghia","cat":"designers","en":"Angelo Donghia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/angelo-donghia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/angelo-donghia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","still-life","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","light-orange","beige","dark-rust"],"intro":"Angelo Donghia was an influential American interior designer known for his luxurious and sophisticated style, which became highly popular in the 1970s and 1980s. His work is characterized by a blend of modernism and classicism, often incorporating plush fabrics, bold colors, and elegant simplicity. Donghia's designs have left a lasting impact on the world of interior design, influencing both residential and commercial spaces.","observation":"The style presents richly furnished interior scenes with realistic materials, abundant decor, and carefully layered compositions. Warm pools of lamp light contrast with deep shadows and muted earthy colors, while marble, velvet, wood, rugs, plants, and framed art create a luxurious, highly detailed atmosphere."},{"id":"alfred-cheney-johnston","name":"Alfred Cheney Johnston","cat":"photographers","en":"Alfred Cheney Johnston","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-cheney-johnston.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-cheney-johnston","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","beige","silver"],"intro":"Alfred Cheney Johnston was an American photographer known for his portraits of Ziegfeld Follies showgirls during the early 20th century. His work is characterized by its glamorous and theatrical style, capturing the essence of the Roaring Twenties with a focus on elegance and beauty.","observation":"The style is a monochrome photographic portrait series built around glamorous, carefully posed women in elaborate period-inspired clothing and accessories. Strong tonal contrast, selective focus, and visible grain create a dark, theatrical studio mood, while feathers, beads, sequins, and jewelry provide ornate surface detail."},{"id":"francis-picabia","name":"Francis Picabia","cat":"painters","en":"Francis Picabia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francis-picabia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francis-picabia","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["pale-orange","black","brown","beige","ochre","red"],"intro":"Francis Picabia was a French avant-garde painter, poet, and typographist associated with various art movements such as Dada and Surrealism. Known for his experimental and diverse style, Picabia's work often challenged traditional artistic norms and explored new forms of expression. His contributions to modern art have left a lasting impact on the art world.","observation":"This style combines visibly built-up, distressed paint surfaces with collage-like layers, angular abstractions, and strongly outlined facial fragments. Restrained earthy blues, creams, blacks, and reds unify the varied imagery, while high contrast, geometric shapes, repeated eyes and lips, and mechanical or industrial motifs create a surreal, densely packed visual language."},{"id":"richard-schmid","name":"Richard Schmid","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Schmid","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-schmid.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-schmid","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["beige","black","dark-brown","charcoal","rust"],"intro":"Richard Schmid is a renowned American painter known for his skillful use of alla prima techniques and his ability to capture the essence of his subjects with a blend of realism and impressionism. His works often feature portraits, landscapes, and still lifes, characterized by their vibrant color palettes and dynamic brushwork. Schmid has been influential in the art community, inspiring many with his dedication to the craft and his educational contributions through books and workshops.","observation":"The style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, with layered, broken strokes describing faces, fabric, foliage, and light. Warm subdued colors are punctuated by flowers and bright highlights, while intimate female portraits and small social garden scenes recur in atmospheric, densely composed settings."},{"id":"hilla-becher","name":"Hilla Becher","cat":"photographers","en":"Hilla Becher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hilla-becher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hilla-becher","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","urban","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["white","silver","brown","beige","grey","black"],"intro":"Hilla Becher was a German photographer known for her collaborative work with her husband, Bernd Becher. Together, they pioneered a style of photography that focused on industrial structures, documenting them in a systematic and typological manner. Their work is characterized by its black and white format, frontal perspectives, and emphasis on form and structure, contributing significantly to the Düsseldorf School of Photography.","observation":"The style presents industrial architecture as austere, carefully isolated documentary studies, using centered elevations, measured geometry, and generous pale negative space. Restrained monochrome tones, crisp fine detail, visible grain, and strong structural contrast give the images the feel of archival architectural plates."},{"id":"howardena-pindell","name":"Howardena Pindell","cat":"painters","en":"Howardena Pindell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howardena-pindell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howardena-pindell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","patterns","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["pale-blue","muted-blue","bone-white","muted-rust","charcoal","vivid-red"],"intro":"Howardena Pindell is an American artist known for her innovative use of texture, color, and mixed media. Her work often explores themes of race, gender, and the politics of identity. Pindell's art is characterized by its abstract and conceptual nature, utilizing a variety of materials and techniques to create layered and textured compositions. She has been a significant figure in contemporary art, contributing to discussions on social issues through her visual narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is an abstract, heavily textured field of layered paint flecks and brush marks, usually organized over a pale blue ground. Saturated reds, oranges, pinks, yellows, and darker blues create expressive clustered patterns, while one view places the same visual language in a large gallery floor installation."},{"id":"aaron-douglas","name":"Aaron Douglas","cat":"painters","en":"Aaron Douglas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aaron-douglas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aaron-douglas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-cyan","rust","beige","light-orange"],"intro":"Aaron Douglas was an influential African American painter and a major figure in the Harlem Renaissance. Known for his distinctive style, Douglas's work often explored themes of African heritage and cultural identity. His paintings are celebrated for their bold use of geometric shapes, vibrant colors, and symbolic imagery, reflecting both modernist and Art Deco influences.","observation":"Across all four images, broad visible brushwork builds angular figures, landscapes, and dramatic situations with strongly simplified silhouettes. Saturated warm and cool colors, deep shadows, and luminous fire-like areas create an expressive, high-contrast fantasy atmosphere full of movement and crowded forms."},{"id":"francois-truffaut","name":"Francois Truffaut","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Francois Truffaut","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francois-truffaut.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francois-truffaut","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Francois Truffaut was a renowned French filmmaker and a central figure in the French New Wave cinema movement. Known for his innovative storytelling and deep character studies, Truffaut's films often explored themes of love, youth, and existential reflection. His works are celebrated for their emotional depth and artistic style, influencing generations of filmmakers.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome photography with occasional cool or warm tinted panels, pronounced grain, and strong tonal contrast. It consistently frames introspective faces and candid urban encounters through close-ups, layered crowds, selective focus, and a distinctly vintage film-photo atmosphere."},{"id":"evgeny-lushpin","name":"Evgeny Lushpin","cat":"painters","en":"Evgeny Lushpin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/evgeny-lushpin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/evgeny-lushpin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-blue","brown","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Evgeny Lushpin is a contemporary Russian artist known for his highly detailed and atmospheric cityscapes. His work often features a blend of realism and romanticism, capturing the charm and mystery of urban environments, particularly those in Europe.","observation":"The style presents richly detailed, realistic canal-city environments with Gothic architecture, layered rooftops, waterways, boats, and atmospheric depth. Cool blue dusk or winter light is consistently contrasted by warm glowing windows and lanterns, producing a cinematic, dreamy fantasy mood with strong reflective surfaces and carefully composed urban vistas."},{"id":"vince-colletta","name":"Vince Colletta","cat":"illustrators","en":"Vince Colletta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vince-colletta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vince-colletta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-blue","vivid-red","orange","olive"],"intro":"Vince Colletta is a renowned comic book artist known for his work with Marvel and DC Comics, particularly during the Silver Age of Comic Books. He was celebrated for his inking skills and contributed to numerous iconic series, including Thor and The Fantastic Four.","observation":"The style uses intensely saturated color blocks, heavy ink contours, and dense crosshatched marks to create forceful comic-book character portraits and action scenes. High contrast, exaggerated expressions, masked figures, and distressed printed textures give the images a bold retro pulp-comic energy."},{"id":"kelly-vivanco","name":"Kelly Vivanco","cat":"painters","en":"Kelly Vivanco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kelly-vivanco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kelly-vivanco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","muted-orange","brown","grey","vivid-red","dark-red"],"intro":"Kelly Vivanco is an American artist known for her whimsical and enchanting paintings that often feature young girls and fantastical creatures. Her work is characterized by a blend of surrealism and fantasy, creating dreamlike scenes that captivate the viewer's imagination. Vivanco's art is celebrated for its narrative quality and the way it evokes a sense of wonder and introspection.","observation":"Across all four portraits, strongly outlined illustrative figures are rendered with visible directional brushwork and textured, built-up paint. The style combines expressive, finely observed faces and flowing hair with dense botanical framing, woodland animals, and a restrained blue-gray ground punctuated by vivid red flowers and garments."},{"id":"william-etty","name":"William Etty","cat":"painters","en":"William Etty","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-etty.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-etty","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","ochre","dark-red","light-orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"William Etty was a 19th-century English painter known for his depictions of nude figures and historical scenes. He was a prominent figure in the Romantic movement, celebrated for his ability to capture the human form with a sense of drama and emotion. Etty's work often explored themes from classical mythology and literature, characterized by rich color palettes and expressive compositions.","observation":"A richly painterly portrait style, built from visible loose brushwork, softly modeled faces, and dense tonal variation in hair, fabric, and floral adornments. The four images share subdued, warm, dark colors and intimate cropped compositions, with expressive female sitters presented in historically styled garments against shadowed backgrounds."},{"id":"mike-worrall","name":"Mike Worrall","cat":"painters","en":"Mike Worrall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-worrall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-worrall","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-ochre","dark-olive","grey","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"Mike Worrall is a contemporary British artist known for his surreal and fantastical paintings that often explore themes of mystery and the subconscious. His work is characterized by intricate details and a unique blend of realism and imagination, drawing inspiration from historical and gothic elements.","observation":"These images use richly textured, painterly realism with densely rendered architecture, clothing, vegetation, and reflective wet surfaces. Restrained dark greens, browns, greys, and selective reds create a brooding cinematic mood, while theatrical figures, uncanny staging, and recurring garden and mansion settings give the scenes a surreal narrative quality."},{"id":"stephen-ormandy","name":"Stephen Ormandy","cat":"painters","en":"Stephen Ormandy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-ormandy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-ormandy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","illustrative","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","silver","blue","black","pink"],"intro":"Stephen Ormandy is an Australian artist known for his vibrant and abstract geometric paintings. His work often explores the interplay of color and form, creating dynamic compositions that are both playful and sophisticated. Ormandy is also a co-founder of Dinosaur Designs, a company renowned for its innovative resin jewelry and homewares.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses large overlapping rounded and rectilinear forms arranged as non-representational compositions. Saturated contrasting colors, clean hard edges, and mostly flat painted areas create a bold graphic language, with subtle surface texture on the pale ground and colored shapes."},{"id":"stan-winston","name":"Stan Winston","cat":"various-artists","en":"Stan Winston","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stan-winston.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stan-winston","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","rust","pale-orange"],"intro":"Stan Winston was a renowned American special effects and makeup artist known for his work in the film industry, particularly in creating iconic characters and creatures. He was instrumental in the development of groundbreaking visual effects and creature designs for movies such as \" Jurassic Park ,\" \"Terminator,\" and \"Aliens,\" earning multiple Academy Awards for his contributions.","observation":"The style is photographic and cinematic, combining intimate close-up portraits and behind-the-scenes group scenes with highly detailed practical creature effects. Subdued, moody color, warm studio illumination, strong contrast, and shallow backgrounds give the images a candid film-set atmosphere while emphasizing textured reptilian surfaces and expressive faces."},{"id":"bela-kadar","name":"Bela Kadar","cat":"painters","en":"Bela Kadar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bela-kadar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bela-kadar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","charcoal","dark-brown","red","dark-blue","grey"],"intro":"Bela Kadar is a Hungarian painter known for his unique blend of modernist and folk art influences. His work often features geometric forms and vibrant colors, drawing from both cubism and expressionism. Kadar's paintings frequently depict whimsical and dreamlike scenes, incorporating elements of Eastern European culture and mythology.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable faces and figures are broken into angular, overlapping planes, with forceful contouring and saturated reds, blues, greens, and ochres. Visible brush marks and built-up paint texture soften the graphic geometry, producing dense, expressive portrait compositions that shift between figurative and surreal abstraction."},{"id":"peter-robert-keil","name":"Peter Robert Keil","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Robert Keil","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-robert-keil.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-robert-keil","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","black","blue","muted-brown","vivid-red","light-orange","deep-blue","green"],"intro":"Peter Robert Keil is a German painter known for his vibrant and expressive works that often explore themes of identity and emotion. Born in 1942, Keil's art is characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions, drawing influence from movements like neo-expressionism and cubism. His work frequently features distorted human figures and faces, reflecting a deep engagement with the human condition.","observation":"Across all four works, faces are fragmented into bold geometric planes, oversized eyes, and strongly outlined mouths. Saturated primary and secondary colors collide with heavy black contours, while visible brush marks and layered paint keep the graphic constructions tactile and expressive."},{"id":"peter-fischli-and-david-weiss","name":"Peter Fischli and David Weiss","cat":"various-artists","en":"Peter Fischli and David Weiss","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-fischli-and-david-weiss.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-fischli-and-david-weiss","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","scenes","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","epic","geometric"],"colours":["beige","dark-ochre","bone-white","red","ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Peter Fischli and David Weiss was a Swiss artist duo known for their collaborative work across various media, including sculpture, photography, and video. They gained recognition for their playful and thought-provoking installations that often explored everyday objects and environments, infusing them with a sense of whimsy and surrealism.","observation":"Across all four images, the style presents carefully staged miniature worlds with monumental objects, tiny figures, and improbable environments, rendered with cinematic framing and a dreamlike sense of scale. Muted ochres, reds, and blue-greens, strong directional light, visible grain, and richly textured surfaces give the scenes a nostalgic, slightly uncanny atmosphere."},{"id":"judith-clay","name":"Judith Clay","cat":"illustrators","en":"Judith Clay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/judith-clay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/judith-clay","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Judith Clay is a contemporary illustrator known for her enchanting and whimsical art style. Her work often draws inspiration from European folklore and fairy tales, creating a unique blend of fantasy and surrealism. Clay's illustrations are characterized by their intricate detailing and delicate textures, often featuring mythical creatures and symbolic elements. Her art has been widely appreciated for its ability to evoke a sense of nostalgia and wonder.","observation":"Across all four renders, finely drawn figures and animals inhabit dense winter woodland settings, with delicate contour lines, patterned textiles, and abundant small surface details. The restrained black, cream, grey, and rust-red palette, elongated forms, and improbable animal-human encounters create an ornate, storybook-like surrealism."},{"id":"john-baldessari","name":"John Baldessari","cat":"various-artists","en":"John Baldessari","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-baldessari.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-baldessari","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","floral","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["silver","black","beige","vivid-red","blue","ochre"],"intro":"John Baldessari is an influential American conceptual artist known for his pioneering work in the fields of photography, painting, and video. He is recognized for his innovative use of found photography and appropriated images, often incorporating text to challenge traditional narratives and explore the boundaries of art.","observation":"The style combines stark, often monochrome portrait photography with aggressively contrasting cutout and painted overlays, replacing or obscuring faces with animals, flowers, and vivid geometric color fields. Large close-up compositions, hard edges, and selective saturated reds, blues, pinks, and yellows create a surreal collage effect against pale backgrounds."},{"id":"daniel-libeskind","name":"Daniel Libeskind","cat":"architects","en":"Daniel Libeskind","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daniel-libeskind.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daniel-libeskind","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","geometric"],"colours":["grey","black","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Daniel Libeskind is a renowned architect known for his innovative and bold designs. Born in Poland and later becoming an American citizen, Libeskind has made significant contributions to contemporary architecture, with notable works including the Jewish Museum in Berlin and the master plan for the World Trade Center redevelopment in New York City. His architectural style is characterized by its deconstructivist approach, often featuring sharp angles and fragmented forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, sharply faceted buildings dominate the frame, with dramatic upward perspectives emphasizing triangles, wedges, planes, and deep recesses. The monochrome treatment, strong tonal separation, reflective glazing, and hard-edged material textures create a stark, monumental architectural style."},{"id":"inna-mosina","name":"Inna Mosina","cat":"photographers","en":"Inna Mosina","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/inna-mosina.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/inna-mosina","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","grey","deep-red"],"intro":"Inna Mosina is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and romantic style, often integrating natural elements and feminine aesthetics into her work. Her photography explores themes of beauty, nature, and introspection, creating a dreamy and surreal atmosphere that captivates viewers.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic portrait photography with intimate close cropping, shallow focus, and softly atmospheric natural light. Muted earthy colors, deep shadows, botanical surroundings, elaborate ruffled clothing, and distant expressions create a dreamy, darkly romantic mood."},{"id":"pietro-antonio-rotari","name":"Pietro Antonio Rotari","cat":"painters","en":"Pietro Antonio Rotari","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pietro-antonio-rotari.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pietro-antonio-rotari","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Pietro Antonio Rotari was an 18th-century Italian painter, renowned for his portraits and genre scenes that often depicted young women in domestic settings. His works are characterized by their delicate and detailed brushwork, capturing the subtlety of human expressions and the elegance of Rococo style.","observation":"The style uses richly modeled oil-paint surfaces, visible fine brushwork, and carefully rendered faces, hair, fabric, and small accessories. Restrained earthy colors, deep backgrounds, and strong directional illumination create intimate, dramatic portrait compositions with a classical historical character."},{"id":"johnnie-to","name":"Johnnie To","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Johnnie To","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johnnie-to.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johnnie-to","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","glow","mist","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-teal","muted-cyan","dark-red","silver"],"intro":"Johnnie To is a renowned filmmaker from Hong Kong, celebrated for his work in the crime and action genres. Known for his masterful storytelling and distinctive visual style, To has directed numerous critically acclaimed films that have left a significant mark on Hong Kong cinema. His works often explore themes of loyalty, morality, and the complexities of human relationships, set against the backdrop of urban landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines cinematic urban scenes and portraits with moody teal-and-red lighting, strong contrast, neon glow, and atmospheric haze. Broad, visibly brushed and smeared paint marks soften faces, architecture, reflections, and city detail into an expressive, dreamlike nocturnal texture."},{"id":"peter-callesen","name":"Peter Callesen","cat":"various-artists","en":"Peter Callesen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-callesen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-callesen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","patterns","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Peter Callesen is a Danish artist known for his intricate paper sculptures and installations. His work often explores themes of fragility and transformation, using paper as a primary medium to create delicate and detailed pieces that challenge perceptions of materiality and space.","observation":"The style consistently transforms books, walls, clouds, plants, and human figures into highly detailed sculptural tableaux with a pale, restrained palette. Surreal architectural ruptures and miniature narrative figures create an otherworldly sense of scale, while generous empty backgrounds and softly controlled lighting keep the compositions refined and contemplative."},{"id":"edgar-maxence","name":"Edgar Maxence","cat":"painters","en":"Edgar Maxence","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edgar-maxence.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edgar-maxence","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Edgar Maxence is a French Symbolist painter known for his ethereal and mystical portraits, often depicting young women in dreamlike settings. His work is characterized by a delicate use of color and intricate detailing, drawing inspiration from mythology and nature.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses richly visible paint texture and fine, controlled brushwork to model faces, hair, fabric, and ornament with exceptional precision. Dark earthy grounds, restrained reds and creams, floral accessories, and gilded or embroidered surfaces create an ornate, somber, old-master-like presentation."},{"id":"kevin-eastman","name":"Kevin Eastman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kevin Eastman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kevin-eastman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kevin-eastman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["cream","black","dark-olive","beige","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Kevin Eastman is an American comic book artist and writer, best known as the co-creator of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles (TMNT). His work in the comic book industry has been influential, particularly in the 1980s and 1990s, where his distinctive style and storytelling captured the imaginations of readers worldwide.","observation":"The style combines densely detailed character illustration with expressive, heavily inked contours and fine crosshatched shading. It shifts between subdued earthy color scenes and stark monochrome studies, retaining rugged textures, dramatic poses, worn equipment, and a gritty fantasy-comics presentation throughout."},{"id":"riccardo-tisci","name":"Riccardo Tisci","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Riccardo Tisci","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/riccardo-tisci.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/riccardo-tisci","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","glow","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","rust","white","ochre","red"],"intro":"Riccardo Tisci is an Italian fashion designer known for his innovative and bold approach to fashion. He has worked with several prestigious fashion houses, bringing a unique blend of modernity and tradition to his designs. Tisci's work often features intricate detailing, luxurious materials, and a dark yet romantic aesthetic.","observation":"A dark, highly realistic editorial fashion style built around close-up portraits and runway scenes, with dramatic black clothing, rich animal motifs, lace, pearls, crystals, and sculptural jewelry. Strong contrast, selective highlights, shallow-looking photographic detail, and a subtle grain give the images a luxurious but severe atmosphere."},{"id":"edouard-boubat","name":"Edouard Boubat","cat":"photographers","en":"Edouard Boubat","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edouard-boubat.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edouard-boubat","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Edouard Boubat is a renowned French photographer known for his poetic and humanist approach to capturing everyday life. His work is characterized by a gentle and empathetic portrayal of people and scenes, often focusing on moments of quiet reflection and beauty in the mundane.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic black-and-white photography with strong tonal contrast, visible grain, and selective focus. Intimate, emotionally restrained portraits and small narrative moments are framed with natural window or outdoor light, giving the images a quiet, somber tension."},{"id":"rockwell-kent","name":"Rockwell Kent","cat":"painters","en":"Rockwell Kent","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rockwell-kent.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rockwell-kent","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["dark-blue","grey","light-orange","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Rockwell Kent was an American painter, printmaker, and illustrator known for his dramatic landscapes and adventure-themed works. Born in 1882, Kent's art often depicted the rugged terrains of the northern regions, capturing the essence of exploration and solitude. His work is characterized by bold compositions and a strong sense of narrative, reflecting both the beauty and harshness of nature.","observation":"The style combines strongly visible, broad painterly strokes with graphic angular shapes, crisp edges, and an illustrative sense of design. Saturated orange, blue, and violet passages are organized through stark light-dark contrasts, giving the recurring mountain and architectural scenes a luminous, monumental, almost mythic atmosphere."},{"id":"deborah-turbeville","name":"Deborah Turbeville","cat":"photographers","en":"Deborah Turbeville","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/deborah-turbeville.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/deborah-turbeville","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","silver"],"intro":"Deborah Turbeville was an influential American fashion photographer known for her ethereal and moody imagery. Her work often featured soft focus, grainy textures, and a dreamlike quality that set her apart from her contemporaries. Turbeville's photographs were characterized by their romantic and mysterious atmosphere, often capturing models in historical or decayed settings, evoking a sense of nostalgia and introspection.","observation":"The style combines softly painterly, grain-textured imagery with muted sepia tones, deep shadows, and strong window-lit contrast. Elaborate historic interiors frame solemn female figures in flowing white gowns or black dresses, creating a cinematic, fashion-editorial tableau with an eerie, dreamlike mood."},{"id":"oskar-fischinger","name":"Oskar Fischinger","cat":"various-artists","en":"Oskar Fischinger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oskar-fischinger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oskar-fischinger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","patterns","glow","fine-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-blue","dark-green","vivid-red","ochre"],"intro":"Oskar Fischinger was a German-American abstract animator, filmmaker, and painter, known for creating abstract musical animations before the advent of computer graphics. His work is characterized by its innovative use of color and form, often synchronized with music, making him a pioneer in the field of visual music.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines stark black grounds with saturated red, blue, teal, and orange geometric forms. Concentric rings, dotted matrices, spheres, and flowing light trails are rendered with crisp linework, luminous halos, flat graphic shapes, and a persistent grainy texture, creating a surreal abstract atmosphere."},{"id":"brassai","name":"Brassai","cat":"photographers","en":"Brassai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brassai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brassai","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","urban","backlighting","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white"],"intro":"Brassai is a renowned Hungarian-French photographer known for his evocative images of Paris at night. Born in 1899, he became famous for capturing the essence of the city's urban life, particularly during the interwar period. His work is celebrated for its ability to reveal the beauty and mystery of everyday scenes, often highlighting the interplay of light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep silhouettes, bright practical lights, wet reflective streets, and dense nocturnal haze. Urban figures and architectural settings are framed like dramatic film stills, with selective focus, grain, backlighting, and strongly compressed tonal contrast."},{"id":"dorina-costras","name":"Dorina Costras","cat":"painters","en":"Dorina Costras","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dorina-costras.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dorina-costras","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","dark-blue","muted-pink","deep-red","black"],"intro":"Dorina Costras is a contemporary Romanian artist known for her ethereal and dreamlike portraits that often explore themes of fantasy and introspection. Her work is characterized by a romantic and mysterious atmosphere, often featuring delicate female figures enveloped in flowing, surreal environments.","observation":"The style combines intimate portraiture with visibly built-up, directional paint strokes and richly textured surfaces. Saturated blue, red, and violet hues, flowing hair and fabric, floral adornments, and softly idealized faces create a dreamy, emotionally expressive atmosphere."},{"id":"michael-kidner","name":"Michael Kidner","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Kidner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-kidner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-kidner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","green","deep-blue","bone-white","blue","orange"],"intro":"Michael Kidner is a British artist known for his pioneering work in Op Art, a style characterized by optical illusions and visual effects. His work often explores mathematical concepts and the perception of color and form, contributing significantly to the development of kinetic and optical art movements.","observation":"The style uses saturated blocks of red, blue, green, orange, pink, and yellow arranged into repeated geometric and organic motifs. Clean-edged stripes, rounded bars, and undulating shapes are combined with subtly visible paint texture, giving the flat compositions a tactile, hand-painted surface."},{"id":"evgeni-gordiets","name":"Evgeni Gordiets","cat":"painters","en":"Evgeni Gordiets","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/evgeni-gordiets.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/evgeni-gordiets","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","glow","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","epic","geometric"],"colours":["dark-olive","dark-teal","blue","silver","muted-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Evgeni Gordiets is a contemporary artist known for his surreal and dreamlike landscapes that often blend fantasy with reality. His work is characterized by intricate details and imaginative compositions, creating a unique visual experience that captivates viewers with its otherworldly charm.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, clean-edged illustrative rendering with saturated blues, greens, oranges, and warm architectural light. Formal topiary, cypress-lined terraces, monumental stairways, and fantastical coastal settings create a dreamy, surreal, storybook grandeur across all four views."},{"id":"eudora-welty","name":"Eudora Welty","cat":"photographers","en":"Eudora Welty","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eudora-welty.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eudora-welty","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["black","grey","white","charcoal","brown","muted-brown"],"intro":"Eudora Welty was an American author and photographer known for her works of fiction set in the American South. Her writing often explored themes of community, family, and the complexities of human relationships. Welty's photographic work, although less known than her literary contributions, captured the essence of Southern life and its people during the mid-20th century.","observation":"The style uses intimate, realistic portrait photography with strong tonal contrast, subdued monochrome treatment, and visible film grain. Framing through porches, windows, and doorways creates a cinematic, observational feeling, while selective focus and natural light keep attention on the subject’s restrained expressions."},{"id":"john-ford","name":"John Ford","cat":"filmmakers","en":"John Ford","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-ford.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-ford","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-blue","brown","ochre","muted-blue","pale-orange","orange"],"intro":"John Ford was a renowned American film director, best known for his Westerns and adaptations of classic American literature. His work is characterized by its epic storytelling, strong character development, and stunning use of the American landscape. Ford's films often explore themes of heroism, community, and the American experience, making him a pivotal figure in the history of cinema.","observation":"Across the four images, recognizable figures, animals, and landscapes are rendered with visible, broad paint strokes and heavily textured surfaces. Strong warm⁠–cool color contrasts, dramatic lighting, dark silhouettes, and richly worked details give the style an expressive fantasy character."},{"id":"charles-fazzino","name":"Charles Fazzino","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Fazzino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-fazzino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-fazzino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","landscapes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","charcoal","dark-blue","dark-brown","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Charles Fazzino is a contemporary American artist known for his vibrant and detailed three-dimensional pop art. He is celebrated for his unique style that combines elements of urban landscapes and cultural landmarks, often incorporating a playful and whimsical approach to his subjects. His work is characterized by its intricate details and layered compositions, making each piece a lively depiction of city life.","observation":"The style combines densely packed, painterly city panoramas with crisp illustrative linework and highly saturated blues, reds, and greens. Circular, map-like framing and radial organisation recur throughout, while countless buildings, landmarks, waterways, boats, and stadiums create an ornate, encyclopedic urban texture."},{"id":"nick-anderson","name":"Nick Anderson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Nick Anderson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nick-anderson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nick-anderson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["silver","grey","muted-cyan","charcoal","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Nick Anderson is an illustrator known for his intricate and imaginative artwork, often exploring themes of fantasy and surrealism. His work is characterized by detailed compositions and a unique blend of traditional and digital techniques, creating a distinctive style that captivates viewers with its depth and complexity.","observation":"Across all four images, loose watercolor washes are overlaid with dense, visibly drawn pen lines, fine hatching, and rough paper texture. The subdued blue-gray palette, isolated figures, strange anthropomorphic characters, immense waste or cloud forms, and catastrophic settings create a dark, expressive fantasy-storybook mood."},{"id":"amy-giacomelli","name":"Amy Giacomelli","cat":"painters","en":"Amy Giacomelli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amy-giacomelli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amy-giacomelli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-blue","vivid-red","muted-blue","deep-red","brown","orange"],"intro":"Amy Giacomelli is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and whimsical paintings that often incorporate elements of nature and fantasy. Her work is characterized by intricate detailing and a playful use of color, creating a sense of movement and life within her compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, swirling brushwork to build richly textured skies, clouds, foliage, and ground, with expressive red-orange and blue color contrasts. Monumental autumn trees, moons, and branching silhouettes create dreamlike landscape compositions that balance detailed natural forms with deliberately stylized, patterned surfaces."},{"id":"george-birrell","name":"George Birrell","cat":"painters","en":"George Birrell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-birrell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-birrell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-blue","deep-blue","dark-blue","grey","rust","vivid-orange"],"intro":"George Birrell is a contemporary Scottish artist known for his vibrant and colorful depictions of coastal landscapes and architecture. His work often features bold color contrasts and a unique blend of realism and abstraction, capturing the essence of Scottish coastal life with a modern twist.","observation":"Across all four views, compact urban houses and rooftops are rendered with strongly geometric shapes, simplified architectural planes, and vivid blue-and-orange color contrasts. Visible brush texture, crisp outlines, and dense small architectural details combine a graphic illustrative structure with expressive painted surfaces."},{"id":"nick-walker","name":"Nick Walker","cat":"street-artists","en":"Nick Walker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nick-walker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nick-walker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","urban","motion","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","black","brown","blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"Nick Walker is a renowned British street artist known for his pioneering work in the stencil graffiti movement. Emerging from the Bristol street art scene in the 1980s, Walker's art often features playful and satirical themes, blending traditional graffiti with a unique stencil technique. His works have gained international acclaim, and he is considered a significant influence on the street art genre.","observation":"Across all four renders, bold black figures and animals are painted over weathered urban walls with forceful red and blue accents. Thick drawn contours, splatters, drips, scraped texture, and high contrast create an expressive mural-like style with a dark, kinetic mood."},{"id":"mark-grotjahn","name":"Mark Grotjahn","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Grotjahn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-grotjahn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-grotjahn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["red","bone-white","muted-orange","charcoal","light-orange"],"intro":"Mark Grotjahn is an American artist known for his abstract and geometric paintings, often characterized by bold colors and intricate patterns. His work frequently explores themes of symmetry and optical illusion, drawing inspiration from both modernist and contemporary art movements.","observation":"The style uses brightly colored geometric wedges radiating from central points, with strong bilateral or radial organization across every composition. Thick, visibly built-up paint and scraped, directional strokes give the flat graphic structures a tactile, handmade surface."},{"id":"dina-wakley","name":"Dina Wakley","cat":"painters","en":"Dina Wakley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dina-wakley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dina-wakley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage","drawing","ink"],"colours":["red","muted-orange","brown","silver","vivid-red","ochre","violet"],"intro":"Dina Wakley is an American mixed media artist known for her vibrant and expressive art style. She is celebrated for her use of bold colors and dynamic compositions, often incorporating mixed media techniques to create textured and layered artworks. Her work is characterized by its emotive quality and contemporary approach to portraiture.","observation":"The style combines expressive, painterly close-up portraits with vivid saturated color, strongly outlined facial features, and visible mixed-media marks. Geometric color blocks, collage-like overlays, ink sketching, splatters, and varied surface textures fragment the faces while retaining recognizable eyes, lips, and skin modelling."},{"id":"francis-ford-coppola","name":"Francis Ford Coppola","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Francis Ford Coppola","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francis-ford-coppola.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francis-ford-coppola","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["vivid-red","bone-white","black","beige","red","dark-red","green"],"intro":"Francis Ford Coppola is a renowned American filmmaker, best known for his work on iconic films such as \"The Godfather\" series and \"Apocalypse Now.\" His contributions to cinema have earned him numerous accolades, including multiple Academy Awards. Coppola's work is characterized by its epic storytelling, complex characters, and innovative use of cinematic techniques.","observation":"The style combines vividly saturated color with heavily worked, visibly tactile paint: broad strokes, scraping, drips, and layered marks coexist with fine gestural drawing. It repeatedly uses tightly cropped, expressive portraits and strong contrasts, balancing recognizable facial detail against fractured abstract color fields and energetic backgrounds."},{"id":"michael-wesely","name":"Michael Wesely","cat":"photographers","en":"Michael Wesely","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-wesely.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-wesely","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","mist","motion","moody-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","silver","rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"Michael Wesely is a German photographer renowned for his innovative long-exposure techniques that capture the passage of time in a single frame. His work often explores urban environments and the interplay between natural and man-made structures, creating a unique perspective on the world.","observation":"Across all four images, architectural interiors and city views are rendered with layered translucency, smeared movement, and ghostlike repetitions, giving solid spaces an unstable, dreamlike quality. The dark earthy palette, shafts of daylight, atmospheric haze, and dense architectural detail create an expressive surrealism with a persistent sense of motion."},{"id":"pierre-huyghe","name":"Pierre Huyghe","cat":"various-artists","en":"Pierre Huyghe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-huyghe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-huyghe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","dark-green","light-blue"],"intro":"Pierre Huyghe is a contemporary French artist known for his innovative and interdisciplinary approach to art. His work often explores themes of time, memory, and the relationship between humans and nature. Huyghe's installations and projects frequently incorporate living elements, such as plants and animals, creating immersive environments that challenge the boundaries between reality and fiction.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and cinematic, combining meticulously rendered natural landscapes with stark, monumental architectural interiors. Cool subdued greens and blue-greys, deep shadows, mist, reflective water, and sharply structured window grids create a quiet, mysterious atmosphere with carefully placed human figures for scale."},{"id":"sacha-goldberger","name":"Sacha Goldberger","cat":"photographers","en":"Sacha Goldberger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sacha-goldberger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sacha-goldberger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","metallic","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Sacha Goldberger is a contemporary French photographer known for his creative and humorous approach to portraiture. He often blends historical and fantastical elements to create unique visual narratives that challenge conventional boundaries.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, carefully lit character portraits against a subdued olive-brown studio backdrop. It combines richly ornate historical clothing, ruffled collars, feathers, pearls, patterned textiles and reflective armor with polished fashion-editorial composition and a dark, restrained atmosphere."},{"id":"jack-davis","name":"Jack Davis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jack Davis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-davis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-davis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Jack Davis was an American cartoonist and illustrator, renowned for his work with MAD Magazine and his distinctive style that combined humor with exaggerated caricatures. His illustrations often featured bold lines, dynamic compositions, and a satirical take on American culture, making him a significant figure in the world of comic art.","observation":"The style is a densely packed, painterly character tableau built from expressive grotesque faces, exaggerated anatomy, heavy ink contours, and visible directional brushwork. Saturated reds, ochres, greens, and blacks create strong contrast, while ornamental costume details, bones, ravens, papers, and smoking figures give the imagery a fantastical, macabre storybook quality."},{"id":"philip-toledano","name":"Philip Toledano","cat":"various-artists","en":"Philip Toledano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philip-toledano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philip-toledano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","dark-blue","grey","dark-cyan"],"intro":"Philip Toledano is a contemporary artist known for his evocative and thought-provoking photography. His work often explores themes of identity, memory, and the human condition, using a blend of conceptual and fine art photography to challenge viewers' perceptions and emotions.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely resolved portraiture with pale subjects, tactile skin, hair, and crumpled white fabric against dark teal surroundings. Controlled cinematic lighting, selective focus, and restrained composition create a somber, theatrical atmosphere across both intimate close-ups and staged figure scenes."},{"id":"okuda-san-miguel","name":"Okuda San Miguel","cat":"painters","en":"Okuda San Miguel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/okuda-san-miguel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/okuda-san-miguel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","red","white","blue","ochre","green"],"intro":"Okuda San Miguel is a contemporary Spanish artist known for his vibrant and geometric style. His work often features bold colors and surreal compositions, blending elements of pop art and street culture. He is recognized for transforming public spaces with his large-scale murals and installations.","observation":"Across all four views, monumental building facades are covered with vivid, saturated geometric murals depicting expressive faces, hands, and figures. The style uses sharply faceted planes, bold graphic contours, and clean color blocks, integrating the imagery with windows, balconies, and other urban architecture."},{"id":"clive-barker","name":"Clive Barker","cat":"painters","en":"Clive Barker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clive-barker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clive-barker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-blue","orange","beige","red"],"intro":"Clive Barker is a renowned English author, film director, and visual artist known for his works in horror and fantasy genres. He gained fame with his \"Books of Blood\" series and the \"Hellraiser\" film franchise, which he directed. Barker's artistic endeavors extend beyond writing and filmmaking, as he is also an accomplished painter, often exploring dark and fantastical themes in his visual art.","observation":"Across all four renders, distorted faces and figures emerge from dense, visibly built-up paint, with broad directional strokes, scratches, and forceful red marks. Deep blue-black shadows oppose saturated orange, red, and pale highlights, producing an anxious, confrontational mood with surreal facial distortions and heavily worked surfaces."},{"id":"kerry-james-marshall","name":"Kerry James Marshall","cat":"painters","en":"Kerry James Marshall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kerry-james-marshall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kerry-james-marshall","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","brown","orange","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Kerry James Marshall is an influential American artist known for his work exploring African American culture and history. Born in 1955, Marshall's art often addresses themes of identity, race, and the African American experience. His paintings are celebrated for their vivid color, intricate detail, and powerful storytelling, making him a significant figure in contemporary art.","observation":"The style combines richly visible painted texture with crisp illustrative contours, dense ornamental patterning, and strongly saturated botanical color. Formal portraits and fashionably dressed figures are embedded in luxuriant floral interiors and gardens, with deep blacks, bright reds and blues, and surreal, densely layered arrangements creating a theatrical effect."},{"id":"mort-kunstler","name":"Mort Kunstler","cat":"painters","en":"Mort Kunstler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mort-kunstler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mort-kunstler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","dark-brown","silver","orange"],"intro":"Mort Kunstler is an American artist renowned for his historical paintings, particularly those depicting the American Civil War and the Old West. His works are celebrated for their meticulous attention to detail, historical accuracy, and ability to capture the drama and emotion of pivotal moments in American history.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from visible, directional brushwork and richly layered, highly detailed scenes with strong darks, fiery highlights, and a somber atmosphere. Characters, horses, fire, water, and weather are arranged as dramatic narrative moments, giving the images an epic, dynamic fantasy-adventure quality."},{"id":"rick-amor","name":"Rick Amor","cat":"painters","en":"Rick Amor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rick-amor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rick-amor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","light-yellow","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Rick Amor is an Australian contemporary artist known for his evocative and atmospheric paintings that often explore themes of isolation and urban landscapes. His work is characterized by a moody and introspective quality, often depicting solitary figures and deserted environments that evoke a sense of melancholy and contemplation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured, painterly surfaces with cinematic framing and strongly controlled shadows. Restrained amber, brown, and blue-green color schemes, monumental architecture, trees, and deep atmospheric skies create brooding urban and landscape scenes with a dark, nostalgic sense of place."},{"id":"blek-le-rat","name":"Blek le Rat","cat":"street-artists","en":"Blek le Rat","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/blek-le-rat.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/blek-le-rat","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","black","muted-cyan","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Blek le Rat is a pioneering French street artist, often credited as one of the originators of stencil graffiti. Emerging in the 1980s, his work has been influential in shaping the street art movement, blending social commentary with striking visual imagery. Known for his distinctive style, Blek le Rat's art often features rats, which he uses as a symbol of freedom and resistance.","observation":"Across all four panels, recognizable human figures are rendered as forceful black stencil-like silhouettes and graphic painted shapes against weathered urban walls. The style combines stark contrast, limited muted grounds, rough ink-like edges, splatters, drips, and distressed surface texture with energetic poses and poster-like flat color."},{"id":"caras-ionut","name":"Caras Ionut","cat":"various-artists","en":"Caras Ionut","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/caras-ionut.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/caras-ionut","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","grey","silver","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Caras Ionut is a Romanian digital artist known for his surreal and fantastical photo manipulations. He creates dreamlike landscapes that blend reality with imagination, often featuring solitary figures in mysterious and whimsical settings.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, built around solitary figures moving through bleak landscapes and abandoned urban spaces. Moody teal-and-orange color grading, strong tonal contrast, atmospheric haze, selective focus, and dramatic skies give the scenes an expressive, dreamlike sense of isolation."},{"id":"jane-newland","name":"Jane Newland","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jane Newland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jane-newland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jane-newland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","floral","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-green","muted-blue","ochre","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Jane Newland is an illustrator known for her enchanting and whimsical landscapes that often feature intricate details and a vivid color palette. Her work is characterized by a dreamy and fantasy-like quality, often depicting serene and imaginative scenes.","observation":"These images combine dense, hand-painted botanical detail with fine linear marks, layered foliage, and highly saturated coral, teal, blue, and pink hues. Woodland animals and fantastical landscapes sit within richly patterned flowers, luminous specks, unusual vegetation, and dreamlike twilight settings."},{"id":"kelly-mckernan","name":"Kelly McKernan","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kelly McKernan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kelly-mckernan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kelly-mckernan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","dark-red","bone-white","beige","brown"],"intro":"Kelly McKernan is an American artist known for her vibrant and ethereal illustrations, often blending elements of surrealism and fantasy. Her work frequently explores themes of nature, femininity, and introspection, characterized by intricate details and a dreamlike quality.","observation":"The style combines densely detailed, painterly portraiture with fine illustrative linework and an ornate web of hair, feathers, animals, branches, and patterned fabric. Earthy reds, charcoal blacks, bone whites, and muted greens create an expressive, darkly romantic fantasy atmosphere, while tightly cropped faces and overlapping forms make the compositions feel richly interwoven."},{"id":"jean-tinguely","name":"Jean Tinguely","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jean Tinguely","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-tinguely.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-tinguely","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","patterns","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["white","silver","beige","black","brown","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Jean Tinguely was a Swiss sculptor known for his kinetic art and sculptural machines. He was a prominent figure in the Dada movement and is celebrated for his playful and mechanical creations that often incorporated found objects and industrial materials. Tinguely's work challenged traditional notions of art by introducing motion and sound, creating dynamic pieces that engaged viewers in unique ways.","observation":"The style depicts monumental mechanical figures assembled from dense networks of salvaged parts, wheels, gears, wires, pipes, and metal fragments. Fine linear frameworks and intricate object detail dominate, with sculptural volume presented in bright gallery interiors and restrained industrial colors punctuated by red and blue."},{"id":"emily-kame-kngwarreye","name":"Emily Kame Kngwarreye","cat":"painters","en":"Emily Kame Kngwarreye","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emily-kame-kngwarreye.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emily-kame-kngwarreye","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","vivid-red","pale-red"],"intro":"Emily Kame Kngwarreye was an influential Indigenous Australian artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings that often depicted the natural environment and cultural stories of her people. Her work is celebrated for its bold use of color and abstract forms, reflecting the landscapes and spiritual narratives of her heritage.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses dense floral repetition and radial petal structures rendered with clearly visible, layered brushstrokes. Saturated reds, corals, and pinks dominate, shifting between recognizable flower heads and looser abstract fields while retaining a tactile painted surface."},{"id":"charles-blackman","name":"Charles Blackman","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Blackman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-blackman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-blackman","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","dark-blue","dark-red","silver","vivid-red"],"intro":"Charles Blackman is an Australian painter known for his distinctive style that blends elements of surrealism and expressionism. Born in Sydney in 1928, Blackman became a prominent figure in the Australian art scene during the mid-20th century. His work often explores themes of childhood, dreams, and the subconscious, characterized by a unique use of color and form. Blackman's paintings are celebrated for their emotional depth and imaginative compositions, making him a significant contributor to modern Australian art.","observation":"Across all four renders, stylized figures and portraits are built from elongated forms, obscured faces, broad hat shapes, and strongly graphic clothing silhouettes. Saturated reds and teals sit against deep dark passages, while visible brush texture and fine facial and garment marks give the flat, poster-like compositions a moody, expressive character."},{"id":"edouard-manet","name":"Edouard Manet","cat":"painters","en":"Edouard Manet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edouard-manet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edouard-manet","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","charcoal","beige","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Edouard Manet is a renowned French painter who played a pivotal role in the transition from Realism to Impressionism. Known for his innovative approach to modern life subjects, Manet's works often depicted contemporary scenes with a unique blend of realism and impressionistic techniques. His bold brushwork and use of light and shadow were groundbreaking, influencing many artists of his time and beyond.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses visible, confident paint strokes to model faces, clothing, feathers, flowers, and interior details. Restrained greens, creams, grays, and blacks create an elegant, subdued palette, while expressive brushwork and cropped figure-centered compositions emphasize fashionable hats and richly textured garments."},{"id":"loomis-dean","name":"Loomis Dean","cat":"photographers","en":"Loomis Dean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/loomis-dean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/loomis-dean","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Loomis Dean was an American photographer known for his work with LIFE magazine, capturing iconic images of celebrities, historical events, and cultural moments throughout the mid-20th century. His photography often combined a documentary approach with a keen eye for composition and storytelling, making his work both informative and visually compelling.","observation":"A monochrome photographic style built around strong tonal contrast, hard directional light, and dramatic framing. It combines candid character studies with cinematic narrative moments, vintage clothing and settings, selective focus, and a lightly grainy documentary texture."},{"id":"alan-kenny","name":"Alan Kenny","cat":"painters","en":"Alan Kenny","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-kenny.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-kenny","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","deep-blue","deep-red","black","beige","red","light-lime"],"intro":"Alan Kenny is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and imaginative works that blend elements of surrealism and abstraction. His real-life counterpart is celebrated for exploring themes of identity and perception through bold, geometric compositions and vivid color palettes.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines highly saturated red, blue, orange, and pink with sharply organized geometric color blocks. Faces and garments are simplified into angular, sculptural forms with clean graphic edges, while fine surface texture and delicate painted patterning keep the otherwise flat illustrative shapes tactile."},{"id":"philip-mckay","name":"Philip McKay","cat":"photographers","en":"Philip McKay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philip-mckay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philip-mckay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","white"],"intro":"Philip McKay is a contemporary photographer known for his surreal and conceptual imagery. His work often explores themes of solitude, introspection, and the human condition, using digital manipulation to create dreamlike landscapes that challenge perceptions of reality.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic seascapes are framed like moody film stills, with solitary figures and stark architectural objects set against immense, storm-laden skies. Desaturated blue-gray tones, strong light-dark separation, atmospheric haze, reflective water, and isolated warm light create a bleak yet surreal sense of scale and mystery."},{"id":"gary-baseman","name":"Gary Baseman","cat":"illustrators","en":"Gary Baseman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gary-baseman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gary-baseman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","orange","black","muted-brown","grey","red"],"intro":"Gary Baseman is an American artist known for his distinctive style that blends pop culture, surrealism, and whimsical storytelling. His work spans various mediums, including illustration, painting, and animation, often featuring playful yet dark themes. Baseman's art is characterized by its unique blend of humor and fantasy, with influences from both traditional and contemporary art forms.","observation":"Across the sheet, the style combines vividly colored, roughly brushed paintings with bold graphic outlines and deliberately flattened forms. Repeated animal-like characters, oversized eyes, teeth, costumes, and ornamental motifs create a fantastical, surreal, slightly grotesque visual language."},{"id":"thomas-dewing","name":"Thomas Dewing","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Dewing","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-dewing.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-dewing","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-ochre","ochre","muted-olive","bone-white"],"intro":"Thomas Dewing is an American painter known for his ethereal and tonal portraits, often depicting elegant women in dreamlike settings. His work is characterized by a delicate use of color and a focus on mood and atmosphere, contributing to the American Impressionism and Tonalism movements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the scenes are rendered with visible, loose painterly strokes, softly blended edges, and a richly textured surface. Dark, warm interiors and subdued colors heighten the expressive movement of elegantly dressed figures, while flowing skirts and gestures give the compositions a theatrical sense of motion."},{"id":"jean-paul-gaultier","name":"Jean Paul Gaultier","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Jean Paul Gaultier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-paul-gaultier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-paul-gaultier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","black","dark-brown","pale-orange","blue","rust"],"intro":"Jean Paul Gaultier is a renowned French fashion designer known for his avant-garde and innovative designs. He gained fame for his unique approach to fashion, often blending different cultural elements and challenging traditional norms. Gaultier's work includes iconic pieces such as the cone bra worn by Madonna and his sailor-inspired collections, which have left a lasting impact on the fashion industry.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, sculptural couture figures in grand museum-like interiors, with elaborate textures, exaggerated silhouettes, and ornate headpieces or architectural props. Cinematic lighting, selective focus, reflective surfaces, and dark atmospheric tones give the scenes a theatrical fashion-exhibition quality."},{"id":"bruno-walpoth","name":"Bruno Walpoth","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Bruno Walpoth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruno-walpoth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruno-walpoth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["beige","silver","brown","black"],"intro":"Bruno Walpoth is an Italian sculptor known for his realistic wooden sculptures that capture the human form with remarkable detail and emotion. His work often explores themes of introspection and solitude, using wood as his primary medium to create lifelike figures that evoke a sense of calm and contemplation.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, close-cropped portraits with faces, hair, skin, and draped garments rendered as tactile, dimensional surfaces. Subdued beige, ivory, and olive tones, soft diffused lighting, fine hair detail, and classical sculptural posing create an austere, refined editorial look."},{"id":"mark-demsteader","name":"Mark Demsteader","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Demsteader","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-demsteader.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-demsteader","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["portraits","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","cream","charcoal","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Mark Demsteader is a contemporary British artist known for his evocative and expressive portraiture. His work often features detailed and moody representations of female figures, capturing emotional depth and introspection through his unique use of light and shadow.","observation":"The style combines subdued, moody portraiture with visible brushwork, sketch-like fine lines, and rough gestural marks that partially dissolve the figures into the background. Cropped faces, turned profiles, dark clothing, pale skin, and unruly hair create an introspective, melancholic mood, while the distorted poses and fragmented treatment add a subtly surreal quality."},{"id":"zaria-forman","name":"Zaria Forman","cat":"painters","en":"Zaria Forman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zaria-forman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zaria-forman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","motion","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["muted-cyan","dark-cyan","light-blue","white"],"intro":"Zaria Forman is an American artist known for her large-scale pastel drawings that capture the beauty and fragility of the natural world, particularly focusing on polar and oceanic landscapes. Her work often addresses themes of climate change and environmental preservation, using art to inspire awareness and action.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly rendering to build turbulent water, curling foam, windblown fabric, and fractured ice in dense layers of visible detail. A restrained blue-white palette, dramatic movement, and expansive maritime settings create an epic, dreamlike sense of danger and isolation."},{"id":"paul-serusier","name":"Paul Serusier","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Serusier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-serusier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-serusier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","brown","charcoal","beige","rust"],"intro":"Paul Serusier was a French painter and a key figure in the Post-Impressionist movement. He is best known for his involvement with the Nabis group, which emphasized the symbolic and spiritual aspects of art. Serusier's work often explored themes of nature and spirituality, and he played a significant role in the development of modern art in the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to depict landscaped nature, village settings, and leisurely human activity with carefully arranged compositions. Deep greens and blues are balanced by autumnal oranges and reds, while strong light-dark contrasts and finely observed details give the scenes a quietly dramatic, expressive character."},{"id":"julie-arkell","name":"Julie Arkell","cat":"various-artists","en":"Julie Arkell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julie-arkell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julie-arkell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","ochre","brown","beige","deep-red","black"],"intro":"Julie Arkell is a renowned British artist known for her whimsical and handcrafted creations, often blending elements of folk art with contemporary themes. Her work typically involves mixed media, including papier-mâché, textiles, and found objects, creating unique and playful pieces that evoke a sense of nostalgia and innocence.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely textured, hand-worked doll forms with softly painted faces, visible fibers, seams, buttons, and worn surfaces. Muted earthy colors are punctuated by red textile accents, while elongated features, oversized eyes, and uncanny expressions give the portraits a distinctly surreal, expressive character."},{"id":"giambattista-valli","name":"Giambattista Valli","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Giambattista Valli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giambattista-valli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giambattista-valli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","negative-space"],"colours":["white","red","pale-pink","deep-red","brown"],"intro":"Giambattista Valli is an Italian fashion designer known for his luxurious and feminine haute couture collections. He established his own label in 2005 and quickly gained recognition for his romantic and opulent designs that often feature intricate detailing and voluminous silhouettes.","observation":"The style combines fashion-editorial portraiture with visibly painted, gestural brushwork, especially in the voluminous ruffles, feathers, and layered gowns. Saturated pinks and reds stand out against spacious pale backgrounds, while elegant elongated figures and carefully arranged couture silhouettes give the images a refined yet fantastical quality."},{"id":"ludwig-mies-van-der-rohe","name":"Ludwig Mies van der Rohe","cat":"architects","en":"Ludwig Mies van der Rohe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ludwig-mies-van-der-rohe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ludwig-mies-van-der-rohe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","white","charcoal","grey","brown","muted-brown"],"intro":"Ludwig Mies van der Rohe was a pioneering German-American architect known for his role in the development of modern architecture. He was a leading figure in the Bauhaus movement and the International Style, emphasizing simplicity and clarity in design. His work is characterized by the use of modern materials such as steel and glass, and he is renowned for his minimalist approach that focuses on open spaces and functional design.","observation":"The style presents modern glass-and-steel architecture with highly realistic, carefully composed photographic views, emphasizing rectilinear grids, reflections, and strong perspective. Subdued autumnal color, warm low sunlight, deep shadows, and occasional haze create a cinematic, contemplative atmosphere across both interior and exterior scenes."},{"id":"jessie-willcox-smith","name":"Jessie Willcox Smith","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jessie Willcox Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jessie-willcox-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jessie-willcox-smith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["black","beige","dark-ochre","charcoal","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Jessie Willcox Smith was an American illustrator renowned for her work during the Golden Age of Illustration. She is best known for her depictions of children and domestic scenes, often published in magazines and children's books in the early 20th century. Her style is characterized by its gentle, tender portrayal of childhood innocence and family life, often using soft, pastel colors and delicate brushwork.","observation":"Across the sheet, intimate scenes of children, families, and animals are rendered with visible, finely controlled brushwork and richly textured surfaces. Muted blue, cream, green, and coral tones, abundant flowers, patterned fabrics, and close, crowded arrangements create a gentle, nostalgic, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"hermann-nitsch","name":"Hermann Nitsch","cat":"various-artists","en":"Hermann Nitsch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hermann-nitsch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hermann-nitsch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["deep-red","dark-red","red","bone-white"],"intro":"Hermann Nitsch is an Austrian artist known for his controversial and provocative works that often involve performance art, painting, and multimedia installations. He is a key figure in the Viennese Actionism movement, which emerged in the 1960s and is characterized by its radical approach to art-making, often involving bodily fluids and ritualistic performances.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is intensely abstract and expressive, built from saturated crimson paint against stark white interruptions. Broad gestural strokes, scraped and built-up pigment, ink-like lines, splatters, and long vertical drips create a raw, high-contrast surface with surreal, nonrepresentational energy."},{"id":"man-ray","name":"Man Ray","cat":"photographers","en":"Man Ray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/man-ray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/man-ray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","black"],"intro":"Man Ray was an American visual artist who spent most of his career in Paris. He was a significant contributor to the Dada and Surrealist movements, known for his innovative photographic techniques, including solarization and rayographs. His work often explored themes of identity, abstraction, and the unconscious, making him a pivotal figure in 20th-century art.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped, monochrome photographic portraits with stark lighting, deep shadows, and prominent grain. Eyes, lips, fingers, and graphic objects are arranged as surreal facial fragments, with heavy dark contours and emphatic makeup details creating an unsettling editorial mood."},{"id":"michael-eastman","name":"Michael Eastman","cat":"photographers","en":"Michael Eastman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-eastman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-eastman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","dark","epic"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-green","black","brown","silver"],"intro":"Michael Eastman is an American photographer known for his large-scale images of architecture and interiors, capturing the essence of urban decay and historical spaces. His work often explores the intersection of time and space, revealing the beauty in deterioration and the stories embedded in walls and furniture.","observation":"The style presents vast, decaying mansion interiors with highly realistic architectural detail, elaborate ornament, aged surfaces, and imposing arches, staircases, chandeliers, and furnishings. A restrained green-heavy palette, deep shadows, and selective window or chandelier light create a dark, haunting grandeur with a subtly uncanny atmosphere."},{"id":"eduardo-kobra","name":"Eduardo Kobra","cat":"street-artists","en":"Eduardo Kobra","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eduardo-kobra.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eduardo-kobra","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","portraits","scenes","urban","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","dark-red","orange","light-blue","red"],"intro":"Eduardo Kobra is a renowned Brazilian street artist known for his vibrant and colorful murals that often depict famous figures and cultural icons. His work is characterized by a unique blend of realism and abstraction, using bold colors and geometric patterns to create striking visual effects. Kobra's murals can be found in cities around the world, where they add a splash of color and creativity to urban landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental urban murals cover building facades with vivid, saturated color and fractured geometric planes. Large expressive human portraits recur within the city streetscape, combining flat graphic color blocks with painterly surface texture and dramatic scale."},{"id":"jim-burns","name":"Jim Burns","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jim Burns","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-burns.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-burns","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","blue","grey","charcoal","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Jim Burns is a renowned British illustrator known for his work in the science fiction and fantasy genres. He has contributed to numerous book covers, bringing to life the imaginative worlds of various authors. His style is characterized by meticulous detail and a vivid portrayal of futuristic and fantastical themes.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, realistic-looking science-fiction imagery with monumental fantasy spectacle: elaborate biomechanical machines, imposing figures, alien forms, deserts, moons, and towering cloud banks. Saturated blue, orange, and purple hues, strong light-dark separation, dramatic low-angle compositions, and action-oriented framing give the images a grand cinematic quality."},{"id":"mike-dargas","name":"Mike Dargas","cat":"painters","en":"Mike Dargas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-dargas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-dargas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","beige","muted-ochre","brown","silver","dark-brown"],"intro":"Mike Dargas is a contemporary German artist known for his hyperrealistic paintings that explore human emotion and introspection. His work often features close-up portraits with a focus on facial expressions, capturing intricate details with a painterly approach. Dargas's art is celebrated for its technical precision and emotional depth, drawing inspiration from both classical and modern influences.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, visibly textured paint to render extreme close-up portraits with expressive faces and tactile materials. Muted flesh, beige, white, and charcoal tones are pushed by strong light-dark contrasts, while surreal coverings and reflective surfaces create a dark, unsettling atmosphere."},{"id":"rimel-neffati","name":"Rimel Neffati","cat":"photographers","en":"Rimel Neffati","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rimel-neffati.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rimel-neffati","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","grain","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","beige","red"],"intro":"Rimel Neffati is a contemporary photographer known for her evocative and surreal imagery, often exploring themes of identity and emotion. Her work frequently features dreamlike compositions and a distinctive use of color and texture, making her a notable figure in modern photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dark, subdued green-gray tones punctuated by vivid red flowers and accents, with strong shadowed modelling around pale faces. Painterly, grainy surface texture, soft focus, and expressive distortions give the portraits a brooding, dreamlike, slightly surreal character."},{"id":"peter-basch","name":"Peter Basch","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Basch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-basch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-basch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Peter Basch was a renowned American photographer known for his portrait and glamour photography during the mid-20th century. He gained prominence for capturing celebrities and models in intimate and elegant settings, often working with major magazines and publications of his time. His work is characterized by a sophisticated and polished aesthetic, reflecting the glamour and allure of Hollywood's golden age.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white portrait photography with hard directional light, deep shadows, bright highlights, and visible skin and hair texture. Tightly cropped faces overlap in an intimate, graphic collage, with selective focus and grain reinforcing a cinematic, intense mood."},{"id":"mel-bochner","name":"Mel Bochner","cat":"various-artists","en":"Mel Bochner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mel-bochner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mel-bochner","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","ornate","letters","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","vivid-red","orange","dark-brown","muted-teal","dark-blue","green"],"intro":"Mel Bochner is an American conceptual artist known for his pioneering work in the use of language in visual art. Born in 1940, Bochner's art often explores the boundaries between language and visual representation, making significant contributions to the development of conceptual art in the 1960s and 1970s.","observation":"Across all four renders, oversized letters and numbers form dense abstract compositions built from grids, overlaps, and repeated motifs. Saturated blocks of red, teal, orange, blue, green, and yellow are distressed with visible brush marks, scraping, drips, and layered semi-transparent paint, giving the clean geometric forms a heavily worked surface."},{"id":"jamini-roy","name":"Jamini Roy","cat":"painters","en":"Jamini Roy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jamini-roy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jamini-roy","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","patterns","bold-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","religious","drawing","ink","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","light-orange","orange","vivid-red","dark-red"],"intro":"Jamini Roy was an Indian painter, born in 1887, known for his unique style that combined traditional Indian folk art with modernist influences. He was a prominent figure in the Bengal School of Art and is celebrated for his vibrant depictions of rural life and mythological themes, often using bold lines and flat colors.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines heavily outlined, graphic figures with visible paint texture and a richly decorated surface. Saturated red, black, ochre, cream, and blue organize flattened faces, patterned garments, geometric borders, and symbolic floral or Egyptian-inspired motifs."},{"id":"albert-lynch","name":"Albert Lynch","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Lynch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-lynch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-lynch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","bone-white","black","muted-ochre","deep-red","dark-red"],"intro":"Albert Lynch was a Peruvian painter known for his elegant and romantic portraits, often depicting women in the Belle Époque style. His works are characterized by their delicate brushwork, soft color palettes, and a focus on feminine beauty and grace. Lynch's paintings often reflect the fashion and cultural ideals of the late 19th and early 20th centuries, capturing the essence of an era marked by elegance and refinement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly layered, visible brushwork to create elegant female portrait studies with softly modeled faces, lustrous fabric, and carefully articulated hair. Warm russet, cream, olive, and brown tones create a subdued, slightly moody palette, while lace, feathers, hats, and flowing garments add ornamental detail and a refined classical fashion mood."},{"id":"edward-julius-detmold","name":"Edward Julius Detmold","cat":"illustrators","en":"Edward Julius Detmold","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-julius-detmold.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-julius-detmold","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-olive","muted-ochre","dark-brown","pale-yellow","red"],"intro":"Edward Julius Detmold was an English illustrator known for his detailed and imaginative depictions of animals and nature. Born in 1883, he gained recognition during the Golden Age of Illustration, often working alongside his twin brother, Charles Maurice Detmold. His work is characterized by intricate line work and a deep appreciation for the natural world, drawing inspiration from Art Nouveau and Japanese art.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visible brushwork with densely populated botanical and animal imagery, using earthy greens, reds, creams, and dark blues. Ornamental natural forms, theatrical figures, and fantastical woodland tableaux are rendered with fine detail and expressive, flowing strokes."},{"id":"fern-isabel-coppedge","name":"Fern Isabel Coppedge","cat":"painters","en":"Fern Isabel Coppedge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fern-isabel-coppedge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fern-isabel-coppedge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","muted-ochre","pale-orange","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Fern Isabel Coppedge was an American painter known for her vibrant landscapes and association with the Pennsylvania Impressionist movement. Born in 1883, she became a prominent figure in the New Hope School, capturing the beauty of rural American life with her distinctive use of color and form.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses visibly broad, directional paint strokes to describe richly detailed neighborhoods and surrounding landscapes. Saturated seasonal colors, strong light-dark contrasts, and graphic architectural silhouettes give the scenes an expressive, nostalgic illustrative character."},{"id":"stanley-greene","name":"Stanley Greene","cat":"photographers","en":"Stanley Greene","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stanley-greene.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stanley-greene","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","scenes","urban","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Stanley Greene was an American photojournalist known for his compelling and often stark black-and-white images that captured the human condition in conflict zones around the world. His work is characterized by a deep emotional resonance and a focus on the stories of individuals caught in the midst of turmoil and change. Greene's photography often explores themes of war, displacement, and resilience, making him a significant figure in contemporary photojournalism.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses stark black-and-white documentary photography with heavy grain, deep shadows, and intense tonal contrast. Solitary figures move through smoke, fire, and devastated urban spaces, creating a bleak cinematic atmosphere with distressed textures and dramatic, observational compositions."},{"id":"simone-rocha","name":"Simone Rocha","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Simone Rocha","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/simone-rocha.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/simone-rocha","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","black","brown","dark-brown","muted-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Simone Rocha is a renowned fashion designer known for her romantic and feminine designs, often incorporating intricate lacework, embroidery, and floral motifs. Born in Dublin, Ireland, she is celebrated for her unique approach to contemporary fashion, blending traditional craftsmanship with modern aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic fashion-editorial portraits and runway scenes, with elaborate lace, ruffles, appliqués, voluminous sleeves, and sculptural silhouettes rendered in fine photographic detail. Warm chandelier light, dark ornate interiors, selective focus, and restrained cream, blush, red, and black tones create a luxurious, moody cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"joel-peter-witkin","name":"Joel-Peter Witkin","cat":"photographers","en":"Joel-Peter Witkin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joel-peter-witkin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joel-peter-witkin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","dark"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Joel-Peter Witkin is an American photographer known for his provocative and often controversial images that explore themes of death, sexuality, and the grotesque. His work is characterized by its surreal and macabre style, often incorporating elements of classical art and religious iconography. Witkin's photography frequently challenges societal norms and pushes the boundaries of conventional beauty, making him a distinctive figure in contemporary art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly detailed, theatrical portrait tableaux populated by costumed human and animal figures, elaborate headpieces, feathers, flowers, and props. Monochrome sepia toning, strong chiaroscuro, shallow studio-like backdrops, and visible photographic grain create an antique, somber, staged appearance."},{"id":"marianna-rothen","name":"Marianna Rothen","cat":"photographers","en":"Marianna Rothen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marianna-rothen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marianna-rothen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","bone-white","muted-orange","grey"],"intro":"Marianna Rothen is a contemporary photographer known for her evocative and cinematic imagery. Her work often explores themes of femininity, nostalgia, and the surreal, capturing moments that feel both intimate and distant.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses softly focused photographic portraiture with warm, muted, slightly darkened color and visible analog-film texture. Lace clothing, flowing hair, flowers, and overgrown greenery create a romantic pastoral atmosphere, while layered or dreamlike compositions and selective focus give the scenes a surreal, cinematic quality."},{"id":"jean-gabriel-domergue","name":"Jean-Gabriel Domergue","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Gabriel Domergue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-gabriel-domergue.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-gabriel-domergue","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","black","light-orange","bone-white","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Jean-Gabriel Domergue was a French painter known for his portraits of fashionable Parisian women. He is often credited with creating the pin-up style and was a prominent figure in the art world during the early to mid-20th century.","observation":"Across all four portraits, visible directional brushwork and softly built-up paint create a polished yet expressive painterly surface. The style emphasizes glamorous close-up fashion poses, dramatic makeup, hats, jewelry, and richly saturated pink, blue, red, and cream accents."},{"id":"elger-esser","name":"Elger Esser","cat":"photographers","en":"Elger Esser","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elger-esser.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elger-esser","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","mist","motion","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["black","muted-cyan","charcoal","grey","silver","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Elger Esser is a contemporary German photographer known for his serene and expansive landscape photography. His work often captures the tranquil beauty of nature, drawing inspiration from 19th-century romanticism and pictorialism. Esser's photographs are characterized by their soft focus, muted color palettes, and a sense of timelessness, often evoking a dreamlike quality.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses painterly, atmospheric landscapes with visible textured brushwork, subdued earthy colors, and heavy mist or haze. Solitary human or animal figures are placed against expansive negative space, with dramatic backlighting, reflective water, and distant forms creating a dark, dreamy, quietly epic mood."},{"id":"jeff-koons","name":"Jeff Koons","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jeff Koons","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeff-koons.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeff-koons","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","floral","still-life","metallic","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","vivid-red","ochre","dark-cyan","red"],"intro":"Jeff Koons is an American artist known for his work in the neo-pop art movement. He gained fame for his large-scale, highly polished sculptures that often incorporate themes of consumerism and popular culture. Koons's art challenges traditional boundaries between high art and kitsch, using everyday objects and transforming them into monumental works.","observation":"The style presents colorful, highly polished sculptural objects in clean contemporary gallery settings. Inflated foil-like forms, reflective metallic surfaces, saturated colors, and abundant small surface details give the still lifes a glossy, dimensional character."},{"id":"chaim-soutine","name":"Chaim Soutine","cat":"painters","en":"Chaim Soutine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chaim-soutine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chaim-soutine","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","orange","vivid-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Chaim Soutine was a Belarusian-born French painter known for his expressionist works characterized by bold colors and dynamic brushstrokes. He was part of the École de Paris and is celebrated for his intense and emotional depictions of landscapes, still lifes, and portraits. His work often reflects a deep psychological insight and a unique approach to form and color.","observation":"Across all four portraits, thick, directional brushstrokes build faces, hair, clothing, and backgrounds into a visibly textured painted surface. Saturated reds, oranges, deep blues, and greens heighten the expressive, psychologically tense mood, while heavy dark marks and angular distortions give the close-up figures a forceful presence."},{"id":"jimmy-choo","name":"Jimmy Choo","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Jimmy Choo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jimmy-choo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jimmy-choo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","still-life","glow","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","metallic","vivid-colors"],"colours":["white","dark-brown","orange","muted-brown","grey"],"intro":"Jimmy Choo is a renowned fashion designer known for his high-end women's shoes. Born in Malaysia, he co-founded Jimmy Choo Ltd, which became famous for its handmade women's shoes. His designs are celebrated for their elegance, quality, and craftsmanship, often seen on celebrities and in high fashion circles.","observation":"The style presents luxury footwear as highly realistic, meticulously detailed product imagery, emphasizing ornate materials such as zebra-patterned fur, crystals, glitter, and transparent sculptural elements. Clean studio compositions alternate between bright high-key settings and warm, dramatic directional light, with reflective surfaces, sharp silhouettes, and selective background softness creating a polished fashion-editorial finish."},{"id":"cai-guo-qiang","name":"Cai Guo-Qiang","cat":"various-artists","en":"Cai Guo-Qiang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cai-guo-qiang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cai-guo-qiang","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","beige","dark-brown","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Cai Guo-Qiang is a contemporary Chinese artist known for his innovative use of gunpowder and explosives in art. He gained international recognition for his large-scale installations and performances, often exploring themes of nature, culture, and transformation. Cai's work is characterized by its dynamic energy and the dramatic interplay of destruction and creation.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive gallery-like environments contain monumental, dreamlike formations of smoke, clouds, vegetation, birds, and fire. The style combines visibly blended, fine painterly marks with subdued earth tones, reflective surfaces, atmospheric depth, and cinematic scale, making small human figures appear dwarfed by the swirling installations."},{"id":"noah-bradley","name":"Noah Bradley","cat":"illustrators","en":"Noah Bradley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/noah-bradley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/noah-bradley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","brown","orange","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Noah Bradley is a contemporary digital artist known for his work in the fantasy genre. He has contributed to various projects, including concept art for games and illustrations for books. His style often features expansive landscapes and intricate details, capturing the imagination with vivid and immersive scenes.","observation":"These images use richly painterly, textured rendering to build immense volcanic landscapes, with dense cloud formations, rugged terrain, and tiny figures that emphasize monumental scale. Saturated orange firelight contrasts with deep blue shadows, while internal illumination from lava, suns, and glowing horizons creates an epic, fantastical atmosphere across all four views."},{"id":"franz-sedlacek","name":"Franz Sedlacek","cat":"painters","en":"Franz Sedlacek","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/franz-sedlacek.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/franz-sedlacek","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","dark-ochre","beige","muted-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Franz Sedlacek was an Austrian painter known for his surreal and fantastical works that often explored themes of mystery and the uncanny. His art frequently depicted otherworldly landscapes and enigmatic scenes, blending elements of fantasy with a dark, moody atmosphere. Sedlacek's work is characterized by meticulous detail and a unique ability to evoke a sense of wonder and contemplation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured, painterly landscapes with dramatic natural forms, monumental ruins, and dreamlike architectural settings. Warm directional light, heavy cloud masses, atmospheric distance, and subdued earthy colors create an epic, cinematic fantasy mood."},{"id":"osgemeos","name":"Os Gemeos","cat":"street-artists","en":"Os Gemeos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/osgemeos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/osgemeos","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","urban","motion","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-rust","brown","beige","ochre","white","green"],"intro":"","observation":"The style combines vivid, highly patterned illustrative figures with thick dark outlines and simplified, mask-like facial features. Oversized whimsical characters are placed throughout urban mural settings, abandoned industrial spaces, and streets, creating a surreal, expressive public-art atmosphere with strong textile textures and saturated color."},{"id":"george-nakashima","name":"George Nakashima","cat":"architects","en":"George Nakashima","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-nakashima.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-nakashima","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["white","grey","silver","dark-brown","beige","brown","orange"],"intro":"George Nakashima was a Japanese-American woodworker and architect known for his unique approach to furniture design, blending traditional Japanese techniques with modernist aesthetics. Born in 1905, Nakashima became a prominent figure in the American craft movement, celebrated for his use of natural materials and organic forms.","observation":"The style presents handcrafted wooden furniture as realistic, sculptural objects, emphasizing massive live edges, flowing organic contours, visible grain, and angular structural supports. Restrained brown and neutral tones, carefully staged interiors, and strong directional daylight create crisp highlights and deep shadows around the furniture."},{"id":"hans-zatzka","name":"Hans Zatzka","cat":"painters","en":"Hans Zatzka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-zatzka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-zatzka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","dark-brown","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Hans Zatzka was an Austrian painter known for his romantic and idyllic scenes, often featuring mythological and allegorical themes. Born in 1859, Zatzka's work is characterized by its detailed and ornate style, capturing the essence of 19th-century European art. He studied at the Academy of Fine Arts in Vienna and became renowned for his depictions of enchanting women, cherubs, and lush landscapes, often infused with a sense of fantasy and whimsy.","observation":"The style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, combining finely modeled faces with energetic, broken strokes in foliage, flowers, and fabric. Repeated female figures are framed by abundant roses and garden greenery, with romantic classical clothing, warm subdued colors, and strong light-dark modeling creating a lush, ornamental mood."},{"id":"jay-defeo","name":"Jay DeFeo","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jay DeFeo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jay-defeo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jay-defeo","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Jay DeFeo is an influential American artist known for her contributions to the Beat Generation and Abstract Expressionism. Her most famous work, \"The Rose,\" is a monumental painting that took eight years to complete and is celebrated for its intricate texture and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines heavily worked, visibly brushed surfaces with stark geometric wedges, fractured forms, and deep irregular voids. A restrained black, ivory, and earth-brown palette, strong tonal contrast, and expressive radial or shard-like composition give the abstract imagery a monumental, geological intensity."},{"id":"norman-mclaren","name":"Norman McLaren","cat":"illustrators","en":"Norman McLaren","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norman-mclaren.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norman-mclaren","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","scenes","motion","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","light-orange","silver","brown","vivid-orange","dark-rust"],"intro":"Norman McLaren is a renowned Scottish-Canadian animator and filmmaker known for his innovative work in the field of animation. Born in 1914, McLaren's career spanned several decades, during which he explored various animation techniques, including hand-drawn, stop-motion, and experimental film. His contributions to the National Film Board of Canada and his pioneering work in visual music and abstract animation have left a lasting impact on the world of animation and film.","observation":"Across the four panels, the style combines stark photographic and graphic imagery with experimental abstraction, using deep blacks, luminous orange accents, grain, and pronounced negative space. Fine linear marks, radial structures, silhouettes, and blurred motion create a tense, enigmatic visual language that shifts between documentary-like scenes and surreal diagrammatic compositions."},{"id":"jonathan-barnbrook","name":"Jonathan Barnbrook","cat":"printmakers","en":"Jonathan Barnbrook","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jonathan-barnbrook.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jonathan-barnbrook","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","dark","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white","deep-red"],"intro":"Jonathan Barnbrook is a renowned British graphic designer and typographer, known for his innovative contributions to visual communication. His work often explores the intersection of design and social commentary, and he has collaborated with notable figures in the music and art industries. Barnbrook's designs are characterized by their boldness and conceptual depth, often challenging conventional aesthetics.","observation":"The style combines stark black-and-white portrait imagery with severe contrast, dense grain, and finely ruled geometric or typographic overlays. Faces are repeatedly fragmented by architectural forms, scanlines, and collage-like interruptions, producing a symmetrical, ominous, surreal poster aesthetic."},{"id":"philip-johnson","name":"Philip Johnson","cat":"architects","en":"Philip Johnson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philip-johnson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philip-johnson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","landscapes","portraits","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["black","charcoal","bone-white","beige","red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Philip Johnson was a renowned American architect known for his influential role in modern architecture. He was a pivotal figure in the development of the International Style and later explored postmodern architecture. Johnson's work is characterized by its innovative use of glass and steel, as seen in iconic buildings like the Glass House and the Seagram Building.","observation":"The style combines highly rendered architectural and portrait imagery with visible, directional paint texture, giving glass buildings, clothing, trees, and clouds a tactile, modelled presence. Strong cinematic framing, deep shadows, and restrained blue-green tones are repeatedly offset by warm amber and coral light, creating a dramatic, contemplative atmosphere."},{"id":"david-choe","name":"David Choe","cat":"illustrators","en":"David Choe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-choe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-choe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","ochre","vivid-red","grey","pale-orange"],"intro":"David Choe is an American artist known for his diverse and dynamic style, often blending elements of street art with traditional techniques. His work spans various mediums, including painting, illustration, and graffiti, and he has gained recognition for his bold and expressive approach.","observation":"The style combines highly visible, layered brushwork with energetic drips, scratches, splatters, and outlined marks, making the portraits feel both tactile and emotionally forceful. Saturated reds, oranges, blues, and neutrals create strong contrast, while oversized faces and glimpses of painters in the studio give the compositions a mural-scale, process-focused character."},{"id":"frederick-cayley-robinson","name":"Frederick Cayley Robinson","cat":"painters","en":"Frederick Cayley Robinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederick-cayley-robinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederick-cayley-robinson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["muted-ochre","brown","black","pale-orange","dark-red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Frederick Cayley Robinson was a British painter and illustrator known for his mystical and symbolic artworks, often depicting scenes with a dreamlike quality. He was active during the late 19th and early 20th centuries, and his work is associated with the Symbolist movement. Robinson's paintings frequently explore themes of nature, mythology, and the human condition, characterized by a delicate and detailed style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses carefully modelled figures, tactile fabrics, architecture, foliage, and stone with visible fine surface marks and restrained earthy colour. Compositions are densely populated narrative scenes, often centred on groups of people in devotional or communal settings, with fine drawn contours supporting the painterly modelling and decorative detail."},{"id":"pierre-auguste-renoir","name":"Pierre-Auguste Renoir","cat":"painters","en":"Pierre-Auguste Renoir","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-auguste-renoir.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-auguste-renoir","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-olive","muted-orange","charcoal","silver","rust","dark-brown"],"intro":"Pierre-Auguste Renoir was a French artist and a leading figure in the Impressionist movement, known for his vibrant light and saturated color. His works often depicted lively social scenes and intimate portraits, capturing the essence of Parisian life in the late 19th century. Renoir's style is characterized by its fluid brushwork and a focus on the effects of light, creating a sense of movement and life in his paintings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly layered visible brushwork, soft blending, and luminous natural color to depict flower-filled gardens, pastoral landscapes, and intimate female portraits. Fine expressive strokes create abundant botanical detail while maintaining a dreamy, romantic atmosphere and gentle classical composition."},{"id":"rui-palha","name":"Rui Palha","cat":"photographers","en":"Rui Palha","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rui-palha.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rui-palha","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Rui Palha is a contemporary Portuguese photographer known for his evocative black and white street photography. His work captures the essence of urban life, often focusing on solitary figures and the interplay of light and shadow in cityscapes. Palha's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey emotion and narrative through simple yet powerful compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is realistic and highly detailed, using stark black-and-white tonal separation, deep shadows, and bright shafts of backlight. Misty urban streets, wet cobblestones, old masonry, and solitary figures create a cinematic, dark atmosphere with strong perspective and selective focus."},{"id":"john-everett-millais","name":"John Everett Millais","cat":"painters","en":"John Everett Millais","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-everett-millais.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-everett-millais","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","ochre","deep-red","orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"John Everett Millais was a prominent English painter and illustrator, a founding member of the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood. Known for his highly detailed and vibrant works, Millais's art often depicted themes of beauty, nature, and romanticism, capturing the essence of the Victorian era with a focus on realism and intricate detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly and representational, with visible brushwork, layered textures, and carefully modelled faces, clothing, foliage, and furnishings. Dark, subdued tones are punctuated by deep reds, greens, and occasional blue garments, while formal portraits and garden or interior scenes create a classical, theatrical atmosphere."},{"id":"william-harnett","name":"William Harnett","cat":"painters","en":"William Harnett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-harnett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-harnett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","pale-yellow","dark-red"],"intro":"William Harnett was an Irish-American painter known for his trompe-l'œil still lifes, a style that creates the optical illusion of three-dimensionality. Born in 1848, Harnett became famous for his meticulous attention to detail and ability to render everyday objects with striking realism. His works often featured musical instruments, books, and other domestic items, capturing the texture and materiality of each object with precision.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely arranged bottles, glassware, books, papers, and workshop objects are depicted as richly textured still lifes. Visible fine brushwork, aged surfaces, deep shadows, and restrained brown, olive, amber, and red tones create a dark, archival atmosphere with strong material detail."},{"id":"stephen-wilkes","name":"Stephen Wilkes","cat":"photographers","en":"Stephen Wilkes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-wilkes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-wilkes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey","muted-blue","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Stephen Wilkes is a renowned American photographer known for his innovative approach to capturing time and space in his work. He is particularly famous for his 'Day to Night ' series, where he blends multiple photographs taken over a period of time into a single image, showcasing the transition from day to night in various iconic locations around the world.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic cityscapes with dense architectural detail, dramatic wide vistas, and strong atmospheric depth. Saturated dusk and storm lighting, glowing windows, reflective water, mist, clouds, and motion-filled streets create an expansive, high-impact sense of scale."},{"id":"storm-thorgerson","name":"Storm Thorgerson","cat":"designers","en":"Storm Thorgerson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/storm-thorgerson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/storm-thorgerson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-blue","ochre","blue","brown","muted-blue","silver"],"intro":"Storm Thorgerson is a renowned British graphic designer and artist, best known for his iconic album cover designs for bands such as Pink Floyd, Led Zeppelin, and Muse. His work is characterized by surreal and thought-provoking imagery, often involving photomontage and digital manipulation to create dreamlike scenes that challenge perception and reality.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, wide-open landscapes with tiny human figures set against monumental floating or oversized objects, creating surreal contrasts of scale. Naturalistic sunlight, saturated blue skies, warm earth tones, strong shadows, and expansive negative space give the scenes a dreamy yet epic photographic presence."},{"id":"william-nicholson","name":"William Nicholson","cat":"painters","en":"William Nicholson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-nicholson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-nicholson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","still-life","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","pale-yellow","black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","light-orange","red"],"intro":"William Nicholson is a renowned British painter known for his contributions to the early 20th-century art scene. He was celebrated for his still lifes, landscapes, and portraits, often characterized by their subtle use of color and light. His works exhibit a mastery of form and composition, reflecting a deep appreciation for the natural world and everyday objects.","observation":"Across all four renders, carefully arranged vases, pitchers, flowers, and branches are depicted as quiet still lifes with earthy, restrained colors and strongly defined cast shadows. Visible brush texture and worn, layered surfaces give the images a hand-painted quality, while simplified shapes and broad areas of even color keep the compositions graphic and illustrative."},{"id":"louis-comfort-tiffany","name":"Louis Comfort Tiffany","cat":"designers","en":"Louis Comfort Tiffany","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-comfort-tiffany.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-comfort-tiffany","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","floral","patterns","still-life","glow","fine-lines","metallic","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","beige","grey","charcoal","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Louis Comfort Tiffany was a renowned American artist and designer, best known for his work in stained glass. He was a prominent figure in the Art Nouveau movement and contributed significantly to the decorative arts in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. Tiffany's innovative techniques and vibrant designs made him a leading designer of his time, influencing both American and European art.","observation":"The style presents richly ornamented, sculptural vessels and lamps as carefully staged still lifes, combining irregular stained-glass or mosaic panels with dark metal fittings and finely drawn botanical or landscape imagery. Subdued teal, green, amber, and copper tones are enlivened by reflective metallic accents and warm light glowing through the translucent surfaces."},{"id":"david-seymour","name":"David Seymour","cat":"photographers","en":"David Seymour","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-seymour.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-seymour","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"David Seymour is a renowned Polish photographer, best known for his work in photojournalism and co-founding the Magnum Photos agency. His real-life work often focused on capturing human emotions and social issues, particularly in post-war Europe, with a distinctive humanist approach.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white portrait photography with high contrast, visible grain, and selective focus. Intimate close-ups, natural expressions, textured faces and tousled hair create a candid documentary feeling, while blurred surroundings and occasional framing elements add depth and atmosphere."},{"id":"george-rouault","name":"George Rouault","cat":"painters","en":"George Rouault","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-rouault.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-rouault","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","portraits","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","ochre","dark-brown","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"George Rouault was a French painter and printmaker associated with Fauvism and Expressionism. Known for his bold use of color and thick black outlines, Rouault's work often explored themes of spirituality and the human condition, reflecting his deep religious convictions and interest in social issues.","observation":"Across all four panels, mask-like portraits are rendered with heavy black contours, simplified angular features, and restrained teal, ochre, rust, and charcoal hues. Visible brush marks, scraped pigment, and rough built-up texture give the paintings an expressive, tactile surface, while the tightly cropped faces create a unified graphic intensity."},{"id":"leonetto-cappiello","name":"Leonetto Cappiello","cat":"illustrators","en":"Leonetto Cappiello","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leonetto-cappiello.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leonetto-cappiello","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-brown","pale-orange","orange","muted-teal"],"intro":"Leonetto Cappiello was an Italian and French poster artist and painter, known for his innovative advertising posters in the early 20th century. Often referred to as the father of modern advertising, Cappiello's work is celebrated for its bold use of color and dynamic compositions that captured the viewer's attention.","observation":"The style uses highly graphic, close-up fashion portraits with crisp fine linework, simplified painted shapes, and strongly contrasted black, orange, teal, and cream areas. Feathered hats, fur, gloves, makeup, cocktails, and elegant poses reinforce a glamorous retro editorial mood, while visible grain and brush-textured surfaces give the illustrations a printed, tactile finish."},{"id":"jean-michel-frank","name":"Jean-Michel Frank","cat":"designers","en":"Jean-Michel Frank","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-michel-frank.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-michel-frank","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","portraits","still-life","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","beige","bone-white","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Jean-Michel Frank was a renowned French interior designer known for his minimalist and elegant style, characterized by the use of luxurious materials and understated forms. He was influential in the early 20th century, contributing significantly to the Art Deco movement with his innovative designs that emphasized simplicity and sophistication.","observation":"The style combines tactile, painterly surfaces with carefully composed interiors, emphasizing dark wood, stone, metal, and woven upholstery. Muted earthy colors, strong geometric framing, frontal faces and eyes, and deep shadows give the images a solemn, gallery-like atmosphere with a recurring sense of symmetry and material weight."},{"id":"andre-derain","name":"Andre Derain","cat":"painters","en":"Andre Derain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andre-derain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andre-derain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","orange","grey","muted-brown","pale-orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Andre Derain was a French artist and a key figure in the Fauvist movement, known for his bold use of color and expressive brushwork. Born in 1880, Derain's work was characterized by vibrant landscapes and a unique approach to color that broke away from traditional representation, influencing modern art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly built-up paint with broad, directional strokes, simplified yet strongly outlined forms, and vivid blue, coral, orange, cream, and deep green contrasts. It repeatedly depicts sunlit coastal and hillside landscapes with clustered architecture, water, trees, and occasional human activity, combining graphic structure with expressive, textured brushwork."},{"id":"phlegm","name":"Phlegm","cat":"street-artists","en":"Phlegm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/phlegm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/phlegm","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","fantasy","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","beige","dark-brown"],"intro":"Phlegm is a renowned street artist known for his intricate and fantastical murals. His work often features surreal characters and imaginative worlds, blending whimsical elements with a dark, illustrative style. Phlegm's art is characterized by detailed line work and a monochrome palette, creating a unique visual language that has captured the attention of audiences worldwide.","observation":"Across all four renders, intricate monochrome murals transform urban brick and plaster facades into surreal architectural worlds populated by colossal tubes, vessels, buildings, and small human figures. Fine ink-like linework, dense crosshatching, and stark black-and-white rendering create a dark, highly detailed illustrative style integrated directly into real city spaces."},{"id":"mike-luckovich","name":"Mike Luckovich","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mike Luckovich","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-luckovich.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-luckovich","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","ink"],"colours":["vivid-red","muted-blue","charcoal","pale-lime","deep-red","red"],"intro":"Mike Luckovich is a renowned American cartoonist known for his political cartoons, often characterized by sharp wit and insightful commentary. His work has been widely recognized and awarded, reflecting his keen ability to capture the essence of political and social issues.","observation":"Across all four renders, brightly saturated painted fields are overlaid with frantic black contour drawing and scratchy ink marks. The portraits and figures are deliberately distorted and cropped, combining flat color blocks with visible brush texture, heavy outlines, and an energetic, confrontational expression."},{"id":"martin-whatson","name":"Martin Whatson","cat":"street-artists","en":"Martin Whatson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-whatson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-whatson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["grey","bone-white","charcoal","red","blue","olive","light-yellow"],"intro":"Martin Whatson is a contemporary Norwegian street artist known for his vibrant and dynamic graffiti art. His work often combines traditional street art techniques with modern themes, creating pieces that are both visually striking and thought-provoking. Whatson's art is characterized by its use of stencils and spray paint, often featuring urban landscapes and cultural references.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable hooded human figures are rendered in largely monochrome, heavily shaded forms and surrounded by explosive saturated paint. Broad visible brushwork, sharp dark outlines, drips, splatters, and graffiti-like marks create an energetic mixed-media mural effect against gray grounds."},{"id":"morgan-weistling","name":"Morgan Weistling","cat":"painters","en":"Morgan Weistling","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/morgan-weistling.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/morgan-weistling","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","floral","scenes","backlighting","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","pale-yellow","rust","olive"],"intro":"Morgan Weistling is a contemporary American painter known for his realistic and detailed depictions of everyday life, particularly focusing on historical and rural themes. His work often captures intimate moments with a painterly technique that combines fine brushwork and a mastery of light and shadow, bringing a sense of warmth and nostalgia to his subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, broad paint strokes to model realistic figures and textured surroundings, with dense natural and domestic detail. Warm shafts of sunlight and lantern glow cut through deep shadows, producing subdued earthy colors, strong contrast, and an intimate, contemplative atmosphere."},{"id":"tania-bruguera","name":"Tania Bruguera","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tania Bruguera","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tania-bruguera.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tania-bruguera","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","white","muted-orange"],"intro":"Tania Bruguera is a Cuban artist known for her politically charged performances and installations that explore themes of power, control, and social justice. Her work often challenges the boundaries between art and activism, engaging with issues of cultural identity and human rights. Bruguera's practice is deeply rooted in her experiences in post-revolutionary Cuba, and she has become a prominent voice in contemporary art for her bold and thought-provoking pieces.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and cinematic, centered on tightly framed, emotionally restrained portraits with natural skin texture, hair detail, and understated black clothing. Soft directional light, shallow focus, dark tonal weight, and occasional monochrome treatment create an austere, contemplative mood across both plain interiors and the candlelit church setting."},{"id":"nathalie-du-pasquier","name":"Nathalie Du Pasquier","cat":"designers","en":"Nathalie Du Pasquier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nathalie-du-pasquier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nathalie-du-pasquier","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","sculptural","patterns","still-life","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","vivid-red","black","blue","muted-blue"],"intro":"Nathalie Du Pasquier is a French designer and artist, known for her role as a founding member of the Memphis Group, a collective that revolutionized design in the 1980s with its bold, colorful, and geometric patterns. Her work spans various mediums, including textiles, furniture, and ceramics, characterized by a playful and avant-garde approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds interiors and object arrangements from crisp geometric volumes, stepped forms, stripes, checks, and sharply bounded color fields. Saturated reds and blues contrast strongly with black, white, pink, and muted architectural grounds, while the illustrative flat treatment retains convincing three-dimensional furniture and spatial staging."},{"id":"adolf-loos","name":"Adolf Loos","cat":"architects","en":"Adolf Loos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adolf-loos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adolf-loos","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","muted-ochre","grey","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"Adolf Loos is a renowned Austrian architect and influential figure in modern architecture, known for his minimalist and functionalist approach. He was a pioneer of modernist architecture, advocating for simplicity and the removal of unnecessary ornamentation in building design.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic architectural scenes with a cinematic, carefully staged quality, combining strong geometric symmetry with dense period-inspired interior detailing. Deep greens, browns, reds, and cream tones are shaped by dramatic sunlight and warm practical lighting, while the exterior view retains the same crisp monumental geometry and restrained palette."},{"id":"ivan-shishkin","name":"Ivan Shishkin","cat":"painters","en":"Ivan Shishkin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ivan-shishkin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ivan-shishkin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","muted-olive","light-lime"],"intro":"Ivan Shishkin was a renowned Russian painter and a prominent figure in the 19th-century Russian art scene. He was best known for his realistic and detailed landscapes, particularly his depictions of Russian forests and natural scenery. Shishkin's work is celebrated for its meticulous attention to detail, capturing the essence of the natural world with precision and depth.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and richly detailed, portraying expansive old-growth forests with towering trunks, moss, ferns, streams, and layered undergrowth. Subdued green-brown tones, deep shadows, filtered sunlight, and recurring atmospheric mist create a quiet, moody woodland depth across all four renders."},{"id":"george-stubbs","name":"George Stubbs","cat":"painters","en":"George Stubbs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-stubbs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-stubbs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","animals","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"George Stubbs was an 18th-century English painter renowned for his detailed and anatomically precise depictions of horses and other animals. His work is celebrated for its naturalism and contribution to equestrian art, making him a pivotal figure in British art history. Stubbs's paintings often feature animals in serene, natural settings, reflecting the elegance and grandeur of the Georgian era.","observation":"Across all four renders, white horses are presented in dramatic, formal poses against dark, atmospheric grounds. The style combines painterly surface texture and visible broad strokes with sculptural anatomy, subdued earthy color, strong light-dark contrast, and monumental classical staging."},{"id":"david-cerny","name":"David Cerny","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"David Cerny","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-cerny.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-cerny","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","urban","metallic"],"colours":["brown","muted-blue","beige","pale-blue","black","muted-orange"],"intro":"David Cerny is a contemporary Czech sculptor known for his provocative and often controversial public art installations. His works frequently challenge social norms and political issues, making him a significant figure in the European avant-garde art scene. Cerny's sculptures are characterized by their boldness and a penchant for the surreal, often incorporating elements of humor and irony.","observation":"The style presents monumental human forms as highly realistic, reflective metal sculptures, with fragmented plates, exposed mechanical structures, and sharply faceted surfaces. Carefully framed urban settings combine historic architecture and contemporary buildings with clear daylight, emphasizing scale, material reflectivity, and sculptural presence."},{"id":"bernard-plossu","name":"Bernard Plossu","cat":"photographers","en":"Bernard Plossu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bernard-plossu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bernard-plossu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","glow","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","silhouette"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Bernard Plossu is a French photographer known for his poetic and introspective approach to capturing everyday life. Born in 1945, Plossu has traveled extensively, documenting his journeys with a distinct style that emphasizes mood and atmosphere over literal representation. His work often features soft focus, grainy textures, and a sense of nostalgia, capturing fleeting moments with an evocative and timeless quality.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photography with pronounced grain, deep shadows, and sharply isolated highlights. Solitary figures, misty outdoor spaces, window views, and intimate interiors are framed cinematically, often using silhouettes, backlit glow, and shallow focus to create a melancholic atmosphere."},{"id":"hugues-merle","name":"Hugues Merle","cat":"painters","en":"Hugues Merle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hugues-merle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hugues-merle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Hugues Merle is a 19th-century French painter known for his realistic and romantic portrayals of women and children. His works often reflect the academic art style of the time, focusing on detailed and emotive expressions, with a soft and gentle approach to color and composition.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents tightly cropped female portraits with lifelike faces, carefully modelled skin, curls, layered garments, and richly tactile fabric. Deep shadowed backgrounds, warm earth reds and creams, restrained highlights, and visible painterly surface create an intimate, solemn, old-master-like mood."},{"id":"fintan-magee","name":"Fintan Magee","cat":"street-artists","en":"Fintan Magee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fintan-magee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fintan-magee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-blue","blue","beige","brown","muted-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Fintan Magee is an Australian street artist known for his large-scale murals that often explore themes of environmentalism and social issues. His work is characterized by a blend of realism and surrealism, often depicting figures in dynamic, dreamlike scenarios.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental human figures are integrated into urban building facades, combining recognizable anatomy and clothing with energetic, visibly brushed paint. The style uses saturated blue, red, and ochre accents, expressive gestures, weathered wall texture, and cropped mural compositions that feel both illustrative and richly painterly."},{"id":"neri-oxman","name":"Neri Oxman","cat":"designers","en":"Neri Oxman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/neri-oxman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/neri-oxman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","floral","patterns","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","black","orange","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Neri Oxman is a renowned designer and architect known for her innovative work at the intersection of art, science, and technology. She is a pioneer in the field of material ecology, exploring the relationship between natural and built environments. Oxman's work often involves the use of advanced technologies to create designs that mimic natural forms and processes.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, sculptural biomorphic forms with flowing filaments, cellular membranes, and lace-like textures. Saturated red-orange hues, translucent surfaces, and strong contrast against pale or black grounds give the imagery an expressive, surreal, quasi-botanical presence."},{"id":"martin-kippenberger","name":"Martin Kippenberger","cat":"painters","en":"Martin Kippenberger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-kippenberger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-kippenberger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["muted-orange","beige","red","brown","silver","green"],"intro":"Martin Kippenberger is a German artist known for his diverse and provocative body of work, which spans painting, sculpture, installation, and performance art. He was a key figure in the Neo-Expressionist movement and is recognized for his critical and often humorous take on contemporary culture and art itself. Kippenberger's work frequently challenges traditional artistic conventions and explores themes of identity, politics, and society.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, visibly worked paint with angular, fragmented compositions and strong saturated reds, greens, blues, and pinks. Figures and interior situations remain recognizable but are distorted into theatrical, surreal tableaux, with broad strokes, fine linear marks, drips, and layered collage-like planes contributing to an expressive studio-painting surface."},{"id":"robert-hagan","name":"Robert Hagan","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Hagan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-hagan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-hagan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-blue","grey","beige","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"Robert Hagan is an Australian painter known for his impressionistic landscapes and romantic scenes. His work often features vibrant colors and dynamic compositions, capturing the essence of rural and coastal life with a sense of nostalgia and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable women, horses, surf, and coastal landscapes are built from visible, energetic paint strokes rather than clean graphic edges. The palette is dominated by luminous blues, whites, and warm sunlit accents, while splashing water, flowing garments, and windblown hair give the scenes a lively sense of motion."},{"id":"anthony-mccall","name":"Anthony McCall","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Anthony McCall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anthony-mccall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anthony-mccall","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","sculptural","characters","glow","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi","geometric","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","brown","silver"],"intro":"Anthony McCall is a British-born artist known for his avant-garde work in the field of light and space art. He gained prominence in the 1970s with his \"solid light\" installations, which explore the intersection of cinema, sculpture, and drawing. His work often involves the use of projected light to create three-dimensional forms that interact with the viewer's perception and the surrounding space.","observation":"The style presents monumental geometric light structures in dark, spacious environments, using intense internal illumination against deep shadow. Long-exposure-like trails, reflective floors, tiny silhouetted figures, and strong perspective make the scenes feel cinematic, futuristic, and spatially monumental."},{"id":"ben-heine","name":"Ben Heine","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ben Heine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ben-heine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ben-heine","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","scenes","urban","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","beige","bone-white","brown","charcoal","white","dark-ochre","red"],"intro":"Ben Heine is a Belgian multidisciplinary visual artist known for his innovative fusion of photography and illustration. His work often explores the boundaries between reality and imagination, creating unique visual narratives that challenge perception. Heine's distinctive style has gained international recognition, blending traditional art techniques with modern digital tools.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, finely observed textures with impossible juxtapositions and dreamlike scale shifts. Dramatic perspective, strong tonal contrast, and cinematic cloud-filled settings give the surreal scenes a monumental, storybook quality, while recurring drawn or pencil-like elements bridge illustration and photography."},{"id":"vija-celmins","name":"Vija Celmins","cat":"painters","en":"Vija Celmins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vija-celmins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vija-celmins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","glow","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["black","charcoal","bone-white","grey","beige","white"],"intro":"Vija Celmins is a Latvian-American visual artist known for her meticulous and detailed depictions of natural scenes, particularly ocean waves, night skies, and desert landscapes. Her work often explores themes of nature, perception, and memory, using techniques like drawing, painting, and printmaking to create photorealistic images that invite contemplation and introspection.","observation":"The style presents stark natural subjects⁠—rough ocean, open night sky, and a monumental sea rock⁠—with highly realistic texture and solid, weighty forms. Restrained monochrome tones, deep shadows, bright reflective highlights, and visible grain create a dramatic, somber, atmospheric photographic look."},{"id":"marlene-dumas","name":"Marlene Dumas","cat":"painters","en":"Marlene Dumas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marlene-dumas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marlene-dumas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","grey","muted-ochre","brown"],"intro":"Marlene Dumas is a South African-born contemporary artist known for her evocative and emotionally charged paintings. Her work often explores themes of identity, sexuality, and the human condition, using a distinctive style characterized by expressive brushwork and a muted color palette. Dumas's paintings are celebrated for their psychological depth and ability to convey complex emotions.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses close-up portrait faces rendered with visibly loose, layered brushwork and delicate drawn marks. Muted flesh, blue-gray, pink, and brown washes create an austere, unsettling mood, while distorted features and heavy eye treatment make the expressions feel raw and psychologically intense."},{"id":"naum-gabo","name":"Naum Gabo","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Naum Gabo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/naum-gabo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/naum-gabo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","metallic","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","cream"],"intro":"Naum Gabo was a pioneering Russian sculptor and key figure in the Constructivist movement. Known for his innovative use of materials and exploration of space, Gabo's work often featured geometric forms and kinetic elements, challenging traditional notions of sculpture. His contributions to modern art include a focus on the integration of art and technology, emphasizing the dynamic interaction between form and environment.","observation":"Across all four renders, delicate ribbon-like forms curl into complex openwork sculptures, with densely repeated fine lines creating translucent, dimensional surfaces. Restrained bronze, silver, and charcoal tones, warm gallery lighting, and pedestal presentation emphasize the objects’ geometric volume and intricate lattice patterns."},{"id":"richard-lindner","name":"Richard Lindner","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Lindner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-lindner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-lindner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","portraits","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["ochre","red","charcoal","bone-white","deep-blue"],"intro":"Richard Lindner is a German-American painter known for his unique blend of modernist and pop art styles. Born in Hamburg in 1901, Lindner fled Nazi Germany and eventually settled in the United States, where he became a prominent figure in the art world. His work often features bold colors, geometric shapes, and stylized figures, reflecting influences from both European modernism and American pop culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, figurative portraits are fragmented into angular geometric planes, strong outlines, and saturated blocks of red, blue, green, purple, and orange. The clean illustrative construction is enriched by visible painted and textile-like surface texture, elaborate clothing patterns, dramatic facial features, and tightly framed decorative compositions."},{"id":"h-p-lovecraft","name":"H. P. Lovecraft","cat":"various-artists","en":"H. P. Lovecraft","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/h-p-lovecraft.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/h-p-lovecraft","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","light-orange","dark-red","red"],"intro":"H. P. Lovecraft was an American writer known for his influential works of horror fiction, particularly the Cthulhu Mythos. His stories often explore themes of cosmic horror, forbidden knowledge, and the insignificance of humanity in the universe. Lovecraft's writing has inspired countless adaptations and has become a cornerstone of the horror genre.","observation":"Across all four images, tightly rendered figures and grotesque organic forms are built from dense pen-like linework, fine hatching, and ink-like shadow. The style combines dark, dramatic character scenes with surreal eye and tentacle motifs, while selective reds, oranges, and teals add vivid color to the otherwise heavily shadowed compositions."},{"id":"austin-osman-spare","name":"Austin Osman Spare","cat":"illustrators","en":"Austin Osman Spare","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/austin-osman-spare.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/austin-osman-spare","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","subdued-colors","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","pale-orange","beige","orange","muted-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Austin Osman Spare was an English artist and occultist known for his unique blend of art and mysticism. Born in 1886, Spare's work often explored themes of the subconscious and esoteric symbolism. His intricate drawings and paintings were characterized by a surreal and dark aesthetic, often depicting fantastical and mythical subjects. Spare's influence extended beyond the art world, impacting the realms of magic and the occult.","observation":"Across all four images, tightly framed faces are rendered as highly detailed, expressive drawings with abundant fine contour lines, crosshatching, and ink-like tonal buildup. The restrained sepia, brown, black, and occasional red palette on textured paper gives the portraits a dark, dramatic character, while unruly hair and strongly modeled features provide visual intensity."},{"id":"ed-wood","name":"Ed Wood","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Ed Wood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-wood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-wood","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","bold-lines","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","pale-orange","brown","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"Ed Wood was an American filmmaker known for his low-budget cult films, particularly in the horror and science fiction genres. Despite the lack of critical acclaim during his lifetime, Wood's work has gained a cult following for its unique style and earnestness.","observation":"The style is graphic and ink-driven, built from bold contour lines, dense black fills, fine hatching, and crosshatched tonal modelling. Across the portraits, stark black-and-cream contrast creates a dramatic, brooding comic-book look, with one render adding a restrained red background accent while preserving the same illustrative treatment."},{"id":"desmond-morris","name":"Desmond Morris","cat":"painters","en":"Desmond Morris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/desmond-morris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/desmond-morris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","animals","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["ochre","teal","charcoal","silver","vivid-red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Desmond Morris is a renowned British zoologist, ethologist, and surrealist painter, best known for his work in animal behavior and his book \"The Naked Ape.\" His artistic endeavors often explore the intersection of human and animal worlds, characterized by a surreal and imaginative style.","observation":"Across all four renders, birds and plant-like forms are reduced to angular, geometric shapes with elongated legs, beaks, and graphic eyes. Saturated teal, blue, orange, red, and yellow shapes sit in flat color blocks, while visible brush texture and canvas grain soften the otherwise crisp, poster-like construction."},{"id":"dries-van-noten","name":"Dries van Noten","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Dries van Noten","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dries-van-noten.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dries-van-noten","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","brown","ochre"],"intro":"Dries van Noten is a renowned Belgian fashion designer known for his eclectic and artistic approach to clothing. A member of the Antwerp Six, he has gained international acclaim for his innovative use of prints, colors, and textures, often drawing inspiration from art and culture.","observation":"The style is realistic, cinematic runway photography with carefully rendered fabrics, oversized layered silhouettes, and richly detailed botanical prints. Dark surroundings, selective spotlighting, muted teal and ochre tones, and shallow background blur give the images a moody, editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"david-inshaw","name":"David Inshaw","cat":"painters","en":"David Inshaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-inshaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-inshaw","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","grain","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","black","charcoal","ochre","silver"],"intro":"David Inshaw is a British painter known for his evocative landscapes and detailed compositions. His work often explores themes of nature, solitude, and the human experience, capturing the essence of the English countryside with a surreal and romantic touch.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents expansive rural landscapes with highly textured vegetation, layered hills, winding paths, and carefully composed estate-like scenery. Richly modeled foliage and fields are rendered with subdued, moody colors, pronounced light-and-shadow contrast, visible grain, and a dreamlike cinematic atmosphere accented by warm localized illumination."},{"id":"willy-ronis","name":"Willy Ronis","cat":"photographers","en":"Willy Ronis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/willy-ronis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/willy-ronis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Willy Ronis was a renowned French photographer known for capturing everyday life in post-war Paris. His work is celebrated for its humanistic approach, focusing on intimate and candid moments that reflect the essence of urban life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome, realistic street photography with stark backlighting, deep shadows, and bright atmospheric haze. Urban stairways, façades, pedestrians, and incidental street life are framed cinematically, with selective focus and long shadows creating a moody, film-noir atmosphere."},{"id":"daniel-garber","name":"Daniel Garber","cat":"painters","en":"Daniel Garber","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daniel-garber.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daniel-garber","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","ochre","muted-blue","bone-white","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Daniel Garber is an American Impressionist painter known for his serene landscapes and masterful use of light. Born in 1880, Garber was a prominent member of the New Hope School, a group of Pennsylvania Impressionists. His work often features lush, idyllic scenes that capture the beauty of the natural world, rendered with a delicate touch and a keen eye for detail.","observation":"Across all four views, the style combines richly visible paint texture with finely articulated branches, buildings, rooftops, and distant terrain. Warm ochres and russets contrast with cool blue-violet shadows and hills, while dark tree trunks create strong vertical framing and depth over expansive hillside landscapes."},{"id":"lewis-baltz","name":"Lewis Baltz","cat":"photographers","en":"Lewis Baltz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lewis-baltz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lewis-baltz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","urban","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Lewis Baltz was an American photographer known for his work in the New Topographics movement, which focused on the visual representation of urban and suburban landscapes. His work often explored the interaction between human-made environments and natural landscapes, emphasizing stark, minimalist compositions.","observation":"The style presents stark urban architecture in monochrome, emphasizing rectilinear facades, sparse compositions, and strong geometric shadows. Fine structural lines, weathered surfaces, and a grainy photographic texture give the scenes a crisp yet tactile documentary character."},{"id":"l-s-lowry","name":"L. S. Lowry","cat":"painters","en":"L. S. Lowry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/l-s-lowry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/l-s-lowry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","mist","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","beige","charcoal","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"L. S. Lowry was a British artist known for his distinctive paintings of industrial scenes in Northern England. His work often depicted urban landscapes populated with stylized figures, capturing the essence of working-class life during the 20th century. Lowry's art is characterized by its unique use of perspective and a limited color palette, which conveys a sense of melancholy and nostalgia.","observation":"The style combines visibly textured, fine-grained paint with delicate linear drawing, building richly populated winter cityscapes from layered buildings, smokestacks, bare trees, and crowds. Muted grey, brown, black, and red accents, soft atmospheric haze, and expressive pedestrian movement create a somber industrial mood."},{"id":"albert-robida","name":"Albert Robida","cat":"illustrators","en":"Albert Robida","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-robida.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-robida","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","scenes","urban","motion","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","epic","geometric"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","beige","bone-white","silver","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Albert Robida was a French illustrator, etcher, and writer known for his futuristic and fantastical visions of the world. Born in 1848, Robida's work often depicted imaginative and whimsical scenes, blending elements of fantasy and science fiction. He was a contemporary of Jules Verne and shared a similar fascination with the future, technology, and the potential of human innovation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely detailed, ornate architectural fantasy with fine drawn linework and visible painterly texture. Subdued vintage tones, monumental urban vistas, airborne vehicles and crowded street scenes create an expansive, kinetic world of floating Parisian-inspired structures."},{"id":"platon","name":"Platon","cat":"photographers","en":"Platon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/platon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/platon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","realistic","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["white","grey","black","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Platon is a renowned photographer known for his striking and intimate portraits of influential figures. His work often captures the essence of his subjects through powerful and direct imagery, utilizing high contrast and a minimalist approach to highlight facial expressions and emotions.","observation":"A stark black-and-white photographic portrait style built around extreme close-ups, aggressive cropping, and unconventional angles. High contrast and visible grain emphasize pores, wrinkles, hair, and facial contours, while expressive gazes and open mouths give the portraits an intense, confrontational presence."},{"id":"georges-lemmen","name":"Georges Lemmen","cat":"painters","en":"Georges Lemmen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-lemmen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-lemmen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","beige","brown","light-orange","silver","rust"],"intro":"Georges Lemmen was a Belgian painter and a prominent figure in the Neo-Impressionist movement. Born in 1865, he was known for his pointillist technique and contributions to the art world during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His works often depicted serene landscapes and intimate portraits, characterized by meticulous detail and a harmonious color palette.","observation":"The style uses richly textured oil-paint surfaces with clearly visible, finely varied brushwork, combining carefully observed architecture, interiors, figures, and landscapes. Muted blue-green surroundings are animated by warm sunset light and selective high contrast, while detailed domestic and urban settings retain a composed, illustrative clarity."},{"id":"gian-lorenzo-bernini","name":"Gian Lorenzo Bernini","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Gian Lorenzo Bernini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gian-lorenzo-bernini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gian-lorenzo-bernini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","scenes","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","white"],"intro":"Gian Lorenzo Bernini was an Italian sculptor and architect, renowned for his work in the Baroque style during the 17th century. Known for his dynamic compositions and lifelike sculptures, Bernini's work often depicted religious and mythological themes with a dramatic flair. His influence extended beyond sculpture to architecture, where he contributed to the design of St. Peter's Basilica in Vatican City.","observation":"The style presents monumental sculptural figures and architectural interiors with highly modelled marble, elaborate drapery, curling hair, and dense ornamental relief. Warm subdued stone tones are shaped by strong directional light and deep shadows, while close viewpoints, foreshortening, and energetic poses create an expansive, theatrical sense of scale."},{"id":"max-dupain","name":"Max Dupain","cat":"photographers","en":"Max Dupain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/max-dupain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/max-dupain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","backlighting","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","silhouette"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Max Dupain is considered one of Australia's most renowned photographers, known for his black and white photography that captures the essence of Australian life and landscapes. His work often features strong contrasts, elegant compositions, and a focus on form and texture, making him a pivotal figure in modernist photography.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photographic imagery with hard tonal separation, luminous highlights, and deep silhouettes. Filmic compositions place solitary figures within expansive beaches, surf, dunes, and sky, combining fashion-like posing with dramatic backlighting and strong geometric landscapes."},{"id":"lee-krasner","name":"Lee Krasner","cat":"painters","en":"Lee Krasner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-krasner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-krasner","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["pale-orange","orange","brown","beige","black","deep-red"],"intro":"Lee Krasner was an influential American abstract expressionist painter, known for her innovative and dynamic compositions. She was a key figure in the New York School and contributed significantly to the development of modern art in the mid-20th century. Her work often features bold colors, energetic forms, and a deep exploration of abstract themes.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style is intensely abstract and painterly, built from dense overlapping palette-knife marks, scraped pigment, and visible impasto. Jagged fragments, forceful gestures, and high-contrast color clusters create energetic, heavily worked surfaces with recurring reds, pinks, creams, blacks, and occasional blues."},{"id":"ivan-aivazovsky","name":"Ivan Aivazovsky","cat":"painters","en":"Ivan Aivazovsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ivan-aivazovsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ivan-aivazovsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","brown","orange","light-yellow"],"intro":"Ivan Aivazovsky was a Russian Romantic painter, renowned for his masterful seascapes and maritime scenes. Born in 1817, he became one of the most famous marine artists of the 19th century, capturing the beauty and power of the sea in his works. His paintings are celebrated for their dramatic use of light and color, often depicting ships and coastal landscapes under varying atmospheric conditions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly seascapes with dense environmental detail, dramatic cloud formations, and turbulent water. Deep teal-blue shadows are punctuated by warm orange celestial light and reflections, creating a high-contrast, cinematic fantasy atmosphere with misty depth and strong movement."},{"id":"moshe-safdie","name":"Moshe Safdie","cat":"architects","en":"Moshe Safdie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/moshe-safdie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/moshe-safdie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-brown","bone-white","pale-blue","dark-olive"],"intro":"Moshe Safdie is a renowned architect known for his innovative and sustainable architectural designs. Born in 1938, Safdie gained prominence with his iconic Habitat 67 project in Montreal, which showcased his vision for urban living. His work often emphasizes community, nature, and human-centric design, making significant contributions to modern architecture.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic architectural scenes built from monumental stacked concrete volumes, deep cantilevers, sharp geometric forms, and abundant integrated vegetation. Warm directional sunlight, saturated natural greens, blue skies, and carefully framed waterfront or courtyard views give the renders a polished cinematic architectural-visualization quality."},{"id":"brett-whiteley","name":"Brett Whiteley","cat":"painters","en":"Brett Whiteley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brett-whiteley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brett-whiteley","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","landscapes","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-blue","bone-white","deep-blue","muted-blue","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Brett Whiteley was an influential Australian artist known for his distinctive style that combined elements of abstraction and expressionism. His work often explored themes of nature, the human condition, and personal experience, characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions. Whiteley’s art is celebrated for its emotional intensity and innovative use of form and space.","observation":"Across the landscapes and still lifes, the style is built from vigorous, visibly dragged and layered paint, with broad blue brushwork, scraped highlights, fine linear marks, and occasional drips. Saturated cobalt, white, black, and small red or orange accents create a high-contrast, expressive surface that shifts between recognizable scenery and loosely abstracted floral arrangements."},{"id":"apollinary-vasnetsov","name":"Apollinary Vasnetsov","cat":"painters","en":"Apollinary Vasnetsov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/apollinary-vasnetsov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/apollinary-vasnetsov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","grey","pale-yellow","dark-brown"],"intro":"Apollinary Vasnetsov is a renowned Russian painter and graphic artist, known for his historical and landscape paintings. He was a key figure in the Russian revival movement, often depicting scenes from Russian history and folklore. His works are characterized by their detailed realism and romanticized portrayal of the past.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly and finely worked, with visible directional brushstrokes, layered textures, and expressive, atmospheric lighting. Muted earth tones are punctuated by red, blue, and gold accents in elaborate costumes and architecture, while historical figures, religious buildings, forests, snowfields, and expansive landscapes are arranged as dramatic narrative scenes."},{"id":"james-sant","name":"James Sant","cat":"painters","en":"James Sant","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-sant.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-sant","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","muted-ochre","pale-orange","deep-red"],"intro":"James Sant is a British painter known for his portraits and genre paintings, particularly during the Victorian era. He was a member of the Royal Academy and gained recognition for his depictions of children and young women, often capturing a sense of innocence and beauty.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly layered oil-paint surfaces, delicate visible brushwork, and softly blended faces against dark, warm interiors. It emphasizes elegant women in elaborate period dress, lace, flowers, jewelry, and ornate furnishings, with intimate cropping and restrained but warm red, cream, brown, and gold tones."},{"id":"johannes-vanderbeek","name":"Johannes VanDerBeek","cat":"various-artists","en":"Johannes VanDerBeek","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johannes-vanderbeek.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johannes-vanderbeek","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","landscapes","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","red","muted-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Johannes VanDerBeek is a contemporary artist known for his innovative approach to mixed media and sculpture. His work often explores themes of transformation and identity, utilizing a variety of materials to create textured and layered pieces that challenge traditional artistic boundaries.","observation":"The style combines photographic fragments, painted textures, geometric paper-like shapes, and graphic linework into dense surreal collages. Across the images, saturated coral and black dominate, with strong contrast, visible grain, scanline effects, and deliberately disruptive overlaps between figures, landscapes, clothing, and foliage."},{"id":"guy-carleton-wiggins","name":"Guy Carleton Wiggins","cat":"painters","en":"Guy Carleton Wiggins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-carleton-wiggins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-carleton-wiggins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["brown","beige","bone-white","grey","rust"],"intro":"Guy Carleton Wiggins is an American Impressionist painter known for his vibrant depictions of New York City in the early 20th century. Born in 1883, Wiggins was celebrated for capturing the dynamic energy and atmospheric conditions of urban life, particularly during winter. His works are characterized by their painterly style, use of light, and attention to the bustling cityscape.","observation":"Across all four views, the style is a richly textured, hand-painted urban winter tableau with fine visible strokes, dense architectural detail, and atmospheric snowfall. Muted gray-brown surroundings are punctuated by warm windows, lamps, reflections, and flags, while deep shadows and strong perspective give the streets a dramatic, nostalgic mood."},{"id":"steven-outram","name":"Steven Outram","cat":"painters","en":"Steven Outram","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steven-outram.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steven-outram","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","grain","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","muted-blue","orange"],"intro":"Steven Outram is a contemporary artist known for his evocative landscape paintings that capture the serene and mysterious qualities of the natural world. His work often features rural settings, with a focus on light and atmosphere, drawing inspiration from the Romantic and Realist traditions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, highly detailed rural landscapes with cinematic twilight compositions. Cool blue-grey darkness, mist, frost, and silhouetted trees are repeatedly punctuated by small warm light sources and orange horizons, creating a quiet, dreamlike mood with a subtle grainy photographic texture."},{"id":"uemura-shoen","name":"Uemura Shoen","cat":"painters","en":"Uemura Shoen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/uemura-shoen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/uemura-shoen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["black","bone-white","dark-blue","red","brown"],"intro":"Uemura Shoen was a prominent Japanese painter known for her exquisite bijin-ga (beautiful women) paintings, which often depicted women in traditional Japanese attire. Her work is celebrated for its delicate brushwork, elegant compositions, and the serene beauty of her subjects, reflecting the aesthetics of the Meiji and Taisho periods.","observation":"The style uses finely drawn, highly detailed portraiture with delicate linework, softly modelled faces, and richly patterned garments. Cropped profiles, strong blocks of background color, dark hair, and saturated red-blue floral textiles create a decorative, formal composition with visible painted surface texture."},{"id":"satyajit-ray","name":"Satyajit Ray","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Satyajit Ray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/satyajit-ray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/satyajit-ray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Satyajit Ray was an influential Indian filmmaker known for his profound impact on world cinema. Born in 1921 in Calcutta, Ray's work is celebrated for its humanist approach and realistic portrayal of Indian life. His films often explore social issues and the human condition, earning him international acclaim and numerous awards.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, bright practical or window light, and pronounced tonal contrast. Intimate portraits and character moments are framed through foreground obstructions and shallow focus, while grain, soft bokeh, and luminous highlights create a brooding cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"lawren-harris","name":"Lawren Harris","cat":"painters","en":"Lawren Harris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lawren-harris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lawren-harris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-blue","beige","pale-orange","grey","brown","black"],"intro":"Lawren Harris was a Canadian painter and a founding member of the Group of Seven, known for his depictions of the Canadian landscape. His work often features bold, simplified forms and vivid colors, capturing the spiritual essence of the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental mountain landscapes are built from angular, simplified forms and strongly contrasting planes of snow, rock, shadow, and sky. Visible broad paint strokes and thick surface texture give the illustrative compositions a handcrafted, expressive quality, with a restrained blue, cream, grey, and brown palette."},{"id":"vladimir-kush","name":"Vladimir Kush","cat":"painters","en":"Vladimir Kush","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vladimir-kush.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vladimir-kush","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","landscapes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["grey","muted-ochre","brown","ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Vladimir Kush is a contemporary Russian artist known for his surrealistic paintings that blend elements of fantasy and reality. His work often features dreamlike landscapes and imaginative scenarios, drawing inspiration from nature and mythology. Kush's art is characterized by its detailed execution and vibrant color palette, creating a sense of wonder and exploration.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly landscapes with monumental trees, books, cliffs, and clouds rendered as grand sculptural forms. Saturated teal, ochre, coral, and gold hues, dramatic illumination, and immense atmospheric skies create a luminous, dreamlike fantasy world with surreal visual transformations."},{"id":"jonone","name":"JonOne","cat":"street-artists","en":"JonOne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jonone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jonone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","dark-brown","red","vivid-rust","ochre"],"intro":"JonOne is a renowned graffiti artist known for his vibrant and abstract style. Born in New York City, he became a prominent figure in the street art scene, blending graffiti with abstract expressionism. His work often features bold colors and dynamic compositions, reflecting the energy and chaos of urban life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is intensely abstract and painterly, built from vigorous overlapping strokes, splashes, drips, scraped marks, and visibly layered paint. Saturated pinks, oranges, blues, greens, and yellows create a kinetic, expressive surface with dense, energetic compositions presented as large gallery canvases."},{"id":"ed-paschke","name":"Ed Paschke","cat":"painters","en":"Ed Paschke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-paschke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-paschke","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","portraits","glow","fine-lines","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-green","vivid-red","dark-brown","ochre","dark-blue"],"intro":"Ed Paschke was an American artist known for his vivid, often surreal portraits that explored themes of identity and popular culture. Born in 1939 in Chicago, Paschke became a prominent figure in the Chicago Imagist movement, which was characterized by its bold colors and graphic style. His work often incorporated elements of media imagery, creating a unique blend of fine art and pop culture.","observation":"Across the sheet, close-up faces and abstracted facial forms are rendered in intensely saturated red, green, blue, and yellow, with deep black shadow areas and luminous color blooms. Fine repeated linework, fingerprint-like contours, and dense granular dot texture give the portraits a retro printed-signal character, while warped features and glowing overlays push the imagery toward surreal expression."},{"id":"jean-fouquet","name":"Jean Fouquet","cat":"painters","en":"Jean Fouquet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-fouquet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-fouquet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["deep-red","dark-ochre","black","deep-blue","beige","blue"],"intro":"Jean Fouquet is a renowned 15th-century French painter, celebrated for his contributions to the Northern Renaissance. Known for his detailed and exquisite panel paintings, Fouquet's work often features religious themes and portraits of nobility. His style is marked by a meticulous attention to detail, a rich color palette, and a harmonious blend of Gothic and Renaissance elements.","observation":"The style uses finely rendered, naturalistic figures and settings with visible delicate brushwork, dense surface detail, and richly saturated reds and blues. Ornate textiles, manuscripts, architectural interiors, medieval-looking costumes, and carefully observed animals create a formal, devotional atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"anthony-van-dyck","name":"Anthony van Dyck","cat":"painters","en":"Anthony van Dyck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anthony-van-dyck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anthony-van-dyck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","orange","dark-brown","bone-white","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Anthony van Dyck was a Flemish Baroque artist, renowned for his portraits of European aristocracy and religious figures. Born in 1599 in Antwerp, he became a leading court painter in England, working for King Charles I. Van Dyck's work is characterized by its elegance, attention to detail, and the use of dramatic contrasts and rich colors, contributing significantly to the portrait genre of the 17th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses convincingly realistic portraiture with visible oil-paint brushwork, layered tonal modeling, and finely observed facial features. Dark backgrounds, restrained earthy colors, warm highlights, and strong light-dark contrast give the portraits a formal, old-master-like presence, while varied close crops keep the faces dominant."},{"id":"bunny-williams","name":"Bunny Williams","cat":"designers","en":"Bunny Williams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bunny-williams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bunny-williams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-ochre","brown","dark-olive","dark-brown","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Bunny Williams is a renowned American interior designer known for her elegant and timeless design aesthetic. With a career spanning several decades, she has become a prominent figure in the world of interior design, celebrated for her ability to blend classic and contemporary styles seamlessly. Williams's work often features a mix of luxurious textures, rich colors, and carefully curated furnishings, creating spaces that are both sophisticated and inviting.","observation":"The style presents richly furnished interiors and seated figures with convincing realism, layered decoration, and visible fine painterly brushwork. Muted greens, creams, blues, and warm wood tones unify the ornate classical rooms, while natural daylight, floral textiles, porcelain, framed art, and architectural symmetry create an elegant domestic tableau."},{"id":"osman-hamdi-bey","name":"Osman Hamdi Bey","cat":"painters","en":"Osman Hamdi Bey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/osman-hamdi-bey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/osman-hamdi-bey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","grey","bone-white","dark-rust"],"intro":"Osman Hamdi Bey was a prominent Ottoman painter, archaeologist, and intellectual, born in 1842 in Istanbul. He is renowned for his contributions to Turkish art and culture, particularly through his orientalist paintings that depict Ottoman and Islamic themes with a focus on cultural and historical accuracy. His works often feature detailed and realistic portrayals of people and settings, reflecting his deep interest in the cultural and historical aspects of the Ottoman Empire.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly and densely detailed, with visible fine brushwork describing textiles, architecture, patterned tiles, carved stone, and human figures. Earthy, subdued colors deepen into moody shadows, while ornate interiors, courtyards, markets, and classical architectural settings create an elaborate historical tableau."},{"id":"yoh-nagao","name":"Yoh Nagao","cat":"various-artists","en":"Yoh Nagao","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yoh-nagao.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yoh-nagao","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["muted-olive","pink","vivid-red","blue","brown","yellow"],"intro":"Yoh Nagao is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and eclectic style that often blends elements of traditional Japanese culture with modern digital techniques. His work is characterized by a unique fusion of pop art and surrealism, creating visually striking compositions that are both playful and thought-provoking.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly saturated color-blocking with dense, tactile patchwork imagery: figures, clothing, flowers, and objects are assembled from overlapping textile-like patterns and painted fragments. Clean graphic contours coexist with visible brush texture, bold outlines, and abundant decorative motifs, producing exuberant collage-like fashion compositions."},{"id":"robert-ryman","name":"Robert Ryman","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Ryman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-ryman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-ryman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["minimalist","patterns","still-life","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","beige","muted-orange"],"intro":"Robert Ryman is an American painter known for his minimalist and abstract works, often focusing on the exploration of white and its textural possibilities. His art emphasizes the materiality of paint and the surface of the canvas, creating a unique dialogue between the viewer and the artwork.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is restrained and nearly monochromatic, centering on sparse white or off-white canvases displayed against clean gallery interiors. Subtle surface irregularities, raw edges, frames, and gentle shadows provide the visual interest while extensive empty space dominates each composition."},{"id":"colin-mccahon","name":"Colin McCahon","cat":"painters","en":"Colin McCahon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/colin-mccahon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/colin-mccahon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","pale-yellow","beige","charcoal","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Colin McCahon was a prominent New Zealand painter known for his abstract and landscape works that often incorporated spiritual and existential themes. His art is characterized by its bold use of text, stark landscapes, and a distinctive use of light and shadow, reflecting the unique environment of New Zealand.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad visible brushwork and layered, rough paint surfaces combine with simplified geometric forms and stark horizontal or diagonal divisions. The restrained charcoal, slate, ochre, and rust palette creates a dark, high-contrast mood, while sparse landscapes and large empty fields give the compositions an austere, abstract stillness."},{"id":"constance-guisset","name":"Constance Guisset","cat":"designers","en":"Constance Guisset","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/constance-guisset.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/constance-guisset","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","fashion","floral","patterns","still-life","glow","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","beige","silver","dark-brown","dark-red","black"],"intro":"Constance Guisset is a renowned French designer known for her innovative and poetic approach to design. Her work often explores the interplay between form and function, creating pieces that are both aesthetically pleasing and highly functional. Guisset's designs span various domains, including furniture, lighting, and interior design, and are characterized by their elegance, fluidity, and imaginative qualities.","observation":"The style presents imaginative lighting and furniture installations as polished, highly realistic interior photography, combining sculptural textile forms with refined architectural settings. Pleated translucent surfaces, glowing internal light, saturated coral and teal accents, and carefully arranged negative space give the scenes a luxurious, dreamlike character."},{"id":"abbott-fuller-graves","name":"Abbott Fuller Graves","cat":"painters","en":"Abbott Fuller Graves","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abbott-fuller-graves.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abbott-fuller-graves","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","light-yellow","grey","dark-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Abbott Fuller Graves is an American painter known for his floral landscapes and garden scenes, often capturing the essence of European gardens with a focus on light and color. His work is characterized by a detailed and painterly style that combines elements of Impressionism and Romanticism.","observation":"These scenes use luminous, highly saturated garden colors and richly visible paint strokes to build dense foliage, abundant flowers, and sunlit architectural spaces. Elegant figures in white dresses are integrated into layered garden settings, with expressive brushwork, dappled light, and a soft, idyllic atmosphere throughout."},{"id":"liu-wei","name":"Liu Wei","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Liu Wei","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/liu-wei.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/liu-wei","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","scenes","urban","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","epic","geometric"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","grey","silver","deep-red"],"intro":"Liu Wei is a contemporary Chinese artist known for his diverse and innovative works that span painting, sculpture, and installation. His art often explores themes of urbanization, identity, and the complexities of modern life, using a variety of materials and techniques to challenge traditional boundaries.","observation":"The style combines heavily textured, visibly built-up paint with highly detailed architectural forms that feel carved, modelled, and physically weighty. Muted stone, dusty beige, and blue-green tones unify surreal scenes of monumental ruins, damaged classical structures, draped interiors, and uncanny oversized objects."},{"id":"adolph-gottlieb","name":"Adolph Gottlieb","cat":"painters","en":"Adolph Gottlieb","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adolph-gottlieb.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adolph-gottlieb","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["vivid-red","red","black","bone-white","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Adolph Gottlieb is a renowned American abstract expressionist painter known for his bold use of color and form. Born in 1903, Gottlieb became a significant figure in the New York art scene, contributing to the development of abstract expressionism. His work often features geometric shapes and a vivid color palette, exploring themes of symbolism and emotion.","observation":"Across all four panels, saturated vermilion fields support stark black circular and biomorphic marks, with occasional white ground and strong negative space. Broad, visibly brushed paint, rough edges, drips, splatters, and ink-like gestures combine geometric blocking with expressive abstraction and pronounced black⁠–red⁠–white contrast."},{"id":"carsten-meyerdierks","name":"Carsten Meyerdierks","cat":"photographers","en":"Carsten Meyerdierks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carsten-meyerdierks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carsten-meyerdierks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","orange"],"intro":"Carsten Meyerdierks is a contemporary photographer known for his surreal and fantastical landscape imagery. His work often explores themes of nature, mystery, and the ethereal, creating visually arresting scenes that transport viewers to otherworldly realms.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic landscapes with dense environmental detail, monumental rock formations, reflective water, and dramatic weather. Muted blue-green tones are punctuated by warm orange light, while mist, cloud masses, and strong contrast create a brooding yet surreal sense of scale."},{"id":"daniel-ridgway-knight","name":"Daniel Ridgway Knight","cat":"painters","en":"Daniel Ridgway Knight","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daniel-ridgway-knight.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daniel-ridgway-knight","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","black","silver","grey","red"],"intro":"Daniel Ridgway Knight was an American artist known for his paintings depicting rural life and landscapes, particularly in France. Born in 1839, Knight studied at the École des Beaux-Arts and became renowned for his detailed and realistic portrayals of peasant women in idyllic settings, capturing the essence of 19th-century rural life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, directional paint strokes to create realistic figures, wildflowers, water, and expansive pastoral landscapes. Subdued natural colors, finely observed textures, classical rural clothing, and soft atmospheric light give the scenes a contemplative, dreamy quality."},{"id":"hans-bellmer","name":"Hans Bellmer","cat":"photographers","en":"Hans Bellmer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-bellmer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-bellmer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","brown"],"intro":"Hans Bellmer was a German artist known for his surreal and provocative work, particularly his life-sized dolls and photographs that explored themes of eroticism and psychological complexity. His work was influential in the surrealist movement, often delving into the darker aspects of human nature and identity.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable faces and figures are fractured into overlapping planes, exposed construction lines, and layered anatomical fragments. Fine ink-like drawing, crosshatched shading, paper texture, and stark monochrome values create an expressive, unsettling surreal portrait style."},{"id":"roberto-cavalli","name":"Roberto Cavalli","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Roberto Cavalli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roberto-cavalli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roberto-cavalli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["brown","black","charcoal","muted-ochre","beige"],"intro":"Roberto Cavalli is an Italian fashion designer known for his exotic prints and luxurious clothing. He founded his fashion house in the early 1970s and became famous for his innovative use of textiles and bold, colorful designs. Cavalli's work often features animal prints, intricate patterns, and a glamorous aesthetic that has made him a staple in high fashion.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic fashion-editorial imagery with models in richly patterned, animal-inspired garments, fur, and metallic accessories. Dark runway settings, selective focus, subdued brown, black, cream, and blue tones, and strong directional lighting create a dramatic cinematic atmosphere, while close-up fabric and belt details emphasize ornate luxury."},{"id":"albert-benois","name":"Albert Benois","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Benois","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-benois.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-benois","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-brown","muted-ochre","pale-orange","red"],"intro":"Albert Benois is a historical figure known for his contributions to the arts, particularly within the Russian art scene. He was part of the influential Benois family, which played a significant role in the development of Russian culture and art during the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"Across the sheet, richly painted figures, garments, interiors, and garden settings are built from visible, varied brushwork with softly blended edges and layered tonal marks. The restrained palette of dusty rose, cream, olive, brown, and black creates an atmospheric, refined mood, while cropped social scenes and fashion-focused portraits provide recurring structure."},{"id":"david-tutwiler","name":"David Tutwiler","cat":"painters","en":"David Tutwiler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-tutwiler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-tutwiler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","scenes","urban","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","pale-orange","rust","light-orange"],"intro":"David Tutwiler is an American artist known for his evocative paintings that capture the essence of transportation and urban landscapes. His work often focuses on the dynamic interplay between light and shadow, creating a sense of movement and nostalgia. Tutwiler's paintings are celebrated for their detailed realism and ability to convey the industrial spirit of early 20th-century America.","observation":"These city scenes combine visible broad paint strokes and textured surfaces with dense architectural detail, giving the streets a cinematic, illustrative character. Moody blue-gray shadows contrast with amber windows, headlights, and signal lights, while rain, reflections, traffic, and pedestrians create a recurring sense of urban movement."},{"id":"choi-jeong-hwa","name":"Choi Jeong-Hwa","cat":"various-artists","en":"Choi Jeong-Hwa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/choi-jeong-hwa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/choi-jeong-hwa","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","glow","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","muted-red","ochre","red","charcoal","silver","blue"],"intro":"Choi Jeong-Hwa is a South Korean artist known for his vibrant and playful installations that often incorporate everyday objects and materials. His work is characterized by a fusion of traditional Korean culture with contemporary pop elements, creating a unique and engaging visual language.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents an exuberant installation of oversized, highly symmetrical vessel-like sculptures assembled from stacked rings, bulbs, ridges, and spirals. Saturated translucent colors, glossy surfaces, dense repetition, reflective floors, and bright atrium light create a vivid surreal environment that feels both sculptural and meticulously decorative."},{"id":"william-kentridge","name":"William Kentridge","cat":"various-artists","en":"William Kentridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-kentridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-kentridge","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","silver","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"William Kentridge is a renowned South African artist known for his unique blend of drawing, film, and performance art. His work often explores themes of history, memory, and identity, reflecting on the socio-political landscape of South Africa, particularly during and after the apartheid era. Kentridge's art is characterized by its expressive use of charcoal and ink, creating a distinctive monochromatic style that conveys deep emotion and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, expressive figures and narrative tableaux are built from dense, gestural black marks, ink-like washes, and broad, visibly worked strokes on rough pale surfaces. The restrained sepia, grey, and black palette, stark lighting, heavy silhouettes, and theatrical staging give the style a dark, dramatic presence."},{"id":"fan-ho","name":"Fan Ho","cat":"photographers","en":"Fan Ho","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fan-ho.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fan-ho","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey"],"intro":"Fan Ho is a celebrated photographer and filmmaker known for his evocative black-and-white images of Hong Kong. His work captures the essence of urban life during the mid-20th century, blending elements of realism and modernism. Fan Ho's photography is renowned for its use of light and shadow, creating a cinematic and introspective atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses stark black-and-white tonal separation, deep silhouettes, and intense backlighting to turn dense urban environments into dramatic visual scenes. Mist, shafts of light, reflective water, steep stairs, and layered architecture create a cinematic sense of depth and quiet human activity."},{"id":"serge-mouille","name":"Serge Mouille","cat":"designers","en":"Serge Mouille","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/serge-mouille.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/serge-mouille","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","still-life","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver","black","ochre"],"intro":"Serge Mouille was a renowned French industrial designer and sculptor, best known for his iconic lighting fixtures and minimalist design approach. His work is characterized by sleek lines, organic shapes, and a focus on functionality, which became emblematic of mid-century modern design. Mouille's designs are celebrated for their elegance and innovative use of materials, particularly metal.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents carefully staged interior scenes with realistic materials, restrained earthy tones, and a strong sense of spaciousness. Sparse compositions, low modern furniture, sculptural lamps, and pools of warm illumination create a quiet, cinematic atmosphere against largely empty walls."},{"id":"antoine-pevsner","name":"Antoine Pevsner","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Antoine Pevsner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antoine-pevsner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antoine-pevsner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","characters","metallic","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","geometric"],"colours":["silver","beige","white","brown","black","rust"],"intro":"Antoine Pevsner was a Russian-born sculptor and painter, known for his pioneering work in the Constructivist movement. He, along with his brother Naum Gabo , developed the concept of \"stereometric construction,\" which emphasized the use of space and volume in sculpture. Pevsner's work often explored themes of geometry and abstraction, reflecting his interest in the intersection of art and technology.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental, abstract human-like sculptures built from sharply faceted, sweeping geometric forms with visible weight and volume. Restrained bronze, wood, and dark metallic surfaces catch directional light against simple gallery backdrops, producing a bold, surreal display-object aesthetic."},{"id":"betsey-johnson","name":"Betsey Johnson","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Betsey Johnson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/betsey-johnson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/betsey-johnson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","still-life","glow","metallic","vivid-colors"],"colours":["white","muted-teal","bone-white","red","rust","brown"],"intro":"Betsey Johnson is an American fashion designer known for her whimsical and bold designs that often incorporate bright colors, playful patterns, and a sense of fun. Her work has been influential in the fashion industry, particularly in the 1980s and 1990s, and she is celebrated for her unique and eclectic style.","observation":"The style presents extravagant high-fashion footwear as highly realistic studio product imagery, with sculptural platforms, towering heels, floral textiles, lace, beads, tassels, and reflective embellishments rendered in crisp detail. Pink, turquoise, cream, and gold dominate the ornate designs, with soft studio illumination emphasizing the layered materials and dimensional surfaces."},{"id":"daan-roosegaarde","name":"Daan Roosegaarde","cat":"various-artists","en":"Daan Roosegaarde","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daan-roosegaarde.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daan-roosegaarde","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-blue","black","red","dark-cyan","magenta"],"intro":"Daan Roosegaarde is a Dutch artist and innovator known for his work at the intersection of art, technology, and the environment. He is recognized for creating interactive artworks and installations that explore the relationship between people, technology, and space. Roosegaarde's projects often focus on sustainability and the future of urban environments, integrating elements of design and innovation to address contemporary issues.","observation":"A cinematic, realistic nocturnal style depicts silhouetted people moving through expansive coastal landscapes and fields of bioluminescent light. Strong cyan, blue, pink, and orange illumination creates vivid reflections, deep shadows, atmospheric haze, and a dreamy otherworldly mood."},{"id":"jose-clemente-orozco","name":"Jose Clemente Orozco","cat":"painters","en":"Jose Clemente Orozco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jose-clemente-orozco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jose-clemente-orozco","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","deep-red","red","orange"],"intro":"Jose Clemente Orozco is a renowned Mexican painter and muralist, known for his powerful and politically charged works. He was a leading figure in the Mexican Muralism movement, alongside Diego Rivera and David Alfaro Siqueiros. Orozco's art often depicted themes of human suffering, social injustice, and the struggles of the Mexican people, characterized by bold lines, dramatic compositions, and a somber color palette.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly broad, directional paint strokes and heavy drawn contours to build densely crowded scenes of distressed, distorted figures. A restricted palette of deep blacks, browns, muted greens, and intense reds creates stark contrast and a grim, monumental atmosphere, while exaggerated faces and gestures make the imagery forcefully expressive."},{"id":"spike-lee","name":"Spike Lee","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Spike Lee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/spike-lee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/spike-lee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["white","black","red","dark-brown","light-red","grey"],"intro":"Spike Lee is an influential American filmmaker known for his provocative and socially conscious films. He has directed numerous critically acclaimed movies that explore themes of race, identity, and politics, often set against the backdrop of urban America. Lee's work is characterized by its bold storytelling, dynamic visuals, and strong cultural commentary, making him a pivotal figure in contemporary cinema.","observation":"The style combines expressive, highly rendered portraiture with visible brushwork, crisp graphic contours, and selective fine linework. Strongly saturated clothing and abstract color fields contrast with a monochrome variation, while oversized eyeglasses, hats, and carefully styled garments give the portraits a distinctive editorial character."},{"id":"andy-kubert","name":"Andy Kubert","cat":"illustrators","en":"Andy Kubert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andy-kubert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andy-kubert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Andy Kubert is a renowned comic book artist known for his work with major publishers like Marvel and DC Comics. His dynamic and detailed illustrations have made significant contributions to the superhero genre, particularly with characters such as Batman and Wolverine. Kubert's style is characterized by bold linework, dramatic compositions, and a strong sense of motion and emotion.","observation":"The style is dense, highly rendered comic-book illustration built from heavy black contouring, abundant hatching, and sharply modeled anatomy. Saturated reds, oranges, blues, and ochres are pushed against deep shadows, with crowded character groupings, explosive gestures, monsters, and ruined settings creating an intense heroic-fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"henry-asencio","name":"Henry Asencio","cat":"painters","en":"Henry Asencio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henry-asencio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henry-asencio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["deep-red","ochre","dark-red","brown","black","white"],"intro":"Henry Asencio is a contemporary American painter known for his expressive and sensual figurative works. His art often explores themes of femininity, beauty, and emotional depth, using a distinctive style characterized by bold brushwork and vibrant color palettes.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses visible, energetic brushwork with layered strokes that remain legible in both skin and clothing. Warm reds and ochres dominate, while cropped, introspective female figures are modeled with selective detail against loosely painted backgrounds."},{"id":"johannes-itten","name":"Johannes Itten","cat":"painters","en":"Johannes Itten","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johannes-itten.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johannes-itten","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","vivid-red","dark-blue","bone-white","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Johannes Itten was a Swiss painter, designer, and teacher associated with the Bauhaus school. Known for his work in color theory, Itten's influence extended into modern art and design education. His exploration of color contrasts and geometric forms has left a lasting impact on the art world.","observation":"The style combines strict geometric organization with saturated blocks of red, orange, yellow, blue, green, and teal. Repeated circles, arcs, grids, and concentric forms create abstract patterned compositions, while visible brush texture and fine drawn boundaries soften the otherwise clean illustrative structure."},{"id":"pierre-bonnard","name":"Pierre Bonnard","cat":"painters","en":"Pierre Bonnard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-bonnard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-bonnard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","landscapes","scenes","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","charcoal","bone-white","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Pierre Bonnard was a French painter and printmaker, known for his vibrant use of color and innovative compositions. Born in 1867, he was a leading figure in the Post-Impressionist movement and a founding member of Les Nabis, a group of avant-garde artists. Bonnard's work often depicted intimate domestic scenes, landscapes, and still lifes, characterized by a unique sense of color and light.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from visibly textured, energetic paint with broad directional strokes and richly layered color. It combines intimate domestic scenes, still-life arrangements, gardens, and framed interior views with decorative fabrics, foliage, ceramics, and strong red accents."},{"id":"thomas-cole","name":"Thomas Cole","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Cole","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-cole.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-cole","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","beige","pale-orange","silver"],"intro":"Thomas Cole was an influential American painter known for his role in establishing the Hudson River School, a mid-19th century American art movement. His work is characterized by romantic landscapes that often depict the grandeur and beauty of the American wilderness, infused with a sense of the sublime and the picturesque. Cole's paintings frequently explore themes of nature, civilization, and the passage of time, often incorporating classical architectural elements.","observation":"The style presents vast fantasy landscapes with painterly atmospheric depth, densely layered cliffs, waterfalls, forests, temples, and distant settlements. Dramatic cloud formations, radiant openings in the sky, mist, and strong warm-cool contrasts create a cinematic, epic sense of scale and wonder."},{"id":"giovanni-boldini","name":"Giovanni Boldini","cat":"painters","en":"Giovanni Boldini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giovanni-boldini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giovanni-boldini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Giovanni Boldini was an Italian painter known for his elegant and dynamic portraits, particularly of women. He was a prominent figure in the Belle Époque era, celebrated for capturing the grace and sophistication of high society. Boldini's work is characterized by its fluid brushwork and vibrant color palette, often portraying his subjects in motion and with a sense of immediacy.","observation":"Across all four renders, fashionable women are presented in tightly cropped portrait compositions with elaborate hats, feathers, fur, and dramatic garments. Visible directional brushwork, softly blended facial modelling, strong dark-and-light separation, and restrained cream, black, white, and red tones create a refined but expressive painted appearance."},{"id":"thomas-wrede","name":"Thomas Wrede","cat":"photographers","en":"Thomas Wrede","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-wrede.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-wrede","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","motion","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["blue","dark-blue","grey","charcoal","silver","dark-olive"],"intro":"Thomas Wrede is a contemporary German photographer known for his innovative and surreal landscape photography. His work often explores the intersection of reality and illusion, creating dreamlike scenes that challenge perceptions of the natural world. Wrede's photographs are characterized by their meticulous composition and attention to detail, often incorporating elements of human intervention within vast, untouched landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, cinematic environmental imagery with dense natural texture and carefully staged, impossible architecture or landscapes. A cool blue, subdued palette and wintry atmosphere dominate, repeatedly contrasted by small pools of warm interior light, while waves, clouds, snow, and frost provide strong visual motion and scale."},{"id":"piero-della-francesca","name":"Piero della Francesca","cat":"painters","en":"Piero della Francesca","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/piero-della-francesca.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/piero-della-francesca","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["blue","pale-orange","grey","muted-brown","black","red"],"intro":"Piero della Francesca was an Italian painter of the Early Renaissance , known for his serene and mathematically precise compositions. His work is characterized by its use of perspective, geometric forms, and a calm, contemplative atmosphere. Piero's paintings often depict religious themes and figures, rendered with a sense of harmony and balance that reflects the humanist ideals of the Renaissance.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, classical-looking profile figures and architectural fragments with a visibly cracked, aged painted surface. Strong geometric cropping, broad blue fields, restrained earthy colors, and carefully placed negative space give the compositions a fragmented collage-like rhythm while retaining illustrative detail."},{"id":"deirdre-sullivan-beeman","name":"Deirdre Sullivan-Beeman","cat":"painters","en":"Deirdre Sullivan-Beeman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/deirdre-sullivan-beeman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/deirdre-sullivan-beeman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","muted-olive","bone-white","orange","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Deirdre Sullivan-Beeman is a contemporary artist known for her surreal and fantastical paintings that often explore themes of femininity and mythology. Her work is characterized by detailed and expressive portraits, often featuring young women adorned with symbolic elements and intricate headpieces.","observation":"Richly textured painted portraits combine finely rendered faces, birds, flowers, feathers, and patterned garments with decorative gold accents. The style uses saturated jewel tones, deep backgrounds, expressive close cropping, and visible delicate brushwork to create an ornate, fantastical atmosphere."},{"id":"masahisa-fukase","name":"Masahisa Fukase","cat":"photographers","en":"Masahisa Fukase","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/masahisa-fukase.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/masahisa-fukase","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","backlighting","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","beige","white","brown"],"intro":"Masahisa Fukase was a renowned Japanese photographer known for his deeply personal and often haunting imagery. His work frequently explored themes of isolation, identity, and the passage of time, often using stark black and white photography to convey a sense of melancholy and introspection. Fukase's most famous series, \"The Solitude of Ravens,\" is celebrated for its powerful emotional impact and innovative use of photographic techniques.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses stark black-and-white portrait photography with deep blacks, bright highlights, and visibly grainy texture. Close cropping, obscured faces, expressive poses, and hard directional or backlighting create an intimate, cinematic atmosphere of tension and introspection."},{"id":"rosalba-carriera","name":"Rosalba Carriera","cat":"painters","en":"Rosalba Carriera","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rosalba-carriera.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rosalba-carriera","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige","grey","red"],"intro":"Rosalba Carriera was an Italian Rococo painter known for her exquisite pastel portraits, particularly of the European aristocracy during the 18th century. Born in Venice, Carriera became one of the most successful female artists of her time, celebrated for her delicate and refined style that captured the elegance and grace of her subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses softly blended, visibly brushed paint to depict refined close-up portraits with powdered hair, elaborate lace, and decorative floral or feather details. Muted blue, cream, pink, and gray tones sit against dark backgrounds, while delicate highlights and fine surface marks enrich the garments and ornaments."},{"id":"nina-leen","name":"Nina Leen","cat":"photographers","en":"Nina Leen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nina-leen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nina-leen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","silver","black","white"],"intro":"Nina Leen is known for her work as a photographer, particularly during the mid-20th century. She was a prominent figure in the world of photography, capturing the essence of American life and culture through her lens. Her work often featured portraits, fashion, and everyday scenes, characterized by a keen eye for detail and composition.","observation":"A monochrome, high-contrast photographic style presents glamorous women in carefully staged domestic interiors, with expressive poses, vintage clothing, props, and pets. Strong window light, deep shadows, selective focus, and polished compositions create a dramatic retro fashion-editorial mood across the four scenes."},{"id":"kenneth-noland","name":"Kenneth Noland","cat":"painters","en":"Kenneth Noland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kenneth-noland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kenneth-noland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","minimalist","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-olive","red","vivid-red","light-orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Kenneth Noland was an influential American painter known for his role in the Color Field movement. He was a prominent figure in the development of abstract art in the mid-20th century, particularly recognized for his use of simple geometric shapes and vibrant colors. Noland's work often featured concentric circles, chevrons, and stripes, exploring the emotional impact of color and form.","observation":"The style uses highly simplified, symmetrical geometric compositions built from concentric circular bands in saturated contrasting colors. Broad painted areas retain visible brush texture and slightly irregular edges, combining flat graphic structure with a handmade canvas surface."},{"id":"mikko-lagerstedt","name":"Mikko Lagerstedt","cat":"photographers","en":"Mikko Lagerstedt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mikko-lagerstedt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mikko-lagerstedt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["dark-cyan","black","muted-blue","dark-blue"],"intro":"Mikko Lagerstedt is a Finnish photographer known for his captivating landscape and night photography. His work often explores the serene and mysterious aspects of nature, capturing the ethereal beauty of the Nordic environment. Lagerstedt's photography is celebrated for its ability to evoke emotion and convey a sense of solitude and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is photographic and cinematic, built around quiet nocturnal landscapes with deep blue tones, strong dark silhouettes, reflective water, and expansive star fields. Mist softens the distant shorelines while localized light sources and bright celestial detail create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere."},{"id":"peter-kuper","name":"Peter Kuper","cat":"illustrators","en":"Peter Kuper","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-kuper.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-kuper","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","motion","bold-lines","vivid-colors","drawing","epic","geometric"],"colours":["muted-teal","ochre","dark-brown","silver","charcoal","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Peter Kuper is an American illustrator and cartoonist known for his distinctive style and contributions to various publications, including Mad magazine and The New Yorker. He is recognized for his political and social commentary, often expressed through bold and expressive illustrations.","observation":"The style is a densely packed, highly narrative illustration built from thick black contours, vivid flat-to-lightly textured colors, and an abundance of small visual details. Crowded scenes, dramatic sunbursts and smoke, architectural structures, expressive figures, and symbolic objects are arranged with energetic, almost poster-like geometry across all four images."},{"id":"jeannette-guichard-bunel","name":"Jeannette Guichard-Bunel","cat":"painters","en":"Jeannette Guichard-Bunel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeannette-guichard-bunel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeannette-guichard-bunel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-orange","dark-blue","black","silver","red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Jeannette Guichard-Bunel is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings that often blend elements of fantasy and surrealism. Her work is characterized by detailed and whimsical portrayals of subjects, often incorporating floral and botanical themes.","observation":"The style combines close-up, idealized portraits with lavish floral headpieces, jewelry, fabrics, and botanical decoration. Saturated blue, coral, orange, and cream hues are rendered with visible painterly strokes, finely modeled faces, and dense ornamental detail, giving the images a romantic, fantastical fashion-editorial character."},{"id":"amanda-clark","name":"Amanda Clark","cat":"illustrators","en":"Amanda Clark","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amanda-clark.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amanda-clark","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","floral","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","silver","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Amanda Clark is a contemporary artist known for her enchanting and whimsical illustrations that often draw inspiration from nature and folklore. Her work is characterized by a dreamy and fantastical style, blending elements of surrealism and detailed floral motifs.","observation":"Across all four images, richly textured paint and delicate visible marks build dense woodland scenes filled with flowers, trees, animals, and fairy-tale figures. The recurring blue-green atmosphere, selective red accents, intricate botanical patterning, and softly strange encounters give the style a dreamy, ornate storybook quality."},{"id":"harry-callahan","name":"Harry Callahan","cat":"photographers","en":"Harry Callahan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harry-callahan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harry-callahan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Harry Callahan is a renowned American photographer known for his innovative and experimental approach to photography. Born in 1912, Callahan's work often explored the boundaries of photographic techniques, focusing on everyday scenes with a unique perspective. His contributions to the field have been recognized as pivotal in the development of modern photography, particularly in the realm of black and white imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark black-and-white imagery uses severe tonal separation to turn buildings, trees, and figures into graphic silhouettes. Bare winter landscapes, deep shadows, grain, selective softness, and atmospheric distance create a bleak, cinematic sense of isolation."},{"id":"isabelle-de-borchgrave","name":"Isabelle de Borchgrave","cat":"various-artists","en":"Isabelle de Borchgrave","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isabelle-de-borchgrave.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isabelle-de-borchgrave","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","subdued-colors","cinematic","classical","retro"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","dark-red","silver"],"intro":"Isabelle de Borchgrave is a Belgian artist known for her innovative work in paper and textile art, particularly her life-sized recreations of historical costumes. Her work often explores themes of history and fashion, bringing to life the intricate details of garments from different eras using paper as her primary medium.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic fashion portraits staged in richly decorated historic interiors, with elaborate gowns, ruffles, floral textiles, and sculptural headpieces dominating the compositions. Muted earthy colors, controlled dramatic lighting, and carefully posed full-length figures create a theatrical, editorial atmosphere with a distinctly antique visual language."},{"id":"william-de-morgan","name":"William de Morgan","cat":"designers","en":"William de Morgan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-de-morgan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-de-morgan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","patterns","bold-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","bone-white","dark-blue","muted-ochre","orange"],"intro":"William de Morgan was a British ceramicist and designer, renowned for his contributions to the Arts and Crafts Movement in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. He is celebrated for his innovative tile designs and intricate patterns, often inspired by nature and mythical themes. His work is characterized by vibrant colors, detailed craftsmanship, and a unique blend of traditional and imaginative elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly painted birds and botanical forms fill decorative tiled compositions, with dense plumage, foliage, and floral motifs. Strong dark outlines, visible brushwork, restrained blue-green and cream tones, and aged crackled surfaces give the style an ornate illustrative character."},{"id":"bill-leak","name":"Bill Leak","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bill Leak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-leak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-leak","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","silver","red","brown","charcoal","bone-white"],"intro":"Bill Leak is (or was) an Australian cartoonist and painter known for his satirical and often controversial works. His art often reflects social and political themes, capturing the essence of Australian culture and identity through a distinctive and bold style.","observation":"The style combines loose, expressive ink drawing with translucent watercolor washes, leaving paper and irregular painted edges visible. Elongated figures, exaggerated anatomy, sparse color-blocked settings, and awkward social encounters create a distinctive illustrative sense of tension and gentle surrealism across the four scenes."},{"id":"yinka-shonibare","name":"Yinka Shonibare","cat":"various-artists","en":"Yinka Shonibare","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yinka-shonibare.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yinka-shonibare","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","scenes","motion","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","beige","orange","deep-rust","charcoal"],"intro":"Yinka Shonibare is a British-Nigerian artist known for his exploration of cultural identity, colonialism, and postcolonialism. He often uses brightly colored African fabrics to create sculptures, installations, and photographs that challenge perceptions of identity and history. His work frequently addresses themes of race, class, and the legacy of colonialism, blending European art history with African cultural references.","observation":"Across all four renders, vividly patterned textiles and layered garments form dense, ornate figures in energetic, acrobatic tableaux. The style combines expressive movement, saturated orange-and-blue color, elaborate surface patterning, and surreal fashion-display settings with a crisp illustrative finish."},{"id":"adrianus-eversen","name":"Adrianus Eversen","cat":"painters","en":"Adrianus Eversen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adrianus-eversen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adrianus-eversen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","light-blue","grey","bone-white","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Adrianus Eversen was a Dutch painter known for his detailed and atmospheric depictions of 19th-century urban and village scenes. His works often featured the quaint streets and canals of the Netherlands, capturing the essence of everyday life with a romantic realism that was characteristic of the Dutch Golden Age.","observation":"These images use richly textured, painterly brushwork to depict densely built canal towns with Gothic spires, aged masonry, boats, and small figures. Warm backlight, reflective water, dramatic cloud formations, and atmospheric haze create a cinematic, high-contrast sense of depth across the scenes."},{"id":"george-platt-lynes","name":"George Platt Lynes","cat":"photographers","en":"George Platt Lynes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-platt-lynes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-platt-lynes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","charcoal","bone-white","grey","white","beige"],"intro":"George Platt Lynes was an American photographer known for his work in fashion and fine art photography during the mid-20th century. He gained recognition for his evocative and often surreal images, which frequently explored themes of sexuality and identity. Lynes was a prominent figure in the artistic circles of his time, collaborating with other notable artists and writers.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome photographic portraiture with strong tonal separation, hard directional window light, and deep architectural shadows. Carefully posed figures, elegant clothing, sparse studio interiors, and generous negative space create a polished, dramatic vintage fashion-editorial mood."},{"id":"francesco-borromini","name":"Francesco Borromini","cat":"architects","en":"Francesco Borromini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francesco-borromini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francesco-borromini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","subdued-colors","surreal","religious","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","beige","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Francesco Borromini was an Italian architect who played a pivotal role in the development of Baroque architecture during the 17th century. Known for his innovative designs and complex spatial compositions, Borromini's work is characterized by its dramatic use of light and shadow, as well as its intricate and dynamic forms. His architectural masterpieces, such as San Carlo alle Quattro Fontane in Rome, showcase his unique approach to geometry and ornamentation, making him one of the most influential figures in Baroque architecture.","observation":"The style presents richly ornamented sacred interiors with dense sculptural relief, layered arches, columns, domes, and carefully rendered architectural detail. Restrained ivory, beige, and brown tones lend the scenes a realistic material presence, while warped perspectives and repeated vault forms create a striking surreal disorientation."},{"id":"josh-keyes","name":"Josh Keyes","cat":"painters","en":"Josh Keyes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josh-keyes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josh-keyes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-blue","blue","charcoal","silver","rust","muted-cyan","red"],"intro":"Josh Keyes is an American contemporary artist known for his detailed and surreal depictions of animals and nature. His work often explores themes of environmentalism and the juxtaposition of wildlife with urban settings, creating a narrative that questions the relationship between humans and the natural world.","observation":"This style combines highly detailed, realistic-looking environmental scenes with fantastically oversized animals and incongruous objects. Saturated colors, crisp daylight, strong contrast, and expressive surface texture give the images a vivid, polished illustrative quality while emphasizing dramatic scale and surreal juxtapositions."},{"id":"romero-britto","name":"Romero Britto","cat":"painters","en":"Romero Britto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/romero-britto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/romero-britto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","blue","light-yellow","vivid-red","pink","green"],"intro":"Romero Britto is a Brazilian artist known for his vibrant and colorful pop art style. His work often combines elements of cubism, graffiti, and pop art, creating a unique and joyful aesthetic. Britto's art is characterized by bold colors, playful themes, and a sense of optimism, making it widely appealing and accessible.","observation":"The style combines densely packed abstract cartoon faces and symbols with thick, emphatic black contour lines and vivid, flat color blocks. Numerous patterned panels, visible brush textures, expressive eyes, hearts, stars, and flowers create a playful, energetic patchwork surface."},{"id":"matt-wuerker","name":"Matt Wuerker","cat":"illustrators","en":"Matt Wuerker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-wuerker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-wuerker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","funny","madness"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-rust","charcoal","grey","red","orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"Matt Wuerker is a renowned American political cartoonist and illustrator known for his work with Politico, where he combines sharp wit with detailed and expressive illustrations to comment on contemporary political issues. His style is characterized by a blend of humor and incisive critique, often employing a rich color palette and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly worked watercolor-like paint with dark, irregular ink contours and highly saturated color. It is densely packed with close-up, caricatured faces whose distorted anatomy, bulging eyes, and exaggerated expressions create a chaotic grotesque-comic mood."},{"id":"madeleine-vionnet","name":"Madeleine Vionnet","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Madeleine Vionnet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/madeleine-vionnet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/madeleine-vionnet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","beige","brown","muted-brown","red","deep-red"],"intro":"Madeleine Vionnet was a renowned French fashion designer, celebrated for her innovative and elegant designs during the early 20th century. Known as the \"Queen of the bias cut,\" she revolutionized women's fashion by introducing techniques that emphasized the natural female form. Her work is characterized by fluidity, simplicity, and a keen understanding of fabric and form.","observation":"The style presents sculptural, heavily draped gowns as realistic fashion-editorial photographs, with intricate pleating and long trailing fabric rendered in fine material detail. Warm, subdued interiors, classical architectural ornament, mannequins, and dramatic directional light give the images a moody, cinematic museum-display atmosphere."},{"id":"marc-newson","name":"Marc Newson","cat":"designers","en":"Marc Newson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-newson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-newson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","fashion","still-life","metallic","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["silver","white","grey","brown","deep-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Marc Newson is an acclaimed Australian designer known for his innovative and futuristic approach to industrial design. His work spans a wide range of products, from furniture to aircraft interiors, characterized by sleek, organic forms and a bold use of color and materials. Newson's designs often incorporate advanced technology and materials, reflecting a modernist aesthetic that is both functional and visually striking.","observation":"The style presents futuristic furniture as highly polished, volumetric sculptures, combining smooth organic curves with occasional geometric or pod-like structures. Reflective chrome, saturated lacquer, and carefully controlled gallery lighting give the objects a realistic, cinematic product-showcase appearance, often arranged with strong symmetry and clean architectural surroundings."},{"id":"herb-lubalin","name":"Herb Lubalin","cat":"designers","en":"Herb Lubalin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herb-lubalin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herb-lubalin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","illustrative","ornate","letters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","cream","deep-blue","dark-red","brown"],"intro":"Herb Lubalin was an influential American graphic designer and typographer known for his innovative use of typography and design in the mid-20th century. He played a significant role in shaping modern graphic design, particularly through his work on magazines and advertising. Lubalin's designs are characterized by their bold and expressive use of type, often integrating text and image in creative ways.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly saturated orange, red, blue, black, and cream in sharply separated flat shapes, with heavy curving contours and strong negative space. Oversized decorative lettering and abstract floral or organic forms create a dense, optical, poster-like composition with a lightly weathered print texture."},{"id":"david-plowden","name":"David Plowden","cat":"photographers","en":"David Plowden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-plowden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-plowden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","backlighting","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["black","grey","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"David Plowden is an American photographer known for his work capturing the vanishing landscapes and structures of rural America. His photography often focuses on the industrial era, documenting the changing face of the American Midwest with a keen eye for detail and composition.","observation":"The style is stark monochrome photography built around strong window light, deep shadows, and sharply separated highlights. Solitary figures, worn interiors, foggy rural roads, and leafless trees create a restrained, melancholic visual narrative with documentary realism and a grainy cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"ragnar-kjartansson","name":"Ragnar Kjartansson","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ragnar Kjartansson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ragnar-kjartansson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ragnar-kjartansson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","dark-blue","beige","red"],"intro":"Ragnar Kjartansson is an Icelandic artist known for his work in performance art, video installations, and painting. His art often explores themes of repetition, endurance, and the intersection of music and visual art. Kjartansson's work is characterized by its emotional depth and the blending of various artistic mediums to create immersive experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable interiors and outdoor settings are built from thick, visibly directional paint strokes, with heavily textured surfaces and energetic, broken edges. The style combines subdued, cool surroundings with forceful warm accents, strong light-dark contrasts, and luminous sources such as fire and chandeliers."},{"id":"kenneth-josephson","name":"Kenneth Josephson","cat":"photographers","en":"Kenneth Josephson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kenneth-josephson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kenneth-josephson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["portraits","scenes","backlighting","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Kenneth Josephson is an American photographer known for his innovative work in conceptual photography. Born in 1932, Josephson is recognized for his pioneering use of photomontage and his exploration of photographic reality and illusion. His work often challenges the viewer's perception and understanding of photography as a medium.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark black-and-white imagery uses hard directional light, deep blacks, and pronounced shadows to create a tense, enigmatic mood. Human figures and ordinary objects are isolated in spare, surreal situations, with grainy photographic texture and dramatic silhouettes reinforcing the cinematic sense of mystery."},{"id":"farel-dalrymple","name":"Farel Dalrymple","cat":"illustrators","en":"Farel Dalrymple","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/farel-dalrymple.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/farel-dalrymple","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","brown","black","orange"],"intro":"Farel Dalrymple is an American illustrator and comic book artist known for his distinctive style that blends elements of fantasy and surrealism. He has contributed to various graphic novels and comic series, often infusing his work with a unique sense of whimsy and darkness. Dalrymple's art is characterized by its detailed line work and imaginative compositions, making him a notable figure in the world of contemporary illustration.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses intricate ink drawing with fine contours, crosshatched texture, and restrained watercolor-like washes on off-white paper. It depicts expressive anthropomorphic characters, strange animals, and expedition-like situations with eccentric costumes and improvised machinery, balancing whimsical fantasy with surreal, slightly grotesque details."},{"id":"tracey-emin","name":"Tracey Emin","cat":"painters","en":"Tracey Emin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tracey-emin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tracey-emin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","floral","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["white","red","bone-white","grey","black","vivid-red"],"intro":"Tracey Emin is a renowned British artist known for her provocative and deeply personal works that explore themes of identity, emotion, and the human experience. Her art often incorporates elements of autobiography, using a variety of mediums including drawing, painting, and installation to convey raw and intimate narratives.","observation":"Across the four images, loose gestural drawing and visibly worked paint combine recognizable figures and flowers with partial abstraction. Strong red, pink, blue, green, and black marks stand against generous pale or flat-colored grounds, with contour lines, broad strokes, and energetic unfinished edges creating an expressive, sketchbook-like character."},{"id":"paulo-mendes-da-rocha","name":"Paulo Mendes da Rocha","cat":"architects","en":"Paulo Mendes da Rocha","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paulo-mendes-da-rocha.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paulo-mendes-da-rocha","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","white","muted-rust"],"intro":"Paulo Mendes da Rocha is a renowned Brazilian architect known for his influential contributions to modern architecture, particularly in the Brutalist style. His work is characterized by the use of raw concrete and innovative structural solutions, which have left a significant impact on urban landscapes in Brazil and beyond.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents monumental concrete architecture through realistic, highly structured architectural photography. Stark geometric masses, deep shadows, strong tonal contrast, and carefully framed openings create a sculptural urban atmosphere, while trees, palms, distant towers, and occasional pedestrians provide scale."},{"id":"david-lean","name":"David Lean","cat":"filmmakers","en":"David Lean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-lean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-lean","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","dark-brown","orange","rust"],"intro":"David Lean was a renowned British film director, known for his epic and visually stunning films such as 'Lawrence of Arabia' and 'Doctor Zhivago.' His work is characterized by its grand scale, meticulous attention to detail, and strong narrative drive, often exploring themes of adventure and human emotion against historical backdrops.","observation":"Across the sheet, dramatic figures and faces are rendered with forceful painterly strokes, strong tonal contrast, and a brooding, film-like atmosphere. Deep shadows, smoky backgrounds, selective highlights, and restrained blue-black or burnt-orange palettes give the images an ominous narrative intensity."},{"id":"antonio-j-manzanedo","name":"Antonio J. Manzanedo","cat":"illustrators","en":"Antonio J. Manzanedo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antonio-j-manzanedo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antonio-j-manzanedo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","dark-red","silver","red"],"intro":"Antonio J. Manzanedo is a contemporary illustrator known for his work in the fantasy genre, often depicting epic and dark themes with a painterly style. His illustrations are characterized by detailed textures, dynamic compositions, and a strong sense of atmosphere, drawing inspiration from mythological and medieval themes.","observation":"A dark, highly painterly fantasy style uses vigorous visible brushwork, dense texture, and expressive, distorted human figures. Deep blue-black and charcoal tones dominate, punctuated by fiery red-orange light and stark spectral illumination, with dramatic gestures and intense close-up faces creating a threatening, theatrical mood."},{"id":"eva-rothschild","name":"Eva Rothschild","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Eva Rothschild","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eva-rothschild.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eva-rothschild","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","minimalist","sculptural","characters","patterns","fine-lines","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","beige","charcoal","deep-red","orange"],"intro":"Eva Rothschild is a contemporary sculptor known for her innovative use of materials and geometric forms. Her work often explores the interplay between structure and color, creating dynamic and engaging pieces that challenge traditional sculptural conventions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents abstract suspended and freestanding sculptures built from angular wire frameworks, geometric planes, and elongated fragmented forms. The bright gallery interiors, ample empty space, crisp fine lines, and selective red, blue, orange, and pink color create a clean but richly structured installation aesthetic."},{"id":"stanko-abadzic","name":"Stanko Abadzic","cat":"photographers","en":"Stanko Abadzic","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stanko-abadzic.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stanko-abadzic","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette","symmetry"],"colours":["black","silver","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Stanko Abadzic is a Croatian photographer known for his evocative black and white images that capture the essence of urban life and human emotion. His work often explores themes of nostalgia, solitude, and the passage of time, using light and shadow to create dramatic and introspective scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark black-and-white photography uses hard directional sunlight, deep shadows, and elongated silhouettes to turn urban architecture into graphic compositions. Solitary figures, repeated stairways and passageways, and strong overhead or axial framing create a cinematic, somber atmosphere."},{"id":"sveta-dorosheva","name":"Sveta Dorosheva","cat":"illustrators","en":"Sveta Dorosheva","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sveta-dorosheva.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sveta-dorosheva","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","floral","patterns","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","light-orange","muted-rust","dark-red","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"Sveta Dorosheva is a contemporary illustrator known for her intricate and fantastical artwork. Her work often draws from folklore, mythology, and historical aesthetics, creating a unique blend of the whimsical and the mysterious. Dorosheva's illustrations are celebrated for their detailed linework and rich narrative quality, often depicting fantastical scenes and characters.","observation":"The style is richly illustrative and highly ornamental, built from fine outlines, dense patterning, intricate textiles, botanical forms, and carefully layered character and animal imagery. Saturated reds, teals, blues, and dark neutrals create strong contrast, while the recurring fantastical figures, ravens, horses, moon, and elaborate landscapes give the whole sheet a dramatic storybook quality."},{"id":"lucien-pissarro","name":"Lucien Pissarro","cat":"painters","en":"Lucien Pissarro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucien-pissarro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucien-pissarro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","dark-brown","muted-ochre","silver","red"],"intro":"Lucien Pissarro is a French painter and printmaker known for his contributions to the Impressionist and Post-Impressionist movements. Born in Paris in 1863, he was the son of Camille Pissarro , a leading figure in the Impressionist movement. Lucien's work often reflects a blend of Impressionist techniques with a unique focus on color and light, capturing the essence of rural and natural settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork and textured, built-up surfaces shaping foliage, water, fields, and clouds. It favors detailed pastoral landscapes and quiet human vignettes in restrained autumnal and blue-green colors, with soft atmospheric depth and a traditional countryside sensibility."},{"id":"laurie-lipton","name":"Laurie Lipton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Laurie Lipton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laurie-lipton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laurie-lipton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","fantasy","drawing","epic"],"colours":["grey","bone-white","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Laurie Lipton is an artist known for her intricate and surreal pencil drawings, often exploring themes of technology, society, and the human condition. Her work is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail and a distinctive monochromatic style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense monochrome linework, fine hatching, and engraved-looking illustration to build exceptionally intricate environments. It combines recognizable figures, architecture, landscapes, and objects at impossible scales, creating elaborate surreal tableaux with a grand fantastical presence."},{"id":"jean-dubuffet","name":"Jean Dubuffet","cat":"painters","en":"Jean Dubuffet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-dubuffet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-dubuffet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","ink","geometric"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","brown","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jean Dubuffet is a French painter and sculptor known for founding the art movement known as Art Brut, or \"raw art.\" He was born in 1901 and became famous for his unconventional approach, often using materials like tar, sand, and gravel in his works. Dubuffet's art is characterized by its raw, unrefined quality, often drawing inspiration from graffiti, children's art, and the works of psychiatric patients.","observation":"Across all four panels, thick black contours and blocky red, cream, blue, and charcoal shapes build a raw, hand-painted field of fragmented faces, mask-like figures, and repeated abstract motifs. The style combines forceful graphic geometry with visible brush texture, distressed surfaces, and dense, expressive visual compression."},{"id":"manolo-blahnik","name":"Manolo Blahnik","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Manolo Blahnik","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/manolo-blahnik.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/manolo-blahnik","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","fashion","floral","still-life","fine-lines","painterly","pastel-colors","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","muted-orange","dark-blue","muted-brown"],"intro":"Manolo Blahnik is a renowned Spanish fashion designer known for his high-end, luxurious footwear. His designs are celebrated for their elegance, creativity, and craftsmanship, often featuring intricate details and unique silhouettes. Blahnik's shoes are iconic in the fashion industry, admired for their blend of classic and contemporary styles.","observation":"The style presents ornate high-fashion footwear as delicate watercolor-and-ink illustrations, combining fine contour lines, translucent washes, and visible paper texture. Shoes are richly embellished with crystals, flowers, ribbons, and sheer fabric while remaining isolated against generous white space in an elegant fashion-sketch layout."},{"id":"charles-sheeler","name":"Charles Sheeler","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Sheeler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-sheeler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-sheeler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","landscapes","urban","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","bone-white","muted-brown","muted-blue","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Charles Sheeler is a prominent American painter and photographer known for his contributions to the Precisionist movement. His work often depicted industrial landscapes and urban architecture, capturing the essence of early 20th-century American modernism. Sheeler's art is characterized by its clean lines, geometric forms, and a focus on the beauty of industrial structures.","observation":"The style presents crisp architectural and industrial scenes through strongly geometric compositions, clean planar forms, and hard-edged shadows. Saturated blue, terracotta, cream, and charcoal tones are balanced with visible painted texture, producing a polished retro illustration with cinematic framing and carefully observed urban detail."},{"id":"mariano-vivanco","name":"Mariano Vivanco","cat":"photographers","en":"Mariano Vivanco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mariano-vivanco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mariano-vivanco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","brown","beige","dark-brown"],"intro":"Mariano Vivanco is a renowned fashion and portrait photographer known for his elegant and striking imagery. Born in Peru, Vivanco has worked with numerous high-profile fashion magazines and brands, capturing the essence of beauty and style through his lens. His work often features a blend of classical and contemporary elements, making him a prominent figure in the world of fashion photography.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, fashion-editorial portraits with elaborate historical-looking garments, oversized headpieces, lace, ruffles, and richly textured fabrics. Muted, often near-monochrome tones, deep shadows, ornate interiors, and formal yet unconventional posing create a dark, theatrical, classically inflected mood."},{"id":"lee-miller","name":"Lee Miller","cat":"photographers","en":"Lee Miller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-miller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-miller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","grey","charcoal","white","beige"],"intro":"Lee Miller was an American photographer and model known for her work as a fashion and fine art photographer, as well as her role as a war correspondent during World War II. She was a prominent figure in the surrealist movement, collaborating with artists like Man Ray. Her work often explored themes of identity, transformation, and the human condition.","observation":"The style is a stark monochrome portrait treatment built around bold tonal separation, sculpted facial light, and deep shadows. Across the images, polished fashion styling, vintage-inspired interiors, dramatic close crops, and composed gazes create a cinematic, high-glamour mood."},{"id":"oswaldo-guayasamin","name":"Oswaldo Guayasamin","cat":"painters","en":"Oswaldo Guayasamin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oswaldo-guayasamin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oswaldo-guayasamin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","light-orange","ochre","dark-brown","charcoal"],"intro":"Oswaldo Guayasamin was an Ecuadorian painter and sculptor known for his powerful and emotive works that often addressed themes of social injustice, human suffering, and the indigenous experience in Latin America. His art is characterized by bold colors, expressive forms, and a deep connection to his cultural roots, making him one of the most prominent figures in modern Latin American art.","observation":"Across all four renders, faces and figures are constructed from angular, interlocking planes with heavy dark contours and strongly simplified features. Saturated red, blue, black, cream, and ochre dominate, while visible raised brush texture and scraped marks give the graphic compositions a tactile painted surface."},{"id":"bert-hardy","name":"Bert Hardy","cat":"photographers","en":"Bert Hardy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bert-hardy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bert-hardy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","white"],"intro":"Bert Hardy was a renowned British photographer known for his work in photojournalism, particularly during the mid-20th century. He gained recognition for capturing the essence of everyday life and the human condition, often focusing on the working class and urban environments. Hardy's photographs are celebrated for their storytelling ability and emotional depth, reflecting the social realities of his time.","observation":"The style presents cinematic black-and-white urban vignettes with strong chiaroscuro, backlit haze, and a pronounced photographic grain. Layered street activity, period clothing, architectural framing, selective focus, and candid human interactions create a documentary-like sense of lived-in city life."},{"id":"cornelia-parker","name":"Cornelia Parker","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Cornelia Parker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cornelia-parker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cornelia-parker","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","patterns","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","beige","muted-orange","silver"],"intro":"Cornelia Parker is a renowned British artist known for her innovative and thought-provoking installations and sculptures. Her work often explores themes of transformation, destruction, and reconstruction, using a variety of materials and techniques to create immersive and engaging experiences. Parker's art challenges viewers to reconsider the familiar and the everyday, often through the lens of conceptual art.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents monumental gallery interiors filled with dense, physically convincing assemblages of wooden chairs and fragments. Realistic architectural space and dramatic directional light contrast with surreal floating, radial, and vortex-like arrangements, using a restrained brown-and-cream palette and strong shadows."},{"id":"diego-dayer","name":"Diego Dayer","cat":"painters","en":"Diego Dayer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/diego-dayer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/diego-dayer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","muted-ochre","muted-yellow","dark-brown"],"intro":"Diego Dayer is an Argentine painter known for his expressive and emotive portraiture, often focusing on the human figure and its emotional depth. His works are characterized by a realistic yet painterly style, blending fine brushstrokes with a keen attention to detail, capturing the essence of his subjects with intensity and sensitivity.","observation":"The style uses visibly layered, broad painterly strokes to model expressive figures, clothing, hair, and interiors, with a richly textured surface throughout. Deep shadows, warm earthy tones, red accents, and strong light-dark contrasts give the portraits a moody editorial presence, while carefully staged poses and cropped framing keep the compositions dramatic."},{"id":"walter-langley","name":"Walter Langley","cat":"painters","en":"Walter Langley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walter-langley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walter-langley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Walter Langley is an English painter known for his role in the Newlyn School, a group of artists who settled in Cornwall in the late 19th century. He is celebrated for his depictions of working-class life and his ability to capture the emotional depth of his subjects through a naturalistic style. Langley's work often focuses on the daily lives of fishermen and their families, rendered with meticulous attention to detail and a sympathetic eye.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and realistic, with visible brushwork modeling faces, fabric, stone, and humble interiors in dense detail. Subdued earth tones, deep shadows, and natural daylight create an observational atmosphere across scenes of rural communal labor, while expressive gestures and period clothing give the figures a grounded human presence."},{"id":"f-w-murnau","name":"F.W. Murnau","cat":"filmmakers","en":"F.W. Murnau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/f-w-murnau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/f-w-murnau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Friedrich Wilhelm Murnau was a German film director, producer and screenwriter. He was greatly influenced by the philosophy of Schopenhauer and Nietzsche, as well as by Shakespeare and Ibsen plays he had seen at the age of 12, and became a friend of director Max Reinhardt.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white imagery with crushed shadows, blown highlights, and coarse film grain, giving every render a distressed photographic texture. Fog, silhouettes, isolated faces, and deep framing create a bleak, dreamlike cinematic atmosphere with strong chiaroscuro."},{"id":"rupert-bunny","name":"Rupert Bunny","cat":"painters","en":"Rupert Bunny","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rupert-bunny.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rupert-bunny","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","ochre","red"],"intro":"Rupert Bunny was an Australian painter known for his elegant and refined depictions of women and domestic scenes, often infused with a sense of intimacy and grace. His works are characterized by their soft color palettes, detailed brushwork, and a focus on light and atmosphere, capturing the essence of the Edwardian era with a touch of Impressionism.","observation":"The style uses richly visible oil brushwork, with layered, finely varied strokes defining faces, hair, garments, flowers, and patterned backgrounds. It combines intimate female portraits and grouped figures with expressive poses, subdued earthy colors, occasional vivid red and turquoise accents, and dense decorative floral and textile detail."},{"id":"agnes-martin","name":"Agnes Martin","cat":"painters","en":"Agnes Martin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/agnes-martin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/agnes-martin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["minimalist","patterns","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["cream","silver","blue","beige","muted-blue","bone-white"],"intro":"Agnes Martin was an American abstract painter known for her minimalist works that often featured grids and stripes. Her art is characterized by subtle color palettes and a focus on line and form, reflecting themes of serenity and introspection. Martin's work is associated with the Abstract Expressionist movement, though her style is distinct in its meditative simplicity.","observation":"The style reduces each image to repeated horizontal or vertical bands in a restrained blue, grey, and cream palette. Clean geometric organization is softened by subtly uneven edges, visible brushwork, and a lightly textured painted surface."},{"id":"rammellzee","name":"Rammellzee","cat":"various-artists","en":"Rammellzee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rammellzee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rammellzee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["black","light-red","grey","dark-red","vivid-red","orange","olive"],"intro":"Rammellzee is a multifaceted artist known for his work in graffiti, performance art, and music, emerging from the vibrant street culture of New York City in the late 20th century. His art is characterized by a unique blend of graffiti and futuristic themes, often exploring the intersection of language, technology, and identity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is intensely abstract and painterly, built from broad, visible brushwork, drips, splatters, scraped textures, and forceful drawn lines. Saturated reds, pinks, oranges, blues, and yellows collide with deep dark areas, producing a high-energy, layered, surreal impression of fragmented forms and partial figures."},{"id":"harry-seidler","name":"Harry Seidler","cat":"architects","en":"Harry Seidler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harry-seidler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harry-seidler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","black","silver","white","grey"],"intro":"Harry Seidler was an Austrian-born Australian architect who became a leading figure in modernist architecture. Known for his innovative use of concrete and glass, Seidler's work is characterized by its integration with the natural environment and a commitment to modernist principles. His designs often feature bold geometric forms, open spaces, and a harmonious relationship with their surroundings, reflecting his belief in architecture as a form of art.","observation":"The style presents monumental urban architecture with heavy concrete masses, geometric repetition, sweeping curves, and strongly sculptural forms. Realistic architectural views use dramatic perspective, hard directional light, deep shadows, and high contrast, often adding lone pedestrians to emphasize scale."},{"id":"peter-hujar","name":"Peter Hujar","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Hujar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-hujar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-hujar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","white","charcoal"],"intro":"Peter Hujar was an American photographer known for his black-and-white portraits of New York City's underground scene in the 1970s and 1980s. His work often captured the raw and intimate aspects of his subjects, including artists, performers, and members of the LGBTQ+ community. Hujar's photography is celebrated for its emotional depth and stark, yet tender portrayal of human vulnerability.","observation":"A stark black-and-white photographic style built around intimate male portraits, with extreme close-ups, unconventional low angles, and boldly cropped bodies. Hard directional light, deep shadows, visible skin and hair texture, and fine grain create a moody, raw editorial atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"antoine-blanchard","name":"Antoine Blanchard","cat":"painters","en":"Antoine Blanchard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antoine-blanchard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antoine-blanchard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","glow","mist","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Antoine Blanchard is known for his evocative paintings of Parisian street scenes, capturing the charm and vibrancy of the city. His works often depict bustling streets, iconic landmarks, and the everyday life of Parisians, rendered in a style reminiscent of the Impressionist movement. Blanchard's paintings are characterized by their rich color palettes, dynamic compositions, and a sense of nostalgia for the romanticized Paris of the past.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses loose, visible broad brushwork to build richly textured urban scenes with softened edges and atmospheric rain haze. Cool blue-grey surroundings are contrasted with intense amber window and street-lamp reflections on wet pavement, creating a moody but lively sense of movement."},{"id":"julia-margaret-cameron","name":"Julia Margaret Cameron","cat":"photographers","en":"Julia Margaret Cameron","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julia-margaret-cameron.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julia-margaret-cameron","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Julia Margaret Cameron was a pioneering British photographer known for her portraits and soft-focus style. Born in 1815, she became one of the most influential figures in early photography, capturing images of prominent figures of her time and creating allegorical works that combined art and photography.","observation":"The style is a set of intimate, tightly cropped photographic portraits rendered in near-monochrome with strong tonal contrast and deep shadows. Fine grain, soft facial modeling, solemn expressions, dark clothing, and occasional botanical adornment create a moody, old-fashioned, emotionally intense atmosphere across the four images."},{"id":"peter-ilsted","name":"Peter Ilsted","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Ilsted","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-ilsted.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-ilsted","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","pale-orange","ochre"],"intro":"Peter Ilsted is a Danish artist known for his contributions to the genre of interior scenes and domestic life paintings. He was part of the Danish Golden Age and is recognized for his detailed and serene depictions of everyday life, often focusing on the interplay of light and shadow within quiet, intimate settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, richly textured painting to depict quiet domestic scenes in old interiors. Subdued earth colors, deep shadows, and sharply angled sunlight through multi-pane windows create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while fine brushwork preserves intricate clothing, furniture, and architectural details."},{"id":"terry-oakes","name":"Terry Oakes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Terry Oakes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/terry-oakes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/terry-oakes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","blue","muted-ochre","red","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Terry Oakes is a renowned illustrator known for his intricate and imaginative artwork, often associated with fantasy and science fiction themes. His work is characterized by detailed and vivid depictions of otherworldly landscapes and mythical creatures, capturing the imagination of audiences worldwide.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly textured, painterly modelling with saturated complementary colours and forceful light-dark contrasts. Grotesque oversized characters, fantastical landscapes, elaborate costumes, and theatrical scale create an expressive, surreal cinematic-fantasy look."},{"id":"al-jaffee","name":"Al Jaffee","cat":"illustrators","en":"Al Jaffee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/al-jaffee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/al-jaffee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","motion","bold-lines","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","funny","geometric"],"colours":["brown","light-orange","beige","rust","olive"],"intro":"Al Jaffee is an American cartoonist best known for his work in MAD Magazine, particularly his creation of the MAD Fold-In and his satirical illustrations. His career spans over seven decades, making him one of the longest-working cartoonists in history. Jaffee's work is characterized by its humor, wit, and a distinctive illustrative style that has influenced generations of cartoonists.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses boldly outlined cartoon characters with exaggerated anatomy, energetic gestures, and densely worked environments. Some scenes are monochrome and heavily hatched while others use saturated flat color, but the shared look is graphic, humorous, highly detailed, and compositionally busy."},{"id":"bruce-pennington","name":"Bruce Pennington","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bruce Pennington","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruce-pennington.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruce-pennington","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","blue","dark-red","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Bruce Pennington is a renowned British illustrator known for his distinctive science fiction and fantasy artwork. Born in 1944, Pennington gained recognition for his vivid and imaginative book covers, particularly in the 1970s. His work often features surreal landscapes, intricate details, and a unique blend of futuristic and mythical elements, making him a prominent figure in speculative art.","observation":"The style presents vast, highly detailed alien landscapes with monumental, ornate futuristic cities set against enormous moons and planets. Dark blue and ember-orange palettes, strong contrast, atmospheric haze, and localized architectural lights create a cinematic, epic sense of scale and otherworldliness."},{"id":"mark-seliger","name":"Mark Seliger","cat":"photographers","en":"Mark Seliger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-seliger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-seliger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","beige","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Mark Seliger is a renowned American photographer known for his iconic portraits of celebrities and musicians. His work has been featured in prominent publications such as Rolling Stone and Vanity Fair, showcasing his ability to capture the essence of his subjects with a unique blend of artistry and technical skill.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, carefully detailed portrait photography with cinematic framing and strongly controlled lighting. It alternates monochrome and earthy, low-key color treatments, emphasizing expressive faces, distinctive clothing, seated poses, and a dark editorial mood."},{"id":"yasuo-kuniyoshi","name":"Yasuo Kuniyoshi","cat":"painters","en":"Yasuo Kuniyoshi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yasuo-kuniyoshi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yasuo-kuniyoshi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","orange","dark-brown","muted-ochre","white"],"intro":"Yasuo Kuniyoshi was a Japanese-American painter and printmaker known for his unique blend of Eastern and Western artistic influences. Born in Okayama, Japan, in 1889, he moved to the United States in 1906. Kuniyoshi's work often features whimsical, dreamlike scenes with a touch of surrealism, reflecting his cross-cultural experiences and personal vision. His art is characterized by a blend of folk art influences and modernist techniques, making him a significant figure in American modernism.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses visibly built-up paint, angular drawing, dark outlines, and expressive distortions of faces and bodies. Earthy reds, ochres, olives, and deep blacks create a restrained but strongly contrasted palette, while crowded theatrical scenes combine human, animal, and fantastical figures."},{"id":"mary-cassatt","name":"Mary Cassatt","cat":"painters","en":"Mary Cassatt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-cassatt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-cassatt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["grey","muted-orange","bone-white","dark-brown","brown","red"],"intro":"Mary Cassatt was an American painter and printmaker, known for her work in the Impressionist movement. Born in 1844, she spent much of her adult life in France, where she became friends with Edgar Degas and exhibited with the Impressionists. Cassatt is celebrated for her portrayals of the intimate bonds between mothers and children, capturing the tenderness and warmth of domestic life.","observation":"Across all four images, softly modeled family portraits are built from visible oil-paint strokes, layered color, and richly textured surfaces. Cropped embraces, sleeping children, pastel garments, and expressive faces create an intimate, tender mood, with subdued blue, pink, cream, and warm earth tones throughout."},{"id":"patek-philippe","name":"Patek Philippe","cat":"designers","en":"Patek Philippe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patek-philippe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patek-philippe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","still-life","glow","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","metallic","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","charcoal","bone-white"],"intro":"Patek Philippe is a renowned Swiss luxury watch manufacturer, known for its high-quality timepieces and intricate craftsmanship. Founded in 1839, the brand has established itself as a leader in the horology industry, producing watches that are both innovative and timeless.","observation":"The style presents luxury watches as highly polished, photorealistic product imagery, with ornate relief dials, gemstones, metallic cases, and rich leather straps rendered in exceptional detail. Warm directional lighting, strong reflections, selective focus, and dark-to-light contrast give the close-ups a cinematic, premium advertising character."},{"id":"ben-shahn","name":"Ben Shahn","cat":"painters","en":"Ben Shahn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ben-shahn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ben-shahn","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","urban","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Ben Shahn was a Lithuanian-born American artist known for his works of social realism. His art often focused on themes of social justice, political activism, and human rights, reflecting his personal commitment to these issues. Shahn's distinctive style combined elements of modernism with a narrative quality, making his work both visually compelling and socially poignant.","observation":"The style combines tightly packed, psychologically intense portraits with simplified urban facades, rendered in muted earth tones punctuated by strong reds, blacks, and pale whites. Fine drawn contours, visibly worked paint surfaces, cracked textures, and compressed spatial depth give the images a deliberate, weathered illustrative-painterly character."},{"id":"virgil-abloh","name":"Virgil Abloh","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Virgil Abloh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/virgil-abloh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/virgil-abloh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","symmetry"],"colours":["black","silver","blue","beige","brown","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Virgil Abloh is a renowned American fashion designer, artist, and entrepreneur, celebrated for his role as the artistic director of Louis Vuitton's menswear collection and the founder of the Off-White brand. His work is known for blending high fashion with streetwear, creating a unique and influential style that resonates with contemporary culture.","observation":"The style is polished, realistic fashion editorial photography, combining centered portrait compositions with dramatic, highly sculptural garments. Saturated color blocking, strong directional light, deep shadows, and softly blurred public or architectural backgrounds give the images a cinematic runway character."},{"id":"matthias-grunewald","name":"Matthias Grunewald","cat":"painters","en":"Matthias Grunewald","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matthias-grunewald.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matthias-grunewald","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Matthias Grunewald was a German Renaissance painter known for his expressive and emotionally intense religious works, particularly the Isenheim Altarpiece. His art is characterized by vivid colors, dramatic contrasts, and a deep sense of spirituality and mysticism.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, painterly rendering with expressive faces, dense feather and hair textures, and strongly visible fine brushwork. Dark backgrounds, earthy neutrals, muted blues, and saturated red accents create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere across the portraits, figures, and birds."},{"id":"titian","name":"Titian","cat":"painters","en":"Titian","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/titian.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/titian","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-orange","charcoal","red","grey"],"intro":"Titian is a renowned Italian painter of the Renaissance , celebrated for his mastery in color and composition. Born in the late 15th century, he became one of the leading figures of the Venetian school. His work is characterized by its vivid use of color, dynamic compositions, and the ability to convey complex human emotions. He painted a wide range of subjects, including portraits, religious themes, and mythological scenes, leaving a lasting impact on the art world.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modelled, painterly figures with visible brushwork, textured surfaces, and strongly directional light. Dark blue-black grounds, red and ochre accents, deep shadows, and expressive gazes create a solemn, dramatic portrait language with recurring sacred-looking human figures and classical drapery."},{"id":"todd-schorr","name":"Todd Schorr","cat":"illustrators","en":"Todd Schorr","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/todd-schorr.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/todd-schorr","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","dark-brown","ochre","red","beige"],"intro":"Todd Schorr is an American artist known for his contributions to the pop surrealism movement. His work often features a blend of cartoon-like imagery with surreal and fantastical elements, drawing on influences from pop culture, mythology, and classic illustration. Schorr's art is characterized by its intricate detail, vibrant color palettes, and humorous yet thought-provoking themes.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, visibly painted surfaces with lavish costumes, food, architecture, and animals packed into theatrical tableaux. Saturated reds, greens, and golds, strong light-dark separation, exaggerated expressions, and grotesque fantasy details create an exuberant, ornamental storybook spectacle."},{"id":"dariusz-klimczak","name":"Dariusz Klimczak","cat":"painters","en":"Dariusz Klimczak","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dariusz-klimczak.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dariusz-klimczak","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","white","bone-white"],"intro":"Dariusz Klimczak is a contemporary Polish photographer known for his surreal and imaginative works. His art often explores dreamlike scenarios, blending reality with fantasy to create thought-provoking imagery.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, realistic-looking environments rendered in a largely monochrome, atmospheric palette with strong tonal contrast. Monumental architecture, storm clouds, mist, empty shorelines, and tiny isolated figures create a surreal, cinematic sense of scale and dreamlike epic isolation."},{"id":"andre-de-dienes","name":"Andre de Dienes","cat":"photographers","en":"Andre de Dienes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andre-de-dienes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andre-de-dienes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["grey","silver","white","charcoal"],"intro":"Andre de Dienes was a Hungarian-American photographer known for his work in fashion and glamour photography during the mid-20th century. He gained prominence for his portraits of Marilyn Monroe and other iconic figures of the era, capturing the essence of Hollywood glamour and beauty. His work often featured a blend of natural settings and intimate poses, creating a unique and recognizable style.","observation":"A monochrome, high-contrast photographic style combines expressive fashion portraiture with spontaneous movement by the sea. Grain, shallow focus, windblown hair and fabric, dramatic cropping, and bright natural light give the images a cinematic editorial energy."},{"id":"bojan-jevtic","name":"Bojan Jevtic","cat":"various-artists","en":"Bojan Jevtic","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bojan-jevtic.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bojan-jevtic","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","collage","dark"],"colours":["beige","black","bone-white","brown","red"],"intro":"Bojan Jevtic is an artist known for his unique approach to digital art, blending surreal and fantastical elements to create captivating visual narratives. His work often explores themes of mythology and introspection, using intricate details and textured layers to draw viewers into his imaginative worlds.","observation":"Across all four portraits, realistic faces are disrupted by layered fragments, branches, architectural remnants, and visible paint-like marks. The style combines subdued earthy tones with sharp coral-red accents, tactile brushwork, high contrast, and a dark, surreal collage aesthetic."},{"id":"ara-guler","name":"Ara Guler","cat":"photographers","en":"Ara Guler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ara-guler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ara-guler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","white"],"intro":"Ara Guler was a renowned Turkish-Armenian photojournalist, often referred to as the 'Eye of Istanbul.' Known for his poignant black and white photography, Guler captured the essence of Istanbul and its people, documenting the city's transformation over decades. His work is celebrated for its emotional depth, capturing the everyday lives of people with a humanist approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, bright openings, visible grain, and richly resolved surface textures. Narrow, decaying urban passages are densely populated with realistic, weathered characters, arranged as candid narrative scenes with a somber, cinematic documentary atmosphere."},{"id":"walter-molino","name":"Walter Molino","cat":"illustrators","en":"Walter Molino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walter-molino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walter-molino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","grey","dark-brown"],"intro":"Walter Molino is an Italian illustrator and painter known for his work in magazines and newspapers, particularly in the mid-20th century. His illustrations often captured dynamic scenes and dramatic narratives, showcasing his ability to convey emotion and movement through his art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible brushwork and fine strokes to build densely textured faces, hair, feathers, fabric, leather, and metal accessories. Dark backgrounds, restrained earthy colors, strong light-dark separation, dramatic gestures, and expressive character portraits create a theatrical fantasy-adventure atmosphere."},{"id":"nicolas-bruno","name":"Nicolas Bruno","cat":"various-artists","en":"Nicolas Bruno","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicolas-bruno.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicolas-bruno","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","brown","black","dark-brown","grey"],"intro":"Nicolas Bruno is a contemporary artist known for his surreal and haunting photographic works. His art often explores themes of dreams, nightmares, and the subconscious, drawing inspiration from his personal experiences with sleep paralysis. Bruno's work is characterized by its dark, moody atmospheres and surreal imagery, often featuring solitary figures in enigmatic settings.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic photography with muted teal-brown color grading, overcast light, misty rural landscapes, and shallow focus. Strange costumed figures and uncanny props are staged as quiet, dreamlike vignettes, creating a dark, melancholic atmosphere across all four renders."},{"id":"byam-shaw","name":"Byam Shaw","cat":"painters","en":"Byam Shaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/byam-shaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/byam-shaw","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","deep-red","light-orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"Byam Shaw is a British painter and illustrator known for his association with the Pre-Raphaelite movement. His works often feature romantic and historical themes, characterized by detailed and vivid compositions. Shaw's art reflects the influence of the late Victorian era, with a focus on mythological and literary subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly rendered faces with visible, varied brushwork and densely ornamented clothing, jewelry, foliage, and floral motifs. Saturated reds, deep blacks, blue accents, and metallic-looking highlights create a sumptuous, high-contrast decorative effect, with tightly cropped portrait compositions and a historical-costume sensibility."},{"id":"henry-scott-tuke","name":"Henry Scott Tuke","cat":"painters","en":"Henry Scott Tuke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henry-scott-tuke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henry-scott-tuke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Henry Scott Tuke was a British painter and photographer known for his depictions of maritime scenes and male nudes, often set against the backdrop of the Cornish coast. Born in 1858, Tuke was associated with the Newlyn School and the Impressionist movement, and his work is celebrated for its vibrant use of color and light, capturing the essence of the Edwardian era.","observation":"The style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork building skin, fabric, rocks, boats, and rippling water. Bright coastal light creates vivid blue-and-warm color contrasts and sparkling highlights, while candid figures and close portrait framing give the scenes an expressive, observational quality."},{"id":"didier-graffet","name":"Didier Graffet","cat":"illustrators","en":"Didier Graffet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/didier-graffet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/didier-graffet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","charcoal","muted-blue","pale-blue","red"],"intro":"Didier Graffet is a renowned French illustrator known for his detailed and atmospheric fantasy and science fiction artworks. His work often features intricate landscapes, mythical creatures, and epic scenes that capture the imagination.","observation":"The style presents vast, fantastical gothic environments with densely constructed architecture, monumental cliffs, and small figures that emphasize scale. Painterly texture, deep blue-grey atmosphere, intense orange interior light, drifting mist, and strong tonal contrast create a dark, cinematic sense of drama across all four scenes."},{"id":"gianni-berengo-gardin","name":"Gianni Berengo Gardin","cat":"photographers","en":"Gianni Berengo Gardin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gianni-berengo-gardin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gianni-berengo-gardin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","urban","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","grey","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Gianni Berengo Gardin is an acclaimed Italian photographer known for his black and white documentary photography that captures the essence of everyday life in Italy. His work is celebrated for its narrative depth and ability to convey the human condition through simple yet profound imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep silhouettes, bright haze, and reflective water to create a moody, cinematic atmosphere. Venetian canals, dense historic architecture, and solitary figures are framed with strong perspective, selective focus, and high tonal contrast."},{"id":"suzanne-lalique","name":"Suzanne Lalique","cat":"designers","en":"Suzanne Lalique","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/suzanne-lalique.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/suzanne-lalique","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","animals","floral","still-life","glow","fine-lines","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","muted-blue","pale-blue","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Suzanne Lalique is a renowned French designer and artist, celebrated for her contributions to decorative arts in the early 20th century. She is known for her work in glassware and ceramics, often collaborating with her father, René Lalique, a famous glassmaker. Her designs are characterized by their elegance, intricate detailing, and a harmonious blend of natural and mythical elements.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, meticulously detailed glass objects with elaborate botanical relief, suspended droplets, birds, berries, and other ornamental elements. Cool subdued tones, translucent materials, reflective highlights, and soft studio illumination create a sculptural, luxurious, dreamlike fantasy-object aesthetic."},{"id":"marino-marini","name":"Marino Marini","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Marino Marini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marino-marini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marino-marini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","animals","characters","still-life","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver"],"intro":"Marino Marini was an influential Italian sculptor and painter known for his distinctive style that often explored themes of human form and expression. Born in 1901, Marini's work is characterized by its abstract and geometric qualities, often depicting figures and horses. His art is celebrated for its bold and expressive forms, contributing significantly to modernist sculpture.","observation":"The style presents elongated horse sculptures and occasional human figures as solid, weighty forms with deliberately simplified anatomy and rough, tactile surfaces. Muted stone, bronze, and patinated green tones, neutral gallery backdrops, and pedestal presentation give the images a restrained classical sculpture-display character."},{"id":"yohji-yamamoto","name":"Yohji Yamamoto","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Yohji Yamamoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yohji-yamamoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yohji-yamamoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","silver","grey"],"intro":"Yohji Yamamoto is a renowned Japanese fashion designer known for his avant-garde and innovative approach to fashion. He is celebrated for his masterful tailoring and the use of dark, flowing fabrics that challenge traditional fashion norms. Yamamoto's work often features asymmetrical designs and a monochromatic palette, reflecting his unique vision and philosophy.","observation":"The style presents full-length fashion figures in sculptural, oversized black garments and wide-brim hats, rendered with realistic fabric texture and carefully controlled dramatic lighting. Sparse studio or urban settings, deep shadows, and generous negative space create a severe, cinematic editorial mood while emphasizing the garments’ sweeping silhouettes."},{"id":"john-varvatos","name":"John Varvatos","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"John Varvatos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-varvatos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-varvatos","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","still-life","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","light-orange","beige","rust"],"intro":"John Varvatos is an American fashion designer known for his rock and roll-inspired menswear collections. He launched his eponymous brand in 2000, which quickly gained recognition for its edgy yet sophisticated style. Varvatos's designs often incorporate elements of classic tailoring with a modern twist, appealing to those who appreciate both luxury and a rebellious spirit.","observation":"The style is photorealistic and richly detailed, presenting dark, curated interiors filled with framed monochrome photographs, vintage clothing, instruments, and furniture. Warm pools of directional light cut through subdued brown, black, and amber tones, while portraits and fashion scenes use cinematic framing and selective focus."},{"id":"subodh-gupta","name":"Subodh Gupta","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Subodh Gupta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/subodh-gupta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/subodh-gupta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","metallic","classical","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","beige","silver","black"],"intro":"Subodh Gupta is an Indian contemporary artist known for his large-scale sculptures and installations. He often uses everyday objects such as kitchen utensils and metal containers to create works that explore themes of globalization, consumerism, and identity. His art frequently reflects on the cultural and social changes in India, blending traditional and modern elements.","observation":"The style presents monumental, highly detailed sculptural forms assembled from densely packed reflective vessels and metal objects. They are rendered realistically with strong metallic highlights, visible weight and volume, often staged symmetrically in ornate, weathered classical interiors."},{"id":"philip-guston","name":"Philip Guston","cat":"painters","en":"Philip Guston","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philip-guston.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philip-guston","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","characters","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["red","vivid-red","silver","pale-red","muted-rust","dark-blue","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Philip Guston is a renowned American painter known for his transition from abstract expressionism to a more figurative style. His work often features cartoonish figures, bold colors, and a unique blend of abstraction and representation. Guston's later works are characterized by their raw, expressive quality and exploration of personal and political themes.","observation":"Across all four images, simplified pink and red figures are built from aggressive black contour lines, flat color blocks, and visibly broad, uneven paint strokes. The distorted faces, oversized mouths, crude anatomy, and stark black accents create an expressive, surreal, childlike visual language."},{"id":"andrew-macara","name":"Andrew Macara","cat":"painters","en":"Andrew Macara","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrew-macara.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrew-macara","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","muted-orange","orange","blue","bone-white"],"intro":"Andrew Macara is a contemporary British painter known for his vibrant and lively depictions of everyday scenes, particularly those involving children and leisure activities. His work often captures the essence of light and movement, bringing a sense of joy and spontaneity to his subjects. Macara's paintings are celebrated for their use of color and dynamic compositions, making him a prominent figure in the modern British art scene.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses luminous, saturated coastal colors and visible, finely controlled brushwork to depict lively seaside scenes. Dense human activity, boats, umbrellas, sparkling water, and strong cast shadows create a bright, observational sense of movement and place."},{"id":"danny-lyon","name":"Danny Lyon","cat":"photographers","en":"Danny Lyon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/danny-lyon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/danny-lyon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","cinematic"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Danny Lyon is an American photographer and filmmaker known for his work documenting social issues and subcultures in the United States. His photography often captures the raw and authentic aspects of American life, focusing on marginalized communities and counterculture movements. Lyon's work is characterized by its intimate and immersive approach, often involving long-term engagement with his subjects.","observation":"The style uses realistic black-and-white photography with expressive, candid portraits of young people embedded in urban street scenes. Grain, selective focus, strong tonal modelling, and vintage vehicles and clothing create a cinematic, documentary-like atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"joel-robison","name":"Joel Robison","cat":"photographers","en":"Joel Robison","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joel-robison.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joel-robison","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","cinematic","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","beige","dark-blue","grey","dark-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Joel Robison is a contemporary photographer known for his whimsical and imaginative style. His work often explores themes of fantasy and surrealism, capturing dreamlike scenes that transport viewers into a world of wonder and introspection. Robison's photography is characterized by its narrative quality, often featuring solitary figures in expansive landscapes, and employs digital manipulation to create otherworldly effects.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic outdoor photography with warm golden-hour grading, deep blue shadows, and dramatic cloud-filled skies. Solitary figures are placed in expansive fields and imaginative situations, with oversized paper objects, flocks of birds, and elevated viewpoints creating a dreamy, emotionally expressive sense of wonder."},{"id":"tom-everhart","name":"Tom Everhart","cat":"painters","en":"Tom Everhart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-everhart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-everhart","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","animals","characters","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","red","blue","light-yellow","brown","olive"],"intro":"Tom Everhart is an American artist known for his unique interpretations of Charles Schulz 's \"Peanuts\" characters. His work often combines elements of pop art and expressionism, creating vibrant and dynamic pieces that capture the whimsy and humor of the beloved comic strip.","observation":"Across all four renders, simplified cartoon dog characters are defined by thick black contours and broad, visibly worked paint strokes. Highly saturated blocks of red, blue, yellow, green, and orange sit beneath energetic splatters, drips, and layered brush texture, creating a bold, playful, high-contrast painted-canvas effect."},{"id":"ferdinando-scianna","name":"Ferdinando Scianna","cat":"photographers","en":"Ferdinando Scianna","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ferdinando-scianna.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ferdinando-scianna","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","backlighting","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","silver","grey","white"],"intro":"Ferdinando Scianna is an Italian photographer known for his work in black and white photography, capturing the essence of Sicilian life and culture. His images often explore themes of religion, festivals, and everyday life, characterized by a strong sense of place and identity. Scianna's work is deeply rooted in the traditions of documentary photography, with a focus on the human condition and cultural narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome, highly contrasted photographic storytelling with carefully posed figures in richly textured interiors and architectural spaces. Window light, deep shadows, strong silhouettes, and restrained, fashion-conscious costumes create a quiet, dramatic editorial mood."},{"id":"william-trost-richards","name":"William Trost Richards","cat":"painters","en":"William Trost Richards","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-trost-richards.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-trost-richards","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","black","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"William Trost Richards was a prominent American landscape painter associated with the Hudson River School and American Romanticism. Born in 1833, Richards was known for his detailed and realistic depictions of natural scenes, particularly seascapes and forests. His work is characterized by a meticulous attention to detail and a deep appreciation for the beauty and majesty of the natural world.","observation":"The style presents expansive natural landscapes with richly textured, painterly surfaces, dense environmental detail, and strongly modeled rocks, trees, water, and clouds. Vivid sunlight and luminous atmospheric effects create dramatic contrast, while rolling surf, towering cloud formations, and reflective water give the scenes an expressive, dreamlike grandeur."},{"id":"germaine-krull","name":"Germaine Krull","cat":"photographers","en":"Germaine Krull","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/germaine-krull.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/germaine-krull","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","urban","backlighting","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","white"],"intro":"Germaine Krull was a pioneering photographer known for her innovative and avant-garde approach to photography during the early 20th century. Her work often explored themes of modernity, architecture, and the human condition, making her a significant figure in the history of photography. Krull's images are characterized by their bold compositions and experimental techniques, which have left a lasting impact on the photographic world.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome, grainy photographic imagery built around expressive close-up portraits and urban interiors. Hard directional light, deep shadows, reflections, selective focus, and blurred practical lights create a tense, filmic noir atmosphere with a retro editorial feel."},{"id":"chiharu-shiota","name":"Chiharu Shiota","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Chiharu Shiota","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chiharu-shiota.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chiharu-shiota","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","still-life","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["dark-red","deep-red","vivid-red","red","muted-red"],"intro":"Chiharu Shiota is a Japanese installation artist known for her intricate and immersive thread installations that explore themes of memory, identity, and the human condition. Her work often involves weaving webs of yarn that create complex and evocative environments, inviting viewers to reflect on the connections between people, places, and time.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic interior spaces are overwhelmed by dense, tangled red branches that form tunnels, chambers, and walls around sparse furniture. The saturated monochrome palette, deep shadows, and theatrical viewpoints create a surreal, immersive, mildly ominous environment, with repeated chairs and seating arrangements providing the main visual anchors."},{"id":"larry-bell","name":"Larry Bell","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Larry Bell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-bell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-bell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["minimalist","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","glow","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["silver","beige","brown","grey","red","black"],"intro":"Larry Bell is an American contemporary artist known for his innovative work with glass and light. He emerged as a leading figure in the Light and Space movement, which originated in Southern California in the 1960s. Bell's work often explores the interaction between light, space, and perception, using materials like glass to create reflective and refractive surfaces that engage viewers in a dynamic visual experience.","observation":"The style presents sparse, rectilinear glass-like volumes in spacious industrial gallery interiors, emphasizing clean geometry, transparency, reflections, and solid spatial construction. Saturated pink, red, cyan, and blue light passes through the translucent forms and pools across the floor, giving the realistic scenes a polished, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"dustin-nguyen","name":"Dustin Nguyen","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dustin Nguyen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dustin-nguyen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dustin-nguyen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","collage","drawing","ink"],"colours":["cream","black","bone-white","brown","red","orange"],"intro":"Dustin Nguyen is a renowned comic book artist and illustrator known for his work on various popular series. He has contributed to major titles and is celebrated for his unique artistic style that blends traditional and modern techniques.","observation":"The style combines expressive fashion portraiture with translucent watercolor washes, visible paper texture, loose splatters, and energetic ink linework. Dark tailored clothing and hats contrast with selective red, orange, and green accents, while cropped figures and open white ground create an editorial collage-like presentation."},{"id":"kelly-freas","name":"Kelly Freas","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kelly Freas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kelly-freas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kelly-freas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-green","dark-blue","beige","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Kelly Freas is a renowned American science fiction and fantasy artist, celebrated for his work in the mid-20th century. He was known for his vibrant and imaginative illustrations that graced the covers of numerous science fiction magazines and books. Freas's art often featured futuristic and otherworldly themes, blending elements of fantasy and science fiction with a distinctive, colorful style.","observation":"The style combines richly visible, broad painterly strokes with dense illustrative detail, strongly modeled figures, and dramatic high-contrast lighting. Saturated orange, teal, blue, and green hues heighten its fantastical space-opera scenes, which mix alien characters, cosmic vistas, ancient occult props, and retro-futurist exploration imagery."},{"id":"michael-ancher","name":"Michael Ancher","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Ancher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-ancher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-ancher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-blue","silver","black","brown","muted-brown","orange"],"intro":"Michael Ancher is a renowned Danish painter known for his association with the Skagen Painters, a group of Scandinavian artists who depicted the natural beauty and everyday life of the Skagen area in Denmark during the late 19th century. His work is celebrated for its realistic portrayal of local fishermen and the coastal environment, capturing the essence of Nordic life with a focus on light and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, directional brushwork to depict figures and seaside settings with a warm, naturalistic glow. Muted blue, cream, brown, and ochre tones, carefully modeled faces, clothing folds, water, and clouds create detailed, emotionally expressive tableaux with a classical illustrative feel."},{"id":"christopher-wool","name":"Christopher Wool","cat":"designers","en":"Christopher Wool","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christopher-wool.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christopher-wool","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","black","white","brown"],"intro":"Christopher Wool is an American artist known for his abstract and text-based paintings. His work often explores themes of language, abstraction, and the interplay between the two, using a variety of techniques to create bold and impactful pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, the work is dominated by black marks on white grounds, combining broad painted masses with energetic looping and scratched linear gestures. Heavy contrast, drips, layered surface texture, and recurring geometric fragments create an intense, gestural abstract presentation."},{"id":"mark-kostabi","name":"Mark Kostabi","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Kostabi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-kostabi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-kostabi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","characters","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","bone-white","red","grey","deep-blue","deep-rust","pink","olive"],"intro":"Mark Kostabi is an American artist known for his distinctive style that blends elements of surrealism and pop art. Born in 1960, Kostabi gained fame in the 1980s for his bold, colorful paintings that often feature faceless figures and urban themes. His work is characterized by a unique combination of abstraction and figurative elements, often exploring themes of identity and consumerism.","observation":"Across all four images, stylized figures and city settings are constructed from sharply faceted geometric planes, clean graphic contours, and strong blocks of saturated color. Deep shadows, bright highlights, and a fine printed grain create high contrast while preserving an illustrative, poster-like finish; recurring hats, checkerboard surfaces, and distorted proportions give the scenes a surreal character."},{"id":"james-casebere","name":"James Casebere","cat":"photographers","en":"James Casebere","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-casebere.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-casebere","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","sculptural","urban","glow","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","dark-olive","light-yellow","muted-blue"],"intro":"James Casebere is an American artist known for his pioneering work in the field of constructed photography. He creates intricate models of architectural spaces, which he then photographs, exploring themes of space, light, and perception. His work often blurs the line between reality and illusion, inviting viewers to question the nature of the spaces they inhabit.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style treats architecture as monumental geometric sculpture, using severe planes, arches, staircases, and spacious interiors. Restrained earthy colors are set against deep shadow and sharply directional sunlight, producing high-contrast, cinematic scenes with a quiet, dreamlike austerity."},{"id":"allan-sekula","name":"Allan Sekula","cat":"photographers","en":"Allan Sekula","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/allan-sekula.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/allan-sekula","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","grey","light-orange","dark-rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"Allan Sekula was an American photographer, writer, and critic known for his work that explored the intersections of social, economic, and political themes. His photography often focused on maritime industries, labor, and the impacts of globalization, using a documentary style to convey complex narratives about society and capitalism.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic photography with restrained warm tones, deep shadows, and a nostalgic vintage-film atmosphere. Carefully framed urban, industrial, and coastal scenes emphasize strong perspective, solitary figures, old cars, and layered presentation within books, frames, and gallery settings."},{"id":"tim-doyle","name":"Tim Doyle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tim Doyle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-doyle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-doyle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","bold-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-red","red","grey"],"intro":"Tim Doyle is an American illustrator and printmaker known for his detailed and vibrant screen prints, often depicting pop culture and urban landscapes. His work is characterized by bold lines, intricate details, and a strong sense of narrative, drawing inspiration from comic book art and popular media.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic, heavily outlined illustration with dense architectural and environmental detail, dramatic perspective, and strongly contrasted red-cyan lighting. Urban and rural scenes alike are pushed into surreal, ominous tableaux populated by silhouettes, birds, stark trees, and turbulent skies."},{"id":"jean-leon-gerome","name":"Jean-Leon Gerome","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Leon Gerome","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-leon-gerome.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-leon-gerome","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","muted-cyan","brown","dark-brown","muted-yellow","dark-red"],"intro":"Jean-Leon Gerome was a French painter and sculptor, known for his academic style and orientalism. He was a prominent figure in 19th-century art, celebrated for his detailed and realistic depictions of historical and exotic scenes. His works often explored themes of cultural interaction and were characterized by meticulous attention to detail and vibrant color palettes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly scenes with visible brushwork, dense architectural ornament, and strongly modelled figures. Saturated robe colors contrast with deep shadows and brilliant blue skies, while theatrical staging, unusual vertical movement, and ceremonial groups give the images an epic, ominous quality."},{"id":"tony-orrico","name":"Tony Orrico","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tony Orrico","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tony-orrico.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tony-orrico","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","sculptural","characters","patterns","motion","fine-lines","subdued-colors","drawing","dreamy","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","beige","white","black"],"intro":"Tony Orrico is an American artist known for his unique blend of performance and visual art, often using his own body as a tool to create large-scale drawings. His work explores the intersection of human movement and artistic expression, resulting in intricate and mesmerizing pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental masses of fine, tangled lines curl into spirals, tunnels, and vortex-like apertures, making the installations feel both abstract and physically sculptural. Restrained charcoal, gray, and warm-white tones, soft gallery lighting, and small human figures emphasize the scale, motion, and contemplative atmosphere."},{"id":"dirk-braeckman","name":"Dirk Braeckman","cat":"photographers","en":"Dirk Braeckman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dirk-braeckman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dirk-braeckman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Dirk Braeckman is a contemporary Belgian photographer known for his introspective and moody black-and-white images. His work often explores themes of solitude and identity, using shadow and light to create haunting atmospheres. Braeckman has exhibited internationally, contributing significantly to modern photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome photography with deep blacks, isolated pools of light, and strongly underexposed architectural interiors. Grain, soft focus, and occasional motion blur create a cinematic, ominous atmosphere, while sparse rooms, doorways, windows, and shadowed figures provide the recurring visual language."},{"id":"fabian-oefner","name":"Fabian Oefner","cat":"various-artists","en":"Fabian Oefner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fabian-oefner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fabian-oefner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","animals","floral","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","beige","dark-red","red","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Fabian Oefner is a Swiss artist known for his innovative work that combines art and science. His projects often explore the beauty of natural phenomena, using photography and other mediums to capture moments that are usually invisible to the naked eye.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style depicts explosive floral and feathered forms suspended in dynamic bursts of powder, dust, and fragments. Saturated coral, blue, white, and earth tones stand sharply against dark or neutral grounds, with dense textures and energetic motion giving the images an expressive, highly detailed appearance."},{"id":"james-pradier","name":"James Pradier","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"James Pradier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-pradier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-pradier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","silver","beige","black"],"intro":"James Pradier was a Swiss-born French sculptor known for his work during the 19th century, particularly in the neoclassical style. He gained recognition for his sculptures that often depicted mythological and allegorical subjects, characterized by their elegance, detailed execution, and classical beauty. Pradier's works were celebrated for their refined craftsmanship and were a significant part of the academic art scene of his time.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic white-marble figures with convincing volume, carved surfaces, elaborate drapery, and finely resolved facial features. Subdued stone tones stand out against deep backgrounds and ornate interiors, while dramatic directional lighting and close cropping give the statues an intense, monumental presence."},{"id":"bill-cunningham","name":"Bill Cunningham","cat":"photographers","en":"Bill Cunningham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-cunningham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-cunningham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","urban","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro"],"colours":["grey","brown","black","white","silver"],"intro":"Bill Cunningham was an American fashion photographer known for his candid and street photography, capturing the essence of New York City's fashion scene. He worked for The New York Times and was celebrated for his ability to document fashion trends and personal style on the streets, often focusing on everyday people rather than celebrities.","observation":"The style uses realistic monochrome photography with strong tonal contrast, dramatic sunlight, and deep architectural shadows. Fashionably dressed figures move through dense city streets, with vintage cars and monumental facades creating a cinematic, mid-century editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"terry-o-neill","name":"Terry O'Neill","cat":"photographers","en":"Terry O'Neill","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/terry-o-neill.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/terry-o-neill","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"","observation":"A monochrome, high-contrast photographic style built around tightly framed fashion portraits, with dramatic shadows, strong highlights, and carefully posed expressions. Rich clothing textures, retro interiors and automobiles, cigarette props, and subtle grain give the images a cinematic editorial character."},{"id":"norman-foster","name":"Norman Foster","cat":"architects","en":"Norman Foster","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norman-foster.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norman-foster","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","vivid-colors","sci-fi","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["charcoal","black","muted-blue","white","brown","grey"],"intro":"Norman Foster is a renowned British architect known for his innovative and modernist designs. He is the founder of Foster + Partners, one of the world's leading architectural firms. Foster's work is characterized by its high-tech architecture, sustainability, and integration of technology and design. His notable projects include the Gherkin in London, the Hearst Tower in New York, and the Reichstag building in Berlin.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic architectural scenes with dense futuristic city environments, reflective glass towers, and monumental organic concrete structures. Geometric façades, sweeping arches, layered atriums, planted terraces, and abundant daylight create a polished, visionary urban atmosphere."},{"id":"david-bomberg","name":"David Bomberg","cat":"painters","en":"David Bomberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-bomberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-bomberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","urban","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","red","ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"David Bomberg is a British painter known for his bold and dynamic compositions, often associated with the Vorticist movement. His work is characterized by geometric abstraction and an expressive use of color, reflecting the influences of Cubism and Futurism. Bomberg's paintings often depict urban landscapes and architectural forms, rendered with a sense of energy and movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable urban and architectural forms are fractured into angular, interlocking planes with strong dark contours. Saturated reds, ochres, blues, and charcoal tones are applied in broad, visibly textured strokes, creating a forceful, high-contrast painted surface that balances observed city imagery with abstraction."},{"id":"betye-saar","name":"Betye Saar","cat":"various-artists","en":"Betye Saar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/betye-saar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/betye-saar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","scenes","still-life","subdued-colors","classical","religious","retro"],"colours":["grey","black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","white","rust"],"intro":"Betye Saar is an American artist known for her work in assemblage and collage, often exploring themes of race, gender, and spirituality. Her art is deeply rooted in African American culture and history, using found objects and symbolic imagery to convey powerful messages.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, densely packed displays of aged cabinets, reliquaries, furniture, paintings, figures, and devotional curiosities. Weathered surfaces, layered ornament, muted earthy color, and warm directional light create the feeling of carefully staged antique collections with a sacred, theatrical character."},{"id":"ernst-ludwig-kirchner","name":"Ernst Ludwig Kirchner","cat":"painters","en":"Ernst Ludwig Kirchner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernst-ludwig-kirchner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernst-ludwig-kirchner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","deep-blue","vivid-red","dark-pink","dark-teal","orange"],"intro":"Ernst Ludwig Kirchner was a German painter and printmaker, and one of the founding members of the Expressionist group Die Brücke. His work is characterized by its bold use of color, dynamic compositions, and expressive forms, often depicting urban life and human figures in a raw and emotional manner. Kirchner's art was influential in the development of modern art in the early 20th century, and he is known for his contributions to the Expressionist movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, figures and faces are built from vivid blocks of cobalt, pink, red, black, and teal, with strong dark contours and visibly broad, directional paint strokes. The repeated hats, cropped groups, expressive poses, and simplified angular features give the portraits a theatrical, fashion-focused character while retaining a richly tactile painted surface."},{"id":"rene-lalique","name":"Rene Lalique","cat":"designers","en":"Rene Lalique","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rene-lalique.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rene-lalique","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","animals","floral","still-life","metallic","subdued-colors","symmetry"],"colours":["black","white","charcoal","grey","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Rene Lalique was a renowned French glass designer known for his innovative and exquisite creations during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. He was a leading figure in the Art Nouveau movement, celebrated for his intricate jewelry and glasswork that often featured natural motifs and elegant forms. Lalique's work is characterized by its delicate craftsmanship and artistic elegance, making him a pivotal figure in the world of decorative arts.","observation":"The style presents highly polished decorative glass objects as carefully lit still lifes, with translucent blue-grey surfaces, warm metallic accents, and strong sculptural volume. Dense floral relief, feathers, birds, and radial ornament give every object an elaborate crafted appearance, while restrained compositions and clean product-like framing keep the focus on the vessels."},{"id":"meryl-mcmaster","name":"Meryl McMaster","cat":"photographers","en":"Meryl McMaster","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/meryl-mcmaster.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/meryl-mcmaster","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","religious","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","silver","deep-red","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Meryl McMaster is a Canadian artist known for her work in photography, which explores themes of identity, cultural heritage, and the natural world. Her art often incorporates elements of performance, costume, and self-portraiture, drawing on her mixed Plains Cree and European ancestry to create compelling narratives that challenge conventional representations of Indigenous peoples.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic portrait photography with carefully staged figures in striking red ceremonial garments, elaborate feathered or branch-like headdresses, and textured natural materials. Muted wintry landscapes, overcast light, and solemn ritual-like poses create a dark, epic atmosphere while the saturated red costumes provide the dominant visual accent."},{"id":"helen-frankenthaler","name":"Helen Frankenthaler","cat":"painters","en":"Helen Frankenthaler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helen-frankenthaler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helen-frankenthaler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","pale-orange","red","dark-cyan","orange","dark-ochre"],"intro":"Helen Frankenthaler was an influential American abstract expressionist painter known for her pioneering work in the color field movement. She was born on December 12, 1928, and became renowned for her innovative soak-stain technique, which involved pouring thinned paint onto unprimed canvas, allowing the colors to soak and spread organically. Frankenthaler's work is characterized by its lyrical abstraction, vibrant color palettes, and fluid forms, contributing significantly to the development of post-painterly abstraction.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad blocks and bands of saturated color are layered into nonrepresentational compositions. Visible brush marks, dragged paint, translucent washes, irregular edges, and occasional drips give the geometric arrangements an energetic, expressive surface."},{"id":"pieter-hugo","name":"Pieter Hugo","cat":"photographers","en":"Pieter Hugo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pieter-hugo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pieter-hugo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","muted-blue","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Pieter Hugo is a South African photographer known for his powerful and thought-provoking portraits that explore themes of identity, culture, and socio-political issues. His work often focuses on marginalized communities and the complexities of post-colonial Africa, capturing the essence of his subjects with a striking realism.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic photography with richly textured costumes, props, and environments rendered in vivid but natural color. Surreal character pairings and theatrical animal imagery are presented as sharply composed scenes, often with shallow focus that separates the subjects from urban or rural backgrounds."},{"id":"paola-navone","name":"Paola Navone","cat":"designers","en":"Paola Navone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paola-navone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paola-navone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","patterns","still-life","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-blue","beige","charcoal","muted-blue","silver"],"intro":"Paola Navone is an Italian designer known for her eclectic and innovative approach to interior and furniture design. With a background in architecture and industrial design, she has worked with numerous prestigious brands, creating pieces that blend traditional craftsmanship with modern aesthetics. Her work often reflects a deep appreciation for cultural diversity and artisanal techniques, making her a prominent figure in the design world.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly designed interior spaces unified by a blue-and-white palette, repeated dots, grids, stripes, and hand-crafted surface patterns. Realistic furnishings are treated as sculptural objects, with elaborate textiles, ceramics, tiles, woven lamps, and strong geometric architecture filling the compositions."},{"id":"kelley-jones","name":"Kelley Jones","cat":"illustrators","en":"Kelley Jones","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kelley-jones.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kelley-jones","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","bold-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","white","charcoal","grey","green","deep-red"],"intro":"Kelley Jones is an American comic book artist known for his distinctive and atmospheric style, particularly in the horror and fantasy genres. He gained prominence for his work on titles such as \"Batman\" and \"Sandman,\" where his use of dark, moody imagery and detailed linework became a hallmark of his illustrations.","observation":"Across the four renders, the style uses highly graphic comic-book drawing with heavy black ink, bold contour lines, dense crosshatched shading, and stark black-and-white contrast. Character-centered compositions and fantastical gothic imagery dominate, with occasional saturated color⁠—especially red and deep green⁠—set against large white or black fields."},{"id":"bastien-lecouffe-deharme","name":"Bastien Lecouffe-Deharme","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bastien Lecouffe-Deharme","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bastien-lecouffe-deharme.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bastien-lecouffe-deharme","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","charcoal","light-yellow"],"intro":"Bastien Lecouffe-Deharme is a contemporary French illustrator known for his dark and fantastical digital artworks. His work often explores themes of surrealism and fantasy, combining intricate details with a haunting atmosphere.","observation":"The style combines moody, subdued portraiture with visible painterly brushwork, layered distressed textures, and softly modeled faces. Dark clothing and tangled hair contrast with muted teal and ochre grounds, while luminous circular forms and drifting fabric create a dreamy, emotionally charged atmosphere."},{"id":"matthias-haker","name":"Matthias Haker","cat":"photographers","en":"Matthias Haker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matthias-haker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matthias-haker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","urban","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","pale-cyan","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Matthias Haker is a contemporary photographer known for his captivating images of abandoned and decaying architecture. His work often explores the beauty in forgotten spaces, capturing the intricate details and haunting atmospheres of these environments.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly detailed abandoned interiors combine decayed architecture with dense ornamental plasterwork, carved wood, stained glass, and elaborate ceilings. Strong shafts of sunlight cut through shadowed spaces, producing vivid teal, amber, and rust tones, while exaggerated perspective and monumental ruins create a dark, epic, slightly surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"michael-kenna","name":"Michael Kenna","cat":"photographers","en":"Michael Kenna","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-kenna.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-kenna","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Michael Kenna is a renowned English photographer known for his black and white landscapes. His work is characterized by minimalist compositions, long exposure techniques, and a focus on serene and ethereal scenes. Kenna's photographs often explore the interplay between light and shadow, creating a sense of timelessness and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is monochrome landscape photography built around stark silhouettes, quiet water, and strong tonal separation. Fog and overcast light soften distant forms while deep blacks, reflective surfaces, and sparse compositions create a dark, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"dziga-vertov","name":"Dziga Vertov","cat":"various-artists","en":"Dziga Vertov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dziga-vertov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dziga-vertov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","surreal","collage","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","bone-white"],"intro":"Dziga Vertov was a pioneering Soviet filmmaker and theorist, best known for his work in documentary filmmaking and his innovative use of montage techniques. He was a key figure in the Soviet avant-garde movement and is celebrated for his contributions to the development of cinema as an art form.","observation":"A stark black-and-white photographic collage combines close-up portraits and mechanical equipment with devastated industrial cityscapes. Dense overlapping exposures, newspaper-like textures, film grain, scratches, and severe tonal contrast create a gritty documentary atmosphere with surreal visual associations."},{"id":"gonzalo-borondo","name":"Gonzalo Borondo","cat":"street-artists","en":"Gonzalo Borondo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gonzalo-borondo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gonzalo-borondo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","beige","red","black","white","deep-red"],"intro":"Gonzalo Borondo is a contemporary Spanish street artist known for his evocative murals and installations. His work often explores themes of human emotion and introspection, blending classical techniques with modern urban influences. Borondo's art is characterized by its expressive and painterly style, often incorporating elements of surrealism and symbolism.","observation":"Across all four renders, expressive figurative murals merge rough architectural surfaces with heavily worked, visibly layered paint. Broad gestural strokes, scraped textures, drips, and sketch-like marks create dense crowds and monumental portraits in a restrained red, black, cream, and gray palette, with strong contrast and an atmospheric surreal quality."},{"id":"jarek-kubicki","name":"Jarek Kubicki","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jarek Kubicki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jarek-kubicki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jarek-kubicki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","brown","bone-white","beige","red"],"intro":"Jarek Kubicki is a contemporary Polish artist known for his distinctive digital art and design work. His creations often explore dark and surreal themes, blending traditional and modern techniques to produce hauntingly beautiful images that captivate viewers with their depth and complexity.","observation":"Across all four portraits, realistic faces are disrupted by dense charcoal-like marks, broad painterly strokes, scratched textures, and hard-edged blocks. The nearly monochrome palette, deep shadows, occasional rust-red accents, and fragmented collage-like overlays create an intense, bleak, surreal portrait style."},{"id":"cecil-touchon","name":"Cecil Touchon","cat":"painters","en":"Cecil Touchon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cecil-touchon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cecil-touchon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","illustrative","ornate","patterns","flat-color","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","muted-orange","deep-red","red","blue"],"intro":"Cecil Touchon is an American artist known for his work in collage, painting, and the fusion of text and image. He is a founding member of the International Post-Dogmatist Group, which explores the boundaries of traditional art forms and embraces a more fluid and dynamic approach to artistic expression.","observation":"The style uses bold geometric abstraction built from interlocking arches, circles, rectangles, and sweeping bands arranged in dense modular compositions. Strong black, rust, cream, blue, and red shapes are rendered with mostly flat edges but softened by visible crackle, abrasion, and aged painted-surface texture."},{"id":"diego-velazquez","name":"Diego Velazquez","cat":"painters","en":"Diego Velazquez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/diego-velazquez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/diego-velazquez","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-brown","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Diego Velazquez was a prominent Spanish painter of the 17th century, known for his significant contributions to the Baroque movement. He served as a court painter for King Philip IV of Spain and is celebrated for his masterful portraits, historical scenes, and his ability to capture the essence of his subjects with realism and depth. Velazquez's work is characterized by its sophisticated use of light and shadow, as well as its detailed and lifelike representation of textures and fabrics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, realistic oil-paint handling with finely observed faces, lace, brocade, velvet, and fabric folds. Dark brown grounds, restrained warm colors, dramatic light, and formal cropped poses create a grave, aristocratic portrait atmosphere."},{"id":"nychos","name":"Nychos","cat":"illustrators","en":"Nychos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nychos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nychos","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","blue","bone-white","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Nychos is an Austrian artist known for his distinctive style that combines elements of street art and pop surrealism. He is recognized for his intricate and detailed depictions of anatomical dissections, often blending organic and mechanical elements. His work is characterized by a vibrant color palette and dynamic compositions that explore themes of life and death.","observation":"Across all four renders, highly detailed fantastical animals and hybrid beasts cover urban building facades in saturated coral, pink, teal, cream, and black. Strong graphic outlines, clean color blocks, and expressive flowing forms give the murals an energetic, surreal street-art character."},{"id":"ernie-barnes","name":"Ernie Barnes","cat":"painters","en":"Ernie Barnes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernie-barnes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernie-barnes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","blue","brown","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Ernie Barnes is a renowned American artist and former professional football player, celebrated for his unique style that combines elements of realism and expressionism. His work often reflects African American culture, capturing the vibrancy and spirit of community life. Barnes's paintings are characterized by elongated figures, dynamic movement, and a vivid color palette, making them instantly recognizable and deeply impactful.","observation":"Across all four renders, athletic figures are shown in energetic, tightly cropped action scenes with strong diagonals, exaggerated poses, and emphatic movement. Visible brushwork combines broad, directional strokes with graphic contours, vivid blue-and-orange color contrasts, and dramatic light-dark modeling."},{"id":"janek-sedlar","name":"Janek Sedlar","cat":"photographers","en":"Janek Sedlar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/janek-sedlar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/janek-sedlar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Janek Sedlar is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative landscape photography that often captures the mystical and ethereal qualities of nature. His work is characterized by a deep connection to the natural world, with a focus on capturing the mood and atmosphere of the environment.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents realistic, highly detailed woodland landscapes with dense trunks, layered foliage, and winding paths. Strong red-orange illumination contrasts with deep blue-black shadows, while glowing light sources and soft atmospheric haze create a dark, cinematic sense of depth."},{"id":"anna-sui","name":"Anna Sui","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Anna Sui","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anna-sui.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anna-sui","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","floral","portraits","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-red","grey","muted-orange","blue"],"intro":"Anna Sui is an American fashion designer known for her eclectic and whimsical designs that blend vintage styles with modern flair. Her work often features bold colors, intricate patterns, and a playful mix of cultural influences. Sui's designs have been celebrated for their unique ability to capture the spirit of bohemian and rock-and-roll aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic fashion portraits with centered models, shallow focus, and softly blurred runway surroundings. It is characterised by richly patterned floral garments, elaborate embroidery, oversized jewelry, textured trims, saturated jewel tones, and ornate styling."},{"id":"maurizio-cattelan","name":"Maurizio Cattelan","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Maurizio Cattelan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maurizio-cattelan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maurizio-cattelan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","deep-red","dark-brown","beige","black"],"intro":"Maurizio Cattelan is an Italian contemporary artist known for his satirical and provocative sculptures and installations. His works often challenge societal norms and provoke thought through humor and absurdity, blending high art with popular culture.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, sharply detailed photographic rendering with dramatic scale contrasts and deadpan human poses among oversized animals, sculptures, and architectural props. Strong red, cream, and neutral tones, clean gallery-like spaces, controlled symmetry, and cinematic staging turn bizarre juxtapositions into polished surreal tableaux."},{"id":"hans-makart","name":"Hans Makart","cat":"painters","en":"Hans Makart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-makart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-makart","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-brown","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Hans Makart was an Austrian painter known for his influence on the Viennese art scene in the late 19th century. His work is characterized by its opulent style, rich color palette, and theatrical compositions, often depicting historical and allegorical subjects. Makart's art played a significant role in shaping the aesthetic culture of his time, blending elements of romanticism and symbolism.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visibly worked paint to depict elegant female portraits in elaborate clothing, surrounded by flowers, foliage, jewelry, and dark interiors. Deep reds, blacks, greens, and muted golds create a moody, dramatic atmosphere, while fine brushwork models faces and fabrics against heavily ornamented surfaces."},{"id":"david-a-hardy","name":"David A. Hardy","cat":"illustrators","en":"David A. Hardy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-a-hardy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-a-hardy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","landscapes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["grey","black","brown","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"David A. Hardy is a renowned British space artist known for his imaginative and scientifically inspired depictions of cosmic landscapes and futuristic scenes. His work often explores the vastness of space, blending elements of science fiction with detailed realism to create awe-inspiring visions of other worlds.","observation":"The style presents expansive alien landscapes with monumental cliffs, mountains, oceans, moons, and planets arranged in sweeping cinematic vistas. Richly modeled rock and cloud forms, saturated sunset colors, luminous celestial bodies, and strong light-dark separation create a grand, fantastical science-fiction atmosphere."},{"id":"kuzma-petrov-vodkin","name":"Kuzma Petrov-Vodkin","cat":"painters","en":"Kuzma Petrov-Vodkin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kuzma-petrov-vodkin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kuzma-petrov-vodkin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["ochre","black","dark-brown","dark-blue","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Kuzma Petrov-Vodkin was a Russian painter and writer known for his unique blend of Symbolism and Post-Impressionism. His work often explored themes of spirituality, human emotion, and Russian identity. Petrov-Vodkin's paintings are characterized by their vivid color palettes, expressive forms, and a strong sense of narrative.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly packed human figures and close-up faces dominate, rendered with visible directional brushwork, layered paint, and carefully modeled facial features. Saturated reds and blues, expressive gazes, and cropped compositions give the portraits a vivid, psychologically charged presence."},{"id":"arnold-newman","name":"Arnold Newman","cat":"photographers","en":"Arnold Newman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arnold-newman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arnold-newman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","characters","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey"],"intro":"Arnold Newman is renowned for his pioneering work in environmental portraiture, capturing subjects in their personal and professional spaces to reveal deeper aspects of their character. His photographs often feature prominent figures from the worlds of art, politics, and culture, framed with a keen eye for composition and context.","observation":"Across all four renders, solitary suited men are staged within stark architectural interiors, using large geometric planes, doorways and unusually generous negative space. The monochrome treatment, grain, hard directional light and deep shadows create a severe, cinematic mood with strongly silhouetted or partially obscured figures."},{"id":"tim-holtz","name":"Tim Holtz","cat":"designers","en":"Tim Holtz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-holtz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-holtz","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","retro"],"colours":["brown","silver","black","muted-brown","beige","orange","red"],"intro":"Tim Holtz is a renowned designer known for his work in the crafting and scrapbooking industry. He has developed a distinctive style that combines vintage aesthetics with contemporary design elements, often incorporating mixed media techniques.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely layered assemblages combine antique mechanisms, aged paper, clocks, compartments, and small curiosities into ornate sculptural still lifes. Fine drawn marks, collage-like surfaces, distressed materials, subdued earthy colors, and carefully arranged mechanical details create a retro, surreal cabinet-of-curiosities aesthetic."},{"id":"todd-james","name":"Todd James","cat":"painters","en":"Todd James","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/todd-james.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/todd-james","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["silver","vivid-red","ochre","deep-blue","black","dark-olive","light-yellow"],"intro":"Todd James is an American artist known for his vibrant and playful works that often incorporate elements of pop culture and surrealism. His art is characterized by bold colors, whimsical themes, and a unique blend of street art and fine art influences.","observation":"Across the sheet, vividly saturated coral, blue, green, and orange shapes are arranged in graphic, angular compositions with heavy dark outlines and strongly simplified forms. Visible brush marks and occasional drips keep the flat color fields painterly, while expressive faces, figures, animals, and gallery-like scenes recur in dense, high-contrast arrangements."},{"id":"ronald-searle","name":"Ronald Searle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ronald Searle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ronald-searle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ronald-searle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","bone-white","beige","red","orange","brown"],"intro":"Ronald Searle is a renowned British illustrator and cartoonist, best known for his satirical and humorous works. His distinctive style has influenced many artists and is characterized by its sharp wit and keen observations of society. Searle's illustrations often feature exaggerated characters and whimsical scenes, capturing the absurdities of human behavior with a unique flair.","observation":"Across the sheet, expressive ink drawing combines wiry, fine contour lines with translucent watercolor-like washes and occasional saturated red accents. The compositions leave broad areas of paper visible while populating them with eccentric costumed figures, fantastical creatures, architectural fragments, and densely layered gestural detail."},{"id":"charles-eames","name":"Charles Eames","cat":"designers","en":"Charles Eames","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-eames.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-eames","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["grey","white","muted-olive","brown","ochre","red"],"intro":"Charles Eames is a renowned American designer, best known for his contributions to modern architecture and furniture design. Alongside his wife, Ray Eames , he played a pivotal role in the development of mid-century modern design, creating iconic pieces like the Eames Lounge Chair and Ottoman. His work is celebrated for its innovative use of materials and focus on functionality and aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents sculptural lounge furniture with highly realistic materials, especially richly figured walnut, leather, and polished metal bases. It combines clean geometric compositions and bold color-blocked backdrops with cinematic interior scenes, strong sunlight, and carefully staged mid-century modern settings."},{"id":"guy-buffet","name":"Guy Buffet","cat":"painters","en":"Guy Buffet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-buffet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-buffet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","funny"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","grey","deep-red","ochre","bone-white","deep-blue"],"intro":"Guy Buffet is a contemporary French artist known for his vibrant and whimsical depictions of social gatherings and café scenes. His work often features elongated figures and exaggerated expressions, capturing the lively essence of Parisian culture. Buffet's art is celebrated for its narrative quality and ability to convey the joy and camaraderie of shared experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, thick visible brushwork, rough impasto, and emphatic dark outlines create densely crowded scenes of grotesquely caricatured people. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and yellows, stark black-and-white accents, framed pictures, and theatrical social settings give the paintings an expressive, comic-surreal character."},{"id":"rafael-vinoly","name":"Rafael Vinoly","cat":"architects","en":"Rafael Vinoly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rafael-vinoly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rafael-vinoly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","subdued-colors","sci-fi","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","white"],"intro":"Rafael Vinoly is a renowned architect known for his innovative and large-scale architectural designs. Born in Uruguay, he has worked internationally, creating iconic structures such as the Tokyo International Forum and 432 Park Avenue in New York City. His work is characterized by a focus on functionality, aesthetics, and the integration of natural elements.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, photorealistic architectural visions with monumental glass towers, flowing sculptural structures, and carefully integrated greenery. Cool neutral materials, warm interior illumination, geometric framing, and expansive urban vistas create a polished futuristic city atmosphere."},{"id":"fabian-perez","name":"Fabian Perez","cat":"painters","en":"Fabian Perez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fabian-perez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fabian-perez","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Fabian Perez is an Argentine artist known for his evocative and atmospheric paintings that often depict intimate scenes of nightlife and romance. His work is characterized by a focus on light and shadow, capturing the mood and essence of urban settings.","observation":"Across all four scenes, visible brushwork builds the figures, clothing, smoke, and dark interiors with energetic, directional strokes. The style uses a restrained brown-black palette with warm amber accents, strong light-dark separation, and expressive snapshots of people socializing in intimate barroom settings."},{"id":"louise-nevelson","name":"Louise Nevelson","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Louise Nevelson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louise-nevelson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louise-nevelson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","flat-color","bw-monochrome","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","bone-white","white","beige","dark-brown","olive"],"intro":"Louise Nevelson was an American sculptor known for her monumental, monochromatic, wooden wall pieces and outdoor sculptures. Born in 1899, she became a prominent figure in the art world with her unique style of assemblage art, often using found objects to create complex, abstract compositions. Her work is characterized by its intricate use of shadow and light, creating a sense of depth and mystery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental, nearly black relief constructions assembled from dense rectangular, circular, and linear elements. The imagery is abstract and architectural, with strong geometric organization, shallow depth, matte surfaces, and extensive repeated patterning that makes each work read as a solid sculptural wall or freestanding installation."},{"id":"william-stout","name":"William Stout","cat":"illustrators","en":"William Stout","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-stout.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-stout","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","ink"],"colours":["brown","pale-orange","black","beige","cream","orange"],"intro":"William Stout is an American artist known for his work in fantasy art, comics, and film design. He has contributed to various projects, including illustrations for books, movie posters, and concept art for films. Stout's work often features detailed and imaginative depictions of prehistoric life and fantastical worlds.","observation":"Highly detailed ink-like illustrations depict colossal grotesque creatures integrated with ancient, barren landscapes. Fine contour lines, dense hatching, weathered textures, and restrained earthy colors create an expressive fantasy atmosphere, with occasional orange celestial accents providing strong contrast."},{"id":"yaacov-agam","name":"Yaacov Agam","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Yaacov Agam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yaacov-agam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yaacov-agam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["cream","grey","black","red","dark-blue","light-orange","green"],"intro":"Yaacov Agam is an Israeli artist known for his contributions to optical and kinetic art. Born in 1928, Agam's work often explores the concepts of movement, perception, and the dynamic interaction between the viewer and the artwork. His innovative approach has made him a prominent figure in the world of modern art, particularly through his use of vibrant colors and geometric forms.","observation":"Across all four works, the style uses dense vertical bar systems and repeated rectangular modules to build highly geometric abstract compositions. Strong saturated color, crisp flat edges, and occasional dimensional slats or framed relief structures combine graphic color blocking with a carefully constructed, decorative surface."},{"id":"alice-neel","name":"Alice Neel","cat":"painters","en":"Alice Neel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alice-neel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alice-neel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","rust","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Alice Neel is a renowned American painter known for her distinctive portraits that capture the psychological depth and individuality of her subjects. Born in 1900, Neel's work often reflects the social and cultural dynamics of 20th-century America, with a focus on urban life and the human condition. Her expressive style and keen observation skills have made her a significant figure in modern art.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses visibly worked paint with energetic directional strokes, strong contour accents, and layered color to build expressive faces, clothing, and interiors. Saturated blues, reds, and oranges contrast with dark neutrals, while tightly cropped family groupings and solitary seated figures create intimate, psychologically charged portraits."},{"id":"sven-pfrommer","name":"Sven Pfrommer","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sven Pfrommer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sven-pfrommer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sven-pfrommer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["red","beige","charcoal","silver","black"],"intro":"Sven Pfrommer is a contemporary artist known for his innovative approach to digital and mixed media art. His work often explores the intersection of photography and painting, creating dynamic and textured compositions that reflect modern urban life. Pfrommer's art is characterized by its vivid color palettes and expressive use of form, capturing the essence of movement and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable city streets and pedestrians are dissolved into vigorous blocks, streaks, and scraped layers of red, teal, black, and pale gray paint. Broad gestural marks, strong silhouettes, reflective ground, and repeated vertical distortions create an expressive, dreamlike urban atmosphere."},{"id":"herbert-list","name":"Herbert List","cat":"photographers","en":"Herbert List","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herbert-list.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herbert-list","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","geometric","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Herbert List was a German photographer known for his work in the mid-20th century, particularly noted for his surreal and modernist style. His photography often explored themes of dreamlike reality, blending elements of the human form with architectural and geometric shapes. List's work is characterized by its introspective and enigmatic qualities, often capturing the essence of post-war Europe.","observation":"Across all four images, stark monochrome photography combines monumental curved architecture and barren landscapes with isolated human figures, distorted anatomy, and impossible spatial relationships. Deep shadows, bright surfaces, visible grain, and expansive negative space create a graphic, dreamlike atmosphere with strong geometric compositions."},{"id":"rei-kawakubo","name":"Rei Kawakubo","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Rei Kawakubo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rei-kawakubo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rei-kawakubo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["white","deep-red","black","muted-blue"],"intro":"Rei Kawakubo is a renowned Japanese fashion designer, celebrated for her avant-garde and innovative approach to fashion. She founded the label Comme des Garçons and is known for challenging conventional norms in fashion design, often incorporating elements of deconstruction and abstraction into her work. Her designs are characterized by their sculptural forms, unconventional silhouettes, and a monochromatic palette.","observation":"The style presents fashion-editorial portraits with monumental, sculptural garments that envelop the bodies in exaggerated volumes, folds, feathers, and quilted textures. Saturated red, occasional black, stark studio backgrounds, strong tonal separation, and carefully posed figures create a dramatic, surreal, highly controlled visual language."},{"id":"raimundo-de-madrazo-y-garreta","name":"Raimundo de Madrazo y Garreta","cat":"painters","en":"Raimundo de Madrazo y Garreta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raimundo-de-madrazo-y-garreta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raimundo-de-madrazo-y-garreta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","brown","bone-white","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Raimundo de Madrazo y Garreta was a Spanish painter known for his elegant and detailed portraits, often depicting the aristocracy and fashionable society of his time. Born in Rome in 1841, he was part of a prominent family of artists and became renowned for his refined technique and ability to capture the grace and poise of his subjects. His works are characterized by their academic realism and attention to detail, reflecting the opulence and sophistication of the Belle Époque.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly dressed women and tightly cropped groups are modeled with visible, layered brushwork, especially in lace, feathers, fabrics, and floral decoration. The subdued olive, cream, black, and red palette, ornate costumes, and softly dramatic interiors create a refined, densely textured portrait style."},{"id":"lucienne-day","name":"Lucienne Day","cat":"designers","en":"Lucienne Day","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucienne-day.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucienne-day","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","floral","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","ochre","brown","grey","red"],"intro":"Lucienne Day is a renowned British textile designer known for her innovative and influential work in the mid-20th century. She gained prominence in the 1950s for her bold and abstract designs, which brought a modern aesthetic to everyday home furnishings. Her work is characterized by vibrant colors, geometric patterns, and a playful yet sophisticated style that helped redefine post-war British design.","observation":"The style combines flat, saturated geometric color blocks with densely repeated botanical forms, especially radiating seedheads and simplified flowers. Heavy irregular black linework, visible woven texture, and slight print-like imperfections give the pattern a handmade textile character, while the mustard, red, blue, black, and cream palette creates a lively retro graphic effect."},{"id":"eduard-veith","name":"Eduard Veith","cat":"painters","en":"Eduard Veith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eduard-veith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eduard-veith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","ochre","light-orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Eduard Veith was an Austrian painter known for his contributions to the Symbolist and Art Nouveau movements. His works often depicted mythological and allegorical themes, characterized by intricate details and a romantic aesthetic. Veith's art is celebrated for its ethereal beauty and the use of soft, muted color palettes.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with delicate brushwork, softly modeled faces, and layered fabric, hair, and botanical detail. Portraits are framed by dusky woodland elements and floral adornments, with subdued copper, rose, teal, and brown tones creating a dreamy, wistful atmosphere."},{"id":"andreas-achenbach","name":"Andreas Achenbach","cat":"painters","en":"Andreas Achenbach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andreas-achenbach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andreas-achenbach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","mist","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","bone-white","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Andreas Achenbach was a prominent German landscape painter of the 19th century, known for his dramatic and detailed depictions of natural scenes, particularly seascapes and coastal landscapes. He was a key figure in the Düsseldorf school of painting and contributed significantly to the Romantic movement in art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured painterly surfaces, dense environmental detail, and dramatic storm lighting to create immense, perilous coastal landscapes. Deep blue-green shadows, warm breaks of sunlight, rolling surf, mist, and monumental ruins give the scenes an epic fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"lewis-hine","name":"Lewis Hine","cat":"photographers","en":"Lewis Hine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lewis-hine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lewis-hine","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Lewis Hine was an American photographer and sociologist, known for his impactful work documenting child labor and the working conditions of the early 20th century. His photographs played a significant role in changing child labor laws in the United States. Hine's work is characterized by its focus on social issues, capturing the human condition with empathy and precision.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic monochrome photography with strong tonal contrast, visible grain, and selective focus. Closely framed portraits of children are embedded in crowded industrial scenes, with worn clothing, machinery, and subdued expressions creating a somber documentary atmosphere."},{"id":"jim-woodring","name":"Jim Woodring","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jim Woodring","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-woodring.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-woodring","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","patterns","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","red","grey","charcoal","dark-olive","yellow"],"intro":"Jim Woodring is an American cartoonist and illustrator known for his surreal and fantastical comic art. His work often explores dreamlike worlds filled with bizarre creatures and intricate landscapes, blending elements of fantasy and surrealism. Woodring's unique style has earned him a distinct place in the world of alternative comics and illustration.","observation":"The style combines densely packed, grotesque fantasy creatures with exaggerated eyes, mouths, teeth, tentacles and mushroom-like forms. Across both the saturated colored images and monochrome drawings, it relies on precise illustrative linework, stippling and fine texture, producing a surreal, expressive bestiary with intricate organic patterning."},{"id":"alson-skinner-clark","name":"Alson Skinner Clark","cat":"painters","en":"Alson Skinner Clark","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alson-skinner-clark.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alson-skinner-clark","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Alson Skinner Clark was an American Impressionist painter known for his landscapes, cityscapes, and depictions of urban life. Born in 1876, Clark studied art in Chicago and Paris, and his work often reflects the influence of French Impressionism. He is celebrated for his ability to capture light and atmosphere, particularly in scenes of Southern California and Europe.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is visibly oil-painted, with broad directional strokes, textured buildup, and expressive handling rather than clean graphic edges. It combines richly varied, often vivid color and strong light-dark contrast with detailed narrative scenes and portraits, presented as traditional framed paintings."},{"id":"alex-majoli","name":"Alex Majoli","cat":"photographers","en":"Alex Majoli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-majoli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-majoli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Alex Majoli is an Italian photographer known for his compelling black and white imagery that often explores human emotions and societal issues. His work is characterized by a documentary style that captures the essence of his subjects with a profound sense of realism and depth.","observation":"The style is stark monochrome photography built around deep blacks, sharply controlled highlights, and dramatic pools or slashes of light. Urban spaces, isolated figures, wet streets, mist, and selective focus create a tense, filmic noir atmosphere across both portraits and narrative scenes."},{"id":"david-bailey","name":"David Bailey","cat":"photographers","en":"David Bailey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-bailey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-bailey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["black","grey","white","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"David Bailey is a renowned British fashion and portrait photographer, celebrated for his iconic images of celebrities and models during the 1960s. His work is characterized by its bold, high-contrast style and intimate portrayal of subjects, capturing the essence of the swinging sixties and the cultural revolution of that era.","observation":"The style is built around tightly cropped, high-detail black-and-white beauty portraits with direct gazes, pronounced eye makeup, sculpted facial lighting, and rich hair texture. Strong tonal contrast, visible grain, and fashion-editorial styling give the images an intense, expressive photographic character."},{"id":"simon-palmer","name":"Simon Palmer","cat":"painters","en":"Simon Palmer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/simon-palmer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/simon-palmer","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","ochre","light-yellow","beige","orange"],"intro":"Simon Palmer is a contemporary British artist known for his detailed watercolor landscapes depicting the English countryside. His work often features intricate compositions with a focus on natural and architectural elements, capturing the serene beauty of rural life.","observation":"Across all four views, the countryside is rendered with dense, visible brushwork and finely articulated foliage, trees, paths, cottages, and cultivated fields. Warm but restrained natural colors, strong light-and-shadow contrasts, and an illustrative drawn structure give the scenes a richly textured, pastoral appearance."},{"id":"bill-blass","name":"Bill Blass","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Bill Blass","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-blass.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-blass","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","black","rust","beige","orange"],"intro":"Bill Blass was an influential American fashion designer known for his elegant and sophisticated designs. He was a leading figure in the fashion industry, celebrated for his ability to blend classic styles with modern sensibilities. Blass's work often featured luxurious fabrics, intricate details, and a timeless aesthetic that appealed to a wide audience.","observation":"The style combines expressive fashion illustration with loose, visible ink-and-wash brushwork, delicate contour lines, and selectively vivid garment colors. Elongated figures, dramatic clothing and hats, cropped portrait studies, and generous cream negative space recur across the sheet, giving the work an editorial runway feel."},{"id":"terry-redlin","name":"Terry Redlin","cat":"painters","en":"Terry Redlin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/terry-redlin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/terry-redlin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","grey","dark-brown","orange","rust"],"intro":"Terry Redlin is an American artist renowned for his paintings depicting rural and wildlife scenes, often capturing the serene beauty of the American countryside. His work is characterized by a warm, nostalgic style that evokes a sense of tranquility and appreciation for nature and simpler times.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured rural landscapes are built from visible painterly detail, with dark blue-grey skies and restrained autumn browns punctuated by strong amber light from windows, sunsets, and the moon. Mist, reflective water, storm clouds, and isolated wooden cabins create a cinematic, somber, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"guillaume-corneille","name":"Guillaume Corneille","cat":"painters","en":"Guillaume Corneille","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guillaume-corneille.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guillaume-corneille","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["muted-blue","charcoal","muted-red","pale-orange","red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Guillaume Corneille is a Dutch artist known for his role in the CoBrA movement, which emphasized spontaneity and experimentation in art. Born in 1922, Corneille's work is characterized by vibrant colors, abstract forms, and a playful, childlike quality. His art often explores themes of nature, animals, and human figures, blending elements of surrealism and expressionism.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable faces, figures, animals, and architectural fragments are fractured into dense, layered compositions of vivid red, blue, orange, pink, and black. Heavy drawn contours, broad visible brushstrokes, scraped and built-up paint, geometric blocks, repeated eyes, and decorative marks create an expressive, surreal mixed-media surface."},{"id":"dod-procter","name":"Dod Procter","cat":"painters","en":"Dod Procter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dod-procter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dod-procter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","dark-brown","black","red","charcoal"],"intro":"Dod Procter is a renowned British artist known for her realistic and intimate portrayals of women. Born in 1890, she became a prominent figure in the Newlyn School of painters, celebrated for her ability to capture the quiet dignity and introspection of her subjects. Her work often features women in contemplative poses, rendered with a soft, painterly touch that emphasizes the subtleties of light and shadow.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses tightly cropped portrait compositions with carefully modeled faces, expressive gazes, and richly textured clothing. Visible fine brushwork, crackled paint-like surfaces, restrained earthy colors, and selective red and blue accents give the images a detailed, classically rendered appearance."},{"id":"carl-mydans","name":"Carl Mydans","cat":"photographers","en":"Carl Mydans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-mydans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-mydans","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","white","silver","grey"],"intro":"Carl Mydans was an American photographer known for his work with Life magazine, capturing significant historical events and everyday life during the mid-20th century. His photography is celebrated for its documentary style, focusing on human experiences and societal changes.","observation":"The style is consistently monochrome, realistic, and filmic, using hard directional light, deep shadows, and occasional silhouettes to create a stark documentary atmosphere. Candid human gestures, layered urban environments, and selective focus make each scene feel observational and emotionally weighty."},{"id":"dorothy-draper","name":"Dorothy Draper","cat":"designers","en":"Dorothy Draper","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dorothy-draper.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dorothy-draper","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","scenes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","retro","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-olive","bone-white","black","muted-ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Dorothy Draper is a renowned American interior designer known for her bold use of color and pattern. She was a pioneer in the field of interior design, establishing her own firm in the 1920s and becoming famous for her work on hotels and public spaces. Draper's style is characterized by its vibrant colors, large-scale patterns, and a sense of theatricality that brought a new level of glamour to interior spaces.","observation":"The style presents richly decorated formal interiors through visible brushwork, layered texture, and dense ornamental detail. Saturated greens, reds, pinks, and blues are organized by strong geometric floors, striped or floral walls, and carefully staged furnishings, giving the scenes a polished vintage editorial character."},{"id":"adam-elsheimer","name":"Adam Elsheimer","cat":"painters","en":"Adam Elsheimer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adam-elsheimer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adam-elsheimer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-cyan","muted-blue","dark-brown","rust","orange"],"intro":"Adam Elsheimer was a German painter active in the early 17th century, known for his small-scale, highly detailed works that often featured dramatic lighting and complex compositions. His work was influential in the development of landscape painting and the use of chiaroscuro, a technique that plays with light and shadow to create depth and drama.","observation":"A richly painterly landscape style builds vast nocturnal vistas from layered cliffs, forests, water, ruins, and monumental cloud formations. Deep blue shadow, subdued earth tones, and intense orange firelight create high contrast, while mist, moonlight, and glowing settlements give the scenes a fantastical, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"willem-van-aelst","name":"Willem van Aelst","cat":"painters","en":"Willem van Aelst","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/willem-van-aelst.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/willem-van-aelst","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","portraits","scenes","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","red","deep-red","beige"],"intro":"Willem van Aelst is a renowned Dutch painter from the 17th century, celebrated for his intricate and realistic still life paintings. Known for his mastery of the baroque style, van Aelst's work often features rich detail and complex compositions, focusing on themes of nature and mortality. His paintings are characterized by their use of chiaroscuro, creating a dramatic interplay of light and shadow that enhances the depth and realism of his subjects.","observation":"Across the four renders, the style uses richly textured, painterly surfaces with fine brushwork, dense floral and costume details, and elaborate still-life arrangements. Deep black grounds and strong chiaroscuro isolate the subjects, while warm reds, creams, and muted greens create a dark, theatrical mood with classical portrait and tableau compositions."},{"id":"evelyn-dunbar","name":"Evelyn Dunbar","cat":"painters","en":"Evelyn Dunbar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/evelyn-dunbar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/evelyn-dunbar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","light-orange","dark-brown","beige","orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"Evelyn Dunbar was a British artist known for her work as an official war artist during World War II. She is celebrated for her depictions of women's contributions to the war effort and her detailed portrayals of rural and domestic life in Britain. Her style is often characterized by a focus on everyday scenes, with a particular emphasis on the roles and environments of women.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly built-up paint with directional, fine brushwork and richly textured surfaces. Representational figures and interiors are densely observed, arranged as narrative workshop or street scenes with strong sunlight, deep shadows, earthy color, and crisp illustrative structure."},{"id":"j-j-grandville","name":"J. J. Grandville","cat":"illustrators","en":"J. J. Grandville","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/j-j-grandville.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/j-j-grandville","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","classical","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","beige","black"],"intro":"J. J. Grandville was a 19th-century French artist and illustrator known for his imaginative and satirical works. His real name was Jean Ignace Isidore Gérard, and he gained fame for his detailed and whimsical illustrations that often featured anthropomorphic animals and fantastical scenes. Grandville's work was influential in the development of surrealism and fantasy art, and he is remembered for his unique ability to blend humor with social commentary.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed black-and-white ink drawing, with fine contour lines and dense crosshatching that create textured fur, clothing, and architectural backgrounds. It presents anthropomorphic animals and human-animal characters in theatrical, storybook scenes with a fantastical and slightly surreal tone, resembling aged printed illustrations."},{"id":"wolfgang-laib","name":"Wolfgang Laib","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Wolfgang Laib","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wolfgang-laib.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wolfgang-laib","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["vivid-ochre","muted-orange","silver","dark-ochre","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Wolfgang Laib is a German artist known for his unique approach to sculpture and installation art. He often uses natural materials such as pollen, milk, and beeswax to create minimalist and meditative works that explore themes of spirituality and the relationship between humans and nature. Laib's work is characterized by its simplicity, purity, and serene beauty, drawing inspiration from Eastern philosophies and traditional rituals.","observation":"The style presents realistic, cinematic architectural scenes with monumental geometric interiors, strong perspective, and expansive negative space. A vivid orange sand installation contrasts with white walls, concrete surfaces, and abundant skylight, while small human figures emphasize the scale and sculptural character of the spaces."},{"id":"el-greco","name":"El Greco","cat":"painters","en":"El Greco","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/el-greco.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/el-greco","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","religious","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-orange","orange","dark-red"],"intro":"El Greco is a renowned painter of the Spanish Renaissance , known for his distinctive style that combines elements of Byzantine and Western painting traditions. Born in Crete, he spent much of his career in Spain, where he developed a unique approach characterized by elongated figures, dramatic use of color, and expressive compositions. His work often features religious themes, reflecting the spiritual intensity of the Counter-Reformation period.","observation":"Across all four images, expressive painted bust portraits emerge from very dark grounds, with strongly modeled faces, dramatic upward gazes, and devotional gestures. Visible, varied brushwork and textured paint give the robes, hair, skin, and drapery a tactile surface, while warm flesh tones and occasional red accents stand out against deep brown-black shadows."},{"id":"ivan-albright","name":"Ivan Albright","cat":"painters","en":"Ivan Albright","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ivan-albright.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ivan-albright","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","silver","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Ivan Albright was an American painter known for his meticulous and often unsettling depictions of the human condition. His works are characterized by their intricate detail and focus on themes of decay, mortality, and the passage of time. Albright's paintings often explore the darker aspects of life, using a rich, textured style that emphasizes the grotesque and the macabre.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is built from dense, directional paint strokes and heavily worked, tactile surfaces, with figures emerging from turbulent layers of pigment. The subdued, often dark palette is punctuated by earthy reds and greens, while stark tonal contrasts, strained faces, and compressed groupings create an intense, somber theatricality."},{"id":"santiago-caruso","name":"Santiago Caruso","cat":"various-artists","en":"Santiago Caruso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/santiago-caruso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/santiago-caruso","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige"],"intro":"Santiago Caruso is an Argentine illustrator known for his dark, surreal, and intricately detailed artwork. His work often explores themes of madness, mythology, and the macabre, drawing inspiration from gothic literature and dark romanticism. Caruso's illustrations are characterized by their fine lines, detailed textures, and haunting atmospheres, making them a distinctive presence in the world of contemporary surrealism.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses heavily textured, painterly surfaces and fine, layered marks to depict meticulously detailed theatrical figures and uncanny situations. A subdued brown-black palette, selective luminous highlights, and strong shadow produce a bleak, surreal atmosphere, while formal staging and expressive gestures give each tableau a ritualistic, symbolic quality."},{"id":"david-burliuk","name":"David Burliuk","cat":"painters","en":"David Burliuk","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-burliuk.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-burliuk","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","muted-ochre","brown","bone-white","red"],"intro":"David Burliuk was a Ukrainian avant-garde artist and poet, often referred to as the 'father of Russian Futurism.' He was a key figure in the development of modern art in Eastern Europe and was known for his vibrant and experimental style, which combined elements of Futurism , Neo-Primitivism, and Expressionism. Burliuk's work often featured bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a whimsical, dreamlike quality.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, visible brushwork and swirling directional strokes to turn urban streets, architecture, foliage, and figures into energetic painted scenes. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and ochres heighten the expressive movement, while abundant small marks create richly layered landscapes and city views."},{"id":"luc-tuymans","name":"Luc Tuymans","cat":"various-artists","en":"Luc Tuymans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/luc-tuymans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/luc-tuymans","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["beige","black","bone-white","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Luc Tuymans is a renowned Belgian contemporary artist known for his distinctive approach to painting. His work often explores themes of history, memory, and identity, utilizing a muted color palette and a minimalist style that evokes a sense of introspection and melancholy. Tuymans's paintings are recognized for their subtlety and depth, often leaving viewers with a lingering sense of contemplation.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and settings are built from visible, loose paint strokes with rough, layered surfaces and simplified but convincing forms. The restrained earthy palette, deep shadows, and cropped portrait-like compositions create a tense, somber mood while preserving clear narrative situations."},{"id":"pietro-da-cortona","name":"Pietro da Cortona","cat":"painters","en":"Pietro da Cortona","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pietro-da-cortona.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pietro-da-cortona","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","bone-white","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Pietro da Cortona was an influential Italian Baroque painter and architect, known for his grandiose and dynamic compositions. He was a leading figure in the development of the Baroque style, particularly noted for his ceiling frescoes and the use of illusionistic techniques. His work often depicted religious and mythological themes, characterized by dramatic use of light and shadow, as well as complex, multi-layered compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly vigorous, broad paint strokes to build crowded mythic scenes filled with contorted figures, flying drapery, clouds, and emphatic gestures. Strong light-dark contrasts, warm flesh and jewel-like fabric colors, and diagonal upward movement create a theatrical, devotional sense of drama."},{"id":"vivian-maier","name":"Vivian Maier","cat":"photographers","en":"Vivian Maier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vivian-maier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vivian-maier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro"],"colours":["grey","white","silver","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Vivian Maier was an American street photographer known for her candid and poignant images of urban life, particularly in Chicago and New York City. Her work, largely undiscovered during her lifetime, has gained significant recognition posthumously, highlighting her unique perspective and talent in capturing the essence of everyday life.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast photographic storytelling set in a mid-century city, with candid figures, classic cars, and dense urban architecture. Film grain, selective focus, hard sunlight, and carefully framed reflections give the images a cinematic documentary character."},{"id":"ed-mell","name":"Ed Mell","cat":"painters","en":"Ed Mell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-mell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-mell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","pale-orange","beige","dark-brown","orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Ed Mell is an American painter known for his distinctive depictions of the Southwestern United States. His work often features bold, geometric forms and vivid color palettes, capturing the dramatic landscapes and skies of the region. Mell's paintings are celebrated for their modernist approach to traditional Western themes, blending realism with stylized abstraction.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental desert formations and towering cloud banks are rendered with visible broad, directional paint strokes and strongly simplified graphic shapes. The saturated orange, blue, and charcoal palette, sharp light-dark separation, and dramatic skies give the landscapes an expansive, heroic intensity."},{"id":"ad-reinhardt","name":"Ad Reinhardt","cat":"painters","en":"Ad Reinhardt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ad-reinhardt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ad-reinhardt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","minimalist","still-life","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","vivid-red","deep-red","black","beige"],"intro":"Ad Reinhardt was an American abstract painter known for his contributions to Abstract Expressionism and Minimalism. He was born in 1913 and became renowned for his 'black paintings,' which were characterized by their subtle variations in color and form. Reinhardt's work focused on the purity of form and color, often using a grid structure to create a meditative and contemplative experience.","observation":"The style is radically reduced, using large rectangular color fields and hard-edged geometric divisions with almost no depicted subject matter. Saturated red and deep black create a stark, high-contrast palette, while the sparse gallery presentation and generous surrounding wall space reinforce its minimalist character."},{"id":"bob-eggleton","name":"Bob Eggleton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bob Eggleton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-eggleton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-eggleton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-red","vivid-red","orange"],"intro":"Bob Eggleton is an acclaimed American science fiction, fantasy, and horror artist known for his vivid and imaginative illustrations. His work often features fantastical creatures, cosmic landscapes, and dramatic scenes, earning him numerous awards, including the Hugo Award for Best Professional Artist.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly and heavily textured, with energetic brushwork defining colossal beasts, volcanic terrain, smoke, and rugged figures. Saturated blue, red, and orange color fields combine with stark shadow and internal firelight to create dramatic, monumental fantasy scenes."},{"id":"kathrin-longhurst","name":"Kathrin Longhurst","cat":"painters","en":"Kathrin Longhurst","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kathrin-longhurst.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kathrin-longhurst","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","silver","dark-brown","muted-cyan","deep-red"],"intro":"Kathrin Longhurst is a contemporary artist known for her striking figurative paintings that often explore themes of identity and empowerment. Born in Germany, she has developed a unique style that blends classical techniques with modern sensibilities, creating works that are both visually captivating and thought-provoking.","observation":"These close-up character portraits combine visible, directional oil-paint brushwork with polished illustrative modeling, rich skin tones, and saturated red, blue, white, and brown accents. The style is strongly expressive and fashion-oriented, emphasizing oversized eyewear, aviation accessories, scarves, gloves, and tightly cropped faces with finely rendered hair, fabric, leather, and reflective surfaces."},{"id":"judy-dater","name":"Judy Dater","cat":"photographers","en":"Judy Dater","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/judy-dater.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/judy-dater","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","beige","bone-white","white"],"intro":"Judy Dater is an American photographer known for her work in portraiture and her exploration of feminist themes. She gained prominence in the 1970s and is celebrated for her compelling and intimate photographs that often focus on women's identity and expression.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is realistic black-and-white portrait photography with pronounced tonal contrast, visible grain, and carefully composed intimate situations. It combines close facial studies with quiet domestic or natural settings, using subdued expressions, tactile fabrics, and directional natural light to create a dark, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"lauren-greenfield","name":"Lauren Greenfield","cat":"photographers","en":"Lauren Greenfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lauren-greenfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lauren-greenfield","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","glow","vivid-colors","surreal","epic"],"colours":["muted-cyan","bone-white","rust","dark-olive","red"],"intro":"Lauren Greenfield is an acclaimed American photographer and filmmaker known for her documentary work exploring youth culture, consumerism, and the pursuit of wealth. Her impactful projects often delve into societal themes, capturing the complexities of modern life through a candid and insightful lens.","observation":"The style uses highly saturated, fashion-editorial tableaux filled with extravagant costumes, oversized accessories, tactile feathers, flowers, and decorative props. It combines polished realistic photography with surreal theatrical staging, bold color coordination, and lavishly detailed surfaces across both portraits and interiors."},{"id":"rebecca-louise-law","name":"Rebecca Louise Law","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Rebecca Louise Law","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rebecca-louise-law.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rebecca-louise-law","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","glow","fine-lines","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["rust","ochre","beige","silver","red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Rebecca Louise Law is a contemporary British artist known for her innovative use of natural materials, particularly flowers, in large-scale installations. Her work often explores the relationship between humanity and nature, creating immersive experiences that highlight the beauty and ephemerality of the natural world.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, densely detailed interior scenes transformed by abundant suspended flowers and floral carpets. Vivid blossoms, sunlit windows, and delicate vertical stems create a dreamy, immersive atmosphere with a lightly fantastical sense of excess."},{"id":"lyubov-popova","name":"Lyubov Popova","cat":"painters","en":"Lyubov Popova","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lyubov-popova.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lyubov-popova","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","bone-white","orange","grey"],"intro":"Lyubov Popova was a prominent Russian avant-garde artist and designer, known for her contributions to the Constructivist and Cubist movements in the early 20th century. Her work often explored geometric abstraction and dynamic compositions, reflecting the revolutionary spirit of her time. Popova's art was influential in shaping modernist aesthetics, and she played a significant role in the development of Russian avant-garde art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds abstract compositions from interlocking angular planes, sharp diagonals, and occasional curved forms. Saturated red, black, white, blue, and beige create strong contrast, while visible broad paint marks and a rough, tactile surface keep the geometric structure painterly rather than mechanically flat."},{"id":"dennis-stock","name":"Dennis Stock","cat":"photographers","en":"Dennis Stock","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dennis-stock.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dennis-stock","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Dennis Stock is a renowned American photographer best known for his iconic images of James Dean and his work capturing the essence of American culture in the mid-20th century. His photography often explores themes of identity, celebrity, and the everyday lives of people, contributing significantly to the field of photojournalism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses high-contrast black-and-white photography with grain, selective focus, and strongly cinematic framing. It depicts crowded urban interiors through candid portraits and incidental social moments, combining sharply observed faces with blurred figures and layered foregrounds."},{"id":"rene-burri","name":"Rene Burri","cat":"photographers","en":"Rene Burri","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rene-burri.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rene-burri","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","urban","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","black","silver","grey"],"intro":"Rene Burri is a renowned Swiss photographer known for his work with Magnum Photos. His career spanned several decades, during which he captured iconic images of political and cultural figures, as well as scenes of everyday life around the world. Burri's work is characterized by its strong composition, attention to detail, and ability to convey powerful narratives through imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark monochrome treatment and severe light divide the scene into bright planes and deep black shadows. Monumental, geometric buildings dominate the compositions, while isolated human figures provide scale and create a quiet, cinematic sense of unease."},{"id":"billy-wilder","name":"Billy Wilder","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Billy Wilder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/billy-wilder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/billy-wilder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Billy Wilder was a renowned filmmaker known for his sharp wit and mastery of various genres, including film noir and comedy. Born in Austria, he became one of Hollywood's most celebrated directors, creating classics such as \"Some Like It Hot\" and \" Sunset Boulevard.\" His films often explore themes of identity, deception, and the human condition, marked by a distinctive blend of humor and darkness.","observation":"The style is monochrome, realistic photography with strong tonal contrast, visible grain, and selective focus. Candid social scenes are densely layered with overlapping figures, expressive faces, cigarette smoke, and dramatic interior lighting, giving the images a tense, filmic atmosphere."},{"id":"david-spriggs","name":"David Spriggs","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"David Spriggs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-spriggs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-spriggs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","glow","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","surreal"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","muted-orange","silver"],"intro":"David Spriggs is a contemporary artist known for his innovative use of layered transparent materials to create three-dimensional installations. His work often explores themes of perception, movement, and the interplay of light and shadow, creating immersive experiences that challenge the viewer's understanding of space and form.","observation":"Across all four renders, luminous filament-like forms burst outward around sparse human figures or empty gallery space, creating a dynamic long-exposure effect. The realistic exhibition interiors are dark and atmospheric, with strong warm and cool light sources, reflective floors, and intense radial motion that gives the scenes a surreal sci-fi character."},{"id":"terence-cuneo","name":"Terence Cuneo","cat":"painters","en":"Terence Cuneo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/terence-cuneo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/terence-cuneo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","light-orange","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Terence Cuneo was a British painter renowned for his detailed and dynamic depictions of railways, military scenes, and industrial subjects. His works are celebrated for their technical precision and ability to capture the energy and movement of machinery, often featuring steam locomotives and bustling railway stations.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vigorous visible brushwork, layered paint, and energetic directional strokes to depict dramatic steam-train disasters. Subdued blue-green and rust tones are punctuated by red machinery and bright fire, with strong contrast, low-angle framing, smoke, debris, and kinetic action creating a cinematic sense of catastrophe."},{"id":"jaime-hayon","name":"Jaime Hayon","cat":"designers","en":"Jaime Hayon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jaime-hayon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jaime-hayon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","fashion","patterns","still-life","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["beige","silver","ochre","charcoal","deep-rust"],"intro":"Jaime Hayon is a Spanish designer known for his innovative and playful approach to design, blending art and functionality. His work often features whimsical forms and vibrant colors, making him a prominent figure in contemporary design.","observation":"The style presents highly saturated, playful interiors filled with rounded sculptural furniture, vessels, figures, and oversized decorative objects. Strong geometric silhouettes, graphic surface patterns, clean illustrative color blocking, and surreal facial motifs unify the scenes, while the polished showroom lighting emphasizes their dimensionality."},{"id":"charlotte-perriand","name":"Charlotte Perriand","cat":"designers","en":"Charlotte Perriand","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charlotte-perriand.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charlotte-perriand","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","white","beige","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Charlotte Perriand was a pioneering French designer known for her innovative contributions to modern furniture and interior design. Born in 1903, she worked alongside notable figures like Le Corbusier and Jean Prouvé, and was instrumental in shaping the modernist movement in the 20th century. Her work is characterized by a focus on functionality, simplicity, and the use of natural materials, reflecting a deep appreciation for both form and function.","observation":"The style presents furniture as highly realistic, carefully staged product imagery, with strong geometric silhouettes and substantial sculptural forms. Restrained earth tones, hard directional sunlight, deep cast shadows, and generous neutral space give the scenes a calm, architectural character."},{"id":"wadim-kashin","name":"Wadim Kashin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Wadim Kashin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wadim-kashin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wadim-kashin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","dark-brown","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Wadim Kashin is a contemporary artist known for his expressive and surreal portraiture, blending traditional and digital techniques to create vivid and introspective works. His style often explores the emotional and psychological depths of his subjects, utilizing rich color palettes and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily textured, visible broad strokes and scraped painterly surfaces to build dense urban and mountainous environments. Muted blue-grey, black, white, and rust-red colors are driven by strong light-dark contrasts, with small figures and architectural details creating expressive, dramatic scenes."},{"id":"bob-pepper","name":"Bob Pepper","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bob Pepper","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-pepper.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-pepper","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","orange","grey","red"],"intro":"Bob Pepper is an American illustrator known for his distinctive and imaginative artwork, often associated with fantasy and psychedelic themes. His work gained prominence in the 1960s and 1970s, particularly through album covers, book illustrations, and posters. Pepper's style is characterized by intricate details, vibrant colors, and surreal compositions that evoke a sense of wonder and otherworldliness.","observation":"The style combines visible, finely worked paint texture with intricate linework, dense natural details, and strongly modeled figures. Saturated reds, oranges, and blues stand against deep blacks and shadowed grounds, producing expressive, fantastical scenes that mix human, skeletal, vegetal, and cavernous imagery."},{"id":"joep-van-lieshout","name":"Joep van Lieshout","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Joep van Lieshout","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joep-van-lieshout.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joep-van-lieshout","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","characters","urban","flat-color","surreal","epic","geometric"],"colours":["beige","silver","charcoal","deep-red","light-blue","dark-olive"],"intro":"Joep van Lieshout is a contemporary Dutch artist known for his innovative and often provocative sculptures and installations. His work frequently explores themes of utopia, dystopia, and the intersection of art and architecture, often using industrial materials and large-scale constructions.","observation":"The style presents monumental figurative sculptures with exaggerated, blocklike anatomy and strongly geometric construction. Surfaces range from rough concrete and corrugated metal to painted relief-like assemblages, while heavy outlines, simplified planes, and assertive color give the imagery a graphic, expressive character."},{"id":"david-brown-milne","name":"David Brown Milne","cat":"painters","en":"David Brown Milne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-brown-milne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-brown-milne","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["pale-orange","charcoal","muted-ochre","grey","orange","red"],"intro":"David Brown Milne is a Canadian painter known for his unique approach to modernist landscapes and still lifes. Born in 1882, Milne developed a distinctive style that combined elements of post-impressionism and expressionism, often focusing on the interplay of color and form. His work is characterized by a deep engagement with the natural world, capturing the essence of the Canadian landscape through a vibrant and expressive palette.","observation":"Across all four views, the landscapes are built from vigorous, visible paint strokes with broad color patches, scratchy marks, and heavy dark linear accents. Saturated blues, yellows, greens, pinks, and reds create expressive high-contrast scenes filled with trees, paths, water, hills, and flowering vegetation."},{"id":"william-russell-flint","name":"William Russell Flint","cat":"painters","en":"William Russell Flint","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-russell-flint.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-russell-flint","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","beige","charcoal","red"],"intro":"William Russell Flint was a renowned Scottish artist known for his exquisite watercolor paintings, particularly of women. Born in 1880, Flint's work is celebrated for its technical mastery and delicate portrayal of feminine beauty, often set against classical and romantic backdrops. His contributions to art were recognized with numerous accolades, and his influence remains significant in the world of watercolor painting.","observation":"Across the sheet, figures and architectural settings are rendered with visible, layered brushwork, softened edges, and finely observed fabric, skin, and stone textures. The restrained earth-and-blue palette is punctuated by vivid reds and whites, while strong sunlight and deep architectural shadows create expressive, high-contrast scenes with a classical illustrative character."},{"id":"frantisek-kupka","name":"Frantisek Kupka","cat":"painters","en":"Frantisek Kupka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frantisek-kupka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frantisek-kupka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","grey","vivid-red","red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Frantisek Kupka is a Czech painter known for his pioneering work in abstract art and Orphism. Born in 1871, Kupka's early career was influenced by Symbolism and the spiritual exploration of color and form. He was a significant figure in the development of modern art, contributing to the evolution of non-representational painting.","observation":"The style combines visibly textured, broad painted strokes with densely layered figurative and geometric forms. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and creams create an energetic, swirling surface in which stylized figures, wings, faces, and concentric patterns overlap and seem to move."},{"id":"eric-standley","name":"Eric Standley","cat":"various-artists","en":"Eric Standley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-standley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-standley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","sculptural","patterns","fine-lines","metallic","vivid-colors","classical","religious","symmetry"],"colours":["muted-brown","ochre","bone-white","dark-blue","brown","deep-rust"],"intro":"Eric Standley is an artist known for his intricate laser-cut paper sculptures that explore themes of geometry and complexity. His work often draws inspiration from Gothic and Islamic architectural elements, creating mesmerizing and detailed pieces that challenge the boundaries of traditional paper art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is densely ornamental and strongly radial, with mirrored scrollwork, repeated rosettes, intricate borders, and central jewel-like emblems. Metallic gold, ivory, deep blue, and crimson surfaces are rendered as richly modelled relief with fine decorative lines and a polished, illustrative clarity."},{"id":"sophie-gengembre-anderson","name":"Sophie Gengembre Anderson","cat":"painters","en":"Sophie Gengembre Anderson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sophie-gengembre-anderson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sophie-gengembre-anderson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","floral","scenes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","ochre","black","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-rust"],"intro":"Sophie Gengembre Anderson was a French-born British artist known for her detailed and romantic paintings, often depicting children and women in idyllic settings. Her work is characterized by a strong emphasis on beauty and innocence, with a focus on nature and floral elements. Anderson's paintings are celebrated for their fine brushwork and attention to detail, capturing the delicate features and expressions of her subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly worked paint to depict realistic young figures in densely filled garden scenes. Subdued natural colors, intricate floral and costume detail, soft modeling, and carefully arranged gestures create an ornate, classical storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"carl-gustav-carus","name":"Carl Gustav Carus","cat":"painters","en":"Carl Gustav Carus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-gustav-carus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-gustav-carus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","beige","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Carl Gustav Carus was a German painter, physician, and naturalist known for his contributions to the Romantic movement in art. He was a contemporary of Caspar David Friedrich and shared a similar interest in landscapes and the sublime aspects of nature. Carus's work often explored themes of solitude and the mystical qualities of the natural world, reflecting the Romantic era's fascination with emotion and the sublime.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents richly detailed, dark woodland landscapes with monumental trees, rocky terrain, distant water or architecture, and atmospheric depth. Muted green, brown, charcoal, and dusk-orange hues combine with strong light-dark contrasts, glowing moons or windows, mist, and a brooding fantasy mood."},{"id":"jeppe-hein","name":"Jeppe Hein","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jeppe Hein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeppe-hein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeppe-hein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","metallic","subdued-colors","sci-fi","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","brown","white","beige"],"intro":"Jeppe Hein is a Danish artist known for his interactive and often humorous approach to sculpture and installation art. His works frequently explore the relationship between viewer and artwork, encouraging participation and engagement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly realistic architectural scenes with large geometric mirrored or metallic installations in sparse white industrial spaces. Subdued neutral colors, reflective surfaces, repeated vertical and oval forms, and carefully controlled daylight create a detailed, sculptural, subtly futuristic atmosphere."},{"id":"alphonse-bertillon","name":"Alphonse Bertillon","cat":"photographers","en":"Alphonse Bertillon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alphonse-bertillon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alphonse-bertillon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","glow","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Alphonse Bertillon was a French police officer and biometrics researcher who developed anthropometry, a systematic method for identifying individuals based on physical measurements. His work laid the foundation for modern forensic science and criminal identification techniques.","observation":"The style uses dark, atmospheric cinematic imagery with a sepia-leaning monochrome palette, heavy grain, soft focus, and pronounced light-versus-shadow contrast. Portraits and woodland vignettes merge through ghostly double exposures, haze, backlighting, and luminous supernatural-looking overlays, creating a bleak surreal mood."},{"id":"philip-jackson","name":"Philip Jackson","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Philip Jackson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philip-jackson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philip-jackson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","dark-olive","beige","silver","olive"],"intro":"Philip Jackson is a renowned British sculptor known for his striking and emotive bronze figures. His works often explore themes of mystery, elegance, and the human condition, characterized by their elongated forms and flowing drapery. Jackson's sculptures are celebrated for their ability to convey deep emotion and narrative through minimalist yet powerful design.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, detailed photographs of monumental draped figures in landscaped gardens, with sculptural folds and umbrella-like canopies rendered in dark textured material. Subdued, moody colors, overcast illumination, and recurring misty woodland backgrounds create a sombre, atmospheric garden setting across the renders."},{"id":"vik-muniz","name":"Vik Muniz","cat":"photographers","en":"Vik Muniz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vik-muniz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vik-muniz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","brown","ochre","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Vik Muniz is a Brazilian artist known for his innovative use of unconventional materials to create intricate and thought-provoking artworks. He often employs materials like chocolate syrup, garbage, and thread to recreate famous images and portraits, challenging perceptions of art and reality. Muniz's work is characterized by its playful yet profound exploration of visual culture and its ability to transform everyday objects into art.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable people, architecture, landscapes, and objects are built from dense, directional paint marks and thick, broken impasto, giving every surface a tactile, sculptural presence. The style combines vivid blue, red, and ochre color with strong tonal separation, expressive gestures, and highly crowded compositions filled with small visual details."},{"id":"guido-borelli-da-caluso","name":"Guido Borelli da Caluso","cat":"painters","en":"Guido Borelli da Caluso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guido-borelli-da-caluso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guido-borelli-da-caluso","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","bone-white","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Guido Borelli da Caluso is an Italian painter known for his romantic and idyllic depictions of the Italian countryside. His works often feature serene landscapes, rustic architecture, and vibrant natural settings, capturing the essence of Mediterranean life with a touch of fantasy and nostalgia.","observation":"These richly rendered waterside village scenes combine visible painterly texture and fine, illustrative detailing with vivid flowers, warm masonry, and reflective water. Dense botanical growth, aged architecture, shutters, lanterns, and stone paths create an ornate, highly composed atmosphere across the variations."},{"id":"pete-souza","name":"Pete Souza","cat":"photographers","en":"Pete Souza","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pete-souza.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pete-souza","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","ochre","silver"],"intro":"Pete Souza is a renowned American photojournalist best known for his work as the Chief Official White House Photographer for U.S. Presidents Ronald Reagan and Barack Obama. His photography captures significant political and historical moments with a focus on candid and intimate portrayals of his subjects, offering a unique perspective on American political life.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, using carefully composed interior scenes, subdued warm colors, and strong pools of practical light against deep shadows. Rich furnishings, dense room detail, and restrained character gestures create an intimate, dramatic atmosphere with a polished photographic finish."},{"id":"paul-cadmus","name":"Paul Cadmus","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Cadmus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-cadmus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-cadmus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-orange","muted-ochre","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Paul Cadmus was an American artist known for his finely detailed and often provocative paintings that explored themes of social dynamics and human interaction. Born in 1904, Cadmus gained recognition for his works that combined elements of realism with a satirical edge, often depicting urban life and societal issues. His art is characterized by meticulous draftsmanship and a keen eye for detail, making him a prominent figure in 20th-century American art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly worked oil-paint surfaces with visible fine strokes, rich modeling, and densely observed faces, clothing, props, and interiors. Dark, earthy surroundings and strong directional illumination heighten the expressive poses and theatrical character studies, while saturated red and blue accents punctuate the otherwise restrained palette."},{"id":"james-balog","name":"James Balog","cat":"photographers","en":"James Balog","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-balog.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-balog","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["blue","dark-cyan","dark-blue","light-blue"],"intro":"James Balog is a renowned American photographer known for his work documenting the relationship between humans and nature, particularly focusing on climate change and environmental issues. His groundbreaking project, the Extreme Ice Survey, has brought attention to the dramatic changes in the world's glaciers due to global warming.","observation":"The style presents vast polar landscapes with highly realistic, finely resolved ice textures and monumental, sculptural formations. Cool blue tones, deep shadowed water, dramatic skies, and occasional mist create a cinematic, moody sense of scale across all four views."},{"id":"damien-hirst","name":"Damien Hirst","cat":"various-artists","en":"Damien Hirst","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/damien-hirst.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/damien-hirst","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["white","dark-teal","muted-cyan","dark-red","red","dark-blue","green","light-yellow"],"intro":"Damien Hirst is a prominent British artist known for his role in the Young British Artists movement in the late 20th century. His work often explores themes of life and death, using a variety of mediums including sculpture, installation, and painting. Hirst is renowned for his controversial and thought-provoking pieces, such as his series of preserved animals and his iconic spot paintings.","observation":"The style combines vivid, high-saturation color with graphic geometric organization, ranging from evenly spaced circles and radial designs to intricate decorative patterning. It mixes clean illustrative forms and flat-color arrangements with tactile, expressive painted surfaces and sculptural presentation, producing bold contemporary gallery-like compositions."},{"id":"ildiko-neer","name":"Ildiko Neer","cat":"photographers","en":"Ildiko Neer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ildiko-neer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ildiko-neer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["dark-red","black","brown","red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Ildiko Neer is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and surreal landscape photography. Her work often explores themes of fantasy and mystery, capturing the beauty and intrigue of natural settings with a unique artistic vision.","observation":"The style presents richly detailed, realistic woodland landscapes with intensely red foliage, near-black trunks, and contrasting blue atmospheric distance. Strong shafts of warm or cool light, visible mist, and deep shadows create a cinematic, slightly fantastical mood across the forest paths and dense canopies."},{"id":"douglas-smith","name":"Douglas Smith","cat":"illustrators","en":"Douglas Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/douglas-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/douglas-smith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","dark-ochre","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Douglas Smith is a contemporary illustrator known for his detailed and imaginative works that often explore themes of fantasy and surrealism. His illustrations frequently feature intricate linework and a distinctive narrative style, drawing inspiration from folklore and mythological elements.","observation":"Across the four renders, the style combines highly detailed, expressive illustration with visible fine linework, crosshatching, and painterly texture. It shifts between muted color scenes and stark monochrome imagery, using dramatic weather, dense environments, and strongly composed figures to create a literary, atmospheric sense of narrative."},{"id":"jean-antoine-watteau","name":"Jean-Antoine Watteau","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Antoine Watteau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-antoine-watteau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-antoine-watteau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-brown","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Jean-Antoine Watteau was a French painter known for his pioneering contributions to the Rococo style in the early 18th century. His works often depicted scenes of aristocratic leisure and were characterized by their lightness, elegance, and use of color. Watteau's style is noted for its delicate brushwork and the depiction of idyllic, pastoral settings, often featuring elegantly dressed figures engaged in leisurely activities.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured oil-paint handling, visible directional brushwork, soft transitions, and layered tonal depth. It consistently combines muted earthy colors with darker atmospheric passages, carefully rendered period figures, ornate surroundings, and theatrical garden or woodland settings."},{"id":"rita-angus","name":"Rita Angus","cat":"painters","en":"Rita Angus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rita-angus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rita-angus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-blue","muted-ochre","black","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Rita Angus is a renowned New Zealand painter known for her distinctive modernist style, which often features landscapes and portraits. Her work is celebrated for its clarity, bold use of color, and incorporation of New Zealand's cultural and natural elements.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with clean, graphic shapes, strong contouring, and selectively flat areas of saturated color. It repeatedly frames domestic interiors, people, flowers, and tea settings against expansive snow-capped mountain landscapes, using bold architectural divisions, crisp sunlight, and dense descriptive detail."},{"id":"marilyn-minter","name":"Marilyn Minter","cat":"photographers","en":"Marilyn Minter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marilyn-minter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marilyn-minter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","portraits","glow","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["muted-red","bone-white","dark-brown","charcoal","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Marilyn Minter is an American artist known for her provocative and sensual works that often explore themes of beauty, glamour, and the body. Her art is characterized by a high level of detail and a focus on the textures and imperfections of the human form, often presented in a hyper-realistic style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses extreme macro portrait framing, vivid color, sharp facial detail, and dramatic contrast. Wet skin, glittering particles, reflective fragments, and lens-like blur create a surreal, jewel-toned atmosphere with luminous highlights and selective focus."},{"id":"honore-daumier","name":"Honore Daumier","cat":"painters","en":"Honore Daumier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/honore-daumier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/honore-daumier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","beige","muted-yellow","rust"],"intro":"Honore Daumier was a French painter, caricaturist, and sculptor known for his social and political commentary through art. Born in 1808, Daumier's work often depicted the struggles and absurdities of 19th-century French society, using a blend of realism and caricature to convey his messages.","observation":"The style uses visibly broad, textured brushwork to build densely populated scenes of expressive figures, with rough facial modelling and emphatic gestures. A subdued, dark palette of blacks, browns, ochres, and occasional reds is organized through strong light-dark contrasts and a theatrical, crowded composition."},{"id":"maurice-de-vlaminck","name":"Maurice de Vlaminck","cat":"painters","en":"Maurice de Vlaminck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maurice-de-vlaminck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maurice-de-vlaminck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","grey","dark-brown","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Maurice de Vlaminck was a French painter and a prominent figure in the Fauvist movement, known for his bold use of color and expressive landscapes. Born in 1876, Vlaminck's work is characterized by vibrant hues and dynamic compositions, often depicting rural scenes and nature with a sense of intensity and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses thick, highly visible brushwork and strongly directional strokes to build expressive landscapes, village streets, and coastal scenes. Saturated reds and oranges push against deep blues and dark outlines, while simplified architecture and swirling skies retain a vivid, energetic sense of place."},{"id":"lee-broom","name":"Lee Broom","cat":"designers","en":"Lee Broom","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-broom.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-broom","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","urban","glow","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","muted-ochre","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"Lee Broom is a renowned British designer known for his innovative and stylish approach to furniture and lighting design. He has gained international acclaim for his unique blend of classical and contemporary aesthetics, creating pieces that are both functional and visually striking. Broom's work often features luxurious materials and meticulous craftsmanship, making him a prominent figure in the world of high-end interior design.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly detailed, realistic interior spaces dominated by sculptural lighting, reflective surfaces, geometric patterns, and carefully arranged furnishings. Warm, low-key illumination creates glowing lamps and strong contrast against dark architectural settings, while the repeated stripes, circles, fluting, and checkerboard motifs give the rooms a cohesive decorative identity."},{"id":"hendrick-avercamp","name":"Hendrick Avercamp","cat":"painters","en":"Hendrick Avercamp","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hendrick-avercamp.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hendrick-avercamp","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["bone-white","silver","grey","beige","dark-brown","brown","red"],"intro":"Hendrick Avercamp was a Dutch painter known for his depictions of winter scenes and landscapes during the Dutch Golden Age. Born in 1585, Avercamp was renowned for his detailed and lively portrayals of ice skating and festive gatherings on frozen canals and rivers. His work is characterized by a keen observation of daily life and a masterful use of color and composition.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses finely observed, densely populated winter landscapes with delicate linear detail and visible painted texture. Muted blue-gray, ochre, red, and white tones, atmospheric skies, snow-covered architecture, and many small human activities create a calm, expansive historical tableau."},{"id":"andreas-feininger","name":"Andreas Feininger","cat":"photographers","en":"Andreas Feininger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andreas-feininger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andreas-feininger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","backlighting","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white"],"intro":"Andreas Feininger was a renowned American photographer known for his striking black and white images of urban landscapes, particularly New York City. Born in 1906, Feininger was celebrated for his ability to capture the architectural beauty and dynamic energy of city life. His work is characterized by a strong sense of composition, often employing high contrast and dramatic lighting to emphasize the geometric forms of skyscrapers and the bustling activity of urban environments.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, bright backlight, visible grain, and strong architectural geometry. Urban scenes are framed from dramatic low or receding viewpoints, with silhouetted figures and buildings creating a dark, cinematic documentary mood."},{"id":"brad-kunkle","name":"Brad Kunkle","cat":"painters","en":"Brad Kunkle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brad-kunkle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brad-kunkle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","ochre","brown","orange","dark-brown","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Brad Kunkle is an American contemporary artist known for his ethereal paintings that often incorporate gold and silver leaf. His work is characterized by a blend of realism and fantasy, creating dreamlike scenes that explore themes of nature and transcendence.","observation":"Across all four renders, expressive female figures emerge from near-black grounds in richly textured, visibly painted surfaces. Restrained ochre, cream, brown, and gold tones create a moody high-contrast atmosphere, while leaves, birds, windswept hair, and cascading fabric produce a surreal sense of motion and theatrical drama."},{"id":"christo","name":"Christo","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Christo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","muted-blue","silver","dark-ochre","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Christo is a renowned artist known for his large-scale environmental installations, often created in collaboration with his wife, Jeanne-Claude. His work involves wrapping and transforming public spaces and natural landscapes, challenging perceptions of art and environment.","observation":"The style presents monumental geometric forms wrapped in richly textured fabric, rendered with convincing volume, folds, reflections, and natural outdoor light. It combines realistic cinematic environments with surreal scale and carefully balanced architectural compositions, often using vivid orange and white against blue skies, water, or grass."},{"id":"brian-jungen","name":"Brian Jungen","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Brian Jungen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-jungen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-jungen","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","brown","beige","black","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Brian Jungen is a contemporary Canadian artist known for his innovative sculptures that often incorporate elements of indigenous culture and modern consumerism. He is celebrated for transforming everyday objects into thought-provoking art pieces, exploring themes of identity, culture, and globalization.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, sculptural sneaker-and-headdress figures as elaborate wearable assemblages, with hard-edged geometric construction, layered materials, feathers, straps, and dangling elements. Restrained white, black, and red palettes, controlled studio lighting, and gallery-like spacing give the surreal objects a polished fashion-installation appearance."},{"id":"teun-hocks","name":"Teun Hocks","cat":"painters","en":"Teun Hocks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/teun-hocks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/teun-hocks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","painterly","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","muted-cyan","muted-orange","grey","brown"],"intro":"Teun Hocks is a Dutch artist known for his unique blend of painting and photography, creating surreal and often humorous self-portraits that explore the human condition. His work typically features himself in staged, dreamlike scenarios that combine elements of reality and fantasy, often with a touch of irony.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible painterly texture with carefully rendered figures, clouds, and expansive environments. Restrained blue, cream, and brown tones, wide cinematic framing, and recurring solitary characters create a quiet, dreamy sense of scale and contemplation."},{"id":"johannes-cornelisz-verspronck","name":"Johannes Cornelisz Verspronck","cat":"painters","en":"Johannes Cornelisz Verspronck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johannes-cornelisz-verspronck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johannes-cornelisz-verspronck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white","dark-rust"],"intro":"Johannes Cornelisz Verspronck was a Dutch painter known for his portraiture and genre scenes during the Dutch Golden Age. He was an influential figure in the 17th century, contributing to the rich tapestry of Dutch art with his detailed and realistic depictions. Verspronck's works are celebrated for their fine brushwork and the serene, contemplative atmosphere they evoke.","observation":"Across the sheet, richly modeled figures and objects emerge from dark interiors through visible brushwork, warm subdued color, and dramatic light-dark contrast. Elaborate clothing, lace, flowers, instruments, books, and birds create densely layered tableaux with a formal historical atmosphere."},{"id":"victor-vasarely","name":"Victor Vasarely","cat":"painters","en":"Victor Vasarely","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/victor-vasarely.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/victor-vasarely","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","illustrative","sculptural","patterns","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-blue","deep-red","blue","silver"],"intro":"Victor Vasarely is a renowned Hungarian-French artist, often hailed as the father of Op Art. His work is characterized by geometric forms and optical illusions, creating dynamic visual experiences that challenge perception. Vasarely's innovative approach to art has left a lasting impact on both the Op Art movement and the broader field of visual arts.","observation":"The style combines vivid orange, blue, black, and pale cyan with stark contrast and clean, flat-edged geometric shapes. Repeated grids, squares, and circular motifs warp around large spherical forms, creating a highly structured yet surreal optical effect with strong symmetry and dimensional depth."},{"id":"jean-joseph-benjamin-constant","name":"Jean-Joseph Benjamin-Constant","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Joseph Benjamin-Constant","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-joseph-benjamin-constant.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-joseph-benjamin-constant","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-ochre","light-yellow","red","deep-red"],"intro":"Jean-Joseph Benjamin-Constant was a French painter known for his orientalist and romantic works during the 19th century. He was celebrated for his detailed and richly colored depictions of exotic and historical scenes, often drawing inspiration from Eastern cultures and aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from richly visible paint strokes, dense ornamental costume, jewelry, and layered fabrics. Dark brown interiors, deep shadows, selective highlights, and saturated red accents create a solemn, theatrical portrait mood, while the tightly framed figures and elaborate headdresses make the compositions feel ceremonial and ornate."},{"id":"louis-faurer","name":"Louis Faurer","cat":"photographers","en":"Louis Faurer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-faurer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-faurer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","urban","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Louis Faurer was an American photographer known for his candid and expressive street photography, capturing the essence of urban life in mid-20th century America. His work often focused on the streets of New York City, portraying the everyday lives of its inhabitants with a unique blend of realism and artistic expression.","observation":"The style uses grainy black-and-white photography with stark tonal separation, luminous urban night lights, and selective focus. Candid close portraits overlap with reflections, blurred passersby, and motion-softened backgrounds to create a moody, filmic street atmosphere."},{"id":"yigal-ozeri","name":"Yigal Ozeri","cat":"painters","en":"Yigal Ozeri","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yigal-ozeri.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yigal-ozeri","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","dark-olive","light-yellow"],"intro":"Yigal Ozeri is an Israeli artist known for his large-scale cinematic portraits of young women in lush landscapes. His work is characterized by a photorealistic style that captures the subtle play of light and shadow, often evoking a sense of tranquility and introspection. Ozeri's paintings are celebrated for their intricate detail and the ethereal quality they bring to the depiction of feminine beauty.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and finely detailed, with intimate close-up portraits set among dense woodland foliage and rough tree trunks. Subdued earthy colors, dappled natural light, tousled hair, and selective background softness create an expressive, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"stuart-haygarth","name":"Stuart Haygarth","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Stuart Haygarth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stuart-haygarth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stuart-haygarth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","glow","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","orange","dark-brown","red","dark-olive"],"intro":"Stuart Haygarth is a British artist known for his innovative use of found objects and recycled materials to create intricate and thought-provoking sculptures. His work often explores themes of consumer culture and environmental awareness, transforming everyday items into complex and visually striking pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds dense, highly detailed assemblages from colorful translucent objects, arranged as sculptural installations with strong decorative excess. Bright saturated reds, oranges, pinks, blues, and greens, reflective surfaces, visible grid-like construction, and glowing gallery light unify the images, while spacious neutral backgrounds isolate the clustered forms."},{"id":"jan-van-kessel-the-elder","name":"Jan van Kessel the Elder","cat":"painters","en":"Jan van Kessel the Elder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-van-kessel-the-elder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-van-kessel-the-elder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["dark-ochre","black","ochre","beige","rust"],"intro":"Jan van Kessel the Elder is a renowned 17th-century Flemish painter known for his detailed still lifes and landscapes. He was part of the Dutch Golden Age of painting, celebrated for his intricate depictions of flora and fauna. Van Kessel's works often feature a meticulous attention to detail, capturing the beauty and complexity of the natural world.","observation":"These richly layered paintings combine realistic birds, insects, flowers, fruit, and foliage into densely populated natural-history tableaux. Visible brushwork, finely rendered textures, dark grounds, and restrained earthy colors create an ornate, moody, museum-like atmosphere."},{"id":"jacob-van-ruisdael","name":"Jacob van Ruisdael","cat":"painters","en":"Jacob van Ruisdael","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacob-van-ruisdael.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacob-van-ruisdael","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","muted-blue","silver","grey","orange"],"intro":"Jacob van Ruisdael is a renowned Dutch painter from the 17th century, celebrated for his masterful landscape paintings. His works are characterized by their dramatic skies, intricate details, and the ability to capture the essence of nature with a sense of grandeur and depth. Van Ruisdael's paintings often depict serene rural scenes, featuring forests, rivers, and expansive skies, and are considered masterpieces of the Dutch Golden Age.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible fine strokes shaping trees, water, and especially monumental cloud formations. Broad rural landscapes are composed as detailed atmospheric scenes, using subdued natural colors with occasional warm illumination and strongly expressive skies."},{"id":"kay-sage","name":"Kay Sage","cat":"painters","en":"Kay Sage","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kay-sage.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kay-sage","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","landscapes","urban","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","beige","grey","dark-red","rust"],"intro":"Kay Sage was an American surrealist painter and poet, known for her enigmatic and architectural style. Born in 1898, she became a prominent figure in the surrealist movement, often exploring themes of isolation and the subconscious through her art. Her work is characterized by its dreamlike quality and meticulous attention to detail, creating a unique blend of realism and abstraction.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental geometric architecture dominates expansive, sparsely populated settings, with arches, columns, stairways, and severe vertical structures arranged against sky, water, desert, or distant city forms. The images combine subdued earth-and-sky colors with strong light-dark contrasts, painterly surface texture, and dreamlike impossible scale and spatial relationships."},{"id":"martin-johnson-heade","name":"Martin Johnson Heade","cat":"painters","en":"Martin Johnson Heade","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-johnson-heade.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-johnson-heade","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","bone-white","red","ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"Martin Johnson Heade was an American painter known for his landscapes, seascapes, and depictions of tropical birds and flowers. Active in the 19th century, Heade was associated with the Hudson River School and is celebrated for his detailed and atmospheric works that often blend realism with romanticism.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly layered flowers and wetland vegetation are integrated with expansive, cloud-heavy landscapes in a romantic, dreamlike composition. Visible brush texture, softly blended atmospheric distance, deep greens, dusky skies, and luminous pink and white blossoms create a painterly yet highly detailed look."},{"id":"rufino-tamayo","name":"Rufino Tamayo","cat":"painters","en":"Rufino Tamayo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rufino-tamayo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rufino-tamayo","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","patterns","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","deep-red","dark-red","dark-blue","beige"],"intro":"Rufino Tamayo was a renowned Mexican painter and printmaker known for his vivid use of color and exploration of Mexican identity. Born in 1899, Tamayo's work often incorporated elements of Mexican culture and pre-Columbian motifs, blending them with modernist styles. He was a significant figure in the Mexican art scene, contributing to the development of modern art in Mexico.","observation":"The style combines vivid red, black, and blue with stark geometric shapes, simplified mask-like figures, and heavy graphic contours. Roughly brushed, distressed surfaces and visible ink-like marks keep the flat, high-contrast compositions tactile and expressive, while recurring eyes, arches, and abstract faces create a surreal symbolic vocabulary."},{"id":"beth-cavener","name":"Beth Cavener","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Beth Cavener","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/beth-cavener.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/beth-cavener","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","animals","characters","fine-brushstrokes","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","beige","bone-white","muted-ochre","silver"],"intro":"Beth Cavener is a contemporary American sculptor known for her expressive and detailed animal sculptures that explore human emotions and psychological themes. Her work often features animals in dynamic poses, capturing a sense of movement and emotion that resonates with viewers.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, three-dimensional fantasy creatures as pale clay or plaster sculptures, with expressive poses and richly modelled anatomy. Flowing manes, wings, horns, fur, and drapery-like surfaces create a tactile, hand-worked appearance, photographed against restrained museum-like surroundings."},{"id":"patricia-piccinini","name":"Patricia Piccinini","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Patricia Piccinini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patricia-piccinini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patricia-piccinini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-brown","beige","orange","bone-white","silver","black"],"intro":"Patricia Piccinini is an Australian contemporary artist known for her hyperrealistic sculptures that explore themes of biotechnology and the relationship between humans and nature. Her work often features fantastical creatures that blur the lines between species, prompting viewers to question the ethical implications of genetic engineering and biotechnology.","observation":"The style presents surreal, oversized animal forms with highly realistic fur, skin, eyes, and bodily volume, staged as tactile sculptural encounters in a contemporary gallery. Soft peach, cream, and pink tones, close cinematic framing, and interactions between people and animals create an uncanny yet tender atmosphere."},{"id":"john-atkinson-grimshaw","name":"John Atkinson Grimshaw","cat":"painters","en":"John Atkinson Grimshaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-atkinson-grimshaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-atkinson-grimshaw","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","backlighting","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-olive","muted-olive","dark-brown"],"intro":"John Atkinson Grimshaw was a renowned English painter known for his evocative and atmospheric depictions of urban landscapes, particularly during the Victorian era. His work is celebrated for its meticulous attention to detail and masterful use of light and shadow, often capturing the ethereal beauty of moonlit nights and misty streets.","observation":"The style presents atmospheric urban landscapes with dense, sharply readable branches, stonework, architecture, and reflective wet surfaces. Subdued green-grey darkness is punctuated by warm lamp and window light, while mist, backlighting, and deep shadows create a cinematic, eerie nocturnal mood."},{"id":"emanuel-ungaro","name":"Emanuel Ungaro","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Emanuel Ungaro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emanuel-ungaro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emanuel-ungaro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","cream","dark-blue","beige","red","dark-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Emanuel Ungaro is a renowned French fashion designer known for his bold and colorful designs. He established his fashion house in the 1960s and became famous for his innovative use of patterns and textures, blending traditional couture techniques with modern aesthetics. Ungaro's work is characterized by its vibrant color palettes, intricate detailing, and a flair for the dramatic, making him a significant figure in the world of haute couture.","observation":"The style combines fashion illustration with runway-editorial imagery, presenting elongated models and strongly designed garments in confident, posed compositions. Clean fine contours and graphic silhouettes coexist with visibly brushed, painterly textile patterns, using saturated orange, teal, pink, red, black, and blue against relatively simple backgrounds."},{"id":"brian-duffy","name":"Brian Duffy","cat":"photographers","en":"Brian Duffy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brian-duffy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brian-duffy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","white","black","rust"],"intro":"Brian Duffy is a renowned British photographer, known for his influential work in fashion photography during the 1960s and 1970s. He was part of the 'Black Trinity' of photographers, alongside David Bailey and Terence Donovan , who revolutionized the fashion industry with their innovative and bold styles. Duffy's work is characterized by its striking compositions and dynamic use of contrast, capturing the spirit of the era.","observation":"The style uses stark, highly realistic photographic portraiture with dense texture, emphatic facial expressions, and tightly framed subjects. Strong black-and-white contrast, occasional muted color, visible grain, and selective focus give the images a raw, cinematic editorial intensity, while incongruous animals and props create a surreal edge."},{"id":"tomma-abts","name":"Tomma Abts","cat":"painters","en":"Tomma Abts","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tomma-abts.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tomma-abts","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","vivid-red","pale-orange","beige","orange","deep-rust"],"intro":"Tomma Abts is a German painter known for her abstract and geometric works. Her paintings often explore the interplay of shapes and colors, creating intricate compositions that challenge perceptions of space and form. Abts's work is characterized by its meticulous attention to detail and precision, often employing a limited color palette to achieve a sense of depth and movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses bold geometric bands, stripes, and arcs arranged as dense abstract compositions. Strong coral, orange, cream, black, and muted green contrasts are contained within clean graphic shapes, while visible canvas-like grain and fine directional marks give the flat forms a tactile painted surface."},{"id":"joan-mitchell","name":"Joan Mitchell","cat":"painters","en":"Joan Mitchell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joan-mitchell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joan-mitchell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","silver","brown","charcoal","dark-blue","rust"],"intro":"Joan Mitchell was an influential American abstract expressionist painter known for her vibrant and emotive works. Born in 1925, she became a prominent figure in the New York School of artists during the 1950s. Her paintings are celebrated for their dynamic compositions and intense use of color, often drawing inspiration from nature and personal experiences.","observation":"Across all four panels, dense gestural paint marks, visible ridges, scraping, and dripping create a heavily worked painterly surface. Saturated blues, greens, reds, oranges, and violets collide with pale ground, while fine linear gestures and broad swaths generate restless, energetic abstract compositions."},{"id":"laure-prouvost","name":"Laure Prouvost","cat":"various-artists","en":"Laure Prouvost","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laure-prouvost.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laure-prouvost","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","scenes","glow","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","muted-orange","brown","dark-red","silver","red","magenta"],"intro":"Laure Prouvost is a contemporary French artist known for her immersive installations and multimedia works that often explore themes of language, translation, and perception. Her work is characterized by a playful and surreal approach, blending video, sound, and sculpture to create engaging and thought-provoking experiences.","observation":"The style presents richly staged, cinematic installation scenes in large industrial interiors, combining believable materials and spatial detail with dreamlike, uncanny arrangements. Muted earthy colors are repeatedly transformed by saturated pink and red illumination, while hanging objects, draped textiles, plants, food, furniture, and rough painted surfaces create an ornate, tactile atmosphere."},{"id":"faith-ringgold","name":"Faith Ringgold","cat":"painters","en":"Faith Ringgold","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/faith-ringgold.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/faith-ringgold","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","floral","patterns","painterly","vivid-colors","collage","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["charcoal","beige","vivid-red","red","dark-brown","green","dark-blue"],"intro":"Faith Ringgold is an American artist known for her narrative quilts and vibrant storytelling through art. She emerged as a prominent figure in the art world during the civil rights movement, using her work to address issues of race, gender, and social justice. Her art often reflects her African American heritage and feminist themes, making her a significant voice in contemporary art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly saturated color with dense, hand-worked textile surfaces, assembling portraits and social scenes from patchwork, appliqué, quilting, and patterned fabric. Strong geometric framing, repeated motifs, floral borders, and richly decorated clothing create an ornate, layered collage effect."},{"id":"francesca-woodman","name":"Francesca Woodman","cat":"photographers","en":"Francesca Woodman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francesca-woodman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francesca-woodman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Francesca Woodman was an American photographer known for her black and white self-portraits. Her work often explored themes of identity, femininity, and the body, characterized by a surreal and haunting quality. Woodman’s photographs frequently feature blurred motion and soft focus, creating an ethereal and introspective atmosphere. Her work has been influential in contemporary art, particularly within the feminist art movement.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photography with strong window backlighting, deep shadows, visible grain, and selective softness. Repeated figures in flowing white dresses occupy a decaying interior, creating cinematic, dreamlike, and surreal scenes with ghostly movement and fragmented reflections."},{"id":"richard-pousette-dart","name":"Richard Pousette-Dart","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Pousette-Dart","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-pousette-dart.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-pousette-dart","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","ornate","patterns","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","charcoal","red","orange"],"intro":"Richard Pousette-Dart is an American painter and a prominent figure in the Abstract Expressionist movement. Born in 1916, he was known for his spiritual and symbolic approach to art, often incorporating intricate patterns and vibrant colors. His work is characterized by a deep exploration of form and color, creating a unique visual language that resonates with both emotional depth and intellectual complexity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is densely layered and abstract, combining concentric geometric motifs with countless small organic marks and symbols. Visible brushwork and textured, built-up surfaces give the vivid palette a tactile, handmade quality, while radial repetition and packed patterning create an expressive, surreal visual rhythm."},{"id":"ian-miller","name":"Ian Miller","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ian Miller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ian-miller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ian-miller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","black","beige","muted-blue","silver","rust"],"intro":"Ian Miller is a British illustrator known for his intricate and darkly fantastical artwork. His work often features gothic and surreal themes, with a detailed and illustrative style that has been influential in the realms of fantasy literature and role-playing games. Miller's art is characterized by its complex linework and textural contrasts, often depicting twisted landscapes and mythical creatures.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds vast fantastical environments from densely layered Gothic architecture, arched structures, spires, bridges, and cavernous interiors. Fine drawn contours and visible painterly texture support an ornate, highly detailed surface, while a cool blue-gray palette, deep shadows, and occasional orange or pale luminous accents create a brooding surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"meindert-hobbema","name":"Meindert Hobbema","cat":"painters","en":"Meindert Hobbema","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/meindert-hobbema.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/meindert-hobbema","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-ochre","muted-blue","silver","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Meindert Hobbema was a Dutch landscape painter of the 17th century, known for his detailed and serene depictions of the countryside. He was a prominent figure during the Dutch Golden Age , and his works often featured lush forests, tranquil streams, and rustic cottages, capturing the natural beauty of rural life with meticulous attention to detail.","observation":"The style presents expansive, idealized woodland landscapes with towering trees, reflective water, cottages, and dramatic cumulus skies. Visible brush texture, fine naturalistic detail, warm autumn accents, atmospheric distance, and deep shadow create a richly painted, classical landscape appearance."},{"id":"annie-swynnerton","name":"Annie Swynnerton","cat":"painters","en":"Annie Swynnerton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/annie-swynnerton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/annie-swynnerton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-ochre","black","dark-rust","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"Annie Swynnerton was a British painter known for her portraits and allegorical works, often featuring strong, independent women. She was associated with the late 19th and early 20th-century art movements, and her work is characterized by its rich color and expressive brushwork.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, visibly brushed paint to render idealized female portraits with luminous skin, flowing hair, elaborate garments, and dense floral decoration. Saturated reds, ochres, greens, and blue grounds combine with fine facial modeling and delicate textile and hair strokes, creating a romantic, decorative, dreamlike effect."},{"id":"james-rizzi","name":"James Rizzi","cat":"illustrators","en":"James Rizzi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-rizzi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-rizzi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","patterns","scenes","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["beige","white","charcoal","red","muted-blue","ochre","green","deep-blue"],"intro":"James Rizzi is an American pop artist known for his vibrant and playful cityscapes. His work often features a blend of urban life with whimsical and cartoonish elements, creating a unique and joyful visual experience. Rizzi's art is characterized by bold outlines, vivid colors, and a sense of childlike wonder, capturing the bustling energy of city life with a touch of fantasy.","observation":"Across all four pictures, densely packed city architecture is rendered as colorful, hand-drawn imagery with fine outlines, patterned surfaces, and mostly flat areas of saturated color. Whimsical suns, stars, rainbows, boats, creatures, and exaggerated buildings give the urban scenes an expressive, playful fantasy character."},{"id":"john-heartfield","name":"John Heartfield","cat":"various-artists","en":"John Heartfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-heartfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-heartfield","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","still-life","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","retro","collage","dark"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","bone-white"],"intro":"John Heartfield was a German artist known for his pioneering work in photomontage, particularly during the Weimar Republic era. He used his art as a form of political protest, especially against fascism and the Nazi regime. Heartfield's works are celebrated for their innovative use of photographic techniques to create powerful visual critiques of social and political issues.","observation":"The style combines stark monochrome, heavily textured archival imagery with surreal photomontage: oversized faces, mechanical objects, historical figures, and impossible juxtapositions share the frame. Dense grain, distressed paper tones, hard tonal contrast, and visible cutout-like assembly give the images a retro, unsettling dream logic."},{"id":"jean-luc-godard","name":"Jean-Luc Godard","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Jean-Luc Godard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-luc-godard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-luc-godard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","white","grey"],"intro":"Jean-Luc Godard is a prominent French-Swiss filmmaker known for his influential role in the French New Wave cinema movement. His work is characterized by its radical approach to narrative, visual style, and themes, often challenging traditional filmmaking conventions. Godard's films are celebrated for their innovative use of editing, sound, and cinematography, contributing significantly to the evolution of modern cinema.","observation":"The style uses high-contrast black-and-white photography with pronounced grain, dramatic cropping, and selective focus. It combines intimate close-up portraits with candid gallery and social scenes, emphasizing expressive faces, fashion details, dense tonal texture, and a retro editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"charles-demuth","name":"Charles Demuth","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Demuth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-demuth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-demuth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","patterns","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","muted-blue","brown","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Charles Demuth was an American painter known for his contributions to the Precisionist movement, a style characterized by its focus on industrial and architectural subjects, often depicted with sharp, geometric forms. Born in 1883, Demuth's work frequently explored the intersection of modernity and art, capturing the essence of early 20th-century American industrial landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense urban architecture is reduced to angular planes, vertical shafts, rooftops, windows, and industrial structures. Clean linear contours and broad flat color fields are softened by visible watercolor-like washes, paper grain, and selectively weathered textures, with recurring reds, blue-gray skies, cream walls, and dark structural accents."},{"id":"thomas-hirschhorn","name":"Thomas Hirschhorn","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Thomas Hirschhorn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-hirschhorn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-hirschhorn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","patterns","urban","glow","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","collage"],"colours":["dark-brown","ochre","black","brown","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Thomas Hirschhorn is a Swiss artist known for his large-scale installations that often incorporate everyday materials and found objects. His work frequently explores themes of consumer culture, media saturation, and political critique, making use of dense, immersive environments that challenge viewers' perceptions.","observation":"Across all four views, the style depicts immense, cluttered interior installations rendered with visible painterly texture and dense accumulations of posters, paint, paper, fabric, and discarded materials. Warm work lights punctuate the subdued, earthy palette, while expressive collage-like surfaces, irregular architectural forms, and high detail create an immersive, chaotic studio atmosphere."},{"id":"erich-heckel","name":"Erich Heckel","cat":"painters","en":"Erich Heckel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erich-heckel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erich-heckel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","silver","dark-brown","red","orange"],"intro":"Erich Heckel was a German painter and printmaker, known for being a founding member of the Die Brücke group, which played a significant role in the development of Expressionism in the early 20th century. His work is characterized by bold colors, expressive forms, and a focus on emotional experience, often depicting urban and rural scenes with a unique intensity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is visibly hand-painted, with broad, directional strokes and thick, uneven pigment building angular faces, clothing, furniture, and architectural forms. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and ochres dominate the color scenes, while one render shifts to stark monochrome; the recurring portraits and interior vignettes feel emotionally intense, dark, and deliberately distorted."},{"id":"su-blackwell","name":"Su Blackwell","cat":"various-artists","en":"Su Blackwell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/su-blackwell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/su-blackwell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","floral","landscapes","still-life","glow","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","dark-ochre","beige","light-orange"],"intro":"Su Blackwell is a British artist known for her enchanting paper sculptures and installations. Her work often involves transforming books into intricate three-dimensional scenes, drawing inspiration from fairy tales and folklore. Blackwell's art is celebrated for its delicate craftsmanship and imaginative storytelling, creating a bridge between literature and visual art.","observation":"The style builds highly detailed, realistic miniature worlds out of open books, with trees, foliage, architecture and animals emerging as sculptural three-dimensional forms. Warm internal light contrasts with dark backgrounds, while naturalistic textures and fantastical juxtapositions create a dreamy, surreal storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"monia-merlo","name":"Monia Merlo","cat":"photographers","en":"Monia Merlo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/monia-merlo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/monia-merlo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","black","dark-teal","beige","dark-brown"],"intro":"Monia Merlo is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and romantic imagery, often blending elements of fantasy and reality. Her work frequently explores themes of femininity and nature, creating a dreamlike atmosphere that captivates viewers.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, softly lit portrait photography with intimate close-up compositions, natural skin texture, and richly rendered lace, hair, and botanical details. Muted greens, creams, whites, and russets create a dark, dreamy atmosphere, while flowers, branches, and elaborate garments give the portraits a romantic editorial character."},{"id":"yousuf-karsh","name":"Yousuf Karsh","cat":"photographers","en":"Yousuf Karsh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yousuf-karsh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yousuf-karsh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","characters","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Yousuf Karsh was a renowned Armenian-Canadian photographer, celebrated for his iconic portraits of notable figures from the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by its dramatic use of lighting and meticulous attention to detail, capturing the essence and personality of his subjects. Karsh's portraits include some of the most famous individuals of his time, including Winston Churchill, Albert Einstein, and Audrey Hepburn.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome portrait photography with intense directional lighting, deep black backgrounds, and sharply modelled faces and fur. Tight close-ups, formal poses, and carefully isolated subjects create a dramatic, cinematic, psychologically charged presentation across both human and animal portraits."},{"id":"peter-brookes","name":"Peter Brookes","cat":"illustrators","en":"Peter Brookes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-brookes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-brookes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-orange","brown","bone-white","grey","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Peter Brookes is a renowned British cartoonist and illustrator, known for his work as a political cartoonist for The Times newspaper. His illustrations often provide sharp and witty commentary on political and social issues, capturing the essence of British culture with humor and insight. Brookes's work is celebrated for its bold lines, expressive characters, and satirical edge, making him a prominent figure in the world of editorial cartoons.","observation":"The style combines dense, expressive caricature with inked contour lines, crosshatched texture, and selective watercolor-like washes. Saturated colors and strong light-dark separation intensify the crowded comic-panel compositions, while exaggerated faces, oversized heads, and absurd juxtapositions create a surreal editorial-satirical tone."},{"id":"c215","name":"C215","cat":"street-artists","en":"C215","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/c215.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/c215","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","portraits","urban","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","beige","red","muted-cyan","dark-blue"],"intro":"C215 is a renowned French street artist known for his intricate stencil work and vibrant portraits that often depict marginalized individuals. His real-life counterpart, Christian Guémy, has made significant contributions to the street art scene with his detailed and emotive portrayals, often found in urban environments.","observation":"The style combines graphic, illustrative portraiture with visibly built-up paint, broad directional strokes, splatters, and strong dark outlines. Saturated orange, teal, blue, and red dominate against dark grounds, while close-cropped human and animal faces are integrated into weathered urban door and wall surfaces."},{"id":"alvin-langdon-coburn","name":"Alvin Langdon Coburn","cat":"photographers","en":"Alvin Langdon Coburn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alvin-langdon-coburn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alvin-langdon-coburn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["portraits","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","beige","charcoal","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Alvin Langdon Coburn was an influential American photographer known for his pioneering work in the early 20th century. He was a key figure in the Pictorialist movement, which emphasized the artistic aspects of photography. Coburn's work often featured soft focus and atmospheric effects, capturing urban landscapes and portraits with a unique sense of mood and depth.","observation":"The style uses monochrome, sepia-tinged photographic imagery with heavy grain, deep shadows, and stark backlighting. Fog and soft focus dissolve city architecture into atmospheric silhouettes, while intimate figures, water, streets, and winter trees create a cinematic, melancholic urban mood."},{"id":"aaron-siskind","name":"Aaron Siskind","cat":"photographers","en":"Aaron Siskind","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aaron-siskind.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aaron-siskind","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","patterns","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","ink","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","silver","black","grey"],"intro":"Aaron Siskind is a renowned American photographer known for his significant contributions to abstract photography. Born in 1903, Siskind initially worked in social documentary photography before shifting to abstract expressionism. His work often focuses on the textures and forms found in urban environments, capturing the beauty in decay and erosion. Siskind's photographs are celebrated for their ability to transform mundane surfaces into compelling visual narratives.","observation":"The style is a stark monochrome study of distressed architectural surfaces, combining dense cracks, peeling layers, rough masonry, and heavy black marks. High contrast, grain, ink-like edges, and collage-like overlaps turn the walls into abstract, sometimes suggestive silhouettes with a dark surreal mood."},{"id":"ran-ortner","name":"Ran Ortner","cat":"painters","en":"Ran Ortner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ran-ortner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ran-ortner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","landscapes","motion","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","bone-white","charcoal","beige"],"intro":"Ran Ortner is an American artist known for his large-scale, hyper-realistic paintings of ocean waves. His work captures the dynamic and powerful nature of the sea, often focusing on the interplay of light and water.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style treats turbulent ocean waves with realistic, densely observed water and foam textures. Dark, subdued color grading and strong light-dark separation heighten the sense of motion, drama, and natural force."},{"id":"mira-schendel","name":"Mira Schendel","cat":"various-artists","en":"Mira Schendel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mira-schendel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mira-schendel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","patterns","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","collage","drawing","ink","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","white","beige","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Mira Schendel was a Swiss-born Brazilian artist known for her contributions to the Concrete and Neo-Concrete art movements. Her work often explored themes of language, identity, and spirituality through a minimalist and abstract lens. Schendel's art is characterized by its use of unconventional materials and techniques, including rice paper, monotype, and acrylic, which she employed to create delicate and ethereal compositions.","observation":"The style combines sparse geometric abstraction with densely layered paper, ink, charcoal, stains, grids, and circular marks. Fine drawn lines and diagrammatic structures sit over subdued cream and sepia surfaces, while occasional black and red accents create an enigmatic, surreal collage-like presence."},{"id":"stefano-gabbana","name":"Stefano Gabbana","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Stefano Gabbana","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stefano-gabbana.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stefano-gabbana","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-red","brown","muted-orange","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Stefano Gabbana is an Italian fashion designer, co-founder of the luxury fashion house Dolce & Gabbana. Known for his opulent and extravagant designs, Gabbana has made significant contributions to the fashion industry with his bold and innovative style, often drawing inspiration from Italian culture and history.","observation":"The style combines highly rendered fashion portraiture with visible painterly brushwork, fine illustrative linework, and dense ornamental detail. Elaborate gowns, floral motifs, jewelry, crowns, and botanical framing recur throughout, shifting between polished photographic-looking portraits and stylized painted fashion plates."},{"id":"edward-steichen","name":"Edward Steichen","cat":"photographers","en":"Edward Steichen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-steichen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-steichen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","backlighting","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Edward Steichen was a Luxembourgish American photographer, painter, and curator, renowned for his pioneering work in photography and his role in shaping modern photographic aesthetics. He was a key figure in the development of fine art photography and was instrumental in the success of the Photo-Secession movement. Steichen's work is characterized by its innovative use of light and composition, as well as his ability to capture the essence of his subjects.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic portrait photography with strongly sculpted side and back lighting, deep shadows, and softly atmospheric backgrounds. A restrained near-monochrome palette, visible film grain, shallow focus, and expressive fashion styling create a dark, intimate, editorial mood across the four images."},{"id":"reem-acra","name":"Reem Acra","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Reem Acra","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/reem-acra.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/reem-acra","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","glow","fine-lines","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","dark-blue"],"intro":"Reem Acra is a renowned Lebanese fashion designer known for her exquisite bridal and evening gowns. Her designs are celebrated for their intricate embroidery, luxurious fabrics, and elegant silhouettes, making her a prominent figure in the world of haute couture.","observation":"The style is highly realistic bridal-couture editorial photography, emphasizing intricate lace, floral appliqué, crystal details, and translucent veils. Soft directional lighting, selective focus, restrained ivory-and-neutral tones, and occasional cool blue backdrops give the portraits a polished, cinematic fashion-magazine finish."},{"id":"david-ligare","name":"David Ligare","cat":"painters","en":"David Ligare","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-ligare.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-ligare","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","pale-orange","beige","muted-blue","ochre"],"intro":"David Ligare is an American contemporary realist painter known for his classical approach to art. His works often draw inspiration from ancient Greek and Roman themes, focusing on clarity, balance, and harmony. Ligare's paintings are celebrated for their meticulous detail and use of light, which create a sense of timelessness and serenity.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic architectural imagery with monumental geometric forms, carefully framed ocean horizons, and recurring arches, columns, and rectilinear planes. Warm subdued tones, strong directional sunlight, deep shadows, and sparse solitary figures create a quiet, contemplative atmosphere with generous negative space."},{"id":"sergei-diaghilev","name":"Sergei Diaghilev","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sergei Diaghilev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sergei-diaghilev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sergei-diaghilev","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","pale-yellow","grey","red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Sergei Diaghilev was a Russian art critic, patron, ballet impresario, and founder of the Ballets Russes, which revolutionized ballet in the early 20th century. He was a pivotal figure in bringing Russian art and culture to the Western world, collaborating with artists, composers, and choreographers to create groundbreaking performances.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly dressed figures and theatrical portraits are built from dense decorative patterning, visible brush texture, fine drawn marks, and layered textile detail. Saturated reds, blues, creams, and blacks create a vivid, high-contrast collage-like appearance, with expressive poses, masks, headpieces, and surreal juxtapositions reinforcing the elaborate stage-like mood."},{"id":"dan-witz","name":"Dan Witz","cat":"street-artists","en":"Dan Witz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-witz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-witz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","dark-brown","yellow"],"intro":"Dan Witz is an American street artist and realist painter known for his hyper-realistic and expressive works that often explore themes of urban life and human emotion. His art frequently features detailed and moody scenes that capture the essence of contemporary city living, often with a focus on the isolation and introspection of individuals within crowded environments.","observation":"Across all four images, densely packed figures and intimate confrontations emerge from near-black surroundings, with faces and gestures picked out by dramatic pools of warm light. The thick, visible brushwork, rough surfaces, earthy dark palette, and heightened expressions give the scenes a tactile, emotionally charged, almost dreamlike intensity."},{"id":"tom-bagshaw","name":"Tom Bagshaw","cat":"various-artists","en":"Tom Bagshaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-bagshaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-bagshaw","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey","beige","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Tom Bagshaw is a contemporary British artist known for his digital paintings that blend elements of fantasy and gothic aesthetics. His work often features ethereal female figures, drawing inspiration from Victorian fashion and gothic subculture, creating a unique blend of realism and surrealism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to depict pale, solemn female portraits in elaborate black garments and veils. Muted blue-grey surroundings, floral framing, restrained expressions, and carefully rendered lace, jewelry, and fabric create a dark, romantic, highly detailed atmosphere."},{"id":"leonard-freed","name":"Leonard Freed","cat":"photographers","en":"Leonard Freed","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leonard-freed.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leonard-freed","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Leonard Freed was an American documentary photojournalist known for his work capturing social and political issues, particularly during the civil rights movement. His photographs often depicted the human condition, focusing on themes of identity, community, and social justice. Freed's work is characterized by its empathetic approach and deep engagement with his subjects, providing a poignant glimpse into the lives of people from various walks of life.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photographic imagery with strong tonal separation, visible grain, and selective focus. Candid urban portraits and street scenes are framed cinematically, often pairing sharply observed faces with deep shadows, blurred backgrounds, and layered public-space activity."},{"id":"michael-heizer","name":"Michael Heizer","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Michael Heizer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-heizer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-heizer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","subdued-colors","surreal","epic","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","beige","silver","pale-blue","blue"],"intro":"Michael Heizer is an American artist known for his pioneering work in the land art movement. Heizer's large-scale earthworks, such as \"Double Negative\" and \"City,\" are monumental interventions in the landscape that challenge traditional notions of sculpture and art. His work often involves moving massive amounts of earth, creating voids, and using industrial materials to engage with the natural environment.","observation":"The style presents monumental stone forms and stark architectural interventions in highly realistic, cinematic desert landscapes. Subdued earth tones, crisp daylight, geometric compositions, and expansive negative space emphasize scale, solitude, and an uncanny surreal grandeur across the images."},{"id":"lorna-simpson","name":"Lorna Simpson","cat":"photographers","en":"Lorna Simpson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lorna-simpson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lorna-simpson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","black","charcoal","beige","brown"],"intro":"Lorna Simpson is an American artist known for her work in photography and multimedia art. She explores themes of identity, gender, race, and history, often incorporating text and images to challenge conventional narratives. Her work is recognized for its conceptual depth and visual impact, making her a significant figure in contemporary art.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome portraiture with deep shadows, bright cream grounds, and a grainy photographic texture. Repeated profiles and frontal faces are combined with oversized, cloudlike hair, floral fragments, and overlapping silhouettes to create a surreal editorial effect."},{"id":"roger-ballen","name":"Roger Ballen","cat":"photographers","en":"Roger Ballen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-ballen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-ballen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","silver","black"],"intro":"Roger Ballen is a renowned photographer known for his distinctive style that blends elements of documentary photography with surreal and abstract compositions. His work often explores themes of the human psyche, using stark black and white imagery to create haunting and thought-provoking scenes. Ballen's photographs frequently feature unusual subjects and settings, drawing the viewer into a world that is both unsettling and captivating.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark monochrome imagery combines distressed interiors, theatrical posing, handmade masks, and unsettling human-animal figures. Strong tonal contrast, visible grain, rough wall textures, and tightly composed portraits create a bleak, surreal photographic-documentary feel."},{"id":"mark-knight","name":"Mark Knight","cat":"illustrators","en":"Mark Knight","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-knight.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-knight","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-rust","muted-orange","red","grey"],"intro":"Mark Knight is an illustrator known for his unique style that blends elements of fantasy and surrealism. His work often features intricate details and imaginative compositions, drawing inspiration from mythological and gothic themes. Knight's illustrations are characterized by their expressive and moody atmosphere, often exploring dark and whimsical subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense illustrative tattoo imagery with heavy black outlines, intricate internal linework, and strongly expressive animal and humanoid forms. Saturated reds, oranges, pinks, and greens contrast against dark ink-heavy shading, producing ornate, dramatic compositions with a recurring grotesque and fantastical tone."},{"id":"kitty-lange-kielland","name":"Kitty Lange Kielland","cat":"painters","en":"Kitty Lange Kielland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kitty-lange-kielland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kitty-lange-kielland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","silver","bone-white","ochre","red"],"intro":"Kitty Lange Kielland was a Norwegian landscape painter known for her realistic depictions of the Scandinavian countryside. Born in 1843, she became one of the first female artists to gain recognition in Norway. Her works often feature serene landscapes, capturing the natural beauty of her homeland with meticulous detail and a romantic sensibility.","observation":"Across all four landscapes, natural scenery is rendered with visible fine brushwork, layered texture, and carefully observed details in trees, rocks, water, and clouds. The style favors subdued, atmospheric colors with moody dusk and dawn lighting, expressive skies, reflective water, and tranquil rural compositions."},{"id":"anka-zhuravleva","name":"Anka Zhuravleva","cat":"photographers","en":"Anka Zhuravleva","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anka-zhuravleva.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anka-zhuravleva","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","white","charcoal","muted-cyan","dark-red","beige"],"intro":"Anka Zhuravleva is a contemporary Russian photographer known for her ethereal and surreal imagery. Her work often explores themes of fantasy, introspection, and the delicate interplay between humans and their environments, creating dreamlike scenes that captivate the viewer.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, built around carefully staged female portraits and narrative scenes with period clothing, weathered architecture, and recurring seabirds. Muted blue-gray and brown tones, selective red accents, shallow focus, soft atmospheric light, and subdued contrast create a dark, melancholic vintage mood."},{"id":"hermann-rorschach","name":"Hermann Rorschach","cat":"various-artists","en":"Hermann Rorschach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hermann-rorschach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hermann-rorschach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","patterns","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","ink","symmetry"],"colours":["cream","black","brown","beige","red"],"intro":"Hermann Rorschach was a Swiss psychiatrist and psychoanalyst, best known for developing the Rorschach inkblot test, a psychological test in which subjects' perceptions of inkblots are recorded and analyzed. Born in 1884, Rorschach's work has had a lasting impact on psychology and the study of personality.","observation":"Across all four renders, loose ink and watercolor-like pigment blooms form mirrored, bilateral figures with strong central axes and ambiguous face-like or creature-like shapes. The mostly black, cream, and grey palette is restrained, with red accents in one variation, while pooling, bleeding edges, splatters, and drips preserve a spontaneous, surreal material quality."},{"id":"lucy-madox-brown","name":"Lucy Madox Brown","cat":"painters","en":"Lucy Madox Brown","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucy-madox-brown.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucy-madox-brown","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","deep-red","ochre","dark-ochre","dark-red","bone-white"],"intro":"Lucy Madox Brown is a historical figure known for her contributions to the Pre-Raphaelite movement in the 19th century. She was an English painter and the daughter of Ford Madox Brown, a prominent artist of the time. Her works often reflected the romantic and detailed style characteristic of the Pre-Raphaelites, focusing on themes of beauty, nature, and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint to depict realistic close-up portraits and groups of figures. Saturated reds, greens, blues, and ochres combine with dense flowers, patterned textiles, elaborate clothing, and carefully observed faces to create an ornate, highly detailed surface."},{"id":"serge-poliakoff","name":"Serge Poliakoff","cat":"painters","en":"Serge Poliakoff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/serge-poliakoff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/serge-poliakoff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","dark-blue","dark-red","bone-white","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Serge Poliakoff was a Russian-born French painter known for his contributions to abstract art in the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by a unique approach to color and form, often featuring bold, interlocking shapes and a vibrant palette. Poliakoff's paintings are celebrated for their dynamic compositions and the way they explore the interaction of colors.","observation":"Across all four renders, large angular blocks of red, navy, and cream form strongly abstract geometric compositions. The surfaces retain visible brush texture and uneven pigment, while the simplified shapes and saturated palette create a bold, graphic presence."},{"id":"willem-de-kooning","name":"Willem de Kooning","cat":"painters","en":"Willem de Kooning","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/willem-de-kooning.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/willem-de-kooning","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-orange","bone-white","brown","red","dark-blue","vivid-ochre"],"intro":"Willem de Kooning was a Dutch-American abstract expressionist artist known for his energetic and gestural painting style. Born in Rotterdam in 1904, he became a leading figure in the post-war New York art scene. His work is characterized by its abstract forms, bold use of color, and dynamic brushwork, contributing significantly to the development of abstract expressionism.","observation":"Across all four works, the style is vigorously painterly and abstract, built from broad, directional strokes, thin exploratory lines, scraped passages, and occasional drips. Saturated reds, blues, pinks, oranges, and ochres collide with cream and gray grounds, producing dense, energetic compositions with loosely suggested forms rather than clearly depicted subjects."},{"id":"igor-mitoraj","name":"Igor Mitoraj","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Igor Mitoraj","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/igor-mitoraj.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/igor-mitoraj","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","silver","black","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Igor Mitoraj is a renowned Polish sculptor known for his monumental works that often explore themes of classical mythology and human form. His sculptures are characterized by fragmented bodies and faces, evoking a sense of timelessness and mystery. Mitoraj's work is celebrated for its ability to blend classical aesthetics with modern sensibilities, creating pieces that are both haunting and beautiful.","observation":"The style presents monumental, highly realistic stone sculptures and fragmented facial forms with strong three-dimensional weight. Subdued earth-and-stone tones, weathered surfaces, cracks, chips, and sharply faceted planes create a classical yet dark, imposing gallery atmosphere."},{"id":"eikoh-hosoe","name":"Eikoh Hosoe","cat":"photographers","en":"Eikoh Hosoe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eikoh-hosoe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eikoh-hosoe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Eikoh Hosoe is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his avant-garde and experimental approach to photography. His work often explores themes of the human condition, identity, and psychological landscapes, frequently collaborating with artists from other disciplines such as dance and theater. Hosoe's photography is characterized by its dramatic use of light and shadow, as well as its intense emotional depth.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped, realistic monochrome portraits with pronounced film grain, deep blacks, and stark highlights. Faces overlap with flowers, branches, and hair, while selective focus and intimate framing create an expressive, dark photographic mood."},{"id":"peter-mendelsund","name":"Peter Mendelsund","cat":"designers","en":"Peter Mendelsund","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-mendelsund.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-mendelsund","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","characters","patterns","portraits","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","pale-yellow","teal","deep-red","light-orange"],"intro":"Peter Mendelsund is a renowned book cover designer and art director known for his innovative and striking designs. He has worked with major publishing houses and is recognized for his ability to visually interpret complex literary themes.","observation":"The style combines stark red, black, cream, and teal blocks with simplified geometric forms, heavy outlines, and strongly cropped portrait compositions. Flat graphic shapes and repeated circular motifs are set against visible grain and tactile paper texture, while concealed faces, isolated eyes, and tiny silhouettes create a surreal, enigmatic mood."},{"id":"william-wendt","name":"William Wendt","cat":"painters","en":"William Wendt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-wendt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-wendt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["charcoal","ochre","dark-ochre","beige","muted-blue"],"intro":"William Wendt is a renowned American landscape painter known for his vibrant depictions of the California countryside. Born in Germany in 1865, he immigrated to the United States and became a leading figure in the California Impressionism movement. His works are celebrated for their rich color palettes and dynamic compositions, capturing the natural beauty of the American West.","observation":"Across all four views, expansive mountain landscapes are rendered with visible, broad, directional brushwork and richly layered vegetation, rock, cloud, and terrain. Saturated greens, ochres, and blue-violet shadows combine with strong sunlight and deep foreground shade to create an expressive, highly detailed pastoral style."},{"id":"lee-madgwick","name":"Lee Madgwick","cat":"photographers","en":"Lee Madgwick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-madgwick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-madgwick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["pale-blue","muted-cyan","brown","black","dark-blue","dark-ochre"],"intro":"Lee Madgwick is a contemporary artist known for his evocative landscapes that often feature solitary, abandoned structures set against expansive natural backdrops. His work captures a sense of isolation and introspection, blending realism with a touch of the surreal.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic landscapes with carefully composed abandoned buildings set against expansive skies, overgrown vegetation, and atmospheric haze. Muted blue-green and brown tones, isolated warm light sources, drifting mist or smoke, and solitary human figures create a dark, dreamlike sense of quiet drama."},{"id":"artemisia-gentileschi","name":"Artemisia Gentileschi","cat":"painters","en":"Artemisia Gentileschi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/artemisia-gentileschi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/artemisia-gentileschi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","erotic","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Artemisia Gentileschi was an Italian Baroque painter, known for her powerful depictions of biblical and mythological scenes. She was one of the most accomplished painters of her generation, recognized for her use of chiaroscuro and dramatic compositions. Her work often explored themes of female empowerment and resilience, reflecting her own life experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, painterly portraiture with visible brushwork, dramatic cropping, and expressive, intertwined figures. Warm subdued reds, browns, creams, and occasional blue are set against deep shadows, while directional light emphasizes skin, fabric folds, and theatrical poses."},{"id":"marcel-broodthaers","name":"Marcel Broodthaers","cat":"various-artists","en":"Marcel Broodthaers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marcel-broodthaers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marcel-broodthaers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","animals","scenes","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-olive","beige","black","bone-white","white","dark-brown"],"intro":"Marcel Broodthaers was a Belgian artist and poet known for his conceptual and installation art. He often incorporated everyday objects into his work, challenging traditional notions of art and exploring themes of language, identity, and consumer culture. Broodthaers's work is characterized by its wit, irony, and intellectual depth, making him a significant figure in the postmodern art movement.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, carefully staged museum-like still lifes in spacious gallery interiors, combining antique furniture, taxidermied birds, glass cloches, flowers, and sculptural display objects. Muted earthy colors, strong directional light, deep shadows, and generous negative space create a dark, cinematic atmosphere, while worn wood, brass, glass, and floral details provide an ornate, tactile richness."},{"id":"denys-lasdun","name":"Denys Lasdun","cat":"architects","en":"Denys Lasdun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/denys-lasdun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/denys-lasdun","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","geometric"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Denys Lasdun was a prominent British architect known for his modernist and brutalist designs, particularly in the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by bold geometric forms and a strong emphasis on concrete structures, contributing significantly to the architectural landscape of the United Kingdom.","observation":"The style presents monumental concrete architecture through stark black-and-white architectural photography, emphasizing geometric masses, cantilevered planes, staircases, and deep recessed shadows. Hard directional light creates severe tonal contrast while visible concrete grain and repeated structural lines add tactile detail; tiny human figures reinforce the buildings’ scale."},{"id":"peter-paul-rubens","name":"Peter Paul Rubens","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Paul Rubens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-paul-rubens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-paul-rubens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","rust","muted-orange"],"intro":"Peter Paul Rubens was a renowned Flemish Baroque painter born in 1577, celebrated for his dynamic compositions, vibrant color palette, and dramatic use of light and shadow. His works often depicted historical, religious, and mythological subjects, characterized by their energetic movement and emotional intensity. Rubens's influence extended across Europe, making him one of the most important painters of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modeled oil-paint surfaces, visible directional brushwork, and densely articulated hair, skin, fabric, and armor. Dramatic close-up faces and crowded historical tableaux are shaped by deep shadows, warm flesh tones, and forceful expressions against dark grounds."},{"id":"rick-mckee","name":"Rick McKee","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rick McKee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rick-mckee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rick-mckee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing"],"colours":["muted-ochre","black","brown","muted-blue","pale-yellow","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Rick McKee is a contemporary illustrator known for his humorous and detailed cartoon style. His work often features exaggerated characters and whimsical scenes, drawing inspiration from fantasy and folklore.","observation":"The style uses energetic editorial-cartoon drawing with heavy black contours, expressive caricatured faces, dense crosshatching, and selectively flat areas of muted yet forceful color. Figures and political tableaux are arranged in dramatic, crowded scenes, with exaggerated anatomy, gestural poses, and recurring red, blue, cream, and grey tones creating a vivid high-contrast graphic look."},{"id":"gustave-courbet","name":"Gustave Courbet","cat":"painters","en":"Gustave Courbet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-courbet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-courbet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-cyan","muted-orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Gustave Courbet was a French painter and a leading figure in the Realism movement of the 19th century. Known for his bold and often controversial works, Courbet challenged the conventions of his time by depicting ordinary people and everyday scenes with unflinching honesty. His commitment to realism and his rejection of idealized art made him a pivotal figure in the transition from Romanticism to modern art.","observation":"Across the four renders, the style is built from visibly worked oil-paint surfaces, broad directional strokes, and richly modelled figures, clothing, clouds, and terrain. It combines subdued, earthy color with dark atmospheric passages and sharp light⁠–shadow contrasts, presenting expressive human moments and expansive coastal landscapes in a densely detailed, traditional pictorial manner."},{"id":"george-cukor","name":"George Cukor","cat":"filmmakers","en":"George Cukor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-cukor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-cukor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","brown","bone-white","rust","dark-green","red"],"intro":"George Cukor was an influential American film director known for his work during the Golden Age of Hollywood. He directed numerous classic films, including \"The Philadelphia Story\" and \"My Fair Lady,\" and was renowned for his ability to elicit strong performances from his actors, particularly women. Cukor's films often featured sophisticated dialogue and elegant settings, contributing to his reputation as a master of romantic and dramatic storytelling.","observation":"These photorealistic scenes use polished cinematic staging, expressive group interactions, and carefully arranged period costumes and interiors. The sheet alternates richly colored, warmly lit tableaux with stark black-and-white images, while selective focus, dramatic lighting, and strong tonal contrast give every frame the feel of a composed film still."},{"id":"patrick-heron","name":"Patrick Heron","cat":"painters","en":"Patrick Heron","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patrick-heron.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patrick-heron","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-orange","deep-indigo","vivid-red","cream","charcoal","deep-blue","light-lime"],"intro":"Patrick Heron is a renowned British artist known for his vibrant abstract paintings and significant contributions to modern art. Born in 1920, Heron became a key figure in the development of post-war abstraction in the United Kingdom. His work is characterized by bold use of color, geometric forms, and an exploration of spatial relationships, often drawing inspiration from the natural world and his surroundings.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses vivid saturated colors and large geometric, organically rounded shapes arranged as abstract compositions. Broad painted areas, rough edges, occasional visible texture, and overlapping flat-color forms combine graphic structure with expressive hand-painted energy."},{"id":"john-roddam-spencer-stanhope","name":"John Roddam Spencer Stanhope","cat":"painters","en":"John Roddam Spencer Stanhope","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-roddam-spencer-stanhope.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-roddam-spencer-stanhope","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-brown","muted-orange","deep-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"John Roddam Spencer Stanhope was a British painter associated with the Pre-Raphaelite movement, known for his detailed and symbolic works. Born in 1829, he was a contemporary of artists like Dante Gabriel Rossetti and Edward Burne-Jones. His work often depicted mythological and literary themes, characterized by rich colors and intricate details, reflecting the ideals of the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, painterly portraiture with fine, layered brushwork and densely ornamented clothing, foliage, and architectural surroundings. Restrained jewel tones, elongated pale faces, formal poses, and richly patterned surfaces create a lush, antique-feeling decorative atmosphere."},{"id":"serge-lutens","name":"Serge Lutens","cat":"photographers","en":"Serge Lutens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/serge-lutens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/serge-lutens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","portraits","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","dark-blue","grey","brown"],"intro":"","observation":"The style presents highly controlled, close-up fashion portraits with porcelain-pale faces, severe black framing, and sharply defined crimson, cobalt, and metallic accents. Strong directional lighting and deep shadows create a dark, cinematic mood, while grain and dense textile and jewelry detail give the images a tactile editorial finish."},{"id":"walter-gropius","name":"Walter Gropius","cat":"architects","en":"Walter Gropius","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walter-gropius.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walter-gropius","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","patterns","urban","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","collage","geometric"],"colours":["silver","black","pale-orange","beige","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Walter Gropius was a pioneering German architect and founder of the Bauhaus School, which played a significant role in shaping modern architecture and design. His work emphasized functionality, simplicity, and the integration of art, craft, and technology. Gropius's influence extended globally, impacting architectural practices and education.","observation":"The style combines sharply constructed architectural imagery with flat geometric overlays, collage-like layering, and visible printed or paper texture. Strong black, white, red, and blue blocks create a high-contrast palette, while thin architectural outlines, window grids, and repeated rectilinear motifs unify the four images."},{"id":"kathryn-morris-trotter","name":"Kathryn Morris Trotter","cat":"painters","en":"Kathryn Morris Trotter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kathryn-morris-trotter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kathryn-morris-trotter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","muted-olive","ochre","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Kathryn Morris Trotter is an American artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings, often focusing on themes of femininity and beauty. Her work is characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions that capture the essence of her subjects with a modern flair.","observation":"Across all four renders, figures and garments are built from clearly visible, broad, directional paint strokes with softened edges and a tactile, layered surface. The restrained earth, cream, green, and rose palette supports elegant fashion portraiture, while cropped poses, turned heads, and partially obscured faces create an expressive editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"peter-beard","name":"Peter Beard","cat":"various-artists","en":"Peter Beard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-beard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-beard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","animals","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary","collage","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","light-yellow","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Peter Beard is an American artist and photographer known for his work in Africa, particularly his documentation of wildlife and indigenous cultures. He gained fame for his diaries and collages that combine photography, text, and found objects, often highlighting themes of conservation and the human impact on nature.","observation":"The style combines stark black-and-white documentary photography with tightly framed portraits of people and elephants, using strong tonal contrast and a visibly grainy, weathered surface. Multiple photographs, newspaper fragments, handwritten marks, torn edges, and layered borders create an ornate distressed collage with an intense editorial mood."},{"id":"tom-sachs","name":"Tom Sachs","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tom Sachs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-sachs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-sachs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","sci-fi","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","beige","dark-brown","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Tom Sachs is an American contemporary artist known for his innovative and often provocative sculptures. His work frequently involves recreating modern icons using everyday materials, exploring themes of consumerism, technology, and cultural identity. Sachs's approach is both meticulous and playful, often incorporating elements of bricolage and assemblage.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, sculptural mechanical constructions with dense readable components, exposed wiring, gauges, panels, and improvised assemblies. Restrained whites, creams, greys, and red accents are photographed against spacious gallery or warehouse settings, combining precise industrial detail with an austere retro-futurist atmosphere."},{"id":"karl-friedrich-schinkel","name":"Karl Friedrich Schinkel","cat":"painters","en":"Karl Friedrich Schinkel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karl-friedrich-schinkel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karl-friedrich-schinkel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-blue","muted-ochre","muted-blue","bone-white"],"intro":"Karl Friedrich Schinkel was a prominent German architect, city planner, and painter, known for his contributions to neoclassical and romantic architecture in the 19th century. His works include iconic buildings such as the Altes Museum in Berlin and the Konzerthaus Berlin. Schinkel's architectural designs often featured classical elements and were marked by their elegance and harmony.","observation":"These images use richly painterly, highly detailed fantasy landscapes with monumental classical ruins embedded in vast jungle ravines and cliffside environments. Strong foreground shadows frame luminous openings, waterfalls and mist create depth, and the cinematic scale is reinforced by tiny figures, towering architecture, and dramatic blue-green or warm-gold atmospheric lighting."},{"id":"steve-epting","name":"Steve Epting","cat":"illustrators","en":"Steve Epting","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-epting.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-epting","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","dark-red","bone-white"],"intro":"Steve Epting is an American comic book artist known for his work on titles such as \"Captain America\" and \"The Avengers.\" His realistic and detailed style has made significant contributions to the superhero genre, blending traditional comic book aesthetics with a modern, cinematic approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, energetic brushwork to model realistic faces and figures with strongly expressive gestures and expressions. Deep shadows, near-black grounds, and blood-red accents create a dark, moody supernatural atmosphere, while tight portrait framing gives the scenes an intense theatrical presence."},{"id":"sue-reno","name":"Sue Reno","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sue Reno","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sue-reno.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sue-reno","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","patterns","fine-lines","painterly","metallic","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-ochre","silver","rust","orange","muted-blue","blue"],"intro":"Sue Reno is a contemporary textile artist known for her intricate and nature-inspired works. Her art often incorporates elements of quilting, embroidery, and mixed media, creating pieces that reflect her deep connection to the natural world.","observation":"The style combines richly textured painting with intricate botanical and architectural imagery, layering representational scenes over abstract patchwork and decorative motifs. Vivid teal, orange, coral, and violet hues are punctuated by reflective gold accents, while fine organic linework and collage-like divisions create an ornate, densely surfaced composition."},{"id":"tony-oursler","name":"Tony Oursler","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tony Oursler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tony-oursler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tony-oursler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","portraits","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","ochre","deep-red","muted-cyan","vivid-red"],"intro":"Tony Oursler is an American multimedia and installation artist known for his innovative use of video projections and sculptural elements. His work often explores themes of technology, identity, and the human psyche, creating immersive environments that challenge traditional perceptions of art and reality.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped, highly expressive faces and head-like forms rendered with theatrical colored illumination, deep shadows, and strong internal glow. Surreal distortions, oversized spherical forms, glittering textures, and projected geometric light create an uncanny, dreamlike visual language with a cinematic intensity."},{"id":"maximilien-luce","name":"Maximilien Luce","cat":"painters","en":"Maximilien Luce","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maximilien-luce.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maximilien-luce","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["muted-blue","silver","dark-blue","brown","charcoal","ochre"],"intro":"Maximilien Luce was a French Neo-Impressionist painter known for his pointillist technique and depictions of urban and rural life. Born in 1858, Luce was part of the post-impressionist movement, contributing significantly to the development of modern art with his vibrant use of color and light.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses visible, finely varied brushstrokes to build sunlit coastal landscapes, harbors, villages, and waterways. Saturated blues, greens, coral reds, and warm yellows are broken into lively patches, with reflective water, atmospheric skies, and active outdoor scenes giving the pictures an energetic impression of light and movement."},{"id":"robin-moline","name":"Robin Moline","cat":"illustrators","en":"Robin Moline","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robin-moline.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robin-moline","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","motion","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","grey","pale-yellow","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Robin Moline is an illustrator known for her detailed and imaginative work, often featuring elements of fantasy and surrealism. Her art is characterized by a playful yet precise approach, blending realistic details with whimsical themes. Moline's work has been featured in various publications and projects, showcasing her ability to create captivating visual narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly visible brushwork builds expansive landscapes from swirling strokes, dense cloud forms, and strongly modeled scenery. Saturated blues, oranges, and golds, luminous atmospheric effects, and energetic curved marks give the scenes a fantastical, grand, dreamlike intensity."},{"id":"michael-creese","name":"Michael Creese","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Creese","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-creese.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-creese","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","beige","muted-blue","red","deep-blue","yellow"],"intro":"Michael Creese is an artist known for his vibrant and expressive paintings, often characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions. His work typically features a blend of realism and abstraction, creating a unique visual experience that captures the viewer's attention.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces are built from vigorous, visible paint strokes and raised impasto, with facial features emerging through layered, fragmented planes. Saturated blues, oranges, reds, yellows, and greens create an intense expressive effect, reinforced by strong dark-light contrasts and recurring close-up portrait framing."},{"id":"robert-irwin","name":"Robert Irwin","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Robert Irwin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-irwin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-irwin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","minimalist","realistic","scenes","urban","glow","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","brown","white","bone-white","silver"],"intro":"Robert Irwin is an influential American artist known for his pioneering work in the Light and Space movement. His art focuses on altering the perception of space and light, often using minimalistic and abstract forms. Irwin's work has significantly impacted contemporary art, particularly in how artists and audiences perceive and interact with art installations.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic architectural photography with sparse monumental interiors, repeated vertical light bars, and strong geometric order. Restrained neutral tones, subtle teal accents, luminous fixtures, polished-floor reflections, and large areas of negative space create a quiet, contemplative atmosphere."},{"id":"olek","name":"Olek","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Olek","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olek.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olek","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["vivid-red","muted-ochre","blue","brown","pink","deep-red","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Olek is a Polish-born artist known for her innovative use of crochet and textile art. She is recognized for transforming everyday objects and spaces with vibrant, large-scale crocheted installations. Her work often explores themes of identity, community, and feminism, using yarn as a medium to create immersive environments.","observation":"The style combines intensely saturated color with densely layered textile surfaces, using yarn, fringe, pom-poms, and oversized floral forms to turn human figures into tactile sculptural costumes. Repeatedly staged in colorful urban settings and graphic studio-like backdrops, the images feel theatrical, fantastical, and highly decorative, with strong outlines and poster-like color blocks."},{"id":"aristide-maillol","name":"Aristide Maillol","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Aristide Maillol","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aristide-maillol.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aristide-maillol","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-green","grey","ochre","bone-white","dark-blue"],"intro":"Aristide Maillol was a French sculptor and painter known for his classical approach to the human form, particularly in sculpture. Born in 1861, Maillol's work is characterized by its simplicity and focus on the beauty of the human body. His sculptures often depict serene, contemplative figures, and he played a significant role in the transition from 19th-century academic art to modernism.","observation":"The style presents solitary female figures in carefully composed natural settings, rendered with visible fine painterly texture and softly modelled forms. Muted greens, blues, ochres, and dusk tones create a contemplative, dreamy atmosphere, while detailed foliage, water, fabric, and grain-like surfaces give the scenes tactile richness."},{"id":"mike-campau","name":"Mike Campau","cat":"various-artists","en":"Mike Campau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-campau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-campau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","characters","glow","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","dark"],"colours":["muted-cyan","black","brown","dark-cyan","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Mike Campau is a contemporary digital artist known for his innovative use of technology in creating visually striking compositions. His work often blends elements of photography, digital illustration, and 3D modeling to produce surreal and fantastical imagery. Campau's art explores themes of modernity, technology, and the human experience, often incorporating a sense of narrative and emotion.","observation":"Across all four images, familiar subjects are rendered as highly detailed, solid mechanical or composite forms caught in dramatic states of rupture, impact, or submersion. Strong directional lighting, reflective metallic surfaces, saturated red and teal palettes, and dark backgrounds create a cinematic science-fiction look with intense motion and spectacle."},{"id":"hopare","name":"Hopare","cat":"street-artists","en":"Hopare","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hopare.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hopare","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","silver","beige","grey","red","blue","rust"],"intro":"Hopare is a contemporary French street artist known for his dynamic and colorful murals that blend geometric patterns with expressive portraiture. His work often explores themes of identity and emotion, using a vibrant palette and intricate line work to create striking visual narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, large human faces are built from dense, visible brushwork and energetic fine and bold lines, with features fractured into layered planes. Saturated pinks, reds, teals, oranges, and blues create a vivid, high-contrast palette, while splatters, drips, and gestural marks push the portraits toward an expressive surrealism."},{"id":"emory-douglas","name":"Emory Douglas","cat":"various-artists","en":"Emory Douglas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emory-douglas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emory-douglas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","ink"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","light-orange","vivid-red","green","light-yellow"],"intro":"Emory Douglas is an influential American artist and graphic designer known for his work as the Minister of Culture for the Black Panther Party. His art played a crucial role in the visual identity of the movement, using bold imagery and powerful messages to communicate themes of social justice and empowerment.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses bold graphic portraiture with heavy black ink contours, dense hatching, and simplified flat color blocks on visibly distressed paper. Saturated red, teal, yellow, blue, and cream create high contrast, while repeated poster-like framing, targets, rays, and patterned garments reinforce a retro screenprint character."},{"id":"boris-grigoriev","name":"Boris Grigoriev","cat":"painters","en":"Boris Grigoriev","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/boris-grigoriev.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/boris-grigoriev","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["black","ochre","dark-brown","brown","dark-red","bone-white"],"intro":"Boris Grigoriev is a renowned Russian painter known for his expressive and often satirical depictions of Russian society in the early 20th century. His works are characterized by a unique blend of realism and expressionism, capturing the psychological depth and complexity of his subjects. Grigoriev's art often explores themes of identity, society, and the human condition, making him a significant figure in the Russian avant-garde movement.","observation":"Across the sheet, carefully observed faces and figures are rendered with visible, directional brushwork, tactile paint texture, and finely described features. Saturated reds, deep greens, creams, and blacks create strong contrast, while tightly cropped groupings, patterned clothing, and angular interiors give the portraits a dense, graphic presence."},{"id":"julian-beever","name":"Julian Beever","cat":"various-artists","en":"Julian Beever","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julian-beever.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julian-beever","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["charcoal","beige","brown","muted-teal","black","light-teal","deep-red"],"intro":"Julian Beever is a British artist known for his pavement chalk drawings, which create striking three-dimensional illusions. His work often transforms flat surfaces into seemingly tangible objects or scenes, captivating passersby with their realism and playful distortion of perspective. Beever's art has been featured in various public spaces around the world, making him a prominent figure in the street art community.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic street environments and working people are transformed by richly painted, illusionistic scenes that appear to spill into pits, waterways, and pavement. Fine, visible brushwork, saturated turquoise and rust tones, strong light-dark separation, and dense environmental detail create an expressive trompe-l'œil effect with surreal spatial disruptions."},{"id":"cerith-wyn-evans","name":"Cerith Wyn Evans","cat":"various-artists","en":"Cerith Wyn Evans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cerith-wyn-evans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cerith-wyn-evans","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","muted-brown","brown","orange","silver"],"intro":"Cerith Wyn Evans is a contemporary artist known for his conceptual and installation art, often exploring the interplay of light and space. His work frequently incorporates elements of language, sound, and motion, creating immersive experiences that challenge perception and provoke thought.","observation":"The style presents grand architectural interiors as cinematic, realistic scenes dominated by elaborate chandeliers and suspended, glowing wire-like light forms. Rich ornamental detail, deep warm shadows, reflective floors, and occasional cool daylight create a moody, monumental atmosphere, with small human silhouettes emphasizing the scale."},{"id":"michael-page","name":"Michael Page","cat":"painters","en":"Michael Page","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-page.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-page","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","glow","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","red","charcoal","muted-rust","pink"],"intro":"Michael Page is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and surreal paintings that explore themes of consciousness and the human experience. His work often features dreamlike landscapes and intricate patterns, blending elements of fantasy and reality.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly layered, flowing paintwork with densely packed fantastical vegetation, cloud forms, and crystalline organic shapes. Saturated pinks, oranges, blues, and turquoises create luminous contrasts, while glowing internal light and fluid distortions make the landscapes feel dreamlike and surreal."},{"id":"giovanni-domenico-tiepolo","name":"Giovanni Domenico Tiepolo","cat":"painters","en":"Giovanni Domenico Tiepolo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giovanni-domenico-tiepolo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giovanni-domenico-tiepolo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","orange","dark-brown","muted-blue","grey","red"],"intro":"Giovanni Domenico Tiepolo was an Italian painter and printmaker, born in 1727 in Venice. He was the son of the renowned artist Giovanni Battista Tiepolo and followed in his father's footsteps, contributing significantly to the Rococo movement. Domenico is known for his frescoes and genre scenes, often depicting lively and imaginative narratives with a distinct Venetian flair.","observation":"Across all four renders, figures and architectural forms are built from highly visible, broad, broken brushstrokes with a tactile, layered paint surface. The palette favors warm ochres, browns, muted reds and blues, while strong light-dark contrasts and expressive poses give the portraits and group scenes a theatrical, weighty presence."},{"id":"hans-hartung","name":"Hans Hartung","cat":"painters","en":"Hans Hartung","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-hartung.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-hartung","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink","geometric"],"colours":["black","bone-white","deep-blue","light-yellow","grey","dark-ochre"],"intro":"Hans Hartung is a renowned German-French painter known for his abstract expressionist works. Born in 1904, Hartung became a prominent figure in the post-war art scene, celebrated for his dynamic brushwork and innovative techniques. His art is characterized by bold, sweeping gestures and a focus on the emotional impact of color and form.","observation":"Across all four panels, saturated blue, yellow, black, and cream are arranged in forceful abstract blocks and sweeping arcs. Thick gestural marks, dry-brush fringes, scraped-looking texture, and dense linear hatching create a high-contrast, graphic surface that balances flat colour fields with energetic painted strokes."},{"id":"will-barnet","name":"Will Barnet","cat":"painters","en":"Will Barnet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/will-barnet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/will-barnet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","landscapes","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","charcoal","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Will Barnet is an influential American artist known for his contributions to modernist painting. His work often explores themes of family and introspection, characterized by a unique blend of abstraction and realism.","observation":"The style combines flat, poster-like shapes and finely drawn contours with visible cross-grained, tactile paint texture. Restrained earth, black, cream, and blue tones create a somber atmosphere, while isolated figures, bare trees, and carefully arranged interiors produce a quiet, contemplative mood."},{"id":"joan-eardley","name":"Joan Eardley","cat":"painters","en":"Joan Eardley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joan-eardley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joan-eardley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["grey","brown","black","muted-ochre","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Joan Eardley was a renowned Scottish painter known for her expressive and emotive depictions of urban and rural life in mid-20th century Scotland. Her work often focused on the landscapes and people of Scotland, capturing the essence of everyday life with a unique blend of realism and abstraction. Eardley's paintings are celebrated for their bold use of color and texture, reflecting the rugged beauty and social realities of her surroundings.","observation":"Across all four views, the city is rendered with visibly built-up paint, broad gestural strokes, scraped marks, and fine drawn lines that give the architecture a worn, tactile surface. Muted blue-grey, ochre, brown, and charcoal tones dominate, with selective rust-red and window-light accents creating expressive, brooding urban scenes."},{"id":"massimiliano-fuksas","name":"Massimiliano Fuksas","cat":"architects","en":"Massimiliano Fuksas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/massimiliano-fuksas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/massimiliano-fuksas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","glow","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["brown","silver","grey","black","muted-blue","beige"],"intro":"Massimiliano Fuksas is an Italian architect known for his innovative and bold architectural designs. His work often features futuristic and organic forms, pushing the boundaries of modern architecture with a focus on fluidity and dynamic structures.","observation":"The style presents photorealistic, cinematic architectural visions built from immense sculptural forms, translucent membranes, glass, and branching organic frameworks. Carefully composed urban and interior scenes use daylight, warm interior glow, dramatic scale, and intricate geometric structures to create a futuristic yet plausible atmosphere."},{"id":"eddie-colla","name":"Eddie Colla","cat":"street-artists","en":"Eddie Colla","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eddie-colla.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eddie-colla","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","ink"],"colours":["black","light-orange","muted-ochre","brown","muted-blue","red","blue"],"intro":"Eddie Colla is a contemporary American street artist known for his provocative and thought-provoking works that often explore themes of identity, technology, and modern society. His art frequently appears in urban environments, utilizing a mix of traditional and digital techniques to create striking visual narratives.","observation":"The style combines tightly cropped, expressive portraiture with thick, visible paint strokes, rough textile and paper surfaces, and energetic ink-like marks. Saturated blue and red accents cut through earthy neutrals, while collage fragments, splatters, stenciling, and high contrast create a dense, raw mixed-media appearance."},{"id":"bill-brauer","name":"Bill Brauer","cat":"painters","en":"Bill Brauer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-brauer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-brauer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","vivid-red","dark-red","orange","blue"],"intro":"Bill Brauer was an American painter known for his sensual and evocative depictions of the female form, often set against richly colored and dramatic backgrounds. His work is characterized by a blend of realism and fantasy, capturing moments of intimacy and emotion with a painterly touch. Brauer's art often explores themes of beauty, mystery, and the human experience, drawing inspiration from classical and romantic traditions.","observation":"These images use visible, directional paint strokes and simplified, graphic forms to depict intensely posed figures and intimate encounters. Saturated reds and blues are set against deep near-black shadows, producing a high-contrast, moody theatrical effect with recurring vintage clothing and close portrait-like framing."},{"id":"carrie-mae-weems","name":"Carrie Mae Weems","cat":"photographers","en":"Carrie Mae Weems","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carrie-mae-weems.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carrie-mae-weems","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["ornate","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","still-life","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","symmetry"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","beige"],"intro":"Carrie Mae Weems is an influential American artist known for her work in photography, video, and installation, exploring themes of race, gender, and identity. Her work often addresses the African American experience, using storytelling and historical references to provoke thought and dialogue.","observation":"A monochrome, high-contrast photographic style stages elegant figures and still lifes in cavernous, formal interiors. Dramatic pools of light, deep shadows, chessboard floors, chandeliers, framed portraits, and elaborate furnishings create a dark, theatrical atmosphere with strong symmetry and sculptural compositions."},{"id":"lawrence-alma-tadema","name":"Lawrence Alma-Tadema","cat":"painters","en":"Lawrence Alma-Tadema","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lawrence-alma-tadema.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lawrence-alma-tadema","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Lawrence Alma-Tadema was a Dutch-born British painter known for his depictions of luxurious domestic life in the Roman Empire. His works are characterized by meticulous detail, classical themes, and a romanticized view of antiquity, making him a prominent figure in the Victorian art scene.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to render elegant female figures, elaborate clothing, jewelry, furnishings, and architectural settings with finely observed material detail. Warm reds, creams, turquoise, and deep browns create a vivid, opulent palette, while composed seated poses and ornamental interiors give the scenes a classical, luxurious character."},{"id":"phoebe-anna-traquair","name":"Phoebe Anna Traquair","cat":"painters","en":"Phoebe Anna Traquair","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/phoebe-anna-traquair.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/phoebe-anna-traquair","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["ochre","charcoal","dark-brown","light-orange","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Phoebe Anna Traquair was a Scottish artist and illustrator known for her contributions to the Arts and Crafts Movement and her work in mural painting, embroidery, and book illumination during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. Her work often features intricate detailing, rich colors, and a blend of mythological and religious themes.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, painterly portraiture with densely ornamented floral backgrounds, patterned fabrics, and decorative surface detail. Jewel-like reds, blues, greens, and ochres create a vivid, high-contrast tapestry, while close cropping and intertwined figures give the compositions an intimate, tableau-like character."},{"id":"john-cassavetes","name":"John Cassavetes","cat":"filmmakers","en":"John Cassavetes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-cassavetes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-cassavetes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","red","silver","charcoal","orange"],"intro":"John Cassavetes was an influential American filmmaker, actor, and screenwriter known for his pioneering work in independent cinema. He is celebrated for his raw, realistic portrayal of human emotions and relationships, often exploring themes of love, identity, and personal struggle. Cassavetes's films are characterized by their improvisational style, intimate storytelling, and focus on character development.","observation":"The style centers on intense, tightly cropped male portraits with serious expressions, deep shadows, and strongly controlled contrast. It combines moody, warm cinematic photography with an expressive painted treatment, including visible broad brush marks in the painterly variant, while retaining recurring facial detail and dark backgrounds."},{"id":"alex-schomburg","name":"Alex Schomburg","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alex Schomburg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-schomburg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-schomburg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","muted-brown","red","charcoal","orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"Alex Schomburg is a renowned illustrator known for his work in science fiction and comic book art during the mid-20th century. His illustrations are celebrated for their intricate details, vibrant colors, and imaginative scenes, often depicting futuristic and fantastical worlds. Schomburg's contributions to the genre have left a lasting impact on the visual language of science fiction.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible broad paint strokes with densely detailed, dramatic scenes and strongly modeled figures. Saturated orange, red, blue, and green dominate with sharp dark-light contrasts, merging fantastical monsters and heroic characters with retro-futurist space imagery and monumental landscapes."},{"id":"kees-scherer","name":"Kees Scherer","cat":"photographers","en":"Kees Scherer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kees-scherer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kees-scherer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","backlighting","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Kees Scherer is a renowned Dutch photographer known for his evocative black and white images capturing post-war European life. His work often focuses on urban scenes, highlighting the everyday moments and human presence within cityscapes. Scherer is celebrated for his ability to convey emotion and narrative through his photography, making significant contributions to documentary and street photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep silhouettes, hard tonal separation, and bright reflective highlights. Fog softens distant architecture and waterways, while solitary figures, wet cobblestones, canals, bridges, and windmills create a brooding cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"ralph-gibson","name":"Ralph Gibson","cat":"photographers","en":"Ralph Gibson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ralph-gibson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ralph-gibson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Ralph Gibson is an American photographer known for his stark and surreal black-and-white images. His work often explores themes of abstraction, surrealism, and the human form, characterized by high contrast and a minimalist aesthetic. Gibson's photography is celebrated for its unique ability to blend the real with the abstract, creating a mysterious and introspective atmosphere.","observation":"A monochrome portrait style built from tightly cropped faces, stark tonal separation, and dramatic directional lighting. Deep shadows obscure parts of the subjects while bright highlights isolate eyes, lips, noses, and cheekbones, creating a cinematic and confrontational mood."},{"id":"haas-brothers","name":"Haas Brothers","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Haas Brothers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/haas-brothers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/haas-brothers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","animals","scenes","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["silver","white","beige","dark-brown","dark-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Haas Brothers is a collaborative design duo known for their innovative and whimsical approach to art and design. Founded by twins Simon and Nikolai Haas, the brothers have gained recognition for their unique blend of fine art, design, and craftsmanship. Their work often features fantastical elements, vibrant colors, and intricate details, drawing inspiration from nature, mythology, and contemporary culture.","observation":"The style presents surreal animal-like figures and furniture as highly tactile sculptural objects, covered in dense shaggy fur and arranged in clean studio interiors. Saturated pinks, reds, blues, and browns contrast with pale backdrops, while floral upholstery and poppy arrangements add ornate decorative accents to the playful scenes."},{"id":"haider-ackermann","name":"Haider Ackermann","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Haider Ackermann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/haider-ackermann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/haider-ackermann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","dark-teal","brown","grey"],"intro":"Haider Ackermann is a Colombian-born fashion designer known for his avant-garde and sophisticated designs. He has made a significant impact on the fashion industry with his unique approach to tailoring and his ability to blend different cultural influences into his work. Ackermann's designs are often characterized by their elegant draping, rich textures, and a distinctive use of color.","observation":"The style presents realistic fashion-editorial portraits with severe expressions, sculptural layers, wrapped fabrics, and exaggerated silhouettes. Restrained blacks, greys, cream, and deep green are shaped by strong directional lighting and shadow, producing a stark, cinematic runway atmosphere."},{"id":"fritz-scholder","name":"Fritz Scholder","cat":"painters","en":"Fritz Scholder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fritz-scholder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fritz-scholder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","dark"],"colours":["dark-blue","vivid-red","black","pink","dark-indigo"],"intro":"Fritz Scholder is a renowned American painter known for his impactful and contemporary depictions of Native American subjects. He challenged traditional representations by blending elements of pop art and expressionism, creating a unique style that brought attention to indigenous identity and cultural issues. Scholder's work often features bold colors and dynamic compositions, making significant contributions to modern art.","observation":"The style combines rough, visibly brushed paint with graphic black contours, simplified silhouettes, and aggressively saturated blue, red, orange, and purple fields. Cropped warrior portraits and a mounted figure are rendered with stark tonal contrast, broad gestural marks, and an expressive, poster-like intensity."},{"id":"peter-eisenman","name":"Peter Eisenman","cat":"architects","en":"Peter Eisenman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-eisenman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-eisenman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","scenes","urban","flat-color","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","sci-fi","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","blue","deep-red"],"intro":"Peter Eisenman is an influential American architect known for his deconstructivist approach to architecture. His work often challenges conventional architectural forms, emphasizing fragmentation, complexity, and the interplay of space and structure. Eisenman has been a pivotal figure in architectural theory, contributing significantly to the discourse on modern and postmodern architecture.","observation":"The style presents monumental architectural environments as sharply geometric, sculptural assemblages of stacked planes, cantilevers, voids, and stairways. Most renders use stark black-and-white tonal separation with hard directional light, while one introduces saturated blue, red, and pink planes; tiny figures provide scale within highly detailed, futuristic urban scenes."},{"id":"thierry-mugler","name":"Thierry Mugler","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Thierry Mugler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thierry-mugler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thierry-mugler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","still-life","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","dark","geometric"],"colours":["silver","black","blue","charcoal","grey","ochre"],"intro":"Thierry Mugler was a renowned French fashion designer known for his bold and innovative designs that often incorporated elements of fantasy and futurism. His work was characterized by sharp silhouettes, dramatic structures, and a distinct sense of theatricality, making him a pivotal figure in the fashion world from the late 20th century onwards.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic luxury-product photography with sculptural, geometric forms in glass, crystal, lacquer, and metallic gold. Dramatic directional lighting, deep shadows, vivid blue and gold accents, and sharp specular highlights create a futuristic, glamorous, high-contrast presentation."},{"id":"jean-metzinger","name":"Jean Metzinger","cat":"painters","en":"Jean Metzinger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-metzinger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-metzinger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","floral","still-life","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","vivid-red","pale-orange","grey","deep-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Jean Metzinger is a French painter and theorist who was a prominent figure in the development of Cubism. Born in 1883, Metzinger was known for his innovative approach to form and perspective, contributing significantly to the avant-garde art movements of the early 20th century. His works often explored the fragmentation of objects and the interplay of multiple viewpoints, aligning with the Cubist movement's principles.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable faces, figures, plants, flowers, and still-life objects are broken into dense angular planes and overlapping geometric shapes. Saturated reds, blues, greens, oranges, and purples sit in crisp color blocks, while fine linear contours and visible canvas-like brush texture give the surfaces a hand-painted, tactile finish."},{"id":"alan-kitching","name":"Alan Kitching","cat":"designers","en":"Alan Kitching","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-kitching.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-kitching","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","ornate","letters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["black","bone-white","vivid-red","cyan","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Alan Kitching is a renowned British typographer and graphic designer known for his innovative use of letterpress printing. He has significantly influenced the field of design with his bold, expressive typographic compositions and has collaborated with numerous high-profile clients and institutions.","observation":"The style is a forceful abstract graphic collage built from oversized letterforms, geometric blocks, and tightly packed layers. Saturated red, black, blue, yellow, and cream create stark contrast, while distressed ink, scratches, rough edges, and uneven printed textures give the otherwise flat shapes a tactile handmade surface."},{"id":"frederick-mccubbin","name":"Frederick McCubbin","cat":"painters","en":"Frederick McCubbin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederick-mccubbin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederick-mccubbin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","dark-ochre","grey","muted-ochre","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Frederick McCubbin was an influential Australian painter and a key figure in the Heidelberg School, known for his evocative landscapes and depictions of rural life in Australia. His work often captures the essence of the Australian bush and the pioneering spirit of the time, using a distinctive impressionistic style.","observation":"These landscapes are rendered with visible, delicate brushwork, layered foliage, and softly blended atmospheric distance. Tall trees, winding paths, scattered wildflowers, and tiny human figures create expansive, tranquil scenes with muted greens, browns, lavender-blue haze, and luminous filtered light."},{"id":"john-gutmann","name":"John Gutmann","cat":"photographers","en":"John Gutmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-gutmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-gutmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["grey","black","beige","brown","white"],"intro":"John Gutmann was a German-born American photographer known for his work documenting American life during the 1930s and 1940s. His photography often captured the vibrancy and diversity of urban environments, focusing on the cultural and social aspects of everyday life. Gutmann's work is celebrated for its unique perspective and ability to convey the essence of the American experience during a transformative period in history.","observation":"The style uses monochrome, high-contrast photographic imagery with dramatic directional light, selective focus, and richly textured shadows. It consistently combines retro fashion portraiture with candid, cinematic scenes and expressive posed movement in urban and domestic settings."},{"id":"albert-renger-patzsch","name":"Albert Renger-Patzsch","cat":"photographers","en":"Albert Renger-Patzsch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-renger-patzsch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-renger-patzsch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","geometric","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","bone-white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Albert Renger-Patzsch was a German photographer known for his role in the New Objectivity movement. His work focused on capturing the essence of objects and landscapes with sharp clarity and detail, emphasizing their inherent beauty and structure. Renger-Patzsch's photography often featured industrial subjects, plants, and everyday objects, presented in a straightforward and unembellished manner.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome photography with deep shadows, bright atmospheric backgrounds, and a coarse grain that gives the scenes a period-industrial character. Monumental pipes, towers, brickwork, stairs, and silhouetted pedestrians are arranged in strongly geometric, cinematic compositions, often softened by fog or haze."},{"id":"serge-attukwei-clottey","name":"Serge Attukwei Clottey","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Serge Attukwei Clottey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/serge-attukwei-clottey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/serge-attukwei-clottey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","vivid-colors","symmetry"],"colours":["vivid-ochre","ochre","dark-brown","orange","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Serge Attukwei Clottey is a contemporary Ghanaian artist known for his innovative use of recycled materials to explore themes of identity, culture, and environmental issues. His work often involves transforming everyday objects into powerful visual statements, reflecting on the socio-political landscape of Ghana and beyond.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic fashion portraiture with an intensely saturated ochre-yellow environment built from layered, block-like textured surfaces. Elaborate garments and wall structures feel sculptural and tactile, while centered figures, frontal portraits, and carefully arranged architectural backdrops give the images a composed editorial quality."},{"id":"thomas-gainsborough","name":"Thomas Gainsborough","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Gainsborough","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-gainsborough.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-gainsborough","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-ochre","grey","beige","rust"],"intro":"Thomas Gainsborough was an 18th-century English painter known for his portraits and landscapes. He was a leading figure in the development of British art, celebrated for his ability to capture the elegance and grace of his subjects. Gainsborough's work is characterized by its delicate brushwork, rich color palette, and the harmonious integration of figures within natural settings.","observation":"Across the four renders, the style combines richly visible painterly brushwork with carefully modeled faces, elaborate clothing, and densely layered woodland surroundings. Subdued, earthy shadows contrast with selective blue, coral, and cream garments, while directional light and deep framing create a dramatic, classical portrait atmosphere."},{"id":"antoni-tapies","name":"Antoni Tapies","cat":"painters","en":"Antoni Tapies","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antoni-tapies.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antoni-tapies","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["black","orange","rust","bone-white","brown","red"],"intro":"Antoni Tapies is a renowned Spanish painter, sculptor, and art theorist, known for his contributions to the abstract and informalist art movements. Born in 1923 in Barcelona, Tapies became a leading figure in the post-war European avant-garde scene. His work often explores themes of materiality, spirituality, and existentialism, utilizing a unique blend of mixed media and textural surfaces.","observation":"The style is an abstract, highly gestural painting language built from broad black and red marks over distressed earth-toned grounds. Heavy brushwork, drips, scraping, drawn lines, layered panels, and collage-like joins create a tactile, weathered surface, while stark geometric blocks and strong tonal contrast give the compositions their force."},{"id":"paul-outerbridge","name":"Paul Outerbridge","cat":"photographers","en":"Paul Outerbridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-outerbridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-outerbridge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","retro","collage"],"colours":["muted-cyan","black","red","dark-brown","muted-yellow","ochre"],"intro":"Paul Outerbridge is a pioneering American photographer known for his innovative use of color photography in the early 20th century. He was a significant figure in modernist photography, blending commercial and fine art elements. Outerbridge's work often explored themes of glamour, eroticism, and the surreal, making him a key influencer in both fashion and advertising photography.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed photographic portraiture with vivid, slightly aged color, hard directional lighting, and deep graphic shadows. It uses surreal editorial collage compositions, pairing fashion figures with oversized domestic objects, theatrical hats, drapery, and dislocated interior fragments."},{"id":"herakut","name":"Herakut","cat":"street-artists","en":"Herakut","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herakut.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herakut","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Herakut is a German street art duo known for their unique blend of graffiti and fine art. Their work often features expressive characters and narratives that explore themes of identity and emotion. Herakut's art is recognized for its detailed and textured style, combining elements of fantasy and realism.","observation":"The style combines close, tightly cropped portraiture with expressive, finely drawn linework and visibly layered paint, giving faces, hair, clothing, and animal fur a tactile, weathered surface. Muted blue-grey, brown, and rust tones are punctuated by strong shadows and red accents, while overlapping figures and uncanny human-animal pairings create a tense, surreal mood."},{"id":"edward-henry-potthast","name":"Edward Henry Potthast","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Henry Potthast","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-henry-potthast.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-henry-potthast","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["grey","muted-blue","bone-white","brown","charcoal","deep-red"],"intro":"Edward Henry Potthast was an American Impressionist painter known for his vibrant beach scenes and depictions of leisure life. Born in 1857, he became renowned for his ability to capture light and movement, often painting families enjoying the seaside. His works are characterized by their lively brushwork and vivid color palettes, contributing to the American Impressionist movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible oil-paint brushwork and luminous, sunlit coastal scenes with reflective water, rocks, and loosely rendered figures in light summer clothing. Forms remain realistically readable but are built from expressive broken strokes, broad tonal patches, and restrained blue, cream, green, and warm accent colors."},{"id":"mert-otsamo","name":"Mert Otsamo","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Mert Otsamo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mert-otsamo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mert-otsamo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","realistic","fashion","portraits","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["black","deep-red","light-blue","dark-blue","grey","teal"],"intro":"Mert Otsamo is a renowned fashion designer known for his innovative and bold designs that often push the boundaries of traditional fashion. His work is characterized by a unique blend of modern aesthetics and intricate detailing, making him a prominent figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses highly realistic editorial portrait photography with tightly cropped faces, controlled studio posing, and theatrical fashion styling. Saturated color treatments, stark tonal separation, luminous colored light, and surreal accessories create an intense, cinematic mood."},{"id":"lee-bogle","name":"Lee Bogle","cat":"painters","en":"Lee Bogle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-bogle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-bogle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-brown","ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Lee Bogle is an American artist known for his evocative and emotive portraits, often depicting Native American themes and figures. His work is characterized by a deep sensitivity to the human form and spirit, capturing the essence of his subjects with a painterly touch and a focus on emotional depth.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visibly brushed surfaces with tightly cropped portraits of women and animals, emphasizing hair, fur, feathers, and rough fabric. Its subdued earth tones, deep shadows, and expressive faces create a dark, intimate, quasi-mythic atmosphere with a classical fantasy sensibility."},{"id":"valentino","name":"Valentino","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Valentino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/valentino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/valentino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","dark-red","white","muted-rust","vivid-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Valentino is an iconic Italian fashion designer known for his luxurious and elegant creations. He founded the Valentino brand, which is synonymous with high fashion and sophisticated style. His work is characterized by exquisite craftsmanship, attention to detail, and a timeless aesthetic that has influenced the fashion industry for decades.","observation":"The style combines fashion-editorial portraiture with visibly painterly rendering: loose, expressive brushwork overlays carefully structured figures, faces, and elaborate garments. It favors sculptural couture silhouettes, dense floral and textile detail, saturated reds and pinks, and restrained studio-like backgrounds that keep attention on the clothing."},{"id":"stephen-darbishire","name":"Stephen Darbishire","cat":"painters","en":"Stephen Darbishire","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-darbishire.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-darbishire","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","landscapes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","light-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","beige","grey","muted-orange","silver","red"],"intro":"Stephen Darbishire is an English painter known for his idyllic depictions of the English countryside and domestic interiors. His works often capture the serene beauty of rural life, characterized by a delicate interplay of light and shadow, and a rich, textured use of color. Darbishire's paintings are celebrated for their ability to evoke a sense of nostalgia and tranquility, drawing viewers into a world of pastoral charm and simplicity.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly observed cottage interiors open onto bright rolling countryside, with flowers, lace, books, tea settings, and wooden or wicker furniture densely arranged around the windows. The style combines realistic illustrative structure with visible fine painterly strokes, crisp small details, saturated garden colors, and warm sunlight that gives the rooms a luminous, welcoming atmosphere."},{"id":"sonia-rykiel","name":"Sonia Rykiel","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Sonia Rykiel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sonia-rykiel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sonia-rykiel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","white","deep-red","beige","vivid-red"],"intro":"Sonia Rykiel was a renowned French fashion designer known for her distinctive knitwear and bold, feminine designs. She founded her own label in 1968, becoming a prominent figure in the fashion industry with her innovative approach to women's clothing. Rykiel was celebrated for her use of vibrant colors, stripes, and playful patterns, which became her signature style.","observation":"The style combines tightly framed fashion portraits with richly tactile rendering, moving between crisp photographic realism and visibly brushed illustration. Strong black, red, and cream contrasts, direct gazes, dramatic cropping, and highly legible fabric and hair textures give the sheet an intense editorial character."},{"id":"mikhael-subotzky","name":"Mikhael Subotzky","cat":"photographers","en":"Mikhael Subotzky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mikhael-subotzky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mikhael-subotzky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","silver","muted-green","white","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Mikhael Subotzky is a South African photographer known for his work that often explores themes of social justice, identity, and the human condition. His photography is deeply rooted in the documentary tradition, capturing the complexities of post-apartheid South Africa. Subotzky's work is characterized by a strong narrative quality, often focusing on marginalized communities and urban landscapes.","observation":"The style is photographic and cinematic, combining intimate, emotionally charged portraits with solitary landscape scenes and strong visual storytelling. Muted teal, brown, and warm skin tones, pronounced grain, distressed print surfaces, deep shadows, and selective focus give the images the feel of aged documentary photographs reproduced in a worn photo book."},{"id":"ilse-bing","name":"Ilse Bing","cat":"photographers","en":"Ilse Bing","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ilse-bing.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ilse-bing","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["beige","black","brown","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Ilse Bing was a German-born photographer known for her pioneering work in the field of modernist photography. She gained prominence in the 1930s for her innovative use of the Leica camera, which allowed her to capture dynamic and spontaneous images. Bing's work is characterized by its experimental approach, often incorporating elements of surrealism and abstraction. Her photographs frequently explore themes of urban life, architecture, and the human form, reflecting the cultural and artistic movements of her time.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white street photography with intense sunlight, deep shadows, and figures frequently reduced to silhouettes. High overhead viewpoints, elongated shadows, grain, and moments of movement turn ordinary urban pavements into graphic, cinematic compositions."},{"id":"josef-koudelka","name":"Josef Koudelka","cat":"photographers","en":"Josef Koudelka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josef-koudelka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josef-koudelka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Josef Koudelka is a renowned Czech photographer known for his poignant black-and-white images that capture the essence of human experience and societal change. His work often focuses on themes of exile, identity, and the passage of time, reflecting the turbulent history of Eastern Europe during the 20th century.","observation":"A stark black-and-white photographic style uses heavy grain, deep shadows, bright overcast skies, and selective focus to create a bleak, filmic atmosphere. Repeated figures in dark period clothing move through damaged urban streets, with rubble, smoke, worn façades, and asymmetrical compositions reinforcing the sense of desolation and motion."},{"id":"stefan-sagmeister","name":"Stefan Sagmeister","cat":"designers","en":"Stefan Sagmeister","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stefan-sagmeister.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stefan-sagmeister","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","patterns","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["muted-ochre","black","muted-green","red","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Stefan Sagmeister is an Austrian graphic designer and typographer known for his innovative and provocative designs. He has worked with renowned clients such as The Rolling Stones, HBO, and the Guggenheim Museum, and is celebrated for his unique approach to typography and visual storytelling. Sagmeister's work often challenges conventional design norms, blending humor, emotion, and a distinct visual language.","observation":"This style combines highly saturated, sharply contrasting colors with large graphic forms, oversized typography, repeated patterns, and elaborate sculptural installations. It moves between carefully staged portraiture and immersive gallery scenes, using polished surfaces, bold geometry, and dense decorative detail for a playful, theatrical visual impact."},{"id":"eileen-agar","name":"Eileen Agar","cat":"various-artists","en":"Eileen Agar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eileen-agar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eileen-agar","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","animals","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-blue","grey","light-orange","rust","vivid-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Eileen Agar is a renowned British artist known for her contributions to the Surrealist movement. Born in 1899, she became a prominent figure in the 20th-century art scene, blending elements of abstraction and surrealism in her work. Agar's art often features a playful and imaginative use of forms, colors, and textures, reflecting her interest in both the natural world and the subconscious.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense abstract animal imagery with vividly colored geometric shapes, thick dark contours, and visibly tactile painted surfaces. Layered collage-like fragments, patterned marks, and flattened forms create an energetic, expressive composition in which birds, fish, eyes, and faces recur as decorative motifs."},{"id":"abraham-ortelius","name":"Abraham Ortelius","cat":"painters","en":"Abraham Ortelius","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abraham-ortelius.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abraham-ortelius","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","pale-yellow","charcoal","muted-ochre","dark-brown","black","rust"],"intro":"Abraham Ortelius was a Flemish cartographer and geographer, best known for creating the first modern atlas, the \"Theatrum Orbis Terrarum,\" in 1570. His work marked a significant advancement in the field of cartography during the Renaissance , combining scientific accuracy with artistic flair.","observation":"The style combines richly painted, finely drawn cartographic imagery with elaborate borders, cartouches, circular projections, and dense geographic detail. Muted teal, ochre, red, and parchment tones, fine linework, and carefully arranged symmetry create the appearance of an aged illustrated atlas, while the portrait shares the same textured, ornate historical treatment."},{"id":"frans-francken-the-younger","name":"Frans Francken the Younger","cat":"painters","en":"Frans Francken the Younger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frans-francken-the-younger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frans-francken-the-younger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","deep-red","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Frans Francken the Younger is a renowned Flemish painter from the late 16th to early 17th century, known for his detailed and imaginative works that often depicted religious and allegorical themes. He was a key figure in the Antwerp school and contributed significantly to the development of genre painting and cabinet pictures. His works are characterized by their intricate detail, vibrant color palettes, and complex compositions, often featuring a blend of religious and mythological subjects.","observation":"The style uses richly built-up paint, visible directional brushwork, and finely rendered faces, fabrics, fur, food, and metal objects. Dark, crowded interiors are punctuated by warm reds, ochres, and firelight, with expressive figures arranged in bustling narrative scenes."},{"id":"raf-simons","name":"Raf Simons","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Raf Simons","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raf-simons.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raf-simons","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["white","black","beige","brown","red","muted-blue","light-lime"],"intro":"Raf Simons is a renowned Belgian fashion designer known for his innovative and forward-thinking approach to fashion. He has held influential positions at major fashion houses such as Jil Sander , Dior, and Calvin Klein , where he has left a significant mark with his unique blend of youth culture and high fashion.","observation":"The style presents realistic editorial fashion imagery with sharply tailored, oversized silhouettes and expressive painted or floral garment surfaces. Strong contrast, saturated accent colors, and dramatic black foundations recur across studio, architectural, and runway settings, giving the series a bold avant-garde character."},{"id":"frederick-carl-frieseke","name":"Frederick Carl Frieseke","cat":"painters","en":"Frederick Carl Frieseke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederick-carl-frieseke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederick-carl-frieseke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","bone-white","dark-ochre","beige","dark-blue","red","olive","yellow","deep-blue"],"intro":"Frederick Carl Frieseke was an American Impressionist painter known for his light-filled depictions of women and domestic scenes. Born in 1874, Frieseke spent much of his career in France, where he became associated with the Giverny art colony. His work is characterized by a focus on light and color, often portraying serene and intimate moments.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly layered brushwork builds sunlit domestic and garden scenes filled with women, patterned dresses, flowers, furniture, and decorative objects. The style combines vivid yet natural color with fine, visible strokes, intricate fabric and foliage detail, and softly expressive figures arranged in elegant social vignettes."},{"id":"el-lissitzky","name":"El Lissitzky","cat":"various-artists","en":"El Lissitzky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/el-lissitzky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/el-lissitzky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","patterns","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","collage","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["cream","pale-orange","black","beige","vivid-red","red"],"intro":"El Lissitzky was a Russian artist, designer, photographer, typographer, and architect, known for his role in the Russian avant-garde movement and his influence on the Bauhaus and Constructivist movements. His work often featured geometric abstraction and was pivotal in the development of Suprematism.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses sharply bounded circles, bars, wedges, and translucent planes arranged in dynamic geometric compositions. Strong red, black, cream, and occasional gray shapes create high contrast, while worn paper grain and slightly distressed surfaces give the otherwise flat, graphic forms a retro printed character."},{"id":"emmet-gowin","name":"Emmet Gowin","cat":"photographers","en":"Emmet Gowin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emmet-gowin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emmet-gowin","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","white","grey","black","silver"],"intro":"Emmet Gowin is an American photographer known for his intimate portraits and landscapes that often explore family and rural life. His work is characterized by a deep sense of personal narrative and connection to nature, often capturing the quiet beauty of everyday moments.","observation":"A monochrome photographic style combines intimate, psychologically charged portraits with rural outdoor scenes, repeatedly placing figures behind or within tangled branches and tall grass. Strong tonal contrast, film-like grain, selective focus, and dense natural framing create a dark, dreamlike, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"isamu-noguchi","name":"Isamu Noguchi","cat":"architects","en":"Isamu Noguchi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isamu-noguchi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isamu-noguchi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","minimalist","realistic","sculptural","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","silver","grey","orange"],"intro":"Isamu Noguchi was a renowned Japanese-American artist and landscape architect known for his sculptures, gardens, and furniture designs. His work is characterized by a blend of Eastern and Western influences, and he is celebrated for his contributions to modern art and design throughout the 20th century.","observation":"The style presents sparse, gallery-like interiors with carefully arranged sculptural objects, geometric furniture, and generous negative space. Realistic materials and subdued earth tones are shaped by strong directional sunlight, deep shadows, and crisp architectural framing."},{"id":"faile","name":"FAILE","cat":"various-artists","en":"FAILE","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/faile.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/faile","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","collage","drawing"],"colours":["black","red","pale-orange","brown","orange","blue"],"intro":"FAILE is a Brooklyn-based artistic collaboration between Patrick McNeil and Patrick Miller, known for their multimedia works that blend street art, pop culture, and traditional art techniques. Their work often incorporates elements of collage, stenciling, and screen printing, creating dynamic and layered compositions that explore themes of urban life and cultural narratives.","observation":"This style combines vivid, high-contrast painted collage with graphic comic-like figures, heavy contour lines, flat color blocks, and visibly scraped or layered paper textures. It is densely packed with expressive portraits, animals, typography, and overlapping cultural imagery, producing an energetic mixed-media poster effect."},{"id":"barnett-newman","name":"Barnett Newman","cat":"painters","en":"Barnett Newman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barnett-newman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barnett-newman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","minimalist","characters","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["deep-red","bone-white","vivid-red","muted-ochre","brown"],"intro":"Barnett Newman was an influential American artist known for his contributions to Abstract Expressionism and Color Field painting. He was a prominent figure in the mid-20th century art scene, particularly associated with the New York School.","observation":"The style pairs vast, nearly monochrome red fields with restrained gallery architecture and occasional tiny human figures, creating a strong sense of scale and negative space. Geometric framing, centered compositions, saturated red, and subtly painterly surface variation recur across the renders, giving the scenes a minimalist yet surreal, monumental character."},{"id":"aleksi-briclot","name":"Aleksi Briclot","cat":"various-artists","en":"Aleksi Briclot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aleksi-briclot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aleksi-briclot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","dark-brown","orange","dark-rust"],"intro":"Aleksi Briclot is a renowned French artist known for his work in the fantasy and science fiction genres. He has contributed to various video games, comic books, and illustrations, gaining recognition for his imaginative and detailed style.","observation":"Across the sheet, dark humanoid figures are rendered with vigorous, visible brushwork, rough layered texture, and fragmented edges. Heavy blacks and blue-green shadows are cut by intense orange firelight or icy highlights, creating high-contrast, glowing portraits and imposing fantasy character scenes."},{"id":"elearnor-vere-boyle","name":"Eleanor Vere Boyle","cat":"illustrators","en":"Eleanor Vere Boyle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elearnor-vere-boyle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elearnor-vere-boyle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-brown","light-orange","brown","beige","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Eleanor Vere Boyle was a prominent British illustrator known for her work in children's literature during the Victorian era. She produced illustrations for several notable books, including Child's Play (1852) and The Story Without an End (1868), which showcased her delicate and intricate artistic style. Boyle's illustrations often featured detailed depictions of nature and fairy-tale elements, aligning with the Pre-Raphaelite movement's emphasis on beauty and realism. Her contributions to literature were highly regarded, and she collaborated with authors such as Hans Christian Andersen and Christina Rossetti. Boyle's work remains a significant example of 19th-century book illustration, reflecting the artistic and cultural values of her time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, textured surfaces, and carefully modelled faces, hands, fabric, and foliage. It combines intimate female portraits and small social vignettes with elaborate clothing, floral patterning, restrained earthy colors, and strong light-dark contrasts."},{"id":"gustave-de-smet","name":"Gustave De Smet","cat":"painters","en":"Gustave De Smet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-de-smet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-de-smet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","landscapes","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","orange","beige","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Gustave De Smet was a Belgian painter associated with the Flemish Expressionism movement. He was known for his expressive use of color and form, often depicting scenes of everyday life and human emotion. His work is characterized by a bold, painterly style that combines elements of Cubism and Expressionism , creating a unique visual language that captures the essence of early 20th-century European art.","observation":"The style combines strongly visible woven or impasto-like surface texture with dense decorative linework, stylized contours, and richly layered patterning. Saturated jewel-like colors, dark outlines, and high contrast unify portraits, forests, flowers, architecture, and abstract ornamental forms across the sheet."},{"id":"stephen-burrows","name":"Stephen Burrows","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Stephen Burrows","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-burrows.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-burrows","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","sculptural","characters","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","white","blue","light-yellow","deep-blue","dark-red","green"],"intro":"Stephen Burrows is an influential American fashion designer known for his innovative designs and vibrant use of color. Emerging in the 1970s, Burrows became one of the first African American designers to gain international acclaim. His work is characterized by fluid silhouettes, bold colors, and a playful, energetic aesthetic that has left a lasting impact on the fashion industry.","observation":"The style combines vivid, high-saturation color blocks with rounded geometric forms and clean, emphatic contours. Some images use these shapes as flat abstract compositions, while others turn them into softly modeled sculptural figures, maintaining a surreal, graphic coherence across the set."},{"id":"thomas-struth","name":"Thomas Struth","cat":"photographers","en":"Thomas Struth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-struth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-struth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","geometric"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","dark-green","beige","silver"],"intro":"Thomas Struth is a renowned German photographer known for his large-scale photographs of urban environments, architecture, and family portraits. His work often explores the relationship between people and their surroundings, capturing the essence of modern life and the impact of urbanization.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and cinematic, presenting richly detailed architectural spaces with strong perspective, monumental arches, and carefully framed depth. Subdued earth tones, deep shadows, and selective shafts of daylight create a moody, atmospheric sense of age across interiors, dense streets, and overgrown glasshouse environments."},{"id":"giacomo-balla","name":"Giacomo Balla","cat":"painters","en":"Giacomo Balla","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giacomo-balla.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giacomo-balla","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","pale-orange","dark-blue","orange","black","grey"],"intro":"Giacomo Balla was an Italian painter and a key figure in the Futurist movement, known for his dynamic compositions and exploration of movement and light. His work often focused on capturing the essence of speed and technology, reflecting the rapid changes of the early 20th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vivid red, blue, cream, black, and earth tones in sharply geometric, interlocking wedges, arcs, and radiating bursts. Clean graphic shapes are enriched by visible brush texture and layered tonal variation, creating an energetic, abstract and slightly surreal painted surface."},{"id":"sebastiano-del-piombo","name":"Sebastiano del Piombo","cat":"painters","en":"Sebastiano del Piombo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sebastiano-del-piombo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sebastiano-del-piombo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","religious","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","dark-blue","deep-red"],"intro":"Sebastiano del Piombo was an Italian Renaissance painter known for his skillful use of color and light, as well as his ability to convey emotion through portraiture and religious scenes. He was a contemporary of Michelangelo and Raphael , and his work often reflects the influence of these masters.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, painterly portraiture with visible oil-textured surfaces, carefully modeled faces, and richly folded fabric. Dark grounds, strong light-to-shadow transitions, restrained earth tones, and intense, solemn expressions give the imagery a dramatic devotional character."},{"id":"ken-howard","name":"Ken Howard","cat":"painters","en":"Ken Howard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ken-howard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ken-howard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","silver","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Ken Howard is a renowned British painter known for his realistic and impressionistic depictions of light and shadow, often focusing on interior and exterior scenes. His works capture the essence of everyday life, using a painterly style that combines detailed observation with expressive brushwork. Howard's art is celebrated for its ability to convey mood and atmosphere through the careful use of natural light and color.","observation":"Across all four views, recognizable urban architecture and everyday city scenes are rendered with visible, broad, gestural paint strokes and dense structural detail. Warm sunlight, saturated earth tones, reflective water, and strong light-dark contrasts give the images a vivid, cinematic sense of place while retaining an illustrative painted finish."},{"id":"filippo-brunelleschi","name":"Filippo Brunelleschi","cat":"architects","en":"Filippo Brunelleschi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/filippo-brunelleschi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/filippo-brunelleschi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","realistic","landscapes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["brown","pale-orange","muted-brown","dark-cyan","silver","rust"],"intro":"Filippo Brunelleschi was a pivotal figure in the Italian Renaissance , renowned for his architectural innovations and engineering prowess. He is best known for designing the dome of the Florence Cathedral, a feat that showcased his mastery of perspective and structural ingenuity. Brunelleschi's work laid the foundation for Renaissance architecture, emphasizing symmetry, proportion, and geometry.","observation":"The style combines detailed architectural realism with visible fine drawn lines, restrained warm colors, and textured painterly surfaces. Across the views, monumental cathedral forms, domes, arches, and dense city panoramas are arranged with strong geometric structure and an old architectural-illustration character."},{"id":"wharton-esherick","name":"Wharton Esherick","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Wharton Esherick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wharton-esherick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wharton-esherick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","glow","high-contrast","subdued-colors","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white","muted-olive"],"intro":"Wharton Esherick was an influential American sculptor and woodworker known for his pioneering work in the American Studio Craft Movement. His innovative designs and craftsmanship in furniture and architecture have left a lasting impact on modern design. Esherick's work is characterized by its organic forms, integration with nature, and use of natural materials, reflecting a deep connection to the environment.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, richly detailed organic architecture, combining massive tree trunks, rough stone, exposed timber, and handcrafted furniture. Warm natural light streams through repeated geometric windows, producing strong highlights and shadows across subdued earthy materials while interiors merge seamlessly with the surrounding forest."},{"id":"martin-wittfooth","name":"Martin Wittfooth","cat":"painters","en":"Martin Wittfooth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-wittfooth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-wittfooth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","floral","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","dark-olive","bone-white","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Martin Wittfooth is a contemporary artist known for his surreal and fantastical paintings that often explore themes of nature and the human condition. His work frequently features animals in dreamlike settings, combining rich symbolism with intricate detail.","observation":"These images use richly visible, broad painterly strokes to build highly detailed animal forms, tangled vegetation, and reflective wetland settings. Muted blue-green shadows contrast with warm orange fire and autumnal accents, creating expressive, fantastical scenes in which hybrid animals and elemental flames feel dreamlike yet tangible."},{"id":"steve-mcniven","name":"Steve McNiven","cat":"illustrators","en":"Steve McNiven","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-mcniven.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-mcniven","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","drawing","ink","epic"],"colours":["black","deep-red","brown","red","orange","grey"],"intro":"Steve McNiven is a Canadian comic book artist known for his work with Marvel Comics, including popular series such as \"Civil War\" and \"Old Man Logan.\" His detailed and dynamic style has made him a prominent figure in the comic book industry, contributing to the visual storytelling of numerous iconic characters.","observation":"The style combines visibly painted surfaces and directional brushwork with dense ink-like contours, heavy line emphasis, and extensive small anatomical and costume details. Saturated reds, greens, blues, and oranges are pushed against deep blacks, creating high-contrast, expressive superhero and monster scenes with an epic, action-oriented intensity."},{"id":"dorothea-sharp","name":"Dorothea Sharp","cat":"painters","en":"Dorothea Sharp","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dorothea-sharp.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dorothea-sharp","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-ochre","pale-orange","black","beige","ochre","red"],"intro":"Dorothea Sharp was a British painter known for her impressionistic style, focusing on landscapes and domestic scenes. Born in 1874, she became renowned for her use of color and light, capturing the essence of rural life and the natural world. Her works often depicted children and women in serene settings, emphasizing the beauty of everyday moments.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from visibly broad, directional paint strokes that model faces, fabrics, flowers, and foliage while retaining a richly textured surface. Vivid floral clothing and garden details fill intimate scenes of women and children, combining expressive portraiture with dense, decorative arrangements and lively color."},{"id":"levalet","name":"Levalet","cat":"street-artists","en":"Levalet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/levalet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/levalet","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","surreal","drawing","dark"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","orange","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Levalet is a French street artist known for his clever and interactive installations that blend seamlessly with urban environments. His real-life work often features life-sized figures painted on walls, engaging with their surroundings in humorous and thought-provoking ways.","observation":"The style combines realistic urban façades with expressive, finely drawn human figures applied like oversized monochrome wall illustrations. Dense fine lines, crosshatching, and ink-like drips give the characters a hand-rendered graphic presence, while their repeated hunched poses and uncanny placement create a bleak surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"nicholas-hughes","name":"Nicholas Hughes","cat":"photographers","en":"Nicholas Hughes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicholas-hughes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicholas-hughes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","backlighting","glow","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-teal","muted-green","red"],"intro":"Nicholas Hughes is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative and atmospheric landscapes. His work often explores themes of solitude and the natural world, capturing the ethereal and mysterious aspects of the environment.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is cinematic and realistic, built around dark teal-green night tones, warm orange-red practical lights, and strong pools of illumination. Fog, selective focus, silhouettes, and backlit subjects create quiet, suspenseful narrative scenes with restrained compositions and pronounced atmospheric depth."},{"id":"george-stefanescu","name":"George Stefanescu","cat":"painters","en":"George Stefanescu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-stefanescu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-stefanescu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-cyan","muted-orange","vivid-red","dark-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"George Stefanescu was a Romanian abstract painter known for his vibrant and expressive works that often featured fragmented human faces. His style is heavily influenced by Cubism and Abstract Expressionism , characterized by bold colors, high contrast, and textured surfaces. Stefanescu's paintings often convey complex narratives and emotional depth through their intense and chaotic compositions.","observation":"Across all four portraits, thick visible brushwork and rough built-up texture combine with forceful dark contours, angular planes, and fragmented facial features. Saturated reds, oranges, teals, purples, and blacks create a vivid, high-contrast palette, while geometric simplification and expressive distortions keep the faces between representation and surreal abstraction."},{"id":"kenro-izu","name":"Kenro Izu","cat":"photographers","en":"Kenro Izu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kenro-izu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kenro-izu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","scenes","backlighting","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Kenro Izu is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his contemplative and ethereal black and white photography. His work often explores themes of spirituality, nature, and the human condition, capturing serene and meditative landscapes and portraits with a timeless quality. Izu's use of large format cameras and traditional printing techniques lends his images a distinctive depth and clarity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome imagery with deep blacks, bright highlights, strong silhouettes, and dramatic backlighting. Mist, fog, and atmospheric distance unify forests, waterfalls, mountains, and architectural light patterns into dark, cinematic, slightly surreal scenes."},{"id":"sofonisba-anguissola","name":"Sofonisba Anguissola","cat":"painters","en":"Sofonisba Anguissola","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sofonisba-anguissola.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sofonisba-anguissola","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","muted-orange","muted-ochre","brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Sofonisba Anguissola was an Italian Renaissance painter known for her portraits and contributions to the art of the 16th century. She was one of the first known female artists to gain international recognition and served as a court painter to King Philip II of Spain. Her work is characterized by its detailed and realistic portrayal of subjects, often focusing on the nobility and court life.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly painted portraiture with delicate brushwork, subdued, darkly atmospheric colors, and carefully rendered faces, fabrics, jewelry, and lace. Formal three-quarter poses against near-black backgrounds, ornate clothing, and restrained directional light create a stately classical appearance."},{"id":"vincent-giarrano","name":"Vincent Giarrano","cat":"painters","en":"Vincent Giarrano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vincent-giarrano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vincent-giarrano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-yellow","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Vincent Giarrano is an American realist painter known for his detailed and evocative portrayals of urban life. His work often captures the essence of city living, focusing on intimate moments and the quiet beauty of everyday scenes. Giarrano's paintings are celebrated for their meticulous attention to detail and their ability to convey mood and atmosphere.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly surfaces with dense architectural and interior detail, rendered in restrained brown, ochre, charcoal, and deep red tones. Strong directional light and shadow give the urban scenes and solitary, formally dressed figures a cinematic, brooding narrative quality."},{"id":"matt-adnate","name":"Matt Adnate","cat":"street-artists","en":"Matt Adnate","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-adnate.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-adnate","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","portraits","urban","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-red","charcoal","beige","red","pale-blue","blue"],"intro":"Matt Adnate is an Australian street artist known for his large-scale murals and portraits that often depict Indigenous Australians and other cultural figures. His work is characterized by a focus on realism and a deep connection to the communities he portrays, often highlighting themes of identity and cultural heritage.","observation":"Across all four renders, enormous realistic faces are painted directly onto brick building walls, combining recognizable portraiture with energetic, visible brushwork and scraped or dripping marks. Saturated reds and blues, strong tonal contrast, and graphic linear accents give the murals an expressive, forceful presence while the masonry remains visible through the paint."},{"id":"christopher-r-w-nevinson","name":"Christopher R. W. Nevinson","cat":"painters","en":"Christopher R. W. Nevinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christopher-r-w-nevinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christopher-r-w-nevinson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","brown","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Christopher R. W. Nevinson was a British painter and printmaker, known for his association with the Futurist and Vorticist movements. He is celebrated for his dynamic depictions of urban life and war, often characterized by bold geometric forms and a sense of movement. Nevinson's works capture the energy and chaos of the modern city, reflecting the technological advancements and societal changes of the early 20th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly textured, broad painted strokes with angular, faceted geometry and densely layered urban scenes. A dark blue-grey palette is punctuated by vivid red-orange light, deep shadows, and energetic diagonals that give the cityscapes a tense, expressive sense of movement."},{"id":"harold-gilman","name":"Harold Gilman","cat":"painters","en":"Harold Gilman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harold-gilman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harold-gilman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","grey","red","deep-red"],"intro":"Harold Gilman was a British painter associated with the Camden Town Group, known for his post-impressionist style and focus on domestic interiors. Born in 1876, Gilman was a significant figure in early 20th-century British art, contributing to the development of modernist painting in the UK. His works often depicted everyday scenes with a keen eye for detail and a vibrant use of color.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly built-up paint with broad, directional strokes and strongly textured surfaces. Dense urban scenes combine expressive, simplified architectural forms with vivid coral, blue, green, and ochre accents, while recurring pedestrians and street details create a richly populated, old-city atmosphere."},{"id":"richard-long","name":"Richard Long","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Richard Long","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-long.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-long","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","patterns","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Richard Long is a renowned British sculptor and land artist known for his innovative use of natural materials and landscapes. Born in 1945, Long has been a pivotal figure in the land art movement since the late 1960s. His work often involves walking as a form of art, creating sculptures and installations using stones, mud, and other natural elements. Long's art emphasizes the relationship between humans and nature, exploring themes of time, space, and movement.","observation":"The style presents monumental stone installations in spacious architectural interiors, rendered with realistic photographic detail and restrained earth-and-slate tones. Repeated radial, concentric, and spiral structures create strong geometric symmetry, while small solitary figures emphasize the works’ scale and contemplative negative space."},{"id":"hebru-brantley","name":"Hebru Brantley","cat":"various-artists","en":"Hebru Brantley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hebru-brantley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hebru-brantley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["brown","light-teal","rust","muted-cyan","beige","vivid-red"],"intro":"Hebru Brantley is a contemporary American artist known for his vibrant and narrative-driven works that often explore themes of nostalgia, youth, and cultural identity. His art draws inspiration from pop culture, comic books, and street art, creating a unique blend that resonates with a wide audience.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped character portraits in vivid cyan, red, orange, and blue, combining clean graphic contours with visibly layered, tactile paint strokes. Oversized goggles, helmets, and improvised mechanical accessories create a playful retro-futurist fantasy, while expressive faces, dense costume details, and bold color blocking give the images a polished editorial character-design feel."},{"id":"mat-collishaw","name":"Mat Collishaw","cat":"various-artists","en":"Mat Collishaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mat-collishaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mat-collishaw","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","floral","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","beige","red"],"intro":"Mat Collishaw is a contemporary British artist known for his provocative and visually striking works that often explore themes of beauty, desire, and decay. His art frequently incorporates elements of photography, sculpture, and digital media, creating immersive and thought-provoking experiences.","observation":"The style presents richly layered floral still lifes against near-black grounds, using intense highlights and deep shadows to make petals, glass, water, and stems feel tactile and dimensional. Dense, ornate arrangements are balanced by large areas of negative space, while delicate brushwork and expressive, slightly surreal compositions give the bouquets a dramatic, theatrical presence."},{"id":"samuel-melton-fisher","name":"Samuel Melton Fisher","cat":"painters","en":"Samuel Melton Fisher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/samuel-melton-fisher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/samuel-melton-fisher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","light-orange","muted-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Samuel Melton Fisher is a British painter known for his portraits and genre scenes, often depicting women in contemplative poses. His works are characterized by a delicate use of color and attention to detail, capturing the subtleties of light and texture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, layered textures, and finely articulated faces, fabric, foliage, and architecture. Warm subdued colors are set against deep shadows and selective sunlight, creating intimate, emotionally expressive portraits and narrative garden or domestic scenes with a classical atmosphere."},{"id":"david-michael-bowers","name":"David Michael Bowers","cat":"painters","en":"David Michael Bowers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-michael-bowers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-michael-bowers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","beige","brown","bone-white","charcoal","dark-red","rust"],"intro":"David Michael Bowers is a contemporary American painter known for his detailed and imaginative works that often blend elements of fantasy and realism. His art typically features rich narratives and intricate compositions, drawing inspiration from classical techniques and historical themes.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, visibly painted surfaces with fine brushwork, elaborate lace, patterned textiles, drapery, and finely rendered facial and animal details. Formal portrait-like compositions place costumed figures and birds in dark, theatrical woodland settings, using restrained, shadow-heavy colors with selective reds, creams, and muted blues."},{"id":"nicole-eisenman","name":"Nicole Eisenman","cat":"painters","en":"Nicole Eisenman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicole-eisenman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicole-eisenman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","portraits","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-orange","orange","dark-brown","vivid-red","blue"],"intro":"Nicole Eisenman is a contemporary American artist known for her figurative paintings that blend humor, social commentary, and a distinctive style. Her work often explores themes of identity, community, and the human condition, using a mix of traditional and modern techniques.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible, directional paint strokes with flattened illustrative shapes, thick contouring, and highly saturated color. Crowded portraits, animals, foliage, patterned clothing, and cropped bodies are layered into dense, expressive compositions with exaggerated faces and direct gazes."},{"id":"sergio-larrain","name":"Sergio Larrain","cat":"photographers","en":"Sergio Larrain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sergio-larrain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sergio-larrain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","backlighting","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","silver","grey"],"intro":"Sergio Larrain was a renowned Chilean photographer known for his evocative and introspective street photography. He was a member of the prestigious Magnum Photos agency and gained recognition for his ability to capture the essence of urban life with a unique and poetic vision. Larrain's work often explored themes of solitude and the human condition, set against the backdrop of cityscapes.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is stark monochrome urban photography built around hard sunlight, deep shadows, and elongated silhouettes. Documentary-like street moments are framed with strong perspective, motion blur, reflective pavement, and occasional shallow focus, creating a tense, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"marianne-von-werefkin","name":"Marianne von Werefkin","cat":"painters","en":"Marianne von Werefkin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marianne-von-werefkin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marianne-von-werefkin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-red","light-blue","red","beige"],"intro":"Marianne von Werefkin was a Russian-Swiss painter associated with the Expressionist movement. Born in 1860, she was a prominent figure in the early 20th-century art scene, known for her vivid use of color and emotive landscapes. Her work often explored themes of spirituality and the human condition, contributing significantly to the development of modern art.","observation":"Across all four scenes, the style uses visibly worked paint with directional strokes, built-up texture, and emphatic dark contours. Saturated reds, blues, violets, and greens create high-contrast, emotionally charged compositions that portray both theatrical human gatherings and dramatic mountain landscapes."},{"id":"william-oxer","name":"William Oxer","cat":"painters","en":"William Oxer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-oxer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-oxer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","silver"],"intro":"William Oxer is a contemporary artist known for his emotive and expressive portraits, often capturing the subtle nuances of human emotion and beauty. His work is characterized by a romantic and classical approach, blending traditional techniques with a modern sensibility.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visible oil-paint handling with fine, layered brushwork to render expressive female figures, garments, hair, and skin. Restrained cream, brown, black, and rust tones sit against deep backgrounds, with dramatic contrast and tightly cropped portrait compositions creating an intimate, somber mood."},{"id":"frans-floris","name":"Frans Floris","cat":"painters","en":"Frans Floris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frans-floris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frans-floris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","muted-orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Frans Floris was a prominent Flemish painter of the 16th century, known for his contributions to the Northern Renaissance. He was a key figure in the development of the Flemish Baroque style, blending Italian Renaissance influences with local traditions. His works often depicted mythological and religious themes, characterized by intricate detail and dynamic compositions.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, richly detailed painted portraits with visible fine brushwork, dark backgrounds, and restrained brown, cream, and red hues. Dramatic light models the faces and elaborate hair, lace, pearls, fur, and metal ornaments, giving the close-cropped compositions a formal old-master character."},{"id":"john-darkow","name":"John Darkow","cat":"illustrators","en":"John Darkow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-darkow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-darkow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink","negative-space"],"colours":["white","grey","black","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"John Darkow is a contemporary cartoonist known for his editorial cartoons and humorous illustrations. His work often features sharp wit and commentary on social and political issues, capturing the essence of current events with a unique artistic flair.","observation":"Across all four images, expressive ink drawing combines fine, scratchy contours with dense crosshatching and occasional translucent gray washes. The stark black-and-white treatment, strong figure-ground contrast, and large areas of white paper frame theatrical, eccentric characters in surreal situations."},{"id":"maggi-hambling","name":"Maggi Hambling","cat":"painters","en":"Maggi Hambling","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maggi-hambling.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maggi-hambling","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","landscapes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-cyan","silver","black","beige","charcoal","dark-red"],"intro":"Maggi Hambling is a renowned British artist known for her expressive and dynamic works, often exploring themes of nature and human emotion. Her art is characterized by bold brushwork and a vivid use of color, capturing the raw energy of her subjects. Hambling has been a significant figure in contemporary art, with her works displayed in major galleries and collections around the world.","observation":"Across all four renders, thick visible paint strokes sweep into turbulent, wave-like forms, giving the images an expressive sense of motion. Cool blue-gray and white masses are punctuated by dark and rust-colored accents, with occasional recognizable figures or forms emerging dreamlike from largely abstract seascapes."},{"id":"arkhyp-kuindzhi","name":"Arkhyp Kuindzhi","cat":"painters","en":"Arkhyp Kuindzhi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arkhyp-kuindzhi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arkhyp-kuindzhi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy","silhouette"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","rust","orange","light-yellow"],"intro":"Arkhyp Kuindzhi was a renowned Ukrainian landscape painter of the 19th century, known for his dramatic use of light and color. His works often depicted vast, serene landscapes, capturing the beauty and mystery of nature with a unique atmospheric quality. Kuindzhi's paintings are celebrated for their innovative techniques and emotional depth, making him a significant figure in the Russian art scene of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines realistic landscape imagery with visible painterly texture, deep shadow, and strongly glowing orange sunset light. Monumental silhouettes, reflective water, atmospheric haze, and isolated figures create a cinematic, dreamy sense of scale and quiet drama."},{"id":"auguste-perret","name":"Auguste Perret","cat":"architects","en":"Auguste Perret","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/auguste-perret.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/auguste-perret","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","silver"],"intro":"Auguste Perret was a pioneering French architect known for his innovative use of reinforced concrete. Born in 1874, he played a significant role in shaping modern architecture with his designs that combined classical elements with new construction techniques. His notable works include the Théâtre des Champs-Élysées and the Church of Notre-Dame du Raincy, which are celebrated for their structural clarity and aesthetic elegance.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed architectural views with monumental scale, carved ornament, sculptural stone figures, and strong vertical and arched geometry. Subdued stone hues are shaped by pronounced light and shadow, while carefully framed urban scenes emphasize symmetry, perspective, and imposing classical forms."},{"id":"brent-heighton","name":"Brent Heighton","cat":"painters","en":"Brent Heighton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brent-heighton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brent-heighton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","silver","ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Brent Heighton is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and expressive paintings that capture the essence of European street life and landscapes. His works often depict bustling urban scenes, characterized by their lively atmosphere and rich color palettes. Heighton's style is influenced by impressionism, focusing on the play of light and shadow, and the use of bold, broad brushstrokes to convey movement and emotion.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses highly visible, broad, broken brushwork to build richly detailed urban and waterfront scenes. Strong warm-cool color contrasts, reflective surfaces, and selective luminous highlights give the scenes an energetic, atmospheric realism while retaining a clearly painted, illustrative character."},{"id":"albert-oehlen","name":"Albert Oehlen","cat":"various-artists","en":"Albert Oehlen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-oehlen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-oehlen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["beige","silver","brown","muted-cyan","rust","dark-blue","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Albert Oehlen is a German artist known for his abstract and expressionistic paintings. He emerged in the 1980s as part of the Neue Wilde movement, which was characterized by its bold, gestural style and rejection of traditional artistic norms. Oehlen's work often explores the boundaries between abstraction and figuration, employing a diverse range of techniques and media to challenge conventional perceptions of painting.","observation":"Across all four works, energetic painted gestures, drips, splatters, and scratched linear marks build dense abstract compositions from overlapping fragments. Saturated orange, blue, turquoise, red, and pink passages punctuate pale grounds, while broad brushwork and forceful dark contours give the surfaces an expressive, restless intensity."},{"id":"idris-khan","name":"Idris Khan","cat":"various-artists","en":"Idris Khan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/idris-khan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/idris-khan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","minimalist","patterns","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","white","charcoal"],"intro":"Idris Khan is a contemporary British artist known for his work in photography and digital media. His art often explores themes of memory, time, and the layering of images and text. Khan's work is characterized by its use of repetition and superimposition, creating complex and textured visual narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style relies on black-and-white framed drawings built from dense, delicate intersecting lines and layered hatching. Dark central masses and partially emerging faces create a stark, restrained atmosphere, while the repeated rectangular presentation gives the work a disciplined gallery-like structure."},{"id":"zinaida-serebriakova","name":"Zinaida Serebriakova","cat":"painters","en":"Zinaida Serebriakova","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zinaida-serebriakova.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zinaida-serebriakova","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["grey","brown","charcoal","bone-white","ochre","dark-brown","dark-blue"],"intro":"Zinaida Serebriakova was a prominent Russian painter known for her realistic and impressionistic style. Born in 1884, she was part of the renowned Benois family and became one of the first female painters in Russia to gain recognition. Her work often depicted rural life, family, and intimate domestic scenes, characterized by a gentle and serene atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from visible, layered brushwork that models faces, fabric, and furnishings with expressive variation rather than smooth photographic precision. It consistently presents intimate, tightly cropped character portraits in subdued blue, cream, brown, and warm skin tones, with richly textured clothing and interiors."},{"id":"ferdinand-hodler","name":"Ferdinand Hodler","cat":"painters","en":"Ferdinand Hodler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ferdinand-hodler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ferdinand-hodler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["muted-blue","muted-olive","bone-white","dark-blue","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Ferdinand Hodler was a Swiss painter known for his contributions to symbolism and modernism in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work often explored themes of nature, human emotion, and spirituality, characterized by a distinctive use of color and form. Hodler's paintings frequently depicted the Swiss landscape, capturing its grandeur and serenity with a unique blend of realism and symbolic abstraction.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive mountain landscapes are depicted with visible, directional paint strokes and richly modelled terrain. Cool blue skies and water contrast with muted greens, ochres, and snow tones, while atmospheric distance, reflective lakes, and dramatic peaks create a grand but naturalistic panorama."},{"id":"bill-jacklin","name":"Bill Jacklin","cat":"painters","en":"Bill Jacklin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-jacklin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-jacklin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","glow","mist","motion","broad-brushstrokes","grain","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","silhouette"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","rust","muted-olive"],"intro":"Bill Jacklin is a British painter known for his evocative depictions of light and movement, often capturing the essence of urban life. His work is characterized by a blend of impressionism and realism, focusing on the interplay of light and shadow in dynamic cityscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, loosely painted silhouettes move through hazy nighttime environments filled with glowing points of warm light. Broad, visible brushwork, grain, deep shadows, and teal-to-amber color contrasts create an atmospheric, expressive sense of motion and crowd energy."},{"id":"richard-rogers","name":"Richard Rogers","cat":"architects","en":"Richard Rogers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-rogers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-rogers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","scenes","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","silver","grey","dark-red","vivid-red","olive","deep-blue"],"intro":"Richard Rogers is a renowned British architect known for his modernist and functionalist designs. He is celebrated for his work on iconic structures such as the Pompidou Centre in Paris and the Lloyd's building in London. Rogers's architectural philosophy emphasizes transparency, flexibility, and the integration of public spaces, often showcasing structural elements as part of the aesthetic.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense urban architecture is depicted through layered, angular forms, exposed infrastructure, elevated walkways, and crowded street scenes. Fine drawn lines and graphic flat-color passages combine with expressive distortion, vivid red-blue-green accents, and strong light-dark contrasts."},{"id":"dale-chihuly","name":"Dale Chihuly","cat":"designers","en":"Dale Chihuly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dale-chihuly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dale-chihuly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","glow","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","vivid-red","deep-red","red","orange"],"intro":"Dale Chihuly is an American artist and glass sculptor renowned for his innovative and colorful glass installations. Born in 1941, Chihuly has transformed the art of glassblowing into a form of large-scale sculpture, often displayed in botanical gardens, museums, and architectural settings worldwide. His work is characterized by vibrant colors, organic shapes, and intricate designs that capture the imagination and challenge traditional notions of glass art.","observation":"The style presents ornate, shell-like glass vessels as highly realistic sculptural still lifes, with translucent red and amber material, fine internal striations, and sharply defined reflective highlights. Saturated warm lighting makes the objects glow against dark backgrounds while reflections and shadows ground them on a tabletop."},{"id":"bernd-and-hilla-becher","name":"Bernd and Hilla Becher","cat":"photographers","en":"Bernd and Hilla Becher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bernd-and-hilla-becher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bernd-and-hilla-becher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","retro","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Bernd and Hilla Becher was a German artist duo known for their photographic documentation of industrial structures. They gained recognition for their typological approach to photography, capturing water towers, blast furnaces, and other industrial buildings with a distinctive, systematic style. Their work is characterized by a focus on form, structure, and the stark beauty of industrial architecture, contributing significantly to the conceptual art movement.","observation":"The style presents industrial structures as stark black-and-white architectural studies, with precise fine lines, weathered surfaces, and strong geometric silhouettes. Repeated centered compositions, sparse horizons, generous pale sky, and subtle grain give the images a restrained retro-industrial photographic character."},{"id":"augustus-john","name":"Augustus John","cat":"painters","en":"Augustus John","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/augustus-john.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/augustus-john","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-orange","black","muted-brown","red","dark-brown","muted-blue"],"intro":"Augustus John was a prominent Welsh painter and draughtsman known for his expressive portraits and bohemian lifestyle. He was a leading figure in British art during the early 20th century, celebrated for his vivid depictions of people and his ability to capture the essence of his subjects.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly worked oil-paint surfaces, visible directional brushstrokes, and layered color to build expressive female portraits. Vivid reds, blues, creams, and flesh tones contrast with darker grounds, while cropped poses, elaborate clothing, and carefully rendered faces give the portraits a classical yet emotionally immediate presence."},{"id":"barkley-l-hendricks","name":"Barkley L. Hendricks","cat":"painters","en":"Barkley L. Hendricks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barkley-l-hendricks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barkley-l-hendricks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["dark-rust","pale-yellow","brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","black"],"intro":"Barkley L. Hendricks is an influential American painter known for his vibrant and empowering portraits of African Americans. His work often highlights themes of identity, style, and cultural pride, capturing the essence of Black life and fashion in the 1970s. Hendricks's paintings are celebrated for their realism, attention to detail, and striking use of color, making a significant impact on contemporary art.","observation":"The style presents fashion-forward portraiture with richly textured, visibly painted surfaces, careful fabric detail, and strong sculptural modelling of faces and clothing. Restrained earth tones, deep shadows, and saturated terracotta or green backgrounds create a dramatic editorial mood, while hats, sunglasses, ornate upholstery, and tailored garments provide a consistent decorative identity."},{"id":"william-holman-hunt","name":"William Holman Hunt","cat":"painters","en":"William Holman Hunt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-holman-hunt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-holman-hunt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-brown","rust","muted-orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"William Holman Hunt was a prominent English painter and one of the founders of the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood. Known for his meticulous attention to detail and vibrant color palette, Hunt's work often explored themes of religion, morality, and realism. His paintings are characterized by their vividness and symbolic depth, making him a significant figure in 19th-century art.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and highly detailed, with visible fine brushwork modelling naturalistic faces, fabric, hair, flowers, and reflective vessels. Saturated jewel tones and deep shadowy greens support ornate costumes, patterned interiors, floral arrangements, and formal portrait-like groupings with a classical, theatrical presence."},{"id":"herve-leger","name":"Herve Leger","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Herve Leger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/herve-leger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/herve-leger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","subdued-colors","classical","retro","geometric"],"colours":["brown","black","white","beige","dark-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Herve Leger is a renowned French fashion designer, best known for pioneering the iconic bandage dress, which became a symbol of sensuality and elegance in the late 20th century. His designs are celebrated for their ability to sculpt and enhance the female form, combining innovative fabric techniques with a sleek, modern aesthetic.","observation":"The style presents highly structured couture garments through precise, symmetrical geometry, dense surface ornament, and black-and-ivory contrast. The designs are shown both on mannequins and as isolated garment studies, with a polished, sculptural finish and classical architectural display settings."},{"id":"ron-walotsky","name":"Ron Walotsky","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ron Walotsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ron-walotsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ron-walotsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-yellow","charcoal","blue","rust"],"intro":"Ron Walotsky is an American illustrator known for his work in science fiction and fantasy art. His illustrations often feature imaginative and surreal landscapes, blending elements of the fantastical with the cosmic. Walotsky's work is celebrated for its intricate detail and vivid color palettes, capturing the essence of speculative fiction.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible paintwork, dense surface detail, and dramatic portrait-like compositions populated by eccentric human and monstrous figures. Dark teal and earthy surroundings are punctuated by red and blue accents, while antique furnishings, books, globes, costumes, and symbolic objects create an ornate, fantastical, surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"oscar-tuazon","name":"Oscar Tuazon","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Oscar Tuazon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oscar-tuazon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oscar-tuazon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","minimalist","sculptural","patterns","still-life","subdued-colors","classical","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","white","brown","beige","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Oscar Tuazon is a contemporary American artist known for his innovative sculptures that often incorporate architectural elements and natural materials. His work explores the intersection of art and architecture, frequently utilizing wood, metal, and concrete to create large-scale installations that challenge traditional notions of space and structure.","observation":"The style presents monumental wooden constructions in sparse, sunlit gallery interiors, emphasizing stacked blocks, cantilevers, repeated structural rhythms, and strong geometric silhouettes. Natural wood, pale walls, concrete floors, and long window shadows create a restrained material palette, while the precise architectural framing gives the images a clean, sculptural presence."},{"id":"steve-bell","name":"Steve Bell","cat":"illustrators","en":"Steve Bell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-bell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-bell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing"],"colours":["black","orange","muted-brown","pale-yellow","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Steve Bell is a renowned British cartoonist and illustrator, known for his satirical and often controversial political cartoons. His work frequently appears in major newspapers and magazines, where he uses humor and exaggeration to critique political figures and social issues. Bell's distinctive style combines bold lines, detailed cross-hatching, and expressive characters, making his illustrations instantly recognizable.","observation":"The style combines densely packed caricature portraits with grotesque hybrid figures, rendered through visible brush texture, fine ink-like outlines, and crosshatched shading. Strong reds, dark tones, and sharp facial expressions create a vivid, high-contrast satirical tableau with little empty space."},{"id":"jonathan-meese","name":"Jonathan Meese","cat":"painters","en":"Jonathan Meese","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jonathan-meese.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jonathan-meese","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","characters","motion","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","madness"],"colours":["vivid-red","bone-white","brown","red","deep-red","orange"],"intro":"Jonathan Meese is a contemporary German artist known for his provocative and often controversial works that explore themes of power, identity, and mythology. His art is characterized by its chaotic energy, bold use of color, and incorporation of various media, including painting, sculpture, and performance.","observation":"Across all four panels, saturated reds, oranges, pinks, yellows, blues, black, and white are layered through visible brushwork, scraping, drips, and frantic drawn marks. Fragmented faces, creatures, eyes, mouths, and gestural figures overlap in densely packed compositions, producing an energetic, chaotic, high-contrast painted surface."},{"id":"carleton-watkins","name":"Carleton Watkins","cat":"photographers","en":"Carleton Watkins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carleton-watkins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carleton-watkins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","muted-orange","beige"],"intro":"Carleton Watkins was a pioneering American photographer known for his stunning large-format photographs of the American West, particularly Yosemite Valley. His work played a significant role in the establishment of national parks in the United States. Watkins's photographs are characterized by their clarity, composition, and ability to capture the grandeur of natural landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents expansive mountain landscapes with highly realistic detail, strong tonal separation, and a restrained sepia-brown monochrome treatment. Fine grain, crisp geological and forest textures, reflective water, and softly fading distant peaks give the images the character of archival landscape photography."},{"id":"alex-timmermans","name":"Alex Timmermans","cat":"photographers","en":"Alex Timmermans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-timmermans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-timmermans","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","white"],"intro":"Alex Timmermans is a contemporary photographer known for his mastery of the wet plate collodion process, a technique that dates back to the mid-19th century. His work often explores themes of nostalgia and timelessness, capturing moments that seem to transcend the present. Timmermans's photographs are celebrated for their intricate detail and the unique, ethereal quality that the wet plate process imparts.","observation":"A monochrome, sepia-leaning photographic style presents period-dressed figures in atmospheric woodland and manor settings. Soft selective focus, visible film grain, deep shadows, and weathered borders give the staged vignettes a moody, cinematic vintage character."},{"id":"francesco-guardi","name":"Francesco Guardi","cat":"painters","en":"Francesco Guardi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francesco-guardi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francesco-guardi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","scenes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["grey","bone-white","white","brown","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Francesco Guardi was an Italian painter of the 18th century, known for his vedute, or detailed cityscapes, primarily of Venice. He was a prominent figure of the Venetian school and is celebrated for his atmospheric and lively depictions of the city's canals and architecture, contributing significantly to the Rococo movement.","observation":"The style presents richly detailed painted views of a Venetian waterfront, with layered brushwork shaping turbulent clouds, rippling water, boats, and monumental architecture. Restrained blue, cream, brown, and rose tones create a luminous but subdued atmosphere, while the repeated framed presentation reinforces a classical decorative character."},{"id":"sanford-biggers","name":"Sanford Biggers","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sanford Biggers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sanford-biggers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sanford-biggers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","patterns","scenes","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["beige","white","dark-brown","black","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Sanford Biggers is an American artist known for his diverse and thought-provoking works that explore themes of identity, history, and culture. His art often incorporates a variety of mediums, including sculpture, installation, and performance, and he is recognized for his ability to blend contemporary and traditional elements to create pieces that challenge viewers' perceptions and provoke dialogue.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely layered textile collage with vividly colored patchwork, visible seams, frayed edges, and repeated woven or stitched patterns. Fabric is shaped into monumental human forms and installation-like scenes, mixing expressive figuration with elaborate surface decoration and sculptural drapery."},{"id":"erik-spiekermann","name":"Erik Spiekermann","cat":"designers","en":"Erik Spiekermann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erik-spiekermann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erik-spiekermann","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","portraits","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Erik Spiekermann is a renowned German typographer and designer, celebrated for his influential work in type design and graphic communication. He is known for creating iconic typefaces and contributing significantly to the field of typography, shaping modern visual culture with his innovative approach.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, finely textured portrait faces with stark graphic design: saturated orange and red fields, black shapes, and hard-edged geometric overlays. Strong directional lighting creates deep shadows, while grain and halftone-like texture unify the photographic detail with the poster-like flat color and bold composition."},{"id":"tatiana-suarez","name":"Tatiana Suarez","cat":"street-artists","en":"Tatiana Suarez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tatiana-suarez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tatiana-suarez","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["orange","dark-brown","red","grey","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Tatiana Suarez is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and ethereal murals that often depict fantastical female figures intertwined with nature. Her work is characterized by a dreamy and surreal quality, blending elements of fantasy with bold, illustrative details.","observation":"The style combines close-up portraiture with dense floral and botanical framing, rendered through visible, varied paint strokes and fine illustrative linework. Saturated coral, teal, red, and green hues, expressive faces, and richly layered surface detail give the images an ornate, tactile intensity."},{"id":"ken-domon","name":"Ken Domon","cat":"photographers","en":"Ken Domon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ken-domon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ken-domon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","urban","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Ken Domon is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his realistic and documentary-style photography. He is celebrated for capturing the essence of post-war Japan, focusing on both urban and rural life. His work often reflects the human condition, portraying everyday moments with depth and emotion.","observation":"A monochrome photographic style built around glamorous, atmospheric portraits in urban nightlife settings. High contrast, visible grain, selective focus, and strong motion blur create a cinematic retro mood, balancing sharply observed faces with smeared lights, reflections, and passing figures."},{"id":"howard-hodgkin","name":"Howard Hodgkin","cat":"painters","en":"Howard Hodgkin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/howard-hodgkin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/howard-hodgkin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-teal","dark-green","deep-rust","vivid-red","cream","vivid-ochre"],"intro":"Howard Hodgkin is a renowned British painter known for his vibrant and emotive abstract works. Born in 1932, Hodgkin's career spanned several decades, during which he developed a distinctive style characterized by bold colors and expressive brushwork. His paintings often evoke intense emotions and are celebrated for their ability to convey complex feelings through abstract forms.","observation":"The style uses abstract geometric arrangements built from nested rectangles, curved bands, and repeated marks. Saturated reds, greens, oranges, and blues are applied with broad, highly visible brushstrokes, leaving ridged impasto, irregular edges, and energetic gestural texture across every panel."},{"id":"norman-bluhm","name":"Norman Bluhm","cat":"painters","en":"Norman Bluhm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/norman-bluhm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/norman-bluhm","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","vivid-red","muted-red","black","red","deep-red"],"intro":"Norman Bluhm was an American abstract expressionist painter known for his dynamic and vibrant works. Born in 1921, he became a prominent figure in the post-war art scene, contributing to the development of action painting and gestural abstraction. His works are characterized by bold colors, energetic compositions, and a sense of movement that captures the viewer's attention.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style is non-representational and aggressively gestural, built from saturated red, pink, black, and cream paint. Broad scraped strokes, splatters, drips, and fine ink-like lines create high-contrast fields with energetic diagonals and a visibly layered, tactile surface."},{"id":"giuseppe-de-nittis","name":"Giuseppe de Nittis","cat":"painters","en":"Giuseppe de Nittis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giuseppe-de-nittis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giuseppe-de-nittis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Giuseppe de Nittis was an Italian painter known for his Impressionist works that captured the essence of 19th-century European life. Born in 1846, he became a prominent figure in the art world, blending Italian and French influences in his paintings. His works often depicted urban landscapes, elegant figures, and atmospheric scenes, showcasing his mastery of light and color.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, loose painterly brushwork to depict atmospheric waterfront scenes populated by elegantly dressed figures. Muted blue-gray and brown tones, deep blacks, warm lamp and window lights, reflective wet surfaces, and soft haze create a somber, romantic mood, while fine strokes enrich clothing, foliage, water, and architectural details."},{"id":"paula-rego","name":"Paula Rego","cat":"painters","en":"Paula Rego","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paula-rego.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paula-rego","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","black","charcoal","dark-red","yellow"],"intro":"Paula Rego is a renowned Portuguese-British visual artist known for her powerful and imaginative paintings and prints. Her work often explores themes of feminism, folklore, and the human condition, using a distinctive style that blends realism with surrealism. Rego's art is celebrated for its narrative depth and emotional intensity, often depicting complex characters and scenes that challenge societal norms and provoke thought.","observation":"The style is built from vigorous, visibly broad paint strokes that model expressive figures, clothing, and faces with energetic, broken edges. Saturated reds, pinks, blues, and greens stand against darker passages, while crowded groupings, dramatic gestures, and unusual cropped arrangements give the scenes a theatrical sense of motion."},{"id":"tracey-adams","name":"Tracey Adams","cat":"painters","en":"Tracey Adams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tracey-adams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tracey-adams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","drawing"],"colours":["bone-white","pale-yellow","beige","ochre","red","charcoal"],"intro":"Tracey Adams is a contemporary artist known for her abstract and geometric compositions. Her work often explores the interplay of color, form, and space, creating dynamic and visually engaging pieces that challenge traditional notions of representation.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines layered, visibly worked paint with loose abstract drawing: thin looping marks, faint grids, translucent washes, and irregular blocks of color accumulate over a pale ground. The palette is mostly restrained and earthy, punctuated by red, ochre, blue, and green, while exposed brushwork and rough surface texture give the compositions an expressive, handmade quality."},{"id":"greg-olsen","name":"Greg Olsen","cat":"illustrators","en":"Greg Olsen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/greg-olsen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/greg-olsen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","yellow","bone-white"],"intro":"Greg Olsen is an American artist known for his inspirational and religious-themed paintings. His work often features serene landscapes and tender human interactions, capturing moments of peace and reflection.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly textured, painterly rendering with visible fine brushwork, detailed fabrics, foliage, hair, and faces. Warm natural or candlelit illumination is set against deep shadow, creating intimate, expressive scenes centered on figures reading or gathered outdoors and beside windows."},{"id":"mark-steinmetz","name":"Mark Steinmetz","cat":"photographers","en":"Mark Steinmetz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-steinmetz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-steinmetz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["grey","white","charcoal","black","silver"],"intro":"Mark Steinmetz is an American photographer known for his black and white images that capture the subtle, everyday moments of life. His work often focuses on the youth and suburban settings of the United States, offering a reflective and intimate view of his subjects. Steinmetz's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey emotion and narrative through simple, yet powerful compositions.","observation":"The style uses realistic black-and-white portrait photography with strong tonal contrast, candid direct gazes, and documentary-like moments staged within ordinary suburban surroundings. Shallow focus, occasional backlighting, natural textures, and loosely framed figures create an intimate, cinematic atmosphere across the four images."},{"id":"dave-whamond","name":"Dave Whamond","cat":"illustrators","en":"Dave Whamond","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dave-whamond.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dave-whamond","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","cream","orange","brown","vivid-red","grey","olive","blue"],"intro":"Dave Whamond is a Canadian illustrator and cartoonist known for his humorous and whimsical style. He has contributed to various publications and is recognized for his engaging and playful illustrations, often featuring exaggerated characters and lively scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly expressive comic-book drawing with thick black ink contours, dense hatching, simplified flat color areas, and vivid primary-heavy palettes. Faces and figures are exaggerated into caricature, while energetic poses, dramatic expressions, and humorous action give the sheet a pulp-style visual intensity."},{"id":"canaletto","name":"Canaletto","cat":"painters","en":"Canaletto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/canaletto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/canaletto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","light-cyan","muted-blue","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Canaletto was an Italian painter known for his detailed and accurate depictions of Venice. His works are celebrated for their precise architectural renderings and the use of light to create depth and realism. Canaletto's paintings were highly sought after by European aristocrats during the Grand Tour, making him a prominent figure in 18th-century art.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents highly detailed Venetian cityscapes with convincing architecture, boats, crowds, and atmospheric skies. Visible brushwork and fine strokes soften the realistic rendering, while restrained blue, ochre, terracotta, and brown tones create a luminous but subdued classical palette."},{"id":"george-tice","name":"George Tice","cat":"photographers","en":"George Tice","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-tice.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-tice","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","urban","backlighting","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["black","white","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"George Tice is a renowned American photographer known for his black and white images that capture the essence of American life, particularly focusing on rural and urban landscapes. His work often highlights the beauty and solitude of everyday scenes, bringing attention to the overlooked details of the American environment.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome photography with deep blacks, luminous highlights, and a restrained, somber atmosphere. Wide, observational compositions emphasize empty roads, trees, rural structures, and open landscapes, often softened by fog or defined by strong backlighting and reflective surfaces."},{"id":"nadar","name":"Nadar","cat":"photographers","en":"Nadar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nadar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nadar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Nadar was a renowned 19th-century French photographer, known for his pioneering work in portrait photography. He was a key figure in the development of photographic techniques and was celebrated for his ability to capture the character and essence of his subjects. His portraits often featured notable figures of his time, contributing significantly to the cultural and historical documentation of the era.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, monochrome photographic tableaux with dense textile, fur, feather, and facial detail, strong tonal contrast, and aged grain. Formal portrait staging and period clothing are combined with uncanny animal-human subjects and sparse, shadowy backgrounds, creating a dark surreal museum-like atmosphere."},{"id":"zio-ziegler","name":"Zio Ziegler","cat":"street-artists","en":"Zio Ziegler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zio-ziegler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zio-ziegler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","portraits","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","black","deep-red","red"],"intro":"Zio Ziegler is an American artist known for his large-scale murals and intricate paintings. His work often features complex patterns, vivid colors, and a blend of abstract and figurative elements. Ziegler's art is recognized for its boldness, detailed linework, and cultural references, making him a prominent figure in contemporary street art.","observation":"Across the sheet, tightly packed faces and figures are rendered with dense black linework, crosshatched textures, exaggerated anatomy, and intense red accents. The illustrative ink treatment is highly detailed and expressive, combining grotesque portrait imagery with surreal, ornamental patterning and strong contrast."},{"id":"ruth-sanderson","name":"Ruth Sanderson","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ruth Sanderson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ruth-sanderson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ruth-sanderson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","rust","pale-yellow","beige"],"intro":"Ruth Sanderson is an American illustrator known for her enchanting and detailed illustrations, often found in children's books and fairy tales. Her work is celebrated for its intricate detail, whimsical charm, and ability to capture the magic of storytelling through visual art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint to depict romantic storybook scenes with finely rendered figures, animals, fabrics, architecture, and foliage. Earthy reds, creams, greens, and browns support an ornate classical-fantasy atmosphere, with elaborate patterned surfaces and soft, dreamy natural settings."},{"id":"carsten-nicolai","name":"Carsten Nicolai","cat":"various-artists","en":"Carsten Nicolai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carsten-nicolai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carsten-nicolai","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","minimalist","sculptural","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","sci-fi","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Carsten Nicolai is a German artist and musician known for his work in the fields of electronic music and visual art. He often explores the intersection of sound and visual phenomena, creating immersive experiences that challenge perceptions. Nicolai's work frequently involves the use of technology to manipulate light and sound, resulting in innovative and thought-provoking installations.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white architectural environments built from monumental repetition, precise geometry, and dramatic vanishing points. Bright architectural light against deep shadow, sparse solitary figures, reflective floors, and expansive interior space create a futuristic, immersive atmosphere."},{"id":"henri-fantin-latour","name":"Henri Fantin-Latour","cat":"painters","en":"Henri Fantin-Latour","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-fantin-latour.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-fantin-latour","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","patterns","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","dark-red","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Henri Fantin-Latour was a French painter and lithographer known for his exquisite still lifes and portraits. Born in 1836, he became renowned for his ability to capture delicate textures and subtle light in his works. His paintings often feature floral arrangements and intimate domestic scenes, reflecting a serene and contemplative atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, abundant flowers are modeled with visible, delicate brushwork and layered, tactile paint. The compositions use dark grounds, earthy muted colors, strong light-dark separation, and densely arranged botanical details for a dramatic floral still-life effect."},{"id":"mary-heilmann","name":"Mary Heilmann","cat":"painters","en":"Mary Heilmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-heilmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-heilmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","dark-blue","white","light-orange","light-pink","vivid-pink"],"intro":"Mary Heilmann is an American artist known for her vibrant abstract paintings that blend elements of minimalism and pop culture. Her work often explores the interplay of color and form, creating dynamic compositions that challenge traditional artistic boundaries. Heilmann's unique approach has made her a significant figure in contemporary art, influencing a generation of artists with her bold use of color and innovative techniques.","observation":"Across all four works, vivid geometric color fields dominate, arranged as angular blocks, triangles, and rectangles rather than recognizable subjects. The surfaces visibly retain broad brushwork and thick, uneven paint, combining hard-edged composition with a tactile handmade finish."},{"id":"erik-kessels","name":"Erik Kessels","cat":"various-artists","en":"Erik Kessels","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erik-kessels.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erik-kessels","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","scenes","still-life","glow","fine-lines","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","retro","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-teal","dark-cyan","bone-white","muted-brown","red","dark-olive"],"intro":"Erik Kessels is a Dutch artist, designer, and curator known for his work in photography and advertising. He is a co-founder of the communications agency KesselsKramer and has published several books on photography, often focusing on vernacular and found images. Kessels's work frequently explores themes of memory, identity, and the impact of media on society.","observation":"The style combines realistic, highly detailed photography-like rendering with vivid candy-colored environments and impossible juxtapositions. Recurring clouds, reflective glass, domestic interiors, abundant objects, and theatrical compositions create a dreamy surrealism with a nostalgic cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"jacques-louis-david","name":"Jacques-Louis David","cat":"painters","en":"Jacques-Louis David","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacques-louis-david.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacques-louis-david","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","rust","pale-yellow","light-yellow"],"intro":"Jacques-Louis David was a prominent French painter in the late 18th and early 19th centuries, known for his influential role in the development of Neoclassicism. He was a key figure during the French Revolution, producing works that emphasized classical themes and heroic subjects. David's paintings are characterized by their clarity, precision, and adherence to classical ideals, often depicting historical and mythological scenes with a focus on moral narratives.","observation":"The style uses richly layered oil-paint rendering with visible fine brushwork, modeled faces, textured fabric, and densely populated historical tableaux. Strong light-dark contrasts, deep earthy shadows, and fiery highlights heighten the emotional gestures, turbulent action, and monumental sense of catastrophe."},{"id":"clyfford-still","name":"Clyfford Still","cat":"painters","en":"Clyfford Still","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clyfford-still.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clyfford-still","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-blue","dark-brown","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Clyfford Still is a prominent figure in the American abstract expressionist movement, known for his large-scale, non-representational paintings. His work is characterized by bold colors, jagged forms, and a focus on emotional expression. Still's art played a significant role in the development of abstract expressionism in the mid-20th century, influencing many contemporaries and future artists.","observation":"Across all four works, saturated red, blue, black, and occasional cream form large abstract fields with stark contrast and irregular, energetic boundaries. Broad dragged or brushed marks, layered pigment, and gravity-fed drips create a raw, tactile surface, while the compositions remain graphic and boldly structured."},{"id":"loui-jover","name":"Loui Jover","cat":"painters","en":"Loui Jover","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/loui-jover.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/loui-jover","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","collage","ink"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","black","brown","silver","red","light-green"],"intro":"Loui Jover is an Australian artist known for his expressive ink drawings and mixed media artworks. He often incorporates vintage book pages and newspapers into his pieces, creating a unique blend of traditional and contemporary elements. Jover's work is characterized by its emotional depth and striking visual impact, often focusing on themes of love, loss, and human connection.","observation":"Across all four panels, tightly cropped female faces are rendered with forceful black contouring, visible brush marks, scraped paint, and dripping pigment. Muted beige, grey, and blue grounds are punctuated by vivid eye colors and paint accents, while newspaper fragments, lettering, and rough paper joins create a layered collage surface."},{"id":"squeak-carnwath","name":"Squeak Carnwath","cat":"painters","en":"Squeak Carnwath","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/squeak-carnwath.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/squeak-carnwath","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","collage","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","light-orange","muted-blue","muted-ochre","red","black"],"intro":"Squeak Carnwath is an American contemporary artist known for her vibrant and introspective works that often incorporate text, symbols, and abstract forms. Her art explores themes of human experience, memory, and the passage of time, using a distinctive style that blends elements of abstraction and symbolism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines heavily worked painted surfaces with loose linear drawing, scraped textures, layered blocks, and collage-like panel divisions. Saturated reds and blues stand out against pale grounds, while birds, figures, suns, stars, and abstract geometric motifs create an expressive, dreamlike visual language."},{"id":"simon-vouet","name":"Simon Vouet","cat":"painters","en":"Simon Vouet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/simon-vouet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/simon-vouet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["baroque","detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","muted-orange","dark-red","rust"],"intro":"Simon Vouet was a prominent French Baroque painter known for his influence on the development of French art in the 17th century. His work is characterized by its dramatic use of light and shadow, vibrant color palette, and dynamic compositions. Vouet's paintings often depict religious and mythological themes, rendered with a naturalistic style that combines elements of Italian Baroque and French Classicism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modelled, visibly painted figures with dramatic gestures, expressive faces, and deep shadow against warm, dark grounds. Strong light-dark contrasts, saturated earth-and-jewel accents, elaborate drapery, and tightly cropped theatrical compositions give the scenes a grand classical sense of drama."},{"id":"elsa-schiaparelli","name":"Elsa Schiaparelli","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Elsa Schiaparelli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elsa-schiaparelli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elsa-schiaparelli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","beige","black","dark-brown","orange","red"],"intro":"Elsa Schiaparelli was an influential Italian fashion designer known for her avant-garde and surrealist approach to fashion. Born in 1890, she became a prominent figure in the fashion world during the 1930s and 1940s, collaborating with artists like Salvador Dalí. Schiaparelli was celebrated for her bold designs, innovative use of textiles, and incorporation of surrealist elements into her work, making her a pioneer in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic couture garments on mannequins and cropped dress forms, with elaborate floral embroidery, botanical decoration, draping, and long sculptural trains. Warm gallery lighting, dark tonal contrasts, and ornate interiors give the fashion displays a theatrical, museum-like atmosphere."},{"id":"ted-degrazia","name":"Ted DeGrazia","cat":"painters","en":"Ted DeGrazia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ted-degrazia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ted-degrazia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","charcoal","grey","blue","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Ted DeGrazia is an American artist known for his colorful depictions of Native American and Southwestern scenes. His work often features expressive brushstrokes and vibrant colors, capturing the essence of the desert landscape and its cultural heritage.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines vigorously visible broad paint strokes with loose black drawing and ink-like contour marks. Saturated blues, reds, ochres, and whites create high-contrast desert scenes populated by simplified buildings, riders, animals, and expressive gestural figures."},{"id":"gene-davis","name":"Gene Davis","cat":"painters","en":"Gene Davis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gene-davis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gene-davis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","illustrative","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-blue","red","dark-green","pale-yellow","light-orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"Gene Davis was an American painter known for his contributions to the Color Field movement, characterized by his use of vibrant, vertical stripes. His work is celebrated for its exploration of color relationships and optical effects, often creating a sense of rhythm and movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a non-representational arrangement of vertical, parallel color bands in varied widths and densities. Strong saturated color blocking, crisp geometric structure, and repeated stripe patterns dominate, with only subtle surface texture and minimal modulation within the bands."},{"id":"peter-henry-emerson","name":"Peter Henry Emerson","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Henry Emerson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-henry-emerson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-henry-emerson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["beige","black","charcoal","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Peter Henry Emerson was a British photographer and writer, known for his pioneering work in naturalistic photography during the late 19th century. He advocated for photography as a fine art and was influential in the pictorialist movement. Emerson's work often depicted rural life and landscapes, capturing the essence of the English countryside with a focus on realism and natural beauty.","observation":"The style consistently presents realistic rural waterside scenes in a restrained sepia-brown palette, with strong dark silhouettes set against pale, hazy skies and reflective water. Mist, grain, soft atmospheric distance, and subdued natural light create a melancholy, old-photographic mood across the compositions."},{"id":"felix-vallotton","name":"Felix Vallotton","cat":"painters","en":"Felix Vallotton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/felix-vallotton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/felix-vallotton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","muted-blue","olive","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Felix Vallotton was a Swiss-French painter and printmaker associated with the post-impressionist movement and the group Les Nabis. Known for his distinctive style, Vallotton's work often features bold outlines, flat color planes, and a keen sense of composition. His subjects range from intimate domestic scenes to landscapes, often imbued with a sense of mystery and introspection.","observation":"These images use richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with layered brushwork, strong silhouettes, and deep shadows against clear blue skies and luminous clouds. Formal gardens, expansive lawns, and small dark figures create a quiet but uncanny, dreamlike atmosphere, with carefully structured landscape compositions and vivid natural detail."},{"id":"albert-joseph-moore","name":"Albert Joseph Moore","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Joseph Moore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-joseph-moore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-joseph-moore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","rust","black"],"intro":"Albert Joseph Moore is a renowned English painter associated with the Aesthetic Movement during the Victorian era. Known for his exquisite depictions of classical themes, Moore's work often features serene and harmonious compositions, characterized by detailed and realistic portrayals of figures and settings. His paintings frequently explore themes of beauty and tranquility, with a focus on the elegance of drapery and the human form.","observation":"These richly rendered scenes combine visible fine brushwork with densely observed fabrics, carved stone, foliage, and architectural ornament. Warm terracotta, cream, red, and muted green tones unify elegant figures in flowing garments with luxurious classical interiors and garden terraces."},{"id":"henri-lebasque","name":"Henri Lebasque","cat":"painters","en":"Henri Lebasque","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-lebasque.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-lebasque","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-green","grey","bone-white","muted-olive","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Henri Lebasque is a French painter known for his contributions to post-impressionism and intimism. He was born in 1865 and developed a style characterized by a focus on light and color, often depicting serene domestic scenes and landscapes. Lebasque's work is celebrated for its gentle brushwork and harmonious compositions, capturing the essence of early 20th-century French life.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork and layered, textured paint shaping people, foliage, architecture, and fabric. Vivid garden colors, abundant flowers, sunlit interiors, and intimate figure-in-landscape scenes create a lively, observational atmosphere with dense decorative detail."},{"id":"arthur-lismer","name":"Arthur Lismer","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur Lismer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-lismer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-lismer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","grey","charcoal","ochre","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Arthur Lismer was a Canadian painter and member of the Group of Seven, known for his vivid and expressive landscapes that captured the natural beauty of Canada. His work is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a deep connection to the Canadian wilderness, often depicting forests, lakes, and coastlines with a unique post-impressionistic style.","observation":"Across all four views, the scenes are rendered with visible, layered brush marks and energetic directional strokes, giving buildings, trees, snow, and water a richly textured surface. The palette is generally restrained and earthy, with recurring rust, ochre, blue-grey, and green accents, while densely arranged urban and rural landscapes create a vivid sense of place."},{"id":"john-sloane","name":"John Sloane","cat":"painters","en":"John Sloane","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-sloane.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-sloane","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","landscapes","scenes","painterly","light-colors","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-olive","muted-blue","olive","bone-white","dark-rust"],"intro":"John Sloane is an American artist known for his nostalgic and idyllic depictions of rural life. His work often captures the essence of the American countryside, portraying traditional homesteads and serene landscapes with a focus on detail and realism.","observation":"The style presents idyllic lakeside and countryside scenes with highly detailed architecture, gardens, trees, water, and distant hills. Bright natural light, saturated colors, crisp descriptive forms, and softly painterly surfaces create a polished, nostalgic, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"maurice-prendergast","name":"Maurice Prendergast","cat":"painters","en":"Maurice Prendergast","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maurice-prendergast.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maurice-prendergast","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","ochre","beige","charcoal","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Maurice Prendergast was an American post-impressionist artist known for his vibrant and decorative style. Born in 1858 in St. John's, Newfoundland, he later moved to Boston and became a prominent figure in the American art scene. Prendergast's work is characterized by its use of color, pattern, and a focus on leisure scenes, often depicting bustling urban life and serene landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, broad strokes, and a textured built-up surface to depict lively outdoor settings. Saturated blues, greens, reds, and creams animate crowded seaside scenes, town views, gardens, and architectural backgrounds, with expressive marks retaining the energy of the paint."},{"id":"roman-vishniac","name":"Roman Vishniac","cat":"photographers","en":"Roman Vishniac","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roman-vishniac.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roman-vishniac","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver"],"intro":"Roman Vishniac is a renowned photographer known for his poignant documentation of Jewish communities in Eastern Europe before World War II. His work captures the daily lives, struggles, and resilience of these communities, providing a vital historical record of a world that was largely destroyed during the Holocaust.","observation":"The style is grounded in stark black-and-white street photography, with strong tonal contrast, visible film grain, and selective focus that separates foreground figures from blurred urban backgrounds. Candid groups of adults and children inhabit cramped, weathered architectural settings, giving the images a somber, cinematic documentary atmosphere."},{"id":"ralph-eugene-meatyard","name":"Ralph Eugene Meatyard","cat":"photographers","en":"Ralph Eugene Meatyard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ralph-eugene-meatyard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ralph-eugene-meatyard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","surreal","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige","white"],"intro":"Ralph Eugene Meatyard is an American photographer known for his enigmatic and surreal imagery, often featuring family members and friends in haunting, dreamlike settings. His work is characterized by its exploration of identity, childhood, and the uncanny, often set against the backdrop of rural decay and Southern Gothic themes.","observation":"The style presents stark, staged rural vignettes in monochrome, combining documentary-like realism with cinematic framing and a visibly aged, grainy photographic surface. High contrast, weathered buildings, overgrown ground, masked children, and bleak expressions create an eerie surrealism and oppressive dark mood across the set."},{"id":"alexandre-benois","name":"Alexandre Benois","cat":"painters","en":"Alexandre Benois","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexandre-benois.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexandre-benois","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","black","brown","silver","rust"],"intro":"Alexandre Benois was a Russian artist, art critic, and stage designer, known for his influential role in the development of Russian art and theater in the early 20th century. He was a key figure in the Mir iskusstva (World of Art) movement and contributed significantly to the Ballets Russes, collaborating with renowned figures like Sergei Diaghilev.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly textured, hand-painted-looking brushwork with loose directional strokes, layered washes, and finely observed architectural and environmental details. Muted, atmospheric palettes support narrative scenes populated by small figures, while dramatic lighting, strong silhouettes, and carefully framed vistas give the images an illustrative cinematic quality."},{"id":"morgan-maassen","name":"Morgan Maassen","cat":"photographers","en":"Morgan Maassen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/morgan-maassen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/morgan-maassen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","glow","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["dark-cyan","muted-cyan","black","grey","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Morgan Maassen is a contemporary photographer known for his stunning ocean and surf photography. His work often captures the beauty and power of the sea, blending artistic vision with technical skill to create images that are both visually striking and emotionally resonant.","observation":"The style is cinematic and photorealistic, built around immersive low-angle ocean views that move between the waterline, underwater depths, and open sky. Strong backlighting, luminous reflections, deep teal water, and high contrast create dramatic motion, with selective focus and atmospheric depth enhancing the sense of being inside the scene."},{"id":"isabel-toledo","name":"Isabel Toledo","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Isabel Toledo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isabel-toledo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isabel-toledo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Isabel Toledo is a celebrated Cuban-American fashion designer known for her innovative and artistic approach to clothing design. She gained prominence for her unique ability to blend traditional craftsmanship with modern aesthetics, creating garments that are both timeless and avant-garde. Toledo's work is characterized by its meticulous attention to detail, sculptural silhouettes, and an artistic flair that transcends conventional fashion boundaries.","observation":"Across the sheet, elongated fashion figures, stylized portraits, birds, and arranged objects are rendered with angular silhouettes, fine linear marks, and a visibly distressed, crackled surface. Restrained cream, black, red, ochre, and muted blue tones are punctuated by strong geometric patterning and layered textile texture, creating an expressive illustrative style with painterly material richness."},{"id":"carl-theodor-dreyer","name":"Carl Theodor Dreyer","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Carl Theodor Dreyer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-theodor-dreyer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-theodor-dreyer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Carl Theodor Dreyer was a Danish film director renowned for his meticulous craftsmanship and innovative storytelling. His work is characterized by its exploration of themes such as spirituality, identity, and human emotion, often conveyed through a stark and minimalist visual style. Dreyer's films, including \"The Passion of Joan of Arc\" and \"Vampyr,\" are celebrated for their emotional depth and visual intensity.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark monochrome photography uses strong backlight, deep shadows, and selective haze to create a brooding, filmic atmosphere. Solitary cloaked figures are framed against monumental stone architecture, church silhouettes, arches, and birds, with carefully staged negative forms and dramatic depth."},{"id":"jack-spencer","name":"Jack Spencer","cat":"photographers","en":"Jack Spencer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-spencer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-spencer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","backlighting","mist","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","epic","silhouette"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","ochre","dark-ochre","beige"],"intro":"Jack Spencer is an American photographer known for his evocative and atmospheric imagery, often exploring themes of the American South. His work is characterized by a painterly quality and a focus on mood and emotion, capturing the essence of rural landscapes and human figures.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic compositions in a restrained sepia-brown palette, with solitary figures and sparse rural landscapes reduced to strong silhouettes. Backlit haze, soft focus, dramatic skies, and distant horizons create a bleak, mysterious, and monumental atmosphere across the renders."},{"id":"ryan-mcginness","name":"Ryan McGinness","cat":"painters","en":"Ryan McGinness","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryan-mcginness.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryan-mcginness","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","floral","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["vivid-red","red","blue","charcoal","muted-ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Ryan McGinness is an American artist known for his vibrant and intricate works that blend elements of graphic design, pop culture, and fine art. His art often features layered compositions filled with symbols, icons, and patterns, reflecting themes of consumerism and urban life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense floral and symbolic ornament with vivid, highly saturated color and strong bilateral or radial organization. Broad painterly marks, graphic outlines, layered textures, repeated motifs, and dark silhouette-like forms create an exuberant, surreal decorative surface."},{"id":"max-beckmann","name":"Max Beckmann","cat":"painters","en":"Max Beckmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/max-beckmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/max-beckmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-blue","light-orange","red","ochre"],"intro":"Max Beckmann was a German painter and printmaker, known for his intense and expressive style. Born in 1884, Beckmann's work is often associated with the New Objectivity movement, characterized by its critical and sometimes satirical depiction of society. His art frequently explores themes of human suffering, existential dread, and the complexities of modern life, often set against the backdrop of the tumultuous early 20th century.","observation":"The style uses vigorous, highly visible broad brushwork and thick dark contours to build crowded portraits with angular, deliberately distorted faces. Saturated reds, blues, ochres, and blacks create strong contrast, while overlapping figures and varied expressions give the montage an intense, restless character."},{"id":"antoine-bourdelle","name":"Antoine Bourdelle","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Antoine Bourdelle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antoine-bourdelle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antoine-bourdelle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","white","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Antoine Bourdelle was a French sculptor known for his expressive and dramatic works, often exploring themes of heroism and human emotion. Born in 1861, Bourdelle was a student of Auguste Rodin and later became a prominent figure in the transition from traditional to modern sculpture, influencing many artists of his time.","observation":"The style presents expressive human busts as solid, volumetric sculptures, combining recognizable facial anatomy with fractured, aggressively modeled planes and visible tool marks. Restrained earth and bronze tones, strong directional lighting, and museum-like plinths emphasize the weight, texture, and dramatic presence of each portrait."},{"id":"winifred-knights","name":"Winifred Knights","cat":"painters","en":"Winifred Knights","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/winifred-knights.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/winifred-knights","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","landscapes","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-ochre","dark-ochre","brown","light-yellow","dark-brown","grey"],"intro":"Winifred Knights was a British painter known for her distinctive style and contributions to early 20th-century art. She was celebrated for her meticulous compositions and the serene, contemplative quality of her works, often depicting figures in landscapes with a neoclassical influence.","observation":"The style uses naturalistic, carefully modelled figures and landscapes with visible brushwork, tactile fabric, and richly articulated foliage. Restrained earth tones, warm sunlight, and contemplative poses create a classical, quietly dramatic atmosphere across both rural scenes and formal figure groupings."},{"id":"henry-moore","name":"Henry Moore","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Henry Moore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henry-moore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henry-moore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","metallic","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","silver","muted-blue","olive"],"intro":"Henry Moore was a renowned British sculptor and artist known for his semi-abstract monumental sculptures. His work often features organic forms and explores the relationship between the human figure and the landscape. Moore's sculptures are characterized by their smooth surfaces, hollow spaces, and use of materials like bronze and stone. His influence on modern sculpture is profound, and his works are displayed in public spaces worldwide.","observation":"The style presents monumental abstract sculptures as highly realistic, carefully lit forms with solid volume, weathered metallic surfaces, and broad organic openings. Museum and landscape settings provide clean architectural or natural backdrops, while subdued earth tones, strong silhouettes, and precise photographic detail emphasize the sculptures’ scale and geometry."},{"id":"mikhail-nesterov","name":"Mikhail Nesterov","cat":"painters","en":"Mikhail Nesterov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mikhail-nesterov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mikhail-nesterov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","beige","muted-green","rust","pale-orange","red","blue"],"intro":"Mikhail Nesterov was a Russian painter known for his works that often depicted spiritual and religious themes, particularly within the context of Russian Orthodoxy. His art is characterized by a deep connection to Russian culture and landscapes, often portraying serene and contemplative scenes that reflect the spiritual life of the Russian people during the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly visible brushwork builds dense forests, flowering meadows, bare branches, and layered fabrics with varied directional strokes. The scenes combine vivid greens, blues, ochres, and sunset oranges with solitary pale or hooded figures, creating a dreamy, mysterious woodland atmosphere."},{"id":"archibald-thorburn","name":"Archibald Thorburn","cat":"painters","en":"Archibald Thorburn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/archibald-thorburn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/archibald-thorburn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","grey","dark-brown","beige","ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"Archibald Thorburn was a Scottish artist known for his detailed and realistic paintings of wildlife, particularly birds. Born in 1860, Thorburn became renowned for his ability to capture the essence of nature with precision and artistry. His works are celebrated for their fine detailing and vibrant portrayal of avian life, often set against lush natural backdrops.","observation":"The style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, with fine directional strokes shaping feathers, grasses, branches, and softly textured skies. It combines carefully observed bird forms with expressive poses and atmospheric, subdued earth tones, creating detailed wildlife scenes with a classical illustrative character."},{"id":"vanessa-bell","name":"Vanessa Bell","cat":"painters","en":"Vanessa Bell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vanessa-bell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vanessa-bell","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","patterns","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["light-orange","dark-brown","muted-ochre","rust","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Vanessa Bell was an influential English painter and interior designer, known for her role in the Bloomsbury Group, a collective of English writers, intellectuals, and artists. Her work is characterized by its modernist approach, often exploring themes of domesticity and femininity through a post-impressionist lens.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly furnished domestic interiors are built from clearly visible, directional brushwork and layered, expressive color. Floral arrangements, patterned fabrics, windows, furniture, and seated figures recur as decorative yet lived-in subjects, with vivid reds, greens, blues, and pinks tying the compositions together."},{"id":"pierre-paulin","name":"Pierre Paulin","cat":"designers","en":"Pierre Paulin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-paulin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-paulin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["white","silver","dark-red","red","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Pierre Paulin is a renowned French designer known for his innovative and modernist approach to furniture and interior design. His work is characterized by bold, sculptural forms and a focus on ergonomic comfort, making him a pivotal figure in 20th-century design. Paulin's designs often feature organic shapes and vibrant colors, reflecting the optimistic spirit of the post-war era.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents highly realistic, sculptural lounge chairs with exaggerated organic curves and substantial upholstered volume. Saturated red, ochre, and blue fabrics stand out against sparse gallery-like interiors, with soft directional lighting revealing the tactile textile surfaces and strong three-dimensional forms."},{"id":"jane-small","name":"Jane Small","cat":"painters","en":"Jane Small","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jane-small.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jane-small","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","landscapes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","blue","muted-blue","muted-ochre","magenta","red"],"intro":"Jane Small is a contemporary artist known for her vibrant and enchanting paintings that often depict scenes of fantasy and nature. Her work is characterized by a romantic and whimsical style, drawing inspiration from European folklore and mythical themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly visible brushwork builds dense gardens, figures, flowers, and distant landscapes from layered, directional strokes. Saturated blues, pinks, oranges, and greens combine with luminous sunlight and soft atmospheric depth, creating an expressive, dreamlike fantasy mood."},{"id":"arne-jacobsen","name":"Arne Jacobsen","cat":"designers","en":"Arne Jacobsen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arne-jacobsen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arne-jacobsen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","charcoal","black","rust"],"intro":"Arne Jacobsen is a renowned Danish architect and designer, celebrated for his contributions to modernist architecture and furniture design. Known for his functionalist approach, Jacobsen's work is characterized by clean lines, geometric shapes, and an emphasis on form and function. His designs, such as the Egg and Swan chairs, have become iconic symbols of mid-century modernism and continue to influence contemporary design.","observation":"The style presents sculptural leather lounge chairs in realistic, highly detailed interior photographs, emphasizing smooth molded forms, reflective surfaces, and carefully arranged modern furnishings. Restrained brown, gray, and teal tones combine with strong directional daylight, deep shadows, geometric architecture, and generous negative space."},{"id":"jimmy-lawlor","name":"Jimmy Lawlor","cat":"painters","en":"Jimmy Lawlor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jimmy-lawlor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jimmy-lawlor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["blue","dark-cyan","brown","silver","rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jimmy Lawlor is an Irish painter known for his whimsical and surreal landscapes that often incorporate elements of fantasy and magic realism. His work is characterized by a vivid color palette and a detailed, painterly technique that brings to life imaginative scenes inspired by Irish landscapes and folklore.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible painterly texture and delicate brushwork with vivid blue skies, warm reds, and strong light-dark separation. Recurring upward-looking figures and swirling birds create a lyrical sense of movement, while low viewpoints, expansive skies, and dreamlike staging give the scenes a fantastical, emotionally expressive quality."},{"id":"rashad-alakbarov","name":"Rashad Alakbarov","cat":"various-artists","en":"Rashad Alakbarov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rashad-alakbarov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rashad-alakbarov","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","glow","motion","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","epic","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","black","orange","silver"],"intro":"Rashad Alakbarov is an Azerbaijani artist known for his innovative use of light and shadow to create intricate installations. His work often involves projecting shadows onto walls using everyday objects and sculptural elements, transforming them into detailed and thought-provoking scenes. Alakbarov's art explores themes of perception and reality, challenging viewers to see beyond the surface.","observation":"Across all four renders, vast gallery-like interiors are filled with dense, sculptural accumulations of wooden chairs, fragments, and architectural debris. Warm subdued tones, strong directional sunlight, long shadows, reflective floors, and repeated angular structures create a dramatic, monumental atmosphere with a sense of motion and collapse."},{"id":"david-wilkie","name":"David Wilkie","cat":"painters","en":"David Wilkie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-wilkie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-wilkie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-brown","light-orange","rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"David Wilkie was a renowned Scottish painter known for his genre scenes and portraits, capturing the everyday life of 19th-century Britain. His work is characterized by a keen observation of social interactions and a masterful use of light and shadow, contributing to the Romantic and Realist movements of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, loose paint strokes to depict densely populated historical scenes with expressive gestures, textured fabrics, and layered interiors. Warm earth tones, deep shadows, and sharply illuminated faces and garments create a dramatic, somber atmosphere, while the compositions remain observational and narrative rather than ornamental."},{"id":"christian-krohg","name":"Christian Krohg","cat":"painters","en":"Christian Krohg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-krohg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-krohg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","dark-brown","muted-ochre","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Christian Krohg was a Norwegian painter, illustrator, and writer, known for his contributions to the naturalist movement in art. Born in 1852, Krohg's work often depicted the everyday life and struggles of ordinary people, reflecting social issues of his time. He was a prominent figure in the Norwegian art scene and played a significant role in the development of modern art in Norway.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible paint strokes to build intimate portraits and quiet narrative scenes, with carefully observed faces, clothing, architecture, and landscapes. The palette is restrained and earthy⁠—deep blacks, olive greens, muted blues, and warm skin tones⁠—while selective light and expressive brushwork give the images a tactile, emotionally attentive quality."},{"id":"alex-garant","name":"Alex Garant","cat":"painters","en":"Alex Garant","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-garant.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-garant","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["muted-red","black","muted-rust","red","light-teal","grey","light-lime","violet"],"intro":"Alex Garant is a contemporary Canadian artist known for her distinctive approach to portraiture, often referred to as the 'Queen of Double Eyes.' Her work is characterized by a unique blend of realism and surrealism, creating a captivating visual experience that challenges perceptions of identity and reality.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces are painted with visible, directional brushwork, layered color, and highly saturated coral, turquoise, pink, and blue hues. The portraits combine recognizable facial modelling with surreal multiplied eyes and distorted features, while dark graphic contours, elaborate hair, and strongly styled clothing reinforce the expressive, fashion-editorial presentation."},{"id":"les-edwards","name":"Les Edwards","cat":"illustrators","en":"Les Edwards","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/les-edwards.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/les-edwards","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","backlighting","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","rust","dark-cyan","silver","light-orange"],"intro":"Les Edwards is a renowned British illustrator known for his work in the fantasy and science fiction genres. His artwork often features vivid and imaginative scenes, bringing to life the worlds of horror and fantasy literature. Edwards has contributed to numerous book covers, film posters, and graphic novels, establishing a distinct style characterized by his attention to detail and atmospheric compositions.","observation":"The style presents vast fantasy landscapes with painterly surface texture, highly realistic depth, and cinematic framing. Strong blue-orange color contrasts, luminous moons and horizons, atmospheric mist, and backlit silhouettes create a dark, epic sense of scale across all four renders."},{"id":"konstantin-grcic","name":"Konstantin Grcic","cat":"designers","en":"Konstantin Grcic","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/konstantin-grcic.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/konstantin-grcic","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","brown","beige","muted-ochre","rust"],"intro":"Konstantin Grcic is a renowned German industrial designer known for his innovative and functional approach to furniture design. He has gained international acclaim for his minimalist and modernist style, often characterized by clean lines, geometric shapes, and a focus on functionality. Grcic's work is celebrated for its precision and thoughtful design, making him a prominent figure in contemporary design.","observation":"The style presents sculptural furniture as realistic product imagery, emphasizing bold geometric silhouettes, smooth molded surfaces, and carefully controlled studio lighting. Sparse showroom compositions, strong color accents, architectural backdrops, and long shadows give the renders a polished contemporary design-catalogue feel."},{"id":"harry-bertoia","name":"Harry Bertoia","cat":"designers","en":"Harry Bertoia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harry-bertoia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harry-bertoia","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","floral","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","muted-brown","beige","dark-brown"],"intro":"Harry Bertoia was an Italian-born American artist, sculptor, and modern furniture designer known for his innovative work in metal and sound sculpture. He gained prominence in the mid-20th century, particularly for his iconic wire furniture designs, such as the Bertoia Diamond Chair, which combined artistic expression with functional design.","observation":"The style presents refined sculptural objects built from slender vertical metal rods, woven mesh, and flattened botanical forms. Restrained bronze and brown tones, intricate linear textures, clean studio presentation, and generous white space give the works a quiet, minimalist gallery character."},{"id":"stanhope-forbes","name":"Stanhope Forbes","cat":"painters","en":"Stanhope Forbes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stanhope-forbes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stanhope-forbes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","pale-orange","muted-ochre","beige","orange"],"intro":"Stanhope Forbes was a British artist known for his role in the Newlyn School, a group of artists who settled in Cornwall in the late 19th century. His work is characterized by its realistic depiction of rural and coastal life, often focusing on the daily activities of fishermen and their families. Forbes's paintings are celebrated for their detailed brushwork, naturalistic light, and evocative portrayal of community life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, broad oil-paint strokes to build realistic people, workspaces, and waterfront settings with dense material detail. Restrained earth tones, strong sunlight and deep shadows create an expressive, historically grounded atmosphere, while crowded groups and active labor give each composition a narrative sense of everyday life."},{"id":"gottfried-helnwein","name":"Gottfried Helnwein","cat":"various-artists","en":"Gottfried Helnwein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gottfried-helnwein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gottfried-helnwein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","muted-red","muted-blue","dark-blue"],"intro":"Gottfried Helnwein is an Austrian-Irish visual artist known for his provocative and often unsettling work that explores themes of childhood, innocence, and societal issues. His art spans various mediums, including painting, photography, and installation, often characterized by a photorealistic style that challenges viewers' perceptions.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed photographic portraits framed as intense extreme close-ups, with faces repeatedly cropped by the image edges. Cool blue tones, deep shadows, wet hair, skin texture, and visible injuries create a dark, cinematic mood with stark contrast and an intimate, confrontational presence."},{"id":"patty-maher","name":"Patty Maher","cat":"photographers","en":"Patty Maher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patty-maher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patty-maher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","dark-ochre","dark-olive","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Patty Maher is a Canadian photographer known for her evocative and narrative-driven imagery. Her work often explores themes of solitude, nature, and the mystical, creating a unique blend of fine art and conceptual photography. Maher's photographs are characterized by their ethereal quality and introspective mood, often featuring solitary figures in expansive landscapes.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, using subdued, moody color grading and expansive landscape compositions. Solitary figures in flowing dark clothing are placed against windswept grass, rolling hills, and heavy storm clouds, giving the scenes a dark, dreamy, emotionally charged atmosphere."},{"id":"cathy-wilkes","name":"Cathy Wilkes","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Cathy Wilkes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cathy-wilkes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cathy-wilkes","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","fashion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["bone-white","dark-ochre","muted-orange","grey","brown","deep-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Cathy Wilkes is a contemporary artist known for her evocative installations and sculptures. Her work often explores themes of memory, identity, and the passage of time, using a variety of materials to create deeply personal and introspective pieces. Wilkes's art is characterized by its emotional depth and the use of found objects, which she transforms into poignant narratives.","observation":"The style presents softly lit gallery scenes filled with sculptural, fabric-covered figures and mannequins in oversized, handmade clothing. Visible brushwork, worn surfaces, layered textiles, and muted pastel colors give the imagery a tactile, painterly quality, while the uncanny faces and dreamlike arrangements create a surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"charlie-chaplin","name":"Charlie Chaplin","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Charlie Chaplin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charlie-chaplin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charlie-chaplin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","collage","ink"],"colours":["black","orange","silver","muted-rust","red","blue"],"intro":"Charlie Chaplin was a British comedian, filmmaker, and composer who became a worldwide icon through his screen persona, \"The Tramp.\" He is considered one of the most important figures in the history of the film industry, known for his silent films and slapstick comedy.","observation":"A vivid, heavily worked portrait style combines thick, directional paint strokes with graphic dark contours and angularly modelled faces. Saturated coral, turquoise, blue, pink and black collide with drips, splatters, scraped marks and newspaper-like collage fragments, while the repeated cropped figures create a bold four-panel presentation."},{"id":"jasper-johns","name":"Jasper Johns","cat":"painters","en":"Jasper Johns","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jasper-johns.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jasper-johns","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","ochre","red","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Jasper Johns is an influential American painter and sculptor, known for his contributions to the development of contemporary art. Born in 1930, Johns is celebrated for his innovative use of everyday symbols and objects, such as flags, numbers, and targets, which he incorporated into his work to challenge traditional notions of art. His approach often blurred the lines between fine art and popular culture, making him a pivotal figure in the transition from Abstract Expressionism to Pop Art and Neo-Dada.","observation":"Across all four works, vivid red, blue, yellow, white, and gray forms are arranged as abstract geometric blocks, wedges, arcs, and intersecting diagonal bands. Thick, visibly worked paint and scraped, directional strokes give the otherwise structured compositions an expressive, tactile surface."},{"id":"arthur-boyd","name":"Arthur Boyd","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur Boyd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-boyd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-boyd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["beige","brown","muted-blue","blue","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Arthur Boyd is an Australian painter known for his expressive and emotive works that often explore themes of nature, mythology, and the human condition. His art is characterized by a unique blend of romanticism and expressionism, capturing the Australian landscape and its cultural narratives with a profound depth and intensity.","observation":"Across all four renders, natural landscapes are built from visibly layered, directional paint strokes, with scraped and textured surfaces rather than clean graphic shapes. Strong cobalt blues, rusty reds, ochres, and dark vegetation create expressive, dreamlike scenes populated by trees, water, birds, and occasional distant figures."},{"id":"morris-louis","name":"Morris Louis","cat":"painters","en":"Morris Louis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/morris-louis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/morris-louis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","light-orange","brown","rust","dark-blue","grey"],"intro":"Morris Louis is an influential American painter known for his role in the Color Field movement and Post-Painterly Abstraction. Active during the mid-20th century, Louis developed a unique technique of pouring and staining paint onto unprimed canvases, creating vibrant, flowing compositions that emphasized color and form over traditional representation.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated bands and ribbons of paint dominate pale canvases, shifting between vertical stripes and sweeping curved forms. Broad, visibly brushed strokes, drips, and irregular edges give the abstract compositions a physical, expressive character, while generous unpainted space keeps the layouts open."},{"id":"charles-le-brun","name":"Charles Le Brun","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Le Brun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-le-brun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-le-brun","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","silver","grey","beige","blue"],"intro":"Charles Le Brun was a prominent French painter and art theorist of the 17th century, known for his influential role in the development of the French Baroque style. He served as the court painter to King Louis XIV and was instrumental in the decoration of the Palace of Versailles. Le Brun's work is characterized by its dramatic compositions, expressive figures, and grand historical and mythological themes.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visible brushwork with highly modeled faces, flowing hair, elaborate fabrics, and densely layered scenes. Warm russets, ochres, flesh tones, and deep shadows create a dramatic, emotionally charged classical atmosphere, with strong light-dark contrasts and theatrical gestures throughout."},{"id":"halston","name":"Halston","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Halston","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/halston.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/halston","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","fashion","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["grey","silver","white","deep-red","black"],"intro":"Halston was an influential American fashion designer known for his minimalist yet elegant designs that defined the 1970s fashion scene. His work was characterized by clean lines, luxurious fabrics, and a modern aesthetic that resonated with the era's cultural shifts.","observation":"The style presents high-fashion garments as dramatic sculptural forms, with dense folds, pleats, gathered fabric, and trailing trains rendered in realistic studio detail. Strong saturated reds, oranges, teal, and whites stand out against restrained backdrops, while directional lighting and carefully staged poses give the images a polished editorial, cinematic presence."},{"id":"david-welker","name":"David Welker","cat":"painters","en":"David Welker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-welker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-welker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","landscapes","patterns","fine-lines","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","bone-white","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"David Welker is an American artist known for his intricate and imaginative artwork, often associated with the music industry and poster art. His work is characterized by detailed linework and a surreal, dreamlike quality that draws from both fantasy and reality.","observation":"The style combines extremely dense, fine-lined architectural drawing with ornate, labyrinthine structures, repeated patterns, and exaggerated vertical or tilted perspectives. It shifts between restrained sepia and black-and-white rendering and richly saturated jewel-like color, while maintaining a highly detailed, illustrative fantasy-world treatment across the scenes."},{"id":"george-callaghan","name":"George Callaghan","cat":"painters","en":"George Callaghan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-callaghan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-callaghan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","floral","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-olive","grey","olive","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"George Callaghan is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and imaginative landscape paintings. His work often features whimsical and surreal elements, blending fantasy with reality to create unique visual experiences.","observation":"The style presents richly layered hillside landscapes with highly stylized, rounded vegetation, cypress rows, cottages, paths, and water vistas. Fine repeated marks and delicate brushwork give the illustrative scenes a textured, handcrafted surface, while saturated greens and warm highlights create a luminous, storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"tokujin-yoshioka","name":"Tokujin Yoshioka","cat":"various-artists","en":"Tokujin Yoshioka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tokujin-yoshioka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tokujin-yoshioka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","fashion","scenes","fine-lines","light-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","grey","muted-blue","brown"],"intro":"Tokujin Yoshioka is a renowned Japanese designer known for his innovative and ethereal designs that often incorporate elements of light and transparency. His work spans various fields, including furniture design, architecture, and art installations, and he is celebrated for his ability to blend nature with technology, creating immersive and contemplative experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, pale gallery interiors are transformed by monumental sculptural masses made from fine, translucent, feathery strands. The restrained white and icy-blue palette, sparse compositions, solitary figures, and diffused light create an ethereal, surreal installation-like atmosphere."},{"id":"karl-knaths","name":"Karl Knaths","cat":"painters","en":"Karl Knaths","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karl-knaths.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karl-knaths","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","beige","brown","rust","muted-blue","silver","deep-green"],"intro":"Karl Knaths is an American painter known for his contributions to modernist art in the 20th century. His work often blends elements of cubism and expressionism, creating a unique style that reflects both abstraction and emotional depth. Knaths's paintings are characterized by their bold use of color and geometric forms, often exploring themes of nature and human experience.","observation":"Across all four works, the style combines abstract geometric construction with visibly layered, tactile paint and collage-like surfaces. Rectangular blocks, angular forms, circular accents, scraped textures, and dark drawn marks recur in a restrained earthy palette punctuated by strong reds, blues, greens, and ochres."},{"id":"thomas-lawrence","name":"Thomas Lawrence","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Lawrence","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-lawrence.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-lawrence","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Thomas Lawrence was a prominent English portrait painter of the late 18th and early 19th centuries, known for his masterful depictions of high society and royalty. He became the leading portraitist in England, capturing the elegance and grandeur of his subjects with a distinctive style that combined neoclassical and romantic elements.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly textured oil-paint handling with visible directional strokes, blended flesh tones, and loosely built garments and backgrounds. It consistently presents carefully posed, fashionably dressed figures in intimate portrait crops, using subdued earthy colors, dark grounds, and selective highlights for expressive, dimensional faces."},{"id":"bartolome-esteban-murillo","name":"Bartolome Esteban Murillo","cat":"painters","en":"Bartolome Esteban Murillo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bartolome-esteban-murillo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bartolome-esteban-murillo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","light-orange","beige","white","red"],"intro":"Bartolome Esteban Murillo was a prominent Spanish Baroque painter known for his religious works and depictions of everyday life in 17th century Spain. His style is characterized by a soft, warm palette and a focus on light and shadow, often portraying serene and intimate scenes with a spiritual undertone. Murillo's works are celebrated for their gentle realism and emotional depth, capturing the essence of the Spanish Golden Age.","observation":"These images use richly textured oil-paint handling, with broad visible strokes, softly modeled faces, and weighty folds of fabric. Warm earth tones, deep shadowed backgrounds, and strong light-dark contrasts create an intimate, dramatic classical mood across both portraits and narrative pastoral groupings."},{"id":"john-stezaker","name":"John Stezaker","cat":"various-artists","en":"John Stezaker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-stezaker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-stezaker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","retro","collage"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","grey","charcoal","orange"],"intro":"John Stezaker is a British conceptual artist known for his innovative use of collage to explore themes of identity, memory, and the subconscious. His work often involves the manipulation of found images, particularly from vintage film stills, postcards, and other printed materials, to create new and thought-provoking compositions.","observation":"The style combines tightly framed vintage portrait photography with surreal collage interventions, layering mountains, clouds, and flowers across faces and bodies. Strong monochrome tonal contrast, selective color accents, visible film grain, and retro studio styling give the images a tactile cinematic character."},{"id":"jean-baptiste-carpeaux","name":"Jean-Baptiste Carpeaux","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jean-Baptiste Carpeaux","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-baptiste-carpeaux.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-baptiste-carpeaux","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-lines","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Jean-Baptiste Carpeaux was a renowned French sculptor of the 19th century, celebrated for his expressive and dynamic works that often depicted human emotion and movement. His sculptures are characterized by their intricate details and lifelike qualities, capturing the essence of Romanticism and Neoclassicism. Carpeaux's ability to convey emotion through texture and form made him a pivotal figure in the art world of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents emotionally charged human busts as solid, highly modelled sculptures, with carefully articulated anatomy, hair, and cascading drapery. Restrained stone, bronze, and shadowed tones, directional lighting, and dark neutral backdrops give the portraits a solemn classical presence while emphasizing expressive poses and surface texture."},{"id":"joana-vasconcelos","name":"Joana Vasconcelos","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Joana Vasconcelos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joana-vasconcelos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joana-vasconcelos","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","motion","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic","geometric"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver","deep-red","red","black"],"intro":"Joana Vasconcelos is a contemporary Portuguese artist known for her large-scale installations and sculptures that often incorporate everyday objects and traditional crafts. Her work explores themes of identity, gender, and cultural heritage, blending the boundaries between art and craft.","observation":"The style presents enormous fantastical creatures as highly tactile soft sculptures, covered in dense beads, yarn, embroidery, tassels, and repeated ornamental motifs. Saturated pinks, reds, oranges, and blues contrast with grand pale architectural interiors, while curling appendages and monumental scale create a vivid, surreal installation-like spectacle."},{"id":"sonia-boyce","name":"Sonia Boyce","cat":"painters","en":"Sonia Boyce","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sonia-boyce.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sonia-boyce","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","dark-rust","dark-blue","vivid-rust","deep-pink"],"intro":"Sonia Boyce is a prominent British artist known for her work exploring themes of race, gender, and history. Her art often incorporates multimedia elements, including photography, video, and sound, to create immersive experiences that challenge societal norms and celebrate cultural diversity. Boyce has been a significant figure in the British art scene since the 1980s, contributing to the discourse on black identity and representation.","observation":"Across the sheet, richly patterned portraits and group scenes combine visible painted texture with crisp illustrative contours and densely layered details. Saturated orange, blue, red, and green dominate, while patterned clothing, textiles, ceramics, and interiors create a highly decorative, expressive visual language."},{"id":"alfred-augustus-glendening","name":"Alfred Augustus Glendening","cat":"painters","en":"Alfred Augustus Glendening","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-augustus-glendening.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-augustus-glendening","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","dark-olive","beige","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Alfred Augustus Glendening was a British landscape painter known for his detailed and idyllic depictions of the English countryside during the Victorian era. His works often feature serene natural settings, capturing the tranquility and beauty of rural life with a focus on light and atmosphere.","observation":"The style uses richly painterly, visible brushwork to render lush garden landscapes with realistic figures, reflective ponds, abundant flowers, and layered foliage. Warm natural light, subdued earthy color, and dense environmental detail create tranquil, romantic scenes with a polished storybook quality."},{"id":"frances-macdonald","name":"Frances MacDonald","cat":"painters","en":"Frances MacDonald","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frances-macdonald.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frances-macdonald","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","muted-blue","dark-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Frances MacDonald is a Scottish artist associated with the Glasgow Style and Art Nouveau movement. She was known for her intricate and symbolic works, often featuring ethereal figures and decorative elements. Her art was characterized by a blend of mystical themes and detailed ornamentation, reflecting early 20th-century aesthetics.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, painterly portraiture with delicate linework, softly blended muted colors, and richly patterned surfaces. Elongated women, elaborate garments, botanical details, and halo-like circular forms create an ornate, dreamy tableau with a distinctly illustrative, decorative finish."},{"id":"edward-kienholz","name":"Edward Kienholz","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Edward Kienholz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-kienholz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-kienholz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","muted-ochre","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Edward Kienholz was an American artist known for his assemblage sculptures and installations that often critiqued social and cultural issues. His work frequently incorporated found objects and materials to create immersive environments that challenged viewers' perceptions of reality and society.","observation":"The style presents densely constructed, surreal tableaux assembled from distressed machinery, furniture, animal forms, mannequins, and found materials. Subdued earth tones, strong light-dark separation, weathered surfaces, and carefully staged interior compositions give the scenes a sculptural, museum-installation character."},{"id":"paul-strand","name":"Paul Strand","cat":"photographers","en":"Paul Strand","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-strand.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-strand","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Paul Strand was an influential American photographer and filmmaker, known for his pioneering work in the field of modernist photography. Born in 1890, Strand played a crucial role in establishing photography as an art form. His work often focused on capturing the essence of everyday life, architecture, and portraits with a keen eye for detail and composition.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome photography with hard tonal separation, deep shadows, and prominent tactile textures in skin, rope, wood, and fabric. Tight cropping and close viewpoints create a dramatic, cinematic sense of human tension, while visible grain and direct faces reinforce the austere documentary-like mood."},{"id":"willi-baumeister","name":"Willi Baumeister","cat":"painters","en":"Willi Baumeister","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/willi-baumeister.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/willi-baumeister","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","ornate","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","dark-blue","muted-ochre","silver","vivid-red","ochre"],"intro":"Willi Baumeister was a German painter, scenic designer, and typographer, known for his contributions to modern art and abstract painting. Born in 1889, Baumeister was a prominent figure in the European avant-garde movement, particularly recognized for his work in the Bauhaus and Constructivist styles. His art often explored themes of abstraction and symbolism, using geometric forms and vibrant colors to convey complex ideas.","observation":"Across all four works, bold geometric and biomorphic shapes are arranged in dense abstract compositions on warm cream grounds. Strong red, blue, black, orange, and muted green forms use flat-edged areas alongside visibly brushed, textured paint, with recurring circles, eyes, spikes, and simplified organic figures creating an expressive surreal effect."},{"id":"jeffrey-milstein","name":"Jeffrey Milstein","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jeffrey Milstein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeffrey-milstein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeffrey-milstein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","patterns","scenes","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","brown","dark-cyan","orange"],"intro":"Jeffrey Milstein is a renowned photographer known for his aerial images capturing the complexity and beauty of urban landscapes. His work often focuses on the intricate patterns and structures of cities, offering a unique perspective from above.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, top-down aerial imagery with dense aircraft-filled industrial landscapes and strong geometric organization. Muted blue-gray and brown tones, crisp structural detail, repeated airplane forms, and hard directional shadows create a cinematic, high-contrast documentary-like appearance."},{"id":"horst-p-horst","name":"Horst P. Horst","cat":"photographers","en":"Horst P. Horst","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/horst-p-horst.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/horst-p-horst","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","backlighting","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","white","beige","bone-white","black"],"intro":"Horst P. Horst was a renowned German-American fashion photographer known for his elegant and sophisticated images, particularly in the realm of fashion and portrait photography. His work often appeared in Vogue and other high-profile publications, capturing the essence of glamour and style during the mid-20th century.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, monochrome fashion tableaux with carefully posed figures, elaborate garments, and richly furnished interiors. Hard sunlight through large windows creates graphic shadows, deep blacks, and bright whites, while balanced arrangements and vintage editorial staging give the images a polished cinematic character."},{"id":"carl-spitzweg","name":"Carl Spitzweg","cat":"painters","en":"Carl Spitzweg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-spitzweg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-spitzweg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","ochre","bone-white","muted-green"],"intro":"Carl Spitzweg was a German Romanticist painter known for his detailed and intimate portrayals of everyday life in 19th-century Europe. His works often depict scenes of bourgeois domesticity, urban landscapes, and quiet moments of contemplation, characterized by a warm, earthy color palette and a gentle, painterly style.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to depict atmospheric ruined urban environments with dense architectural detail and small narrative figures. Muted earth tones, deep teal shadows, warm orange light, and strong dark-to-light contrasts create a somber, fantastical mood across the scenes."},{"id":"felix-gonzalez-torres","name":"Felix Gonzalez-Torres","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Felix Gonzalez-Torres","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/felix-gonzalez-torres.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/felix-gonzalez-torres","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","glow","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","sci-fi"],"colours":["brown","beige","silver","muted-brown","black"],"intro":"Felix Gonzalez-Torres was a Cuban-American visual artist known for his minimalist and conceptual works that often engage with themes of love, loss, and identity. His art frequently incorporates everyday materials and is characterized by its simplicity and emotional depth. Gonzalez-Torres is celebrated for his ability to transform the mundane into profound statements, often inviting viewer interaction and interpretation.","observation":"The style is photorealistic and cinematic, presenting expansive industrial interiors with dense curtains of suspended lights and reflective floors. Subdued, moody color palettes contrast with luminous points of warm or cool light, while sparse human figures provide scale and a contemplative sci-fi atmosphere."},{"id":"mark-henson","name":"Mark Henson","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Henson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-henson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-henson","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","glow","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-blue","brown","muted-violet","rust","pale-orange"],"intro":"Mark Henson is a contemporary American artist known for his visionary and psychedelic art. His work often explores themes of spirituality, consciousness, and the interconnectedness of life. Henson's paintings are celebrated for their vibrant colors, intricate details, and imaginative compositions that invite viewers into a world of fantasy and transcendence.","observation":"These landscapes combine richly visible brushwork with dense, finely articulated foliage, bark, clouds, and terrain. Saturated jewel-like colors, radiant internal light, winding paths, and impossible natural forms create an expansive dreamlike fantasy atmosphere across all four views."},{"id":"josef-hoffmann","name":"Josef Hoffmann","cat":"designers","en":"Josef Hoffmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/josef-hoffmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/josef-hoffmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","brown","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Josef Hoffmann was an influential Austrian architect and designer, known for his role in the Vienna Secession movement and as a founder of the Wiener Werkstätte. His work is characterized by a combination of functional design and decorative art, often featuring geometric patterns and a modernist aesthetic. Hoffmann's contributions to architecture and design have left a lasting impact on the development of modernist styles in Europe.","observation":"The style presents carefully staged furniture and objects as realistic studio still lifes, with crisp geometry, fine linear structures, and highly legible woven or gridded surface patterns. Restrained neutrals, dark metal, warm wood, and occasional lacquer red sit against generous uncluttered backdrops, while directional lighting casts long, defined shadows."},{"id":"heywood-hardy","name":"Heywood Hardy","cat":"painters","en":"Heywood Hardy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/heywood-hardy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/heywood-hardy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","bone-white","white","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Heywood Hardy was a British painter known for his depictions of animals, hunting scenes, and rural life during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His works often captured the essence of the English countryside, portraying both the landscape and the people within it with a keen eye for detail and realism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint to depict pastoral hunting scenes with dogs, horses, riders, and expansive countryside. Earthy autumnal colors, atmospheric skies, layered vegetation, and carefully observed animal forms create a detailed yet energetic classical landscape-painting effect."},{"id":"leandro-erlich","name":"Leandro Erlich","cat":"various-artists","en":"Leandro Erlich","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leandro-erlich.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leandro-erlich","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","scenes","urban","motion","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","blue","beige","white","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Leandro Erlich is an Argentine conceptual artist known for his large-scale installations that challenge perceptions of reality. His works often play with architectural elements and optical illusions, creating immersive experiences that invite viewers to question their surroundings.","observation":"The style combines realistic, cinematic architectural photography with surreal floating structures, mirrored spaces, and impossible perspectives. Strong geometric framing, saturated blue skies, and deep teal shadows give the urban scenes a dreamy, slightly uncanny atmosphere, while tiny figures emphasize the buildings’ monumental scale."},{"id":"thomas-leuthard","name":"Thomas Leuthard","cat":"photographers","en":"Thomas Leuthard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-leuthard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-leuthard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","scenes","urban","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","geometric"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Thomas Leuthard is a renowned Swiss street photographer known for his compelling black and white images that capture the essence of urban life. His work often focuses on candid moments and the interactions of people within city environments, emphasizing storytelling through visual composition.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, hard directional sunlight, and sharply defined pools of illumination. Geometric concrete architecture dominates the compositions, while solitary moving figures provide scale and a restrained cinematic sense of urban isolation."},{"id":"thurston-hopkins","name":"Thurston Hopkins","cat":"photographers","en":"Thurston Hopkins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thurston-hopkins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thurston-hopkins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","characters","scenes","urban","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Thurston Hopkins was a renowned British photojournalist known for his evocative black and white images capturing post-war Britain. His work often depicted the everyday life and social conditions of the time, providing a poignant glimpse into the lives of ordinary people.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome, high-contrast photographic storytelling set in dense urban streets, with children, adults, and animals caught in candid, narrative moments. Grain, selective focus, weathered architecture, and recurring haze give the scenes a documentary-like, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"yeezy","name":"Yeezy","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Yeezy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yeezy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yeezy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors"],"colours":["beige","brown","muted-brown","black","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Yeezy is a fashion brand founded by the American rapper, singer, and entrepreneur known for his influential impact on music and fashion. The brand is recognized for its minimalist yet bold designs, often incorporating elements of streetwear and high fashion.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, carefully constructed sneaker product studies with strong material definition, sculptural volume, and densely legible textile and sole textures. Warm, subdued earth tones, controlled studio-like lighting, shallow focus, and grounded shadows unify the images, while one dramatic environmental setup adds red fabric and a dark forest backdrop without changing the overall product-rendering emphasis."},{"id":"joaquin-salvador-lavado-tejon","name":"Quino","cat":"illustrators","en":"Quino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joaquin-salvador-lavado-tejon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joaquin-salvador-lavado-tejon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","surreal","drawing","ink","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","dark-brown","grey","charcoal","muted-orange"],"intro":"Quino is a fantasy storybook illustrator known for his detailed and whimsical ink drawings. His works often feature medieval castles, fantasy creatures, and intricate architectural elements, creating a dreamlike and mysterious atmosphere. Influenced by Gothic art and Surrealism , Quino's illustrations are characterized by high contrast, precise line work, and a rich narrative quality that evokes fairy-tale stories and complex adventures.","observation":"The style uses monochrome pen-and-ink illustration with delicate contour lines, stippling, and dense crosshatched shading on textured white paper. Odd, elongated humanoid and animal characters are presented as sparse, self-contained vignettes, giving the work a whimsical, slightly surreal storybook mood."},{"id":"patrick-chappatte","name":"Patrick Chappatte","cat":"illustrators","en":"Patrick Chappatte","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patrick-chappatte.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patrick-chappatte","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","subdued-colors","comics","drawing","dark"],"colours":["grey","bone-white","charcoal","vivid-red","rust","silver"],"intro":"Patrick Chappatte is a Swiss-Lebanese cartoonist known for his editorial cartoons and graphic journalism. His work often addresses political and social issues with a sharp, insightful perspective, blending humor with critical commentary.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense black ink contours, heavy crosshatching, and emphatic linework to create richly detailed graphic-novel scenes. Restrained blue-grey and earth tones are punctuated by intense orange fire and stark red fields, giving the compositions a tense, bleak, documentary-like wartime atmosphere."},{"id":"george-clausen","name":"George Clausen","cat":"painters","en":"George Clausen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-clausen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-clausen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"George Clausen was a British painter known for his depictions of rural life and landscapes during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. He was associated with the Newlyn School and was influenced by French naturalism, focusing on the beauty and simplicity of the countryside. Clausen's works often featured detailed and realistic portrayals of rural scenes, capturing the essence of agrarian life with a gentle and serene touch.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint with fine, layered strokes to render naturalistic figures, clothing, flowers, grasses, and trees. Restrained earthy colors, warm atmospheric light, and softly hazed pastoral settings create a contemplative, dreamy mood across both portraits and quiet outdoor scenes."},{"id":"esther-pissarro","name":"Esther Pissarro","cat":"painters","en":"Esther Pissarro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/esther-pissarro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/esther-pissarro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-green","bone-white","beige","dark-brown","ochre","white"],"intro":"Esther Pissarro is known for her contributions to the arts, particularly in the context of her family’s artistic legacy. As the daughter-in-law of Camille Pissarro , a leading figure in Impressionism , she was part of a vibrant artistic community in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. Her work often reflects the pastoral and idyllic scenes characteristic of the Impressionist movement, focusing on natural landscapes and rural life.","observation":"Across the landscapes and portrait, the style uses visible, finely varied brushstrokes and a textured oil-paint surface, with dense foliage and atmospheric skies built from many small marks. The palette is restrained and naturalistic, balancing deep greens with muted blues, creams, and warm peach accents in composed pastoral scenes and a quietly observed figure."},{"id":"william-whitaker","name":"William Whitaker","cat":"painters","en":"William Whitaker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-whitaker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-whitaker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","black","light-orange","ochre"],"intro":"William Whitaker is an American artist known for his realistic portraits and figurative works. He has a reputation for capturing the subtle nuances of human expression and emotion, often focusing on the delicate interplay of light and shadow in his compositions. Whitaker's work is celebrated for its technical precision and the ability to convey a sense of intimacy and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines softly realistic portraiture with visible oil-paint brushwork, layered fabric texture, and richly modelled faces and clothing. Warm ochres, browns, creams, and deep shadows create an intimate, subdued mood, while restrained poses and dark studio-like grounds give the images a classical fashion-portrait character."},{"id":"hans-hofmann","name":"Hans Hofmann","cat":"painters","en":"Hans Hofmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-hofmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-hofmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","ink","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-orange","dark-green","vivid-rust","ochre","dark-blue"],"intro":"Hans Hofmann is a renowned German-American painter, known for his significant contributions to Abstract Expressionism. Born in 1880, Hofmann was a pivotal figure in the development of modern art, particularly in the United States, where he taught and influenced many artists. His work is characterized by vibrant colors, dynamic compositions, and a unique approach to form and space.","observation":"These abstract paintings combine saturated blocks of red, blue, yellow, green, and white with vigorous, visibly built-up brushwork. Broad gestures, scraped and dragged pigment, thin scratched marks, and occasional drips create an expressive tension between geometric structure and raw painterly surface."},{"id":"arthur-suydam","name":"Arthur Suydam","cat":"illustrators","en":"Arthur Suydam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-suydam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-suydam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-green","dark-brown","muted-green","dark-rust","orange"],"intro":"Arthur Suydam is a renowned American artist known for his work in comic books and fantasy art. He has contributed to various popular series and is celebrated for his distinctive style that combines elements of horror and fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, imposing monstrous characters occupy turbulent fantasy environments shaped by fire, smoke, cliffs, and water. Thick visible brushwork, rough textured surfaces, deep shadows, and forceful orange-versus-teal lighting create an expressive, ominous, monumental look."},{"id":"kohei-nawa","name":"Kohei Nawa","cat":"various-artists","en":"Kohei Nawa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kohei-nawa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kohei-nawa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","animals","glow","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","brown","charcoal","beige","silver"],"intro":"Kohei Nawa is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his innovative use of materials and technology to explore themes of perception and reality. His work often involves a fusion of organic and synthetic elements, creating visually striking and thought-provoking pieces that challenge traditional boundaries of art.","observation":"Across all four renders, deer are depicted as elaborate, otherworldly sculptures made from translucent, crystalline, branching materials, with bodies dissolving into foliage, splashes, or butterflies. Restrained whites, silvers, and greys are punctuated by strong gallery lighting and reflective highlights, producing a highly detailed, luminous fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"camille-pissarro","name":"Camille Pissarro","cat":"painters","en":"Camille Pissarro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/camille-pissarro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/camille-pissarro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","silver","dark-green","olive","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Camille Pissarro was a Danish-French Impressionist and Neo-Impressionist painter born in 1830. He is known for his influence on the Impressionist movement and his depictions of rural and urban French life. Pissarro's work often features landscapes, rural scenes, and cityscapes, characterized by a focus on light and atmosphere, with a distinctive use of color and brushwork.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses richly visible, directional brushwork and layered paint to render bright rural landscapes with abundant vegetation, village buildings, paths, and small human activity. The compositions are detailed and atmospheric, with warm natural light, vivid greens and reds, and a calm pastoral setting.utm"},{"id":"jules-breton","name":"Jules Breton","cat":"painters","en":"Jules Breton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jules-breton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jules-breton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","pale-yellow","orange"],"intro":"Jules Breton is a renowned 19th-century French painter known for his depictions of rural life and peasant scenes. His works often reflect the natural beauty and simplicity of the countryside, capturing the essence of agrarian life with a focus on realism and detail. Breton's paintings are celebrated for their serene and contemplative atmosphere, often portraying figures in harmonious landscapes.","observation":"The style uses richly visible paint handling, fine brushwork, and dense naturalistic detail to depict emotionally charged rural scenes. Muted earth tones, deep shadows, and warm sunset light create a solemn, atmospheric mood, while carefully posed figures and expansive skies give the compositions a classical sense of drama."},{"id":"leo-caillard","name":"Leo Caillard","cat":"various-artists","en":"Leo Caillard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leo-caillard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leo-caillard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["dark-brown","beige","brown","white","dark-blue","muted-blue"],"intro":"Leo Caillard is a contemporary French artist known for his innovative approach to blending classical art with modern digital techniques. His work often explores themes of time, identity, and perception, creating a dialogue between the past and present through his unique artistic vision.","observation":"The style presents surreal, highly detailed sculptural figures and objects in carefully staged, cinematic tableaux. Draped fabric, flowers, collage fragments, and carved or modeled surfaces create tactile visual richness, while subdued earth tones and controlled lighting give the scenes a moody, fine-art editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"adolf-wolfli","name":"Adolf Wolfli","cat":"painters","en":"Adolf Wolfli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adolf-wolfli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adolf-wolfli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","patterns","fine-lines","vivid-colors","religious","drawing","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["muted-orange","rust","dark-brown","charcoal","beige","red"],"intro":"Adolf Wolfli was a Swiss artist known for his intricate and imaginative works that are often categorized as outsider art. Born in 1864, Wolfli spent much of his life in a psychiatric hospital, where he created a vast body of work that included drawings, writings, and musical compositions. His art is characterized by its detailed patterns, complex structures, and fantastical themes, often reflecting his inner world and experiences.","observation":"The style is densely illustrative and highly ornamental, combining fine linear drawing with repeated geometric and radial structures. Saturated reds, blues, ochres, and blacks organize frontal figures, symbolic eyes, solar emblems, hieroglyphic marks, and temple-like scenes into symmetrical, register-based compositions with a deliberately aged painted-surface texture."},{"id":"albert-marquet","name":"Albert Marquet","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Marquet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-marquet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-marquet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","pale-orange","brown","charcoal","olive","rust"],"intro":"Albert Marquet is a French painter known for his post-impressionist works, often depicting urban and coastal scenes with a focus on light and atmosphere. His style is characterized by a harmonious blend of color and form, capturing the essence of his surroundings with a serene and tranquil approach.","observation":"Across all four views, the scenes are built from visible, broad paint strokes that simplify harbor water, boats, rooftops, trees, and distant skylines into lively planes of color. The palette remains restrained and airy, with expressive marks, fine structural lines, and recurring coastal activity creating a cohesive painted travelogue style."},{"id":"archibald-motley","name":"Archibald Motley","cat":"painters","en":"Archibald Motley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/archibald-motley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/archibald-motley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","deep-red","grey","ochre","deep-green","blue"],"intro":"Archibald Motley is a renowned African American painter known for his vibrant depictions of urban Black culture during the Harlem Renaissance. His work often captures the lively and dynamic atmosphere of social gatherings, nightclubs, and everyday life, highlighting themes of identity and community.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured paint and broad, visible strokes shape crowded scenes of stylish figures dancing, socializing, and posing. Saturated reds, greens, blacks, and oranges create forceful contrast, while patterned clothing, hats, furniture, and gallery-like interiors receive dense decorative detail."},{"id":"hanne-darboven","name":"Hanne Darboven","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Hanne Darboven","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hanne-darboven.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hanne-darboven","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","patterns","scenes","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","muted-ochre","white","brown","orange"],"intro":"Hanne Darboven is a German conceptual artist known for her large-scale, repetitive works that often explore themes of time and history. Her art is characterized by the use of numbers, texts, and calendars, creating a unique visual language that bridges the gap between art and mathematics.","observation":"The style presents quiet, realistic museum interiors with carefully arranged archival materials, furniture, and framed documents. Repeated grids, orderly symmetry, fine printed lines, warm wood, and restrained cream-and-brown colors create a meticulous vintage exhibition aesthetic."},{"id":"cleon-peterson","name":"Cleon Peterson","cat":"painters","en":"Cleon Peterson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cleon-peterson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cleon-peterson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","deep-red","dark-red","pale-orange"],"intro":"Cleon Peterson is a contemporary American artist known for his graphic and often unsettling depictions of violence and chaos. His work frequently explores themes of power, conflict, and societal tension, often rendered in stark black and white with occasional splashes of red. Peterson's art is characterized by its bold, graphic style and its exploration of human nature's darker aspects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses a highly graphic red-and-black treatment with flat color fields, heavy ink-like contours, dense hatching, and stark tonal separation. Crowded human figures, dramatic gestures, and layered situational compositions create a forceful comic-panel energy with a dark, kinetic mood."},{"id":"leroy-neiman","name":"LeRoy Neiman","cat":"painters","en":"LeRoy Neiman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leroy-neiman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leroy-neiman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["cream","dark-blue","muted-teal","blue","orange","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"LeRoy Neiman is known for his vibrant and energetic paintings that capture the excitement of sports and leisure activities. His work is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a distinctive style that blends elements of impressionism and expressionism. Neiman's art often depicts scenes of social gatherings, nightlife, and athletic events, reflecting a lively and celebratory atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four images, energetic horse-and-rider or landscape forms are built from thick, highly visible paint strokes, scraped textures, and forceful directional marks. Saturated turquoise, cobalt, orange, coral, pink, and black create intense contrast, while fragmented contours and compressed forms give the scenes a dynamic, semi-surreal character."},{"id":"lilla-cabot-perry","name":"Lilla Cabot Perry","cat":"painters","en":"Lilla Cabot Perry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lilla-cabot-perry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lilla-cabot-perry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","light-orange","deep-blue","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Lilla Cabot Perry was an American artist known for her contributions to the American Impressionist movement. Born in 1848, she was influenced by her time in France and her interactions with artists like Claude Monet. Perry's work often features portraits and landscapes, characterized by a soft, impressionistic style.","observation":"The style presents richly rendered female portraits with visible, tactile brushwork, nuanced faces, and carefully described fabrics, fur, flowers, and interiors. Saturated blues, purples, reds, and deep greens create a dramatic yet refined palette, while composed poses and period garments give the images a formal classical character."},{"id":"edward-ardizzone","name":"Edward Ardizzone","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Ardizzone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-ardizzone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-ardizzone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","muted-orange","brown","black","dark-red","orange"],"intro":"Edward Ardizzone was a British painter and illustrator known for his distinctive style in children's book illustrations and narrative art. Born in 1900, Ardizzone's work is characterized by its whimsical and nostalgic qualities, often depicting scenes of everyday life with a touch of humor and warmth.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines expressive watercolor washes with visible pen-and-ink outlines, fine hatching, and varied line density. It presents richly observed, narrative scenes with children and adults moving through domestic urban and garden settings, using restrained earthy colors punctuated by reds and greens."},{"id":"cornelis-springer","name":"Cornelis Springer","cat":"painters","en":"Cornelis Springer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cornelis-springer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cornelis-springer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-blue","bone-white","dark-brown","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Cornelis Springer is a renowned Dutch painter known for his detailed and atmospheric depictions of urban landscapes and architectural scenes. Born in 1817, Springer became famous for his ability to capture the essence of 19th-century Dutch towns, often focusing on historical buildings and bustling street life. His works are celebrated for their realism and intricate attention to detail, reflecting a deep appreciation for the architectural heritage of the Netherlands.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents richly observed historic canal cities with weathered brick architecture, Gothic spires, boats, waterways, and bustling figures. Warm directional light, atmospheric skies, reflective water, and visible fine brushwork create a detailed, painterly realism with subdued earth tones and dramatic golden highlights."},{"id":"jacob-riis","name":"Jacob Riis","cat":"photographers","en":"Jacob Riis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacob-riis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacob-riis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","urban","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","white"],"intro":"Jacob Riis was a Danish-American social reformer, \"muckraking\" journalist, and social documentary photographer. He is known for his dedication to improving the living conditions of impoverished communities in New York City during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work, particularly his book \"How the Other Half Lives,\" brought attention to the squalid living conditions in the city's slums and helped inspire housing reform.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents crowded, impoverished urban interiors in stark black and white, with documentary-like human scenes staged in cramped rooms and passageways. Hard pools of practical light, deep shadows, visible grain, selective focus, and richly rendered grime give the images a cinematic yet observational intensity."},{"id":"george-caleb-bingham","name":"George Caleb Bingham","cat":"painters","en":"George Caleb Bingham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-caleb-bingham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-caleb-bingham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","muted-blue","grey","silver"],"intro":"George Caleb Bingham was a 19th-century American artist known for his depictions of frontier life and river scenes. His work is characterized by a focus on everyday life and the American landscape, often capturing the spirit of the people and places of the time. Bingham's paintings are celebrated for their detailed realism and ability to convey the atmosphere of the American frontier.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents expansive river landscapes with carefully observed trees, water, boats, cliffs, and towering clouds in a richly painted, naturalistic manner. Warm directional light, softened distance, reflective water, and subdued earth-and-sky colors create a tranquil yet grand, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"finn-juhl","name":"Finn Juhl","cat":"designers","en":"Finn Juhl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/finn-juhl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/finn-juhl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","beige","black","bone-white","brown","dark-brown"],"intro":"Finn Juhl was a Danish architect, interior, and industrial designer, renowned for his significant contributions to the Danish Modern movement. He is celebrated for his innovative approach to furniture design, characterized by organic shapes and a focus on functionality and aesthetics. Juhl's work often features clean lines, smooth curves, and a harmonious blend of form and function, making him a pivotal figure in 20th-century design.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents carefully composed, realistic furniture imagery with sculptural wooden frames, curved upholstery, and finely resolved material surfaces. Restrained earthy colors, spacious studio backgrounds, and controlled directional lighting give the images a refined, design-focused product-photography appearance."},{"id":"trevor-paglen","name":"Trevor Paglen","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Trevor Paglen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/trevor-paglen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/trevor-paglen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","dark-brown","silver","orange"],"intro":"Trevor Paglen is an American artist known for his work that explores themes of surveillance, data collection, and the unseen aspects of our world. His art often delves into the intersections of technology, politics, and society, using a variety of mediums including photography, sculpture, and video to reveal hidden systems and structures.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, cinematic landscape imagery with dense atmospheric detail, deep shadows, and strong warm light against cool storm tones. Glowing fire, reflected highlights, misty cloud layers, and immense natural phenomena create a dark, epic, surreal mood across the variations."},{"id":"laszlo-moholy-nagy","name":"Laszlo Moholy-Nagy","cat":"various-artists","en":"Laszlo Moholy-Nagy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laszlo-moholy-nagy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laszlo-moholy-nagy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","ornate","patterns","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["muted-yellow","bone-white","silver","vivid-red","black","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Laszlo Moholy-Nagy was a Hungarian artist and educator associated with the Bauhaus school. He was a pioneer in integrating technology and art, exploring new media such as photography, film, and industrial design. His work is characterized by a focus on abstraction, geometric shapes, and a modernist aesthetic.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines strongly geometric abstraction with circles, bars, grids, and overlapping flat shapes arranged in balanced but varied compositions. Saturated red and black accents sit against subdued cream, grey, and tan grounds, while visible canvas grain, brush texture, and fine construction lines give the clean geometry a tactile, handmade surface."},{"id":"franz-kline","name":"Franz Kline","cat":"painters","en":"Franz Kline","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/franz-kline.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/franz-kline","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","ink","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","cream","bone-white","beige","brown"],"intro":"Franz Kline was an American painter known for his distinctive style within the Abstract Expressionist movement. Born in 1910, Kline became a prominent figure in the New York School, renowned for his bold, gestural brushstrokes and dramatic compositions. His work often features stark contrasts and a monochromatic palette, emphasizing the dynamic interplay of form and space.","observation":"Across all four panels, stark black masses and angular bands are set against an ivory ground in a highly abstract, forceful arrangement. Visible brush direction, dry edges, scraping, drips, and built-up paint give the work a raw painterly surface, while the restricted palette and extreme tonal separation make the geometry especially emphatic."},{"id":"godfried-schalcken","name":"Godfried Schalcken","cat":"painters","en":"Godfried Schalcken","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/godfried-schalcken.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/godfried-schalcken","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Godfried Schalcken was a Dutch genre and portrait painter known for his mastery of candlelight effects, active during the Dutch Golden Age. His works often depicted intimate, domestic scenes with a focus on light and shadow, creating a serene and contemplative atmosphere.","observation":"These images use richly modeled, painterly figures emerging from near-black surroundings, with warm amber and copper light concentrated on faces, hands, fabric, flames, and mystical apparatus. Strong chiaroscuro, visible fine brushwork, and atmospheric smoke create an old-fashioned, theatrical mood across portraits and occult laboratory scenes."},{"id":"takeshi-kitano","name":"Takeshi Kitano","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Takeshi Kitano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/takeshi-kitano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/takeshi-kitano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","rust","dark-cyan","beige","silver"],"intro":"Takeshi Kitano is a renowned Japanese filmmaker, actor, and comedian known for his unique blend of humor and violence in cinema. He has directed and starred in numerous films, gaining international acclaim for works like \"Hana-bi\" and \"Sonatine.\" Kitano's style often explores themes of existentialism, human emotion, and the complexities of life, making him a distinctive voice in the world of film.","observation":"The style uses intensely realistic, tightly cropped portraiture with highly legible skin texture, bruising, smoke, and facial detail. Moody teal, amber, and near-black tones combine with hard cinematic contrast, visible grain, and shadow-heavy compositions to create a gritty, surreal editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"wade-guyton","name":"Wade Guyton","cat":"various-artists","en":"Wade Guyton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wade-guyton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wade-guyton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","silver","brown","black","rust","vivid-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Wade Guyton is an American contemporary artist known for his innovative use of digital technology in art. His work often explores the intersection of traditional painting and digital processes, utilizing tools like inkjet printers to create large-scale abstract pieces. Guyton's art challenges conventional notions of authorship and originality in the digital age, making him a significant figure in postmodern art.","observation":"Across all four views, the style combines large geometric color fields with energetic black gestural paint, scraped textures, drips, grids, and irregular edges. Strong red, orange, cream, yellow, and black contrasts alternate with generous pale space, producing bold, monumental abstract compositions with a visibly worked surface."},{"id":"rafael-lozano-hemmer","name":"Rafael Lozano-Hemmer","cat":"various-artists","en":"Rafael Lozano-Hemmer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rafael-lozano-hemmer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rafael-lozano-hemmer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","glow","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","rust","orange"],"intro":"Rafael Lozano-Hemmer is a Mexican-Canadian artist known for his large-scale interactive installations that explore the intersection of architecture and performance art. His work often involves the use of technology to create immersive environments that engage the public in unique and thought-provoking ways.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, presenting vast architectural interiors filled with dense arrays of suspended glowing bulbs and reflective floors. Warm amber-brown color grading, atmospheric depth, silhouetted visitors, and monumental perspective create a moody, immersive, subtly surreal exhibition-like mood."},{"id":"tom-toles","name":"Tom Toles","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tom Toles","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-toles.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-toles","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","grey","white","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Tom Toles is an American editorial cartoonist known for his work in political satire. His cartoons have been featured in prominent newspapers, where he uses humor and wit to comment on political and social issues. Toles's style is characterized by bold lines, exaggerated features, and a keen sense of irony, making his work both visually striking and thought-provoking.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses dense black-and-white ink drawing, heavy outlines, and extensive crosshatching to build expressive faces, clothing, crowds, and atmospheric backgrounds. The scenes combine macabre or uncanny characters with exaggerated eyes, stark contrast, and surreal comic situations."},{"id":"camille-claudel","name":"Camille Claudel","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Camille Claudel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/camille-claudel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/camille-claudel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","dark-brown"],"intro":"Camille Claudel was a French sculptor known for her expressive and emotive works in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. She was a student and collaborator of Auguste Rodin , and her work is often associated with the Symbolist and Romantic movements. Claudel's sculptures are celebrated for their intricate detail and dynamic compositions, capturing the human form with sensitivity and depth.","observation":"The style presents realistic, head-and-shoulders portraits as solid, heavily modeled busts, with visibly worked clay surfaces, rough hair, and folded drapery. Restrained beige and gray tones, strong directional light, deep backgrounds, and tightly cropped compositions give the figures a dramatic classical presence."},{"id":"talbot-hughes","name":"Talbot Hughes","cat":"painters","en":"Talbot Hughes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/talbot-hughes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/talbot-hughes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","silver","brown","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Talbot Hughes was a British painter known for his historical genre paintings and portraits, often depicting scenes from the 18th and 19th centuries. His work is characterized by its detailed representation of period costumes and settings, capturing the elegance and social dynamics of the time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is defined by richly layered oil-paint surfaces, delicate but visible brushwork, and highly rendered fabrics, faces, foliage, and ornament. Dark surroundings and strong light-dark separation create a dramatic, romantic atmosphere, while soft figures, floral details, and flowing drapery recur as expressive subjects."},{"id":"percy-tarrant","name":"Percy Tarrant","cat":"illustrators","en":"Percy Tarrant","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/percy-tarrant.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/percy-tarrant","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","muted-brown","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Percy Tarrant is a historical illustrator known for his contributions to Victorian and early 20th-century art. His works often depict romantic and idyllic scenes, capturing the essence of the era with a focus on detailed and realistic portrayals of characters and settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, directional brushwork with layered, textured paint and expressive figure rendering. Warm highlights against deep shadows, subdued earth-and-sea colors, and carefully staged historical or coastal scenes create a dramatic yet naturalistic classical mood."},{"id":"william-klein","name":"William Klein","cat":"photographers","en":"William Klein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-klein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-klein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","beige","white","brown","dark-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"William Klein is an influential American photographer and filmmaker known for his innovative approach to street and fashion photography. Born in 1926, Klein's work is characterized by its bold, graphic style and often confrontational subject matter. He is celebrated for his ability to capture the raw energy of urban life, particularly in cities like New York and Paris, and his work has had a lasting impact on both photography and cinema.","observation":"The style is a cinematic, editorial fashion-photography collage built from tightly cropped portraits, urban street glimpses, and dramatic accessories. Predominantly monochrome imagery, selective red accents, strong contrast, visible grain, shallow focus, and motion blur create a polished retro-magazine atmosphere."},{"id":"timothy-easton","name":"Timothy Easton","cat":"painters","en":"Timothy Easton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/timothy-easton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/timothy-easton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-ochre","beige","dark-green","muted-ochre","silver","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Timothy Easton is a contemporary British artist known for his vibrant and detailed landscape paintings, often depicting the English countryside and gardens. His work is characterized by a keen observation of nature and a dedication to capturing the beauty of rural settings.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with finely observed domestic and garden scenes, using vivid floral color, strong sunlight, and layered countryside depth. Dense botanical detail, patterned textiles, porcelain objects, and reflective water are handled with lively, delicate strokes that keep the scenes atmospheric and inviting."},{"id":"edmund-de-waal","name":"Edmund de Waal","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Edmund de Waal","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edmund-de-waal.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edmund-de-waal","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","flat-color","subdued-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","silver","dark-brown"],"intro":"Edmund de Waal is a renowned British ceramic artist and author, celebrated for his minimalist porcelain works and installations. His art often explores themes of memory, history, and the passage of time, with a particular focus on the delicate beauty of simple forms. De Waal's works are characterized by their serene and contemplative nature, often displayed in carefully arranged installations that invite viewers to reflect on the spaces between objects.","observation":"The style presents carefully arranged ceramic vessels in highly ordered grids, vitrines, and shelving, with repeated forms creating a strong geometric rhythm. Soft neutral lighting, pale surfaces, and restrained white-and-wood colors give the scenes a calm, refined museum-display quality, while the ceramics retain dimensional modeled surfaces and fine decorative variation."},{"id":"george-biddle","name":"George Biddle","cat":"painters","en":"George Biddle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-biddle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-biddle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","patterns","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["bone-white","black","dark-brown","beige","ochre","rust"],"intro":"George Biddle is an American artist known for his contributions to the development of social realism in the United States. He played a significant role in the establishment of the Federal Art Project during the Great Depression, which aimed to provide work for artists and bring art to the public. Biddle's work often depicted social issues and everyday life, reflecting his commitment to art as a tool for social change.","observation":"Across the sheet, the style combines heavily textured, visibly worked surfaces with dense collage-like layering, expressive figurative forms, and intricate drawn marks. Strong reds, ochres, blacks, and contrasting highlights give the works a vivid, dramatic presence, while the imagery shifts between recognizable figures and surreal, fragmented compositions."},{"id":"bernard-leach","name":"Bernard Leach","cat":"designers","en":"Bernard Leach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bernard-leach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bernard-leach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","subdued-colors"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","white","muted-brown","brown"],"intro":"Bernard Leach was a British studio potter and art teacher, often regarded as the \"Father of British studio pottery.\" He played a significant role in the development of modern ceramics and was instrumental in bridging Eastern and Western pottery traditions. Leach's work is characterized by its simplicity, functionality, and a deep respect for traditional craftsmanship.","observation":"The style presents handmade ceramic vessels as realistic tabletop still lifes, with carefully rendered volume, glaze variation, chips, speckles, and rough fired surfaces. Muted earthy greens, creams, and browns, soft studio lighting, and uncluttered neutral backgrounds create a quiet, tactile presentation."},{"id":"alma-woodsey-thomas","name":"Alma Woodsey Thomas","cat":"painters","en":"Alma Woodsey Thomas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alma-woodsey-thomas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alma-woodsey-thomas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","bone-white","light-orange","muted-teal","red","blue"],"intro":"Alma Woodsey Thomas was an influential African American painter known for her vibrant abstract works and as a prominent figure in the Washington Color School. Born in 1891, she became the first graduate of Howard University's art department and later a key figure in the civil rights movement, using her art to express themes of joy and beauty.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is abstract and pattern-driven, built from vivid blocks, stripes, grids, and mosaic-like repeated marks. Thick, visibly worked paint and irregular edges give the surfaces a tactile, energetic quality rather than a clean graphic finish."},{"id":"don-dixon","name":"Don Dixon","cat":"various-artists","en":"Don Dixon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/don-dixon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/don-dixon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-red","grey","red","bone-white"],"intro":"Don Dixon is a renowned American artist known for his contributions to the field of astronomical art. His work often depicts imaginative and scientifically inspired visions of space and otherworldly landscapes, blending artistic creativity with scientific accuracy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely detailed futuristic environments with monumental scale, saturated color, and strong light-dark contrasts. It presents expansive alien landscapes, elaborate megastructures, planets, and armored figures as dramatic, highly polished speculative-world illustrations."},{"id":"elisabeth-vigee-le-brun","name":"Elisabeth Vigee Le Brun","cat":"painters","en":"Elisabeth Vigee Le Brun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elisabeth-vigee-le-brun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elisabeth-vigee-le-brun","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","red","grey"],"intro":"Elisabeth Vigee Le Brun was a prominent French portrait painter of the late 18th century, known for her work depicting European aristocracy, including Marie Antoinette. Her style is characterized by its elegance, grace, and attention to detail, often incorporating elements of Rococo and Neoclassicism.","observation":"Across all four images, finely modeled female portraits are rendered with visible, delicate brushwork, rich fabric and lace detail, and dark grounds that set off the faces and saturated red accents. Floral headpieces, historical-looking garments, jewelry, and symbolic props give the compositions a formal, decorative character while the subdued palette and strong light-dark separation maintain a dramatic mood."},{"id":"frank-gehry","name":"Frank Gehry","cat":"architects","en":"Frank Gehry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-gehry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-gehry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","metallic","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["muted-blue","grey","black","silver","brown","muted-ochre","orange"],"intro":"Frank Gehry is a renowned Canadian-American architect known for his innovative and distinctive architectural designs. His work is characterized by bold, unconventional forms and the use of unique materials, which have made him a leading figure in contemporary architecture. Gehry's designs often challenge traditional architectural norms, resulting in visually striking and dynamic structures that have garnered international acclaim.","observation":"Across all four views, the architecture is rendered as realistic, highly detailed urban photography with strongly sculptural, warped forms and reflective metallic skins. Curving facades, skewed windows, and sharp geometric masses create a surreal cityscape, emphasized by vivid daylight, warm reflections, and dramatic close perspectives."},{"id":"weegee","name":"Weegee","cat":"photographers","en":"Weegee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/weegee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/weegee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","glow","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Weegee was a renowned American photographer known for his stark black-and-white street photography, capturing the raw and unfiltered essence of urban life in mid-20th century New York City. His work often featured crime scenes, emergencies, and candid moments, characterized by dramatic lighting and a keen eye for human emotion.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white flash photography with deep shadows, bright highlights, visible grain, and occasional starburst light sources. Tightly cropped urban scenes capture expressive faces, spontaneous gestures, movement, and theatrical nighttime encounters around vintage cars."},{"id":"pat-steir","name":"Pat Steir","cat":"painters","en":"Pat Steir","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pat-steir.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pat-steir","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","minimalist","sculptural","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-teal","dark-red","muted-cyan","white","orange"],"intro":"Pat Steir is an American painter known for her contributions to contemporary art, particularly in the realms of abstract and conceptual painting. Her work often explores themes of nature, chance, and the act of painting itself. Steir's approach is characterized by her use of dripping and pouring techniques, creating dynamic and layered compositions that challenge traditional notions of control and intention in art.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style is abstract and materially painterly, built from broad vertical drag marks, dripping pigment, and visibly layered, textured surfaces. Restrained dark palettes of charcoal, rust, orange, teal, and turquoise create moody, high-contrast geometric fields with a forceful but minimalist presence."},{"id":"fay-godwin","name":"Fay Godwin","cat":"photographers","en":"Fay Godwin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fay-godwin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fay-godwin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["black","grey","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Fay Godwin was a renowned British photographer known for her evocative black and white landscape photography. Her work often captured the essence of the British countryside, exploring themes of nature, solitude, and the human interaction with the environment. Godwin's photography is celebrated for its meticulous composition and ability to convey a deep sense of place and mood.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white landscape photography with heavy grain, deep shadows, and bright skies. Windswept trees, open moorland, mist, and isolated human or architectural forms are framed with expansive negative space for a bleak, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"victor-pasmore","name":"Victor Pasmore","cat":"painters","en":"Victor Pasmore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/victor-pasmore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/victor-pasmore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","black","orange","muted-ochre","dark-rust"],"intro":"Victor Pasmore is a renowned British artist known for his pioneering work in abstract art during the mid-20th century. He played a significant role in the development of modernist art in Britain, transitioning from figurative painting to abstraction. His work often explores geometric forms and spatial relationships, contributing to the evolution of abstract art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses spare abstract compositions built from rounded geometric blocks, circles, arcs, and broad flat fields. Muted earth tones, off-white grounds, subtle brush and paper texture, and delicate contour lines give the clean shapes a tactile, aged painted-surface quality."},{"id":"rudolf-ernst","name":"Rudolf Ernst","cat":"painters","en":"Rudolf Ernst","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rudolf-ernst.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rudolf-ernst","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-brown","light-yellow","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Rudolf Ernst was an Austrian painter known for his Orientalist works, capturing the allure and exoticism of Eastern cultures through detailed and vibrant compositions. His paintings often depicted opulent interiors, rich textiles, and intricate architectural elements, reflecting a fascination with Middle Eastern and North African themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visible paintwork to depict densely populated historical courtyards and interiors. Warm earth tones, selective saturated reds and blues, strong sunlight, and deep architectural shadows give the scenes a dramatic, carefully staged atmosphere, while ornate masonry, textiles, vessels, and clothing provide abundant surface detail."},{"id":"mario-giacomelli","name":"Mario Giacomelli","cat":"photographers","en":"Mario Giacomelli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mario-giacomelli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mario-giacomelli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","dreamy","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["silver","grey","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Mario Giacomelli was an influential Italian photographer known for his stark black-and-white images that often depicted rural life and existential themes. His work is characterized by high contrast, grainy textures, and a focus on the human condition, often capturing moments of solitude and introspection.","observation":"Across the renders, stark monochrome imagery places anonymous, often silhouetted figures in sweeping textured landscapes. Strong tonal opposition, grainy surfaces, dramatic diagonals, and isolated negative space create a dark, dreamlike sense of movement and uncanny scale."},{"id":"tomokazu-matsuyama","name":"Tomokazu Matsuyama","cat":"various-artists","en":"Tomokazu Matsuyama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tomokazu-matsuyama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tomokazu-matsuyama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["blue","beige","charcoal","red","deep-blue","light-yellow","green"],"intro":"Tomokazu Matsuyama is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his vibrant and eclectic works that blend traditional Japanese motifs with Western influences. His art often explores themes of cultural identity and globalization, creating a unique fusion of styles that reflect his bicultural background.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely layered figures, animals, flowers, costumes, and instruments interlock in highly saturated color fields. Clean graphic contours and flat, vivid shapes are combined with fine internal marks, producing an expressive illustrative style that feels fantastical and surreal rather than naturalistic."},{"id":"arata-isozaki","name":"Arata Isozaki","cat":"architects","en":"Arata Isozaki","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arata-isozaki.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arata-isozaki","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","white","dark-blue","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Arata Isozaki is a renowned Japanese architect known for his innovative and influential designs that blend Eastern and Western architectural philosophies. Born in 1931, Isozaki's work spans a wide range of styles, from the metabolist movement to postmodernism, and he has been recognized with numerous awards, including the Pritzker Architecture Prize. His designs often explore the relationship between space and time, creating structures that are both functional and aesthetically striking.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental concrete architecture is reduced to hard geometric masses, repeated columns, deep recesses, and dramatic perspectival corridors. The style combines stark black-and-white or restrained blue-and-red accents with crisp illustrative edges, heavy linework, strong contrast, and subtly surreal architectural juxtapositions."},{"id":"isaac-cordal","name":"Isaac Cordal","cat":"various-artists","en":"Isaac Cordal","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isaac-cordal.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isaac-cordal","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","silver","black"],"intro":"Isaac Cordal is a Spanish artist known for his thought-provoking miniature sculptures placed in urban environments. His work often explores themes of societal critique, isolation, and the human condition, using small-scale figures to create impactful narratives within public spaces.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic photographic rendering with subdued, earthy colors, tactile rubble, and selective focus. Repeated formally dressed figures occupy bleak, surreal landscapes of ruins, polluted water, and excavated earth, creating a dark and unsettling visual narrative."},{"id":"robert-gober","name":"Robert Gober","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Robert Gober","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-gober.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-gober","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","grain","pastel-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","geometric"],"colours":["silver","beige","brown","dark-olive","muted-cyan","ochre"],"intro":"Robert Gober is an American sculptor known for his evocative installations and sculptures that often explore themes of domesticity, identity, and the human condition. His work frequently incorporates everyday objects and architectural elements, recontextualizing them in ways that evoke introspection and contemplation. Gober's art is recognized for its meticulous craftsmanship and the ability to provoke thought and emotion through seemingly mundane subjects.","observation":"The style presents ordinary porcelain bathroom fixtures as carefully staged sculptural objects in gallery-like or theatrical environments. Realistic forms, soft subdued and pastel lighting, visible grain, restrained compositions, and occasional surreal settings give the images a museum-installation quality with a gently uncanny feel."},{"id":"kati-horna","name":"Kati Horna","cat":"photographers","en":"Kati Horna","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kati-horna.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kati-horna","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","beige","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Kati Horna was a Hungarian-born photographer known for her surreal and avant-garde imagery, often capturing the essence of post-war Europe and Mexican culture. Her work is characterized by a unique blend of documentary and surrealist styles, exploring themes of identity, femininity, and the human condition.","observation":"A stark black-and-white photographic style built around tightly cropped female portraits, intense expressions, and dramatic low-key lighting. Heavy grain, deep shadows, selective focus, and softly blurred backgrounds create an intimate, brooding, filmic atmosphere."},{"id":"edward-lear","name":"Edward Lear","cat":"illustrators","en":"Edward Lear","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-lear.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-lear","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","landscapes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["light-yellow","bone-white","brown","muted-orange","beige"],"intro":"Edward Lear is known as a 19th-century British artist, illustrator, and writer, celebrated for his literary nonsense and natural history illustrations. His work often features whimsical and humorous elements, particularly in his depictions of animals and landscapes. Lear's artistic contributions extend to ornithological art, where he skillfully combined scientific accuracy with a playful touch.","observation":"The style combines finely ruled ink and engraving-like linework with softly tinted, sepia-toned landscape painting. It alternates between densely rendered monumental wilderness scenes and clean natural-history bird studies, giving the whole sheet an illustrated, archival fantasy character."},{"id":"john-hoyland","name":"John Hoyland","cat":"painters","en":"John Hoyland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-hoyland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-hoyland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["vivid-red","charcoal","orange","green","blue","pink","ochre"],"intro":"John Hoyland is a renowned British abstract painter known for his vibrant use of color and bold, non-representational compositions. He was a leading figure in the development of abstract art in the UK during the 20th century, contributing significantly to the post-war art scene with his expressive and dynamic works.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is intensely abstract and painterly, built from saturated blocks of color, thick worked surfaces, scraping, splattering, and visible drips. Broad gestural marks, linear scratches, and layered pigment create an energetic, expressive composition with recurring geometric fragments and raw canvas texture."},{"id":"edward-burne-jones","name":"Edward Burne-Jones","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Burne-Jones","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-burne-jones.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-burne-jones","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","deep-red","muted-brown","muted-orange"],"intro":"Edward Burne-Jones was a British painter and designer associated with the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood and the Arts and Crafts Movement. Known for his romantic and mythological themes, Burne-Jones's work often features medieval and literary influences, characterized by intricate detail and a dreamy, ethereal quality. His paintings typically depict elegant figures in serene, otherworldly settings, rendered with fine brushstrokes and a soft, muted color palette.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly and densely detailed, with visible brush texture, intricate textiles, foliage, flowers, feathers, and ornamental architectural elements. Somber jewel tones, romantic figures, flowing hair, and dreamlike mythic tableaux create an ornate, emotionally charged classical mood."},{"id":"tony-scott","name":"Tony Scott","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Tony Scott","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tony-scott.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tony-scott","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-teal","muted-ochre","dark-red","bone-white"],"intro":"Tony Scott was a renowned British film director and producer, known for his high-energy and visually striking films. His works often featured dynamic action sequences and a distinctive visual style that left a lasting impact on the film industry. Some of his most notable films include 'Top Gun,' 'True Romance,' and 'Man on Fire.' Scott's approach to filmmaking was characterized by a bold use of color, innovative camera techniques, and a keen sense of pacing and rhythm.","observation":"The style combines cinematic character imagery with heavily textured, visibly brushed surfaces and forceful, gestural marks. It consistently uses a dark teal-green palette punctuated by warm amber and red light, with high-contrast illumination, brooding expressions, and collage-like fragmentation across portraits and scenes."},{"id":"martin-stranka","name":"Martin Stranka","cat":"photographers","en":"Martin Stranka","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-stranka.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-stranka","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","mist","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["black","beige","dark-green","muted-green","bone-white","light-green"],"intro":"Martin Stranka is a contemporary photographer known for his surreal and dreamlike imagery. His work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, blending reality with fantasy to create ethereal and thought-provoking compositions.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, using muted teal-and-sepia grading, strong backlighting, deep silhouettes, and broad expanses of empty sky or roadway. Solitary figures and transforming debris recur in atmospheric, surreal scenes shaped by mist, motion, and a dark dreamlike mood."},{"id":"jeff-lemire","name":"Jeff Lemire","cat":"illustrators","en":"Jeff Lemire","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeff-lemire.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeff-lemire","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","brown","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Jeff Lemire is a Canadian cartoonist and graphic novelist known for his distinctive storytelling and artistic style. His works often explore themes of family, isolation, and rural life, blending emotional depth with a unique visual approach. Lemire's notable works include \"Essex County,\" \"Sweet Tooth,\" and \"The Underwater Welder,\" which have garnered critical acclaim and a dedicated readership.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive storybook illustration with bold ink contours, energetic hatching, and visible watercolor-like washes on textured paper. Strong red, black, cream, and muted green accents create high contrast, while oversized animals, solitary children, and wooded settings give the compositions a dramatic, narrative quality."},{"id":"fritz-henle","name":"Fritz Henle","cat":"photographers","en":"Fritz Henle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fritz-henle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fritz-henle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["grey","silver","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Fritz Henle was a renowned German-born photographer known for his versatile and prolific work across various genres, including fashion, travel, and portrait photography. His career spanned several decades, during which he captured images that were celebrated for their clarity, composition, and elegance. Henle's work is often associated with the humanist photography movement, and he was known for his ability to capture the essence of his subjects with a timeless quality.","observation":"A monochrome photographic style combines fashion-editorial portraiture with dramatic outdoor tableaux, using expressive poses, sculptural clothing, and strong natural light. High contrast, visible grain, and detailed textures give the images a cinematic, vintage-looking finish across both intimate close-ups and expansive beach scenes."},{"id":"beauford-delaney","name":"Beauford Delaney","cat":"painters","en":"Beauford Delaney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/beauford-delaney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/beauford-delaney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["orange","red","bone-white","muted-olive","dark-brown"],"intro":"Beauford Delaney was an influential African American painter known for his vibrant use of color and expressive style. Born in 1901 in Knoxville, Tennessee, Delaney became a prominent figure in the Harlem Renaissance and later moved to Paris, where he continued to develop his unique artistic voice. His work often explored themes of identity, spirituality, and the human condition, leaving a lasting impact on modern art.","observation":"Across all four works, the style is visibly built from thick, energetic paint applied in layered, sweeping and dragging strokes, with frequent drips and heavily textured surfaces. Saturated reds, yellows, blues and greens animate dense abstract compositions whose loose, suggestive forms feel expressive and slightly surreal rather than representational."},{"id":"bill-brandt","name":"Bill Brandt","cat":"photographers","en":"Bill Brandt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-brandt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-brandt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","urban","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Bill Brandt was a renowned British photographer known for his distinctive black and white images that captured the essence of 20th-century life in Europe. His work often explored themes of social contrast, surrealism, and the human condition, making him a pivotal figure in modernist photography.","observation":"Across all four images, stark monochrome photography uses deep blacks, bright atmospheric backgrounds, and pronounced grain to create a bleak, film-noir mood. Repeated solitary figures, silhouetted architecture, wet paths, bare trees, and misty distance give the style a cinematic sense of quiet urban isolation."},{"id":"lucas-cranach-the-younger","name":"Lucas Cranach the Younger","cat":"painters","en":"Lucas Cranach the Younger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucas-cranach-the-younger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucas-cranach-the-younger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","metallic","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-olive","ochre","orange","dark-brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Lucas Cranach the Younger was a prominent German Renaissance painter, known for his portraits and religious works. He was the son of Lucas Cranach the Elder and continued the family workshop, producing art that was deeply rooted in the Protestant Reformation and Northern Renaissance traditions. His works are characterized by their detailed realism, expressive figures, and intricate compositions.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped, formal portraits rendered with highly controlled oil-paint modelling, fine brushwork, and a visibly aged, craquelured surface. Rich textiles, lace, fur, jewelry, and headwear are described with meticulous detail, using restrained earthy reds, greens, browns, and black against relatively plain backgrounds."},{"id":"dan-graham","name":"Dan Graham","cat":"various-artists","en":"Dan Graham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-graham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-graham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","light-blue","grey","silver","dark-olive"],"intro":"Dan Graham is a renowned American artist known for his work in conceptual art and architecture. His art often explores the relationship between architecture, audience, and environment, using reflective materials and interactive installations to engage viewers in a dialogue about perception and space.","observation":"The style uses realistic, cinematic architectural photography with restrained natural color, careful exposure, and crisp geometric compositions. Monumental transparent cylindrical structures are placed in coastal, rural, or gallery settings, where reflections, repeated vertical seams, and small human figures create a contemplative sense of scale."},{"id":"james-nachtwey","name":"James Nachtwey","cat":"photographers","en":"James Nachtwey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-nachtwey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-nachtwey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"James Nachtwey is a renowned American photojournalist known for his powerful and evocative images documenting war, conflict, and social issues around the world. His work is characterized by a deep commitment to capturing the human condition and raising awareness about global crises. Nachtwey has received numerous awards for his impactful photography, which often highlights the resilience and suffering of marginalized communities.","observation":"The style is stark monochrome photography with strong tonal contrast, deep shadows, and sharply directional window light. It combines documentary-like human situations with intimate portraits, tactile worn environments, occasional silhouettes, and restrained film grain."},{"id":"jakub-schikaneder","name":"Jakub Schikaneder","cat":"painters","en":"Jakub Schikaneder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jakub-schikaneder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jakub-schikaneder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","rust"],"intro":"Jakub Schikaneder was a Czech painter known for his atmospheric and melancholic scenes, often depicting the urban and rural landscapes of Prague and its surroundings during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work is characterized by its use of light and shadow, creating a sense of moodiness and introspection.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly rendering with subdued charcoal and green-gray tones punctuated by warm orange lamplight and windows. Cinematic compositions layer bare branches, mist, historic urban architecture, wet reflective paving, and recurring silhouetted figures into dark, atmospheric nocturnal scenes."},{"id":"haroshi","name":"Haroshi","cat":"various-artists","en":"Haroshi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/haroshi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/haroshi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["grey","muted-rust","beige","silver","brown","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Haroshi is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his innovative use of recycled skateboard decks to create vibrant, three-dimensional sculptures. His work often explores themes of urban culture and sustainability, transforming discarded materials into intricate art pieces that reflect both traditional craftsmanship and modern aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, oversized human and animal forms are built as dense mixed-media assemblages from layered textiles, clothing, and found materials. The sculptures are richly textured and highly detailed, with saturated patches of color, convincing volume, and gallery-like cinematic presentation that makes the surreal subjects feel physically present."},{"id":"alfred-munnings","name":"Alfred Munnings","cat":"painters","en":"Alfred Munnings","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-munnings.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-munnings","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","beige","light-orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Alfred Munnings was a renowned British painter known for his equestrian and landscape paintings. Born in 1878, Munnings became a leading figure in the British art scene, celebrated for his ability to capture the vitality and grace of horses. His works often depicted scenes of rural life and aristocratic leisure, reflecting the cultural and social milieu of early 20th-century England.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from visible, energetic brushwork that models figures, horses, water, and landscape with layered, broken strokes. Restrained earth tones are punctuated by whites and reds, while strong light-dark contrasts and active mounted compositions create a dramatic, vigorous pictorial effect."},{"id":"valentin-serov","name":"Valentin Serov","cat":"painters","en":"Valentin Serov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/valentin-serov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/valentin-serov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","bone-white","grey","rust","red"],"intro":"Valentin Serov was a renowned Russian painter, celebrated for his contributions to portraiture and realism during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His works are characterized by their delicate brushwork, keen observation of character, and a harmonious blend of light and color, capturing the essence of his subjects with both intimacy and grandeur.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable women and domestic moments are built from visible, directional oil-paint strokes, with thickly worked highlights and softened edges. The palette stays restrained in whites, creams, blue-greys, browns, and deep blacks, while natural window or outdoor light creates quiet, intimate portrait scenes."},{"id":"james-wilson-morrice","name":"James Wilson Morrice","cat":"painters","en":"James Wilson Morrice","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-wilson-morrice.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-wilson-morrice","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-orange","red","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"James Wilson Morrice is a Canadian painter known for his contributions to post-impressionism and his depictions of urban and rural scenes. His work often captures the subtle interplay of light and color, with a focus on mood and atmosphere, influenced by his time in France.","observation":"Across all four views, dense urban architecture and streets are rendered with visibly built-up paint, broad directional strokes, and rough, expressive edges. Muted earth tones are punctuated by brick reds and deep shadows, while simplified buildings, chimneys, trees, and tiny pedestrians create detailed but strongly graphic city scenes."},{"id":"seth-globepainter","name":"Seth Globepainter","cat":"street-artists","en":"Seth Globepainter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/seth-globepainter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/seth-globepainter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","urban","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["beige","brown","pale-blue","pale-orange","blue","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Seth Globepainter is a renowned French street artist known for his vibrant and imaginative murals. His work often features whimsical characters and dreamlike scenes, blending elements of fantasy and reality. He has gained international recognition for his ability to transform urban spaces into colorful and thought-provoking environments.","observation":"The style combines clean, illustrative mural painting with bold outlines, flat yet richly varied color areas, and selectively modeled volume. Surreal, oversized childlike figures and objects are integrated into weathered urban architecture, creating playful scenes that contrast vivid graphic imagery with realistic city surroundings."},{"id":"jean-patou","name":"Jean Patou","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Jean Patou","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-patou.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-patou","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","still-life","glow","light-colors","metallic","negative-space"],"colours":["white","silver","beige","rust","brown","orange"],"intro":"Jean Patou is a renowned French fashion designer known for his innovative contributions to women's fashion in the early 20th century. He is celebrated for introducing sportswear as a fashion staple and for his luxurious, elegant designs that often featured intricate details and high-quality materials. Patou's work was influential in shaping the fashion landscape of the 1920s and 1930s, and his legacy continues to inspire designers today.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic product-like objects against clean, pale studio backgrounds with generous negative space. Reflective glass, gold-toned metal, embossed floral surfaces, and densely woven textiles are rendered with crisp material definition, warm highlights, and soft cast shadows."},{"id":"invader","name":"Invader","cat":"street-artists","en":"Invader","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/invader.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/invader","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","urban","flat-color","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","brown","beige","black","blue","rust","light-yellow","dark-red"],"intro":"Invader is a French street artist known for his mosaic tile works inspired by 8-bit video games, particularly the iconic Space Invaders. His art often appears in urban environments worldwide, transforming public spaces into interactive and playful installations. Invader's work is characterized by its pixelated aesthetic, drawing on themes from popular culture and digital art.","observation":"The style combines realistic urban photography with crisp, flat-color pixel murals placed across weathered building facades. Strong primary colors and recognizable arcade-like figures contrast with detailed architectural textures, while selective focus and street-level framing give the scenes a photographic sense of depth."},{"id":"troy-brooks","name":"Troy Brooks","cat":"painters","en":"Troy Brooks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/troy-brooks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/troy-brooks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","symmetry"],"colours":["deep-red","muted-cyan","silver","beige","dark-teal"],"intro":"Troy Brooks is a contemporary artist known for his distinctive surreal portraits of elongated female figures. His work often explores themes of identity, beauty, and transformation, drawing on influences from pop surrealism and neo-gothic art.","observation":"The style presents highly composed fashion portraits with pale, porcelain-like faces set against restrained blue-green or crimson backgrounds, dominated by sculptural red garments and extravagant headwear. Fine painterly surface work describes velvet, lace, woven cloth, pleats, and embroidery, while strong frontal or profile arrangements, crisp facial features, and controlled contrast give the images a formal, theatrical character."},{"id":"rogier-van-der-weyden","name":"Rogier van der Weyden","cat":"painters","en":"Rogier van der Weyden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rogier-van-der-weyden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rogier-van-der-weyden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["muted-ochre","silver","dark-brown","black","deep-red"],"intro":"Rogier van der Weyden was a prominent Early Netherlandish painter known for his religious works and portraits. Born in Tournai, he became one of the most influential artists of the 15th century, celebrated for his detailed and expressive style that captured the spiritual intensity of his subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces and busts are modeled with exceptionally fine, realistic paint handling, visible brush texture, and an aged craquelure surface. Muted earth tones, pale veils, structured historical garments, and solemn frontal or profile gazes create a devotional, classical portrait atmosphere."},{"id":"emile-bernard","name":"Emile Bernard","cat":"painters","en":"Emile Bernard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emile-bernard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emile-bernard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","floral","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-brown","vivid-red","ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Emile Bernard was a French Post-Impressionist painter and writer, known for his significant contributions to the Symbolist movement and his close associations with artists like Vincent van Gogh and Paul Gauguin. His work often explored themes of rural life and spirituality, characterized by bold colors and simplified forms, which were part of the Synthetism style he helped develop.","observation":"Across the sheet, richly colored portraits, village views, and floral arrangements are rendered with visible, directional brushwork and a built-up painted surface. Strong color contrasts, simplified yet expressive forms, patterned garments, and dense decorative detail give the style a vivid, illustrative presence."},{"id":"eastman-johnson","name":"Eastman Johnson","cat":"painters","en":"Eastman Johnson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eastman-johnson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eastman-johnson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","rust","orange","muted-orange"],"intro":"Eastman Johnson was an American painter known for his genre paintings and portraits, often depicting scenes of everyday life in 19th-century America. His works are characterized by their detailed realism and warm, earthy color palettes, capturing the essence of rural and domestic life during his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint to depict realistic interior scenes populated by carefully observed figures. Dark brown interiors, warm firelight, deep shadows, and selective red accents create a subdued, dramatic atmosphere, while broad strokes preserve the tactile character of the painted surface."},{"id":"bruce-onobrakpeya","name":"Bruce Onobrakpeya","cat":"printmakers","en":"Bruce Onobrakpeya","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruce-onobrakpeya.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruce-onobrakpeya","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-red","vivid-red","red","muted-rust","dark-blue"],"intro":"Bruce Onobrakpeya is a renowned Nigerian printmaker and artist known for his innovative techniques and contributions to contemporary African art. He has played a significant role in the development of modern art in Nigeria, blending traditional African themes with modernist styles. His work often explores cultural identity and heritage, using a variety of printmaking techniques to create textured and intricate pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines intensely saturated red, blue, black, and orange with heavy drawn contours and dense scratched, crosshatched marks. Figures are elongated and angular, arranged in active theatrical scenes against richly worked geometric or architectural grounds, producing a forceful, highly expressive painted-print appearance."},{"id":"alexandre-evariste-fragonard","name":"Alexandre-Evariste Fragonard","cat":"painters","en":"Alexandre-Evariste Fragonard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexandre-evariste-fragonard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexandre-evariste-fragonard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","grey","muted-ochre","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Alexandre-Evariste Fragonard was a French painter and sculptor, known for his works that often depicted historical and mythological subjects. He was the son of the famous Rococo painter Jean-Honoré Fragonard, and his style was influenced by both the Rococo and Neoclassical movements, blending intricate details with classical themes.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly landscapes with monumental cliffs, gnarled trees, clouds, and tiny human figures arranged for immense vertical scale. Deep shadow against luminous shafts of warm light, reflective water, and expressive gestures create an epic, theatrical fantasy atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"ana-mendieta","name":"Ana Mendieta","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ana Mendieta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ana-mendieta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ana-mendieta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["red","black","dark-red","brown","rust"],"intro":"Ana Mendieta was a Cuban-American artist known for her groundbreaking work in performance art, land art, and body art. Her art often explored themes of identity, feminism, and spirituality, using natural materials and her own body as mediums. Mendieta's work is characterized by its deep connection to nature and its exploration of cultural and ancestral roots.","observation":"A realistic, cinematic photographic style built around vivid rust-red clothing and wet earth, with strong contrast between illuminated skin, dark hair, and heavy clay textures. Intimate close-ups alternate with posed full-body compositions, producing an expressive, bold, and slightly dark editorial mood."},{"id":"konstantin-melnikov","name":"Konstantin Melnikov","cat":"architects","en":"Konstantin Melnikov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/konstantin-melnikov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/konstantin-melnikov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","retro","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-cyan","pale-orange","silver","dark-red","rust"],"intro":"Konstantin Melnikov was a prominent Russian architect and painter, known for his innovative contributions to modernist architecture during the early 20th century. His work is characterized by a unique blend of constructivism and futurism, often exploring geometric forms and bold structural designs. Melnikov's architectural legacy includes iconic buildings like the Melnikov House in Moscow, which exemplifies his avant-garde approach and emphasis on functional aesthetics.","observation":"The style combines cinematic architectural photography with surreal, carefully staged urban scenes: monumental concrete structures, oversized red spheres, teal skies, and isolated figures recur across the sheet. Muted teal-and-charcoal surroundings are punctuated by coral reds and warm window light, while geometric framing, fine drawn contours, and subtle grain give the images a retro editorial quality."},{"id":"otto-wagner","name":"Otto Wagner","cat":"architects","en":"Otto Wagner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/otto-wagner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/otto-wagner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","urban","subdued-colors","classical","retro","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","grey","bone-white","silver"],"intro":"Otto Wagner was an influential Austrian architect and urban planner, known for his significant contributions to the development of modern architecture in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. He was a key figure in the Vienna Secession movement and is celebrated for his innovative designs that combined functionality with aesthetic appeal.","observation":"The style presents richly decorated historic architecture with realistic, highly detailed surfaces, formal geometry, and strong architectural framing. Subdued cream, green, brown, and gold tones unify grand interiors, ornate facades, balconies, arches, and monumental entrances in a polished, slightly nostalgic visual treatment."},{"id":"everett-shinn","name":"Everett Shinn","cat":"painters","en":"Everett Shinn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/everett-shinn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/everett-shinn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","ochre","beige","red"],"intro":"Everett Shinn was an American painter and member of the Ashcan School, known for his depictions of urban life and theatrical scenes in the early 20th century. His work often captured the vibrancy and complexity of city life, using dynamic compositions and expressive brushwork to convey movement and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from vigorous, visibly broad brushstrokes and thickly worked paint, with figures and garments emerging through loose, expressive marks rather than precise outlines. Dark green, brown, black, and ochre masses are punctuated by red and pale highlights, creating theatrical scenes of crowded movement, dramatic gestures, and richly textured formal clothing."},{"id":"tony-cragg","name":"Tony Cragg","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tony Cragg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tony-cragg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tony-cragg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","sculptural","patterns","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","white","silver","dark-brown","dark-green"],"intro":"Tony Cragg is a renowned British sculptor known for his innovative use of materials and exploration of form. Born in 1949, Cragg's work often involves transforming everyday objects into complex, abstract sculptures. His artistic journey has been marked by a deep interest in the relationship between humans and the material world, leading to a diverse body of work that challenges traditional notions of sculpture.","observation":"The style presents monumental abstract sculptures with heavily twisted, wave-like contours and a strong sense of solid volume. Smooth glossy surfaces, visible wood grain or glaze, restrained earthy colors, and clean gallery settings give the renders a polished contemporary exhibition look."},{"id":"george-bellows","name":"George Bellows","cat":"painters","en":"George Bellows","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-bellows.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-bellows","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","light-orange","deep-rust","muted-blue","vivid-red"],"intro":"George Bellows was an American realist painter known for his depictions of urban life in New York City during the early 20th century. A prominent member of the Ashcan School, Bellows captured the vibrancy and grit of city life, often focusing on scenes of everyday people and events.","observation":"Across the sheet, dense urban gatherings and theatrical interiors are rendered with visible, broad, energetic brushwork and strongly simplified yet readable figures. Dark masses, warm highlights, and sharp tonal contrasts create an expressive, dramatic atmosphere, while layered crowds and architectural settings keep the compositions richly detailed."},{"id":"bronzino","name":"Bronzino","cat":"painters","en":"Bronzino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bronzino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bronzino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","light-orange","muted-ochre","muted-blue","dark-cyan"],"intro":"Bronzino was an Italian Mannerist painter from the 16th century, known for his portraits of the Medici family and other members of the Florentine elite. His work is characterized by its elegant style, meticulous attention to detail, and the use of vibrant colors and smooth textures. Bronzino's paintings often depict figures with serene expressions and elaborate costumes, reflecting the sophistication of the Renaissance court.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, finely painted portraiture with delicate brushwork, subtle skin modeling, and numerous small details in hair, jewelry, fabric, and facial texture. Restrained earthy colors, dark or blue grounds, and strong directional lighting create a formal classical appearance with tightly cropped faces as the dominant composition."},{"id":"marc-quinn","name":"Marc Quinn","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Marc Quinn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-quinn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-quinn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","sculptural","floral","patterns","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["vivid-red","white","grey","red","brown","muted-blue"],"intro":"Marc Quinn is a contemporary British artist known for his innovative and often provocative sculptures that explore themes of identity, nature, and the human condition. His works frequently incorporate unconventional materials and techniques, challenging traditional boundaries in art.","observation":"The style presents oversized floral forms as intensely saturated, close-cropped studies, with luminous reds, oranges, turquoise, and whites set against clean pale grounds. Fine directional brushwork, glossy modeled surfaces, dense petal textures, and expressive pigment-like bleeding make the flowers feel both tactile and partially abstract."},{"id":"peter-sculthorpe","name":"Peter Sculthorpe","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Sculthorpe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-sculthorpe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-sculthorpe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","urban","glow","mist","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-ochre","charcoal","ochre","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Peter Sculthorpe is an Australian composer known for his orchestral and choral works that often incorporate elements of indigenous Australian music and themes related to the Australian landscape. His compositions are celebrated for their evocative and atmospheric qualities, reflecting a deep connection to the natural environment.","observation":"The style is photographic and highly detailed, depicting secluded rural landscapes with cottages, mills, trees, water, and stonework. It combines subdued autumnal color with strong cinematic contrast, warm points of light, reflective surfaces, and a lightly grainy atmospheric finish."},{"id":"christian-louboutin","name":"Christian Louboutin","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Christian Louboutin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-louboutin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-louboutin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["white","light-orange","rust","dark-brown","muted-blue","red"],"intro":"Christian Louboutin is a renowned French fashion designer known for his high-end stiletto footwear, characterized by their signature red-lacquered soles. His designs are celebrated for their elegance, luxury, and innovative use of materials, making them a staple in the world of fashion.","observation":"The style combines polished fashion imagery with highly decorative, floral shoe designs rendered in vivid color and crisp illustrative outlines. Across the sheet, footwear is treated as the central sculptural object, alternating between clean studio presentation and warm lifestyle compositions with strong light and shadow."},{"id":"manfred-kielnhofer","name":"Manfred Kielnhofer","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Manfred Kielnhofer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/manfred-kielnhofer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/manfred-kielnhofer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","metallic","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["white","beige","light-blue","deep-red","dark-red"],"intro":"Manfred Kielnhofer is an Austrian artist known for his intriguing sculptures and installations that often explore themes of time, existence, and the human condition. His works frequently feature hooded figures, which have become a signature element in his artistic repertoire.","observation":"The style presents faceless, hooded human forms as highly realistic sculptural fashion studies, emphasizing dense folds, reflective surfaces, and carefully rendered material weight. Saturated red and metallic gold fabrics stand out against sparse pale settings, combining studio-like portrait framing with surreal, enigmatic staging."},{"id":"graham-sutherland","name":"Graham Sutherland","cat":"painters","en":"Graham Sutherland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/graham-sutherland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/graham-sutherland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-ochre","olive","yellow","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Graham Sutherland was a British artist known for his work in painting, printmaking, and design. He gained recognition for his distinctive style, which often depicted landscapes and natural forms with a surreal and expressive quality. Sutherland's work was influenced by the devastation of World War II, and he became an official war artist during the conflict. His art is characterized by its intense use of color, dramatic compositions, and exploration of themes such as decay and transformation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines vigorous, visibly built-up brushwork with rough drawn contours, scraped textures, and occasional drips. Saturated greens, oranges, yellows, reds, and blacks form high-contrast geometric blocks around loosely recognizable figures, objects, and floral forms, producing energetic scenes that oscillate between representation and abstraction."},{"id":"louise-bourgeois","name":"Louise Bourgeois","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Louise Bourgeois","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louise-bourgeois.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louise-bourgeois","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","animals","urban","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","brown","white","grey"],"intro":"Louise Bourgeois was a French-American artist known for her large-scale sculpture and installation art. Her work often explored themes of family, memory, and the subconscious, drawing from her own personal experiences and emotions. Bourgeois's art is characterized by its psychological depth and its ability to evoke complex emotional responses.","observation":"The style presents oversized spider sculptures as realistic, highly dimensional gallery installations, with carefully rendered material textures, articulated limbs, and strong spatial depth. Restrained earthy and black tones, museum interiors, and dramatic scale give the images a dark, imposing presence while maintaining a polished photographic finish."},{"id":"frank-holl","name":"Frank Holl","cat":"painters","en":"Frank Holl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-holl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-holl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige","dark-brown"],"intro":"Frank Holl is a British painter known for his poignant and realistic depictions of Victorian life. Born in 1845, Holl was a prominent figure in the Victorian art scene, celebrated for his ability to capture the emotional depth and social realities of his time. His works often focused on themes of family, work, and the struggles of everyday people, rendered with a meticulous attention to detail and a deep sense of empathy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from visible, energetic oil-paint strokes, with thick highlights and broadly modelled forms balanced by finer work in faces and hair. It consistently uses subdued, warm earth tones with deep shadows and selective bright whites, presenting intimate portraits and loosely staged social scenes through cropped, atmospheric compositions."},{"id":"jean-cocteau","name":"Jean Cocteau","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Jean Cocteau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-cocteau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-cocteau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","collage","drawing"],"colours":["muted-orange","bone-white","black","rust","charcoal","beige","vivid-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Jean Cocteau was a French poet, playwright, novelist, designer, filmmaker, visual artist, and critic. Known for his avant-garde style, Cocteau was a prominent figure in the French art scene of the 20th century. His work often explored themes of love, death, and mythology, blending surrealism with classical motifs. Cocteau's influence extended across various artistic disciplines, making him a versatile and innovative creator.","observation":"The style combines expressive, finely drawn portrait and animal studies with loose gestural linework, visible paper texture, and occasional bright painted accents. It shifts between monochrome photographic documentation and mixed-media sketch imagery, creating a collage-like, art-gallery presentation with strong tonal contrast."},{"id":"clay-mann","name":"Clay Mann","cat":"illustrators","en":"Clay Mann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clay-mann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clay-mann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","ochre","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Clay Mann is a contemporary comic book artist known for his detailed and expressive illustrations. His work often features dynamic characters and intricate compositions, contributing to popular series in the comic book industry.","observation":"Across the sheet, tightly cropped faces are rendered with visible, energetic brushwork, fine dark linear accents, and layered, tactile paint. The palette is predominantly dark and moody, punctuated by saturated reds, blues, and skin tones, with strong contrast that heightens the intense, theatrical expressions."},{"id":"hans-memling","name":"Hans Memling","cat":"painters","en":"Hans Memling","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-memling.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-memling","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","silver","muted-ochre","deep-red","dark-cyan"],"intro":"Hans Memling was a prominent painter of the Northern Renaissance , known for his detailed and serene religious portraits. Born in Germany, he spent much of his career in Bruges, Flanders, where he became a leading figure in the art community. Memling's work is characterized by its fine detailing, use of color, and incorporation of religious themes, often depicting figures like the Madonna and Child.","observation":"The style uses highly refined, painstakingly detailed portrait painting with delicate brushwork, precise facial modelling, and visibly aged, textured surfaces. Restrained earthy colors are punctuated by red, blue, black, and white garments, while ornate textiles, flowers, veils, and religious dress create a solemn devotional character across the portraits."},{"id":"raymond-duchamp-villon","name":"Raymond Duchamp-Villon","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Raymond Duchamp-Villon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raymond-duchamp-villon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raymond-duchamp-villon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","subdued-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["silver","beige","bone-white","muted-ochre","black","dark-brown"],"intro":"Raymond Duchamp-Villon was a French sculptor and a prominent figure in the Cubist movement. Born in 1876, he was known for his innovative approach to form and structure, often incorporating elements of machinery and architecture into his works. His contributions to modern sculpture were significant, and he was part of a family of renowned artists, including his brothers Marcel Duchamp and Jacques Villon.","observation":"The style presents figurative sculptures as solid, weighty objects built from sharply faceted geometric planes, with visible wood grain or dark bronze-like surfaces. Restrained earthy colors, realistic gallery lighting, pedestal displays, and elongated fragmented anatomy recur across the four renders."},{"id":"pejac","name":"Pejac","cat":"street-artists","en":"Pejac","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pejac.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pejac","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","animals","landscapes","scenes","motion","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","grey","black"],"intro":"Pejac is a Spanish street artist known for his thought-provoking and often surreal artworks that engage with urban environments. His real-life works are characterized by their clever use of space and often incorporate elements of nature and human figures to create a dialogue about contemporary issues.","observation":"The style combines weathered, painterly wall surfaces with restrained blue-gray, white, and black tones, using stark silhouettes and strong contrast. Sparse figures, trees, and swarming birds create surreal visual narratives with generous negative space, while expressive motion and mural-like integration make the scenes feel dreamlike."},{"id":"adrian-frutiger","name":"Adrian Frutiger","cat":"designers","en":"Adrian Frutiger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adrian-frutiger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adrian-frutiger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["letters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","retro","collage","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","black","cream","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Adrian Frutiger is a renowned Swiss typeface designer, best known for creating some of the most widely used fonts, including Univers and Frutiger. His work has had a significant impact on typography and graphic design, characterized by clarity, legibility, and a modernist approach. Frutiger's designs are celebrated for their functional beauty and have been influential in both print and digital media.","observation":"This style combines oversized black typography with stark white space, geometric cropping, and occasional photographic portrait fragments. Its mostly flat, high-contrast monochrome treatment is softened by coarse photographic grain and collage-like overlays, creating a bold retro editorial appearance."},{"id":"vera-wang","name":"Vera Wang","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Vera Wang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vera-wang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vera-wang","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","brown","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Vera Wang is an American fashion designer renowned for her exquisite bridal collections and elegant evening wear. She began her career in fashion at Vogue and later became a design director for Ralph Lauren before launching her own label. Wang's designs are celebrated for their modern aesthetic, luxurious fabrics, and intricate detailing, making her a leading name in the bridal fashion industry.","observation":"The style presents realistic fashion-editorial portraits with elongated figures, sculptural couture gowns, and abundant layered ruffles. Neutral studio settings, subdued tones, soft directional light, and restrained dramatic posing create a moody, cinematic atmosphere across the four renders."},{"id":"dennis-oppenheim","name":"Dennis Oppenheim","cat":"various-artists","en":"Dennis Oppenheim","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dennis-oppenheim.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dennis-oppenheim","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["brown","blue","muted-blue","dark-brown","silver","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Dennis Oppenheim was an American conceptual artist known for his innovative land art, sculpture, and installations. His work often explored the boundaries between art and architecture, employing a variety of materials and techniques to create thought-provoking pieces that engaged with their environment. Oppenheim's contributions to the art world have been influential in shaping contemporary art practices.","observation":"The style presents surreal architectural forms as convincingly realistic outdoor photographs, with crisp detail, strong geometry, and saturated red metal against expansive blue skies and natural landscapes. Monumental structures, unusual distortions, and tiny human figures create an uncanny sense of scale while bright daylight keeps the scenes clear and vivid."},{"id":"thomas-moran","name":"Thomas Moran","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Moran","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-moran.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-moran","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","silver","dark-red","orange","light-orange"],"intro":"Thomas Moran is a renowned American painter known for his dramatic landscapes of the American West. Born in 1837, Moran was a key figure in the Hudson River School and is celebrated for his depictions of Yellowstone and the Grand Canyon, which helped promote the idea of national parks.","observation":"These landscapes use richly visible paint texture and layered brushwork to build monumental cliffs, turbulent clouds, water, and atmospheric depth. Strong warm-cool contrasts, fiery internal light, mist, and immense scale give the scenes an epic, fantastical, dreamlike presence."},{"id":"tony-dezuniga","name":"Tony DeZuniga","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tony DeZuniga","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tony-dezuniga.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tony-dezuniga","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","grain","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","beige","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Tony DeZuniga is a renowned Filipino comic book artist and illustrator, best known for co-creating characters like Jonah Hex and Black Orchid for DC Comics. His work has significantly influenced the comic book industry, blending Western and Filipino artistic styles. DeZuniga's contributions have been celebrated for their dynamic storytelling and expressive character designs.","observation":"Across the sheet, the images use dense, tactile paint handling with broad directional strokes, rough surface grain, and strongly modeled forms. Dark, muted palettes and stark light create an ominous cinematic mood, while oversized creatures, isolated figures, and uncanny encounters give the scenes a surreal fantasy character."},{"id":"donna-huanca","name":"Donna Huanca","cat":"various-artists","en":"Donna Huanca","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/donna-huanca.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/donna-huanca","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","scenes","motion","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["beige","silver","bone-white","muted-blue","charcoal","orange"],"intro":"Donna Huanca is a contemporary artist known for her immersive installations and performance art that explore identity and the human form. Her work often incorporates elements of painting, sculpture, and live performance, creating a unique blend of visual and experiential art.","observation":"Across all four renders, figures and environments are built from thick, visibly layered paint that behaves like both brushwork and sculpted material. Saturated blues, whites, coral, and greens form elaborate, surreal gallery-like scenes with dynamic human poses, dripping surfaces, and monumental painterly structures."},{"id":"matt-fraction","name":"Matt Fraction","cat":"illustrators","en":"Matt Fraction","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/matt-fraction.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/matt-fraction","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","surreal","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","grey","pink","dark-brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Matt Fraction is a renowned comic book writer known for his work on series such as \"Hawkeye\" and \"Sex Criminals.\" His storytelling is characterized by a unique blend of humor, emotion, and innovative narrative techniques, which have earned him critical acclaim and a dedicated fanbase.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly saturated coral, pink, teal, and black with stark tonal separation. Heavy ink contours, dense hatching, flat graphic color fields, and rough splattered textures give the recurring portrait-and-character imagery an intense comic-book presence with surreal visual disruptions."},{"id":"rj-matson","name":"RJ Matson","cat":"illustrators","en":"RJ Matson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rj-matson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rj-matson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","comics","dark"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","charcoal","brown","light-yellow","silver","red"],"intro":"RJ Matson is a contemporary illustrator known for his engaging and thought-provoking editorial cartoons. His work often explores political and social themes with a keen eye for detail and a sharp sense of humor. Matson's illustrations have been featured in numerous publications, showcasing his ability to capture complex ideas in a visually compelling manner.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly detailed comic-book illustration with heavy ink outlines, dense crosshatched textures, and strongly staged narrative scenes. Its recurring dark blue and charcoal palette, sharply contrasting warm lights, gothic settings, and expressive characters create an ominous Halloween storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"tran-nguyen","name":"Tran Nguyen","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tran Nguyen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tran-nguyen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tran-nguyen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["bone-white","black","muted-ochre","brown","grey","red"],"intro":"Tran Nguyen is a contemporary artist known for her ethereal and dreamlike illustrations that often explore themes of introspection and fantasy. Born in Vietnam and raised in the United States, her work is characterized by delicate brushwork and a soft color palette, often incorporating elements of nature and surrealism.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, close-cropped portraiture with visible fine brushwork, delicate linework, and richly textured skin, hair, feathers, flowers, and fabric. Vivid accents such as red lips, orange flowers, and fiery eyes contrast with cool blue and deep green surroundings, while surreal animal and botanical companions create an expressive, dreamlike mood."},{"id":"piero-manzoni","name":"Piero Manzoni","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Piero Manzoni","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/piero-manzoni.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/piero-manzoni","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","minimalist","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","white","dark-brown"],"intro":"Piero Manzoni was an Italian artist known for his avant-garde and conceptual works that challenged traditional notions of art. Born in 1933, he became a prominent figure in the post-war European art scene, particularly associated with the Arte Povera movement. Manzoni's work often explored themes of identity, materiality, and the role of the artist, using unconventional materials and methods.","observation":"The style presents restrained, monochromatic material studies as carefully composed gallery objects, emphasizing paper fibers, wrinkles, folds, ridges, and packaged samples. Soft directional light and ample neutral space give the arrangements a quiet, tactile realism, while repeated grids and framed reliefs add orderly sculptural structure."},{"id":"dan-colen","name":"Dan Colen","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Dan Colen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dan-colen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dan-colen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-red","grey","red","brown","orange","magenta"],"intro":"Dan Colen is an American artist known for his diverse and provocative works that span painting, sculpture, and installation. Emerging in the early 2000s, Colen became associated with the downtown New York art scene, often exploring themes of youth culture, rebellion, and the ephemeral nature of life.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style is abstract and intensely painterly, built from thick impasto, scraping, smearing, splattering, and visible directional brushwork. Saturated reds, pinks, yellows, blues, and greens alternate with pale grounds, while diffuse organic shapes and dense pigment clusters create an expressive, surreal sense of motion."},{"id":"stanley-william-hayter","name":"Stanley William Hayter","cat":"printmakers","en":"Stanley William Hayter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stanley-william-hayter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stanley-william-hayter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-green","muted-ochre","dark-red","red","pale-orange"],"intro":"Stanley William Hayter is a renowned British printmaker and painter, celebrated for his innovative techniques in printmaking. He founded Atelier 17, a famous printmaking studio in Paris, which became a hub for many influential artists. His work is characterized by dynamic forms, bold colors, and a deep exploration of abstraction and surrealism.","observation":"Across all four panels, broad translucent painted forms and dense fine linear tracery interweave into energetic, nonrepresentational compositions. Saturated teal, green, red, orange, and cream contrast against dark grounds, with recurring arcs, spirals, grids, and sweeping directional movement."},{"id":"el-anatsui","name":"El Anatsui","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"El Anatsui","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/el-anatsui.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/el-anatsui","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","patterns","metallic","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-brown","muted-orange","ochre","dark-brown","deep-red"],"intro":"El Anatsui is a renowned Ghanaian sculptor known for his innovative use of recycled materials to create large-scale installations. His works often explore themes of history, culture, and the environment, reflecting a deep connection to African heritage and contemporary global issues.","observation":"The style depicts monumental abstract textile installations with irregular, torn silhouettes and heavy folds that make the works read as sculptural objects. Dense woven grids, patchwork fragments, metallic foil-like sections, and saturated red, blue, gold, and earth tones create a richly tactile, highly embellished surface across all four views."},{"id":"david-alfaro-siqueiros","name":"David Alfaro Siqueiros","cat":"painters","en":"David Alfaro Siqueiros","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-alfaro-siqueiros.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-alfaro-siqueiros","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","red","muted-ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"David Alfaro Siqueiros was a prominent Mexican painter and one of the most influential figures in the Mexican muralism movement. Known for his large-scale murals and politically charged themes, Siqueiros's work often depicted the struggles and aspirations of the working class. His innovative techniques and dynamic compositions have left a lasting impact on modern art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily worked paint with visible directional strokes, rough texture, and dense layering to build grotesquely distorted faces and figures. Deep blacks, rusty reds, ochres, and occasional blue accents create a high-contrast, ominous mood, while exaggerated eyes, mouths, and warped anatomy give the imagery a surreal, nightmarish force."},{"id":"john-la-farge","name":"John La Farge","cat":"painters","en":"John La Farge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-la-farge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-la-farge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","dark-blue","muted-blue","orange"],"intro":"John La Farge was an American artist and writer known for his innovations in stained glass and his contributions to American art in the late 19th century. He was a prominent figure in the Aesthetic Movement and was recognized for his ability to blend different artistic styles and cultural influences in his work.","observation":"Across the portraits and landscapes, the style uses visibly worked, directional brushstrokes, layered textures, and expressive edges rather than clean graphic shapes. Deep teal, brown, and blue shadows are punctuated by amber candlelight and sunset highlights, creating a dark, dreamy atmosphere with recurring haze, wooded settings, and dramatic luminous skies."},{"id":"alex-russell-flint","name":"Alex Russell Flint","cat":"painters","en":"Alex Russell Flint","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-russell-flint.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-russell-flint","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","pale-orange","grey","dark-red"],"intro":"Alex Russell Flint is a contemporary artist known for his evocative and atmospheric paintings that often explore themes of solitude and introspection. His work is characterized by a delicate balance between realism and romanticism, capturing the subtle nuances of light and shadow.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and finely worked, with visible brush texture describing skin, fabric, aged plaster, and wood across atmospheric interior scenes. Restrained earthy colors, deep shadow, and sharply angled sunlight create a moody, expressive tension, while repeated back-facing figures and fragmented architectural framing give the images a dreamlike, classical tableau quality."},{"id":"helen-levitt","name":"Helen Levitt","cat":"photographers","en":"Helen Levitt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helen-levitt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helen-levitt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige","rust"],"intro":"Helen Levitt is a renowned American photographer known for her candid and intimate street photography, particularly capturing the lives of children and urban scenes in New York City during the mid-20th century. Her work is celebrated for its humanistic approach and ability to capture the beauty and complexity of everyday life.","observation":"The style is candid, realistic street photography focused on children moving and playing among weathered urban buildings. Strong black-and-white contrast, deep shadows, expressive gestures, and visible grain give the scenes a gritty documentary character."},{"id":"edmund-tarbell","name":"Edmund Tarbell","cat":"painters","en":"Edmund Tarbell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edmund-tarbell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edmund-tarbell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Edmund Tarbell was an American Impressionist painter, known for his refined and elegant depictions of domestic life and portraits. He was a leading figure of the Boston School, which combined Impressionist techniques with a focus on realism and academic painting. Tarbell's work is celebrated for its soft color palettes, delicate brushwork, and the serene, introspective quality of his subjects.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses visible, broad, layered brushwork to model faces, satin, lace, and richly upholstered interiors. Restrained earth tones and deep shadows are punctuated by pale gowns and pink fabric, while poised seated figures, dramatic window light, and carefully arranged garments create an elegant, expressive atmosphere."},{"id":"joris-laarman","name":"Joris Laarman","cat":"designers","en":"Joris Laarman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joris-laarman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joris-laarman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","metallic","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["beige","silver","white","dark-brown","brown"],"intro":"Joris Laarman is a Dutch designer known for his innovative approach to design and technology. He is recognized for integrating digital fabrication techniques with traditional craftsmanship, creating pieces that challenge conventional design boundaries. Laarman often explores the intersection of art, science, and technology, producing works that are both functional and aesthetically compelling.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, digitally rendered sculptural furniture with fluid, biomorphic forms, hollowed structures, and glossy reflective surfaces. Restrained metallic, black, and warm wood tones dominate, while gallery-like interiors and an ornate historic room provide clean architectural settings that contrast with the elaborate objects."},{"id":"harold-cazneaux","name":"Harold Cazneaux","cat":"photographers","en":"Harold Cazneaux","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harold-cazneaux.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harold-cazneaux","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","urban","backlighting","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","beige","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Harold Cazneaux was an influential Australian photographer known for his pioneering work in pictorialism, a style that emphasizes beauty and artistic expression in photography. Born in 1878, Cazneaux became a leading figure in Australian photography, capturing the essence of the early 20th century through his evocative images of landscapes, architecture, and people. His work is celebrated for its soft focus, atmospheric lighting, and emotional depth, contributing significantly to the development of photography as an art form.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is cinematic and realistic, using dark sepia-toned palettes, strong silhouettes, atmospheric haze, and sharply isolated practical light sources. Backlit figures, glowing lamps or sunsets, monumental trees and city structures create a brooding, nostalgic sense of scale and drama."},{"id":"pinturicchio","name":"Pinturicchio","cat":"painters","en":"Pinturicchio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pinturicchio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pinturicchio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","portraits","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["ochre","dark-brown","brown","bone-white","dark-rust","muted-blue"],"intro":"Pinturicchio was an Italian painter of the Renaissance , known for his detailed frescoes and panel paintings. His work often featured religious and mythological themes, characterized by intricate details and vibrant colors. Pinturicchio's art was marked by its ornate style, with a strong emphasis on architectural elements and narrative scenes.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, finely rendered painting with visible delicate brushwork, densely ornamented costumes, architectural details, and luminous but restrained historical color. It combines close-up devotional portraits and grand ceremonial figures with detailed city vistas, giving every scene a textured, museum-like old-master surface."},{"id":"judith-desrosiers","name":"Judith Desrosiers","cat":"painters","en":"Judith Desrosiers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/judith-desrosiers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/judith-desrosiers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","light-orange","muted-olive","silver","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Judith Desrosiers is a contemporary artist known for her ethereal and whimsical paintings, often featuring delicate portraits and floral motifs. Her work is characterized by a dreamy and surreal quality, blending elements of fantasy and romanticism.","observation":"Across all four renders, softly stylized female portraits and floral forms are built from visible layered brushwork, translucent color, and delicate sketch-like outlines. The palette is predominantly pastel yet punctuated by vivid coral, pink, turquoise, and green accents, giving the images an expressive, romantic, garden-like character."},{"id":"eugene-atget","name":"Eugene Atget","cat":"photographers","en":"Eugene Atget","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eugene-atget.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eugene-atget","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","mist","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","white","bone-white"],"intro":"Eugene Atget was a French photographer known for his pioneering work in documenting the architecture and street scenes of Paris in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His photographs are celebrated for their historical significance and their ability to capture the essence of a rapidly changing city. Atget's work has been influential in the fields of documentary photography and urban exploration, offering a glimpse into the everyday life and architecture of Paris before modernization.","observation":"A realistic, highly detailed photographic style depicts atmospheric historic city streets through subdued sepia monochrome, strong tonal contrast, rain-darkened surfaces, and soft mist. Cinematic framing, period clothing, ornate lamps, cobblestones, and layered pedestrian activity create a nostalgic, shadowy urban mood."},{"id":"horace-vernet","name":"Horace Vernet","cat":"painters","en":"Horace Vernet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/horace-vernet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/horace-vernet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","charcoal","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Horace Vernet was a 19th-century French painter known for his historical and military scenes. His works often depicted dramatic and heroic moments from French history, characterized by precise detailing and dynamic compositions. Vernet's paintings are celebrated for their vivid storytelling and emotional intensity, capturing the essence of the Romantic era.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint to depict grand historical or quasi-historical tableaux with crowded action, monumental ruins, and mounted figures. Earthy, subdued colors are punctuated by red, blue, and sunset-orange accents, while strong light-dark contrasts and broad atmospheric strokes create an epic, dramatic mood."},{"id":"oscar-de-la-renta","name":"Oscar de la Renta","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Oscar de la Renta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oscar-de-la-renta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oscar-de-la-renta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","black","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Oscar de la Renta was a renowned Dominican-American fashion designer known for his elegant and luxurious evening wear. His designs have been worn by some of the most influential women in the world, including first ladies and celebrities. De la Renta's work is characterized by its sophisticated silhouettes, intricate detailing, and use of vibrant colors, making him a prominent figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style combines polished fashion photography with delicate haute-couture illustration, presenting elongated models and highly constructed gowns in runway and gallery settings. Soft neutral lighting, shallow focus, fine sketch lines, lace, embroidery, ruffles, and floral surface detail create an elegant, refined editorial mood."},{"id":"faith47","name":"Faith47","cat":"street-artists","en":"Faith47","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/faith47.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/faith47","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","beige","red","muted-blue","white","light-blue"],"intro":"Faith47 is a renowned South African street artist known for her evocative and thought-provoking murals that often explore themes of social justice, spirituality, and human connection. Her work is characterized by a blend of realism and abstraction, often incorporating text and symbolic imagery to convey deeper meanings.","observation":"The style uses large, expressive portrait murals rendered with visible, energetic brushwork, scraped textures, drips, and layered marks. Faces and clothing remain highly recognizable while dissolving into broad painterly fragments, with saturated color blocks and dramatic close cropping against weathered urban architecture."},{"id":"guy-harvey","name":"Guy Harvey","cat":"painters","en":"Guy Harvey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-harvey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-harvey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","animals","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-blue","blue","silver","dark-teal","ochre","red","green","light-yellow"],"intro":"Guy Harvey is a renowned marine wildlife artist and conservationist known for his vibrant and detailed depictions of ocean life. His work often features a variety of marine animals, capturing their beauty and movement in their natural habitats. Harvey's art is celebrated for its accuracy and attention to detail, reflecting his background in marine biology and his passion for ocean conservation.","observation":"Across all four renders, ocean fish are depicted in energetic action with strong diagonal movement and splashing water. The surfaces are built from clearly visible broad, directional brushstrokes, combining vivid blues with sharp yellow, orange, white, and green accents in an expressive illustrative treatment."},{"id":"joe-casely-hayford","name":"Joe Casely-Hayford","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Joe Casely-Hayford","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joe-casely-hayford.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joe-casely-hayford","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-orange","muted-teal","vivid-red","pink","deep-blue"],"intro":"Joe Casely-Hayford is a renowned British fashion designer known for his innovative and culturally rich designs. He was celebrated for blending traditional African aesthetics with contemporary British fashion, creating a unique and influential style that resonated globally.","observation":"The style combines fashion-editorial portraiture with vividly painted, collage-like environments, using saturated teal, orange, pink, red and black alongside strong tonal contrast. Figures are sharply posed and richly dressed, while rough plaster, patchwork, animal prints, graphic marks and heavy drawn contours create a tactile, layered surface."},{"id":"lucie-rie","name":"Lucie Rie","cat":"designers","en":"Lucie Rie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucie-rie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucie-rie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","white","dark-brown","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Lucie Rie is a renowned Austrian-born British studio potter known for her innovative and elegant ceramic designs. Her work is celebrated for its modernist approach, combining traditional techniques with contemporary aesthetics, and has significantly influenced the field of studio pottery.","observation":"The style presents handcrafted ceramic vessels as realistic studio still lifes, emphasizing solid modeled volume, irregular rims, rough speckled glazing, and weathered earthy surfaces. Muted beige, brown, and blue-green tones sit against spacious neutral backdrops with soft directional shadows and carefully isolated compositions."},{"id":"helen-allingham","name":"Helen Allingham","cat":"painters","en":"Helen Allingham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helen-allingham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helen-allingham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","black","beige","muted-orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Helen Allingham was a renowned English watercolorist and illustrator, celebrated for her idyllic depictions of rural life in the late 19th century. Her work is characterized by detailed and delicate portrayals of the English countryside, often featuring charming cottages and lush gardens.","observation":"These images use richly textured, realistic oil-paint handling, with fine visible brushwork building flowers, foliage, masonry, fabric, and weathered timber. The compositions consistently depict quiet domestic scenes in lush cottage gardens, combining subdued natural colors with intricate botanical detail and softly expressive figures."},{"id":"albert-gleizes","name":"Albert Gleizes","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Gleizes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-gleizes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-gleizes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","ornate","patterns","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["pale-orange","black","rust","vivid-red","grey","dark-blue"],"intro":"Albert Gleizes was a French painter and a key figure in the development of Cubism. Born in 1881, he was known for his abstract and geometric style, contributing significantly to the avant-garde movement in the early 20th century. Gleizes's work often explored themes of modernity and industrialization, reflecting the changing landscapes of his time.","observation":"Across all four panels, recognizable figures, instruments, and interiors are broken into interlocking geometric planes, with strong angular structure and vivid red, blue, ochre, black, and cream shapes. Visible brush texture and rough canvas grain soften the otherwise flat, sharply bounded color fields, creating a dense, rhythmic, expressive painted surface."},{"id":"alfred-henry-maurer","name":"Alfred Henry Maurer","cat":"painters","en":"Alfred Henry Maurer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-henry-maurer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-henry-maurer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-blue","dark-red","bone-white"],"intro":"Alfred Henry Maurer was an American modernist painter known for his bold use of color and form. Born in 1868, Maurer initially worked in a traditional style but later embraced modernism, becoming one of the first American artists to adopt the avant-garde movements of the early 20th century. His work often featured expressive portraits and figures, characterized by a vivid color palette and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four portraits, thick visible paint marks build faces, clothing, furniture, and backgrounds with energetic variation in stroke direction. The style combines saturated reds, blues, greens, and whites with strong light-dark contrasts, presenting fashionable seated women in richly dressed, expressive poses."},{"id":"david-trubridge","name":"David Trubridge","cat":"designers","en":"David Trubridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-trubridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-trubridge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","patterns","still-life","glow","subdued-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","muted-ochre","grey","orange"],"intro":"David Trubridge is a renowned designer from New Zealand, celebrated for his innovative approach to sustainable design and sculptural furniture. His work often draws inspiration from nature, incorporating organic forms and eco-friendly materials. Trubridge's designs are recognized for their elegance and simplicity, blending traditional craftsmanship with modern technology.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic interior and product imagery with densely detailed, sculptural pendant lamps built from curved woven wood strips and repeating lattice patterns. Warm internal illumination, subdued natural wood tones, and carefully composed showroom views emphasize the fixtures’ ornate surfaces and dimensional construction."},{"id":"eugene-boudin","name":"Eugene Boudin","cat":"painters","en":"Eugene Boudin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eugene-boudin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eugene-boudin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-blue","bone-white","grey","brown","beige","black"],"intro":"Eugene Boudin is a renowned French painter, recognized as one of the pioneers of outdoor painting and a precursor to the Impressionist movement. Born in 1824, Boudin is celebrated for his depictions of coastal scenes and his ability to capture the transient effects of light and atmosphere. His works often feature the beaches and harbors of Normandy, showcasing his keen observation of nature and the changing skies.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible oil-paint brushwork, soft atmospheric blending, and finely articulated rigging, hulls, clouds, and reflections. Restrained blue, gray, cream, and brown tones create expansive harbor scenes with lively shoreline activity and a richly observed maritime setting."},{"id":"clarence-h-white","name":"Clarence H. White","cat":"photographers","en":"Clarence H. White","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clarence-h-white.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clarence-h-white","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","brown","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Clarence H. White was an influential American photographer known for his role in the Pictorialist movement. Active in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, White's work is characterized by its soft focus, romantic themes, and artistic compositions. He was a founding member of the Photo-Secession group and contributed significantly to the development of photography as a fine art.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses realistic, filmic portraiture with a sepia-toned monochrome treatment, strong chiaroscuro, and pronounced grain. Figures in pale dresses occupy shadowy woodland and interior settings, while haze, soft focus, and dappled or firelit highlights create a somber, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"ramon-casas","name":"Ramon Casas","cat":"painters","en":"Ramon Casas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ramon-casas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ramon-casas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","bone-white","muted-ochre","dark-brown","red","deep-red"],"intro":"Ramon Casas is a renowned Spanish painter known for his significant contributions to the Catalan modernisme movement. Born in Barcelona in 1866, Casas was a key figure in the cultural revival of Catalonia during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His works often depict the bourgeoisie of the time, capturing the elegance and sophistication of the era with a focus on realism and detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses softly modeled, painterly figures with visible fine brushwork and expressive, loosely handled edges. Restrained charcoal, cream, brown, muted red, and pale blue tones emphasize elegant women, dramatic hats, flowing garments, and cropped fashion-portrait compositions with a classical atmosphere."},{"id":"brothers-grimm","name":"Brothers Grimm","cat":"various-artists","en":"Brothers Grimm","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brothers-grimm.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brothers-grimm","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","bone-white","dark-brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Brothers Grimm was a pair of German scholars, Jacob and Wilhelm Grimm, famous for their collection of folklore and fairy tales. Their work, published in the 19th century, includes well-known stories such as 'Cinderella,' 'Snow White,' and 'Hansel and Gretel.' The Grimms' tales have become a significant part of Western culture, influencing literature, film, and art.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and densely textured, with visible brushwork shaping tangled forests, fur, bark, fabric, and weathered surfaces. Dark, subdued woodland colors are punctuated by vivid red garments and warm lantern light, while oversized creatures and storybook figures create an ominous yet fantastical narrative atmosphere."},{"id":"george-eastman","name":"George Eastman","cat":"photographers","en":"George Eastman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-eastman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-eastman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","white"],"intro":"George Eastman was an American entrepreneur and the founder of the Eastman Kodak Company. He played a pivotal role in popularizing photography by making it accessible to the general public through the introduction of roll film and affordable cameras. His innovations significantly contributed to the development of photography as both an art form and a popular hobby.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is photographic and filmic, using a restrained monochrome-sepia palette, deep shadows, and selective light to create a brooding, suspenseful atmosphere. Fog, wet surfaces, dense foliage, long shadows, and carefully framed solitary figures give the scenes a dreamlike, uncanny narrative quality, reinforced by visible grain and occasional shallow focus."},{"id":"orazio-gentileschi","name":"Orazio Gentileschi","cat":"painters","en":"Orazio Gentileschi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/orazio-gentileschi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/orazio-gentileschi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","erotic","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","pale-orange","ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Orazio Gentileschi was an Italian Baroque painter known for his dramatic use of light and shadow, often depicting religious and mythological scenes. He was a contemporary of Caravaggio and shared similar stylistic elements, such as tenebrism and naturalism, which were prominent in his works.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visible paintwork, warm restrained color, and strong light against deep shadow. Cropped human figures, expressive gestures, draped fabrics, and intimate poses create a dramatic, sensual, classically staged mood."},{"id":"clayton-crain","name":"Clayton Crain","cat":"illustrators","en":"Clayton Crain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clayton-crain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clayton-crain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","red","muted-rust","dark-red","bone-white"],"intro":"Clayton Crain is an American comic book artist known for his work on Marvel Comics titles such as \"Ghost Rider\" and \"X-Force.\" He is recognized for his distinctive digital painting style, which often features dynamic compositions and a vivid color palette.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses forceful, visible brushwork with broad strokes, thick textured paint, and expressive, distorted character forms. Dark blacks, deep reds, and smoky neutrals are set against sharp light and occasional fiery highlights, producing dramatic fantasy portraits and action scenes with an ominous, emotionally intense atmosphere."},{"id":"roberto-rossellini","name":"Roberto Rossellini","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Roberto Rossellini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roberto-rossellini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roberto-rossellini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","collage","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","vivid-red"],"intro":"Roberto Rossellini was an influential Italian film director and screenwriter, known for his role in the Italian neorealism movement. His films often depicted the harsh realities of post-war Italy, focusing on everyday life and human emotions. Rossellini's work is celebrated for its realistic portrayal of characters and settings, often using non-professional actors and on-location shooting to enhance authenticity.","observation":"The style combines grainy monochrome portrait photography with hard, directional lighting, deep shadows, and tightly cropped faces that create a tense film-noir mood. Across the sheet, photographic figures are layered with distressed paper, painted red and blue blocks, and rough collage textures, producing a retro editorial image with deliberate physical wear."},{"id":"ellen-jewett","name":"Ellen Jewett","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Ellen Jewett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ellen-jewett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ellen-jewett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","animals","characters","floral","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["grey","silver","muted-green","muted-ochre","charcoal","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Ellen Jewett is a Canadian sculptor known for her intricate and fantastical sculptures that blend elements of nature and surrealism. Her work often features animals intertwined with floral and botanical motifs, creating a unique fusion of the natural world and imaginative fantasy.","observation":"The style presents animal figures as richly textured botanical assemblages, combining feathers, dried flowers, moss, vines, and branches into sculptural hybrid forms. Soft studio backgrounds and subdued sage, cream, teal, and ochre hues give the detailed subjects an illustrative yet painterly, fantastical character."},{"id":"john-martin","name":"John Martin","cat":"painters","en":"John Martin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-martin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-martin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","red","beige","vivid-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"John Martin is a renowned 19th-century English painter known for his dramatic and grandiose landscapes, often depicting biblical and apocalyptic themes. His work is characterized by its epic scale, detailed compositions, and the use of light to create a sense of the sublime and the otherworldly.","observation":"Across all four renders, immense volcanic landscapes are painted with visible textured brushwork, dense atmospheric detail, and dramatic contrasts between near-black rock and incandescent lava or sky openings. The recurring scale, tiny human figures, cosmic phenomena, misty cloud masses, and impossible terrain give the style an epic, fantastical, surreal character."},{"id":"tim-hawkinson","name":"Tim Hawkinson","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tim Hawkinson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-hawkinson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-hawkinson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","patterns","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver","white"],"intro":"Tim Hawkinson is an American artist known for his innovative and often whimsical sculptures that explore themes of time, technology, and the human body. His work frequently incorporates everyday materials and mechanical elements, resulting in pieces that are both playful and thought-provoking.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents immense, highly detailed sculptural installations built from pale anatomical, mechanical, and architectural fragments. Subdued ivory tones, realistic spatial lighting, geometric gallery structures, and large areas of open floor contrast with densely layered surfaces, creating a monumental and surreal museum atmosphere."},{"id":"lynette-yiadom-boakye","name":"Lynette Yiadom-Boakye","cat":"painters","en":"Lynette Yiadom-Boakye","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lynette-yiadom-boakye.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lynette-yiadom-boakye","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","ochre","pale-orange"],"intro":"Lynette Yiadom-Boakye is a British artist known for her evocative portraits of fictional characters, often focusing on themes of identity and the African diaspora. Her work is celebrated for its painterly quality and deep exploration of human emotion, capturing the essence of her subjects through expressive brushwork and a rich color palette.","observation":"Across all four images, expressive painted figures emerge from near-black green and rust-red grounds, with broad, visibly directional brushwork and strongly contrasted highlights. The style emphasizes dramatic gestures, cropped framing, and dense, tactile handling of clothing, skin, and background surfaces."},{"id":"steven-harrington","name":"Steven Harrington","cat":"various-artists","en":"Steven Harrington","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steven-harrington.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steven-harrington","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","ornate","sculptural","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["silver","dark-blue","muted-olive","red","vivid-red","yellow","blue","green"],"intro":"Steven Harrington is a contemporary artist and designer known for his vibrant, playful, and psychedelic art style. His work often features bold colors, whimsical characters, and surreal landscapes, drawing inspiration from California's culture and lifestyle. Harrington's art is characterized by its engaging and dynamic compositions, often incorporating elements of pop culture and modern consumerism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense, surreal monster imagery with vivid flat color, heavy black contouring, and highly readable cartoon shapes. Repeated eyes, teeth, tongues, spikes, and organic motifs create an expressive, playful-grotesque visual language that carries from crowded illustrations into decorated sculptural forms."},{"id":"adriaen-van-utrecht","name":"Adriaen van Utrecht","cat":"painters","en":"Adriaen van Utrecht","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adriaen-van-utrecht.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adriaen-van-utrecht","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Adriaen van Utrecht was a Flemish Baroque painter known for his detailed still lifes and market scenes. He was active during the 17th century and was part of the Dutch Golden Age of painting. Van Utrecht's works often featured elaborate compositions with a focus on realism and intricate detail, capturing the abundance and variety of nature and daily life.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly surfaces with dramatic chiaroscuro, subdued earth tones, and warm highlights against deep shadow. It combines densely observed historical figures, animals, and woodland settings with cinematic staging, atmospheric depth, and a somber, storybook mood."},{"id":"tobia-scarpa","name":"Tobia Scarpa","cat":"architects","en":"Tobia Scarpa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tobia-scarpa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tobia-scarpa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","retro","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["rust","brown","silver","dark-brown","beige","black"],"intro":"Tobia Scarpa is an Italian architect and designer known for his innovative contributions to modern architecture and furniture design. His work is characterized by a blend of traditional craftsmanship and modernist principles, often incorporating natural materials and clean lines. Scarpa's designs have been influential in shaping contemporary architectural and design practices, with a focus on functionality and aesthetic simplicity.","observation":"The style presents carefully composed interior-furniture still lifes with realistic materials, strong geometric structure, and sculptural organic curves. Warm walnut, terracotta, muted blue, stone, and aged metal recur throughout, while generous negative space and directional light give the objects a refined retro-modern showroom character."},{"id":"simon-schubert","name":"Simon Schubert","cat":"various-artists","en":"Simon Schubert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/simon-schubert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/simon-schubert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","scenes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","classical","epic"],"colours":["grey","silver","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Simon Schubert is a contemporary artist known for his intricate paper folding and cutting techniques, creating detailed and often surreal architectural scenes. His work explores themes of perception, reality, and the interplay between light and shadow, often evoking a sense of mystery and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental white sculptural forms and elaborate classical interiors are presented in stark monochrome, with small human figures creating an overwhelming sense of scale. Strong directional lighting, deep shadows, and cinematic compositions turn each architectural tableau into a surreal, imposing scene."},{"id":"kikuji-kawada","name":"Kikuji Kawada","cat":"photographers","en":"Kikuji Kawada","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kikuji-kawada.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kikuji-kawada","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["portraits","urban","glow","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Kikuji Kawada is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his exploration of memory and history through a unique visual language. His work often delves into themes of identity and the passage of time, capturing the essence of post-war Japan with a haunting and introspective style.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, blown highlights, visible grain, and selective focus. Close-up faces and rain-soaked urban scenes are shaped by blurred streetlights, reflections, mist, and an ominous nocturnal atmosphere."},{"id":"rankin","name":"Rankin","cat":"photographers","en":"Rankin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rankin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rankin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","grey","muted-blue","deep-blue"],"intro":"Rankin is a renowned British photographer known for his distinctive style in fashion and portrait photography. He has worked with numerous high-profile clients and publications, capturing iconic images that blend creativity with technical precision. His work often explores themes of beauty, identity, and contemporary culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped beauty portraits with meticulous skin, hair, makeup, and material detail. Stark black, white, and electric-blue accents create a bold high-contrast editorial look, reinforced by glossy face paint, sculptural styling, and luxurious dark textures."},{"id":"janine-antoni","name":"Janine Antoni","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Janine Antoni","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/janine-antoni.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/janine-antoni","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","scenes","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","white","brown","black"],"intro":"Janine Antoni is a contemporary artist known for her innovative approach to sculpture and performance art. Her work often explores themes of identity, the body, and the human condition, using unconventional materials and methods to challenge traditional boundaries in art. Antoni's pieces are characterized by their emotional depth and conceptual rigor, making her a significant figure in the contemporary art scene.","observation":"The style presents pale, heavily modelled clay or plaster figures in sparse gallery installations, emphasizing torn drapery, rough surfaces, bodily fragments, and monumental forms. Restrained earth tones, soft museum lighting, and generous empty space create a quiet but unsettling atmosphere, while the recurring covered figures and sculptural interventions give the images a surreal, expressive character."},{"id":"robert-mapplethorpe","name":"Robert Mapplethorpe","cat":"photographers","en":"Robert Mapplethorpe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-mapplethorpe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-mapplethorpe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","floral","still-life","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","negative-space"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","beige"],"intro":"Robert Mapplethorpe was an influential American photographer known for his black-and-white portraits, self-portraits, and images of flowers. His work often explored themes of identity, sexuality, and the human form, making significant contributions to contemporary art and LGBTQ+ representation. Mapplethorpe's style is characterized by its classical composition, sharp contrasts, and elegant simplicity.","observation":"A monochrome photographic style presents flowers and vases against near-black backgrounds, using dramatic directional light, deep shadows, and bright sculptural highlights. The compositions range from sparse single stems to dense bouquets, consistently emphasizing botanical detail, elegant negative space, and finely rendered textures."},{"id":"tatsuo-miyajima","name":"Tatsuo Miyajima","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tatsuo Miyajima","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tatsuo-miyajima.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tatsuo-miyajima","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","dark","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-red","deep-red","black","vivid-red"],"intro":"Tatsuo Miyajima is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his innovative use of technology and light in his sculptural installations. His work often explores themes of time, space, and the human experience, utilizing digital counters and LED lights to create immersive environments.","observation":"The style presents photorealistic, cinematic interiors dominated by saturated red illumination, occasional cyan accents, deep shadows, and strong reflective surfaces. Repeated light grids, axial symmetry, and receding architectural perspectives create immersive geometric scenes, often with a solitary silhouetted figure for scale."},{"id":"robert-morris","name":"Robert Morris","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Robert Morris","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-morris.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-morris","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","minimalist","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","patterns","still-life","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","silver","brown","white"],"intro":"Robert Morris was an influential American artist and sculptor, known for his contributions to Minimalism and Conceptual Art. His work often explored themes of perception, space, and the relationship between the viewer and the artwork, using simple geometric forms and industrial materials.","observation":"The style presents sparse gallery interiors with carefully isolated sculptural objects, combining organic wood, reflective metal, concrete, and dramatically folded white forms. Photorealistic lighting, restrained neutral tones, clean architectural geometry, and generous negative space create a quiet, highly curated exhibition atmosphere."},{"id":"grace-cossington-smith","name":"Grace Cossington Smith","cat":"painters","en":"Grace Cossington Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/grace-cossington-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/grace-cossington-smith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["red","light-orange","charcoal","grey","muted-olive"],"intro":"Grace Cossington Smith was an influential Australian artist known for her pioneering role in introducing modernist styles to Australian art. Born in 1892, she became renowned for her vibrant use of color and light, often depicting domestic interiors and landscapes. Her work is characterized by a post-impressionist style, with a focus on capturing the essence of her subjects through expressive brushwork and a vivid color palette.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses visibly built-up paint and broad, energetic strokes to describe gardens, homes, harbor scenery, and interiors. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and oranges, strong light-dark separation, and dense overlapping details create an expressive, richly textured illustrative appearance."},{"id":"elizabeth-murray","name":"Elizabeth Murray","cat":"printmakers","en":"Elizabeth Murray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elizabeth-murray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elizabeth-murray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","patterns","bold-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","vivid-red","charcoal","red","orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Elizabeth Murray is a renowned American painter and printmaker known for her distinctively shaped canvases and bold use of color. Her work often explores the boundaries between abstraction and representation, contributing significantly to the Neo-Expressionist movement. Murray's art is celebrated for its dynamic compositions and playful forms, which challenge traditional artistic conventions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses brightly painted, three-dimensional assemblages of biomorphic and animal-like forms, combining thick drawn contours with visible brushwork and raised sculptural surfaces. Dense stripes, dots, grids, eyes, and ornamental internal motifs create highly colorful, expressive compositions that feel playful, fantastical, and deliberately surreal."},{"id":"bhupen-khakhar","name":"Bhupen Khakhar","cat":"painters","en":"Bhupen Khakhar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bhupen-khakhar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bhupen-khakhar","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-green","muted-olive","red","dark-blue","beige","muted-blue"],"intro":"Bhupen Khakhar is a renowned Indian painter known for his vivid and narrative depictions of everyday life, often exploring themes of identity and sexuality. His work is characterized by its vibrant colors, intricate details, and a unique blend of traditional Indian and modern art influences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible painted brushwork and fine linear accents with dense, illustrative scenes filled with figures, architecture, gardens, and vegetation. Saturated coral, turquoise, green, pink, and deep blue create an expressive, richly layered tropical world, balancing carefully arranged landscapes with imaginative visual storytelling."},{"id":"john-divola","name":"John Divola","cat":"various-artists","en":"John Divola","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-divola.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-divola","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","scenes","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","grey","dark-red","red","orange"],"intro":"John Divola is an American photographer known for his exploration of abandoned and decaying spaces, often capturing the interplay between nature and man-made environments. His work frequently delves into themes of transience and abandonment, using photography as a medium to explore these concepts.","observation":"Across the four images, recognizable figures, vehicles, fire, and industrial spaces are treated with vigorous, visible brushwork and smeared directional strokes. A dark teal-and-red palette, intense internal firelight, heavy contrast, and blurred motion create a bleak, cinematic, surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"artur-bordalo","name":"Artur Bordalo","cat":"street-artists","en":"Artur Bordalo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/artur-bordalo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/artur-bordalo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","scenes","urban","motion","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","brown","muted-blue","dark-red","ochre","green"],"intro":"Artur Bordalo is a contemporary Portuguese artist known for his innovative approach to street art, particularly through the use of recycled materials to create large-scale installations. His work often addresses themes of environmental conservation and sustainability, using discarded objects to form vibrant and thought-provoking pieces that challenge perceptions of waste and art.","observation":"Across all four renders, large animal figures emerge from intensely colorful, heavily textured paint applied in broad, directional strokes, with scraped edges, drips, and thick layered surfaces. The murals are integrated into weathered urban courtyards and façades, combining expressive animal gestures with dense, high-contrast color and energetic marks."},{"id":"john-galliano","name":"John Galliano","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"John Galliano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-galliano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-galliano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","bone-white","ochre","dark-brown","deep-rust"],"intro":"John Galliano is a renowned British fashion designer known for his innovative and theatrical approach to fashion. He gained fame as the head designer of major fashion houses such as Givenchy, Christian Dior , and his own label. Galliano is celebrated for his ability to blend historical references with contemporary design, creating collections that are both avant-garde and commercially successful.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly detailed and ornate, presenting theatrical fashion figures in elaborate layered costumes, feathers, lace, sequins, and sculptural accessories. Dark interiors, warm practical lights, deep shadows, and dramatic editorial posing create a cinematic, expressive atmosphere with strong contrast."},{"id":"wilhelmina-barns-graham","name":"Wilhelmina Barns-Graham","cat":"painters","en":"Wilhelmina Barns-Graham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wilhelmina-barns-graham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wilhelmina-barns-graham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","muted-teal","vivid-rust","blue","muted-ochre","silver"],"intro":"Wilhelmina Barns-Graham was a Scottish painter known for her abstract and geometric works, often associated with the St Ives School. Her art explored the interplay of color, form, and space, creating dynamic compositions that reflect her interest in modernist principles.","observation":"The style is abstract and strongly geometric, built from overlapping angular blocks and irregular planar shapes. Saturated blue, orange, teal, ochre, and black create bold contrast, while visible broad brushwork, scratches, and uneven painted surfaces keep the composition tactile rather than mechanically flat."},{"id":"marina-abramovic","name":"Marina Abramovic","cat":"various-artists","en":"Marina Abramovic","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marina-abramovic.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marina-abramovic","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","religious","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","charcoal","bone-white","dark-red","deep-red"],"intro":"Marina Abramovic is a Serbian performance artist known for her pioneering work in the field of performance art. Her career spans over four decades, during which she has explored the relationship between performer and audience, the limits of the body, and the possibilities of the mind. Abramovic is renowned for her endurance-based performances and has been a major figure in the development of contemporary art.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, highly realistic compositions with restrained dark tones, intense red accents, deep shadows, and strong reflections. Sparse gallery-like spaces, repeated figures, ritual fires, mirrors, and carefully centered arrangements create a solemn, theatrical, surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"carlo-dolci","name":"Carlo Dolci","cat":"painters","en":"Carlo Dolci","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carlo-dolci.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carlo-dolci","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-orange","dark-blue","red"],"intro":"Carlo Dolci was a renowned Italian painter of the Baroque period, known for his highly detailed and refined religious works. Born in Florence in 1616, Dolci's art is characterized by its delicate brushwork, vibrant colors, and serene compositions. His devotion to religious themes and his meticulous technique made him one of the most celebrated artists of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modeled oil-paint surfaces, delicate visible brushwork, and dramatic light against near-black backgrounds. It repeatedly presents emotionally intense female figures in devotional or swooning poses, with saturated blue, white, and red garments, strong facial expression, and tightly cropped portrait compositions."},{"id":"francesco-albani","name":"Francesco Albani","cat":"painters","en":"Francesco Albani","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francesco-albani.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francesco-albani","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","ochre","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Francesco Albani was an Italian Baroque painter, known for his idyllic and mythological scenes. Born in 1578, Albani was a prominent figure in the Bolognese School, often depicting religious and classical themes with a refined and harmonious style. His works are characterized by their delicate use of color and graceful compositions, often featuring cherubs and mythological figures.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly and highly detailed, with visible fine brushwork, modeled faces, elaborate fabrics, and expressive gestures. Dark backgrounds and strong light-dark separation create a solemn, dramatic atmosphere, while portraits and crowded narrative scenes share classical-looking costumes, animals, and theatrical compositions."},{"id":"gabriel-metsu","name":"Gabriel Metsu","cat":"painters","en":"Gabriel Metsu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gabriel-metsu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gabriel-metsu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-brown","dark-brown","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Gabriel Metsu was a Dutch painter from the 17th century, known for his detailed and intimate genre paintings depicting everyday life. He was a prominent figure during the Dutch Golden Age , capturing domestic scenes with a focus on realism and fine detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, layered fabrics, expressive faces, and densely populated interiors. Restrained earth tones are punctuated by red and orange garments, while strong light-dark contrast gives the domestic scenes depth and theatrical emphasis."},{"id":"hans-erni","name":"Hans Erni","cat":"various-artists","en":"Hans Erni","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-erni.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-erni","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","muted-orange","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"Hans Erni is a Swiss artist known for his work as a painter, graphic designer, and sculptor. Born in 1909, Erni's career spanned several decades, during which he became renowned for his distinctive style that often combined elements of abstraction and realism. His work is characterized by intricate line work, vibrant colors, and a strong sense of movement and form, often exploring themes related to science, nature, and mythology.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines heavily worked painterly surfaces with fine, directional brushwork, dense textural detail, and sculptural human or animal forms. Compositions are tightly cropped and emotionally charged, using earthy muted colors, isolated red accents, and deep shadows to create a dark, dramatic, almost mythic atmosphere."},{"id":"marianne-breslauer","name":"Marianne Breslauer","cat":"photographers","en":"Marianne Breslauer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marianne-breslauer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marianne-breslauer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","portraits","urban","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","bone-white","beige","orange","silver"],"intro":"Marianne Breslauer was a German photographer known for her work during the interwar period. She was associated with the New Photography movement and captured striking images that often depicted the everyday life and culture of early 20th-century Europe. Her work is characterized by its modernist approach, blending elements of expressionism and surrealism.","observation":"The style combines tactile painted and drawn surfaces with collage-like juxtapositions, sharply cropped faces, architecture, and botanical forms. Muted teal, ochre, black, and cream tones create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while fine hatching, paper texture, angular geometry, and layered edges give the images an expressive editorial character."},{"id":"ian-davenport","name":"Ian Davenport","cat":"painters","en":"Ian Davenport","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ian-davenport.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ian-davenport","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["red","bone-white","muted-blue","charcoal","orange"],"intro":"Ian Davenport is a contemporary British artist known for his abstract paintings that explore the dynamics of color and form. He gained recognition for his innovative use of paint pouring techniques, creating vibrant, fluid compositions that challenge traditional notions of painting.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated pigments form abstract flowing bands, drips, arches, and marbled swirls on a pale ground. Visible wet-looking paint buildup, pooling, and broad directional strokes give the style a tactile, painterly energy, while the warped repetitions create a surreal sense of motion."},{"id":"kishin-shinoyama","name":"Kishin Shinoyama","cat":"photographers","en":"Kishin Shinoyama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kishin-shinoyama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kishin-shinoyama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","beige","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Kishin Shinoyama is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his work in portraiture and fashion photography. His career spans several decades, during which he has captured iconic images of celebrities and models, often characterized by their bold and intimate style. Shinoyama's work is celebrated for its ability to blend traditional Japanese aesthetics with contemporary themes, creating a unique and influential body of work.","observation":"The style is built around tightly cropped, realistic portrait photography with expressive gazes, windblown hair, and faces partly obscured by fabric or hair. Most images use stark monochrome, deep shadows, visible grain, and selective focus, with occasional muted color and reflective veiling adding a moody editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"alberto-giacometti","name":"Alberto Giacometti","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Alberto Giacometti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alberto-giacometti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alberto-giacometti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","still-life","grain","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","beige","black","brown"],"intro":"Alberto Giacometti was a Swiss sculptor and painter known for his distinctive elongated figures and existential themes. His work is characterized by its focus on the human condition, often reflecting themes of isolation and introspection. Giacometti's sculptures are celebrated for their unique style, which combines elements of surrealism and modernism, and his influence extends across various artistic movements of the 20th century.","observation":"The style presents austere, elongated human sculptures with attenuated limbs, rough built-up surfaces, and expressive, distorted anatomy. Restrained brown, black, and gray tones, neutral gallery settings, plinths, and close-up studies give the images a solemn, museum-documentation character."},{"id":"daido-moriyama","name":"Daido Moriyama","cat":"photographers","en":"Daido Moriyama","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daido-moriyama.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daido-moriyama","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","backlighting","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Daido Moriyama is a renowned Japanese photographer known for his raw and provocative images that capture the gritty reality of urban life. His work often explores themes of identity, isolation, and the chaotic energy of city environments, particularly in post-war Japan. Moriyama's style is characterized by high contrast, grainy textures, and a focus on the darker aspects of human experience.","observation":"A stark black-and-white photographic style built around deep blacks, blown highlights, visible grain, and strong backlighting. It combines intimate close-up portraiture with rainy urban scenes, using shallow focus, motion blur, reflections, and isolated figures to create a dark, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"gyorgy-kepes","name":"Gyorgy Kepes","cat":"painters","en":"Gyorgy Kepes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gyorgy-kepes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gyorgy-kepes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","sculptural","patterns","motion","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","beige"],"intro":"Gyorgy Kepes was a Hungarian-born artist and educator known for his work in visual design and his association with the Bauhaus movement. He was a significant figure in the development of modernist art and design, particularly in the fields of photography and visual communication. Kepes was also a prolific writer and theorist, contributing to the understanding of visual perception and the role of art in society.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines stark monochrome contrast with abstract sculptural forms, smooth volumes, and precisely repeated linear patterns. Fine drawn lines, grainy photographic texture, and dramatic shadows create optical distortion and a surreal sense of motion."},{"id":"jill-freedman","name":"Jill Freedman","cat":"photographers","en":"Jill Freedman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jill-freedman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jill-freedman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Jill Freedman was an American documentary photographer known for her poignant and humanistic approach to capturing everyday life. Her work often focused on social issues and urban environments, particularly in New York City during the 1970s. Freedman's photography is celebrated for its emotional depth and ability to convey the stories of marginalized communities.","observation":"The style is stark black-and-white documentary photography, using strong tonal contrast, visible grain, and candid framing to capture children and families in dense urban streets. Rough masonry, cluttered alleys, direct gazes, and occasional shallow focus create an intimate, socially observant atmosphere."},{"id":"les-paul","name":"Les Paul","cat":"designers","en":"Les Paul","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/les-paul.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/les-paul","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","still-life","fine-lines","grain","high-contrast","metallic","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","white","dark-brown","grey","orange","rust"],"intro":"Les Paul was an American jazz, country, and blues guitarist, songwriter, and inventor, known for pioneering the solid-body electric guitar, which made the sound of rock and roll possible. His innovations in recording techniques, such as overdubbing and multitrack recording, have had a lasting impact on the music industry.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, densely detailed still-life photographs of customized electric guitars, emphasizing worn finishes, floral decoration, collage imagery, exposed mechanisms, and polished hardware. Saturated warm colors, reflective metal, sharp close-up detail, and strong light-dark contrast recur across the sheet, with both workshop scenes and isolated instrument views."},{"id":"spartacus-chetwynd","name":"Spartacus Chetwynd","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Spartacus Chetwynd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/spartacus-chetwynd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/spartacus-chetwynd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["beige","silver","dark-brown","red","brown","ochre"],"intro":"Spartacus Chetwynd is a British contemporary artist known for her performance art, installations, and playful, theatrical style. Often incorporating costumes, masks, and props, Chetwynd's work explores themes of identity, mythology, and storytelling, drawing on a wide range of cultural references from popular culture to classical literature.","observation":"The style presents eccentric figures and textile sculptures in realistic gallery-like settings, with saturated colors and densely layered fabrics, feathers, flowers, and found materials. Its expressive, surreal character comes from elaborate wearable assemblages, irregular silhouettes, and collage-like surface construction rather than from painted effects."},{"id":"julio-le-parc","name":"Julio Le Parc","cat":"painters","en":"Julio Le Parc","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julio-le-parc.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julio-le-parc","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","glow","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","vivid-red","bone-white","dark-blue","dark-olive","dark-pink"],"intro":"Julio Le Parc is an influential Argentinian artist known for his contributions to kinetic and op art. Born in 1928, he became a key figure in the avant-garde art movement, exploring the interplay of light, movement, and perception. His work often challenges the viewer's visual experience, creating dynamic and immersive environments.","observation":"The style is abstract and highly geometric, built from repeated ridges, stacked forms, radial symmetry, and strong central vanishing points. Saturated spectral colors, luminous internal light, deep blacks, and reflective distortions create a vivid, surreal optical effect across both the tunnel-like and grid-like compositions."},{"id":"paolo-soleri","name":"Paolo Soleri","cat":"architects","en":"Paolo Soleri","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paolo-soleri.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paolo-soleri","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","glow","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","muted-orange","white","orange"],"intro":"Paolo Soleri was an Italian architect known for his innovative and environmentally conscious designs. He is celebrated for his concept of 'arcology,' which combines architecture and ecology to create sustainable urban environments. Soleri's work emphasizes harmony between the built and natural environments, often featuring organic forms and futuristic designs.","observation":"The style presents monumental organic architecture with highly realistic, sculptural surfaces, dense structural detail, and sweeping geometric arches. Warm earth tones, strong sunlight, deep interior shadows, and glowing openings emphasize the cavernous interiors and unusual spatial forms across all four views."},{"id":"daniel-buren","name":"Daniel Buren","cat":"various-artists","en":"Daniel Buren","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daniel-buren.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daniel-buren","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","scenes","urban","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-orange","deep-red","charcoal","vivid-rust","silver"],"intro":"Daniel Buren is a French conceptual artist known for his distinctive use of stripes and his site-specific installations. Born in 1938, Buren's work often explores the relationship between art and its environment, challenging traditional notions of art presentation. His signature style involves the use of alternating white and colored stripes, which he applies to a variety of surfaces and contexts, from gallery walls to public spaces.","observation":"The style combines bold geometric architecture with saturated color blocking, especially repeated vertical stripes and monumental columns. Strong daylight, hard-edged shadows, reflective floors, and deep perspective make the spaces feel vivid, graphic, and theatrically cinematic."},{"id":"hubert-de-givenchy","name":"Hubert de Givenchy","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Hubert de Givenchy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hubert-de-givenchy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hubert-de-givenchy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","beige"],"intro":"Hubert de Givenchy was a renowned French fashion designer, celebrated for his elegant and sophisticated haute couture creations. He founded the House of Givenchy in 1952, and his designs were favored by many iconic figures, including Audrey Hepburn. Givenchy's work is characterized by its timeless elegance, refined silhouettes, and luxurious fabrics, making a significant impact on the fashion industry.","observation":"The style presents couture garments as dramatic, sculptural forms on mannequin-like figures, with exaggerated sleeves, sweeping skirts, hats, and richly textured fabric. It combines subdued, shadowed tones with carefully arranged museum or studio settings, balancing clean illustrative presentation against ornate surface detail and expressive silhouettes."},{"id":"mary-ellen-mark","name":"Mary Ellen Mark","cat":"photographers","en":"Mary Ellen Mark","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mary-ellen-mark.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mary-ellen-mark","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Mary Ellen Mark is a renowned American photographer known for her photojournalistic and documentary work. Her career spanned several decades, during which she captured powerful images of marginalized communities and individuals, often focusing on social issues and human experiences. Her work is characterized by its empathetic approach and ability to tell compelling stories through the lens of her camera.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photography with strong tonal contrast, intimate portrait framing, and selective focus. Its candid domestic settings, solemn expressions, vintage clothing, and richly textured interiors create a dark, psychologically charged documentary-like atmosphere across the four images."},{"id":"jules-bastien-lepage","name":"Jules Bastien-Lepage","cat":"painters","en":"Jules Bastien-Lepage","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jules-bastien-lepage.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jules-bastien-lepage","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Jules Bastien-Lepage was a French painter known for his naturalistic style and depictions of rural life in the late 19th century. His work often focused on the everyday lives of peasants, capturing their essence with a keen eye for detail and a soft, painterly touch. Bastien-Lepage's art is celebrated for its realistic portrayal of rural settings and its ability to convey the quiet dignity of his subjects.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from richly visible paint, layered brushwork, and finely observed figures set among dense grasses and wildflowers. Earthy, subdued colors, soft outdoor light, and expressive gestures create a realistic yet emotionally atmospheric rural tableau with a classical pastoral character."},{"id":"tami-bone","name":"Tami Bone","cat":"photographers","en":"Tami Bone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tami-bone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tami-bone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Tami Bone is a contemporary photographer known for her evocative and dreamlike imagery. Her work often explores themes of memory, imagination, and the natural world, creating a bridge between reality and fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome, high-contrast photographic scenes with figures and birds reduced to striking silhouettes against luminous mist. Shallow focus, backlighting, and blurred woodland forms create a dark, dreamy, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"john-bellany","name":"John Bellany","cat":"painters","en":"John Bellany","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-bellany.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-bellany","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","portraits","scenes","urban","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","beige","muted-blue","charcoal","ochre","red"],"intro":"John Bellany is a renowned Scottish painter known for his expressive and often haunting depictions of the human condition. His work is characterized by bold colors, dramatic compositions, and a deep exploration of themes related to identity and mortality. Bellany's art often reflects his Scottish heritage and personal experiences, making him a significant figure in modern British art.","observation":"Across the four images, recognizable harbors, villages, landscapes, and a portrait are rendered with energetic visible brushwork, layered paint, and fine dark linear accents. Saturated blues, reds, ochres, and greens give the scenes a vivid, expressive character, while dense architectural and nautical details fill the compositions."},{"id":"maurice-sapiro","name":"Maurice Sapiro","cat":"painters","en":"Maurice Sapiro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maurice-sapiro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maurice-sapiro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","landscapes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["ochre","black","dark-brown","beige"],"intro":"Maurice Sapiro is an American artist known for his evocative landscape paintings that often explore the interplay of light and atmosphere. His works are characterized by a masterful use of color and texture, creating scenes that are both realistic and imbued with a sense of mystery and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four renders, the landscapes are treated as atmospheric paintings built from translucent haze, soft blended masses, and visible fine surface strokes. Dark woodland silhouettes and reflective water are repeatedly set against glowing amber-orange horizons, creating a moody, dreamlike sense of distance and light."},{"id":"bob-byerley","name":"Bob Byerley","cat":"painters","en":"Bob Byerley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-byerley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-byerley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Bob Byerley is an American painter known for his nostalgic and imaginative depictions of children. His work often captures the innocence and wonder of childhood, set against detailed and realistic backgrounds that evoke a sense of mid-20th century Americana. Byerley's paintings are celebrated for their narrative quality and the way they blend realism with a touch of fantasy.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is densely composed and painterly, with visible fine brushwork, richly textured surfaces, and expressive faces. Warm, subdued brown, green, and cream tones are shaped by strong chiaroscuro, while children, toys, elaborate clothing, and crowded interiors create a nostalgic classical tableau."},{"id":"craola","name":"Craola","cat":"painters","en":"Craola","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/craola.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/craola","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","floral","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","grey","light-orange","dark-brown","red","pale-blue"],"intro":"Craola is a contemporary artist known for his unique blend of pop surrealism and fantasy art. His work often features whimsical, imaginative scenes that combine elements of nature, technology, and fantastical creatures. Craola's art is characterized by intricate details and vibrant colors, creating a playful yet complex visual experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines dense painterly brushwork with highly ornamental, fantastical imagery. Saturated coral, turquoise, green, and gold hues, exaggerated animal and human features, elaborate floral details, and surreal hybrid arrangements create an expressive, richly layered surface."},{"id":"felice-casorati","name":"Felice Casorati","cat":"painters","en":"Felice Casorati","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/felice-casorati.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/felice-casorati","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","fashion","floral","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","beige","brown","muted-blue","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Felice Casorati was an Italian painter known for his distinctive style that combined elements of realism and abstraction. His work often featured elongated figures and a serene, contemplative atmosphere, drawing on influences from the Renaissance and Symbolism. Casorati's paintings are characterized by their precise composition and a unique blend of modernist and classical elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly composed female portraits with flattened yet dimensional forms, dense textile and floral patterning, and carefully arranged decorative backgrounds. Saturated reds, blues, blacks, and creams combine with visible painted texture, fine contouring, and strong light-dark separation to create an ornate, fashion-conscious portrait language."},{"id":"duccio","name":"Duccio","cat":"painters","en":"Duccio","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/duccio.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/duccio","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","metallic","vivid-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["ochre","dark-brown","vivid-red","black","orange","deep-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Duccio is a renowned Italian painter from the late 13th and early 14th centuries, known for his significant contributions to the Sienese school of painting. His work is characterized by a blend of Byzantine and Gothic styles, often featuring religious themes and intricate detailing. Duccio's most famous work is the Maestà, an altarpiece that showcases his skill in composition and use of color.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with fine linear detailing, elaborate gold backgrounds, and saturated red, blue, ochre, and black pigments. Repeated haloed figures, solemn or expressive faces, stylized anatomy, and tightly cropped devotional groupings create a densely ornamental religious-image aesthetic."},{"id":"kazuo-shiraga","name":"Kazuo Shiraga","cat":"painters","en":"Kazuo Shiraga","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kazuo-shiraga.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kazuo-shiraga","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["deep-red","bone-white","black","white","muted-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Kazuo Shiraga was a Japanese artist known for his innovative contributions to the Gutai group, an avant-garde collective in post-war Japan. He is celebrated for his dynamic and physical approach to painting, often using his feet to create bold, expressive works. Shiraga's art is characterized by its energetic brushstrokes and vibrant color palette, reflecting the spirit of experimentation and freedom that defined the Gutai movement.","observation":"Across all four works, thick, visibly worked paint forms sweeping, turbulent gestures in a restricted red, black, and cream palette. Fragmentary figures and animal-like shapes emerge from splatters, scraping, and layered strokes, giving the series an intense, motion-filled, surreal quality."},{"id":"jean-auguste-dominique-ingres","name":"Jean Auguste Dominique Ingres","cat":"painters","en":"Jean Auguste Dominique Ingres","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-auguste-dominique-ingres.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-auguste-dominique-ingres","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-red","dark-cyan","black","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"Jean Auguste Dominique Ingres was a prominent French Neoclassical painter, known for his precise and detailed portraits, as well as his commitment to classical ideals. Born in 1780, Ingres was a key figure in the art world of the 19th century, celebrated for his mastery of line and form. His works often depicted historical and mythological subjects, characterized by their clarity, elegance, and adherence to classical principles.","observation":"The style presents tightly framed, formal portraits in richly layered oil paint, with delicate facial modelling, visible fine brushwork, and subtly textured surfaces. Restrained blue-green grounds contrast with saturated reds, blues, whites, and golds in ornate historical clothing, floral adornments, jewelry, and patterned fabrics."},{"id":"do-ho-suh","name":"Do Ho Suh","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Do Ho Suh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/do-ho-suh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/do-ho-suh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","urban","vivid-colors","sci-fi","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["brown","dark-red","red","blue","muted-teal","silver"],"intro":"Do Ho Suh is a South Korean artist known for his large-scale installations and sculptures that explore themes of home, memory, and identity. His work often reflects his experiences as a Korean expatriate, blending traditional Korean aesthetics with contemporary art practices.","observation":"The style combines realistic architectural interiors with dense geometric, translucent room-like structures rendered in saturated single-color washes. Fine repeated linear grids create a sculptural, wireframe effect, while small human figures and grand museum architecture establish scale and a surreal, futuristic atmosphere."},{"id":"gordon-matta-clark","name":"Gordon Matta-Clark","cat":"various-artists","en":"Gordon Matta-Clark","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gordon-matta-clark.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gordon-matta-clark","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","silver","white"],"intro":"Gordon Matta-Clark was an American artist known for his innovative and unconventional approach to architecture and art. Born in 1943, he became famous for his 'building cuts'⁠—transformative works that involved slicing through buildings to create new perspectives and challenge traditional architectural concepts. His work often explored themes of urban decay, space, and the relationship between structure and environment.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents photorealistic, highly detailed views of severely damaged urban interiors, with collapsed ceilings, exposed masonry, rubble, and stripped walls. A monochrome, high-contrast treatment, visible grain, and selective focus give the scenes a bleak documentary-like intensity while emphasizing the textures and depth of the ruined architecture."},{"id":"al-capp","name":"Al Capp","cat":"illustrators","en":"Al Capp","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/al-capp.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/al-capp","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing"],"colours":["ochre","pale-orange","brown","silver","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Al Capp was an American cartoonist best known for creating the satirical comic strip 'Li'l Abner,' which ran from 1934 to 1977. His work was characterized by its humorous and often biting social commentary, focusing on American culture and politics. Capp's style was influential in the world of comics, blending exaggerated caricatures with sharp wit.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses expressive caricature, thick black contour lines, and dense ink shading to stage humorous everyday interactions. Flat, slightly weathered color fills⁠—especially cream, red, green, and ochre⁠—combine with detailed period interiors and clothing in a vintage comic-panel presentation."},{"id":"olive-cotton","name":"Olive Cotton","cat":"photographers","en":"Olive Cotton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/olive-cotton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/olive-cotton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","white","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Olive Cotton was an influential Australian photographer known for her contributions to modernist photography in the 20th century. She was celebrated for her ability to capture the subtleties of light and shadow, often focusing on intimate and serene compositions that highlighted the beauty of everyday moments.","observation":"The style uses realistic black-and-white photography with strong window backlighting, deep shadows, and pronounced grain. Intimate domestic scenes and portraits are framed cinematically, combining theatrical poses, expressive faces, and richly textured interiors with a dark, contemplative mood."},{"id":"winslow-homer","name":"Winslow Homer","cat":"painters","en":"Winslow Homer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/winslow-homer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/winslow-homer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Winslow Homer was an American painter known for his powerful and evocative seascapes and depictions of rural life. Born in 1836, Homer became one of the foremost painters of 19th-century America, celebrated for his mastery of light and shadow, and his ability to capture the raw beauty of nature. His works often reflect themes of human struggle and resilience, set against the backdrop of the American landscape.","observation":"These pictures use visible, broad, energetic brushstrokes to build stormy water, clouds, rocks, and boats, with richly textured surfaces throughout. Muted blue-gray and earth tones are punctuated by bright foam and strong dark-light contrasts, while figures and vessels are arranged in active maritime scenes full of movement."},{"id":"adolf-fassbender","name":"Adolf Fassbender","cat":"photographers","en":"Adolf Fassbender","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adolf-fassbender.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adolf-fassbender","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Adolf Fassbender is a renowned photographer known for his contributions to pictorialism and his evocative black and white landscapes. His work often captures the interplay of light and shadow, creating atmospheric and moody scenes that evoke a sense of nostalgia and mystery.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome imagery with deep silhouettes, luminous practical lights, and heavy atmospheric fog. Cinematic compositions repeatedly frame lakes, paths, castles, and bare trees with small cloaked figures, producing a bleak yet dreamlike sense of scale and mystery."},{"id":"pascale-marthine-tayou","name":"Pascale Marthine Tayou","cat":"various-artists","en":"Pascale Marthine Tayou","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pascale-marthine-tayou.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pascale-marthine-tayou","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["brown","silver","beige","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Pascale Marthine Tayou is a contemporary artist from Cameroon known for his dynamic and thought-provoking installations. His work often explores themes of identity, cultural hybridity, and globalization, using a variety of materials and techniques to create vibrant and engaging pieces.","observation":"The style presents monumental, densely packed assemblages of colorful found materials, combining visible brushwork, fabric, ribbons, painted fragments, and dangling strands into sculptural masses. Saturated color, radial and irregular protrusions, layered surface decoration, and surreal scale give the gallery installations an exuberant, tactile, highly expressive presence."},{"id":"edith-head","name":"Edith Head","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Edith Head","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edith-head.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edith-head","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","drawing"],"colours":["white","bone-white","charcoal","muted-rust","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Edith Head was a renowned American costume designer who worked extensively in Hollywood, creating iconic looks for films from the 1920s to the 1980s. She won eight Academy Awards for Best Costume Design, making her one of the most celebrated figures in the field. Known for her ability to enhance a film's narrative through costume, Head's work remains influential in the world of fashion and film.","observation":"The style combines elongated fashion-illustration figures with expressive ink contours and visible watercolor or gouache brushwork. It shifts between restrained monochrome studies and saturated red, pink, green, and black garments, while consistently emphasizing dramatic silhouettes, flowing fabric, and elegant editorial poses."},{"id":"alan-moore","name":"Alan Moore","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alan Moore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-moore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-moore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Alan Moore is a renowned British writer known for his influential work in the comic book industry. He is celebrated for creating groundbreaking graphic novels such as \"Watchmen,\" \"V for Vendetta,\" and \"From Hell.\" Moore's storytelling often explores complex themes, blending elements of fantasy, horror, and social commentary.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white close-up portraits with dense etched linework, crosshatched texture, and extreme light-dark separation. Long hair and beards, exaggerated eyes, wrinkles, horns, and distorted expressions give the finely rendered figures a grim, uncanny, surreal character."},{"id":"dave-heath","name":"Dave Heath","cat":"photographers","en":"Dave Heath","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dave-heath.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dave-heath","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Dave Heath is an influential American photographer known for his poignant and introspective black-and-white portraits. Born in 1931, Heath's work often explores themes of isolation and the human condition, capturing the emotional depth of his subjects. His photography is characterized by its intimate and expressive nature, often focusing on the subtle nuances of human expression and interaction.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white portrait photography with deep shadows, bright highlights, and visible grain. Intimate close-ups and candid interior scenes are framed cinematically, with selective focus isolating expressive faces against softened, indistinct backgrounds."},{"id":"robert-arneson","name":"Robert Arneson","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Robert Arneson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-arneson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-arneson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","red","deep-red","dark-brown"],"intro":"Robert Arneson was an influential American sculptor and ceramicist known for his role in the Funk Art movement. He challenged traditional perceptions of ceramics as a craft rather than a fine art, using humor and satire to address themes of identity and the human condition. Arneson often incorporated self-portraiture and pop culture references into his work, creating pieces that were both personal and universally relatable.","observation":"The style presents expressive, highly modeled portrait busts with visibly built-up clay or paint-like surfaces, dense tool marks, and intricate treatment of hair, beards, clothing, and facial features. Restrained terracotta, cream, blue, and grey tones unify the museum-like compositions, while close cropping and pedestal displays emphasize the tactile sculptural form."},{"id":"jeffrey-t-larson","name":"Jeffrey T. Larson","cat":"painters","en":"Jeffrey T. Larson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeffrey-t-larson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeffrey-t-larson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","beige","dark-brown","pale-orange","ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"Jeffrey T. Larson is an American painter known for his realistic and detailed depictions of everyday life. He often focuses on capturing the subtleties of light and texture in his work, creating a sense of intimacy and tranquility. His paintings are celebrated for their technical precision and ability to convey the beauty of ordinary moments.","observation":"Across the sheet, representational scenes are built from visible, directional paint strokes, with richly textured foliage, fabric, hair, wood, and skin. Warm natural light, earthy shadows, and softly varied greens and creams create an intimate, nostalgic atmosphere, while children engaged in simple activities provide recurring movement and narrative."},{"id":"willard-metcalf","name":"Willard Metcalf","cat":"painters","en":"Willard Metcalf","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/willard-metcalf.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/willard-metcalf","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-olive","ochre","muted-blue","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Willard Metcalf was an American painter known for his Impressionist landscapes, particularly those depicting the New England countryside. Born in 1858, he was a prominent member of the American Impressionist movement, contributing significantly to the art scene with his serene and light-filled depictions of nature.","observation":"Across all four views, the landscapes are rendered with visible, varied brushwork, layered texture, and naturalistic observation. Saturated greens, blues, and autumn oranges combine with detailed rural settings, reflective water, broad skies, and strong atmospheric light."},{"id":"eric-dowdle","name":"Eric Dowdle","cat":"painters","en":"Eric Dowdle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-dowdle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-dowdle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","landscapes","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-blue","dark-red","blue","orange"],"intro":"Eric Dowdle is a contemporary American folk artist known for his vibrant and detailed paintings that often depict lively cityscapes and community scenes. His works are characterized by a whimsical and nostalgic style, capturing the essence of American life with a unique narrative flair.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, realistic urban landscapes with ornate historic architecture, mountain or river settings, and cinematic twilight or nighttime lighting. Saturated blue, violet, amber, and orange hues create strong contrast, while abundant windows, lamps, stars, and architectural details produce a luminous, richly layered, dreamy atmosphere."},{"id":"ezra-stoller","name":"Ezra Stoller","cat":"photographers","en":"Ezra Stoller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ezra-stoller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ezra-stoller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","white"],"intro":"Ezra Stoller was a renowned American architectural photographer known for his iconic images of modernist buildings. His work captured the essence of mid-20th-century architecture, showcasing structures by famous architects like Frank Lloyd Wright and Ludwig Mies van der Rohe. Stoller's photography played a significant role in defining the visual language of modern architecture, emphasizing clarity, form, and space.","observation":"This style presents monumental architectural interiors and plazas in stark black-and-white, with strong geometric framing and pronounced contrast between sunlit surfaces and deep shadow. Smooth, sculptural concrete curves, layered ramps, glass walls, and small silhouetted people create a cinematic sense of scale and spatial drama."},{"id":"robert-seldon-duncanson","name":"Robert Seldon Duncanson","cat":"painters","en":"Robert Seldon Duncanson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-seldon-duncanson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-seldon-duncanson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","bone-white","beige","white","ochre"],"intro":"Robert Seldon Duncanson was an African American painter known for his landscape paintings during the 19th century. He is often associated with the Hudson River School and is celebrated for his serene and romantic depictions of nature. Duncanson's work is characterized by its detailed and lush portrayal of the American wilderness, capturing the beauty and tranquility of the natural world.","observation":"These landscapes use richly layered, visibly painted surfaces with careful naturalistic detail, deep woodland shadows, and warm sunset illumination. Broad vistas, waterfalls, reflective water, monumental trees, and hazy distance create a grand, atmospheric wilderness style with strong light-dark modelling."},{"id":"woody-allen","name":"Woody Allen","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Woody Allen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/woody-allen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/woody-allen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","drawing"],"colours":["black","cream","pale-yellow","brown","rust","vivid-red"],"intro":"Woody Allen is an American filmmaker, writer, actor, and comedian known for his distinctive style and prolific output. His career spans over six decades, during which he has created numerous films characterized by their wit, humor, and exploration of philosophical themes. Allen's work often reflects his personal experiences and cultural background, making him a significant figure in both American and international cinema.","observation":"The style centers on expressive close-up portraits rendered with dense pencil- and ink-like linework, fine contours, crosshatched shadows, and lightly roughened paper texture. Most images are monochrome with cream grounds, while one variation introduces vivid, flat blocks of orange and blue without abandoning the graphic drawing treatment."},{"id":"charles-marion-russell","name":"Charles Marion Russell","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Marion Russell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-marion-russell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-marion-russell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["grey","muted-brown","beige","brown","ochre"],"intro":"Charles Marion Russell was an American artist known for his vivid depictions of the American West. Born in 1864, he created over 2,000 paintings of cowboys, Native Americans, and landscapes, capturing the spirit and drama of frontier life. His work is celebrated for its historical accuracy and dynamic compositions, making him a key figure in Western art.","observation":"Across all four renders, energetic horse-and-rider scenes are built from visible, loose broad brushstrokes and richly textured paint. Subdued earth tones, expansive landscapes, atmospheric skies, and sweeping motion give the pictures a dramatic, monumental character, while the framed presentation reinforces their traditional illustrative feel."},{"id":"eduard-gaertner","name":"Eduard Gaertner","cat":"painters","en":"Eduard Gaertner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eduard-gaertner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eduard-gaertner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","charcoal","muted-ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Eduard Gaertner was a German painter known for his detailed and realistic depictions of urban architecture and landscapes during the 19th century. His works often captured the essence of Berlin and other European settings, showcasing a blend of romanticism and realism that highlighted the architectural beauty and serene landscapes of the time.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly rendering with highly detailed classical architecture, lush gardens, grand mountain vistas, and formal portrait staging. Strong contrasts, saturated natural colors, elaborate interiors, and monumental compositions give the images an ornate, romantic, epic character."},{"id":"delphin-enjolras","name":"Delphin Enjolras","cat":"painters","en":"Delphin Enjolras","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/delphin-enjolras.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/delphin-enjolras","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","charcoal","grey","orange"],"intro":"Delphin Enjolras was a French academic painter known for his exquisite depictions of women in intimate and elegant settings, often illuminated by soft, glowing light. His work is celebrated for its romantic and detailed portrayal of the Belle Époque era, capturing the grace and beauty of Parisian life.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured brushwork models elegant women in lavish evening interiors, with fine surface detail in fabrics, hair, jewelry, wood, and glass. Warm candle and lamp light glows against deep blue-green shadows, creating a refined, theatrical, distinctly nocturnal mood."},{"id":"james-bullough","name":"James Bullough","cat":"street-artists","en":"James Bullough","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-bullough.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-bullough","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["dark-red","bone-white","red","muted-blue","charcoal","blue"],"intro":"James Bullough is a contemporary artist known for his striking murals and paintings that blend realistic portraiture with geometric abstraction. His work often explores themes of identity, movement, and the human form, creating a dynamic visual experience that challenges traditional boundaries.","observation":"Across all four renders, highly detailed figurative portraits and actions are built from visible, directional brushwork, with faces, hands, hair, and fabric rendered in energetic layered strokes. Saturated coral, peach, white, and blue tones, dramatic gestures, and fragmented overlaps create an expressive, surreal mural-like style."},{"id":"julie-mehretu","name":"Julie Mehretu","cat":"various-artists","en":"Julie Mehretu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/julie-mehretu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/julie-mehretu","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","silver","brown","grey","muted-red","rust","light-yellow","green"],"intro":"Julie Mehretu is a contemporary artist known for her large-scale abstract paintings that explore themes of urban landscapes, architecture, and social dynamics. Born in Ethiopia, Mehretu's work often incorporates a blend of cultural and historical references, creating complex and layered compositions that reflect her interest in the interconnectedness of global societies.","observation":"Across all four works, energetic abstract forms are built from broad painted passages, fine ink-like filaments, splatters, drips, and sharply contrasting accents on pale grounds. Dense central clusters and sweeping directional marks create a restless sense of motion, while vivid reds, oranges, blues, and greens punctuate the predominantly gray and white field."},{"id":"chuck-close","name":"Chuck Close","cat":"various-artists","en":"Chuck Close","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chuck-close.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chuck-close","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-red","red","muted-orange","brown","deep-blue"],"intro":"Chuck Close is a renowned American painter and photographer known for his large-scale, photorealistic portraits. His work often involves a meticulous grid method, transforming photographs into detailed paintings. Close's art is celebrated for its exploration of human identity and perception, utilizing a unique blend of realism and abstraction.","observation":"Across all four portraits, recognizable faces are built from dense, visible brush marks and tiny tessellated grid-like units, giving the surfaces a richly worked, mosaic-like texture. Strong reds, blues, flesh tones, and deep shadows create high contrast, while fine linear strokes define hair, beards, facial features, and decorative geometric clothing patterns."},{"id":"theodor-kittelsen","name":"Theodor Kittelsen","cat":"painters","en":"Theodor Kittelsen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theodor-kittelsen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theodor-kittelsen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","bone-white","grey","beige"],"intro":"Theodor Kittelsen was a Norwegian artist known for his illustrations and paintings that often depicted themes from folklore and nature. His work is characterized by its mystical and sometimes dark qualities, often portraying mythical creatures and eerie landscapes. Kittelsen's art is celebrated for its ability to capture the essence of Norwegian mythology and the natural beauty of the Scandinavian wilderness.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense conifer landscapes are treated with textured, painterly realism, subdued green-brown tones, deep shadows, and selective atmospheric light. Mist softens the forest depth while sparse fantastical figures and silhouettes create a dark, dreamlike woodland mood."},{"id":"dorothy-johnstone","name":"Dorothy Johnstone","cat":"painters","en":"Dorothy Johnstone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dorothy-johnstone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dorothy-johnstone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["light-orange","black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","red","muted-green"],"intro":"Dorothy Johnstone is a Scottish painter known for her contributions to the Edinburgh School of art. She was active in the early 20th century and is celebrated for her portraits and landscapes that often feature women and children in serene, natural settings. Her work is characterized by a delicate use of color and a keen attention to detail, capturing the quiet beauty of everyday life.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style combines highly rendered faces and garments with visible, directional brushwork and a tactile painted surface. Saturated red, teal, orange, and black backgrounds, emphatic makeup, graphic clothing patterns, and tightly cropped poses create a polished yet boldly illustrative fashion-portrait look."},{"id":"antonello-da-messina","name":"Antonello da Messina","cat":"painters","en":"Antonello da Messina","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antonello-da-messina.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antonello-da-messina","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","muted-orange","dark-brown","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Antonello da Messina was an Italian painter from the 15th century, known for his pioneering work in oil painting and his influence on the Renaissance art movement. He is celebrated for his detailed and realistic portraits, which often feature serene expressions and a mastery of light and shadow.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped devotional portraits and figures with highly realistic facial modeling, carefully rendered fabrics, hair, hands, and animal texture. Visible brushwork and craquelure give the images an aged painted surface, while restrained earth tones, deep shadows, saturated red and blue garments, and ornate sacred details create a solemn classical mood."},{"id":"abraham-rattner","name":"Abraham Rattner","cat":"painters","en":"Abraham Rattner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abraham-rattner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abraham-rattner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","still-life","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["rust","black","bone-white","grey","dark-blue","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Abraham Rattner is an American painter known for his expressive and symbolic works that often explore themes of human emotion and spirituality. His style is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a blend of abstract and figurative elements. Rattner's work is influenced by modernist movements and reflects a deep engagement with the complexities of the human psyche.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vigorously visible, broad paint strokes, thick dark contours, and angular, fractured forms. Saturated reds, blues, yellows, greens, and pinks create high-contrast compositions combining distorted figures, still-life objects, flowers, and surreal abstract shapes."},{"id":"giovanni-battista-tiepolo","name":"Giovanni Battista Tiepolo","cat":"painters","en":"Giovanni Battista Tiepolo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giovanni-battista-tiepolo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giovanni-battista-tiepolo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["grey","muted-ochre","brown","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Giovanni Battista Tiepolo was an Italian painter and printmaker known for his grand, dramatic frescoes and vibrant use of color. Born in Venice in 1696, he became one of the most important artists of the 18th century, celebrated for his ability to create dynamic compositions filled with movement and light. His works often depicted religious and mythological scenes, characterized by their theatricality and intricate detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from vigorous visible brushwork, dense layered paint, and expressive figures caught in theatrical gestures or movement. Muted blue, ochre, brown, and grey passages are punctuated by forceful red-orange accents, with dramatic cloud-filled spaces, strong light-dark contrasts, and grand elevated compositions."},{"id":"andy-gilmore","name":"Andy Gilmore","cat":"various-artists","en":"Andy Gilmore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andy-gilmore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andy-gilmore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","patterns","glow","fine-lines","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","dark-red","dark-blue","red","orange","magenta"],"intro":"Andy Gilmore is an American artist known for his intricate geometric patterns and vibrant digital compositions. His work often explores the intersection of art and music, creating visually stimulating pieces that resonate with rhythm and harmony.","observation":"The style is abstract and highly geometric, combining overlapping translucent shapes, radial symmetry, concentric curves, and repeated patterned units. Saturated coral, blue, teal, orange, and violet glow against dark grounds, while fine contour lines, granular speckling, and subtle grid textures give the clean flat forms a tactile, luminous surface."},{"id":"maurice-denis","name":"Maurice Denis","cat":"painters","en":"Maurice Denis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maurice-denis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maurice-denis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","rust","dark-brown","grey","deep-red","muted-orange"],"intro":"Maurice Denis was a French painter, decorative artist, and writer, associated with the Symbolist and Nabi movements. Born in 1870, Denis was known for his theoretical writings and his involvement in the transition from Impressionism to modern art. He emphasized the importance of spirituality and symbolism in art, influencing many artists of his time.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, hand-painted surfaces with flattened illustrative shapes, crisp contours, and densely patterned clothing, foliage, and floral decoration. Saturated rust, teal, coral, purple, and ochre hues organize crowded scenes of figures and gardens into ornamental, mural-like compositions with strong geometric framing."},{"id":"yue-minjun","name":"Yue Minjun","cat":"painters","en":"Yue Minjun","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yue-minjun.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yue-minjun","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","funny"],"colours":["blue","pink","red","muted-green","dark-red","charcoal"],"intro":"Yue Minjun is a contemporary Chinese artist known for his distinctive style characterized by smiling figures, often interpreted as a critique of modern society and politics. His works are associated with the Cynical Realism movement, which emerged in China in the 1990s.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses vividly colored, heavily modeled painted figures with visible broad strokes and exaggerated facial expressions. Close-up portrait compositions, repeated laughing characters, strong dark-light separation, and surreal color shifts create a humorous, theatrical effect."},{"id":"jasper-francis-cropsey","name":"Jasper Francis Cropsey","cat":"painters","en":"Jasper Francis Cropsey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jasper-francis-cropsey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jasper-francis-cropsey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","silver","orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Jasper Francis Cropsey was an American landscape artist associated with the Hudson River School, known for his detailed and luminous depictions of the American countryside. Born in 1823, Cropsey's work often featured vibrant autumnal scenes and expansive vistas, capturing the beauty and grandeur of nature during the 19th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive mountain-and-lake vistas are framed by large trees, with layered terrain, reflective water, and towering clouds creating a grand, dreamlike composition. Visible brush texture, fine environmental detail, warm sunset illumination, and strong light-dark separation give the landscapes a richly painted, classical sense of drama."},{"id":"kathe-kollwitz","name":"Kathe Kollwitz","cat":"printmakers","en":"Kathe Kollwitz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kathe-kollwitz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kathe-kollwitz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","cream","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Kathe Kollwitz was a German artist known for her powerful and emotive prints and drawings that often depicted the struggles and suffering of the working class. Her work is characterized by its expressive use of line and its focus on themes of war, poverty, and the human condition.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses monochrome black ink with dense fine hatching and crosshatching to build intensely modeled faces and deep shadows. The close-cropped, expressive portraits and interacting figures feel somber and dramatic, with graphic outlines and a strongly print-like illustrative treatment."},{"id":"frank-auerbach","name":"Frank Auerbach","cat":"painters","en":"Frank Auerbach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-auerbach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-auerbach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","red","dark-red","orange","light-yellow"],"intro":"Frank Auerbach is a British painter known for his thickly impastoed portraits and landscapes. Born in 1931, Auerbach's work is characterized by its intense emotional depth and dynamic use of color and form. His paintings often explore the human condition, capturing the essence of his subjects through bold, gestural brushstrokes and a vivid, contrasting color palette.","observation":"Across the four renders, the style is defined by vigorous, visibly built-up paint with broad directional strokes, rough texture, and strongly simplified yet recognizable forms. Dark green, brown, rust, and red passages dominate, punctuated by amber lights and forceful highlights; portraits and nocturnal urban scenes share the same fractured, emotionally intense handling."},{"id":"jean-arp","name":"Jean Arp","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jean Arp","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-arp.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-arp","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","sculptural","patterns","still-life","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","vivid-red","beige","dark-blue","brown","deep-blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"Jean Arp was a French-German sculptor, painter, and poet associated with Dadaism and Surrealism. Known for his abstract, organic forms, Arp's work often explored the intersection of nature and abstraction, using smooth, flowing shapes to create a sense of harmony and balance.","observation":"The style combines bold biomorphic abstraction with clean, flowing contours and vivid primary-color blocks against spacious cream or neutral grounds. It moves between flat graphic compositions and tactile sculptural objects, using smooth modeled surfaces, cutout voids, and carefully staged gallery-like presentation."},{"id":"frank-cadogan-cowper","name":"Frank Cadogan Cowper","cat":"painters","en":"Frank Cadogan Cowper","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-cadogan-cowper.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-cadogan-cowper","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["red","ochre","deep-red","dark-brown","black","light-orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"Frank Cadogan Cowper was an English painter often associated with the Pre-Raphaelite movement. Born in 1877, he was known for his richly detailed and romanticized depictions of historical and literary subjects. His work often featured elaborate costumes and settings, drawing inspiration from medieval and Renaissance themes. Cowper's paintings are characterized by their meticulous attention to detail and vibrant use of color, capturing a sense of timeless beauty and elegance.","observation":"A richly painterly portrait style built from finely rendered faces, flowing hair, elaborate veils, brocade, lace, jewelry, and dense flowers. Saturated reds and blues are set against deep shadowed grounds, while intricate surface decoration and delicate brushwork create a sumptuous, layered appearance."},{"id":"jason-decaires-taylor","name":"Jason deCaires Taylor","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jason deCaires Taylor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jason-decaires-taylor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jason-decaires-taylor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-teal","dark-cyan","cyan","dark-teal","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Jason deCaires Taylor is a British sculptor and environmentalist known for creating underwater sculptures that transform into artificial reefs. His work often explores themes of marine conservation and the relationship between art and the environment, aiming to raise awareness about the impact of human activity on the oceans.","observation":"The style presents expansive underwater environments with realistic, highly textured stone figures and coral-encrusted surfaces. Cool, subdued blue-green tones, shafts of light, suspended haze, and deep spatial vistas create a cinematic, dreamlike atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"sung-kim","name":"Sung Kim","cat":"painters","en":"Sung Kim","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sung-kim.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sung-kim","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","landscapes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","grey","muted-blue","muted-orange","silver","red"],"intro":"Sung Kim is a contemporary artist known for his vibrant and detailed landscape paintings, often featuring idyllic and romantic scenes. His works are characterized by a painterly style that combines elements of realism and impressionism, capturing the serene beauty of nature and architecture.","observation":"Across all four views, the style combines richly visible brushwork with highly detailed, sunlit coastal architecture and abundant flowering plants. Vivid blues, warm terracotta, and luminous water create expressive Mediterranean tableaux, while arches, balconies, railings, and layered façades give the scenes a decorative, dreamlike richness."},{"id":"gustav-vigeland","name":"Gustav Vigeland","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Gustav Vigeland","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustav-vigeland.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustav-vigeland","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["charcoal","black","white","grey","blue","silver"],"intro":"Gustav Vigeland was a Norwegian sculptor known for his large-scale sculptures and installations, particularly in Oslo's Vigeland Park. His work often explored themes of human relationships, emotions, and existential struggles, using materials like bronze and granite to create expressive and dynamic forms.","observation":"The style presents monumental stone figures through realistic, cinematic close-ups, emphasizing weight, weathering, carved facial features, and tactile granite surfaces. Low-angle framing, layered groupings, subdued stone tones, and occasional shallow focus make the sculptures feel imposing and dimensional against open sky."},{"id":"renato-guttuso","name":"Renato Guttuso","cat":"painters","en":"Renato Guttuso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/renato-guttuso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/renato-guttuso","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Renato Guttuso was an Italian painter known for his vivid and socially engaged works that often depicted scenes of everyday life and political themes. Born in 1911 in Bagheria, Sicily, Guttuso became a prominent figure in the Italian art scene, particularly noted for his contributions to social realism. His paintings are characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a focus on human figures, often reflecting the social and political climate of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses thick, visible paint strokes and angular, built-up planes to depict crowded human situations and close portraits. Restrained earth tones are punctuated by forceful reds, with strong light-dark contrasts, dense overlapping forms, and emphatic facial expressions creating a tense, immediate character."},{"id":"alan-davis","name":"Alan Davis","cat":"illustrators","en":"Alan Davis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-davis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-davis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","characters","bold-lines","crosshatching","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","red","orange","dark-ochre","dark-blue"],"intro":"Alan Davis is a renowned British comic book artist and writer, known for his work on titles such as \"Excalibur,\" \"Captain Britain,\" and \"The Uncanny X-Men.\" His distinctive style combines dynamic storytelling with detailed and expressive artwork, making him a prominent figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"The style uses highly saturated, sharply contrasting color blocks with heavy black contouring, crosshatched shading, and dense illustrative detail. It consistently presents dramatic close-up characters and fantastical mechanical or monstrous imagery with an assertive graphic-comic intensity."},{"id":"theo-van-rysselberghe","name":"Theo van Rysselberghe","cat":"painters","en":"Theo van Rysselberghe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theo-van-rysselberghe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theo-van-rysselberghe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","dark-blue","charcoal","brown","red"],"intro":"Theo van Rysselberghe was a Belgian neo-impressionist painter known for his pointillist technique and vibrant use of color. He was a central figure in the development of the neo-impressionist movement and played a significant role in introducing the style to Belgium. His works often depicted serene landscapes, intimate portraits, and domestic scenes, characterized by meticulous attention to detail and a harmonious color palette.","observation":"Across all four images, richly textured paint builds figures, architecture, foliage, water, and patterned fabrics with visible directional brushwork. Saturated blues, oranges, reds, and lilacs create strong contrasts, while decorative surfaces and carefully arranged domestic or coastal scenes give the style an ornate, expressive character."},{"id":"james-ensor","name":"James Ensor","cat":"painters","en":"James Ensor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-ensor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-ensor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","brown","orange","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"James Ensor was a Belgian painter and printmaker known for his vibrant and often macabre works that combined elements of symbolism and expressionism. Born in 1860 in Ostend, Belgium, Ensor's art was characterized by its bold use of color, grotesque imagery, and satirical themes. He was a prominent figure in the avant-garde movement and influenced many artists with his unique style and thematic explorations of masks, skeletons, and carnival scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from dense, expressive oil-paint marks, broad strokes, and heavily worked surfaces. Crowded portraits and character groupings combine vivid reds, creams, blacks, and ochres with grotesque faces, skulls, formal clothing, and a darkly surreal theatrical mood."},{"id":"michael-ramirez","name":"Michael Ramirez","cat":"illustrators","en":"Michael Ramirez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-ramirez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-ramirez","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","scenes","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","brown","green","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Michael Ramirez is a renowned American cartoonist known for his sharp political commentary and distinctive style. His work often features bold, satirical illustrations that critique political figures and societal issues. Ramirez has received multiple awards for his contributions to editorial cartooning, making him a significant figure in contemporary political art.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly surfaces and dense detail to create theatrical scenes of monumental figures, ruined architecture, and symbolic props. Deep shadows, selective red or green color accents, mist, and stark illumination give the imagery a grim, cinematic fantasy atmosphere with surreal political tableaux."},{"id":"clint-eastwood","name":"Clint Eastwood","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Clint Eastwood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clint-eastwood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clint-eastwood","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","silver","dark-brown","orange","vivid-red","brown"],"intro":"Clint Eastwood is an iconic American actor, director, and producer known for his roles in Westerns and action films. He gained fame with his 'Man with No Name' character in Sergio Leone 's Spaghetti Westerns and later became a successful filmmaker with critically acclaimed movies like 'Unforgiven' and 'Million Dollar Baby.' Eastwood's career spans over six decades, making him a significant figure in Hollywood.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to build highly detailed, expressive male portraits with emphatic facial planes, wrinkles, hair, and fabric. Dark, moody palettes and strong light-shadow separation dominate, while occasional saturated red grounds and close cropping give the portraits a bold graphic presence."},{"id":"theophile-steinlen","name":"Theophile Steinlen","cat":"painters","en":"Theophile Steinlen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theophile-steinlen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theophile-steinlen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","animals","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","retro","drawing"],"colours":["black","light-orange","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Theophile Steinlen was a Swiss-born French artist and printmaker, renowned for his contributions to the Art Nouveau movement. He is best known for his posters, illustrations, and paintings that often depicted scenes of Parisian life, with a particular fondness for cats and the bohemian lifestyle of Montmartre.","observation":"The style uses dense illustrative drawing with heavy black contours, crosshatched marks, and a visibly textured, aged-paper surface. Restrained ochres, browns, charcoal blacks, and vivid red accents create a moody, high-contrast poster-like look, while repeated cats and witchlike figures provide a theatrical narrative focus."},{"id":"margaret-olley","name":"Margaret Olley","cat":"painters","en":"Margaret Olley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/margaret-olley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/margaret-olley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","dark-brown","beige","red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Margaret Olley was a renowned Australian painter known for her vibrant still lifes and interior scenes. Born in 1923, she became one of Australia's most celebrated artists, capturing everyday objects with a unique blend of realism and post-impressionism. Her works often feature rich colors and detailed compositions, reflecting her deep appreciation for the beauty of domestic life.","observation":"Across all four views, richly layered flower arrangements and household objects fill intimate interiors, rendered with visible, finely varied brushwork and abundant surface detail. Saturated reds, blues, greens, and whites stand out against dark wood and shadowed backgrounds, while patterned textiles, ceramics, furniture, and window light create an ornate domestic still-life effect."},{"id":"willem-kalf","name":"Willem Kalf","cat":"painters","en":"Willem Kalf","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/willem-kalf.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/willem-kalf","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","patterns","still-life","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Willem Kalf is a renowned Dutch painter from the 17th century, celebrated for his exquisite still life paintings. His works are characterized by their intricate details, rich textures, and masterful use of light and shadow, often depicting opulent objects and scenes that reflect the prosperity of the Dutch Golden Age. Kalf's paintings are noted for their dramatic compositions and the subtle interplay of light, creating a sense of depth and realism that captivates viewers.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents richly packed still-life arrangements of antique tableware, candles, textiles, flowers, and reflective vessels in a dark, theatrical setting. Visible paint texture, elaborate surface decoration, deep shadows, warm candlelight, and restrained brown, black, cream, and metallic tones create an ornate, old-world atmosphere."},{"id":"jacob-aue-sobol","name":"Jacob Aue Sobol","cat":"photographers","en":"Jacob Aue Sobol","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacob-aue-sobol.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacob-aue-sobol","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Jacob Aue Sobol is a Danish photographer known for his distinctive black and white imagery that explores human emotion and identity. His work often captures intimate moments with a raw and expressive style, characterized by high contrast and a focus on personal narratives.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped faces overlap and dissolve into one another in stark black and white. Heavy grain, scratches, smudged tonal fields, and ink-like surface damage create an expressive, distressed, almost fragmented portrait treatment with strong dark-light separation."},{"id":"ingmar-bergman","name":"Ingmar Bergman","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Ingmar Bergman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ingmar-bergman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ingmar-bergman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","white","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Ingmar Bergman was a renowned Swedish filmmaker and theater director, celebrated for his profound and introspective exploration of human emotions and existential themes. His work often delves into the complexities of relationships, identity, and the human condition, making him one of the most influential figures in the world of cinema.","observation":"The style uses stark monochrome photography with deep blacks, pale highlights, visible grain, and selective focus to create a bleak, filmic atmosphere. Close portraits, isolated hooded figures, fragmented framing, and surreal eye imagery give the compositions a psychologically tense, dreamlike quality."},{"id":"charles-amable-lenoir","name":"Charles-Amable Lenoir","cat":"painters","en":"Charles-Amable Lenoir","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-amable-lenoir.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-amable-lenoir","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","muted-brown","black","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Charles-Amable Lenoir was a French painter known for his portraits and genre scenes, often depicting young women in serene and idyllic settings. His work is characterized by its academic style, attention to detail, and use of soft, harmonious colors. Lenoir was a student of William-Adolphe Bouguereau and was influenced by the neoclassical and romantic movements of the late 19th century.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, visible brushwork to render idealized female portraits with softly modeled skin, intricate hair, jewelry, and draped garments. Muted earthy colors, dark textured grounds, fine fabric detail, and restrained expressions create an elegant, formal, old-master-like atmosphere."},{"id":"sverre-fehn","name":"Sverre Fehn","cat":"architects","en":"Sverre Fehn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sverre-fehn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sverre-fehn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","beige","silver"],"intro":"Sverre Fehn is a renowned Norwegian architect known for his innovative and modernist approach to design. He gained international recognition for his work, which often incorporates natural elements and emphasizes simplicity and functionality. Fehn's designs are celebrated for their integration with the landscape and thoughtful use of materials, making him a pivotal figure in Scandinavian architecture.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents monumental concrete interiors with highly realistic material detail, strong geometric structure, and subdued earth-gray color. Harsh sunlight through tall openings creates dramatic contrast, long shadows, and a cinematic sense of scale, while the spaces remain sparsely furnished and sculptural."},{"id":"xu-bing","name":"Xu Bing","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Xu Bing","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/xu-bing.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/xu-bing","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","patterns","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","beige","red"],"intro":"Xu Bing is a contemporary Chinese artist known for his innovative use of language and text in art. He gained international recognition for his work that often explores themes of communication, cultural exchange, and the reinterpretation of traditional Chinese art forms. Xu Bing's art frequently incorporates elements of calligraphy, printmaking, and installation, challenging viewers to reconsider the nature of language and meaning.","observation":"The style combines densely detailed ink drawing with finely controlled linework, calligraphic marks, and richly textured paper-like surfaces. Mountain landscapes, foliage, text, and decorative seals are arranged like elaborate scrolls, using restrained earth tones with selective red accents."},{"id":"john-hejduk","name":"John Hejduk","cat":"architects","en":"John Hejduk","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-hejduk.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-hejduk","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","silver","red"],"intro":"John Hejduk was an influential American architect and educator, known for his innovative and conceptual approach to architecture. He was a key figure in the New York Five, a group of architects who were pivotal in the development of modernist architecture in the United States. Hejduk's work often explored the boundaries between architecture and art, focusing on the poetic and symbolic aspects of architectural design.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental architectural maquettes built from stacked, cantilevered, and interlocking geometric volumes. Restrained beige, cream, and wood tones, crisp illustrative edges, deep recesses, and repeated stairways give the models a carefully designed yet surreal architectural character."},{"id":"kevin-sloan","name":"Kevin Sloan","cat":"painters","en":"Kevin Sloan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kevin-sloan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kevin-sloan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","muted-cyan","dark-ochre","muted-green","light-yellow","red"],"intro":"Kevin Sloan is an American painter known for his surreal and whimsical artworks that often incorporate elements of nature and wildlife. His work is characterized by a blend of realism and fantasy, creating dreamlike scenes that invite viewers to explore the boundaries between the natural and the imagined.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly rendering with finely observed birds, flowers, foliage, porcelain, and animals arranged in fantastical garden tableaux. Muted blue-green and rose-gold palettes, soft atmospheric clouds, and elaborate botanical compositions give all four images a dreamy, antique decorative quality."},{"id":"paul-wonner","name":"Paul Wonner","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Wonner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-wonner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-wonner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-olive","dark-blue","olive","grey","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Paul Wonner is an American painter known for his contributions to the Bay Area Figurative Movement. His work often features still lifes, interiors, and landscapes, characterized by a vibrant use of color and expressive brushwork. Wonner's paintings are celebrated for their ability to capture the interplay of light and shadow, creating a sense of depth and atmosphere.","observation":"Across the renders, richly painted brushwork combines vivid saturated colors with strong sunlight and deep shadows. Dense gardens, flowers, domestic settings, and posed figures are rendered with expressive, broadly visible strokes while retaining clear illustrative structure and abundant small details."},{"id":"jacques-henri-lartigue","name":"Jacques Henri Lartigue","cat":"photographers","en":"Jacques Henri Lartigue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacques-henri-lartigue.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacques-henri-lartigue","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","motion","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["black","white","silver","beige","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Jacques Henri Lartigue was a French photographer and painter, known for his photographs of automobile races, planes, and Parisian fashion models. Born in 1894, Lartigue began taking photographs at a young age, capturing the joie de vivre of the early 20th century. His work is celebrated for its spontaneity and charm, often depicting the carefree lifestyle of the French upper class.","observation":"The style is consistent black-and-white cinematic photography with strong tonal contrast, selective focus, and expressive motion blur. Fashionably dressed figures and vintage open vehicles are framed in dynamic seaside and wooded settings, emphasizing wind, movement, silhouettes, and period-styled glamour."},{"id":"eugene-richards","name":"Eugene Richards","cat":"photographers","en":"Eugene Richards","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eugene-richards.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eugene-richards","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","white"],"intro":"Eugene Richards is an American documentary photographer known for his powerful and intimate portrayals of social issues and marginalized communities. His work often focuses on the struggles and resilience of people in challenging circumstances, capturing raw and emotional moments with a deep sense of empathy and realism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, bright highlights, and a pronounced grainy film texture. It combines intimate portraiture with observational scenes of people in worn rural settings, using close framing, selective focus, and emotionally charged, cinematic compositions."},{"id":"marcel-wanders","name":"Marcel Wanders","cat":"designers","en":"Marcel Wanders","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marcel-wanders.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marcel-wanders","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","fashion","patterns","still-life","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","brown","dark-blue","deep-red","dark-red"],"intro":"Marcel Wanders is a renowned Dutch designer known for his innovative and whimsical approach to product and interior design. He gained international recognition in the 1990s and is celebrated for his ability to blend traditional craftsmanship with contemporary aesthetics. His work often features bold patterns, intricate details, and a playful yet sophisticated style that challenges conventional design norms.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly decorated interiors combine deeply embossed floral and figurative surfaces with elaborate furniture, chandeliers, and sculptural lighting. Strong red, blue, and white treatments, repeated motifs, axial arrangements, and theatrical furnishings create a maximalist, highly ornamental visual language."},{"id":"lewis-morley","name":"Lewis Morley","cat":"photographers","en":"Lewis Morley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lewis-morley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lewis-morley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Lewis Morley is a renowned British photographer known for his iconic portraits of celebrities and cultural figures during the 1960s. His work is characterized by a distinctive style that captures the essence of the era, blending elements of fashion, art, and documentary photography. Morley's portraits are celebrated for their ability to reveal the personality and mood of his subjects, often using minimalistic settings and dramatic lighting to create a powerful visual impact.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast photographic portraiture with pronounced grain, selective focus, and cinematic framing. It combines fashion-editorial styling with candid, psychologically charged poses, using cramped interiors, staircases, windows, and architectural edges to create layered compositions."},{"id":"nick-brandt","name":"Nick Brandt","cat":"photographers","en":"Nick Brandt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nick-brandt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nick-brandt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["silver","charcoal","beige","grey","black"],"intro":"Nick Brandt is a renowned photographer known for his evocative images of African wildlife. His work often focuses on the beauty and fragility of the natural world, highlighting the threats faced by animals due to human activities. Brandt's photography is characterized by its cinematic quality, capturing the majesty and dignity of his subjects in their natural habitats.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic monochrome wildlife photography with strong tonal contrast, visible grain, and richly resolved animal and landscape textures. Monumental animals are staged in expansive African savanna settings beneath dramatic skies, giving the images a cinematic, dark, and epic sense of scale."},{"id":"steven-holl","name":"Steven Holl","cat":"architects","en":"Steven Holl","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steven-holl.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steven-holl","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","bone-white","grey","blue","rust","olive"],"intro":"Steven Holl is an American architect known for his innovative and conceptual approach to architecture. He is celebrated for his ability to blend space, light, and form, creating structures that are both functional and aesthetically pleasing. Holl's work often incorporates elements of phenomenology, focusing on the human experience of space and light.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental white concrete buildings are presented with sculptural massing, geometric voids, curved openings, and strongly framed architectural compositions. Crisp daylight, deep shadows, warm interior illumination, and occasional saturated red or blue surfaces create a cinematic, high-contrast photographic style, with people and trees providing scale."},{"id":"joshua-reynolds","name":"Joshua Reynolds","cat":"painters","en":"Joshua Reynolds","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joshua-reynolds.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joshua-reynolds","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Joshua Reynolds was an influential 18th-century English painter known for his portraits of the British aristocracy. As a founding member and the first president of the Royal Academy of Arts, Reynolds played a significant role in shaping the development of British art. His work is characterized by a blend of Rococo and Neoclassical styles, with an emphasis on grace, elegance, and idealized beauty.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly worked paint to depict expressive figures in formal historical clothing. Dark backgrounds and strong light on faces create a subdued, moody palette with pronounced contrast, while lace, hats, wigs, flowers, and layered fabrics provide ornamental detail."},{"id":"asger-jorn","name":"Asger Jorn","cat":"painters","en":"Asger Jorn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/asger-jorn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/asger-jorn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["charcoal","bone-white","dark-blue","muted-rust","vivid-red","orange"],"intro":"Asger Jorn was a Danish painter, sculptor, and founding member of the avant-garde movement CoBrA. Known for his vibrant and expressive works, Jorn's art often explored themes of existentialism and mythology, characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions. His contributions to post-war European art have left a lasting impact on the abstract expressionist and neo-expressionist movements.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style is aggressively abstract and painterly, built from broad, visible strokes, scraped and layered pigment, splatters, drips, and emphatic black linear marks. Saturated orange, red, blue, green, yellow, and white collide in high-contrast, densely layered compositions whose fragmented forms feel energetic and surreal rather than representational."},{"id":"amrita-sher-gil","name":"Amrita Sher-Gil","cat":"painters","en":"Amrita Sher-Gil","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/amrita-sher-gil.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/amrita-sher-gil","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["dark-red","black","ochre","brown","light-orange"],"intro":"Amrita Sher-Gil was an influential Indian painter, often considered a pioneer of modern Indian art. Born in 1913 in Hungary, she was known for her expressive and evocative portrayal of Indian women and rural life. Her work is celebrated for its fusion of Western and Indian artistic traditions, and she is often compared to Frida Kahlo for her bold and introspective style.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visibly hand-painted surfaces with fine, controlled brushwork, warm earthy reds, browns, creams, and deep greens. It focuses on elegantly posed women in tightly framed portrait groupings, combining carefully rendered facial features, garments, jewelry, and decorative textile backgrounds."},{"id":"wim-delvoye","name":"Wim Delvoye","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Wim Delvoye","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wim-delvoye.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wim-delvoye","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","patterns","metallic","subdued-colors","sci-fi","surreal","fantasy","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","silver","bone-white","grey","beige","black"],"intro":"Wim Delvoye is a contemporary Belgian artist known for his innovative and often provocative works that blend traditional craftsmanship with modern technology. His art often explores themes of consumerism, religion, and the human body, using a variety of mediums including sculpture, drawing, and digital art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds monumental hybrid structures and machines from extremely dense, finely articulated ornamental parts. Cool subdued metallic tones, sculptural depth, gothic architecture, radial symmetry, and elaborate baroque-like decoration unify the scenes, while fantastical mechanical forms create a surreal sci-fi atmosphere."},{"id":"james-dyson","name":"James Dyson","cat":"designers","en":"James Dyson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-dyson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-dyson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["brown","muted-blue","black","beige","dark-rust"],"intro":"James Dyson is a British inventor and industrial designer, best known for founding Dyson Ltd. and revolutionizing household appliances with his innovative vacuum cleaner designs. His work is characterized by a focus on functionality, aesthetics, and technological advancement, often incorporating cutting-edge engineering and design principles.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, presenting a recurring older man in carefully staged environments filled with complex industrial machinery. Restrained earthy colors, strong light-dark separation, selective focus, and spacious geometric compositions give the images a serious speculative-science-fiction portrait quality."},{"id":"rosa-bonheur","name":"Rosa Bonheur","cat":"painters","en":"Rosa Bonheur","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rosa-bonheur.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rosa-bonheur","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","epic"],"colours":["beige","dark-ochre","black","brown","grey","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Rosa Bonheur was a renowned 19th-century French painter known for her realistic depictions of animals and rural scenes. She gained international fame for her ability to capture the essence and vitality of animals in their natural habitats, often focusing on themes of pastoral life and wildlife.","observation":"Across all four renders, the subjects are rendered as imposing animals in expansive natural settings, with convincing anatomy, dramatic poses, and strongly modelled light and shadow. Visible, varied brushwork builds fur, grass, rocks, and clouds, while an earthy, restrained palette and sweeping compositions give the scenes an epic, energetic character."},{"id":"edward-burtynsky","name":"Edward Burtynsky","cat":"photographers","en":"Edward Burtynsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-burtynsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-burtynsky","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","dark-brown","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Edward Burtynsky is a renowned Canadian photographer known for his large-scale images of industrial landscapes. His work often explores the complex relationship between nature and industry, highlighting the environmental impact of human activities. Burtynsky's photography is characterized by its detailed and expansive views, often captured using aerial perspectives to emphasize the scale and scope of the landscapes he documents.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents expansive aerial landscapes with highly realistic geological surfaces, layered cliffs, terraced excavation, and extensive industrial scars. Muted earth tones are punctuated by mineral greens and blues, while strong directional light and deep quarry shadows create a dramatic cinematic scale."},{"id":"guillaume-seignac","name":"Guillaume Seignac","cat":"painters","en":"Guillaume Seignac","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guillaume-seignac.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guillaume-seignac","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-brown","muted-orange","bone-white","black","beige","dark-red"],"intro":"Guillaume Seignac was a French academic painter known for his classical and romantic style. Born in 1870, he studied at the Académie Julian in Paris and was influenced by the neoclassical tradition. His works often depicted mythological and allegorical subjects, characterized by their delicate detail and idealized beauty, reflecting the aesthetics of the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, softly blended oil-paint rendering with visible fine brushwork, layered fabric, foliage, flowers, and hair details. Repeated female portraits are framed by lush garden vegetation and floral decoration, with warm subdued colors and an elegant classical presentation."},{"id":"toyin-ojih-odutola","name":"Toyin Ojih Odutola","cat":"various-artists","en":"Toyin Ojih Odutola","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/toyin-ojih-odutola.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/toyin-ojih-odutola","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","characters","ethnic-poc","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","charcoal","red","bone-white","brown","deep-blue"],"intro":"Toyin Ojih Odutola is a Nigerian-American contemporary artist known for her intricate and layered portraits that explore themes of identity, race, and culture. Her work often features rich textures and detailed linework, creating a distinctive style that challenges traditional portraiture.","observation":"Across all four images, close-up Black portraits are rendered as highly graphic, illustrative compositions with near-black figures, crisp fine linework, and dense repeating textures across skin, hair, and clothing. Limited blue, pink, cream, and charcoal grounds create strong contrast, while botanical patterning and dappled highlights provide the main decorative structure."},{"id":"thom-mayne","name":"Thom Mayne","cat":"architects","en":"Thom Mayne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thom-mayne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thom-mayne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","scenes","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","sci-fi","surreal","epic","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","white","brown","silver"],"intro":"Thom Mayne is an American architect known for his innovative and unconventional designs. He is a founding partner of Morphosis, an architectural firm that has gained international acclaim for its bold and futuristic structures. Mayne's work often challenges traditional architectural norms, incorporating complex geometries and dynamic forms.","observation":"The style depicts monumental, impossible urban megastructures rendered with dense architectural detail, hard-edged geometric planes, and a strongly sculptural sense of mass and depth. Restrained concrete-gray tones are punctuated by warm interior light, while tiny figures, dramatic scale, fractured spaces, and cinematic perspectives create a surreal futuristic atmosphere."},{"id":"anton-mauve","name":"Anton Mauve","cat":"painters","en":"Anton Mauve","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anton-mauve.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anton-mauve","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","black","brown"],"intro":"Anton Mauve was a Dutch realist painter, known for his pastoral scenes and association with the Hague School. His work often depicted rural life and landscapes, characterized by a subdued color palette and a focus on natural light and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four images, broad rural settings and solitary shepherding figures are rendered with visible, softly blended brushwork and fine surface strokes. Restrained earth tones, overcast light, misty distance, and wet reflective ground create a somber, dreamlike atmosphere, while recurring paths and moving flocks provide quiet narrative motion."},{"id":"pal-szinyei-merse","name":"Pal Szinyei Merse","cat":"painters","en":"Pal Szinyei Merse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pal-szinyei-merse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pal-szinyei-merse","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","dark-brown","orange","red"],"intro":"Pal Szinyei Merse was a Hungarian painter known for his contributions to the Impressionist movement in Hungary. Born in 1845, he was a prominent figure in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, celebrated for his vibrant use of color and light. His works often depicted idyllic landscapes and scenes of leisure, capturing the essence of nature and human interaction with it.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint with layered natural scenery, figures, and architecture. Muted earth tones and deep shadows are repeatedly contrasted with warm sunset or window light, creating a somber, narrative, old-world atmosphere."},{"id":"robert-mccall","name":"Robert McCall","cat":"painters","en":"Robert McCall","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-mccall.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-mccall","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","dark-blue","beige","muted-brown"],"intro":"Robert McCall was an American artist known for his work depicting space exploration and futuristic themes. His illustrations captured the imagination of the public during the space race era, often collaborating with NASA to visualize space missions and the possibilities of human spaceflight.","observation":"The style combines richly visible painterly brushwork with dense, cinematic science-fiction worldbuilding. Vivid blues, warm orange lights, and strong light-dark contrasts give the monumental orbital architecture and expansive alien landscapes an epic scale, while tiny figures and vehicles reinforce the sense of immense environments."},{"id":"edward-wadsworth","name":"Edward Wadsworth","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Wadsworth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-wadsworth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-wadsworth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","retro","geometric"],"colours":["cream","grey","black","dark-brown","charcoal","red"],"intro":"Edward Wadsworth is a British artist known for his contributions to the Vorticist movement, a modernist art movement in the early 20th century. His work often features bold geometric forms and a fascination with machinery and architecture, reflecting the industrial age's influence on art. Wadsworth's paintings and prints are characterized by their precision, structured compositions, and a unique blend of abstraction and realism.","observation":"Across all four images, monumental urban and industrial architecture is reduced to sharply structured geometric masses, bold dark contours, and strongly contrasting blocks of red, blue, cream, and charcoal. Visible brush texture softens the otherwise graphic, poster-like construction, while dramatic perspective, arches, spires, chimneys, rails, and harbor elements create an expressive retro cityscape style."},{"id":"inge-morath","name":"Inge Morath","cat":"photographers","en":"Inge Morath","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/inge-morath.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/inge-morath","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Inge Morath was an Austrian photographer known for her work as a member of Magnum Photos. Her photography often captured the essence of human life with a focus on documentary realism and humanist themes. Morath's work is celebrated for its insightful portrayal of people and places, often revealing the underlying stories and emotions of her subjects.","observation":"The style uses realistic black-and-white photography with strong tonal separation, selective focus, and filmic framing. Carefully posed, fashion-conscious passengers in vintage clothing and elaborate hats create a dark, nostalgic visual atmosphere, while windows, reflections, and crowded seating add layered cinematic depth."},{"id":"john-reuss","name":"John Reuss","cat":"painters","en":"John Reuss","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-reuss.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-reuss","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["silver","muted-cyan","black","dark-blue","muted-red","red"],"intro":"John Reuss is a contemporary artist known for his exploration of the human condition through surreal and abstract compositions. His work often delves into themes of identity, perception, and the subconscious, creating a bridge between reality and imagination. Reuss's art is characterized by a blend of traditional techniques and modern concepts, resulting in pieces that are both thought-provoking and visually captivating.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered, painterly portraiture with translucent, sweeping overlays that obscure and repeat facial features. Cool cyan and deep charcoal fields are punctuated by intense coral-red accents, while layered brush textures, fragmented geometry, and ghosted exposures create an expressive, dreamlike surrealism."},{"id":"russ-meyer","name":"Russ Meyer","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Russ Meyer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/russ-meyer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/russ-meyer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","rust","dark-red"],"intro":"Russ Meyer was an American filmmaker known for his work in the exploitation film genre, particularly in the 1960s and 1970s. He gained fame for his bold and provocative films that often featured strong, voluptuous female characters and satirical takes on American culture. Meyer's work is characterized by its unique blend of humor, sexuality, and social commentary.","observation":"The style uses realistic, tightly framed photographic portraits with strong facial detail, dramatic contrast, and selective focus. It combines grainy monochrome and warm, subdued color treatments with candid interior staging, producing a vintage, film-still atmosphere."},{"id":"augusta-savage","name":"Augusta Savage","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Augusta Savage","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/augusta-savage.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/augusta-savage","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","cream","light-yellow","muted-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Augusta Savage was an influential African American sculptor associated with the Harlem Renaissance. Known for her realistic and expressive sculptures, she played a significant role in advocating for African American artists and their representation in the art world. Her works often depicted themes of cultural pride and identity, focusing on the African American experience.","observation":"The style presents tightly framed, realistic portrait busts as solid, carefully modelled sculptures, with convincing facial anatomy, hair texture, clothing folds, and reflective or roughened surfaces. Restrained brown, bronze, and clay tones, soft directional lighting, and museum-like backdrops unify the four renders, while varied head angles and expressions keep the portraits visually expressive."},{"id":"gari-melchers","name":"Gari Melchers","cat":"painters","en":"Gari Melchers","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gari-melchers.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gari-melchers","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","floral","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","olive","grey","beige","dark-rust"],"intro":"Gari Melchers was an American painter known for his contributions to the American Impressionist movement. Born in 1860, he gained recognition for his ability to capture everyday life with a sense of realism and warmth. Melchers's work often depicted serene domestic and rural scenes, characterized by a soft color palette and a keen attention to light and detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from visible, directional brushwork that models figures, foliage, fabric, and water with lively texture. Natural garden settings, domestic leisure, flowers, and softly observed figures recur in rich but mostly restrained greens, blues, whites, and warm red accents."},{"id":"piet-hein-eek","name":"Piet Hein Eek","cat":"designers","en":"Piet Hein Eek","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/piet-hein-eek.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/piet-hein-eek","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","glow","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["brown","beige","grey","white","ochre"],"intro":"Piet Hein Eek is a renowned Dutch designer known for his innovative approach to furniture design, particularly through the use of reclaimed materials. His work often emphasizes sustainability and craftsmanship, blending traditional techniques with modern aesthetics to create unique and functional pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents realistic, highly detailed interior scenes in a subdued, earthy palette. Weathered materials, reclaimed wood, aged paint, tall factory windows, sculptural lighting, and eclectic furnishings create a refined but worn industrial atmosphere."},{"id":"alfred-eisenstaedt","name":"Alfred Eisenstaedt","cat":"photographers","en":"Alfred Eisenstaedt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-eisenstaedt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-eisenstaedt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","urban","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","silver","white"],"intro":"Alfred Eisenstaedt was a renowned German-born American photographer and photojournalist, best known for his candid and spontaneous photographs. He was a pioneer in the field of photojournalism and worked for Life magazine, capturing some of the most iconic images of the 20th century. His work is characterized by its ability to capture human emotion and everyday life, often in black and white.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast street photography with a grainy archival feel, shallow focus, and strong cinematic framing. Repeated foreground figures and spontaneous kissing poses create kinetic public scenes against dense skyscraper-lined avenues and gathered crowds."},{"id":"phyllida-barlow","name":"Phyllida Barlow","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Phyllida Barlow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/phyllida-barlow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/phyllida-barlow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","scenes","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","epic","geometric"],"colours":["brown","silver","deep-red","beige","red"],"intro":"Phyllida Barlow is a renowned British sculptor known for her large-scale installations and use of everyday materials. Her work often explores themes of impermanence and transformation, challenging traditional notions of sculpture with its bold and expressive forms.","observation":"Across all four views, monumental red-and-white sculptural forms dominate cavernous industrial interiors, combining rough crumpled surfaces with strong architectural geometry. The images emphasize saturated color, dramatic scale, dense construction detail, and a bold, futuristic installation-like atmosphere."},{"id":"william-stanley-haseltine","name":"William Stanley Haseltine","cat":"painters","en":"William Stanley Haseltine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-stanley-haseltine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-stanley-haseltine","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","floral","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","dark-ochre","dark-cyan","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"William Stanley Haseltine was an American landscape painter associated with the Hudson River School, known for his detailed and luminous depictions of coastal landscapes. Born in 1835, he traveled extensively in Europe, capturing the scenic beauty of the Mediterranean and other regions. His work is celebrated for its clarity, precision, and atmospheric quality, often featuring serene and idyllic natural settings.","observation":"Across all four views, the style combines richly textured, painterly surfaces with elaborate architectural and botanical detail. Subdued twilight colors, warm internal lights, reflective water, and monumental ruins create a dreamy, atmospheric fantasy landscape."},{"id":"w-eugene-smith","name":"W. Eugene Smith","cat":"photographers","en":"W. Eugene Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/w-eugene-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/w-eugene-smith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","backlighting","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey"],"intro":"W. Eugene Smith was an influential American photojournalist known for his powerful and emotive photographic essays. His work often focused on social issues and the human condition, capturing the struggles and triumphs of everyday life with a deep sense of empathy and realism. Smith's images are celebrated for their technical mastery and emotional depth, making significant contributions to the field of documentary photography.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photographic imagery with strong backlighting, deep shadows, and bright shafts of window light. Intimate domestic scenes are framed cinematically around figures and children, with visible grain and selective focus reinforcing a somber, dramatic atmosphere."},{"id":"cory-arcangel","name":"Cory Arcangel","cat":"various-artists","en":"Cory Arcangel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cory-arcangel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cory-arcangel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","realistic","still-life","glow","flat-color","vivid-colors","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["brown","dark-blue","silver","vivid-red","vivid-blue","pink","deep-olive"],"intro":"Cory Arcangel is a contemporary American artist known for his work in new media art. He often explores the intersection of technology and culture, using digital tools and platforms to create innovative and thought-provoking pieces. Arcangel's work frequently addresses themes related to the internet, digital aesthetics, and the impact of technology on society.","observation":"The style presents vivid, geometric artworks in clean contemporary gallery interiors, combining smooth red-blue gradients with brightly illuminated framed displays. It mixes realistic installation photography with crisp, flat-color illustrative imagery, using strong internal glow, saturated color, and carefully controlled architectural compositions."},{"id":"narayan-shridhar-bendre","name":"Narayan Shridhar Bendre","cat":"painters","en":"Narayan Shridhar Bendre","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/narayan-shridhar-bendre.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/narayan-shridhar-bendre","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["pale-orange","grey","muted-ochre","black","dark-brown","rust","dark-olive"],"intro":"Narayan Shridhar Bendre was an influential Indian painter known for his contributions to modern Indian art. Born in 1910, Bendre's work often depicted rural Indian life and culture, blending traditional themes with modern techniques. His paintings are celebrated for their vibrant use of color and expressive portrayal of Indian society.","observation":"The style presents intimate character portraits with visible brushwork, tactile paint texture, and expressive modeling of faces and clothing. Warm, subdued colors, soft atmospheric backgrounds, and selectively sharper facial details create a quiet, slightly dreamlike portrait treatment across both painterly and more realistic renderings."},{"id":"jun-kaneko","name":"Jun Kaneko","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jun Kaneko","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jun-kaneko.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jun-kaneko","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["white","beige","brown","black","grey","deep-red"],"intro":"Jun Kaneko is a Japanese-American ceramic artist and sculptor known for his large-scale, abstract, and colorful works. His pieces often explore the interplay between form and surface, utilizing bold patterns and vibrant colors. Kaneko's work is recognized for its innovative approach to traditional ceramic techniques, blending Eastern and Western art influences.","observation":"The style presents large, solid ovoid sculptures as highly realistic objects staged in refined architectural interiors. Strong geometric striping and dotted bands wrap around the forms, using crisp, high-contrast black, white, and red patterns with polished surfaces, directional light, and carefully balanced compositions."},{"id":"ossip-zadkine","name":"Ossip Zadkine","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Ossip Zadkine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ossip-zadkine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ossip-zadkine","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","subdued-colors","classical","dark","geometric"],"colours":["beige","silver","dark-brown","light-orange","black","ochre"],"intro":"Ossip Zadkine was a Russian-born sculptor known for his abstract and cubist works, primarily in stone and wood. He was a significant figure in the early 20th-century European avant-garde art scene, contributing to the development of modernist sculpture. Zadkine's work often explored themes of human emotion and form through fragmented and geometric designs.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental seated figures are presented as solid, carved sculptures with sharply faceted planes, geometric anatomy, and substantial weight. The subdued earth-and-charcoal palette, visible stone texture, and museum-gallery settings reinforce a somber, classical sculptural character."},{"id":"donna-karan","name":"Donna Karan","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Donna Karan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/donna-karan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/donna-karan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["white","brown","bone-white","black","orange"],"intro":"Donna Karan is an influential American fashion designer known for her innovative and practical designs, particularly in women's wear. She founded her brand in 1984, emphasizing comfort and elegance, and became famous for her 'Seven Easy Pieces' collection, which revolutionized women's wardrobes by offering versatile and interchangeable clothing items.","observation":"The style combines fashion-editorial portraiture with elongated, deliberately posed figures and highly sculptural draping. Across the renders it shifts between dark photographic runway imagery and loose fashion-illustration treatments, unified by restrained tones, expressive linework, visible brush texture, and emphasis on flowing couture silhouettes."},{"id":"andre-lhote","name":"Andre Lhote","cat":"painters","en":"Andre Lhote","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andre-lhote.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andre-lhote","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","still-life","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["orange","charcoal","dark-brown","grey","dark-rust","bone-white","deep-blue"],"intro":"Andre Lhote was a French painter and sculptor known for his contributions to Cubism and his role as an influential art teacher. Born in 1885, Lhote's work often explored the boundaries between abstraction and representation, incorporating geometric shapes and vivid colors. He was a prominent figure in the early 20th-century art scene, contributing to the development of modern art through both his paintings and his teachings.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and domestic objects are built from angular, faceted shapes with strong dark contours and saturated ochre, red, blue, and teal color blocks. Broad visible brushstrokes and a built-up painted surface give the scenes tactile weight, while geometric simplification and expressive poses keep the imagery graphic rather than naturalistic."},{"id":"hendrick-goltzius","name":"Hendrick Goltzius","cat":"printmakers","en":"Hendrick Goltzius","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hendrick-goltzius.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hendrick-goltzius","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","classical","drawing","ink"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Hendrick Goltzius was a prominent Dutch printmaker, draftsman, and painter of the late 16th and early 17th centuries. Known for his exceptional skill in engraving and his detailed, expressive style, Goltzius became a leading figure of the Northern Mannerist movement. His works often featured mythological and religious themes, characterized by intricate line work and dramatic compositions.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed monochrome ink drawing, with fine contour lines and dense crosshatching to model exaggerated, grotesque male faces. Close cropping, parchment-like grounds, heavy shadows, and expressive wrinkles give the portraits an antique, anatomically observed character."},{"id":"colin-campbell-cooper","name":"Colin Campbell Cooper","cat":"painters","en":"Colin Campbell Cooper","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/colin-campbell-cooper.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/colin-campbell-cooper","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","muted-brown","muted-blue","pale-orange","orange"],"intro":"Colin Campbell Cooper was an American Impressionist painter known for his urban landscapes and architectural scenes, particularly those depicting the grandeur of cities like New York and Philadelphia. Born in 1856, Cooper's work is characterized by a keen interest in light and color, often capturing the vibrancy of city life and the elegance of structures with a painterly touch.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses visibly painted, directional brushwork to build richly layered urban scenes with expressive light and atmosphere. Historic architecture, crowds, streets, and waterways are rendered with fine marks, warm-cool tonal shifts, and softened yet readable detail."},{"id":"keith-carter","name":"Keith Carter","cat":"photographers","en":"Keith Carter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/keith-carter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/keith-carter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","characters","scenes","backlighting","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige","white"],"intro":"Keith Carter is an American photographer known for his evocative and dreamlike imagery. His work often explores themes of childhood, nature, and the mystical aspects of everyday life, capturing the essence of the American South with a unique blend of realism and surrealism.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome, high-contrast photographic imagery with strong grain, soft focus, and cinematic framing. Human figures and crows occupy ominous woodland or domestic settings, while motion blur, backlighting, and atmospheric depth create a bleak, suspenseful mood."},{"id":"swoon","name":"Swoon","cat":"printmakers","en":"Swoon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/swoon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/swoon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","urban","bold-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","collage","drawing","ink"],"colours":["light-orange","muted-ochre","brown","silver","black","rust"],"intro":"Swoon is a contemporary artist known for her large-scale installations and intricate street art, often incorporating elements of printmaking and collage. Her work frequently explores themes of community, identity, and the human experience, utilizing a blend of traditional and modern techniques to create immersive and thought-provoking pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely layered figurative imagery combines expressive human figures with botanical forms, heavy black contours, and finely worked interior hatching. The style uses subdued ochre, cream, blue, and red accents with strong tonal contrast, presenting illustration-like imagery as weathered, collage-like mural surfaces integrated into urban architecture."},{"id":"william-merritt-chase","name":"William Merritt Chase","cat":"painters","en":"William Merritt Chase","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-merritt-chase.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-merritt-chase","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","deep-red","dark-red","muted-orange"],"intro":"William Merritt Chase was an influential American painter known for his contributions to Impressionism and Realism. Born in 1849, he became a prominent figure in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, celebrated for his portraits, landscapes, and depictions of urban life. Chase's work is characterized by its vibrant color palette, dynamic compositions, and masterful brushwork, which capture the essence of his subjects with elegance and precision.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly staged seated portraits are built from visible, broad paint strokes, with textured fabrics, furniture, flowers, and ceramics filling elaborate interiors. A restrained palette of deep reds, browns, creams, and black creates a luxurious, moody atmosphere, while expressive faces and gestures keep the compositions alive."},{"id":"antonio-stradivari","name":"Antonio Stradivari","cat":"designers","en":"Antonio Stradivari","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antonio-stradivari.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antonio-stradivari","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","still-life","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","grey","deep-rust","dark-red","rust"],"intro":"Antonio Stradivari was an Italian luthier and a master craftsman of string instruments such as violins, cellos, guitars, violas, and harps. He is widely regarded as one of the greatest luthiers of all time, with his instruments being highly sought after for their superior sound quality and craftsmanship. Stradivari's work is celebrated for its precision, elegance, and the unique tonal qualities of his instruments, which remain unparalleled to this day.","observation":"The style presents finely crafted string instruments as realistic studio still lifes, with close crops, controlled compositions, and strong isolation against dark or neutral backgrounds. Rich wood grain, varnished surfaces, carved details, and fine instrument lines are rendered sharply, using restrained amber-brown tones and pronounced light-dark contrast."},{"id":"maya-lin","name":"Maya Lin","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Maya Lin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maya-lin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maya-lin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-ochre","ochre","silver","grey","dark-olive"],"intro":"Maya Lin is an American designer and artist known for her work in sculpture and land art. She gained prominence with her design of the Vietnam Veterans Memorial in Washington, D.C., which is celebrated for its minimalist and contemplative qualities. Lin's work often explores the relationship between nature and the built environment, emphasizing environmental themes and sustainability.","observation":"The style presents cinematic, dreamlike environments with monumental sculptural forms and very small human figures used to emphasize scale. Realistic lighting and subdued earth-and-white tones lend the scenes a plausible photographic presence, while unusual terrain, vast interiors, and warped architectural spaces create a surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"jusepe-de-ribera","name":"Jusepe de Ribera","cat":"painters","en":"Jusepe de Ribera","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jusepe-de-ribera.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jusepe-de-ribera","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","dark-brown","light-orange","ochre"],"intro":"Jusepe de Ribera was a Spanish painter and printmaker, active during the Baroque period. Known for his dramatic use of chiaroscuro and realistic depictions of religious and mythological subjects, Ribera's work often features intense emotional expressions and detailed anatomical studies. He spent much of his career in Italy, where he was influenced by Caravaggio and became a leading figure in the Neapolitan school.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly worked, painterly portraiture with visible fine brushwork, tactile skin and hair, and emotionally charged facial expressions and gestures. Warm flesh tones and ochres emerge from near-black grounds under severe directional light, creating strong chiaroscuro and a solemn devotional atmosphere."},{"id":"james-mcintosh-patrick","name":"James McIntosh Patrick","cat":"painters","en":"James McIntosh Patrick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-mcintosh-patrick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-mcintosh-patrick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","ochre","silver","dark-brown"],"intro":"James McIntosh Patrick is a renowned Scottish painter known for his detailed and vibrant landscape paintings. Born in 1907, he became famous for capturing the essence of the Scottish countryside with precision and a keen eye for natural beauty. His works often depict rural scenes with a focus on traditional architecture and the changing seasons, reflecting a deep appreciation for the natural world.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with fine, directional brushwork and dense natural detail. It consistently presents romantic rural and village landscapes in saturated seasonal colors, combining carefully described architecture and vegetation with atmospheric, story-like scenes."},{"id":"nelleke-pieters","name":"Nelleke Pieters","cat":"photographers","en":"Nelleke Pieters","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nelleke-pieters.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nelleke-pieters","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","muted-ochre","brown","silver","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Nelleke Pieters is a contemporary photographer known for her ethereal and dreamlike landscapes. Her work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, capturing the mysterious beauty of natural settings. Pieters's photography is characterized by its use of soft focus and muted color palettes, creating a sense of tranquility and melancholy.","observation":"Across all four images, visible brushwork and softly built surfaces create a painterly, atmospheric treatment, with fine strokes shaping clouds, trees, water, and foliage. Restrained earth tones, mist, and selective internal light produce a dreamy, somber fantasy mood, while solitary figures, remote architecture, and expansive natural settings reinforce the sense of quiet isolation."},{"id":"sohrab-hura","name":"Sohrab Hura","cat":"photographers","en":"Sohrab Hura","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sohrab-hura.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sohrab-hura","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","landscapes","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","silver","black","grey"],"intro":"Sohrab Hura is an Indian photographer known for his evocative and introspective work, often exploring themes of identity, memory, and the human condition. His photography is characterized by a documentary style that captures the essence of everyday life, particularly in rural India. Hura's work has been recognized for its emotional depth and ability to convey complex narratives through simple yet powerful imagery.","observation":"The style is a monochrome photographic treatment built around stark tonal separation, tactile textures, and dramatic natural light. It shifts between intimate close-ups, contemplative human figures, and atmospheric outdoor scenes, using selective focus, grain, and strongly composed framing to create an introspective, cinematic mood."},{"id":"frank-stella","name":"Frank Stella","cat":"printmakers","en":"Frank Stella","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-stella.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-stella","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","sculptural","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","dark-brown","ochre","red","dark-blue","green"],"intro":"Frank Stella is an American painter and printmaker known for his contributions to minimalism and post-painterly abstraction. Born in 1936, Stella's work is characterized by its geometric precision, bold use of color, and innovative exploration of space and form. His art often challenges traditional notions of painting by incorporating three-dimensional elements and complex patterns.","observation":"These works are intensely colorful abstract assemblages built from overlapping, irregular planes, painted fragments, broad gestural marks, and recurring curved and geometric forms. Their physical relief and cast shadows make the compositions read as sculptural wall constructions, while collage-like layering, dense surface detail, and surreal juxtapositions create a deliberately chaotic visual rhythm."},{"id":"frank-horvat","name":"Frank Horvat","cat":"photographers","en":"Frank Horvat","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frank-horvat.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frank-horvat","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Frank Horvat is a renowned photographer known for his innovative approach to fashion photography and photojournalism. Born in Italy in 1928, he became a pivotal figure in the world of photography, contributing significantly to the development of modern photographic techniques. His work often blends elements of realism with a keen eye for capturing the essence of his subjects, making his photographs timeless.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast cinematic photography with richly detailed portraits and carefully staged social moments. Vintage clothing, hats, smoke, reflective windows, selective focus, and visible grain create a glamorous yet dark, atmospheric sense of period drama."},{"id":"ernst-lubitsch","name":"Ernst Lubitsch","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Ernst Lubitsch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernst-lubitsch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernst-lubitsch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","retro"],"colours":["black","orange","grey","silver","red","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Ernst Lubitsch was a renowned German-American filmmaker known for his sophisticated comedies and distinctive 'Lubitsch Touch.' Born in Berlin in 1892, he became a prominent figure in both German and American cinema, directing classics such as 'Ninotchka' and 'The Shop Around the Corner.' His work is celebrated for its wit, elegance, and subtlety, influencing generations of filmmakers.","observation":"The style combines glamorous vintage portraiture with strongly expressive, visible brushwork and dramatic, theatrical posing. It shifts between richly colored painted scenes and stark black-and-white photographic treatment, while retaining bold cropping, high contrast, and a polished mid-century fashion-editorial mood."},{"id":"barbara-kasten","name":"Barbara Kasten","cat":"various-artists","en":"Barbara Kasten","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barbara-kasten.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barbara-kasten","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","patterns","still-life","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","muted-yellow","silver","dark-brown","orange","violet"],"intro":"Barbara Kasten is an American artist known for her innovative work in photography and installation art. Her work often explores the interplay of light, shadow, and architectural forms, creating abstract compositions that challenge perceptions of space and reality. Kasten's art is characterized by its use of geometric shapes, reflective surfaces, and a modernist aesthetic, drawing inspiration from the Bauhaus movement and contemporary architecture.","observation":"The style presents carefully arranged geometric forms and glasslike objects as sculptural still lifes, with crisp planes, strong perspective, and reflective or translucent surfaces. Saturated teal, orange, red, and blue hues are intensified by hard directional sunlight, deep shadows, and graphic flat-edged shapes, producing a polished surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"roberto-matta","name":"Roberto Matta","cat":"painters","en":"Roberto Matta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roberto-matta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roberto-matta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","muted-green","dark-green","silver","charcoal","ochre","vivid-red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Roberto Matta is a renowned Chilean painter and a significant figure in the Surrealist movement. Born in 1911, Matta's work is celebrated for its exploration of the subconscious and the human psyche, often blending elements of science fiction and abstract expressionism. His paintings are known for their vivid colors, dynamic compositions, and the use of biomorphic forms to create dreamlike, otherworldly landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad translucent brushwork, scraped and layered paint, drips, splatters, and delicate looping lines create a richly tactile abstract surface. Teal and blue-green grounds are energized by orange, coral, yellow, and red accents, while fragmented forms and dense central clusters suggest dreamlike motion without settling into clearly readable subjects."},{"id":"fred-stein","name":"Fred Stein","cat":"photographers","en":"Fred Stein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fred-stein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fred-stein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","backlighting","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Fred Stein is a renowned photographer known for his pioneering work in street and portrait photography. Born in Germany in 1909, Stein fled to Paris in 1933, where he began his career using a handheld Leica camera. His work is characterized by its candid and intimate portrayal of urban life, capturing the essence of mid-20th century cities like Paris and New York. Stein's photographs are celebrated for their composition, use of light, and ability to convey the mood and atmosphere of the time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome photographic realism with strong tonal separation, dramatic backlighting, and deep shadows. It combines candid urban scenes and posed portraits with filmic framing, selective focus, and a subtle grain that evokes vintage street photography."},{"id":"marianne-stokes","name":"Marianne Stokes","cat":"painters","en":"Marianne Stokes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marianne-stokes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marianne-stokes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["muted-ochre","dark-brown","rust","dark-green","black","muted-blue"],"intro":"Marianne Stokes was an Austrian-born painter known for her work in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. She was associated with the Pre-Raphaelite and Symbolist movements, often depicting serene and mystical scenes with a focus on feminine beauty and nature. Her paintings are characterized by detailed and delicate brushwork, rich color palettes, and a sense of intimacy and contemplation.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint with finely rendered faces, fabric, foliage, and animal forms. Close-cropped portrait compositions combine subdued earthy colors, dark teal grounds, ornate botanical or textile details, and a quiet mythic atmosphere."},{"id":"martin-creed","name":"Martin Creed","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Martin Creed","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-creed.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-creed","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-orange","silver","red","dark-olive","light-yellow","dark-blue"],"intro":"Martin Creed is a British artist known for his innovative and often minimalist approach to art. He gained prominence as part of the Young British Artists movement in the 1990s and is celebrated for his conceptual works that challenge traditional notions of art. Creed's work spans various mediums, including sculpture, painting, and performance, often characterized by a playful and thought-provoking nature.","observation":"The style presents vivid, cleanly separated bands of saturated color within realistic contemporary gallery interiors. Strong perspective, repeated geometric stripes, spacious white architecture, and crisp flat surfaces create a bold, polished installation-like look across the four renders."},{"id":"mike-kelley","name":"Mike Kelley","cat":"various-artists","en":"Mike Kelley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mike-kelley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mike-kelley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","beige","red","dark-blue","deep-red","ochre","magenta"],"intro":"Mike Kelley was an influential American artist known for his diverse and provocative works that often explored themes of memory, trauma, and popular culture. His practice spanned various mediums, including performance, installation, and sculpture, making him a significant figure in contemporary art.","observation":"The style presents brightly colored, shaggy creature sculptures in realistic gallery settings, with dense fur texture and substantial three-dimensional forms. Repeated groupings of whimsical monsters, oversized eyes, and playful poses create an expressive, bold, densely populated visual language."},{"id":"ernst-fuchs","name":"Ernst Fuchs","cat":"painters","en":"Ernst Fuchs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernst-fuchs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernst-fuchs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-red","red","muted-blue","ochre"],"intro":"Ernst Fuchs was an Austrian painter, draftsman, printmaker, sculptor, architect, stage designer, poet, and singer. He was one of the founders of the Vienna School of Fantastic Realism , known for its intricate and surreal compositions that blend mythological, religious, and fantastical themes. His works often explore the mystical and the esoteric, characterized by vivid colors and detailed imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured paint builds expressive faces, garments, and symbolic forms from dense, fine directional strokes. Saturated blue, red, and gold dominate against deep dark grounds, with dramatic close framing, surreal facial motifs, and layered narrative imagery creating an intense, dreamlike style."},{"id":"ernst-wilhelm-nay","name":"Ernst Wilhelm Nay","cat":"painters","en":"Ernst Wilhelm Nay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernst-wilhelm-nay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernst-wilhelm-nay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","black","red","dark-blue","grey","light-yellow","green"],"intro":"Ernst Wilhelm Nay is a renowned German painter known for his abstract and expressive works. Born in 1902, Nay became a significant figure in the post-war art scene, contributing to the development of abstract expressionism in Europe. His works are characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a focus on form and color interaction, reflecting the vibrant and transformative art movements of the 20th century.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines vivid, high-energy color fields with visibly painted, broad gestural strokes and heavy black drawn lines. Abstract organic shapes, circles, splatters, and overlapping color blocks create a dense, expressive surface that remains deliberately non-representational and slightly surreal."},{"id":"charles-reiffel","name":"Charles Reiffel","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Reiffel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-reiffel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-reiffel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-blue","charcoal","brown","beige","blue","red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Charles Reiffel was an American painter known for his vibrant landscapes and urban scenes, often capturing the dynamic interplay of light and color. Born in 1862, Reiffel's work is associated with the American Impressionist movement, and he is celebrated for his ability to convey the essence of a scene through expressive brushwork and vivid color palettes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vigorous, clearly visible brushwork and broad strokes to build richly textured landscapes and waterfront scenes. Saturated blues, greens, oranges, and pinks heighten expressive skies, reflections, architecture, and atmospheric light, while cinematic compositions present active human and industrial settings with strong visual movement."},{"id":"oskar-schlemmer","name":"Oskar Schlemmer","cat":"various-artists","en":"Oskar Schlemmer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oskar-schlemmer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oskar-schlemmer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","black","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Oskar Schlemmer was a German painter, sculptor, designer, and choreographer associated with the Bauhaus school. Known for his innovative approach to art and design, Schlemmer explored the relationship between the human body and space, often incorporating geometric forms and abstraction into his work. His contributions to stage design and choreography, particularly the \"Triadic Ballet,\" reflect his interest in the synthesis of art and technology.","observation":"The style presents staged, surreal tableaux with masked or abstracted figures, geometric props, and carefully arranged negative space. It uses a largely monochrome sepia treatment, sculptural modelling, dramatic contrast, textured surfaces, and a grainy photographic finish that gives the scenes a theatrical, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"anna-ancher","name":"Anna Ancher","cat":"painters","en":"Anna Ancher","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anna-ancher.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anna-ancher","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","grey","muted-ochre","pale-orange","rust"],"intro":"Anna Ancher was a Danish painter known for her role in the Skagen Painters, a group of Scandinavian artists who gathered in the late 19th century in the village of Skagen, Denmark. She is celebrated for her ability to capture light and atmosphere, often depicting scenes of everyday life, interiors, and landscapes with a focus on natural light and color.","observation":"Across all four interiors, the style uses visible, broad oil-paint strokes to model realistic figures, furniture, and household objects. Restrained earthy colors are punctuated by strong daylight and deep shadows, while densely observed domestic details and expressive, informal poses create intimate narrative scenes."},{"id":"zapiro","name":"Zapiro","cat":"illustrators","en":"Zapiro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zapiro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zapiro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","silver","grey","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Zapiro is a renowned South African cartoonist known for his sharp political satire and distinctive style. His work often features bold caricatures and addresses contemporary social and political issues with humor and wit. Zapiro's cartoons have been published in various newspapers and magazines, making him a prominent figure in the world of editorial cartooning.","observation":"The style uses monochrome ink drawing with heavy contour lines, dense crosshatching, and strongly contrasted black-and-white areas. Exaggerated caricatural characters act out crowded, satirical scenes, with expressive gestures, grotesque faces, and richly observed clothing and props."},{"id":"meret-oppenheim","name":"Meret Oppenheim","cat":"photographers","en":"Meret Oppenheim","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/meret-oppenheim.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/meret-oppenheim","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","still-life","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["beige","grey","silver","brown"],"intro":"Meret Oppenheim was a Swiss artist and photographer known for her involvement in the Surrealist movement. She gained fame for her unconventional and thought-provoking works, often blending everyday objects with fantastical elements. One of her most famous pieces is \"Object,\" a fur-covered teacup, which exemplifies her ability to challenge perceptions and explore the boundaries between reality and imagination.","observation":"The style presents surreal still-life objects with highly realistic materials, especially individually readable fur contrasted against porcelain and reflective metal. Soft studio lighting, subdued earthy colors, shallow focus, and clean product-like arrangements give the bizarre forms a polished photographic appearance."},{"id":"dora-maar","name":"Dora Maar","cat":"photographers","en":"Dora Maar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dora-maar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dora-maar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","dark"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Dora Maar was a prominent French photographer, painter, and poet, known for her involvement in the Surrealist movement and her relationship with Pablo Picasso. Her work often explored themes of identity, emotion, and the subconscious, using innovative techniques such as photomontage and collage to create striking and thought-provoking images.","observation":"Across all four images, tightly cropped faces are rendered in stark black and white, with deep shadows, bright highlights, and visible photographic grain. Torn surfaces, fractured reflections, glass-like overlays, and abrupt image fragments create a surreal collage effect around the portraits."},{"id":"vivienne-westwood","name":"Vivienne Westwood","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Vivienne Westwood","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vivienne-westwood.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vivienne-westwood","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","scenes","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","grey","black","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Vivienne Westwood is a renowned British fashion designer known for her pioneering role in bringing modern punk and new wave fashions into the mainstream. Her designs often incorporate historical references, bold patterns, and a rebellious spirit, making her a significant figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic fashion imagery centered on expressive models wearing oversized, deconstructed garments assembled from crumpled, layered, plaid, and paint-marked textiles. Strong studio or runway lighting, saturated fabric accents, dramatic gestures, and flowing cloth create a theatrical sense of motion while preserving extensive tactile garment detail."},{"id":"chris-moore","name":"Chris Moore","cat":"illustrators","en":"Chris Moore","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-moore.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-moore","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["brown","muted-pink","red","muted-blue","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Chris Moore is a renowned British illustrator known for his work in science fiction and fantasy art. His illustrations have graced the covers of numerous books, capturing the imagination with their vivid depictions of otherworldly landscapes and futuristic settings. Moore's work is characterized by its intricate detail, dynamic compositions, and a masterful use of color that brings fantastical worlds to life.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with highly detailed, cinematic speculative landscapes, using saturated orange, coral, violet, and blue contrasts. Monumental geology, enormous celestial bodies, eruptions, and tiny figures create an epic sense of scale, while internal fire and sunset light produce strong atmospheric glow."},{"id":"achille-castiglioni","name":"Achille Castiglioni","cat":"designers","en":"Achille Castiglioni","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/achille-castiglioni.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/achille-castiglioni","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","glow","subdued-colors","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","beige","brown","black","dark-red"],"intro":"Achille Castiglioni was an influential Italian designer known for his innovative and functional approach to industrial design. His work, characterized by a playful yet sophisticated style, has left a significant mark on modern design. Castiglioni's designs often incorporate everyday objects and materials, transforming them into functional art pieces with a distinctive aesthetic.","observation":"The style presents lamps as carefully staged, realistic product still lifes, emphasizing clean geometric silhouettes, sculptural materials, and generous negative space. Neutral interiors and controlled illumination are punctuated by saturated red and green fixtures, with visible reflections and emitted light reinforcing the polished studio-rendered finish."},{"id":"lubaina-himid","name":"Lubaina Himid","cat":"various-artists","en":"Lubaina Himid","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lubaina-himid.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lubaina-himid","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","red","bone-white","muted-blue","light-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Lubaina Himid is a British artist and curator known for her work in the Black British art movement. She explores themes of cultural identity, history, and representation, often incorporating elements of storytelling and vibrant color in her pieces. Himid's work frequently addresses social and political issues, reflecting her commitment to highlighting marginalized voices and narratives.","observation":"Across the sheet, fashion-focused portraits and groups are rendered with visible brush texture, angular simplified anatomy, and fine drawn contours. Saturated blocks of red, blue, green, pink, and black contrast with patterned garments and relatively flat geometric backgrounds, giving the paintings a graphic yet expressive presence."},{"id":"irma-stern","name":"Irma Stern","cat":"painters","en":"Irma Stern","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/irma-stern.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/irma-stern","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-ochre","red","dark-brown","light-orange","green"],"intro":"Irma Stern was a prominent South African artist known for her vibrant and expressive paintings that often depicted African subjects and themes. Born in 1894, Stern's work was influenced by her travels and exposure to various cultures, particularly in Africa and Europe. Her style is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a deep emotional resonance, making her one of the leading figures in modern South African art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly built-up, directional oil-paint strokes with emphatic dark contour marks and richly saturated reds, blues, greens, and pinks. Fashionable seated women, floral arrangements, patterned garments, and interior objects are densely layered into expressive portrait-like tableaux with decorative surfaces and abundant visual detail."},{"id":"james-guthrie","name":"James Guthrie","cat":"painters","en":"James Guthrie","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-guthrie.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-guthrie","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"James Guthrie was a Scottish painter, born in 1859, known for his association with the Glasgow Boys, a group of artists who contributed to the development of modern art in Scotland. His work is characterized by a naturalistic approach and often depicts rural and domestic scenes, capturing the essence of late 19th and early 20th-century life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the imagery is built from visible, directional paint strokes with softly broken edges and layered, tactile surface texture. Restrained taupes, creams, blacks, and muted greens create an elegant but somber atmosphere, while posed women, elaborate dresses, hats, flowers, and architectural details form refined fashion and garden tableaux."},{"id":"wangechi-mutu","name":"Wangechi Mutu","cat":"painters","en":"Wangechi Mutu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wangechi-mutu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wangechi-mutu","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["white","bone-white","muted-ochre","black","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Wangechi Mutu is a Kenyan-born artist known for her work in painting, sculpture, and mixed media. Her art often explores themes of identity, gender, and postcolonial narratives, blending elements of fantasy and reality to create thought-provoking pieces. Mutu's work is celebrated for its intricate detail and symbolic depth, often incorporating elements from nature and African culture.","observation":"The style combines finely rendered profile portraits with dense botanical and organic assemblages, leaving broad cream-colored negative space around the forms. Delicate threadlike lines, translucent washes, dark silhouetted areas, and richly layered floral textures create an expressive, surreal mixed-media appearance with restrained earthy colors and sharp coral accents."},{"id":"nicolaes-maes","name":"Nicolaes Maes","cat":"painters","en":"Nicolaes Maes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicolaes-maes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicolaes-maes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","scenes","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-brown","dark-rust","bone-white"],"intro":"Nicolaes Maes was a Dutch painter known for his genre scenes and portraits during the Dutch Golden Age. A student of Rembrandt , Maes's work is characterized by its detailed realism and intimate depictions of domestic life. His paintings often feature warm tones and a mastery of light and shadow, capturing the essence of 17th-century Dutch society.","observation":"Across the sheet, richly textured paint models figures, fabrics, flowers, animals, and objects with visible stroke work and abundant small detail. Dark grounds and strong chiaroscuro isolate warm highlights, while elaborate arrangements, expressive gestures, and sumptuous period costumes create a theatrical, densely ornamental appearance."},{"id":"levi-strauss","name":"Levi Strauss","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Levi Strauss","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/levi-strauss.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/levi-strauss","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","fashion","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["dark-blue","grey","black","white","light-yellow","beige","rust"],"intro":"Levi Strauss was a German-American businessman who founded the first company to manufacture blue jeans. Born in 1829, Strauss moved to San Francisco during the California Gold Rush and established Levi Strauss & Co., which became synonymous with durable denim workwear.","observation":"The style presents distressed denim and textile constructions with highly realistic, tactile surface detail, emphasizing frayed threads, seams, patches, and worn fibers. Cool blue tones, strong tonal separation, and clean presentation make the garments read as carefully arranged fashion still lifes, with one variation extending the textile treatment into a bearded figure."},{"id":"jacopo-bassano","name":"Jacopo Bassano","cat":"painters","en":"Jacopo Bassano","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacopo-bassano.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacopo-bassano","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Jacopo Bassano was an Italian Renaissance painter known for his religious and genre scenes, characterized by dynamic compositions and rich color palettes. Born in the town of Bassano del Grappa, he was a prominent figure in the Venetian school and was renowned for his ability to blend naturalism with expressive detail.","observation":"The style is a densely packed, painterly tableau built from visible broad strokes, textured surfaces, and strongly modeled figures. Dark earthy tones and deep shadows heighten the expressive gestures, vivid red drapery, crowded religious drama, and intermingling of people and animals."},{"id":"pipilotti-rist","name":"Pipilotti Rist","cat":"various-artists","en":"Pipilotti Rist","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pipilotti-rist.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pipilotti-rist","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","scenes","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["dark-red","deep-red","red","black","dark-blue","blue"],"intro":"Pipilotti Rist is a Swiss visual artist known for her innovative video installations and multimedia works that explore themes of femininity, nature, and the human body. Her work often incorporates vibrant colors and immersive environments, inviting viewers to engage with her art on a sensory level.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents immersive interior scenes filled with oversized flowers, projected imagery, reflective surfaces, and people moving or resting within the installation. Saturated red, pink, and blue lighting, strong contrast, and luminous projections create a cinematic, dreamlike atmosphere, while the repeated architectural panels and reflections add geometric structure."},{"id":"edward-ruscha","name":"Edward Ruscha","cat":"various-artists","en":"Edward Ruscha","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-ruscha.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-ruscha","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","urban","motion","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","vivid-red","brown","dark-cyan","muted-cyan","rust"],"intro":"Edward Ruscha is an influential American artist known for his work in painting, drawing, photography, and printmaking. His art often explores themes of American culture, language, and the urban landscape, with a distinctive style that blends elements of pop art and conceptual art. Ruscha's work is characterized by its focus on everyday objects and scenes, often incorporating text and typography in innovative ways.","observation":"The style combines stark graphic geometry and expansive negative space with saturated red, blue, and orange palettes, often presented as framed print-like compositions. Photographic-looking architectural and landscape scenes are treated with cinematic motion blur, grain, strong tonal contrast, and restrained retro screenprint qualities, while occasional paint-like marks and bold abstract forms reinforce the printed-art aesthetic."},{"id":"james-stirling","name":"James Stirling","cat":"architects","en":"James Stirling","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-stirling.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-stirling","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","scenes","urban","fine-lines","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","silver","grey","charcoal","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"James Stirling was a renowned British architect known for his bold and innovative designs that often challenged conventional architectural norms. His work is characterized by a unique blend of modernism and postmodernism, with a focus on geometric forms and dynamic spatial arrangements.","observation":"The style presents dense urban architecture through crisp, fine ruled lines, simplified geometric masses, and selectively flat blocks of saturated red, green, blue, and cream. It combines an illustrated architectural-rendering look with lightly grainy paper-like texture, emphasizing dramatic curves, glass, tiled surfaces, stairways, and layered public spaces across the views."},{"id":"walker-evans","name":"Walker Evans","cat":"photographers","en":"Walker Evans","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walker-evans.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walker-evans","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Walker Evans is a renowned American photographer best known for his work documenting the Great Depression. His images, particularly those taken for the Farm Security Administration, captured the stark realities of American life during the 1930s. Evans's work is characterized by its straightforward, unembellished style, focusing on everyday subjects and scenes with a keen eye for detail and composition.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photographic realism, with hard sunlight, deep shadows, and richly textured weathered settings. Its observational portraits and group scenes feel candid and documentary, framed through porches, windows, and storefronts with strong architectural structure."},{"id":"hendrick-ter-brugghen","name":"Hendrick ter Brugghen","cat":"painters","en":"Hendrick ter Brugghen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hendrick-ter-brugghen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hendrick-ter-brugghen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","deep-red","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Hendrick ter Brugghen was a Dutch painter known for his work during the early 17th century as part of the Utrecht Caravaggisti movement. Influenced by Caravaggio , he was renowned for his dramatic use of light and shadow, as well as his expressive portrayal of human figures. His paintings often depicted religious and genre scenes, characterized by a strong sense of realism and emotional depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly modelled painterly figures with visible fine brushwork, warm earthy colors, and strong chiaroscuro against deep dark grounds. Portrait-like faces, expressive gestures, elaborate drapery, and crowded theatrical groupings create a classical, emotionally charged atmosphere."},{"id":"harald-sohlberg","name":"Harald Sohlberg","cat":"painters","en":"Harald Sohlberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harald-sohlberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harald-sohlberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","charcoal","grey","dark-cyan","orange"],"intro":"Harald Sohlberg was a Norwegian painter known for his evocative landscapes that often depicted the mystical and serene aspects of the Norwegian countryside. His work is characterized by a deep connection to nature and a unique ability to capture the ethereal quality of the Nordic light. Sohlberg's paintings often explore themes of solitude and introspection, making him a significant figure in the Symbolist movement.","observation":"The style presents expansive wilderness landscapes with towering trees, reflective lakes, distant mountains, and occasional tiny human or architectural elements. Deep blue-green shadows, subdued twilight color, warm points of window light, visible atmospheric texture, and misty distance create a dark, contemplative, dreamlike grandeur."},{"id":"christophe-staelens","name":"Christophe Staelens","cat":"photographers","en":"Christophe Staelens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christophe-staelens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christophe-staelens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","mist","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","dark","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Christophe Staelens is a contemporary photographer known for his evocative and atmospheric imagery. His work often explores themes of solitude and introspection, capturing moments that are both haunting and beautiful.","observation":"Across all four images, stark black-and-white landscapes place tiny solitary figures in vast, ominous spaces, with strong vanishing points and monumental skies or trees. Dense clouds, fog, and shafts of backlight create a high-contrast, surreal atmosphere that feels bleak, dramatic, and dreamlike."},{"id":"johnson-tsang","name":"Johnson Tsang","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Johnson Tsang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/johnson-tsang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/johnson-tsang","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["grey","bone-white","brown","beige","black"],"intro":"Johnson Tsang is a renowned sculptor from Hong Kong, celebrated for his innovative and surreal ceramic sculptures. His work often explores the boundaries between reality and imagination, blending human forms with fantastical elements. Tsang's pieces are known for their intricate details and expressive qualities, making him a prominent figure in contemporary art.","observation":"The style presents surreal, highly modeled ceramic or plaster-like faces and vessels in restrained ivory and pastel tones. Realistic facial anatomy is combined with unsettling transformations, clustered heads, fractured surfaces, and floral ornament, all shown with softly controlled gallery lighting and tactile dimensional detail."},{"id":"theodore-chasseriau","name":"Theodore Chasseriau","cat":"painters","en":"Theodore Chasseriau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theodore-chasseriau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theodore-chasseriau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","deep-red","dark-cyan"],"intro":"Theodore Chasseriau was a French Romantic painter known for his portraits, historical, and religious subjects. Born in 1819, he was a student of Ingres and later influenced by Delacroix. Chasseriau's work is characterized by a blend of neoclassical precision and romantic expressiveness, often exploring themes of beauty, exoticism, and emotion.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped female portraits with softly modelled faces, visible directional brushwork, and richly textured fabrics and jewelry. Deep shadowed backgrounds, warm reds and browns, and selective highlights create a dramatic, solemn atmosphere, while ornamental costume details add visual richness."},{"id":"bob-clampett","name":"Bob Clampett","cat":"illustrators","en":"Bob Clampett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bob-clampett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bob-clampett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","motion","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink","funny"],"colours":["pale-orange","bone-white","black","dark-blue","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Bob Clampett is a renowned American animator, director, and producer, best known for his work on the Looney Tunes and Merrie Melodies series for Warner Bros. He was a key figure in the Golden Age of Animation , contributing to the development of iconic characters such as Bugs Bunny and Daffy Duck. Clampett's work is characterized by its energetic and surreal humor, pushing the boundaries of traditional animation with innovative techniques and storytelling.","observation":"The style combines expressive cartoon characters with exaggerated anatomy, elastic poses, and humorous facial expressions. Strong black ink contours, flat saturated color blocks, and occasional loose construction strokes create a lively animation-sketchbook appearance across both polished and rougher drawings."},{"id":"mikhail-larionov","name":"Mikhail Larionov","cat":"painters","en":"Mikhail Larionov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mikhail-larionov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mikhail-larionov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","charcoal","beige","orange","red","dark-red"],"intro":"Mikhail Larionov is a renowned Russian painter and one of the founding figures of the Russian avant-garde movement. Known for his innovative approaches, Larionov played a pivotal role in the development of Neo-Primitivism and Rayonism, exploring themes that combined traditional Russian folk art with modernist techniques. His work often features bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a playful yet sophisticated use of form and space.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense painted surfaces combine broad, directional brushstrokes with heavy dark marks, angular geometry, and saturated reds, oranges, blues, and flesh tones. Figures, faces, architecture, and objects overlap in crowded, fragmented scenes, creating an energetic and surreal visual field rather than a literal depiction."},{"id":"sanyu","name":"Sanyu","cat":"painters","en":"Sanyu","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sanyu.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sanyu","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["illustrative","characters","floral","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["red","vivid-red","black","beige","deep-red","ochre"],"intro":"Sanyu was a Chinese-French painter known for his unique blend of Eastern and Western art styles. Born in 1901 in Sichuan, China, he moved to Paris in the 1920s, where he became part of the vibrant art scene. Sanyu's work is characterized by its simplicity, elegance, and a distinct use of line and color, often focusing on still lifes and nudes. His art reflects a synthesis of traditional Chinese aesthetics with modernist influences, making him a significant figure in the cross-cultural art movement of the early 20th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, simplified figures, plants, flowers, and a tree are painted with rough visible brush texture, strong black contours, and selectively flat color fields. Saturated coral-red grounds, dark silhouettes, elongated anatomy, and unusual scale relationships create an expressive, graphic, slightly surreal style."},{"id":"ernest-lawson","name":"Ernest Lawson","cat":"painters","en":"Ernest Lawson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernest-lawson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernest-lawson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-olive","beige","bone-white","dark-green","dark-brown","white","red"],"intro":"Ernest Lawson was an American painter known for his contributions to American Impressionism. Born in 1873, Lawson was part of the \"The Eight,\" a group of artists who challenged the academic standards of the time. His work often depicted landscapes and urban scenes, characterized by a unique blend of realism and impressionistic techniques. Lawson's paintings are noted for their vibrant colors and expressive brushwork, capturing the essence of the American landscape.","observation":"Across all four views, the style is built from visible, directional paint strokes and layered, textured color, giving the landscapes a richly hand-painted surface. Muted greens, ochres, creams, and autumn reds shape pastoral villages, hills, gardens, and waterways with expressive detail and a traditional framed-painting presentation."},{"id":"tina-modotti","name":"Tina Modotti","cat":"photographers","en":"Tina Modotti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tina-modotti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tina-modotti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","geometric","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["grey","black","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Tina Modotti was an Italian photographer, model, actress, and revolutionary political activist. She is known for her work in Mexico during the 1920s and 1930s, where she became a prominent figure in the artistic and political scenes. Her photography is celebrated for its social and political themes, capturing the essence of Mexican culture and the human condition with a modernist approach.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark monochrome photography combines hard sunlight, deep shadows, and strongly cropped forms with expansive empty grounds. Human figures are repeatedly reduced to silhouettes or tiny scale contrasts against faces, hands, shadows, and monumental geometric architecture, while coarse grain reinforces the stark, surreal cinematic mood."},{"id":"pieter-jansz-van-asch","name":"Pieter-Jansz van Asch","cat":"painters","en":"Pieter-Jansz van Asch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pieter-jansz-van-asch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pieter-jansz-van-asch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["silver","white","black","beige","dark-brown","brown","rust"],"intro":"Pieter-Jansz van Asch was a Dutch Golden Age painter known for his landscapes and genre scenes. He was active in the 17th century and contributed to the rich tradition of Dutch realism, focusing on detailed and naturalistic depictions of everyday life and nature.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, realistic oil-paint rendering with visible fine brushwork, carefully modelled forms, and subdued earth-toned color. Broad atmospheric skies, reflective waterways, pastoral landscapes, maritime scenes, and richly arranged still lifes share a classical, softly dramatic mood with warm light and deep shadows."},{"id":"albert-goodwin","name":"Albert Goodwin","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Goodwin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-goodwin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-goodwin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","orange","silver","rust"],"intro":"Albert Goodwin was a British landscape painter known for his ethereal and romantic depictions of natural scenes. Born in 1845, he was influenced by the Pre-Raphaelites and J.M.W. Turner , and his work often features dramatic skies and luminous light effects. Goodwin's paintings are characterized by their detailed brushwork and atmospheric depth, capturing the beauty and tranquility of the English countryside.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint to depict atmospheric countryside scenes at dusk or dawn. Broad marks, layered clouds, dark silhouetted vegetation, and intense low sunlight create expressive, moody landscapes with strong luminous focal points and detailed natural surroundings."},{"id":"zhang-xiaogang","name":"Zhang Xiaogang","cat":"painters","en":"Zhang Xiaogang","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zhang-xiaogang.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zhang-xiaogang","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["black","blue","muted-blue","charcoal","red","bone-white"],"intro":"Zhang Xiaogang is a contemporary Chinese painter known for his surreal and introspective portraits. His work often explores themes of identity, memory, and family, reflecting the cultural and societal changes in China, particularly during the post-Mao era. Zhang's paintings are characterized by their muted color palettes and expressive, yet restrained, emotional depth.","observation":"The style presents highly controlled, front-facing character portraits with near-axial symmetry, simplified facial forms, severe expressions, and formal clothing. Restrained blue, red, black, and flesh tones are combined with dramatic split lighting, softly blended modelling, crisp graphic contours, and a subtly textured surface."},{"id":"alan-bean","name":"Alan Bean","cat":"painters","en":"Alan Bean","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alan-bean.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alan-bean","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","grey","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Alan Bean is a former NASA astronaut and the fourth person to walk on the moon. After retiring from space exploration, he became an artist, focusing on painting scenes from his experiences in space. His work often captures the awe and wonder of space travel, blending realism with imaginative elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible, broad painterly strokes with dense surface detail in rocks, snow, spacesuits, and planetary terrain. Dramatic cinematic compositions place astronauts in expansive extraterrestrial landscapes, using saturated earth-and-ice colors, deep space shadows, and strong highlights for an epic science-fiction adventure mood."},{"id":"hannah-hoch","name":"Hannah Hoch","cat":"various-artists","en":"Hannah Hoch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hannah-hoch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hannah-hoch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["animals","characters","patterns","portraits","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["black","rust","orange","dark-brown","red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Hannah Hoch was a pioneering German Dada artist known for her innovative photomontages and collages. Born in 1889, she became a prominent figure in the Dada movement , challenging traditional art forms and exploring themes of gender and identity. Her work often combined disparate elements to create surreal and thought-provoking compositions.","observation":"A dense cut-and-paste montage combines cropped photographic faces, eyes, lips, and an animal with sharply torn geometric paper fragments. Strong red, black, blue, and ochre blocks, heavy contrast, visible print grain, and irregular overlaps create a vivid, surreal graphic surface."},{"id":"joachim-beuckelaer","name":"Joachim Beuckelaer","cat":"painters","en":"Joachim Beuckelaer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joachim-beuckelaer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joachim-beuckelaer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","ochre","dark-brown","beige","red"],"intro":"Joachim Beuckelaer was a Flemish painter known for his detailed and vibrant market and kitchen scenes, often filled with an abundance of food and domestic activity. Active during the 16th century, Beuckelaer's work is characterized by its rich textures, intricate details, and vivid portrayal of everyday life, reflecting the prosperity and cultural richness of the Flemish region during the Renaissance period.","observation":"The style is a densely layered, highly detailed painted tableau, combining naturalistic figures and animals with overflowing arrangements of fish, shellfish, fruit, vegetables, flowers, and kitchen objects. Rich saturated reds, greens, and ochres, strong light-dark contrast, visible fine brushwork, and elaborate surface detail create a lavish, theatrical sense of abundance."},{"id":"paul-rudolph","name":"Paul Rudolph","cat":"architects","en":"Paul Rudolph","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-rudolph.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-rudolph","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","urban","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","charcoal","dark-brown","orange","red"],"intro":"Paul Rudolph was an influential American architect known for his innovative and bold designs, particularly in the Brutalist style. He gained prominence in the mid-20th century and is recognized for his work on the Yale Art and Architecture Building, among other significant projects. Rudolph's architectural philosophy often involved complex spatial arrangements and a strong emphasis on materiality, particularly concrete.","observation":"The style presents monumental concrete architecture through realistic, highly detailed photographic compositions with strong geometric structure and cinematic framing. Deep shadows, warm directional light, vivid sky and vegetation, reflective water, and occasional film-like grain give the buildings a dramatic yet polished architectural-editorial feel."},{"id":"bruce-gilden","name":"Bruce Gilden","cat":"photographers","en":"Bruce Gilden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruce-gilden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruce-gilden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Bruce Gilden is an American street photographer known for his candid and often confrontational style. His work captures the raw and unfiltered essence of urban life, focusing on the streets of New York City. Gilden's photography is characterized by its bold use of flash, close-up compositions, and an intense focus on the human face, often highlighting the grit and texture of his subjects.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white documentary photography with hard flash, deep shadows, and pronounced facial and fabric texture. Tight, candid close-ups of expressive, unconventional characters create an intimate, raw nightlife reportage feel."},{"id":"yves-saint-laurent","name":"Yves Saint-Laurent","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Yves Saint-Laurent","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yves-saint-laurent.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yves-saint-laurent","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","fashion","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["black","silver","brown","white","beige"],"intro":"Yves Saint-Laurent is a renowned French fashion designer known for his influential contributions to the fashion industry, particularly in the 20th century. He is celebrated for his innovative designs that blend elegance with boldness, and his work has left a lasting impact on modern fashion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome fashion photography with strong tonal separation, sculptural black garments, and dramatic hat silhouettes. Close, poised portraits are framed with cinematic lighting, deep shadows, selective softness, and an austere editorial mood."},{"id":"duane-michals","name":"Duane Michals","cat":"photographers","en":"Duane Michals","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/duane-michals.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/duane-michals","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","backlighting","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","symmetry"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Duane Michals is an American photographer known for his innovative work in the field of photography, particularly in the use of sequences and multiple exposures. Born in 1932, Michals's work often explores themes of identity, emotion, and the human condition, blending elements of surrealism and narrative storytelling. His photographs are characterized by their introspective and philosophical nature, often accompanied by handwritten text that adds a personal dimension to the images.","observation":"A stark monochrome photographic style built around cinematic interior scenes, deep blacks, bright window light, and strongly backlit or silhouetted figures. Grain, smoke, reflections, and carefully arranged architectural frames create an ominous, psychologically charged atmosphere across the images."},{"id":"leo-fender","name":"Leo Fender","cat":"designers","en":"Leo Fender","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leo-fender.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leo-fender","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","still-life","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","light-orange","dark-rust","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Leo Fender was an American inventor and founder of the Fender Electric Instrument Manufacturing Company, known for creating iconic electric guitars such as the Fender Stratocaster and Telecaster. His innovations have had a profound impact on music, particularly in rock and roll, jazz, and blues genres.","observation":"The style presents richly detailed photographic still lifes of electric guitars and workshop equipment, with tactile wood grain, chipped finishes, metal hardware, and cluttered repair environments. Warm subdued colors, strong directional light, deep shadows, and selective focus give the images a cinematic, atmospheric character."},{"id":"sonia-delaunay","name":"Sonia Delaunay","cat":"painters","en":"Sonia Delaunay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sonia-delaunay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sonia-delaunay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","ornate","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["pale-orange","vivid-red","deep-blue","muted-teal","black","light-orange"],"intro":"Sonia Delaunay was a Ukrainian-born French artist known for her vibrant use of color and geometric shapes. She was a key figure in the Orphism art movement, which focused on the use of strong colors and abstract forms. Her work often explored the relationship between colors and forms, creating dynamic compositions that were both visually striking and conceptually innovative.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds dense abstract compositions from concentric circles, arcs, spirals, and sharply divided geometric panels. Saturated reds, blues, oranges, greens, pinks, black, and cream are applied in broad visible strokes, combining flat graphic shapes with a tactile painted surface and energetic radial repetition."},{"id":"glenn-ligon","name":"Glenn Ligon","cat":"various-artists","en":"Glenn Ligon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/glenn-ligon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/glenn-ligon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","bold-lines","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink","geometric","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Glenn Ligon is an American conceptual artist known for his text-based works and exploration of race, identity, and language. His work often incorporates quotes and literary references, addressing complex themes of identity and history.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style combines stark black-and-white abstraction with visibly rough, gestural ink and paint textures. Heavy geometric blocks, distressed surfaces, oversized lettering, and near-solid silhouettes create a forceful, screenprint-like visual language with stark negative shapes and an ominous surreal character."},{"id":"roger-fenton","name":"Roger Fenton","cat":"photographers","en":"Roger Fenton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-fenton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-fenton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","grain","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["pale-yellow","brown","muted-brown","muted-orange","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Roger Fenton was a pioneering British photographer known for his work during the Crimean War and his contributions to the development of photography in the 19th century. He is recognized for his classical compositions and technical innovations in early photographic processes, such as the wet plate collodion method. Fenton's work often depicted landscapes, architecture, and portraits, capturing the essence of Victorian society and its surroundings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style resembles aged sepia documentary photography: heavily textured grain, weathered tonal fading, and stark contrast give the scenes an archival, mournful character. Wide compositions place small human figures, military remnants, bodies, and barren terrain against expansive skies and hills, creating a cinematic historical tableau."},{"id":"nick-gentry","name":"Nick Gentry","cat":"various-artists","en":"Nick Gentry","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nick-gentry.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nick-gentry","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["bone-white","black","beige","grey","blue","orange","light-yellow"],"intro":"Nick Gentry is a contemporary British artist known for his innovative use of obsolete technology and social commentary through art. He often incorporates used floppy disks and film negatives into his work, creating a dialogue between the digital and physical worlds.","observation":"Across all four portraits, realistic facial features are fragmented and partially obscured by dense layers of document-like paper, rectangular strips, and graphic marks. The style combines high-contrast monochrome faces with vivid blue, red, and yellow accents, fine linear detail, hard-edged collage shapes, and an expressive surreal disruption of facial structure."},{"id":"nam-june-paik","name":"Nam June Paik","cat":"various-artists","en":"Nam June Paik","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nam-june-paik.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nam-june-paik","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi"],"colours":["brown","muted-rust","dark-blue","grey","red","blue","light-teal","light-yellow"],"intro":"Nam June Paik is a pioneering figure in video art, known for his innovative use of television and electronic media. Born in South Korea, he became a central figure in the Fluxus movement and is celebrated for his groundbreaking work that explores the relationship between technology and art.","observation":"The style presents dense, highly detailed assemblages of vintage televisions and exposed electronics as weighty sculptural installations, rendered with realistic photographic texture. Saturated screen colors, practical bulbs, indicator lights, and reflective floors create strong contrast and localized glow against sparse gallery interiors, with repeated stacked forms and cables supplying visual pattern."},{"id":"winsor-mccay","name":"Winsor McCay","cat":"illustrators","en":"Winsor McCay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/winsor-mccay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/winsor-mccay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","pale-orange","light-orange","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Winsor McCay was a pioneering American cartoonist and animator, best known for his groundbreaking comic strip \"Little Nemo in Slumberland\" and the animated film \"Gertie the Dinosaur.\" His work is celebrated for its intricate line work, imaginative storytelling, and innovative use of the comic strip format, influencing generations of artists and animators.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses dense black ink outlines, fine hatching, and tightly packed illustrative detail over warm ochre and orange grounds. It combines oversized animals, small human figures, strange machines, and impossible environments into surreal narrative scenes with strong graphic contrast and recurring grotesque visual motifs."},{"id":"george-goodwin-kilburne","name":"George Goodwin Kilburne","cat":"painters","en":"George Goodwin Kilburne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-goodwin-kilburne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-goodwin-kilburne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","dark-red","bone-white"],"intro":"George Goodwin Kilburne was a British artist known for his detailed and realistic depictions of Victorian life. Born in 1839, Kilburne specialized in genre scenes, capturing the elegance and intricacies of 19th-century English society. His works often feature domestic interiors and social gatherings, rendered with fine brushstrokes and a keen eye for detail. Kilburne's paintings are celebrated for their historical accuracy and charming portrayal of everyday life during the Victorian era.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, finely observed oil-paint handling to depict richly dressed figures in everyday social and domestic situations. Subdued, earthy colors, dense environmental detail, carefully rendered fabrics, and soft natural light create a classical, atmospheric sense of lived-in historical interiors and gardens."},{"id":"george-henry-boughton","name":"George Henry Boughton","cat":"painters","en":"George Henry Boughton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-henry-boughton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-henry-boughton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"George Henry Boughton was a 19th-century American-British painter known for his landscapes and genre scenes, often depicting historical and rural themes. His work is characterized by a delicate touch and a focus on narrative, capturing the essence of Victorian life and literature.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, richly textured oil-paint handling with visible fine brushwork, carefully modelled faces, clothing, foliage, and architecture. Muted earthy colors, occasional deep reds, and atmospheric outdoor settings create a subdued, darkly romantic mood, while posed figures and historical-looking garments give the scenes a classical portrait-and-tableau character."},{"id":"burt-glinn","name":"Burt Glinn","cat":"photographers","en":"Burt Glinn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/burt-glinn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/burt-glinn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["silver","grey","white","charcoal","black"],"intro":"Burt Glinn is a renowned American photographer known for his work with Magnum Photos, capturing pivotal moments of the 20th century. His photography often focused on social issues, politics, and urban life, showcasing a keen eye for detail and composition.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark black-and-white photography-like imagery uses hard sunlight, deep shadows, and strongly cropped compositions. Human figures in flowing garments inhabit uncanny, theatrical encounters and ordinary courtyards, giving the scenes a cinematic, expressive, and ominous character."},{"id":"philippe-de-champaigne","name":"Philippe de Champaigne","cat":"painters","en":"Philippe de Champaigne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philippe-de-champaigne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philippe-de-champaigne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","beige","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Philippe de Champaigne was a prominent 17th-century French Baroque painter known for his religious and portrait paintings. He was a key figure in the French Baroque movement, recognized for his detailed and realistic depictions, often imbued with a sense of solemnity and introspection. His works are characterized by their use of chiaroscuro, fine brushwork, and a rich color palette that often includes earth tones and warm hues.","observation":"The style uses richly modelled, painterly figures and fabric with visible brush texture, dense costume and architectural detail, and expressive gestures. Deep shadow is set against warm illuminated skin, white cloth, and rust-orange garments, creating a dramatic devotional atmosphere in richly staged interior scenes."},{"id":"louis-marcoussis","name":"Louis Marcoussis","cat":"painters","en":"Louis Marcoussis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-marcoussis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-marcoussis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","black","brown","vivid-red","deep-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Louis Marcoussis was a Polish-French painter and engraver known for his contributions to the Cubist movement. Born in 1878, he became a prominent figure in the Parisian art scene, collaborating with other avant-garde artists of his time. His work is characterized by its geometric abstraction and innovative use of form and color.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and domestic objects are reduced to interlocking geometric planes, strong rectangular and curved forms, and a deliberately flattened spatial structure. Saturated reds, blues, blacks, creams, and muted earth tones sit in crisp blocks, while visible brush texture gives the surfaces a tactile, hand-painted character."},{"id":"erik-jones","name":"Erik Jones","cat":"painters","en":"Erik Jones","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/erik-jones.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/erik-jones","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","black","silver","muted-ochre","blue","deep-red"],"intro":"Erik Jones is a contemporary American artist known for his vibrant and surreal portraiture. His work often combines traditional painting techniques with digital elements, creating a unique fusion that explores themes of identity and expression.","observation":"Across all four images, tightly cropped faces are rendered with vivid red, cyan, blue, and coral paint, combining realistic facial detail with angular geometric interruptions. Visible brushwork, energetic line marks, layered fragments, and abrupt tonal contrasts create an expressive, collage-like surreal portrait style."},{"id":"christian-boltanski","name":"Christian Boltanski","cat":"various-artists","en":"Christian Boltanski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-boltanski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-boltanski","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","patterns","glow","fine-lines","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","brown","charcoal","orange"],"intro":"Christian Boltanski is a French artist known for his installations and conceptual art that explore themes of memory, identity, and the passage of time. His works often incorporate found objects, photographs, and lights to create haunting and reflective environments. Boltanski's art is deeply influenced by his personal history and the broader context of European history, particularly the Holocaust.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents immersive gallery installations built from suspended frames, cords, bulbs, and repeated hanging objects. Warm amber light glows within the dark structures, producing high contrast, moody interiors, intricate linear patterns, and an uncanny surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"john-melhuish-strudwick","name":"John Melhuish Strudwick","cat":"painters","en":"John Melhuish Strudwick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-melhuish-strudwick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-melhuish-strudwick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-red","muted-orange","deep-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"John Melhuish Strudwick was an English painter associated with the Pre-Raphaelite movement, known for his detailed and romantic depictions of mythological and medieval themes. Born in 1849, Strudwick was a student of Edward Burne-Jones and became recognized for his intricate compositions and use of rich, warm colors. His works often feature serene figures set against ornate backgrounds, capturing a sense of nostalgia and introspection.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, visibly painted portrait scenes with delicate brushwork, luminous skin, flowing hair, elaborate textiles, and dense botanical ornament. Rich reds, blues, greens, and golds create sumptuous classical tableaux, while the floral settings and gentle expressions give the images a dreamy, romantic atmosphere."},{"id":"haroon-mirza","name":"Haroon Mirza","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Haroon Mirza","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/haroon-mirza.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/haroon-mirza","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","urban","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["deep-red","dark-olive","black","red","green","dark-blue"],"intro":"Haroon Mirza is a contemporary British artist known for his innovative use of sound, light, and video to create immersive installations. His work often explores the intersections of technology, culture, and perception, challenging traditional boundaries between different art forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, starkly geometric acoustic interiors are depicted with dense repeating wedge textures, strong bilateral compositions, and vivid red, cyan, and green illumination. The photographic, cinematic treatment emphasizes deep shadows, glowing tube lights, reflective floors, and a futuristic industrial atmosphere."},{"id":"berndnaut-smilde","name":"Berndnaut Smilde","cat":"various-artists","en":"Berndnaut Smilde","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/berndnaut-smilde.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/berndnaut-smilde","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","muted-brown","black","beige","silver"],"intro":"Berndnaut Smilde is a contemporary Dutch artist known for his innovative installations that explore themes of impermanence and transience. His work often involves creating temporary clouds indoors, challenging perceptions of space and environment.","observation":"Across all four renders, photorealistic clouds fill richly decorated palace rooms, with extensive woodwork, frescoed ceilings, parquet floors, and tall windows rendered in fine architectural detail. Muted brown-green interiors contrast with luminous white vapor and dramatic window light, creating a surreal, dreamlike atmosphere with strong depth and cinematic framing."},{"id":"george-inness","name":"George Inness","cat":"painters","en":"George Inness","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-inness.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-inness","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["dark-ochre","grey","black","muted-brown","muted-orange","bone-white"],"intro":"George Inness is considered one of the most influential American landscape painters of the 19th century. Known for his association with the Hudson River School and later Tonalism, Inness's work is characterized by its spiritual and emotional depth. He often depicted serene landscapes imbued with a sense of tranquility and mysticism, using a soft and atmospheric approach to light and color.","observation":"Across all four images, broad rural landscapes are rendered with visible oil-paint texture, delicate brushwork, and carefully layered atmospheric distance. Subdued earth tones, dramatic clouds, warm shafts of light, and occasional solitary figures create a contemplative, dreamlike pastoral mood with a classical gallery-painting presentation."},{"id":"antanas-sutkus","name":"Antanas Sutkus","cat":"photographers","en":"Antanas Sutkus","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antanas-sutkus.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antanas-sutkus","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","silver","grey","white"],"intro":"Antanas Sutkus is a renowned Lithuanian photographer known for his poignant black and white images that capture the essence of human life in post-war Lithuania. His work is celebrated for its humanist approach, focusing on the everyday lives of people, often highlighting themes of solitude and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, bright highlights, visible grain, and selective focus. Children and shadowy figures are staged in cinematic, unsettling woodland or urban scenes, with mist, veils, bare branches, and period clothing creating a dreamlike, ominous atmosphere."},{"id":"ed-piskor","name":"Ed Piskor","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ed Piskor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-piskor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-piskor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","moody-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","dark-ochre","orange","rust"],"intro":"Ed Piskor is an American cartoonist and illustrator known for his work in the comic book industry. He gained prominence with his series \"Hip Hop Family Tree,\" which explores the history of hip-hop music, and \"X-Men: Grand Design,\" a retelling of the X-Men saga. Piskor's work is characterized by its detailed line art and narrative-driven style, often drawing inspiration from the aesthetics of underground and alternative comics.","observation":"The style is a densely packed graphic-novel illustration, built from heavy black ink contours, flat blocks of burnt orange, teal, ochre and near-black, and abundant fine interior hatching. It combines exaggerated masked and skeletal characters with crowded retro interiors and architectural cutaways, using stark contrast, theatrical poses and intricate environmental detail throughout."},{"id":"ted-nasmith","name":"Ted Nasmith","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ted Nasmith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ted-nasmith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ted-nasmith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","blue","light-blue","grey","muted-orange"],"intro":"Ted Nasmith is a renowned Canadian illustrator known for his detailed and atmospheric depictions of fantasy worlds, particularly those inspired by the works of J.R.R. Tolkien. His illustrations often capture the grandeur and mystique of mythical landscapes, bringing to life the epic tales and settings of Middle-earth with a meticulous attention to detail and a rich, immersive style.","observation":"The style presents expansive fantasy landscapes with towering, sharply textured mountains, deep valleys, waterfalls, rivers, and distant architectural spires. Richly modeled painterly surfaces, atmospheric haze, dramatic light, and strong foreground framing create a cinematic, epic sense of scale across all four renders."},{"id":"jason-rhoades","name":"Jason Rhoades","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jason Rhoades","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jason-rhoades.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jason-rhoades","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","urban","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["dark-red","black","red","charcoal"],"intro":"Jason Rhoades was an American artist known for his large-scale, immersive installations that often combined a variety of materials and objects. His work frequently explored themes of consumer culture, identity, and the chaotic nature of modern life. Rhoades's art is characterized by its bold use of color, intricate compositions, and the incorporation of neon lights and found objects, creating dynamic and often overwhelming environments.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style depicts expansive industrial interiors densely packed with suspended wires, vintage electronics, furniture, lamps, and improvised installations. Saturated red, blue, and orange illumination creates strong contrast and abundant internal glow, while the photographic rendering remains detailed, realistic, and slightly surreal."},{"id":"susan-hiller","name":"Susan Hiller","cat":"various-artists","en":"Susan Hiller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/susan-hiller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/susan-hiller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","urban","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-red","black","deep-red","dark-magenta","vivid-red"],"intro":"Susan Hiller is an influential American-born artist known for her innovative and multidisciplinary approach to contemporary art. Her work often explores themes of memory, culture, and the subconscious, using a variety of mediums including installation, video, and sound. Hiller's art is recognized for its conceptual depth and engagement with both personal and collective experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses cinematic architectural photography with geometric interiors, strong perspective, and saturated red, pink, orange, and cyan illumination. Glowing practical lights, reflective surfaces, selective focus, and deep shadow create a moody futuristic atmosphere, while the rooms remain richly structured and slightly surreal."},{"id":"richard-dadd","name":"Richard Dadd","cat":"painters","en":"Richard Dadd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-dadd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-dadd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","floral","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["grey","muted-brown","brown","muted-blue","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Richard Dadd was a 19th-century English painter known for his intricate and fantastical works, often depicting fairy scenes and mythological subjects. His career was marked by a tragic turn when he was diagnosed with mental illness, leading to his confinement in psychiatric hospitals. Despite these challenges, Dadd continued to produce art, creating some of his most famous pieces during this period.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible broad strokes, layered texture, and expressive movement. Elaborate costumed figures, horses, birds, and abundant flowers create dense, fantastical equestrian tableaux in saturated pinks, reds, greens, and sky blue."},{"id":"li-hongbo","name":"Li Hongbo","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Li Hongbo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/li-hongbo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/li-hongbo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["grey","brown","silver","muted-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Li Hongbo is a contemporary Chinese artist known for his innovative paper sculptures. His work often explores themes of transformation and identity, using traditional materials in unconventional ways. Hongbo's sculptures are celebrated for their intricate designs and the surprising flexibility they exhibit, challenging perceptions of solidity and form.","observation":"The style presents monumental portrait busts as highly detailed, solid sculptures with visible layered wood grain and finely carved hair, beards, and facial features. Restrained pale timber tones, realistic gallery lighting, and formal museum framing combine classical-looking heads with a strongly geometric, contemporary material treatment."},{"id":"arshile-gorky","name":"Arshile Gorky","cat":"painters","en":"Arshile Gorky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arshile-gorky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arshile-gorky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","ink","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","ochre","dark-brown","black","vivid-rust","muted-teal","dark-green","dark-blue"],"intro":"Arshile Gorky was an Armenian-American painter known for his influential role in the development of abstract expressionism. Born in 1904, Gorky's work is characterized by its blend of surrealism and abstraction, often incorporating biomorphic shapes and vivid colors. His art reflects a deep emotional intensity and a unique approach to form and color, making him a significant figure in 20th-century American art.","observation":"Across all four works, the style combines visibly textured, layered paint with abstract geometric fragments and energetic linear marks. Saturated reds, blues, greens, oranges, and blacks stand out against beige grounds, while irregular contours and overlapping shapes create a bold, surreal, collage-like visual rhythm."},{"id":"scott-rohlfs","name":"Scott Rohlfs","cat":"painters","en":"Scott Rohlfs","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/scott-rohlfs.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/scott-rohlfs","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["brown","orange","bone-white","dark-red","muted-cyan","dark-blue"],"intro":"Scott Rohlfs is a contemporary artist known for his captivating and surreal portraits that often explore themes of beauty and fantasy. His work is characterized by a striking use of color and a focus on the human form, particularly the face. Rohlfs's paintings often feature bold, vivid hues and a hyperrealistic style that draws the viewer into a world of heightened emotion and allure.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped beauty portraits with saturated red, white, and blue areas, strong contrast, and graphic patterning. Smooth illustrative surfaces, fine contour work, glossy highlights, and exaggerated facial details create a polished, surreal editorial effect across all four images."},{"id":"elihu-vedder","name":"Elihu Vedder","cat":"painters","en":"Elihu Vedder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elihu-vedder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elihu-vedder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","ochre","red","pale-orange"],"intro":"Elihu Vedder was an American symbolist painter known for his visionary and mystical works, often incorporating themes of mythology and fantasy. Born in 1836, Vedder's art is characterized by its dreamlike quality and detailed execution, reflecting the symbolist movement of the 19th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly visible brushwork with highly modelled figures, rocks, clouds, and fabric. Deep umbers, rust reds, slate blues, and near-black shadows create a brooding, high-contrast atmosphere, while recurring robed characters and impossible geological or cosmic settings give the scenes a surreal, mythic grandeur."},{"id":"martine-franck","name":"Martine Franck","cat":"photographers","en":"Martine Franck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martine-franck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martine-franck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","black","silver","white"],"intro":"Martine Franck is a renowned Belgian-born photographer known for her work in documentary and humanist photography. She was a member of the prestigious Magnum Photos agency and was celebrated for her ability to capture the essence of the human condition through her lens. Her work often focused on themes of solitude, introspection, and the everyday lives of people, with a particular emphasis on European settings.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photographic imagery with strong tonal separation, deep shadows, and sharply directional light. It combines intimate portraits and solitary figures with atmospheric environmental scenes, often using selective focus, grain, and cinematic framing to create a melancholic, observational mood."},{"id":"jacob-hashimoto","name":"Jacob Hashimoto","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jacob Hashimoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacob-hashimoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacob-hashimoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","patterns","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["muted-brown","beige","muted-orange","white","brown","rust"],"intro":"Jacob Hashimoto is an American contemporary artist known for his innovative use of traditional kite-making techniques to create large-scale installations. His work often explores the interplay between light, color, and form, drawing inspiration from both Western and Eastern artistic traditions.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents expansive gallery installations built from dense suspended grids, patchwork textile fragments, and layered sculptural forms. Bright color blocks and intricate repeated patterns contrast with broad areas of white architectural space, producing a highly detailed, geometric, materially rich, and surreal visual language."},{"id":"jacob-lawrence","name":"Jacob Lawrence","cat":"painters","en":"Jacob Lawrence","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacob-lawrence.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacob-lawrence","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-green","light-orange","vivid-red","dark-blue","blue"],"intro":"Jacob Lawrence is a renowned American painter known for his portrayal of African American historical subjects and contemporary life. His work is characterized by a distinctive style that combines vivid colors, dynamic compositions, and a strong narrative element. Lawrence's art often reflects themes of social justice, community, and the African American experience, making him a pivotal figure in 20th-century American art.","observation":"Across all four images, simplified human figures and objects are built from forceful dark contours, broad painted shapes, and sharply contrasting blocks of blue, red, teal, black, and cream. The scenes feel expressive and slightly surreal, with visible brush texture, flattened space, cropped compositions, and emphatic silhouettes rather than naturalistic modeling."},{"id":"jack-butler-yeats","name":"Jack Butler Yeats","cat":"painters","en":"Jack Butler Yeats","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-butler-yeats.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-butler-yeats","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","orange","dark-olive","dark-blue","deep-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Jack Butler Yeats is an Irish painter known for his expressive and vivid landscapes, often capturing the spirit and culture of Ireland. Born in 1871, he was a prominent figure in the early 20th-century art scene, contributing significantly to the modernist movement. Yeats's work is characterized by its emotional depth and dynamic use of color, reflecting both the beauty and the tumultuous nature of the Irish landscape.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable people and social situations are built from heavily worked, visibly directional paint, with rough edges and strongly articulated brush marks. The style combines dark, weighty passages with saturated blue, red, ochre, and green accents, preserving expressive gesture over precise contour or anatomical detail."},{"id":"fernand-leger","name":"Fernand Leger","cat":"painters","en":"Fernand Leger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/fernand-leger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/fernand-leger","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","vivid-red","beige","deep-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Fernand Leger was a French painter, sculptor, and filmmaker associated with Cubism and Modernism. Born in 1881, Leger was known for his bold use of color and geometric forms, often depicting industrial and mechanical subjects. His work is characterized by a dynamic interplay of shapes and vibrant color palettes, reflecting the influence of the machine age and urbanization.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses bold black contours to divide flat, saturated red, blue, cream, yellow, and black geometric shapes. Faces and figures are fragmented into overlapping planes, stripes, circles, and architectural blocks, with dense decorative patterning and a subtly textured painted surface."},{"id":"brice-marden","name":"Brice Marden","cat":"painters","en":"Brice Marden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brice-marden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brice-marden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","patterns","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","bone-white","white","brown","pale-orange","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Brice Marden is an American artist known for his contributions to abstract painting. His work is characterized by its minimalist approach and use of subtle color palettes, often exploring the interplay of line and space.","observation":"Across all four works, broad geometric fields and irregular dark divisions are painted onto pale, weathered grounds, creating an abstract style with a restrained charcoal, ivory, ochre, and olive palette. Visible surface variation, hairline cracking, and uneven painted edges keep the compositions tactile and painterly, while the heavy linear structure gives them a stark, architectural presence."},{"id":"le-corbusier","name":"Le Corbusier","cat":"architects","en":"Le Corbusier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/le-corbusier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/le-corbusier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","patterns","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","retro","collage","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","brown","muted-cyan","dark-red","vivid-red","teal"],"intro":"Le Corbusier was a Swiss-French architect, designer, and urban planner, renowned for pioneering modern architecture. His work emphasized functionality, simplicity, and the use of modern materials like concrete and steel. He was instrumental in developing the International Style and had a profound influence on urban planning and design.","observation":"The style combines architectural photography and monochrome portrait imagery with visibly assembled collage layers, distressed paper textures, and bold geometric overlays. Saturated orange, blue, turquoise, and red blocks contrast with concrete neutrals and deep blacks, producing a graphic, high-contrast urban composition with a retro-surreal character."},{"id":"marcel-breuer","name":"Marcel Breuer","cat":"architects","en":"Marcel Breuer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marcel-breuer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marcel-breuer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","patterns","still-life","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","black","vivid-red","muted-ochre","blue"],"intro":"Marcel Breuer was a Hungarian-born architect and furniture designer, known for his innovative use of materials and his contributions to the Bauhaus movement. He is celebrated for his modernist approach and his pioneering work in tubular steel furniture design, which has left a lasting impact on architecture and design.","observation":"The style combines sharply geometric furniture and architectural forms with strong planar composition, hard directional light, and deep graphic shadows. Saturated red and blue accents alternate with concrete, black, and wood, while grain and distressed surface texture give the otherwise clean, illustrative forms a tactile printed quality."},{"id":"ron-mueck","name":"Ron Mueck","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Ron Mueck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ron-mueck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ron-mueck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","pale-orange","dark-brown","brown"],"intro":"Ron Mueck is an Australian hyperrealist sculptor known for his incredibly lifelike sculptures that explore the human condition. Born in 1958, Mueck began his career in special effects and puppetry before transitioning to fine art. His works often feature exaggerated scale, either monumental or miniature, to evoke emotional responses and challenge perceptions of reality.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely observed human figures with exceptionally detailed skin, hair, fabric, and bedding. Subdued neutral colors, soft naturalistic light, and carefully staged intimate interactions create a quiet, cinematic sense of vulnerability across the four scenes."},{"id":"gustave-caillebotte","name":"Gustave Caillebotte","cat":"painters","en":"Gustave Caillebotte","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-caillebotte.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-caillebotte","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","beige","rust"],"intro":"Gustave Caillebotte was a French painter known for his contributions to the Impressionist movement, particularly his realistic and detailed urban scenes. Born in 1848, Caillebotte's work often depicted Parisian life and architecture, capturing the essence of modernity during the late 19th century. His unique approach combined elements of realism with impressionistic techniques, offering a fresh perspective on city life and leisure.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visible, directional paint strokes to build richly observed domestic and outdoor scenes, with expressive figures and abundant environmental detail. It favors subdued, moody colors punctuated by warm reds and strong light-dark contrasts, giving the imagery a nostalgic, period-inflected atmosphere."},{"id":"lee-jeffries","name":"Lee Jeffries","cat":"photographers","en":"Lee Jeffries","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-jeffries.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-jeffries","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Lee Jeffries is a renowned photographer known for his compelling black and white portraits that capture the raw emotions and stories of homeless individuals. His work is characterized by a deep empathy and connection with his subjects, often revealing the depth of human experience through their eyes and expressions.","observation":"A stark monochrome portrait style built around intimate, extreme close-ups, hard directional light, deep shadows, and pronounced facial texture. The images feel documentary and cinematic, with selective focus, visible grain, and emotionally intense direct gazes across a varied cast of faces."},{"id":"samantha-keely-smith","name":"Samantha Keely Smith","cat":"painters","en":"Samantha Keely Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/samantha-keely-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/samantha-keely-smith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","landscapes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","muted-green","dark-brown","rust","muted-olive","vivid-rust"],"intro":"Samantha Keely Smith is a contemporary artist known for her abstract and emotive paintings. Her work often explores themes of consciousness and the human experience, using a vivid color palette and dynamic compositions to evoke deep emotional responses.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses painterly, visibly blended strokes to build vast atmospheric landscapes of cloud, smoke, and rugged ground. Deep teal shadows contrast with intense orange and turquoise openings, while mist, internal light, and sweeping cloud formations create a dreamy, epic sense of scale."},{"id":"george-pemba","name":"George Pemba","cat":"painters","en":"George Pemba","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-pemba.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-pemba","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-orange","red","muted-cyan","orange","blue"],"intro":"George Pemba is a renowned South African painter known for his vivid depictions of African life and culture. His work often explores themes of identity, community, and social issues, capturing the essence of South African society through expressive and colorful compositions.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, visibly painted surfaces with bold graphic contours, dense mark-making, and saturated color-blocked compositions. It repeatedly centers Black portrait subjects and fashion-conscious figures within gallery-like interiors, surrounding them with layered abstract artwork, geometric motifs, and strong warm⁠–cool contrast."},{"id":"gunther-uecker","name":"Gunther Uecker","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Gunther Uecker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gunther-uecker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gunther-uecker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","subdued-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","muted-yellow","muted-ochre","brown"],"intro":"Gunther Uecker is a German sculptor and installation artist known for his dynamic use of nails and other materials to create textured, kinetic artworks. A prominent member of the ZERO movement, Uecker's work often explores themes of light, movement, and space, pushing the boundaries of traditional sculpture.","observation":"The style presents highly ordered abstract wall reliefs built from hundreds of repeated spikes, pegs, or slender rods arranged in concentric and radial patterns. Neutral wood, ivory, and charcoal tones emphasize the sculptural depth, strong symmetry, and dense tactile repetition, while framed presentation gives the pieces a refined decorative-art character."},{"id":"max-liebermann","name":"Max Liebermann","cat":"painters","en":"Max Liebermann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/max-liebermann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/max-liebermann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","muted-ochre","muted-yellow","deep-red"],"intro":"Max Liebermann was a German painter and printmaker, a leading figure in the German Impressionist movement. Known for his depictions of everyday life and leisure activities, Liebermann's work often portrayed scenes of bourgeois society, capturing the essence of the late 19th and early 20th centuries.","observation":"Across all four scenes, visible directional brushwork and layered paint give the figures, foliage, clothing, and shoreline a richly painterly surface. The compositions depict socially observed outdoor moments with period dress, natural settings, and subdued earth-and-jewel tones, balancing readable detail with loose expressive marks."},{"id":"ward-kimball","name":"Ward Kimball","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ward Kimball","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ward-kimball.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ward-kimball","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","funny"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","bone-white","beige","charcoal","ochre","red"],"intro":"Ward Kimball was an influential American animator and one of Walt Disney 's core team members, known as one of Disney's Nine Old Men. He contributed significantly to the development of classic animated films and was recognized for his unique and whimsical style, which often included a playful and imaginative approach to character design and storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines energetic, visibly brushed paint with graphic cartoon drawing, exaggerated character designs, and densely packed workshop or adventure scenes. Strong blue, ochre, and warm flesh tones are pushed through high contrast, while broad directional strokes and lively gestures create a humorous, kinetic storybook atmosphere."},{"id":"daleast","name":"DALeast","cat":"street-artists","en":"DALeast","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/daleast.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/daleast","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","animals","scenes","urban","fine-lines","surreal","drawing","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","brown","bone-white","beige","dark-brown"],"intro":"DALeast is a contemporary Chinese street artist known for his dynamic and large-scale murals that often feature animals and natural elements. His work is characterized by a unique style that combines fine art techniques with street art aesthetics, creating a sense of movement and energy.","observation":"The style depicts large animal forms integrated into urban walls, rendered with dense, expressive networks of fine black lines resembling tangled twigs or charcoal strokes. Strong dark figures contrast with weathered brick and plaster facades, combining illustrative drawing with surreal, sculptural-looking forms and an atmospheric street-art setting."},{"id":"helio-oiticica","name":"Helio Oiticica","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Helio Oiticica","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/helio-oiticica.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/helio-oiticica","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-rust","deep-rust","bone-white","dark-brown","ochre","dark-blue"],"intro":"Helio Oiticica was a Brazilian artist known for his innovative contributions to the Neo-Concrete movement. He explored the boundaries of art through immersive installations and participatory environments, challenging traditional perceptions of art. His work often incorporated vibrant colors and geometric forms, reflecting a deep engagement with Brazilian culture and social issues.","observation":"The style presents large-scale textile installations as realistic, richly detailed gallery scenes, with saturated red, orange, blue, and white fabrics dominating the frame. Geometric tent-like structures, hanging cloth walls, folds, openings, and occasional visitors create an immersive sense of architectural space and movement through the installation."},{"id":"guy-maddin","name":"Guy Maddin","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Guy Maddin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guy-maddin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guy-maddin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Guy Maddin is a Canadian filmmaker known for his unique and surreal cinematic style, often drawing inspiration from early 20th-century cinema, particularly silent films and film noir. His works are characterized by their dreamlike quality, blending nostalgia with avant-garde techniques to create a distinctive visual and narrative experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white imagery with crushed shadows, blown highlights, coarse grain, and visibly distressed photographic surfaces. Overlapping faces, figures, film-strip borders, blur, and double-exposure effects create a fragmented collage with an eerie, dreamlike mood."},{"id":"lesser-ury","name":"Lesser Ury","cat":"painters","en":"Lesser Ury","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lesser-ury.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lesser-ury","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","glow","mist","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","brown","beige","orange","blue","red"],"intro":"Lesser Ury was a German painter and printmaker associated with the Impressionist movement. Known for his atmospheric urban scenes and landscapes, Ury captured the essence of Berlin and its surroundings during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. His work often features dramatic lighting and reflections, creating a moody and contemplative atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly broad, textured brushwork to build dark woodland scenes with expressive, loosely defined forms. Teal, blue, and brown shadows are punctuated by warm reflected lights, misty depth, and small solitary figures that give the images a brooding, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"emil-nolde","name":"Emil Nolde","cat":"painters","en":"Emil Nolde","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emil-nolde.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emil-nolde","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","landscapes","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","charcoal","dark-brown","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Emil Nolde was a German-Danish painter and printmaker, known for his bold use of color and expressive style. He was a prominent figure in the German Expressionist movement, and his work often depicted vivid landscapes, religious scenes, and intense emotional portraits. Nolde's art is characterized by its vibrant color palette and dynamic brushwork, which convey a sense of energy and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, landscapes are built from thick, visibly directional paint strokes, with rough textured surfaces and expressive, simplified forms. Saturated vermilion, orange, ochre, blue, and near-black areas create stark contrasts, glowing horizons, heavy storm-like skies, and a dreamlike, slightly unreal atmosphere."},{"id":"peter-howson","name":"Peter Howson","cat":"painters","en":"Peter Howson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-howson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-howson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","charcoal","beige"],"intro":"Peter Howson is a Scottish painter known for his powerful and often unsettling depictions of the human condition. His work frequently explores themes of struggle, madness, and the darker aspects of society, rendered in a bold and expressive style. Howson's paintings are characterized by their intense emotional impact and detailed portrayal of human figures, often with exaggerated and distorted features.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured oil-paint surfaces, broad directional brushwork, and dense, carefully modelled facial detail. Cropped faces and figures crowd the frame with exaggerated anatomy and anguished expressions, while a dark, earthy palette and heavy shadows create an intense, nightmarish atmosphere."},{"id":"charles-spencelayh","name":"Charles Spencelayh","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Spencelayh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-spencelayh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-spencelayh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","deep-red","red"],"intro":"Charles Spencelayh was an English genre painter known for his detailed and realistic depictions of everyday life, often focusing on elderly subjects and domestic scenes. His works are characterized by meticulous attention to detail and a warm, nostalgic atmosphere.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, realistic oil-paint-like rendering with visible fine brushwork, dense object detail, and expressive elderly figures engaged in quiet activities. Deep shadowed interiors contrast with strong window light and selective red accents, creating a moody, classical atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"eduardo-chillida","name":"Eduardo Chillida","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Eduardo Chillida","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eduardo-chillida.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eduardo-chillida","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","still-life","subdued-colors","classical","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","silver","dark-brown","beige","muted-ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Eduardo Chillida is a renowned Spanish sculptor known for his monumental abstract works that explore space, material, and form. Born in 1924 in San Sebastián, Chillida's work is characterized by its use of heavy materials such as iron and stone, and his innovative approach to sculpture that often integrates with the surrounding environment. His art reflects a deep connection to his Basque heritage and a philosophical exploration of space and boundaries.","observation":"The style presents monumental abstract sculptures as heavy, geometric arrangements of rough, weathered blocks with deep architectural openings and strong negative spaces. Restrained earth tones, hard directional light, and museum-like staging emphasize the mass, texture, and carved solidity of each form."},{"id":"lin-fengmian","name":"Lin Fengmian","cat":"painters","en":"Lin Fengmian","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lin-fengmian.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lin-fengmian","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","brown","muted-cyan","beige","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Lin Fengmian was a pioneering Chinese painter known for blending traditional Chinese art with Western modernism. Born in 1900, he became a significant figure in 20th-century Chinese art, influencing generations with his innovative style that merged Eastern and Western techniques.","observation":"Across all four images, broad visible brushwork builds moody blue-green landscapes with dark water, monumental rock forms, and elongated robed figures. The scenes remain illustrative and dreamlike, using simplified shapes, reflective surfaces, sparse silhouettes, and occasional red foliage to create a surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"marie-spartali-stillman","name":"Marie Spartali Stillman","cat":"painters","en":"Marie Spartali Stillman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marie-spartali-stillman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marie-spartali-stillman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Marie Spartali Stillman is a renowned British painter associated with the Pre-Raphaelite movement. Born in 1844, she was one of the few female artists of her time to gain recognition for her work. Her paintings often depict romantic and mythological themes, characterized by meticulous detail and vibrant colors.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, finely worked paint to depict pale female figures in intimate close-up portraits, with flowing hair, patterned garments, and dark decorative backgrounds. Deep russets, browns, navy, and muted gold create a restrained, somber atmosphere, while ornate textiles and visible surface texture provide dense visual richness."},{"id":"tom-fruin","name":"Tom Fruin","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tom Fruin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-fruin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-fruin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","bold-lines","vivid-colors","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-blue","blue","brown","red","pale-blue","pink"],"intro":"Tom Fruin is an American artist known for his vibrant and colorful sculptures, often utilizing reclaimed materials to create large-scale installations. His work frequently explores themes of urban life and architecture, transforming everyday environments into dynamic art spaces.","observation":"Across all four renders, solid waterfront buildings are constructed from vivid, jewel-toned glass panels divided by strong black geometric lines. The imagery is highly structured and detailed, combining realistic urban settings with an illustrative, futuristic architectural concept and visible interior glow."},{"id":"frederic-edwin-church","name":"Frederic Edwin Church","cat":"painters","en":"Frederic Edwin Church","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederic-edwin-church.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederic-edwin-church","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","glow","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","red","beige","bone-white","orange","light-yellow"],"intro":"Frederic Edwin Church was a prominent American landscape painter of the 19th century, associated with the Hudson River School. He is renowned for his large-scale, detailed landscapes that capture the majesty and drama of the natural world. Church's work often reflects themes of exploration and the sublime, with a focus on the interplay of light and atmosphere.","observation":"These landscapes use visibly textured, painterly surfaces and dense atmospheric detail to build monumental cliffs, volcanoes, forests, rivers, and towering clouds. Saturated fire-orange, coral, blue, and deep green hues are intensified by brilliant internal light sources, strong contrast, and expansive fantastical compositions."},{"id":"pieter-de-hooch","name":"Pieter de Hooch","cat":"painters","en":"Pieter de Hooch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pieter-de-hooch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pieter-de-hooch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","muted-ochre","brown","rust","bone-white"],"intro":"Pieter de Hooch was a Dutch painter known for his genre scenes of domestic life during the Dutch Golden Age. His works often depict quiet, intimate moments within household settings, characterized by a masterful use of light and perspective. De Hooch's paintings are celebrated for their detailed interiors and the subtle play of light and shadow, reflecting the everyday life of 17th-century Netherlands.","observation":"These images use richly rendered, realistic domestic interiors with fine detail, carefully observed figures, animals, furniture, and architectural surfaces. Warm subdued colors, directional window light, deep shadows, and strong interior geometry create a classical, painterly atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"albert-pinkham-ryder","name":"Albert Pinkham Ryder","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Pinkham Ryder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-pinkham-ryder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-pinkham-ryder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic","silhouette"],"colours":["black","brown","red","dark-brown","ochre","rust"],"intro":"Albert Pinkham Ryder was an American painter known for his moody and mystical landscapes and seascapes, often imbued with a dreamlike quality. His work is characterized by dark tones, ethereal light, and a unique painterly style that makes use of broad brushstrokes and textured surfaces. Ryder's paintings often depict solitary figures and natural settings, reflecting themes of solitude and introspection.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses heavily textured, visibly painted surfaces with broad atmospheric masses, distressed crackle, and expressive tonal blending. Dark silhouettes and rugged horizons are set against glowing amber, rust, and orange skies, creating ominous, mythic landscape scenes with mist, dramatic light, and strong contrast."},{"id":"imogen-cunningham","name":"Imogen Cunningham","cat":"photographers","en":"Imogen Cunningham","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/imogen-cunningham.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/imogen-cunningham","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","floral","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","silver","grey"],"intro":"Imogen Cunningham was an American photographer known for her botanical photography, nudes, and industrial landscapes. She was a prominent figure in the development of modernist photography and a member of the f/64 group, which advocated for sharp focus and the use of large-format cameras.","observation":"The style uses realistic monochrome photography with stark tonal contrast, deep shadows, and selective focus. Female figures are staged among dense garden foliage and flowers in cinematic, intimate compositions, with dappled light and soft foreground obstructions creating a moody, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"anne-truitt","name":"Anne Truitt","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Anne Truitt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anne-truitt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anne-truitt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["minimalist","realistic","sculptural","patterns","urban","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","red","rust","muted-teal","pale-cyan"],"intro":"Anne Truitt was an American sculptor known for her work in the minimalist movement. Her art is characterized by its exploration of color, form, and space, often resulting in large, monolithic sculptures that emphasize simplicity and precision. Truitt's work is celebrated for its subtle interplay of color and form, reflecting a deep engagement with the principles of minimalism and abstraction.","observation":"The style presents sparse gallery interiors with repeated, vertically oriented rectangular sculptures arranged in geometric sequences. Clean architectural photography, vivid color blocking, polished surfaces, reflections, and strong directional shadows give the scenes a crisp, sculptural presence while preserving substantial negative space."},{"id":"john-piper","name":"John Piper","cat":"painters","en":"John Piper","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-piper.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-piper","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-blue","muted-blue","muted-ochre","ochre","vivid-orange"],"intro":"John Piper was a prominent British painter and printmaker known for his landscapes and architectural subjects, particularly focusing on churches and historic buildings. His work is characterized by a blend of romanticism and modernism, often capturing the essence of British heritage and landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable church architecture and clustered rooftops are built from vigorous, visible paint marks, scraped textures, and broad gestural strokes. The style uses a restrained blue-gray and charcoal ground punctuated by intense orange window light, with strong silhouettes, atmospheric distance, and expressive, partially abstracted architectural edges."},{"id":"albert-anker","name":"Albert Anker","cat":"painters","en":"Albert Anker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-anker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-anker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","light-yellow","dark-rust"],"intro":"Albert Anker was a Swiss painter known for his detailed and realistic depictions of rural life, particularly focusing on children and family scenes. Born in 1831, Anker's works are celebrated for their warmth and intimate portrayal of everyday life, capturing the essence of 19th-century Swiss culture. His paintings often reflect a deep appreciation for the simplicity and beauty of rural existence.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses highly realistic, richly textured oil-paint rendering with visible fine brushwork and carefully observed faces, clothing, wood, hay, and household objects. Dark rustic interiors are punctuated by warm window light, subdued earthy colors, strong tonal contrast, and intimate scenes of children and women engaged in everyday work or quiet observation."},{"id":"cecil-beaton","name":"Cecil Beaton","cat":"photographers","en":"Cecil Beaton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/cecil-beaton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/cecil-beaton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","black","silver","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Cecil Beaton was a renowned British photographer and designer, celebrated for his work in fashion, portrait, and war photography. He was known for his elegant and whimsical style, capturing the glamour of high society and the arts. Beaton's work spanned several decades, and he became a prominent figure in the world of photography, influencing both fashion and cultural aesthetics.","observation":"The style uses high-contrast black-and-white photographic imagery with carefully staged, cinematic portraits in richly furnished interiors. Ornate mirrors, floral textiles, lamps, clocks, and formal gowns create a detailed retro-luxury atmosphere, while selective focus and strong compositions give the scenes a polished editorial feel."},{"id":"jacques-laurent-agasse","name":"Jacques-Laurent Agasse","cat":"painters","en":"Jacques-Laurent Agasse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacques-laurent-agasse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacques-laurent-agasse","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","grey"],"intro":"Jacques-Laurent Agasse was a Swiss painter known for his detailed and realistic depictions of animals and landscapes. Born in 1767, Agasse gained prominence in England, where he became celebrated for his equestrian and animal paintings, often commissioned by the aristocracy. His works are characterized by their precision, elegance, and the naturalistic portrayal of subjects, reflecting the neoclassical and romantic movements of his time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is convincingly painterly and naturalistic, with fine modelling, visible brush texture, and a restrained earthy palette. Horses are presented in composed pastoral or formal settings, framed by mature trees, water, architecture, and dramatic drapery, with a softly aged, crackled surface and controlled classical atmosphere."},{"id":"louis-valtat","name":"Louis Valtat","cat":"painters","en":"Louis Valtat","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/louis-valtat.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/louis-valtat","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["rust","muted-olive","charcoal","grey","light-orange","silver"],"intro":"Louis Valtat is a French painter known for his contributions to the Post-Impressionist and Fauvist movements. Born in 1869, he was a contemporary of artists like Henri Matisse and André Derain. Valtat's work is characterized by its vibrant color palette and expressive brushwork, often depicting landscapes and coastal scenes.","observation":"Across the sheet, representational landscapes and a seated portrait are rendered with dense, visible brushwork and strongly directional strokes. Saturated oranges, blues, greens, pinks, and reds create a vivid, expressive surface, while dark contour accents and patterned areas give the scenes a graphic, decorative structure."},{"id":"alexei-harlamoff","name":"Alexei Harlamoff","cat":"painters","en":"Alexei Harlamoff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexei-harlamoff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexei-harlamoff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","dark-rust"],"intro":"Alexei Harlamoff was a Russian painter known for his exquisite portraits and genre scenes, often depicting young women and children with a focus on delicate beauty and emotional depth. His works are characterized by their fine brushwork, attention to detail, and use of light to create a soft, intimate atmosphere.","observation":"These images use richly visible, layered brushwork to model faces, hair, animals, and rough fabrics against nearly black grounds. Restrained earthy colors, candlelike warm highlights, deep shadows, and intimate close framing create an expressive, somber portrait-and-tableau style."},{"id":"ed-templeton","name":"Ed Templeton","cat":"illustrators","en":"Ed Templeton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ed-templeton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ed-templeton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","retro","drawing","ink"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","black","red","muted-blue","light-lime","dark-blue"],"intro":"Ed Templeton is an American contemporary artist and professional skateboarder known for his work in photography, painting, and illustration. His art often explores themes of youth culture, identity, and the urban experience, capturing the raw and unfiltered aspects of everyday life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed, fine-lined ink drawing with flat, sharply separated blocks of saturated color and heavy black contours. It combines expressive portrait and character imagery with crosshatching, screen-print-like texture, patterned clothing, and deliberately vintage graphic design."},{"id":"stuart-davis","name":"Stuart Davis","cat":"painters","en":"Stuart Davis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stuart-davis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stuart-davis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","illustrative","ornate","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","vivid-red","blue","red","vivid-orange","magenta","green"],"intro":"Stuart Davis was an American modernist painter known for his vibrant, abstract compositions that often incorporated elements of jazz and urban life. His work is characterized by bold colors, geometric shapes, and a dynamic sense of rhythm, reflecting the energy of early 20th-century American culture.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style uses densely layered abstract forms with vivid red, blue, black, white, and beige shapes arranged in energetic geometric compositions. Thick dark contours, flat color fields, symbolic faces and architectural fragments combine with visible painted texture and small decorative patterning."},{"id":"mimmo-rotella","name":"Mimmo Rotella","cat":"various-artists","en":"Mimmo Rotella","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mimmo-rotella.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mimmo-rotella","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","portraits","urban","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","collage"],"colours":["brown","pale-yellow","muted-olive","rust","vivid-red","orange"],"intro":"Mimmo Rotella was an Italian artist known for his innovative use of decollage and collage techniques. Born in 1918, he became a prominent figure in the Nouveau Réalisme movement, which sought to redefine art by incorporating everyday objects and urban elements. Rotella's work often involved tearing posters from city walls and reassembling them into new compositions, reflecting the chaos and vibrancy of urban life.","observation":"The style combines vividly painted portrait fragments with torn-paper collage, vintage photographic imagery, printed type, and aggressively layered poster scraps. Thick gestural marks, scraped and wrinkled surfaces, hard-edged red and teal shapes, and strong dark-light contrast create a dense, tactile urban-pop montage."},{"id":"douglas-gordon","name":"Douglas Gordon","cat":"various-artists","en":"Douglas Gordon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/douglas-gordon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/douglas-gordon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","dark-brown","orange","silver"],"intro":"Douglas Gordon is a Scottish artist known for his conceptual and installation art, often exploring themes of memory, time, and identity. His work frequently involves video installations and projections, using light and shadow to create immersive experiences that challenge viewers' perceptions.","observation":"The style is cinematic and highly realistic, using dark gallery-like spaces, dramatic spot lighting, deep shadows, and strong reflections. Surreal installations and impossible physical situations are rendered with meticulous photographic detail, while internal light sources such as flames and projections create glowing focal points. композиitional framing often isolates figures or objects as theatrical installations against near-black surroundings."},{"id":"elizabeth-catlett","name":"Elizabeth Catlett","cat":"printmakers","en":"Elizabeth Catlett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elizabeth-catlett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elizabeth-catlett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","expressive","illustrative","ornate","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","ink"],"colours":["black","bone-white","charcoal","brown","orange","beige"],"intro":"Elizabeth Catlett is a renowned American and Mexican artist known for her powerful sculptures and prints that explore themes of social justice and African American identity. Her work often reflects her commitment to civil rights and her deep connection to her cultural heritage.","observation":"Across all four images, close-up faces are rendered as stark black-and-cream graphic portraits, with carved-looking fine lines, crosshatching, and dense inked shadows. Strong silhouettes, patterned clothing, radiating or vertical marks, and emphatic facial features create a bold, expressive print-like style."},{"id":"auguste-rodin","name":"Auguste Rodin","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Auguste Rodin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/auguste-rodin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/auguste-rodin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","metallic","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["bone-white","black","white","grey","brown","beige"],"intro":"Auguste Rodin was a pioneering French sculptor known for his expressive and detailed works that marked a departure from the traditional academic style. His most famous pieces, such as \"The Thinker\" and \"The Kiss,\" showcase his ability to convey complex human emotions and physicality through dynamic and textured forms. Rodin's work is often associated with the late 19th and early 20th centuries, reflecting the cultural and artistic shifts of his time.","observation":"The style presents expressive, realistically modeled figurative sculptures with visibly rough, built-up surfaces and strong anatomical volume. Dark bronze or metallic patinas, restrained warm neutrals, museum pedestals, and soft directional gallery lighting unify the four views."},{"id":"eric-gill","name":"Eric Gill","cat":"printmakers","en":"Eric Gill","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eric-gill.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eric-gill","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","floral","patterns","portraits","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["beige","light-orange","silver","black","brown"],"intro":"Eric Gill was a British sculptor, typeface designer, and printmaker known for his work in the early 20th century. His contributions to typography and sculpture have had a lasting impact on the arts, with notable works in both religious and secular contexts. Gill's style often reflects a blend of classical and modernist influences, characterized by clean lines and a strong sense of form.","observation":"Across all four renders, faces and botanical forms are presented as solid carved reliefs with weight, layered depth, and visible granular stone surfaces. Angular planes, simplified contours, earth-toned or nearly monochrome palettes, and strong directional shadows create a geometric, monumental look."},{"id":"harry-benson","name":"Harry Benson","cat":"photographers","en":"Harry Benson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harry-benson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harry-benson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Harry Benson is a renowned Scottish photographer known for his work in photojournalism and portrait photography. He gained fame for capturing intimate and iconic moments of celebrities, politicians, and significant historical events. Benson's work is characterized by its ability to convey emotion and narrative, often providing a personal glimpse into the lives of his subjects.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photography with deep shadows, bright highlights, visible grain, and selective focus. Candid portraits and informal group scenes are framed with dramatic cropping and layered foregrounds, creating a gritty, filmic backstage atmosphere with a retro sensibility."},{"id":"frederick-arthur-bridgman","name":"Frederick Arthur Bridgman","cat":"painters","en":"Frederick Arthur Bridgman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederick-arthur-bridgman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederick-arthur-bridgman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","pale-orange","dark-red","brown"],"intro":"Frederick Arthur Bridgman was an American artist known for his detailed and romantic depictions of North African and Middle Eastern scenes. Born in 1847, Bridgman was a prominent figure in the Orientalist movement, capturing the exotic allure of distant cultures through his paintings. His works often featured elaborate architectural settings and richly dressed figures, reflecting a fascination with the cultural and historical aspects of the regions he portrayed.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly textured brushwork models expressive faces, fabrics, jewelry, and headdresses with a strongly painterly surface. Warm reds, blues, ochres, and deep browns create dramatic tonal depth, while tightly framed portraits emphasize ornate clothing and visible cultural adornment."},{"id":"thomas-chippendale","name":"Thomas Chippendale","cat":"designers","en":"Thomas Chippendale","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-chippendale.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-chippendale","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","floral","patterns","still-life","subdued-colors","classical","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","grey","charcoal","black","silver","dark-brown"],"intro":"Thomas Chippendale was an influential English cabinetmaker and furniture designer in the 18th century. Known for his innovative and elegant designs, Chippendale's work combined elements of Gothic, Rococo , and Chinese styles, creating a unique and enduring aesthetic. His book, \"The Gentleman and Cabinet-Maker's Director,\" published in 1754, became a significant reference for furniture makers and designers, solidifying his legacy in the world of decorative arts.","observation":"The style presents highly crafted furniture as formal, symmetrical still lifes, combining curved silhouettes, carved relief, gilded ornament, and densely populated botanical decoration. Muted blue-green, brown, and cream surfaces unify the pieces, while illustrative floral and bird imagery contrasts with the dimensional wood carving and metallic accents."},{"id":"peter-behrens","name":"Peter Behrens","cat":"architects","en":"Peter Behrens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-behrens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-behrens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","urban","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","retro","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","black","dark-green","beige","white"],"intro":"Peter Behrens was a German architect and designer, known for his influential role in the development of modern architecture and industrial design. He was a key figure in the early 20th-century design movement, contributing to the evolution of the Bauhaus and modernist aesthetics. Behrens's work is characterized by a blend of functionality and artistic expression, often incorporating geometric forms and innovative use of materials.","observation":"The style presents grand architectural interiors and exteriors with realistic, highly detailed materials, especially brick, glazed tile, metal, and patterned flooring. Strong axial symmetry, repeated geometric window grids, monumental arches, and cinematic low warm lighting create a restrained, atmospheric, historically styled grandeur."},{"id":"andre-charles-boulle","name":"Andre-Charles Boulle","cat":"designers","en":"Andre-Charles Boulle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andre-charles-boulle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andre-charles-boulle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","floral","patterns","still-life","metallic","subdued-colors","symmetry"],"colours":["grey","black","white","brown","ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Andre-Charles Boulle was a renowned French cabinetmaker and designer, celebrated for his mastery in marquetry and inlay techniques during the late 17th and early 18th centuries. Known for his innovative use of materials such as brass, tortoiseshell, and pewter, Boulle's work epitomizes the opulent style of the Louis XIV era, often featuring intricate designs and luxurious finishes.","observation":"The style presents highly ornate black lacquer furniture with dense floral inlay, elaborate scrollwork, sculpted gilded mounts, and strongly curved legs. Restrained black, red, and gold colors create a luxurious, high-detail appearance, while the clean studio staging and frontal views keep the objects legible and product-like."},{"id":"emil-alzamora","name":"Emil Alzamora","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Emil Alzamora","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emil-alzamora.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emil-alzamora","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","portraits","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","bone-white"],"intro":"Emil Alzamora is a contemporary sculptor known for his exploration of the human form and emotional expression through minimalist and abstract techniques. His works often delve into themes of introspection and the human condition, using elongated and simplified forms to convey complex emotions.","observation":"The style presents highly dimensional, pale stone-like human sculptures with carefully modelled anatomy and abundant drapery, often obscuring the face. Neutral studio settings, restrained color, soft directional lighting, and generous negative space give the compositions a gallery-like calm, while the contorted poses and concealed identities create an uncanny, surreal mood."},{"id":"sam-francis","name":"Sam Francis","cat":"painters","en":"Sam Francis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sam-francis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sam-francis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["white","dark-blue","vivid-orange","muted-blue","orange","dark-green","green","magenta"],"intro":"Sam Francis is an influential American painter known for his vibrant and expressive abstract works. Emerging in the mid-20th century, he became a prominent figure in the abstract expressionist movement, celebrated for his use of color and dynamic compositions. His work often features bold, sweeping gestures and a keen sense of spontaneity, which has left a lasting impact on modern art.","observation":"Across all four renders, vivid painted masses, drips, splashes, and thin gestural marks build energetic nonrepresentational compositions on predominantly white grounds. Broad strokes and scattered droplets create a strongly expressive sense of motion, with recurring saturated blues, reds, oranges, greens, and blacks."},{"id":"david-walker","name":"David Walker","cat":"street-artists","en":"David Walker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-walker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-walker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","beige","charcoal","red","white","dark-blue"],"intro":"David Walker is a contemporary British street artist known for his vibrant and expressive portraits created using spray paint. His work often features close-up depictions of faces, capturing intense emotions and dynamic expressions. Walker's technique involves layering colors and textures to create depth and movement, resulting in striking and detailed compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental close-up portraits cover urban brick façades in saturated reds, blues, oranges, and yellows. Realistic facial features remain legible beneath energetic, overlapping brushstrokes, scraped-looking marks, and strong linear accents, creating an expressive mural style integrated with the surrounding streetscape."},{"id":"sanford-robinson-gifford","name":"Sanford Robinson Gifford","cat":"painters","en":"Sanford Robinson Gifford","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sanford-robinson-gifford.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sanford-robinson-gifford","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","epic"],"colours":["black","silver","brown","bone-white","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Sanford Robinson Gifford was a prominent American landscape painter associated with the Hudson River School and Luminism. Born in 1823, he was known for his ability to capture light and atmosphere in his works, often depicting serene and expansive natural scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental lakeside mountain landscapes with towering rock formations, small boats, and layered atmospheric distance. Visible brush texture, softened edges, warm sunset illumination, reflective water, and mist create a richly painted, dreamlike epic mood."},{"id":"lee-jae-hyo","name":"Lee Jae-Hyo","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Lee Jae-Hyo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-jae-hyo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-jae-hyo","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","patterns","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","geometric"],"colours":["beige","brown","black","grey","charcoal","white"],"intro":"Lee Jae-Hyo is a South Korean sculptor known for his innovative use of natural materials, particularly wood and metal, to create large-scale installations and sculptures. His work often explores the relationship between nature and art, emphasizing organic forms and textures. Lee's sculptures are renowned for their intricate craftsmanship and the way they transform raw materials into striking visual experiences.","observation":"The style presents monumental, biomorphic gallery installations rendered with realistic spatial depth and strong black-and-white contrast. Dense perforated and cellular surfaces, glossy dark materials, and repeated organic patterns create an ornate, highly detailed sculptural effect, with small human figures and patterned clothing establishing scale."},{"id":"silvestro-lega","name":"Silvestro Lega","cat":"painters","en":"Silvestro Lega","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/silvestro-lega.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/silvestro-lega","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","silver","muted-blue","ochre","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Silvestro Lega was an Italian painter and a prominent member of the Macchiaioli movement, which was a precursor to Impressionism. Born in 1826, Lega is known for his realistic and detailed depictions of rural and domestic life in 19th-century Italy. His works often capture the serene and contemplative aspects of everyday scenes, characterized by a focus on natural light and a subdued color palette.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, richly observed oil-paint handling with visible fine brushwork, textured surfaces, and carefully modelled figures, clothing, foliage, and architecture. Sunlit outdoor settings combine elegant period dress and quiet human activity with expansive Mediterranean-like landscapes, using restrained natural colours and detailed atmospheric scenery."},{"id":"roland-topor","name":"Roland Topor","cat":"illustrators","en":"Roland Topor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roland-topor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roland-topor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink"],"colours":["black","white","grey","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Roland Topor is a French illustrator, writer, and filmmaker known for his surreal and satirical works. He was a prominent figure in the European avant-garde movement and contributed significantly to the fields of illustration and animation. Topor's unique style often explores themes of absurdity and the human psyche, blending dark humor with intricate detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark black-and-white portrait imagery combines finely ruled ink lines, crosshatching, stippling, and grain with highly distorted facial anatomy. Formal figures and profile heads are transformed by surreal insertions⁠—extra eyes, embedded crowds, and landscapes⁠—while strong light-dark separation gives the illustrative compositions an engraved, unsettling intensity."},{"id":"giorgio-vasari","name":"Giorgio Vasari","cat":"painters","en":"Giorgio Vasari","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giorgio-vasari.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giorgio-vasari","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","dark-red","red"],"intro":"Giorgio Vasari was an Italian painter, architect, and writer, known for his biographies of Renaissance artists. Born in 1511, Vasari is often credited with coining the term \" Renaissance \" and is remembered for his contributions to art history through his book \"Lives of the Most Excellent Painters, Sculptors, and Architects.\" His own artistic work is characterized by its Mannerist style, featuring elongated figures and complex compositions.","observation":"The style uses richly layered oil-paint textures, fine directional brushwork, and highly modeled faces, hair, beards, and fabric. Deep shadowed backgrounds contrast with warm flesh and red garments, while expressive gestures and tightly cropped groupings create a solemn, devotional atmosphere."},{"id":"gustave-moreau","name":"Gustave Moreau","cat":"painters","en":"Gustave Moreau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustave-moreau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustave-moreau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","bone-white","ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Gustave Moreau was a French Symbolist painter known for his intricate and imaginative works that often depicted mythological and biblical themes. Born in 1826, Moreau's art is characterized by its rich detail, vibrant color palette, and a dreamlike quality that blends fantasy with reality. His paintings are celebrated for their elaborate compositions and the use of symbolism to convey deeper meanings.","observation":"Across the four images, richly textured paint and visible fine brushwork create dramatic architectural and landscape scenes, with dense detail and expressive, atmospheric strokes. Deep blue-black shadows contrast with luminous sky, fire, halos, and reflected light, producing a dark, epic fantasy mood."},{"id":"roman-polanski","name":"Roman Polanski","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Roman Polanski","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roman-polanski.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roman-polanski","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["vivid-red","brown","bone-white","black","orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Roman Polanski is a renowned filmmaker known for his work in psychological thrillers and dramas. Born in 1933 in Paris, he has directed numerous acclaimed films, including 'Rosemary's Baby' and 'Chinatown.' His work is often characterized by its exploration of dark and complex themes, reflecting his own tumultuous life experiences.","observation":"Across all four images, tightly cropped faces are rendered with forceful, visible paint strokes, scraped texture, and graphic drawn marks. A recurring red, navy, black, and cream palette, strong light-dark separation, cropped framing, and poster-like geometric blocks give the portraits an expressive retro editorial character."},{"id":"david-nash","name":"David Nash","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"David Nash","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-nash.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-nash","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","minimalist","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","white","dark-brown","muted-ochre","dark-olive","black"],"intro":"David Nash is a British sculptor known for his work with natural materials, particularly wood. His sculptures often explore themes of nature and transformation, and he is recognized for his environmental art that interacts with the landscape. Nash's work is characterized by its organic forms and the use of sustainable materials, reflecting a deep connection with the natural world.","observation":"The style presents monumental, rough-hewn wooden forms as carefully arranged sculptural objects, rendered with realistic volume, visible grain, tool marks, and substantial weight. Restrained earth tones, bright gallery spaces, sparse compositions, and generous negative space create a minimalist, contemplative presentation across both indoor and outdoor settings."},{"id":"emily-carr","name":"Emily Carr","cat":"painters","en":"Emily Carr","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emily-carr.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emily-carr","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-green","dark-olive","muted-olive","dark-cyan","pale-yellow"],"intro":"Emily Carr was a Canadian artist and writer known for her paintings of Indigenous peoples and landscapes of the Pacific Northwest. She was a key figure in Canadian modernism and is celebrated for her unique style that blends post-impressionism with the cultural influences of First Nations art.","observation":"The style uses dense, visibly built-up brushwork and broad, curling strokes to turn trees, mountains, sky, and undergrowth into rhythmic, undulating forms. Deep blue-greens and earthy browns dominate, with subdued warm openings and atmospheric light creating an expressive, dreamlike forest landscape."},{"id":"sean-scully","name":"Sean Scully","cat":"painters","en":"Sean Scully","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sean-scully.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sean-scully","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","charcoal","dark-red","bone-white","grey","vivid-orange"],"intro":"Sean Scully is an Irish-born American artist known for his contributions to contemporary abstract painting. His work is characterized by bold, geometric forms and a distinctive use of color and texture. Scully's paintings often explore the interplay between structure and emotion, drawing inspiration from both modernist and minimalist traditions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses abstract geometric arrangements of rectangular color fields in layered grids, bands, and vertical panels. Saturated earthy hues contrast with deep blue-black areas, while visible broad brushwork, uneven edges, and coarse surface texture keep the rigid geometry tactile and handmade."},{"id":"claes-oldenburg","name":"Claes Oldenburg","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Claes Oldenburg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/claes-oldenburg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/claes-oldenburg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["blue","charcoal","deep-red","dark-ochre","muted-blue","light-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Claes Oldenburg is a renowned American sculptor known for his innovative and humorous public art installations. Born in 1929, Oldenburg became a leading figure in the Pop Art movement, creating large-scale sculptures of everyday objects that challenge perceptions of scale and material. His works often incorporate elements of consumer culture and mass production, reflecting the societal shifts of the 1960s and beyond.","observation":"The style presents monumental abstract sculptures as convincingly photographed public artworks, with solid dimensional forms, visible surface folds, and strong sunlight. Saturated red, white, and green forms contrast with blue skies, landscaped grounds, and crisp modern architecture in carefully framed urban settings."},{"id":"frits-thaulow","name":"Frits Thaulow","cat":"painters","en":"Frits Thaulow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frits-thaulow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frits-thaulow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","urban","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","ochre"],"intro":"Frits Thaulow was a Norwegian Impressionist painter known for his naturalistic depictions of landscapes and urban scenes. Born in 1847, Thaulow's work is celebrated for its detailed and atmospheric portrayal of water and light, often capturing the serene beauty of rural and urban settings in Norway and France.","observation":"The style combines richly textured, painterly rendering with subdued, moody twilight colors and fine visible brushwork. Quiet canal-side settlements are densely detailed with bare trees, old masonry, glowing windows, lamps, and elongated reflections, while mist and strong warm-cool contrast create a dark atmospheric mood."},{"id":"constantin-brancusi","name":"Constantin Brancusi","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Constantin Brancusi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/constantin-brancusi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/constantin-brancusi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["minimalist","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","white","brown","silver"],"intro":"Constantin Brancusi was a Romanian sculptor known for his pioneering work in modern sculpture. Born in 1876, he became a leading figure in the modern art movement, celebrated for his abstract and minimalist approach. Brancusi's work often focused on the essence of form, stripping away unnecessary details to reveal the purity of shapes. His influence extended beyond sculpture, impacting various art forms and movements throughout the 20th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents carefully balanced stone sculptures as minimalist still lifes, with geometric and organic forms staged against spacious, quiet backgrounds. Realistic marble and stone textures, restrained beige and gray colors, soft directional daylight, and strong axial balance give the images a calm gallery-like presence."},{"id":"jack-whitten","name":"Jack Whitten","cat":"painters","en":"Jack Whitten","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jack-whitten.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jack-whitten","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","white","beige","dark-brown","ochre","deep-blue"],"intro":"Jack Whitten was an influential American artist known for his innovative approaches to painting and sculpture. Born in 1939, Whitten's work often explored themes of identity, memory, and history, and he was recognized for his experimental techniques that pushed the boundaries of traditional art forms. His contributions to abstract art and his unique methods of layering and texturing have left a lasting impact on contemporary art.","observation":"Across all four works, the style is vigorously abstract and painterly, built from visible scraping, splattering, dragging, and layered pigment. Strong dark masses and saturated orange, red, blue, teal, and yellow accents create high-contrast compositions organized by grids, radiating marks, and forceful directional strokes."},{"id":"romare-bearden","name":"Romare Bearden","cat":"various-artists","en":"Romare Bearden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/romare-bearden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/romare-bearden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","patterns","flat-color","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","vivid-red","dark-brown","deep-blue","green","light-orange"],"intro":"Romare Bearden was an influential African American artist known for his vibrant collages and depictions of African American life and culture. His work often explored themes of community, music, and identity, drawing inspiration from the Harlem Renaissance and the civil rights movement. Bearden's art is celebrated for its innovative use of collage and its ability to convey complex narratives through layered imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and musicians are assembled from vivid geometric blocks, layered paper-like fragments, and sharply cropped shapes. The style combines flat color and visible collage texture with expressive poses, patterned clothing, hats, and musical instruments, producing dense, energetic compositions."},{"id":"graciela-iturbide","name":"Graciela Iturbide","cat":"photographers","en":"Graciela Iturbide","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/graciela-iturbide.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/graciela-iturbide","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["white","grey","silver","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Graciela Iturbide is a renowned Mexican photographer known for her evocative black and white images that explore Mexican culture and identity. Her work often captures the intersection of tradition and modernity, focusing on indigenous communities and the everyday life of Mexican people.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark monochrome photography combines wide desert landscapes with isolated, uncanny figures and recurring birds. Deep shadows, bright skies, weathered textures, and theatrical arrangements create a cinematic yet surreal, ominous dreamscape."},{"id":"john-nash","name":"John Nash","cat":"painters","en":"John Nash","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-nash.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-nash","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","brown","pale-orange","muted-ochre","muted-blue","rust","vivid-orange"],"intro":"John Nash is a renowned British painter known for his landscape paintings and contributions to the Neo-Romantic movement. His works often depict the British countryside with a focus on natural beauty and emotional depth, capturing the essence of the landscapes with a unique blend of realism and romanticism.","observation":"Across the sheet, representational scenes are built from visible, directional paint strokes, simplified angular forms, and finely controlled linework. The palette is restrained and earthy, with deep shadows set against pale skies and strongly contrasted terracotta, cream, blue, and green passages; recurring architecture, landscapes, crowds, and monumental geometric structures give the style a composed yet dramatic narrative quality."},{"id":"georg-jensen","name":"Georg Jensen","cat":"designers","en":"Georg Jensen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georg-jensen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georg-jensen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","bw-monochrome","metallic","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","grey","beige","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Georg Jensen was a Danish silversmith and designer renowned for his innovative and elegant designs in silverware and jewelry. Born in 1866, Jensen's work is celebrated for its blend of functionality and artistic beauty, often incorporating organic forms and clean lines that reflect the principles of Scandinavian design.","observation":"Across all four renders, highly polished silver objects are presented as realistic sculptural still lifes, with flowing organic contours and carefully resolved reflective surfaces. The restrained monochrome setting, spacious neutral backgrounds, and soft directional studio lighting emphasize the objects’ silhouettes, volume, and metallic highlights."},{"id":"anthea-hamilton","name":"Anthea Hamilton","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Anthea Hamilton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anthea-hamilton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anthea-hamilton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","silver","brown","black","ochre"],"intro":"Anthea Hamilton is a contemporary British artist known for her innovative and playful approach to sculpture and installation art. Her work often explores themes of identity, space, and the human experience, utilizing a variety of materials and techniques to create immersive environments that challenge conventional perceptions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines gallery-like figurative scenes with heavily worked, painterly surfaces and fragmented silhouettes. Broad gestural marks, scraped or broken edges, restrained earth tones with occasional ochre or navy accents, and strong dark⁠–light contrasts create a curated yet surreal atmosphere."},{"id":"janet-hill","name":"Janet Hill","cat":"painters","en":"Janet Hill","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/janet-hill.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/janet-hill","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","painterly","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["muted-green","muted-yellow","dark-olive","red","deep-rust","ochre"],"intro":"Janet Hill is a Canadian artist known for her whimsical and nostalgic paintings that often feature feminine subjects and vintage elements. Her work is characterized by a romantic and dreamy quality, capturing intimate moments with a sense of timeless elegance.","observation":"Visible brushwork and layered, textured paint give the interiors, clothing, flowers, and faces a richly hand-painted surface. The style combines saturated coral, pink, and green with densely decorated domestic settings, glamorous fashion, and staged character scenes in a nostalgic retro idiom."},{"id":"liam-gillick","name":"Liam Gillick","cat":"various-artists","en":"Liam Gillick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/liam-gillick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/liam-gillick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","sculptural","characters","urban","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["silver","beige","brown","deep-red","ochre","charcoal","deep-green","deep-blue"],"intro":"Liam Gillick is a British artist known for his conceptual and minimalist approach to art. He explores the intersection of art, architecture, and design, often creating installations that challenge conventional perceptions of space and structure. His work frequently involves the use of industrial materials and vivid colors, contributing to a distinctive visual language that engages viewers in a dialogue about contemporary society and aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents monumental geometric installations in realistic, spacious exhibition interiors, using saturated primary colors and strong linear perspective. Repeated beams, frames, columns, and suspended forms create bold architectural rhythms, while polished floors, skylights, and tiny human figures establish scale and depth."},{"id":"thota-vaikuntam","name":"Thota Vaikuntam","cat":"painters","en":"Thota Vaikuntam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thota-vaikuntam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thota-vaikuntam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","ethnic-poc","floral","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","dark-olive","dark-rust","light-orange","dark-blue","deep-blue"],"intro":"Thota Vaikuntam is an Indian painter known for his vibrant depictions of rural life and traditional Indian culture, particularly focusing on the people and festivals of Telangana. His work is characterized by bold colors, intricate patterns, and a distinctive style that captures the essence of Indian village life.","observation":"Across all four renders, stylized figures are built from clean, heavy contours, flat color blocks, and dense ornamental patterning. Saturated reds, oranges, greens, blues, and golds intensify the graphic compositions, while elaborate clothing, jewelry, botanical forms, and cultural motifs create a richly decorative surface."},{"id":"len-lye","name":"Len Lye","cat":"various-artists","en":"Len Lye","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/len-lye.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/len-lye","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","sculptural","glow","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","charcoal","red","deep-blue","magenta"],"intro":"Len Lye was a pioneering New Zealand-born artist known for his innovative work in film and kinetic sculpture. He is celebrated for his experimental techniques and contributions to the avant-garde movement, particularly in the mid-20th century. Lye's work often explored movement and rhythm, creating dynamic visual experiences that challenged traditional artistic boundaries.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style turns concentric circular forms into monumental, abstract sculptural installations, using radial symmetry, deep shadow, and carefully isolated negative space. Long-exposure-like light trails and luminous red, blue, white, and amber accents create a kinetic, surreal atmosphere with strong geometric structure and high contrast."},{"id":"natalia-goncharova","name":"Natalia Goncharova","cat":"painters","en":"Natalia Goncharova","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/natalia-goncharova.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/natalia-goncharova","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","religious","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","red","pale-yellow","orange","dark-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Natalia Goncharova was a Russian avant-garde artist and a key figure in the development of modern art in Russia. She was known for her innovative approach, blending elements of Russian folk art with modernist styles such as cubism and futurism. Her work often featured vibrant colors, dynamic compositions, and a unique synthesis of traditional and contemporary themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines vivid, highly saturated color with visible broad paint strokes and angular, graphic drawing. Dense floral ornament, stylized figures, patterned clothing, and small architectural or mythical details fill the compositions, producing an elaborate, decorative fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"giovanni-battista-venanzi","name":"Giovanni Battista Venanzi","cat":"painters","en":"Giovanni Battista Venanzi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giovanni-battista-venanzi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giovanni-battista-venanzi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","dark-brown","muted-orange","dark-red"],"intro":"Giovanni Battista Venanzi was an Italian painter known for his contributions to the Baroque period. His works often featured religious and historical themes, characterized by dramatic lighting and intricate detail. Venanzi's style was influenced by the grandeur and emotion typical of Baroque art, with a focus on dynamic compositions and vivid storytelling.","observation":"The style uses richly modelled, visibly painted surfaces with fine brushwork, dense facial and fabric detail, and strongly expressive poses and expressions. Warm flesh tones and red accents emerge from subdued brown-black surroundings under dramatic light, giving the repeated portraits and scenes a grave, theatrical character."},{"id":"peder-balke","name":"Peder Balke","cat":"painters","en":"Peder Balke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peder-balke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peder-balke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","orange"],"intro":"Peder Balke was a Norwegian painter known for his dramatic and atmospheric landscapes, particularly of the Nordic coastlines. Born in 1804, Balke's work is characterized by its romantic and sublime qualities, capturing the raw beauty and power of nature. His paintings often depict stormy seas, rugged cliffs, and vast skies, reflecting the dramatic landscapes of Norway.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a dark, richly textured maritime fantasy built from monumental cliffs, cavernous shorelines, and small sailing vessels or figures. Subdued earth-and-charcoal colors are punctuated by intense internal light from fire, moon, sun, and bright openings, with mist, reflective water, and dramatic scale creating a cinematic, epic atmosphere."},{"id":"heinz-mack","name":"Heinz Mack","cat":"various-artists","en":"Heinz Mack","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/heinz-mack.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/heinz-mack","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","patterns","glow","motion","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","deep-red","vivid-red","dark-blue"],"intro":"Heinz Mack is a German artist known for his contributions to the Zero movement, which emphasized light, structure, and space in art. His work often explores the interplay of light and materials, creating dynamic and reflective surfaces that challenge perceptions of space and form.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses geometric abstract compositions built from dense grids, slats, dots, and radiating lines that create strong optical and kinetic effects. Saturated red, blue, white, and black fields combine with internal luminous glow and stark contrast, producing an immersive, futuristic, slightly surreal gallery-installation aesthetic."},{"id":"william-henry-margetson","name":"William Henry Margetson","cat":"painters","en":"William Henry Margetson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-henry-margetson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-henry-margetson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","retro"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"William Henry Margetson was an English painter and illustrator known for his portraits and genre scenes, particularly of women. He was active during the late 19th and early 20th centuries, and his work often featured elegant compositions and a soft, romantic style. Margetson's paintings are characterized by their detailed depiction of fabrics and delicate use of color, capturing the grace and beauty of his subjects.","observation":"Across the sheet, the images use richly visible oil-paint brushwork, layered textures, and finely observed fabrics, foliage, faces, and interiors. Warm muted colors are punctuated by strong sunlight and deep shadow, creating intimate domestic scenes with period clothing, flowers, books, and architectural details."},{"id":"ray-eames","name":"Ray Eames","cat":"designers","en":"Ray Eames","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ray-eames.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ray-eames","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["silver","white","brown","beige","deep-red","ochre"],"intro":"Ray Eames was an influential American designer and artist, renowned for her groundbreaking work in furniture design, architecture, and industrial design. Alongside her husband, Charles Eames , she played a pivotal role in shaping mid-century modern design, characterized by its clean lines, innovative use of materials, and functional elegance. Their collaborative efforts produced iconic pieces such as the Eames Lounge Chair and the Eames Molded Plywood Chair, which remain celebrated for their timeless appeal and ergonomic sophistication.","observation":"The style presents carefully staged furniture and sculptural objects as realistic studio still lifes, combining warm wood, saturated red and orange upholstery, and graphic geometric forms. Clean product-like lighting, strong silhouettes, visible material texture, and spacious neutral backdrops give the renders a polished yet tactile design-showroom appearance."},{"id":"agostino-iacurci","name":"Agostino Iacurci","cat":"street-artists","en":"Agostino Iacurci","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/agostino-iacurci.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/agostino-iacurci","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","illustrative","characters","landscapes","flat-color","grain","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","vivid-red","pale-orange","dark-green","dark-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"Agostino Iacurci is an Italian artist known for his large-scale murals and vibrant street art. His work often features bold colors, geometric shapes, and playful imagery that transform urban environments into whimsical landscapes. Iacurci's art is celebrated for its ability to engage public spaces and create a dialogue with the community.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses graphic, angular shapes, bold outlines, flat color fields, and strongly contrasting red, black, cream, green, and blue. Sparse figures and faces are integrated with surreal landscapes and oversized botanical or geometric forms, while a consistent fine grain gives the clean poster-like surfaces a tactile printed texture."},{"id":"aron-demetz","name":"Aron Demetz","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Aron Demetz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aron-demetz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aron-demetz","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","black","muted-ochre","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Aron Demetz is an Italian sculptor known for his evocative wooden sculptures that explore the human condition. His work often features figures with textured, cracked surfaces, symbolizing themes of decay and regeneration. Demetz's sculptures are recognized for their expressive detail and the use of natural materials, reflecting a deep connection to nature and existential themes.","observation":"The style presents realistic, sculptural human figures assembled from layered bark, paper, and fibrous strips, with extremely tactile surfaces and finely resolved material detail. Restrained earth tones, warm directional light, museum-like architectural settings, selective focus, and unsettlingly fragmented anatomy create a surreal, cinematic portrait language."},{"id":"jannis-kounellis","name":"Jannis Kounellis","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jannis Kounellis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jannis-kounellis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jannis-kounellis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","white","black","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"Jannis Kounellis is a Greek-Italian artist known for his influential role in the Arte Povera movement, which emerged in Italy during the late 1960s. His work often incorporates everyday materials and found objects, challenging traditional notions of art and exploring themes of industrialization and materiality. Kounellis's art is characterized by its use of raw materials, such as coal, iron, and burlap, to create installations that engage with space and provoke contemplation.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents a realistic, carefully composed gallery installation in restrained earth, charcoal, and ivory tones. Weathered architectural surfaces, heavy garments, wood, rope, metal, and strong geometric spacing create a sculptural, somber atmosphere with abundant architectural negative space."},{"id":"yves-tanguy","name":"Yves Tanguy","cat":"painters","en":"Yves Tanguy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yves-tanguy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yves-tanguy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["grey","silver","orange","brown","rust"],"intro":"Yves Tanguy was a French surrealist painter known for his imaginative landscapes filled with abstract forms and dreamlike qualities. His work often features organic shapes and a unique sense of depth, creating an otherworldly atmosphere that has influenced many artists within the surrealist movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visibly brushed, layered paint with delicate linear marks and densely populated surreal landscapes. Pale blue-grey skies, cream and ochre terrain, floating or spindly structures, and isolated red accents create a restrained, dreamlike atmosphere, while biomorphic forms and improbable suspended objects make the scenes feel fantastical."},{"id":"chris-burden","name":"Chris Burden","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Chris Burden","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-burden.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-burden","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","subdued-colors","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["silver","muted-brown","beige","grey","brown","white"],"intro":"Chris Burden was an American artist known for his performance, sculpture, and installation art. His work often explored themes of power, control, and the human condition, pushing the boundaries of artistic expression. Burden's pieces were characterized by their conceptual depth and often provocative nature, making significant contributions to the contemporary art scene.","observation":"The style presents monumental mechanical installations and aircraft in vast, pristine gallery or hangar spaces, rendered with highly realistic photographic detail. Subdued industrial colors, strong geometric structures, polished floors, and dramatic scale create a cinematic, futuristic atmosphere."},{"id":"willem-claesz-heda","name":"Willem Claesz. Heda","cat":"painters","en":"Willem Claesz. Heda","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/willem-claesz-heda.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/willem-claesz-heda","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"Willem Claesz. Heda was a Dutch Golden Age painter known for his still life works, particularly those that explore themes of vanitas and the transience of life. His paintings are characterized by their meticulous detail, use of chiaroscuro, and a subdued color palette that often features earth tones and muted hues. Heda's compositions typically include everyday objects arranged on a tabletop, inviting viewers to reflect on the fleeting nature of material possessions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents densely arranged still lifes of glass, silver, textiles, fruit, and elaborate tableware with highly realistic modelling and abundant surface detail. A restrained brown-black palette, reflective materials, deep shadows, and concentrated highlights create a dark, ornate, museum-like atmosphere."},{"id":"raghu-rai","name":"Raghu Rai","cat":"photographers","en":"Raghu Rai","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raghu-rai.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raghu-rai","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","scenes","mist","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Raghu Rai is an acclaimed Indian photographer known for his compelling photojournalism and documentary work. His career began in the 1960s, and he has since become a prominent figure in capturing the essence of Indian life and culture. Rai's work often focuses on social issues, spirituality, and the everyday lives of people across India. His photographs are renowned for their depth, emotion, and ability to tell powerful stories through imagery.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is stark monochrome photography with pronounced tonal contrast, visible grain, and a filmic, documentary sensibility. It favors emotionally weighty human situations in weathered environments, using mist, selective focus, dramatic light, and frozen or blurred motion to create an austere narrative atmosphere."},{"id":"marie-severin","name":"Marie Severin","cat":"illustrators","en":"Marie Severin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marie-severin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marie-severin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","bold-lines","crosshatching","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","comics","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["grey","black","white","charcoal","bone-white"],"intro":"Marie Severin was an American comic book artist and colorist, known for her work with Marvel Comics. She was celebrated for her vibrant coloring and dynamic illustrations, contributing significantly to the comic book industry during the Silver Age.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed black-and-white ink drawing with assertive contour lines, dense hatching, and heavy shadow masses. Expressive faces, exaggerated figures, crowded action, and supernatural subject matter give the compositions a dark, dramatic comic-book character."},{"id":"georges-clairin","name":"Georges Clairin","cat":"painters","en":"Georges Clairin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-clairin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-clairin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","bone-white","muted-ochre","red"],"intro":"Georges Clairin is a French painter known for his orientalist and romantic works, often depicting exotic and opulent scenes. He was active during the late 19th and early 20th centuries, contributing to the academic art movement with his detailed and expressive style. Clairin's works are characterized by their rich textures, elaborate compositions, and a fascination with Eastern themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly broad, textured paint strokes to build richly detailed, realistic figures, fabrics, architecture, and crowded public scenes. Warm earthy colors, strong light-dark modeling, ornate costume details, and dramatic close-up gazes give the images an expressive, monumental atmosphere."},{"id":"alexander-millar","name":"Alexander Millar","cat":"painters","en":"Alexander Millar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexander-millar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexander-millar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["muted-blue","black","blue","charcoal","deep-red"],"intro":"Alexander Millar is a contemporary Scottish artist known for his evocative depictions of working-class life and urban landscapes. His work often captures the essence of industrial towns, focusing on the everyday lives of ordinary people, imbued with a sense of nostalgia and emotion.","observation":"Across all four images, solitary urban figures are rendered with visible, broad, textured brushwork and strongly blocked silhouettes. Cool blue dusk, deep shadows, selective red accents, industrial structures, and glowing streetlamps create a moody, cinematic atmosphere with expressive painterly surfaces."},{"id":"mark-keathley","name":"Mark Keathley","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Keathley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-keathley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-keathley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-ochre","grey","ochre","silver","pink"],"intro":"Mark Keathley is a contemporary American painter known for his serene and idyllic landscape paintings that often depict rural and natural settings. His works are characterized by a romantic realism that captures the beauty and tranquility of the American countryside, often featuring cabins, rivers, and lush forests.","observation":"The style presents expansive, richly detailed wilderness scenes with visible painterly texture, saturated greens and warm golds, and strong atmospheric depth. Glowing low sunlight, mist, reflective water, seasonal foliage, and storybook rural details create a dreamy, grand romantic-fantasy mood across all four images."},{"id":"george-luks","name":"George Luks","cat":"painters","en":"George Luks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-luks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-luks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-brown","dark-blue","light-yellow","red"],"intro":"George Luks was an American realist painter known for his vigorous brushwork and depictions of urban life. As a member of the Ashcan School, Luks captured the vibrancy and grit of early 20th-century New York City, focusing on everyday people and scenes.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable figures and social moments are built from visible, energetic oil-paint strokes, with rugged impasto and loose edges rather than polished detail. The style relies on dark blue-green grounds, restrained ochres and reds, and strong light-dark contrasts to create an expressive, brooding atmosphere."},{"id":"karl-schmidt-rottluff","name":"Karl Schmidt-Rottluff","cat":"painters","en":"Karl Schmidt-Rottluff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/karl-schmidt-rottluff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/karl-schmidt-rottluff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","red","dark-blue","dark-teal","bone-white","orange"],"intro":"Karl Schmidt-Rottluff was a German painter and printmaker, known for his role in the Expressionist movement and as a founding member of the artist group Die Brücke. His work is characterized by bold colors, distorted forms, and emotional intensity, often exploring themes of modernity and human experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines forceful black contouring and angular simplification with visibly broad, energetic paint strokes. Saturated reds, oranges, blues, and deep greens are set against strong dark-light contrasts, depicting expressive faces, figures, landscapes, and built environments with a rough, tactile painted surface."},{"id":"titus-kaphar","name":"Titus Kaphar","cat":"painters","en":"Titus Kaphar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/titus-kaphar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/titus-kaphar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","bone-white","orange","beige","red"],"intro":"Titus Kaphar is an American contemporary artist known for his work that explores the intersection of art and history. His paintings often reimagine historical narratives, focusing on themes of race, identity, and the erasure of marginalized voices in art. Kaphar's work is characterized by its innovative use of traditional techniques, combined with modern elements to challenge and engage viewers in a dialogue about the past and present.","observation":"Across all four portraits, thick visible brushwork builds richly textured faces, garments, and fabric against dark, restrained grounds. The expressive figures are repeatedly disrupted by torn, bandage-like strips and obscured features, creating a surreal, unsettling portrait style with strong light-dark contrast."},{"id":"isaac-mizrahi","name":"Isaac Mizrahi","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Isaac Mizrahi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isaac-mizrahi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isaac-mizrahi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["pink","bone-white","white","red","dark-teal","black"],"intro":"Isaac Mizrahi is a renowned American fashion designer known for his work in high fashion and his influence on contemporary style. Born in 1961, Mizrahi has been a prominent figure in the fashion industry, celebrated for his innovative designs and vibrant use of color. He has also been a television presenter and actor, further showcasing his diverse talents.","observation":"The style combines fashion-editorial portraiture with richly painted and illustrated surfaces, using saturated pinks, greens, blacks, and floral color fields. Elaborate garments, oversized accessories, visible brushwork, and assertive outlines create a theatrical, highly decorative presentation across the varied compositions."},{"id":"lorenzo-quinn","name":"Lorenzo Quinn","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Lorenzo Quinn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lorenzo-quinn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lorenzo-quinn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","subdued-colors","classical","epic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["muted-blue","dark-brown","muted-ochre","grey","black","white","orange"],"intro":"Lorenzo Quinn is an Italian sculptor known for his expressive and symbolic works that often explore themes of human emotion and connection. His sculptures are characterized by their large scale and intricate details, often featuring human forms and hands that convey a sense of introspection and contemplation. Quinn's work is celebrated for its ability to evoke deep emotional responses and provoke thought about the human condition.","observation":"The style presents monumental hand sculptures and architectural installations as highly realistic, carefully composed scenes. Solid, weathered surfaces, reflective water, classical arches, and clear natural light create a detailed sculptural grandeur, with recurring symmetry and strong geometric framing."},{"id":"harriet-backer","name":"Harriet Backer","cat":"painters","en":"Harriet Backer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/harriet-backer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/harriet-backer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","muted-orange","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Harriet Backer was a Norwegian painter known for her detailed and intimate interior scenes, often depicting domestic life with a focus on light and atmosphere. Born in 1845, she became a prominent figure in the art world, celebrated for her ability to capture the quiet beauty of everyday moments.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly built-up, directional paint with loose yet controlled brushwork, dense interior detail, and expressive handling of faces, fabrics, furniture, and light. Dark, warm rooms are structured by strong contrasts between shadow and localized lamp or fire illumination, presenting quiet domestic activities as richly composed scenes."},{"id":"michelangelo-pistoletto","name":"Michelangelo Pistoletto","cat":"painters","en":"Michelangelo Pistoletto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michelangelo-pistoletto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michelangelo-pistoletto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","patterns","scenes","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["bone-white","muted-ochre","muted-brown","brown","white","deep-red"],"intro":"Michelangelo Pistoletto is an Italian artist known for his influential role in the Arte Povera movement. His work often explores themes of reflection, identity, and the relationship between art and the viewer. Pistoletto's art frequently incorporates mirrors and reflective surfaces, challenging perceptions and inviting introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental architectural forms assembled from densely layered discarded garments, rendered with highly realistic fabric texture and physical volume. Sunlit gallery interiors, restrained earthy colors, strong light-and-shadow contrasts, and recurring portals or archways give the textile installations a surreal yet photographic, cinematic presence."},{"id":"marsden-hartley","name":"Marsden Hartley","cat":"painters","en":"Marsden Hartley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marsden-hartley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marsden-hartley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","ornate","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["pale-orange","red","black","dark-brown","blue","dark-blue","light-orange"],"intro":"Marsden Hartley was an American modernist painter known for his bold use of color and expressive forms. Born in 1877, Hartley was a prominent figure in the early 20th-century art scene, often exploring themes of spirituality and identity through his work. His style is characterized by vibrant colors, abstract forms, and a unique blend of symbolism and expressionism, making him a key figure in American modernism.","observation":"The style uses vivid primary-like colors, heavy black contours, angular geometric shapes, and flattened areas of paint to create forceful abstract figures and objects. Visible brush marks and rough, built-up canvas texture keep the graphic compositions painterly, while repeated eyes, rays, stripes, and ornamental motifs give them an expressive surreal quality."},{"id":"roni-horn","name":"Roni Horn","cat":"various-artists","en":"Roni Horn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roni-horn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roni-horn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","urban","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["grey","muted-brown","dark-cyan","silver","muted-orange","brown"],"intro":"Roni Horn is an American visual artist known for her work in sculpture, drawing, photography, and installation art. Her pieces often explore themes of identity, perception, and the relationship between people and nature. Horn's art is characterized by its minimalist aesthetic and conceptual depth, frequently incorporating elements of repetition and variation.","observation":"The style presents monumental contemporary artworks in spacious, minimalist gallery interiors, rendered with realistic materials, lighting, and scale. It combines geometric sculptural forms and highly detailed organic imagery with restrained beige, white, and blue tones, creating a surreal but convincingly photographed exhibition atmosphere."},{"id":"martyn-turner","name":"Martyn Turner","cat":"illustrators","en":"Martyn Turner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martyn-turner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martyn-turner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","drawing","ink"],"colours":["white","grey","silver","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Martyn Turner is a renowned cartoonist and illustrator known for his satirical and political works. His illustrations often feature bold lines and a distinctive style that captures the essence of the subjects he portrays. Turner has contributed to various publications, making a significant impact in the world of editorial cartoons.","observation":"The style uses monochrome ink drawing with energetic fine contour lines, dense crosshatching, and occasional broad wash-like black areas. High contrast, stark white space, exaggerated figures, and richly described ruined or theatrical environments create an expressive, surreal graphic-narrative mood across the set."},{"id":"hans-haacke","name":"Hans Haacke","cat":"various-artists","en":"Hans Haacke","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-haacke.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-haacke","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-teal","dark-green","silver","beige","dark-brown","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Hans Haacke is a German-born artist known for his conceptual and installation art that often addresses social and political issues. His work frequently explores themes of environmentalism, institutional critique, and the relationship between art and society. Haacke's art is characterized by its use of real-world data and systems, often incorporating elements like water, plants, and air to create dynamic, interactive pieces.","observation":"Across all four renders, carefully staged museum-like installations are depicted with realistic materials, precise geometry, and abundant small structural details. The subdued teal, gray, and warm-red palette, selective illumination, reflective glass, and deep gallery shadows create a moody, cinematic atmosphere with luminous objects and spacious architectural framing."},{"id":"oscar-gustave-rejlander","name":"Oscar Gustave Rejlander","cat":"photographers","en":"Oscar Gustave Rejlander","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/oscar-gustave-rejlander.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/oscar-gustave-rejlander","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Oscar Gustave Rejlander was a pioneering Swedish photographer known for his innovative techniques in the 19th century. Often referred to as the 'father of art photography,' Rejlander was instrumental in the development of combination printing, a technique that allowed multiple negatives to be combined into a single image. His work often explored themes of morality, emotion, and the human condition, and he collaborated with notable figures such as Charles Darwin.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed, monochrome portrait tableaux with a vintage photographic surface, pronounced grain, deep shadows, and stark highlights. Classical costumes, flowers, masks, ornate interiors, and intimate groupings create a dark, theatrical, dreamlike atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"alfred-stevens","name":"Alfred Stevens","cat":"painters","en":"Alfred Stevens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfred-stevens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfred-stevens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","floral","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","dark-red","beige","red"],"intro":"Alfred Stevens was a Belgian painter known for his elegant depictions of women in domestic settings during the 19th century. He was associated with the Realism movement and often portrayed scenes of bourgeois life, capturing the fashion and interiors of the time with meticulous detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, richly painted interior scenes show elegantly dressed women surrounded by framed pictures, mirrors, furniture, and flowers. Visible directional brushwork builds the fabrics, faces, wood, and furnishings, while a restrained palette of deep reds, browns, blacks, creams, and muted floral accents creates a refined, intimate atmosphere."},{"id":"jeanne-lanvin","name":"Jeanne Lanvin","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Jeanne Lanvin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jeanne-lanvin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jeanne-lanvin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","muted-cyan","brown","dark-cyan","red"],"intro":"Jeanne Lanvin was a pioneering French fashion designer, known for founding the Lanvin fashion house in 1889. She was celebrated for her elegant and innovative designs, which often featured intricate details, luxurious fabrics, and a distinctive use of color. Lanvin's work was influential in the development of haute couture and remains a significant part of fashion history.","observation":"The style combines elegant fashion-plate illustration with softly textured, visibly painted surfaces and delicate contour work. Across the sheet, elongated figures, elaborate gowns, hats, trains, and floral or beaded details are presented in restrained, often sepia-toned compositions, with occasional saturated blue accents and theatrical dark backgrounds."},{"id":"richard-macdonald","name":"Richard MacDonald","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Richard MacDonald","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-macdonald.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-macdonald","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","motion","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","dark-brown"],"intro":"Richard MacDonald is a renowned American sculptor known for his dynamic and expressive bronze sculptures, often depicting dancers and athletes in motion. His work is celebrated for its anatomical precision and ability to capture the fluidity and grace of the human form.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental human figures are presented as highly modelled sculptures, with rough, layered surfaces and elaborate, wind-swept drapery. Earthy muted tones, deep shadows, and isolated studio-like backdrops heighten the dramatic motion and epic emotional intensity of the compositions."},{"id":"lucy-glendinning","name":"Lucy Glendinning","cat":"various-artists","en":"Lucy Glendinning","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucy-glendinning.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucy-glendinning","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","portraits","painterly","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["silver","beige","brown"],"intro":"Lucy Glendinning is a contemporary British artist known for her sculptural works that explore themes of identity and human form. Her art often combines elements of realism with surreal and fantastical aspects, creating pieces that are both thought-provoking and visually striking.","observation":"Across the four renders, pale human figures and animal-human hybrids are presented with highly tactile feathers, wool, plaster, and crumpled fabric, giving the imagery a sculptural, hand-worked presence. Soft gray-white tones, restrained lighting, close portrait framing, and uncanny fantastical pairings create a quiet, dreamlike editorial atmosphere."},{"id":"basil-gogos","name":"Basil Gogos","cat":"illustrators","en":"Basil Gogos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/basil-gogos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/basil-gogos","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","ochre","light-orange","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Basil Gogos is a renowned illustrator best known for his vivid and striking portraits of classic movie monsters. His work, primarily featured on the covers of Famous Monsters of Filmland magazine, is celebrated for its bold use of color and dramatic compositions, bringing a unique vibrancy to the horror genre.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines broad, visibly painted strokes with forceful dark contours and strongly modeled, expressive faces and bodies. Saturated but heavy colors, deep shadows, and orange-red highlights give the scenes a dramatic pulp-fantasy intensity, while dense costume, fur, weapon, and environmental detail reinforces the illustrative storytelling."},{"id":"ernest-zacharevic","name":"Ernest Zacharevic","cat":"street-artists","en":"Ernest Zacharevic","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernest-zacharevic.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernest-zacharevic","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["beige","grey","brown","muted-ochre","black","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Ernest Zacharevic is a Lithuanian artist known for his street art and murals that often incorporate elements of the surrounding environment. His work is characterized by its playful and interactive nature, often featuring children and everyday scenes that resonate with local culture and community.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, richly textured urban photography with carefully staged human vignettes embedded in weathered architecture. Muted earthy colors, strong natural daylight, cinematic framing, and subtle grain give the scenes a documentary-like sense of place, while the oversized or mural-like figures create a gently surreal effect."},{"id":"donald-judd","name":"Donald Judd","cat":"painters","en":"Donald Judd","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/donald-judd.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/donald-judd","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","sculptural","patterns","urban","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","white","dark-red","vivid-red","muted-blue"],"intro":"Donald Judd is a renowned American artist known for his significant contributions to the Minimalist movement. His work is characterized by its focus on simplicity, geometric forms, and the use of industrial materials. Judd's art often explores the relationship between space and form, emphasizing clarity and precision without the use of traditional artistic techniques.","observation":"The style presents bold geometric red structures as solid, dimensional architectural forms, often suspended or cantilevered against expansive white surfaces. Strong directional light, crisp cast shadows, saturated vermilion, and ample negative space create a graphic, surreal gallery-like language across the renders."},{"id":"carsten-holler","name":"Carsten Holler","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Carsten Holler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carsten-holler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carsten-holler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","motion","metallic","subdued-colors","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","silver","white"],"intro":"Carsten Holler is a contemporary artist known for his interactive and large-scale installations that often incorporate elements of play and public engagement. Originally trained as a scientist, Holler's work frequently explores themes of perception and experience, inviting viewers to participate in his art in unique and often playful ways.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and architecturally detailed, depicting vast interior spaces filled with monumental, interlocking metallic tubes and polished reflective surfaces. Cool neutral tones, strong structural geometry, daylight, and sweeping curves create an immersive futuristic environment with a sense of motion and engineered complexity."},{"id":"walter-quirt","name":"Walter Quirt","cat":"painters","en":"Walter Quirt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walter-quirt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walter-quirt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["charcoal","red","dark-blue","vivid-red","grey","light-orange"],"intro":"Walter Quirt was an American painter known for his involvement in surrealism and social realism during the early to mid-20th century. His work often explored themes of social justice and human psychology, characterized by a unique blend of abstraction and figurative elements. Quirt's paintings are noted for their vibrant colors, dynamic compositions, and expressive forms, contributing to the modernist movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely layered, fragmented faces and figures with saturated colors, heavy dark contours, and sharply angular shapes. Visible brush texture coexists with flat color blocks, patterned marks, and recurring eyes and mask-like features, creating an intense, expressive surreal composition."},{"id":"frederic-bazille","name":"Frederic Bazille","cat":"painters","en":"Frederic Bazille","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederic-bazille.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederic-bazille","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-blue","muted-ochre","light-orange","red"],"intro":"Frederic Bazille was a French Impressionist painter known for his contributions to the movement during the 19th century. He was a contemporary of artists like Claude Monet and Pierre-Auguste Renoir , and his work often depicted outdoor scenes and social gatherings, capturing the essence of light and color in natural settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic figures and social settings are built from visible, directional brushwork rather than clean graphic shapes. Richly patterned fabrics, foliage, flowers, furnishings, and architectural details fill the compositions, while bright outdoor light and saturated blues, greens, reds, and pinks create a lively atmosphere."},{"id":"conrad-shawcross","name":"Conrad Shawcross","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Conrad Shawcross","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/conrad-shawcross.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/conrad-shawcross","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","high-contrast","metallic","cinematic","surreal","epic","geometric"],"colours":["brown","silver","charcoal","beige","dark-brown"],"intro":"Conrad Shawcross is a contemporary British artist known for his large-scale mechanical sculptures that explore themes of science, philosophy, and geometry. His works often incorporate complex engineering and are inspired by mathematical concepts, resulting in visually striking installations that challenge perceptions of space and form.","observation":"The style presents monumental, highly detailed abstract sculptures assembled from sharp, twisting metallic ribbons, rendered with convincing reflective surfaces and solid volumetric depth. Photographic compositions place these imposing forms in grand classical interiors and civic squares, using strong daylight, architectural symmetry, and human figures to emphasize scale and drama."},{"id":"emek-golan","name":"Emek","cat":"illustrators","en":"Emek","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emek-golan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emek-golan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","drawing"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-olive","beige","brown","red","muted-blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"Emek Golan, is an American designer, illustrator and fine art painter. He was called \"The Thinking Man’s Poster Artist\" by punk-rock singer Henry Rollins while working on the album cover for A Rollins in the Wry.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines densely packed, finely outlined illustrative forms with vivid, high-contrast colors and elaborate surface patterning. It builds fantastical landscape scenes from anthropomorphic trees, faces, floating landforms, strange vehicles, and tiny figures, with crisp contours and abundant visual detail."},{"id":"annibale-carracci","name":"Annibale Carracci","cat":"painters","en":"Annibale Carracci","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/annibale-carracci.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/annibale-carracci","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","ochre","light-orange","dark-brown","dark-rust","brown"],"intro":"Annibale Carracci was an influential Italian Baroque painter, known for his dynamic compositions and realistic portrayal of figures. He played a significant role in the development of the Baroque style, blending elements of the Renaissance with new artistic innovations. Carracci's work often featured religious and mythological themes, characterized by dramatic use of light and shadow, and a keen attention to detail.","observation":"The style uses highly finished, painterly portraiture with fine visible strokes, modeled flesh, and dense facial detail. Strong light against deep shadows, warm subdued hues, dramatic foreshortening, and upward-looking expressions create an intense, devotional theatricality across the sheet."},{"id":"nacho-carbonell","name":"Nacho Carbonell","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Nacho Carbonell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nacho-carbonell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nacho-carbonell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","grey","beige","black","brown","dark-brown"],"intro":"Nacho Carbonell is a contemporary Spanish designer and artist known for his innovative and experimental approach to sculpture and furniture design. His work often explores the boundaries between art and functionality, incorporating organic forms and textures that evoke a sense of connection with nature.","observation":"The style presents strange, hand-built furniture-like sculptures as realistic gallery photographs, emphasizing their weight, rough fiber surfaces, and thin structural supports. Sparse compositions, muted earthy colors, soft natural light, and generous wall and floor space give the images a quiet, surreal installation-like atmosphere."},{"id":"roberto-burle-marx","name":"Roberto Burle Marx","cat":"various-artists","en":"Roberto Burle Marx","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roberto-burle-marx.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roberto-burle-marx","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","floral","landscapes","patterns","urban","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","dark-olive","beige","olive","bone-white","grey","rust"],"intro":"Roberto Burle Marx was a Brazilian landscape architect, artist, and environmentalist known for his modernist approach to garden design. He is celebrated for integrating native Brazilian plants into his landscapes, creating harmonious and innovative public spaces. His work combines art, architecture, and nature, influencing the development of modern landscape architecture.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, richly detailed aerial views of luxuriant tropical gardens, with dense foliage, palms, pools, and carefully manicured planting. Strong geometric and symmetrical compositions are created by sweeping black-and-white mosaic paths and sculptural landscaping, rendered in vivid natural color with cinematic sunlight and deep layered perspective."},{"id":"eustache-le-sueur","name":"Eustache Le Sueur","cat":"painters","en":"Eustache Le Sueur","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eustache-le-sueur.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eustache-le-sueur","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-brown","muted-blue","muted-orange","rust"],"intro":"Eustache Le Sueur is a renowned French Baroque painter, often referred to as one of the founders of the French Academy of Painting. He is known for his religious and mythological subjects, characterized by a refined and elegant style that reflects the influence of classical antiquity and the Italian Renaissance.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly worked oil-paint surfaces, fine brushwork, idealized faces, expressive gestures, and flowing drapery. Warm earth tones are punctuated by strong blue and orange garments, while dramatic light and shadow shape crowded narrative scenes with classical architecture, landscapes, and religious or mythological figures."},{"id":"issei-suda","name":"Issei Suda","cat":"photographers","en":"Issei Suda","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/issei-suda.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/issei-suda","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["portraits","scenes","urban","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver"],"intro":"Issei Suda was a renowned Japanese photographer known for his unique and evocative black-and-white images. His work often explored themes of everyday life, capturing the subtle and surreal moments within urban and rural settings in Japan. Suda's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey a sense of mystery and introspection, often focusing on the interplay between people and their environments.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is stark monochrome photography with deep blacks, bright highlights, visible grain, and selective focus. It combines intimate facial closeups with candid urban incidents and theatrical compositions, using motion blur, smoke, and hard contrast to create a tense, darkly cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"willem-van-der-velde","name":"Willem van der Velde","cat":"painters","en":"Willem van der Velde","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/willem-van-der-velde.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/willem-van-der-velde","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["beige","muted-blue","silver","brown","black","pale-orange"],"intro":"Willem van der Velde was a renowned Dutch marine painter from the 17th century, known for his detailed and dramatic seascapes. His works often depicted naval battles and ships, capturing the essence of the Dutch Golden Age 's maritime prowess. Van der Velde's paintings are celebrated for their realism, intricate details, and masterful use of light and shadow.","observation":"The style presents expansive maritime scenes as richly painterly, with finely rendered rigging, hulls, sails, and layered ships receding into atmospheric distance. Muted blue, ochre, and peach tones, luminous low sunlight, monumental clouds, and reflective water create a grand, nostalgic seascape with expressive tonal drama."},{"id":"edward-atkinson-hornel","name":"Edward Atkinson Hornel","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Atkinson Hornel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-atkinson-hornel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-atkinson-hornel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-ochre","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Edward Atkinson Hornel was a Scottish painter associated with the Glasgow Boys, known for his richly textured and vibrant depictions of children and nature. Born in 1864, Hornel's work often featured floral motifs and was influenced by both post-impressionism and symbolism. His paintings are characterized by their expressive use of color and texture, capturing the whimsical and romantic aspects of rural life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible layered brushwork shaping faces, fabrics, flowers, and densely decorated interiors. It favors elegant female portraits and social figures in ornate clothing, surrounded by floral abundance and subdued, earthy reds, greens, creams, and browns."},{"id":"ron-arad","name":"Ron Arad","cat":"designers","en":"Ron Arad","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ron-arad.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ron-arad","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","high-contrast","metallic","classical","geometric"],"colours":["silver","brown","white","grey","beige","deep-red"],"intro":"Ron Arad is a renowned Israeli designer and architect known for his innovative and experimental approach to furniture and product design. Born in 1951, Arad has made significant contributions to contemporary design, blending art and functionality in his creations. His works often feature bold, sculptural forms and a playful use of materials, challenging traditional design norms.","observation":"The style presents highly polished, fluid abstract sculptures as realistic studio or interior photographs, emphasizing reflective metal, lustrous red surfaces, and volumetric contours. Strong directional light, crisp cast shadows, and architectural settings give the forms a gallery-like, tactile presence while their looping geometry remains the visual focus."},{"id":"barclay-shaw","name":"Barclay Shaw","cat":"illustrators","en":"Barclay Shaw","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barclay-shaw.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barclay-shaw","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","fantasy"],"colours":["black","grey","red","dark-red","muted-orange","blue"],"intro":"Barclay Shaw is an American illustrator known for his work in science fiction and fantasy art. His illustrations often feature intricate details, imaginative landscapes, and vibrant color palettes, making them stand out in the genre. Shaw's work has been featured in numerous book covers, magazines, and art collections, contributing significantly to the visual language of speculative fiction.","observation":"The style combines richly visible, directional paintwork with densely rendered costumes, machinery, faces, and environmental details. Saturated orange, red, blue, and green passages are pushed against deep shadows, creating high-contrast, expressive character scenes with a retro-futurist science-fiction and fantasy-adventure feel."},{"id":"thomas-eakins","name":"Thomas Eakins","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Eakins","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-eakins.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-eakins","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","pale-orange","dark-brown","ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Thomas Eakins was an American realist painter, photographer, and sculptor, known for his profound influence on American art. He was born in 1844 in Philadelphia and became renowned for his dedication to capturing the human figure with anatomical precision. Eakins's work often depicted everyday life, sports, and medical scenes, reflecting his interest in both art and science.","observation":"These images use richly worked oil-paint surfaces, with visible directional brushstrokes modelling faces, fabric, hair, and flesh. Restrained brown, black, cream, and red tones are set against deep shadow, while strong directional light and close portrait cropping create an intense, somber presence across both figures and narrative scenes."},{"id":"kenny-scharf","name":"Kenny Scharf","cat":"painters","en":"Kenny Scharf","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kenny-scharf.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kenny-scharf","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","animals","characters","motion","bold-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","madness"],"colours":["blue","muted-blue","vivid-red","pink","light-lime","dark-green"],"intro":"Kenny Scharf is an American artist known for his vibrant, surrealist pop art, often featuring fantastical and cartoon-like imagery. Emerging from the New York City art scene in the 1980s, Scharf became associated with the East Village art movement alongside contemporaries like Keith Haring and Jean-Michel Basquiat. His work is characterized by a playful, psychedelic style that blends elements of pop culture, science fiction, and street art.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated colors, glossy modeled surfaces, and visible flowing paint-like strokes turn crowded biomorphic forms into a feverish abstract world. Heavy outlines, distorted faces, eyes, teeth, and animal-like fragments create relentless motion and surreal visual overload."},{"id":"bradford-young","name":"Bradford Young","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Bradford Young","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bradford-young.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bradford-young","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","muted-brown","silver","dark-rust"],"intro":"Bradford Young is an acclaimed cinematographer known for his work on films such as \"Selma\" and \"Arrival.\" He is celebrated for his distinctive visual style, characterized by natural lighting and a deep exploration of character and emotion. Young's work often emphasizes the human experience, capturing intimate moments with a rich, textured aesthetic.","observation":"The style uses realistic photographic portraiture with cinematic compositions, strong black-and-white tonal separation, and selective focus that isolates seated subjects from richly furnished interiors. Across the renders, careful posing, dramatic directional light, and art-studio settings create an intimate, contemplative editorial-documentary feel."},{"id":"tom-grummett","name":"Tom Grummett","cat":"illustrators","en":"Tom Grummett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-grummett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-grummett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","scenes","bold-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics","fantasy","drawing","ink"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-red","red","orange","muted-orange"],"intro":"Tom Grummett is a Canadian comic book artist known for his work on popular superhero titles such as \"Superman,\" \"The Adventures of Superman,\" and \"Teen Titans.\" His style is characterized by dynamic compositions, detailed line work, and a strong sense of storytelling, making him a prominent figure in the comic book industry.","observation":"The style is richly detailed comic-book illustration, combining heavy black ink contours, dense hatching, expressive faces, and strongly modeled anatomy. Saturated reds, blues, oranges, and purples are pushed against deep shadows, with dramatic poses, explosive scenery, and fantasy superhero imagery creating an intense, high-impact page-like look."},{"id":"william-james-glackens","name":"William James Glackens","cat":"painters","en":"William James Glackens","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-james-glackens.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-james-glackens","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","grey","orange","vivid-red","deep-red","dark-brown","deep-blue"],"intro":"William James Glackens was an American painter and one of the founders of the Ashcan School, known for his vibrant and lively depictions of urban life in the early 20th century. His work often captured the social dynamics and leisure activities of the time, reflecting the bustling energy of city life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, directional paint strokes to build crowded groups of fashionable figures, especially women in elaborate hats and vivid clothing. Strong reds, blues, greens, and blacks create expressive, high-contrast portraits and social scenes with dense, tactile surfaces and a classical gallery-painting atmosphere."},{"id":"abelardo-morell","name":"Abelardo Morell","cat":"photographers","en":"Abelardo Morell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abelardo-morell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abelardo-morell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","urban","glow","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","collage","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","white"],"intro":"Abelardo Morell is a Cuban-born American photographer known for his innovative use of the camera obscura technique. His work often transforms ordinary spaces into extraordinary visual experiences by projecting external scenes onto interior surfaces. Morell's photography explores themes of perception, reality, and the passage of time, often blurring the boundaries between inside and outside worlds.","observation":"The style combines stark black-and-white photography with high contrast, grain, and layered collage-like architectural imagery. Abandoned ornate interiors, urban skylines, reflections, and luminous windows create a dark, cinematic atmosphere with surreal spatial overlaps."},{"id":"zarina-hashmi","name":"Zarina Hashmi","cat":"printmakers","en":"Zarina Hashmi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zarina-hashmi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zarina-hashmi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","minimalist","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","drawing","ink","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["cream","brown","black","beige"],"intro":"Zarina Hashmi was an Indian-American artist known for her minimalist and abstract printmaking. Her work often explored themes of home, displacement, and memory, reflecting her experiences as part of the Indian diaspora. Hashmi's art is characterized by its use of geometric forms, fine lines, and a subdued color palette, often incorporating elements of Islamic and Indian architecture and design.","observation":"The style uses stark black ink marks on warm, uneven cream paper, reducing each composition to geometric repetitions, concentric structures, and dense linear fields. Strong axial or radial organization contrasts solid black areas with deliberate open space, while slight mark irregularity and deckled paper edges preserve a handmade print-like character."},{"id":"leo-villareal","name":"Leo Villareal","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Leo Villareal","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leo-villareal.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leo-villareal","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","glow","high-contrast","vivid-colors","sci-fi","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","blue","dark-blue","dark-red","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Leo Villareal is an American artist known for his innovative use of light and technology in creating immersive installations. He is celebrated for his large-scale public art projects that often incorporate LED lights and computer programming to create dynamic visual experiences. Villareal's work explores the intersection of art and technology, pushing the boundaries of traditional sculpture and installation art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental light installations in dark architectural spaces, using dense arrays of luminous points, strands, and grids to create precise geometric forms. Saturated colored illumination, strong contrast, reflections, and controlled symmetrical compositions give the scenes a futuristic, immersive exhibition quality."},{"id":"lovis-corinth","name":"Lovis Corinth","cat":"painters","en":"Lovis Corinth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lovis-corinth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lovis-corinth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","light-orange","brown","beige","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Lovis Corinth was a German painter and printmaker, known for his contributions to the Impressionist and Expressionist movements. His work often explored themes of human emotion and experience, characterized by vigorous brushwork and a bold use of color. Corinth's art evolved over time, reflecting his personal struggles and the broader cultural shifts of early 20th-century Europe.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, layered strokes, and textured highlights to build expressive portraits and partial figures. The palette is predominantly dark and restrained, with warm flesh tones and occasional red accents set against deep backgrounds and tightly cropped compositions."},{"id":"michael-thonet","name":"Michael Thonet","cat":"designers","en":"Michael Thonet","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-thonet.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-thonet","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","shallow-depth-of-field","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","brown","bone-white","beige","rust"],"intro":"Michael Thonet was a German-Austrian cabinet maker and designer, renowned for his pioneering work in bentwood furniture. Born in 1796, Thonet revolutionized furniture design with his innovative techniques, particularly in the use of steam-bent wood, which allowed for the creation of lightweight, durable, and elegantly curved pieces. His most famous creation, the No. 14 chair, became an icon of modern furniture design, widely used in cafes and homes around the world.","observation":"The style presents sculptural bentwood chairs as realistic furniture studies, with polished dark wood, visible grain, and strongly looping contours. Restrained interiors, generous negative space, selective focus, and soft cinematic lighting keep attention on the chair’s unusual geometry."},{"id":"judith-leyster","name":"Judith Leyster","cat":"painters","en":"Judith Leyster","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/judith-leyster.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/judith-leyster","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-orange","dark-ochre","grey","rust"],"intro":"Judith Leyster was a prominent Dutch painter of the 17th century, known for her genre works, portraits, and still lifes. As one of the few female artists of her time, she gained recognition for her lively and expressive depictions of everyday life, often featuring children and domestic scenes. Her work is characterized by a mastery of light and shadow, as well as a keen attention to detail and composition.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured oil-paint handling, visible broad strokes, and carefully modeled faces, fabric, and instruments. The tightly cropped musicians are highly expressive and theatrical, set against dark grounds with strong light-dark contrast and a restrained, warm palette."},{"id":"huma-bhabha","name":"Huma Bhabha","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Huma Bhabha","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/huma-bhabha.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/huma-bhabha","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","portraits","moody-colors","subdued-colors","collage","dark","epic"],"colours":["silver","beige","brown","black","red"],"intro":"Huma Bhabha is a contemporary Pakistani-American sculptor known for her innovative use of materials and exploration of themes related to identity, postcolonialism, and the human condition. Her work often incorporates found objects and mixed media to create haunting, expressive forms that challenge conventional understandings of sculpture.","observation":"The style presents imposing, roughly assembled human sculptures whose bodies and clothing are built from torn fabric, layered scraps, wire, and heavily textured surfaces. Muted gallery spaces and dark earthy materials support expressive, unsettling figures, with occasional blue, red, and orange accents providing dramatic contrast."},{"id":"thomas-sully","name":"Thomas Sully","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Sully","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-sully.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-sully","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","pale-orange","muted-ochre","deep-red","dark-red"],"intro":"Thomas Sully was an American portrait painter known for his elegant and romantic style. Born in 1783, Sully became a prominent figure in 19th-century American art, creating portraits of many notable individuals, including political leaders and social elites. His work is characterized by its delicate rendering and attention to detail, often capturing the grace and poise of his subjects.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visible oil-paint brushwork with finely modeled faces, hair, lace, and drapery. Restrained dark backgrounds and warm earthy tones create a subdued, museum-like atmosphere, while red garments and softly illuminated skin provide concentrated color and emphasis."},{"id":"yiannis-moralis","name":"Yiannis Moralis","cat":"various-artists","en":"Yiannis Moralis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yiannis-moralis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yiannis-moralis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","ornate","patterns","flat-color","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","muted-orange","vivid-red","brown","dark-red"],"intro":"Yiannis Moralis is a renowned Greek painter and sculptor, celebrated for his contributions to modern art in Greece. His work often explores themes of human form and architecture, blending classical elements with modernist abstraction. Moralis's art is characterized by its geometric precision, subtle color palettes, and a harmonious balance between form and space.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses tightly packed geometric abstractions built from hard-edged black, red, cream, and brown shapes, with strong contrast and assertive linework. The flat forms are enriched by a consistently distressed, tactile painted-canvas surface and dense interlocking arrangements that feel decorative without depicting recognizable subjects."},{"id":"tomoo-gokita","name":"Tomoo Gokita","cat":"painters","en":"Tomoo Gokita","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tomoo-gokita.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tomoo-gokita","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","characters","portraits","flat-color","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","negative-space"],"colours":["black","grey","silver","charcoal","muted-blue"],"intro":"Tomoo Gokita is a contemporary Japanese artist known for his monochromatic paintings and abstract portraits. His work often explores themes of identity and emotion through a unique blend of surrealism and abstraction.","observation":"Across all four portraits, the style uses stark black-and-white graphic shapes, smooth tonal modelling, and selective concealment of facial features. Cropped head-and-shoulder compositions, sculptural hair and garments, strong negative space, and occasional blue-gray framing create a refined, surreal editorial mood."},{"id":"mark-tobey","name":"Mark Tobey","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Tobey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-tobey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-tobey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","silver","beige","muted-yellow","brown","ochre","red"],"intro":"Mark Tobey is an American painter known for his contributions to abstract expressionism and his unique calligraphic style. Born in 1890, Tobey's work often reflects a synthesis of Eastern and Western artistic traditions, influenced by his interest in Zen Buddhism and Asian calligraphy. His art is characterized by intricate patterns and a focus on the spiritual and mystical aspects of life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is an all-over abstract field built from dense, visibly layered paint marks and broad gestural strokes. Its mostly pale gray, white, and beige palette is repeatedly punctuated by rust, black, and occasional stronger pigment fragments, creating a heavily textured, energetic surface rather than recognizable subject matter."},{"id":"george-segal","name":"George Segal","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"George Segal","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-segal.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-segal","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","scenes","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver","grey","black"],"intro":"George Segal was an American sculptor known for his distinctive life-sized figures cast in plaster. He was a prominent figure in the Pop Art movement, and his work often explored themes of isolation and the human condition. Segal's sculptures are characterized by their realistic yet ghostly appearance, capturing everyday people in mundane settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, human figures and groups are presented as pale, rough-surfaced sculptural forms in gallery-like settings. The subdued neutral palette, realistic poses, expressive faces, and abundant folds and creases create a tactile, heavily modelled installation aesthetic."},{"id":"ryoji-ikeda","name":"Ryoji Ikeda","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ryoji Ikeda","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ryoji-ikeda.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ryoji-ikeda","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","scenes","urban","backlighting","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","geometric","negative-space","silhouette"],"colours":["black","white","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Ryoji Ikeda is a Japanese visual and sound artist known for his work in the field of electronic music and digital art. He explores the relationship between sound and visuals, often using mathematical concepts and data to create immersive experiences. Ikeda's work is recognized for its precision and minimalism, engaging audiences with its intense and contemplative nature.","observation":"Across all four renders, vast industrial interiors are defined by monumental vertical bands of white light against near-black architecture, with small human figures providing scale. The photographic, cinematic treatment relies on stark backlighting, silhouettes, geometric perspective, and large areas of darkness and open floor."},{"id":"lygia-clark","name":"Lygia Clark","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Lygia Clark","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lygia-clark.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lygia-clark","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","high-contrast","metallic","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","muted-orange","pale-orange","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Lygia Clark was a Brazilian artist and sculptor known for her innovative contributions to the Neo-Concrete movement. Her work often explored the relationship between art and the viewer, emphasizing sensory experiences and interactive elements. Clark's artistic journey led her to create groundbreaking sculptures and installations that challenged traditional boundaries and invited active participation.","observation":"Across all four renders, sharply folded geometric metal sculptures are presented as realistic still-life objects with substantial volume and highly reflective bronze and silver surfaces. Strong directional sunlight creates bright highlights, deep cast shadows, and graphic negative space against restrained architectural backdrops."},{"id":"judy-chicago","name":"Judy Chicago","cat":"various-artists","en":"Judy Chicago","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/judy-chicago.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/judy-chicago","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","glow","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","pale-orange","vivid-red","red","light-orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Judy Chicago is an American artist known for her pioneering work in feminist art. Born in 1939, she gained prominence in the 1970s with her installation piece \"The Dinner Party,\" which celebrated women's history and achievements. Chicago's work often explores themes of gender, identity, and power, using a variety of mediums including painting, sculpture, and installation.","observation":"The style combines highly symmetrical organic forms with vivid, layered color gradients and radiating, hairline-like strokes. Floral, butterfly, heart, and mountainous motifs are simplified into decorative abstract patterns, often with luminous centers and concentric or mirrored structures."},{"id":"ralph-blakelock","name":"Ralph Blakelock","cat":"painters","en":"Ralph Blakelock","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ralph-blakelock.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ralph-blakelock","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","grain","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Ralph Blakelock is an American painter known for his evocative landscapes, often depicting moonlit scenes and wilderness settings. Born in 1847, Blakelock's work is characterized by a moody and mysterious atmosphere, reflecting the Romantic and Tonalist movements of the late 19th century. His paintings frequently explore themes of solitude and nature, capturing the ethereal beauty of the American landscape.","observation":"Across all four renders, wooded waterways are treated with dense, visible painterly texture and a dark, subdued palette dominated by burnt orange and deep brown-black shadows. Strong internal light from the moon or low sun glows through the trees and reflects across the water, creating dreamy, high-contrast landscape scenes with richly layered foliage."},{"id":"edward-cucuel","name":"Edward Cucuel","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Cucuel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-cucuel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-cucuel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","fashion","floral","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","grey","black","beige","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Edward Cucuel is an American painter known for his impressionistic style, often depicting idyllic scenes of leisure and elegance. Born in 1875, Cucuel studied in Paris and became associated with the Munich Secession, a group of artists who embraced modernist approaches. His work is characterized by vibrant colors, fluid brushwork, and a focus on capturing the beauty of everyday moments, particularly in outdoor settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses luminous, richly colored oil-paint texture with clearly visible directional brushwork and carefully modeled figures. It consistently depicts elegantly dressed women relaxing on sunlit terraces and garden balconies, with hats, flowers, railings, water, and patterned garments arranged as leisurely outdoor scenes."},{"id":"max-weber","name":"Max Weber","cat":"painters","en":"Max Weber","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/max-weber.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/max-weber","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","silver","dark-red"],"intro":"Max Weber was an influential American painter and one of the first artists to introduce Cubism to the United States. Born in Russia in 1881, he immigrated to America and became a prominent figure in the early 20th-century art scene. Weber's work is characterized by its bold use of color, abstract forms, and exploration of modernist themes, often reflecting his Jewish heritage and urban experiences.","observation":"Across all four images, the style combines visible, directional brushwork with simplified angular forms and strongly structured outlines. Landscapes and narrative interiors use earthy, somewhat muted colors punctuated by red, blue, and ochre accents, while dense marks and deep shadows give the scenes an expressive, tactile character."},{"id":"christian-marclay","name":"Christian Marclay","cat":"various-artists","en":"Christian Marclay","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/christian-marclay.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/christian-marclay","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","brown","bone-white","rust","olive","vivid-red"],"intro":"Christian Marclay is a Swiss-American visual artist and composer known for his innovative work in the field of sound art and his exploration of the relationship between sound, photography, video, and film. His work often involves the use of everyday objects and media, transforming them into new forms of artistic expression. Marclay is widely recognized for his influence on the development of turntablism and his contributions to the art of sound collage.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines expressive, heavily textured painting with dramatic gallery-scale presentation and forceful gestural marks. Saturated contrasting colors, layered surfaces, bold dark forms, and energetic splatters create a vivid surreal atmosphere, while recurring figures and eyes anchor the otherwise abstract compositions."},{"id":"george-romney","name":"George Romney","cat":"painters","en":"George Romney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-romney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-romney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","grey"],"intro":"George Romney is a renowned English portrait painter from the 18th century, known for his elegant and expressive depictions of the British aristocracy. His works are characterized by a refined neoclassical style, capturing the grace and poise of his subjects with a delicate touch. Romney's portraits often feature a soft color palette and a focus on the sitter's expression and demeanor, reflecting the cultural and social nuances of his time.","observation":"The style uses richly visible, fluid brushwork to model idealized female portraits and flowing garments, with expressive poses and softly articulated faces. Subdued earthy colors, warm highlights, dark grounds, and strong light-dark separation create a dramatic, romantic atmosphere across the four images."},{"id":"filippino-lippi","name":"Filippino Lippi","cat":"painters","en":"Filippino Lippi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/filippino-lippi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/filippino-lippi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","muted-orange","grey","deep-red","rust"],"intro":"Filippino Lippi was an Italian painter of the Renaissance , known for his religious and mythological works. He was the son of Fra Filippo Lippi and was influenced by the styles of his father and Botticelli. Lippi's works are characterized by their delicate figures, rich colors, and intricate details, often depicting religious themes with a humanist touch.","observation":"The style uses richly layered, visibly brushed paint to render crowded classical scenes with highly detailed faces, hair, fabrics, jewelry, and architectural ornament. Muted warm earth tones are accented by dusty blues, reds, and pinks, while expressive gestures and tightly framed groupings give the figures a theatrical, narrative presence."},{"id":"georges-rousse","name":"Georges Rousse","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Georges Rousse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/georges-rousse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/georges-rousse","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","sculptural","urban","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-red","deep-red","charcoal","black","grey","vivid-red"],"intro":"Georges Rousse is a French artist known for his unique blend of photography and installation art. His work often involves transforming abandoned or derelict spaces into striking visual illusions, using geometric shapes and vivid colors to alter perceptions of space and form. Rousse's art challenges viewers to reconsider the relationship between architecture and visual art, creating immersive experiences that blur the lines between reality and illusion.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark red geometric structures occupy weathered, abandoned architectural interiors, turning arches, spheres, walls, and staircases into monumental sculptural forms. The imagery combines vivid flat color and crisp graphic edges with rough masonry, deep shadows, and strong spatial contrasts, creating a surreal, imposing atmosphere."},{"id":"tim-etchells","name":"Tim Etchells","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tim Etchells","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tim-etchells.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tim-etchells","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","letters","portraits","urban","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","dark-red","deep-red","vivid-red","light-orange","pale-orange"],"intro":"Tim Etchells is a British artist and writer known for his work in performance art and installation. He is the artistic director of Forced Entertainment, a theater company based in Sheffield, England. Etchells's work often explores themes of language, communication, and the dynamics of performance.","observation":"A photographic portrait style built around saturated red neon, deep shadows, and strong pools of internal light from signage. The subjects are framed cinematically against blurred industrial or urban interiors, with shallow focus and recurring graphic lettering creating a dramatic, moody atmosphere."},{"id":"seydou-keita","name":"Seydou Keita","cat":"photographers","en":"Seydou Keita","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/seydou-keita.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/seydou-keita","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","ethnic-poc","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","retro"],"colours":["grey","charcoal","brown","light-orange","beige","silver"],"intro":"Seydou Keita was a renowned Malian photographer known for his iconic black and white portraits that captured the essence of Malian society in the mid-20th century. His work is celebrated for its ability to document the cultural and social transformations of post-colonial Africa, often featuring individuals in traditional attire against simple yet textured backdrops.","observation":"The style uses highly posed, editorial portrait photography with richly patterned garments, sculptural accessories, and carefully arranged studio tableaux. Strong monochrome or sepia toning, deep shadows, pronounced film grain, and aged textured backdrops give the images a tactile retro-photographic character."},{"id":"sebastian-errazuriz","name":"Sebastian Errazuriz","cat":"designers","en":"Sebastian Errazuriz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sebastian-errazuriz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sebastian-errazuriz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","still-life","bw-monochrome","metallic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["silver","grey","brown"],"intro":"Sebastian Errazuriz is a Chilean artist and designer known for his innovative and thought-provoking works that blend art, design, and functionality. His creations often challenge conventional perceptions, exploring themes of life, death, and the human condition.","observation":"The style presents highly elaborate furniture and object forms as monochrome sculptural works, with dense carved ornament, theatrical silhouettes, and carefully modelled upholstery, figures, and animals. Neutral gallery settings and controlled lighting emphasize the solid volume, intricate surface relief, and occasional reflective metallic finish."},{"id":"rachel-whiteread","name":"Rachel Whiteread","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Rachel Whiteread","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rachel-whiteread.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rachel-whiteread","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","beige","silver","muted-ochre","dark-brown"],"intro":"Rachel Whiteread is a renowned British sculptor known for her large-scale works that explore themes of memory and absence. She gained prominence in the early 1990s and became the first woman to win the Turner Prize in 1993. Her work often involves casting the negative spaces of everyday objects and architectural structures, creating ghostly and contemplative pieces that challenge perceptions of space and form.","observation":"The style presents monumental white, wax-like architectural structures installed inside grand historic interiors, rendered with convincing spatial depth and finely resolved surfaces. Restrained cream and brown tones, symmetrical architectural framing, soft daylight, and large areas of floor and ceiling create a quiet, surreal museum-installation atmosphere."},{"id":"clive-madgwick","name":"Clive Madgwick","cat":"painters","en":"Clive Madgwick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/clive-madgwick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/clive-madgwick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-blue","silver","muted-ochre","pale-orange","orange"],"intro":"Clive Madgwick is a British artist known for his detailed and atmospheric landscape paintings, often depicting the rural countryside of England. His works are characterized by a realistic and traditional style, capturing the serene beauty and tranquility of pastoral settings. Madgwick's paintings often feature soft lighting and a rich color palette, emphasizing the natural charm of the English landscape.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic imagery with carefully staged tableaux, solitary figures, and incongruous domestic objects placed within expansive rural landscapes. Moody subdued color, strong warm⁠–cool lighting, atmospheric haze, and backlighting create a quiet, dreamlike sense of mystery across the set."},{"id":"on-kawara","name":"On Kawara","cat":"various-artists","en":"On Kawara","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/on-kawara.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/on-kawara","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["minimalist","realistic","patterns","urban","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["white","bone-white","beige","black","dark-blue"],"intro":"On Kawara was a Japanese conceptual artist known for his exploration of time and existence through his work. He gained recognition for his \"Today\" series, where he painted the date of the day he created each piece, emphasizing the passage of time and the ephemeral nature of life.","observation":"The style presents sparse contemporary gallery interiors with rigid rectangular works, repeated numerical motifs, strong alignment, and carefully controlled perspective. Neutral whites, blacks, greys, and deep blue create restrained contrast, while generous empty walls and polished floors give the compositions a quiet, photographic, film-like atmosphere."},{"id":"lucio-fontana","name":"Lucio Fontana","cat":"painters","en":"Lucio Fontana","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucio-fontana.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucio-fontana","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","sculptural","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["vivid-red","muted-ochre","charcoal","brown"],"intro":"Lucio Fontana was an Italian-Argentinian artist known for founding the Spatialism movement. He is celebrated for his innovative approach to art, particularly his slashed and punctured canvases that challenged traditional perceptions of space and form. Fontana's work is characterized by its exploration of the physicality of the canvas and the concept of the void, making significant contributions to the avant-garde and modernist movements of the 20th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses abstract geometric panel compositions with heavily textured, physically built-up surfaces. Broad vertical grooves and fissures repeat as a structural motif, while saturated red, charcoal, and beige fields create a bold, tactile contrast."},{"id":"patrick-dougherty","name":"Patrick Dougherty","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Patrick Dougherty","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/patrick-dougherty.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/patrick-dougherty","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","glow","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-olive","beige","olive","bone-white"],"intro":"Patrick Dougherty is a renowned American sculptor known for his innovative work with natural materials, particularly saplings and branches. His large-scale installations, often created in outdoor settings, blend seamlessly with their environments, evoking a sense of wonder and connection to nature. Dougherty's work is celebrated for its organic forms and intricate weaving techniques, which have been displayed in various public spaces around the world.","observation":"The style presents a highly realistic, richly detailed woodland environment filled with monumental woven tree-like structures and walk-through arches. Natural textures, dappled sunlight, deep layered shade, and strong organic repetition create a sculptural, cinematic atmosphere that feels both plausible and dreamlike."},{"id":"arturo-souto","name":"Arturo Souto","cat":"painters","en":"Arturo Souto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arturo-souto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arturo-souto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","dark-brown","muted-ochre","red","grey"],"intro":"Arturo Souto is a renowned Spanish painter known for his expressive and emotive style. His work often explores themes of human emotion and social interaction, capturing the complexities of urban life and personal introspection. Souto's paintings are characterized by their rich color palettes and dynamic compositions, reflecting the influence of modernist and expressionist movements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses heavily textured, directional paint with broad, visible strokes and rugged impasto. Dark urban settings, crowded architecture, and expressive figures are built from angular forms, restrained earth-and-jewel colors, and strong red-black contrast, producing a tense, kinetic atmosphere."},{"id":"odeith","name":"Odeith","cat":"street-artists","en":"Odeith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/odeith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/odeith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","urban","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","muted-orange","grey","deep-red","white"],"intro":"Odeith is a Portuguese street artist known for his innovative 3D graffiti and anamorphic art. His work often plays with perspective and illusion, creating striking visual effects that appear to leap off the walls. Odeith has gained international recognition for his ability to transform urban spaces into immersive art experiences.","observation":"The style combines vivid, expressive creature murals with painterly, highly textured rendering, strong dark-light contrast, and assertive graphic contours. Fantastical animals dominate the scenes while remaining integrated into photorealistic abandoned architectural spaces marked by peeling plaster, rubble, and weathered masonry."},{"id":"george-frederic-watts","name":"George Frederic Watts","cat":"painters","en":"George Frederic Watts","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-frederic-watts.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-frederic-watts","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-brown","black","muted-orange","dark-red","dark-teal"],"intro":"George Frederic Watts was a British painter and sculptor associated with the Symbolist movement in the 19th century. Known for his allegorical works, Watts focused on themes of hope, love, and the human condition, often using a rich color palette and expressive compositions. His work is characterized by a deep introspection and philosophical depth, making him a significant figure in Victorian art.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, visible brushwork to model tightly cropped faces and reclining or sleeping figures with a quietly intense, expressive mood. Deep burgundy, brown, ochre, and teal tones, soft directional illumination, and layered fabric and hair textures create a dark, intimate classical-painting effect."},{"id":"jan-steen","name":"Jan Steen","cat":"painters","en":"Jan Steen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-steen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-steen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","rust","pale-orange"],"intro":"Jan Steen is a renowned Dutch painter from the 17th century, known for his lively and humorous depictions of everyday life. His works often feature domestic scenes filled with expressive characters and intricate details, capturing the essence of Dutch society during the Golden Age. Steen's paintings are celebrated for their narrative quality and ability to convey moral lessons through vivid storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible fine brushwork, layered textures, and densely populated tavern scenes. Warm, subdued earth tones are organized by strong light-dark contrasts, while expressive gestures, untidy surroundings, and animated groups create a lively yet grimy atmosphere."},{"id":"nicolaes-van-verendael","name":"Nicolaes van Verendael","cat":"painters","en":"Nicolaes van Verendael","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nicolaes-van-verendael.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nicolaes-van-verendael","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","floral","scenes","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","grey","bone-white","red"],"intro":"Nicolaes van Verendael was a Flemish painter known for his exquisite still lifes and floral compositions during the Baroque period. His works are characterized by meticulous detail, vibrant colors, and a harmonious arrangement of elements, often reflecting the opulence and beauty of nature.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly built-up, finely controlled paint to depict elaborate floral arrangements, animals, figures, and still-life settings. Dark grounds, selective illumination, muted earth tones, and saturated flower accents create theatrical depth, while dense ornament and abundant small details give the compositions a lavish classical character."},{"id":"jim-dine","name":"Jim Dine","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jim Dine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jim-dine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jim-dine","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","patterns","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","vivid-red","red","yellow","deep-blue"],"intro":"Jim Dine is an American artist known for his contributions to the Pop Art movement. Born in 1935, Dine's work often incorporates everyday objects and symbols, exploring themes of identity and personal expression. His art spans various mediums, including painting, drawing, and sculpture, characterized by a distinctive blend of bold colors and expressive forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses vigorous, visibly built-up paint with broad gestural strokes, scratching, drips, splatters, and emphatic dark linework. Familiar flowers and heart forms are repeatedly pushed toward expressive, surreal abstraction through saturated reds, pinks, yellows, blues, and deep blacks, with densely layered surfaces and strong contrast."},{"id":"pj-crook","name":"PJ Crook","cat":"painters","en":"PJ Crook","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pj-crook.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pj-crook","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-red","brown","beige"],"intro":"PJ Crook is a contemporary British painter known for her distinctive style that often explores themes of urban life and societal critique. Her work is characterized by crowded compositions and a surreal, narrative approach that blends elements of fantasy and reality. Crook's paintings frequently depict scenes filled with expressive characters, often with exaggerated features, set against urban backdrops.","observation":"The style combines highly detailed, painterly rendering with crisp illustrative contours and finely controlled linework. Crowded faces and layered winter garments fill the frame, using subdued blue-grey and brown tones punctuated by bold red, with strong contrast and expressive, angular features."},{"id":"lucas-cranach-the-elder","name":"Lucas Cranach the Elder","cat":"painters","en":"Lucas Cranach the Elder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lucas-cranach-the-elder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lucas-cranach-the-elder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","orange","deep-red","grey","bone-white"],"intro":"Lucas Cranach the Elder was a prominent German painter and printmaker of the Renaissance , known for his portraits and religious subjects. He served as court painter to the Electors of Saxony and was a close friend of Martin Luther. His works are characterized by their detailed realism, vibrant colors, and incorporation of both religious and mythological themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped portraiture with meticulous modeling of faces, hair, fur, feathers, and fabric. Muted earth and jewel tones, fine visible brushwork, restrained formal poses, and aged painted-surface texture give the images a classical portrait character."},{"id":"joseph-stella","name":"Joseph Stella","cat":"painters","en":"Joseph Stella","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joseph-stella.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joseph-stella","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","landscapes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["black","brown","red","dark-blue","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Joseph Stella was an Italian-American painter known for his depictions of industrial America and his involvement in the Futurist movement. Born in 1877, Stella's work often combined elements of modernism and precisionism, characterized by vibrant colors and dynamic compositions. He is best known for his paintings of the Brooklyn Bridge and other urban landscapes, which reflect his fascination with the energy and architecture of the modern city.","observation":"Across all four renders, vivid angular forms and repeated radial bursts organize stylized city, foliage, and crowd imagery into energetic, symmetrical compositions. Broad visible paint strokes, layered color blocks, and textured surfaces give the illustrative scenes a strongly expressive, hand-painted appearance."},{"id":"arnaldo-pomodoro","name":"Arnaldo Pomodoro","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Arnaldo Pomodoro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arnaldo-pomodoro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arnaldo-pomodoro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","high-contrast","metallic","surreal"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","beige","light-orange","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Arnaldo Pomodoro is an Italian sculptor known for his innovative and monumental bronze sculptures. His works often explore themes of geometry and abstraction, characterized by their intricate detailing and polished surfaces. Pomodoro's sculptures are celebrated for their ability to blend modernist aesthetics with a sense of timelessness, making him a prominent figure in contemporary art.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental metallic spheres contain or rupture into dense miniature architectural cityscapes, giving the images a strongly sculptural and surreal character. Reflective bronze surfaces, deep black cavities, intricate fragment work, and realistic museum or urban settings create a dramatic high-contrast presentation."},{"id":"sidney-nolan","name":"Sidney Nolan","cat":"painters","en":"Sidney Nolan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sidney-nolan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sidney-nolan","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","red","dark-brown","cyan","dark-green","teal"],"intro":"Sidney Nolan was an Australian painter known for his distinctive style and contribution to modern art. He is celebrated for his depictions of Australian history and landscapes, often incorporating mythological and historical themes. His work is characterized by bold colors, dramatic compositions, and a unique narrative quality.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad visible brushwork, scraped texture, and irregular pigment create a heavily painted surface, while thin branch and contour marks remain legible over it. Saturated red, turquoise, blue, and ochre grounds contrast with dark simplified figures and sparse landscapes, producing an uncanny, dreamlike atmosphere with recurring solitary characters and animal forms."},{"id":"henri-michaux","name":"Henri Michaux","cat":"painters","en":"Henri Michaux","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henri-michaux.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henri-michaux","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","motion","broad-brushstrokes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","surreal","ink","dark"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","beige"],"intro":"Henri Michaux is a Belgian-born French poet and painter known for his avant-garde and experimental works. His art often explores the subconscious and the abstract, using a variety of techniques to convey emotion and movement. Michaux's work is characterized by its expressive and gestural style, often incorporating elements of surrealism and abstraction.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style is monochromatic and intensely gestural, built from black ink splashes, washes, drips, broad marks, and granular paper texture. Abstract organic forms and repeated silhouettes shift between sparse pale grounds and dense dark masses, creating a raw, kinetic, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"john-bratby","name":"John Bratby","cat":"painters","en":"John Bratby","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-bratby.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-bratby","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","muted-brown","grey","orange","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"John Bratby was a British painter known for his role in the Kitchen Sink realism movement during the mid-20th century. His work often depicted everyday scenes and domestic life with a focus on the working class. Bratby’s paintings are characterized by their bold use of color, expressive brushwork, and a focus on the mundane aspects of life, capturing the essence of post-war Britain.","observation":"Across the four views, recognizable city streets, landmarks, traffic, pedestrians, and a close-up portrait are rendered with energetic, clearly visible broad paint strokes and dark emphatic contour lines. Saturated reds, ochres, greens, and blues, strong light-dark separation, and dense architectural detail give the urban scenes an expressive, animated intensity."},{"id":"richard-serra","name":"Richard Serra","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Richard Serra","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-serra.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-serra","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","minimalist","sculptural","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","cream","white","brown","beige"],"intro":"Richard Serra is an American sculptor known for his monumental steel sculptures that explore the relationship between viewer, space, and material. Born in 1938, Serra's work is characterized by its large scale and use of industrial materials, often installed in public spaces. His sculptures challenge perceptions of balance and gravity, creating immersive experiences that invite viewers to engage with the environment.","observation":"The style combines stark black-and-white geometry with expansive white negative space, using circles, rings, rectangles, and massive cylindrical forms as recurring motifs. Rough, visibly brushed and splattered edges contrast with stark flat areas and monumental architectural scale, producing a bold minimalist abstraction."},{"id":"abraham-pether","name":"Abraham Pether","cat":"painters","en":"Abraham Pether","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/abraham-pether.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/abraham-pether","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","motion","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","grey","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Abraham Pether was an English landscape painter known for his moonlit scenes and romantic depictions of nature. Active during the late 18th and early 19th centuries, Pether's work often featured dramatic lighting and atmospheric effects, capturing the serene beauty of the English countryside.","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly realism with dense environmental detail and cinematic staging. It consistently contrasts deep blue-black shadows with warm firelight, sunset, or moonlight, using glowing skies, reflective water, mist, and silhouetted trees to create an epic, atmospheric sense of drama."},{"id":"marcello-barenghi","name":"Marcello Barenghi","cat":"various-artists","en":"Marcello Barenghi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marcello-barenghi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marcello-barenghi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","still-life","fine-lines","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","white","black","muted-ochre","red","light-orange"],"intro":"Marcello Barenghi is an Italian artist renowned for his hyper-realistic drawings, often using colored pencils and markers to create stunningly lifelike depictions of everyday objects. His work is characterized by meticulous attention to detail and a mastery of light and shadow, which brings a three-dimensional quality to his illustrations.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic fruit studies with vivid color, crisp contours, glossy highlights, and strong cast shadows. The images combine clean illustrative drawing with fine surface detail, often showing colored pencils or a hand interacting with the subject on contrasting paper or dark work surfaces."},{"id":"lisette-model","name":"Lisette Model","cat":"photographers","en":"Lisette Model","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lisette-model.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lisette-model","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Lisette Model was an Austrian-born American photographer known for her street photography and candid portraits. Her work often captured the raw and unfiltered essence of urban life, focusing on the human condition and societal norms. Model's influence extended to many notable photographers, and she was a significant figure in the development of 20th-century photography.","observation":"This style uses realistic black-and-white photography with strong tonal contrast, visible grain, and selective focus. Candid portraits and small urban situations are framed cinematically in buses, shop windows, and city streets, with period clothing and reflective glass adding documentary atmosphere."},{"id":"charles-e-burchfield","name":"Charles E. Burchfield","cat":"painters","en":"Charles E. Burchfield","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-e-burchfield.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-e-burchfield","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","ink"],"colours":["beige","black","bone-white","dark-ochre","charcoal","ochre","orange"],"intro":"Charles E. Burchfield is an American painter known for his visionary landscapes and depictions of nature. Born in 1893, Burchfield's work often reflects the moods and atmospheres of the American Midwest, capturing the essence of rural life and the natural world with a unique blend of realism and fantasy. His paintings are characterized by their expressive use of color and form, often conveying a sense of mystery and wonder.","observation":"The style combines richly visible, broad painted strokes with dark ink-like contours and a dense illustrative treatment of vegetation, architecture, and terrain. Restrained earthy greens, creams, ochres, and blue-greys unify varied landscape scenes, while expressive foliage marks and layered detail create a storybook-like sense of place."},{"id":"junya-watanabe","name":"Junya Watanabe","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Junya Watanabe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/junya-watanabe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/junya-watanabe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","realistic","sculptural","characters","fashion","portraits","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","dark-blue","dark-red","deep-red","muted-blue","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Junya Watanabe is a renowned Japanese fashion designer known for his innovative and avant-garde approach to clothing design. He began his career at Comme des Garçons and later launched his own label, gaining recognition for his experimental techniques and unique aesthetic. Watanabe's work often explores themes of technology and modernity, blending traditional Japanese elements with futuristic designs.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic editorial fashion portraits with saturated primary colors, dramatic oversized silhouettes, and richly tactile materials such as feathers, gathered fabric, and distressed denim. Close framing, selective focus, strong contrast, and sculptural garments make each runway look feel bold and theatrical while retaining photographic detail."},{"id":"peter-voulkos","name":"Peter Voulkos","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Peter Voulkos","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-voulkos.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-voulkos","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","subdued-colors"],"colours":["silver","beige","brown","white","muted-ochre","black"],"intro":"Peter Voulkos is a renowned American artist and sculptor known for his groundbreaking work in ceramics. Born in 1924, Voulkos played a pivotal role in elevating ceramics to a fine art form, challenging traditional boundaries and integrating abstract expressionist techniques into his pieces. His work is characterized by bold, dynamic forms and a raw, expressive style that defies conventional aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents heavily weathered, hollow ceramic vessels as solid, tactile sculptural objects, with chipped edges, cracks, layered clay, and irregular handmade construction rendered in careful realistic detail. Muted earth tones, soft studio lighting, neutral backgrounds, and isolated still-life framing make the damaged forms read like archaeological artifacts or gallery specimens."},{"id":"danny-clinch","name":"Danny Clinch","cat":"photographers","en":"Danny Clinch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/danny-clinch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/danny-clinch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","white","grey","silver"],"intro":"Danny Clinch is a renowned American photographer known for his evocative portraits of musicians and artists. His work captures the raw and authentic essence of his subjects, often set against urban backdrops. Clinch's photography is celebrated for its ability to convey emotion and narrative through a documentary style that feels both intimate and expansive.","observation":"A monochrome photographic style built around intimate, cinematic portraits in richly furnished interiors. Strong tonal contrast, selective focus, dramatic window light, tailored dark clothing, and wide-brim hats create a moody editorial atmosphere, while ornate mirrors and patterned upholstery add environmental detail."},{"id":"keith-mallett","name":"Keith Mallett","cat":"painters","en":"Keith Mallett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/keith-mallett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/keith-mallett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","illustrative","ornate","characters","patterns","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing","geometric"],"colours":["black","dark-red","rust","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Keith Mallett is an American artist known for his vibrant and expressive works that often explore themes of African American culture and heritage. His art spans various mediums, including painting, printmaking, and ceramics, and is celebrated for its rich color palettes and emotive subjects. Mallett's work often features figures and scenes that convey a sense of harmony and cultural pride.","observation":"Across all four renders, tightly cropped figures and faces are built from angular, interlocking planes with fine dark contours and richly textured, visibly worked surfaces. Saturated rust, ochre, teal, red, and black create a high-contrast decorative field, while repeated geometric blocks, patterned clothing, and ornamental marks make each portrait feel densely layered."},{"id":"nell-dorr","name":"Nell Dorr","cat":"photographers","en":"Nell Dorr","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nell-dorr.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nell-dorr","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","floral","portraits","backlighting","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","white","silver"],"intro":"Nell Dorr was an American photographer known for her soft-focus, pictorialist style and intimate portraits. Her work often explored themes of femininity, nature, and introspection, capturing the quiet beauty of her subjects with a delicate and ethereal touch. Dorr's photography was influential in the early 20th century, contributing to the fine art photography movement.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photography with pronounced film grain, deep shadows, blown highlights, and frequent backlighting. Women in flowing white garments are staged in forests, water, flowers, and drifting haze, with selective focus and motion-softened fabric creating a dreamy, ghostly cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"pierre-balmain","name":"Pierre Balmain","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Pierre Balmain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-balmain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-balmain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","high-contrast","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-teal","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Pierre Balmain is a renowned French fashion designer known for his elegant and sophisticated haute couture creations. He founded the fashion house Balmain in 1945, which became famous for its luxurious and opulent designs. Balmain's work is characterized by its classic yet innovative approach, often incorporating intricate embroidery, rich fabrics, and a refined sense of style that has influenced the fashion industry for decades.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed couture fashion through realistic editorial portraits, emphasizing elaborate surface decoration, lace, embroidery, sculptural silhouettes, and richly textured fabrics. Dark backgrounds, restrained jewel-like color, strong directional lighting, and cinematic cropping give the images a dramatic, gallery-like atmosphere."},{"id":"chris-leib","name":"Chris Leib","cat":"painters","en":"Chris Leib","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/chris-leib.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/chris-leib","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-ochre","bone-white","ochre","red"],"intro":"Chris Leib is a contemporary artist known for his surreal and fantastical works that often explore themes of science fiction and alternative realities. His art is characterized by a unique blend of whimsical and eerie elements, creating a distinctive visual narrative that captivates viewers with its imaginative and mysterious qualities.","observation":"Across all four images, fantastical anthropomorphic characters and elaborate mechanical costumes are rendered with visible, layered brushwork, tactile surfaces, and carefully modeled volume. The subdued, darkly atmospheric palette, ornate brass and copper details, and close portrait-like framing create a surreal, dreamlike retro-space tableau."},{"id":"moses-soyer","name":"Moses Soyer","cat":"painters","en":"Moses Soyer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/moses-soyer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/moses-soyer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-red","beige","ochre","dark-brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Moses Soyer was a Russian-born American painter known for his social realist works that often depicted the lives of working-class individuals and intimate family scenes. His art was characterized by a focus on human emotion and social issues, reflecting the influences of the Great Depression and the New Deal era. Soyer's works are celebrated for their expressive quality and commitment to portraying the dignity of everyday people.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible oil-paint brushwork, softly modeled faces, and layered, textured surfaces. It consistently focuses on expressive female portraits and intimate figure arrangements, with warm reds, earthy neutrals, cropped framing, and subdued interior backgrounds."},{"id":"jenny-holzer","name":"Jenny Holzer","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jenny Holzer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jenny-holzer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jenny-holzer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","letters","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","vivid-colors","cinematic","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["deep-red","dark-red","black","vivid-red","deep-blue"],"intro":"Jenny Holzer is an American conceptual artist known for her text-based public art installations. Her work often explores themes of power, identity, and social justice, utilizing language as a primary medium. Holzer's art has been displayed in various public spaces, including billboards, buildings, and electronic displays, challenging viewers to engage with provocative and thought-provoking messages.","observation":"The style presents monumental interior spaces as cinematic, realistic architectural photographs dominated by saturated red illumination, deep shadows, and strong reflective surfaces. Glowing text-based installations, geometric framing, and small silhouetted visitors create a dramatic futuristic exhibition atmosphere across both contemporary galleries and ornate vaulted interiors."},{"id":"laure-albin-guillot","name":"Laure Albin Guillot","cat":"photographers","en":"Laure Albin Guillot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/laure-albin-guillot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/laure-albin-guillot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","bone-white","beige","grey","silver"],"intro":"Laure Albin Guillot was a prominent French photographer known for her contributions to the art of photography in the early to mid-20th century. She was celebrated for her elegant and refined portraiture, often capturing the essence of her subjects with a delicate and sophisticated touch. Her work is characterized by a blend of classical beauty and modernist influences, making her a significant figure in the photographic art scene of her time.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome, high-contrast portrait photography with tightly cropped faces, deep shadows, and selective focus. Grain, soft optical blur, and dramatic expressions create an intimate, dark, cinematic mood, while clothing, veils, and occasional floral accents add visual drama."},{"id":"todd-white","name":"Todd White","cat":"painters","en":"Todd White","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/todd-white.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/todd-white","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-red","black","orange","brown","muted-green"],"intro":"Todd White is a contemporary American artist known for his distinctive figurative paintings that often explore themes of human expression and social commentary. His work is characterized by a unique style that combines elements of pop culture with a painterly approach, resulting in vibrant and dynamic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly textured paint with fine illustrative linework, expressive faces, and densely ornamented costumes and backgrounds. Saturated reds, blacks, creams, and teal recur throughout, while decorative curves, floral forms, patterned textiles, and theatrical fashion create a fantastical, surreal portrait language."},{"id":"lee-ufan","name":"Lee Ufan","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Lee Ufan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-ufan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-ufan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","minimalist","realistic","sculptural","still-life","glow","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","white","brown","bone-white","light-orange"],"intro":"Lee Ufan is a Korean artist and sculptor known for his association with the Mono-ha movement and his minimalist approach to art. Born in 1936, Lee's work often explores the relationship between materials and space, emphasizing simplicity and the natural qualities of the materials he uses. His art is deeply influenced by Eastern philosophies, particularly Zen, and he has been a significant figure in both Korean and Japanese contemporary art scenes.","observation":"The style presents monumental stone forms as highly realistic, sculptural objects in spare contemporary gallery spaces. Subdued earth tones, strong geometric architecture, dramatic directional light, and expansive negative space create a cinematic, contemplative atmosphere, with detailed rock surfaces providing the main visual texture."},{"id":"william-langson-lathrop","name":"William Langson Lathrop","cat":"painters","en":"William Langson Lathrop","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-langson-lathrop.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-langson-lathrop","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","mist","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","charcoal","grey","muted-ochre","bone-white","ochre"],"intro":"William Langson Lathrop was an American painter known for his contributions to the American Impressionist movement. Born in 1859, he became a prominent figure in the art colonies of Pennsylvania, particularly the New Hope School. Lathrop's work often depicted serene landscapes, capturing the quiet beauty of rural America with a focus on light and atmosphere. His paintings are characterized by their soft, painterly style and harmonious compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the landscapes are built from visible, broad, textured brushwork with softened edges and richly layered foliage. Restrained earthy greens, russets, ochres, and blue-greys create a quiet, atmospheric pastoral mood, while misty distance and filtered light give the scenes a dreamy, classical landscape character."},{"id":"jason-middlebrook","name":"Jason Middlebrook","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jason Middlebrook","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jason-middlebrook.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jason-middlebrook","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["white","beige","bone-white","orange","red","brown"],"intro":"Jason Middlebrook is an American artist known for his innovative use of materials and exploration of environmental themes. His work often incorporates elements of nature and sustainability, reflecting a deep engagement with ecological issues.","observation":"The style presents irregular wood cross-sections as highly detailed sculptural objects, with rough bark edges framing dense, flowing bands of vividly colored concentric lines. Repeated organic contours create an ornate, almost topographic pattern, while clean presentation against a pale wall gives the pieces the character of displayed decorative specimens."},{"id":"naomi-tydeman","name":"Naomi Tydeman","cat":"painters","en":"Naomi Tydeman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/naomi-tydeman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/naomi-tydeman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","backlighting","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","muted-blue","silver","grey"],"intro":"Naomi Tydeman is a contemporary artist known for her evocative landscape paintings, often capturing the ethereal beauty of natural scenes. Her work is celebrated for its atmospheric quality and delicate use of color, drawing viewers into tranquil and contemplative worlds.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive meadow landscapes are treated with visible painterly texture, dense fine vegetation, and dark silhouetted trees against cool twilight skies. Strong backlighting, luminous flower heads, atmospheric haze, and restrained blue-grey tones create a dreamy, cinematic-feeling stillness with occasional figures or birds providing scale."},{"id":"martin-grelle","name":"Martin Grelle","cat":"painters","en":"Martin Grelle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-grelle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-grelle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["muted-blue","muted-ochre","brown","silver","grey","deep-red"],"intro":"Martin Grelle is an American painter known for his vivid depictions of Native American life and the American West. His work often features detailed portrayals of indigenous peoples, landscapes, and historical scenes, capturing the spirit and culture of the frontier era.","observation":"Across all four renders, broad mountain vistas and travelling horse riders are painted with visible, energetic strokes and finely varied surface texture. Saturated blue skies, green valleys, white snow, and warm costume accents create an expansive, heroic wilderness mood with strong atmospheric depth."},{"id":"elia-kazan","name":"Elia Kazan","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Elia Kazan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elia-kazan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elia-kazan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Elia Kazan was a prominent American film and theater director, known for his influential work in the mid-20th century. He directed classic films such as \"A Streetcar Named Desire\" and \"On the Waterfront,\" and was celebrated for his ability to elicit powerful performances from actors. Kazan's work often explored themes of social justice, personal conflict, and the American experience.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with strong tonal separation, dramatic shadows, and localized practical lights. It presents introspective male portraits in cinematic, candid-looking table or audience settings, with shallow focus keeping the subject prominent against blurred surroundings."},{"id":"evelyn-de-morgan","name":"Evelyn De Morgan","cat":"painters","en":"Evelyn De Morgan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/evelyn-de-morgan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/evelyn-de-morgan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","fantasy"],"colours":["brown","muted-brown","light-orange","grey","muted-blue","dark-blue"],"intro":"Evelyn De Morgan was an English painter associated with the Pre-Raphaelite movement, known for her symbolic and allegorical works. Her paintings often depicted themes of spirituality, mythology, and social commentary, characterized by detailed and vibrant compositions.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and finely worked, with visible brush texture modeling faces, feathers, hair, and layered fabric. It repeatedly presents idealized, expressive figures in ornate classical-looking drapery, using restrained earth, cream, blue, and russet tones with dense decorative detail and a mythic atmosphere."},{"id":"alice-bailly","name":"Alice Bailly","cat":"painters","en":"Alice Bailly","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alice-bailly.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alice-bailly","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","charcoal","beige","orange","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"Alice Bailly was a Swiss painter known for her vibrant and dynamic works that often incorporated elements of cubism and futurism. Her art is characterized by bold colors, fluid forms, and a sense of movement, capturing the energy of early 20th-century modernism.","observation":"Across the sheet, figures and faces are built from sharply faceted geometric planes, strong dark contours, and carefully layered color fields. The images retain visible paint and canvas texture while combining vivid clothing and architectural colors with highly stylized, angular portraiture."},{"id":"pyotr-konchalovsky","name":"Pyotr Konchalovsky","cat":"painters","en":"Pyotr Konchalovsky","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pyotr-konchalovsky.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pyotr-konchalovsky","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","dark-brown","olive","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Pyotr Konchalovsky is a renowned Russian painter known for his vibrant landscapes and expressive use of color. He was a prominent figure in the Russian avant-garde movement and contributed significantly to the development of modern Russian art in the early 20th century.","observation":"Across the four renders, the style uses visibly worked oil paint, with broad and fine directional strokes building trees, buildings, figures, and terrain. It combines richly observed rural and urban scenes with expressive color contrasts, textured surfaces, and densely layered environmental detail."},{"id":"rodney-smith","name":"Rodney Smith","cat":"photographers","en":"Rodney Smith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rodney-smith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rodney-smith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","landscapes","scenes","backlighting","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","dreamy","silhouette"],"colours":["white","grey","black","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Rodney Smith was an American photographer known for his whimsical and surreal imagery, often characterized by elegant compositions and a timeless quality. His work frequently featured formal attire, top hats, and ball gowns, set against natural landscapes or refined interior spaces. Smith's photographs are celebrated for their classical and minimalist style, often evoking a sense of mystery and romance.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photographic imagery with strong backlighting, deep silhouettes, and selective focus. Carefully staged figures in formal clothing are placed within dreamlike landscapes and interiors, while birds, reflections, frames, and oversized natural forms create an uncanny cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"moise-kisling","name":"Moise Kisling","cat":"painters","en":"Moise Kisling","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/moise-kisling.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/moise-kisling","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","floral","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","retro"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-green","muted-orange","red","dark-red","white","deep-blue"],"intro":"Moise Kisling was a Polish-born French painter known for his unique style that combined elements of modernism and expressionism. He was part of the early 20th-century Parisian art scene and was recognized for his portraits and nudes, characterized by elongated forms and vivid colors. His work often reflected a blend of European artistic traditions with a distinctive personal touch.","observation":"The style combines carefully modeled, stylized portraits with vivid red, blue, green, and black accents, visible brush texture, and crisp graphic contours. Fashion, floral arrangements, patterned fabrics, decorative objects, and ornate accessories densely fill the compositions, giving the images a polished vintage-poster character."},{"id":"ursula-von-rydingsvard","name":"Ursula von Rydingsvard","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Ursula von Rydingsvard","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ursula-von-rydingsvard.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ursula-von-rydingsvard","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","subdued-colors","epic"],"colours":["dark-brown","black","white","beige","rust","olive"],"intro":"Ursula von Rydingsvard is a renowned American sculptor known for her monumental works crafted primarily from cedar wood. Her sculptures often explore themes of nature, memory, and personal history, characterized by their large scale and intricate textures. Born in Germany, von Rydingsvard has established herself as a significant figure in contemporary art, with her works displayed in major museums and public spaces worldwide.","observation":"The style presents monumental, highly realistic rock formations with deeply layered, weathered surfaces and irregular carved-looking contours. Warm earth tones, strong volumetric modelling, and human-scale settings make the formations feel like imposing sculptural installations or natural monuments, whether shown indoors or outdoors."},{"id":"david-goldblatt","name":"David Goldblatt","cat":"photographers","en":"David Goldblatt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-goldblatt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-goldblatt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","classical","retro"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","white","charcoal"],"intro":"David Goldblatt is a renowned South African photographer known for his poignant documentation of the social and political landscape of South Africa during the apartheid era. His work often focuses on the everyday lives of people, capturing the nuances of racial segregation and social inequality with a humanistic approach.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white photographic realism, with hard directional light, deep shadows, and carefully composed, filmic framing. It combines candid-looking portraits with formal group tableaux, weathered architecture, period clothing, and vintage vehicles to create a restrained documentary atmosphere."},{"id":"alfredo-jaar","name":"Alfredo Jaar","cat":"various-artists","en":"Alfredo Jaar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alfredo-jaar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alfredo-jaar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","scenes","urban","glow","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","geometric","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-cyan","rust","bone-white"],"intro":"Alfredo Jaar is a Chilean-born artist and architect known for his thought-provoking installations and public interventions that often address social and political issues. His work frequently explores themes of media representation and the power dynamics inherent in the dissemination of information.","observation":"The style is cinematic and realistic, presenting monumental contemporary interiors with strong geometric structure, deep perspective, and carefully balanced solitary figures. Dark industrial spaces are punctuated by luminous screens or bulbs, producing moody blue and amber palettes, strong contrast, reflective floors, and expansive negative space."},{"id":"lee-bul","name":"Lee Bul","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Lee Bul","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lee-bul.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lee-bul","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","urban","fine-lines","metallic","subdued-colors","sci-fi","geometric"],"colours":["grey","silver","brown","white","black"],"intro":"Lee Bul is a South Korean contemporary artist known for her innovative and experimental sculptures and installations. Her work often explores themes of utopia, technology, and the human condition, blending elements of fantasy and reality. Lee Bul's creations are characterized by their intricate designs and use of unconventional materials, which challenge traditional notions of sculpture and space.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental installation-like structures fill gallery interiors, built from reflective silver foil, translucent material, wire, and dense skeletal frameworks. The style is highly intricate and architectural, combining fine linear drawing with sculptural volume, geometric construction, metallic surfaces, and a restrained silver, white, and blue-grey palette."},{"id":"steve-henderson","name":"Steve Henderson","cat":"painters","en":"Steve Henderson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-henderson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-henderson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","glow","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","fantasy","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-brown","brown","ochre","dark-brown","grey","pale-orange"],"intro":"Steve Henderson is a contemporary American artist known for his romantic and impressionistic style. His work often features serene landscapes and intimate portraits, capturing moments of tranquility and introspection.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses luminous, romantic oil-paint handling with clearly visible directional brushwork, softened edges, and richly layered natural textures. Saturated garden, coastal, and sunset colors frame graceful women in flowing dresses, with wind, gesture, and glowing light creating an expressive, dreamlike sense of movement."},{"id":"pentti-sammallahti","name":"Pentti Sammallahti","cat":"photographers","en":"Pentti Sammallahti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pentti-sammallahti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pentti-sammallahti","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","mist","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Pentti Sammallahti is a Finnish photographer known for his black and white landscape photography that captures the serene and often melancholic beauty of Nordic environments. His work is characterized by a deep connection to nature and a keen eye for the subtle interactions between humans and animals in their natural settings.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark monochrome photography combines heavy grain, deep silhouettes, broad areas of pale sky or fog, and sharply isolated figures, trees, and animals. The recurring rural landscapes feel cinematic and bleak, with mist and strong tonal contrast creating a quiet, uncanny sense of solitude."},{"id":"max-gimblett","name":"Max Gimblett","cat":"various-artists","en":"Max Gimblett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/max-gimblett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/max-gimblett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","sculptural","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","black","ochre","vivid-red","dark-blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"Max Gimblett is a New Zealand-born artist known for his abstract and expressive works that often incorporate spiritual and philosophical themes. His art is characterized by the use of bold colors, geometric shapes, and a blend of Eastern and Western influences. Gimblett's work often explores the intersection of art and spirituality, drawing inspiration from Zen Buddhism and calligraphy.","observation":"Across all four works, bold circular and concentric forms are built from saturated red, blue, black, white, and ochre paint. Broad, visibly directional brushstrokes, scraped edges, splatters, drips, and uneven built-up surfaces give the geometric arrangements an energetic, tactile character."},{"id":"alexander-archipenko","name":"Alexander Archipenko","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Alexander Archipenko","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alexander-archipenko.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alexander-archipenko","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","still-life","subdued-colors"],"colours":["white","dark-brown","black","muted-orange","bone-white","brown"],"intro":"Alexander Archipenko is a renowned Ukrainian-American sculptor and artist, recognized for his pioneering work in the field of modern sculpture. Born in 1887, Archipenko was a key figure in the development of Cubism and Constructivism , known for his innovative use of negative space and abstract forms. His work often explored the human figure through a geometric lens, blending traditional sculptural techniques with avant-garde aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents simplified human figures as solid, highly polished sculptures, with sweeping organic contours, elongated proportions, and interlocking limbs. Warm brown wood and bronze-like surfaces, controlled highlights, and pedestal-mounted studio presentation give the renders a refined, tactile, gallery-object appearance."},{"id":"james-van-der-zee","name":"James Van Der Zee","cat":"photographers","en":"James Van Der Zee","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/james-van-der-zee.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/james-van-der-zee","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","cinematic","retro"],"colours":["brown","beige","black","bone-white"],"intro":"James Van Der Zee was an influential African American photographer known for his portraits of black New Yorkers during the Harlem Renaissance. His work captured the elegance, pride, and cultural vitality of the African American community in the early 20th century, often featuring subjects in formal attire and composed settings.","observation":"The style presents richly staged fashion portraits in a sepia-toned monochrome treatment, with highly detailed clothing, elaborate interiors, flowers, carved furniture, and period accessories. Soft focus, film-like grain, restrained lighting, and carefully posed compositions give the images a nostalgic vintage studio-photography character."},{"id":"anish-kapoor","name":"Anish Kapoor","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Anish Kapoor","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anish-kapoor.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anish-kapoor","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","sculptural","characters","urban","metallic","vivid-colors","cinematic","epic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["deep-red","bone-white","beige","white","black","red"],"intro":"Anish Kapoor is a renowned British-Indian sculptor known for his innovative use of materials and monumental works. His art often explores themes of perception, space, and the void, utilizing reflective surfaces and bold colors to create immersive experiences.","observation":"The style presents monumental spherical sculptures in expansive gallery and industrial interiors, rendered with realistic architectural detail and cinematic scale. Saturated crimson surfaces, reflective metallic highlights, dramatic interiors, and tiny human figures create a bold, imposing visual contrast."},{"id":"mark-manders","name":"Mark Manders","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Mark Manders","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-manders.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-manders","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","subdued-colors","surreal","classical"],"colours":["beige","brown","silver","white"],"intro":"Mark Manders is a contemporary Dutch artist known for his sculptural installations that explore themes of identity and the human condition. His work often features fragmented and abstract forms, creating a sense of mystery and introspection.","observation":"The style presents monumental, fragmented human sculptures in bright gallery-like interiors, rendered with convincing weight, rough plaster texture, and abundant structural detail. Restrained beige and gray tones, stark architectural framing, and damaged classical-looking faces create an uncanny blend of realism, ruin, and surreal installation imagery."},{"id":"brent-cotton","name":"Brent Cotton","cat":"painters","en":"Brent Cotton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/brent-cotton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/brent-cotton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["landscapes","portraits","scenes","glow","mist","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","black","brown","dark-brown","rust","bone-white"],"intro":"Brent Cotton is an American painter known for his atmospheric landscapes and mastery of light and shadow. His work often reflects a deep connection to nature, capturing serene and contemplative moments in rural settings. Cotton's paintings are characterized by their tonal richness and subtle interplay of light, evoking a sense of tranquility and introspection.","observation":"The style combines visible painterly brushwork with cinematic, atmospheric compositions centered on shadowy forests, water, firelight, and solitary figures. Deep blue-green darkness is punctuated by warm orange glows, mist-softened distance, reflective surfaces, and expressive, dreamlike imagery."},{"id":"antony-gormley","name":"Antony Gormley","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Antony Gormley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/antony-gormley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/antony-gormley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","urban","subdued-colors","classical","dark","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","silver","white","orange"],"intro":"Antony Gormley is a renowned British sculptor known for his exploration of the human form and space. His works often involve large-scale installations that challenge perceptions of the body and its relationship to the environment. Gormley's sculptures frequently use industrial materials like cast iron and steel, reflecting themes of isolation and introspection.","observation":"The style presents monumental geometric sculptures in spacious architectural interiors, rendered with highly realistic detail and strong attention to material weight, rust, shadow, and structure. Restrained earthy colors, axial compositions, and recurring human figures establish a dramatic contrast between industrial forms and historic or gallery-like spaces."},{"id":"frederic-leighton","name":"Frederic Leighton","cat":"painters","en":"Frederic Leighton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/frederic-leighton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/frederic-leighton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["deep-red","dark-brown","black","brown","light-orange"],"intro":"Frederic Leighton was a prominent British painter and sculptor of the 19th century, known for his association with the Victorian era and the Aesthetic Movement. His works often depicted classical themes, historical subjects, and mythological scenes, characterized by their meticulous attention to detail and refined elegance. Leighton's art is celebrated for its academic precision and the harmonious blending of color and form.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly layered oil-paint surfaces with visible, controlled brushwork, finely modeled faces, and highly articulated folds, hair, and ornament. Warm auburn, brown, cream, and black tones dominate, with strong light-dark separation and emotionally intimate, classically staged figures."},{"id":"steve-sack","name":"Steve Sack","cat":"illustrators","en":"Steve Sack","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/steve-sack.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/steve-sack","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","comics"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","white","light-orange","dark-brown","orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Steve Sack is an American cartoonist known for his editorial cartoons and illustrations. He has been recognized for his work in newspapers and has received several awards for his contributions to the field of cartooning.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses highly detailed illustrative caricature with exaggerated faces, expressive gestures, crisp fine ink lines, crosshatched shading, and selective painterly texture. Saturated reds, skin tones, dark suits, and strong light-dark separation give the compositions a vivid, comic-editorial impact, while each image stages a humorous or pointed character-driven situation."},{"id":"joan-fontcuberta","name":"Joan Fontcuberta","cat":"various-artists","en":"Joan Fontcuberta","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joan-fontcuberta.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joan-fontcuberta","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","brown","white"],"intro":"Joan Fontcuberta is a Spanish artist known for his innovative work in photography and conceptual art. His work often explores themes of reality, fiction, and the nature of images, challenging viewers to question the authenticity of what they see. Fontcuberta's art is characterized by its playful yet critical approach to the medium of photography, often incorporating elements of surrealism and narrative storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark monochrome photographic imagery with strong tonal separation, fine surface detail, and a subtle grain that gives the scenes a tactile, filmic presence. Human figures are paired with oversized or unusually positioned birds in uncanny, darkly surreal tableaux, often isolated against shadowed studio grounds or sparse misty landscapes."},{"id":"tom-ford","name":"Tom Ford","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Tom Ford","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-ford.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-ford","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","muted-orange","dark-red","rust","bone-white","deep-red"],"intro":"Tom Ford is an American fashion designer and filmmaker known for his work with Gucci and his own label, Tom Ford. He has been a significant figure in the fashion industry, recognized for his sleek, modern designs and luxurious aesthetic.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, tightly cropped beauty portraits with meticulous skin, makeup, hair, and eyewear detail. Saturated reds and browns, hard directional lighting, deep shadows, and reflective glossy surfaces create a bold, dramatic fashion-editorial look."},{"id":"domenichino","name":"Domenichino","cat":"painters","en":"Domenichino","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/domenichino.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/domenichino","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical","religious"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-blue","beige","muted-cyan","rust"],"intro":"Domenichino is a renowned Italian Baroque painter known for his classical compositions and detailed depictions of religious and mythological subjects. His works are celebrated for their harmonious balance, elegant figures, and use of rich color palettes, reflecting the ideals of the Counter-Reformation period.","observation":"The style uses richly textured oil-paint handling, visible broad strokes, strong modeling, and saturated blue, red, and earth tones. Grand landscape settings, monumental architecture, robed figures, and dramatic cloud formations are composed as densely detailed, theatrical tableaux with an antique sacred atmosphere."},{"id":"arthur-wardle","name":"Arthur Wardle","cat":"painters","en":"Arthur Wardle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/arthur-wardle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/arthur-wardle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","floral","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","dark-ochre","black","muted-ochre","dark-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Arthur Wardle is a renowned English painter, celebrated for his detailed and expressive depictions of animals and mythological scenes. Born in 1860, Wardle's work often captures the essence of the Victorian era, blending realism with romanticism. His paintings are known for their intricate detail and vibrant color palettes, often featuring animals in dynamic and engaging compositions.","observation":"The style is richly painterly, with broad, visible strokes building textured foliage, fur, fabric, masonry, and flowers. It combines detailed outdoor tableaux of people and animals with warm, subdued natural colors and a classical garden setting, while expressive lighting and lively gestures keep the scenes animated."},{"id":"mark-bradford","name":"Mark Bradford","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Bradford","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-bradford.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-bradford","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","patterns","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","grey","brown","red"],"intro":"Mark Bradford is an American artist known for his large-scale abstract paintings that explore social and political themes. His work often incorporates materials found in urban environments, such as billboard paper and other detritus, to create textured and layered compositions that reflect the complexity of contemporary life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is a dense, aggressively layered painting built from scraped impasto, broad directional strokes, drips, splatters, and collage-like fragments. Saturated reds, blacks, whites, and blues create a high-contrast field in which partial figures and architectural or diagrammatic forms emerge and dissolve into energetic abstraction."},{"id":"sol-lewitt","name":"Sol LeWitt","cat":"painters","en":"Sol LeWitt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sol-lewitt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sol-lewitt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","patterns","scenes","flat-color","vivid-colors","cinematic","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","red","dark-olive","bone-white","light-orange","dark-blue"],"intro":"Sol LeWitt is a renowned American artist known for his contributions to conceptual art and minimalism. He gained prominence in the 1960s with his innovative approach to art, emphasizing ideas over visual forms. LeWitt's work often involves geometric shapes, systematic processes, and vibrant color schemes, influencing a wide range of contemporary art practices.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated geometric murals and installations dominate expansive gallery interiors, using flat-edged blocks, stripes, and sharply bounded color fields. The imagery is clean and illustrative yet materially textured, with strong architectural perspective, dramatic sunlight, and small human figures providing scale."},{"id":"jan-van-scorel","name":"Jan van Scorel","cat":"painters","en":"Jan van Scorel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jan-van-scorel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jan-van-scorel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-blue","beige","ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Jan van Scorel is a notable figure in the history of art, recognized for his contributions to the Northern Renaissance. Born in 1495 in the Netherlands, he was a painter and architect who played a significant role in introducing Italian Renaissance art styles to the northern regions of Europe. His works often feature religious themes, detailed landscapes, and portraiture, reflecting the influence of his travels to Italy and his exposure to the works of artists like Michelangelo and Raphael.","observation":"The style uses highly realistic, finely modelled painting with visible delicate brushwork, dense surface detail, and dramatic light against deep shadows. Formal portraits and narrative figures are framed by lavish flowers, foliage, textiles, jewelry, and architectural scenery in restrained yet richly varied colors."},{"id":"sam-maloof","name":"Sam Maloof","cat":"designers","en":"Sam Maloof","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sam-maloof.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sam-maloof","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["grey","beige","white","brown","dark-rust","dark-brown"],"intro":"Sam Maloof was an American woodworker and furniture designer renowned for his handcrafted wooden furniture, particularly his rocking chairs. His work is celebrated for its elegant design, fine craftsmanship, and organic forms, making him a pivotal figure in the American studio furniture movement.","observation":"The style presents furniture as highly polished, sculptural wooden forms with exaggerated organic curves, elongated supports, and irregular openings. Realistic wood grain, controlled studio lighting, neutral gallery settings, and strong cast shadows give the surreal designs the appearance of refined product photography."},{"id":"ray-metzker","name":"Ray Metzker","cat":"photographers","en":"Ray Metzker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ray-metzker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ray-metzker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","characters","urban","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","geometric","silhouette"],"colours":["black","silver","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Ray Metzker is an influential American photographer known for his innovative use of light and shadow in black and white photography. His work often explores urban environments, capturing the interplay between architecture and human figures. Metzker's unique approach to composition and contrast has left a lasting impact on the field of photography.","observation":"Across all four images, stark monochrome photography combines severe geometric architecture with isolated human figures and strongly blocked shadows. Hard directional light creates deep silhouettes, long cast shadows, and a tense, filmic urban mood."},{"id":"franz-west","name":"Franz West","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Franz West","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/franz-west.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/franz-west","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","characters","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","geometric"],"colours":["silver","beige","red","dark-red","ochre"],"intro":"Franz West was an Austrian artist known for his unconventional sculptures and installations that often challenged traditional perceptions of art. Born in 1947, West became a significant figure in the contemporary art scene, particularly noted for his humorous and abstract works that engaged viewers in unique ways. His art often incorporated everyday materials, creating pieces that blurred the lines between art and functionality.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental, roughly modeled sculptural forms with chunky organic contours and visibly built-up surfaces. Pastel pinks and saturated yellow, coral, turquoise, and blue areas create a playful, surreal installation-like atmosphere, shown in bright contemporary gallery spaces."},{"id":"santosh-sivan","name":"Santosh Sivan","cat":"filmmakers","en":"Santosh Sivan","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/santosh-sivan.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/santosh-sivan","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","painterly","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver","white"],"intro":"Santosh Sivan is an acclaimed Indian filmmaker and cinematographer known for his work in Indian cinema. He has contributed significantly to the visual storytelling landscape with his unique style and artistic vision, often blending traditional and contemporary elements.","observation":"The style centers on intimate, expressive male portraits rendered in stark black and white, with strong tonal contrast and cinematic framing. Most images feel photographic, using shallow focus and natural interior light, while the painted treatment introduces visible gestural brushwork without losing the likeness or moody atmosphere."},{"id":"david-teniers-the-younger","name":"David Teniers the Younger","cat":"painters","en":"David Teniers the Younger","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-teniers-the-younger.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-teniers-the-younger","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-brown","muted-blue","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"David Teniers the Younger is a renowned Flemish Baroque painter, celebrated for his genre scenes and depictions of peasant life. Born in 1610 in Antwerp, he became a master of capturing the everyday activities of rural and domestic settings with a humorous and detailed touch. His works often include lively tavern scenes, rustic interiors, and playful interactions between people and animals, reflecting the social and cultural life of 17th-century Flanders.","observation":"The style is richly painterly, using visible layered brushwork, earthy muted colors, and dramatic pools of warm and cool light. It combines densely populated rustic interiors with pastoral outdoor scenes, emphasizing expressive figures, weathered materials, atmospheric depth, and lively communal activity."},{"id":"vito-acconci","name":"Vito Acconci","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Vito Acconci","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vito-acconci.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vito-acconci","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey"],"intro":"Vito Acconci was an influential American artist known for his pioneering work in performance and installation art. He gained prominence in the 1970s with his provocative and often controversial pieces that explored themes of space, identity, and the body. Acconci's work frequently challenged the boundaries between public and private spaces, and he was a key figure in the development of conceptual art.","observation":"The style uses stark black-and-white portrait photography with pronounced grain, deep shadows, and hard tonal separation. Intimate close-ups, expressive poses, and austere interiors create a bleak, psychologically intense cinematic mood across the four images."},{"id":"gerda-taro","name":"Gerda Taro","cat":"photographers","en":"Gerda Taro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerda-taro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerda-taro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey","white"],"intro":"Gerda Taro was a pioneering photojournalist known for her work during the Spanish Civil War. She was one of the first female war photographers and is celebrated for her fearless documentation of conflict. Taro's work is characterized by its intimate and humanistic approach, capturing the raw emotions and realities of war.","observation":"The style is high-contrast black-and-white photography, combining candid portraiture with documentary crowd scenes. Selective focus, visible film grain, hard directional light, and heavily layered foreground figures create an intimate, observational, cinematic image of spectators in a dense gathering."},{"id":"wilfredo-lam","name":"Wilfredo Lam","cat":"painters","en":"Wilfredo Lam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wilfredo-lam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wilfredo-lam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["dark-brown","white","grey","brown","light-yellow","ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"Wilfredo Lam was a Cuban artist known for his unique style that blended elements of surrealism, cubism, and Afro-Cuban symbolism. Born in 1902, Lam's work often reflects his multicultural heritage and explores themes related to identity, spirituality, and mythology. His art is characterized by its bold use of color, abstract forms, and incorporation of African and Caribbean cultural motifs.","observation":"Across all four images, elongated humanoid figures are built from sharp geometric planes, heavy dark outlines, and masklike facial forms. Muted earth tones and weathered brush texture are punctuated by turquoise and red accents, while radiating spikes and fragmented anatomy create an expressive, surreal fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"francois-xavier-lalanne","name":"Francois-Xavier Lalanne","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Francois-Xavier Lalanne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francois-xavier-lalanne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francois-xavier-lalanne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","fashion","metallic","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","beige","brown","ochre"],"intro":"Francois-Xavier Lalanne is a renowned French sculptor known for his whimsical and surreal animal sculptures. His work often combines functionality with art, creating pieces that are both playful and practical. Lalanne's sculptures are celebrated for their imaginative forms and integration into everyday environments.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, sculptural animal-shaped furniture in a refined gallery-like setting. Muted neutral tones, reflective gold surfaces, plush shag textures, soft studio lighting, and generous negative space give the images a luxurious editorial feel."},{"id":"max-pechstein","name":"Max Pechstein","cat":"painters","en":"Max Pechstein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/max-pechstein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/max-pechstein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","portraits","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","muted-olive","dark-brown","red","orange"],"intro":"Max Pechstein is a prominent German Expressionist painter known for his vibrant use of color and dynamic compositions. Born in 1881, he was a member of the Die Brücke movement, which sought to create a new form of art that expressed raw emotion and broke away from traditional academic styles. Pechstein's work often features bold brushstrokes and vivid colors, capturing the essence of early 20th-century modernism.","observation":"Across all four renders, thick, visibly directional brushstrokes build faces, foliage, water, and clothing with a heavily worked painted surface. Saturated coral, orange, blue, green, and yellow are set against dark contours, producing an intense, expressive style that combines portraits, figures, animals, and tropical landscapes."},{"id":"pieter-aertsen","name":"Pieter Aertsen","cat":"painters","en":"Pieter Aertsen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pieter-aertsen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pieter-aertsen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","animals","characters","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","dark-brown","ochre","dark-red","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Pieter Aertsen was a Dutch painter known for his pioneering work in genre painting and still life during the Northern Renaissance. Born in 1508, Aertsen's work often depicted domestic scenes with a focus on everyday life, integrating religious themes subtly within his compositions. His paintings are celebrated for their intricate detail and vibrant depiction of food and kitchen scenes, reflecting the cultural and social aspects of 16th-century Netherlands.","observation":"The style is densely composed and highly painterly, combining crowded figures, animals, hanging game, and overflowing food into an ornate tableau. Fine brushwork, tactile surfaces, subdued earthy colors, and deep shadow create a classical yet strange and expressive atmosphere, with grotesque facial details and surreal juxtapositions throughout."},{"id":"walasse-ting","name":"Walasse Ting","cat":"various-artists","en":"Walasse Ting","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walasse-ting.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walasse-ting","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","floral","patterns","portraits","bold-lines","fine-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["pink","dark-green","blue","vivid-red","orange"],"intro":"Walasse Ting was a Chinese-American artist known for his vibrant and colorful paintings, often featuring women, animals, and nature. Born in Shanghai in 1929, Ting moved to Paris in the 1950s and later to New York, where he became associated with the avant-garde art scene. His work is characterized by its bold use of color and expressive brushwork, blending elements of Eastern and Western art traditions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly saturated pinks, blues, greens, reds, and yellows with visibly hand-painted, gestural marks. Figurative hints such as faces, flowers, foliage, and organic forms are flattened into bold outlined shapes and energetic abstract color fields."},{"id":"scott-adams","name":"Scott Adams","cat":"illustrators","en":"Scott Adams","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/scott-adams.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/scott-adams","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","animals","characters","urban","bold-lines","fine-lines","vivid-colors","comics","drawing","ink"],"colours":["light-orange","beige","black","rust","dark-brown","silver"],"intro":"Scott Adams is an American cartoonist and creator of the popular comic strip \"Dilbert,\" which satirizes office culture and corporate life. Known for his humor and insight into the absurdities of work environments, Adams has gained a significant following and has published several books related to the themes explored in his comics.","observation":"Across all four designs, the style uses expressive comic-like figures with strong black contouring, dense interior hatching, and carefully packed small details. Mostly flat, limited color fills sit beneath the ink drawing, while eccentric animals, robots, crowds, and city forms give the tattoos a playful, surreal narrative quality."},{"id":"gaston-lachaise","name":"Gaston Lachaise","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Gaston Lachaise","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gaston-lachaise.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gaston-lachaise","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","grey","black","silver","bone-white"],"intro":"Gaston Lachaise was a French-American sculptor known for his monumental female nudes and contributions to modernist sculpture. Born in 1882 in Paris, he moved to the United States in 1906, where he became a prominent figure in the art world. Lachaise's work is celebrated for its exploration of the human form, characterized by exaggerated proportions and a sense of vitality.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, three-dimensional stone and metal sculptures with weighty volumes, carved facial features, and visibly weathered surfaces. Restrained earth tones, controlled studio lighting, and neutral backdrops emphasize the material texture and classical, monumental character of the figures."},{"id":"jean-paul-riopelle","name":"Jean-Paul Riopelle","cat":"painters","en":"Jean-Paul Riopelle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jean-paul-riopelle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jean-paul-riopelle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","beige","dark-red","bone-white","vivid-red","deep-blue","orange"],"intro":"Jean-Paul Riopelle was a Canadian painter and sculptor, known for his abstract expressionist work. He was a prominent figure in the post-war art scene, contributing significantly to the Automatism movement. Riopelle's work is characterized by its dynamic use of color and texture, often employing a palette knife to create thick, impasto surfaces.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style is intensely abstract and painterly, built from thick, visibly worked paint, palette-knife ridges, scraped passages, drips, and energetic linear gestures. Saturated reds, blacks, whites, blues, and greens collide in dense, high-contrast fields of fragmented geometry, producing an expressive, almost turbulent surface rather than readable subject matter."},{"id":"aleksey-savrasov","name":"Aleksey Savrasov","cat":"painters","en":"Aleksey Savrasov","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/aleksey-savrasov.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/aleksey-savrasov","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","surreal","epic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","beige","light-orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Aleksey Savrasov was a Russian landscape painter known for his emotive and atmospheric depictions of rural scenes and nature. He played a significant role in the development of the Russian landscape painting tradition in the 19th century, contributing to the Romantic and Realist movements with his detailed and evocative works.","observation":"The style presents expansive, highly detailed winter landscapes with monumental Gothic architecture, turbulent skies, and small figures that emphasize scale. Painterly textures, misty atmospheric depth, strong dark-to-light contrast, and internal sunset or fire-like glow create a dramatic, melancholic fantasy mood across all four images."},{"id":"tony-fitzpatrick","name":"Tony Fitzpatrick","cat":"various-artists","en":"Tony Fitzpatrick","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tony-fitzpatrick.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tony-fitzpatrick","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","ornate","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","surreal","drawing","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["light-orange","dark-brown","grey","black","vivid-red","orange","deep-blue"],"intro":"Tony Fitzpatrick is an American artist known for his intricate collages and mixed media works that often incorporate elements of urban life and personal narratives. His art is characterized by a rich tapestry of symbols, text, and imagery that reflect his experiences and observations.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is intensely dense and decorative, combining bold outlined figures, masks, skulls, eyes, suns, geometric fields, and repeated ornamental framing. Saturated red, blue, black, cream, and orange areas are arranged in flat graphic shapes, while abundant small motifs and symmetrical icon-like faces create a surreal, collage-like visual overload."},{"id":"taro-okamoto","name":"Taro Okamoto","cat":"painters","en":"Taro Okamoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/taro-okamoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/taro-okamoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","detailed","ornate","motion","fine-lines","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","bone-white","vivid-red","brown","orange","muted-blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"Taro Okamoto is a renowned Japanese artist known for his avant-garde and abstract art, often characterized by bold colors and dynamic compositions. His work is deeply influenced by Japanese culture and post-war sentiments, making him a significant figure in modern art.","observation":"The style combines visibly fluid, marbled paint with dense decorative detail, splatters, fine contouring, and sharply contrasted black grounds. Saturated reds, blues, oranges, and greens form swirling organic and floral motifs, shifting between recognizable fragments and surreal abstract compositions."},{"id":"anthony-caro","name":"Anthony Caro","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Anthony Caro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anthony-caro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anthony-caro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","sculptural","still-life","urban","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["white","beige","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Anthony Caro is a renowned British sculptor known for his abstract metal sculptures. Born in 1924, Caro's work is characterized by his innovative use of industrial materials and large-scale compositions. He studied under Henry Moore and became a leading figure in modernist sculpture, contributing significantly to the development of abstract art in the 20th century.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents large abstract sculptures assembled from angular plates, beams, and irregular fabricated parts, with a strong sense of physical weight and construction. Restrained rust, brown, grey, and occasional muted blue tones contrast with spacious white gallery interiors and clean, documentary-like presentation."},{"id":"joel-shapiro","name":"Joel Shapiro","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Joel Shapiro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joel-shapiro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joel-shapiro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","sculptural","urban","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["white","brown","beige","bone-white","black"],"intro":"Joel Shapiro is an American sculptor known for his dynamic and abstract forms. His work often explores the human figure through geometric abstraction, creating pieces that challenge perceptions of balance and movement. Shapiro's sculptures are characterized by their simplicity and expressive power, often using materials like wood and bronze.","observation":"The style presents monumental geometric sculptures as realistic architectural photographs, emphasizing solid mass, angular construction, and weathered metal surfaces. Restrained earthy browns and grays, spacious compositions, and urban or gallery settings give the images a sober, contemporary public-art appearance."},{"id":"rube-goldberg","name":"Rube Goldberg","cat":"illustrators","en":"Rube Goldberg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rube-goldberg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rube-goldberg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","patterns","scenes","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["muted-ochre","beige","pale-yellow","bone-white","dark-brown","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Rube Goldberg was an American cartoonist, sculptor, author, engineer, and inventor, known for his popular cartoons depicting complicated gadgets performing simple tasks in indirect, convoluted ways. His work inspired the term \"Rube Goldberg machines,\" referring to overly complex contraptions.","observation":"Across all four renders, densely assembled mechanical contraptions combine fine drawn lines with convincing three-dimensional objects, glassware, wood, metal, and suspended parts. The restrained earthy palette, vintage apparatus, and intricate webs of wires create an elaborate illustrative still-life style with a whimsical sense of engineered motion."},{"id":"henry-ossawa-tanner","name":"Henry Ossawa Tanner","cat":"painters","en":"Henry Ossawa Tanner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/henry-ossawa-tanner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/henry-ossawa-tanner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","scenes","glow","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Henry Ossawa Tanner was an influential African American painter known for his religious and genre scenes. Born in 1859 in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, Tanner became the first African American painter to gain international acclaim. His work often depicted biblical themes and was characterized by a blend of realism and symbolism, with a focus on light and atmosphere. Tanner's paintings are celebrated for their spiritual depth and emotional resonance, reflecting his personal experiences and cultural heritage.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly broad, textured brushwork and expressive, loosely defined forms to depict hooded figures in shadowy underground settings. A restrained palette of deep blue, brown, charcoal, and amber is intensified by small internal light sources such as candles, producing dramatic contrast and a dark, mystical atmosphere."},{"id":"gertrude-kasebier","name":"Gertrude Kasebier","cat":"photographers","en":"Gertrude Kasebier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gertrude-kasebier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gertrude-kasebier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","floral","portraits","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","retro","dark"],"colours":["beige","black","charcoal","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Gertrude Kasebier was a pioneering American photographer known for her work in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. She was a prominent figure in the pictorialist movement, which sought to elevate photography to the status of fine art. Her portraits often focused on women and children, capturing intimate and emotive moments with a soft, painterly quality.","observation":"The style uses richly textured monochrome portrait photography with sepia warmth, pronounced grain, dramatic shadows, and selective focus. Victorian garments, veils, flowers, and parasols create an ornate period mood, while close crops and controlled theatrical lighting give the portraits a haunting, cinematic presence."},{"id":"armand-guillaumin","name":"Armand Guillaumin","cat":"painters","en":"Armand Guillaumin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/armand-guillaumin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/armand-guillaumin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","bone-white","muted-olive","muted-blue","rust","deep-blue"],"intro":"Armand Guillaumin was a French Impressionist painter known for his vibrant landscapes and use of color. Born in 1841, he was associated with the Impressionist movement and was a contemporary of artists like Monet and Pissarro. Guillaumin's work often depicted rural scenes and the natural beauty of the French countryside, characterized by bold brushstrokes and a vivid color palette.","observation":"Across all four renders, natural landscapes are built from visible, directional paint strokes, with richly textured trees, terrain, water, and skies. Saturated greens, blues, ochres, and autumn reds create expressive seasonal variation, while paths, rivers, and valleys lead the eye through detailed pastoral settings."},{"id":"noemie-goudal","name":"Noemie Goudal","cat":"various-artists","en":"Noemie Goudal","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/noemie-goudal.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/noemie-goudal","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","mist","subdued-colors","surreal","dreamy","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","silver","black","grey","white"],"intro":"Noemie Goudal is a contemporary French artist known for her exploration of the relationship between architecture and nature through photography and installation art. Her work often involves creating large-scale photographic installations that challenge perceptions of space and reality.","observation":"The style combines highly realistic, finely resolved environments with surreal architectural interventions: transparent geometric structures contain or reflect cliffs, clouds, ruins, and water. Muted natural colors, diffuse overcast light, reflective surfaces, and generous atmospheric space create a quiet, dreamlike cinematic mood across both interior and coastal landscapes."},{"id":"barthel-bruyn-the-elder","name":"Barthel Bruyn the Elder","cat":"painters","en":"Barthel Bruyn the Elder","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barthel-bruyn-the-elder.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barthel-bruyn-the-elder","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","landscapes","portraits","scenes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","religious","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","white","muted-ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Barthel Bruyn the Elder was a German painter of the Northern Renaissance , renowned for his detailed portraits and religious scenes. Active during the 16th century, he was known for his ability to capture the essence of his subjects with precision and depth. His works often featured intricate details and rich color palettes, reflecting the cultural and religious milieu of his time.","observation":"The style presents richly modeled oil paintings with visible brushwork, dense surface detail, and carefully rendered fabrics, faces, wood, and landscape. Dark, subdued tonalities are punctuated by red drapery and warm gold framing, while devotional figures, halos, dramatic skies, and theatrical gestures create a solemn religious atmosphere."},{"id":"charles-white","name":"Charles White","cat":"painters","en":"Charles White","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-white.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-white","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","portraits","crosshatching","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","ink","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","beige","ochre"],"intro":"Charles White is a renowned American artist known for his powerful and emotive depictions of African American subjects. His work often explores themes of identity, struggle, and resilience, reflecting the social and cultural issues of his time. White's art is celebrated for its technical mastery and profound emotional impact, making him a significant figure in 20th-century American art.","observation":"The style uses intensely cropped, expressive portraiture with strongly modelled faces, dramatic shadow, and a tactile engraved or woodcut-like surface. Dense crosshatching and ink-like linework dominate the monochrome lower imagery, while the upper imagery adds restrained earthy color without losing the high-contrast, sculptural treatment."},{"id":"buckminster-fuller","name":"Buckminster Fuller","cat":"architects","en":"Buckminster Fuller","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/buckminster-fuller.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/buckminster-fuller","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","landscapes","glow","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","sci-fi","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["charcoal","black","brown","grey","muted-ochre","pale-yellow","deep-red"],"intro":"Buckminster Fuller was an American architect, systems theorist, author, designer, and inventor known for his work on geodesic domes and his visionary ideas about sustainable living and design. He was a prominent figure in the 20th century, advocating for innovative approaches to architecture and technology.","observation":"The style combines monumental, faceted geometric forms with surreal science-fiction imagery, including domed structures, floating orbs, and an uncanny helmeted portrait. Dark teal and copper-leaning colors, strong light-dark separation, visible grain, fine diagrammatic linework, and luminous highlights give the scenes a weathered, cinematic-concept-art atmosphere."},{"id":"camille-corot","name":"Camille Corot","cat":"painters","en":"Camille Corot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/camille-corot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/camille-corot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","grey","ochre"],"intro":"Camille Corot was a 19th-century French painter known for his landscape paintings and contributions to the Barbizon School. His work is characterized by a naturalistic style, often depicting serene and tranquil rural scenes with a focus on light and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, expansive pastoral landscapes are built with visible, softly textured brushwork, dense tree forms, reflective water, and atmospheric distance. Restrained earth greens, browns, and blue-grey skies are punctuated by luminous breaks in the clouds, creating a tranquil yet melancholic, dreamlike mood."},{"id":"eve-arnold","name":"Eve Arnold","cat":"photographers","en":"Eve Arnold","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eve-arnold.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eve-arnold","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","white","silver"],"intro":"Eve Arnold was an American photojournalist known for her insightful and humanistic approach to photography. Born in 1912, she became one of the first female members of the Magnum Photos agency. Arnold is celebrated for her candid portraits of celebrities, as well as her documentation of social issues and everyday life, capturing the essence of the human experience with empathy and depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white photography with pronounced grain, deep shadows, and bright highlights. It combines candid character studies with observational social scenes, frequently using shallow focus, expressive gestures, and cinematic framing."},{"id":"kris-kuksi","name":"Kris Kuksi","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Kris Kuksi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kris-kuksi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kris-kuksi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","landscapes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","grey","black","muted-ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Kris Kuksi is an American artist known for his intricate and fantastical sculptures that often explore themes of mortality, decay, and the interplay between the organic and the mechanical. His work is characterized by a neo-baroque style, blending elements of gothic architecture, mythology, and industrial motifs to create complex and detailed assemblages.","observation":"Across all four renders, monumental ships and citadel-like structures are densely layered with spires, statues, rigging, carvings, and weathered architectural fragments. The subdued, dark palette and selective warm interior lights create a brooding fantastical atmosphere, while the highly dimensional forms and elaborate surfaces make the scenes feel sculptural and richly ornate."},{"id":"guido-van-helten","name":"Guido van Helten","cat":"street-artists","en":"Guido van Helten","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/guido-van-helten.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/guido-van-helten","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["dark-brown","grey","charcoal","white","muted-orange","blue"],"intro":"Guido van Helten is an Australian artist known for his large-scale, photorealistic murals that often depict human faces and expressions. His work is celebrated for its ability to transform urban spaces and engage with the community, often reflecting local stories and identities.","observation":"The style combines monumental, expressive portrait painting with industrial architecture, wrapping carefully rendered faces around silos and warehouse walls. Earthy subdued colors, visible fine brushwork, weathered surfaces, and strong natural light create a detailed yet grounded mural-like realism across varied viewpoints."},{"id":"anthony-lister","name":"Anthony Lister","cat":"street-artists","en":"Anthony Lister","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/anthony-lister.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/anthony-lister","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","characters","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","ink"],"colours":["white","bone-white","black","brown","red","vivid-red","olive","dark-blue"],"intro":"Anthony Lister is an Australian contemporary artist known for his work in street art and painting. He has gained recognition for his unique style that blends elements of graffiti, pop culture, and fine art. Lister's work often explores themes of modern society, identity, and the human condition, characterized by a dynamic and expressive approach.","observation":"Across all four panels, loosely recognizable faces and figures dissolve into energetic fields of layered paint, gestural marks, and fragmented geometric patches. Broad visible strokes, ink-like contours, drips, splatters, and sharp black accents create a vivid, high-contrast surface with an intentionally unstable, dreamlike sense of form."},{"id":"nobuo-sekine","name":"Nobuo Sekine","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Nobuo Sekine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/nobuo-sekine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/nobuo-sekine","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","metallic","subdued-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","silver","grey","dark-brown","white","black"],"intro":"Nobuo Sekine is a renowned Japanese sculptor and a pivotal figure in the Mono-ha movement, which emerged in the late 1960s. Known for his conceptual and minimalist approach, Sekine's work often explores the relationship between natural and industrial materials, creating a dialogue between the viewer and the environment. His most famous work, \"Phase⁠—Mother Earth,\" exemplifies his interest in the interplay of form, space, and perception.","observation":"The style presents surreal sculptural installations as highly realistic, carefully lit gallery photographs, with tactile materials and convincing reflections, folds, grain, and stone texture. Restrained neutral colors, spacious compositions, and isolated monumental objects create a quiet, museum-like atmosphere."},{"id":"minor-martin-white","name":"Minor Martin White","cat":"photographers","en":"Minor Martin White","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/minor-martin-white.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/minor-martin-white","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","landscapes","backlighting","mist","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","silhouette"],"colours":["black","charcoal","bone-white","brown","beige"],"intro":"Minor Martin White is a renowned American photographer known for his black and white photography, which often explores themes of spirituality and the human condition. His work is characterized by its deep emotional resonance and technical precision, making him a pivotal figure in 20th-century photography.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is monochrome landscape photography with strong backlighting, deep silhouettes, and a subdued, atmospheric tonal range. Grain, haze, and selective softness give the scenes a stark, moody, almost nocturnal quality while isolated trees, hills, ruins, and celestial light create quiet visual drama."},{"id":"vicente-romero-redondo","name":"Vicente Romero Redondo","cat":"painters","en":"Vicente Romero Redondo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vicente-romero-redondo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vicente-romero-redondo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","portraits","scenes","glow","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","muted-brown","light-lime"],"intro":"Vicente Romero Redondo is a contemporary Spanish painter known for his impressionistic realism, focusing on intimate and serene depictions of feminine beauty and domestic scenes. His works often feature soft pastels and warm tones, capturing the essence of Mediterranean life with a romantic and tranquil atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, directional paint strokes to model softly posed women, elaborate white garments, roses, and sunlit interiors. Warm natural light and occasional candlelight create a subdued, gently moody palette, while floral surroundings and period-inspired interiors provide detailed, intimate scenes."},{"id":"john-frederick-kensett","name":"John Frederick Kensett","cat":"painters","en":"John Frederick Kensett","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-frederick-kensett.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-frederick-kensett","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","landscapes","scenes","glow","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["black","bone-white","beige","dark-brown","brown","grey"],"intro":"John Frederick Kensett was an American landscape painter associated with the Hudson River School and Luminism. Born in 1816, Kensett is renowned for his serene and detailed depictions of natural settings, particularly coastal scenes and tranquil landscapes. His work is characterized by a meticulous attention to light and atmosphere, capturing the subtle interplay of sunlight and shadow.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents expansive, highly naturalistic landscapes with dense vegetation, reflective water, distant mountains, and towering cloud formations. Warm low-angle light, softened atmospheric depth, and visible painterly texture give the scenes a romantic, dreamlike grandeur while retaining richly resolved environmental detail."},{"id":"ernst-barlach","name":"Ernst Barlach","cat":"printmakers","en":"Ernst Barlach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernst-barlach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernst-barlach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","religious","dark"],"colours":["beige","white","brown","black","dark-brown"],"intro":"Ernst Barlach was a German expressionist sculptor, printmaker, and writer known for his deeply emotive works that often explored themes of human suffering and spirituality. Born in 1870, Barlach's art was heavily influenced by the socio-political upheavals of his time, particularly World War I. His sculptures and prints are characterized by their expressive forms and emotional depth, often depicting solitary figures in moments of introspection or despair.","observation":"The style presents solemn, hooded human figures as heavy carved sculptures, with faceted anatomy, visible chisel marks, deep recesses, and strongly modelled volume. Restrained brown, bronze, and charcoal tones, dramatic shadowing, and repeated gestures of covering the face create an austere, devotional mood across the four views."},{"id":"paolo-pellegrin","name":"Paolo Pellegrin","cat":"photographers","en":"Paolo Pellegrin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paolo-pellegrin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paolo-pellegrin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","portraits","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","silver"],"intro":"Paolo Pellegrin is an acclaimed Italian photojournalist known for his compelling documentary photography. His work often explores themes of human conflict, natural disasters, and the human condition, capturing powerful and emotive images that tell profound stories.","observation":"A stark monochrome photographic style built around intimate faces, deep blacks, blown highlights, and expressive, psychologically charged poses. Reflections, wet or scratched glass, smoke, blurred lights, shallow focus, and visible grain create a tense, nocturnal cinematic atmosphere across the set."},{"id":"elliott-erwitt","name":"Elliott Erwitt","cat":"photographers","en":"Elliott Erwitt","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/elliott-erwitt.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/elliott-erwitt","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","silver","grey","white"],"intro":"Elliott Erwitt is a renowned American photographer known for his candid and often humorous black-and-white images. Born in 1928, Erwitt's work spans decades, capturing everyday moments with a unique blend of wit and poignancy. His photographs often explore themes of human interaction, irony, and the absurdities of life, making him a prominent figure in the world of documentary and street photography.","observation":"The style uses realistic black-and-white photography with strong tonal contrast, grain, and selective focus. It frames candid urban encounters⁠—people, dogs, cafés, and transit interiors⁠—through layered windows, reflections, and tightly composed cinematic scenes with a dark, atmospheric mood."},{"id":"thomas-edwin-mostyn","name":"Thomas Edwin Mostyn","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Edwin Mostyn","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-edwin-mostyn.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-edwin-mostyn","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["black","dark-red","brown","muted-brown","muted-orange","vivid-red"],"intro":"Thomas Edwin Mostyn is a British painter known for his romantic and idyllic landscapes, often depicting serene and dreamlike scenes. His work is characterized by a rich use of color and detailed compositions, drawing inspiration from the Victorian era and pre-Raphaelite movement. Mostyn's paintings often feature lush gardens, historical settings, and figures in contemplative poses, creating a sense of nostalgia and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visible brushwork with layered botanical detail and softly modelled figures. Deep teal, brown, and red tones create a moody romantic atmosphere, while ornate clothing, flowers, and garden settings give the portraits a dreamy, decorative character."},{"id":"john-chamberlain","name":"John Chamberlain","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"John Chamberlain","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-chamberlain.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-chamberlain","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","sculptural","characters","metallic","vivid-colors","surreal","epic","negative-space"],"colours":["white","beige","charcoal","dark-brown","orange","red","pink","dark-blue"],"intro":"John Chamberlain is an American sculptor known for his innovative use of scrap metal and automobile parts to create dynamic, abstract sculptures. His work is often associated with the Abstract Expressionist movement, and he is celebrated for transforming industrial materials into expressive art forms that challenge traditional notions of sculpture.","observation":"The style presents towering, faceless human-like sculptures assembled from sharply crumpled, reflective sheets and vividly colored fabric-like forms. Strong studio-gallery presentation, generous pale negative space, and crisp sculptural modeling make the chaotic layered surfaces read as monumental contemporary objects."},{"id":"gerard-ter-borch","name":"Gerard ter Borch","cat":"painters","en":"Gerard ter Borch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerard-ter-borch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerard-ter-borch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","fashion","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-red","brown","beige","dark-rust"],"intro":"Gerard ter Borch was a Dutch painter from the 17th century, renowned for his exquisite genre paintings and portraits. His works are celebrated for their detailed depiction of textures and fabrics, as well as their intimate portrayal of domestic scenes. Ter Borch's ability to capture the subtleties of human expression and interaction made him a prominent figure in the Dutch Golden Age of painting.","observation":"These images use richly textured, realistic oil-paint rendering with visible fine brushwork, carefully modelled faces, fabrics, furniture, and domestic detail. The subdued, shadowed palette is enlivened by red drapery and pale garments, while formal figures, period clothing, pets, and interiors are arranged as intimate narrative scenes."},{"id":"walter-sickert","name":"Walter Sickert","cat":"painters","en":"Walter Sickert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/walter-sickert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/walter-sickert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-red","muted-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Walter Sickert was an influential British painter known for his involvement in the Camden Town Group and his contributions to the transition from Impressionism to Modernism. His works often depicted urban scenes and interiors, capturing the mood and atmosphere of early 20th-century London with a focus on shadow and light.","observation":"Across all four scenes, thick, visible brushwork builds dark urban interiors and nighttime streets with strongly contrasted reds, blacks, pinks, and muted earth tones. Figures, cafés, lamps, windows, and architectural details are rendered expressively, with loose painterly edges and a dramatic, shadow-heavy atmosphere."},{"id":"salvator-rosa","name":"Salvator Rosa","cat":"painters","en":"Salvator Rosa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/salvator-rosa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/salvator-rosa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","grey","muted-brown","bone-white","rust"],"intro":"Salvator Rosa was an Italian Baroque painter, poet, and printmaker known for his unorthodox and romantic style. Born in 1615, Rosa's works often depicted wild landscapes, dramatic scenes, and philosophical themes, setting him apart from his contemporaries. His art is characterized by a dark, moody atmosphere and a focus on the sublime and the mysterious.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible, broad painterly strokes to build monumental mountain landscapes, turbulent skies, water, trees, and small narrative figures or animals. Strong light-dark contrasts, subdued earthy colors, and expressive cloud and rock forms give the scenes an expansive, dramatic, epic atmosphere."},{"id":"paul-mccarthy","name":"Paul McCarthy","cat":"various-artists","en":"Paul McCarthy","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-mccarthy.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-mccarthy","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","ornate","sculptural","characters","scenes","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["silver","beige","vivid-red","black","deep-red","red","blue"],"intro":"Paul McCarthy is an American contemporary artist known for his provocative and often controversial works that critique consumer culture and mass media. His art spans various mediums, including sculpture, performance, and video, often characterized by its dark humor and satirical edge.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents theatrical, large-scale sculptural installations with exaggerated figures, elaborate surfaces, and a strongly staged gallery presence. Saturated reds and pinks dominate, often contrasted with stark white or blue, while grotesque clown-like characters and surreal accumulations of bodies, fabric, and props create an expressive fantasy atmosphere."},{"id":"candido-portinari","name":"Candido Portinari","cat":"painters","en":"Candido Portinari","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/candido-portinari.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/candido-portinari","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","muted-orange","rust","dark-blue"],"intro":"Candido Portinari was a Brazilian painter and one of the most prominent artists of his time, known for his large-scale murals and paintings that often depicted social and political themes. His work is characterized by a blend of modernist and figurative styles, with a focus on the lives and struggles of ordinary people.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is built from richly visible oil-paint brushwork, layered surfaces, and carefully modelled faces and clothing. It favors subdued earth tones with strong light-dark contrasts, expressive portraiture, and tightly cropped, densely composed arrangements that feel both observational and classically staged."},{"id":"bruce-davidson","name":"Bruce Davidson","cat":"photographers","en":"Bruce Davidson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruce-davidson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruce-davidson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Bruce Davidson is an American photographer known for his work in documenting social issues and urban life. His photography often captures the essence of communities and individuals, focusing on themes of identity, culture, and social dynamics. Davidson's work is recognized for its depth, empathy, and ability to tell compelling stories through images.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast photographic portraiture with a grainy, retro documentary feel. Tight candid framing, expressive faces, environmental reflections, selective focus, and crowded social settings create an intimate, cinematic atmosphere."},{"id":"sean-yoro","name":"Sean Yoro","cat":"street-artists","en":"Sean Yoro","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sean-yoro.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sean-yoro","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["charcoal","muted-cyan","dark-cyan","brown","white","silver"],"intro":"Sean Yoro is a contemporary artist known for his striking murals that often depict realistic portraits emerging from water. He is recognized for his unique approach to street art, blending hyperrealism with environmental themes. Yoro's work often addresses issues of climate change and human connection to nature, making him a notable figure in the contemporary art scene.","observation":"The style combines monumental figurative murals with neglected industrial and waterside environments, using visible brushwork, layered texture, and expressive portraiture. A restrained blue-green palette, reflective water, overgrown vegetation, and isolated human figures create a moody, surreal sense of scale."},{"id":"martin-puryear","name":"Martin Puryear","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Martin Puryear","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/martin-puryear.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/martin-puryear","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","patterns","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["beige","dark-brown","white","bone-white"],"intro":"Martin Puryear is an American sculptor known for his devotion to traditional craft techniques and his exploration of form and material. His work often reflects a deep understanding of woodworking and a commitment to creating pieces that resonate with cultural and historical references, particularly those related to African American heritage.","observation":"The style presents large sculptural forms woven from natural reeds or rattan, emphasizing open latticework, repeated linear patterns, and sweeping organic curves. Subdued earth tones, clean gallery interiors, controlled lighting, and carefully staged views give the renders a polished illustrative and exhibition-documentation character."},{"id":"thiago-valdi","name":"Thiago Valdi","cat":"street-artists","en":"Thiago Valdi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thiago-valdi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thiago-valdi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","illustrative","characters","fashion","portraits","bold-lines","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","drawing"],"colours":["dark-red","muted-red","black","dark-cyan","white","red"],"intro":"Thiago Valdi is a Brazilian street artist known for his vibrant and expressive murals. His work often features bold colors and intricate details, capturing the essence of urban life and contemporary culture.","observation":"Across all four renders, realistic faces and bodies are covered by dense, vividly colored tattoo-like imagery combining layered facial fragments, angular shapes, and energetic painted marks. Strong red, coral, teal, and dark blue contrasts are contained by both heavy graphic contours and finer sketch lines, giving the portraits an expressive illustrative-painterly finish."},{"id":"george-catlin","name":"George Catlin","cat":"painters","en":"George Catlin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/george-catlin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/george-catlin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["grey","black","muted-orange","dark-brown","red"],"intro":"George Catlin was an American painter, author, and traveler known for his depictions of Native American life in the 19th century. He traveled extensively throughout the American West, documenting the customs, costumes, and daily life of various tribes through his art. Catlin's work is significant for its historical value, providing a visual record of indigenous cultures during a period of rapid change and westward expansion in the United States.","observation":"Across the portraits and wider gathering scene, the style uses visible, directional paint strokes and layered texture to model faces, feathers, leather, and fabric. Restrained earth tones are enlivened by red accents and sunset light, combining closely framed character studies with a monumental landscape tableau and an expressive, historically evocative presentation."},{"id":"rone","name":"Rone","cat":"street-artists","en":"Rone","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/rone.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/rone","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","muted-orange","beige","white","red"],"intro":"Rone is an Australian street artist known for his large-scale portraits that often explore themes of beauty and decay. His work can be seen on walls and buildings around the world, blending elements of street art with fine art techniques.","observation":"Large, expressive painted portraits are integrated into weathered urban brick and plaster architecture, with visible brushwork, scraped layers, and fine linear marks. The style combines earthy, subdued colors and strong facial contrast with monumental close-up framing and richly distressed wall surfaces."},{"id":"larry-fink","name":"Larry Fink","cat":"photographers","en":"Larry Fink","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/larry-fink.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/larry-fink","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal"],"intro":"Larry Fink is an American photographer known for his black-and-white images that capture the social dynamics and intimate moments of everyday life. His work often explores themes of class, culture, and personal interaction, with a focus on the subtleties of human expression and connection.","observation":"The style uses realistic black-and-white photography with strong tonal contrast, selective focus, and visible film-like grain. It frames atmospheric nightclub and bar encounters as cinematic character moments, emphasizing expressive faces, formal evening clothing, cigarette smoke, and pools of blurred practical light."},{"id":"philippe-starck","name":"Philippe Starck","cat":"designers","en":"Philippe Starck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/philippe-starck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/philippe-starck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","still-life","glow","metallic","subdued-colors","classical","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","silver","grey","muted-ochre","muted-orange"],"intro":"Philippe Starck is a renowned French designer known for his wide-ranging work in interior design, architecture, and consumer goods. His designs often incorporate a sense of whimsy and innovation, blending practicality with artistic expression. Starck's influence extends globally, with a focus on creating accessible, democratic design that challenges traditional norms.","observation":"The style presents sculptural transparent furniture in highly realistic, carefully staged interiors, balancing sparse studio backdrops with richly ornamented architectural spaces. Subdued neutral tones, reflective materials, warm directional light, and crisp product-like detailing unify the four renders."},{"id":"carlo-scarpa","name":"Carlo Scarpa","cat":"architects","en":"Carlo Scarpa","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carlo-scarpa.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carlo-scarpa","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","dark-green","bone-white"],"intro":"Carlo Scarpa was a renowned Italian architect known for his unique blend of modernism and traditional craftsmanship. His work is celebrated for its meticulous attention to detail, innovative use of materials, and harmonious integration with the surrounding environment. Scarpa's designs often feature geometric forms, layered spaces, and a profound understanding of light and shadow.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic architectural interiors with monumental concrete forms, repeated arches, columns, staircases, and pools arranged in strongly geometric compositions. Weathered surfaces, subdued earthy greens and browns, reflective water, and sharply directed sunlight create a cinematic, atmospheric mood with deep shadow and bright openings."},{"id":"dana-schutz","name":"Dana Schutz","cat":"painters","en":"Dana Schutz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dana-schutz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dana-schutz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["red","orange","brown","vivid-red","grey","deep-blue"],"intro":"Dana Schutz is an American contemporary artist known for her vibrant and often surreal paintings. Her work frequently explores themes of identity, perception, and the human condition, using a bold and expressive style that combines elements of abstraction and figuration. Schutz's paintings are characterized by their vivid color palettes, dynamic compositions, and a playful yet intense approach to subject matter.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable people and social interiors are built from dense, visible brushwork, with faces, clothing, and objects merging into overlapping painted forms. Saturated oranges, blues, pinks, greens, and reds create an intense, high-contrast surface, while distorted anatomy and fragmented arrangements give the scenes a surreal, expressive character."},{"id":"alex-chinneck","name":"Alex Chinneck","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Alex Chinneck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alex-chinneck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alex-chinneck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","urban","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["dark-brown","brown","white","pale-blue","beige","orange"],"intro":"Alex Chinneck is a British sculptor known for his large-scale public artworks that often involve architectural illusions and playful manipulations of everyday structures. His works frequently challenge perceptions of the built environment, creating surprising and whimsical experiences for viewers.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, detailed architectural scenes focused on severely damaged urban buildings. Natural lighting, subdued earthy colors, strong structural forms, and close low-angle framing emphasize exposed brick, fractured plaster, rubble, and empty interiors."},{"id":"francis-newton-souza","name":"Francis Newton Souza","cat":"painters","en":"Francis Newton Souza","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francis-newton-souza.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francis-newton-souza","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","urban","bold-lines","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-blue","dark-red","blue","red","beige"],"intro":"Francis Newton Souza was a prominent Indian artist known for his bold and expressive style. Born in 1924 in Goa, India, he was a founding member of the Progressive Artists' Group in Bombay. Souza's work is characterized by its intense emotional content and often explores themes of human condition and identity. His paintings frequently feature distorted figures and vivid colors, drawing influence from both Western modernism and his Indian heritage.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines heavily visible, broad painted strokes with rough ink-like contour lines and dense hatch marks. It uses a forceful blue, black, and red-orange palette, presenting ominous urban scenes and tightly packed, angular hooded or masked characters with high contrast and a dark emotional charge."},{"id":"tomas-saraceno","name":"Tomas Saraceno","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tomas Saraceno","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tomas-saraceno.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tomas-saraceno","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","urban","fine-lines","subdued-colors","sci-fi","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["brown","beige","silver","white"],"intro":"Tomas Saraceno is an Argentine artist known for his innovative work in the fields of art, architecture, and science. His projects often explore the interconnectedness of humans and the environment, utilizing elements from nature, technology, and the cosmos. Saraceno's work is recognized for its visionary approach, blending art with ecological and social themes.","observation":"Across all four views, the style is highly realistic and cinematic, presenting monumental geometric structures assembled from translucent, crumpled membranes and fine wire-like frameworks. Subdued neutral tones, diffuse skylight, reflective surfaces, and human figures for scale create a surreal, futuristic exhibition environment with strongly sculptural forms."},{"id":"hans-wegner","name":"Hans Wegner","cat":"designers","en":"Hans Wegner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-wegner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-wegner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["silver","bone-white","beige","dark-brown","white","brown"],"intro":"Hans Wegner was a Danish furniture designer renowned for his innovative and elegant chair designs. A key figure in mid-century modern design, Wegner's work is celebrated for its blend of functionality and beauty, often featuring organic forms and expert craftsmanship. His iconic creations, such as the \"Wishbone Chair,\" reflect a deep understanding of materials and a commitment to simplicity and comfort.","observation":"The style presents furniture as carefully staged, highly realistic product imagery, with detailed wood grain, woven cane, leather, and solid sculptural construction. Warm subdued browns stand against a neutral studio background, while strong directional lighting creates crisp cast shadows and emphasizes the chairs’ geometric, ergonomic curves."},{"id":"adolph-menzel","name":"Adolph Menzel","cat":"painters","en":"Adolph Menzel","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adolph-menzel.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adolph-menzel","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-ochre","dark-red","pale-orange"],"intro":"Adolph Menzel was a German painter and graphic artist known for his detailed and realistic depictions of 19th-century European life. He played a significant role in the German art scene and was a prominent figure in the Realism movement. Menzel's works often captured the essence of the industrial era and the intricacies of bourgeois society, showcasing his mastery in portraying both grand historical events and intimate domestic scenes.","observation":"The style is a densely populated, expressive painted tableau built from broad, visible brushwork and layered marks. Subdued brown, black, cream, and red tones, strong light-dark separation, and dramatic faces create a theatrical, somber atmosphere across the scenes."},{"id":"sarah-sze","name":"Sarah Sze","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Sarah Sze","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sarah-sze.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sarah-sze","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","surreal"],"colours":["dark-blue","blue","charcoal","grey","light-blue","red"],"intro":"Sarah Sze is a contemporary American artist known for her intricate installations and sculptures that explore the relationship between objects, space, and perception. Her work often incorporates everyday materials and found objects, creating complex and dynamic environments that challenge viewers' understanding of scale and space.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable interiors and workspaces dissolve into dense, painterly layers of blue architecture, reflections, furniture, wires, and scattered objects. Fine linear marks, scraped-looking passages, fragmented perspective, and occasional warm red-orange accents create a richly detailed, surreal atmosphere with strong light-dark contrasts."},{"id":"sandra-chevrier","name":"Sandra Chevrier","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sandra Chevrier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sandra-chevrier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sandra-chevrier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","collage"],"colours":["white","light-orange","brown","grey","ochre","red","olive"],"intro":"Sandra Chevrier is a contemporary Canadian artist known for her captivating mixed media portraits that explore themes of identity and femininity. Her work often incorporates elements of pop culture and comic book imagery, creating a unique blend of fine art and street art aesthetics.","observation":"Across all four renders, close-up faces are built from vivid, high-contrast fragments, with recognizable features emerging through layered painted marks and collage-like disruptions. Fine gestural lines, exposed brushwork, torn-looking edges, and embedded imagery create an expressive, surreal fashion-portrait style against open white grounds."},{"id":"michael-wolf","name":"Michael Wolf","cat":"photographers","en":"Michael Wolf","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-wolf.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-wolf","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","urban","glow","mist","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-teal","dark-blue","muted-green","grey","rust"],"intro":"Michael Wolf is a renowned photographer known for his work capturing the complexities of urban life and architecture. His photography often explores themes of density, anonymity, and the human condition within city environments. Wolf's work has been celebrated for its ability to reveal the hidden stories and patterns within urban landscapes, offering a unique perspective on contemporary life.","observation":"A realistic, highly detailed urban style focused on dense, weathered apartment facades and the intimate life suggested by countless windows. Cool green-blue dusk tones, warm interior lights, atmospheric depth, and strong light-dark separation create a cinematic, quietly somber mood."},{"id":"paula-modersohn-becker","name":"Paula Modersohn-Becker","cat":"painters","en":"Paula Modersohn-Becker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paula-modersohn-becker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paula-modersohn-becker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["muted-ochre","brown","charcoal","light-orange","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Paula Modersohn-Becker was a pioneering German painter and one of the most important early expressionists. She was known for her unique style that combined elements of realism with modernist influences, focusing on portraits and still lifes. Her work often depicted rural life and intimate domestic scenes, reflecting her deep connection to nature and the human condition.","observation":"The style uses close, formal portrait compositions rendered with visibly built-up oil paint, fine brushwork, and pronounced craquelure. Muted earth tones are punctuated by red flowers, blue grounds, and flushed skin, while controlled facial detail and expressive gazes create a quiet, classical intensity."},{"id":"theodore-rousseau","name":"Theodore Rousseau","cat":"painters","en":"Theodore Rousseau","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theodore-rousseau.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theodore-rousseau","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-ochre","silver","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Theodore Rousseau was a prominent French painter associated with the Barbizon School, known for his landscape paintings that emphasized naturalism and the beauty of rural France. Active during the 19th century, Rousseau's work often depicted serene and detailed scenes of forests, rivers, and countryside, capturing the essence of Romanticism and Realism.","observation":"These landscapes use richly textured, visible paintwork to build dense woodland scenes with monumental trees, reflective water, and layered foliage. Subdued earthy greens and browns are punctuated by warm low sunlight, luminous skies, and deep shadow, creating a classical, tranquil, dreamlike atmosphere."},{"id":"enid-blyton","name":"Enid Blyton","cat":"various-artists","en":"Enid Blyton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/enid-blyton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/enid-blyton","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["dark-olive","grey","olive","red","light-yellow"],"intro":"Enid Blyton was a prolific English children's author, known for her extensive contribution to children's literature with series like 'The Famous Five' and 'The Secret Seven'. Her work, characterized by adventure and mystery, has captivated young readers for generations, making her one of the most beloved children's writers of the 20th century.","observation":"The style combines richly visible paint handling with finely observed, storybook-like scenes of children moving through lush countryside. Warm saturated clothing contrasts with layered greens, dappled light, abundant foliage, flowers, animals, and expressive figures, while fine brushwork preserves a detailed illustrative clarity."},{"id":"gilbert-and-george","name":"Gilbert and George","cat":"various-artists","en":"Gilbert and George","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gilbert-and-george.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gilbert-and-george","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","deep-red","dark-red","vivid-red","beige"],"intro":"Gilbert and George is a British artist duo known for their distinctive and provocative art, often exploring themes of identity, society, and the human condition. They became prominent in the late 20th century and are recognized for their large-scale, brightly colored photo-based works that challenge traditional art norms.","observation":"The style combines formal, highly posed portraiture with eccentric tailored clothing, hats, spectacles, and strongly patterned fabrics. Saturated reds, deep greens, and dark outlines create a theatrical high-contrast look, while dense foliage, architectural motifs, and decorative framing make every backdrop visually elaborate."},{"id":"edwin-landseer","name":"Edwin Landseer","cat":"painters","en":"Edwin Landseer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edwin-landseer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edwin-landseer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","orange","bone-white"],"intro":"Edwin Landseer was a prominent English painter and sculptor, renowned for his animal paintings and sculptures during the 19th century. His works often depicted animals in a highly realistic and expressive manner, capturing their emotions and interactions. Landseer was a key figure in the Victorian art scene, and his paintings were celebrated for their technical skill and emotional depth.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly layered oil-like paint, visible broad strokes, and carefully modelled fur, rocks, foliage, and mountainous settings. Dark earthy colours, dramatic light, and crowded animal groupings create an intense, expressive wilderness tableau with a convincingly traditional painted surface."},{"id":"jacob-epstein","name":"Jacob Epstein","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jacob Epstein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacob-epstein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacob-epstein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","portraits","still-life","fine-brushstrokes","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["white","black","brown","grey","bone-white","beige"],"intro":"Jacob Epstein is a renowned sculptor known for his pioneering contributions to modern sculpture. Born in the United States and later becoming a British citizen, Epstein's work is characterized by its bold forms and expressive qualities. He played a significant role in the development of modern art in the early 20th century, often challenging traditional aesthetics with his innovative techniques and themes.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic sculptural portrait busts with convincing weight, carved volume, and richly weathered surfaces. Restrained stone, plaster, and bronze tones are shaped by directional museum-like lighting, ranging from softly even illumination to pronounced shadow, while close cropping emphasizes the faces and material detail."},{"id":"william-dyce","name":"William Dyce","cat":"painters","en":"William Dyce","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-dyce.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-dyce","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","muted-blue","bone-white","dark-ochre","dark-blue","dark-red"],"intro":"William Dyce was a Scottish painter and a key figure in the Pre-Raphaelite movement. Known for his detailed and realistic portrayals of religious and historical subjects, Dyce's work often reflects a deep appreciation for nature and the human form. His paintings are characterized by their meticulous attention to detail, rich color palette, and harmonious compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines richly painted figures in flowing historical-looking garments with expansive mountainous and coastal landscapes. Visible brush texture, finely modelled faces and fabric, saturated reds and blues, dramatic clouds, and strong light-dark contrasts give the scenes a grand, emotionally charged pictorial presence."},{"id":"john-perceval","name":"John Perceval","cat":"painters","en":"John Perceval","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-perceval.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-perceval","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","floral","landscapes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","dreamy"],"colours":["muted-blue","brown","charcoal","silver","orange","red"],"intro":"John Perceval is an Australian artist known for his contributions to the Angry Penguins movement and his expressive, vibrant paintings. His work often features bold colors and dynamic compositions, reflecting a unique blend of surrealism and expressionism. Perceval's art captures a whimsical yet enigmatic atmosphere, often drawing on themes from Australian culture and landscapes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses dense, visibly worked paint with broad directional strokes, layered texture, and energetic mark-making. Vivid blues, reds, oranges, and greens turn gardens, village scenes, skies, and water into expressive, dreamlike landscapes with swirling movement and abundant floral detail."},{"id":"giovanni-bellini","name":"Giovanni Bellini","cat":"painters","en":"Giovanni Bellini","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/giovanni-bellini.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/giovanni-bellini","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-red","muted-blue","dark-brown","brown","muted-orange"],"intro":"Giovanni Bellini was an Italian Renaissance painter, known for his pioneering use of color and light in religious and portrait paintings. Born in Venice in the 15th century, Bellini's work is characterized by its serene and contemplative quality, often depicting sacred themes with a profound sense of spirituality and harmony.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable faces and figures are rendered with careful anatomical detail, restrained earthy color, and visible fine craquelure-like paint texture. The style combines tightly cropped portraiture with layered, theatrical arrangements, crisp fine contours, and strong light-dark modelling."},{"id":"joachim-wtewael","name":"Joachim Wtewael","cat":"painters","en":"Joachim Wtewael","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joachim-wtewael.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joachim-wtewael","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-ochre","dark-brown","rust","beige","muted-blue"],"intro":"Joachim Wtewael was a Dutch painter known for his intricate and detailed works during the late Renaissance and early Baroque periods. He was a prominent figure in the Utrecht Caravaggisti movement, which was influenced by the dramatic use of light and shadow. Wtewael's paintings often depicted mythological and biblical scenes, characterized by their vibrant colors and complex compositions.","observation":"The style uses highly finished, painterly rendering with visible fine brushwork, dense textures, and elaborate costumes, props, foliage, and animal anatomy. Saturated warm reds, greens, and ochres stand against deep shadows, while tightly packed portraits and creatures create a grand, theatrical tableau."},{"id":"lynda-benglis","name":"Lynda Benglis","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Lynda Benglis","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lynda-benglis.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lynda-benglis","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","floral","patterns","still-life","glow","metallic","vivid-colors","negative-space"],"colours":["white","beige","vivid-red","deep-red","pink","ochre"],"intro":"Lynda Benglis is an American sculptor known for her innovative use of materials and bold, expressive forms. Her work often challenges traditional boundaries in sculpture, exploring themes of fluidity and transformation. Benglis gained prominence in the 1960s and 1970s, becoming a significant figure in the post-minimalist movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, vividly colored and metallic materials are shaped into highly dimensional, textile-like sculptural forms, with dense pleating, folds, and irregular built-up surfaces. The clean gallery setting and generous white space make the ornate material textures, reflective highlights, and floral or abstract relief forms the central focus."},{"id":"viviane-sassen","name":"Viviane Sassen","cat":"various-artists","en":"Viviane Sassen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/viviane-sassen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/viviane-sassen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","realistic","sculptural","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","negative-space","symmetry"],"colours":["blue","muted-cyan","dark-cyan","black","dark-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"Viviane Sassen is a Dutch photographer known for her innovative approach to fashion and fine art photography. Her work often explores themes of identity, culture, and the human form, blending elements of surrealism and abstraction with vivid color palettes and striking compositions.","observation":"A highly realistic, editorial fashion style built around saturated cobalt blue, sharply contrasting red accents, and sculptural draped garments. Hard directional sunlight, deep shadows, geometric surroundings, dramatic cropping, and generous negative space create a bold, cinematic sense of visual design across the portraits and full-body scenes."},{"id":"sopheap-pich","name":"Sopheap Pich","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Sopheap Pich","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sopheap-pich.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sopheap-pich","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","dreamy","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","muted-orange","white"],"intro":"Sopheap Pich is a Cambodian artist known for his innovative use of natural materials such as bamboo and rattan in creating large-scale sculptures. His work often reflects themes of memory, identity, and the environment, drawing inspiration from his cultural heritage and personal experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental, hollow human-like sculptures built from dense woven lattices, with fine linear texture and strong sculptural volume. Muted rust, beige, and brown tones, spacious gallery interiors, soft daylight, and repeated organic geometric forms create a contemplative, dreamlike installation aesthetic."},{"id":"ernie-ball","name":"Ernie Ball","cat":"designers","en":"Ernie Ball","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernie-ball.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernie-ball","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","still-life","glow","shallow-depth-of-field","high-contrast","moody-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","grey","rust","pale-orange"],"intro":"Ernie Ball is a renowned American manufacturer known for producing high-quality guitar strings and accessories. Founded in 1962, the company has become a staple in the music industry, providing products used by musicians worldwide.","observation":"The style uses realistic, highly detailed close-up photography with richly decorated electric guitars as the dominant subject, emphasizing painted motifs, reflective hardware, strings, and wood grain. Dark warm tones, selective focus, strong contrast, and small amber highlights create an intimate, moody studio atmosphere, while occasional hands and clothing add a staged lifestyle context."},{"id":"adriaen-van-ostade","name":"Adriaen van Ostade","cat":"painters","en":"Adriaen van Ostade","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/adriaen-van-ostade.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/adriaen-van-ostade","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-ochre","muted-ochre","pale-yellow","rust"],"intro":"Adriaen van Ostade was a Dutch Golden Age painter known for his detailed and lively depictions of peasant life. Born in 1610 in Haarlem, Netherlands, van Ostade was a master of genre painting, capturing the everyday activities and rustic charm of rural Dutch society. His work is characterized by its warm color palette, intricate details, and the use of chiaroscuro to create depth and atmosphere.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines heavily worked oil-paint surfaces with fine linear detail, broad visible strokes, and a restrained earthy palette. It depicts expressive groups of rustic figures in taverns and rural settings, using deep shadows, aged textures, and dramatic gestures to create a historically styled, convivial yet somber atmosphere."},{"id":"vacheron-constantin","name":"Vacheron Constantin","cat":"designers","en":"Vacheron Constantin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vacheron-constantin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vacheron-constantin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","still-life","fine-lines","high-contrast","metallic"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","beige","charcoal","grey"],"intro":"Vacheron Constantin is one of the oldest and most prestigious Swiss watch manufacturers, renowned for its luxury timepieces and exquisite craftsmanship. Founded in 1755, the brand is celebrated for its innovative designs and technical excellence in watchmaking, often incorporating intricate details and high-quality materials.","observation":"The style presents luxury timepieces as highly realistic, meticulously detailed still-life subjects, combining close-up product photography with dramatic dark-to-light contrast. Intricate engraved reliefs, exposed mechanical components, polished metal, leather straps, and fine decorative details create an ornate, sculptural, premium look."},{"id":"raphael-soyer","name":"Raphael Soyer","cat":"painters","en":"Raphael Soyer","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raphael-soyer.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raphael-soyer","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","dark-brown","light-yellow","red"],"intro":"Raphael Soyer was an American painter known for his realistic depictions of urban life and human emotion. Born in 1899 in Russia and later emigrating to the United States, Soyer became a prominent figure in the American social realism movement. His work often focused on the everyday lives of people in New York City, capturing their struggles and emotions with empathy and detail.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly textured, finely worked paint to depict realistic women in intimate café interiors. Muted earth tones, deep shadows, restrained highlights, and emotionally introspective expressions create a dark, atmospheric mood, while cropped framing and layered background figures add narrative density."},{"id":"ai-weiwei","name":"Ai Weiwei","cat":"various-artists","en":"Ai Weiwei","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ai-weiwei.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ai-weiwei","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","patterns","still-life","subdued-colors","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["beige","white","silver","black","dark-brown"],"intro":"Ai Weiwei is a prominent Chinese contemporary artist and activist known for his work in sculpture, installation, architecture, and photography. He is recognized for his critical view of the Chinese government and his advocacy for human rights and freedom of expression. Weiwei's art often explores themes of cultural identity, history, and social justice, making him a significant figure in both the art world and global activism.","observation":"The style presents monumental, highly detailed assemblage sculptures made from repeated furniture, tools, wood, and transparent glass forms. Carefully staged gallery interiors, restrained neutral and wood-toned colors, strong geometric silhouettes, and generous surrounding space give the works a polished yet surreal installation-art character."},{"id":"leon-spilliaert","name":"Leon Spilliaert","cat":"painters","en":"Leon Spilliaert","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leon-spilliaert.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leon-spilliaert","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","scenes","motion","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["black","charcoal","dark-cyan","muted-cyan","brown","orange"],"intro":"Leon Spilliaert was a Belgian symbolist painter known for his moody and introspective works. Born in 1881, Spilliaert's art often explored themes of solitude and existential reflection, characterized by his use of stark contrasts and ethereal atmospheres. His work is associated with the Symbolist and Expressionist movements, and he is recognized for his unique ability to convey deep emotional and psychological states through his paintings.","observation":"Across all four images, monumental geometric structures and tiny solitary figures are rendered with stark perspective, deep shadow, and sharply angled light. The dark blue-black and amber palette, visible surface texture, and simplified graphic forms create a brooding, expressive architectural atmosphere."},{"id":"stephen-shortridge","name":"Stephen Shortridge","cat":"painters","en":"Stephen Shortridge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stephen-shortridge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stephen-shortridge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","deep-red","muted-ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Stephen Shortridge is an American actor and artist known for his work in television and his impressionistic painting style. He has appeared in various TV shows and movies, gaining recognition for his artistic talents in both acting and painting.","observation":"Across all four scenes, the style relies on richly visible, directional brushwork and layered paint to build figures, foliage, interiors, and atmospheric backgrounds. Warm reds, ochres, greens, and amber highlights create vivid, nostalgic tableaux with dense detail, expressive gestures, and softly blended but still tactile surfaces."},{"id":"esaias-van-de-velde","name":"Esaias van de Velde","cat":"painters","en":"Esaias van de Velde","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/esaias-van-de-velde.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/esaias-van-de-velde","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","crosshatching","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","bone-white","black","muted-ochre","dark-rust"],"intro":"Esaias van de Velde was a Dutch landscape painter of the early 17th century, known for his contributions to the development of realistic landscape painting during the Dutch Golden Age. His works often depicted serene and detailed natural scenes, capturing the essence of rural life and the beauty of the Dutch countryside.","observation":"The style combines finely crosshatched, engraved-looking monochrome illustrations with richly painted, darkly lit character scenes. Across the sheet, expressive faces, theatrical gestures, period clothing, warm brown tones, and strong light⁠–shadow modelling create a detailed classical narrative mood."},{"id":"gerard-sekoto","name":"Gerard Sekoto","cat":"painters","en":"Gerard Sekoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gerard-sekoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gerard-sekoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","charcoal","rust","beige","pale-orange"],"intro":"Gerard Sekoto was a South African artist and musician, recognized as a pioneer of urban black art and social realism in his country. Born in 1913, Sekoto's work often depicted the everyday life and struggles of black South Africans during the apartheid era. His paintings are celebrated for their vibrant use of color and expressive portrayal of human figures, capturing the essence of cultural identity and social commentary.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is representational oil painting with visible, broad, directional brushwork and strongly modeled faces and clothing. Dark earthy colors, deep shadows, warm red accents, and angular expressive marks give the portraits and street scene a serious, richly textured character."},{"id":"bruce-nauman","name":"Bruce Nauman","cat":"various-artists","en":"Bruce Nauman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bruce-nauman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bruce-nauman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","characters","scenes","glow","motion","fine-lines","high-contrast","vivid-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["dark-red","deep-red","charcoal","vivid-red","violet","green"],"intro":"Bruce Nauman is an influential American artist known for his work in a variety of media, including sculpture, video, and performance art. His work often explores themes of language, perception, and the human condition, challenging viewers to question their understanding of reality and art.","observation":"The style combines photographic gallery scenes with intense long-exposure light painting, turning human figures into blurred silhouettes and luminous wire-like trails. Saturated neon colors, strong contrast, internal glow, and sweeping lines create a kinetic, surreal atmosphere across all four renders."},{"id":"yves-klein","name":"Yves Klein","cat":"painters","en":"Yves Klein","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/yves-klein.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/yves-klein","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","expressive","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["deep-blue","bone-white","blue","light-blue"],"intro":"Yves Klein was a French artist known for his pioneering work in the mid-20th century, particularly in the realm of monochrome painting and performance art. He is best known for his development of International Klein Blue (IKB), a deep blue hue that became a signature element of his artistic practice. Klein's work often explored themes of immateriality and the infinite, and he was a leading figure in the Nouveau Réalisme movement.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated cobalt-blue paint forms dense organic bursts and irregular blotches against pale grounds. Broad gestural strokes, splatters, drips, rough edges, and radiating marks create a forceful abstract surface with strong dark-light contrast and recurring radial patterning."},{"id":"albert-paley","name":"Albert Paley","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Albert Paley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/albert-paley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/albert-paley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","urban","metallic","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","white","silver","muted-brown","olive","pale-blue","red"],"intro":"Albert Paley is a renowned American sculptor, celebrated for his innovative work with metal. Known for his large-scale, intricate sculptures, Paley's art often features complex, flowing forms that explore the interplay between structure and space. His contributions to the field have earned him a prominent place in contemporary art, with pieces displayed in numerous public and private collections.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents monumental, humanoid metal sculptures assembled from sharply folded, layered plates and projecting shards. The forms are densely detailed and convincingly volumetric, with dark black or weathered bronze surfaces photographed realistically in gallery and landscaped public settings."},{"id":"bill-viola","name":"Bill Viola","cat":"various-artists","en":"Bill Viola","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/bill-viola.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/bill-viola","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","scenes","backlighting","glow","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","grey","charcoal","dark-brown","orange"],"intro":"Bill Viola is an influential American video artist known for his exploration of the human experience and spirituality through video installations. His work often incorporates themes of life, death, and consciousness, using slow-motion video and high contrast lighting to create immersive and contemplative experiences.","observation":"Across all four images, human figures perform against a nearly black setting while erupting fire or water creates dramatic, kinetic shapes around them. Strong orange-blue illumination, reflective wet ground, backlighting, and deep shadows give the scenes a theatrical, emotionally intense cinematic quality."},{"id":"charles-tunnicliffe","name":"Charles Tunnicliffe","cat":"painters","en":"Charles Tunnicliffe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/charles-tunnicliffe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/charles-tunnicliffe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","landscapes","scenes","broad-brushstrokes","flat-color","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","grey","ochre"],"intro":"Charles Tunnicliffe was a renowned British wildlife artist and illustrator, celebrated for his detailed and realistic depictions of birds and nature. Born in 1901, Tunnicliffe's work was characterized by his keen observation of wildlife, particularly avian subjects, and his ability to capture the essence of the British countryside. His illustrations have been featured in numerous books and publications, making significant contributions to the field of natural history art.","observation":"The style uses visible, broad, directional paint strokes to build richly textured waterfowl, foliage, feathers, and reflections. Restrained earth-and-blue colors are punctuated by orange bills and legs, while simplified flat-edged shapes and strong dark-light contrasts give the scenes an expressive illustrated character."},{"id":"shozo-shimamoto","name":"Shozo Shimamoto","cat":"painters","en":"Shozo Shimamoto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shozo-shimamoto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shozo-shimamoto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["cream","light-yellow","red","vivid-red","blue","muted-green"],"intro":"Shozo Shimamoto was a Japanese artist and a prominent member of the Gutai Art Association, known for his innovative and experimental approach to painting. His work often involved unconventional methods, such as throwing paint onto canvases, and he was a pioneer in the field of performance art. Shimamoto's contributions to the art world were significant in the post-war era, influencing many contemporary artists.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated colors are applied as energetic splashes, drips, daubs, and sweeping marks over a pale ground. The style is highly abstract and expressive, combining broad visible brushwork with fine gestural lines and spontaneous splatter."},{"id":"leon-kossoff","name":"Leon Kossoff","cat":"painters","en":"Leon Kossoff","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/leon-kossoff.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/leon-kossoff","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","dark-brown","beige","light-yellow"],"intro":"Leon Kossoff is a British painter known for his expressive and textured depictions of urban life, particularly in post-war London. His works often feature thick impasto techniques and a focus on the human figure within the cityscape, capturing the emotional and physical landscapes of his surroundings.","observation":"Across all four renders, wooded landscapes are built from dense, directional paint strokes and heavily worked, raised-looking surfaces. The subdued earth-and-forest palette is punctuated by rust tones and pale openings, while deep shadows and vigorous marks give the scenes an expressive, brooding intensity."},{"id":"eileen-gray","name":"Eileen Gray","cat":"designers","en":"Eileen Gray","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/eileen-gray.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/eileen-gray","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","fine-lines","subdued-colors","classical","retro","geometric"],"colours":["muted-ochre","silver","black","dark-brown","dark-blue","dark-rust"],"intro":"Eileen Gray was an influential Irish designer and architect, renowned for her pioneering work in modernist design and architecture. She was a leading figure in the Art Deco movement and is celebrated for her innovative furniture designs and architectural projects that combined functionality with aesthetic elegance.","observation":"The style presents highly composed architectural interiors and exteriors with strong geometric masses, sculptural curves, crisp fine detailing, and carefully staged spatial depth. Restrained earth tones, deep blue accents, dark wood, marble, and hard directional light create a polished, nostalgic luxury while the repeated architectural framing gives the images a cinematic, editorial character."},{"id":"kader-attia","name":"Kader Attia","cat":"various-artists","en":"Kader Attia","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kader-attia.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kader-attia","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["muted-orange","brown","muted-brown","beige","black","silver"],"intro":"Kader Attia is a contemporary artist known for his work exploring themes of identity, culture, and postcolonialism. Born in France to Algerian parents, Attia's art often reflects on the cultural exchanges and tensions between Western and non-Western societies. His work spans various mediums, including sculpture, installation, and photography, and is recognized for its critical engagement with historical and social issues.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, monumental sculptural figures and installations rendered with dense surface detail, tactile materials, and carefully controlled gallery or cinematic lighting. Muted earth tones, dark metal, carved wood, and dramatic scale create an ominous, epic atmosphere across both interior exhibitions and ruined outdoor settings."},{"id":"hans-op-de-beeck","name":"Hans Op de Beeck","cat":"various-artists","en":"Hans Op de Beeck","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/hans-op-de-beeck.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/hans-op-de-beeck","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","brown","black","beige","bone-white"],"intro":"Hans Op de Beeck is a Belgian visual artist known for his immersive installations, sculptures, and videos that often explore themes of memory, solitude, and the human condition. His works are characterized by their contemplative nature and often employ a monochromatic palette to evoke a sense of timelessness and introspection.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines stark monochrome tonal control with highly detailed, cinematic compositions of uncanny landscapes and architectural settings. Snow, dark water, bare trees, colossal clouds, and impossible formations create a dreamy yet ominous surreal atmosphere, presented with crisp illustrative realism and strong depth."},{"id":"carl-andre","name":"Carl Andre","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Carl Andre","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/carl-andre.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/carl-andre","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","urban","subdued-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","beige","dark-brown","brown","ochre"],"intro":"Carl Andre is an American minimalist artist known for his work in sculpture, particularly with materials like wood, bricks, and metal. His art often involves simple, geometric forms and a focus on the physical properties of the materials he uses. Andre's work is characterized by its emphasis on the arrangement and placement of materials, creating a dialogue between the sculpture and the space it occupies.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, carefully composed gallery interiors with strong geometric arrangements of heavy concrete, stone, and timber forms. Subdued earth tones, natural daylight, architectural detail, and generous empty space give the images a quiet, minimalist exhibition-installation character."},{"id":"allan-kaprow","name":"Allan Kaprow","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Allan Kaprow","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/allan-kaprow.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/allan-kaprow","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","silver","brown","black","light-orange","red","light-yellow","green"],"intro":"Allan Kaprow was an American artist known for pioneering the \"Happenings\" movement, which blurred the boundaries between art and life. His work often involved audience participation and emphasized the ephemeral nature of art. Kaprow's innovative approach to art-making challenged traditional art forms and inspired future generations of artists.","observation":"Across the sheet, the style combines expressive figurative and abstract imagery with visibly broad, layered brushwork, splatters, and forceful dark linework. Scenes are presented as dramatic gallery installations or large-scale artworks, using saturated reds, blues, yellows, and blacks alongside stark monochrome imagery and strong contrasts."},{"id":"jason-freeny","name":"Jason Freeny","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jason Freeny","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jason-freeny.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jason-freeny","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy"],"colours":["white","black","muted-ochre","brown","deep-red","red"],"intro":"Jason Freeny is an American artist known for his unique approach to sculpture and design, often blending elements of anatomy with popular culture. He gained recognition for his intricate anatomical dissections of toys and characters, creating a playful yet thought-provoking commentary on consumer culture.","observation":"This style presents familiar cartoon characters as highly detailed, three-dimensional anatomical cutaways, combining glossy toy-like modelling with exposed bones, muscles, organs, and occasional miniature internal figures. Bright primary colors, clean graphic contours, exaggerated proportions, and studio-like backgrounds create a playful yet surreal contrast with the macabre anatomical subject matter."},{"id":"ernest-hamlin-baker","name":"Ernest Hamlin Baker","cat":"painters","en":"Ernest Hamlin Baker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ernest-hamlin-baker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ernest-hamlin-baker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","floral","landscapes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors"],"colours":["brown","muted-ochre","grey","bone-white","dark-red"],"intro":"Ernest Hamlin Baker is known for his detailed and expressive illustrations, often capturing the essence of American life and culture during the early to mid-20th century. His work is characterized by a strong sense of realism and an ability to convey emotion and narrative through his compositions. Baker's illustrations have been featured in numerous publications, showcasing his ability to blend artistic skill with storytelling.","observation":"The style is consistently representational and painterly, with visible, controlled brushwork building clouds, foliage, fur, stone, and architectural surfaces. It favors richly observed natural settings, warm subdued earth tones, and finely layered detail while retaining a traditional, gallery-like sense of composition."},{"id":"pierre-puvis-de-chavannes","name":"Pierre Puvis de Chavannes","cat":"painters","en":"Pierre Puvis de Chavannes","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/pierre-puvis-de-chavannes.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/pierre-puvis-de-chavannes","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","animals","characters","landscapes","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-blue","light-orange","muted-ochre","dark-red"],"intro":"Pierre Puvis de Chavannes was a French painter known for his large-scale murals and contributions to the Symbolist movement. Born in 1824, he became a prominent figure in the late 19th century art scene, with works characterized by their serene, dreamlike quality and classical themes. His art often depicted allegorical and mythological subjects, rendered in a muted color palette that conveyed a sense of timelessness and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four images, the style uses richly textured oil-like brushwork, carefully modelled figures, animals, fabric, and rugged landscapes. Restrained earth tones, deep shadowed foliage, and solemn pastoral scenes create a classical, contemplative atmosphere, with fine strokes and layered surface detail throughout."},{"id":"maurice-utrillo","name":"Maurice Utrillo","cat":"painters","en":"Maurice Utrillo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/maurice-utrillo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/maurice-utrillo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","urban","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["beige","brown","bone-white","charcoal","dark-brown"],"intro":"Maurice Utrillo was a French painter known for his depictions of Montmartre and other Parisian scenes. Born in 1883, he became famous for his cityscapes, often capturing the essence of urban life with a unique blend of realism and impressionism. Utrillo's work is characterized by its focus on architecture and street scenes, often rendered in a subdued color palette that evokes a sense of nostalgia and tranquility.","observation":"Across all four views, the style uses visible, layered brushwork to render quiet urban streets with softened architectural edges, bare trees, and atmospheric depth. Restrained gray-green, ochre, and brick-red colors, fine linear marks, and glowing streetlamps create a muted, wintry mood while preserving abundant environmental detail."},{"id":"robert-longo","name":"Robert Longo","cat":"various-artists","en":"Robert Longo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-longo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-longo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","scenes","motion","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","silver","black","muted-orange"],"intro":"Robert Longo is an American artist known for his large-scale, photorealistic charcoal drawings and works that explore power, authority, and social issues. Born in 1953, Longo gained prominence in the 1980s with his \"Men in the Cities\" series, which depicted sharply dressed figures in contorted poses. His work often reflects themes of tension and conflict, combining elements of realism with dramatic, cinematic flair.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses stark black-and-white figures in highly dynamic, theatrical poses against large areas of pale negative space. Heavy graphic contours, ink-like tonal blocks, and dramatic shadows give the scenes a cinematic, action-oriented poster quality."},{"id":"marc-riboud","name":"Marc Riboud","cat":"photographers","en":"Marc Riboud","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/marc-riboud.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/marc-riboud","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","dark"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Marc Riboud is a renowned French photographer known for his extensive work in photojournalism and humanist photography. His career spanned several decades, during which he captured iconic images that documented cultural and social changes around the world. Riboud's work is celebrated for its ability to convey deep emotion and narrative through candid and intimate portrayals of everyday life.","observation":"The style is stark monochrome documentary photography with pronounced grain, deep shadows, and bright highlights. It repeatedly uses crowded, layered compositions, close human faces, strong architectural or fabric forms, and dramatic shadow patterns to create a solemn, cinematic sense of witness."},{"id":"isaiah-zagar","name":"Isaiah Zagar","cat":"various-artists","en":"Isaiah Zagar","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/isaiah-zagar.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/isaiah-zagar","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","vivid-colors"],"colours":["brown","beige","dark-brown","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Isaiah Zagar is an American mosaic artist known for his vibrant and intricate public art installations, particularly in Philadelphia. His work is characterized by the use of colorful tiles, mirrors, and found objects, creating immersive environments that reflect community and personal narratives.","observation":"The style combines realistic portrait and environmental photography with intensely detailed, multicolored mosaic architecture. Rich tile fragments, reflective glass, painted markings, and weathered masonry create an ornate urban setting, while selective focus repeatedly isolates the elderly figure or nearby surfaces from the passage behind."},{"id":"zac-posen","name":"Zac Posen","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Zac Posen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zac-posen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zac-posen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","fashion","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","subdued-colors","drawing","negative-space"],"colours":["bone-white","white","charcoal","black","muted-ochre","grey","red"],"intro":"Zac Posen is an American fashion designer known for his glamorous and elegant evening wear. He gained recognition for his sophisticated designs that often feature intricate detailing and luxurious fabrics. Posen's work is celebrated for its ability to blend modern aesthetics with classic silhouettes, making him a prominent figure in the fashion industry.","observation":"Across all four renders, elegant full-length fashion figures and elaborate gowns are depicted with expressive, hand-painted brushwork, fine sketch lines, and layered translucent fabric marks. Restrained dark, earthy colors, spacious pale backgrounds, and varied floral, beaded, and tulle textures give the illustrations a refined couture-sketch character."},{"id":"liu-bolin","name":"Liu Bolin","cat":"various-artists","en":"Liu Bolin","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/liu-bolin.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/liu-bolin","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","patterns","scenes","high-contrast","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["muted-ochre","dark-olive","brown","dark-red","beige","dark-cyan"],"intro":"Liu Bolin is a Chinese artist known for his unique approach to blending into urban environments through a technique called \"camouflage art.\" Often referred to as \"The Invisible Man,\" Bolin uses his body as a canvas, painting himself to seamlessly merge with backgrounds, creating thought-provoking visual statements about identity, consumerism, and the relationship between individuals and their surroundings.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style builds dense, highly detailed environments from repeated cans, packages, shelves, and masonry, using vivid reds, greens, blues, and oranges with strong graphic structure. Human figures are placed within these saturated patterned settings, rendered with crisp illustrative edges, pronounced outlines, and a broadly realistic spatial presentation."},{"id":"william-hogarth","name":"William Hogarth","cat":"painters","en":"William Hogarth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-hogarth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-hogarth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","funny"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","orange","rust"],"intro":"William Hogarth was an English painter, printmaker, pictorial satirist, social critic, and editorial cartoonist. Born in 1697, he is best known for his narrative paintings and engravings that offer a satirical look at contemporary English society. His works often depicted the moral and social issues of his time, using humor and detailed observation to critique the vices and follies of 18th-century life.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses visibly loose, broad paint handling, warm earthy colors, and strong light-dark contrasts to depict densely crowded social scenes. Figures are rendered with exaggerated gestures and facial expressions, creating a lively, humorous theatricality within richly detailed historical interiors and clothing."},{"id":"jonathan-lasker","name":"Jonathan Lasker","cat":"painters","en":"Jonathan Lasker","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jonathan-lasker.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jonathan-lasker","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","characters","patterns","bold-lines","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","geometric"],"colours":["silver","light-yellow","black","vivid-red","pink","dark-blue"],"intro":"Jonathan Lasker is an American painter known for his distinctive abstract style characterized by bold colors and geometric forms. His work often explores the boundaries between abstraction and representation, using thick outlines and vibrant hues to create dynamic compositions. Lasker's paintings have been influential in the contemporary art scene, particularly within the realms of postmodernism and neo-expressionism.","observation":"Across all four works, saturated primary and secondary colors are organized into flat, geometric fields, oversized looping bands, grids, and simplified organic figures. Thick black and blue drawn contours combine with visible painted texture, producing an energetic, graphic abstraction that feels expressive and slightly surreal."},{"id":"salomon-van-ruysdael","name":"Salomon van Ruysdael","cat":"painters","en":"Salomon van Ruysdael","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/salomon-van-ruysdael.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/salomon-van-ruysdael","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["grey","black","bone-white","brown","dark-ochre"],"intro":"Salomon van Ruysdael was a prominent Dutch landscape painter of the 17th century, known for his serene and atmospheric depictions of the Dutch countryside. He was a key figure in the development of Dutch landscape painting during the Golden Age, often focusing on rivers, forests, and rural scenes. His works are characterized by their naturalistic style, attention to detail, and harmonious compositions.","observation":"These landscapes are rendered with visible, finely controlled paintwork, layered atmospheric depth, and subdued natural colors that shift between warm sunlight and cool shadow. Grand cloud formations, reflective waterways, distant architecture, and wooded framing create a classical, cinematic sense of scale with a dreamy, quietly epic mood."},{"id":"njideka-akunyili-crosby","name":"Njideka Akunyili Crosby","cat":"various-artists","en":"Njideka Akunyili Crosby","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/njideka-akunyili-crosby.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/njideka-akunyili-crosby","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","ethnic-poc","patterns","scenes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","collage","geometric"],"colours":["grey","brown","muted-ochre","light-orange","red","orange"],"intro":"Njideka Akunyili Crosby is a Nigerian-born visual artist known for her intricate and layered artworks that explore themes of cultural identity, personal history, and the African diaspora. Her work often combines elements of painting, collage, and photography to create rich, textured compositions that reflect her experiences as a Nigerian living in the United States. Akunyili Crosby's art is celebrated for its ability to weave together different cultural narratives and visual languages, offering a complex and nuanced portrayal of identity and belonging.","observation":"The style combines richly visible brushwork with fine drawn marks, layered collage-like panels, and dense geometric and textile patterns. Saturated turquoise, orange, green, and blue unify expressive portraits and social interior scenes, often framed by tropical foliage and boldly patterned clothing."},{"id":"worthington-whittredge","name":"Worthington Whittredge","cat":"painters","en":"Worthington Whittredge","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/worthington-whittredge.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/worthington-whittredge","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","landscapes","glow","mist","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dreamy"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-ochre","dark-brown","ochre","bone-white"],"intro":"Worthington Whittredge is a renowned American landscape painter associated with the Hudson River School, known for his detailed and serene depictions of the American wilderness. His works often capture the tranquility and beauty of natural settings, reflecting the Romantic ideals of the 19th century.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is highly realistic and richly detailed, presenting tranquil woodland landscapes with dense trees, streams or ponds, and autumn foliage. Warm shafts of sunlight, reflective water, and soft atmospheric haze create a moody yet dreamy, cinematic sense of depth."},{"id":"john-butler-yeats","name":"John Butler Yeats","cat":"painters","en":"John Butler Yeats","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/john-butler-yeats.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/john-butler-yeats","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","fashion","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","dark-green","beige","orange","red"],"intro":"John Butler Yeats is known as an Irish artist and the father of poet W.B. Yeats. He was a prominent figure in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, celebrated for his portraiture and contributions to the Irish cultural revival. His work often depicted intimate and personal scenes, capturing the essence of his subjects with a keen eye for detail and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured oil-paint surfaces, visible brushwork, and restrained dark greens, browns, blacks, and occasional red accents. It presents elegant female portraits in formal clothing and elaborate hats, with carefully modelled faces, decorative details, and heavily ornamented gold frames reinforcing a refined historical-gallery presentation."},{"id":"dawoud-bey","name":"Dawoud Bey","cat":"photographers","en":"Dawoud Bey","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dawoud-bey.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dawoud-bey","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","fashion","portraits","scenes","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["silver","charcoal","black","grey"],"intro":"Dawoud Bey is an acclaimed American photographer known for his powerful portraits and exploration of African American identity. His work often delves into themes of community, history, and personal narratives, capturing the essence of his subjects with depth and sensitivity. Bey's photographs have been exhibited in numerous prestigious institutions, and he continues to influence contemporary photography with his insightful and evocative imagery.","observation":"The style is a realistic, high-contrast black-and-white portrait treatment with carefully staged, formal poses and richly furnished interiors. Dense antique décor, patterned clothing, framed family photographs, reflective surfaces, and sculptural furniture create an ornate, period-inflected visual environment while the subjects remain sharply emphasized."},{"id":"william-powell-frith","name":"William Powell Frith","cat":"painters","en":"William Powell Frith","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-powell-frith.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-powell-frith","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","ochre","beige","white","deep-red"],"intro":"William Powell Frith was a renowned English painter known for his detailed and vivid depictions of Victorian life. Born in 1819, he became famous for his genre paintings that captured the social dynamics and cultural nuances of 19th-century Britain. His works often featured large groups of people in intricate settings, showcasing his keen observation of society and his ability to convey narrative through art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly visible brushwork, layered texture, and carefully modelled figures in formal period clothing. Deep brown interiors, crimson accents, and selective warm highlights create a subdued, high-contrast atmosphere, while the scenes are composed like elaborate narrative portraits surrounded by ornate furnishings and gilded frames."},{"id":"kent-monkman","name":"Kent Monkman","cat":"painters","en":"Kent Monkman","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kent-monkman.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kent-monkman","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","animals","characters","fashion","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-blue","beige","muted-brown","deep-red"],"intro":"Kent Monkman is a contemporary Canadian artist of Cree ancestry, known for his provocative and narrative-rich works that explore themes of Indigenous identity, colonial history, and cultural resilience. His art often challenges historical narratives and incorporates elements of humor, mythology, and social commentary.","observation":"The style combines richly painterly surfaces with densely layered, highly detailed tableaux populated by formally posed figures, animals, elaborate costumes, and sweeping mountain landscapes. Saturated reds and blues, dramatic light-dark separation, monumental scenery, and decorative textiles give the images an ornate, theatrical, epic presence."},{"id":"medardo-rosso","name":"Medardo Rosso","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Medardo Rosso","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/medardo-rosso.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/medardo-rosso","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","sculptural","characters","portraits","still-life","broad-brushstrokes","subdued-colors"],"colours":["white","muted-brown","brown","bone-white","beige","black"],"intro":"Medardo Rosso was an Italian sculptor known for his innovative approach to Impressionist sculpture. He focused on capturing fleeting moments and emotions, often using materials like plaster and bronze to create textured, atmospheric works that challenged traditional boundaries of form and light.","observation":"The style presents expressive portrait busts as solid, materially modeled sculptures, with rough fragments and broad gestural tool marks surrounding carefully formed faces. Restrained earthy browns, bronze-like tones, pedestal displays, and clean white backgrounds emphasize the tactile volume and emotional movement of the forms."},{"id":"edward-poynter","name":"Edward Poynter","cat":"painters","en":"Edward Poynter","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edward-poynter.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edward-poynter","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","characters","floral","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-red","dark-brown","muted-ochre","light-orange"],"intro":"Edward Poynter was a prominent British painter and designer, known for his detailed and classical style. He was born in 1836 and became a leading figure in the Victorian art scene, often drawing inspiration from historical and mythological themes. Poynter's works are characterized by their academic precision and neoclassical influences, reflecting his deep appreciation for the art and architecture of ancient civilizations.","observation":"The style is richly painterly and highly detailed, with visible fine brushwork modelling faces, fabric, foliage, carved stone, and ornate furnishings. Restrained earth reds, creams, greens, and browns unify formal portraits and seated figures within densely decorated classical interiors and garden-like settings."},{"id":"peter-turnley","name":"Peter Turnley","cat":"photographers","en":"Peter Turnley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-turnley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-turnley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","urban","motion","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","dark"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","silver","white"],"intro":"Peter Turnley is a renowned American photojournalist known for his evocative images capturing human experiences and global events. His work often focuses on moments of intimacy and reflection, bringing a humanistic perspective to documentary photography. Turnley's photographs have been published in major international publications and have contributed significantly to visual storytelling.","observation":"Across all four images, the style is monochrome, high-contrast photographic storytelling set among crowded urban interiors and streets. Selective focus, pronounced grain, blurred foreground figures, reflected light, and circular bokeh create a cinematic sense of depth and candid human encounters."},{"id":"toshiko-okanoue","name":"Toshiko Okanoue","cat":"various-artists","en":"Toshiko Okanoue","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/toshiko-okanoue.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/toshiko-okanoue","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","scenes","urban","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","collage","dark"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","black","beige"],"intro":"Toshiko Okanoue is a Japanese artist known for her surrealist collages and photomontages. Active primarily in the 1950s, her work often explores themes of identity, memory, and the post-war experience. Okanoue's art is characterized by a unique blend of Eastern and Western influences, reflecting the cultural shifts in Japan during her time.","observation":"A monochrome, high-contrast photographic collage combines fashion-editorial figures with devastated urban environments, monumental architecture, birds, smoke, and dense rubble. Grain, dramatic cloud masses, and carefully staged tableaux create a cinematic yet surreal apocalyptic mood."},{"id":"mark-di-suvero","name":"Mark di Suvero","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Mark di Suvero","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-di-suvero.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-di-suvero","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","landscapes","still-life","urban","high-contrast","vivid-colors"],"colours":["light-blue","dark-olive","white","black","olive","dark-red"],"intro":"Mark di Suvero is an American abstract expressionist sculptor known for his monumental works made from industrial materials such as steel. Born in 1933, di Suvero's innovative approach to sculpture has made him a significant figure in contemporary art, particularly in the realm of public art installations.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and photographically composed, presenting monumental industrial sculptures with crisp structural detail, strong perspective, and natural outdoor lighting. Saturated rust-orange and dark weathered metal stand out against expansive green landscapes and blue skies, with varied low-angle and contextual views giving the images a cinematic sense of scale."},{"id":"sarah-lucas","name":"Sarah Lucas","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Sarah Lucas","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sarah-lucas.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sarah-lucas","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","fashion","scenes","still-life","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["beige","ochre","dark-brown","silver","brown"],"intro":"Sarah Lucas is a prominent British artist known for her provocative and humorous sculptures and installations. She emerged as part of the Young British Artists (YBA) movement in the 1990s, gaining recognition for her exploration of themes related to gender, identity, and consumer culture. Her work often incorporates everyday objects, reimagined in bold and unexpected ways, challenging societal norms and conventions.","observation":"The style is realistic, softly lit editorial photography staged in contemporary gallery interiors, combining carefully posed models with oversized sculptural furniture and found-object-like installations. A restrained palette of cream, tan, white, and warm wood emphasizes tactile upholstery, carved surfaces, fabric, and architectural space."},{"id":"andrea-mantegna","name":"Andrea Mantegna","cat":"painters","en":"Andrea Mantegna","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/andrea-mantegna.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/andrea-mantegna","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","ochre","dark-brown","muted-orange","muted-blue"],"intro":"Andrea Mantegna was an Italian Renaissance painter known for his mastery of perspective and detail. Born in 1431, he was a prominent figure in the Italian Renaissance , contributing significantly to the development of illusionistic painting. Mantegna's work is characterized by its classical themes, meticulous attention to detail, and innovative use of perspective, which influenced many artists of his time.","observation":"The style presents tightly cropped, highly rendered painted faces and figures with expressive gazes, tactile skin, hair, fabric, and metal surfaces. Earthy reds, browns, creams, and muted blues combine with strong light-dark modelling, visible fine brushwork, and an aged cracked-paint surface."},{"id":"richard-deacon","name":"Richard Deacon","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Richard Deacon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/richard-deacon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/richard-deacon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","metallic","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["beige","silver","dark-brown","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Richard Deacon is a renowned British sculptor known for his innovative use of materials and fluid, abstract forms. Born in 1949, Deacon has been a significant figure in contemporary art, often exploring the interplay between form, space, and materiality. His works are characterized by their intricate construction and the seamless integration of organic and geometric shapes, making him a pivotal figure in post-minimalist sculpture.","observation":"The style presents large abstract sculptures as carefully staged gallery objects, rendered with convincing solid volume, material texture, and reflective or faceted surfaces. Interlocking geometric structures, woven lattices, and hollow organic forms recur across subdued wood-and-metal palettes, with clean architectural settings and controlled naturalistic lighting."},{"id":"theo-van-doesburg","name":"Theo van Doesburg","cat":"painters","en":"Theo van Doesburg","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theo-van-doesburg.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theo-van-doesburg","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","illustrative","patterns","flat-color","grain","vivid-colors","surreal","retro","geometric"],"colours":["cream","vivid-red","black","dark-blue","blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"Theo van Doesburg was a Dutch artist, architect, and writer, best known as a leading figure in the De Stijl movement. Born in 1883, he played a crucial role in the development of abstract art, emphasizing geometric forms and primary colors. His work often explored the relationship between art and architecture, and he collaborated with other prominent artists of his time, including Piet Mondrian.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses abstract geometric compositions built from overlapping rectangular blocks, strong right angles, and asymmetrical grids. Saturated primary colors contrast with cream, black, and ochre fields, while clean graphic edges are softened by a consistently visible grainy, painted-canvas surface."},{"id":"sudarsan-pattnaik","name":"Sudarsan Pattnaik","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Sudarsan Pattnaik","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sudarsan-pattnaik.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sudarsan-pattnaik","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","landscapes","scenes","subdued-colors","religious","epic"],"colours":["silver","dark-brown","ochre","brown","light-orange"],"intro":"Sudarsan Pattnaik is an acclaimed Indian sand artist known for his intricate and large-scale sand sculptures. He has gained international recognition for his ability to transform ordinary sand into extraordinary works of art, often conveying social messages and cultural themes. Pattnaik's work is celebrated for its detail, creativity, and the ephemeral nature of sand art.","observation":"The style presents monumental, highly detailed religious sculptures as realistic beach scenes, with convincing carved volume, intricate surface ornament, and visible sand texture. Warm subdued earth tones, expansive coastal backgrounds, and cinematic framing emphasize the sculptures’ epic scale against small human figures."},{"id":"alighiero-boetti","name":"Alighiero Boetti","cat":"various-artists","en":"Alighiero Boetti","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/alighiero-boetti.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/alighiero-boetti","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","characters","patterns","flat-color","painterly","vivid-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["bone-white","rust","dark-olive","vivid-red","dark-blue","orange"],"intro":"Alighiero Boetti is an Italian conceptual artist known for his innovative approach to art, often incorporating elements of chance, order, and collaboration in his works. He was a prominent figure in the Arte Povera movement, which emphasized the use of simple materials and a focus on the conceptual aspects of art. Boetti's work often explored themes of duality, identity, and the passage of time.","observation":"Across all four images, dense multicolored fragments form maps, letterforms, figures, animals, and symbolic arrangements in a highly layered visual field. Flat, angular shapes and emphatic dark outlines coexist with visibly rough, tactile paint and collage-like surface variation, producing a vivid, crowded, surreal patchwork aesthetic."},{"id":"stella-mccartney","name":"Stella McCartney","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Stella McCartney","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/stella-mccartney.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/stella-mccartney","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","vivid-colors"],"colours":["beige","black","muted-brown","bone-white","grey","red","pink"],"intro":"Stella McCartney is a renowned British fashion designer known for her commitment to sustainable and ethical fashion. Born in 1971, she is the daughter of former Beatle Paul McCartney and American photographer Linda McCartney. Stella launched her own fashion house in 2001 and has since been celebrated for her innovative designs that blend modern aesthetics with eco-friendly practices. Her work often features clean lines, bold prints, and a strong emphasis on tailoring.","observation":"The style is polished editorial fashion photography with realistic models, carefully styled garments, and richly furnished interior settings. It combines detailed textile patterns and ornate architectural surroundings with strong color contrasts, sculptural silhouettes, and composed portrait-like framing."},{"id":"roxy-paine","name":"Roxy Paine","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Roxy Paine","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roxy-paine.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roxy-paine","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","urban","fine-lines","subdued-colors","dreamy","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["brown","grey","silver","white","muted-ochre"],"intro":"Roxy Paine is an American artist known for his large-scale sculptures and installations that explore the intersection of nature and industry. His work often features intricate, lifelike representations of natural forms, such as trees and fungi, crafted from industrial materials like stainless steel.","observation":"The style presents monumental, leafless tree forms as highly realistic sculptures in spacious contemporary gallery interiors. Cool subdued tones, architectural geometry, reflective floors, fine branching detail, and carefully controlled light create a quiet, dreamlike exhibition atmosphere."},{"id":"sheila-hicks","name":"Sheila Hicks","cat":"various-artists","en":"Sheila Hicks","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sheila-hicks.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sheila-hicks","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","patterns","still-life","vivid-colors","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["charcoal","white","red","beige","deep-red","ochre"],"intro":"Sheila Hicks is an American artist known for her innovative work in textiles and fiber art. Her career spans several decades, during which she has explored the interplay of color, texture, and form in her large-scale installations and intricate weavings. Hicks's work often blurs the lines between art and craft, drawing inspiration from global textile traditions and modernist aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents monumental textile installations with highly realistic, tactile rendering of thick yarn, loops, knots, fringe, and layered fiber surfaces. Saturated color blocks and modular geometric arrangements contrast with clean gallery spaces and generous negative space, while the dense, sculptural wool textures remain the visual focus across the renders."},{"id":"roger-hiorns","name":"Roger Hiorns","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Roger Hiorns","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roger-hiorns.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roger-hiorns","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","sculptural","characters","landscapes","urban","glow","vivid-colors","surreal","fantasy","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["grey","white","muted-cyan","brown","charcoal","deep-blue"],"intro":"Roger Hiorns is a contemporary British artist known for his innovative use of materials and transformative installations. He often explores themes of transformation, decay, and the human condition through his work, utilizing unconventional materials and processes to create thought-provoking pieces.","observation":"The style presents monumental, surreal sculptures and architectural forms in abandoned, cathedral-like industrial interiors. Saturated blue and turquoise materials, translucent or melted-looking surfaces, intricate ornament, and soft architectural light create a dreamlike fantasy atmosphere with strong physical volume and scale."},{"id":"robert-smithson","name":"Robert Smithson","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Robert Smithson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-smithson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-smithson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","scenes","moody-colors","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-brown","muted-ochre","brown","muted-blue","grey","silver"],"intro":"Robert Smithson was an American artist known for his pioneering work in the field of land art. He is best recognized for his large-scale earthworks, such as the famous \"Spiral Jetty,\" which integrate natural landscapes with artistic expression. Smithson's work often explores themes of entropy, decay, and the relationship between human activity and the natural environment.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and cinematic, presenting expansive arid landscapes with carefully resolved rocks, scrub, mountains, and water. Repeated spiral and concentric stone formations create a geometric, sculptural presence, while subdued earthy colors, broad horizons, and soft atmospheric distance give the images a quiet, contemplative mood."},{"id":"paul-nash","name":"Paul Nash","cat":"painters","en":"Paul Nash","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/paul-nash.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/paul-nash","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","landscapes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","surreal","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","brown","dark-brown","muted-ochre","bone-white","grey","orange"],"intro":"Paul Nash was a British painter and war artist known for his surreal landscapes and contributions to Modernism. His work often explored themes of nature, war, and the subconscious, blending reality with dreamlike elements.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines visible, layered paint texture with dense linear drawing, especially in the branching trees and tangled undergrowth. Restrained earthy colors, deep shadows, and occasional cool or rust-colored accents create atmospheric woodland landscapes that feel expressive, bleak, and slightly unreal."},{"id":"david-driskell","name":"David Driskell","cat":"painters","en":"David Driskell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-driskell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-driskell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","portraits","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","dark-blue","vivid-red","ochre","dark-green"],"intro":"David Driskell is a renowned American artist, scholar, and curator, recognized for his contributions to African American art and art history. He played a pivotal role in bringing attention to African American artists and their work, particularly through his teaching and curatorial efforts. Driskell's influence extends beyond his own artwork, as he has been a key figure in the academic and cultural recognition of African American art.","observation":"Across the sheet, expressive painted faces and figures are built from saturated reds, blues, greens, and ochres, with heavy dark contours and visible, layered brushwork. Dense patterns, fragmented geometry, multiple eyes, and distorted features give the portraits a surreal, mask-like intensity."},{"id":"lawrence-weiner","name":"Lawrence Weiner","cat":"various-artists","en":"Lawrence Weiner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/lawrence-weiner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/lawrence-weiner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","urban","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["brown","black","vivid-red","bone-white","red","blue","light-yellow"],"intro":"Lawrence Weiner is an influential American conceptual artist known for his text-based works and installations. Emerging in the late 20th century, Weiner's art often explores the relationship between language and physical space, challenging traditional notions of art-making and viewing.","observation":"The style combines realistic, carefully detailed portrait photography with stark geometric gallery environments and oversized graphic murals. Saturated red, blue, yellow, orange, black, and white structures create a bold visual contrast against the industrial warehouse settings, while distinctive clothing and posed figures give the images an editorial fashion-portrait character."},{"id":"thomas-birch","name":"Thomas Birch","cat":"painters","en":"Thomas Birch","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/thomas-birch.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/thomas-birch","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","epic"],"colours":["dark-ochre","black","muted-brown","beige","grey","orange"],"intro":"Thomas Birch is an American painter known for his maritime and landscape paintings during the early 19th century. He was a prominent figure in the American Romanticism movement, capturing the sublime beauty of the natural world with a focus on dramatic seascapes and serene landscapes.","observation":"The style presents expansive, highly detailed landscape scenes with visible oil-paint texture, layered atmospheric skies, and carefully arranged foreground framing. Subdued earth tones shift into moody, high-contrast lighting, while ships, shorelines, architecture, and tiny figures give the compositions a grand, cinematic sense of scale."},{"id":"ivan-fedorovich-choultse","name":"Ivan Fedorovich Choultse","cat":"painters","en":"Ivan Fedorovich Choultse","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ivan-fedorovich-choultse.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ivan-fedorovich-choultse","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","scenes","glow","mist","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy","dreamy","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","charcoal","muted-blue","beige","bone-white","ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Ivan Fedorovich Choultse was a Russian painter known for his exquisite landscape paintings that capture the serene beauty of nature. Born in 1874, Choultse's work is characterized by its detailed realism and romantic portrayal of natural scenes, often featuring snow-covered landscapes and luminous skies. His paintings are celebrated for their technical precision and the ability to evoke a sense of tranquility and majesty.","observation":"Across the four images, richly textured painterly surfaces and dense natural detail create lush forests, reflective waters, fantastical valleys, and an ornate reading tableau. The style consistently uses subdued, cool atmospheres punctuated by warm internal light, with misty depth, dramatic scenery, and a dreamy storybook grandeur."},{"id":"latoya-ruby-frazier","name":"LaToya Ruby Frazier","cat":"photographers","en":"LaToya Ruby Frazier","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/latoya-ruby-frazier.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/latoya-ruby-frazier","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","retro","dark"],"colours":["grey","silver","black","charcoal","white"],"intro":"LaToya Ruby Frazier is an American artist and photographer known for her work exploring themes of family, identity, and the socio-economic issues affecting African American communities. Her photography often focuses on the Rust Belt and the impact of industrial decline on working-class families, using a documentary style to capture intimate and personal narratives.","observation":"The style is monochrome, high-contrast photographic portraiture with a richly detailed, lived-in atmosphere. Carefully posed figures occupy vintage domestic interiors or urban settings, while grain, selective focus, and strong window light give the images a period feel and tactile realism."},{"id":"emilio-pucci","name":"Emilio Pucci","cat":"fashion-designers","en":"Emilio Pucci","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/emilio-pucci.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/emilio-pucci","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","patterns","fine-lines","flat-color","vivid-colors","retro","symmetry"],"colours":["bone-white","brown","beige","black","muted-cyan","red"],"intro":"Emilio Pucci is an iconic Italian fashion designer known for his bold, colorful prints and innovative designs that revolutionized women's fashion in the mid-20th century. His work is characterized by geometric patterns and a vibrant color palette, making him a pivotal figure in modern fashion history.","observation":"The style combines highly saturated, swirling textile patterns with elongated couture silhouettes and theatrical runway posing. It shifts between polished fashion photography and flat, graphic illustration, unified by clean contour lines, decorative patterning, and strong areas of unmodulated color."},{"id":"william-henry-fox-talbot","name":"William Henry Fox Talbot","cat":"photographers","en":"William Henry Fox Talbot","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/william-henry-fox-talbot.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/william-henry-fox-talbot","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","floral","landscapes","mist","grain","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","retro","dark","negative-space"],"colours":["dark-brown","charcoal","bone-white","muted-ochre","brown"],"intro":"William Henry Fox Talbot was a British scientist, inventor, and photography pioneer known for inventing the calotype process, an early photographic technique. His work laid the foundation for modern photography, and he is celebrated for his contributions to the development of photographic processes in the 19th century.","observation":"The style combines subdued sepia and charcoal tones with strong silhouettes, visible grain, and softly diffused woodland haze. Botanical specimens and tree studies are arranged with archival, aged-paper character, balancing finely rendered natural detail against broad areas of negative space."},{"id":"valentin-de-boulogne","name":"Valentin de Boulogne","cat":"painters","en":"Valentin de Boulogne","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/valentin-de-boulogne.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/valentin-de-boulogne","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","animals","characters","scenes","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","dark","epic"],"colours":["black","brown","muted-brown","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Valentin de Boulogne was a French Baroque painter known for his realistic and dramatic depictions of everyday life and religious subjects. He was influenced by Caravaggio and part of the Caravaggisti movement, which emphasized strong contrasts of light and shadow.","observation":"These images use dense, painterly scenes of tightly packed figures, animals, and vigorous gestures, with broad visible strokes and richly modelled anatomy. A dark warm palette and stark illumination carve the subjects out of deep shadow, creating an intense, dramatic, monumental mood."},{"id":"gaetano-pesce","name":"Gaetano Pesce","cat":"designers","en":"Gaetano Pesce","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gaetano-pesce.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gaetano-pesce","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","sculptural","still-life","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["muted-ochre","white","silver","vivid-red","deep-red","dark-cyan"],"intro":"Gaetano Pesce is an Italian architect and designer known for his innovative and unconventional approach to design. His work often challenges traditional boundaries, incorporating a playful and experimental use of materials and forms. Pesce's designs are characterized by their bold colors, unique shapes, and a sense of whimsy that defies conventional aesthetics.","observation":"The style presents furniture as brightly colored sculptural objects, combining translucent, glossy resin-like forms with rough textiles, plush surfaces, and visibly manipulated upholstery. Clean gallery-like settings and strong saturated color make the exaggerated silhouettes feel playful, surreal, and materially experimental."},{"id":"michael-vincent-manalo","name":"Michael Vincent Manalo","cat":"various-artists","en":"Michael Vincent Manalo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/michael-vincent-manalo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/michael-vincent-manalo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","landscapes","scenes","motion","high-contrast","moody-colors","cinematic","surreal","dreamy","geometric"],"colours":["muted-green","dark-olive","dark-green","dark-brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Michael Vincent Manalo is a contemporary visual artist known for his surreal and dreamlike digital artworks. His work often explores themes of memory, dreams, and the passage of time, using a blend of photography and digital manipulation to create ethereal and contemplative images.","observation":"The style uses cinematic, realistic landscape imagery with expansive horizons, dramatic cloud formations, and moody teal-and-amber grading. Surreal geometric objects and isolated figures are placed in vast open spaces, creating a dreamlike visual narrative with strong scale contrast and crisp architectural forms."},{"id":"david-hammons","name":"David Hammons","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"David Hammons","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/david-hammons.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/david-hammons","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","patterns","still-life","subdued-colors"],"colours":["white","beige","black","charcoal","dark-red","rust"],"intro":"David Hammons is an influential American artist known for his innovative use of found objects and his exploration of African American identity and culture. His work often challenges social and political norms, using unconventional materials to create thought-provoking pieces that engage with themes of race, identity, and cultural heritage.","observation":"The style presents large, highly tactile textile assemblages as sculptural gallery objects, with layered, frayed, draped fabrics creating complex silhouettes and dense surface detail. Neutral gallery settings and restrained earthy colors emphasize the material contrast between dark cloth, faded patchwork, and occasional saturated fabric accents, rendered with a realistic illustrative clarity."},{"id":"otto-piene","name":"Otto Piene","cat":"various-artists","en":"Otto Piene","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/otto-piene.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/otto-piene","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","bold","expressive","glow","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","orange","vivid-red","deep-red","deep-blue","dark-blue"],"intro":"Otto Piene was a German artist known for his innovative contributions to kinetic and light art. He was a founding member of the ZERO group, which sought to redefine art in the post-war era through the use of light, movement, and technology. Piene's work often explored themes of energy and transformation, utilizing unconventional materials and methods to create dynamic visual experiences.","observation":"Across all four renders, saturated orange, red, and blue pigment erupts against deep dark or pale grounds in energetic radial bursts. Broad, visibly worked strokes, splatter, blooming edges, and glowing hot centers create a tactile painterly surface with strong contrast and an abstract, volatile sense of motion."},{"id":"kadir-nelson","name":"Kadir Nelson","cat":"painters","en":"Kadir Nelson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kadir-nelson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kadir-nelson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","epic"],"colours":["black","dark-cyan","muted-green","pale-orange","dark-brown","ochre","deep-red"],"intro":"Kadir Nelson is an acclaimed American artist known for his evocative paintings and illustrations that often explore African American culture and history. His work is celebrated for its narrative depth and rich visual storytelling, capturing the essence of his subjects with a profound sense of dignity and grace.","observation":"Across all four renders, recognizable baseball figures are painted with visible, controlled brushwork, strong facial modeling, and dramatic light-dark separation. The low-angle portraits and action groupings feel monumental and cinematic, while the restrained earth, cream, blue, and green palette gives the set a cohesive, serious atmosphere."},{"id":"raphael-perez","name":"Raphael Perez","cat":"painters","en":"Raphael Perez","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/raphael-perez.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/raphael-perez","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["black","beige","dark-red","light-orange","dark-blue","vivid-red","green"],"intro":"Raphael Perez is an artist known for his vibrant and imaginative works that often blend elements of fantasy and surrealism. His art is characterized by intricate details and a rich use of color, creating dreamlike scenes that captivate viewers. Perez's work often explores themes of nature and the fantastical, inviting audiences into a world of whimsy and wonder.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style combines highly saturated color with dense, hand-rendered-looking detail and energetic fine contouring. Figures, clothing, instruments, interiors, flowers, and city fragments are layered into busy compositions, with expressive faces and patterned surfaces held together by visible linear marks and painterly texture."},{"id":"reginald-marsh","name":"Reginald Marsh","cat":"painters","en":"Reginald Marsh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/reginald-marsh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/reginald-marsh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","scenes","urban","motion","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","retro"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","dark-brown","bone-white","muted-orange","red"],"intro":"Reginald Marsh was an American painter known for his depictions of urban life in New York City during the early 20th century. His work often focused on the bustling energy of the city, capturing scenes of everyday life, including crowded beaches, dance halls, and street scenes. Marsh's style is characterized by its detailed and dynamic compositions, often portraying the vibrancy and complexity of urban environments.","observation":"Across all four views, the scenes are rendered as energetic watercolor-like paintings with visible broad strokes, paper texture, loose edges, and strongly varied tonal masses. Dense urban activity, period clothing, industrial structures, and moving crowds recur throughout, using a restrained earthy palette punctuated by blue, red, and sunlit highlights."},{"id":"theaster-gates","name":"Theaster Gates","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Theaster Gates","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theaster-gates.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theaster-gates","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","scenes","still-life","urban","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["black","dark-brown","brown","beige","ochre","silver","red"],"intro":"Theaster Gates is a renowned American artist known for his innovative work in sculpture, installation, and urban renewal. He often explores themes of race, space, and history, using reclaimed materials to create thought-provoking pieces that bridge art and social practice.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is highly realistic and densely detailed, presenting atmospheric gallery interiors assembled from weathered brick, wood, stone, books, doors, and sculptural objects. A subdued, earthy palette and dramatic warm practical lighting give the spaces a dark, cinematic mood, while the materials read as solid, tactile, and heavily dimensional."},{"id":"ludwig-meidner","name":"Ludwig Meidner","cat":"painters","en":"Ludwig Meidner","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/ludwig-meidner.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/ludwig-meidner","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","portraits","scenes","bold-lines","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","drawing","ink","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","pale-orange","muted-ochre","orange"],"intro":"Ludwig Meidner was a German painter and printmaker known for his expressionist works, particularly those depicting apocalyptic landscapes and urban scenes. Born in 1884, Meidner's art often reflected the tumultuous socio-political climate of early 20th century Europe, characterized by intense emotion and dramatic compositions.","observation":"Across all four renders, anguished faces and crowded human figures are pushed into exaggerated, emotionally intense compositions. The style combines visible, directional paint handling with heavy ink-like marks, dense hatching, deep shadows, and a restricted dark palette punctuated by burnt orange and pale highlights."},{"id":"santiago-rusinol","name":"Santiago Rusinol","cat":"painters","en":"Santiago Rusinol","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/santiago-rusinol.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/santiago-rusinol","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","muted-ochre","vivid-red"],"intro":"Santiago Rusinol was a Spanish painter, poet, and playwright, known for his significant contributions to the Catalan modernisme movement. Born in 1861, he was a key figure in the cultural life of Barcelona and is celebrated for his landscape paintings and depictions of gardens and urban scenes. Rusinol's work often explored themes of solitude and introspection, capturing the essence of Catalan identity and the beauty of nature.","observation":"Across the scenes, visible brushwork and layered, finely observed marks create a richly painterly surface, with expressive figures and environments arranged as atmospheric narrative moments. Deep greens, browns, and blacks dominate, punctuated by warm red and amber light and strong contrasts between illuminated openings and shadowed spaces."},{"id":"mona-hatoum","name":"Mona Hatoum","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Mona Hatoum","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mona-hatoum.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mona-hatoum","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","glow","fine-lines","moody-colors","subdued-colors"],"colours":["muted-ochre","bone-white","deep-red","brown","vivid-red"],"intro":"Mona Hatoum is a contemporary artist known for her work in installation and sculpture, often exploring themes of displacement, conflict, and identity. Born in Lebanon, Hatoum's art frequently reflects her experiences of exile and cultural dislocation, using a range of materials to create pieces that challenge viewers' perceptions and provoke thought.","observation":"The style presents highly detailed sculptural installations in realistic, cinematic interior photography, with delicate wire and mesh constructions dominating the compositions. Restrained, shadowy palettes are punctuated by glowing bulbs and strong red illumination, while shallow focus, reflective floors, and carefully framed gallery spaces create a dramatic atmosphere."},{"id":"jacques-lipchitz","name":"Jacques Lipchitz","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Jacques Lipchitz","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jacques-lipchitz.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jacques-lipchitz","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","subdued-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["silver","grey","dark-brown","brown","muted-orange"],"intro":"Jacques Lipchitz was a renowned sculptor known for his contributions to the Cubist movement. Born in Lithuania and later becoming a French citizen, Lipchitz's work is characterized by its abstract and geometric forms, often exploring themes of human figures and relationships. His sculptures are celebrated for their innovative use of space and form, making significant impacts on modernist art.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents compact carved-stone sculptures made from interlocking, angular human forms. Faceted planes, deep cutouts, rough mineral surfaces, and earthy restrained coloring give the pieces a weighty, geometric presence, while clean studio presentation makes them read as realistic gallery objects."},{"id":"robert-indiana","name":"Robert Indiana","cat":"various-artists","en":"Robert Indiana","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/robert-indiana.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/robert-indiana","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","sculptural","letters","flat-color","vivid-colors","geometric"],"colours":["white","vivid-red","blue","dark-olive","deep-blue","olive"],"intro":"Robert Indiana is an American artist associated with the pop art movement, known for his bold, simple, and iconic imagery. His work often incorporates numbers, letters, and short words, exploring themes of American identity and culture. Indiana's art is characterized by its use of bright colors and clean lines, often drawing inspiration from commercial art and signage.","observation":"The style presents oversized red-and-blue letterforms as bold, geometric sculptures, with solid volume, clean edges, and strong cast shadows. Bright primary colors and simple flat surfaces create a graphic, poster-like appearance, while outdoor settings and cropped close views emphasize the monumental scale."},{"id":"barbara-chase-riboud","name":"Barbara Chase-Riboud","cat":"various-artists","en":"Barbara Chase-Riboud","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barbara-chase-riboud.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barbara-chase-riboud","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","fashion","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["white","bone-white","black","charcoal","beige"],"intro":"Barbara Chase-Riboud is an American artist, sculptor, and novelist known for her innovative and powerful works that often explore themes of identity, history, and culture. Her art is recognized for its unique blend of materials and its exploration of African American and feminist themes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style presents faceless, garment-like sculptural forms built from densely layered, torn and gathered fabric. The restrained black-and-ivory palette, stark studio backgrounds, strong silhouettes, and extensive tactile folds give the images a dramatic yet clean fashion-display character."},{"id":"tony-conrad","name":"Tony Conrad","cat":"various-artists","en":"Tony Conrad","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tony-conrad.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tony-conrad","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","scenes","still-life","fine-lines","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal"],"colours":["silver","beige","dark-brown","black","cream","rust"],"intro":"Tony Conrad was an influential American avant-garde artist, filmmaker, and musician known for his work in experimental film and minimalist music. He was a key figure in the 1960s New York art scene and collaborated with various artists and musicians, contributing significantly to the development of drone music and structural film.","observation":"The style combines documentary-looking interior photography with carefully arranged, surreal studio tableaux. Natural window light, restrained earthy tones, fine cable lines, and spacious architectural framing recur alongside tactile instruments, electronics, and large vividly patterned artworks."},{"id":"simeon-solomon","name":"Simeon Solomon","cat":"painters","en":"Simeon Solomon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/simeon-solomon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/simeon-solomon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","portraits","fine-brushstrokes","fine-lines","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["brown","black","orange","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Simeon Solomon was a 19th-century English painter associated with the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood, known for his depictions of biblical and classical themes. His work often explored themes of beauty, spirituality, and mythology, characterized by detailed and delicate brushwork, rich color palettes, and a focus on emotional expression.","observation":"The style uses highly rendered close-up portraiture with visible fine brushwork, delicate linear texture, and softly modeled skin. Earthy, subdued colors, dark tonal passages, floral adornment, and ornate garments create a classical, richly decorative appearance across the set."},{"id":"tintoretto","name":"Tintoretto","cat":"painters","en":"Tintoretto","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tintoretto.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tintoretto","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","subdued-colors","classical","dark"],"colours":["brown","black","muted-brown","muted-orange","dark-brown"],"intro":"Tintoretto was a prominent Italian painter of the late Renaissance , known for his dynamic compositions and dramatic use of light and shadow. His work is characterized by its energetic brushwork and vivid color palette, often depicting religious and mythological scenes with a sense of movement and emotional intensity.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses richly textured, visibly brushed paint to create realistic figures, sumptuous fabrics, and densely layered settings. Dark brown tonalities, strong light⁠–shadow separation, formal posing, and ornate historical environments give the portraits and narrative scenes a grave, classical atmosphere."},{"id":"kurt-schwitters","name":"Kurt Schwitters","cat":"various-artists","en":"Kurt Schwitters","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kurt-schwitters.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kurt-schwitters","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","ornate","patterns","flat-color","painterly","subdued-colors","surreal","collage","geometric"],"colours":["light-orange","bone-white","ochre","brown","black","vivid-red"],"intro":"Kurt Schwitters was a German artist known for his pioneering work in the Dada movement and his development of the Merz art style, which involved creating collages from found objects and materials. His work spanned various mediums, including painting, sculpture, and poetry, and he was influential in the fields of graphic design and typography.","observation":"Across all four panels, the style builds abstract compositions from overlapping paper, board, wood-like strips, and painted fragments. Muted earth tones are punctuated by red, black, blue, and teal geometric shapes, while worn edges, cracks, visible grain, and uneven surfaces give the arrangements a tactile handmade character."},{"id":"francesco-solimena","name":"Francesco Solimena","cat":"painters","en":"Francesco Solimena","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/francesco-solimena.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/francesco-solimena","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","characters","scenes","motion","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","dark","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","dark-brown","light-orange","rust"],"intro":"Francesco Solimena was an Italian Baroque painter, born in 1657 and active until his death in 1747. Known for his grandiose compositions and dramatic use of light and shadow, Solimena's works often depicted religious themes with a dynamic and theatrical flair. His paintings are characterized by intricate detailing and a mastery of chiaroscuro, reflecting the influence of both the Baroque and Rococo styles.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork shaping faces, fabric, clouds, and rugged architectural forms. Dramatic diagonals, crowded human and angelic figures, deep shadows, and concentrated shafts of light create expressive, monumental tableaux in a warm, subdued palette."},{"id":"joseph-beuys","name":"Joseph Beuys","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Joseph Beuys","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/joseph-beuys.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/joseph-beuys","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","characters","portraits","still-life","urban","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","dark"],"colours":["beige","muted-ochre","white","dark-ochre","dark-green","black"],"intro":"Joseph Beuys was a German artist known for his work as a sculptor, performance artist, and theorist. He was a leading figure in the Fluxus movement and is recognized for his innovative approach to art, which often included social and political themes. Beuys's work is characterized by its use of unconventional materials and its focus on the transformative power of art.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and cinematic, using subdued earth tones, moody shadows, and carefully observed surface textures. It combines stark portraiture and still-life-like object arrangements with surreal, installation-like juxtapositions in worn architectural spaces."},{"id":"umberto-boccioni","name":"Umberto Boccioni","cat":"painters","en":"Umberto Boccioni","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/umberto-boccioni.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/umberto-boccioni","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["abstract","detailed","expressive","floral","patterns","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["black","brown","dark-brown","muted-orange","muted-blue","rust"],"intro":"Umberto Boccioni was an influential Italian painter and sculptor, known for his role in the Futurist movement. Born in 1882, Boccioni's work focused on the dynamism of modern life, capturing movement and speed. His art often depicted urban scenes and human figures in motion, characterized by bold colors and geometric forms.","observation":"Across all four renders, dense overlapping foliage is transformed into angular, faceted shapes rather than depicted naturalistically. Strong directional brushwork, richly varied saturated colors, and dark interlocking shadows create a tactile, energetic surface with an abstract botanical character."},{"id":"roy-decarava","name":"Roy DeCarava","cat":"photographers","en":"Roy DeCarava","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/roy-decarava.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/roy-decarava","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["characters","portraits","scenes","glow","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","documentary","retro","dark"],"colours":["charcoal","black","grey","beige","white"],"intro":"Roy DeCarava was an American photographer known for his work capturing the everyday lives and experiences of African Americans, particularly in Harlem. His work is celebrated for its deep emotional resonance and masterful use of light and shadow, often highlighting themes of identity, community, and the human condition. DeCarava's photography is characterized by its intimate and introspective nature, offering a poignant glimpse into the lives of his subjects.","observation":"The style uses grainy monochrome photography with occasional warm sepia bias, strong chiaroscuro, and luminous practical lights against deep shadows. Candid close-ups and small group situations are framed through architectural obstructions, reflective glass, counters, and shallow focus, creating a gritty retro nightlife atmosphere."},{"id":"tom-otterness","name":"Tom Otterness","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Tom Otterness","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-otterness.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-otterness","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","urban","metallic","subdued-colors","epic"],"colours":["brown","black","beige","bone-white","silver","ochre"],"intro":"Tom Otterness is an American sculptor known for his whimsical and satirical public art installations. His works often feature cartoon-like characters crafted in bronze, exploring themes of consumerism and social dynamics. Otterness's sculptures are widely recognized for their playful yet thought-provoking nature, making him a prominent figure in contemporary art.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, detailed photographs of monumental bronze sculptures in dense urban plazas, with solid modeled forms, reflective metal surfaces, and numerous small attached figures or creatures. Carefully framed city architecture, bridges, fountains, and changing daylight give the images a cinematic, monumental sense of scale."},{"id":"mark-gertler","name":"Mark Gertler","cat":"painters","en":"Mark Gertler","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/mark-gertler.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/mark-gertler","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","subdued-colors","classical"],"colours":["black","dark-red","deep-red","dark-brown","orange","white"],"intro":"Mark Gertler was an influential British painter known for his distinctive style that combined elements of modernism and post-impressionism. Born in 1891, Gertler was part of the early 20th-century art scene in the United Kingdom, and his work often depicted intimate and reflective scenes. He was associated with the Bloomsbury Group and was known for his expressive portraits and still lifes.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses carefully modelled painted faces, visible fine brushwork, and richly textured garments in a restrained palette dominated by reds, greens, browns, and black. Cropped groupings and individual bust portraits emphasize composed expressions, period clothing, and decorative surface detail with a polished illustrative clarity."},{"id":"peter-fischli","name":"Peter Fischli","cat":"various-artists","en":"Peter Fischli","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/peter-fischli.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/peter-fischli","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","subdued-colors","surreal","fantasy","collage","geometric"],"colours":["silver","beige","bone-white","brown","muted-cyan"],"intro":"Peter Fischli is a Swiss artist known for his collaborative work with David Weiss, creating art that often explores the mundane and the absurd. Their work spans various mediums, including sculpture, photography, and video, often characterized by a playful yet profound examination of everyday life.","observation":"The style presents hyperreal, impossible architectural sculptures with stark geometric forms, weathered concrete, rocks, vegetation, and found-material surfaces. Muted natural colors, crisp daylight, and carefully staged museum or coastal settings make the surreal constructions feel physically tangible while retaining an uncanny, dreamlike quality."},{"id":"billie-tsien","name":"Billie Tsien","cat":"architects","en":"Billie Tsien","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/billie-tsien.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/billie-tsien","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","urban","shallow-depth-of-field","moody-colors","subdued-colors","cinematic"],"colours":["black","brown","silver","beige","muted-orange","white"],"intro":"Billie Tsien is an acclaimed architect known for her thoughtful and refined design approach, often integrating art and architecture. Her work is characterized by a deep understanding of materials and a commitment to creating spaces that are both functional and beautiful.","observation":"The style is highly realistic and photographic, presenting the same woman in carefully composed close-up and environmental portraits. Muted, warm-dark tones, soft window illumination, shallow focus, and richly resolved studio details create an intimate cinematic mood."},{"id":"barbara-hepworth","name":"Barbara Hepworth","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Barbara Hepworth","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/barbara-hepworth.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/barbara-hepworth","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","still-life","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["dark-green","dark-olive","beige","silver","dark-brown","olive"],"intro":"Barbara Hepworth is a renowned British sculptor known for her pioneering work in modern sculpture. Her career spanned several decades in the 20th century, during which she became a leading figure in the modernist movement. Hepworth's work is characterized by its abstract forms, often inspired by natural landscapes and the human figure. She frequently used materials such as wood, stone, and bronze, creating sculptures that are both monumental and intimate.","observation":"The style presents monumental abstract sculptures as carefully staged, realistic architectural and garden photographs. Smooth rounded forms, geometric cutouts, weathered stone and bronze surfaces, and subdued natural colors recur across all four views, with detailed environments and strong daylight defining their volume."},{"id":"shirin-neshat","name":"Shirin Neshat","cat":"various-artists","en":"Shirin Neshat","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/shirin-neshat.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/shirin-neshat","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","characters","portraits","fine-lines","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","dark"],"colours":["black","beige","charcoal","brown","bone-white"],"intro":"Shirin Neshat is an Iranian visual artist known for her work in film, video, and photography, often exploring themes of gender, identity, and cultural conflict. Her art frequently addresses the social, political, and psychological dimensions of women's experiences in Islamic societies.","observation":"The style uses tightly cropped, realistic black-and-white portraiture with strong tonal separation and visible grain. Intricate ink-like script, hands framing the faces, dark clothing, and direct gazes create a stark, intimate, slightly ominous visual language across the four images."},{"id":"gustav-stickley","name":"Gustav Stickley","cat":"designers","en":"Gustav Stickley","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/gustav-stickley.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/gustav-stickley","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","high-contrast","subdued-colors","classical","geometric"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","silver","black","ochre","white"],"intro":"Gustav Stickley was an influential American furniture maker and designer associated with the Arts and Crafts movement in the early 20th century. Known for his simple, yet functional designs, Stickley emphasized craftsmanship and the use of natural materials, particularly wood. His work often featured rectilinear forms, exposed joinery, and a focus on utility, aligning with the anti-industrial sentiments of the time.","observation":"The style presents handcrafted wooden furniture with realistic, highly resolved grain, joinery, drawer construction, and solid dimensional forms. Warm brown subdued tones, controlled studio lighting, geometric silhouettes, and uncluttered product-oriented compositions recur across all four renders."},{"id":"poul-henningsen","name":"Poul Henningsen","cat":"designers","en":"Poul Henningsen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/poul-henningsen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/poul-henningsen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","glow","metallic","subdued-colors","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["silver","white","dark-brown","ochre"],"intro":"Poul Henningsen was a Danish designer and architect, renowned for his innovative lighting designs and contributions to modernist architecture. He is best known for his work with the Danish company Louis Poulsen, where he developed the iconic PH lamp series, which emphasized glare-free illumination and functional beauty.","observation":"The style presents carefully engineered lighting fixtures as clean, realistic product studies, emphasizing stacked geometric shades, axial symmetry, and solid material volume. Restrained brass, bronze, glass, green, and cream tones are shown against uncluttered backgrounds, with warm internal illumination and softly controlled shadows."},{"id":"dayanita-singh","name":"Dayanita Singh","cat":"photographers","en":"Dayanita Singh","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/dayanita-singh.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/dayanita-singh","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["grey","black","charcoal","white","silver"],"intro":"Dayanita Singh is an Indian photographer known for her work that often explores themes of identity, memory, and the passage of time. Her photography is characterized by its intimate and thoughtful portrayal of subjects, often using black and white imagery to convey depth and emotion.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses monochrome photographic portraiture with strong tonal separation, tactile fabric detail, and softly blurred surroundings. It favors intimate, cinematic domestic or urban settings, natural window light, candid seated poses, and a restrained, melancholic atmosphere."},{"id":"kenneth-snelson","name":"Kenneth Snelson","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Kenneth Snelson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/kenneth-snelson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/kenneth-snelson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["bold","detailed","realistic","sculptural","landscapes","urban","metallic","epic","geometric"],"colours":["dark-olive","light-blue","silver","blue","olive","grey"],"intro":"Kenneth Snelson was an American sculptor and photographer known for his innovative use of tensegrity structures, which combine elements of tension and compression to create stable yet flexible forms. His work is often associated with the modernist movement and reflects a deep interest in the interplay between art and science.","observation":"Across all four renders, a monumental geometric sculpture made from intersecting reflective metal tubes dominates landscaped outdoor settings. The style is realistic and photographic, emphasizing gleaming surfaces, strong angular construction, expansive scale, and changing park, woodland, and mountain backdrops."},{"id":"zanele-muholi","name":"Zanele Muholi","cat":"photographers","en":"Zanele Muholi","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/zanele-muholi.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/zanele-muholi","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["black","white","grey","silver","charcoal"],"intro":"Zanele Muholi is a South African visual activist and photographer known for their work focusing on race, gender, and sexuality. They have gained international recognition for their powerful portraits that explore and celebrate the identities of Black LGBTQ+ individuals, particularly within South Africa. Muholi's work often challenges societal norms and seeks to empower marginalized communities through visual storytelling.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic black-and-white studio portraiture with strong directional lighting, deep shadows, and crisp facial detail. The compositions alternate between close crops and spacious full-body poses, presenting fashion, adornment, and unusual headwear against minimal neutral backgrounds."},{"id":"tom-dixon","name":"Tom Dixon","cat":"designers","en":"Tom Dixon","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/tom-dixon.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/tom-dixon","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","still-life","urban","glow","high-contrast","metallic","moody-colors"],"colours":["brown","dark-brown","grey","rust","black","light-orange"],"intro":"Tom Dixon is a renowned British designer known for his innovative approach to lighting and furniture design. His work often features a blend of industrial and modern aesthetics, with a focus on creating functional yet visually striking pieces. Dixon's designs are celebrated for their use of materials like metal and glass, often incorporating reflective surfaces and geometric forms.","observation":"The style is highly realistic, cinematic interior imagery centered on reflective copper spheres, polished surfaces, and carefully arranged contemporary furnishings. Deep shadows, warm amber illumination, cool blue upholstery, and concrete architectural textures create a moody, high-contrast atmosphere, while glowing fixtures and floor reflections add visual drama."},{"id":"vhils","name":"Vhils","cat":"street-artists","en":"Vhils","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/vhils.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/vhils","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","urban","subdued-colors","documentary","dark"],"colours":["beige","bone-white","dark-brown","black","silver","white","deep-red"],"intro":"Vhils is a Portuguese street artist known for his innovative approach to urban art, particularly his technique of carving into walls to create striking portraits. His work often explores themes of identity, urban life, and the passage of time, reflecting a deep connection to the environments in which he creates.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style uses realistic, documentary-like views of decaying urban architecture, emphasizing heavily eroded plaster, exposed brick, rubble, and industrial structures. Dense surface detail and sculptural damage make the walls feel physically relief-like, while subdued earthy tones and shadowed interiors create a bleak, expressive atmosphere."},{"id":"wendell-castle","name":"Wendell Castle","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Wendell Castle","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/wendell-castle.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/wendell-castle","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","still-life","glow","subdued-colors","geometric"],"colours":["beige","silver","white","dark-brown","rust"],"intro":"Wendell Castle is an influential American artist and designer, widely recognized for his pioneering work in the field of furniture design. Born in 1932, Castle is often credited with blurring the lines between art and functional design, creating pieces that are both sculptural and practical. His innovative approach to woodworking and furniture design has left a lasting impact on the art world, inspiring generations of designers and artists.","observation":"The style presents sculptural wooden furniture with flowing, organic curves, tapered supports, and visibly modelled solid forms. Rich wood grain and polished highlights are rendered with realistic detail against restrained gallery interiors, while directional light creates strong floor shadows and emphasizes the objects’ volume."},{"id":"jennifer-rubell","name":"Jennifer Rubell","cat":"various-artists","en":"Jennifer Rubell","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jennifer-rubell.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jennifer-rubell","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","ornate","realistic","sculptural","characters","scenes","glow","vivid-colors","surreal"],"colours":["beige","silver","dark-red","brown","red","pink"],"intro":"Jennifer Rubell is an American conceptual artist known for her participatory artwork and large-scale installations. Her work often explores themes of consumption, interaction, and the role of the viewer in the art experience. Rubell's art is characterized by its playful yet thought-provoking nature, inviting audiences to engage directly with the pieces.","observation":"The style presents highly realistic, cinematic views of immersive gallery installations, with monumental sculptural forms, human figures, architectural fragments, and carefully staged lighting. Saturated monochrome zones of pink and red contrast with neutral gallery interiors, while elaborate textures, suspended structures, and surreal arrangements create a dramatic contemporary-art atmosphere."},{"id":"sam-gilliam","name":"Sam Gilliam","cat":"painters","en":"Sam Gilliam","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/sam-gilliam.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/sam-gilliam","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","realistic","sculptural","fashion","patterns","painterly","vivid-colors"],"colours":["silver","beige","charcoal","dark-red","rust","orange"],"intro":"Sam Gilliam is an influential American artist known for his innovative contributions to abstract expressionism and color field painting. Born in 1933, Gilliam is celebrated for his pioneering work with draped and unstretched canvases, transforming the traditional approach to painting. His art is characterized by vibrant colors, dynamic compositions, and a unique use of materials and techniques, making him a significant figure in the modern art movement.","observation":"The style presents vividly painted, heavily textured textiles as large sculptural installations in a clean contemporary gallery setting. Richly layered brushwork, irregular edges, deep folds, and saturated contrasting colors make the drapery feel tactile, expressive, and dimensional across all four views."},{"id":"edmund-leighton","name":"Edmund Leighton","cat":"painters","en":"Edmund Leighton","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/edmund-leighton.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/edmund-leighton","tested":true,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","characters","fashion","landscapes","scenes","fine-brushstrokes","painterly","moody-colors","subdued-colors","fantasy"],"colours":["black","brown","beige","bone-white","muted-ochre","deep-red","red"],"intro":"Edmund Leighton was a British painter known for his historical and romantic scenes, particularly those depicting medieval and Victorian themes. His works often featured detailed and realistic portrayals of courtly love and chivalric ideals, set against richly textured backgrounds.","observation":"Across all four renders, the style is richly painterly, with visible directional brushwork, layered textures, and carefully articulated clothing, armor, foliage, and masonry. Muted earthy tones with selective warm highlights create a romantic, softly dramatic atmosphere, while recurring figures and courtly interactions are staged as detailed fantasy scenes in gardens and castle settings."},{"id":"theo-jansen","name":"Theo Jansen","cat":"sculpture-installation","en":"Theo Jansen","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/theo-jansen.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/theo-jansen","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","sculptural","animals","characters","scenes","fine-lines","subdued-colors","cinematic","surreal","geometric","negative-space"],"colours":["silver","muted-ochre","muted-blue","beige","brown"],"intro":"Theo Jansen is a Dutch artist and engineer known for his kinetic sculptures called \"Strandbeests\"⁠—mechanical creatures that move on their own using wind power. His work blurs the line between art and engineering, creating lifelike structures that mimic biological forms.","observation":"The style presents monumental animal forms as highly detailed, translucent sculptural frameworks made from delicate fabric, wire, and layered linear elements. Photographic, cinematic framing places these surreal constructions in broad coastal landscapes, using subdued natural colors, open sky, and human figures to emphasize their scale."},{"id":"malick-sidibe","name":"Malick Sidibe","cat":"photographers","en":"Malick Sidibe","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/malick-sidibe.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/malick-sidibe","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["expressive","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","motion","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast"],"colours":["silver","grey","black","charcoal"],"intro":"Malick Sidibe was a renowned Malian photographer known for his black-and-white portraits that captured the vibrant youth culture of post-independence Mali. His work is celebrated for its intimate and candid portrayal of everyday life, often set against the backdrop of social gatherings and personal moments. Sidibe's photographs are characterized by their documentary style and cultural richness, offering a glimpse into the lives and identities of his subjects.","observation":"The style uses high-contrast black-and-white photography with visible grain, treating fashionably dressed figures as sharply posed characters. Bold patterned garments, sunglasses, hats, and headwraps stand out against textured domestic or street backdrops, while several images capture theatrical movement and dance-like gestures."},{"id":"danh-vo","name":"Danh Vo","cat":"various-artists","en":"Danh Vo","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/danh-vo.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/danh-vo","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","sculptural","characters","patterns","fine-lines","subdued-colors","surreal","classical","geometric"],"colours":["white","dark-brown","beige","orange","brown"],"intro":"Danh Vo is a contemporary artist known for his conceptual works that explore themes of identity, history, and cultural exchange. Born in Vietnam and raised in Denmark, Vo's art often reflects his personal experiences and the broader context of globalization and diaspora.","observation":"Across all four views, the style presents large-scale, highly detailed paper or cardboard sculptures photographed in spacious museum galleries. Angular folded sheets, fine linear creases, layered surfaces, and warm restrained earth tones give the installations a tactile, sculptural character, while the oversized animals, buildings, and vessels create a surreal effect."},{"id":"a-y-jackson","name":"A. Y. Jackson","cat":"painters","en":"A. Y. Jackson","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/a-y-jackson.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/a-y-jackson","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","broad-brushstrokes","painterly","high-contrast","subdued-colors"],"colours":["bone-white","grey","black","brown","rust","dark-red"],"intro":"A. Y. Jackson was a Canadian painter and a founding member of the Group of Seven, known for his vibrant landscape paintings that captured the essence of the Canadian wilderness. His work is characterized by bold colors, dynamic compositions, and a distinctive style that blends elements of post-impressionism and modernism.","observation":"Across all four views, the landscapes are built from conspicuous broad, directional paint strokes, textured surfaces, and strongly simplified but recognizable forms. Muted blue, ochre, rust, and forest-green passages are punctuated by high-contrast dark trees and shadowed structures, producing expressive mountain, lakeshore, and rural scenes."},{"id":"e-j-bellocq","name":"E. J. Bellocq","cat":"photographers","en":"E. J. Bellocq","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/e-j-bellocq.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/e-j-bellocq","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","animals","characters","portraits","scenes","grain","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic"],"colours":["black","charcoal","grey","beige","silver","deep-red","vivid-red"],"intro":"E. J. Bellocq was an American photographer known primarily for his evocative portraits of Storyville prostitutes in New Orleans, taken in the early 20th century. His work remained largely obscure until the 1970s when a collection of his glass plate negatives was discovered and subsequently published by photographer Lee Friedlander. Bellocq's portraits, characterized by their intimate and candid nature, provide a rare glimpse into the lives of women in the red-light district during that era. The photographs, often marked by a stark yet sensitive portrayal of their subjects, have been critically acclaimed for their historical and artistic significance. Bellocq's work is preserved in collections such as Storyville Portraits, which has been instrumental in cementing his posthumous reputation as a significant figure in the realm of portrait photography.","observation":"The style uses highly detailed, realistic photographic tableaux with intimate portraits, staged interiors, and animal subjects. It alternates between stark grainy monochrome and deep jewel-toned colour, using candlelight, heavy shadows, shallow focus, and richly furnished rooms to create a theatrical, melancholic atmosphere."},{"id":"f-c-gundlach","name":"F. C. Gundlach","cat":"photographers","en":"F. C. Gundlach","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/f-c-gundlach.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/f-c-gundlach","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","realistic","characters","fashion","portraits","scenes","shallow-depth-of-field","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","geometric","symmetry"],"colours":["beige","black","grey","silver","brown","muted-ochre"],"intro":"F. C. Gundlach was a renowned German fashion photographer known for his influential work in the mid-20th century. He was celebrated for his elegant and sophisticated compositions, often capturing the essence of post-war European fashion. Gundlach's photography is characterized by its timeless quality and a keen eye for detail, making him a pivotal figure in the world of fashion photography.","observation":"The style uses highly composed fashion photography with graphic checkerboard motifs, sculptural settings, dramatic poses, and carefully controlled geometric framing. Across the sheet, monochrome high-contrast imagery alternates with a restrained color variant, combining surreal proportions and theatrical styling with realistic textures, selective focus, and cinematic lighting."},{"id":"j-p-targete","name":"J.P. Targete","cat":"illustrators","en":"J.P. Targete","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/j-p-targete.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/j-p-targete","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","expressive","ornate","characters","scenes","painterly","high-contrast","moody-colors","fantasy","dark","epic"],"colours":["charcoal","black","beige","brown","silver"],"intro":"","observation":"The style uses richly textured, painterly rendering with dense ornamental detail, monumental gothic architecture, and elaborate monstrous figures. Dark green, charcoal, bronze, and muted crimson tones are punctuated by strong shafts of light and glowing portals, creating an epic, threatening fantasy atmosphere across all four scenes."},{"id":"jerry-uelsmann","name":"Jerry Uelsmann","cat":"photographers","en":"Jerry Uelsmann","preview":"../public/preview-images/tracked/jerry-uelsmann.webp","url":"https://midlibrary.io/library/jerry-uelsmann","tested":false,"pick":false,"terms":["detailed","landscapes","fine-lines","bw-monochrome","high-contrast","cinematic","surreal","dark","dreamy"],"colours":["charcoal","grey","black","silver"],"intro":"Jerry Uelsmann is an American photographer known for his pioneering work in photomontage. Born in 1934, Uelsmann became a prominent figure in the field of photography during the 1960s. His innovative use of multiple exposures and darkroom techniques allowed him to create surreal and dreamlike images that challenged conventional perceptions of reality.","observation":"Across all four renders, stark black-and-white imagery combines dramatic landscapes with impossible juxtapositions, oversized eyes, floating terrain, and architecture isolated in water or wilderness. Strong tonal contrast, crisp organic detail, and monumental framing create a bleak, dreamlike, cinematic atmosphere."}];
